lake \\r\\nenvironments. \\r\\n Optimized SQL queries and Snowflake warehouse configurations to improve migration performance \\r\\nand reduce execution time. \\r\\n Automated ETL workflows to improve operational efficiency and support cloud-based reporting \\r\\nthrough Amazon QuickSight.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2020\", \"degree\": \"B.E.: Computer Science\", \"result\": \"72\", \"institution\": \"Sethu Institute of Technology\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1786414202-549.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('0141888f-5767-4d68-847e-5908bf161375','4e180140-81ba-4df6-a1e6-1b5d74f2f5b9','Experienced MES PAS-X (Körber) Application Support Engineer with comprehensive expertise in end-to\r\nend application support, MBR/PMBR design, and MES–SAP integration within regulated GxP\r\nenvironments. Skilled in incident management (P1–P4), root cause an','Experienced MES PAS-X (Körber) Application Support Engineer with comprehensive expertise in end-to\r\nend application support, MBR/PMBR design, and MES–SAP integration within regulated GxP\r\nenvironments. Skilled in incident management (P1–P4), root cause analysis (RCA), and ITIL-based\r\nServiceNow processes. Proficient in PAS-X infrastructure components including JBoss, BPS, and\r\nGateway. Demonstrates strong knowledge of validation, audit trail management, and compliance with\r\nregulatory standards such as 21 CFR Part 11, ISA-95, and ISA-88. Adept at ensuring system reliability and\r\nregulatory adherence to support pharmaceutical manufacturing excellence.','Associate',2,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1778615507-930.pdf',NULL,'[\"Mes\", \"KPI Reporting\", \"C++\", \"AWS\", \"21 CFR Part 11\", \"ISA-88\", \"SAP\", \"MBRs\", \"ServiceNow\", \"Werum PAS-X\", \"Root Cause Analysis\", \"MYSQL\", \"Splunk\", \"OOPS\"]','PUBLIC','2026-05-13 07:20:13.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Associate\", \"company\": \"Cognizant\", \"endDate\": \"Sun May 10\", \"