nhance student engagement and understanding. ● Guided students in lab experiments, ensuring practical application of theoretical concepts. ● Mentored and advised students on academic progress, projects, and career development. ● Collaborated with faculty members to design and update the electrical engineering curriculum.\"}, {\"title\": \"Executive Engineer (Electrical)\", \"company\": \"Raj Ceramics Private Limited\", \"endDate\": \"Mon Sep 11\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Thu Aug 13\", \"description\": \"Key Responsibilities: ● Direct the upkeep and diagnosis of PLC enclosures to guarantee continuous production and reduce operational interruptions. ● Supervise and refine SCADA network configurations to maximize system dependability and output performance. ● Control the operation and upkeep of industrial cooling units, securing peak energy functionality. ● Regulate Variable Frequency Drives (VFD) for precision motor velocity adjustments, boosting system safety and conservation. ● Supervise the installation and upkeep of solar panels, contributing to sustainable energy solutions.\"}, {\"title\": \"Faculty\", \"company\": \"Gate Forum | Ranchi\", \"endDate\": \"Wed Jan 08\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Wed Jan 04\", \"description\": \"● Delivered in-depth lectures on Power Systems, Electrical Machines, and Control Systems to GATE aspirants. ● Developed comprehensive teaching materials and curriculum plans to ensure thorough coverage of core subjects. ● Conducted regular assessments and mock exams to evaluate student progress and readiness for GATE. ● Provided one-on-one guidance to students, helping them strengthen their understanding of complex topics. ● Engaged students through interactive sessions and problem-solving techniques to enhance their analytical skills. ● Collaborated with the academic team to update and refine course content based on the latest GATE syllabus and trends.\"}, {\"title\": \"Executive Engineer (Electrical)\", \"company\": \"Industrial technology and Energy | Oman\", \"endDate\": \"Wed Jul 10\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Tue Oct 10\", \"description\": \"Key Responsibilities: ● Manage the maintenance and troubleshooting of PLC panels, ensuring smooth operations and minimal downtime. ● Monitor and optimize SCADA systems to enhance process efficiency and reliability. ● Oversee the operation and maintenance of chillers, ensuring their efficient performance. ● Handle Variable Frequency Drives (VFD) for motor speed control, ensuring energy efficiency and system reliability.\"}, {\"title\": \"Assistant Manager (Electrical)\", \"company\": \"Thriveni Earth Movers Pvt. Ltd.\", \"endDate\": \"Mon May 18\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Mon May 12\", \"description\": \"● Electrification project of RH340, R996, EX1200, EX 2500 excavators replacing diesel engine with 6.6kV and 11kV motors using HT panel and field switch alongwith PLC control. ● Manage the manpower for regular maintenance and troubleshooting of all the panels, ovens and devices ensuring smooth operations and minimal downtime. ● Leveraged Python, Power BI, and Redlion gateways to extract data from PLCs in remote mining locations, creating a web-based dashboard for data presentation. ● Developed VB script code within WinCC SCADA to implement PLC redundancy. ACHIEVEMENTS ● Designed and deployed single and double ring PLC redundancy topologies to ensure seamless operations. ● Established a secure communication methodology to transmit remote mining site PLC data directly to ignition scada and  mobile platforms including Telegram, Slack, and Google Chat.\"}, {\"title\": \"Sr. PLC Automation Engineer\", \"company\": \"SAS Automation Pvt. Ltd.\", \"endDate\": \"Thu Jan 01\", \"isCurrent\": true, \"startDate\": \"Wed Jul 08\", \"description\": \"● Leading turnkey automation, system integration, PLC/SCADA programming, and OT/IT architecture across multi-sector industrial projects.  ● Architect scalable OT-to-IT data bridges using OPC UA and MQTT, streaming real-time factory telemetry directly to Ignition SCADA, Grafana dashboards, and cloud databases.  ● Program modular SCL code, complex UDTs, and multi-instance function blocks, reducing overall project software development cycle time by 25%.  ● Configure and tune closed-loop VFDs (Sinamics G120/S120)  for high-precision speed and positioning applications. EDUCATION ● Master of Technology (Power System) from Birla institute of technology, Ranchi, 2019 ● Bachelor of Technology (Electrical and Electronics Engineering) from Rajasthan Technical University, 2012 LANGUAGES ● English ● Hindi ● Punjabi ● Direct FAT/SAT procedures, client demonstrations, and on-site commissioning teams, ensuring 100% compliance with safety and functional design specifications.  ● Architected secure OT/IT network zones and data conduits adhering to IEC 62443 guidelines to protect critical PLC/SCADA assets against unauthorized access. ● Implemented secure data logging, user-role access controls, and electronic records architecture compliant with 21 CFR Part 11 and GAMP 5 software lifecycle risk principles for industrial clients.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2019\", \"degree\": \"POWER SYSTEM\", \"result\": \"7.4\", \"institution\": \"Birla institute of Technology\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/yogesh-bhatia-1790241085-941.pdf\", \"title\": \"YOGESH BHATIA\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('01d40863-8c75-4e92-86f6-5c9f3e35d2a0','73ebe9fc-5963-4b25-ab32-4dce77329e07','Test Resume401','Test Resume401','Software Deve',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\".NET\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-25 11:22:55.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Deve\", \"company\": \"Grey Chain Technology\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[{\"year\": \"\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech\", \"result\": \"\", \"institution\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('01ddb55a-5874-4a63-a8cc-b