ime. \\r\\n• Developed stored procedures and complex SQL queries for OCR metadata \\r\\nprocessing and automated reports. \\r\\n• Collaborated with QA to achieve 100% zero-defect delivery in production. \\r\\n• Conducted Root Cause Analysis (RCA) and resolved production issues with \\r\\npermanent fixes.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2020\", \"degree\": \"B.E. Mechanical Engineering\", \"result\": \"73\", \"institution\": \"SNS College of Technology\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1764945896-31.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('027bbb47-5262-49d4-bd5e-80a1d9ade900','4ad067fb-c89e-4fc9-a619-aa2dfb0bdd1f','Test Resume877','Test Resume877','Software Deve',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Guidewire Automation Testing\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-25 12:06:01.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Deve\", \"company\": \"Relevance Lab\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[{\"year\": \"\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech\", \"result\": \"\", \"institution\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('027dca96-8421-4818-b8b9-0cf7de0a4fd7','275a7410-7010-44e7-a09f-88b2f54b2bc4','Asp .net MVC Developer',NULL,'Asp .net MVC Developer',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"C#\", \".NET\", \"C#\", \"Microsoft SQL Server\", \"ASP.NET MVC\", \"JQUERY\", \"CSS\", \"MVC\", \"WCF\", \"WCF\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-15 06:21:10.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"Asp .net MVC Developer\", \"company\": \"logical software solution\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('027f5764-0c46-4ca5-8a07-57c55389ad86','92e44ec8-c4a4-4886-8eaa-c819b9251e36','SPC Student placement coordinator',NULL,'SPC Student placement coordinator',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','PUBLIC','2025-05-13 18:31:29.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"SPC Student placement coordinator\", \"company\": \"National University students skills development program,Tata institute of social sciences\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('0289beba-35bb-495a-91ab-4a6cf60036c6','749e6e7b-3469-4cbd-aaeb-501e54cc2bb1','To provide value addition to the organization by utilizing my technical knowledge and to grow in the \r\norganization by accomplishing the tasks allotted to me sincerely, thereby becoming an asset to the \r\norganization. Presently working with Renom Energy S','To provide value addition to the organization by utilizing my technical knowledge and to grow in the \r\norganization by accomplishing the tasks allotted to me sincerely, thereby becoming an asset to the \r\norganization. Presently working with Renom Energy Services as a– Head SCADA, Digital Twin & Analytics \r\nat Head Office, I lead the end-to-end lifecycle of Digital twin and SCADA solutions for \r\nnationwide renewable energy portfolios. My role bridges technical teams and business \r\nstakeholders, providing strategic direction and hands-on management throughout product \r\ndevelopment—from concept, 3D simulation and IEC logical mapping, to launch, training, \r\ncognitive assistance to operation team and ongoing optimization. I act as the voice of the \r\ncustomer, engaging with clients to define requirements and prioritize product backlogs, and \r\nwork closely with data engineering, design, DevOps, analytics, and AI teams to deliver high\r\nimpact, standards-compliant digital twin solutions. Leveraging AI and advanced analytics, \r\nincluding Python programming, I drive predictive maintenance, performance optimization, \r\nand asset health insights tailored for renewable energy operations. My responsibilities include \r\ncloud-based deployment and integration with GCP and Azure, AWS and other cloud services to \r\nensuring robust security, scalability, and operational reliability.','Manager - Head SCADA & Digital Analytics',8,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1764728921-171.pdf',NULL,'[\"Digital Twin Technology\", \"Analytics\", \"DevOps\", \"API Integration\", \"KPI Tracking\", \"AutoCAD\", \"SCADA\", \"Python\", \"SAP\", \"Kepware\", \"Qlikview\", \"Tableau\", \"Power BI\", \"Modbus\", \"CMS\", \"Opc\", \"HMI\"]','PUBLIC','2025-12-03 14:42:42.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Manager - Head SCADA & Digital Analytics\", \"company\": \"Renom Energy Services Pvt. Ltd.\", \"endDate\": \"Sun Nov 30\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Tue Mar 17\", \"description\": \"Responsible for giving SCADA lead support across PAN Indian i.e., SCADA server support and \\r\\nbackup related activities, SCADA solution support across all make / model, configuration of \\r\\nfarms, update in SCADA, Asset mapping for Digital platform like AMPS, Digital Twin & SCADA \\r\\nUI. \\r\\n❖ Providing support for all technical requirement to develop new SCADA for wind farms. \\r\\n❖ Working on different controller & make, provide solution in one screen UI SCADA interface. \\r\\n❖ Responsible for implementation of SAP – AMPS integrated model for Inventory across all \\r\\nactivity done by O&M team. \\r\\n❖ Responsible for implantation of advance digital tool e.g., Digital Twin and done the mapping of \\r\\ndifferent make & model according there BOM & Error specification. Done the component 3D \\r\\nmapping, fault analysis, Service Report & Fault analysis according to make/model. \\r\\n❖ Providing support and solution for IPP & Retail customer as per there requirement. \\r\\n❖ Responsible for handing approx. 2.5 GW of Wind & 240 MW of Solar sites. \\r\\n❖ Responsible for review and resolve site SCADA issue, wind farms connectivity issue (i.e., OFC \\r\\nconnectivity / wireless connectivity for SCADA). Ensure associated site SCADA infrastructure \\r\\nand maintain it. As SCADA Lead, taking care management approval for new SCADA requirement \\r\\n& complete procurement process & providing final solution for existing & new project. \\r\\n❖ Responsible for Configure new turbine in our SCADA and existing turbine configuration change \\r\\nas according to requirement. \\r\\n❖ Responsible for giving all kind of SCADA access / MIS and DGR access to O&M team, IPP \\r\\nCustomer / Investor. Maintain SCADA, DGR & Digital Portal, BAU, Predictive analysis portal \\r\\n❖ Review central monitoring team for various task of SCADA support like SCADA data availability \\r\\n/Data fetching tool, data analysis / power curve analysis for improving turbine \\r\\nperformance and provide customer support. \\r\\n❖ Responsible for purchasing the license for SCADA and up gradation for SCADA application and \\r\\nSCADA data server securities & support to central server system for Digital tool.\"}, {\"title\": \"Assistant Manager SCADA Head(O&M)\", \"company\": \"ReGen Powertech Pvt Ltd.\", \"endDate\": \"Tue Mar 31\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Fri Aug 10\", \"description\": \"❖ Worked as lead SCADA for O&M. Review and resolve site SCADA issue, wind farms connectivity \\r\\nissue & ensure associated site SCADA infrastructure and maintain report & documentation. As \\r\\nSCADA Lead, taking care management approval for new SCADA requirement & complete \\r\\nprocurement process. \\r\\n❖ Head SCADA team for execution of SCADA CMS operation 24×7 & turbine analytics. \\r\\n❖ Responsible for establish and configuration of OPC data to IPP Customer / Investor as according \\r\\nto requirement and checking site SCADA system/customer system.  \\r\\n❖ Responsible for doing configuration of OPC / OPC Client from SCADA server to customer system \\r\\nvia OPC client suite configurations with securities configuration like Firewall security device \\r\\nand data security. \\r\\n❖ Responsible for review MPLS link connectivity and MPLS Link restoration & new MPLS Link \\r\\nestablishment from wind farms to Central office with coordination of IT team Support. \\r\\n❖ Responsible for establishment of Telemetry through Feeder wise & Turbine wise Telemetry \\r\\nsolution with vendor and as per customer requirement, wind farm turbine data verify and test \\r\\nit with SLDC. \\r\\n❖ Responsible for SCADA control system Data Management as well as SCADA MIS system for \\r\\nGenerating DGR and Reports. \\r\\n❖ Given support for IPP Customer / Investor query solution for SCADA and provide SCADA \\r\\nsupport. Support wind forecasting Data and turbines historical mean Data / Real Time Data. \\r\\n❖ Responsible and maintain static data, SCADA data, turbine details & coordinate with site team \\r\\nas well as requirement / coordinate with SLDC. \\r\\n❖ Given support for turbines Data & Monitoring to IPP / Customer / Investor via various sources \\r\\nlike J logger, Live Gen, Vayu Profiler trough VPN and web-based application.\"}, {\"title\": \"SCADA Support (O&M)\", \"company\": \"SUZLON ENERGY LTD.\", \"endDate\": \"Sun Aug 05\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Thu Mar 10\", \"description\": \"Experience with SCADA support and data analysis by using various SCADA tools like Trinity, \\r\\nAlarm Explorers and SC-Commander with scope of R programming. \\r\\n❖ Creation of Master Data such as new equipment’s, functional location, equipment Class, \\r\\nCharacteristics in SCADA. \\r\\n❖ Experience on RF Link / V-Sat Link and restoration work for link with IT Team. \\r\\n❖ Review wind park turbines connectivity daily and weekly report sharing for different wind \\r\\nfarms and for different IPP customer. \\r\\n❖ Experience on creating and managing conference call with our team and with IPP customer / \\r\\ninvestor for reviews & resolve the customer issue. \\r\\n❖ Responsible for configuring new WTG in SCADA system at central server. \\r\\n❖ Experience on FTP data, telemetry data review / checking and support. \\r\\n❖ Responsible for SCADA wind farms monitoring and streamline the guideline with team and \\r\\nensure the effective output, increase turbines efficiency and turbine health. \\r\\n❖ Plant Maintenance related activities & Plant operation & Maintenance support for effective \\r\\nbusiness processes. \\r\\n❖ Responsible for taking follow-up with IT team and review the open and closed IT call logged \\r\\n(ticket) for SCADA issues. \\r\\n❖ Expert in mapping of Breakdown maintenance, preventive maintenance, Calibration process, \\r\\ncorrective maintenance and corrective action plan & adhering CAPA. \\r\\n❖ Experience on SCADA Monitoring turbines error protocol streamline for different models and \\r\\nreview the protocol sheet and update it as per company requirement and Critical data analysis. \\r\\n❖ Operation & maintenance activities of 1.25 MW, 1.50 MW &2.1 MW (Wind Turbine Generator) \\r\\nof total 240 MW wind power plant. \\r\\n❖ Responsible for coordinating, monitoring of every activity such as DGR, B/D Report, Meter \\r\\nReading, meter calibration and transformer /substation activity. \\r\\n❖ Managing the AOM (Active Output Management), O&M Activity.\"}, {\"title\": \"Instrumentation & Maintenance Engineer\", \"company\": \"Asian Paints Ltd from Sodexo Maclellan Pvt ltd.\", \"endDate\": \"Wed Jul 30\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Wed Apr 10\", \"description\": \"Experience in Calibration & working with Flow Transmitter, Temperature Transmitter, \\r\\nPressure Transmitter, Level Transmitter, Sensing devices and load cell (Rose Mount, Emerson, \\r\\nEndress & Hauser, Siemens, and Forbes Marsell). \\r\\n❖ Checking hot and cold loop of DCS, Loop Checking, Logic Checking & troubleshooting on DCS. \\r\\n❖ Experience on working ABB – DCS (800X – PM 891), ABB (CI- 801 & CI- 854), Gateway PLC, \\r\\nCommunication Protocol such as Profibus, Modbus, Ethernet, OFC. \\r\\n❖ Involved in installation of Field Instruments as well as configuring the parameters as per the \\r\\nrelative requirement of the site and assembling and installing the equipment. \\r\\n❖ Experience on commissioning and calibration of SMART Devices like mass flow meter, \\r\\ndifferential pressure transmitter, differential flow transmitter, level transmitter, temperature \\r\\ntransmitter through “HART COMMUNICATOR” (Emerson-475). \\r\\n❖ Experience on variable DRIVES (Siemens, ABB, Moog) & MCC (motor control center). \\r\\n❖ Profibus looping and node checking with the RIO’s panel during breakdown and preventive \\r\\nmaintenance. \\r\\n❖ Looking after all Calibration, breakdown & maintenance activity of WBPB (Water Based Paint \\r\\nBlock), SPB (Solvent Paint Block), RB (Resin Block), EB (Emulsion Block). \\r\\n❖ Preparing daily reports like preventive Maintenance and corrective action plans, Shut Down \\r\\nmaintenance preparing documentation on calibration device status. \\r\\n❖ Experience in calibration and Troubleshooting of Control Valve (TCV, PCV & FCV).\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2009\", \"degree\": \"B.E in Electronics & Instrumentation Engineering\", \"result\": \"69\", \"institution\": \"Sinhgad Institute of Management\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1764728921-171.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('028f7ecf-f2f5-4a2e-a403-3f5ffe394bc9','7c242e2c-d812-4d2b-8ee7-0d44a6359384','Senior Customer Service Associate/Office Assistant/Backoffice',NULL,'Senior Customer Service Associate/Office Assistant/Backoffice',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Media\", \"Advertising\", \"Critical Thinking\", \"Microsoft Office\", \"Chat\", \"Back Office Operations\", \"Customer Retention\", \"Customer Relationship Management (CRM)\", \"Customer Satisfaction\", \"Customer Service Management\", \"Problem Solving\", \"Patience\", \"Recruitment\", \"Talent Acquisition\", \"Recruiting\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-14 11:46:41.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"Senior Customer Service Associate/Office Assistant/Backoffice\", \"company\": \"RK Global\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[]','[]