e\": \"Wed Feb 06\", \"description\": \"• Maintained 99.5% infrastructure availability across server, network & endpoints for 300 users; critical MTTR < 2 hrs. • Produced 12 SOPs & training guides — reduced new-staff onboarding time by 30%. EDUCATION\"}, {\"title\": \"Microsoft Intune & Exchange Administrator\", \"company\": \"Cognizant Technology Solutions\", \"endDate\": \"Fri Apr 16\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Thu Jul 16\", \"description\": \"• MDM/MAM for 2,000+ devices on Intune — non-compliant incidents down 60% in two quarters; passed all security audits. • Led Exchange Online migration of 1,500 mailboxes — 1 week ahead of schedule, zero data loss, 99.9% availability.\"}, {\"title\": \"ServiceNow Developer & Administrator\", \"company\": \"Cognizant Technology Solutions\", \"endDate\": \"Mon May 19\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Thu Jun 10\", \"description\": \" Implemented Incident Management: Created new fields, tables, views, modules and documents for implementation  Regular Interaction with Client for requirements Clarification  Form Validations using UI Policies. •  Worked with SLA and used ACL for Controlling Security mechanism in ServiceNow  Created Buttons and Context menus both on form and list using UI Actions  Worked on Business rules on different scenarios based on Client requirements to • automate the process of incidents.  Used Background Scripts in case of any data validations the • • •  Worked on Data policy, dictionary entries to meet client requirements  Developed UI policies, UI actions, Client scripts to make User interface effective  Experience in glide Ajax and implemented vastly to fetch the date from server.  Implemented Service Catalog effectively to make ServiceNow end user friendly  Handled Data Sources, import sets and transform maps to load the data from other • sources of the project.\"}, {\"title\": \"Senior Software Enginee\", \"company\": \"Tech Mahindra\", \"endDate\": \"Thu Dec 25\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Wed Aug 13\", \"description\": \"• Reduced HR service resolution time by 35% — redesigned HRSD Case Management framework (case categories, assignment rules, SLA definitions) for 3,000+ employees. • Automated Onboarding & Offboarding via Lifecycle Events & Flow Designer, cutting completion from 5 days to 48 hrs; L1 HR queries down 40%. • Delivered self-service Employee Centre portal (HR Catalogue, Knowledge Base, document Management) — 80% selfservice rate, inbound HR cases down 30%. • Authored 15 Knowledge Base articles; configured 10+ HR Templates aligned to German compliance requirements.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2017\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech in Computer Science and Engineering\", \"result\": \"7.3\", \"institution\": \"JNTU\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/mownika-annem-1790676209-388.pdf\", \"title\": \"MOWNIKA ANNEM\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('03391dfc-18d7-4bf5-b4c7-a4970837ac28','708b0243-62df-470d-9968-cc73228d974a','Test Resume22','Test Resume22','Software Deve',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Guidewire Automation Testing\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-26 19:56:17.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Deve\", \"company\": \"Cognizant \", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[{\"year\": \"\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech\", \"result\": \"\", \"institution\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('033becf4-37c9-42df-a55b-ff40f5fb1505','cd94577a-fa8c-4106-b1f2-a09eb08cdf72','Azure devops engeneer',NULL,'Azure devops engeneer',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Azure DevOps\", \"TerraForm\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-16 11:31:39.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"Azure devops engeneer\", \"company\": \"Coventine digital private ltd\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('03426402-c588-4748-8937-ab3707e03b54','c09bfb24-0356-48ab