erational visibility \r\nfor 1000+ end users.','Senior Engineer – Industrial IoT',2,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1769167530-750.pdf',NULL,'[\"JavaScript\", \"CSS\", \"Java\", \"HTML\", \"C#\", \"Github\", \"Angular\", \".NET CORE\", \"Microservices\", \"Docker\", \"Kubernetes\", \"ThingWorx\", \"ThingWorx Applications\", \"ThingWorx Navigate\", \"Kepware\", \"MYSQL\", \"Powershell\", \"Python\", \"REST API\"]','PUBLIC','2026-01-23 23:40:38.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Senior Engineer – Industrial IoT\", \"company\": \"LTIMindtree\", \"endDate\": \"Tue Jan 20\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Sun Oct 10\", \"description\": \"• Engineered automated reports to analyze production metrics, batch details, product details, and inventory status tracked \\r\\nacross daily production shifts in Thingworx Composer resulting in reduced data processing time and eliminating manual \\r\\ninventory tracking errors. \\r\\n• Architected a multi-tenant Thingworx solution using user extensions across a single server instance, reducing operational \\r\\ninfrastructure costs by 66% across 11 manufacturing sites. \\r\\n• Optimized database schemas and executed SQL agent scripts to automate workflows, improving data reliability and \\r\\nreducing manual tasks. \\r\\n• Designed advanced queries in DBThings, custom extensions and services in Things/ThingShapes for seamless \\r\\ndata retrieval, data export and dynamic dashboard updates, enabling real-time data visibility and improved tracking. \\r\\n• Created intuitive Thingworx Mashups for visually appealing and informative dashboards using custom CSS, \\r\\nexpressions, validators, event routers, etc., to enhance data visualization and improve user engagement.  \\r\\n• Developed and maintained comprehensive documentation covering services, architectural patterns and operational \\r\\nworkflows to ensure consistency and knowledge sharing across teams and end users. \\r\\n• Enhanced system security by implementing Role-Based Access Control (RBAC) via Active Directory, strictly \\r\\nenforcing least-privilege policies across sensitive IoT nodes. \\r\\n• Integrated Thingworx application with on-prem servers via gateway (using MQTT, OPC UA, Modbus TCP/IP \\r\\nprotocols, GDH and Kepware servers) to achieve seamless integration of our full-stack software with IoT hardware, \\r\\nenabling real-time capture of operational data for advanced analysis. \\r\\n• Led the enterprise migration of Thingworx Foundation (version 9.3.2 to 9.7.0), resolving critical legacy bugs and \\r\\noptimizing system throughput. \\r\\n• Successfully managed roll-out of new application releases and deployed Thingworx Foundation across multiple \\r\\nproduction environments as part of the release process.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2021\", \"degree\": \"B. Tech, Computer Science and Engineering\", \"result\": \"63\", \"institution\": \"Techno India University\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1769167530-750.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('058af509-d438-4df1-ac1d-c7a92fa7161e','0b4a6f3e-ba96-4b31-be43-d30dfe37abb8','Test Resume96','Test Resume96','Professional',1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','PUBLIC','2025-05-24 18:13:50.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[]','[{\"year\": \"\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech\", \"result\": \"\", \"institution\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',1400000.00,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('058f3421-594e-4a98-b04c-48947de7e900','ea24ddb1-da7a-4b4f-b094-f03b542eb775','CEO',NULL,'CEO',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"HTML\", \"C++\", \"AutoCAD\", \"Microsoft Office\", \"Interior Design\", \"Interior Architecture\", \"Management\", \"Business Development\", \"Leadership\", \"Business Planning\", \"C\", \"Space Planning\", \"Team Management\", \"Project Management\", \"Project Planning\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-16 10:34:44.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"CEO\", \"company\": \"Clarus Interiors & Designers\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \