cient in Machine Learning and Deep Learning technique',' Data Scientist with 5+ Years of Experience in developing and deploying \r\nAI/ML solutions across multiple domains, with strong problem-solving, \r\ncommunication, and team collaboration skills. \r\n Proficient in Machine Learning and Deep Learning techniques, including \r\nANN, CNN, RNN, LSTM, and advanced architectures for building robust \r\npredictive models. \r\n Expertise in Natural Language Processing (NLP), including Named Entity \r\nRecognition (NER), text classification, multi-label classification, word \r\nembeddings, and conversational AI. \r\n Hands-on experience with RAG and  Large Language Models (LLMs) and \r\nGenerative AI such as GPT-4, BERT, and Transformers, applied in chatbot \r\ndevelopment and content generation. \r\n Proficient in Python programming and core data science libraries: NumPy, \r\nPandas, Matplotlib, Seaborn, Scikit-learn, PyTorch, and TensorFlow. \r\n Built and deployed interactive AI applications using tools like Streamlit for \r\nUI development and Azure ML/OpenAI for scalable cloud-based solutions. \r\n Familiar with AI orchestration frameworks such as Langchain, LangGraph, \r\nLlamaIndex, and prompt engineering techniques for enhancing model \r\nperformance. \r\n Skilled in implementing a variety of ML algorithms: linear/logistic regression, \r\ndecision trees, SVM, KNN, Naive Bayes, ensemble methods (Random Forest, \r\nXGBoost), and clustering (K-means, DBSCAN). \r\n Involved in client demonstrations, knowledge transfers, and technical \r\npresentations, showcasing AI solution capabilities and business value. \r\n Experienced in working across cloud environments, including GCP, AWS, and \r\nAzure, for developing, deploying, and scaling AI/ML solutions. \r\n Strong understanding of end-to-end AI solution development, from data \r\npreprocessing and model training to deployment, monitoring, and continuous \r\nimprovement.','Data Scientist',6,NULL,'/uploads/res