paigns, LinkedIn\\r\\noutreach, Apollo, Lusha). \\r\\nRegularly reported on paid/inbound leads performance and pipeline movement, providing insights on conversion trends,\\r\\ndrop-offs, and next-step actions to improve closure rates.\\r\\nExecuted full sales lifecycle: discovery, requirement mapping, solution positioning, product demos, negotiation, and closure.\\r\\nClosed deals with domestic and cross-border clients, managing stakeholders including CXOs, HR Heads, and founders.\\r\\nAchieved high conversion through consultative selling and business-focused solution mapping.\\r\\nRecognised for fast deal closures, including same-call and demo-stage conversions.\\r\\nDelivered tailored demos highlighting ROI across payroll automation, compliance, and workforce management.\\r\\nConsistently exceeded revenue targets by optimising pipeline velocity and leveraging upsell/cross-sell opportunities.\\r\\nUsed LeadSquared CRM and Excel for pipeline tracking, forecasting, and performance reporting.\\r\\nCollaborated cross-functionally with product, onboarding, and support teams to improve customer experience and\\r\\nimplementation success.\\r\\nSupported onboarding and implementation, including payroll setup, attendance systems, and compliance configuration\"}, {\"title\": \"Inside Sales Specialist (B2C EdTech)\", \"company\": \"Simplilearn\", \"endDate\": \"Sun Nov 10\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Sat Feb 10\", \"description\": \"Converted high-intent inbound and outbound leads into paid enrollments by driving structured conversations focused on career outcomes and ROI.\\r\\nManaged a high-velocity sales environment with 200+ daily touchpoints, balancing speed with personalisation across domestic and international\\r\\nprospects.\\r\\nDelivered consistent performance, achieving 85–90%+ of monthly revenue targets through disciplined follow-ups and conversion-focused engagement.\\r\\nActed as a career advisor, guiding students and working professionals in selecting programs aligned with long-term goals rather than just closing\\r\\ntransactions.\\r\\nStrengthened customer engagement by building trust early in the funnel, resulting in higher retention and referral-driven conversions.\\r\\nLeveraged Salesforce CRM to track funnel movement, analyse conversion behaviour, and maintain clean pipeline data for decision-making.\\r\\nImproved conversion efficiency by 15–20% by refining follow-up strategy and personalised communication.\\r\\nGenerated consistent monthly revenue contribution in the range of ₹6–10L through high-volume lead conversion and pipeline management.\"}, {\"title\": \"Business Development Associate - Internship B2B\", \"company\": \"Be10X\", \"endDate\": \"Thu Jan 25\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Mon Apr 10\", \"description\": \"Transitioned from intern to a full-time role with increased ownership, contributing to B2B revenue generation across institutions and corporate clients\\r\\nEngaged with decision-makers across schools, colleges, and corporate L&D teams to understand training needs and position relevant solutions.\\r\\nClosed institutional and corporate deals by aligning product offerings with business use-cases and ROI expectations.\\r\\nCollaborated with internal teams to ensure smooth onboarding and delivery of training programs.\\r\\nMaintained CRM hygiene and tracked pipeline movement using LeadSquared/Marvin, ensuring accurate forecasting and reporting.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2023\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech in Computer Science & Engineering\", \"result\": \"63\", \"institution\": \"Techno India University\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1776972886-195.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('06d467b1-e89b-4263-bc51-173754a5f708','501418d1-b966-41ba-805c-c7af1f0c4320','Founder and CEO',NULL,'Founder and CEO',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Magento\", \"HTML\", \"CSS\", \"JavaScript\", \"JQUERY\", \"AJAX\", \"API\", \"PHP\", \"MYSQL\", \"Wordpres