agement systems, including the creation, revision and review of \\r\\nLIMS static data for R&D and commercial products, and the assessment \\r\\nof all changes for impact to LIMS static data. \\r\\n• Initiation of change controls in QMS for changes related in LIMS \\r\\nfollowed by execution of changes in LIMS and finally closure of change \\r\\ncontrols in QMS. \\r\\n• Responsible for product launch readiness and implementation of tech \\r\\ntransfer packages for NPD, PLCM, MLCM and site transfers. \\r\\n• Planning and monitoring of execution & completion of LIMS related \\r\\nchange controls within Apotex Corporate structure. \\r\\n• Liaise with QC and R&D labs, GIS, Global QC LIMS Business Support, \\r\\nQuality, internal & external consultants on new developments & cross\\r\\ndivisional changes for configuration, code, reports and projects.\"}, {\"title\": \"Chemist\", \"company\": \"SGS India Pvt Ltd.\", \"endDate\": \"Fri Feb 19\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Tue Jun 30\", \"description\": \"• Operated sophisticated analytical instruments such as mass \\r\\nspectrometers, chromatographs, calorimeters, viscometers, \\r\\nrefractometers, titrators, spectrophotometers. \\r\\n• Performed wet lab analysis for Stability samples including test like \\r\\nRelated Compounds, Residual Solvents, dissolution on HPLC, GC. \\r\\n• Daily Calibrations of Balances and periodic calibrations of instruments.\"}, {\"title\": \"Senior Executive\", \"company\": \"Reliance Life Sciences\", \"endDate\": \"Thu Jul 30\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Thu Jul 31\", \"description\": \"• Senior executive Quality control in Stability group – charging and pull \\r\\nout of samples, Analysis including HPLC, DISSOLUTION, \\r\\nDISINTEGRATION, WATER CONTENT by KF, HARDNESS, FRIABILITY \\r\\nand other analysis. \\r\\n• LIMS – Configuration of products in LIMS (RM and PM), dealing with \\r\\nmaster data configuration, configuration of analysis, product and item \\r\\ncode according to the Specification. \\r\\n• Performing IQ, OQ, PQ in LIMS for Stability configurations and reports. \\r\\n• Faced GMP Certification audits from USFDA, MHRA, WHO, State FDA \\r\\nand various vendor audits.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2014\", \"degree\": \"Master of Science - Biotechnology\", \"result\": \"68\", \"institution\": \"S.I.E.S College - Sion\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1759235267-17.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('0768d405-7eb6-49ac-b1ee-b1953ee8b021','01d52c9a-5bf0-4d01-9fcd-6c9aa77e835b','Senior Mechanical Engineer',NULL,'Senior Mechanical Engineer',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Microsoft Excel\", \"Microsoft Word\", \"Excel\", \"Production Management\", \"Project Management\", \"Risk Management\", \"Word\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-14 16:36:21.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"Senior Mechanical Engineer\", \"company\": \"Elecon Engineering Co\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]',650000.00,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('07719a1c-4857-4190-829c-e4fa1104bef1','50401529-3091-4081-a54c-dbd2131de8f1','Deputy CEO',NULL,'Deputy CEO',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Microsoft Office\", \"Leadership\", \"Customer Service\", \"Business Strategy\", \"Team Management\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-16 10:25:39.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"Deputy CEO\", \"company\": \"Techno Solutions\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('0773bf0f-e662-49fc-84ea-f4a2029238c1','d9abd59e-4f4c-41af-bb5a-015124c6b8b0','Senior Associate - Technology',NULL,'Senior Associate - Technology',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"CSS\", \"JavaScript\", \"JQUERY\", \"Java\", \"Android\", \"JavaScript\", \"C++\", \"HTML\", \"PHP Development\", \"PHP\", \"Swagger\", \"XML\", \"SQL\", \"PHP\", \"C\", \"MYSQL\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-14 20:03:16.000000','2026-10-21 07:09