 and Redshift. Strong knowledge of relational databases including MySQL and PostgreSQL. \r\nHands-on expertise in workflow orchestration and automation of ETL pipelines using Apache Airflow','Aws Senior Data Engineer',6,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1768248381-747.pdf',NULL,'[\"Data Pipelines\", \"ETL\", \"Data Modeling\", \"Data Integration\", \"Matplotlib\", \"AWS\", \"Azure\", \"Data Lake\", \"AWS Glue\", \"EC2\", \"CloudWatch\", \"Database Design\", \"System Performance Optimization\", \"Pandas\", \"Numpy\", \"Pyspark\", \"ADF\", \"Redshift\", \"S3\"]','PUBLIC','2026-01-13 08:14:52.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Aws Senior Data Engineer\", \"company\": \"Happiest Minds Technologies\", \"endDate\": \"Fri Nov 28\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Wed Sep 18\", \"description\": \"• Developing and deploying serverless functions (Lambdas) for data transformation and \\r\\nprocessing within each pipeline. \\r\\n• Designing and implementing ETL (Extract, Transform, Load) processes using AWS Glue to \\r\\nmove and prepare data. \\r\\n• Monitoring the performance and reliability of Lambda functions and Glue jobs. \\r\\n• Automate tasks and processes using Python scripts within Lambda functions. \\r\\n• Defined and deployed monitoring, metrics, and logging systems on AWS. \\r\\n• Integrate with various data sources like SFMC, AEP APIs, and internal databases (Aurora DB)\"}, {\"title\": \"Aws Senior Data Engineer\", \"company\": \"Amiga Informatics\", \"endDate\": \"Sat Jul 20\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Tue Oct 10\", \"description\": \"Design, develop, and implement serverless architectures using AWS Lambda for data processing \\r\\ntasks. \\r\\nAutomate tasks and processes using Python scripts within Lambda functions. \\r\\nDefined and deployed monitoring, metrics, and logging systems on AWS. \\r\\nIntegrate with various data sources like SFTP locations, Workday APIs, and internal databases \\r\\n(RDS PostgreSQL). \\r\\nDesigned and Developed ETL jobs to extract data from Sales data from PostgreSQL Database and \\r\\nload it in Redshift. \\r\\nResponsible for Designing Logical and Physical data modelling for various data sources on \\r\\nRedshift. \\r\\nImplement data validation processes and data pipelines for seamless data transfer and \\r\\ntransformation.\"}, {\"title\": \"Aws Senior Data Engineer\", \"company\": \"Newage Software Solutions\", \"endDate\": \"Fri Sep 15\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Wed Mar 10\", \"description\": \"• Design, implement, and continuously expand data pipelines by performing extraction, \\r\\ntransformation, and loading activities. \\r\\n• Develop ETL data workflows for new data integrations and maintain/enhance existing workflows \\r\\nand code. \\r\\n• Migrating data from one Database to another Using AWS and AZURE ADF \\r\\n• Designed and Developed ETL jobs to extract data from Sales data from Oracle Database and load \\r\\nit in Redshift. \\r\\n• Used glue to create the table structure for the raw files and created jobs to load them into DWH \\r\\n(Redshift). \\r\\n• Written Scripts in Glue Jobs to make the raw file data into canonical format and remove \\r\\nunwanted data, columns and load them into the Redshift database. \\r\\n• Scripting, automating routine tasks, performance tuning, and other database related activities.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2015\", \"degree\": \"Bachelor of Technology in Computer Science\", \"result\": \"75\", \"institution\": \"Pune University\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1768248381-747.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('07b5ddca-6827-46f6-a245-266bd75075e7','3ba7d021-61f4-4ed1-80b2-a8c439c77532','Java Specialist',NULL,'Java Specialist',1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Java\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-23 20:35:21.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('07bb2f3a-d924-445d-9f33-72cb02789c66','93de0ff5-8fcf-4080-b217-6c6887