tion modernization.','SOFTWARE ENGINEER',2,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/aldo-passio-thomas-p-1792066565-3.pdf',NULL,'[\"JavaScript\", \"Mes\", \"Java\", \"SQL\", \"Rockwell Factorytalk\", \"SQL\", \"PTC ThingWorx Platform\", \"ThingWorx\"]','PUBLIC','2026-10-15 23:39:05.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"SOFTWARE ENGINEER\", \"company\": \"ROCKWELL AUTOMATION\", \"endDate\": \"Thu Jan 01\", \"isCurrent\": true, \"startDate\": \"Wed Oct 16\", \"description\": \"CLIENT: SLB (MAY 2022 – PRESENT)\\r\\nWorked across both Manufacturing Execution Systems (MES) and\\r\\nIndustrial IoT (IIoT) solution domains, delivering enterprise-scale\\r\\nmanufacturing automation solutions.\\r\\nDesigned and developed MES-SAP integration interfaces for seamless\\r\\nproduction order, confirmation, and manufacturing data exchange.\\r\\nImplemented Operation Start and Operation End transaction workflows to\\r\\nsupport real-time shop-floor execution and production tracking.\\r\\nDeveloped Final Confirmation and Partial Confirmation integrations\\r\\nbetween MES and SAP, improving production reporting accuracy.\\r\\nAutomated Non-Conformance Report (NCR) communication processes,\\r\\nreducing manual intervention and improving issue traceability.\\r\\nDesigned and implemented scheduler-based failed transaction\\r\\nreprocessing mechanisms, increasing integration reliability and reducing\\r\\noperational downtime.\\r\\nBuilt a dedicated ThingWorx application for visualization of critical\\r\\nproduction and manufacturing KPIs.\\r\\nDeveloped Plant Overview dashboards providing real-time operational\\r\\nvisibility across manufacturing lines.\\r\\nImplemented live alerting and notification systems for proactive\\r\\nmonitoring of production events and exceptions.\\r\\nDeveloped OEE (Overall Equipment Effectiveness) and OLE (Overall Line\\r\\nEffectiveness) reporting solutions to support operational excellence\\r\\ninitiatives.\\r\\nCollaborated with cross-functional teams including Manufacturing,\\r\\nQuality, SAP, and Operations to deliver end-to-end production solutions.\\r\\nParticipated in requirements gathering, solution design, development,\\r\\ntesting, deployment, and post-production support activities.\\r\\nCERTIFICATIONS\\r\\nThingWorx Associate\\r\\nCertification\\r\\nThingWorx Developer Model\\r\\nSpecialist Exam\\r\\nThingWorx Developer\\r\\nDeploy Specialist Exam\\r\\nClient: NBC Bearings (Jun 2021 – May 2022)\\r\\nLed development of digital transformation solutions for NBC\\r\\nmanufacturing client.\\r\\nManaged ThingWorx server installation, configuration, and upgrades on\\r\\nWindows.\\r\\nDesigned and implemented ThingWorx mashups for production\\r\\nmonitoring, OEE dashboards, and maintenance insights.\\r\\nBuilt machine monitoring system for 100+ machines with real-time\\r\\nupdates under 2 seconds.\\r\\nDeveloped custom JavaScript services for data aggregation, validation,\\r\\nand API integration.\\r\\nCreated reusable templates and UI components adopted across multiple\\r\\nIoT teams to ensure consistency and faster delivery.\\r\\nIntegrated ThingWorx with external SQL databases for large-scale\\r\\nmachine data handling.\\r\\nConfigured Industrial Connectivity using ThingWorx Kepware for OPC\\r\\ncommunication and real-time equipment data acquisition.\\r\\nCreated reusable ThingTemplates, ThingShapes, and Data Tables to\\r\\nstandardize asset models.\\r\\nConfigured Value Streams for time-series data tracking and historical\\r\\nanalysis.\\r\\nBuilt REST API integrations between ThingWorx and ERP/MES systems\\r\\nfor seamless data exchange.\\r\\nImplemented role-based access control and enhanced security measures\\r\\nacross applications.\\r\\nPerformed platform tuning through optimized queries and database\\r\\nindexing for improved performance.\\r\\nImproved application performance by 40% through optimized service\\r\\nlogic.\\r\\nPerformed system monitoring and troubleshooting for ThingWorx\\r\\napplications.\\r\\nC