"title\": \"Cognos Consultant\", \"company\": \"McLane Enterprises\", \"endDate\": \"Thu Nov 20\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Fri Sep 15\", \"description\": \"Environment: Cognos Analytics 11.1 R7, Manhattan SCI, Oracle 11g, Windows Server 2008 \\r\\n• Providing production support and performing report enhancements across critical business functions. \\r\\n• Developed and maintained dashboards using Manhattan SCI (Warehouse Management System) for \\r\\nwarehouse and logistics analysis. \\r\\n• Worked on Framework Manager model promotion from UAT to Production ensuring data consistency and \\r\\nsecurity compliance.  \\r\\n• Modified and optimized stored procedures as per evolving business requirements to improve data \\r\\nprocessing efficiency. \\r\\n• Monitored and analysed job failures in Control-M, identifying root causes and rerunning failed jobs manually \\r\\nwhen required. \\r\\n• Performed log analysis on Linux servers to troubleshoot issues in ETL and Cognos report executions. \\r\\n• Utilized Jira for tracking incidents, job failures, and enhancement requests, ensuring timely resolution of \\r\\nclient tickets. \\r\\n• Enhanced existing reports and dashboards to align with KPIs and data visualization standards. \\r\\n• Collaborated with cross-functional teams to design and optimize data flows for Manhattan SCI integration. \\r\\n• Optimized report performance by analysing SQL queries and improving framework model relationships. \\r\\n• Worked closely with data engineering team to monitor and validate data pipelines related to Manhattan SCI. \\r\\n• Contributed to continuous improvements in data governance and ETL validation processes.\"}, {\"title\": \"BI Analyst\", \"company\": \"American International Group (AIG)\", \"endDate\": \"Sat Jul 29\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Thu Mar 10\", \"description\": \"Environment: Cognos 11.1 R7, Oracle 11g, Windows Server 2008 \\r\\n• Developed complex Cognos reports using drill-through, prompts, and conditional formatting for finance and \\r\\nrisk analysis teams. \\r\\n• Created Framework Manager models, implemented row-level security, and published secured packages for \\r\\nbusiness users. \\r\\n• Designed and maintained dashboards providing insights into KPIs for executive-level decision-making. \\r\\n• Developed MTD and YTD reports, ensuring data accuracy and timely delivery to stakeholders. \\r\\n• Implemented bursting functionality to distribute customized reports to multiple departments automatically. \\r\\n• Monitored report schedules and automated workflows ensuring reliability in recurring reports. \\r\\n• Optimized SQL queries to enhance report performance and reduce load time by up to 30%. \\r\\n• Worked with business teams to analyse requirements, validate report data, and support production \\r\\nactivities. \\r\\n• Acted as SME for report troubleshooting, providing quick resolutions for production issues.\"}, {\"title\": \"BI Analyst\", \"company\": \"Trade and Development Bank\", \"endDate\": \"Fri Feb 25\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Wed Mar 10\", \"description\": \"Environment: Cognos 11.1 R7, Oracle 11g \\r\\n• Led migration from Cognos 10.2.2 to Cognos 11, successfully converting reports and models with zero data \\r\\nloss. \\r\\n• Developed list, crosstab, chart, and active reports used by business users for daily and monthly reporting. \\r\\n• Created interactive dashboards using Cognos Workspace to visualize key business metrics. \\r\\n• Supported report deployment and validation across Dev, UAT, and Production environments. \\r\\n• Collaborated with end-users to refine specifications and improve report usability. \\r\\n• Troubleshot report-level data issues ensuring data accuracy and consistency.\"}, {\"title\": \"Cognos Developer\", \"company\": \"Wal-Mart Inc\", \"endDate\": \"Thu Feb 25\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Mon Jan 20\", \"description\": \"Environment: IBM Cognos CA11, IBM Cognos 10.2.1, Oracle 11g, SQL Server, UNIX \\r\\n• Enhanced Framework Manager models and packages in alignment with new business rules. \\r\\n• Developed complex reports including drill-through, crosstab, bursting, and master-detail layouts. \\r\\n• Created conditional formatting and prompts for dynamic user experience and flexibility. \\r\\n• Performed Cognos administration tasks such as data source creation, scheduling, and deployments. \\r\\n• Collaborated with business teams to gather requirements and convert them into technical solutions. \\r\\n• Worked on performance tuning by optimizing queries and improving data caching mechanisms. \\r\\n• Provided production support ensuring timely resolution of report and data issues.\"}, {\"title\": \"Cognos Developer\", \"company\": \"Client - Genpact\", \"endDate\": \"Tue Dec 10\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Wed Jan 10\", \"description\": \"Environment: IBM Cognos BI, IBM DB2, IBM DataStage \\r\\n• Developed list, grouped list, crosstab, and chart reports to meet diverse reporting needs. \\r\\n• Created user-based report security and managed role assignments for access control. \\r\\n• Implemented filters, parameters, and cascading prompts to improve interactivity in reports. \\r\\n• Generated monthly, quarterly, and yearly business reports and validated outputs with data owners. \\r\\n• Involved in production support activities including issue resolution and enhancement requests. \\r\\n• Collaborated with ETL teams for data consistency between source and reporting layers.\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1764168312-217.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('090eda3d-ab2e-44c1-8672-15d0a88ac6a7','067d7372-b253-4f0d-be49-2d408384026f','Test Resume195','Test Resume195','Software Deve',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','PUBLIC','2025-05-24 21:17:21.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Deve\", \"company\": \"TCS\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": fals