on\", \"MYSQL\", \"Numpy\", \"Python\", \"Numpy\", \"MYSQL\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-13 16:31:54.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"Artificial Intelligence Engineer\", \"company\": \"D2R AI Labs\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('092bcc0b-0577-4d22-8745-3244e464644b','1acabb1c-9337-4e6b-b006-0c87b80cfce8','Data Engineer with 4.5 years total experience (including 3+ years relevant) in the Azure data ecosystem. Currently working at \r\nCognizant (since July 2021), specializing in big data solutions using Azure and Databricks. Skilled in designing and delivering','Data Engineer with 4.5 years total experience (including 3+ years relevant) in the Azure data ecosystem. Currently working at \r\nCognizant (since July 2021), specializing in big data solutions using Azure and Databricks. Skilled in designing and delivering \r\nscalable ETL/ELT pipelines with Azure Data Factory (ADF), Databricks, Py-Spark, Spark SQL, Delta Lake, and Azure Data Lake \r\nStorage (ADLS). Experienced in Databricks workflows, job orchestration, performance optimization, and implementing \r\nmedallion architecture for large structured and unstructured datasets. Strong hands-on expertise with Azure Synapse for data \r\nintegration and analytics. Proficient in Python and SQL for data processing, cleaning, transformation, and quality \r\nimprovement. Familiar with Power BI for visualization and reporting, with a focus on leveraging the Spark ecosystem to solve \r\ncomplex data challenges efficiently.','Data Engineer',2,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1767298858-598.pdf',NULL,'[\"Microsoft Azure Platform\", \"ETL\", \"Git\", \"Github\", \"Azure DevOps\", \"ADF\", \"Azure Databricks\", \"Azure Data Lake Storage\", \"Delta Lake\", \"Azure Functions\", \"Python\", \"MYSQL\", \"Pyspark\", \"Spark\", \"System Performance Optimization\", \"Big Data technologies\"]','PUBLIC','2026-01-02 08:37:27