ed use case fine-tuning based on business requirements. • Onboarded and offboarded Windows and syslog devices to LogRhythm. • Identified vulnerabilities in security products and recommended best practices. • Delivered SOC services to meet business and customer expectations. • Utilized EDR tools such as CrowdStrike and Kaspersky for malware detection and response. • Conducted raw log analysis and checked for parsing issues. • Generated daily, weekly, and monthly SOC reports as per the client requirement. • Monitored EPS spikes and device health, troubleshooting silent log sources. • Collaborated with external auditors to provide evidence and remediate findings. • Worked with ServiceNow for ticketing and ensured resolution within SLAs. • Engaged stakeholders to mitigate issues and improve the security posture. • Participated in leadership decision-making and security meetings for improvements.\\r\\nAnalyst - Sykes Oct 2019 – July 2021 • Provided L1 SOC support using ArcSight SIEM tool. • Investigated anti-malware detections and escalated complex issues for deeper analysis. • Reviewed and blocked malicious URLs, domains, and IPs. • Conducted regular health checks for Palo Alto, Cisco, and Checkpoint firewalls. • Correlated logs to detect IOCs and determined remediation and escalation paths. • Analyzed security breaches and investigated alerts to identify root causes. • Utilized endpoint EDR tools for proactive threat containment. • Expert in Handling DLP incidents, Identifying True positive events and escalating to the appropriate team for further\\r\\naction • Finetuned DLP alerts across various channels Network, endpoint Https & Endpoint LAN to minimize the false\\r\\npositives\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2012\", \"degree\": \"Computer Science\", \"result\": \"Yes\", \"institution\": \"VNR Vignana Jyothi Institute of Engineering and Technology\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1765525448-428.pdf\", \"title\": \"cv\", \"isDefault\": fal