ows and nanoflows to implement business validations and process logic. \\r\\n• Built and customized UI pages using Mendix widgets, layouts, and dynamic visibility. \\r\\n• Configured Single Sign-On (SSO) authentication to enable secure user login. \\r\\n• Implemented SAP integration from the Mendix side for data exchange and business operations. \\r\\n• Developed and consumed REST APIs for external system connectivity. \\r\\n• Participated in requirement analysis and translated business needs into technical solutions. \\r\\n• Managed application releases and ensured stable deployments across environments. \\r\\n• Provided production support including issue analysis and bug resolution.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2021\", \"degree\": \"B.E. Electronics & Telecommunication Engineering\", \"result\": \"73\", \"institution\": \"Pune University\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1776193356-438.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('0ca71f9a-d7af-461a-8545-8d9b758ba3b9','4b9e3c23-e893-4391-818c-27ff8eace8c5','Test Resume260','Test Resume260','Software Deve',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','PUBLIC','2025-05-25 20:34:50.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Deve\", \"company\": \"Achyutas\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[{\"year\": \"\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech\", \"result\": \"\", \"institution\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('0cac9c02-2a12-4a37-bea3-b482b5be7e74','a9433a02-390b-4d43-8bed-aa1a86c256c5','To look for new challenges and work towards achieving them with the highest level of efficiency. To secure a\r\nchallenging assignment that would provide a significant coverage for progressive learning growth and opportunities\r\nand achieve in-depth practica','To look for new challenges and work towards achieving them with the highest level of efficiency. To secure a\r\nchallenging assignment that would provide a significant cover