ace.\\r\\nRoles & Responsibilities\\r\\n• Requirement Analysis – Gathered business needs to track daily/monthly core production and\\r\\nmaterial consumption (resin, hardener, amine).\\r\\n• Design & Development – Designed and developed a Core Shop Report application using custom CDS\\r\\nviews .\\r\\n• UI Implementation – Built selection screen with filters (Plant, Date, Material, Prepared Sand) and\\r\\nintegrated search help functionality.\\r\\n• Data Integration & Logic – Implemented calculation logic for Core Production, Core Rejection, Mix\\r\\nWastage %, Resin %, Hardener %, Amine %, and ensured duplication removal.\\r\\n• Validations – Enforced mandatory fields (Plant, Date, Prepared Sand), and added error handling for\\r\\nmissing/incorrect inputs.\\r\\n• Enhancements – Applied BAdIs and application logic for performance, reporting, and export to\\r\\nspreadsheet.\\r\\nClient: Reliable Au\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2021\", \"degree\": \"Computer Science\", \"result\": \"Yes\", \"institution\": \"Savitribai Phule University Pune\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('110db7b6-1463-47ef-ab99-485eeeec1fdd','4a34343f-7891-420e-ad5c-7745914cf08b','Technical Program Manager with 8 years of\r\nexperience delivering Government,\r\nFinTech, and Enterprise Digital\r\nTransformation initiatives. Skilled in\r\nprogram governance, stakeholder\r\nmanagement, Agile delivery, cloud\r\ninfrastructure, system integrations,','Technical Program Manager with 8 years of\r\nexperience delivering Government,\r\nFinTech, and Enterprise Digital\r\nTransformation initiatives. Skilled in\r\nprogram governance, stakeholder\r\nmanagement, Agile delivery, cloud\r\ninfrastructure, system integrations, and\r\ncross-functional team leadership. Proven\r\ntrack record of managing large-scale\r\nplatforms serving 500,000+ healthcare\r\nfacilities, with expertise in Java,\r\nMicroservices, AWS, and enterprise\r\nprogram delivery.','Technical Project Manager',6,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1