ynamic date selection in dashboards for customized data exploration.\\r\\nActed as a senior team member, taking on additional responsibilities to support team objectives and \\r\\nproject success.\\r\\nTrained and mentored junior team members on Power BI, Power Query, and advanced Excel \\r\\ntechniques, fostering skill development within the team.\\r\\nCollaborated with cross-functional teams to gather reporting requirements and translate business \\r\\nneeds into technical solutions.\\r\\nDeveloped and maintained documentation for automation processes and dashboards to support \\r\\ncontinuity and onboarding.\\r\\nConducted data validation and quality checks to ensure the accuracy and reliability of reports and \\r\\ndashboards\"}, {\"title\": \"Data analyst\", \"company\": \"Proziod analytics Pvt ltd\", \"endDate\": \"Thu Jun 23\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Fri Feb 05\", \"description\": \"Analyzed and parsed energy domain bills using automated tools and manual validation to ensure \\r\\n100% accuracy before integration into the billing platform.\\r\\nAssigned unique identifiers to each energy bill for streamlined tracking and reference.\\r\\nOnboard new energy domain sites onto the platform, ensuring all data and configurations met \\r\\nplatform standards.\\r\\nVerified energy rates and contract terms across providers to identify the most cost-effective options, \\r\\nrecommending optimal contracts for onboarding new sites.\\r\\nCreated standardized Excel report templates for consistent data reporting and uploaded them to the \\r\\nplatform.\\r\\nClosed energy domain sites on the platform as per project or client requirements.\\r\\nCleansed and formatted raw data, ensuring accuracy, consistency, and readiness for system ingestion.\\r\\nMapped consolidated energy bills to corresponding platform structures for proper categorization and \\r\\nusage.\\r\\nResponded to and resolved client and retailer email queries, providing accurate and timely \\r\\ni