ms, ensuring 99.9% data accuracy.\\r\\n• Automated workflows with Apache Airflow, cutting manual effort by 70% and\\r\\nimproving pipeline reliability with retry, scheduling, and DAG orchestration.\\r\\n• Optimized data preprocessing & validation using NumPy, Pandas, and\\r\\nSQLAlchemy, reducing transformation time by 40%on large-scale datasets\\r\\n(>1M rows).\\r\\n• Implemented secure, high-availability storage on AWS S3 via Boto3, enabling\\r\\ncost-efficient handling of 500GB+ structured/unstructured data.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2015\", \"degree\": \"Computer Science\", \"result\": \"Yes\", \"institution\": \"Mechanical Engineering Bharath University,\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1770280481-559.pdf\", \"title\": \"cv\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('141a6b49-697a-40db-8164-069ed330c4b7','077cdee6-f04b-428d-9dca-4c208264412c','Senior Associate Consultant \r\n| SPARTA trained TrackWise Developer | TW Digital Developer | Along with \r\nProduction Support with 7 years of IT Experience in the area of “TrackWise set \r\nof applications covering different phases of the project lifecycle. W','Senior Associate Consultant \r\n| SPARTA trained TrackWise Developer | TW Digital Developer | Along with \r\nProduction Support with 7 years of IT Experience in the area of “TrackWise set \r\nof applications covering different phases of the project lifecycle. Well \r\nexperienced in analysis, design through development to implementation & \r\ntesting and documentation of OQ scripts and Execution. Have worked on \r\nTrackWise Digital Application, Configuration and Support and have good \r\nunderstanding on Salesforce administration.','TrackWise Consultant',8,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/harish-kumar-s-1791463539-274.pdf',NULL,'[\"Crystal Report\", \"QMS System\", \"Trackwise configuration\", \"MS Excel\", \"SQL\"]','PUBLIC','2026-10-09 00:09:16.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"TrackWise Consultant\", \"company\": \"Impact Sy