 and review Configuration Specifications, Design Specifications, Technical Specifications, Data Dictionaries, \\r\\ntest cases, and deployment documents. \\r\\n• Guiding the users and providing on time resolution to fix the issue. Performed the testing in lower environments and \\r\\nfixed the user issues in higher environments. Performing AM/AQM activities periodically for keeping the user data \\r\\nupdated. \\r\\n• Modified the crystal report and implemented in all environments as per user requirements. Performed the SSL \\r\\ncertificate renewal activity and other periodical activities to ensure application data check. \\r\\n• Worked in TrackWise Digital by configuring the workflows and supporting the client queries. \\r\\n• Leading the team and trouble shoot the issues also delivered the projects under provided timeline in a quality \\r\\nmanner. Experienced in working on several projects. Involved in the preparation of a project plan. Followed the \\r\\nprocedures as per the customer\'s SOPs.  \\r\\n• Knowledge in Functional requirement specification and document preparation Configuration of QMS Workflows \\r\\naccording to Business Requirements. Data Field Sheet and Workflows have been analyzed and \\r\\nreviewed.Experienced in providing client user training. Reporting project status to senior management on a regular \\r\\nbasis.\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/harish-kumar-s-1791463539-274.pdf\", \"title\": \"Harish Kumar S\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('141e1b66-0864-4c6a-af52-b834115278f3','cd707e81-99ed-460e-b9bb-faa6f7b3a363','Test Resume816','Test Resume816','Software Deve',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Performance Testing\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-25 12:03:02.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Deve\", \"company\": \"Apsidata\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[{\"year\": \"\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech\", \"result\": \"\", \"institution\": \