lementation, Deployment and maintenance of\\r\\nBI applications.\\r\\n•Able to properly understand the business requirements and develop data models accordingly by taking\\r\\ncare of the resources\\r\\n•Writing some SǪL query to get the data from source to Power BI environment.\\r\\n•Knowledge on Tableau Dashboards as well.\\r\\n•Developed quality assurance procedures to minimize coding errors.\\r\\nProjects\\r\\nCLIENT - ERIE INSURANCE 10/2024 – Till Date\\r\\n•Erie Insurance a publicly held insurance company, offering auto, home, commercial and life insurance\\r\\nthrough a network of independent insurance agent.\\r\\n•As of 2017, Erie insurance Group is ranked 378th among the largest public U.S. Companies, in terms of\\r\\nrevenue, by Fortune magazine.\\r\\nROLES AND RESPONSIBILITIES :\\r\\n•Use Measure Names and Measure Values field to create visualizations with multiple measures and\\r\\ndimensions.\\r\\n•Preparing Dashboards using Calculations, Parameters in Power BI.\\r\\n•Used filters, parameters and calculated fields on Power BI reports.\\r\\n•Used Trend lines , Aggregate Functions, table calculations and Filters,\\r\\n•Create visually compelling and actionable interactive worksheets and dashboards.\\r\\n•Using Power BI desktop analyze and obtain insights into large data sets.\\r\\n•Developed Interactive Dashboards using various Power BI objects like Parameters and Filters in various\\r\\nlevels.\\r\\nI• mplement DAX Measures and Calculations for various Accounting Aggregations\\r\\nI• mpalement DAX Ǫuick Measures for Categorizing the data based on given parameters\\r\\nI• mplement Time Based Intelligence Calculations including YoY, ǪoǪ, MoM and YTD, ǪTD, MTD and the\\r\\nlike.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2020\", \"degree\": \"Computer Science\", \"result\": \"Yes\", \"institution\": \"Bangalore Universit\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1772714057-47.pdf\", \"title\": \"cv\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('14562d7f-10d6-4