\\n• Writing SQL queries to retrieve, manipulate, and update data from databases.  \\r\\n• Verified trigger executions and scheduled pipeline runs regularly.  \\r\\n• Coordinated with the development team for quick issue resolution in live pipelines.\"}, {\"title\": \"Data Analyst\", \"company\": \"Electronics Sector Skills Council of India\", \"endDate\": \"Sat Apr 30\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Fri Jan 10\", \"description\": \"• Performed Import and Export of data into HDFS and Hive using Sqoop and managed data within the environment. \\r\\n• Created multiple Hive tables, running hive queries in those data, implemented Partitioning, Dynamic Partitioning, \\r\\nand Bucketing in Hive for efficient data access. \\r\\n• Generated complex JSON data after all the transformations for easy storage and access as per client requirements. \\r\\n• Checked for null, duplicate, and inconsistent values to ensure data quality. \\r\\n• As per the business requirement storing the spark processed data in HDFS/S3 with appropriate file formats. \\r\\n• Performed data cleaning and transformation (handling missing values, type conversions, normalization). \\r\\n• Used group by, merge, and pivot operations for aggregations and relational data handling. \\r\\n• Involved in creating Hive tables, data loading and writing hive queries. \\r\\n• Prepared dashboard’s/reports either in power BI and tableau.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2016\", \"degree\": \"B.TECH, ECE\", \"result\": \"72\", \"institution\": \"Dr. APJ Abdul Kalam Technical University\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1766512581-946.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('153e63a9-53aa-432a-8429-ae16eb04741c','b46edeac-705c-4963-aef0-3a175a7e8dda','National sales manager-EMS division',NULL,'National sales manager-EMS division',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','PUBLIC','2025-05-15 06:05:27.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"National sales manager-EMS division\",