ate, Delete) for patients, doctors, and\\r\\nappointments.\\r\\n• Designed a secure user authentication and authorization system using ASP.NET Core Identity.\\r\\nUsed Entity Framework Core with SQL Server for database access and data persistence.\\r\\n• Created responsive and user-friendly interfaces using React 18 and Redux.\\r\\n• Implemented role-based access control for Admin, Doctor, and Receptionist users.\\r\\n• Enabled appointment scheduling and management with date and time validation.\\r\\n• Followed Microservice architecture for clean separation of concerns and maintainable code.\\r\\n• Used RESTful APIs for data communication between frontend and backend.\\r\\n• Extensively used Azure Key Vault, Azure Event Bus, Azure Function, Azure logic apps and Azure\\r\\nService Bus.\\r\\n• Created automated workflows and CI/CD pipelines ensuring reliable, compliant, and traceable\\r\\ndeployments across learning environments.\\r\\n• Led team of developers to deliver high-quality software projects on time with 40% reduction in\\r\\nproduction bugs through rigorous code reviews.\"}, {\"title\": \"Senior Software Engineer\", \"company\": \"Cornerstone OnDemand\", \"endDate\": \"Wed Nov 27\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Tue Oct 04\", \"description\": \"Developed a full stack Learning Management System using C # , ASP.NET Core MVC Razor\\r\\npages & React to manage student and their assigned course records efficiently.\\r\\n• Implemented CRUD operations (Create, Read, Update, Delete) for Student, Teacher, and courses.\\r\\n• Designed a secure user authentication and authorization system using ASP.NET Core Identity.\\r\\n• Used Entity Framework Core with SQL Server for database access and data persistence.\\r\\n• Created responsive and user-friendly interfaces using React 17 and Redux.\\r\\n• Implemented role-based access control for Admin, Teacher, and Student users.\\r\\n• Followed Microservice architecture for clean separation of concerns and maintainable code.\\r\\n• Used RESTful APIs for data communication between frontend and backend.\\r\\n• Configured and managed Azure CI/CD pipelines using Azure DevOps for automated deployment\\r\\nand testing.\\r\\n• Integrated React based applications with RESTful APIs, handling authentication (JWT/OAuth),\\r\\nrole-based access control, and secure HTTP communication.\\r\\n• Created automated workflows and CI/CD pipelines ensuring reliable, compliant, and traceable\\r\\ndeployments across learning environments.\\r\\n• Extensively used Azure Key Vault, Azure Event Bus, Azure Function, Azure logic apps and Azure\\r\\nService Bus.\\r\\n• Led team of developers to deliver high-quality software projects on time with 30% reduction in\\r\\nproduction bugs through rigorous code reviews.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2013\", \"degree\": \"Computer Science\", \"result\": \"Yes\", \"institution\": \"ARMIET College, Mumbai,\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1768567030-510.pdf\", \"title\": \"cv\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('1685889d-2663-41e6-bd0f-e68b37150320','3924a5f0-b3a4-438e-9fa0-641496e73ba7','Test Resume40','Test Resume40','Software Deve',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"JMETER\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-25 20:15:58.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Deve\", \"company\": \"Aceenture\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[{\"year\": \"\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech\", \"result\": \"\", \"institution\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('16872a80-b80a-434f-84d7-0730d54b2377','81e1502d-cf5a-47ac-bd65-d3ebaae6d4a8','✰ 6.5 Years of total IT experience and 2.5 years of experience in Delmia Apriso.   \r\n✰ Presently Working as Packaged App Development Senior Analyst with Accenture Solutions Pvt. Ltd.   \r\n✰ Previously Worked as Senior Software Developer with Birlasoft Pvt.','✰ 6.5 Years of total IT experience and 2.5 years of experience in Delmia Apriso.   \r\n✰ Presently Working as Packaged App Development Senior Analyst with Accenture Solutions Pvt. Ltd.   \r\n✰ Previously Worked as Senior Software Developer with Birlasoft Pvt. Ltd.   \r\n✰ Strong hands-on experience on DELMIA Apriso 2016 and 2021, DELMIA Ortems, SQL Queries, CSS, HTML,    \r\nJavaScript.  \r\n✰ Experience in Requirement Analysis, Estimation, Design, Planning and Tracking, Code reviews.   \r\n✰ Good working knowledge of terms used in manufacturing domain.','Software Developer',8,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1769597381-460.pdf',NULL,'[\"Delmia Apriso\", \"Apriso\", \"HTML\", \"CSS\", \"Bootstrap\", \"JavaScript\", \"JIRA\", \"Process Builder\", \"SQL Server\", \"XML\", \"SVN\", \"Swift\", \"Snowflake\"]','PUBLIC','2026-01-28 22:48:40.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Developer\", \"company\": \"BNY Mellon International Operations Pvt Ltd.\", \"endDate\": \"Wed Jul 31\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Mon Aug 10\", \"description\": \"✰ Application and database enhancement for the new implementation.   \\r\\n✰ Fixing of existing issues and done fixes to the issues identified in testing phase.   \\r\\n✰ Prepared High Level & Low-Level Design documents.   \\r\\n✰ Ability to work independently and multitask effectively.   \\r\\n✰ Collaborated with team of IT professionals to set specifications for new features.   \\r\\n✰ Written high quality source code to program complete applications within deadlines.\"}, {\"title\": \"Senior Software Developer\", \"company\": \"Tata Technologies Pvt Ltd\", \"endDate\": \"Mon Mar 30\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Wed Jul 10\", \"description\": \"✰ Application and database enhancement for the new implementation.   \\r\\n✰ Fixing of existing issues and done fixes to the issues identified in testing phase.   \\r\\n✰ Prepared User Manual and Training Design documents.   \\r\\n✰ Ability to work independently and multitask effectively.   \\r\\n✰ Collaborated with team of IT professionals to set specifications for new features.   \\r\\n✰ Check shop floor activities and verify recorded data.  \\r\\n✰ Built SSRS reports.\"}, {\"title\": \"Senior Software Developer\", \"company\": \"Birlasoft Pvt Ltd\", \"endDate\": \"Fri Mar 10\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Thu Aug 05\", \"description\": \"✰ Handle all the maintenance functional and UI related issues. \\r\\n✰ Process Jobs. \\r\\n✰ Prepare and maintain functional and resolution documents, technical designs and specifications.  \\r\\n✰ Capability to understand, collect, analyses and gather business requirement.  \\r\\n✰ Fixing of existing issues and done fixes to the issues identified in testing phase.   \\r\\n✰ Ability to work independently and multitask effectively.   \\r\\n✰ Collaborated with team of IT professionals to set specifications for new features and Upgrade activities.   \\r\\n✰ Create packages for deployment.\"}, {\"title\": \"Packaged App Development Senior Analyst\", \"company\": \"Accenture Solutions Pvt Ltd\", \"endDate\": \"Sun Jan 25\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Fri Mar 10\", \"description\": \"✰ Handle client call. \\r\\n✰ Involved In Rollout activities. \\r\\n✰ Fixing of issues reported by client. \\r\\n✰ Prepare and maintain Knowledge Based (KB) articles.  \\r\\n✰ Capability to understand, collect, analyses and gather business requirement.  \\r\\n✰ Conduct internal daily status meeting with team\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2015\", \"degree\": \"Bachelor of Engineering in Computer Science and Engineering\", \"result\": \"69\", \"institution\": \"Sinhgad College of Engineering\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1769597381-460.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('168bc99e-ec58-4c65-a370-0e70aa351aea','1bdd36b7-8369-4996-8483-7f0386e55dad','Test Resume173','Test Resume173','Professional',1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','PUBLIC','2025-05-27 04:13:06.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[]','[{\"year\": \"\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech\", 