ined automation test scripts using Selenium WebDriver with Java for regression and \\r\\nfunctional testing \\r\\n• Managed defect lifecycle using standard defect tracking processes, including defect logging, tracking, retesting, \\r\\nand closure\"}, {\"title\": \"Software Engineer\", \"company\": \"Capgemini\", \"endDate\": \"Wed Apr 30\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Thu Jun 10\", \"description\": \"• Managed the OSS Commissioning Workflow; reviewed and approved code commits under the +2 approval \\r\\nprocess, and oversaw build promotions following successful execution in the MR pipeline. \\r\\n• Implemented and maintained continuous integration (CI) and continuous delivery (CD) Pipelines for the \\r\\nNetAct Product using Jenkins, ensuring smooth and consistent deployment. \\r\\n• Monitored and supervised daily NetAct Upgrade triggers to identify, log, and analyze bugs through Pronto and JIRA \\r\\n, Driving root cause analysis and issue resolution \\r\\n• Managed and supported large-scale Linux-based NetAct environments, including filesystem management, user access \\r\\ncontrols, DNS configurations, and core networking protocols (TCP/IP, HTTP, SSL/TLS). \\r\\n• Authored comprehensive test documentation, including test plans, test cases, and test scripts, ensuring test \\r\\nreproducibility and full coverage \\r\\n• Conducted regression, functional and performance Testing on NetAct Software, Identifying high-impact bugs before \\r\\nproduction deployment \\r\\n• Automated manual documentation and validation tasks using shell scripting and other automation tools, \\r\\nimproving efficiency and reducing human error. \\r\\n• Contributed to infrastructure standardization efforts by documenting and automating NetAct deployment procedures \\r\\n(aligning with IaC concepts such as Terraform/Packer workflows). \\r\\n• Mentored and guided a team of 4 junior engineers, providing training and technical support during onboarding and \\r\\nproject execution. \\r\\n• Developed Jenkins Pipeline jobs for security updates using Ansible and Groovy, improving automation and \\r\\nconsistency in deployments \\r\\n• Worked on Ansible-based configuration deployments across distributed NetAct components to ensure consistent \\r\\nand repeatable setups \\r\\n• Exposure to Kubernetes concepts while supporting container-based service deployments and monitoring \\r\\ncontainerized workloads for internal automation tasks.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2020\", \"degree\": \"Bachelor of Technology in Computer Science\", \"result\": \"6.2\", \"institution\": \"Yenepoya  Institute of  Technology\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1776193795-823.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('16ab0d69-ed82-473e-9ef2-d6dda365b2f7','f4f280fa-d4b2-4c5f-b329-8deb8627a06e','Test Resume597','Test Resume597','Software Deve',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','PUBLIC','2025-05-26 09:17:48.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Deve\", \"company\": \"Synechron\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[{\"year\": \"\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech\", \"result\": \"\", \"institution\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]');
INSERT INTO `candidates` VALUES ('16cc67a1-3d6e-44e6-8428-8faf026bb429','22a683fb-6a12-4869-9c8b-bcbfd29c1e3e','• Frontend Developer with 5+ years of IT experience specializing in web-based \r\napplication design and development \r\n• Strong experience in React.js, Next.js, HTML5, CSS3, JavaScript, TypeScript \r\n(ES6+), Redux, REST and GraphQL API integrations. \r\n• Expe','• Frontend Developer with 5+ years of IT experience specializing in web-based \r\napplication design and development \r\n• Strong experience in React.js, Next.js, HTML5, CSS3, JavaScript, TypeScript \r\n(ES6+), Redux, REST and GraphQL API integrations. \r\n• Experienced in building reusable component architectures, performance \r\noptimization, and Agile/Scrum delivery. \r\n• Skilled in UI/UX design implementation, translating design mockups into clean, \r\nscalable frontend code. \r\n• Hands-on experience developing Single Page Applications (SPA). \r\n• Strong knowledge of React concepts including functional components, hooks, \r\nvirtual DOM, and Web APIs. \r\n• Effective collaborator with designers, backend engineers, QA, and product teams.','Software Developer',6,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1769978229-7.pdf',NULL,'[\"JavaScript\", \"HTML5\", \"CSS3\", \"Graph QL\", \"Github\", \"JIRA\", \"React JS\", \"NextJS\", \"Redux Toolkit\", \"Typescript\", \"Tailwind CSS\", \"Webpack\", \"Rest API Integration\", \"Context API\", \"NPM\", \"VSCode\", \"Generative AI\", \"Prompt Engineering\"]','PUBLIC','2026-02-02 08:48:50.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Developer\", \"company\": \"Flydocs India Pvt. Ltd.\", \"endDate\": \"Thu Oct 30\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Wed Oct 05\", \"description\": \"• Led the frontend development using React.js, Next.js, TypeScript, Tailwind \\r\\nCSS and MUI, ensuring a scalable and responsive user experience. \\r\\n• Developed scalable React and Next.js applications using TypeScript and \\r\\nRedux Toolkit. \\r\\n• Implemented React Hooks for efficient state and lifecycle management. \\r\\n• Integrated RESTful APIs and managed application state using Redux Toolkit. \\r\\n• Built reusable, responsive UI components using Tailwind CSS and MUI. \\r\\n• Optimized performance using memoization and code‑splitting techniques. \\r\\n• Collaborated with backend, QA, and product teams in Agile/Scrum \\r\\nenvironment. \\r\\n• Integrated GraphQL APIs using Apollo Client for efficient data fetching. \\r\\n• Used AI tools like Azure OpenAI API and ChatGPT for content generation \\r\\nand development assistance.\"}, {\"title\": \"Software Engineer\", \"company\": \"Destar (Accenture)\", \"endDate\": \"Tue Aug 30\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Mon May 10\", \"description\": \"• Creating feature modules, services, components, interfaces and their \\r\\nfunctionality as well as developing routing for applications navigation. \\r\\n• Involved in feature design, development, and implementation. \\r\\n• Converted UI templates to PostHTML as per project standards. \\r\\n• Developing feature modules, Components and their functionality. \\r\\n• Design and develop responsive, reusable UI component using JavaScript, \\r\\nBootrap, CSS3 and HTML5, React JS, Redux. \\r\\n• Creating innovative design and making it mobile responsive. \\r\\n• Developing front-end part to back end of application business logic. \\r\\n• Providing support to various issues raised in Production.\"}, {\"title\": \"Academic Counsellor\", \"company\": \"MIT- World Peace University\", \"endDate\": \"Thu May 20\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Wed May 10\", \"description\": \"• Primary role involved academic counseling and administrative \\r\\nresponsibilities. \\r\\n• Led and coordinated a small team for admissions-related activities, task \\r\\nallocation, and daily follow-ups \\r\\n• Acted as a point of contact between academic staff and management, \\r\\nensuring smooth communication. \\r\\n• Additionally contributed to web development work during the final year, \\r\\nsupporting the IT team \\r\\n• Assisted in development of Admissions and Dean websites using \\r\\nHTML, CSS, & JS. Worked with HTML5, CSS3, Bootstrap and JavaScript. \\r\\n• Creating innovative design and making it mobile responsive \\r\\n• Designed and implemented responsive UI pages based on requirements \\r\\n• Independently developed the Dean website from scratch based on \\r\\nrequirements.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2015\", \"degree\": \"Master of Computer Applications [MCA]\", \"result\": \"73\", \"institution\": \"Solapur University\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1769978229-7.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('16d0c531-ef90-4439-8b7d-b75501ce36b8','95733d93-4282-439c-a673-df63c84e642a','Test Resume176','Test Resume176','Software Deve',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\".NET\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-25 10:56:25.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Deve\", \"company\": \"Inovalon\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[{\"year\": \"\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech\", \"result\": \"\", \"institution\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('16d3c4eb-e6f0-4e96-ab6a-fe4522331a30','c0aeca2a-af9a-4f77-89c1-4d27d3edba81','Full-Stack Developer with 5+ years of experience specializing in WordPress and\r\nWooCommerce-based eCommerce platforms. Expert in building custom themes,\r\nplugins, and scalable architectures from scratch. Strong background in Odoo frontend,\r\nREST APIs, web','Full-Stack Developer with 5+ years of experience specializing in WordPress and\r\nWooCommerce-based eCommerce platforms. Expert in building custom themes,\r\nplugins, and scalable architectures from scratch. Strong background in Odoo frontend,\r\nREST APIs, webhooks, payment gateway integrations, and third-party integrations.\r\nProficient in ReactJS, TypeScript, JavaScript, Tailwind CSS, and MVC frameworks.\r\nDelive