mens Opcenter Execution (Camstar) across the Core and Electronics suites. Hands-on with MES modeling and master-data configuration in Camstar Designer, VP page development in Portal Studio, Designer, and system customization using C#, ASP.NET and SQL Server. Configures and validates end-to-end shop-floor workflows – products, routings, specifications, WIP tracking and traceability – aligned to client manufacturing processes, and supports functional testing, UAT and go-live with onshore and offshore teams. \r\nBrings an unusual second dimension for MES delivery: direct PLC and equipment-layer experience through TIA Portal Openness, OPC UA/DA and Tecnomatix Process Simulate, enabling credible work on equipment integration and shop-floor connectivity','Application Engineer – MES & Digital Manufacturing',4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Camstar\", \"Mes\", \"Data Collection\", \"C#\", \".NET Framework\", \".NET CORE\", \"ASP.NET Core\", \"ASP.NET MVC\", \"Entity Framework\", \"Siemens Opcenter\", \"Web API\", \"OPC UA\"]','PUBLIC','2026-09-08 06:01:45.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Application Engineer – MES & Digital Manufacturing\", \"company\": \"PLM Indishtech Pvt. Ltd.\", \"endDate\": \"Mon Aug 31\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Fri Jan 10\", \"description\": \"•\\tConfigure and validate end-to-end MES workflows in Siemens Opcenter Execution (Camstar) Core and Electronics suites, aligning system behaviour with client manufacturing processes, production routings and business requirements.\\r\\n•\\tDevelop VP (View Portal) pages in Portal Studio for shop-floor operator transactions – configuring controls, data binding and page layout to reduce transaction steps and improve data-capture accuracy.\\r\\n•\\tApply Camstar Designer for MES object modeling and configuration of master data – products, workflows, routings, specifications and resources – and for customization of shop-floor transactions.\\r\\n•\\tSupport MES master data setup, WIP tracking 