on, transformation, and loading across \r\nmultiple data sources. \r\n Big Data & Delta Lake: Proficient in using Azure Databricks and Delta Lake for \r\nscalable big data processing. \r\n Pipeline Development & Automation: Expertise in creating ADF pipelines to automate data \r\nworkflows and integrate multiple Azure services seamlessly. \r\n Data Architecture: Designed and optimized data pipelines and ingestion patterns, efficiently \r\nhandling both structured and unstructured data in Data Lakes. \r\n Azure Key vault: Experience in Managing and storing confidential credential in Key vault. \r\n Orchestrated the end-to-end data integration pipelines using Azure Data Factory. \r\n Database Migration: Experienced in migrating SQL databases to Azure SQL Database, \r\nAzure Data Lake and Azure Databricks, while managing database access control and \r\nsecurely migrating on- premises databases to Azure Data Lake Store using Azure Data \r\nFactory.','System Engineer (Azure Data Engineer)',2,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1767561574-114.pdf',NULL,'[\"Azure Blob Storage\", \"Azure Key Vault\", \"Azure Logic Apps\", \"Azure Databricks\", \"ADF\", \"Azure Data Lake Storage\", \"Spark\", \"Pyspark\", \"SQL Server\", \"MYSQL\", \"Pandas\"]','PUBLIC','2026-01-05 09:39:11.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"System Engineer (Azure Data Engineer)\", \"company\": \"Tata Consultancy Services\", \"endDate\": \"Wed Dec 31\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Thu Feb 10\", \"description\": \" Azure Cloud & Data Engineering: 4 years of hands-on experience in Cloud \\r\\ncomputing technologies (Azure Data Factory, Azure Databricks, Azure Data Lake \\r\\nand Azure Blob Storage.) \\r\\n ETL/ELT Design & Implementation: Skilled in designing and implementing end-to- \\r\\nend ETL processes, managing data extraction, transformation, and loading across \\r\\nmultiple data sources. \\r\\n Big Data & Delta Lake: Proficient in using Azure Databricks and Delta Lake for \