ity audits, while documenting standards and providing training to ensure team-wide adherence.\"}, {\"title\": \"SQL Database Administrator\", \"company\": \"Cognizant Ltd\", \"endDate\": \"Thu Aug 22\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Thu Jul 18\", \"description\": \"•\\tAdministered SQL server environments, optimizing performance and reducing query execution times by 30%.\\r\\n•\\tIntegrated SQL Server database deployments with Azure DevOps pipelines, enabling continuous integration and deployment (CI/CD) for development and production environments.\\r\\n•\\tConfigured PostgreSQL replication (logical & streaming) to enhance database availability.\\r\\n•\\tCollaborated with QA and development teams to design efficient database schemas, enhancing application scalability.\\r\\n•\\tEnhanced system performance by improving query response times by 30% through tuning and monitoring, while ensuring OS-level security compliance with industry standards.\\r\\n•\\tSuccessfully optimized cloud resource allocation and utilization in Azure, leading to a 20% reduction in monthly operational costs.\\r\\n•\\tUtilized third-party tools such as RedGate, Cloud Watch Grafana and Idera to monitor, troubleshoot, and optimize SQL Server environments\"}, {\"title\": \"Sql Database Administrator\", \"company\": \"University Of Pacific\", \"endDate\": \"Fri Dec 19\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Thu Aug 28\", \"description\": \"•\\tAdministered and optimized SQL server, PostgreSQL instances for academic and research workloads.\\r\\n•\\tAutomated backup, monitoring, and failover using CloudWatch, SNS, and Terraform scripts, ensuring 99.9% uptime.\\r\\n•\\tSupported migration of on-prem SQL databases to Azure MI using DMS and DMA, BACPAC restore utilities.\\r\\n•\\tImplemented indexing, partitioning, and query-plan analysis, improving query performance by 30%.\\r\\n•\\tPartnered with developers and system administrators to troubleshoot issues, manage IAM permissions, and apply security best practices.\\r\\n•\\tEnhanced database security with IAM roles, encryption at rest, and fine-grained access policies ensuring full compliance with SOC2 and GDPR standards.\\r\\n•\\tCollaborated with application and DevOps teams to troubleshoot incidents, perform RCA, and document preventive measures.\\r\\n•\\tDocumented database configurations, maintenance tasks, and migration workflows for institutional continuity.\\r\\n•\\tReduced downtime by implementing robust High Availability and Disaster Recovery (HADR) solutions using SQL Always On Availability Groups.\\r\\n•\\tAutomated database deployment using Azure Resource Manager templates and PowerShell scripting, cutting manual efforts by 40%.\\r\\n•\\tMaintained database integrity and security, reducing incidents by 30%, by implementing robust access control measures.\\r\\n•\\tDesigned and implemented automated database monitoring solutions using tools like SQL Profiler, DMVs, and Power BI, resulting in a 50% reduction in downtime incidents.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2020\", \"degree\": \"Master\'s in computer and Information\", \"result\": \"Yes\", \"institution\": \"Webster University, San Antonio | TX\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1763553166-801.docx\", \"title\": \"cv\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('1818e8d2-bb60-4957-9c20-7600c447005e','f27ecd7c-3bb0-4e3c-9e8f-c261dc3ac729','A motivated fresher looking for an entry-role where I can apply my technical skills efficiently and \r\ngrow along with the organization.','A motivated fresher looking for an entry-role where I can apply my technical skills efficiently and \r\ngrow along with the organization.','C Programming Specialist',1,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1770924256-536.pdf',NULL,'[\"C Programming\", \"C++\", \"Data Structures\", \"Python\", \"VSCode\"]','PUBLIC','2026-02-13 07:47:37.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[]','[{\"year\": \"2025\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech in Computer Science and Engineering\", \"re