\", \"Agile\", \"SECS/GEM Standards\", \"Semi\", \"Semiconductor\", \"Factory Automation\", \"WPF\", \"REST API\", \"MS SQL Server\", \"Scrum Framework\"]','PUBLIC','2026-07-23 06:37:00.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Senior Software Engineer\", \"company\": \"Tata Electronics\", \"endDate\": \"Tue Jun 30\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Fri Jan 02\", \"description\": \"• Contributing to the Dholera, Tata Electronics Greenfield semiconductor fab project — India\'s first advanced \\r\\nsemiconductor manufacturing facility — gaining real-world experience in setting up and automating a fab from the \\r\\nground up. \\r\\n• Completed 6-month onsite job training at PSMC (P5 Fab, Taiwan), gaining comprehensive hands-on exposure to end-to\\r\\nend semiconductor manufacturing processes, fab workflows, and production operations in a high-volume environment. \\r\\n• Developed and maintained Host Applications for real-time equipment communication using SEMI E30 (SECS/GEM) and \\r\\nE10 standards, ensuring reliable data exchange between fab equipment and host systems. \\r\\n• Managed recipe management workflows, including recipe upload/download, validation, and change control across \\r\\nmultiple process tools in a live production environment. \\r\\n• Collected and monitored equipment data including state tracking, alarm management, and process data to support \\r\\nequipment performance monitoring and fault detection. \\r\\n• Led a team of engineers in factory automation development activities, coordinating requirements, resolving integration \\r\\nissues, and providing Go-Live and HyperCare support for production rollouts. \\r\\n• Contributed to fit-gap analysis and process standardization initiatives, working with SMEs to document automation \\r\\nrequirements and support validation activities.\"}, {\"title\": \"Staff Engineer – Software Developer\", \"company\": \"Aark Global INC\", \"endDate\": \"Wed Nov 05\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDat