d reliability. \\r\\n● Developed IAM solutions with Role-Based Access Control (RBAC) to enhance security and multi-tenant access \\r\\nmanagement. \\r\\n● Implemented FOTA/LOTA updates via AWS Lambda and MQTT, streamlining remote firmware upgrades and \\r\\nreducing operational overhead. \\r\\n● Led DevOps & Security teams to optimize AWS cloud security policies, improving incident response efficiency \\r\\nand system reliability. \\r\\n● Deployed containerized microservices on Google Cloud Run, ensuring cost-efficient scalability and streamlined \\r\\nproduction workloads.\"}, {\"title\": \"Software Developer\", \"company\": \"Sierra Circuits\", \"endDate\": \"Wed Sep 30\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Mon Jun 10\", \"description\": \"Technologies: Python, KiCad, WxPython, Flask, FastAPI, Cassandra, AWS Lambda, AWS API Gateway, AWS S3 \\r\\n● Developed a KiCad plugin that automated PCB design validation, reducing design errors and improving accuracy. \\r\\n● Designed and deployed Python-based microservices for PCB automation, streamlining manufacturing workflows \\r\\nand reducing delays. \\r\\n● Created Flask-based PCB analysis tools, accelerating design verification and validation processes.\"}, {\"title\": \"Senior Technology Consultant\", \"company\": \"Aequm India Pvt. Ltd.\", \"endDate\": \"Thu Jun 20\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Wed Jun 15\", \"description\": \"Technologies: Python, Flask, FastAPI, MySQL, SQLite, Pandas, NumPy, OpenCV, Tesseract OCR, SOAP APIs \\r\\n● Developed Retail POS microservices, enabling real-time data synchronization across multiple store locations. \\r\\n● Designed AI-based invoice extraction models using OpenCV and TensorFlow to automate invoice processing. \\r\\n● Implemented CI/CD pipelines with Jenkins and AWS CodePipeline, optimizing deployment workflows and \\r\\nreducing manual intervention.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2014\", \"degree\": \"B.E. in Electronics & Communication Engineering\", \"result\": \"63\",