ing. \r\n Strong hands-on expertise in Playwright Automation Testing with support for multi-browser and \r\nparallel executions. \r\n Proficient in API Testing using Postman, Rest Assured, and SOAPUI, validating REST and SOAP \r\nservices with HTTP methods (GET, POST, PUT, DELETE). \r\n Experienced in writing dynamic XPath, CSS Selectors, and Playwright Locators for robust element \r\nidentification. \r\n Well-versed in Test Data Management using Apache POI and TestNG Data Providers for data-driven \r\ntesting. \r\n Experienced in version control and collaborative code management with GitHub.','Software Test Engineer',2,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1781640626-795.pdf',NULL,'[\"Automation Testing\", \"Maven\", \"Jenkins\", \"Github\", \"JIRA\", \"Java\", \"Groovy\", \"HTML\", \"Eclipse\", \"Selenium\", \"Playwright\", \"TestNG\", \"SOAPUI\", \"SVN\", \"SQL\", \"SQL Server\"]','PUBLIC','2026-06-17 07:33:20.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Test Engineer\", \"company\": \"Wipro\", \"endDate\": \"Wed Jun 10\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Mon Feb 10\", \"description\": \" Analyzed Business Requirements and Functional Requirements to understand application behavior and \\r\\nprepare comprehensive test scenarios and test cases. \\r\\n Prepared Test Plans, Test Strategies, and Test Specifications for new enhancements and releases. \\r\\n Performed Manual Testing including Functional, Regression, Sanity, System, and Integration testing. \\r\\n Designed and implemented Automation Framework using Selenium WebDriver, Java, C#, TestNG, \\r\\nMaven, and Page Object Model (POM). \\r\\n Developed and maintained Regression Automation Suites, optimizing scripts for application and UI \\r\\nchanges. \\r\\n Implemented BDD framework using Cucumber, writing feature files and step definitions for UI \\r\\nautomation. \\r\\n Performed Cross-Browser Testing on Chrome, Firefox, Safari, and Internet Explorer using TestNG. \\r\\n Used Maven for build management and execution; automated test reports were generated and shared \\r\\nvia email and uploaded to Jira Confluence. \\r\\n Implemented Mobile Automation Testing using Appium for Android and iOS applications. \\r\\n Executed manual test cases on Emulators and Simulators across multiple device and OS combinations. \\r\\n Integrated automation scripts with Jenkins CI/CD pipeline to trigger executions for every build. \\r\\n Participated in Requirement Reviews, Design Reviews, and Test Case Reviews with Business Analysts, \\r\\nClients, and Project Managers. \\r\\n Performed Accessibility Testing in compliance with WCAG 2.0 and Section 508, validating color contrast, \\r\\npage magnification (200%), and UI readability. \\r\\n Created and maintained Requirement Traceability Matrix (RTM) to ensure complete test coverage. \\r\\n Logged, tracked, and managed defects using JIRA, working closely with development teams to validate \\r\\nfixes. \\r\\n Created QA Dashboards in JIRA to track test execution status and defect metrics.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2017\", \"degree\": \"Bachelor of Engineering in Computer Science and Engineering\", \"result\": \"75\", \"institution\": \"Visveswaraya College of Engineering\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1781640626-795.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('197a9d00-9588-49b6-8050-1f77418f4646','32e5430c-562b-49d3-8839-76575d6377a9','.net full stack developer',NULL,'.net full stack developer',2,700000.00,NULL,NULL,'[\"Snowflake\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-23 16:37:17.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \".net full stack developer\", \"company\": \"Au Small Finance Bank\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]',700000.00,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('197f9d2b-6b7b-40f6-bdd0-62d66ae3b941','389b88b8-e54b-483f-847c-cb17070d0ad8','Technical Support Engineer',NULL,'Technical Support Engineer',