ta integrity within validated environments. Skilled in managing\r\napplication integrations, database maintenance, and periodic audits to maintain\r\ncompliance and operational efficiency across laboratory informatics systems. Proven\r\nability to operate in and ensure compliance within heavily regulated environments,\r\nrigorously adhering to global standards including 21 CFR Part 11, EU GMP-\r\n, and GAMP. Adept at strategic vendor management, spearheading complex system\r\nimplementations, executing critical infrastructure upgrades, and ensuring absolute\r\naudit readiness to consistently deliver secure, high-performing, and fully compliant IT\r\necosystems','Junior Manage',10,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1764939378-617.pdf',NULL,'[\"CDS Views\", \"Networking\", \"GMP\", \"SCADA\", \"SQL\", \"Windows Server\"]','PUBLIC','2025-12-06 01:22:14.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Junior Manage\", \"company\": \"IT Infrastructure & Sy\", \"endDate\": \"Fri Jan 30\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Thu Jan 05\", \"description\": \"• Lead a team of 6–7 QC IT professionals, managing complete infrastructure\\r\\noperations across compute, storage, and network systems supporting\\r\\nlaboratory and manufacturing units.\\r\\n• Drive the deployment of advanced technologies to enhance system reliability,\\r\\nscalability, and regulatory compliance.\\r\\n• Oversee enterprise infrastructure including Cisco HyperFlex HX240C-M4SX,\\r\\nCisco UCS B200 M3, Cisco C240 M5X, Dell VNX 5300, Data Domain, NetApp,\\r\\nand Cisco Catalyst switches (2960, 2960X, 3850).\\r\\n• Administer and optimize core infrastructure components—Cisco UCS Blades,\\r\\nDell EMC Servers, VMware ESXi, and HyperFlex—ensuring performance,\\r\\nsecurity, and availability.\\r\\n• Manage vendor relationships and service implementations focusing on system\\r\\nuptime, validation, and audit readiness.\\r\\n• Execute infrastructure upgrades and change management activities within\\r\\nGxP-regulat