pelines: Azure Pipelines, Jenkins, GitLab CI/CD, Harness\r\n•	Languages: SQL, T-SQL,\r\n•	Development & Delivery • Data Base: Build and Release Process, Agile Methodologies, SDLC/STLC IBM Doors\r\n•	Versioning: GIT\r\n•	Database: MSSQL, Azure SQL','Data Engineer',4,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1767862140-672.docx',NULL,'[\"AWS\", \"Azure\", \"Data\", \"Cosmos DB\", \"DevOps\", \"Pyspark\", \"Spark\", \"SQL\", \"Pyspark\", \"Spark\", \"SQL\", \"Power BI\"]','PUBLIC','2026-01-08 21:16:46.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Data Engineer\", \"company\": \"VR GLOBAL Technologies\", \"endDate\": \"Sat Jan 31\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Mon Jan 08\", \"description\": \"Responsibilities:\\r\\n• Implemented Delta Lake and incremental loading strategies for optimized data refresh and consistency across both cloud platforms. Designed and implemented scalable data transformation workflows using Databricks (PySpark, Spark SQL) and GCP Dataproc for processing structured and unstructured datasets.\\r\\n• Implemented Delta Lake and incremental data ingestion strategies to ensure optimized performance and data consistency across Azure and GCP environments.\\r\\n• Built and maintained data warehouse models (Star/Snowflake) in Azure Synapse Analytics and BigQuery to support enterprise analytics and reporting.\\r\\n• Automated data pipeline deployments, version control, and CI/CD processes using Azure DevOps, Git, and Cloud Build for streamlined delivery.\\r\\nExperience in enabling ML workflows using Azure Databricks, with exposure to ML tools such as MLlib and TensorFlow for model development and deployment support.\\r\\nExperience with ML tools such as MLlib (in Databricks) and TensorFlow for supporting machine learning data pipelines and model integration.\\r\\n• Established comprehensive data governance frameworks using Azure Purview, including data classification, cataloging, lineage tracking, and access control for sensitive information.\\r\\n• Integrated diverse data sources such as SQL Server, APIs, Blob Storage, Cloud SQL, and Pub/Sub streams into unified, governed data models.\\r\\n• Configured Purview scans and collections to maintain accurate metadata, improve discoverability, and ensure regulatory compliance across Azure data assets.\\r\\n• Implemented role-based access controls (RBAC) and sensitivity labeling in Purview to enhance data privacy and security in alignment with GDPR and organizational standards.\\r\\n• Collaborated with BI teams to enable data discovery and lineage visibility in Power BI, ensuring datasets are traceable through Purview integration with Synapse and ADF.\\r\\n• Optimized ETL performance with dynamic parameterization, parallel execution, and auto-scaling Spark clusters for cost efficiency.\"}, {\"title\": \"Data Engineer\", \"company\": \"Accenture\", \"endDate\": \"Wed Mar 08\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Wed Dec 11\", \"description\": \"Data Engineer|\\r\\n•\\tExtract, Transform and Load data from source systems to Azure data storage services using Azure Data Factory, Databricks and Spark.\\r\\n•\\tTransform the data using Pyspark and push the data to Azure Data Lake based on the downstream team’s requirement.\\r\\n•\\tData Cleaning and validating the data as per the Data Quality rules.\\r\\n•\\tSupported the development of data validation scripts to ensure data integrity during the transformation process.\\r\\n•\\tUnderstand the business scenario and implement the ADF Pipelines.\\r\\n•\\tIntegrate and Transform data from sources using Azure data factory tools & Azure Databricks notebooks.\\r\\n•\\tContributed to the development of ETL pipelines using PySpark to process large datasets, applying transformations such as filtering, creating new columns and joining datasets to prepare clean, structured data for analysis and reporting.\\r\\n•\\tAssisted in the implementation of caching for frequently used datasets and partitioning for large datasets to improve job performance.\\r\\n•\\tDesigned data modeling strategies for high-throughput and highly available Cosmos DB workloads.\\r\\n•\\tImplemented backup and disaster recovery strategies using Cosmos DB continuous backup.\\r\\n•\\tDevelop and maintain ETL workflow/framework, which includes writing Pyspark jobs scripts, stored procedures, functions, views.\\r\\n•\\tAcknowledge and handle failures in development phase.\\r\\n•\\tOptimization of the given process is done by our Craftsman team.\\r\\n•\\tData analysis and rectification of Load Failure errors using SQL.\\r\\n•\\tScheduling and monitoring loads via Oracle ODI.\\r\\n•\\tMonitoring and support for dashboards using POWER BI.\\r\\n•\\tInvolved in deployment in pre prod and prod environments using SQL.\\r\\n•\\tPerform Ad-hoc activities, realignments, data reconciliation, data reloads.\\r\\n•\\tInvolved in pre cutover and post cutover activities while the objects moving into production system.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2019\", \"degree\": \"Computer Science\", \"result\": \"Yes\", \"institution\": \"Pydah Kaushik college of engineering| JNTUK University\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1767862140-672.docx\", \"title\": \"cv\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('1ee8ebea-d877-4826-83e8-a870bfdcef74','074d6282-2420-4b62-a297-cd9d8083ff15','Test Resume283','Test Resume283','Software Deve',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\".NET\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-25 17:30:53.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Deve\", \"company\": \"CGI\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[{\"year\": \"\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech\", \"result\": \"\", \"institution\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('1eef44ff-6829-43e7-a8cc-c79fcd1f3c61','41744008-245b-45df-ac79-052018027c4e','ERP Implementation Manager',NULL,'ERP Implementation Manager',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Good Communication\", \"ERP Implementation\", \"Leadership\", \"CRM Tools\", \"SQL\