ing\r\npip','Data Engineer with 4+ years of experience, specializing in Azure (Data Factory, Synapse Analytics, Fabric) and Databricks,\r\nwith hands-on expertise in end-to-end pipeline design using Medallion architecture. Experience in reducing costs and improving\r\npipeline performance. Experienced in GenAI/RAG implementations, near real-time streaming, and cross-functional stakeholder\r\ncollaboration. Holds 6 active Microsoft and Databricks certifications','Infosys Limited',2,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1776265574-450.pdf',NULL,'[\"Azure\", \"JSON\", \"AWS\", \"DevOps\", \"Cosmos DB\", \"DAX\", \"XML\", \"Power BI\"]','PUBLIC','2026-04-16 02:34:40.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Infosys Limited\", \"company\": \"Data Engineer\", \"endDate\": \"Wed Apr 29\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Thu Mar 10\", \"description\": \"esigned 10+ ETL pipelines for a global gaming service, processing terabyte-scale telemetry data for near real-time insights.\\r\\n∗ Engineered end-to-end data pipelines leveraging Azure Data Factory and Azure Databricks to ingest, process, and transform\\r\\n5+ TB of gaming telemetry data from diverse formats (CSV, JSON, XML, Parquet) sourced from on-premise and cloud storage\\r\\n(ADLS Gen2), enabling near real-time analytics for a global user base.\\r\\n∗ Refined complex transformation logic in SCOPE SQL and Spark SQL, resolving 98% of data quality issues through rigorous\\r\\nvalidation checks and automated monitoring, ensuring high reliability of downstream analytics.\\r\\n∗ Spearheaded the implementation of near-real-time streaming ETL pipelines using Azure Event Hubs, reducing data latency\\r\\nfrom hours to minutes and supporting live dashboards for business stakeholders.\\r\\n∗ Partnered to drive agile sessions with client architects to refine data requirements and system design for high-throughput\\r\\nscenarios, including peak sale events such as Black Friday and holiday season\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2021\", \"degree\": \"Computer Science\", \"result\": \"Yes\", \"institution\": \"Bachelor of Technology in Computer Science and Engineering\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1776265574-450.pdf\", \"title\": \"cv\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('1fa53802-0439-419e-a5ca-2657b52fbdd4','d2699d32-9d69-4212-92ea-ce6ef26c7473','Java Backend Developer with 4+ years of experience designing and delivering scalable Spring Boot–based microservices in \r\nthe BFS/Insurance domain. Strong expertise in REST API development, Oracle SQL optimization, and service-to-service \r\ncommunication u','Java Backend Developer with 4+ years of experience designing and delivering scalable Spring Boot–based microservices in \r\nthe BFS/Insurance domain. Strong expertise in REST API development, Oracle SQL optimization, and service-to-service \r\ncommunication using Feign Client and WebClient. Experienced in Agile delivery, CI/CD-enabled deployments, and production \r\nissue resolution. Known for writing clean, maintainable code and taking ownership of backend features from development to \r\nrelease. Took ownership of backend modules from design to production release, ensuring stability.','Software Engineer',2,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1786327604-910.pdf',NULL,'[\"Java\", \"Microservices\", \"JSON\", \"Git\", \"Docker\", \"Spring MVC\", \"Spring MVC\", \"Spring Boot\", \"RESTFUL APIS\", \"Web Services\", \"Mockito\", \"Oracle\", \"MYSQL\", \"SQL Query Optimization\", \"Postman\", \"CI/CD\"]','PUBLIC','2026-08-10 13:33:08.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Engineer\", \"company\": \"Cognizant Technology Solutions\", \"endDate\": \"Fri Jul 31\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Mon Oct 10\", \"description\": \"• Designed, developed, and maintained 15+ RESTful Web APIs and Spring Boot microservices for insurance policy creation, \\r\\nvalidation, and premium processing, supporting regular production releases. \\r\\n• Worked with Orac