re Java (SE 8), Spring Boot, Spring MVC, and Hibernate/JPA for developing \r\n','• Results-driven Java Backend Developer with 3+ years of professional experience building \r\nenterprise-grade backend systems across HRMS and staffing domains. \r\n• Proficient in Core Java (SE 8), Spring Boot, Spring MVC, and Hibernate/JPA for developing \r\nrobust and scalable backend services. \r\n• Hands-on expertise in RESTful API design and development, handling 60+ endpoints across \r\ncomplex enterprise modules. \r\n• Experienced in designing and working with MySQL databases — schema design, HQL, native \r\nSQL, indexes, and stored procedures. \r\n• Skilled in implementing Spring Security-based Role-Based Access Control (RBAC) with \r\nlayered role hierarchies for secure enterprise applications. \r\n• Proven ability to optimise SQL query performance — achieved a 6× improvement by reducing \r\npayroll report generation from 18s to under 3s. \r\n• Strong experience with unit and integration testing using JUnit 5 and Mockito, consistently \r\nachieving 85%+ test coverage.','Java Developer (Backend)',2,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1785769939-495.pdf',NULL,'[\"Core Java\", \"Java\", \"J2EE\", \"Hibernate\", \"JPA (Java Persistence Api)\", \"JSON\", \"J UNIT\", \"Jenkins\", \"Docker\", \"Maven\", \"AWS\", \"Github\", \"Intellij Idea\", \"JIRA\", \"SQL\", \"Spring Boot\", \"Spring MVC\", \"Spring Security\", \"RESTFUL\", \"MYSQL\", \"Mockito\", \"Unit Testing\", \"Spring Security\"]','PUBLIC','2026-08-04 02:31:38.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Java Developer (Backend)\", \"company\": \"Aititude Pvt. Ltd\", \"endDate\": \"Thu Jul 30\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Tue Mar 05\", \"description\": \"• Designed and developed 60+ RESTful API endpoints powering employee lifecycle \\r\\nmanagement — onboarding, payroll processing, attendance tracking, leave management, and \\r\\noffboarding workflows. \\r\\n• Engineered the Payroll Processing module including CTC breakup computation, PF/ESI \\r\\ndeductions, TDS calculations, and automated payslip generation in PDF format. \\r\\n• Built a configurable Leave Policy Engine supporting CL, PL, SL, and LOP categories with \\r\\nmulti-location policy rules, approval workflow, and real-time leave balance tracking. \\r\\n• Developed the Attendance & Timesheet module with biometric data synchronization via \\r\\nscheduled jobs, shift management, and overtime calculation logic. \\r\\n• Implemented Spring Security-based RBAC with role hierarchies (Admin, HR Manager, Team \\r\\nLead, Employee) securing sensitive HR data and operations. \\r\\n• Optimised a critical payroll SQL query, reducing report generation from 18 seconds to under 3 \\r\\nseconds — a 6× performance improvement through index tuning and query restructuring. \\r\\n• Wrote HQL and native SQL queries using Hibernate/JPA; designed MySQL schemas with \\r\\ntables, indexes, foreign keys, and stored procedures. \\r\\n• Achieved 85%+ unit test coverage across Leave Management and Employee modules using \\r\\nJUnit 5 and Mockito, reducing regression bugs by 40%. \\r\\n• Configured and maintained Jenkins CI/CD pipelines for automated build, test, and deployment \\r\\nto AWS EC2; containerised the application using Docker.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2023\", \"degree\": \"Bachelor of Technology – Computer Science & Engineering\", \"result\": \"8.1\", \"institution\": \"JNTUH\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1785769939-495.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('2583303c-f861-4546-bbcc-1e6a8f5f9de7','c05cae83-e9a5-462a-97b4-7faa2c76daf8','AWS & DevOps Engineer with 6.8years of experience, including 4+ years in cloud infrastructure and automation using \r\nAWS, GCP, Terraform, Jenkins, and Kubernetes. Proven expertise in designing scalable, secure, and automated CI/CD \r\npipelines across multi','AWS & DevOps Engineer with 6.8years of experience, including 4+ years in cloud infrastructure and automation using \r\nAWS, GCP, Terraform, Jenkins, and Kubernetes. Proven expertise in designing scalable, secure, and automated CI/CD \r\npipelines across multi-environment architectures. Skilled in infrastructure as code (IaC), containerization, observability, and \r\ncloud migration. Successfully authored reusable AWS and GCP Terraform modules for dev and prod environments. \r\nActively worked with global clients in telecom and healthcare sectors. Seeking challenging opportunities to lead DevOps \r\ninitiatives in cloud-native ecosystems.','DevOps Engineer',6,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1773407555-597.pdf',NULL,'[\"GCP\", \"Jenkins\", \"Gitlab\", \"AWS CodePipeline\", \"Bash\", \"JIRA\", \"Docker\", \"Kubernetes\", \"Kubernetes\", \"EKS\", \"CloudWatch\", \"CI/CD\", \"Python\", \"ServiceNow\"]','PUBLIC','2026-03-14 00:25:12.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"DevOps Engineer\", \"company\": \"Publicis Sapient\", \"endDate\": \"Thu Dec 05\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Thu May 05\", \"description\": \" \\r\\nMay 2022– Dec 2024 \\r\\nReduced deployment time by 60% through automated CI/CD pipelines using Jenkins and GitLab CI for 15+ \\r\\nmicroservices. \\r\\n \\r\\n \\r\\n \\r\\n \\r\\n \\r\\n \\r\\n \\r\\n \\r\\n \\r\\nDesigned scalable, multi-region AWS infrastructure (EC2, VPC, IAM, ELB, Route53, S3). \\r\\nDeveloped production-grade Terraform modules for AWS and GCP, improving provisioning efficiency by 70%. \\r\\nDeployed containers using Docker and Kubernetes, achieving 99.99% uptime. \\r\\nIntegrated AWS CloudWatch and SNS for monitoring and alerting, reducing MTTR by 40%. \\r\\nImplemented secure IAM roles and policies to enforce least privilege access for services and users. \\r\\nOrchestrated blue-green and canary deployments for zero-downtime releases across staging and production. \\r\\nWorked with cross-functional teams to migrate legacy monolithic apps to containerized microservices on EKS. \\r\\nEstablished cost-monitoring dashboards using AWS Cost Explorer and tagging strategy, saving 15% on monthly cloud \\r\\nspend. \\r\\nAutomated backup and disaster recovery strategy using AWS Backup, RDS snapshots, and lifecycle policies.\"}, {\"title\": \"Cloud Infrastructure Engineer\", \"company\": \"Wellington Management Company\", \"endDate\": \"Wed Apr 20\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Wed Jun 10\", \"description\": \" Automated infrastructure provisioning with Terraform and AWS CLI across dev, QA, and prod environments. \\r\\n Implemented Ansible for zero-touch deployment and configuration management. \\r\\n Built and maintained Kubernetes clusters using Helm, deployed 20+ microservices with rolling update strategy. \\r\\n Developed CI/CD templates and reusable Helm charts for microservice deployments. \\r\\n Created Lambda-based auto-recovery scripts triggered by CloudWatch alerts. \\r\\n Designed secure VPC architectures with NAT Gateways, private subnets, and NACLs. \\r\\n Migrated on-premise Jenkins setup to AWS-managed Jenkins on EC2 with S3 artifact storage. \\r\\n Integrated log aggregation using CloudWatch Logs, Fluentd, and Grafana Loki for centralized visibility. \\r\\n Conducted regular infrastructure audits using AWS Config, Trusted Advisor, and Security Hub. \\r\\n Coordinated with developers and QA teams to implement staging environments mirroring production.\"}, {\"title\": \"Loblaw Company Limited\", \"company\": \"Operation Support Analyst\", \"endDate\": \"Wed May 20\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Mon Mar 05\", \"description\": \" Provided Tier 1 and Tier 2 operational support for 50+ AWS EC2 instances, RDS databases, and S3 buckets across \\r\\ndevelopment, staging, and production environments. \\r\\n Automated health checks and instance recovery using Bash scripts and AWS CloudWatch alarms, reducing manual \\r\\nintervention by 40%. \\r\\n Configured and maintained auto-scaling groups and ALBs to ensure 99.9% uptime during high-traffic periods. \\r\\n Created detailed incident response documentation and SOPs, reducing onboarding time for new team members by \\r\\n30%.\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1773407555-597.pdf\", \"title\": \"cv\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('259344e2-f8db-4ac8-83f6-d557edb01157','df0d0f18-c1d8-4fa4-80aa-dbf7654b10f3','Results-driven Technical Support Engineer with over 8 years of experience across IT \r\ninfrastructure support, networking, cloud fundamentals (AWS), DevOps basics, and SAP \r\nHANA production environments. Proven expertise in end-user support, server and \r\nn','Results-driven Technical Support Engineer with over 8 years of experience across IT \r\ninfrastructure support, networking, cloud fundamentals (AWS), DevOps basics, and SAP \r\nHANA production environments. Proven expertise in end-user support, server and \r\nnetwork troubleshooting, ERP (SAP) production operations, hardware and software \r\nmaintenance, and IT security compliance. Strong hands-on experience with Windows, \r\nLinux, Mac OS, LAN/WAN networks, Active Directory, DNS/DHCP, antivirus and \r\nendpoint security solutions. Adept at working in Agile environments, supporting \r\nmanufacturing and enterprise IT operations, and collaborating with cross-functional \r\nteams to ensure business continuity.','Professional',1,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1776196321-376.pdf',NULL,'[]','PUBLIC','2026-04-15 07:20:02.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1776196321-376.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('25987d97-32fa-49fa-a297-4d98c3220c0c','78c384e2-418b-4d59-9ec8-38d8935ec7cc','Test Resume74','Test Resume74','Software Deve',4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Guidewire CC\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-24 21:11:44.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Deve\", \"company\": \"TCS\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDa