ogy sectors.','Solution Architect Expert',8,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1761296507-47.doc',NULL,'[\"AWS\", \"IOT\", \"Edge Computing\", \"Cloud\", \"SCADA\", \"SQL\", \"Python\", \"AVEVA MES\"]','PUBLIC','2025-10-24 08:58:15.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Solution Architect Expert\", \"company\": \"SCHNEIDER ELECTRIC INDIA\", \"endDate\": \"Fri Nov 28\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Mon Feb 20\", \"description\": \"1.\\tIntroducing Digital transformation with industrial 4.0 and EDGE computing concept, implementing cloud connectivity solution and deliver comprehensive cybersecurity-compliant projects.\\r\\n\\r\\n2.\\tImplement end to end IOT solution with IT and OT integration, with the best possible System architecture design. \\r\\n\\r\\n3.\\tExplain and demonstrate the technical advantages of the solution, realize proofs of concept (POC). Answer In-depth technical questions on the integration and compatibility of components within architecture. Responsible for product selection, helping partners with BOM creation.\\r\\n\\r\\n4.\\tProvide technical expert pre-sales support to the sales team to help accelerate sales growth and increase opportunities. Collaboration with cross functional teams and identifying and assigning each stakeholder responsibility.\\r\\n\\r\\nSKILLS AND TOOLS:\\r\\n•\\tDCS, PLC Software, Control Architecture.\\r\\n•\\tControl networking, High Available redundant architecture\\r\\n•\\tAVEVA plant SCADA, Historian\\r\\n•\\tPython, Linux, SQL, OPC UA, MQTT, AWS IOT, EDGE IO, Wire-shark, IOT gateways, Node-Red\\r\\n\\r\\nPROJECT POC’s AND PROCESS Industries:\\r\\n\\r\\n1.\\tEnergy management project\\r\\n2.\\tWater treatment Plant\\r\\n3.\\tChemical & Cement Plant\\r\\n4.\\tCBG (Compress biogas) Green energy\\r\\n5.\\tWearhouse automation\"}, {\"title\": \"Sr. Application Engineer\", \"company\": \"DELTA ELECTRONICS INDIA PVT. LTD\", \"endDate\": \"Tue Feb 21\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Wed Jan 08\", \"description\": \"ROLE AND RESPONSIBILITIES:\\r\\n1.\\tDigital transformation initiatives & developed and implemented cloud connectivity solutions.\\r\\n2.\\tAdvanced sensor integration and communication technology.\\r\\n3.\\tUnderstand the application, Process optimization & propose best possible solution\\r\\n4.\\tIntegration & Programming of Automation OT products PLC, HMI, SERVO, SCADA, VFD Drives, DELTA Vision camera, IPC, and SCARA Robot\\r\\n5.\\tInstallation, Commissioning & Troubleshooting of the SPM Machine.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nPROJECT WORK\\r\\n\\r\\nProject\\t\\tIIOT 4.0 Project | IIT Kharagpur\\r\\nDescription\\tImplemented comprehensive IIOT 4.0 solution on 4 Demo Cells (MIG welding, TIG welding, Spot welding, Laser welding cell). Developed real-time data analytics framework. All cells communicate with central server via OPC UA. Used EDGE computing concept on each cell.\\r\\n\\r\\nProject\\t\\tEnergy Management & Data Acquisition Application (Automotive industry) | PVNA\\r\\nDescription\\t20 Station with PLC & 100 Energy meters. Fetch data from each station and logged, integrated with central SQL server. Reporting in SCADA. Used VB Scripting to make logic in SCADA. Data is sent to cloud server and can monitor vis any PC over internet.\\r\\n\\r\\nProject\\t\\tINDIGO Paint Plant digitization (Material Handling application) | INDIGO Paints\\r\\nDescription\\tImplemented Buffer system in 2.0 Km conveyor, each conveyor section heaving sensors, Integration with Kuka robots, Pick and place and palletizing of 20,10 liters buckets.  Total of over 2000 IO, Integration with DCS and MES system.\\r\\n\\r\\nProject\\t\\tLaser Welding Machine (Automotive Industry) | Padmini VNA Mechatronics Ltd.\\r\\nDescription \\t6 Axis Servo (X, Y, Z, Laser head, ST1, ST2), and All Axis are operating in interpolation using G-Codes. Teach functionality given in Gentry machine. The application is of welding of automotive plastic valves with different shapes and sizes. \\r\\n\\r\\nProject\\t\\tGentry for 400T Press Machine (Automotive industry) | JBM\\r\\nDescription \\tAutomating production line, removing manual process with 4 Axis, Pickup and Place application between two Press 400T Machines, Used Motion EtherCAT controller with G-codes for Gentry. Teaching functionality is given in this Gantry machine.\\r\\n\\r\\nProject\\t\\tWagon Decoupling System (Process Industry) | TATA Steel\\t\\r\\nDescription\\t6 Axis Servo, EtherCAT Motion controller, Gantry used for Decoupling 2 Variant (10 Mtr. and 13 Mtr.)  of Box Wagon. \\r\\n\\r\\nProject\\t\\tUnloading & Capping Machine (Food and Pharma Industry) | Otsuka Pharmaceutical Co. Ltd\\r\\nDescription\\t\\tAutomatic Unloading and Capping of Saline bottles. Implementation of 21CFR part-11 compliance\"}, {\"title\": \"Application Engineer\", \"company\": \"BECKHOFF AUTOMATION PVT. LTD\", \"endDate\": \"Tue Jan 14\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Wed Apr 13\", \"description\": \"ROLE AND RESPONSIBILITIES:\\r\\n1.\\tUnderstand application and give solution based on customer requirement.\\r\\n2.\\tPC based PLC solution. Directly integrate IT with OT technology with PLC controller.\\r\\n3.\\tProduct selection and Engineering BOM preparation.\\r\\n4.\\tProgram according to IEC-61131-3 standard. Languages - (Structure Text, Ladder, FBD, Codesys, SFC).\\r\\n5.\\tServo Motion Controller: -NC- PTP and NC-I level, Camming, Flying Saw, Rotary cut, Gear-In, Smart-Belt application, G-Codes, Pick and Place, cut-to-length application.\\r\\n\\r\\nHANDELLING TOOLS:\\r\\n•\\tTwinCAT-2, TwinCAT-3, CodeSys, Indusoft SCADA, Motion Controller Application.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\nPROJECT WORKS AND JOB RESPONSIBILITIES:\\r\\n\\r\\nProject\\t\\tPower Monitoring Project (AWS IOT Project) | Advance control\\t\\r\\nDescription\\tPower data is taken from 150 Power meter located in various distribution panel and pushed in cloud using MQTT (IOT) protocol and monitored through mobile Application. Also, Data logged into SQL server from Central controller for power monitoring and analyzing. AWS IOT configuration and sharing data via AWS IOT cloud server using Beckhoff Controller.\\r\\nProject\\t\\tCondition Monitoring (Predictive maintenance)\\r\\nDescription\\tVibration measured using accelerometer (EL1816-3008) for condition monitoring of Machine, send this vibration data to 3rd party ProfiBus Master PLC.\\r\\nProject\\t\\tPowder Coating Plant | Hero Cycle Ltd, Ludhiana\\r\\nDescription\\tUpgradation of PLC, added Motion part, HMI, IO, used ABB servo drive with encoder Terminal and encoder and made Powder spraying gun move in camming motion, up and down so that powder spray cover full area during coating\\r\\n\\r\\nProject\\t\\tInjection Molding Machine\\r\\nHardware\\t\\tE-Mold Solution\\r\\nDescription\\t\\tInput outputs mapping, Wiring, and commissioning.\\r\\n\\r\\nTesting and Measurement Projects & POC.\\r\\n1.\\tN2 &O2 Analyzer Machine\\r\\n2.\\tLight Source Testing Machine\\r\\n3.\\tResistant Measurement Machine\\r\\n4.\\tLeak Testing Machine\\r\\n5.\\tDynamic load measurement, Program made for automatic Load cell calibration, stabilize and read Load cell 0.8 sec\\r\\n6.\\tPLC and LIDAR sensor integration. LIDAR sensor used in Automatic Guided Vehicle (AGV).\\r\\n7.\\tIntegration Barcode Cognex (DM60L) scanner with Beckhoff PLC, SQL server. And integration with AWS IOT cloud\"}, {\"title\": \"Automation Engineer\", \"company\": \"Trinity Microsystem PVT. LTD\", \"endDate\": \"Wed Mar 09\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Tue Feb 12\", \"description\": \"ROLES and RESPONCIBLITIES:\\r\\nManufacturing and Installation Electrical and electronics lab equipment. And give support to customer hardware wise as well as software wise.\\r\\nPython programming, Raspberry-Pi\\r\\nWorked with PLC as SIEMENS, ALLEN BRADLEY\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1761296507-47.doc\", \"title\": \"cv\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('2622fab5-3091-4404-b7fe-fc87c