\\r\\n• Directed cross‑functional teams in deploying robotic automation (Cobots, AMRs, vision systems) \\r\\nfor assembly and warehousing, improving throughput and material flow efficiency. \\r\\n• Established Smart Manufacturing Lab & Experience Center, showcasing AR/VR, additive \\r\\nmanufacturing, and IIoT solutions to clients and stakeholders, strengthening pre‑sales and \\r\\nconsulting impact. \\r\\n• Architected connected shopfloor solutions, integrating machine health monitoring, OEE \\r\\ndashboards, and predictive analytics to improve utilization and quality visibility. \\r\\n• Develop an Augmented Reality solution for the assembly process. Manual Work Instruction to be \\r\\ndigitized to assist the station operator in avoiding mistakes. \\r\\n• Set up the Smart warehousing system to showcase part replenishment message to the kitting team. \\r\\nDeveloping an auto-feeding system for the assembly station \\r\\n• Develop a Network architecture to establish communication between the Main PLC control \\r\\nsystem to individual station PLCs by MQTT/OPC-UA communication protocol.  \\r\\n• Consulted with CXOs and plant managers to develop feasibility studies, gap analyses, and Capex \\r\\nbudgets, ensuring executive buy‑in for large‑scale digital transformation initiatives. \\r\\n• Oversaw vendor partnerships and RFP processes, ensuring compliance with standards and \\r\\nsuccessful integration of cutting‑edge Industry 4.0 technologies. \\r\\n• Mentored client teams and junior engineers, building internal capability for MES/MOM adoption \\r\\nand digital manufacturing maturity. \\r\\n• Governed project execution through milestone tracking, waterfall studies, and management \\r\\nreviews, ensuring timely delivery and measurable ROI.\"}, {\"title\": \"Senior MES Process Engineer\", \"company\": \"Foxconn\", \"endDate\": \"Sat Jun 20\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Thu Apr 05\", \"description\": \"▪ Develop & configure Product, Routings, process flow, and rework process reflows in the MES \\r\\nsystem. \\r\\n▪ Creating & Defining IMEI, Bluetooth ID & WI-FI ID in the MES system as part of product \\r\\ntraceability. \\r\\n▪ Define & integrate machine for statistical analysis by Process Capability & Process capability \\r\\nIndex (Cp & Cpk) (Gluing machine, thermal Gel Machine, Plasma Machine, CCD machine, \\r\\n&Primer Machine).   \\r\\n▪ Develop MES system for Genealogy & traceability of child part, FG parts & packaging box.  \\r\\n2 \\r\\n▪ Work on process and testing automation to reduce human dependency and drive the project for \\r\\nimprovements.  \\r\\n▪ Hands-on experience in setting up a new production line through selecting and validating \\r\\nappropriate systems, tools, dashboards & applications. \\r\\n▪ Standardize Process & productivity improvement by reducing 8 wastes of the manufacturing \\r\\nprocess and measure by UPPH & Yield tools. \\r\\n▪ Prepare the Bill of Materials for every new project & Change requirement through ECN.  \\r\\n▪ Release the PCF (Product configuration file) matrix to define the test tool & SFC tool version.\"}, {\"title\": \"Manufacturing Engineer\", \"company\": \"Videocon Industries\", \"endDate\": \"Thu Dec 15\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Sat Jan 05\", \"description\": \"▪ Worked on Production Planning & Material management module in the SAP system for \\r\\nmanaging production operations.  \\r\\n▪ Raw material, WIP & Finished good material, BOM management & Material flow management \\r\\nby the SAP system. \\r\\n▪ Worked in different domains to support Mobile Assembly, LED assembly, Injection molding, \\r\\nSMT, and Soldering etc. \\r\\n▪ Monitor & improve of Yield, OEE, utilization, Efficiency, and Line Capacity for Production \\r\\nstatus.  \\r\\n▪ Develop DCS for NPI & Mass production for document control.  \\r\\n▪ Code-Soft label template design (Gift Box Label, MRP Label, Master Carton Label, ISO standard \\r\\nLabel) for packaging line. \\r\\n▪ Prepare cycle time assessment, forecasting, UPPH, Utilization, throughput & productivity \\r\\nreport.  \\r\\n▪ Develop a production downtime report &  analysis report to discuss a preventive action plan by \\r\\nthe production team. \\r\\n▪ Develop a ramp-up plan for the new Product \\\\and monitor in NPI.   \\r\\n▪ Managing the material flow, manpower flow, and Equipment utilization as part of the resource \\r\\nutilization & cost optimization part. \\r\\n▪ Time study to reduce waste & benchmark factory UPH and Work on how to eliminate man idle \\r\\ntime, machine downtime, process scrap for maximum utilization of organization resources.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2007\", \"degree\": \"Bachelor of Technology in Electronics & Instrumentation\", \"result\": \"63\", \"institution\": \"Arya Institute of Engineering & Technology\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1782933667-979.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('27e251d3-9a90-4f4b-a292-899e5d6d2f05','007383e5-8e11-4a45-ba76-c327d321c1b3','Test Resume10','Test Resume10','Software Deve',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Guidewire CC\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-24 17:55:08.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Deve\", \"company\": \"Capgemini\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[{\"year\": \"\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech\", \"result\": \"\", \"institution\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',550000.00,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('27ea8db1-3ab2-42f2-8c1e-37d9f0c5fc2e','d5e4d675-9ad1-49c1-8a7a-15359f65fc34','Client: Japan Post Corporation\r\nRole: Cloud Infrastructure Engineer\r\nRoles & Responsibilities:\r\nServed as the primary technical support contact for the Japan team, handling queries related to AWS and\r\nAzure services with timely issue resolution and docume','Client: Japan Post Corporation\r\nRole: Cloud Infrastructure Engineer\r\nRoles & Responsibilities:\r\nServed as the primary technical support contact for the Japan team, h