DevOps/Site Reliability Engineer experience in managing AWS and Azure. Expertise in designing, implementing, and maintaining scalable cloud infrastructure, CI/CD pipelines, containerization, and automation tools. Served as a Lead Assistant Manager, overseeing cloud operations, task planning, and team mentoring. Adept at deploying infrastructure using Terraform, managing containerized applications with Kubernetes, and optimizing cloud usage through FinOps.','Assistant Manager – IT',8,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"AWS\", \"EC2\", \"AWS Lambda\", \"CloudWatch\", \"EKS\", \"CodeBuild\", \"Docker\", \"Kubernetes\", \"ECS\", \"Helm\", \"CloudFormation\", \"Ansible\", \"Grafana\", \"Bash\", \"CentOS\", \"S3\", \"Rds\", \"VPC\", \"CI/CD\", \"TerraForm\", \"Prometheus\", \"Python\", \"Ubuntu\"]','PUBLIC','2025-10-24 14:11:03.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Assistant Manager – IT\", \"company\": \"NANO TECH E SERVICES\", \"endDate\": \"Sun Oct 19\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Thu Aug 31\", \"description\": \"•\\tManaged end-to-end delivery of IT infrastructure and application support services.\\r\\n•\\tFacilitated smooth communication between business, development, and infrastructure teams.\\r\\n•\\tLed DevOps teams in building robust CI/CD pipelines using Jenkins, AWS CodePipeline, and GitHub Actions. Designed and implemented scalable AWS infrastructure using CloudFormation, Terraform, and EC2 Auto Scaling.\\r\\n•\\tMigrated legacy systems to AWS, improving system performance, reliability, and reducing operational cost.\\r\\n•\\tSupervised cross-functional IT teams to deliver critical projects on time and within budget.\\r\\n•\\tAutomated infrastructure provisioning and configuration using Ansible and AWS Systems Manager.\\r\\n•\\tManaged containerized applications using Docker, Amazon ECS Fargate, and EKS.\\r\\n•\\tAdministered IT operations, monitored systems and ensured 24x7 uptime with CloudWatch and ELK Stack.\\r\\n•\\tOversaw patching, compliance audits, disaster recovery planning, and backup strategies across platforms.\\r\\n•\\tCoordinated with stakeholders and vendors for procurement, upgrades, and system transitions.\\r\\n•\\tDirected cost optimization using AWS Trusted Advisor and set budgets with FinOps practices.\\r\\n•\\tDeployed serverless apps using AWS Lambda, DynamoDB, and API Gateway. Championed DevSecOps by integrating security checks in CI/CD pipelines and automating vulnerability scans.\\r\\n•\\tManage project documentation, change requests, and client communications.\\r\\n•\\tImplement process improvements to enhance productivity and team efficiency.\"}, {\"title\": \"Lead Assistant Manager\", \"company\": \"EXL Services\", \"endDate\": \"Wed Aug 30\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Tue Aug 31\", \"description\": \"•\\tCreate and maintain fully automated CI/CD pipelines for code deployment. Actively manage, improve, and monitor cloud infrastructure on AWS, EC2 including backups, patches, and scaling.\\r\\n•\\tConducted regular updates of Linux OS kernels and patches, as well as managed Red Hat Satellite for synchronization, content view publication, patch promotion, and upgrades, ensuring system security.\\r\\n•\\tAutomated build and deployment using Jenkins to reduce human error and speed up production processes. Managed GitHub repositories and permissions, including branching and tagging.  \\r\\n•\\tContainerizing applications with Docker. Responsible for managing the Docker private registry    and having good experience of maintaining containers using Kubernetes.\\r\\n•\\tModerate exposure of Python Technologies \\r\\n•\\tImplemented Infrastructure provisioning in AWS using Terraform Modules and handled Statefile Locking using remote-exec provisioner. \\r\\n•\\tExperience on orchestrating creating Kubernetes cluster on AWS EKS and Private cloud and worked on creating deployments, replica sets, pods and Services along with Ingress controller.\\r\\n•\\tActively involved in creating namespace, pods, node-affinity, stateful sets and deployments and handling manifest files also worked on Helm Charts. \\r\\n•\\tUtilizing FinOps principles and AWS billing tools, provide recommendations for cost reduction. Create reports, dashboards, and documentation to help clients comprehend cloud spend, risks, and network usage.\\r\\n•\\tWAF Design & Implementation: Design and deploy Web Application Firewall (WAF) solutions across AWS and hybrid environments, including the development of custom AWS WAF rules.\\r\\n•\\tThreat Detection & Mitigation: Use AWS WAF, AWS Shield, and Firewall Manager to keep an eye on application-layer traffic, assess threats, and take appropriate action.\"}, {\"title\": \"Senior Developer\", \"company\": \"Cognizant Technology Solutions\", \"endDate\": \"Wed Dec 30\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Sun Dec 31\", \"description\": \"•\\tProvisioned AWS infrastructure using Terraform and CloudFormation.\\r\\n•\\tSet up multi-environment Kubernetes EKS clusters.\\r\\n•\\tDesigned secure VPC architectures with subnets, NAT gateways, route tables.\\r\\n•\\tMonitored health and set automated actions via CloudWatch.\\r\\n•\\tDeveloped scripts in Python/Bash for AWS task automation.\\r\\n•\\tManaged AMI lifecycle, EBS optimization.\\r\\n•\\tMaintained GitHub and Bitbucket for version control.\\r\\n•\\tResolved network issues with Route53 tuning.\\r\\n•\\tManaged and documented incidents via ServiceNow.\\r\\n•\\tSupported microservices deployment on ECS and EKS.\"}, {\"title\": \"Software Engineer\", \"company\": \"Cloudgate Systems India Pvt Ltd\", \"endDate\": \"Tue Jan 30\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Sat Jun 09\", \"description\": \"•\\tDelivered full lifecycle Workday HCM integrations using EIB, Studio.\\r\\n•\\tCreated reports, calculated fields, condition rules.\\r\\n•\\tImplemented org hierarchies, job profiles, compensation plans.\\r\\n•\\tMigrated config objects using Object Transporter.\\r\\n•\\tProvided L2 support, production fixes, UAT, end-user training.\\r\\n•\\tAdapted templates for client-specific logic.\\r\\n•\\tHandled incident and change management.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2017\", \"degree\": \"Master of Business Administration in Banking and Insurance Management\", \"result\": \"73\", \"institution\": \"Anna University\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('294cc777-5ed0-49f5-887e-ee87fa9927e7','742399ff-e350-44b8-8fb4-0e698152f5b1','Sap Finance Control Consultant',NULL,'Sap Finance Control Consultant',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"SAP Hana\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-13 19:03:01.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"Sap Finance Control Consultant\", \"company\": \"Sap Fico Consultant\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('294eae38-14e5-4df6-a831-30ba14fd0439','1838de93-74ec-4b09-89c3-146cf6fb56ea','Test Resume6','Test Resume6','Software Deve',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Automation\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-24 21:04:59.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Deve\", \"company\": \"Wipro\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[{\"year\": \"\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech\", \"result\": \"\", \"institution\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('2951ffa7-f4a8-426c-98f7-1f899433c940','581c7f15-1835-427e-84e5-0ae79ba577b2','Test Resume438','Test Resume438','Software Deve',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"OT Exstream\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-26 18:03:01.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Deve\", \"company\": \"KPI Partners\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[{\"year\": \"\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech\", \"result\": \"\", \"institution\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('2952d162-160a-458a-8521-e7bee11a1699','f11ef5c6-8d28-49bb-937a-72feb1485bd0','Test Resume248','Test Resume248','Software Deve',2,NUL