 Solving\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-07 03:35:40.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1746589292-642.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('29825b43-b3fc-4f90-b1f1-49057e729aee','64442439-7150-452f-92ea-497566a94d81','MES Developer with 3+ years of experience specializing in SMOM MES\r\nPlant Configuration for the Consumer Packaged Goods (CPG) industry.\r\nProven expertise in utilizing GE Proficy Plant Applications, SQL, and\r\nPTC Thing Worx to streamline manufacturing oper','MES Developer with 3+ years of experience specializing in SMOM MES\r\nPlant Configuration for the Consumer Packaged Goods (CPG) industry.\r\nProven expertise in utilizing GE Proficy Plant Applications, SQL, and\r\nPTC Thing Worx to streamline manufacturing operations. Adept at\r\ncollaborating with cross-functional teams to translate business needs\r\ninto technical solutions, with a strong track record in analyzing and\r\ndebugging complex SQL Server Reporting Services (SSRS), stored\r\nprocedures, and functions. Possesses foundational knowledge of\r\nPython and Java, with a strong commitment to continuous learning.','Associate',2,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/mounika-khandavilli-1791891982-124.pdf',NULL,'[\"Core Java\", \"IOT\", \"Mes\", \"SQL\", \"Python\", \"SSRS\", \"PTC ThingWorx Platform\", \"ISA-88\", \"ISA-95\", \"Proficy Historian\"]','PUBLIC','2026-10-13 23:07:54.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Associate\", \"company\": \"Cognizant\", \"endDate\": \"Thu Jan 01\", \"isCurrent\": true, \"startDate\": \"Thu Dec 22\", \"description\": \"Job Role involves working on GE Proficy Plant Application Configuration,\\r\\nPTC Thingworx , Troubleshooting with SQL Stored Procedures, Problem\\r\\nanalysis and MES Configuration for different sites.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2020\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech\", \"result\": \"7.1\", \"institution\": \"Pragati Engineering College\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/mounika-khandavilli-1791891982-124.pdf\", \"title\": \"Mounika Khandavilli\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('2986b3ff-606f-4659-a944-09584f2bb222','3908a251-0431-46b3-9d5f-2f971399b4c3','Test Resume91','Test Resume91','Software Deve',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Guidewire CC\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-26 14:46:18.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Deve\", \"company\": \"TECHSOPHY\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[{\"year\": \"\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech\", \"result\": \"\", \"institution\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('298ff110-347a-49c8-b2c4-789e0c09aded','410e153c-6920-4180-b140-e6415c531abc','Ignition SCADA and controls specialist with 9 years across aerospace, FMCG, logistics and renewable energy, currently leading a 15-member smart factory programme for a private jet manufacturer in Montreal. Deep hands-on ownership of the full Ignition stac','Ignition SCADA and controls specialist with 9 years across aerospace, FMCG, logistics and renewable energy, currently leading a 15-member smart factory programme for a private jet manufacturer in Montreal. Deep hands-on ownership of the full Ignition stack — gateway architecture and redundancy, UDT and template libraries, alarm pipelines, Perspective/Vision development, Python scripting, SQL-backed historisation and OPC UA/MQTT connectivity — including Ignition Cloud Edition on AWS with hardened certificate, secret-rotation and IT/OT access controls. Programmes PLCs across CodeSys, Siemens and Rockwell platforms using modular, reusable structures, and designs plant control architectures to the Purdue (PERA) model with connectivity delivered through Kepware, Litmus Edge and MQTT/UNS layers. Equally comfortable defining scopes for vendors, writing FRS/FDS and control narratives, and commissioning on the floor.','Assistant Engineer – Electrical Maintenance, Extrusion',10,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/meet-dharmendra-shah-1790230515-784.pdf',NULL,'[\"SCADA\"]','PUBLIC','2026-09-24 17:37:04.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Assistant Engineer – Electrical Maintenance, Extrusion\", \"company\": \"Maxxis Rubber India Pvt. Ltd.\", \"endDate\": \"Thu Apr 16\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Wed Jul 05\", \"description\": \"Owned electrical maintenance, breakdown resolution and continuous improvement for extrusion lines in a high-volume manufacturing plant at Sanand, Gujarat. ▪ Diagnosed and modified PLC logic, drive parameters and instrumentation loops during breakdowns, working directly against live production constraints — the grounding for later control-system design work.\"}, {\"title\": \"Senior R&D Engineer – Automation\", \"company\": \"NIDO Machineries Pvt. Ltd.\", \"endDate\": \"Mon Jul 20\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Wed Jul 15\", \"description\": \"Designed and developed new products for warehousing automation end to end — control architecture, panel and I/O design, controller and drive selection, PLC and HMI development, FAT, testing and commissioning. ▪ ▪ Programmed CodeSys 3.5 and 2.3 based controllers (Schneider, Wago, IFM) in Structured Text and Ladder, building reusable function-block libraries and standardised data structures so machine variants could be configured rather than re-coded. Developed motion and sequence control for Festo CMMT-ST, Mitsubishi MR-J4 and Delta ASDA-B2 servo axes, including homing, positioning, interlocks and fault recovery; integrated field devices over Modbus TCP/RTU and IO-Link.\"}, {\"title\": \"Senior Engineer – Engineering & Manufacturing Management\", \"company\": \"L&T Technology Services Ltd.\", \"endDate\": \"Mon May 12\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Wed Jul 06\", \"description\": \"Set up machine connectivity on a Unified Namespace using HiveMQ for consistent datapoint nomenclature, contextualisation and distribution; subscribed Ignition to the required topics for acquisition, visualisation and storage in MSSQL. ▪ ▪ ▪ ▪ Built a proof-of-concept Ignition SCADA based WMS/WCS solution for logistics, selected as one of the top 10 concepts organisation-wide. Led a team of 7 on an NPD programme with a leading logistics OEM — FRS and FDS authoring, PSR/governance reporting, and development of a reusable Allen Bradley Add-On Instruction (AOI) library in Studio 5000 with standardised UDTs and modular routine structure for rapid machine roll-out. Commissioned automated baggage handling systems onsite in Atlanta, USA and Barcelona, Spain — GuardLogix safety PLC programming and safety-function validation, Festo CMMT-ST servo integration and IO-Link remote I/O configuration; developed and unit/integration tested the Cruise Control System module for ROKBAK, UK. Grew account revenue from € 30,000 to over € 560,000 with engagements running up to 2 years through proposal design and effort estimation.\"}, {\"title\": \"Controls System Integrator II – Automation / Solar\", \"company\": \"Vertech Industrial Systems Pvt. Ltd.\", \"endDate\": \"Wed Sep 10\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Wed May 14\", \"description\": \"Developed Ignition SCADA scripts for energy calculation across multiple time frames, automatic wireframe configuration, bulk tag creation and Canary Historian API integration — turning repetitive plant build-out into a templated, scriptable process. ▪ ▪ ▪ Integrated inverters, MET stations, albedometers, power plant controllers, BESS and substation equipment over Modbus TCP/RTU, DNP3 and SEL protocols. Prepared the ERD for database design and historised plant data in Canary; authored control narratives from user requirements and interconnect agreements. Developed and tested SEL RTAC logic for real and reactive power control, over/under-frequency protection, inverter curtailment, control mode switching and redundancy.\"}, {\"title\": \"Technology Lead – Smart Factory Services\", \"company\": \"Tech Mahindra Ltd.\", \"endDate\": \"Thu Jan 01\", \"isCurrent\": true, \"startDate\": \"Wed Sep 24\", \"description\": \"Smart Factory Initiative — Machine Connectivity, OEE & Predictive Maintenance | Private Jet Manufacturer, Montreal, Canada ▪ ▪ ▪ ▪ ▪ ▪ Leading a team of 15 associates across two proof-of-concepts (OEE and Predictive Maintenance) with 3 direct reports; own solution architecture, sprint execution and customer-facing design reviews. Designed the plant-to-cloud control architecture to the Purdue (PERA) model — Level 0-2 machine and controller layers feeding a Level 3 connectivity and historisation tier, with the IT/OT boundary, DMZ placement and cloud gateway workloads defined so that shop-floor control remains isolated from enterprise analytics traffic. Selected and configured the machine connectivity layer using Kepware and Litmus Edge — driver selection per asset class, OPC UA server and certificate trust configuration, tag namespace design and edge buffering for intermittent links. Architected and deployed the Ignition Cloud Edition gateway on AWS EC2 (Linux), integrating on-premise Kepware OPC UA servers and a SQL Server historian on AWS RDS — including HTTPS port configuration, certificate trust chains and resolution of SSL hostname-mismatch and OPC UA Bad_Timeout / discovery-URL issues across the IT/OT boundary. Implemented automated database credential rotation for the gateway using AWS Secrets Manager, IAM policy scoping, scheduled fetch scripts and Ignition\'s File-Based Secret Provider, removing plaintext credentials from the gateway configuration; scoped an event-driven EventBridge + SSM Run Command extension and handed over documented next steps. Designed the UDT and tag architecture for the deployment — structured tag hierarchies, alarm-metrics rollup tags and Translation Manager localisation for an English/French plant floor.▪ Defined the OEE methodology end to end: a derived machine-state model (Production, Setup, Fault, Emergency Stop, Planned Maintenance, Filter Change, Not Scheduled, Communication Interrupt, Undefined Stop) and hierarchical rollup formulas for availability and performance across asset, cell, work centre and department levels, with run-time-weighted targets to keep availability effects out of performance. ▪ ▪ ▪ Built availability and performance logic for a Matsuura MX520-4 CNC using Fanuc FOCAS2 tags exposed through Kepware (run/auto status, alarm and emergency bits, operating time, part counts, executing programme number); extended the pattern to MTTR/MTBF reporting. Executed connectivity assessment for protocol-ready assets (Siemens S7-1500 riveters, Fanuc 31i CNCs, gantries via OPC UA / MTConnect / FOCAS) and legacy assets (presses, autoclaves, gantries) via a data-acquisition PLC over Modbus TCP; ran onsite machine-readiness workshops. Delivered predictive maintenance for 21 motors using vibration sensors, plus rule-based condition monitoring for burners, filters and HVAC controllers — extending SCADA visibility from process equipment into facility utilities.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2017\", \"degree\": \"B.TECH\", \"result\": \"7.74\", \"institution\": \"Pandit Deendayal Petroleum University\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/meet-dharmendra-shah-1790230515-784.pdf\", \"title\": \"MEET DHARMENDRA SHAH\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('29922ba5-9a4b-4906-8b32-06c569897f84','73065c71-b3b5-4514-bbcd-8423bf182153','Artificial Intelligence Engineer',NULL,'Artificial Intelligence Engineer',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Kubernetes\", \"Docker\", \"AWS\", \"Machine Learning\", \"Software Development\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-13 15:49:15.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"Artificial Intelligence Engineer\", \"company\": \"RadicalX\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('2994ac8f-6474-461e-a728-bc402b7bd002','e4b12594-99af-49a2-b18c-6f6c00290b78','Test Resume69','Tes