n Power BI administration, gateway management,\r\nand Power Automate for workflow automation. Proven ability to deliver data-driven\r\nsolutions that support strategic decisions across Healthcare, Networking, Production, Sales,\r\nFinance, and Marketing','Power BI Developer',4,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1773718190-175.pdf',NULL,'[\"ETL\", \"Data Analytics\", \"Power BI\", \"Microsoft Powerapps\", \"Power Automate\", \"Power Query\", \"DAX\", \"MYSQL\"]','PUBLIC','2026-03-17 14:47:02.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Power BI Developer\", \"company\": \"Kankaria Properties Pvt. Ltd.\", \"endDate\": \"Sun Mar 15\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Mon Jan 05\", \"description\": \"Designing and developing interactive Power BI dashboards and reports, creating advanced DAX measures and\\r\\noptimized data models to deliver actionable insights for business decision-making.\\r\\nPublishing and managing reports in Power BI Service, configuring workspaces, role-level security (RLS), on\\r\\npremises gateways, and scheduled refresh to ensure secure and reliable data access.\\r\\nDeveloping Power Apps solutions integrated with SharePoint and Microsoft 365 to streamline internal\\r\\nprocesses, data collection, and operational workflows.\\r\\nAutomating business processes using Power Automate, including approval workflows, alerts, and data\\r\\nsynchronization between systems to improve efficiency and reduce manual effort.\"}, {\"title\": \"Power BI Developer\", \"company\": \"Itdose Infosystems Pvt. Ltd.\", \"endDate\": \"Thu Oct 30\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Thu Jul 10\", \"description\": \"I have been working on designing interactive dashboards, creating DAX measures, and building optimized data\\r\\nmodels for analysis.\\r\\nWorking on publishing and managing reports, configuring workspaces, implementing RLS, and setting up\\r\\nscheduled data refresh and implementing on-premises gateways in PBI Services.\\r\\nWorking with MySQL Workbench and SQLyog for data extraction and transformation, to support BI reporting\\r\\nneeds.\\r\\nUsing SharePoint to integrate Power BI reports with other Microsoft tools to enable seamless data sharing and\\r\\ncollaboration across teams.\\r\\nDeveloping efficient data transformation workflows using Power Query and ETL techniques to clean, shape, and\\r\\nprepare data from multiple sources for accurate reporting and analytics in Power BI\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2023\", \"degree\": \"Bachelor of Technology in Computer Science\", \"result\": \"68\", \"institution\": \"IEC College of Engineering and Technology\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1773718190-175.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('29aa66c4-b836-4db8-aa18-e1abaa46f52f','8d3a72ea-0b94-4445-b6b8-9b87fd65a981','Test Resume416','Test Resume416','Software Deve',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Java\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-25 20:48:23.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Deve\", \"company\": \"Synergy\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[{\"year\": \"\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech\", \"result\": \"\", \"institution\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('29aadf9b-1b8c-4053-a89c-3bd383642c83','33fca6f5-49b6-4bab-b99a-dcc42dd7b8c7','Office Assistant',NULL,'Office Assistant',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"MS CIT\", \"Typing Speed\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-14 11:46:48.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"Office Assistant\", \"company\": \"Sant Baba Charitable Trust\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('29ad044a-ba7e-4ff0-986d-f4dad82f6be9','d49d5951-f117-4d5a-8e92-1f97d4155185','Programming Analyst',NULL,'Programming Analyst',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','PUBLIC','2025-05-23 19:46:32.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"Programming Analyst\", \"company\": \"\", \"endDa