e System to PI Interface connection and configuration\\r\\nof AF and create AF analysis.\\r\\nDeveloped PI Analysis for PI-MES RBE (Review Based\\r\\nException) Implementation.\\r\\nDone PI-SAP Implementation with SAP(S4/HANA and SAPECC)\"}, {\"title\": \"Sr. OSIsoft PI Engineer\", \"company\": \"Value Chain Solutions India\", \"endDate\": \"Tue Jun 13\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Mon Dec 28\", \"description\": \"• PI DA and PI AF and PI Vision Development, Batch-to-Batch\\r\\nVerification and Analysis, Critical Alarms Notification\\r\\ndevelopment.\\r\\nWork Role is to be Build Bridge between Operational\\r\\nTechnologies OT and Information Technologies IT to execute\\r\\nvarious Projects which based on IIOT or Industry 4.0.\\r\\nTo Understand Business requirements, operation &\\r\\nmaintenance requirements and Other analytical or custom\\r\\nrequirements for Designing complete turn-key solution.\\r\\nInstallation, configuration and licensing of complete\\r\\nOSISOFT PI System with all components like PI DA, PI AF, PI\\r\\nVision, PI Datalink, PI Manual Logger, PIOLEDB, PI Interfaces\\r\\nand connectors with all securities and identities.\\r\\nCompleted and working on more than 4 no’s of OSIsoft PI\\r\\nHistorian Implementation projects in various Industries\\r\\ndomains like metals & mines, Pulp & Paper, Pharma, Power &\\r\\nEnergy, Oil & Gas, Cement, Chemical etc.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2016\", \"degree\": \"Computer Engineering\", \"result\": \"Yes\", \"institution\": \"Shantilal Shah Government Engineering College\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1775129171-157.pdf\", \"title\": \"cv\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('29baf1bd-3050-4afc-ae5a-2ad5b3673bfc','5ef671fd-e981-4eb1-8a49-c3e2d2f17ce2','Chief Executive Officer (CEO) and Founder',NULL,'Chief Executive Officer (CEO) and Founder',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Business Development\", \"Market Research\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-16 10:34:49.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.00