d \r\nHealthcare IT industry. Specialized in Computer System Validation (CSV) and ensuring regulatory compliance \r\nwithin GxP environments (21 CFR Part','Experienced Validation Engineer and Senior Analyst with over 6 years of expertise in the Pharmaceutical and \r\nHealthcare IT industry. Specialized in Computer System Validation (CSV) and ensuring regulatory compliance \r\nwithin GxP environments (21 CFR Part 11, EU Annex 11). Proven track record in managing the full System \r\nDevelopment Life Cycle (SDLC), driving roadmap strategies for validation teams, and maintaining audit-ready \r\nsystems.','Business and Technology Delivery Senior Analyst',6,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1775060011-141.pdf',NULL,'[\"JIRA\", \"Gxp Compliance\", \"CSV\", \"ServiceNow\", \"SOP Development\", \"Root Cause Analysis\", \"SDLC\"]','PUBLIC','2026-04-02 03:34:03.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Business and Technology Delivery Senior Analyst\", \"company\": \"Accenture\", \"endDate\": \"Tue Mar 31\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Mon Jun 14\", \"description\": \"• Oversee validation deliverables across the System Lifecycle in a GxP regulated environment. \\r\\n• Define strategic roadmaps for validation teams to align with capacity expansion and future device \\r\\nlaunches. \\r\\n• Review system documentation to ensure strict adherence to client CSV SOPs and global regulatory \\r\\nguidance. \\r\\n• Manage application maintenance, including Incident, Change, and Service Request Management. \\r\\n• Ensure systems remain in a validated state and are prepared for audits and inspections at all times.\"}, {\"title\": \"Validation Associate\", \"company\": \"Navitas Life Sciences\", \"endDate\": \"Wed Jun 30\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Tue Mar 10\", \"description\": \"• Assessed and implemented regulatory processes according to IT-Pharma and Healthcare Quality \\r\\nstandards. \\r\\n• Developed and authorized validation plans and reports, ensuring systems were ready for \\\"Go-Live\\\". \\r\\n• Provided expert consultancy on test-related deviations and corrective actions. \\r\\n• Collaborated with stakeholders across multiple functional areas to drive planning activities.\"}, {\"title\": \"QA/QC Trainee\", \"company\": \"Softgel Health Care Pvt. Ltd.\", \"endDate\": \"Fri Feb 28\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Thu Jan 10\", \"description\": \"• Supported quality control and assurance processes within a regulated manufacturing environment. \\r\\n• Assisted in the verification of records and deliverables according to approved procedures.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2019\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech in Biotechnology\", \"result\": \"9.04\", \"institution\": \"Vinayaka Missions Research Foundation\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1775060011-141.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('2acaa5f9-af50-4faa-88de-6744f722e42e','2f31f7df-8608-4e48-8656-c98e9e404ee5','Test Resume787','Test Resume787','Software Deve',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Informatica\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-25 12:02:58.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Deve\", \"company\": \"Web crypt technologies\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[{\"year\": \"\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech\", \"result\": \"\", \"institution\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('2ad5be0e-41af-45aa-854e-b9838959b1e0','07a3afed-5861-45fd-ae9d-d34f855a6f6e','5 years of professional IT experience as Data engineer, Developer in BFSI, Wealth Management and Health \r\ndomain with US based client. Demonstrated expertise in building and optimizing data solutions using Azure Data \r\nFactory, Azure Data Lake, Azure Data','5 years of professional IT experience as Data engineer, Developer in BFSI, Wealth Management and Health \r\ndomain with US based client. Demonstrated expertise in building and optimizing data solutions using Azure Data \r\nFactory, Azure Data Lake, Azure Databricks, and SQL. Proficient in designing and maintaining data pipelines, \r\ndeveloping Databricks notebooks, and integrating data into robust Data Warehouse solutions. Experienced in \r\nleveraging Power BI for data visualization and business insights. Proven ability to work in fast-paced, client\r\nfacing environment with a strong focus on performance, scalability, and reliability.','Data Developer',4,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1776436472-977.pdf',NULL,'[\"Azure Data Engineer\", \"Azure\", \"Bigquery\", \"Python\", \"MS SQL Developer\", \"ADF\", \"Power BI\", \"ADLS Gen2\", \"MS SQL Server\", \"Pyspark\", \"Delta Lake\", \"Azure Databricks\"]','PUBLIC','2026-04-18 01:59:24.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Data Developer\", \"company\": \"EXL Services\", \"endDate\": \"Wed Apr 15\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Sat Feb 10\", \"description\": \"• Migrated unstructured data from on-premises storage to Azure Data Lake Storage Gen2 using Azure Data Factory, \\r\\nenabling scalable data processing and analytics in Azure Databricks. \\r\\n• Designed and implemented end-to-end data ingestion pipelines to extract data from multiple source systems into \\r\\nAzure-based data lakes using ADF and Databricks. \\r\\n• Developed transformation logic in Databricks using PySpark to cleanse, normalize, and consolidate data into a unified \\r\\n“Big Table” architecture for downstream analytics and reporting. \\r\\n• Wrote complex and optimized SQL queries for data validation, aggregation, and advanced data manipulation to \\r\\nsupport business logic implementation. \\r\\n \\r\\n \\r\\nS I G N I F I C A N T A C H I E V E M E N T S \\r\\nS K I L L S \\r\\nP R O J E C T U N D E R T A K E N \\r\\n• Created reusable Databricks notebooks for ETL workflows, with modular and scalable script design for ease of \\r\\nmaintenance and debugging. \\r\\n• Built interactive dashboards and reports in Databricks for stakeholders, enabling real-time insights and monitoring  \\r\\nof healthcare data. \\r\\n• Ensured data quality and consistency through rigorous testing and validation steps across the data pipeline. \\r\\n• Collaborated closely with data analysts, domain experts, and business teams to align data solutions with healthcare \\r\\ncompliance and reporting requirements. \\r\\n• Designed end-to-end data architectures following medallion/lakehouse frameworks (Bronze–Silver–Gold layers).\"}, {\"title\": \"Data Developer\", \"company\": \"TCS\", \"endDate\": \"Sat Jan 20\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Tue Jul 05\", \"description\": \"• Automated daily ingestion of unstructured data into Azure Data Lake using parameterized ADF pipelines with trigger\\r\\nbased orchestration and fault-tolerant mechanisms. \\r\\n• Working as Data Developer and used Azure Databricks, Azure Data Warehouse, Data Lake Gen1 and Gen2 Azure \\r\\nStorage Blobs, Azure Data Factory, Azure Analytics services. \\r\\n• Development/creation of pipelines in ADF using Linked Services/Datasets/Pipeline to get data from different source \\r\\nsystems into Azure Data Lake environment and to process and perform ETL transformation and get into our common \\r\\ndata model using Azure Databricks, Spark, ADLS with different file system and format. \\r\\n• Hands on Experience on Azure Databricks script writing to perform ETL transformation on data using Spark and load \\r\\ninto SQL, Cosmos. \\r\\n• Involved in the investigations and debugging of the scripts when the customer raises the issue and given the root\\r\\ncause with corresponding solutions within SLA. \\r\\n• Worked with Azure Logic Apps to send email and also the files from SFTP to Blob Storage. \\r\\n• Designed and implemented scalable data pipelines using GCP services (BigQuery, Dataflow, Pub/Sub, Cloud Storage). \\r\\n• Worked on MS SQL studio to write queries, stored procedure, views for data development. \\r\\n• Worked on automating the processes and performing data validations for different source system. \\r\\n• Active participation in the weekly client meetings to discuss the open issues and in the meeting with Development \\r\\nleaders to discuss the open PBIs and Bugs. \\r\\n• Excellent communication skills, both written and verbal. I can work in a team independently and I am always keen to \\r\\nlearn new thing.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2020\", \"degree\": \"BACHELOR OF  TECHNOLOGY in  (Mechanical Engineering)\", \"result\": \"8.55\", \"institution\": \"(BIJU PATNAIK UNIVERSITYOF  TECHNOLOGY)  NATIONAL INSTITUTE OF SCIENCE  ANDTECHNOLOGY\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1776436472-977.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('2adc42da-858f-4cd7-97e9-efc7aff31d36','7c7c5fab-0db8-4f15-92a1-7bc509de3054','Node.Js AWS Backend Developer',NULL,'Node.Js AWS Backend Developer',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Core Java\", \"J2EE\", \"Hibernate\", \"HTML5\", \"CSS3\", \"Java Developer\", \"C#\", \"Java\", \"C++\", \"Algorithms\", \"Data Structures\", \"Angular\", \"Software Engineering\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-14 12:29:44.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"Node.Js AWS Backend Developer\", \"company\": \"Sustainability Economics\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('2adc67af-220c-4989-9c20-73e1a0697757','4ef8508f-33bb-46a7-b14f-6a79c8787fae','MES Apriso Developer with 4+ years of experience in DELMIA Apriso development, MES implementation,\r\nproduction execution systems, manufacturing process optimization, machine integration, testing, deployment, and\r\nclient-facing consulting. Experienced in a','MES Apriso Developer with 4+ years of experience in DELMIA Apriso development, MES implementation,\r\nproduction execution systems, manufacturing process optimization, machine integration, testing, deployment, and\r\nclient-facing consulting. Experienced in automotive, batter