t, and cleaner deployment paths).\\r\\nUsed Datadog (logs, metrics, traces) to troubleshoot production issues, accelerating root-cause analysis, improving incident\\r\\nresponse, and increasing service stability through better observability and actionable alerts.\\r\\nMigrated CI/CD from Azure DevOps to GitHub Actions, improving build reliability, speeding up feedback cycles, and reducing\\r\\npipeline maintenance overhead through standardized workflows and reusable actions.\\r\\nPerformed thorough code reviews to strengthen code quality, improve maintainability, and reduce production defects by\\r\\ncatching edge cases, performance risks, and security gaps earlier in the SDLC.\\r\\nLeveraged AI-assisted development tools (Cline, GitHub Copilot, Claude) to accelerate implementation, refactoring,\\r\\ndebugging, and test creation, improving developer throughput while maintaining code consistency and quality.\\r\\nSupported deployments and release activities, improving release confidence, reducing rollback risk, and strengthening\\r\\noperational readiness through better coordination, validation, and release hygiene.\\r\\nIntegrated and upgraded third-party document tooling (Apryse, GroupDocs, Dynamsoft), improving document workflow\\r\\nstability, reducing processing failures, and ensuring compatibility across upgrades and customer environments.\\r\\nParticipated in requirement analysis and architecture discussions, improving scope clarity, reducing rework, and ensuring\\r\\nsprint work stayed aligned with business priorities and technical constraints\"}, {\"title\": \"Associate Staff Engineer\", \"company\": \"Nagarro\", \"endDate\": \"Sun Jan 05\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Tue Oct 10\", \"description\": \"Retail Domain Project\\r\\nManaged the end-to-end solution for a retail application, starting from vendor data integration to developing and supporting\\r\\nfrontend applications.\\r\\nVendor Data Loads: Led the integration and transformation of vendor data into the system, ensuring accurate, timely, and\\r\\nefficient data processing.\\r\\nAPI Integrations: Managed API integrations between various systems, ensuring smooth data flow between vendors, internal\\r\\ndatabases, and other retail systems.\\r\\nFrontend Application Development: Worked closely with frontend teams to ensure that the user interface was aligned with the\\r\\nbackend logic and optimized for performance and user experience using angular and asp.net mvc.\\r\\nCross-Functional Collaboration: Coordinated with business analysts, QA, and product teams to define requirements and\\r\\ntroubleshoot issues, ensuring smooth product delivery.\\r\\nOptimized Database performance by designing efficient SQL queries and stored procedures, and implemented Entity\\r\\nFramework for data access, resulting in a 30% reduction in query execution time.\\r\\nDesigned and developed an SSO solution for an enterprise-level application, allowing seamless user authentication across\\r\\nmultiple services using [OAuth 2.0/OpenID Connect].\\r\\nIntegrated Redis Cache to store and retrieve frequently accessed data, significantly improving application performance\\r\\nand reducing database load\"}, {\"title\": \"Capgemini\", \"company\": \"Associate Consultant\", \"endDate\": \"Wed Mar 30\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Tue Aug 20\", \"description\": \"Developed a comprehensive web solution using ASP.NET MVC that assists SAP Subject Matter Experts in selecting optimized\\r\\ncloud infrastructure services and determining the best cloud service provider based on client region.\\r\\nCreated Python automated scripts to streamline the cloud infrastructure setup for SAP systems, reducing manual\\r\\nconfiguration efforts and increasing efficiency. \\r\\nDesigned an innovative Web VR application using A-Frame to showcase cutting-edge ideas to customers, which significantly\\r\\ncontributed to attracting multiple new clients and enhancing the organization\'s market presence\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2019\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech Information Technology |\", \"result\": \"9.21\", \"institution\": \"NIT Raipur\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1777045537-690.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('2be29965-1256-4e66-a54c-bd37e3b7c780','fcc0467d-2f15-4a77-95ea-2d3c9768ef34','Test Resume260','Test Resume260','Software Deve',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Guidewire CC\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-26 15:02:24.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Deve\", \"company\": \"Elric Soft Pvt\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[{\"year\": \"\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech\", \"result\": \"\", \"institution\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('2be3929d-b2e4-4c23-9bd0-e1e8c0d744e7','0b187799-da56-4c35-8e43-363d8d27e72c','DevOps Engineer with 4+ years of experience in designing, automating, and optimizing CI/CD pipelines \r\nand cloud infrastructure on AWS. Proven expertise in Jenkins, Terraform, Docker, Kubernetes (EKS), and \r\nGitOps-based deployment strategies. Successfull','DevOps Engineer with 4+ years of experience in designing, automating, and optimizing CI/CD pipelines \r\nand cloud infrastructure on AWS. Proven expertise in Jenkins, Terraform, Docker, Kubernetes (EKS), and \r\nGitOps-based deployment strategies. Successfully improved deployment frequency, system reliability, and \r\ncloud cost efficiency through automation, monitoring, and infrastructure standardization. Strong experience  \r\nin production support, observability, security best practices, and cross-functional collaboration.','DevOps Engineer',6,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1773155624-206.pdf',NULL,'[]','PUBLIC','2026-03-11 02:35:45.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"DevOps Engineer\", \"company\": \"AFour Technologies Pvt Ltd\", \"endDate\": \"Sun Nov 30\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Wed Sep 10\", \"description\": \"Con