ed operational costs by 20% through cloud cost optimization efforts.  \\r\\n• Enforced IAM-based security, RBAC policies, and SSH key rotations in AWS.\"}, {\"title\": \"Systems Engineer\", \"company\": \"ATOS, Atos Global IT Solutions and Services Pvt Ltd\", \"endDate\": \"Thu Feb 29\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Thu Jun 10\", \"description\": \"• Operated daily DevOps operations ensuring smooth deployments and quick issue resolution.  \\r\\n• Configured alert rules, SLA dashboards, and resource utilization metrics using Prometheus and Grafana.  \\r\\n• Maintained Jenkins pipelines to automate CI/CD workflows for microservices.  \\r\\n• Provisioned AWS infrastructure (EC2, S3, VPC, IAM, etc.) to ensure uptime and scalability.  \\r\\n• Supported containerization using Docker and Kubernetes, reducing deployment time by 40%.  \\r\\n• Used Terraform and Ansible to eliminate configuration drift and standardize environments.  \\r\\n• Facilitated daily stand-ups, improving team communication and reducing incident resolution time by \\r\\n25%.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2020\", \"degree\": \"Bachelor of Engineering in Electronics & Telecommunication\", \"result\": \"67.7\", \"institution\": \"Solapur University\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1773155624-206.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('2be7077c-0b6c-47ae-88f8-aede303a432a','f4f40ef3-aa43-4f1d-8f2c-486ce3f3c596','Senior Software Developer',NULL,'Senior Software Developer',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Change Management\", \"HTML\", \"Jenkins\", \"Core Java\", \"IT Manager\", \"JavaScript\", \"Java\", \"Hibernate\", \"C#\", \"ASP.NET\", \".NET\", \"Microsoft SQL Server\", \"HTML\", \"CSS\", \"JavaScript\", \"Microsoft Office\", \"Java\", \"Microsoft Excel\", \"SQL Server\", \"Requirement Gathering\", \"Software Testing\", \"Software Development\", \"Software Engineering\", \"TestNG\", \"MYSQL\", \"OOPS\", \"SQL\", \"Team Management\", \"C\", \"Selenium Webdri