rmaceutical serialization and traceability regulations \\r\\nacross NA, APAC, and LATAM regions with GS1 standard (including US, Brazil and other regional \\r\\nmandates). - Managed incident tickets, service requests and tasks through ITSM tools (ServiceNow) with \\r\\ndefined SLAs for serialization system issues. - Supported implementation and testing of Change Requests (CRs) related to product \\r\\nconfiguration, regulatory updates, and process optimization. - Conducted validation, UAT, and regression testing for system changes, label updates, and \\r\\nintegration enhancements. - Co-ordinated with supply chain, packaging, distribution centers, and QA teams to troubleshoot \\r\\nserialization scanning failures, data sync issues, and EPCIS reporting errors. - Monitored product events across the supply chain (commissioning, aggregation, decommissioning, \\r\\nshipping, receiving). - Collaborated with vendors and external partners for system integration (SAP ATTP, ATLAS team). - Ensured data accuracy and serialization readiness during product introduction, label \\r\\nchanges, and packaging updates. \\r\\n• Real-Time Data Migration and Transformation from On-Premises to Azure Cloud \\r\\nUsing Azure Data Factory, PySpark, and Data Pipelines \\r\\n[Azure Data Factory, Azure data lake storage, Azure synapse analytics, Azure pipeline, PySpark, Azure \\r\\nDatabricks] - Designed and implemented a real-time data pipeline to migrate and transform data from on\\r\\npremises SQL Server to Azure Cloud. - Utilized Azure Data Factory with Self-hosted Integration Runtime to extract and load raw data \\r\\ninto Azure Data Lake Storage (ADLS). - Developed PySpark scripts in Azure Databricks for data cleansing, aggregation, and joining from \\r\\nmultiple sources. - Loaded transformed data into Azure Synapse Analytics for reporting and analytical processing. - Leveraged Azure Synapse Spark Pools as an alternative compute for PySpark transformations when \\r\\nrequired. - Implemented ADF pipelines with scheduling, error handling, and monitoring for end-to-end \\r\\norchestration. - Configured linked services, datasets, and Copy Activities within ADF for efficient data movement.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2020\", \"degree\": \"Bachelor of Technology in Computer Science and Engineering\", \"result\": \"7.1\", \"institution\": \"Walchand College of Engineering, Sangli\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/nikita-laxman-gaikwad-1791533608-537.pdf\", \"title\": \"Nikita Laxman Gaikwad\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('2d50333b-c358-484c-b47f-ab7cc917ac02','ef955dae-f148-4583-a107-6ae97f31d5ac','Test Resume100','Test Resume100','Software Deve',2,2200000.00,NULL,NULL,'[\"Process Safety Engineer\"]','PUBLIC','2025-06-05 14:14:05.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Deve\", \"company\": \"Reliance Industries Limited \", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]',1500000.00,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('2d52372a-9a6b-44e1-b77d-58435192c48a','c9db0883-cca5-42ba-b501-b322ee8c7efd','Software Developer',NULL,'Software Developer',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Java\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-23 12:52:53.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Developer\", \"company\": \"Luxoft\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]',2000000.00,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('2d558959-5499-4c28-ad80-7d8d884a4350','adf29666-3993-4633-8153-7deebacce1b6','Test Resume164','Test Resume164','Software Deve',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Java\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-26 17:25:55.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Deve\", \"company\": \"Innvision\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[{\"year\": \"\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech\", \"result\": \"\", \"institution\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('2d585d31-381e-4ed1-