K — owning features from first commit to\\r\\nPlay Store release.\\r\\n• Integrated 30+ REST APIs via Retrofit to power auth, product\\r\\nmanagement, cart, order tracking, Firebase Cloud Messaging,\\r\\nand the Google Maps API — the backbone of live checkout\\r\\nand delivery-tracking flows.\\r\\n• Architected offline-first modules on MVVM + Room Database,\\r\\npartnering with cross-functional Agile teams to ship weekly\\r\\nreleases.\\r\\n• Owned Google Play Store publishing end-to-end — build\\r\\nsigning, staged rollouts, and post-release maintenance.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2025\", \"degree\": \"MCA, Computer Applications\", \"result\": \"73\", \"institution\": \"LOVELY PROFESSIONAL UNI VERSITY\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1784030006-278.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('2d97bc58-7016-4dcd-b746-ddb17a2e91a7','3f240935-42aa-483a-a569-9b22771510b4','Senior Software Engineer with 5.6+ years of experience building scalable, low-latency Java-based microser\r\nvices for fintech and telecom platforms.\r\nExpert in Spring Boot, Kafka, and distributed systems with strong experience in designing event-driven arc','Senior Software Engineer with 5.6+ years of experience building scalable, low-latency Java-based microser\r\nvices for fintech and telecom platforms.\r\nExpert in Spring Boot, Kafka, and distributed systems with strong experience in designing event-driven archi\r\ntectures and real-time data pipelines. Proven track record of improving system performance (up to 35% la\r\ntency reduction) and delivering secure, cloud-native solutions on AWS with CI/CD automation.','Senior Software Engineer',6,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1778529895-698.pdf',NULL,'[\"Data Structures Algorithms\", \"Java\", \"JavaScript\", \"Hibernate\", \"JPA (Java Persistence Api)\", \"JWT (Json Web Tokens)\", \"Apache Ant\", \"Kafka\", \"J UNIT\", \"SQL\", \"Spring Boot\", \"Spring Security\", \"REST API\", \"Spring Cloud\", \"Mongo DB\", \"Splunk\", \"Mockito\", \"Prometheus\"]','PUBLIC','2026-05-12 07:31:23.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Senior Software Engineer\", \"company\": \"Publicis Sapient\", \"endDate\": \"Thu Apr 09\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Fri Aug 15\", \"description\": \"• Applied advanced Data Structures & Algorithms (hashing, heaps, graphs, and dynamic programming) to optimize back\\r\\nend services, improving response time and reducing computational overhead in high-throughput systems.\\r\\n• Designed efficient in-memory data structures and caching strategies (LRU, Redis-based) to handle large-scale data pro\\r\\ncessing and reduce latency under peak load.\\r\\n• Architected and built cloud-native, distributed microservices using Java 17, Spring Boot, and Spring Cloud, deployed on\\r\\nAWS(EC2, API Gateway, RDS, S3), supporting high-throughput telecom systems.\\r\\n• Designed end-to-end system architecture (HLD + LLD) for scalable services, improving system reliability and reducing\\r\\nfailure points.\\r\\n• Implemented API Gateway pattern using AWS API Gateway and Spring Cloud Gateway, enabling centralized routing,\\r\\nauthentication, and rate limiting.\\r\\n• Built secure REST APIs using Spring Security (JWT, OAuth2), ensuring enterprise-grade authentication and authoriza\\r\\ntion.\\r\\n• Applied Resilience4j (Circuit Breaker, Retry, Bulkhead) to prevent cascading failures in distributed systems.\\r\\n• Integrated Kafka-based event-driven architecture, enabling asynchronous communication and improving system scala\\r\\nbility.\\r\\n• UsedAWSRDS(PostgreSQL/MySQL) with optimized indexing and query tuning to improve DB performance by 25%.\\r\\n• Implemented Redis caching and async processing, reducing average API response time by 30% under peak load.\\r\\n• Containerized services using Docker and deployed on Kubernetes, enabling horizontal scaling and zero-downtime de\\r\\nployments.\\r\\n• Set upmonitoring, logging, and alerting using AWS CloudWatch, Prometheus, Grafana, and ELK Stack, reducing MTTR\\r\\nsignificantly.\\r\\n• Automated CI/CD pipelines using Jenkins, GitHub Actions, and AWS CodePipeline, reducing deployment time by 40%.\\r\\n• Applied prompt engineering techniques to improve response accuracy, consistency, and reduce hallucinations.\\r\\n• Built AI agents for task automation (e.g., data extraction, summarization, workflow orchestration) integrated with back\\r\\nend services.\\r\\n• Implemented context management and prompt chaining strategies for multi-step reasoning tasks.\\r\\n• Ledfeature ownership end-to-end, mentored junior engineers, and drove best practices in code quality, design patterns,\\r\\nand performance optimization.\"}, {\"title\": \"Software Engineer II\", \"company\": \"Morgan Stanley (via eClerx)\", \"endDate\": \"Wed Apr 30\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Sun Dec 10\", \"description\": \"• Designed and developed low-latency trading microservices using Java, Spring Boot, and Kafka, deployed on AWS EC2,\\r\\nhandling real-time ETF order processing.\\r\\n• Built event-driven pipelines using Apache Kafka (Producers, Consumers, Kafka Streams) processing high-volume market\\r\\ndata with near real-time latency.\\r\\n• Optimized Kafka throughput using partitioning strategy, batching, and consumer group scaling, achieving 35% latency\\r\\nreduction.\\r\\n• Ensured data consistency using idempotent consumers and exactly-once processing strategies in financial workflows.\\r\\n• Implemented distributed transaction management using Saga Pattern, ensuring consistency across microservices.\\r\\n• Secured APIs using Spring Security, OAuth2, and JWT, meeting financial-grade security standards.\\r\\n• UsedAWSSQSforasynchronous processing and service decoupling.\\r\\n• Designed database solutions using Oracle, PostgreSQL, and MongoDB, improving query efficiency and reducing re\\r\\nsponse time. Built and maintained CI/CD pipelines using Jenkins, GitHub Actions, and AWS CodePipeline.\\r\\n• Enabled observability using AWS CloudWatch, ELK Stack, Prometheus, and Grafana, improving production monitoring\\r\\nand alerting.\\r\\n• Collaborated in Agile/Scrum teams, contributing to sprint planning, design discussions, and production releases.\"}, {\"title\": \"Software Engineer\", \"company\": \"Rakuten Symphony India\", \"endDate\": \"Mon Nov 20\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Thu Dec 10\", \"description\": \"• Developed and maintained Spring Boot microservices using Java 8/11, Spring Data JPA, and Hibernate, handling 1M+\\r\\ndaily transactions with sub-100ms latency.\\r\\n• Designed efficient data access layers using JPA/Hibernate, implementing entity relationships, lazy/eager loading strate\\r\\ngies, and optimizing ORM performance.\\r\\n• Optimized database interactions using Hibernate caching, query tuning, and indexing, reducing query execution time\\r\\nand improving throughput.\\r\\n• Designed event-driven systems using Kafka and RabbitMQ, improving system scalability and asynchronous processing.\\r\\n• Deployed applications on AWS EC2, using S3 for storage and RDS for database management.\\r\\n• Implemented Redis caching, reducing database load and improving response time by 20%.\\r\\n• Built secure APIs using Spring Security, implementing authentication and authorization mechanisms.\\r\\n• Workedwith MySQLandMongoDB, optimizing schema design and query performance.\\r\\n• Containerized applications using Docker and supported scalable deployments.\\r\\n• Automated CI/CD pipelines using Jenkins and AWS CodePipeline, improving release efficiency.\\r\\n• Documented APIs using Swagger/OpenAPI, improving cross-team integration.\\r\\n• Applied design patterns and clean architecture principles, ensuring maintainable and scalable codebases\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2020\", \"degree\": \"Master of Computer Applications (MCA)- Computer Science & Engineering\", \"result\": \"7.45\", \"institution\": \"Motilal Nehru National Institute of Technology\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1778529895-698.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('2da0c551-9ed0-41ba-b852-01ab11982cb4','77d92664-32f1-4fdc-ac86-a49d2c031740','Results-oriented sales professional with 8.5 years of experience in sales and a proven track record of exceeding\r\n monthly sales quotas. Highly skilled at creating new relationships and maintaining strong customer relations to\r\n generate repeated business','Results-oriented sales professional with 8.5 years of experience in sales and a proven track record of exceeding\r\n monthly sales quotas. Highly skilled at creating new relationships and maintaining strong customer relations to\r\n generate repeated business. In-depth knowledge of effective sales strategies and excellent presentation skills.\r\n Analytical thinker with the ability to perform well under pressure. Goal and team-oriented with strong leadership skills\r\n and commitment to achieving sales quotas to drive the growth of the company.','Sales Manager',8,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1759735178-694.pdf',NULL,'[\"Leadership Skills\", \"CRM (Customer Relationship Management)\", \"Communication Skills\", \"IOT\", \"ERP\", \"Government\", \"B2B Sales\", \"IT Infrastructure\", \"Quick Decision Making\", \"SAAS\"]','PUBLIC','2025-10-06 07:02:30.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Sales Manager\", \"company\": \"ARYA OMNITALK WIRELESS SOLUTIONS PVT LTD (Parent- Arvind Ltd)\", \"endDate\": \"Sat Oct 04\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Thu May 09\", \"description\": \"Led end-to-end sales cycle for IoT and SaaS solutions (ERP) with a strong focus on \\r\\nGovernment Smart City Projects. Developed and executed solution-based selling \\r\\nstrategies, positioning smart infrastructure technologies (IoT sensors, SaaS platforms, \\r\\nand analytics tools) for Municipal Corporations Also (Govt./Semi/PSU)\\r\\n •\\r\\n Actively engaged in Tender Processes includ