SS/MSS modules by analyzing issues, coordinating with \\r\\ncross-functional teams, resolving access and workflow errors, documenting recurring problems, and \\r\\nensuring SLA compliance for seamless employee and manager self-service operations. \\r\\n▪ Received formal client appreciation for delivering high-quality SAP Fiori/UI5 solutions ahead of schedule, \\r\\ndemonstrating strong technical expertise, proactive communication, and commitment to business \\r\\noutcomes. \\r\\n▪ Collaborated effectively with diverse teams to achieve project goals and resolve product-related issues.  \\r\\n▪ Developed responsive SAPUI5 applications using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript, ensuring cross-browser \\r\\ncompatibility and adherence to SAP Fiori design principles for enhanced user experience. \\r\\n▪ Facilitated meetings to gather input and align team objectives on key projects. \\r\\n▪ Team Leadership: Successfully advanced to a leadership role, managing a team of 4. Developed strong \\r\\nleadership skills and provided mentorship to junior team members.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2021\", \"degree\": \"Bachelor of Engineering (Electronics and Communication Engineering)\", \"result\": \"75\", \"institution\": \"Sridevi Women\'s Engineering College\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1767125856-808.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('309eeb2b-c3a1-4120-9f5d-e04ca65f72dd','0c6ad8b8-55db-4021-8228-1b210ed3fa55','Test Resume207','Test Resume207','Software Deve',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\".NET\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-24 18:59:57.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Deve\", \"company\": \"Synergies\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[{\"year\": \"\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech\", \"result\": \"\", \"institution\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',2800000.00,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('30a04f45-9b90-4f49-bada-0806a93e066f','5dbf425f-1230-4781-8ec0-fb8a85f76730','Test Resume268