lex data into intuitive\r\nstorytelling-focused Power BI vi','Senior Power BI Developer and Data Analyst with 4.3+ years of experience building enterprise dashboards and\r\npersona-driven reporting solutions for leadership teams. Specialized in transforming complex data into intuitive\r\nstorytelling-focused Power BI visualizations using strong UI/UX design principles. Proven ability to deliver scalable analytics\r\nsolutions in Agile environments that drive adoption and informed business outcomes.','Technology Analyst',2,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1771913903-836.pdf',NULL,'[\"KPI Analysis\", \"KPIS\", \"Azure\", \"Python\", \"Power BI\", \"DAX\", \"SQL\", \"Pandas\"]','PUBLIC','2026-02-24 18:46:51.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Technology Analyst\", \"company\": \"tcs\", \"endDate\": \"Fri Feb 20\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Tue Jan 11\", \"description\": \"Designed executive-level Power BI dashboards focused on persona-based insights, enabling leadership teams\\r\\nto interpret complex operational metrics through intuitive visual storytelling.\\r\\n Designed and orchestrated an end-to-end data infrastructure using Databricks, Azure Synapse SQL Server,\\r\\nand MySQL, integrating 15+ data sources into a unified storage layer, reducing manual data preparation by\\r\\n40% and improving data accuracy by 25%.\\r\\n Acted as a Business Analyst for 6 analytics projects, leading 20+ stakeholder requirement-gathering sessions\\r\\nand authoring functional design documents and scalable data models, reducing rework by 35%.\\r\\n Applied UI/UX and visual design principles to simplify technical data into accessible reports for both technical\\r\\nand non-technical stakeholders.\\r\\n Authored and maintained 50+ complex DAX measures, improving calculation accuracy by 20% and reducing\\r\\nreport load times by 30%.\\r\\n Led and mentored a team of 8 engineers, overseeing 15+ end-to-end BI deliveries and improving on-time\\r\\nproduction deployment from 75% to 96%.\\r\\n Built and maintained Power BI dataflows including linked dataflows with automated refresh dependencies,\\r\\nenabling multi-country reporting across 5 regions.\\r\\n Optimized Power BI data models and dashboards for performance, usability, and enterprise-wide adopti\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2020\", \"degree\": \"Mechanical Engineering\", \"result\": \"Yes\", \"institution\": \"Anil Neerukonda Institute of Technology & Sciences\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1771913903-836.pdf\", \"title\": \"cv\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('3145d9df-45c0-4146-80b5-811deb43aa25','456dd206-20a1-4c0c-9aa1-86ab1fa300b5','BPO Voice Process',NULL,'BPO Voice Process',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','PUBLIC','2025-05-13 17:01:47.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"BPO Voice Process\", \"company\": \"Sri ram life insurence, bajaj finserv\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('314b5a62-0a2f-4013-818d-688ef0861934','62fec024-d3a1-411c-a4d4-4f3f36ef2bea','Test Resume137','Test Resume137','Software Deve',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Guidewire CC\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-24 21:11:47.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Deve\", \"company\": \"TCS\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[{\"year\": \"\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech\", \"result\": \"\", \"institution\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('314e8476-55c3-46ec-b68e-458b473d0fc8','3b6f9990-e358-4712-95de-035930e5deda','C#/.NET Software Engineer with 3+ years of experience developing production-grade desktop and backend applications using WPF, MVVM, \r\nASP.NET Core Web API, REST APIs, and WCF. Specialized in semiconductor equipment automation with hands-on experience in S','C#/.NET Software Engineer with 3+ years of experience developing production-grade desktop and backend applications using WPF, MVVM, \r\nASP.NET Core Web API, REST APIs, and WCF. Specialized in semiconductor equipment automation with hands-on experience in SECS/GEM, \r\nGEM300, equipment communication, workflow automation, and manufacturing software. Experienced in Generative AI integration, including \r\nLLMs, RAG-based document processing, intelligent data extraction, structured data mapping, and AI-powered workflow automation. Delivered \r\nscalable software solutions for global clients including Western Digital and Eugenus, with a strong focus on performance, reliability, \r\nmaintainability, and intelligent automation.','Software Engineer',4,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1789570198-956.pdf',NULL,'[\"C#\", \".NET\", \".NET CORE\", \"ASP.NET Core\", \"ASP.NET Core Web API\", \"Entity Framework\", \"MES Integration\", \"Git\", \"WPF\", \"MVVM\", \"WCF\", \"FastAPI\", \"Semiconductor\", \"SECS/GEM Standards\", \"Semi\", \"Generative AI\", \"Agentic AI\", \"LLM Fine-tuning\", \"SQL Server\"]','PUBLIC','2026-09-17 02:17:11.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Engineer\", \"company\": \"HiCore Software Technologies Pvt. Ltd.\", \"endDate\": \"Thu Sep 10\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Thu Sep 05\", \"description\": \"• Built and maintained a WPF/.NET host application enabling SECS/GEM and GEM300 communication between semiconductor equipment \\r\\nand MES systems, supporting real-time production workflows. \\r\\n• Designed and containerized ASP.NET Core Web APIs with Docker for equipment connectivity, event/alarm handling, and remote \\r\\ncommand execution, reducing manual intervention in Control Job and Process Job workflows. \\r\\n• Implemented SVID/ECID management, SECS/SML message parsing, and automated test execution aligned with SEMI standards, \\r\\nimproving traceability of equipment events. \\r\\n• Integrated Generative AI and RAG-based retrieval to automate SECS/GEM specification extraction and document chunking, cutting \\r\\nmanual spec-review effort by an estimated . \\r\\n• Collaborated with cross-functional engineering teams across time zones to troubleshoot production issues and deliver reliable, high\\r\\nperformance releases.\"}, {\"title\": \"Associate Software Developer\", \"company\": \"HiCore Software Technologies Pvt. Ltd.\", \"endDate\": \"Fri Aug 30\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Tue Sep 05\", \"description\": \"Core, FastAPI, WCF, SQL Server, REST APIs, SECS/GEM \\r\\n• Developed WPF-based UI modules and workflow automation features for semiconductor deposition equipment, improving operator \\r\\nvisibility into execution status. \\r\\n• Built REST APIs (ASP.NET Core / FastAPI) for system integration between equipment software and backend services. \\r\\n• Implemented SQL Server-backed data processing and equipment communication logic, supporting real-time monitoring of deposition runs. \\r\\n• Contributed to early Generative AI integration for intelligent document processing and structured data mapping, an initiative that expanded \\r\\ninto the AI workstream on the following project. \\r\\n• Participated in code reviews and resolved production defects, contributing to on-time delivery of client milestones.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2019\", \"degree\": \"Master of Science, Computer Science\", \"result\": \"73\", \"institution\": \"Hindustan University\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1789570198-956.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('31514075-14ea-4071-ad54-7af293cb0be9','0dfcb9d4-6ad5-4288-81cb-2e99176915d8','Professional',NULL,'Professional',1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','PUBLIC','2025-05-14 11:57:00.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('31543afd-47ba-4145-992e-eff6819a1f2c','f75a8255-026f-48dc-81ef-4c352d3cd536','Control Engineer with 10+ years in industrial automation. Specialised in designing, programming and commissioning PLC, robot\r\nand vision systems