0-415e-976a-a0c0bf91c150','50adbd17-8302-46fc-ab7d-35526891b81c','Robotics Engineer working in the field of researching, designing, and developing advanced robotic systems. Having hands\r\non experience in hardware integration of motors, drivers, controllers, power systems, and sensors, along with mapping and \r\ndevelopmen','Robotics Engineer working in the field of researching, designing, and developing advanced robotic systems. Having hands\r\non experience in hardware integration of motors, drivers, controllers, power systems, and sensors, along with mapping and \r\ndevelopment of Autonomous Mobile Robots (AMRs), tracked robots, and quadruped robots. Skilled in sensor calibration \r\n(IMU, LiDAR, GPS, encoders, cameras), ROS2 integration, simulation workflows, troubleshooting, and debugging. \r\nExperienced in onsite support, system testing, network maintenance, and field validation on varied terrains. Seeking a \r\nchallenging position where I can utilize my technical expertise to deploy cutting-edge robotic solutions and drive innovation \r\nin the field.','Robotics Engineer- Defense',8,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1777403814-121.pdf',NULL,'[\"Linux\", \"C++\", \"Data Science\", \"Robotics\", \"Python\", \"Python\", \"PLC Programming\", \"HMI\", \"Trouble Shooting\"]','PUBLIC','2026-04-29 06:46:16.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Robotics Engineer- Defense\", \"company\": \"Novus Hi-Tech Robotic Systemz Pvt Ltd\", \"endDate\": \"Mon Apr 20\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Thu Jul 10\", \"description\": \"• Hardware integration of motors, drivers, power systems, controllers, and wiring harnesses.  \\r\\n• Sensor integration & calibration: IMU, LiDAR, GPS, encoders, cameras. \\r\\n• Developed and tested Tracked Robot, Sentry Robot, Chusky Robot, and Quadruped Robot. \\r\\n• Conducted field testing on ramps, stairs, indoor/outdoor, and rugged terrain. \\r\\n• Built URDF-to-Unity simulations, mapped articulation bodies, and validated teleoperation. \\r\\n• Integrated robots with ROS/ROS2, cmd_vel teleop, and communication modules. \\r\\n• Troubleshot hardware–software issues (power, comms, sensor faults). \\r\\n• Supported system testing, maintenance, and technical documentation.\"}, {\"title\": \"Robotics R&D Engineer\", \"company\": \"Premier Evolvics Pvt. Ltd\", \"endDate\": \"Wed Jun 25\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Tue Sep 05\", \"description\": \"• Led initiatives involving self-driving robots and fully integrated robotic systems within the Research & \\r\\nDevelopment and Deployment departments. \\r\\n• Experience in developing advanced robotic arm systems specifically designed for piecing and gating activities in \\r\\ntextile mills, enhancing efficiency and precision in the manufacturing process. \\r\\n• Worked on integrating standard components like servo drives, motion controllers, high-end IMU sensors, and \\r\\ncustom actuators across diverse applications, improving the performance and functionality of robotic systems. \\r\\n• Conducting experiments and tests to evaluate the performance and reliability of robotic systems, and documenting \\r\\nresults. \\r\\n• Identifying and troubleshooting technical issues and implementing effective solutions. \\r\\n• Commissioning and programming Lidar and IMU Sensors.\"}, {\"title\": \"Senior Service Engineer\", \"company\": \"Ati Motors\", \"endDate\": \"Tue Jul 25\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Wed Jan 05\", \"description\": \"• Assisting the installation and integration of robotic systems in various environments, gaining hands-on experience in \\r\\nhardware assembly, sensor calibration, and software configuration. \\r\\n• Mapping customer sites with Deployment team. \\r\\n• Experience working on Linux OS \\r\\n• Experience working on SLAM algorithms, mapping sensors like Lidar, Camera, Radar, IMU. \\r\\n• Experience using Fleet management \\r\\n• Conducted root cause analysis and troubleshooting of issues identified during validation tests, collaborating with \\r\\ncross-functional teams to implement effective solutions. \\r\\n• Conducting performance testing and troubleshooting to identify and resolve technical issues, contributing to the \\r\\nsuccessful deployment of robotic systems \\r\\n• Execute field retrofits. Work with the mechanical, electrical and software engineers on troubleshooting field issues. \\r\\n• Provide on-site technical support to customers post- deployment, maintaining a high level of customer satisfaction.\"}, {\"title\": \"Automation Engineer\", \"company\": \"AE Mechatronics\", \"endDate\": \"Sat Nov 20\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Tue Mar 10\", \"description\": \"• Supervising the installation and wiring of automation control panels, programming of PLC and HMI.  \\r\\n• Assisting in the trouble shooting and maintenances of automation equipment’s to ensure smooth operation. \\r\\n• Area of responsibilities include Ladder logic and HMI Screen Programming a supervising field wiring of sensors \\r\\nand various peripheral devices, providing training to the customer. \\r\\n• Drive testing, Cable soldering\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2019\", \"degree\": \"BTech Mechatronics\", \"result\": \"75\", \"institution\": \"APJ Abdul Kalam Technological University\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1777403814-121.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('338ff415-6f6f-4735-8320-d61dbde2484c','b948ca69-d07e-40f8-94be-4c1b01d27fc2','Test Resume18','Test Resume18','Software Deve',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"ADF\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-25 10:02:07.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Deve\", \"company\": \"Matrix Ascentech Private Limited\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[{\"year\": \"\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech\", \"result\": \"\", \"institution\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('33936a0f-0441-44c7-8870-6dcfd85058ce','6077a075-41d5-442f-b6aa-427ca932fbd6','Azure Data Engineer with 3.5+ years of experience in building scalable data pipelines, transforming raw data\r\ninto analytical datasets, and supporting business insights in the retail/parts ordering domain.\r\nHands-on experience with Azure Data Factory, Azu','Azure Data Engineer with 3.5+ years of experience in building scalable data pipelines, transforming raw data\r\ninto analytical datasets, and supporting business insights in the retail/parts ordering domain.\r\nHands-on experience with Azure Data Factory, Azure Databricks, PySpark, SQL, ADLS Gen2, and Snowflake.\r\nSkilled in developing ETL workflows, optimizing data pipelines, building delta lake architecture, and\r\nimplementing business KPIs. Strong background in data modeling, analytics, and cross-functional\r\ncollaboration.','Senior Analyst',4,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1766571462-640.pdf',NULL,'[\"Azure\", \"Database\", \"Github\", \"Python\", \"Pyspark\", \"Azure Databricks\", \"Azure Data Lake Storage\", \"Numpy\", \"VSCode\", \"Power BI\"]','PUBLIC','2025-12-24 19:51:41.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Senior Analyst\", \"company\": \"Capgemini\", \"endDate\": \"Mon Jun 30\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Thu Jan 05\", \"description\": \"Designed and developed end-to-end ETL pipelines using Azure Data Factory, ingesting data from POS,\\r\\nordering systems, vendor feeds, and Excel/CSV sources into ADLS Gen2.\\r\\nBuilt scalable PySpark data transformation jobs in Databricks, processing millions of order, sales, and\\r\\ninventory records.\\r\\nImplemented Bronze → Silver → Gold Delta Lake architecture, improving data reliability and query\\r\\nperformance.\\r\\nDeveloped dimension & fact tables (FactSales, FactOrders, DimProduct, DimCustomer, DimStore) using\\r\\nstar schema for retail analytics.\\r\\nOptimized PySpark jobs, reducing runtime by 40% through partitioning, caching, and broadcast joins.\\r\\nIntegrated curated datasets into Snowflake for downstream analytics & reporting teams.\\r\\nBuilt ADF pipelines with event triggers & scheduled triggers, enabling automated daily/weekly data\\r\\nrefresh.\\r\\nCollaborated with business stakeholders to translate retail KPIs (sales trends, part order frequency,\\r\\ncustomer demand patterns) into analytical datasets.\\r\\nCreated validation frameworks for data quality checks (null checks, duplicates, schema validation)\"}, {\"title\": \"Data Analyst\", \"company\": \"Capgemini\", \"endDate\": \"Thu Dec 15\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Mon Nov 15\", \"description\": \"Processed parts ordering and sales datasets from the POL system to analyze demand trends and\\r\\nrevenue patterns.\\r\\nBuilt a revenue prediction model using Python and regression techniques to forecast future sales.\\r\\nDeveloped automated data-cleaning and preprocessing workflows to improve model accuracy.\\r\\nExtracted and optimized SQL queries to support analytical reporting and insights generation.\\r\\nCreated Power BI reports highlighting revenue trends, seasonal patterns, and order fluctuations.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2021\", \"degree\": \"B.E. in Electrical and Electronics Engineering\", \"result\": \"89\", \"institution\": \"SSIT\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1766571462-640.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('3398ef8d-a537-42c1-9dd2-a7d6d6f7b863','6ba1fc15-33a5-4fc6-bea0-1b80bedf1470','Creative and meticulous software\r\n developer with four years of practical\r\n knowledge creating strong React.js\r\n and.NET web apps. Rather good in\r\n designing scalable backend services and\r\n dynamic front-end interfaces. Having\r\n worked in agile contexts, ','Creative and meticulous software\r\n developer with four years of practical\r\n knowledge creating strong React.js\r\n and.NET web apps. Rather good in\r\n designing scalable backend services and\r\n dynamic front-end interfaces. Having\r\n worked in a