iple data sources with comprehensive validation.\\r\\n Led the development and deployment of a message queue subscriber for investment operations, ensuring quality through unit, integration, and\\r\\nmanual testing.\\r\\n Improved system performance and\"}, {\"title\": \"Software Engineer\", \"company\": \"GlobalLogi\", \"endDate\": \"Wed Oct 05\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Wed Dec 16\", \"description\": \"Key Result Areas:\\r\\n Engineered and deployed new features from scratch in an Agile environment while maintaining and enhancing the codebase, ensuring high\\r\\nperformance and zero critical defects.\\r\\n Diagnosed and resolved complex issues across new and legacy features, boosting system reliability and efficiency.\\r\\n Reviewed code, enforced best practices, and mentored team members by providing technical guidance and product knowledge to unblock tasks\\r\\nand sustain high code quality.\\r\\nHighlights:\\r\\n Reduced critical bug rate through proactive troubleshooting and implementing automated testing strategies.\\r\\n Improved system performance by optimizing legacy code and refactoring key modules\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2020\", \"degree\": \"Computer Science\", \"result\": \"Yes\", \"institution\": \"EVA University, Bangalore, Karnataka\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1767861050-762.pdf\", \"title\": \"cv\", \"isDefault\": false}, {\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1767861052-832.pdf\", \"title\": \"cv\", \"isDefault\": false}, {\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1767861053-930.pdf\", \"title\": \"cv\", \"isDefault\": false}, {\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1767861053-142.pdf\", \"title\": \"cv\", \"isDefault\": false}, {\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1767861054-233.pdf\", \"title\": \"cv\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('3444b52d-7dab-48c5-aa50-756334a4688d','ad4133fe-e601-42da-8931-5ca850fe7796','Professional',NULL,'Professional',1,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1773910030-592.pdf',NULL,'[]','PUBLIC','2