ion Testing, I also have Good knowledge in\r\nautomation testing, database, and ETL concepts. I have a strong record\r\nin E2E testing, test case design, review, execution, UAT demos, and\r\nadept in SQL, Linux, SOAP, Postman, Selenium for backend data flow,\r\nand automation scripts for regression and sanity testing. Proficient in\r\nAgile Scrum, SIT, UAT testing phases, and application-level database\r\ntesting, I am experienced in defect management tools Jira and ALM.','SW Test engineer',4,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1775741270-752.pdf',NULL,'[\"Linux\", \"Manual\", \"Selenium\", \"Selenium Webdriver\", \"SOAP\", \"Semantic Web\", \"Postman\", \"MYSQL\"]','PUBLIC','2026-04-10 00:56:01.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"SW Test engineer\", \"company\": \"Amdocs\", \"endDate\": \"Wed Apr 29\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Tue Jun 10\", \"description\": \"Payroll: QUESS CORP LTD\\r\\nProject: Brightspeed Technology\\r\\nWorked on end-to-end (E2E) testing across multiple applications, including\\r\\nPre-Sale, OSS/BSS, Amdocs CRM, Amdocs ARM/ANN, and Siebel CRM.\\r\\nPerformed testing on CRM, ARM, Amdocs Billing, and web applications.\\r\\nAnalyzed and understood requirements, designed test cases, and executed\\r\\nthem successfully.\\r\\nDelivered UAT demos to the client.\\r\\nReported bugs, triaged defects, retested fixes, and tracked progress.\\r\\nConducted regression testing to ensure system stability.\\r\\nExecuted automation scripts for regression and sanity testing.\"}, {\"title\": \"Senior QA Engineer\", \"company\": \"Netcracker\", \"endDate\": \"Wed Apr 09\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Tue Jul 30\", \"description\": \"Worked on end-to-end (E2E) testing of web applications, NC CRM (CSRD),\\r\\nand Salesforce CRM (SFDC).\\r\\nAnalyzed and understood requirements, designed test cases, and executed\\r\\nthem effectively.\\r\\nDelivered UAT demos to the client to validate functionality.\\r\\nReported bugs, triaged defects, r