ines integrating internal/external unstructured data sources into vector databases, enabling\\r\\nsemantic search, context enrichment, and grounded LLM responses for production business use cases.\\r\\n• Implemented and maintained end to end data pipelines for model training, evaluation, prompt management,\\r\\nand deployment, using Python, FastAPI, and CI/CD workflows to ensure reproducibility and scalability.\\r\\n• Collaborated with product and engineering teams to identify business opportunities, translate them into data\\r\\ndriven AI solutions, and deploy secure, containerized services (Docker, AWS Lambda/EC2) with observability\\r\\nvia Splunk/CloudWatch for real time model monitoring and retraining.\\r\\n• Engineered reusable LLM service layers and APIs supporting microservices, with dynamic framework selection\\r\\n(LangChain, Langflow) and integration of enterprise data for knowledge graphs and vector stores.\\r\\n• Led model evaluation, performance tuning, and governance across multi cloud environments, enforcing high code\\r\\nquality through PyTest, modular design, and structured logging.\\r\\n• Built a modular communication engine supporting Sinch, Twilio, SMS, and email gateways, enabling plug and\\r\\nplay integrations and scaling to 500K+ monthly user interactions.\\r\\n• Led observability and monitoring for AI systems using Splunk, AWS CloudWatch, and structured logging,\\r\\nenabling real time alerting, performance tuning, and operational reliability across multi cloud deployments.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2023\", \"degree\": \"Computer Science\", \"result\": \"Yes\", \"institution\": \"Veltech University\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1773395279-595.pdf\", \"title\": \"cv\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('3a4ef3e7-f769-43de-950b-a764eca410dd','7fa4d2c1-8d59-4769-a3e6-5948c3bddd5a','Office Assistant',NULL,'Office Assistant',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Office Assistant\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-14 11:46:48.000000','2026-