ser query, retrieves associated\\r\\ndrugs and proposes similar candidate drugs using LLM, leveraging vector search and FastAPI for serving, achieving\\r\\n80–90% accuracy on expert-labelled drug relevance with\"}, {\"title\": \"Software Engineer\", \"company\": \"KPIT\", \"endDate\": \"Thu Aug 14\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Wed Oct 11\", \"description\": \"Worked on GenAI and RAG-based platforms and automation pipelines for automotive and enterprise clients using\\r\\nPython, LLMs, graph databases and vector databases, contributing to production-grade features and POCs.\\r\\nAI Interventions for Automotive Clients\\r\\nCollaborated with SMEs to design AI solutions using LLMs (Azure OpenAI, Claude) for knowledge retrieval, summarization and task automation, improving operational workflows and decision-making efficiency by 15–20% through\\r\\nfaster access to domain knowledge and reduced manual effort.\\r\\nAI-Driven Automated Bug Resolution Pipeline (75% Accuracy)\\r\\nBuilt an automated bug resolution pipeline that fetches bug details, classifies bug type, identifies impacted repositories\\r\\nvia a graph database and generates corrected code suggestions using GPT-4o and Claude, achieving 75% accurate\\r\\nfix suggestions and reducing triage time by 40% compared to the prior manual process.\\r\\nRAG-Based Data Platform (90% Accuracy)\\r\\nDeveloped a scalable RAG platform for semantic search over PDFs, spreadsheets and HTML using GPT-4/Claude\\r\\nwith Milvus, CouchDB and FalkorDB, integrating FastAPI, Celery and RabbitMQ to support high-throughput ingestion and retrieval, and delivering 90%+ relevant document retrieval and significantly faster data access for internal\\r\\nusers.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2023\", \"degree\": \"Computer Science\", \"result\": \"Yes\", \"institution\": \"Sanjivani College of Engineering, Kopargaon\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1773299662-644.pdf\", \"title\": \"cv\", \"isDefault\":