ess workflows, ensuring data security, and driving\r\ncompliance with HIPAA and GxP standards.Collaborative team player who works seamlessly\r\nwith cross-functional teams including QA, BI, DBAs, and architects to deliver scalable and\r\nhigh-performance solutions. Passionate about continuous learning and adopting Oracle best\r\npractices for reliable, secure, and efficient systems.','PL/SQL Developer',2,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1775049981-620.pdf',NULL,'[\"Agile\", \"JIRA\", \"TOAD\", \"Oracle\", \"UNIX\", \"Oracle WebLogic Server (9i/12c/14c)\", \"Oracle Cloud\"]','PUBLIC','2026-04-02 00:55:00.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"PL/SQL Developer\", \"company\": \"Tech Mahindra, Bangalore |\", \"endDate\": \"Wed Apr 29\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Wed Mar 04\", \"description\": \"• Developed dynamic SQL scripts using EXECUTE IMMEDIATE to handle flexible and metadatadriven data operations.\\r\\n• Created reusable PL/SQL utility packages for common tasks such as logging, date\\r\\nconversions, string manipulations, and validations.\\r\\n• Designed pipelined table functions for real-time data transformation and streaming results\\r\\nin reporting applications.\\r\\n• Implemented cross-schema communication using database links and autonomous\\r\\ntransactions where needed.\\r\\n• Used PRAGMA AUTONOMOUS_TRANSACTION to manage independent logging and error\\r\\ncapture outside main transactions.\\r\\n• Leveraged PL/SQL Collections and Nested Tables for processing hierarchical and multi-level\\r\\ndata structures.\\r\\n• Used cursor variables (REF CURSORs) to return dynamic result sets to front-end applications\\r\\nand reporting tools.\\r\\n• Designed and executed high-volume data migration strategies using PL/SQL for legacy-tomodern system transitions.\\r\\n• Applied DBMS_SCHEDULER and DBMS_JOB to schedule and monitor automated tasks and\\r\\nETL batch jobs.\\r\\n• Created custom exception hierarchies using user-defined exceptions for better fault isolation\\r\\nand resolution.\\r\\n• Performed advanced data cleansing and transformation using multi-level cursor logic and\\r\\nCASE expressions within PL/SQL blocks.\\r\\n• Implemented row-level and column-level security using Oracle Virtual Private Database\\r\\n(VPD) concepts.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2017\", \"degree\": \"Computer Engineering\", \"result\": \"Yes\", \"institution\": \"Rayalaseema University,\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1775049981-620.pdf\", \"title\": \"cv\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('3b4dec2d-ed5c-49bb-8162-4e2290593222','81ee9127-b603-4046-bc82-f231833d2542','Test Resume168','Test Resume168','Professional',1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','PUBLIC','2025-05-27 04:06:11.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[]','[{\"year\": \"\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech\", \"result\": \"\", \"institution\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('3b4e63b0-8368-4679-9036-e0a49f66884c','7762de45-0af8-4f5a-a627-deb0d75b33f9','Test Resume341','Test Resume341','Software Deve',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"OT Exstream\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-27 04:41:00.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Deve\", \"company\": \"HCL\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[{\"year\": \"\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech\", \"result\": \"\", \"institution\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('3b539364-e78e-4709-90f3-19dd0ef3a1fd','fcf60c59-0f93-470d-aad6-3837c1a14a8f','Test Resume57','Test Resume57','Software Deve',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Guidewire CC\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-27 03:17:31.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Deve\", \"company\": \"Mind Spark\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[{\"year\": \"\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech\", \"result\": \"\", \"institution\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('3b5580b1-d8f1-4abf-aba1-bceca58bfd54','0238e3b4-848c-4ad4