). \\r\\nRefactored legacy SQL queries into optimized CTEs and Window Functions, reducing \\r\\nETL processing time and improving data retrieval efficiency by 30%. \\r\\nCollaborated with cross-functional stakeholders in Agile/Scrum environment to \\r\\ntranslate business requirements into scalable BI architecture. \\r\\nResolved high-priority ServiceNow incidents, ensuring 99% reporting uptime for \\r\\nbusiness-critical dashboards. \\r\\nLeveraged Power BI Copilot and Generative AI tools to accelerate DAX development \\r\\nand reduce report delivery timelines by 25%. \\r\\nFacilitated weekly stakeholder meetings with Market Research teams to translate \\r\\nbusiness insights into interactive visualization frameworks and Field Parameters. \\r\\nImplemented a Business Unit hierarchy and drill-down functionality, allowing users to \\r\\nnavigate from high-level summaries to granular data levels seamlessly.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2018\", \"degree\": \"Bachelor of Degree(Bsc)\", \"result\": \"9.0\", \"institution\": \"Yogi Vemana University\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1777316792-918.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('3b621bae-a02e-454f-b0c4-5c8f8c603bd0','9857fae6-cb12-4a1a-b711-29a2244e6788','Office Assistant',NULL,'Office Assistant',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Cash Handling\", \"Accountant\", \"Cashier\", \"Backend\", \"Back Office\", \"Back Office Operations\", \"Office Assistant\", \"Operations\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-14 11:46:53.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"Office Assistant\", \"company\": \"21 Staff\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('3b64f204-0a8c-4827-875a-dda59bd7c44a','d30e79ce-99f2-4154-a1a1-93a56aae102e','Senior  Consultant Lead',NULL,'Senior  Consultant Lead',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\".NET Development\", \"Agile Methodology\", \"Database\", \"Waterfall Methodology\"]','PUBLIC'