ng, and FCA/Solvency II compliance — four years of making complex financial data move accurately, on schedule, and audit\r\nready.','SQL Developer / Database Engineer',2,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1779331814-53.pdf',NULL,'[\"ETL Processes\", \"Data Warehousing\", \"JIRA\", \"Agile\", \"Oracle 19C\", \"SQL Server\", \"MYSQL\", \"PostgreSQL\", \"Windows Forms\", \"Data Governance\", \"SSRS Report Building\", \"Root Cause Analysis\", \"SSMS\", \"TOAD\", \"PGAdmin\", \"UNIX\", \"Shell Scripts\"]','PUBLIC','2026-05-21 14:17:25.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"SQL Developer / Database Engineer\", \"company\": \"Tata Consultancy Services (TCS)\", \"endDate\": \"Sun May 10\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Wed Jan 05\", \"description\": \"‣ Achieved near-perfect migration accuracy: Migrated 2.6M pension records at 99.7% reconciled accuracy (verified via row-count and MD5 checksum \\r\\ncomparison across 15+ source system extracts), cutting manual QA sign-off effort by ~60% and enabling on-schedule client delivery. \\r\\n‣ Optimised 30 high-volume queries: Reduced average query runtime from ~48 s to ~36 s (25% improvement, benchmarked via Execution Plan analysis \\r\\nacross 28 high-priority queries in sprint review) using composite indexing and partition pruning on Oracle 19c and SQL Server 2019. \\r\\n‣ Reduced ETL defects by ~40%: Cut ETL defect count from ~42 to ~25 per sprint (~40% reduction, tracked in JIRA UAT logs across 3 consecutive \\r\\nreleases) by replacing row-by-row processing with BULK COLLECT/FORALL and BULK INSERT frameworks. \\r\\n‣ Near-zero-defect delivery: Delivered 6 of 7 production releases with zero P1/P2 incidents (per release tracker) by leading cross-timezone UAT and \\r\\nproducing FCA/Solvency II-compliant SCD Type 2 audit lineage with architect-reviewed LLD documentation. \\r\\nScott Data Migration  UK Life & Pensions Insurance  |  Jan 2022 – Apr 2024 \\r\\n‣ 6× ETL runtime improvement: Cut nightly batch runtime from ~6 hrs to under 55 min (confirmed over 4-week job-log baseline) by redesigning ODI \\r\\n12c sequential jobs into parallel SQL streams across Oracle and SQL Server — saving ~25 compute-hours weekly on 20M+ financial records. \\r\\n‣ Audit-grade reconciliation engine: Built multi-RDBMS reconciliation engine achieving 95.2% transaction match rate across 3 FCA audit submissions \\r\\n(documented in audit closure reports), reducing client-reported data discrepancies from ~18 to ~4 per cycle. \\r\\n‣ Full historical traceability: Designed SCD Type 2 versioning across 6 policy and premium-history tables for 20M+ records, enabling full change \\r\\ntraceability cited as compliant in Solvency II review (Apr 2023). \\r\\n‣ Stabilised pipelines, mentored team: Reduced recurring pipeline incidents from ~18/quarter to ~5/quarter (per TCS incident log) through root cause \\r\\nanalysis on 15 production failures; mentored 2 junior developers now independently owning sprint-1 modules.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2021\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech – Electronics & Communication Engineering\", \"result\": \"72\", \"institution\": \"Ponnaiyah Ramajayam Institute of Science and Technology\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1779331814-53.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('3b946132-5826-4a1b-9743-362745058787','5a4c3b16-0faf-447e-b5ab-0b290898f85e','Node.Js Developer',NULL,'Node.Js Developer',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Express.js\", \"Node.JS\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-14 12:29:40.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"Node.Js Developer\", \"company\": \"Tyzent Technologies\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('3b958bab-ebe9-45ff-abfe-a6ce92a3474a','4e6eb691-813f-4f0a-87e8-7c6ebaa7ce82','Test Resume308','Test Resume308','Software Deve',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Angular\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-25 17:32:00.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000'