: \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[{\"year\": \"\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech\", \"result\": \"\", \"institution\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('3c6c77b2-5d0d-45b4-8642-d48f6346a556','bc43112e-bd51-476d-a288-ba1a78b90a59','Techno-Functional IBM Maximo Consultant with 5+ years of experience delivering Enterprise Asset Management solutions across Oil & \r\nGas, Utilities, and Transportation sectors. Skilled in IBM Maximo 7.6 and Maximo Application Suite (MAS) including system c','Techno-Functional IBM Maximo Consultant with 5+ years of experience delivering Enterprise Asset Management solutions across Oil & \r\nGas, Utilities, and Transportation sectors. Skilled in IBM Maximo 7.6 and Maximo Application Suite (MAS) including system configuration, \r\nintegrations, automation scripts, workflows, and performance optimization. \r\nExperienced in AI-powered asset inspection using Maximo Visual Inspection (MVI), enabling automated defect detection, asset condition \r\nmonitoring, and integration with Maximo Manage for intelligent maintenance workflows. Strong ability to translate business requirements \r\ninto scalable technical solutions while supporting enterprise asset management and digital transformation initiatives..','Lead Maximo Consultant',4,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1775223159-657.pdf',NULL,'[\"Maximo\", \"JIRA\", \"Machine Learning\", \"IBM Mainframe\", \"SAP\", \"Python\"]','PUBLIC','2026-04-04 00:58:48.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Lead Maximo Consultant\", \"company\": \"Infosys- SLB (Schlumberger)\", \"endDate\": \"Tue Mar 31\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Thu May 15\", \"description\": \"Maximo Techno Functional Consultant for a company focused on IT and consulting services. \\r\\nBangalore \\r\\n05/2025 - Present \\r\\n• Supported global SLB Maximo operations by handling incidents, change requests, enhancements, and user guidance across \\r\\nmultiple Maximo modules in a production environment. \\r\\n• Implemented AI-based visual inspection use cases using IBM Maximo Visual Inspection within Maximo Application Suite (MAS). \\r\\n• Implemented AI-powered asset inspection using Maximo Visual Inspection (MVI) to automate defect detection from equipment images. \\r\\n• Provided L2/L3 production support for IBM Maximo 7.6.1.x supporting global Oil & Gas operations for SLB. \\r\\n• Assisted users in understanding correct operational workflows, ensuring compliance with defined Maximo processes and reducing \\r\\nrecurring incidents. \\r\\n• Coordinated with cross-functional teams including integration teams, SAP team, and platform engineers to resolve critical \\r\\nproduction incidents. \\r\\n• Created Bug & Product Backlog Items (PBIs) for identified defects and enhancement requests including detailed summary, \\r\\nreproduction steps, expected results, system information, and acceptance criteria for engineering teams. \\r\\n• Supported workflow troubleshooting and assignment issues across Maximo modules ensuring correct routing and \\r\\napprovals. \\r\\n• Worked closely with business stakeholders to understand functional requirements and translate them into technical solutions \\r\\nwithin IBM Maximo. \\r\\n• Provided functional and technical support to end users, assisting them in navigating Maximo applications and resolving operational \\r\\nissues. \\r\\n• Guided users by referring to WIKI documentation and internal SOPs, helping them understand the correct business process and \\r\\nMaximo functionality. \\r\\n• Maintained incident tracking and resolution updates in JIRA / ESM tools, ensuring proper documentation and closure of support tickets.\"}, {\"title\": \"Maximo Techno Functional Consultant\", \"company\": \"Comm-IT Sdn Bhd\", \"endDate\": \"Sat Nov 30\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Thu Nov 10\", \"description\": \"Maximo Techno Functional Consultant for a company focused on IT and consulting services. \\r\\nMalaysia \\r\\n11/2022 - 11/2024 \\r\\n• Designed and implemented scalable IBM Maximo architectures, ensuring alignment with business objectives. Created integration \\r\\nstrategies between Maximo and enterprise systems like ERP and IoT platforms. \\r\\n• Improved inspection efficiency through automated visual analysis and defect identification. \\r\\n• Acted as an onsite Techno-Functional Architect and SPOC for customers. \\r\\n• Customized Maximo to meet specific business needs, including configuring workflows, reports, and user interfaces. Leveraged \\r\\nAutomation Scripts, MBOs, and Java for custom development. \\r\\n• Developed APIs and integrate Maximo with third-party systems to enhance data exchange and functionality. \\r\\n• Configuration changes such as creating new attributes, cloning an existing application and creating new fields according to the \\r\\nclient requirement \\r\\n• Conducted training for new hires and facilitated customer design meetings. \\r\\n• Prepared comprehensive documentation, including BRD, FSD, IRD, and TSD. \\r\\n• Installed Maximo from scratch and managed environment configurations. \\r\\n• Provided ongoing support for clients post-implementation, resolving technical issues and providing troubleshooting assistance.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2013\", \"degree\": \"MBA\", \"result\": \"73\", \"institution\": \"Reva ITM\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1775223159-657.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('3c6df108-fbc4-4fd3-9e73-6dd79a92014d','0ae15962-4b88-4792-8ae7-7984d5d92169','Test Resume169','Test Resume169','Software Deve',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Mainframe\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-24 18:54:06.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Deve\", \"company\": \"IBM\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[{\"year\": \"\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech\", \"result\": \"\", \"institution\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',930000.00,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('3c6ee9c