ata Engineering and strong expertise in data analytics, business intelligence, and database development. Experienced in designing scalable ETL/ELT pipelines, integrating da','Data Professional with over 6 years of IT experience, including 4+ years in Azure Data Engineering and strong expertise in data analytics, business intelligence, and database development. Experienced in designing scalable ETL/ELT pipelines, integrating data from multiple sources, developing analytical datasets, and delivering actionable insights for business stakeholders.\r\n                     Hands-on experience with Azure Data Factory, Azure Databricks, PySpark, SQL Server, Azure Data Lake Storage Gen2, Delta Lake, Tableau, and Python. Skilled in SQL development, data modeling, dashboard support, data quality validation, performance optimization, and stakeholder collaboration. Proven ability to translate business requirements into scalable technical solutions that support reporting, analytics, and data-driven decision-making.','Team Lead/Azure Data Engineer',2,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1784602777-378.docx',NULL,'[\"Azure SQL Database\", \"Azure Key Vault\", \"Data Visualization\", \"KPI Reporting\", \"Data Analysis\", \"ETL\", \"Data Integration\", \"ADF\", \"Azure Databricks\", \"ADLS Gen2\", \"Delta Lake\", \"SQL\", \"Python\", \"Pyspark\", \"Tableau\", \"ELT Pipelines\"]','PUBLIC','2026-07-21 14:17:49.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Team Lead/Azure Data Engineer\", \"company\": \"DominanceTech IT Solutions Pvt Ltd\", \"endDate\": \"Tue Jun 30\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Tue Dec 10\", \"description\": \"•\\tDesigned and developed scalable ETL and ELT pipelines using Azure Data Factory.\\r\\n•\\tBuilt PySpark notebooks in Azure Databricks for data transformation, cleansing, aggregation, and enrichment.\\r\\n•\\tIntegrated multiple source systems into Azure Data Lake Storage for centralized analytics.\\r\\n•\\tDeveloped reusable parameterized Azure Data Factory pipelines to automate data ingestion processes.\\r\\n•\\tImplemented incremental loading strategies for efficient processing of large datasets.\\r\\n•\\tCreated Delta Lake tables to improve data consistency, reliability, and performance.\\r\\n•\\tOptimized SQL queries, stored procedures, indexes, and database objects to improve application performance.\\r\\n•\\tPerformed data validation, reconciliation, and quality checks to ensure accurate reporting.\\r\\n•\\tSupported business users by preparing datasets for dashboards and management reports.\\r\\n•\\tWorked with business stakeholders to understand reporting requirements and translate them into technical solutions.\\r\\n•\\tAutomated repetitive data processing tasks using SQL and Python, reducing manual effort.\\r\\n•\\tImplemented monitoring, logging, and exception handling for production data pipelines.\\r\\n•\\tCollaborated with US-based clients to deliver reporting and analytics solutions within project timelines.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2014\", \"degree\": \"Bachelor of Technology (Electrical & Electronics Engineering)\", \"result\": \"73\", \"institution\": \"SHEAT College of Engineering\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1784602777-378.docx\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('3e38184d-809e-47bd-a73f-c29b2216172a','51e33079-4d37-4c45-8ebb-cf9bf3fc2a9d','Professional',NULL,'Professional',1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','PUBLIC','2025-05-15 06:58:41.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('3e4026bf-6f3c-4668-855d-5c23bb1951c6','e913ffc9-66ca-4eb1-a8a1-23f3164f693b','Test Resume43','Test Resume43','Software Deve',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"AWS\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-26 12:27:05.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Deve\", \"company\": \"TCS\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[{\"year\": \"\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech\", \"result\": \"\", \"i