ctor. Deployed at\\r\\nRockwell Automation, contributing to the MES implementation\\r\\nproject. Responsible for developing, configuring, and validating\\r\\nMES recipes to enhance manufacturing efficiency and ensure\\r\\ncompliance with industry regulations. Collaborating with cross\\r\\nfunctional teams to support seamless MES integration, process\\r\\nautomation, and continuous improvement initiatives\"}, {\"title\": \"Team Member- Production MES DCS MES Recipe Developer\", \"company\": \"Dr Reddys\", \"endDate\": \"Thu Jan 30\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Tue Oct 10\", \"description\": \"As the MES Implementation Lead , my responsibilities include:\\r\\nDesigning and developing 16 recipes for 8 production blocks,\\r\\nensuring timely delivery. Implementing the MES facility across 8\\r\\nproduction blocks while leading a team of 3 members for the\\r\\nMES Project. Troubleshooting and resolving production issues\\r\\npromptly. Extensive experience as an avid user of ERP SAP\\r\\nS4HANA. Serving as the MES representative for the L2\\r\\nIntegration DCS Control Room project with a budget on crores,\\r\\nthereby gaining vast knowledge of L2 integration of DCS MES\\r\\nsystems using Rockwell FTPS 8.3 with Honeywell DCS, Siemens\\r\\nDCS, and Emerson DCS. Possessing knowledge of Bill of\\r\\nMaterials (BOM) creation from Master Recipes and integration\\r\\nwith SAP S4HANA. Familiarity with the Validation Master Plan\\r\\nusing the V Model Approach and having successfully completed\\r\\nPerformance Qualification (PQ) of OSI PI Systems. Proficiency in\\r\\nAveva OSI PI System and its frameworks. Understanding of\\r\\nChange Management, Incident Management, and Qualitative\\r\\nRisk Assessment creation. Leading the MES team with innovative\\r\\nimplementations such as Campaign Count Cleaning rules and\\r\\nProduct Changeover rules for operator convenience. Expertise\\r\\nLANGUAGES\\r\\nEnglish\\r\\nTelugu\\r\\nHindi\\r\\nin Exception Management. Conducting training programs for\\r\\nMES for production and documentation teams. Participating in\\r\\nand successfully monitoring audit preparedness for MES\\r\\nsystems. Developing several workflows based on Good\\r\\nManufacturing Practice (GMP) and operator convenience.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2021\", \"degree\": \"M.Tech. in Computer Science\", \"result\": \"71\", \"institution\": \"Andhra University\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1768851816-30.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('3e5d6b9b-047e-4a60-9c11-33a0d1e8a370','dbe697a3-c569-424f-b8e4-322f42c93198','Jr Python Backend Developer',NULL,'Jr Python Backend Developer',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"English\", \"Java\", \"Django\", \"Machine Learning\", \"Leadership\", \"Communication\", \"JavaScript\", \"Docker\", \"Python\", \"Web Development\", \"Strategic Thinking\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-13 19:48:46.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"Jr Python Backend Developer\", \"company\": \"autobotAI\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('3e641afb-1587-4fd9-a9cc-aefb9b759adb','3c6d3950-b301-4dd0-8d8a-99d016f5f428','Sap Materials Management Consultant @ TCS',NULL,'Sap Materials Management Consultant @ TCS',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"IDOC\", \"SAP Mm\", \"SAP Mm\", \"SAP Mm\", \"SAP Mm\", \"Team Management\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-13 19:06:04.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"Sap Materials Management Consultant @ TCS\", \"company\": \"Tata Consultancy Services\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('3e64a868-12b7-4616-b35c-21ed43033742','24068873-e0b3-4090-8c53-961ae4a41385','● Good experience with Manufacturing Domain (MES) design for Production line automation using Delmia \r\nApriso Tool and Siemens OPCenter.  \r\n● Experience working as Business Analyst for Advance Planning System (OPcenter APS). \r\n● Hands on Experience in Cor','● Good experience with Manufacturing Domain (MES) design for Production line automation using Delmia \r\nApriso Tool and Siemens OPCenter.  \r\n● Experience working as Business Analyst for Advance Planning System (OPcenter APS). \r\n● Hands on Experience in Core Java, Advance Java. \r\n● Worked and Good Knowledge of developing Web based application using Java. \r\n● Hands on Experience in Database like Oracle 11G, SSMS (Microsoft SQL Server Management Studio).  \r\n● Hands on Experience of UI technologies - JavaScript, JQuery, HTML, CSS. Also used for custom UI \r\nDevelopment. \r\n● Hands on Experience in DELMIA Apriso 2016, 2017, 2018, 2019 and Siemens OPCenter.  \r\n● Worked and Good Knowledge of working with Apriso applications Process Builder (Screen or UI design and \r\nlogic Development), GPM (Deployment), Apriso Desktop client (Configuration), Microsoft SQL Server \r\n(Database). Also learnt and gained experience on another MES system i.e., Siemens OPCenter and its \r\napplications like Modelling (Configuration), Portal Studio (Screen or UI design), Designer (Logic \r\nDevelopment), MOM Connect (Interface), Map Designer (mapping) \r\n● Hands on experience of Screen Flow Layout, UI Interface, SQL – Scripts, Stored Procedures, Functions in \r\nApriso and OPCenter.','Analyist',2,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/vikas-cv-1765164027-997.pdf',NULL,'[\"Mes\", \"Delmia Apriso\", \"Business Analyst\", \"Core Java\", \"Advanced Java\", \"JavaScript\", \"CSS\", \"GPM Deployment\", \"Camstar Designer\", \"APACHE TOMCAT\", \"Siemens Opcenter\", \"Opcenter APS\", \"Web Applications Support\", \"Oracle 19C\"]','PUBLIC','2025-12-08 15:34:28.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Analyist\", \"company\": \"Deloitte\", \"endDate\": \"Sun Nov 30\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Wed Feb 05\", \"description\": \"Hands on experience of Screen Flow Layout, UI Interface, SQL – Scripts, Stored Procedures, Functions in \\r\\nApriso and OPCenter.   \\r\\n● Knowledge of Standard Tables and database base design in Apriso. \\r\\n● Knowledge of Business Integration and Outbound/Inbound interface configurations in Apriso and OPCente. \\r\\n● Understanding of Machine Integration Configuration in Apriso. \\r\\n● Worked on Label Printing and Label Configuration. \\r\\n● Worked and good understanding of Apriso and OPCenter Translation Tools, Global Process Manager and \\r\\nPackage Version controls.  \\r\\n● Hands on experience on GPM Package deployment. Worked in the deployment Team and did the cut over \\r\\ndeployment tasks in production site on production servers. \\r\\n● Proven technical and analytical skills to provide solutions based on customer requirement and business \\r\\npractice. \\r\\n● Skilled in the ability to troubleshoot (Production & Development), debug, and support MES. \\r\\n● Worked on bug fixing during testing phase (Functional testing, .  \\r\\n● Experience in working on all the Phases of System Design Life Cycle (SDLC). \\r\\n● Worked on multiple projects at a time on different modules and performed consistently over the time. \\r\\n● Experience of interacting with customers, getting requirements and providing solution based on it.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2017\", \"degree\": \"BE | Computer Engineering\", \"result\": \"76\", \"institution\": \"Bharati Vidyapeeth’s College of Engineering\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/vikas-cv-1765164027-997.pdf\", \"title\": \"Vikas_CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('3e6618f6-3b11-4898-8ed8-0fe630bb217d','5f3bbc83-b834-4879-841b-dc807539d2a1','Experienced LabVantage Developer / Java Full Stack Developer with 5+ years of expertise in designing, developing, and implementing web-based \r\nenterprise applications, including Laboratory Information Management Systems (LIMS) such as LabVantage. Skilled ','Experienced LabVantage Developer / Java Full Stack Developer with 5