ation without system replacement. \\r\\n1.5. Designed and implemented ChatGPT (LLM)-based effort estimation framework integrated with UiPath to generate time & cost estimates using prompt \\r\\nengineering and historical project data. \\r\\n2. QA, BA & Delivery Ownership – Led testing/QA efforts, ensured end-to-end validation, and played an active role as a Business Analyst for \\r\\nrequirement gathering, process mapping, and solution design. \\r\\n3. Release & Hypercare – Managed production rollouts and hypercare support, ensuring smooth go-live and quick resolution of post-production issues. \\r\\n4. Led a team of 5+ RPA developers, testers, BAs, and support members, driving delivery, coordination, and mentoring. \\r\\n5. Led development and publication of UiPath-focused whitepapers, contributing to internal knowledge building and best practices.\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1778097876-353.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('3e8faba9-99a6-4c15-89a8-abb48aad90d3','aa2d5f4a-fcda-4cf4-9e19-c483dd8e77de','Experienced engineer with over 2.8+ years of hands-on experience in designing and developing\r\nhigh-performance web applications and backend systems using ASP.NET Core, Node.js, and\r\nReact.js. Skilled in writing clean, maintainable, and efficient code foll','Experienced engineer with over 2.8+ years of hands-on experience in designing and developing\r\nhigh-performance web applications and backend systems using ASP.NET Core, Node.js, and\r\nReact.js. Skilled in writing clean, maintainable, and efficient code following industry best practices.\r\nStrong problem-solving and communication skills, with a passion for learning new technologies\r\nevery day.','Software Developer',2,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1767613261-300.pdf',NULL,'[\".NET\", \"ASP.NET\", \"Bootstrap\", \"JQUERY\", \"C++\", \"HTML\", \"CSS\", \"MVC\", \"React JS\", \"C\", \"SQL\"]','PUBLIC','2026-01-06 00:09:11.000000','2026-10-21 