 plans, and quality improvements\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2020\", \"degree\": \"Master of Science (M.Sc.) in Botany\", \"result\": \"71\", \"institution\": \"St. Joseph’s College\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1773713412-912.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('3f3413db-b1d6-48cb-82eb-b3f8e75527bf','e0d2fecd-6eee-4e0e-b308-0485f445917f','Data Analyst with 4+ years of experience driving data-driven decision-making across retail and enterprise\r\nenvironments. Experienced in delivering litigation analytics, campaign targeting insights, sustainability\r\nreporting, and executive-level dashboards','Data Analyst with 4+ years of experience driving data-driven decision-making across retail and enterprise\r\nenvironments. Experienced in delivering litigation analytics, campaign targeting insights, sustainability\r\nreporting, and executive-level dashboards that support business and cross-functional senior leadership. Strong\r\nbackground in cloud data modernization, including Hadoop to GCP BigQuery migration, with expertise in translating\r\ncomplex business problems into scalable analytics solutions using SQL, Python, and BI tools','Data Analyst',4,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1773143171-710.pdf',NULL,'[\"Data Modeling\", \"Data Integration\", \"Data Visualization\", \"Excel\", \"Power BI\", \"DAX\", \"SQL\"]','PUBLIC','2026-03-10 23:14:59.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Data Analyst\", \"company\": \"Lowe’s India\", \"endDate\": \"Tue Mar 31\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Wed Apr 09\", \"description\": \"Delivered vendor-litigation analytics by extracting/validating 100K+ transactional records per case,\\r\\nenabling faster and data-driven dispute resolution.\\r\\n• Led campaign analytics (Black Friday, New Year, promotions) using segmentation and trends, improving\\r\\ntargeting precision and boosting campaign performance by 5–12%.\\r\\n• Built sustainability dashboards used in QBRs,