,'[\"AI Programming\", \"AI/ML\", \"Machine Learning\", \"Analysis\", \"Python\"]','PUBLIC','2026-04-09 17:44:04.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Senior Data Scientist\", \"company\": \"Ciklum\", \"endDate\": \"Wed Apr 29\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Fri Mar 13\", \"description\": \"Designed and implemented a Generative AI orchestration pipeline for healthcare\\r\\nuse cases using Azure OpenAI (Chat Completion, Assistants API).\\r\\n○ Built a modular LLM orchestration layer to handle prompt construction, context\\r\\ninjection, response validation, and safety controls for medical queries.\\r\\n○ Integrated user-specific health context (medical history, lab summaries, prior\\r\\nassessments) into LLM prompts to enable personalized, context-aware responses.\\r\\n○ Implemented prompt templates and system instructions to constrain model\\r\\nbehavior, reduce hallucinations, and enforce healthcare-safe response patterns.\\r\\n○ Developed backend services using Flask and FastAPI to expose LLM-powered\\r\\nendpoints for health chat, report explanation, and decision-support workflows.\\r\\n○ Designed the system to be RAG-ready, enabling future integration of document\\r\\nretrieval pipelines (clinical guidelines, knowledge bases) without changing application\\r\\nlogic\"}, {\"title\": \"AI Data Scientist\", \"company\": \"Helfie Management Pty. Ltd.\", \"endDate\": \"Fri Mar 20\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Thu Apr 06\", \"description\": \"Skin disease screening using AI\\r\\n○ Built a Flask-based backend to handle requests from both mobile and web application\\r\\nfront ends.\\r\\n○ Developed RESTful APIs to enable functionalities such as skin classification, lesion\\r\\ndetection, and disease risk assessment using AI.\\r\\n○ Connected the backend to a Supabase database for secure and efficient data storage,\\r\\nallowing easy management and retrieval of patient information.\\r\\n○ Trained and deployed Deep Learning models to diagnose common skin issues\\r\\nbased on image input, and integrated data collection and refinement processes.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2015\", \"degree\": \"Computer Science\", \"result\": \"Yes\", \"institution\": \"Dr. Babasaheb Ambedkar Technological University\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1775715358-679.pdf\", \"title\": \"cv\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('3f94e5d0-cad0-47d8-9af5-dab0839b10e4','412dcfe6-7db3-4115-a253-aa241c3bf3a7','• SAP Certified Fiori Application Developer with 4+ years of experience in designing, developing, and extending \r\nSAP UI5/Fiori applications across implementation and enhancement projects. \r\n• Hands-on expertise in extending standard Fiori Elements applic','• SAP Certified Fiori Application Developer with 4+ years of experience in designing, developing, and extending \r\nSAP UI5/Fiori applications across implementation and enhancement projects. \r\n• Hands-on expertise in extending standard Fiori Elements applications using manifest file extensions, Visual Editor \r\n(WebIDE), and Page Map (BAS). \r\n• Proficient in SAP UI5/Fiori (UX), OData services (CRUD operations), and Fiori Launchpad configuration while following \r\nSAP Fiori design guidelines. \r\n• Strong experience with application prototyping, debugging, troubleshooting, and production support to ensure smooth \r\nbusiness operations. \r\n• Skilled in frontend technologies (HTML5, CSS3, JavaScript, JSON) and MVC architecture. \r\n• Practical experience with SAP Web IDE, BAS, and Eclipse for app development, extension, and deployment. \r\n• Knowledge of performance optimization using UI5 Support Assistant, efficient data binding techniques, and clean \r\ncoding practices. \r\n• Familiar with Git for version control, CI/CD pipelines, and collaborative development. \r\n• Strong communicator with expertise in client interaction, requirement gathering, demos, and technical documentation. \r\n• Current role: Senior Analyst (UI5/Fiori) at Accenture, contributing to enterprise-level application enhancements and \r\ndevelopment. \r\n• Previous role: Consultant (UI5/Fiori) at Invenio Business Solutions, delivering custom UI5/Fiori applications for the \r\nFederal Tax Authority (FTA).','Consultant – UI5/Fiori',4,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1766723253-331.pdf',NULL,'[\"Eclipse\", \"HTML5\", \"CSS3\", \"JavaScript\", \"SAP FIORI\", \"Sap UI5\", \"SAP Web IDE\", \"Sap Business Objects\"]','PUBLIC','2025-12-26 16:46:40.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Consultant – UI5/Fiori\", \"company\": \"InvenioLSI\", \"endDate\": \"Fri Sep 20\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Fri Dec 10\", \"description\": \"• Developed and deployed multiple SAP UI5 applications in the TRM (Tax Revenue Management) domain. \\r\\n• Designed and implemented dashboards with navigation across Revenue Process, Tax Agent, and Registration \\r\\nmodules. \\r\\n• Built reusable UI5 components, improving productivity. \\r\\n• Authored technical specification documents and collaborated with onsite teams for alignment. \\r\\n• Conducted unit testing, debugging, and troubleshooting across TRM modules. \\r\\n• Delivered high-quality modules ahead of schedule, contributing to the corporate tax system rollout. \\r\\n• Provided ongoing technical support and enhancements for Corporate Tax Group processes and e-CTS system.\"}, {\"title\": \"Senior Analyst – UI5/Fiori\", \"company\": \"Accenture\", \"endDate\": \"Sat Dec 20\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Thu Oct 10\", \"description\": \"• Worked on implementing enhancement requirements on existing standard applications. \\r\\n• Resolved incidents raised in ServiceNow (SNOW) and updated tasks in JIRA during Scrum ceremonies. \\r\\n• Delivered customer tickets and fixes on time, ensuring SLA compliance. \\r\\n• Prepared Technical Design Documents (TDDs) and FIT documents for completed requirements. \\r\\n• Used SAP Business Application Studio (BAS) and SAP WebIDE fo