-365.pdf',NULL,'[\"Forecasting\", \"Business Planning\", \"Data Management\", \"Audit Reporting\", \"Account Management\", \"Cross-Functional\", \"B2B Sales\", \"B2C\", \"Cloud Sales\", \"Data Center\", \"IaasS\", \"Broadcasting\", \"Content Delivery Network\", \"Advanced Excel\", \"Creative Strategy\", \"Sales Strategy\", \"Process Optimization\", \"Performance Appraisal\", \"SAAS\", \"PaaS\", \"MS Power Point\", \"MS Word\", \"Power BI\", \"Remote Project Coordination\", \"Salesforce Administrator\", \"Team Player\"]','PUBLIC','2025-10-06 07:25:28.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Cloud Solution Consultant\", \"company\": \"PC Solutions Pvt Ltd\", \"endDate\": \"Sat Oct 04\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Sat Nov 30\", \"description\": \"⚫ Identify and engage potential customers for cloud solutions (mainly AWS). \\r\\n⚫ Understand client requirements and propose suitable cloud offerings. \\r\\n⚫ Drive end-to-end sales cycle: lead generation to deal closure. \\r\\n⚫ Present cloud solutions with strong business value articulation. \\r\\n⚫ Coordinate with pre-sales, architects, and delivery teams for proposals. \\r\\n⚫ Manage and grow relationships with key customer stakeholders. \\r\\n⚫ Leverage AWS partnership programs, credits, and co-selling opportunities. \\r\\n⚫ Track sales pipeline and update CRM regularly. \\r\\n⚫ Stay updated with AWS services and competitor offerings. \\r\\n⚫ Meet assigned revenue targets and contribute to cloud business growth.\"}, {\"title\": \"Business Development  Manager\", \"company\": \"Comprinno Technologies Pvt. Ltd\", \"endDate\": \"Sun Sep 29\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Sun Mar 31\", \"description\": \"⚫ Create and execute account plans; ensure end-to-end customer satisfaction. \\r\\n⚫ Share prospect feedback and suggest service improvements to leadership. \\r\\n⚫ Collaborate with Marketing for account-specific campaigns and \\r\\nengagements. \\r\\n⚫ Gather market intelligence on customers, competitors, and govt policies. \\r\\n⚫ Build targeted contact databases via research and social platforms. \\r\\n⚫ Analyze buying behavior and stay updated on industry/domain trends. \\r\\n⚫ Work with engineering teams to enhance cloud offerings based on market \\r\\nneeds.\"}, {\"title\": \"Assistant Manager\", \"company\": \"Velocis Systems Private Limited\", \"endDate\": \"Mon Apr 29\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Sat May 13\", \"description\": \"⚫ Identify and qualify opportunities in IaaS, PaaS, and SaaS space. \\r\\n⚫ Define and execute cloud sales strategies to close deals. \\r\\n⚫ Engage key decision-makers within target accounts. \\r\\n⚫ Conduct discovery sessions to understand client needs. \\r\\n⚫ Present cloud solutions with focus on ROI and business value. \\r\\n⚫ Collaborate with pre-sales for tailored solution design. \\r\\n⚫ Prepare proposals, quotes, and participate in bids. \\r\\n⚫ Lead contract negotiations and pricing discussions. \\r\\n⚫ Track market trends and competitive insights. \\r\\n⚫ Maintain CRM records and pipeline accuracy. \\r\\n⚫ Provide feedback to internal teams on market/customer needs. \\r\\n⚫ Represent PC Solutions at industry events and forums.\"}, {\"title\": \"Tele Account Manager\", \"company\": \"Denave India Private limited\", \"endDate\": \"Tue May 30\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Mon Jan 09\", \"description\": \"• Engage Enterprise/SMB accounts from TATA Communications across \\r\\nIndia. \\r\\n• Promote TATA’s offerings in Network, Cloud, Security & UC solutions. \\r\\n• Map decision-makers and influencers within target accounts. \\r\\n• Convert campaign leads to opportunities via teleconnects. \\r\\n• Coordinate with internal teams for lead validation and follow-ups. \\r\\n• Nurture long-term leads using defined engagement strategies. \\r\\n• Build strong relationships with key stakeholders and maintain account \\r\\nplans. \\r\\n• Identify high-priority accounts, assess budgets and timelines. \\r\\n• Collaborate with specialists and service advisors to drive business. \\r\\n• Use CRM tools for opportunity tracking and account creation. \\r\\n• Ensure high client satisfaction and timely issue resolution. \\r\\n• Escalate and close customer queries with internal support.\"}, {\"title\": \"Executive - Marketing And Sales\", \"company\": \"Planetcast Media Services Ltd\", \"endDate\": \"Mon Jan 30\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Sat Feb 29\", \"description\": \"• Advise senior leadership (VP/CTO level) on Media Cloud, Cloud Playout & \\r\\nManaged Services. \\r\\n• Gather client requirements for content production, management, \\r\\nbroadcast, and streaming. \\r\\n• Perform technical analysis, prototype creation, and solution demos. \\r\\n• Contribute to cloud solution design and feasibility assessments. \\r\\n• Manage key accounts across GEC & non-GEC channels in India. \\r\\n• Collect user feedback for product enhancements. \\r\\n• Coordinate with digital marketing for promotions and lead generation. \\r\\n• Create email campaigns and promotional content with marketing teams.\"}, {\"title\": \"Sales Executive\", \"company\": \"Info edge India. Ltd\", \"endDate\": \"Fri Nov 29\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Wed Oct 31\", \"description\": \"• Reaching out to new customers and explaining them the benefits of \\r\\nProducts and Services. \\r\\n• Analyzing customer\'s requirements and providing them solutions as per \\r\\ntheir needs. \\r\\n• Improving sales performance by acquiring new clients and growing  \\r\\n• business from existing clients  \\r\\n• Creating database of existing and new clients  \\r\\n• Adhering to quality standards and processes. \\r\\n• Achieving Monthly Target\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1759737827-365.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('40a82f01-d7e5-4178-9175-5dfa194eaf17','e98c48cb-9c2c-4c51-b891-e96e5da30bdf','Azure Specialist',NULL,'Azu