0000','[{\"title\": \"Sr. ERP Implementation Executive\", \"company\": \"Corporate Munim\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('40bad49a-68bc-40ef-bceb-65bb993a0665','35ff527c-69e2-4256-a07f-8df44a105094','Experienced Data Scientist with 5+ years of experience and a strong background in\r\ndeveloping predictive models for financial services, E-commerce, and especially Credit\r\nUnions. Proven ability to deliver end-to-end machine learning solutions that solve r','Experienced Data Scientist with 5+ years of experience and a strong background in\r\ndeveloping predictive models for financial services, E-commerce, and especially Credit\r\nUnions. Proven ability to deliver end-to-end machine learning solutions that solve realworld business problems and drive measurable outcomes. Skilled in data preparation,\r\nfeature engineering, and model optimization, with ongoing learning in NLP and Deep\r\nLearning','Trellance',4,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1769767586-663.pdf',NULL,'[\"Docker\", \"Git\", \"Azure\", \"JIRA\", \"Python\", \"MYSQL\", \"Jupyter\", \"TensorFlow\"]','PUBLIC','2026-01-30 22:34:54.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Trellance\", \"company\": \"Data Scientist\", \"endDate\": \"Fri Jan 30\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Thu Aug 17\", \"description\": \"Project 1 : Next Best Product | Finance\\r\\nProject 2 : Member Attrition | Finance\\r\\nBuilt a predictive model to identify credit union members at risk of attrition based on\\r\\nbehavioral patterns and engagement levels. Enabled the implementation of targeted\\r\\nretention strategies for high-risk member groups to improve overall member retention.\\r\\nProject 3 : Member Risk Score | Finance\\r\\nBuilt a predictive model to identify members at risk of becoming delinquent, allowing the\\r\\ncredit union to take proactive measures and reduce potential losses. The model\\r\\nsupported early intervention strategies, minimizing delinquency management and\\r\\ncollection costs.\\r\\nAnalyzed large volumes of data to derive actionable insights that support business\\r\\ndecision-making processes.\\r\\nPerformed data cleansing, manipulation, and exploratory data analysis (EDA) using\\r\\nPython to identify trends and patterns in large datasets.\\r\\nConducted experiments on model performance using feature selection techniques\\r\\nsuch as correlation analysis and ANOVA, and integrated them with various machine\\r\\nlearning algorithms.\\r\\nApplied feature engineering and EDA techniques using visualization tools to understand\\r\\ndata distributions and relationships.\\r\\nTrained and evaluated multiple machine learning models using classification\\r\\nperformance metrics including accuracy, classification report, and AUC-ROC curve.\"}, {\"title\": \"ML engineer\", \"company\": \"Code Icons Technology\", \"endDate\": \"Fri Aug 18\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Thu Apr 09\", \"description\": \"roject 4 : NLP - Driven Customer\\r\\n\'\\r\\ns Experience Analysis and Topic Modelling for Strategic\\r\\nDecision Making | Textile\\r\\nDeveloped an NLP-based solution to analyze customer reviews for identifying product\\r\\nissues and improving marketing strategies.\\r\\nPerformed language detection and translation using langdetect and Googletrans.\\r\\nConducted text preprocessing and cleaning, followed by insights extraction using\\r\\nN-grams, WordCloud, and keyphrase extraction tools such as RAKE and YAKE.\\r\\nConverted textual data into numerical vectors using CountVectorizer, TF-IDF, and\\r\\nWord2Vec embeddings.\\r\\nBuilt and evaluated classification models using Naive Bayes and Support Vector\\r\\nMachines to analyze sentiment and categorize feedback.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2019\", \"degree\": \"Computer Science\", \"result\": \"Yes\", \"institution\": \"University of Pune\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resu