aceability, tools, equipment’s, process, production lines, routing and BOM’s. \\r\\n Ensure configurations support high-volume, high-precision production processes. \\r\\n Define data mapping and workflows for seamless integration between MES and ERP \\r\\nsystem. \\r\\n Develop and execute test cases for MES functionalities (UAT, functional testing). \\r\\n Collaborate with reporting teams to enable dashboards for real-time shopfloor \\r\\nvisibility. \\r\\n Analyze MES data for root cause analysis of production issues. \\r\\n Create user guides and training materials for MES end-users. \\r\\n Maintained documentation of change requests for new MES features or patch \\r\\nupdates. \\r\\n Ensure all changes are documented as per regulatory standards \\r\\n Assist in audit preparations and provide MES traceability logs during internal or \\r\\ncustomer audits.\"}, {\"title\": \"MES Support Engineer\", \"company\": \"Cantier Systems Private limited\", \"endDate\": \"Fri Mar 31\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Thu Sep 08\", \"description\": \" Installing the MES application or HMI screens support in shop floor. \\r\\n Provide immediate support for production line issues related to MES systems. \\r\\n Troubleshoot integration issues between MES and Ignition for inform to developer. \\r\\n Support and provide training for shopfloor operators, supervisors, and quality \\r\\nteams in using MES or HMI screen. \\r\\n Resolve tickets related to MES incidents. \\r\\n Work closely with IIOT developers and IT to escalate and track critical issues. \\r\\n Support and ensuring the smooth production flow is going on post deployment of \\r\\nMES updates, patches, and configuration changes.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2018\", \"degree\": \"B.E. Mechanical Engineering\", \"result\": \"72\", \"institution\": \"Government College of Engineering\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1767794356-561.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('41510511-d481-48f0-888a-1e85b5089f37','6f8c6848-a562-449a-bfd1-ae41c9550e83','Test Resume73','Test Resume73','Software Deve',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Guidewire CC\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-26 17:10:05.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Deve\", \"company\": \"VOIS Info Tech\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[{\"year\": \"\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech\", \"result\": \"\", \"institution\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('41514799-c37d-4f01-9807-c878ae49c964','5874bd63-e247-4cac-9642-b6e2d69a9749','Revit Architecture - AutoCAD Designer Architecture',NULL,'Revit Architecture - AutoCAD Designer Architecture',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"MS Office\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-13 12:46:59.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"Revit Architecture - AutoCAD Designer Architecture\", \"company\": \"SMJ SOlutions\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('4152f50e-d6a0-47bc-9640-3492b9758a5b','87d6f670-0167-4634-9dc7-d4b87aa86a3d','Test Resume25','Test Resume25','Software Deve',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Majesco\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-26 20:40:24.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Deve\", \"company\": \"Chubb\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[{\"year\": \"\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech\", \"result\": \"\", \"institution\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('41557f74-037e-48c2-a609-61ef99baf73e','34e13bda-3749-4c34-b15e-4c3f46bea1d9','Test Resume44','Test Resume44','Software Deve',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Java\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-25 10:05:21.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Deve\", \"company\": \"Farenexus Solutions\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[{\"year\": \"\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech\", \"result\": \"\", \"institution\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]');
INSERT INTO `candidates` VALUES ('415817b1-277c-4610-ad26-4a6e5bbe4452','c42700c1-fab2-4c3e-a679-1810c6cf119c',' \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\nExperienced Senior Analyst with 5.9 years in IT services, specializing in Manufacturing Engineering Systems (MES). \r\nProficient in Rockwell FTPC, PMX (Legacy MES) and Siemens Opcenter application tools, with hands-on experience',' \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\nExperienced Senior Analyst with 5.9 years in IT services, specializing in Manufacturing Engineering Systems (MES). \r\nProficient in Rockwell FTPC, PMX (Legacy MES) and Siemens Opcenter application tools, with hands-on experience in incident \r\nmanagement, problem management, and change management to resolve critical production issues. \r\nDemonstrated expertise in operations and maintenance, coupled with a solid background in manufacturing plant environments. \r\nStrong problem-solving and technical skills, driving efficiency and optimization in manufacturing processes. Associated with Life \r\ngiants as client, throughout the length of career \r\nIn-depth knowledge of S88 standards, with hands-on experience in 21 CFR Part 11 compliance requirements for the \r\npharmaceutical industry. \r\nExpertise in Opcenter (Opcenter Execution pharma, Siemens product), Pharma Suite (Factory Talk Pharma Suite, a Rockwell Automation \r\nproduct), PMX (Legacy Rockwell Automation product) and contributing to the optimization and compliance of pharmaceutical \r\nmanufacturing systems. Extensive understanding of the critical role of compliance within the pharmaceutical sector, particularly \r\nregarding regulatory standards and quality assurance. \r\nInvolvement in shop floor processes in the pharmaceutical industry, streamlining operations and ensuring adherence to industry \r\nregulations. Engaging with end users to understand challenges, and documenting use cases to address and resolve operational \r\nissues.','IoT IO Smart Mfg Ops',6,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1769169003-926.pdf',NULL,'[\"JIRA\", \"Microsoft Office\", \"Dynatrace\", \"ServiceNow\", \"Trackwise configuration\", \"Rockwell Factorytalk\", \"Siemens Opcenter\", \"Warehouse Management Systems\", \"Splunk\", \"MS SQL Server\", \"Oracle\", \"TOAD\"]','PUBLIC','2026-01-24 00:04:38.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"IoT IO Smart Mfg Ops\", \"company\": \"Cognizant\", \"endDate\": \"Tue Jan 20\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Thu Apr 10\", \"description\": \" \\r\\nApr 2025 -Till date  \\r\\nA key member of AIMS team for France Pharma Major client supporting 39 sites around the world for MES. Responsible for Incident, \\r\\nChange, and Problem Management. \\r\\n \\r\\n \\r\\n \\r\\n \\r\\n \\r\\n \\r\\n \\r\\n \\r\\n \\r\\nGained proficiency in MES tool Siemens Opcenter Pharma Controller tool. \\r\\nHaving better understanding of MES tool Integration with other systems like SAP/Label Management Systems/Warehouse \\r\\nManagement Systems and its related transactions. \\r\\nHaving high level idea in server/database configurations and services associated for running application, Recipe designing, \\r\\nOrder/Batch releases, Work center and equipment configurations and their binding with relevant orders during live shop floor \\r\\nproduction. \\r\\nPerformed user requested database changes complying industry standards. \\r\\nFor production related issues, implemented the logic in core environment to understand whether the issue is system expected \\r\\nbehavior or bug. Provided resolutions to end users based on the issue replication. \\r\\nHaving support experience for the Opcenter tool for resolving production critical issues. Worked in monitoring the system \\r\\nperformance for bringing stabilization of servers and other app related parameters. \\r\\nInvestigated and analyzed production-related issues in the core environment, differentiating between system behavior and bugs, \\r\\nand provided resolutions to end users based on issue replication. \\r\\nTroubleshooted high and critical issues over SIAM call along with infrastructure teams, driving towards fix. \\r\\nUpdated and enriched knowledge base articles with new solutions to ensure swift resolution of future issues.\"}, {\"title\": \"Level 3 Global Application Support Team\", \"company\": \"Accenture\", \"endDate\": \"Mon Mar 10\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Thu Feb 10\", \"description\": \"  \\r\\nFeb 2022 -Mar 2025 \\r\\nA key member of the Level 3 Global Application support team for US Pharma Major client supporting 32 sites around the world for \\r\\nMES. \\r\\n \\r\\n \\r\\n \\r\\n \\r\\n \\r\\n \\r\\n \\r\\n \\r\\nResponsible for Incident, Change, and Problem Management. \\r\\nWorked in creation of change controls, Deviation and CAPA to record as per industrial standards. \\r\\nGained proficiency in MES tools like Rockwell Automation based FTPC, PMX tool. \\r\\nPerformed user requested database changes complying industry standards. \\r\\nHandled building block imports required for creating shop floor operator recipes. \\r\\nTroubleshooted high and critical issues over Global Command Center call along with infrastructure teams, driving towards fix. \\r\\nUpdated and enriched knowledge base articles with new solutions to ensure swift resolution of future issues. \\r\\nContributed to the training and testing of Generative AI chatbot to assist end users in resolving issues more efficiently, leveraging \\r\\nup-to date knowledge base resources. \\r\\nDesigned dashboards, alerts, lookups in the Splunk tool based on the requirement criteria.\"}, {\"title\": \"Level 2 Global Application Support Team|\", \"company\": \"Accenture\", \"endDate\": \"Fri Feb 25\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Wed Aug 05\", \"description\": \" \\r\\n \\r\\n \\r\\n \\r\\n \\r\\n \\r\\nActively supported the MES FTPC application, managing live production issues and ensuring prompt resolution of incidents. \\r\\nCoordinated and managed outage scenarios, overseeing the graceful shutdown and successful recovery of application functionality. \\r\\nCollaborated within a global support team to ensure seamless incident management and minimal service disruption. \\r\\nApart from MES FTPC application, worked in multiple shop floor applications like label management system, warehouse \\r\\nmanagement system and Label printing systems. \\r\\nActive contributor towards disaster recovery management for all the sites. \\r\\nCollaborate all teams and actively involve them in getting the disaster recovery work done with creating SOP’s and maintaining \\r\\nbusiness requirements.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2019\", \"degree\": \"Bachelor of Engineering in Computer Science and Engineering\", \"result\": \"72\", \"institution\": \"Madanapalle Institute of Technology & Science\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1769169003-926.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('415b7941-c799-4f69-addb-a257f67afeda','fe2e1044-e6ac-4714-91f2-62358f7e8b7f','Mysql and Oracle PLSQL Developer',NULL,'Mysql and Oracle PLSQL Developer',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Microsoft SQL Server\", \"MYSQL\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-14 16:09:41.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"Mysql and Oracle PLSQL Developer\", \"company\": \"Pace Automation Limited\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('4168ff19-d196-4b30-aa38-4b7b8b7af195','c65336b2-2aff-40d5-aab2-a5d867fd7983','Senior Software Engineer',NULL,'Senior Software Engineer',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"IOS\", \"Git\", \"JIRA\", \"Xcode\", \"Swift\", \"Swift\", \"Objective C\", \"Xcode\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-14 20:03:03.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"Senior Software Engineer\", \"company\": \"Tech Mahindra Business\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','