y checks\\r\\nand real-time reporting.\\r\\n– Designed Power BI dashboards to visualize key test metrics, defect trends, and release readiness, improving test\\r\\ntransparency and stakeholder decision-making.\\r\\n– Led design of a new Snowflake-based data warehouse, resulting in 40% improvement in data retrieval times and\\r\\nsupporting 500+ users.\\r\\n– Mentored and managed a cross-functional team of 8 engineers, driving continuous improvement and adherence\\r\\nto quality engineering standards.\\r\\n– Architected and implemented CI/CD-driven automation pipelines using Jenkins, enabling continuous testing and\\r\\nfaster release cycles.\\r\\n– Migration of manual regression suites to automated test cases, achieving more than 90% automation coverage\\r\\nfor high-impact modules.\\r\\n– Collaborated with product and development teams to define scalable test strategies that ensure coverage of new\\r\\nfeature developments and third-party integrations.\\r\\n– Delivered mission-critical solutions including multi-domain Payment Gateway Integrations and booking automation, enhancing transaction success by 35% and reducing booking errors by 25%.\\r\\n– Improved cross-team collaboration and stakeholder trust by providing detailed Power BI insights into test\\r\\nprogress, defect analytics, and business-critical KPIs\"}, {\"title\": \"Senior System Analyst\", \"company\": \"Techpeople Infotech Sdn. Bhd. (freelance\", \"endDate\": \"Wed May 21\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Mon May 13\", \"description\": \"Environment: ASP.NET, C#.NET, Ajax, JavaScript, VBScript, XML/XSL/XSLT, BizTalk Server, Oracle, HP\\r\\nQC, Power BI\\r\\n– Worked on-site at TOUCH N GO to deliver project modules with high quality and compliance with deadlines.\\r\\n– Designed, executed and optimized testing processes covering Unit, Functional, System Integration (SIT), User\\r\\nAcceptance (UAT), Regression, and Performance Testing.\\r\\n– Integrated Power BI reports to track test execution, incidents, and product performance, providing managementlevel insights.\\r\\n– Created and maintained snowflake data pipelines using Streams, Tasks, and SQL procedures to automate data\\r\\nprocessing and ensure consistency across environments.\\r\\n– Reviewed and validated requirement specifications, system manuals, test cases, and plans to ensure complete\\r\\nfunctional traceability.\\r\\n– Conducted legacy system testing and collaborated with development teams to quickly troubleshoot and resolve\\r\\ncomplex issues.\\r\\n– Maintained strong configuration management and version control practices across testing deliverables.\\r\\n– Worked with cross-functional teams to ensure timely delivery, quality assurance, and alignment with business\\r\\ngoals.\\r\\n– Ensured all QA policies, standards, and procedures were followed, resulting in consistent quality deliverables\"}, {\"title\": \"Manager – Quality Assurance\", \"company\": \"ProcessMAP Infotech Pvt. Ltd\", \"endDate\": \"Thu Dec 29\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Thu Oct 13\", \"description\": \"Environment: ASP, .NET, AJAX, SQL Server 2008, SSIS, SSRS, Vault, QuickBase, Snowflake, Power BI\\r\\n– Led the QA team for ProcessMAP’s EHS (Environmental Health and Safety) platform, ensuring robust quality\\r\\nacross multiple product modules.\\r\\n– Conducted requirement analysis, identified gaps, and collaborated with development and product teams for\\r\\nclarification and improvement.\\r\\n– Developed automated data pipelines using Snowflake Tasks and Streams, enabling near real-time data availability\\r\\nfor analytics teams.\\r\\n– Implemented SSIS and Snowflake data pipelines for test data preparation, ETL verification, and reporting automation.\\r\\n– Developed Power BI dashboards for release quality metrics, defect leakage, and team performance tracking,\\r\\nenhancing leadership visibility.\\r\\n– Trained QA teams on functional and automation testing processes, significantly improving team productivity\\r\\nand accuracy.\\r\\n– Created detailed test strategies, resource allocation plans, and project timelines for multiple concurrent releases.\\r\\n– Supervised and optimized resource utilization through workload management and process standardization.\\r\\n– Coordinated between development, QA, support, and infrastructure teams, ensuring seamless communication\\r\\nand issue resolution throughout project phases.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2004\", \"degree\": \"Computer Science\", \"result\": \"Yes\", \"institution\": \"Kakatiya University\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1764677331-702.pdf\", \"title\": \"cv\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('45613bee-78b8-478f-9578-0a67a0a807d0','8805e363-f605-4746-b4aa-be3eaa31f375','.net full stack developer',NULL,'.net full stack developer',2,700000.00,NULL,NULL,'[\"Spring Boot\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-23 16:24:48.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \".net full stack developer\", \"company\": \"Cognizant\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]',700000.00,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('45657c76-0036-4f7d-9e05-2650048435d1','5595561e-a483-4ade-8d33-80f4671dda46','AI/ML Engineer with 3+ years of experience building and deploying Generative AI and machine learning systems, including LLM\r\npowered chatbots, RAG-based document intelligence, and scalable inference APIs. Delivered enterprise AI solutions across sectors,\r','AI/ML Engineer with 3+ years of experience building and deploying Generative AI and machine learning systems, including LLM\r\npowered chatbots, RAG-based document intelligence, and scalable inference APIs. Delivered enterprise AI solutions across sectors,\r\nwith on-site engagements at Godrej & Boyce and the Government of Rajasthan. Strong in RAG pipelines, OCR-driven document\r\nintelligence, and FastAPI-based conversational AI systems on Azure and AWS. Certified in AI/ML from IIT Kanpur and pu