asesfor validating search filters and seat\\r\\navailability.\\r\\n• Maintained automation scriptsin GitHub, executed buildsin Jenkins, and tracked issues\\r\\nin JIRA\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2019\", \"degree\": \"Computer Science\", \"result\": \"Yes\", \"institution\": \"Jairam Arts and Science College,\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1775826895-325.pdf\", \"title\": \"cv\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('45c5a085-753f-456e-a209-e195fbafbc16','72cba7b8-524a-4481-9f92-96507d0705fa','Test Resume650','Test Resume650','Software Deve',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\".NET\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-24 21:38:25.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Deve\", \"company\": \"TCS\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[{\"year\": \"\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech\", \"result\": \"\", \"institution\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('45ce70ee-fd78-4b50-8047-19270b66e0ad','78233732-cb96-4304-89b2-5e0efbd8d51f','Software Test Engineer with 4+ years of experience in manual and automation testing of web, mobile, and API\r\nplatforms. Proficient in Selenium (Java), TestNG, Cucumber, Appium, Playwright, Rest Assured, JMeter, and CI/CD test\r\nexecution using Jenkins and ','Software Test Engineer with 4+ years of experience in manual and automation testing of web, mobile, and API\r\nplatforms. Proficient in Selenium (Java), TestNG, Cucumber, Appium, Playwright, Rest Assured, JMeter, and CI/CD test\r\nexecution using Jenkins and Azure DevOps. Skilled in API testing, database validation (SQL, PostgreSQL, MongoDB),\r\nperformance testing, and Agile Scrum processes. Strong expertise in building automation frameworks and improving\r\ntest coverage, reliability, and delivery quality.','Software Tester',4,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1771567312-625.pdf',NULL,'[\"AWS\", \"JMETER\", \"JMETER\", \"Selenium\", \"Selenium Webdriver\", \"TestNG\", \"API testing\", \"Java Selenium\"]','P