nd processing, and stock updates using\\r\\nmanual and automation methods.\\r\\n• Automated UI scenarios using Selenium WebDriver (Java + TestNG).\\r\\n• Developed API automation scripts using Rest Assured.\\r\\n• Performed database validation using SQL and PostgreSQL.\\r\\n• Managed test cases, logged defects, and tracked resolution status using JIRA to ensure clear\\r\\ncommunication between QA and development teams.\\r\\n• Collaborated with developers, business analysts, and product owners to refine requirements, identify\\r\\nedge cases, and improve test quality.\\r\\nProject: EV Battery Swapping System\\r\\n• Performed functional, regression, integration, and system testing for battery swapping\\r\\nworkflows, station availability, and authentication.\\r\\n• Automated web UI with Selenium and mobile UI with Appium.\\r\\n• Developed API test scripts using Rest Assured & Postman.\\r\\n• Conducted stress/load testing using JMeter to analyse system behaviour under peak demand.\\r\\n• Verified real-time battery status updates, transaction accuracy, payment gateway integrations,\\r\\nand secure data transmission.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2020\", \"degree\": \"Computer Science\", \"result\": \"Yes\", \"institution\": \"IES College of Technology\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1771567312-625.pdf\", \"title\": \"cv\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('45d01cef-9851-4360-8cbb-3a0786612bfc','7c285d2f-748b-4c4b-8a36-30990c876fdb','Node.Js Developer',NULL,'Node.Js Developer',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"CSS\", \"HTML5\", \"Bootstrap\", \"Internship\", \"CSS\", \"HTML5\", \"Bootstrap\", \"Express.js\", \"HTML\", \"Excel\", \"JavaScript\", \"Node JS\", \"Node.JS\", \"Node.JS\", \"MYSQL\", \"Software Development\", \"MVC\", \"Web Development\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-14 12:29:50.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"Node.Js Developer\", \"company\": \"i square technologis\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"d