hreat detection, and overall security posture.\\r\\n• Designed, reviewed, and validated security architectures and monitoring solutions through High-Level\\r\\nand Low-Level Design (HLD/LLD) reviews, ensuring alignment with enterprise security standards and\\r\\nbest practices.\\r\\n• Acted as a security reviewer for infrastructure and system changes, assessing cyber risk, validating\\r\\nsecure-by-design principles, and preventing the introduction of security vulnerabilities.\\r\\n• Performed Threat Analysis and Risk Assessments (TARA) for digital and industrial initiatives, identifying\\r\\ncyber risks and defining mitigation strategies aligned with enterprise risk frameworks.\\r\\n• Contributed cybersecurity expertise to Security Pre-Architecture Design Approval (SPADA) reviews as\\r\\npart of the enterprise GRC framework, supporting risk-informed decision-making for new initiatives\\r\\nand change-driven enterprise programs.\\r\\n• Established an operational model for Armis, defining processes for asset visibility, alert lifecycle\\r\\nmanagement, and continuous improvement of security monitoring capabilities.\\r\\n• Defined and supported the strategy to integrate security alerts with SOC operations, enabling\\r\\ncentralized visibility, consistent triage, and effective incident response.\\r\\n• Developed and fine-tuned security policies to improve detection effectiveness, reduce false positives,\\r\\nand ensure consistent, repeatable security operations.\\r\\n• Collaborated with multiple delivery squads and cross-functional stakeholders, supporting security\\r\\ninitiatives within Agile delivery models.\"}, {\"title\": \"SPECIALIST / TEAM LEAD\", \"company\": \"ACCENTURE,\", \"endDate\": \"Thu May 07\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Thu Dec 14\", \"description\": \"Led an end-to-end cybersecurity program covering 100+ industrial sites, spanning assessment,\\r\\narchitecture design, implementation, and transition to operations.\\r\\n• Conducted detailed site assessments and feasibility studies to evaluate physical and logical\\r\\nindustrial network architectures, identifying security gaps and improvement opportunities.\\r\\n• Designed secure monitoring architectures using Forescout eyeInspect, including traffic\\r\\nacquisition strategies, sensor placement, and enterprise connectivity models.\\r\\n• Oversaw eyeInspect sensor pre-staging, deployment planning, installation, configuration, and\\r\\nonboarding into the Forescout Command Center (CC).\\r\\n• Coordinated integration between Forescout CC, Enterprise Command Center (ECC), and SIEM\\r\\nplatforms to enable centralized visibility, alert correlation, and enterprise-level monitoring.\\r\\n• Analyzed security alerts and telemetry from deployed sensors, led development of detection\\r\\nlogic, and worked with stakeholders to fine-tune detections and reduce operational noise.\\r\\n• Drove asset inventory, classification, and vulnerability risk management activities across multiple\\r\\nsites, supporting informed remediation planning.\\r\\n• Worked closely with plant/site control and maintenance teams, enterprise IT, network, and\\r\\ncybersecurity stakeholders to align implementation activities and resolve technical and\\r\\noperational challenges.\\r\\n• Led Site Acceptance Testing (SAT), ensured operational readiness, and managed structured\\r\\nhandover to run teams with complete technical and operational documentation.\\r\\n• Provided technical leadership, progress reporting, and risk escalation to client and internal\\r\\nstakeholders, ensuring timely delivery of program milestone\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2016\", \"degree\": \"Computer Science\", \"result\": \"Yes\", \"institution\": \"L.D. COLLEGE OF ENGINEERING, AHMEDABAD, GUJARAT\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1772126226-96.pdf\", \"title\": \"cv\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('47f462e3-02a8-4482-83e4-e65562ae9778','ae686839-3884-4e71-8232-f1e4adb7d84e','Test Resu