ormance Monitoring: Implemented AWS CloudWatch to monitor application\\r\\nperformance, set up logging and alerts for proactive issue resolution, and ensure system\\r\\nreliability.\\r\\n• Agile/Scrum Participation: Collaborated with cross-functional teams in an Agile\\r\\nenvironment, actively participating in sprint planning, backlog grooming, and daily\\r\\nstandups\\r\\n• Issue Resolution & Optimization: Diagnosed and resolved production issues promptly,\\r\\noptimized database queries, and application code to enhance system performance and\\r\\nuser experience.\"}, {\"title\": \"Software Engineer\", \"company\": \"Concentrix\", \"endDate\": \"Wed Jan 15\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Wed Oct 13\", \"description\": \"escription: AT&T is the largest provider of local and large distance telephone services in\\r\\nthe United States and sales digital subscriber line internet. It supports broadband\\r\\nfunctionalities like ordering, billing, and servicing.\\r\\nIt is a requirement for GIOM to be migration to the existing system, with a different framework\\r\\ndesign.\\r\\nIntegrated Order Management System (GIOM) provide to process different orders coming from\\r\\ndifferent external systems.\\r\\nResponsibility:\\r\\n• By using Python on Flask Web Framework designed backend and created database\\r\\nschema to represent and support business .\\r\\n• Developing views and templates with Python and Flask view controller and templating\\r\\nlanguage to create a user-friendly website interface\\r\\n• Involved in building database Model, APIs and Views utilizing Python to build an\\r\\ninteractive web-based solution .\\r\\n• Working with MySQL database on simple queries and writing Stored Procedures for\\r\\nnormalization\\r\\n• Creating Business Logic using Python to create planning and tracking functions.\\r\\n• Flask APIs to access the database by using python Flask Template developed the customer\\r\\nservice.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2020\", \"degree\": \"Computer Science\", \"result\": \"Yes\", \"institution\": \"Shree Medha University .\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1770122404-201.pdf\", \"title\": \"cv\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('48048b39-fec3-473d-85c7-8a62da58178f','096a26c2-8978-4f0e-a28b-c6bd0bf0f04a','office assistant',NULL,'office assistant',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"MS Excel\", \"MS Word\", \"SAP\", \"Word\", \"MS Office\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-14 11:46:52.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"office assistant\", \"company\": \"Air Inda\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('4806411e-d913-4e11-97d3-2a3550b09fb1','79f3e401-0e78-44cd-ba80-4c560d3d0b33','7 years of software development experience with a strong core focus on Java and Spring Boot. Proficient in\r\nbuilding distributed microservices and RESTful APIs. Experienced in the Travel Tech and Finance domains,\r\ndedicated to writing clean, maintainable,','7 years of software development experience with a strong core focus on Java and Spring Boot. Proficient in\r\nbuilding distributed microservices and RESTful APIs. Experienced in the Travel Tech and Finance domains,\r\ndedicated to writing clean, maintainable, and efficient code.','Software Developer',4,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1770790534-482.pdf',NULL,'[\"Java\", \"HTML\", \"CSS\", \"Github\", \"Docker\", \"JavaScript\", \"PostgreSQL\", \"MYSQL\"]','PUBLIC','2026-02-11 18:43:56.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Developer\", \"company\": \"Ekfrazo Technologies Pvt. Ltd\", \"endDate\": \"Sat Feb 28\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Fri Apr 05\", \"description\": \"Camino Messenger Plugin\\r\\nMiddleware API service bridging frontend and Camino bot for searching, booking, and managing\\r\\nflights/hotels using gRPC protocols.\\r\\nTech: Java, Spring Boot, gRPC\"}, {\"title\": \"Software Developer\", \"company\": \