ution delivery. \r\n \r\n Proficient in arch',' Accomplished Software Engineer with 4+ years of full-stack development expertise, \r\ncomplemented by 8+ years of Python training experience, blending deep technical \r\nknowledge with leadership in mentoring and solution delivery. \r\n \r\n Proficient in architecting and delivering scalable, event-driven applications and SDKs, \r\nwith hands-on experience in React.js, Next.js, Node.js, Django, and cloud-native solutions \r\non AWS. \r\n \r\n Specialized in database design, migration, and optimization, with proven success in \r\ntransitioning large-scale systems from MongoDB to PostgreSQL while ensuring 100% \r\naccuracy and data integrity. \r\n \r\n Strong expertise in data engineering and ETL pipelines, leveraging Python, Kafka, \r\nAirflow, and GCP BigQuery to automate workflows and enable real-time analytics for \r\nbusiness-critical reporting. \r\n \r\n Skilled in microservices architecture and integration, developing middlewares and SDKs \r\nthat reduced deployment time by 20% and enhanced collaboration efficiency across \r\nplatforms by 25%. \r\n \r\n Skilled in IoT-driven solutions and message protocols (MQTT, Kafka), implementing \r\nsecure and high-performance communication channels that improved system stability \r\nand reduced latency by up to 25%.','Senior Software Engineer',4,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1760019900-306.pdf',NULL,'[\"Full Stack Development\", \"API Design\", \"Microservices Architectures\", \"Event-Driven Architecture\", \"Code Optimization\", \"Cloud Computing\", \"Azure Data Engineer\", \"ETL\", \"Airflow\", \"Kafka\", \"GCP\", \"Containerization\", \"DevOps\", \"Agile\", \"Documentation\", \"Cross-Functional Teams\", \"HTML\", \"HTML5\", \"Express.js\", \"Django\", \"JavaScript\", \"C++\", \"AWS\", \"AWS Lambda\", \"JIRA\", \"Git\", \"Database Design\", \"Data Migration\", \"Python\", \"Orchestration\", \"CI/CD\", \"System Performance Optimization\", \"Stakeholder Management\", \"Re