Jun 13\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Tue May 11\", \"description\": \"•  Managed end-to-end software release lifecycle including build management, integration, deployment, and post-release testing for RDK-V and RDK-B projects. •  Supported Windows and Linux server setup, OS patching, and troubleshooting to maintain infrastructure stability. •  Monitored infrastructure health using Nagios, Splunk, and Grafana; proactively identified and resolved performance bottlenecks. •  Led incident management and ticket resolution through Jira and ServiceNow, ensuring SLA adherence. •  Configured build and artifact tools including Apache Maven, JFrog Artifactory, and Git for artifact lifecycle management.\"}, {\"title\": \"QA Automation Engineer\", \"company\": \"Tata Elxsi Ltd.\", \"endDate\": \"Tue Aug 13\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Wed Jul 12\", \"description\": \"•  Developed and executed automated test scripts for Comcast RDK-C camera device firmware using ALM Octane and Automatics frameworks. •  Conducted regression testing, root cause analysis (RCA), performance testing, and security testing across firmware release cycles. •  Built reusable test utilities to accelerate test coverage and improve team productivity. •  Collaborated with development teams for defect triage, resolution tracking, and defect lifecycle management. •  Participated in code reviews and authored comprehensive test cases aligned with acceptance criteria and quality standards.\"}, {\"title\": \"DevOps Engineer\", \"company\": \"Tata Elxsi Ltd.\", \"endDate\": \"Thu Mar 13\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Wed Sep 11\", \"description\": \"•  Designed and maintained CI/CD pipelines using Jenkins and GitHub Actions to automate build, test, and deployment for Comcast\'s RDK platform (RDK-C, RDK-V, RDK-B). •  Provisioned scalable cloud infrastructure using Terraform and AWS CloudFormation following Infrastructure as Code (IaC) best practices. •  Developed Python and Bash automation scripts to streamline operational tasks, reducing manual effort and improving deployment consistency. •  Configured monitoring and alerting with Prometheus, Grafana, ELK Stack, and CloudWatch to ensure system performance and SLA compliance. •  Managed Ansible playbooks for configuration management across cloud and on-premises environments. •  Administered AWS services (EC2, S3, RDS, IAM, Route53, Auto Scaling) and enforced secure networking via VPCs, NAT gateways, and security groups. •  Performed kernel upgrades, OS uplifts, and artifact upgrades using Ansible and shell scripting to maintain security compliance.\"}, {\"title\": \"Software Engineer\", \"company\": \"Enfec Solutions (Remote)\", \"endDate\": \"Thu Jan 01\", \"isCurrent\": true, \"startDate\": \"Tue Oct 21\", \"description\": \"•  Executed functional, integration, and end-to-end testing of T-Mobile\'s Core & Services platforms, validating provisioning, billing, and charging flows (prepaid, MBC, roaming, MVNE). •  Validated REST, SOAP, XML, and JSON APIs; ensured accurate CDR generation for voice, data, and SMS traffic. •  Troubleshot interoperability issues, service failures, and defects using logs, traces, Wireshark, JIRA, and qTest. •  Collaborated with Nokia/Ericsson vendors and internal engineering teams for feature validation, issue triage, and service delivery readiness. •  Performed testing and debugging on UNIX/Linux using SQL and MongoDB with telecom protocols (TCP/UDP, SIP, DIAMETER, HTTP/S). •  Delivered daily status updates, risk reports, and detailed test documentation supporting lab-to-operations handoff.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2020\", \"degree\": \"Bachelor of Engineering (B.E.)\", \"result\": \"7.0\", \"institution\": \"Visvesvaraya Technological University\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/ujjawal-kumar-1790756555-31.pdf\", \"title\": \"UJJAWAL KUMAR\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('4b3c41b3-c22a-4d6e-9c68-5c6a84c8e112','b0a03cfd-1247-47fc-bf