g Queries and issues. in Development server and validation server \\r\\n Involving with the IT team for parser issues for port base (Balance, PH, etc.), file base (Tiamo, auto titrator, UV) \\r\\n Providing suggestion to Labware team, regarding templates as per our need. \\r\\n ID Creation, Password resetting, Privilege matrix verification for the Functional roles ie analyst, supervisor,  \\r\\n reviewer etc. \\r\\n Creating formulas using basic SQL tool in analysis and setting configuration as per component. \\r\\n Instrument configuration for Balance, PH meter port and file based Parsing Script . \\r\\n Supporting users to creation of Lot, Batch, Inventory and Standard management in LIMS. \\r\\n Importing / Exporting the objective from Development to validation and from validation to production server \\r\\n Good knowledge of LIMS Basic format calculations, analysis component calculations (variables \\r\\nproperties, writing basic algorithms) \\r\\n Writing calculations using LIMS basic as per the business requirements \\r\\n Involving in trouble shooting, including master data and for end user activities. \\r\\n End to End Knowledge, Hands on experience in LIMS, \\r\\n Initiating& preparing CCP, CCT, CAPA , Deviation, incidents related to LIMS.\"}, {\"title\": \"Assistant Manager\", \"company\": \"Cipla Ltd\", \"endDate\": \"Mon Aug 30\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Thu May 05\", \"description\": \" Prepared the master data (static data) and Implement the LOT management module for Sterile facility. \\r\\n Prepared necessary pre-requisites and conducted dry runs, identifying and mitigating 90% of potential issues \\r\\nbefore formal validation \\r\\n Perform Environmental monitoring of production areas by air sampling and settle plate, surface monitoring and \\r\\npersonnel monitoring Through LABWARE LIMS. \\r\\n Well experience in Creation of Master data, like (Stock, Analysis, Product, Sample plan, Item code, Product Master \\r\\nveri