y, production monitoring, and process efficiency. \\r\\n Provide 24/7 operational support and maintenance for MES applications across \\r\\ndevelopment, testing, and production environments. \\r\\n Partner with cross-functional stakeholders to translate business and manufacturing \\r\\nrequirements into scalable technical solutions. \\r\\n Optimize database performance and application efficiency by redesigning complex \\r\\nSQL queries and improving query execution plans. \\r\\n Collaborate with global IT teams to deliver new application features and system \\r\\nenhancements aligned with business needs. \\r\\n Develop database integration mechanisms using synonyms and database links to \\r\\nenable secure and efficient cross-schema data access.\"}, {\"title\": \"Junior Engineer - IT SFCS\", \"company\": \"Wistron Infocomm Manufacturing (India) Private Limited\", \"endDate\": \"Sat Mar 20\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Thu Sep 05\", \"description\": \" Provide operational guidance and diagnostic support to shop floor operators, \\r\\nensuring adherence to manufacturing procedures and improving production \\r\\nefficiency. \\r\\n Ensure accurate and timely delivery of production and operational data to relevant \\r\\nstakeholders to support effective decision-making and process control. \\r\\n Perform problem analysis, root cause investigation, and implementation of \\r\\ncorrective actions to resolve production and system issues. \\r\\n Support production line setup and deployment of configuration programs on the \\r\\nshop floor in alignment with product specifications and manufacturing process \\r\\nrequirements. \\r\\n Develop and maintain database objects including stored procedures, functions, \\r\\ntriggers, tables, views, and packages using Oracle development tools such as TOAD \\r\\nand PL/SQL Developer. \\r\\n Create and maintain database scripts for new enhancements, including table \\r\\ncreation, view development, and query optimiza