rieval of hotel images.  \\r\\n Containerized applications using Docker and deployed services on Kubernetes (EKS).  \\r\\n Developed Jenkins pipelines with Groovy scripting and bash shell commands for automated Maven builds, \\r\\nDocker image creation, and  ECR pushes on Linux servers. \\r\\n Provisioned AWS infrastructure with Terraform (IaC) and deployed  \\r\\n microservices to Kubernetes (EKS) with zero-downtime rolling updates.Implemented centralized logging and \\r\\nmonitoring using ELK Stack, Zipkin, and Spring Boot Actuator\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2020\", \"degree\": \"Bachelor of Engineering in Computer Science and Engineering\", \"result\": \"71\", \"institution\": \"DRIEMS, Biju Patnaik University of Technology\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1781203977-872.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('524ba7c2-c1c4-41af-998e-04c827e27e22','87e7e7b8-80bc-4545-a367-e2910083d455','Machine Learning Specialist',NULL,'Machine Learning Specialist',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Machine Learning\", \"Python\", \"Numpy\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-14 19:53:59.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"Machine Learning Specialist\", \"company\": \"EOS\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]',850000.00,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('5252a91c-e04b-4ba0-ba33-75d3f1c4d708','7f6de006-4bb4-4738-b9b7-b2f3115998da','Office Assistant',NULL,'Office Assistant',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','PUBLIC','2025-05-14 11:46:53.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"Office Assistant\", \"company\": \"Anywhere\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('5253e211-11b4-4bed-80a1-d6a151280c6f','557f7ee4-8f71-4f77-af24-b4519351ebb9','.net full stack developer',NULL,'.net full stack developer',2,700000.00,NULL,NULL,'[\"Azure\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-23 16:19:29.000000','2026-1