ction history management. \\r\\n• Invoice Module: \\r\\nBuilt an automated invoicing system that generated invoices based on approved \\r\\nquotations and payments. Enabled PDF export and email delivery features using \\r\\n.NET Core services. \\r\\n• Training & Implementation Module: \\r\\nDesigned a customer training management interface to schedule, track, and record \\r\\nproduct training sessions. Added status tracking and feedback recording to \\r\\nimprove client onboarding experience\"}, {\"title\": \"Software Developer\", \"company\": \"Srimathi Infotech\", \"endDate\": \"Wed May 31\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Thu Oct 10\", \"description\": \"• Built enterprise web solutions using ASP.NET, C#, and JavaScript. \\r\\n• Migrated legacy applications to .NET Core, improving performance by 40%. \\r\\n• Implemented authentication and authorization using JWT and Identity \\r\\nFramework. \\r\\n• Worked closely with database administrators to optimize stored procedures and \\r\\nindexes. \\r\\n• Mentored junior developers and participated in code reviews to ensure best \\r\\npractices.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2019\", \"degree\": \"Master of Engineering (M.E.) in Computer Science\", \"result\": \"67\", \"institution\": \"Thiruvalluvar College of Engineering and Technology-Anna University\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1764001900-739.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('52b0aceb-57b8-4fff-8ffa-f2ec71d62e91','64a01f39-da97-47cb-82f7-8152579b1efb','Azure Lead Engineer L3',NULL,'Azure Lead Engineer L3',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Cloud Migration\", \"CCNA\", \"CCNP\", \"Linux\", \"DHCP\", \"DNS\", \"Active Directory\", \"Cloud Computing\", \"Cloud Storage\", \"Azure DevOps\", \"VMware\", \"Windows Server\", \"Red Hat Linux\", \"Virtualization\", \"VMware\", \"Windows XP\", \"VMware Certified Professional\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-16 11:34:46.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"Azure Lead Engi