 solutions.','PROJECT ENGINEER',2,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1788808937-102.pdf',NULL,'[\"GE Cimplicity\", \"GE iFIX\", \"Siemens\", \"WinCC\", \"Siemens Tia Portal\", \"Kepware\", \"GE Proficy\", \"TCP\", \"Allen-Bradley\", \"Modbus\", \"OPC UA\"]','PUBLIC','2026-09-08 06:50:23.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"PROJECT ENGINEER\", \"company\": \"ATS Global\", \"endDate\": \"Mon Aug 31\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Mon Jul 10\", \"description\": \"• Executed OT integration activities for pharmaceutical manufacturing facilities by connecting shop \\r\\nfloor equipment with Level 2 automation systems. \\r\\n• Integrated more than 150 shop floor equipment for real-time production data acquisition and \\r\\nmonitoring. \\r\\n• Configured KEPServerEX for reliable industrial communication between PLCs, SCADA systems, \\r\\nGE Proficy Historian, and enterprise applications. \\r\\n• Established communication using OPC UA, OPC DA, Siemens TCP/IP, Allen-Bradley Ethernet, and \\r\\nModbus TCP/IP protocols. \\r\\n• Supported OT-MES integration by establishing communication between GE Proficy Historian and \\r\\nKörber PAS-X, enabling reliable manufacturing data exchange. \\r\\n• Analyzed and troubleshot Siemens S7-1500, S7-1200, S7-300, and S7-400 PLC programs. \\r\\n• Performed PLC diagnostics, backup verification, and online monitoring using TIA Portal and \\r\\nSIMATIC Manager. \\r\\n• Supported PLC modifications required for OT integration and process data acquisition \\r\\n• Developed SCADA graphics and configured tags, alarms, and trends using GE iFIX, Cimplicity, and \\r\\nGE Operations Hub. \\r\\n• Configured GE Proficy Historian for process data collection and visualization.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2023\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech in Electrical and Electronics Engineering\", \"result\": \"7.15\", \"institution\": \"APJ Abdhul Kalam Technological University\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1788808937-102.pdf