gramming skills and a solid foundation in software development. Proficient in Python, Django, and\r\nMySQL, with hands on experience in b','Motivated and detail-oriented Python developer with a Master’s in Computer Applications (MCA), equipped with\r\nstrong programming skills and a solid foundation in software development. Proficient in Python, Django, and\r\nMySQL, with hands on experience in building web applications and automation scripts.','Python Developer',2,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1771449177-968.pdf',NULL,'[\"Data Structures Algorithms\", \"Django\", \"Flask\", \"JavaScript\", \"HTML\", \"CSS\", \"Bootstrap\", \"Machine Learning\", \"Artificial Intelligence\", \"OOPS\", \"DBMS\", \"Python\", \"MYSQL\", \"Pandas\", \"Generative AI\", \"LangChain\"]','PUBLIC','2026-02-19 09:31:08.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Python Developer\", \"company\": \"YPSILION IT Solutions\", \"endDate\": \"Mon Sep 30\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Wed Apr 10\", \"description\": \"• Selected for a 6-months internship, Utilized HTML, CSS, JavaScript, Bootstrap, Python, SQL, Django, and Flask to\\r\\ndevelop and maintain web applications.\\r\\n• Architected and delivered highly responsive user interfaces, ensuring flawless cross-browser and cross-device compatibility\\r\\nfor superior user experiences.\\r\\n• Developed and maintained web applications using frontend and backend technologies, ensuring efficiency, reliability, and\\r\\nease of maintenance.\\r\\n• Earned advanced certification in Python, Django, and comprehensive software project development through successful\\r\\ncompletion of an intensive training program.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2025\", \"degree\": \"Masters Of Computer Applications\", \"result\": \"68\", \"institution\": \"Maharaja Ranjit Singh Professional And Science\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1771449177-968.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('54b3b556-c9c3-4513-bc92-8d57dc960b48','613f3db4-2ed4-43b6-8c98-338349e60607','• Industrial Automation and IT-OT Integration professional with 10+ years of experience designing and delivering scalable manufacturing technology solutions across pharmaceutical, food, automotive, utilities, and regulated industrial environments. • Exper','• Industrial Automation and IT-OT Integration professional with 10+ years of experience designing and delivering scalable manufacturing technology solutions across pharmaceutical, food, automotive, utilities, and regulated industrial environments. • Experienced in architecting and deploying Ignition, Sepasoft MES, historian, industrial data platforms, and cloud-connected applications across multi-site manufacturing operations. • Extensive technical expertise in PLC, SCADA, Historians, L2 integrations, ERP integrations, industrial networking, UNS Implementation, Python, and SQL databases. • Proven experience implementing centralized automation, production monitoring, data acquisition, Track & Trace, OEE, SPC, QMS, batch processing, and manufacturing analytics solutions. • Skilled in integrating plant-floor, enterprise, edge devices, and cloud systems using OPC UA, MQTT, REST APIs, SOAP, SQL, JSON, and XML. • Proven success in customer-facing technical leadership roles involving solution architecture, requirements discovery, technical workshops, estimation, project planning, development, deployment, validation, commissioning, and lifecycle support. • Additional expertise in Agentic AI systems for manufacturing, complemented by experience in cloud and edge architectures, OT cybersecurity, disaster recovery, business continuity, and database performance optimization. • Effective at collaborating with sales, engineering, operations, quality, IT, vendors, and system integrators to deliver secure, compliant, reliable, scalable, and maintainable industrial systems. • Strong knowledge of regulated manufacturing standards and practices, including 21 CFR Part 11, GAMP 5, ISA-95, ISA-88 and computerized system validation.','Junior Project Engineer',12,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/hitesh-rathod-1790235932-561.pdf',NULL,'[\"SCADA\"]','PUBLIC','2026-09-24 19:10:24.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Junior Project Engineer\", \"company\": \"Kevin Technologies Pvt. Ltd\", \"endDate\": \"Fri Mar 01\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Thu May 04\", \"description\": \"• Designed, developed, and commissioned a centralized SCADA system to enable efficient monitoring and control of facility operations.  • Configured and implemented a secure network infrastructure to ensure reliable SCADA communication and seamless data transfer. • Integrated SCADA systems with plant data sources, ensuring real-time reporting to facilitate business intelligence and manufacturing optimization. • Led projects from conception to completion, ensuring compliance with GMP standards and regulatory requirements throughout the process. • Translated P&IDs into actionable control systems by programming PLCs, HMIs, and SCADA applications tailored to project needs. • Reviewed and validated control panel designs and electrical drawings, ensuring accuracy and adherence to project specifications. • Configured and managed databases using SQL Server, while leveraging Microsoft Reporting Services (SSRS) for advanced data handling and reporting solutions. • Developed expertise in validation documentation, including URS, FRS, FDS, IQ, OQ, and PQ, to ensure project readiness and compliance. • Collaborated with cross-functional teams and coordinated with various departments, ensuring seamless project execution and on-time delivery.\"}, {\"title\": \"Project Engineer\", \"company\": \"ATS Global\", \"endDate\": \"Wed Oct 16\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Thu Mar 07\", \"description\": \"• Managed complex L2 integration projects for clients in pharmaceuticals industry, ensuring smooth project execution and delivery. • Led cross-functional project teams in developing and configuring L2 servers for critical data collection, visualization, storage, and reporting.  • Defined project scope, timelines, resources, and budgets, ensuring successful project execution and on-time delivery. • Acted as the primary technical and delivery point of contact for customers throughout the project lifecycle. • Managed client relationships, maintaining clear and proactive communication channels to address concerns and keep stakeholders updated on project progress. • Conducted regular client meetings to provide progress updates, address technical issues, and manage expectations. • Presented project status, risks, and milestone to senior management during periodic review. • Provided technical leadership and support to project teams, resolving challenges and ensuring technical requirements were met, while collaborating with validation and reporting teams to finalize deliverables. • Ensured structured execution, documentation discipline, and timely project closure. • Coordinated system integration activities between PLCs, SCADA, Historian, and L2 servers to ensure reliable data flow and system stability.\"}, {\"title\": \"Ignition Developer\", \"company\": \"SNDK Corp (IT HO of Deep Kiran Foods, Deep Foods and ICPL)\", \"endDate\": \"Tue Jan 04\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Wed Oct 09\", \"description\": \"• Designed and implemented an Industry 4.0 edge-to-cloud architecture using Ignition Edge, Ignition 8.1 on AWS, Cirrus Link MQTT modules, and Amazon Aurora RDS.  • Integrated shop-floor data from Siemens, Allen-Bradley, Mitsubishi, and Delta PLCs with a centralized AWS-hosted Ignition platform through OPC and MQTT.  • Developed Perspective and Vision applications for real-time monitoring, control, alarming, historian trends, auditing, reporting, and user management.  • Stored time-series machine and production data in Amazon Aurora RDS and supplied structured datasets for machine-learning-based predictive maintenance.  • UDT and Tags config, OPC, MQTT, historian, alarm, audit, and reporting configuration, along with SQL and Python scripting and PLC program modifications.  • Coordinated project activities with engineering teams and management to deliver solutions within schedule and budget.\"}, {\"title\": \"Senior Technical Analyst\", \"company\": \"Thirdware Solution Inc\", \"endDate\": \"Mon Feb 06\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Tue Feb 08\", \"description\": \"• Designed and delivered scalable architectures for Ignition, MES, SCADA, and IIoT solutions across manufacturing environments.  • Managed project plans, schedules, technical coordination, and customer communication to ensure timely delivery.  • Provided technical consultation, troubleshooting, and 24x7 production support for Ignition and industrial automation systems.  • Defined VM cluster specifications for highly available and scalable Ignition deployments.  • Developed Ignition Perspective and Vision applications and designed Track & Trace and Batchand-Hold architectures.  • Connected 40+ shop-floor Ignition gateways to a centralized Enterprise Ignition gateway for monitoring and performance analysis.  • Developed an enterprise health-monitoring dashboard for CPU, memory, disk, license, and gateway status monitoring.  • Implemented a long-term industrial data archival solution on Microsoft Azure.  • Delivered reliable and maintainable SCADA, MES, and IIoT projects aligned with customer and manufacturing requirements.\"}, {\"title\": \"Control System Engineer\", \"company\": \"SL Controls\", \"endDate\": \"Thu Nov 16\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Thu Feb 02\", \"description\": \"• Developed and supported Ignition Perspective and Vision applications, including Docker-based deployments, Python scripting, database integration, Sepasoft MES, and Azure Snowflake connectivity.  • Designed and developed Quality Management System (QMS) and Statistical Process Control (SPC) applications using Sepasoft modules on the Ignition platform.  • Provided technical and operational support for the APT system at the Johnson & Johnson Vision Care facility in Limerick, Ireland, ensuring system reliability and continuity.  • Supported AVEVA InTouch SCADA applications by implementing new changes, troubleshooting issues, and assisting with system enhancements based on operational requirements. • Configured and integrated Cognex vision systems for automated foil and carton inspection and reading.  • Performed post-installation system validation, functional testing, and documentation to confirm compliance with project and regulated manufacturing requirements.\"}, {\"title\": \"Solution Architech\", \"company\": \"Crescenza Consulting Group\", \"endDate\": \"Thu Jan 01\", \"isCurrent\": true, \"startDate\": \"Fri Dec 08\", \"description\": \"• Lead end-to-end delivery of MES, SCADA, IIoT, and Ignition solutions, covering architecture, development, deployment, validation, production support, and lifecycle management. • Architect Ignition 8.1/8.3 applications using Perspective, Vision, UDTs, alarming, historian, reporting, transaction groups, security, SQL, Python, HTML, and CSS. • Design and optimize database solutions across Microsoft SQL Server, MySQL, and PostgreSQL, including schemas, stored procedures, indexing, query optimization, and performance tuning. • Design and implemented Unified Namespace (UNS) architectures including data models (ISA95), MQTT topic structures, and data pipelines. • Working with AI teams to develop enterprise Agentic AI solutions for manufacturing, covering AI orchestration, AI ontologies, RAG, intelligent agents & multi agents, workflow builders, tool calling, multi-LLM workflows, and AI governance. • Conduct customer workshops, technical presentations, and architecture reviews to define requirements and recommend secure, scalable manufacturing IT solutions. • Deliver Sepasoft-based applications for Batch Procedure, Track & Trace, OEE, SPC, QMS, Advanced Scripting, SepaIQ, and manufacturing analytics. • Integrate MES, ERP, SCADA, PLC, historian, cloud, and enterprise systems using OPC UA, MQTT, REST, SOAP, SQL, JSON, and XML. • Manage multi-site implementations while coordinating with customers, vendors, system integrators, and cross-functional engineering teams. • Drive application standardization, database optimization, industrial data archival, cloud migration, OT cybersecurity, disaster recovery, business continuity, and deployment automation initiatives. • Lead and mentor a team of 5+ engineers, providing technical training, standardized application design guidance, daily project oversight, challenge resolution, and career-development support. • Good communication, time management & decision-making skills.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2016\", \"degree\": \"ELECTRICAL ENGINEERING\", \"result\": \"8.33\", \"institution\": \"Vishwakarma Govt. Engineering College\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/hitesh-rathod-1790235932-561.pdf\", \"title\": \"HITESH RATHOD\", \"isDefault\": false}, {\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/hitesh-rathod-1790235934-653.pdf\", \"title\": \"HITESH RATHOD\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('54b9e2be-9b0e-4c61-8a3a-5d076e895ba6','d80076b2-d88d-4c7f-a94e-b2ba7d367ea7','EMS Eng.',NULL,'EMS Eng.',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Oracle\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-15 06:05:38.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"EMS Eng.\", \"company\": \"Inspira enterpeise\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('54ca9e73-3a20-4717-9c9f-f3cadfd986d2','9d03797d-20ca-4df8-ac04-e71b798d18d2','Professional',NULL,'Professional',1,600000.00,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1754301634-322.pdf',NULL,'[]','PUBLIC','2025-08-04 09:55:24.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]',435000.00,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1754301634-322.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'