col to establish communication between PLC and other machines. • Troubleshooting of the various issues in Automation system. • Troubleshooting and new incorporation of the instruments such as Proxy, controllers, transmitters as per the process requirement. • Control wiring, logic development • Parameterization of VFDs and PID controllers • Taking care of new projects and maintain existing project of Camera, NVR, DVR, Door access, Fire Alarm system and other security system • Total load calculation, Project Execution and planning, Cable sizing calculation, planning of  • Manage SCADA operators and provide trainings, Task assignment, manage shifts, and collect Data of process • Worked with Online UPS, Inverter. • Project manager for IT Applications and developed Apps for process and purchase and maintenance. • Carried out maintenance up to 2500 KVA transformer and 1500 KVA DG set. Responsibilities: • Working as a project coordinator for establishment of new Green field project of 1500 TPM plant. • Develop new vendors and discuss the Techno-Commercial package. • Review the technical approvals of the documents. • Execution on the site as per the design. • Carry inspection of all electrical equipment before dispatch. • preparing a budget for electrical automation and instruments for projects and  monitoring the project to complete it within the budget. • Study of the power system for exploring the possibility of connecting the load of new projects. • Preparing single-line diagrams for new projects • Transformer sizing for the new projects • HT and LT cable sizing. • Preparation of technical specifications for motors. • Floating RFQ for all the, instruments and automation system equipment. • Designing power control scheme for electrical • Coordinate with the civil, mechanical, and maintenance teams for the execution of projects. • Study and approval of instrumentation data sheet. • Ensuring Equipment availability and reliability to meet Business demand. • Monitor electrical spares procurement and usage maintain critical spares, consumption pattern and reliability. Prepare & follow-up for Purchase Requisition (PR). • Shift Management and maintain report of breakdown and maintenance. • Co-ordinate with government officials regarding New approvals and prepare  documents. • Reporting to Technical Vice President and Director\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2017\", \"degree\": \"B.TECH\", \"result\": \"8.94\", \"institution\": \"MARWADI EDUCATION FOUNDATION GROUP OF INSTITUTATIONS\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/deep-aghera-1790232030-274.pdf\", \"title\": \"Deep Aghera\", \"isDefault\": false}, {\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/deep-aghera-1790232030-268.pdf\", \"title\": \"Deep Aghera\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('55104185-1ff6-4837-9bc2-298a418fbfbf','91ce9030-fc2e-4735-88cb-4e604aa3cb23','Azure Devops Administrator',NULL,'Azure Devops Administrator',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Azure DevOps Server\", \"Cloud\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-16 11:31:44.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"Azure Devops Administrator\", \"company\": \"Mahindra Satyam\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('5523e310-3111-4ed9-865d-6b650282ca8d','ad3015f9-9e42-4d37-a03a-b2c070cf6bd2','Software Test Engineer with over 4.6 years of professional experience in ensuring software quality across\r\nvarious domains. Proven expertise in designing and executing comprehensive test strategies, identifying\r\nbugs, and working closely with development ','Software Test Engineer with over 4.6 years of professional experience in ensuring software quality across\r\nvarious domains. Proven expertise in designing and executing comprehensive test strategies, identifying\r\nbugs, and working closely with development teams to deliver high-quality applications. Adept at\r\nunderstanding business requirements, translating them into effective test cases, 