strator ( MYSQL )\", \"company\": \"Ibm Global Services\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('5656cdc7-32dd-4622-a0dd-50e98908cb0f','4afee0b2-9284-451e-9024-0785542a7026','Data Engineer with 4+ years of experience and strong expertise in designing, building, and optimizing scalable data \r\npipelines, data warehouses, and business intelligence solutions. Skilled in leveraging modern cloud platforms such as \r\nMicrosoft Fabric,','Data Engineer with 4+ years of experience and strong expertise in designing, building, and optimizing scalable data \r\npipelines, data warehouses, and business intelligence solutions. Skilled in leveraging modern cloud platforms such as \r\nMicrosoft Fabric, Azure, and Databricks, along with big data tools to improve data reliability, processing speed, and \r\nbusiness insights. Experienced in managing the end-to-end data lifecycle—from data ingestion and transformation to \r\ngovernance and analytics—while driving automation, ensuring data quality, and applying industry best practices.','Data Engineer',4,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1776440261-605.pdf',NULL,'[\"Azure\", \"Microsoft SQL\", \"AWS Lambda\", \"ETL\", \"Data Lake\", \"Azure DevOps\", \"AWS\", \"Data Warehouse\", \"Azure Databricks\", \"Apache Spark\", \"CI/CD\", \"REST API\", \"PyCharm\", \"Data Engineer\"]','PUBLIC','2026-04-18 03:04:53.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Data Engineer\", \"company\": \"UNIZEN TECHNOLOGIES Pvt Ltd\", \"endDate\": \"Wed Apr 15\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Tue Oct 10\", \"description\": \" Led end-to-end migration of legacy on-prem healthcare claims systems (SQL Server, Oracle) to Azure Lakehouse, \\r\\nmigrating 5+ years of historical data with zero data loss and seamless production cutover.  \\r\\n Architected scalable Medallion Architecture (Bronze, Silver, Gold) using Azure Databricks, PySpark, Spark SQL, and \\r\\nDelta Lake to enable governed and high-performance analytics.  \\r\\n Implemented CDC-based incremental data processing using watermark logic and Delta Lake MERGE to handle claim \\r\\nupdates, late-arriving records, and SCD Type 2 historical tracking.  \\r\\n Designed healthcare dimensional data models including Member 360, Claims Fact, Provider Dimension, and Policy \\r\\nHistory to support end-to-end claim lifecycle analytics.  \\r\\n Built distributed Spark pipelines processing 50+ GB daily data and optimized performance using partitioning,  \\r\\nZ-Ordering, AQE, broadcast joins, and file compaction.  \\r\\n Developed automated Data Quality and Monitoring Framework with schema validation, reconciliation checks, \\r\\nbusiness rule validation, SLA tracking, and retry mechanisms achieving 99.5% pipeline reliability.  \\r\\n Implemented enterprise data governance using Unity Catalog with RBAC, row-level security, column masking, \\r\\nlineage tracking, and audit logging for secure healthcare data management.  \\r\\n Enabled governed self-service analytics using Databricks SQL Warehouse and Power BI, reducing manual reporting \\r\\neffort and accelerating executive insights.  \\r\\n Optimized infrastructure using autoscaling clusters and workload tuning, achieving 30–40% cost reduction and 45% \\r\\nperformance improvement.  \\r\\n Improved business reporting efficiency by reducing claim reporting time from days to hours and enhancing fraud \\r\\ndetection and compliance reporting accuracy, and centralizing enterprise healthcare analytics\"}, {\"title\": \"Jr Data Engineer\", \"company\": \"UNIZEN TECHNOLOGIES Pvt Ltd.\", \"endDate\": \"Wed Oct 25\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Thu Mar 10\", \"description\": \" Developed and maintained robust PySpark ETL pipelines on Azure Databricks for ingestion and processing of 20–40 \\r\\nGB daily transactional data including dealer sales, logistics, and warranty datasets to support enterprise analytics.  \\r\\n Engineered scalable data ingestion workflows using Azure Data Factory with metadata-driven frameworks, dynamic \\r\\nparameterization, and incremental load strategies, improving pipeline reusability and reducing onboarding effort by \\r\\n40%.  \\r\\n Implemented Delta Lake optimization techniques including partitioning strategy, liquid clustering, file compaction, \\r\\nOPTIMIZE, data skipping, and VACUUM, achieving 45% improvement in query performance and 30% reduction in \\r\\nstorage overhead.  \\r\\n Designed enterprise-grade data models using SCD Type 2, CDC processing, deduplication frameworks, and late\\r\\narriving data handling to ensure consistent dimensional analytics.  \\r\\n Built high-performance Spark transformations using AQE tuning, broadcast joins, shuffle optimization, caching \\r\\nstrategies, and workload isolation, reducing ETL execution time by 35%.  \\r\\n Established data quality and monitoring framework including schema validation, reconciliation checks, automated \\r\\nalerts, retry mechanisms, and SLA tracking, ensuring >99% pipeline reliability.  \\r\\n Implemented secure governance model using RBAC access controls, secret management, audit logging, lineage \\r\\ntracking, and standardized access policies to ensure compliance and controlled data sharing.  \\r\\n Optimized operational costs through autoscaling job clusters, cluster right-sizing, workload scheduling, and Azure \\r\\nData Lake Storage lifecycle management, achieving 25–30% compute cost savings and 20% storage reduction.  \\r\\n Delivered complex business transformations and aggregates for Lakehouse analytics pipelines and supported \\r\\nscalable and secure data platform architecture.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2021\", \"degree\": \"Bachelor of Technology in Computer Science\", \"result\": \"68\", \"institution\": \"Rajiv Gandhi University of Knowledge and Technologies\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1776440261-605.pd