tion Systems (LES), and Instrument Integration, configuration of \r\nProduct and its classification, Analysis Calculatio','Experienced Labware LIMS Specialist with over 3+ years of hands-on expertise in Electronic Laboratory \r\nNotebooks (ELN), Laboratory Execution Systems (LES), and Instrument Integration, configuration of \r\nProduct and its classification, Analysis Calculation, LIMS Basic Programming and Sample Lifecycle. \r\nDemonstrated success in enhancing existing workflows, systems, and models through exceptional \r\npersonal, communication, organizational, and technical skills. Possess a solid background in software \r\ndevelopment and system analysis. A dedicated team player with excellent communication abilities, \r\ndelivering high-quality work consistently. Highly self-motivated and driven, with strong negotiating skills \r\nand a keen business and technical acumen. Capable of working independently and collaboratively to \r\nachieve organizational goals.','ASSOCIATE',4,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1759752093-450.pdf',NULL,'[\"LabWare LIMS\", \"Oracle\", \"MYSQL\", \"Python\", \"C\", \"Team Player\"]','PUBLIC','2025-10-06 11:58:23.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"ASSOCIATE\", \"company\": \"Cognizant Technology Solutions\", \"endDate\": \"Sat Oct 04\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Mon Jan 31\", \"description\": \"• Designed and built Laboratory Execution System (LES) from scratch with Electronic \\r\\nLab Notebook (ELN) for an European pharma giant. \\r\\n• Proper working experience on product creation, modification and well versed in \\r\\nproduct classification. \\r\\n• Proper working experience on analysis creation, modification and analysis calculation. \\r\\n• Has solid working experience on File based and Port based Instrument Integration to \\r\\nLIMS using LabStation Module and Message Engine (ME). \\r\\n• Has proper understanding in LIMS Basic Programming and LIMS Basic functions \\r\\nwhich enabled me to build many Subroutines, Parsing Formulas and Analysis \\r\\nCalculations ranging from easy to very complex requirements from Client. \\r\\n• Can properly utilize SQL queries to extract data from LIMS into Subroutines, Parsing \\r\\nFormula, Analysis Calculations and Stored Queries and vice versa. \\r\\n• Has deep understanding on Sample Lifecycle in Labware LIMS. \\r\\n• Has been able to integrate and populate instrument data in Plate module from \\r\\ndiminutive LIMS data in files. \\r\\n• Has mitigated many bugs related to Instrument Integration, Laboratory Execution \\r\\nSystem (LES), Electronic Laboratory Notebook (ELN), and Analysis Calculation in \\r\\nLabware LIMS.\"}, {\"title\": \"DIGITAL ASSOCIATE AMAZON\", \"company\": \"Amazon Web Services (AWS)\", \"endDate\": \"Tue Nov 29\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Sat Jan 09\", \"description\": \"• Worked closely with AWS Rekognition team to annotate feature for Machine model. \\r\\n• Was responsible for collecting and processing ground truth data for the Machine \\r\\nmodel. \\r\\n• Worked on different annotations like Face Identification, headgears, accessories, \\r\\nextracting and identifying text, characters and symbols from image and content \\r\\nmoderation etc. to construct data for training Machine models. \\r\\n• Was responsible for Quality Assurance of the ground truth data fabricated by \\r\\nannotators.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2020\", \"degree\": \"APPLIED ELECTRONICS &  INSTRUMENTATION  ENGINEERING (AEIE) ·\", \"result\": \"89\", \"institution\": \"Academy of Technology\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1759752093-450.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('5690afea-aa92-434e-aa2f-0d76f95595c7','1ec6f13d-a086-4b1f-a5a1-f998d75e255f','Professional',NULL,'Professional',1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','PUBLIC','2026-03-03 00:25:20.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('56932146-78b3-45ff-8e83-1dbe625fe8a6