id IOS cross platform application and C#\r\n(.NET Core Web API). Excellent reputation in deriving problem resolutions\r\nand expertise in presentation skills','Hand-on experience in android IOS cross platform application and C#\r\n(.NET Core Web API). Excellent reputation in deriving problem resolutions\r\nand expertise in presentation skills','developer',6,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1765798026-743.pdf',NULL,'[\".NET\", \".NET Framework\", \"Git\", \"C#\", \"JSON\", \"Xamarin\", \".NET MAUI\"]','PUBLIC','2025-12-15 23:54:53.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"developer\", \"company\": \"Data-Elektronik GmbH\", \"endDate\": \"Fri Jan 30\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Tue Jun 11\", \"description\": \"Hands on checkin-checkout system using NFC tags(Android), WMS.\\r\\nResearch on RFID technologies.\\r\\nIDE:Rcom Editor(company tool).\\r\\nJira,TortoiseSVN.\\r\\n.NET Core Web API\"}, {\"title\": \"developer\", \"company\": \"Dynamic Biz Software Solutions Private Limited\", \"endDate\": \"Thu Jun 06\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Thu Feb 02\", \"description\": \"Hands on overturexl (cross platform), Overture is an application that\\r\\nBalance Your Lifestyle With Your Workstyle-Candidates use the\\r\\nOverture Lifestyle APP to claim shifts and manage your work\\r\\nschedule.\\r\\ncreate and integrated google map system and voice over for map\\r\\nnavigation, inside the app.\\r\\nConverting the whole application from Xamarin Forms to .NET MAUI.\\r\\nDeveloped and maintained overture xl.\\r\\nDesign and developed popups for different scenario using .NET MAUI.\\r\\nsetup star Rating system for the application to maintain better shift\\r\\nmanagement.\\r\\nResearch on nuget packages and plugins used in MAUI.\\r\\nXamarin Forms,.Net MAUI,Azure DevOps,.NET Core Web API.\\r\\nhttps://play.google.com/store/apps/detailsid=com.overture.live.\"}, {\"title\": \"developer\", \"company\": \"Salus Technologies Pvt. Ltd.\", \"endDate\": \"Tue Oct 18\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Wed Jun 08\", \"description\": \"Hand-on , COLUD REPORT APP (Cross platform)\\r\\n The project cloud report app is an application used to get report from\\r\\n different billing software (restaurants, supermarket and other billing\\r\\n software)\\r\\nWorked with: Xamarin , .Net Core, C#, Firebase, Sqlite\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2017\", \"degree\": \"Computer Science\", \"result\": \"Yes\", \"institution\": \"College of Applied Science , Paravur Mahatma Gandhi University\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1765798026-743.pdf\", \"title\": \"cv\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('57a4f43a-a04c-4aed-9f7c-1f62374b16cc','809272a5-dffd-4e95-9b3d-317b28e2fe63','Full Stack Developer at Tech Mahindra | Java, Spring Boot, Vue.js Expert',NULL,'Full Stack Developer at Tech Mahindra | Java, Spring Boot, Vue.js Expert',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"JavaScript\", \"JQUERY\", \"JSON\", \"AJAX\", \"CSS\", \"Bootstrap\", \"HTML\", \"JQUERY\", \"JavaScript\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-15 03:28:41.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"Full Stack Developer at Tech Mahindra | Java, Spring Boot, Vue.js Expert\", \"company\": \"Tech Mahindra Business\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('57ac1837-ec0b-49ac-bdc6-ecfbbddf871e','d0b74692-4f64-4e48-a6f5-12082a9f2036','Test Resume667','Test Resume667','Software Deve',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Python\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-25 12:00:35.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Deve\", \"company\": \"IBM\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[{\"year\": \"\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech\", \"result\": \"\", \"institution\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('57ad23e7-5523-44dc-9a53-e57fe6b8ef00','50dad6dd-0221-43ee-bf80-7e80e63d7b43','.net full stack developer',NULL,'.net full stack developer',2,2800000.00,NULL,NULL,'[\"Informatica\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-23 16:37:17.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \".net full stack developer\", \"company\": \"Infosys \", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]',2800000.00,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('57b0cf9d-5f1c-4155-af6d-dea52e6b72d6','d0c7f564-d771-4024-a9cc-8f02d46b3ad6','Test Resume815','Test Resume815','Software Deve',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"ASP.NET\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-26 09:51:51.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Deve\", \"company\": \"Achyutas\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[{\"year\": \"\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech\", \"result\": \"\", \"institution\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('57b17790-c9e4-41df-a3b4-4f98b0b9430d','11c08e59-2fa3-43bf-aa5d-3322baef4749','Data Engineer with 4+ years of experience building scalable data pipelines on Azure. Skilled in Azure Data Factory, Databricks,\r\nPySpark, and SQL. Strong in ETL/ELT, big data processing, and cloud data architecture with focus on performance optimization,\r','Data Engineer with 4+ years of experience building scalable data pipelines on Azure. Skilled in Azure Data Factory, Databricks,\r\nPySpark, and SQL. Strong in ETL/ELT, big data processing, and cloud data architecture with focus on performance optimization,\r\ndata quality, and secure enterprise data solutions.','Data Engineer',4,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1782133569-716.pdf',NULL,'[\"Microsoft Azure Platform\", \"Azure SQL Database\", \"ETL\", \"Data Warehousing\", \"Azure Key Vault\", \"Data Pipelines\", \"Data Modeling\", \"Azure Blob Storage\", \"ADF\", \"Pyspark\", \"Delta Lake\", \"Python\", \"CI/CD\", \"ADLS Gen2\", \"Spark\", \"SQL\"]','PUBLIC','2026-06-23 00:31:16.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Data Engineer\", \"company\": \"Capgemini Technology Services India Limited\", \"endDate\": \"Mon Jun 15\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Thu Apr 10\", \"description\": \"Built scalable ETL/ELT pipelines using Azure Data Factory (ADF) and Azure Databricks.\\r\\nImplemented Medallion Architecture (Bronze, Silver, Gold) using Delta Lake on ADLS Gen2.\\r\\nDeveloped high-performance transformations using PySpark and Spark SQL.\\r\\nDesigned incremental and full-load ingestion frameworks with error handling.\\r\\nImplemented CI/CD pipelines using Azure DevOps for automated deployments.\\r\\nSecured data using Azure Key Vault, Managed Identity, RBAC/ABAC.\"}, {\"title\": \"Data Engineer\", \"company\": \"Myclan Services Private Limited\", \"endDate\": \"Sun Apr 20\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Thu Mar 10\", \"description\": \"Developed and optimized ADF pipelines for data ingestion and orchestration.\\r\\nDesigned cloud-based data solutions using Azure SQL Database & Data Warehouse.\\r\\nProcessed large datasets (CSV, JSON, Parquet) using PySpark & Databricks.\\r\\nImplemented data transformation, partitioning, caching, and performance tuning.\\r\\nWorked with ADLS Gen2, Blob Storage, and Delta Tables.\\r\\nCollaborated with cross-functional teams for requirement gathering and delivery.\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1782133569-716.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]');
INSERT INTO `candidates` VALUES ('57b64c97-cca1-4a74-ad41-119085a585e0','a0ccca42-792b-4fd4-a72d-fe609509b808','Seeking a position to enhance my skills & abilities in the TrackWise\r\nApplication where I can utilize my experience of 4 years as a TrackWise\r\nDeveloper to grow being resourceful, innovative and flexible.','Seeking a position to enhance my skills & abilities in the TrackWise\r\nApplication where I can utilize my experience of 4 years as a TrackWise\r\nDeveloper to grow being resourceful, innovative and flexible.','TrackWise Developer',6,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1776652168-451.pdf',NULL,'[\"Microsoft SQL Server\", \"CSV\", \"Trackwise configuration\", \"Trackwise Developer\", \"SAP Crystal Reports\", \"Quality Assurance\", \"Val Genesis OQ Testing\"]','PUBLIC','2026-04-20 13:57:33.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"TrackWise Developer\", \"company\": \"Cognizant Technology Services Pvt Ltd Programmer Analyst\", \"endDate\": \"Wed Apr 15\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Wed Jan 10\", \"description\": \"Configure and customize TrackWise workflows, rules, and forms to\\r\\nmeet business requirements. Ensure TrackWise configuration follows\\r\\nbest practices and aligns with organizational quality processes.\\r\\nProficiency in Trackwise development methodologies and best\\r\\npractices, including configuration, customization, and workflow design.\\r\\nDevelop and maintain TrackWise reports using SAP Crystal Reports.\\r\\nPerformed system upgrades, patches, and validations, ensuring\\r\\ncompliance with GxP, 21 CFR Part 11 and regulatory standards.\\r\\nExecuted many Installation Qualification for the system upgrades &\\r\\nOperational Qualification for the system enhancements using ALM\\r\\ntool.\\r\\nProven track record of successfully completing Trackwise project\\r\\nimplementations, including stages such as analysis, design,\\r\\ndevelopment, testing, and deployment.\\r\\nExperience in system integration, data migration, and interfacing\\r\\nTrackwise with other enterprise systems.\\r\\nDevelop and maintain TrackWise Web Services (TWS) and API\\r\\nintegrations with external systems (SAP, LIMS etc.).\\r\\nTroubleshoot and resolve TrackWise issues, providing support to end\\r\\nusers.\\r\\nWork closely with business stakeholders to gather requirements and\\r\\ntranslate them into technical solutions, demonstrating the configured\\r\\nsystem to business in-order to suffice the requirements.\\r\\nStrong Knowledge of SDLC, GAMP, and Computer Systems Validation\\r\\nin a GxP Environment. Familiarity with SDLC and Agile methodologies,\\r\\nwith the ability to apply these frameworks to Trackwise development\\r\\nprojects.\\r\\nPreparion of configuration documents, report design specifications,\\r\\ndata dictionaris, user requirement specifications, business requirement\\r\\ndetails etc to maintain system consistency and ensuring complaince.\"}, {\"title\": \"Software Engineer\", \"company\": \"Coforge Limited\", \"endDate\": \"Wed Jan 10\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Sat Dec 10\", \"description\": \"TrackWise configuration & Workflow development to suffice the\\r\\nBusiness requirements.\\r\\nMigration of configuration activities from Source to Destination system\\r\\nusing migrator tool. \\r\\nParticipated & Supported for the External, Internal Audits.\\r\\nRANJITH B S\\r\\nTrackWise Developer\\r\\nEDUCATION\\r\\nCrystal report development & modification for the TrackWise\\r\\nmodules. \\r\\nCo-Ordinator configuration including admin queries, schedules, admin\\r\\nactivities, admin query logs.\\r\\nDesigned Java tool which export PR, attachments & grid values from\\r\\nsource system & save it as CSV file which is later on Imported in target\\r\\nsystem using Import utility.\\r\\nEffective handling & configuration of TrackWise software utilities like\\r\\nCo-Ordinator services. \\r\\nTroubleshooting the Application based hypercare issues.\\r\\nProficient in handling of QMS activities such as CAPA, Change Control,\\r\\nDeviation etc.\\r\\nTrained & mentored junior developers, teaching TrackWise skills &\\r\\ncollaboratively working to improve overall team performance.\\r\\nDeveloping the Notification configuration by using admin query based\\r\\non the activity & data fields. \\r\\nCollaborating Effectively with the Vendor for the deployment of Print\\r\\nControl System tool in TrackWise for the document printing.\"}, {\"title\": \"Developer | TrackWise Configuration\", \"company\": \"Arcolab Private Limited\", \"endDate\": \"Thu Nov 10\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Fri Sep 10\", \"description\": \"Handled TrackWise module Enhancements such as QMS (CAPA,\\r\\nChange Management, Deviation, OOS, OOT, Alert etc.,), Document\\r\\nManagement System, Audit Management, Vendor Management.\\r\\nPerformed Impact assessment & Risk management factors as part of\\r\\nTrackWise version upgrade from 8.7 to 10.1\\r\\nTesting the TrackWise workflows against the user requirement and\\r\\ndesign specifications. \\r\\nTrackWise administrative activities such as creation of user accounts\\r\\nagainst the request form, person account creation, assigning user\\r\\nprivileges, inactivation of user ID and updating the selection values.\\r\\nCreation and review of user manuals, Design Specifications, standard\\r\\noperating procedure against the TrackWise workflow. \\r\\nInvolvement in the execution activities of TrackWise workflow against\\r\\nthe Qualification protocol.\\r\\nWorked on L1, L2, L3 & L4 support & having knowledge on Incident &\\r\\nError management.\\r\\nHandled QMS activities such as CAPA, Change Management,\\r\\nDeviation & Audit observations.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2021\", \"degree\": \"Bachelor of Engineering in Computer Science and Engineering\", \"result\": \"71\", \"institution\": \"Visvesvaraya Technological University\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1776652168-451.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"i