 \"Window Installation\", \"Wifi\", \"Store Management\", \"Quality Control\", \"Networking\", \"Troubleshooting\", \"Technical Support\", \"WLan\", \"Switches\", \"OSPF\", \"Windows Server\", \"Routing\", \"Operating systems\", \"Network Security\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-13 17:33:55.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"It Support Engineer\", \"company\": \"Ebix Cash Mobility Software India ltd\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('5850d9eb-9224-4016-94a0-5f7722dd8224','842257d3-593e-4066-b8e6-77182660760a','Technical Project Manager with 11+ years across digital banking, digital lending and enterprise application delivery, \r\noperating at a program level across multiple concurrent workstreams. Currently an IT Lead Consultant at Infosys for \r\nICICI Bank, runni','Technical Project Manager with 11+ years across digital banking, digital lending and enterprise application delivery, \r\noperating at a program level across multiple concurrent workstreams. Currently an IT Lead Consultant at Infosys for \r\nICICI Bank, running two Agile squads and coordinating 40+ stakeholders spanning engineering, QA, architecture, \r\ninfrastructure, network and partner teams. Own the delivery lifecycle end to end — program governance, roadmap \r\nand quarterly planning, risk and dependency management, resource planning, estimation, SOW and commercial \r\nmanagement — through to production go-live. Engineering background in Java, Spring Boot, microservices, REST/SOAP \r\nAPIs, Angular, Redis, MongoDB/Oracle and Kubernetes/OpenShift; that depth is what lets me push back on unrealistic \r\ntimelines and unblock engineering teams directly instead of just tracking status.','Technical Project Manager (IT Lead Consultant)',6,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1790774392-244.pdf',NULL,'[\"Java\", \"Hibernate\", \"Angular\", \"Microservices\", \"Kubernetes\", \"AWS\", \"Github\", \"Spring Boot\", \"Spring Batch\", \"Spring Data JPA\", \"REST API\", \"Oracle\", \"CI/CD\", \"Project Management\"]','PUBLIC','2026-10-01 00:46:58.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Technical Project Manager (IT Lead Consultant)\", \"company\": \"Infosys Limited\", \"endDate\": \"Sun Sep 20\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Wed Jan 05\", \"description\": \"• Run end-to-end delivery for ICICI\'s Retail Internet Banking (~1 crore active users, 250+ APIs) and Cooperative Bank \\r\\nInternet Banking (~12 lakh users, 150+ APIs) platforms, coordinating 40+ stakeholders across two Agile squads and \\r\\npartner teams at a program level. \\r\\n• Manage a 25-member team — 20 developers plus QA and delivery staff — covering day-to-day work allocation, \\r\\nmentoring and onboarding, performance feedback, and resolving the conflicts that come with a team this size. \\r\\n• Run two concurrent Agile workstreams on 15-day sprints, holding ~140 story points of velocity against a backlog of \\r\\n1,000+ points. 40+ sprints delivered over three years, with estimation accuracy and team maturity improving \\r\\nsteadily along the way. \\r\\n• Own the commercial side too: SOW preparation, effort estimation, capacity planning, milestone billing and \\r\\nfinancial tracking for banking programs valued above ₹20 crore. \\r\\n• Sit across the table from bank AVPs, product and technology leadership, architects and vendor teams on a \\r\\nrecurring cadence — daily client syncs, weekly steering reviews, monthly management reviews, and periodic \\r\\nsenior stakeholder workshops. \\r\\n• Track risks, dependencies and decisions in Jira, Excel and Infosys Propel, and own the escalation path when things \\r\\ngo sideways — release readiness, production readiness, DR and business continuity all fall under this. \\r\\n• Get pulled into architecture and technical solution discussions often — APIs, microservices, integration, \\r\\nperformance, cloud/platform changes — and help align architects and developers on HLDs through to sign-off. \\r\\n• After a rough go-live, led the Retail Internet Banking performance recovery effort: ran the war room, drove root\\r\\ncause analysis with Lighthouse and profiling tools, and traced the slowdown to JS bundle size, duplicate API calls \\r\\nand a bad loading sequence. \\r\\n• The fix involved lazy loading, bundle optimization, cutting redundant API calls, restructuring components, deferring \\r\\nnon-critical CSS, Brotli compression, and evaluating CDN/server-side rendering options. Pre-login load time \\r\\ndropped from ~15–16 seconds to under 6.\"}, {\"title\": \"Deputy Manager\", \"company\": \"IndusInd Bank IT\", \"endDate\": \"Wed Dec 15\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Wed Jul 10\", \"description\": \"• Worked across digital banking and lending initiatives including Credit Card Migration, Indus Mobile Banking and \\r\\nthe Personal Loan App. \\r\\n• Coordinated the credit-card migration from Mastercard to Fiserv, working across application, infrastructure and \\r\\nsecurity teams on environment setup, deployment, testing and architecture sign-off. \\r\\n• Drove the move to containerized deployment on Kubernetes/VMware Tanzu — learned the platform on the job \\r\\nwhile resolving environment and deployment dependencies for the team. \\r\\n• Built and integrated Java/Spring REST services, and handled production and UAT issue resolution across these \\r\\ninitiatives.\"}, {\"title\": \"Development and Integration\", \"company\": \"L&T Finance\", \"endDate\": \"Wed Oct 10\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Thu Sep 10\", \"description\": \"• Worked on digital lending applications for two-wheeler and farm loans — turned business requirements into \\r\\ntechnical specs, built backend services and REST APIs, and coordinated delivery between business and technology \\r\\nteams.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2014\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech, Computer Science & Engineering\", \"result\": \"68\", \"institution\": \"Priyadarshini College of Computer Sciences\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1790774392-244.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('58565d6a-d67e-4437-9a7d-b11454411a38','f42d4034-641f-4d2a-a7b8-94ede06d37d0','Test Resume96','Test Resume96','Software Deve',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Java\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-26 20:46:50.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Deve\", \"company\": \"Mphasis \", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[{\"year\": \"\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech\", \"result\": \"\", \"institution\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('5856860b-61f6-41d1-9d61-23668009158b','bee7a0b1-7404-43c7-963e-e63253c41174','Azure Cloud Engineer',NULL,'Azure Cloud Engineer',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Java\", \"C++\", \"Cloud Migration\", \"Data Structures\", \"C\", \"SQL\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-16 11:31:51.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"Azure Cloud Engineer\", \"company\": \"Tata Consultancy Services\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('58688437-d59d-43c2-b5ae-ef8b6b9ec380','08d752c2-b1e1-463a-ae67-2775ed44bca7','Experienced Java Developer with 4 years of experience in designing and developing scalable backend systems using Java,\r\nSpring, Spring Boot, Hibernate, JSP and Microservices. Expertise in creating RESTful APIs, implementing business logic, and\r\nintegratin','Experienced Java Developer with 4 years of experience in designing and developing scalable backend systems using Java,\r\nSpring, Spring Boot, Hibernate, JSP and Microservices. Expertise in creating RESTful APIs, implementing business logic, and\r\nintegrating MySQL, MongoDB, and Redis databases. Skilled in TDD, CI/CD pipelines, Git, SVN, and Maven, ensuring highquality and maintainable code through Design Patterns and best coding pract