abase security, ensuring 100% compliance with corporate IT and audit standards. \\r\\n• Championed process improvements through Lean Green Belt initiatives, reducing system downtime and boosting team productivity by \\r\\n20%. \\r\\n• Mentored and led a cross-functional team of 6, enhancing team skillsets through hands-on training and knowledge-sharing sessions.\"}, {\"title\": \"Junior Engineer & Senior Specialist\", \"company\": \"Growth Path\", \"endDate\": \"Tue Sep 29\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Tue Nov 30\", \"description\": \"• Engineered and deployed MES configurations for key manufacturing processes, including MSD control, IDM tracking (thawing time, shelf \\r\\nlife, floor life), and serial number automation. \\r\\n• Integrated MES with production equipment and ERP systems, enabling real-time defect tracking and data analytics for continuous \\r\\nimprovement. \\r\\n• Collaborated with quality and production teams to develop and refine assembly workflows, resulting in reduced rework and improved \\r\\nline efficiency. \\r\\n• Acted as a key support resource during plant audits and system validations, ensuring compliance with manufacturing standards and \\r\\ndocumentation protocols.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2010\", \"degree\": \"Master of Computer Applications\", \"result\": \"66\", \"institution\": \"Anna University\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1761338329-502.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('59dd5cc1-8ad1-4a02-acee-bd39e6f643c6','53d27092-d5a1-4ccc-bea9-b2f9ccbcb00b','Test Resume835','Test Resume835','Software Deve',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Java\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-25 12:04:56.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Deve\", \"company\": \"TCS\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[{\"year\": \"\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech\", \"result\": \"\", \"institution\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]