ise in ThingWorx installation, configuration, customization, and AMU (Asset Monitoring and \r\nUtilization) implementation. \r\n• Skilled in troubleshooting and resolving issues related to ThingWorx Platform, connectivity, integrations, and \r\ndata flow. \r\n• Troubleshooting: Skilled in identifying and resolving issues related to the Thingworx Platform, connectivity, \r\nand data flow.  \r\n• Experience working with Axeda and eMessage Connector for medical device connectivity and integration \r\nwith ThingWorx. \r\n• Strong knowledge of JavaScript, Python, Kepware, Axeda, IoT integrations, and industrial connectivity \r\nsolutions.','ThingWorx Developer',4,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1781626282-601.pdf',NULL,'[\"JavaScript\", \"Eclipse\", \"Python\", \"MS SQL Developer\", \"PostgreSQL\", \"ThingWorx\", \"Kepware\", \"MQTT\", \"Visual Studio\"]','PUBLIC','2026-06-17 03:39:55.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"ThingWorx Developer\", \"company\": \"Wipro\", \"endDate\": \"Wed Jun 10\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Wed Feb 05\", \"description\": \"• Built a real-time monitoring system with data storage, enabling continuous analysis and operational \\r\\nvisibility \\r\\n• Designed and developed an IoT-based medical device monitoring solution using Axeda and eMessage \\r\\nConnector for seamless device connectivity with ThingWorx. \\r\\n• Added a feature in Axeda to monitor available C Drive storage and total C Drive capacity for each device \\r\\nand transmit the data to ThingWorx for centralized monitoring. \\r\\n• Implemented functionality to remotely push software updates and patches, improving device performance \\r\\nand reliability \\r\\n• Resolved multiple critical application issues, ensuring high availability, stability, and minimal disruption to \\r\\nbusiness operations. \\r\\n• Designed and developed a responsive dashboard to monitor and track package transfer status for assets, \\r\\nimproving real-time visibility and operational tracking.\"}, {\"title\": \"ThingWorx Developer\", \"company\": \"Pratiti Technologies\", \"endDate\": \"Wed Nov 20\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Thu Oct 05\", \"description\": \"The primary goal of the program is to track the effectiveness and performance of the machine.  \\r\\n• The MQTT protocol is utilized to collect machine data, and Kepware is used to transport this data to \\r\\nThingWorx AMU, which is used for asset monitoring.  \\r\\n• A custom dashboard created for OEE and other performance KPIs, SQL and JavaScript programming are used \\r\\nto calculate KPIs.  \\r\\n• Developed shift configuration (CRUD) operation.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2021\", \"degree\": \"B. Tech (CSE)\", \"result\": \"7.69\", \"institution\": \"Hitkarini College of Engineering  and Technology\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1781626282-601.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('5bc40c57-d375-4cdf-b7ad-90e084b29275','90d6f2a1-f356-420f-b1e5-1e4932f59237','Test Resume296','Test Resume296','Software Deve',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"SmartComm\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-26 17:40:10.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Deve\", \"company\": \"OnPassive\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[{\"year\": \"\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech\", \"result\": \"\", \"institution\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('5bd03884-6eff-458d-abf1-7debe298d0de','765606c9-8be1-4e84-87c5-e67c12ec1300','To secure a challenging position where I can effectively utilize my technical skills and expertise as a software\r\nprofessional. I am eager to contribute to the success of a dynamic team by applying my competencies in\r\nsoftware development, problem-solving','To secure a challenging position where I can effectively utilize my technical skills and expertise as a software\r\nprofessional. I am eager to contribute to the success of a dynamic team by applying my competencies in\r\nsoftware development, problem-solving, and continuous learning','Freelane Technologies Pvt',4,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1767775256-955.pdf',NULL,'[\"Java\", \"JDBC\", \"Hibernate\", \"HTML\", \"CSS\", \"Kafka\", \"Git\", \"Springboot Microservices\", \"Spring\", \"MYSQL\", \"Tomcat Server\", \"REST API\"]','PUBLIC','2026-01-07 21:08:19.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Freelane Technologies Pvt\", \"company\": \"Software Developer\", \"endDate\": \"Mon Jan 09\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Wed Mar 04\", \"description\": \"escription:\\r\\n ATM Console is an application that will help various Banks to get the Status of ATMs, Failures at\\r\\nATMs, and Balance at ATMs for various Denominations. We were developing this with Spring Boot/Micro\\r\\nservices Architecture which helped Bank to get a Good Performing Tool. We are also planning to add\\r\\nEnhancements and New Requirements needed by Banks.\\r\\nEnvironment: Java, Spring boot, Microservices, Spring MVC, JSP, Hibernate, Servlet.\\r\\nResponsibilities:\\r\\n Used Spring Hibernate for Querying data from the database.\\r\\n Involved in developing Controllers using Spring MVC.\\r\\n Implementation of Web Pages in JSP using Java Script for validations.\\r\\n Implementation of Web Pages using JSP and HTML.\\r\\n Implement the code as per design. Developed business logic.\\r\\n Develop the site and integrating the dynamic pages with the static designs\"}, {\"title\": \"Software Developer\", \"company\": \"Deloitte\", \"endDate\": \"Sat Jan 31\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Tue Jun 13\", \"description\": \"Description:\\r\\n Plutus Tracker System is a smart financial management tool that helps users track income,\\r\\nexpenses, and budgets. It provides real-time insights and personalized alerts to support better money\\r\\ndecisions. Users can set financial goals, monitor progress, and manage multiple accounts in one place. With\\r\\na secure and user-friendly interface, Plutus makes financial control simple and efficient.\\r\\nEnvironment: REST full Web services Java and J2EE, Hibernate, Jenkins, Maven, Log4J, Spring Boot, Micro\\r\\nServices, HTML, CSS, Agile methodology, Git, JSP, Kafka, Docker, MySQL Database\\r\\nResponsibilities:  Automated expense travel tracking (Spring Boot) eliminating 95% manual data entry,\\r\\nreducing old system leakages.  Developed self-service attendance system using React for employee convenience.  Secured with JWT automated deployments (Code Pipeline). Scaled architecture (RDS DB, S3\\r\\nassets) on Elastic Beanstalk (EC2).  Participated in debugging and optimizing back-end code to improve application\\r\\nperformance and maintainability.  Collaborated with front-end developers and QA teams to ensure smooth end-to-end\\r\\napplication functionality\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2020\", \"degree\": \"Computer Science\", \"result\": \"Yes\", \"institution\": \"BGMIT Mudhol\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1767775256-955.pdf\", \"title\": \"cv\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('5bd0f5fd-289b-4f98-a179-bbdb6f362944','bd0cc2dd-b3b4-4fe0-90bc-3f25035a9d62','HR Executive',NULL,'HR Executive',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','PUBLIC','2025-05-14 19:32:15.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"HR Executive\", \"company\": \"Creative Clothex\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]',405000.00,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('5bd35497-6a58-4aa7-bc4e-17bb328180a6','111f9318-3a41-47d0-84f8-4379ac528695','I am a highly motivated professional with 5.6 years of overall\r\nexperience, including 3.8 years of hands-on IT experience as\r\na Database Developer, with the remaining experience in nonIT roles. My IT background includes successful database\r\nmigrations, pe','I am a highly motivated professional with 5.6 years of overall\r\nexperience, including 3.8 years of hands-on IT experience as\r\na Database Developer, with the remaining experience in nonIT roles. My IT background includes successful database\r\nmigrations, performance tuning, and optimization. I thrive in\r\ncollaborative environments and continuously seek to enhance\r\nmy technical expertise while delivering high-quality database\r\nsolutions.','Postgre SQL Developer',6,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1768910192-8.pdf',NULL,'[\"AWS\", \"JIRA\", \"Linux\", \"ETL\", \"SQL\", \"Spring Test\", \"SQL Server\", \"PostgreSQL\"]','PUBLIC','2026-01-21 00:23:55.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Postgre SQL Developer\", \"company\": \"SUREMIND SOLUTIONS\", \"endDate\": \"Fri Jan 30\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Tue Jun 10\", \"description\": \"Database solutions development for various clients\\r\\n• Creating and modifying Stored Procedures, Triggers, Function, and Views in SQL\\r\\n• Using AWS SCT tool to migrate data from T-SQL to Postgre SQL database\\r\\n• Developing and optimizing SQL queries for efficient data retrieval\\r\\n• Collaborating with developers and analysts to enhance database functionality\"}, {\"title\": \"MS SQL Developer\", \"company\": \"SUMED TECHNOLOGIES\", \"endDate\": \"Wed May 14\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Wed Nov 15\", \"description\": \"Engaged in SQL database development\\r\\n• Developing and optimizing SQL queries for efficient data retrieval\\r\\n• Creating and modifying Stored Procedures, Triggers, and Views in SQL\\r\\n• Analyzing query performance and optimizing execution plans\\r\\n• Working with JIRA for task management and issue tracking\\r\\nSUMMARY\\r\\nI am a highly motivated professional with 5.6 years of overall\\r\\nexperience, including 3.8 years of hands-on IT experience as\\r\\na Database Developer, with the remaining experience in nonIT roles. My IT background includes successful database\\r\\nmigrations, performance tuning, and optimization. I thrive in\\r\\ncollaborative environments and continuously seek to enhance\\r\\nmy technical expertise while delivering high-quality database\\r\\nsolutions.\\r\\nKEY ACHIEVEMENTS\\r\\nDatabase Migration Project\\r\\nSuccessfully migrated several legacy databases to\\r\\nAWS, optimizing data retrieval and enhancing\\r\\nservice delivery\\r\\n• Implementing database security best practices for access control and data\\r\\nprotection\\r\\n• Collaborating with developers and analysts to enhance database functionality\"}, {\"title\": \"PostgreSQL Developer\", \"company\": \"Teamware Solutions\", \"endDate\": \"Wed Oct 18\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Wed Jun 15\", \"description\": \"Designed and implemented database solutions using PostgreSQL\\r\\n• Created and optimized complex SQL queries, Stored Procedures, and Triggers\\r\\n• Participated in daily scrum meetings and sprint planning to gather requirements\\r\\n• Improved query performance and database efficiency\\r\\n• Conducted data migration and transformation between different database systems\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1768910192-8.pdf\", \"title\": \"cv\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('5bd91e5f-b88a-4fe7-b7ce-4f1910676d10','2811eb48-66d6-4940-9f56-db7d5bb95241',' Senior Data & Analytics Engineering Professional with 6+ years of experience \r\narchitecting enterprise-grade ETL/ELT ecosystems, Lakehouse architectures and scalable \r\nanalytics platforms within Microsoft Fabric and Azure environments. \r\n Proven expert',' Senior Data & Analytics Engineering Professional with 6+ years of experience \r\narchitecting enterprise-grade ETL/ELT ecosystems, Lakehouse architectures and scalable \r\nanalytics platforms within Microsoft Fabric and Azure environments. \r\n Proven expertise in designing end-to-end data pipeline engineering frameworks using \r\nPySpark, Dataflow Gen2 and Fabric Pipelines, enabling cross-platform data integration \r\nacross SQL Server, PostgreSQL, SharePoint, and cloud ecosystems. \r\n Strong command over Enterprise BI Architecture, delivering governed semantic models, \r\nKPI-driven reporting frameworks and high-performance Power BI dashboards supporting \r\nexecutive and operational decision-making. \r\n Specialized in large-scale query engineering, performance optimization, incremental \r\nrefresh strategies, and partition-based data modeling to enhance efficiency across high\r\nvolume analytical workloads. \r\n Extensive experience building automation-first enterprise ecosystems leveraging \r\nPower Platform, advanced VBA frameworks, and orchestration solutions to eliminate \r\nmanual dependencies and accelerate operational throughput. \r\n Adept at implementing data governance frameworks, lineage traceability \r\nmechanisms, data quality validation layers & structured transformation architectures \r\naligned with enterprise reporting and compliance standards. \r\n Experienced in translating complex business requirements into scalable data models, \r\nanalytics engineering solutions, and structured insights supporting ESG research, \r\noperational analytics, compliance monitoring, and capacity planning.','Associate',4,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1776437977-258.pdf',NULL,'[\"Data Modeling\", \"ETL\", \"Delta Lake\", \"Power BI\", \"ADF\", \"ADLS Gen2\", \"MYSQL\", \"Power Automate\", \"ELT Pipelines\"]','PUBLIC','2026-04-18 02:26:37.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Associate\", \"company\": \"Morningstar Sustainalytics\", \"endDate\": \"Wed Apr 15\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Wed Aug 10\", \"description\": \" Designing ETL/ELT pipelines in Microsoft Fabric using PySpark and Dataflow Gen2 to \\r\\ningest, transform & standardize data from SQL Server, PostgreSQL & Excel; implementing \\r\\nscalable Medallion Architecture (Bronze–Silver–Gold) for refined data layers. \\r\\n Automating orchestration via Fabric Pipelines, enabling scheduled refreshes, dependency\\r\\nbased execution, unified semantic models, and near real-time Power BI reporting. \\r\\n Configured secure connectivity between Fabric Data Factory and Amazon S3 using Access \\r\\nKeys, IAM credentials, and linked service configurations. \\r\\n Spearheading data architecture initiatives, defining lakehouse design principles, data \\r\\ndomain segregation, access frameworks and cross-platform data integration standards \\r\\nacross SQL, Fabric, and cloud ecosystems. \\r\\n Owning end-to-end data lifecycle management, including ingestion strategy, \\r\\ntransformation governance, archival frameworks, retention policies and performance \\r\\nbenchmarking across analytical workloads. \\r\\n Designing scalable metadata management and data cataloging frameworks to enhance \\r\\ndiscoverability, lineage transparency, and audit-readiness across ESG data assets. \\r\\n Leading large-scale query engineering and performance optimization programs, \\r\\nimplementing indexing strategies, workload balancing, partitioning logic, and compute \\r\\noptimization for high-volume datasets. \\r\\n Partnering with business stakeholders to translate strategic objectives into KPI-driven \\r\\ndata models, implementing structured metric hierarchies and governed semantic layers. \\r\\n Architected CI/CD framework in Microsoft Fabric using Azure DevOps Git integration. \\r\\nEstablished branching strategy (feature → dev → prod), automated deployment pipelines \\r\\nfor artifact promotion, and implemented environment-specific parameterization to \\r\\nmanage Dev and Prod configurations, ensuring governed, scalable, and auditable data \\r\\nplatform releases. \\r\\n Defining data security and access governance policies, implementing role-based access \\r\\ncontrols (RBAC) and compliance-aligned data handling practices.\"}, {\"title\": \"Research Analyst\", \"company\": \"S&P Global Sustainable1\", \"endDate\": \"Tue Aug 30\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Tue Nov 10\", \"description\": \" Designed Power Automate-based bulk email autom