tronic Signature (ER/ES) \\r\\nAssessments, Traceability Matrices, and System \\r\\nValidation Plans. \\r\\n• Collaborated with automation engineers and QA teams to \\r\\nensure accurate data flow, secure role-based access, and \\r\\nvalidated system interoperability. \\r\\n• Ensured complete audit trail integrity and compliance \\r\\nthrough retrospective validation and gap assessments. \\r\\n•  Performed change control impact evaluations, \\r\\nsupported CAPA implementation, and coordinated \\r\\ntechnical evaluations with vendors and equipment \\r\\nsuppliers. \\r\\n• Enabled MES platform validation for batch traceability, \\r\\nproduction tracking, and recipe management, focusing \\r\\non compliance with data integrity standards. \\r\\n• Participated in internal QA audits and vendor \\r\\nqualification exercises, showcasing validation coverage \\r\\nand regulatory preparedness.\"}, {\"title\": \"IT CSV\", \"company\": \"Laurus Lab Ltd.\", \"endDate\": \"Mon Oct 31\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Sat Aug 01\", \"description\": \"• Grasping the Risk-Based Life Cycle approach (V Shape \\r\\nModel) for Computerized System Validation aligned with \\r\\nGAMP 5 guidelines and compliance with FDA \\r\\nregulations such as 21 CFR Part 11 and EU Annexure 11. \\r\\n• Conducting High-Level Risk Assessments. \\r\\n• Categorizing software in accordance with GAMP 5 \\r\\nstandards. \\r\\n• Defining Validation deliverables. \\r\\n• Managing the inventory of Computerized Systems. \\r\\n• Executing periodic validation of computerized systems. \\r\\n• Reviewing and approving CSV documents, including \\r\\nURS, GxP and System Criticality Assessments, \\r\\nElectronic Records and Electronic Signature (ER-ES) \\r\\nAssessments, Vendor Assessments, QRA, System \\r\\nValidation Plans, IQ, OQ, PQ scripts and Testing, \\r\\nTraceability Matrix and system validation reports. \\r\\n• Maintaining a strong focus on Compliance during QA \\r\\nreviews of validation documentation, ensuring \\r\\ncompliance in both prospective and retrospective \\r\\nvalidation of IT systems.\"}, {\"title\": \"Executive\", \"company\": \"Lupin Ltd.\", \"endDate\": \"Mon Aug 10\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Sun Apr 01\", \"description\": \"• Managed laboratory compliance activities including \\r\\ndocumentation control, equipment calibration \\r\\nscheduling, and preventive maintenance plans. \\r\\n• Conducted full lifecycle CSV activities for lab-based IT \\r\\nsystems, ensuring traceability and compliance with FDA \\r\\nrequirements and data integrity guidelines. \\r\\n• Reviewed electronic records, performed audit trail \\r\\nevaluations, and validated software platforms for secure \\r\\ndata capture and electronic signature usage. \\r\\n• Authored and maintained Standard Operating \\r\\nProcedures (SOPs), conducted protocol reviews, and \\r\\nimplemented change controls and deviation management. \\r\\n• Planned and executed finished product analysis \\r\\nprograms, aligning with QA and QC budget forecasts \\r\\nand regulatory expectations. \\r\\n• Designed and executed department-wide training \\r\\ncalendars, delivered technical onboarding for new team \\r\\nmembers, and coordinated external learning \\r\\nengagements. \\r\\n• Actively participated in major regulatory audits \\r\\n(USFDA, MHRA, WHO) by presenting validation \\r\\nevidence, compliance metrics, and audit trail assessments. \\r\\n• Successfully implemented Global Quality Standards at \\r\\nthe laboratory level, ensuring cross-functional adherence \\r\\nand harmonized practices.\"}, {\"title\": \"Quality Control\", \"company\": \"Glenmark Pharmaceutical Ltd.\", \"endDate\": \"Mon Apr 30\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Sat Jun 01\", \"description\": \"• Managed calibration schedules and validated laboratory \\r\\nQC instruments in compliance with GLP protocols and \\r\\nregulatory standards. \\r\\n• Planned, prepared, and maintained working standards, \\r\\nensuring accuracy, traceability, and readiness for \\r\\nanalytical procedures. \\r\\n• Took charge of Reference Standards and Primary \\r\\nStandards, overseeing their qualification, \\r\\ndocumentation, and controlled usage. \\r\\n• Provided hands-on resolution of technical troubleshooting \\r\\nfor laboratory equipment and data anomalies, minimizing \\r\\ndowntime and deviations. \\r\\n• Collaborated with Stability and Finished Product \\r\\nsections to provide analytical support and ensure \\r\\nseamless cross-departmental integration. \\r\\n• Ensured alignment with internal quality benchmarks \\r\\nthrough continuous monitoring and documentation \\r\\nreviews.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2017\", \"degree\": \"MSc in Analytical Chemistry\", \"result\": \"81\", \"institution\": \"Berhampur University\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1762409421-105.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('606c2590-0c3c-497c-b2a2-bbb25f814e8c','70fcb89c-5344-4282-aafb-46ddf28cf182','HTML Specialist',NULL,'HTML Specialist',1,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1746523424-308.docx',NULL,'[\"HTML\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-06 09:22:49.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1746523424-308.docx\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('6076964e-5a9f-4868-a803-ee3e202ff054','fc49788b-6fcb-4e72-bfa9-29ec1b409d8a','Test Resume408','Test Resume408','Software Deve',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\".NET\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-25 11:22:56.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Deve\", \"company\": \"Novact\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[{\"year\": \"\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech\", \"result\": \"\", \"institution\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('60785f97-3385-4b54-a2aa-bd5b034e6c04','d3b002bd-2052-4b7a-8de8-e2f9675bcc18','Test Resume174','Test Resume174','Software Deve',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Automati