ly involved in training programs to enhance compliance awareness among end\\r\\nusers and IT staff.\\r\\n• • Achievement: Successfully cleared ANVISA (Brazil) regulatory audit in February 2022\\r\\nwith zero IT observations, demonstrating strong IT compliance governance\"}, {\"title\": \"Assistant Manager – IT\", \"company\": \"Biological E Limited, Hyderabad\", \"endDate\": \"Thu Oct 07\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Wed Feb 26\", \"description\": \"• • Directed multiple IT validation and infrastructure enhancement projects including\\r\\nEmpower upgrades, LIMS deployment, QMS enhancement, and DSRS implementation.\\r\\n• • Led cross-functional project teams in ensuring timely delivery of CSV deliverables\\r\\naligned with GAMP5 and data integrity principles.\\r\\n• • Developed and executed validation documents (URS, DQ, IQ, OQ, PQ) for various\\r\\nlaboratory and manufacturing systems.\\r\\n• • Ensured GxP systems met business and compliance requirements by designing robust\\r\\nuser access management, audit trail reviews, and periodic verification.\\r\\n• • Implemented backup, restoration, and archival processes using BaraCoda and Veritas\\r\\ntools, ensuring 100% data availability for regulated systems.\\r\\n• • Managed virtualization platforms, optimizing server utilization and ensuring high\\r\\navailability of GxP systems.\\r\\n• • Served as IT Quality Representative for internal audits, CAPA implementation, and\\r\\nSOP revisions for IT processes.\\r\\n• • Achievement: Achieved 100% audit compliance with zero observations during\\r\\ninternal and external regulatory inspections.\"}, {\"title\": \"Executive – IT\", \"company\": \"Natco Pharma Limited, Chennai\", \"endDate\": \"Wed Jan 22\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Fri Feb 12\", \"description\": \"• • Administered Windows Server 2008/2012, Active Directory, DNS, DHCP, and file\\r\\nservers supporting laboratory and production environments.\\r\\n• • Installed and validated Empower 3 systems across multiple laboratory instruments,\\r\\nincluding client/server architecture and standalone setups.\\r\\n• • Ensured consistent daily data backups (hot and cold) and quarterly data verification\\r\\nacross GxP systems as per SOPs.\\r\\n• • Configured and managed McAfee EPO antivirus solutions to maintain secure and\\r\\nvalidated systems.\\r\\n• • Developed and maintained IT SOPs for system administration, user management, and\\r\\ndisaster recovery.\\r\\n• • Provided SAP MM and PP module user access support and change request handling for\\r\\nproduction and procurement functions.\\r\\n• • Supported regulatory inspections (USFDA 2016 & 2019) achieving zero IT-related\\r\\nfindings, demonstrating robust system validation and control.\\r\\n• • Led IT team in troubleshooting system and network issues, ensuring minimal\\r\\ndowntime in a regulated manufacturing setup.\\r\\n• • Achievement: Played a key role in two successful USFDA audits, contributing to the\\r\\ncompany’s compliance record.\"}, {\"title\": \"System Administrator\", \"company\": \"Natco Pharma Limited, Hyderabad\", \"endDate\": \"Fri Jan 15\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Fri Sep 11\", \"description\": \"• • Managed Windows Server 2003/2008 infrastructure, user authentication, and Active\\r\\nDirectory domain policies.\\r\\n• • Performed daily, weekly, and monthly backups of all production servers using Veritas\\r\\nBackup Exec.\\r\\n• • Supported the installation, maintenance, and troubleshooting of hardware, switches,\\r\\nrouters, and LAN printers.\\r\\n• • Configured Outlook clients, managed user mailboxes, and resolved connectivity issues.\\r\\n• • Ensured proper segregation of GxP and non-GxP networks as per IT compliance\\r\\nstandards\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2003\", \"degree\": \"Computer Science\", \"result\": \"Yes\", \"institution\": \"Anna University\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1764592154-631.PDF\", \"title\": \"cv\", \"isDefault