18.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Data Engineer\", \"company\": \"Accenture\", \"endDate\": \"Wed Apr 29\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Wed Jul 16\", \"description\": \"Designed and developed scalable ETL pipelines in Databricks using PySpark and SQL to ingest, transform, and\\r\\nprocess large volumes of pharmaceutical data.\\r\\n• Built and implemented data quality frameworks to identify, filter, and remediate bad or inconsistent data,\\r\\nensuring reliable and accurate datasets for downstream analytics.\\r\\n• Utilized Unity Catalog for centralized data governance, lineage tracking, and access control across multiple\\r\\nworkspaces.\\r\\n• Optimized Delta Lake tables and ETL workflows for improved performance, scalability, and cost efficiency.\\r\\nCollaborated with data engineering, analytics, and business teams to design and deploy robust end-to-end\\r\\ndata solutions in Databricks.\\r\\n• Worked in Agile/Scrum environment, participating in sprint planning, code reviews, and continuous\\r\\nintegration to enhance project delivery.\\r\\n• Performed performance tuning and troubleshooting of PySpark jobs, optimizing cluster configurations and\\r\\nquery execution times\\r\\n• Developed automated data validation and reconciliation scripts to maintain consistency across raw, staging,\\r\\nand curated layers.\\r\\n• Contributed to continuous improvement of data engineering standards and reusable code components to\\r\\nenhance productivity and maintainability\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2020\", \"degree\": \"Computer Science\", \"result\": \"Yes\", \"institution\": \"MJPRU\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1776168684-667.pdf\", \"title\": \"cv\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('6095fcfe-9f93-4872-8d37-acff848c7e6c','22fbe967-3e87-4418-9aa1-b3183b23e484','Power BI and Microsoft Fabric professional with 4.5+ years of experience designing and delivering enterprise-grade\r\ndashboards, paginated reports,