ure. Proven expertise in implementing security standards, \r\nnetwork segmentation, and hardening of OT/IC','A dedicated Systems Engineer with 10+ years of experience across IT and OT environments, specializing \r\nin securing industrial and critical infrastructure. Proven expertise in implementing security standards, \r\nnetwork segmentation, and hardening of OT/ICS systems. Strong background in configuration, \r\ntroubleshooting, and operational resilience of complex infrastructure.','Systems Engineer (Part of Etimad Holdings / EDGE Group)',6,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1771859409-420.pdf',NULL,'[\"McAfree\", \"CentOS\", \"Cisco IOS\", \"Azure\", \"VMware\", \"ServiceNow\", \"SolarWinds\", \"Windows Server\", \"Ubuntu\", \"Nexus\", \"Router\"]','PUBLIC','2026-02-24 03:27:31.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Systems Engineer (Part of Etimad Holdings / EDGE Group)\", \"company\": \"Al Fahad Communications and Networking Solutions\", \"endDate\": \"Fri Feb 20\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Thu Mar 10\", \"description\": \" 4 years of experience working as Site Systems Engineer for a massive, air-gapped, onshore site for a \\r\\nGovernment client in Abu Dhabi Emirate overseeing over 1000+ devices including a wide range of \\r\\ntechnologies like Hyper Converged Infrastructure, Virtualized Servers, Networking devices, ICS \\r\\ndevices, Cameras, Radars, wide range of Sensors, and other IIoT devices \\r\\n Worked to ensure compliance with IEC 62443 requirements and to strengthen the overall \\r\\ncybersecurity posture of the site by conducting risk assessments, developing robust security policies, \\r\\nand implementing defense-in-depth strategies to protect critical infrastructure against cyber threats \\r\\n Managed large-scale OT and enterprise networks, leveraging existing infrastructure from Fortinet, \\r\\nCisco, HPE, Huawei, Advantech, Moxa to implement a security zone model based on Zones and \\r\\nConduits architecture, retrofitting segmentation controls into a traditionally flat ICS environment. \\r\\n Responsible for asset inventory management and high-level risk assessments, including preparation \\r\\nof target (SL-T) and achieved security level (SL-A) reports, development of security policies and \\r\\nprocedures, and communication with management to support effective assignment of resources. \\r\\n Performed preventive maintenance, active monitoring, and troubleshooting of network \\r\\ncomponents and produced weekly and monthly operational reports. \\r\\n Configured industrial switches, firewall policies, and Windows and Linux virtual machines, applying \\r\\nworking knowledge of industrial and IoT protocols including Modbus, DNP3, OPC, and MQTT. \\r\\n Executed a proof-of-concept data diode project using existing site hardware (fiber switches, \\r\\nRaspberry Pi) and open-source solutions to enable unidirectional data transfer for secure file access \\r\\nand telemetry collection \\r\\n Contributed to an estimated 40% improvement in overall security posture of the existing \\r\\ninfrastructure and identified 100+ security issues across vendor-supplied OT security products. \\r\\n Have good experience working with IDS solutions like Suricatta and SIEM platform like Wazuh.  \\r\\n Good Understanding of standards and frameworks like NIST 800-82, IEC 62443, UAE IA.\"}, {\"title\": \"Capgemini Technology Solutions\", \"company\": \"Windows Administrator (Associate Consultant)\", \"endDate\": \"Fri Dec 10\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Sat Aug 10\", \"description\": \" Collaborated with U.S.-based teams for 3 years to support a banking client, providing Wintel \\r\\nadministration and day-to-day operations including server administration, maintenance, patching, \\r\\nand coordination with vendors such as Cisco and HP to resolve hardware-related issues. \\r\\n Worked on landscape where 8,000 Windows servers (2003, 2008, 2008 R2, 2012 R2, 2016), 500 ESXi \\r\\nHosts and 10+ vCenter server are actively running. \\r\\n Day-to-Day Activities Includes Monitor & Manage SolarWinds linked Servers, working on Incidents \\r\\nsuch as CPU, Drive Usage, Node Down Alerts, Disk Corruption, AD Groups, Investigating Unexpected \\r\\nreboots, DNS issues with configuring windows servers to suit the clients needs. \\r\\n Good experience in VMware Web Client 6.7, VMware ESXi Host creation, Cluster Configuration \\r\\n Patching of ESXi Hosts. Worked on ESXi Upgrades from 6 to 6.5 & keeping VMware tools Up-to date. \\r\\n Troubleshooting ESXi hosts (Disconnects from Web-Client), Data store Disconnects, VM server crash, \\r\\nNetBackup via VM snapshot failure, Physical server Crash.  \\r\\n Enabling and disabling TLS 1.1, 1.2, SLS 3.0, RC4 Ciphers, 3DES Ciphers using IIS Crypto tool \\r\\n Managing Windows resources in AWS platform. Patching and Administrating EC2 instances \\r\\n Also managing rare events like Bit locker recovery for HP, cisco servers\"}, {\"title\": \"Network Analyst (Senior Systems Analyst)\", \"company\": \"IGate Global Solutions (Part of Capgemini)\", \"endDate\": \"Wed Jul 31\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Wed Aug 05\", \"description\": \" 3+ years of Successful career in WAN Technologies, Network Implementation & Troubleshooting of \\r\\nLAN/ WAN Networks based on US based banking client as Part of Network Operations Centre (NOC) \\r\\n Troubleshooting various network related issues like Circuit bouncing issues, Packet loss with not only \\r\\nlimited to Service providers (Verizon, AT&T and CenturyLink).  \\r\\n In-depth Cisco technology knowledge in administration and support.  \\r\\n Collaborating with Third Party Vendors in fixing real time issues and Troubleshooting Complex \\r\\nLAN/WAN issues, configuring and troubleshooting routing protocols. \\r\\n Attended to all employee needs and concerns regarding the network and Resolving routing and \\r\\nswitching related real time performance issues \\r\\n Acted as the Team lead for the Offshore team for more than a year and spearheaded the team \\r\\ntowards success with including implementing more Automation in our daily operations. \\r\\n Trained new employees in network operations to avoid miscommunication. \\r\\n Excellent Communication, interpersonal skills and Working Well Under pressure. \\r\\n Dealing with making reports and working with onshore on monthly meetings for tracking Progress. \\r\\n Collecting Individual Performance Reviews for the offshore resources in the team in collaboration \\r\\nwith the manager.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2015\", \"degree\": \"Bachelor of Engineering - Mechatronics Engineering\", \"result\": \"75\", \"institution\": \"Nehru Institute of Engineering and Technology, Anna University\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1771859409-420.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('6316e945-d0ff-4927-a7e0-47dd3d0ab98b','829fefb7-c591-499c-9aeb-2ae1221bca0d','Test Resume805','Test Resume805','Software Deve',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Performance Testing\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-25 12:03:00.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Deve\", \"company\": \"Publicis Sapient\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[{\"year\": \"\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech\", \"result\": \"\", \"institution\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('6322d02a-ab2e-4b43-873a-1da9489d6737','54784222-ad1f-4c22-a88a-630fbc950cdd','.net full stack developer',NULL,'.net full stack developer',2,1000000.00,NULL,NULL,'[\"Guidewire CC\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-23 16:19:30.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \".net full stack developer\", \"company\": \"0Capgemini\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]',1000000.00,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('6324bf0d-e0e8-4ed4-a6f4-ded7ffffbe4e','786d325a-51a9-4bb5-9201-a2d4ec57cae3',