stitution\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('63486a88-97d8-44ae-be68-930670941ea2','63b72da3-7226-417b-8e3a-0119402a78a1','Result-driven and detail-oriented professional with 6.5 + years of experience in pharmaceutical industry and diverse \r\nbackground in quality control, QMS, Documentation, LIMS, ELN, SAP, EDMS, CSV-Validator, Trackwise, Empower \r\nand instrumentation. I am s','Result-driven and detail-oriented professional with 6.5 + years of experience in pharmaceutical industry and diverse \r\nbackground in quality control, QMS, Documentation, LIMS, ELN, SAP, EDMS, CSV-Validator, Trackwise, Empower \r\nand instrumentation. I am seeking a challenging position where my multifaceted expertise can contribute to the \r\nefficiency, compliance, and success of a dynamic organization in the pharmaceutical industry.','Senior Executive',4,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1759499668-939.pdf',NULL,'[\"Mes\", \"GAMP5\", \"Gxp Compliance\", \"CapIQ\", \"LabWare LIMS\", \"VP\", \"OQ\", \"PQ\", \"SOP Adherence\", \"SAP\", \"QMS System\"]','PUBLIC','2025-10-03 13:43:47.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Senior Executive\", \"company\": \"SYNGENE INTEERNATIONAL PVT LTD\", \"endDate\": \"Tue Sep 30\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Tue Mar 31\", \"description\": \"• Expertise in Labware LIMS modules including Lot Management, Static data creation, Sample management, \\r\\nSample workflow, Stability Management, Calculation module, Batch release module and inventory management. \\r\\n• Deployment of ELN - Creation of template, Creation of Experimental workbook template, MES and Product MES. \\r\\n• ELN Validation deliverables and Test script execution.  \\r\\n• Report template Marking and Instrument interface with LIMS- RS232 and Lab station.  \\r\\n• Collaborated with cross-functional teams to understand the user requirements and customized LIMS solution \\r\\naccordingly. \\r\\n• Provided ongoing support to the LIMS and ELN Users. \\r\\