aster and plant. \\r\\n• Experienced in SAP Transaction codes; QA32, QA11 \\r\\n• Implementation of WMS system in SAP. \\r\\n• Expertise in operation, calibration of analytical instruments such as Analytical weighing balance, UV-VIS \\r\\nSpectrophotometer, FTIR, KF Auto titrator, Liquid particle counter, pH meter, Conductivity meter, TOC, etc., \\r\\n• QMS Activities; Handling of Change controls, deviations. \\r\\n• Preparation of SOP, STP and specifications. \\r\\n• Documentation as per GMP and GDP guidelines.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2015\", \"degree\": \"Master of science in Biochemistry\", \"result\": \"6.9\", \"institution\": \"Davanagere University\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1759499668-939.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('634abcef-d2a5-4759-a20f-2d2a6aec6217','333a4d21-9fc8-4303-a403-0840703e38fb','QA Automation Engineer with 5 years of experience in web UI automation, REST API testing, and backend database verification\r\nacross enterprise retail SaaS and ERP platforms. Proficient in architecting Java-based automation frameworks using Selenium\r\nWebDr','QA Automation Engineer with 5 years of experience in web UI automation, REST API testing, and backend database verification\r\nacross enterprise retail SaaS and ERP platforms. Proficient in architecting Java-based automation frameworks using Selenium\r\nWebDriver, TestNG, Apache POI, and Page Object Model (POM). Skilled in end-to-end transaction reconciliation with MS SQL\r\nServer/T-SQL, API validation via Postman and REST Assured, and CI/CD pipeline integration via Maven, Jenkins, and Git in Agile\r\nenvironments.','Associate Support',4,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1791299210-390.pdf',NULL,'[\"Core Java\", \"JSON\", \"Github\", \"Maven\", \"Selenium Webdriver\", \"TestNG\", \"Cucumber(BDD)\", \"REST API\", \"Postman\", \"SQL\", \"Point of Sale (POS) Systems\", \"SQL\", \"Pom (Project Object Model)\", \"API testing\"]','PUBLIC','2026-10-07 02:3