missioning a','Senior Automation Engineer with over 10 years of experience delivering end-to-end PLC, SCADA, and \r\ncontrol system solutions for complex industrial environments. Strong expertise in system design, soft-ware integration, FAT/SAT, and global commissioning across India, China, Turkey, Vietnam, and Europe. Proven ability to lead automation activities, integrate multi-vendor platforms, and support high-availability \r\nproduction systems. Seeking to apply deep technical expertise and international project experience to drive reliable, efficient automation solutions in a global industrial organization.','AUTOMATION ENGINEER',4,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1771249677-349.docx',NULL,'[\"Mes Digital Twin\", \"Beckhoff\", \"Siemens\", \"Rockwell Software\", \"Schneider\", \"Mitsubishi\", \"PLC\", \"WinCC\", \"Rockwell Factorytalk\", \"SCADA\", \"SCADA\", \"HMI\", \"Ladder Logic\", \"OPC UA\", \"Ethernet\", \"SQL Server\", \"MYSQL\", \"Python\", \"FAT / SAT\", \"SECS/GEM Standards\"]','PUBLIC','2026-02-17 02:04:08.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"AUTOMATION ENGINEER\", \"company\": \"Centrotherm International AG\", \"endDate\": \"Tue Feb 10\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Mon Dec 10\", \"description\": \"•\\tWorked with a global technology leader in semiconductor and photovoltaic production equipment, delivering advanced automation solutions for high-temperature diffusion, PECVD, and TOPCon sys-tems.\\r\\n•\\tLed software integration, commissioning, and validation of complex industrial automation systems for large-scale PV and semiconductor manufacturing lines.\\r\\n•\\tDeveloped and maintained PLC, motion control, and safety logic using Beckhoff TwinCAT 3 for \\r\\nproduction-critical equipment.\\r\\n•\\tIntegrated process subsystems including gas handling, vacuum systems, temperature control, \\r\\nmotion axes, and safety interlocks into a unified control architecture.\\r\\n•\\tExecuted onsite and remote commissioning activities for international customers, supporting \\r\\ninstallations across Europe, US, China, Turkey, Vietnam and India.\\r\\n•\\tCollaborated closely with process engineers, mechanical teams, and service engineers to resolve complex system issues during startup and ramp-up phases.\\r\\n•\\tPerformed root cause analysis and implemented long-term software improvements to enhance machine reliability, safety, and throughput.\\r\\n•\\tSupported software upgrades, feature enhancements, and bug fixes on live production tools, \\r\\nensuring minimal downtime and process stability.\\r\\n•\\tDelivered customer training and technical support, ensuring smooth handover from \\r\\ncommissioning to production operations.\"}, {\"title\": \"PLC PROGRAMMER & SCADA ENGINEER\", \"company\": \"Eagle Tk InfoTech Pvt. Ltd.\", \"endDate\": \"Fri Nov 30\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Wed Feb 10\", \"description\": \"•\\tDesigned, developed, and commissioned PLC and SCADA systems for utility infrastructure, and industrial facilities, using Siemens, CODESYS, Phoenix Contact, Mitsubishi, ABB, and Schneider Electric platforms.\\r\\n•\\tImplemented automation and control solutions for pumping stations, booster systems, \\r\\nmotor control centers (MCCs), VFDs, valves, and field instrumentation, \\r\\n•\\tDeveloped SCADA and HMI applications for real-time monitoring, alarm management, \\r\\nhistorical trending, and reporting, supporting operational visibility and regulatory requirements typical of utility and infrastructure projects.\\r\\n•\\tConfigured and tested industrial communication protocols including Modbus RTU/TCP, Profibus, Profinet, Ethernet/IP, and OPC, commonly used in oil & gas and infrastructure environments.\\r\\n•\\tPrepared complete project documentation such as control philosophies, I/O lists, loop \\r\\ndiagrams, cause-and-effect charts, wiring diagrams, and operation manuals, aligned with EPC and client standards.\\r\\n•\\tPerformed Factory Acceptance Testing (FAT) and Site