ng verbal and written communication skills and solid analytical skills for writing \r\nrelational database solutions for businesses. Also MES Engineer, Eager to contribute to learn success through hard work, \r\nattention to detail and excellent organizational skills. Clear understanding of manufacturing execution system. Motivated \r\nto learn, grow, and excel in manufacturing development.','Analyst I, IT (MES)',6,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1790588844-823.pdf',NULL,'[\"AvevaWonderware\", \"Mes\", \"MS SQL Server\", \"triggers\", \"Stored Procedures\", \"Oracle\"]','PUBLIC','2026-09-28 21:15:23.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Analyst I, IT (MES)\", \"company\": \"AVIENT MATERIALS INDIA PVT.LTD\", \"endDate\": \"Sun Sep 20\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Tue Nov 05\", \"description\": \" Provide application support for AVEVA Wonderware MES systems, ensuring smooth and uninterrupted \\r\\nmanufacturing operations.  \\r\\n Monitor and resolve production incidents and system issues within MES applications to minimize downtime.  \\r\\n Work with Wonderware System Platform and InTouch HMI for real-time process monitoring and troubleshooting.  \\r\\n Support integration between MES and ERP systems, ensuring accurate and seamless data flow.  \\r\\n Perform root cause analysis (RCA) for recurring issues and implement corrective and preventive actions.  \\r\\n Assist in configuration, testing, and deployment of MES enhancements and system updates.  \\r\\n Generate and maintain production reports, logs, and dashboards for operational performance tracking.  \\r\\n Ensure data accuracy, validation, and traceability within the MES environment.  \\r\\n Collaborate with cross-functional teams to resolve issues and improve system efficiency.  \\r\\n Maintain technical documentation, SOPs, and knowledge base articles for ongoing support activities.(KBA)\"}, {\"title\": \"MES Engineer\", \"company\": \"DANA INDIA PVT.LTD\", \"endDate\": \"Wed No