ionable insights, and enhance decision-making through data-driven\r\nstrategies.\r\n• Experience in improving data integrity and streamlining reporting processes to drive business efficiency.\r\n• Strong background in data cleansing, transformation, and integration using Power Query and ETL tools.\r\n• Strong problem-solving, stakeholder communication, and data storytelling skills with a focus on accuracy and business\r\nimpact.','Data Analyst',2,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1773228511-416.pdf',NULL,'[\"Data Collection\", \"Data Integration\", \"ETL\", \"KPI Analysis\", \"Power BI\", \"SQL\", \"VLOOKUP\", \"Dashboard Configuration\"]','PUBLIC','2026-03-11 22:57:20.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Data Analyst\", \"company\": \"ACCENTURE\", \"endDate\": \"Thu Mar 26\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Tue Oct 11\", \"description\": \"Roles & Responsibilities:\\r\\n∗ Collected, cleaned, and analyzed large datasets from various sources.\\r\\n∗ Designed and developed visually rich and interactive dashboards using Power BI.\\r\\n∗ Wrote efficient SQL queries to extract and manipulate data for reporting.\\r\\n∗ Collaborated with stakeholders to define business metrics and reporting requirements.\\r\\n∗ Automated recurring reports and dashboards to ensure timely delivery of insights.\\r\\n∗ Created and maintained documentation for data models, ETL processes, and dashboards.\\r\\n∗ Ensured data accuracy and integrity in all reports and visualizations.\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1773228511-416.pdf\", \"title\": \"cv\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('69f25356-c5cd-4b20-9232-f9b54d0f1742','235b84e6-85cd-4b23-b325-4f211a4e549c','5+ years of experience as an MES Engineer specializing in MES integration, automation, and data \r\nmanagement across industries including Solar PV, automotive, and heavy-duty trucks. \r\n▪ Proficient in React JS-based MES applications, Kepware OPC Server, SQ','5+ years of exper