o support high-volume HCM data migrations during system cutover, ensuring zero data loss.\\r\\n•\\tBuilt outbound Atom Feed integrations to ADP payroll systems, enabling accurate and incremental employee data synchronization in real time.\\r\\n•\\tDesigned BI Publisher (BIP) report-based integrations using SOAP services to extract and deliver custom datasets to external vendors, replacing manual reporting.\\r\\n•\\tAutomated ERP master data onboarding through inbound REST and FBDI-based integrations, reducing onboarding cycle time for vendors and customers.\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1781118470-593.docx\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('69f774fa-6a07-4dcd-8f68-a57d62ce8e91','a59689fc-8bc0-4b66-b067-628ff95781df','Test Resume523','Test Resume523','Software Deve',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"C#\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-24 21:38:13.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Deve\", \"company\": \"TCS\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[{\"year\": \"\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech\", \"result\": \"\", \"institution\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('69fe81c4-e2c2-439a-924f-2b1268342f55','e74dc621-f425-413a-b04b-3a61a215e4e6','Data Engineer with 4+ years of experience in designing and optimizing Azure-based Big Data solutions,\r\nspecializing in Azure Databricks, Spark, Azure Data Factory, Delta Lake, and Data Migration. Proficient in ETL/ELT,\r\nPySpark, DABs, SQL, Unity Catalog, ','Data Engineer with 4+ years of experience in designing and optimizing Azure-based Big Data solutions,\r\nspecializing in Azure Databricks, Spark, Azure Data Factory, Delta Lake, and Data Migration. Proficient in ETL/ELT,\r\nPySpark, DABs, SQL, Unity Catalog, and SAS, with expertise in data extraction, transformation, cleansing, and\r\nloading to streamline data workflows. Skilled in Medallion architecture, Data Lakehouse management, and\r\ns