s and Work Instruction Devices. \r\n Adept in analyzing the repetitive problems and root cause solutions. \r\n Good understanding on how to integrate shop floor systems with MES and ERP. \r\n  Good knowledge about middleware software’s (TM WIN Expression and PIO) communication with \r\nPLCs such as Siemens and Mitsubishi \r\n  TCP/IP and RS-232 communication with devices like Line Printers, Label printers, Industrial Barcode \r\nscanners and OEM Machines…etc \r\n Extensive knowledge on PLC Data collection integrating with customer MES systems Such as ORACLE, \r\nTibero and MS SQL DB','Mes Specialist',1,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1750849583-774.pdf',NULL,'[\"Mes\", \"ERP\", \"CSS\", \"Excel\", \"TCP\", \"Oracle\", \"MYSQL\", \"SCADA\", \"SAP\", \"MS Word\", \"PowerPoint\"]','PUBLIC','2025-06-07 00:05:17.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1750849583-774.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('6a352c5d-2762-4a8c-a669-b2b6bcac2938','4f41cdc6-52f6-4e12-9471-56947405ea80','5.7 years  experience in c++ development, with sound knowledge in debugging using VS2003',NULL,'5.7 years  experience in c++ development, with sound knowledge in debugging using VS2003',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"C++\", \"C++\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-16 11:13:41.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"5.7 years  experience in c++ development, with sound knowledge in debugging using VS2003\", \"company\": \"HCL Technologies Japan\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('6a47ed7e-4059-4872-9469-7832a9a8b1ab','9065ada6-9490-48a6-a078-be769935907e','Software Developer',NULL,'Software Developer',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Java\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-23 12:38:27.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Developer\", \"company\": \"Virtusa\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDa