war room coordination, stakeholder communication, and\\r\\ncomprehensive RCA documentation\\r\\n▸\\r\\nImplement proactive monitoring using Datadog, Check_MK, and Azure Monitor for early detection of performance degradation, resource\\r\\nexhaustion, and system anomalies\\r\\n▸\\r\\nDrive cost optimization through resource rightsizing, VM SKU optimization, disk tier analysis, and idle resource identification resulting in 15%\\r\\ninfrastructure savings\\r\\n▸\\r\\nCoordinate monthly patching cycles, security updates, SSL renewals, and upgrades through ITIL change management with zero unplanned\\r\\ndowntime\\r\\n▸\\r\\nProvide SQL Server and PostgreSQL support including health checks, backup verification, transaction log monitoring, and performance\\r\\ntroubleshooting\\r\\n▸\\r\\n▸ Monitor and resolve batch job failures (ETL pipelines, data sync, scheduled tasks) collaborating with development and data engineering teams\\r\\nPerform log analysis using Azure Log Analytics, Splunk, and Kibana to identify root causes and performance bottlenecks with KQL and SPL\\r\\nqueries\\r\\n▸\\r\\n▸ Reduced MTTR by 30% through automated alerting, proactive health checks, and creation of 40+ knowledge base articles\\r\\n▸ Create SOPs, runbooks, and troubleshooting guides improving team efficiency by 25% and reducing incident response time\\r\\n▸ Mentor junior engineers on Azure troubleshooting methodologies and cloud operations best practices\"}, {\"title\": \"Production Support Analyst\", \"company\": \"Teamware Solutions\", \"endDate\": \"Wed Sep 23\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Wed Jul 13\", \"description\": \"Delivered platform and production support for business-critical applications across Production, UAT, QA, and Development environments\\r\\nensuring 24×7 availability\\r\\n▸\\r\\n▸ Managed Azure platform operations including VM management, resource monitoring, and cloud infrastructure support for hybrid environments\\r\\nHandled P1–P4 incident lifecycle via ServiceNow with consistent SLA adherence, processing 500+ tickets monthly with 95%+ first-time\\r\\nresolution\\r\\n▸\\r\\n▸ Acted as SPOC coordinating infrastructure, database, network, security, and application teams for complex troubleshooting and RCA\\r\\nImplemented proactive monitoring using Datadog, Check_MK, and Azure Monitor ensuring early detection of performance issues and service\\r\\ndegradation\\r\\n▸\\r\\n▸ Performed Windows and Linux administration including patching, security updates, disk expansion, and performance tuning\\r\\nProvided SQL Server and Oracle database support including health monitoring, backup validation, error log analysis, and connectivity\\r\\ntroubleshooting\\r\\n▸\\r\\nParticipated in release management including pre-deployment preparation, production deployment, smoke testing, validation, and rollback\\r\\nprocedures\\r\\n▸\\r\\nManaged planned maintenance windows with stakeholder notification, change implementation, validation, and post-activity reporting ensuring\\r\\nminimal impact\\r\\n▸\\r\\n▸ Utilized Kibana and Splunk for log investigation identifying root causes, security events, and performance bottlenecks\\r\\n▸ Supported infrastructure changes including server rehosting, cloud migration, VM resizing, environment provisioning, and DR testing\\r\\n▸ Managed privileged access using CyberArk ensuring compliance with security policies and audit requirements\\r\\n▸ Created 30+ SOPs and runbooks improving operational efficiency by 20% and enabling faster onboarding\\r\\n▸ Provided 24×7 on-call support with rapid incident response and escalation management ensuring business continuity\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2020\", \"degree\": \"Computer Science\", \"result\": \"Yes\", \"institution\": \"Jawaharlal Nehru Technological University (\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1768997271-56.pdf\", \"title\": \"cv\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('6b751c4d-cdc6-49c1-9d10-a41d119f9ee2','39a40d4b-fb4c-447