 Razor Pages (MVC), HTML, CSS, and JavaScript to ensure \\r\\nresponsive and user-friendly interfaces. \\r\\n Gathered functional requirements, created technical documentation, and estimated development \\r\\nefforts for timely delivery. \\r\\n Managed code reviews, deployment activities, and administered UAT cycles while providing \\r\\nongoing client support. \\r\\n Enabled end-to-end refund processing by integrating document upload, real-time tracking, \\r\\napproval workflow, and multiple payment gateways into the portal.\"}, {\"title\": \"Senior Associate\", \"company\": \"Kanini Software Solutions Pvt. Ltd.\", \"endDate\": \"Wed May 31\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Wed Jan 10\", \"description\": \"Responsibilities: \\r\\nWorked as a Front-End Developer on auditing, consulting, and healthcare domain projects, \\r\\ndelivering responsive web applications using HTML5, SCSS, and Angular. \\r\\nResolved complex browser compatibility issues to ensure consistent UI/UX across devices and \\r\\nplatforms. \\r\\nCollaborated with cross-functional teams in an Agile environment to implement new features \\r\\nand enhance user interfaces. \\r\\nLed and managed a team of 7 developers, supervising development activities and ensuring \\r\\ntimely, high-quality deliverables.\"}, {\"title\": \"Senior Software Engineer\", \"company\": \"Infosys Pvt. Ltd. (Contract)\", \"endDate\": \"Thu Mar 30\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Tue May 10\", \"description\": \"Developed responsive web applications using HTML5, CSS3, and jQuery, while addressing \\r\\nbrowser compatibility and accessibility standards. \\r\\nEstimated effort for UI prototypes, implemented the same, and incorporated iterative feedback \\r\\nfrom project leads. \\r\\nCreated optimized JavaScript modules and leveraged Chrome Developer Tools and Firebug to \\r\\nensure high-performance front-end delivery.\"}, {\"title\": \"Senior UI Developer\", \"company\": \"Connecting Dots Technology Systems Pvt.