chnical Lead',4,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1779205626-743.pdf',NULL,'[\"Lims\", \"Incident Analysis\", \"Change Management\", \"Applications Migration\", \"AWS\", \"LabWare LIMS\", \"System Design\", \"SQL\", \"ServiceNow\", \"Validation Documentation\", \"Root Cause Analysis\", \"SDLC\"]','PUBLIC','2026-05-20 03:15:11.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Technical Lead\", \"company\": \"HCL Technologies\", \"endDate\": \"Fri May 15\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Thu Oct 05\", \"description\": \"• Support and administration of LabWare LIMS and associated laboratory systems across \\r\\nmultiple business sites. \\r\\n• Manage user accounts, security roles, access permissions, and system configurations within the \\r\\nLabWare LIMS environment. \\r\\n• Ensure continuous application availability for users across 20+ global sites, proactively \\r\\nresolving issues to minimize business impact. \\r\\n• Develop and customize LabWare LIMS modules using LIMS Basic and XML, including \\r\\ncreation and maintenance of visual workflows. \\r\\n• Apply strong knowledge of SQL, SDLC, and ITIL processes, including incident, problem, \\r\\nchange, configuration, and server management via ServiceNow. \\r\\n• Customize ServiceNow reports and maintain compliance-related documentation, SOPs, and \\r\\nlaboratory support procedures for regulated environments. \\r\\n• Configure and maintain subroutines, sites, background servers, schedulers, printers, external \\r\\ninstrument interfaces, SAP integrations, and global settings. \\r\\n• Provide functional support across multiple LabWare modules including Samples (Logging, \\r\\nResult Entry, Review, Authorization ), Tests, Lots (Creation, Review, Authorization),  \\r\\nProducts Specification Designer , Project Manager, Stability Study, Environmental \\r\\nMonitoring , ELN workbook, External Connections, Reports and Configuration Packages \\r\\n• Coordinate with global support teams and business stakeholders to res