e VoIP/media applications. Strong \r\nexpertise in concurrency, performance tuning, GC optim','• Java Technical Lead with 10+ years of experience in high-performance, multi-threaded Java systems, \r\nspecializing in backend platforms, microservices, and real-time VoIP/media applications. Strong \r\nexpertise in concurrency, performance tuning, GC optimization, production issue analysis and system \r\nmodernization. \r\n• Proven leader with hands-on experience in CI/CD setup, cloud-ready deployments, and mentoring \r\nteams to deliver scalable, reliable, production-grade systems. \r\n• Strong background in strategic planning, product ownership, cross-functional team leadership, \r\nfocused on mentoring and motivation.  \r\n• Demonstrated expertise in networking protocols, multimedia recording and communication systems.','Technical Team Lead',4,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1771532923-727.pdf',NULL,'[\"Java\", \"Microservices\", \"JPA (Java Persistence Api)\", \"Hibernate\", \"Apache Kafka\", \"J UNIT\", \"Data Integration\", \"Docker\", \"Github\", \"Confluence\", \"Spring Boot\", \"REST API\", \"Spring Redis\", \"Mockito\", \"PostgreSQL\", \"CI/CD\"]','PUBLIC','2026-02-20 08:44:50.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Technical Team Lead\", \"company\": \"OPTANIUM IT SERVICES PRIVATE LIMITED\", \"endDate\": \"Sun Feb 15\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Wed Jul 10\", \"description\": \"• Developed a Spring Boot–based microservices platform by modernizing a Windows-based legacy \\r\\nrecorder, improving scalability and deployment flexibility. \\r\\n• Architected high-throughput data persistence using PostgreSQL - Optimized schemas and queries for \\r\\nfast ingestion and retrieval. \\r\\n• Implemented server-side pagination and filtering APIs, improving performance and usability of web\\r\\nbased recording dashboards. \\r\\n• Developed Kafka producers and consumers to stream audio/video media packets to downstream \\r\\nmicroservices. \\r\\n• Implemented Redis caching to efficiently fetch audio playlists, significantly reducing database load \\r\\nand improving playback response time. \\r\\n• Integrated multiple backend services using Spring Cloud OpenFeign, enabling configurable inter\\r\\nservice communication. \\r\\n2 | Page \\r\\n \\r\\n• Migrated legacy Spring Framework modules to Spring Boot, aligning with modern microservices \\r\\narchitecture standards. \\r\\n• Dockerized backend services and established consistent CI/CD pipelines across development, QA, \\r\\nand production environments. \\r\\n• Actively participated in Agile ceremonies, sprint planning, retrospectives, and daily stand-ups. \\r\\n• Worked extensively on SIP, RTP, RTSP, and SIPREC flows for voice and video recording platforms. \\r\\n• Designed and implemented REST APIs to ingest real-time audio/video media packets and metadata \\r\\nfrom distributed VDS modules. \\r\\n• Mentored junior engineers, conducted code reviews, and enforced clean code and design best \\r\\npractices. \\r\\n• Contributed to setting up CI/CD pipelines (Git, build automation, deployment scripts), improving \\r\\nbuild reliability and reducing release cycles.\"}, {\"title\": \"Senior Protocol Engineer – R&D (JAVA)\", \"company\": \"Nexge Technologies (P) Limited\", \"endDate\": \"Fri Sep 20\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Tue Feb 10\", \"description\": \"• Designed and enhanced a Java-based SIP Proxy PBX and VAS services, ensuring low-latency and \\r\\nreliable call handling. \\r\\n• Implemented new SIP Proxy features to address evolving customer requirements and support new \\r\\nservice use cases. \\r\\n• Developed a transport manager to listen for UDP and TCP packets and forward SIP traffic to the proxy \\r\\nserver. \\r\\n• Optimized thread pools, executor services, and concurrency models, improving system stability and \\r\\ncall throughput under peak load \\r\\n• Integrated Infinispan to share and manage call state across distributed Java services, ensuring \\r\\nconsistency and high availability. \\r\\n• Implemented legal intercept, transcoding and voice recording solutions using FreeSWITCH. \\r\\n• Led Garbage Collection (GC) tuning activities (Parallel GC, CMS, G1GC), reducing GC pause times and \\r\\nimproving application responsiveness in real-time systems. \\r\\n• Analyzed and resolved complex customer-reported production issues, including call drops, one-way \\r\\naudio, high CPU usage, and memory leaks in large-scale VoIP systems. \\r\\n• Diagnosed protocol-level issues related to SIP, RTP, and media negotiation, using Wireshark and SIPP. \\r\\n• Collaborated with QA and DevOps teams to reproduce production issues, validate fixes, and improve \\r\\nrelease quality.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2014\", \"degree\": \"Bachelor of Computer Science Engineering\", \"result\": \"71\", \"institution\": \"Anna University\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1771532923-727.pdf\", \"title\": \"cv\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('6ec8f90f-524b-475c-ba76-ff0381e734bf','97a38296-da8a-48dd-9bc8-497f54fda9a0','Senior Software Designer',NULL,'Senior Software Designer',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"JavaScript\", \"Healthcare\", \"Windows Server 2012\", \"Telemedicine\", \"SQL Server\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-14 17:00:42.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"Senior Software Designer\", \"company\": \"Lumdex Healt Care pvt ltd\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('6ece2d54-b8df-43ea-b6ad-043bbe8e2110','a7a2d3c5-5f9b-46ce-8ab4-9f70a34604ff','Software Engineer',NULL,'Software Engineer',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Artificial Intelligence\", \"Data Entry\", \"Microsoft Excel\", \"C++\", \"Communication\", \"Data Analysis\", \"Analytical Skills\", \"Software Testing\", \"SQL\", \"Teamwork\", \"UNIX\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-14 17:00:26.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Eng