ch accuracy and retrieval speed.\\r\\nLeveraged Kibana dashboards to visualise search metrics, improving search performance monitoring and user experience.\\r\\nReceived special recognition for completing the project smoothly.\\r\\nIntegrated an NLU-based Engine with a Search engine and increased the search output.\\r\\nLed and contributed diverse technologies like UKG(Kronos) Integrations.\\r\\nCertified Associate Integration Architect from Dell Boomi.\\r\\nSpecial Recognition: Received special recognition for proposing the Idea and Plan for an AI+ML+NLP+Lucene-based\\r\\nsearch engine.\"}, {\"title\": \"Software Developer\", \"company\": \"Turaco Mobile Pvt Ltd\", \"endDate\": \"Wed May 16\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Thu Jun 16\", \"description\": \"Project: GreatBuyz\\r\\nLanguages & Environment: Java, Maven, Spring, Spring-boot, Hibernate, Apache Solr, Elastic Search, ELK stack, Apache\\r\\nKafka, Spring batch, Web services, MongoDB, MariaDB, XML\\r\\nDescription: GreatBuyz is a flexible, multi-channel, scalable, and highly available Mobile Marketing Platform providing\\r\\ninnovative and advanced enablers for mobile marketing through all mobile channels to connect merchants with\\r\\nconsumers.\\r\\nRole and Responsibilities:\\r\\nOrchestrated the development of GreatBuyz, a flexible, scalable, and highly available mobile marketing platform\\r\\nSpearheaded the implementation of innovative and advanced enablers for mobile marketing across all mobile channels\\r\\nFacilitated seamless connection between merchants and customers through effective mobile marketing strategies\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2016\", \"degree\": \"Computer Science\", \"result\": \"Yes\", \"institution\": \"Tezpur University,\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1770788916-571.pdf\", \"title\": \"cv\", \"isDefault\": false}, {\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1770788921-287.pdf\", \"title\": \"cv\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('6ee9d699-7ac4-44a5-