Native / Next.js) with 5+ years of experience building scalable,\r\ncross-platform applications for web and mobile (Android & iOS). Proficient in React.js, Next.js, React Native, and\r\nApache Superset frontend cu','Frontend & Mobile Developer (React.js / React Native / Next.js) with 5+ years of experience building scalable,\r\ncross-platform applications for web and mobile (Android & iOS). Proficient in React.js, Next.js, React Native, and\r\nApache Superset frontend customization. Skilled in designing and developing intuitive UIs, integrating REST\r\nAPIs, Firebase, and payment gateways, and delivering high-performance apps from design to store deployment.\r\nExperienced in creating custom Superset chart plugins, improving dashboard UX/UI, and optimizing mobile app\r\nperformance for government, enterprise, and healthcare clients. Strong collaborator in Agile sprint environments,\r\nworking closely with UI/UX, backend, and QA teams to deliver quality releases on schedule.','Frontend Developer',4,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1773403507-975.pdf',NULL,'[\".NET\", \"Docker\", \"HTML\", \"CSS\", \"Express.js\", \"DevOps\", \"NextJS\", \"Python\", \"MYSQL\"]','PUBLIC','2026-03-13 23:33:42.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Frontend Developer\", \"company\": \"Aurinpro Solutions\", \"endDate\": \"Thu Mar 26\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Tue Jun 11\", \"description\": \"Contributed to the Pragyan Nicsi government analytics project, focusing on dashboard UI and\\r\\nfrontend integration within Apache Superset.\\r\\n• Integrated and customized Superset dashboards using React.js, ensuring 99.5% uptime and smooth\\r\\nreal-time visualization.\\r\\n• Developed custom chart plugins and frontend components, reducing report generation time by 35%.\\r\\n• Improved dashboard UI/UX across web and mobile platforms, increasing user interaction efficiency by 40%.\\r\\n• Optimized Superset themes and layouts, achieving a 20% performance improvement in load speed\\r\\nand rendering.\\r\\n• Automated API analytics integration, cutting manual reporting time from hours to seconds.\\r\\n• Collaborated in Agile sprint cycles with UI/UX, backend, and QA teams for secure deployment and version\\r\\nupgrades.\"}, {\"title\": \"Senior React Native Developer\", \"company\": \"Advantal Technology Pvt. Ltd\", \"endDate\": \"Fri Dec 22\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Wed Jun 11\", \"description\": \"• Started development of TalktoAngel, a telehealth and mental wellness app for PRA Telehealth Pvt. Ltd. using\\r\\nReact Native.\\r\\n• Designed app screens and integrated APIs for authentication, therapist listings, video consultation, and\\r\\nbooking modules.\\r\\n• Worked on UI/UX design, state management, and navigation flow before project handoff.\\r\\n• Project was later completed and released with a 4.6★ rating and 500+ downloads on Play Store.\\r\\n• Contributed reusable component libraries improving development speed across projects.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2018\", \"degree\": \"Computer Science\", \"result\": \"Yes\", \"institution\": \"SDITS Khandwa (RGPV University, Bhopal)\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1773403507-975.pdf\", \"title\": \"cv\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('6f7766c0-54fc-46f4-8518-882e6e2ff20c','1c84fffb-f5c5-4d7f-9301-1c3417e5a507','Test Resume345','Test Resume345','Software Deve',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Guidewire CC\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-27 04:41:00.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Deve\", \"company\": \"Wipro \", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[{\"year\": \"\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech\", \"result\": \"\", \"institution\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('6f79d016-3fa4-46ad-9cd6-28b89000c10b','9f4c8d5b-034b-4f3e-9634-0fb98d2f85f4','Test Resume552','Test Resume552','Software Deve',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Java\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-26 09:13:11.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Deve\", \"company\": \"LTI Mindtree\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[{\"year\": \"\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech\", \"result\": \"\", \"institution\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('6f81cf7c-71ad-4f07-a1fa-d52b6daaa6e2','2c4c1efb-6464-4cfb-852c-8b32fb1882f9','A self-driven, adaptable, and result-oriented professional creative Engineer w i t h 3 years  of expertise \r\nin providing users with high-quality technical support. I want a highly rewarding career where I can use my \r\nskills and knowledge to help the com','A self-driven, adaptable, and result-oriented professional creative Engineer w i t h 3 years  of expertise \r\nin providing users with high-quality technical support. I want a highly rewarding career where I can use my \r\nskills and knowledge to help the company and my co-workers be successful. the growth of your \r\nesteemed organization along with mine. To work in a challenging atmosphere by exhibiting my skills with \r\nOutmost.','Desktop Support',4,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/rohit-kumar-1791895002-151.pdf',NULL,'[\"Java\", \"HTML\", \"CSS\", \"Excel\", \"SAP Hana\", \"PowerPoint\"]','PUBLIC','2026-10-14 00:02:02.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Desktop Support\", \"company\": \"Krishna Maruti Ltd\", \"endDate\": \"Fri Dec 29\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Thu Sep 14\", \"description\": \" Troubleshot daily IT desktop client issues, supporting multiple departments and various offices.\\r\\n Disassembled computer systems to troubleshoot and resolve hardware issues.\\r\\n Configured new employee workstations, including all hardware, software and peripheral devices.\\r\\n Cramping & Punching LAN Cable.\\r\\n Troubleshoot Camera issue with help of Network Team.\\r\\n Set up new desktop systems and configured laptops for incoming employees, loading required \\r\\nsoftware.\\r\\n Trained new employees on support processes, procedures and knowledge base.\\r\\n Independently Managing IT assets & real time troubleshooting for three different branches.\\r\\n Configured & implementation Dlink & nano-station Switches and RF (Wireless).\\r\\n Maintaining Antivirus Software & Server.\\r\\n Responsible / Support ERP Software.\\r\\n Co-coordinating with external Vendor like HP Team for Laptop & Desktop, Wep Team for Printer\\r\\n Handling 40 Wireless.\\r\\n Keep records of application\'s license and subscription.\\r\\n Support in Payroll system.\\r\\n Responsible / Support ERP Software.\\r\\n Increased overall company performance through IT uptime and by implementing cost reductions.\"}, {\"title\": \"MES ENGINEER\", \"company\": \"VDA InfoSolutions (Reliance Industries)\", \"endDate\": \"Thu Jan 01\", \"isCurrent\": true, \"startDate\": \"Thu Dec 25\", \"description\": \" Acted as the primary point of contact for shop floor operators, supervisors, and plant managers\\r\\nencountering MES application runtime issues. \\r\\n Troubleshot user authentication, client-side application crashes, printer routing errors, and barcode \\r\\nscanner connectivity issues.\\r\\n Executed basic SQL scripts to unblock stuck shop orders, verify \\r\\nmaterial lot status, and fix minor data mismatch discrepancies.\\r\\n Gathered application logs, diagnostic files, and step-by-step \\r\\nreproduction notes to cleanly escalate high-priority bugs to the L2/L3 \\r\\nengineering teams.\\r\\n Logged and classified incidents in MITS, achieving a 96% first-contact \\r\\nresolution (FCR) rate for Tier-1 issues.\\r\\n Set up new desktop systems and configured laptops for incoming \\r\\nemployees, loading required software.\\r\\n Performed onsite installation, modification and maintenance of user \\r\\nsystem and network equipment.\\r\\n Monitored automated MES health checks, batch processing errors, and application alerts via system.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2023\", \