rked on production module by creating Individual screens, views and standard \\r\\noperations as per client requirement that involved end-to-end configuration, preparation of \\r\\nthe application. \\r\\n Developed and deployed automated scheduling mechanisms to intelligently \\r\\ndistribute workload across the job queue, improving overall system \\r\\nperformance and responsiveness \\r\\n I am proficient in developing Standard Operation via Process Builder, and \\r\\nhave experience with Global Process Manager. \\r\\n I have a strong background in bug and defect analysis, as well as code \\r\\nenhancement, and have provided L2/L3 support for Apriso solutions. \\r\\n I Have created mutliple utilities such as macros for project to upload \\r\\nmasterdata into production environment.  \\r\\n I have created SQL Jobs and Apriso Jobs to enhance the system performance \\r\\n Worked on creating XSD files and adding synchronization queue in \\r\\nconfiguration manager. \\r\\n Analyzing loading time on portal through developers tool and tried to optimize \\r\\nthe solution or query. \\r\\nTechnologies: \\r\\n Apriso Process \\r\\n Builder 2019 Global \\r\\n Process Manager \\r\\n Javascript \\r\\n Jquer \\r\\n SQL\"}, {\"title\": \"Associate\", \"company\": \"Cognizant Technology Solutions\", \"endDate\": \"Thu Feb 10\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Wed Dec 05\", \"description\": \"Understanding the functional aspects of the clients’ requirement \\r\\n GE Proficy plant app MES Configuration \\r\\n Create label design and developed console ,web services and sql assembly for printer \\r\\ncommunication. \\r\\n Developed solution for integration with Proficy plant app with dotnet \\r\\n Deployment of web application, web services DLL to production \\r\\n Development of Stored Procedure for integration of GE Proficy Plant Apps with .NET \\r\\napplications. \\r\\n Creating and configuring application Pools for the web applications for load balancing 