, \"Manual Functional Testing\", \"JIRA\", \"Core Java\", \"Manual Testing\", \"Selenium Webdriver\", \"API testing\", \"TestNG\", \"Postman\", \"Pom (Project Object Model)\", \"Cucumber(BDD)\", \"MYSQL\"]','PUBLIC','2026-02-24 23:37:53.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Senior Test Engineer\", \"company\": \"HCL Tech\", \"endDate\": \"Fri Feb 20\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Wed Jun 05\", \"description\": \"Designed, developed, and maintained end-to-end test automation framework using WebdriverIO (WDIO) with TypeScript, \\r\\nenhancing test reliability and maintainability.\\r\\n•\\r\\nLed a team of 4 QA engineers to develop and maintain a CI/CD pipeline with Jenkins and Github,Bitbucket, enabling daily \\r\\nautomated test execution.\\r\\n•\\r\\nIntegrated API testing using Postman and REST Assured, improving coverage and catching 30% more defects in backend \\r\\nservices.\\r\\n•\\r\\nCollaborated closely with developers and product managers in Agile sprints to define acceptance criteria and refine test cases.\\r\\n•\\r\\nMentored junior automation engineers and conducted code reviews to ensure the quality and maintainability of test scripts.\\r\\n•\\r\\nSpearheaded migration of legacy tests to a microservices-based test architecture, improving test reliability and execution speed \\r\\nby 45%\"}, {\"title\": \"Memorres Digital Pvt. Ltd.\", \"company\": \"QA Engineer\", \"endDate\": \"Sun Jun 30\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Tue Aug 01\", \"description\": \"Collaborated with Product Owner and Senior Management to develop and design test plans and analyze business requirements.\\r\\n•\\r\\nDesigned and implemented test plans, test cases, and strategies for Manual and Automation Testing based on functional \\r\\nrequirements, design specifications, and Traceability Matrix to link requirements with test cases.\\r\\n•\\r\\nConducted web application testing using Selenium with a BDD framework (Maven, POM) and used libraries suc