roservices in Spring Boot to automate workflow and machine-to-system\\r\\ndata flow.\\r\\nDelivered continuous IT support to keep plant operations uninterrupted, with fast turnaround\\r\\non production issues.\\r\\nTuned SQL Server queries and batch jobs to improve backend responsiveness under production\\r\\nload.\\r\\nPartnered directly with production engineers and shift operators to resolve operational and\\r\\nsystem gaps.\"}, {\"title\": \"Software Engineer\", \"company\": \"EIHUB\", \"endDate\": \"Fri Aug 30\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Fri Jun 10\", \"description\": \"Built batch processing modules to extract, validate, and transform incoming data files for\\r\\ndownstream business logic.\\r\\nDesigned SQL Server table structures and stored procedures for optimized data ingestion.\\r\\nAutomated file-processing workflows, cutting manual effort and turnaround time.\\r\\nDiagnosed and resolved data inconsistencies, processing failures, and schema mismatches.\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1790347992-135.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('77f1f450-44d5-4836-9cef-8c1c54584a53','5a4b9b25-1945-4310-ab0b-2196ccf4f532','Node.Js Developer',NULL,'Node.Js Developer',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"JQUERY\", \"AJAX\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-14 12:29:57.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"Node.Js Developer\", \"company\": \"Quest GTL\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('77f3be14-4a5b-48ee-bd3e-add6a95dc22c','1bfa3368-a73e-474f-bf02-b653f3fbc019','Test Resume156','Test Resume156','Software Deve',4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\".NET\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-24 18:54:02.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Deve\", \"company\": \"PWC\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}, {\"title\": \"Software Deve\", \"company\": \"Infogain\