o site production system and performing validation\\r\\n•\\tCollaborating with the site automation team to collect data required for understanding the manufacturing process at the site.\\r\\n•\\tAnalysing the existing paper batch record templates used for production.\\r\\n•\\tGathering data related to equipment’s in the shop floor and their behaviour during the production.\\r\\n•\\tConfiguring Master data in Data Manager, Designing of Equipment Graphs to track the equipment status during the production.\\r\\n•\\tAuthoring Master Recipes for the existing Paper batches and Building Blocks to support the Master recipe author.\\r\\n•\\tAuthoring Master Workflows for various Maintenance and Cleaning activities during production.\\r\\n•\\tConducted demo calls to explain the developed functional building blocks to client site teams.\\r\\nTesting of new functionalities, new releases and providing KT sessions to the team.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2020\", \"degree\": \"Bachelors in Mechanical Engineering\", \"result\": \"8.11\", \"institution\": \"Institute of Aeronautical Engineering\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1755718982-603.docx\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('781af8f3-3362-4508-b5b9-120855741f7b','b0e7f6b1-0529-44f5-a73b-7b2508fbb3ea','Test Resume445','Test Resume445','Software Deve',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Guidewire CC\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-24 21:28:48.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Deve\", \"company\": \"TCS\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[{\"year\": \"\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech\", \"result\": \"\", \"institution\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('781b706d-6a81-415e-9243-3fa7a634b5da','c14f9a67-3c14-40ee-b0f0-eb254b37c903','Test Resume65','Test Resume65','Software Deve',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"AWS\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-25 20:16:00.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Deve\", \"c