ion bridging AI, backend engineering, and infrastructure to build\r\nreliable, scalable, and business-impacting products.','Senior AI Software Engineer',2,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1787253510-654.pdf',NULL,'[\"AI/ML\", \"Django\", \"Bash\", \"AWS\", \"GCP\", \"Docker\", \"Kubernetes\", \"ETL\", \"Generative AI\", \"LLM Fine-tuning\", \"RAG Pipelines\", \"Prompt Engineering\", \"LangChain\", \"NLP\", \"Deep Learning\", \"PyTorch\", \"TensorFlow\", \"Hugging Face\", \"Transformers\", \"Scikit\", \"Pandas\", \"Numpy\", \"OpenCV\", \"Fast API\", \"Python\", \"Shell Scripts\", \"TerraForm\", \"PostgreSQL\", \"MYSQL\", \"Mongo DB\", \"SQLITE\", \"ELT Pipelines\"]','PUBLIC','2026-08-21 06:44:14.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Senior AI Software Engineer\", \"company\": \"BuildPiper– By OpsTree\", \"endDate\": \"Mon Aug 10\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Wed Sep 15\", \"description\": \"• AI Agent Orchestration (BuildPiper & REMS): Led design and development of AI-driven backend systems for\\r\\nCI/CD and SRE platforms using Django, Celery, LangGraph-based agent orchestration, and MCP integrations —\\r\\nenabling DevOps and SRE automation including diagnostics, pipeline analysis, deployment insights, and operational\\r\\nworkflows across distributed environments.\\r\\n• Voice AI Agent Platform: Architected and developed an autonomous voice-controlled AI agent using LangGraph\\r\\ncapable of executing multi-step workflows across spreadsheets, documents, presentations, PDFs, desktop applications,\\r\\nand web browsers from natural language, backed by deterministic safety validation and human-in-the-loop execution.\\r\\n• AI Agent Framework & Safety: Designed a modular architecture comprising 18 independently tested components\\r\\nand a 14-tool adapter registry enabling extensible desktop, browser, and document automation. Built a deterministic\\r\\npolicy engine enforcing risk-based authorization, prompt-injection protection, audit logging, and secure confirmation\\r\\nworkflows independent of LLM reasoning.\\r\\n• Scalable Agent Infrastructure: Engineered an asynchronous FastAPI/WebSocket platform with LangGraph\\r\\ncheckpointing, resumable execution, WAL-mode SQLite persistence, and concurrent session management, enabling\\r\\nlong-running AI tasks to safely pause, survive server restarts, and resume from the exact execution state.\\r\\n• AI-Powered CI/CD Log Intelligence: Developed AI-powered CI/CD log analyzers using Gemini models for\\r\\nroot-cause analysis and remediation recommendations, reducing troubleshooting time by 80% and saving 15+ engineering\\r\\nhours weekly.\\r\\n• LLM Fine-Tuning (TinyLlama & Gemma): Owned the complete ML lifecycle for TinyLlama-1B-Instruct (SRE\\r\\nknowledge automation) and multi-modal Gemma3n-it (security dashboard anomaly analysis) — including dataset\\r\\npreparation, distributed training with LoRA/QLoRA, evaluation, deployment, and production observability — achieving\\r\\n87% classification accuracy.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2018\", \"degree\": \"Bachelor of Technology in Computer Science & Engineering\", \"result\": \"63\", \"institution\": \"Rajasthan Technical University (RTU)\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1787253510-654.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('784ca102-b833-4b1a-a403-db5f2dc8a3e6','8150f7b5-cc31-443c-bf07-a0a3cf980a8d','Sr ERP Executive',NULL,'Sr ERP Executive',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"ERP Implementation\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-15 03:43:13.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"Sr ERP Executive\", \"company\": \"Bengal Speech and Hearing Pvt Ltd\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('78631f38-333f-4471-ad5c-9dab1d64a214','206db5d5-7fbc-485b-90a9-f8bce64fe5f2','Test Resume357','Test Resume357','Professional',1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','PUBLIC','2025-05-26 17:49:29.000000','2026-10-