ring new plant rollouts, coordinating with clients and on-site teams to ensure timely issue\\r\\nresolution and adherence to SLAs. \\r\\nCollaborated with cross-functional teams to define MES workflows, ensuring alignment between IT, production, and quality\\r\\noperations for standardized manufacturing processes. \\r\\nParticipated in continuous improvement initiatives, gathering user feedback and enhancing MES features for better usability and\\r\\ndata accuracy. \\r\\nUsed DevOps pipelines for version control, deployment, and release management of MES applications, ensuring consistent updates\\r\\nacross environments. \\r\\nIntegrated machine-level PLC data from various plant floors into the Ignition Gateway using Kepware, Ignition OPC-UA and MQTT\\r\\nTransmission ensuring reliable and real-time data acquisition for MES workflows. Configured and optimized OPC-UA channels, device\\r\\nconnections , tag groups and scan classes for high-volume data collection.\"}, {\"title\": \"Project Engineer\", \"company\": \"DVS Technosoft Private Limited\", \"endDate\": \"Tue Aug 20\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Tue Aug 10\", \"description\": \"Connected and synchronized machine PLC signals with Ignition SCADA using OPC-UA communication, delivering real-time visibility,\\r\\naccurate equipment monitoring, and improved MES process. Configured OPC-UA connections with Allen-Bradley and Mitsubishi\\r\\ncontrollers for seamless tag ingestion and industrial communication. \\r\\nDeveloped SCADA screens in Ignition Perspective to visualize production parameters, equipment status and alarms with real-time\\r\\nupdates. Configured more than 20 energy meters to communicate with the master PLC through Modbus TCP/IP protocol. Facilitated\\r\\nreal-time data sharing of all consumable data to SCADA for comprehensive report generation. \\r\\nLed the full project lifecycle of the Recipe Management System, PLC–SCADA–Machine integration, providing go-live support and\\r\\nensuring successful project delivery in coordination with the client.\"}, {\"title\": \"Control Engineer\", \"company\": \"Phoenix Industrial Solutions\", \"endDate\": \"Tue Jul 20\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Wed Jun 05\", \"description\": \"Contributed to the successful installation and commissioning of more than 30 Special Purpose Machines (SPM) across India and\\r\\nRussia, including Helium Leak Testing Machines, Manual Welding Machines, Automatic Checking Gauges, Robot Welding Stations\\r\\nTorqueing Machines, Auto Flushing Machines and Gantry Pick and Place Systems (Servo System), along with Vision Checking Systems. \\r\\nAs a key Control Engineer for these projects, I spearheaded the development of PLC programs, crafted HMI interfaces, and facilitated\\r\\nboth Factory Acceptance Tests (FAT) and Site Acceptance Tests (SAT). \\r\\nDeveloped a PLC program that allows users to define the process dynamically, accommodating additional I/O without the need to\\r\\nmodify the PLC program. Designed the complete PLC–HMI–machine communication architecture and executed machine integration\\r\\nusing Ethernet/IP, IO-Link, Modbus TCP and digital/analog I/O interfaces. \\r\\nEngaged with both the supplier and client to develop the Keyence Vision System program, ensuring seamless data integration across\\r\\nall machines.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2018\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech in Electrical Engineering\", \"result\": \"72\", \"institution\": \"Gandhi Academy of Technology & Engineering\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1776108789-513.pdf\", \"title\": \"cv\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('79b45e1f-72f5-4cb2-8765-e03edac792d2','9aa21cbe-6010-469c-bcc3-054937848569','Azure Cloud Engineer',NULL,'Azure Cloud Engineer',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Jenkins\", \"Continuous Delivery\", \"DevOps\", \"Azure Active Directory\", \"Continuous Integration\", \"Continuous Deployment\", \"Azure Active Directory\", \"Cloud Infrastructure\", \"Jenkins\", \"Docker