ing Docker for containerization and Terraform for infrastructure-as-code.\\r\\n•\\tImplemented automated testing using PyTest to ensure the correctness of APIs and functionality.\\r\\n•\\tUsed Postman for API testing and debugging, ensuring the proper working of REST APIs.\\r\\n•\\tCollaborated in an Agile environment, working in sprints to deliver incremental features and ensuring constant communication with the development team.\\r\\n•\\tUtilized Mangum to bridge between AWS Lambda and ASGI applications (FastAPI).\\r\\n•\\tDeveloped the front-end interfaces using ReactJS and Angular for a responsive and user-friendly experience.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2015\", \"degree\": \"Computer Science\", \"result\": \"Yes\", \"institution\": \"JNTUA\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1770033064-389.docx\", \"title\": \"cv\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('7edbabad-c1b3-4af3-8b6e-2c2c28da51d3','3b6e0a30-44b8-4414-b80b-bb30545da184','Test Resume40','Test Resume40','Software Deve',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Mainframe\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-26 10:17:03.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Deve\", \"company\": \"Aceenture\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[{\"year\": \"\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech\", \"result\": \"\", \"institution\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('7edeb360-537f-4052-8b87-0bc602c42b6c','f5f3e488-8fd6-45d4-aa44-921bb59f8ba8','Test Resume183','Test Resume183','Software Deve',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Automation\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-26 17:25:58.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Deve\", \"company\": \"TCS\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[{\"year\": \"\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech\", \"result\": \"\", \"institution\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('7ee2956e-d790-4903-8cd3-e91c640a8c09','c92868c5-b5b3-4af0-93da-24beaa0c3553','Test Resume2