nPower BI. \\r\\n Designed, developed, and deployed interactive Power BI dashboards and reports based on business \\r\\nrequirements. \\r\\n Converted Qlik Sense expressions and set analysis logic into equivalent DAX calculations. \\r\\n Worked with Microsoft Fabric for end-to-end analytics including data ingestion, transformation, and \\r\\nreporting. \\r\\n Utilized Fabric Lakehouse to store and manage structured and unstructured data using Delta tables. \\r\\n Developed data pipelines using Fabric Data Factory for orchestrating ETL workflows. \\r\\n Implemented OneLake as a centralized data storage layer to enable unified data access across services. \\r\\n Applied data governance and security using Fabric workspace roles and access controls. \\r\\n Optimized data processing and query performance using partitioning and Delta optimization techniques in \\r\\nFabric. \\r\\n Built efficient data models using Star and Snowflake schemas to improve report performance and usability. \\r\\n Integrated data from SQL Server and Databricks Unity Catalog into Power BI, enabling centralized and \\r\\ngoverned analytics. \\r\\n Developed advanced DAX measures including time intelligence, YTD, MTD, rolling averages, and KPIs. \\r\\n Used Power Query (M language) for data extraction, transformation, cleansing, and shaping. \\r\\n Implement drill-down, drill-through, tooltips, bookmarks, and advanced visuals \\r\\n Applied Row-Level Security (RLS) to control data access based on user roles. \\r\\n Published reports to Power BI Service, managed workspaces, and created Power BI Apps. \\r\\n Configured On-Premises Data Gateway for scheduled refresh and live connections. \\r\\n Optimized report and dataset performance using DAX optimization, query folding, and model tuning. \\r\\n Wrote and optimized SQL queries using joins, subqueries, CTEs, and window functions to support \\r\\nPower BI. \\r\\n Created and maintained SQL views for data preparation, aggregation, and simplified consumption in Power BI. \\r\\n Designed and developed interactive Qlik Sense dashboards and reports tailored to business requirements. \\r\\n Created complex Set Analysis expressions for dynamic filtering, KPIs, and advanced calculations. \\r\\n Utilized Qlik Script for data extraction, transformation, and loading (ETL) from multiple sources. \\r\\n Applied drilldowns, drill-throughs, alternate states, and dynamic filters for enhanced interactivity. \\r\\n Analyzed existing Qlik Sense applications, data models, KPIs, and business logic before migration. \\r\\n Performed data validation and reconciliation between source systems and Power BI reports. \\r\\n Documented report logic, data models, and business definitions for knowledge sharing. \\r\\n Validated migrated reports by performing data reconciliation between Tableau/Qlik Sense and Power \\r\\nBI to ensure accurate results. \\r\\n Followed Agile/Scrum methodology, participated in sprint planning, daily stand-ups, and retrospectives. \\r\\n Used JIRA to track tasks, bugs, and enhancements. \\r\\n Supported UAT, production deployments, and post-go-live issues.\"}, {\"title\": \"Analyst – Business Intelligence\", \"company\": \"Task Staffing Solutions Private Limited\", \"endDate\": \"Wed Oct 20\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Thu Jul 15\", \"description\": \" Analyzed existing Qlik Sense dashboards and documented business logic, KPIs, and data models. \\r\\n Worked with stakeholders to understand reporting requirements and migration priorities. \\r\\n Redesigned and developed equivalent dashboards in Power BI ensuring functional parity. \\r\\n Integrated data from multiple sources including Oracle. \\r\\n Converted Qlik load logic and calculations (including set analysis) into Power BI DAX and Power Query. \\r\\n Built and optimized Power BI data models following star schema best practices. \\r\\n Validated migrated reports by performing data reconciliation between Qlik Sense and Power BI. \\r\\n Improved report performance using optimized DAX measures and query tuning. \\r\\n Implemented row-level security (RLS) and managed workspace access in Power BI Service. \\r\\n Supported UAT, incorporated user feedback, and resolved defects during migration\"}, {\"title\": \"Qlik Sense Developer\", \"company\": \"Vim Soft Private Limited\", \"endDate\": \"Thu Aug 20\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Tue Jul 10\", \"description\": \" Collaborated with business stakeholders to gather reporting requirements and translate them into Qlik \\r\\napplications. \\r\\n Performed data validation and reconciliation to ensure accuracy between source systems and Qlik reports. \\r\\n Design, develop, and maintain interactive dashboards and visualizations using Qlik Sense. \\r\\n Build and optimize Qlik data models using best practices (star/snowflake schema). \\r\\n Develop Qlik load scripts to extract, transform, and load (ETL) data from multiple sources. \\r\\n Connect Qlik Sense with various data sources such as SQL Server, Oracle, Excel, CSV. \\r\\n Implement set analysis, expressions, and advanced calculations to meet business requirements. \\r\\n Handle incremental data loads and optimize reload times. \\r\\n Apply Section Access for data security and role-based access control. \\r\\n Support UAT, deployment, and production issues.\"}, {\"title\": \"Data Analyst\", \"company\": \"Infosys BPO Limited\", \"endDate\": \"Tue Sep 20\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Fri May 20\", \"description\": \" Collected and cleaned data using Microsoft Excel and SQL queries. \\r\\n Wrote basic SQL queries to extract and analyze data from databases. \\r\\n Created Excel reports using formulas, pivot tables, and charts. \\r\\n Validated data accuracy and fixed data quality issues. \\r\\n Assisted in preparing daily and weekly data reports for stakeholders. \\r\\n Identified simple trends and shared insights using Excel dashboards\"}