urance and Banking Industries.','Senior Associate',4,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1772461546-883.pdf',NULL,'[\"Cybersecurity\", \"IEC Standards\", \"ISO 27001\", \"HIPAA Compliance\", \"IEC 62351\", \"IEC 62443\", \"SCADA\", \"PLC\", \"OEE Analysis\", \"ISA-95\", \"PCI DSS\", \"TCP\"]','PUBLIC','2026-03-03 02:42:38.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Senior Associate\", \"company\": \"LTIMINDTREE\", \"endDate\": \"Sat Feb 28\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Tue Jan 05\", \"description\": \"Led the end-to-end cybersecurity governance maturity assessment across Client’s smart infrastructure \\r\\nsystems, integrating both IT and OT environments, and aligning with ISO/IEC 27001:2022 and IEC 62443. \\r\\n• Planned and executed security posture assessments by evaluating existing policies, procedures, and \\r\\ntechnical implementations in relation to ISO 27001. \\r\\n• Performed detailed gap analysis to measure the current maturity of cybersecurity controls across multiple \\r\\nzones (HVAC, BMS, and utility management) and benchmarked against the target maturity levels defined in \\r\\nIEC 62443 \\r\\n• Developed a tailored roadmap for security control enhancement, addressing areas such as identity and \\r\\naccess control, secure configuration, and incident response. \\r\\n• Prepared and delivered executive-level reporting, summarizing current cybersecurity maturity, risk \\r\\nexposure, and required remediation actions across IT and OT domains to Senior Management. \\r\\n• Conducted post-assessment workshops to validate findings, prioritize risk treatments, and ensure \\r\\ncontinuous improvement mechanisms are built into ongoing compliance and risk management programs.\"}, {\"title\": \"Lead Solution Advisor\", \"company\": \"Deloitte USI\", \"endDate\": \"Fri Jan 15\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Wed Dec 05\", \"description\": \"• Conducted a thorough analysis and assessment of the current AS-IS state of OT-IT architecture, including \\r\\nlandscapes, systems, infrastructure, and network security topology. \\r\\n• Evaluated edge and cloud applications, components, and interfaces from a security perspective. \\r\\n• Assessed integrations, governance, technology stack, data flows, templates, existing data sources, databases, \\r\\nUNS models, ISA-95 models, and OEE implementation design. \\r\\n• Collected data on existing OT device management and OT network design, including data collection from \\r\\nmachines, sensors, assets, devices, controllers, and gateway interfaces. \\r\\n• Proposed security solution to segment OT-IT Network Security. \\r\\n• Advised client on best practices for securing IT and OT environments, \\r\\n• Performed readiness assessments for HIPAA and PCI DSS compliance. \\r\\n• Conducted maturity assessments for clients in the oil and gas, and manufacturing sectors. \\r\\n• Reviewed and evaluated policies and documentation to ensure compliance with industry standards. \\r\\n• Proposed and implemented cybersecurity solutions to defend and secure client networks. \\r\\n• Reviewed firewall rules and configuration of network devices \\r\\n• Develop and maintain documentation for various compliance standards and regulatory frameworks, \\r\\nincluding policies and procedures \\r\\n• Conduct regular audits and reviews to ensure continuous compliance with organizational requirements. \\r\\n• Conduct ITGC control reviews to evaluate the effectiveness of IT controls. \\r\\n• Identify and document gaps in IT controls and provide actionable recommendations. \\r\\n• Collaborate with cross-functional teams to implement necessary IT controls.\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1772461546-883.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('821b1da8-8d74-43ad-8105-b82a98b3fb82','f755e8ca-1522-4090-99d7-e8301ee9aaa3','Software Engineer III',NULL,'Software Engineer III',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Java\", \"C++\", \"CSS\", \"HTML5\", \"JavaScript\