processes, leading to a notable 40% decrease in verification times for AML and \\r\\nKYC procedures\"}, {\"title\": \"Team Lead\", \"company\": \"VXL Software  Solutions\", \"endDate\": \"Wed Oct 05\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Thu May 10\", \"description\": \"Exhibit strong leadership qualities by cultivating a cooperative team \\r\\natmosphere that promotes creativity and effective problem-solving, while \\r\\nproviding mentorship to junior developers to advance their technical expertise. \\r\\n Possess comprehensive knowledge of cloud computing technologies, especially \\r\\nMicrosoft Azure, facilitating the deployment of scalable applications and \\r\\nservices tailored to contemporary business needs. \\r\\n Initiated the integration of CI/CD pipelines through Jenkins, significantly \\r\\noptimizing the deployment process and shortening the cycle from five days to \\r\\na mere three hours, which greatly improved overall productivity.\"}, {\"title\": \"Team Lead\", \"company\": \"LogicLinks Software\", \"endDate\": \"Sun Nov 30\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Thu Nov 10\", \"description\": \" Exhibit proficiency in employing a diverse range of software development tools \\r\\nand methodologies, guaranteeing the delivery of superior software solutions \\r\\nthat meet client expectations and adhere to industry standards. \\r\\n Proficient in leveraging Agile methodologies and DevOps practices to enhance \\r\\nteam collaboration and streamline software development processes, resulting \\r\\nin improved project delivery and client satisfaction. \\r\\n A forward thinking person with strong communication, analytical & \\r\\norganizational skills; well organized with a track record that demonstrates self\\r\\nmotivation & creativity to achieve corporate goals.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2024\", \"degree\": \"M.Tech. in Computer Science\", \"result\": \"76\", \"institution\": \"ISBM University\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1765961601-584.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('8250464d-4d22-47a0-8967-e822b027c4c8','4b6753bf-e33d-4a3f-a43a-d57a683e8ca1','Results-oriented Data Scientist with 4 years of experience in AI and data solutions, \r\nspecializing in Generative AI and LLMs. Proficient with open-source models like Mistral, Phi, \r\nand LLaMA, and well-versed in transformer architecture and fine-tuning t','Results-oriented Data Scientist with 4 years of experience in AI and data solutions, \r\nspecializing in Generative AI and LLMs. Proficient with open-source models like Mistral, Phi, \r\nand LLaMA, and well-versed in transformer architecture and fine-tuning techniques such as \r\nPEFT, LoRA, QLoRA, and RLHF. Skilled in GenAI frameworks including LangChain, LlamaIndex, \r\nand agentic tools like CrewAI, AutoGen, and LangGraph. Delivered impactful projects like a \r\nRAG-based IT Helpdesk Chatbot using Ollama and an XGBoost-powered inventory optimization \r\nsystem. Strong foundation in Python, SQL, Power BI, and Excel, with hands-on experience in \r\nETL pipelines, cloud deployment (AWS EC2), and real-time analytics. Familiar with Model \r\nContext Protocol (MCP) for advanced LLM integration.','DATA SCIENTIST',2,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1789655747-862.pdf',NULL,'[]','PUBLIC','2026-09-18 01:59:51.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"DATA SCIENTIST\", \"company\": \"P2P System Pvt.Ltd\", \"endDate\": \"Thu Sep 10\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Fri Jul 15\", \"description\": \"● Objective: Developed a domain-specific AI chatbot using Retrieval Augmented \\r\\nGeneration (RAG) architecture to automate IT support for internal employees, \\r\\nimproving accuracy and reducing dependency on manual ticket resolution. \\r\\n● Methodology: Preprocessed 10,000+ IT FAQs and support tickets, generated dense \\r\\nembeddings using Sentence Transformers, and indexed them in FAISS for efficient \\r\\nretrieval. Used Mistral-7B 4bit quantized LLM to generate contextual responses. \\r\\nDeveloped a FastAPI backend with a fallback confidence scoring layer for handling \\r\\nuncertain queries. Deployed the solution on an AWS EC2 GPU-enabled server for \\r\\nscalable organizational access. \\r\\n● Achievements/Impact: Enabled accurate retrieval and generation of IT support \\r\\nanswers with 85%+ retrieval precision. Automated resolution of ~65% employee \\r\\nqueries without human intervention. Reduced average IT ticket response time by over \\r\\n45%. Improved chatbot reliability and maintainability through dynamic retrieval \\r\\ninstead of expensive model fine-tuning.\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1789655747-862.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('82513ad3-0c44-470d-8545-30e254512a4d','af82e5e8-7213-470e-b901-8c3bcca87b4d','Test Resume180','Test Resume180','Software Deve',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"React JS\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-25 10:56:25.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Deve\", \"company\": \"PurpleTalk\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[{\"year\": \"\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech\", \"result\": \"\", \"institution\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('82580daa-1e6b-4a77-a17f-ff15ea01b1e0','5438bf26-55ec-4a69-a85c-f8c906e17218','Test Resume168','Test Resume168','Software Deve',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\".NET CORE\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-24 21:17:19.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Deve\", \"company\": \"TCS\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[{\"year\": \"\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech\", \"result\": \"\", \"institution\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('82598bc6-ce19-46b1-8dba-5afd4f318d8b','e88fae9c-f1cf-4ed4-a93b-58ba5988bda7','BPO Voice Process',NULL,'BPO Voice Process',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Microsoft Word\", \"Microsoft Excel\"]','PU