al professional with around 10 years of experience supporting chromatography data systems in \r\npharmaceutical environments. Specialized in Empower, Chromeleon and related laboratory informatics platforms, \r\nwith expertise in application support, system administration, software deployments, upgrades, validation testing, and \r\noperational support. Experienced in incident, problem, change, and release management using ServiceNow and HP \r\nALM, Hands on Experience with SDMS for data archival/restoration. qualified multiple instrument drivers. \r\nCollaborating with global stakeholders, vendors, and cross-functional teams to deliver compliant, reliable, and \r\nefficient laboratory system solutions while supporting GxP and 21 CFR Part 11 requirements','System Analyst for CDS',8,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1784600189-826.pdf',NULL,'[\"CSV\", \"Gxp Compliance\", \"Agile Methodology\", \"Empower Administration\", \"Waters Empower CDS\", \"NuGenesis ELN Administration\", \"SDMS Integration\", \"21 CFR Part 11\", \"SDLC\", \"SQL\"]','PUBLIC','2026-07-21 13:43:31.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"System Analyst for CDS\", \"company\": \"Novo Nordisk\", \"endDate\": \"Sat Jun 20\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Wed May 10\", \"description\": \"Pharmaceutical company. Provides functional and technical support for Empower and Chromeleon within LAB Systems, including \\r\\nupgrades, validation, deployment and operational support. \\r\\n• Lead and contribute to Empower and Chromeleon upgrade activities covering planning, testing, validation coordination, technical go\\r\\nlive and stabilization. \\r\\n• Support CDS operations across incident, problem, change and release management processes with a focus on timely resolution and \\r\\nbusiness continuity. \\r\\n• Coordinate test execution, defect follow-up, validation evidence collection, and HP ALM related activities for regulated system \\r\\nchanges. \\r\\n• Participate in driver qualification, software deployment, instrument connectivity troubleshooting and configuration verification for \\r\\nchromatography systems. \\r\\n• Collaborate closely with system managers, Danish/global support teams, vendors and business users to ensure support services align \\r\\nwith business needs. \\r\\n• Contribute to user manuals, installation guidance, knowledge articles, process improvements and support database enhancements. \\r\\n• Promote knowledge sharing, operational stability for Empower, Chromeleon and related CDS services.\"}, {\"title\": \"CDS Operations and Deployments\", \"company\": \"Cognizant Technology Solutions\", \"endDate\": \"Wed May 10\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Thu Feb 10\", \"description\": \"Pharmaceutical company. Supported global CDS operations, deployments and service delivery activities for Empower and Chromeleon. \\r\\n• Delivered high-quality functional and technical support for Empower and Chromeleon application users. \\r\\n• Handled ServiceNow incidents, service requests, problem tickets and knowledge article creation for recurring issues and \\r\\nworkarounds. \\r\\n• Supported change and release activities by coordinating testing, deployment checks, validation of documentation inputs, and post\\r\\nrelease monitoring. \\r\\n• Assisted with Empower/Chromeleon software installation, Citrix based usage support, acquisition server checks and instrument driver \\r\\nrelated activities. \\r\\n• Worked with vendors and client support teams for issue investigation, enhancement requests and resolution of application and \\r\\nconnectivity issues. \\r\\n• Maintained strong business and system understanding to support operational stability and global user satisfaction.\"}, {\"title\": \"CDS Application Support / Empower Administrator\", \"company\": \"Dr. Reddy\'s Laboratories Pvt. Ltd\", \"endDate\": \"Mon Jan 10\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Sun May 10\", \"description\": \"Pharma R&D unit. Provided Empower GxP/Non-GxP application support and administration, with a focus on software support, \\r\\nuser/project management, and SDMS interface activities. \\r\\n• Acted as an Empower subject matter expert for application related issues. \\r\\n• Performed Empower software installation on client/acquisition systems and maintained acquisition server checklist and support \\r\\nrecords. \\r\\n• Managed Empower user administration, user groups, project creation, project archival and restoration activities. \\r\\n• Configured instruments within Empower and supported troubleshooting connectivity, acquisition and application related issues \\r\\nduring analysis. \\r\\n• Coordinated with vendor engineers and internal support teams for software/service issues, driver support, and resolution tracking. \\r\\n• Created and updated knowledge articles, support documentation and SOP inputs for Empower administration and support activities.\"}, {\"title\": \"CDS Software Support and Instrumentation - Empower\", \"company\": \"AET Laboratories Pvt. Ltd\", \"endDate\": \"Sun May 10\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Sun Jun 10\", \"description\": \"Pharma formulation unit. Supported Empower software administration activities and acted as an instrumentation engineer \\r\\n• Handled Empower user management, project management, and routine software administration activities. \\r\\n• Installed Empower client software and supported instrument configuration within Empower for chromatography systems. \\r\\n• Troubleshot software, connectivity, and instrument communication issues raised by laboratory users during analysis. \\r\\n• Coordinated with external vendors for qualification, repair, driver/software related support and closure of service issues. \\r\\n• Conducted routine preventive maintenance for HPLC, UPLC, GC, balances and titrators. \\r\\n• Coordinated AMC/CMC activities with vendor engineers and followed up on hardware service issues. \\r\\n• Maintained spare parts inventory and updated maste