er 800+ concurrent enterprise users,\\r\\ngoverning critical configurations across Machine Catalogs, Delivery Groups, StoreFront channels, and NetScaler\\r\\nADC core network topologies.\\r\\n• Spearheaded workspace optimization initiatives by refactoring FSLogix profile container rules, effectively wiping out\\r\\nroaming profile storage bottlenecks and historical user profile corruption incidents.\\r\\n• Diagnosed complex, multi-tiered virtual workspace session latencies and network gateway dropouts utilizing Citrix\\r\\nDirector telemetry, successfully contracting mean time to resolution (MTTR) metrics by 25%.\\r\\n• Patched, updated, and allocated resources for virtual machines using SCCM, WSUS, and vCenter to ensure server\\r\\nstability\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2023\", \"degree\": \"Bachelor of Technology in Computer Science\", \"result\": \"71\", \"institution\": \"Sharda University\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1788448053-747.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('8556ae62-8209-4528-9e0f-aa824af65b23','91291734-c09d-4834-9764-ba5b01a3defb','Test Resume337','Test Resume337','Software Deve',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\".NET\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-27 04:40:59.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Deve\", \"company\": \"HCL \", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[{\"year\": \"\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech\", \"result\": \"\", \"institution\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('85586d9d-439f-4513-b443-8886fcecd4a7','8fbbb9dc-0f93-4350-ada4-784df8595ced','Test Resume179','Test Resume179','Software Deve',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\".NET\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-26 20:53:30.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Deve\", \"company\": \"Capgemini \", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[{\"year\": \"\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech\", \"result\": \"\", \"institution\": \"\