elopment, and\r\nSQL-driven shop-floor solutions for chemical manufacturing. Skilled in building custom screens, grids and forms, writing\r\nstored procedure','Apriso MES Developer with 2+ years of hands-on experience in DELMIA Apriso Process Builder, screen development, and\r\nSQL-driven shop-floor solutions for chemical manufacturing. Skilled in building custom screens, grids and forms, writing\r\nstored procedures for functional steps and scheduled jobs, and delivering OEE/KPI dashboards via SSRS and Apriso\r\nDashboards. Delivered full MES lifecycle — development, BOM/recipe testing, UAT, and GPM-based deployment','Software Engineer',2,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1792159977-505.pdf',NULL,'[\"Delmia Apriso\", \"GPM Deployment\", \"GPM Deployment\", \"JavaScript\", \"HTML\", \"CSS\", \"C#\", \"Process Builder\", \"SQL Server\", \"Integration Testing\", \"UAT\", \"React JS\", \"REST API\"]','PUBLIC','2026-10-17 01:40:42.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Engineer\", \"company\": \"Capgemini\", \"endDate\": \"Tue Jun 10\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Tue Nov 15\", \"description\": \"• Development–Built custom screens from scratch using Apriso Process Builder’s business components, grids, and\\r\\nforms, tailoring UI and business logic to plant-specific production workflows.\\r\\n• Designed and developed a scheduled cleaning process workflow for shop-floor equipment, automating maintenance\\r\\ntriggers within the MES.\\r\\n• Database– Wrote complex SQL queries to power grid data-binding and dynamic filtering across production and\\r\\nquality screens.\\r\\n• Authored stored procedures for scheduled SQL jobs and functional-step input/output handling, enabling data\\r\\nhand-off between sequential process steps.\\r\\n• Machine Integration– Configured Machine Integrator connectors, data points, and action groups to trigger the\\r\\nscheduled cleaning process directly from PLC/OPC tag signals via Kepware, enabling automated, condition-based\\r\\ncleaning cycles.\\r\\n• Deployment– Packaged and deployed Apriso solutions across DEV → QA → Production environments using Global\\r\\nProcess Manager (GPM), scripting MS SQL entity migrations to keep environments in sync.\\r\\n• Packing– Built Packing module visualization screens using dynamic grid properties and conditional CSS to reflect\\r\\nreal-time production states.\\r\\n• OEE–Built dashboards tracking 50+ KPIs including OEE, with live charts and gauges reflecting machine health\\r\\nunder the Machine & Maintenance module.\\r\\n• Testing– Exploded test BOMs to simulate chemical process cycles end-to-end, running integration tests across\\r\\nmultiple recipes and BOM variants including failure-scenario replication.\\r\\n• Delivered UAT sign-off and documented technical implementation details, deployment steps, and hypercare\\r\\nprocedures for plant stakeholders.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2022\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech in Computer Science Engineering\", \"result\": \"7.22\", \"institution\": \"New Horizon College of Engineering\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1792159977-505.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('87077a3d-f834-4664-a759-4926dd5f70a3','27d8494c-eb86-4285-9609-9eb4f2bcaa39','Test Resume42','Test Resume42','Software Deve',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"AWS\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-26 17:07:56.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Deve\", \"company\": \"TCS\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[{\"year\": \"\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech\", \"result\": \"\", \"institution\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('87099292-b9c5-4c77-b799-5f07433fbeea','72a83f12-ed7b-4cba-bbee-fcafe005fc75','Test Resume632','Test Resume632','Professional',1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','PUBLIC','2025-05-25 11:54:41.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[]','[{\"year\": \"\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech\", \"result\": \"\", \"institution\": \"\