[{\"title\": \"Software Deve\", \"company\": \"Mantle Labs\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[{\"year\": \"\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech\", \"result\": \"\", \"institution\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('87fff48a-e523-4c43-ac86-531679c302fe','c6d30f5d-e420-4632-8b7d-82e3ed2f1b46','Accomplished MES Solution Architect with 11 years of IT expertise, specializing in SAP MII, SAP ME, SAP Plant Connectivity, and SAP PP. Proven track record in leading end-to-end MES implementations for clients in Oil & Gas Service Products, Glass Manufact','Accomplished MES Solution Architect with 11 years of IT expertise, specializing in SAP MII, SAP ME, SAP Plant Connectivity, and SAP PP. Proven track record in leading end-to-end MES implementations for clients in Oil & Gas Service Products, Glass Manufacturing, Tools & Outdoor Operating Manufacturing, and Pharmaceuticals. Expert in solutioning, architectural designs, strategic business discussions, requirement gathering, and DevOps leadership, including team and management responsibilities to oversee solution delivery and innovative solution design','Solution Architect – MES | SLB',6,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1761655759-323.docx',NULL,'[\"HTML\", \"CSS\", \"JavaScript\", \"Eclipse\", \"SAP\", \"SAP ABAP\", \"SAP BI\", \"Oracle\", \"S4 HANA\", \"Windows Server\"]','PUBLIC','2025-10-28 12:26:17.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Solution Architect – MES | SLB\", \"company\": \"SAP MII/ME Technical Consultant\", \"endDate\": \"Sun Oct 19\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Thu Jan 09\", \"description\": \"•\\tJoined SLB as a SAP MII/ME Technical Consultant, where I played a key role in developing and supporting a Manufacturing Execution Dashboard used by technicians for labour clocking, production execution, and quality data collection. I later contributed to the SAP implementation initiative, overseeing the configuration, testing, and deployment of MES application across global manufacturing sites.\\r\\n•\\tIn parallel, I delivered continuous enhancements to the MES platform, focusing on improving user experience, system usability, and operational efficiency. A major milestone involved integrating shop floor machines with MES, enabling real-time machine connectivity—driving visibility into machine availability, and empowering the business with plant-wide insights into OEE (Overall Equipment Effectiveness) and OLE (Overall Labor Effectiveness).\\r\\n•\\tAs part of a major digital transformation project, I was instrumental in evolving the MES application from a basic labour tracking dashboard to a full-fledged digital MES. This included redesigned UI/UX, intuitive search, integrated 3D work instructions, multi-level execution for production and service orders, and seamless quality data capture.\\r\\n•\\tPromoted to DevOps Lead, I managed the development, sustainment, and enhancement of multiple MES platforms, leading a cross-functional team to deliver business-critical solutions. My responsibilities spanned project delivery, performance monitoring, and team mentorship, ensuring high-quality outcomes aligned with business priorities.\\r\\n•\\tCurrently serving as MES Solution Architect, I bridge the gap between business needs and technical execution. I provide architectural oversight, craft scalable solutions to complex problems, and guide integrations with enterprise and third-party systems—ensuring long-term alignment with SLB’s digital manufacturing vision.\"}, {\"title\": \"Techno-Functional Consultant\", \"company\": \"Capgemini Technology Services India Limited\", \"endDate\": \"Thu Jan 09\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Sun Feb 04\", \"description\": \"Contributed to global SAP MES projects across diverse manufacturing domains, with a focus on end-to-end system implementations, integration, performance optimization, and knowledge enablement.\\r\\n•\\tEnhanced SAP MII performance and modernized legacy UIs to SAP UI5, delivering customer-specific reports, streamlining Production Order downloads, and providing Work Instructions in the form of CNC files for operators during shop floor execution.\\r\\n•\\tCollaborated with the SAP product team as part of their FD4DI (Fast Development for Discrete Industries) initiative to implement a connected manufacturing scenario for a battery production line. Integrated SAP S/4HANA, SAP MES, and Raspberry Pi–based machine simulators using SAP PCo and MQTT, enabling real-time machine data flow and monitoring.\\r\\n•\\tPlayed a key role in the end-to-end implementation of SAP ECC and SAP ME integration for a major shipbuilding client (Spain), using SAP MEINT, SAP MII, and tailored customizations to standard SAP ME PODs. Worked closely with SAP ECC consultants (PP, PS, PM) to manage IDOC configurations, DRF-based data replication, and implement custom features such as labor tracking. Oversaw development through to successful deployment.\\r\\n•\\tConducted structured SAP MII training sessions for both client teams and freshers, enabling them to independently perform configuration, development, and support tasks. Developed detailed training materials and hands-on sessions that accelerated onboarding, improved team efficiency, and ensured long-term knowledge retention within the organization.\\r\\nTech Stack: SAP MII 15.x, SAP ME 15.2, SAP UI5, SAPMEINT, SAP PCo, SAP S/4HANA, SAP ECC (PP/PS/PM), MQTT\"}, {\"title\": \"SAP ME & MII Technical Consultant\", \"company\": \"Cognizant Technology Solutions India Pvt. Ltd\", \"endDate\": \"Wed Feb 14\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Sat Jan 04\", \"description\": \"Delivered MES solutions for global clients across pharmaceuticals, life sciences, and manufacturing industries, focusing on SAP MII & ME implementations, system integrations, application modernization, and manufacturing intelligence. Played a key role in full-cycle implementations, data integrations, and performance-centric dashboards and reporting.\\r\\n•\\taXis Wehr Migration (Germany):\\r\\nSupported the migration of a critical MES integration interface from SAP MII 12 to MII 15, enabling continued data exchange between SAP ECC and PAS-X MES. Collaborated with ECC and PI teams to ensure successful testing, data consistency, and seamless MDO migration logic.\\r\\n•\\tNovartis CM Johor – Phase 1 & 2 (Malaysia):\\r\\nDesigned scalable modules such as Formula Editor, View Report, ETL Configuration, and Query Editor to automate KPI reporting and streamline operations for Vision Care manufacturing. Focused on future-proof, flexible UI design and reusable logic components to support site-specific customizations.\\r\\n•\\tCPO Reportable Deviations:\\r\\nDeveloped a web-based reporting interface for Quality Personnel using SAP MII and JavaScript (PDF.js) to access deviation summaries integrated with AQWA_Q. Ensured development compliance through thorough documentation and peer code reviews.\\r\\n•\\tAmgen ARM (Global Sites):\\r\\nBuilt hierarchical plant structures across Amgen sites using BIOVIA Discoverant. Integrated multi-source data from PI Historian, Werum MES, and Oracle DB. Developed browser-based tools for site-specific data entry and visualization using Discoverant’s Hierarchy Manager.\\r\\n•\\tAgilent SAP ME Implementation:\\r\\nConfigured SAP ME for shop floor operations including materials, routings, resources, and non-conformance handling. Developed MII-based logic to automate master data uploads, enhancing consistency and reducing manual input.\\r\\n•\\tPhilips MES Dashboard:\\r\\nBuilt interactive dashboards using SAP MII and IRPT to provide real-time shop floor visibility. Developed supervisor-friendly screens with shipment insights and resource tracking using HTML5, JavaScript, and jQuery.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2013\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech (Computer Engineering)\", \"result\": \"68.1\", \"institution\": \"Rajasthan Technical University\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1761655759-323.docx\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('8800b9fd-cac4-44f5-a895-336db1518aed','410a96cc-a7b4-452b-9d82-9058440f4eb7','Test Resume866','Test Resume866','Software Deve',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"AWS\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-26 09:54:27.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Deve\", \"company\": \"Achyutas\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[{\"year\": \"\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech\", \"result\": \"\", \"institution\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('880ae341-d9b6-418a-835e-000e15e554d4','8daadfe0-4b5e-46a2-b9fc-b4a7d11ab29d','Test Resume222','Test Resume222','Software Deve',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"LoadRunner\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-26 14:57:12.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Deve\", \"company\": \"LTIMindtree\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[{\"year\": \"\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech\", \"result\": \"\", \"institution\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('881279a2-948d-4272-b256-4984b13b477e','6c145842-a6cf-4785-9e64-26d71f691f69','Dynamic and results-driven Account Manager with a proven track record in sales,\r\n with 8+ years of experience. Seeking to leverage expertise in cultivating client\r\n relationships, driving revenue growth, and surpassing targets. Generated new\r\n business op','Dynamic and results-driven Account Manager with a proven track record in sales,\r\n with 8+ years of experience. Seeking to leverage expertise in cultivating client\r\n relationships, driving revenue growth, and surpassing targets. Generated new\r\n business opportunities through cold calling and networking. Experience in handling\r\n end-to-end sales for SME and SMB accounts, managing enterprise customer\r\n relationships, and providing demo training to clients. Exceptional communication\r\n skills, and a st