oper\", \"company\": \"TATA Consultancy Services\", \"endDate\": \"Thu Nov 20\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Sat Jul 10\", \"description\": \" Designed and developed IIoT solutions using ThingWorx 9.x, connecting real-time manufacturing \\r\\ndevices via Kepware and OPC-UA. \\r\\n Modeled and configured ThingWorx entities — defined ThingTemplates, ThingShapes, \\r\\nDataShapes, properties, services and events — enabling real-time industrial data flows  \\r\\n Developed and optimized Mashups, Services, and Widgets to provide dynamic dashboards, real\\r\\ntime visualizations, and custom reports. Developed custom UI components and workflows using \\r\\nJavaScript within ThingWorx Mashup Builder \\r\\n Configured and optimized WebSocket-based real-time communication between Kepware\\r\\nconnected edge devices and ThingWorx Mashups, enabling automatic data updates and live \\r\\nproduction monitoring without periodic polling or manual refresh. \\r\\n Integrated external systems using REST APIs and MQTT, improving cross-platform data flow. \\r\\n Integrated Thingworx platform with external SQL database to fetch the data from the DB to \\r\\nprocess data. \\r\\n Configured ThingWorx Value Streams and data models for real-time analytics and historical \\r\\ntime-series visualization from connected edge devices. \\r\\n Installed and configured SSL certificates (via Tomcat configuration) for the Thingworx web \\r\\napplication, ensuring encrypted communication and compliance with enterprise security \\r\\nstandards. \\r\\n Performed ThingWorx installation, configuration, and thingworx application deployment in \\r\\nmultiple environments (Dev/Test/Prod). \\r\\n Assisted in ThingWorx migration activities, including server setup, configuration, and \\r\\ndeployment in new environments (Dev /Prod). \\r\\n Participated in migrating ThingWorx entities, services, and mashups across environments using \\r\\nexport/import utilities. \\r\\n Collaborated with cross-functional teams (Operations, Automation Engineers, IT) to ensure \\r\\nsmooth system integrations and timely delivery of solutions.  \\r\\n Monitored system performance, conducted root cause analysis of incidents, and implemented \\r\\npreventive solutions to minimize downtime. \\r\\n Assisted in creating and maintaining technical documentation, including system architecture \\r\\ndiagrams, data flow designs, and user manuals. \\r\\n Built and deployed AWS infrastructure (EC2,S3, IAM, Lambda) via AWS console. Implemented \\r\\nsecure and scalable AWS architecture using EC2, S3, IAM roles, and VPC subnets via AWS \\r\\nconsole; configured security groups, automated back-ups and lifecycle policies to optimize cost \\r\\nand performance. Implemented AWS Infrastructure as code with Terraform to host static \\r\\nwebsite.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2019\", \"degree\": \"Bachelor of Engineering - Electronics and Communication\", \"result\": \"8.88\", \"institution\": \"Basaveshwara Engineering College\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1764169512-220.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('88aa6aaf-03bb-41c3-8e49-fa91dc939366','19087a97-6b29-4de4-a80d-28f25a88b99b','SR INFORMATICA ETL DEVELOPER',NULL,'SR INFORMATICA ETL DEVELOPER',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Informatica\", \"ETL\", \"SQL\", \"Oracle\", \"DB2\", \"SQL\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-14 17:58:23.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"SR INFORMATICA ETL DEVELOPER\", \"company\": \"CARELON GLOBAL SOULTIONS\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]',1750000.00,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('88af797d-6e9c-4e9f-97fe-cc86ace1cc12','a1c09650-7d5d-4e08-81bb-0e5f577a30c6','Test Resume423','Test Resume423','Software Deve',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Guidewire Automation Testing\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-24 21:28:46.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Deve\", \"company\": \"TCS\", \"endD