Software Engineer and QA Automation Engineer (SDET) with hands-on experience designing, building, \r\nand maintaining scalable test automation frameworks for high-scale financial trading systems at NSE (National Stock \r\nExchange). Proficient in Selenium WebDriver, Playwright, TestNG, Postman, and Page Object Model (POM). Experienced in \r\nAPI testing, REST API validation, and backend data verification using SQL. Skilled in validating complex real-time financial \r\nworkflows including margin calculation, position management, collateral processing, and risk exposure through functional \r\ntesting, regression testing, integration testing, smoke testing, and end-to-end testing. Familiar with CI/CD pipelines, Git, \r\nMaven, and Agile/Scrum methodologies. Strong track record in defect management, test case design, test planning, test \r\nstrategy, and root cause analysis in fast-paced delivery environments','Software Engineer – QA Automation',2,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1784029558-227.pdf',NULL,'[]','PUBLIC','2026-07-14 23:12:44.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Engineer – QA Automation\", \"company\": \"Capgemini\", \"endDate\": \"Wed Jul 15\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Fri Sep 20\", \"description\": \"• Designed, developed, and owned end-to-end test automation frameworks for high-scale financial trading platforms \\r\\nat NSE using Selenium WebDriver and Playwright (Java), covering order placement, margin validation, and position \\r\\nmanagement workflows.\\r\\n• Built and maintained a scalable Page Object Model (POM) framework with data-driven testing capabilities, \\r\\nsignificantly improving test reusability, maintainability, and execution efficiency across regression and integration \\r\\ncycles.\\r\\n• Performed comprehensive API testing and REST API validation using Postman and REST Assured, verifying backend \\r\\nservices, response payloads (JSON/XML), status codes, and financial data accuracy for real-time trading operations.\\r\\n• Validated backend data integrity and traceability using complex SQL queries by cross-referencing UI behaviour, API \\r\\nresponses, and database records to detect data inconsistencies in real-time financial systems.\\r\\n• Designed and executed test cases for functional testing, regression testing, integration testing, smoke testing, sanity \\r\\ntesting, and end-to-end testing across multiple release cycles, ensuring application stability and NSE compliance.\\r\\n• Conducted root cause analysis (RCA) on critical defects in margin calculation, collateral processing, and risk exposure \\r\\nvalidation workflows, reducing post-release defect leakage and improving overall product quality.\\r\\n• Collaborated with developers, business analysts, and product owners in Agile/Scrum sprints; maintained defect \\r\\nlifecycle management, test traceability matrix, and sprint-level defect reporting using JIRA.\\r\\n• Integrated automated test suites into CI/CD pipelines using Jenkins and Maven, enabling continuous testing and \\r\\nfaster feedback loops across release cycles.\\r\\n• Contributed to test planning, test strategy documentation, and sprint review discussions, ensuring QA alignment \\r\\nwith business requirements and acceptance criteria.\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1784029558-227.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('896a9cfb-d692-40dd-882a-41067137b7fa','d21984b5-a91e-492b-9d85-d1efec47f21a','Test Resume902','Test Resume902','Software Deve',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Mendix\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-25 12:06:05.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Deve\", \"company\": \"HTC\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[{\"year\": \"\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech\", \"result\": \"\", \"institution\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('897975eb-5446-46bd-9090-57943ea0fba0','2b19ba59-ca3c-45b0-a684-49a9b