ting, inbound nurturing, \\r\\nnetworking, and partnerships with industry stakeholders. \\r\\n Engaged top HR leaders & decision-makers (CXOs, CHROs, HR Heads) through discovery calls, Virtual & \\r\\nface-to-face demos, and product walkthroughs to drive solution adoption. \\r\\n Led the complete sales cycle — from prospecting and demo presentations to negotiations, contract \\r\\nfinalization, and successful closures. \\r\\n Managed sales pipeline & CRM for accurate forecasting, tracking deal progress, and maintaining a \\r\\nhealthy 3x–4x coverage against revenue targets. \\r\\n Delivered post-sales success by coordinating implementation, providing onboarding support, and \\r\\nensuring product adoption within agreed timelines. \\r\\n Achieved revenue growth & retention goals, driving upsell and cross-sell opportunities to increase \\r\\ncustomer lifetime value while maintaining 90%+ retention rate\"}, {\"title\": \"Business Dev. Executive\", \"company\": \"Keka Technologies Pvt. Ltd\", \"endDate\": \"Sat Jun 29\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Fri Mar 31\", \"description\": \" Lead Generation & Prospecting: Identify and target potential clients through market research, cold \\r\\noutreach, and leveraging tools like LinkedIn Sales Navigator, ZoomInfo and Hubspot CRM platforms to \\r\\nbuild a robust sales pipeline. \\r\\n Client Acquisition & Solution Selling: Engage with CHROs, HR leaders, and business owners to address \\r\\ntheir HR and payroll challenges, presenting Keka’s HR software as a tailored solution to streamline \\r\\nemployee engagement, and optimize workforce management. \\r\\n Market Expansion: Develop and execute strategies to penetrate new markets and industries, focusing on \\r\\nSMEs and Enterprises seeking scalable, cloud-based HR solutions. \\r\\n Relationship Building & Account Management: Build and nurture long-term relationships with clients, \\r\\nensuring high satisfaction levels, repeat business, and referrals while identifying opportunities for up \\r\\nselling and cross-selling. \\r\\n Competitor Analysis & Market Trends: Stay updated on industry trends, competitor offerings, and \\r\\nemerging HR technologies to position Keka as a market leader and adapt strategies accordingly. \\r\\n Collaboration with Internal Teams: Work closely with marketing, product, and customer success teams \\r\\nto align sales strategies, execute campaigns, and ensure seamless on-boarding and implementation for \\r\\nnew clients. \\r\\n Revenue Growth & Target Achievement: Drive the end-to-end sales cycle, from lead generation to deal \\r\\nclosure, while consistently meeting or exceeding revenue targets and contributing to Keka’s growth \\r\\nobjectives.\"}, {\"title\": \"Business Dev. Partner\", \"company\": \"Digital Marketing Agency\", \"endDate\": \"Mon Feb 27\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Thu Jun 30\", \"description\": \" Drove market expansion by identifying and penetrating new business segments, including retail, e\\r\\ncommerce, hospitality, and service-based industries, resulting in a 20–25% increase in client base. \\r\\n Generated and nurtured leads through networking, cold outreach, and partnership channels, converting \\r\\nhigh-quality prospects into long-term agency clients. \\r\\n Conducted requirement analysis with decision-makers (CXOs, marketing heads, and business owners) to \\r\\ndesign tailored digital marketing strategies, aligning campaigns with business objectives. \\r\\n Collaborated with the agency’s creative and performance teams to deliver ROI-driven campaigns, \\r\\nenhancing client acquisition and retention rates. \\r\\n Leveraged CRM tools and analytics to track leads, measure campaign performance, and forecast revenue \\r\\ngrowth. \\r\\n Built strategic alliances and referral partnerships to create recurring revenue streams and expand the \\r\\nagency’s presence in untapped markets.\"}, {\"title\": \"Sr. Business Development Executive\", \"company\": \"Webmobril Technologies Pvt. Ltd\", \"endDate\": \"Fri Jul 29\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Tue Nov 30\", \"description\": \" Market Research & Target Identification: Conduct in-depth market research to identify potential clients \\r\\nand industries for US, UK, UAE, ME (e.g., healthcare, e-commerce, education, logistics, and finance) for \\r\\nWebMobril’s IT services, focusing on startups, SMEs, and enterprises. \\r\\n Lead Generation & Prospecting: Utilize advanced lead generation tools such as Upwork, LinkedIn Sales \\r\\nNavigator, ZoomInfo, Apollo.io, and CRM platforms to build a robust pipeline of qualified leads and \\r\\ndecision-makers. \\r\\n Client Acquisition & Relationship Building: Engage with prospects through personalized outreach, \\r\\npresentations, and consultations, showcasing WebMobril’s expertise in delivering scalable, innovative, \\r\\nand cost-effective IT solutions. \\r\\n Solution Selling & Proposal Development: Collaborate with technical teams to craft tailored proposals \\r\\nthat address client needs, emphasizing WebMobril’s capabilities in digital transformation, game \\r\\ndevelopment, Website & Mob. Software development and emerging technologies. \\r\\n Revenue Growth & Target Achievement: Drive end-to-end sales cycles, from lead generation to contract \\r\\nclosure, while consistently meeting or exceeding revenue targets and contributing to the company’s \\r\\ngrowth objectives. \\r\\n Strategic Partnerships: Build and nurture long-term relationships with clients, ensuring repeat business \\r\\nand referrals, while identifying opportunities for upselling and cross-selling.\"}, {\"title\": \"Vendor Manager\", \"company\": \"Swiggy\", \"endDate\": \"Mon Feb 24\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Thu Feb 28\", \"description\": \" Market Expansion & Territory Management: Spearheaded growth in assigned territories by \\r\\nidentifying high-potential markets, onboarding top-tier restaurant partners, and driving \\r\\nconsistent order volume growth. \\r\\n End-to-End Onboarding & Integration: Managed the full onboarding process for restaurant \\r\\npartners, from documentation and compliance to seamless platform integration and go-live \\r\\nreadiness. \\r\\n Field Engagement & Relationship Management: Conducted face-to-face field meetings with \\r\\nrestaurant owners and decision-makers to build strong partnerships, address operational \\r\\nchallenges, and align on growth strategies. \\r\\n Operational Excellence & Partner Support: Resolved post-onboarding operational issues, \\r\\noptimized menu listings, and ensured high service quality to enhance both partner \\r\\nsatisfaction and customer experience. \\r\\n Revenue Growth via Upselling & Cross-Selling: Promoted premium Swiggy offerings, \\r\\nincluding Swiggy POP and advertising solutions, increasing partner revenue streams and \\r\\nplatform engagement. \\r\\n Performance Optimization & Data-Driven Strategy: Leveraged analytics to improve \\r\\noperational efficiency, reduce order turnaround times, and enhance partner performance \\r\\nthrough targeted reviews. \\r\\n Competitive & Market Intelligence: Monitored competitor activity (Zomato, Uber Eats, etc.) \\r\\nto develop proactive strategies and maintain a competitive advantage in the region. \\r\\n Campaign & Event Collaboration: Partnered with restaurants on localized marketing \\r\\ncampaigns and seasonal promotions, boosting visibility, customer acquisition, and sales \\r\\nduring peak demand.\"}, {\"title\": \"Sr. E-commerce Executive\", \"company\": \"Iksula Services\", \"endDate\": \"Sun Dec 30\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Thu Aug 31\", \"description\": \" Catalog Management & Optimization: Oversee product listing, cataloging, and content \\r\\noptimization across e-commerce platforms (e.g., Amazon, Wayfair, Shopify), ensuring \\r\\naccuracy, compliance, and enhanced discoverability through SEO best practices. \\r\\n Team Leadership & Development: Lead and mentor a team of 15 e-commerce executives, fostering \\r\\nexpertise in product listing, data accuracy, and marketplace operations while ensuring timely \\r\\nproject delivery. \\r\\n Performance Analytics & Insights: Monitor KPIs (sales performance, conversion rates, inventory \\r\\nturnover) using tools like Google Analytics and Power BI, delivering actionable insights to drive \\r\\nprofitability and operational efficiency. \\r\\n Process Improvement & SOP Implementation: Develop and standardize procedures for \\r\\ncataloging, bulk uploads, taxonomy structuring, and product data management to enhance \\r\\nteam productivity and minimize errors. \\r\\n Marketplace Strategy & Collaboration: Drive cross-functional initiatives with marketing, inventory, \\r\\nand logistics teams to execute campaigns, manage inventory, and resolve escalations, ensuring \\r\\nseamless marketplace operations and alignment with business goals.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2017\", \"degree\": \"Masters in Business Administration\", \"result\": \"72\", \"institution\": \"Acropolis Institution\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1761331225-852.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('8b54a7aa-aa0a-4d32-ba51-313c8e2bbf55','d91b803d-c1c4-4816-a204-828787c0347a','SAP UI5/Fiori Developer with hands-on experience in developing custom SAPUI5 applications and leading Fiori\r\nrelated activities across multiple SAP S/4HANA upgrade projects. Skilled in identifying impacted standard Fiori\r\napplications and configuring succ','SAP UI5/Fiori Developer with hands-on experience in developing custom SAPUI5 applications and leading Fiori\r\nrelated activities across multiple SAP S/4HANA upgrade projects. Skilled in identifying impacted standard Fiori\r\napplications and configuring successors using insights from SAP Readiness Check, along with performing\r\ncustom UI adjustments and remediations during upgrade cycles. Known for building responsive, user-friendly\r\nweb interfaces that align with business needs. Recognized for strong collaboration across technical and\r\nfunctional teams and delivering consistent, high-quality solutions','Packaged App Development Senior Analyst',4,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1766726198-678.pdf',NULL,'[\"JavaScript\", \"CSS3\", \"HTML5\", \"Github\", \"Sap UI5\", \"SAP FIORI\", \"MVC\", \"XML\", \"SAP Web IDE\", \"Fiori UI\"]','PUBLIC','2025-12-26 17:00:26.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Packaged App Development Senior Analyst\", \"company\": \"Accenture\", \"endDate\": \"Sat Dec 20\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Wed Jul 10\", \"description\": \"Led SAP Fiori activities across three S/4HANA upgrade projects\\r\\n(GIC Singapore, Astemo Japan, Sumitomo Chemical).\\r\\nIdentified impacted standard/custom apps using SAP Readiness\\r\\nCheck and Fiori Impact Analysis.\\r\\nRemediated custom SAPUI5 apps by resolving compatibility\\r\\nissues, adjusting deprecated APIs, and aligning with latest UI5\\r\\nframework standards.\\r\\nActivated and configured successor Fiori apps; redesigned\\r\\ncatalogs and tiles in the Fiori Launchpad.\\r\\nCollaborated with functional teams to validate deprecated apps\\r\\nand ensure business continuity across upgraded landscapes.\\r\\nResolved technical issues and supported key test phases\\r\\n(SIT/UAT) to ensure smooth application validation.\\r\\nProvided post-go-live support by addressing Fiori-related\\r\\nproduction incidents and ensuring stable app behavior.\\r\\nMaintained detailed documentation of upgrade procedures and\\r\\nupdated the technical documentation for objects\"}, {\"title\": \"Senior Systems Engineer\", \"company\": \"Infosys Limited\", \"endDate\": \"Thu Jun 20\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Fri Dec 10\", \"description\": \"Designed, developed, and deployed custom freestyle SAPUI5\\r\\napplications using the SAP Fiori framework.\\r\\nBuilt responsive UI screens based on client wireframes, using\\r\\nthe MVC architecture and best UI5 practices.\\r\\nIntegrated UI5 applications with backend systems via OData\\r\\nservices in close collaboration with ABAP developers.\\r\\nWorked closely with functional teams to understand business\\r\\nprocesses and deliver tailored technical solutions.\\r\\nDelivered key custom freestyle Fiori applications including Cash\\r\\nAdjustment, Leave Balance Maintenance, Time Approval, and\\r\\nInterface Error Reprocessing, built using SAPUI5.\\r\\nExecuted UI manual cutover activities during transport\\r\\nmovement and supported SIT/UAT testing phases by resolving\\r\\nreported defects.\\r\\nDocumented technical specifications for maintainability and\\r\\nteam knowledge sharing\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2021\", \"degree\": \"Bachelor of Mechanical Engineering\", \"result\": \"63\", \"institution\": \"Savitribai Phule Pune University\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1766726198-678.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('8b72c36f-7440-4a8a-b5b2-a1d986d98c22','87d976f2-175e-4b88-8d80-c47c413dcfdb','Node.Js Developer',NULL,'Node.Js Developer',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Docker\", \"Database\", \"JavaScript\", \"AWS\", \"Node JS\", \"Typescript\", \"MYSQL\", \"Node JS\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-14 12:29:44.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"Node.Js Developer\", \"company\": \"Greychain Design pvt ltd\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('8b780e28-7980-4396-9e7d-6b684864555b','52b7d77f-6853-4172-acee-de05950829b7','Senior Android Developer',NULL,'Senior Android Developer',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Java\", \"KOTLIN\", \"Java\", \"KOTLIN\", \"Team Leadership\", \"Optimization\", \"Spring Boot\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-14 19:54:05.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"Senior Android Developer\", \"company\": \"Apprication Pvt Ltd\", \"endDate\": 