t system troubleshooting,  \r\n➢ customization, and ensuring regulatory compliance (FDA, GxP, CSV). Proficient in \r\nLIMS workflows, ELN scripting, and data integration, delivering reliable solutions \r\nacross multiple sites.  Support:  \r\n➢ Ticket resolution (L1/L2), change requests, and user training. Developed and \r\ndeployed customized     Labware modules to streamline workflows for QC/QA \r\nprocesses. \r\n➢  Provide L1/L2 support for  Labware LIMS, reducing ticket resolution time by 25%. \r\nIntegrated analytical instruments (HPLC, GC) with LIMS, automating data transfer \r\nand ensuring compliance. \r\n➢ Collaborated with business teams for requirement gathering and implemented \r\nsolutions across three global sites','Labware LIMS Specialist',6,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1777395893-284.pdf',NULL,'[\"IOT\", \"CSV\", \"LabWare LIMS\", \"QA Management\", \"PLC\", \"LabVantage LIMS\", \"GMP\", \"Power BI\", \"MYSQL\"]','PUBLIC','2026-04-29 04:34:03.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Labware LIMS Specialist\", \"company\": \"Reliance Life science\", \"endDate\": \"Mon Apr 20\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Tue Dec 10\", \"description\": \"• Provide training and guidance to end-users on LIMS system functionality and best practices. \\r\\n• Delivered comprehensive technical support and troubleshooting for     Labware LIMS users, \\r\\nresolving system issues, data inconsistencies, and performance bottlenecks to ensure seamless \\r\\nlaboratory operations.  \\r\\n• Configured and administered Labware LIMS (Basic to advanced level), including workflow \\r\\ndesign, master data setup, instrument calibration, and interface integration to support end-to-end \\r\\nlaboratory processes.  \\r\\n• Developed and implemented custom solutions using     Labware LIMS scripting and business \\r\\nrules, enhancing system capabilities and aligning with complex business requirements.  \\r\\n• Demonstrated strong expertise in SQL and complex query writing, including joins, subqueries, \\r\\nand performance optimization, to extract, analyze, and troubleshoot LIMS data effectively.  \\r\\n• Designed and maintained Power BI online dashboards integrated with SQL databases, enabling \\r\\nreal-time data visualization, reporting, and informed decision-making.  \\r\\n• Collaborated with cross-functional teams (QA, QC, IT, and vendors) to resolve technical \\r\\nchallenges, improve system efficiency, and support continuous process improvement initiatives.  \\r\\n• Created and maintained technical documentation and validation artifacts (CSV), ensuring \\r\\ncompliance with regulatory standards and audit readiness.  \\r\\n• Participated in system upgrades, patch deployments, and validation activities, ensuring smooth \\r\\nimplementation with minimal business disruption.  \\r\\n• Provided end-user training and guidance, promoting best practices and maximizing effective \\r\\nutilization of Labware LIMS functionalities. \\r\\n• Chromeleon and Lab solution L1 Support\"}, {\"title\": \"Labware LIMS Specialist\", \"company\": \"Lupin Ltd.\", \"endDate\": \"Tue Dec 10\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Wed May 10\", \"description\": \"• Experienced in LIMS systems     Labware LIMS supporting end-to-end lifecycle from \\r\\nimplementation to maintenance. Skilled in data integration, user administration, and validation \\r\\n(IQ, OQ, PQ) with a background in CSV. \\r\\n• Enhancement Activity: Collaborated with cross-functional teams to gather and analyze user \\r\\nrequirements, translating them into functional and technical specifications for     \\r\\nLabware LIMS \\r\\nenhancements. \\r\\n• Module qualification (e.g Lot, Inventory, Instrument, Stability) \\r\\n• User ID Creation and Modification \\r\\n• Instrument Integration Activity: Configured and integrated laboratory instruments with     \\r\\nLabware LIMS, enabling seamless data capture and reporting.\"}, {\"title\": \"Labware LIMS Specialist\", \"company\": \"Syngene Internation Ltd\", \"endDate\": \"Thu Apr 20\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Wed Nov 24\", \"description\": \"• Lab vantage LIMS master data review, implementation support \\r\\n• Preparation of Master data Configuration and LIMS & CSV deliverables like URS, GxP, FRA, \\r\\nFRS, DCS, IQ, OQ, PQ, SRC, TM, VSR, SOP’s. \\r\\n• Responsible for implementation of Quality Improvement plan initiatives for continual \\r\\nimprovement in product, quality, process and services. \\r\\n• Preparation, review and approval of standard operating procedure, with GMP and regulatory \\r\\ncompliance. Involved in preparation/review/ approval of various documents as \\r\\nSTP/Spec/Protocols/Reports. \\r\\n• Responsible for audit and compliance. Handling and participating in Internal Audit Processes. \\r\\nResponsible for shop floor related activities with regards to planning of work, troubleshooting, \\r\\nresource arrangement, SOP training, Shift Schedule preparation, Monthly report and various lab \\r\\npreparations etc. \\r\\n• Stability Summary report and stability pull schedule preparation.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2018\", \"degree\": \"M.Sc. in Organic Chemistry\", \"result\": \"63\", \"institution\": \"C.T Bora Collage\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1777395893-284.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('8c1415da-028e-47ba-98bf-4c12f006ac2f','4c1b16f7-2e04-4a10-80a1-06295072d8bf','Test Resume226','Test Resume226','Software Deve',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\".NET\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-24 21:19:39.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Deve\", \"company\": \"TCS\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[{\"year\": \"\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech\", \"result\": \"\", \"institution\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('8c1c5b95-e66e-4bfb-8ecb-4910f2edbb6b','2b5c9a5a-85a3-4e38-b654-95267d8cf397','Experienced MES Developer with expertise i