omation Engineer\", \"company\": \"DDE Bioengineering Pvt. Ltd\", \"endDate\": \"Tue Nov 05\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Sat Feb 05\", \"description\": \"• Led control system architecture design, P&ID review, IO count validation, and integration of high-end \\r\\nsoftware (Historian, FTTM, Asset Center, Batch). \\r\\n• Executed Pre-FAT and FAT activities including loop verification, calibration, IO testing, and audit trail \\r\\nverification. \\r\\n• Ensured 21 CFR Part 11 compliance, GAMP-5 adherence, ISA-88 batch standard implementation, and \\r\\nSDLC documentation. \\r\\n• Prepared comprehensive automation proposals including system architecture, BOM, costing, and URS \\r\\ncompliance for technical sales. \\r\\n• Managed third-party system integrations and coordinated with clients across Egypt and India for project \\r\\ndelivery.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2021\", \"degree\": \"Bachelor of Engineering – Instrumentation Engineering\", \"result\": \"70\", \"institution\": \"Savitribai Phule Pune University\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1783363684-928.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('8e1240b3-9063-4ca3-b634-276a9aed11f7','48c5ffca-b1d2-4f20-8834-691cf4f09d6f','Test Resume132','Test Resume132','Software Deve',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"PL/SQL\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-25 10:56:21.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Deve\", \"company\": \"Accenture\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[{\"year\": \"\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech\", \"result\": \"\", \"institution\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('8e149da2-c15f-4b54-8741-bedc5641bb5e','389bd8a4-1475-4c4d-be2e-8f07c15edea9','Experienced in designing, developing, and managing robust data pipelines and \r\narchitectures using technologies like Python, PySpark, Azure Data Factory, \r\nDatabricks, SQL, Scala and Spark. Adept at ETL processes, data modeling, and \r\ndata warehousing sol','Experienced in designing, developing, and managing robust data pipelines and \r\narchitectures using technologies like Python, PySpark, Azure Data Factory, \r\nDatabricks, SQL, Scala and Spark. Adept at ETL processes, data modeling, and \r\ndata warehousing solutions, with hands-on expertise in cloud platforms (Azure, \r\nAWS). Skilled in optimizing data workflows for performance, scalability, and \r\nreliability while ensuring data security and compliance. Strong problem-solving \r\nabilities with a focus on delivering data solutions that support business \r\nintelligence and analytics Python, SQL, Databricks, Azure Data Factory, PySpark \r\n, Apache Spark, Hadoop , Hive , Pig , Java, Scala, ETL (Extract, Transform, \r\nLoad), Apache Hadoop, Apache Spark, Apache Flink, Apache Kafka, AWS \r\n(S3, Glue, Redshift, Lambda, EC2), Azure (Data Factory, Databricks, Synapse, \r\nBlob storage, ADLS, Azure DevOps, KeyVault, Logic Apps), Google Cloud \r\n(BigQuery, Cloud Storage, Dataflow), MySQL, PostgreSQL, Oracle, MongoDB, \r\nCassandra, Couchbase, HBase, Data Modeling, Star Schema, Snowflake Schema, \r\nDimensional Modeling, Data Lineage, Apache Airflow, Luigi, AWS Step Functions, \r\nGit, CI/CD, Jenkins, GitLab CI, CircleCI, Data Security, GDPR Compliance, Docker, \r\nKubernetes, Power BI, Tableau, Looker, Problem Solving, Communication, Project \r\nManagement','Data Engineer',4,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1768381089-669.pdf',NULL,'[\"Big Data\", \"Data Warehousing\", \"Data Mining (Basic Level)\", \"Hadoop Ecosystem\", \"ETL\", \"Data Modeling\", \"Cloud Computing\", \"Data Visualization\", \"Machine Learning\", \"Data Analysis\", \"ATHENA\", \"MYSQL\", \"Python\", \"Apache Spark\", \"NoSQL\", \"Data Migration\"]','PUBLIC','2026-01-14 21:08:28.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Data Engineer\", \"company\": \"United Healthcare\", \"endDate\": \"Sat Jan 10\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Tue Sep 10\", \"description\": 