ltiple data sources (SQL Server, Excel, oracle) into\\r\\nPower BI Service with automated refresh schedules. \\r\\nCollaborated with stakeholders to define requirements and\\r\\ndeliver insightful KPIs for decision- making. \\r\\nPerform Data Modeling and maintained relationships\\r\\nbetween data using different Joins. \\r\\nExperienced in the creation of Calculated Tables,\\r\\nCalculated Columns, and Calculated Measures using DAX\\r\\n,Iterative Functions . \\r\\nDesigned Interactive Visualizations Using Slicer, Filter and\\r\\ncreated Hierarchies for Drill-down data and Drill- through\\r\\nfilters. Experienced in the creation of various visualizations\\r\\nlike Line, Bar, Table, Pie, Matrix Table, Area, Tree Map,\\r\\nWaterfall, Funnel, Clustered & Stacked, and many other\\r\\nvisualizations.\\r\\nDesigned and delivered enterprise BI solutions using Power\\r\\nBI, SSIS, and SSRS for healthcare and banking clients.\\r\\nDeveloped SSIS packages for extracting, transforming, and\\r\\nloading data from SQL Server, Oracle, and flat files into\\r\\nreporting databases.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2015\", \"degree\": \"MCA: Computer Application\", \"result\": \"72\", \"institution\": \"Anna University\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1777230596-355.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('8f8a6160-bd1f-4f89-9739-144739d8e828','b7a191d6-98b8-4f3a-923a-196b497b2510','Results-driven Digital Transformation Consultant and Industrial IT/OT Architect with 7+ years of experience designing \r\nand delivering enterprise-scale Industry 4.0 and smart manufacturing solutions across diverse industrial sectors. Proven \r\nability to l','Results-driven Digital Transformation Consultant and Industrial IT/OT Architect with 7+ years of experience designing \r\nand delivering enterprise-scale Industry 4.0 and smart manufacturing solutions across diverse industrial sectors. Proven \r\nability to lead cross-functional and multi-geography teams, govern full project lifecycles, and architect scalable IT/OT \r\nintegrated platforms aligned with ISA-95 and industrial digital strategy.\r\nDeep expertise in FactoryTalk DataMosaix (FTDM), MES/SCADA, IIoT platform delivery, Digital Twins, OEE/Energy \r\nManagement Systems, Golden Batch Optimization, and EBPR/E-Logbook solutions. Recognized for translating \r\ncomplex business and operational requirements into scalable architectural designs that drive measurable OEE \r\nimprovement, cost reduction, and digital adoption at scale','Software Engineer',4,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1779118739-162.pdf',NULL,'[\"Digital Transformation\", \"Mes\", \"AI/ML\", \"AWS\", \"JIRA\", \"Industrial IT/OT\", \"EBR\", \"SCADA\", \"IIoT\", \"OEE Analysis\", \"OPC UA\", \"Modbus\", \"SQL\"]','PUBLIC','2026-05-19 03:06:47.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Engineer\", \"company\": \"Rockwell Automation\", \"endDate\": \"Mon Apr 20\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Wed Oct 10\", \"description\": \"• Architected and led end-to-end Industrial IT/OT integrated solutions across 5+ diverse industrial sectors, ensuring \\r\\nconsistency and integrity across manufacturing applications and digital platforms.\\r\\n• Supervised the architectural design and implementation of industrial information systems including IIoT platforms, \\r\\nMES/SCADA layers, and real-time data visualization aligned with ISA-95 model.\\r\\n• Spearheaded 20+ FactoryTalk DataMosaix (FTDM) implementations, setting and enforcing documentation \\r\\nstandards, architectural blueprints, and delivery governance frameworks.\\r\\n• Drove enterprise integration of manufacturing platforms with IT systems, coordinating across global IT, \\r\\nengineering, and operations stakeholders to align technical solutions with business objectives.\"}, {\"title\": \"Operating Engineer\", \"company\": \"MAHLE Behr India Ltd\", \"endDate\": \"Thu Sep 20\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Tue Aug 15\",