try streams for real-time\\r\\n system health monitoring and behavioral analytics.\\r\\n • Used Databricks as a unified data analytics platform to build and orchestrate scalable ETL pipelines, enabling efficient\\r\\n transformation and processing of large telemetry datasets for real-time insights.\\r\\n • Created internal dashboards and alerts for anomaly detection, performance issues, and content usage trends.\\r\\n • Managedthefull on-premise deployment stack (Kafka, Spark, PostgreSQL- MySQL, Django) with CI/CD automation\\r\\n through GitLab CI across two fault-tolerant RHEL9 nodes.\\r\\n • Achieved 60% faster issue detection, improved showcase performance, and enabled near real-time insights for business\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2022\", \"degree\": \"B.E. in Computer Engineering\", \"result\": \"80\", \"institution\": \"Rajiv Gandhi Institute of Technology\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1764085553-633.pdf\", \"title\": \"cv\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('8fc1f8e9-0ddc-48c0-925e-89eabd1c9112','c536bf0c-73ea-4b21-be16-527b937c49c9','Test Resume305','Test Resume305','Software Deve',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"SmartComm\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-26 17:40:11.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Deve\", \"company\": \"Devlogic Solutions\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[{\"year\": \"\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech\", \"result\": \"\", \"institution\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('8fc74420-cc84-4cad-95c3-6187acd05db7','7d09fbbc-d001-4814-9a83-51cbf24fcebc','Test Resume56','Test Resume56','Software Deve',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\".NET\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-24 21:11:38.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Deve\", \"company\": \"Xceedance\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[{\"year\": \"\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech\", \"result\": \"\", \"institution\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('8fd4db9c-00fc-439e-90c6-ed28d6b47bf6','d53f1391-70e8-41c8-ac75-3b28aee83acd','Generative AI Engineer with 4+ years of experience designing, developing and deploying enterprise AI applications using \r\nLarge Language Models (LLMs), Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG), Agentic AI and intelligent automation. Hands-on \r\nexperience with','Generative AI Engineer with 4+ years of experience designing, developing and deploying enterprise AI applications using \r\nLarge Language Models (LLMs), Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG), Agentic AI and intelligent automation. Hands-on \r\nexperience with Python, Azure OpenAI, LangChain, LangGraph, FastAPI, semantic and hybrid retrieval, embeddings, \r\nreranking and vector databases. Experienced in building enterprise knowledge assistants, multi-agent workflows, \r\ndocument-processing solutions and AI-powered recruitment applications. Skilled in API development, cloud deployment, \r\nevaluation, monitoring and optimization using Microsoft Azure, Docker, Kubernetes, PostgreSQL, Redis and CI/CD.','Professional',1,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1792092276-406.pdf',NULL,'[]','PUBLIC','2026-10-16 06:53:18.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1792092276-406.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('8fd4f5d0-3b10-45a6-8f34-8a49f16aa2bf','87b97f99-f7fe-4c1a-9c2f-81aef5051a03','Computer Vision Engineer with 4 years of experience building AI-based computer vision solutions for image processing \r\nand image retrieval (CBIR). Skilled in building object detection systems using YOLO, along with image preprocessing, \r\nfeature extractio','Computer Vision Engineer with 4 years of experience building AI-based computer vision solutions for image processing \r\nand image retrieval (CBIR). Skilled in building object detection systems using YOLO, along with image preprocessing, \r\nfeature extraction, and image similarity search. Experienced with Python, OpenCV, PyTorch, TensorFlow, and Flask, and \r\ncomfortable building deep learning applications for object detection, image classification, and image segmentation. \r\nEnjoys solving real-world problems with practical AI solutions.','Software Engineer',2,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/arun-kumar-panda-1791375853-224.pdf',NULL,'[\"Machine Learning\", \"Computer Vision\", \"Flask\", \"Python\", \"Transformers\", \"Jupyter\", \"PyTorch\", \"OpenCV\"]','PUBLIC','2026-10-07 23:45:11.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Engineer\", \"company\": \"alfaTKG, Computer Vision & AI\", \"endDate\": \"Thu Oct 01\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Tue Jun 21\", \"description\": \"• Built a YOLO-based system that automatically removes templates & unwanted texts from engineering drawings, \\r\\nwhich improved the accuracy of feature extraction and image search. \\r\\n• Built a YOLO-based system to detect and filter out irrelevant or low-quality engineering drawings before they went \\r\\ninto the CBIR pipeline, improving result quality and reducing wasted processing time. \\r\\n• Built and fine-tuned an ImageNet-pretrained Vision Transformer on a custom dataset and developed a feature \\r\\nextraction pipeline to generate image embeddings for Content-Based Image Retrieval (CBIR). \\r\\n• Built image classification pipelines involving data preprocessing, augmentation, model training, evaluation, and \\r\\noptimization using EfficientNet, GoogleNet. \\r\\n• Set up and deployed the CBIR system on client computers, making it easy for users to access and use through the \\r\\ninterface. \\r\\n• Found and fixed critical bugs by working closely with the team, improving overall system reliability.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2021\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech in Mechanical Engineering (MAKAUT)\", \"result\": \"7.90\", \"institution\": \"College of Engineering and Management\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes