ractices across the team, driving improvements in\\r\\ncode quality and reducing technical debt by 30%,\\r\\nwhile fostering a culture of continuous improvement\\r\\nthrough regular retrospectives. Optimized backend\\r\\nservices and database queries in collaboration with\\r\\nthe development team, improving performance by\\r\\nreducing load times and increasing efficiency by\\r\\n25%, while encouraging cross-functional\"}, {\"title\": \"Software Developer\", \"company\": \"SERVOSYS SOLUTIONS\", \"endDate\": \"Fri May 10\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Mon Jan 05\", \"description\": \"Improved software efficiency by troubleshooting and\\r\\nresolving coding issues, achieving a 25% increase in\\r\\nfunctionality and minimizing downtime by 40%.\\r\\nSaved time and resources by proactively identifying\\r\\nand fixing bugs during development, resulting in a\\r\\n30% reduction in post-deployment fixes and a 20%\\r\\nincrease in overall project efficiency. Optimized\\r\\napplication performance through regular code\\r\\nreviews and refactoring, enhancing overall system\\r\\nreliability. Modified and upgraded software systems,\\r\\nresulting in a 30% improvement in performance and\\r\\nenhanced user experience.\"}, {\"title\": \"Software Engineer Trainee\", \"company\": \"SERVOSYS SOLUTIONS\", \"endDate\": \"Thu Jan 15\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Thu Jun 05\", \"description\": \"Collaborated with senior developers to implement\\r\\nfeatures, enhancing application functionality by 15%\\r\\nand improving user satisfaction. Assisted in\\r\\ndeveloping and testing software applications,\\r\\ncontributing to a 20% reduction in bug reports.\\r\\nConducted research on new technologies, providing\\r\\ninsights that helped the team implement innovative\\r\\nsolutions, improving project outcomes by 10%.\\r\\nLearned to utilize version control systems (e.g., svn)\\r\\nduring training sessions, effectively managing code\\r\\nchanges and reducing merge conflicts