thon\", \"MYSQL\", \"Pyspark\", \"Shell Scripts\", \"ELT Pipelines\", \"Data Ingestion\", \"Power BI\", \"Tableau\", \"Redshift\", \"Snowflake\", \"Process Optimization\", \"S3\", \"Apache Spark\"]','PUBLIC','2026-01-21 09:01:40.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"AWS Data Engineer\", \"company\": \"NeuralMetrics Pvt Ltd,\", \"endDate\": \"Thu May 15\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Thu Sep 15\", \"description\": \"End-to-End AWS Data Pipeline for Investment Banking Trade, Risk & Financial Reporting\\r\\n•\\r\\nArchitected and developed an end-to-end AWS data pipeline to process investment banking trade, \\r\\nposition, and reference data using S3, AWS Glue, PySpark, and Lambda.\\r\\n•\\r\\nBuilt scalable ETL/ELT workflows in PySpark on EMR to ingest, cleanse, and standardize multi\\r\\nsource trading and market data while ensuring data quality and schema consistency.\\r\\n•\\r\\nDesigned Redshift data models and optimized data structures to support reporting for trade \\r\\nlifecycle, P&L, exposure analysis, and risk management operations.\\r\\n•\\r\\nImplemented Snowflake as a cloud data warehouse for downstream analytics, including financial \\r\\ndata modeling, staging layers, and automated ELT pipelines.\\r\\n•\\r\\nUsed Apache Airflow to orchestrate batch pipelines, automate dependencies, and enforce reliable \\r\\ndata processing for investment banking trade and risk datasets.\\r\\n•\\r\\nIntegrated data validation, reconciliation, audit checks, and error-handling frameworks to ensure \\r\\naccuracy and regulatory compliance for capital markets data processing.\\r\\n•\\r\\nCollaborated with front-office, risk, and finance teams to translate business rules into scalable data \\r\\ntransformations and deliver production-ready data pipelines\"}, {\"title\": \"AWS Data Engineer\", \"company\": \"Relationship Science India Pvt Ltd.\", \"endDate\": \"Tue Sep 20\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Fri Jan 10\", \"description\": \"Project: Migration of Investment Banking Data from On-Prem Databases to AWS S3\\r\\n•\\r\\nMigrated investment banking reference, counterparty, and relationship data from legacy on-prem \\r\\nrelational systems to AWS S3, ensuring secure, reliable, and cloud-native data availability.\\r\\n•\\r\\nEngineered scalable ingestion pipelines using AWS Glue, Python, and Spark to extract, normalize, \\r\\nand package structured and semi-structured banking data for cloud storage.\\r\\n•\\r\\nEstablished S3-based partitioning strategies and data layout standards to support optimized \\r\\ndownstream consumption and long-term archival requirements.\\r\\n•\\r\\nImplemented schema evolution, metadata enrichment, and catalog integration using AWS Glue \\r\\nData Catalog to support discoverability across analytics teams.\\r\\n•\\r\\nDeveloped automated orchestration workflows using Apache Airflow to coordinate migration \\r\\nsteps, manage dependencies, and streamline incremental banking data loads.\\r\\n•\\r\\nDesigned validation routines, source-to-target checks, and reconciliation workflows to ensure data \\r\\nintegrity throughout the migration process.\\r\\n•\\r\\nPartnered with data governance, platform engineering, and risk/finance analytics teams to align \\r\\ncloud migration architecture with security, regulatory compliance, and operational objectives\"}, {\"title\": \"Associate\", \"company\": \"Relationship Science India Pvt Ltd\", \"endDate\": \"Tue Dec 05\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Wed Dec 10\", \"description\": \"Performed data auditing and quality assurance on company and executive records to maintain \\r\\naccuracy within large-scale business intelligence databases.\\r\\n•\\r\\nSupported workflow documentation and assisted in refining data validation processes to enhance \\r\\noperational efficiency and reduce review time.\\r\\n•\\r\\nCollaborated with senior analysts to verify key business relationships and organizational \\r\\nhierarchies, improving the precision of relationship mapping and profile accuracy.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2013\", \"degree\": \"B.E. (ECE)\", \"result\": \"75\", \"institution\": \"Maamallan Institute of Technology\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1768942029-695.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('91033281-f3b8-47da-aaa7-df36e24c002d','6af27351-3429-4930-8a56-815b422c27b1','Looking for a challenging career in an organization that will provide me an opportunity to apply \r\nmy skills and experience for the advancement of the organization and my continued growth.','Looking for a challenging career in an organization that will provide me an opportunity to apply \r\nmy skills and experience for the advancement of the organization and my continued growth.','Mendix Modules Specialist',1,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1746595055-859.pdf',NULL,'[\"Mendix Modules\", \"Java\", \"JavaScript\", \"AWS\", \"JSON\", \"HTML\", \"CSS\", \"XML\", \"XPath\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-07 05:10:59.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1746595055-859.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('91055248-cdc1-11f1-8b79-5af6d5d60584','cad78692-81b7-4f7c-b251-f845eb446bd8','Senior Full Stack Engineer | Next.js & NestJS Specialist','Passionate developer with 6+ years building enterprise web applications, microservices, and dynamic design systems.','Senior Full Stack Developer',6,2400000.00,'/uploads/resumes/sample-resume.pdf',NULL,'[\"TypeScript\", \"Next.js\", \"NestJS\", \"React\", \"Tailwind CSS\", \"TypeORM\", \"MySQL\", \"Redis\"]','PUBLIC','2026-10-22 02:37:46.000000','2026-10-22 02:37:46.000000','[{\"id\": \"exp-1\", \"title\": \"Senior Full Stack Engineer\", \"company\": \"TechCorp Global\", \"endDate\": \"Present\", \"location\": \"Bengaluru, India\", \"isCurrent\": true, \"startDate\": \"2022-03-01\", \"jobSummary\": \"Led micro-frontend architectures with Next.js and h