grate deployments, DNS management for 1000+ server migrations, VMware SRM disaster recovery, and CrowdStrike global outage remediation across 2000+ servers. Consistently recognised for deep root cause analysis, cross-team coordination, and resolving critical production incidents at enterprise scale. Currently completing AZ-104 Microsoft Azure Administrator certification.','Professional',1,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1773322175-165.docx',NULL,'[]','PUBLIC','2026-03-13 00:56:10.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1773322175-165.docx\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('92315872-791a-4793-8d95-de6fd3379575','47489d1c-89a3-44a0-aeb9-d01fc5516084','Backend Software Engineer with 3 years of experience in C#/.NET and semiconductor manufacturing automation,\r\nspecialising in SECS/GEM protocol implementation, equipment-host integration, and industrial MES systems.\r\nDelivered 3 production systems — a SECS','Backend Software Engineer with 3 years of experience in C#/.NET and semiconductor manufacturing automation,\r\nspecialising in SECS/GEM protocol implementation, equipment-host integration, and industrial MES systems.\r\nDelivered 3 production systems — a SECS/GEM host communication platform, E30/E87 equipment simulators, and a\r\ndistributed licensing module — across 12+ client deployments in live FAB environments. Hands-on expertise in\r\nASP.NET Core, Windows Services, ActiveMQ, SQL Server, and SEMI standards E30, E40, E87, and E94, with strong\r\nfoundations in multithreading, async programming, SOLID principles, and design patterns. Microsoft Azure\r\nFundamentals (AZ-900) certified, with growing focus on cloud-integrated MES and IoT-connected factory automation','Software Engineer — C#.NET / Semiconductor Automation',4,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1782936303-101.pdf',NULL,'[\".NET Framework\", \"ASP.NET Core\", \"C#\", \".NET Framework\", \"ASP.NET\", \"Exception Handling\",