fficiency gain. Designed and deployed end-to-end real-time analytics solutions using Microsoft Fabric \r\nReal-Time Intelligence (RTI) covering Eventstream ingestion, Eventhouse/KQL Database, KQL QuerySets, and \r\nReal-Time Dashboards. Pioneered Generative AI and LLM-based solutions including a conversational analytics \r\nplatform and a RAG-based Finance P&L insights system using vector database retrieval. Championed data \r\ngovernance frameworks and stakeholder management across cross-functional teams. Recognised as Star of \r\nExcellence 2024 at Teleperformance','Senior Data Engineer',4,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1776442445-907.pdf',NULL,'[\"Database\", \"Data Lake\", \"Bigquery\", \"Bash\", \"Github\", \"Docker\", \"Azure Databricks\", \"Apache Spark\", \"ADF\", \"ADLS Gen2\", \"Pyspark\", \"SQL\", \"Powershell\", \"LangChain\"]','PUBLIC','2026-04-18 03:42:05.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Senior Data Engineer\", \"company\": \"Teleperformance\", \"endDate\": \"Wed Apr 15\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Thu Feb 02\", \"description\": \"• Architected and led end-to-end Databricks migration using Apache Spark, PySpark, Python multithreading, \\r\\nand optimised cluster configurations, achieving 45% cost savings and 50% efficiency gain on the cloud \\r\\ndata platform; enabled real-time streaming and batch analytics via Delta Lake and Spark SQL.\\r\\n• Architected and built ETL/ELT pipelines using Azure Data Factory (ADF), Azure Synapse, Azure Functions, \\r\\nand ADLS Gen2 across batch and streaming workloads. Managed stakeholder requirements across business \\r\\nand engineering teams, integrating REST APIs, SharePoint, and Workday for seamless data flow across 10+ \\r\\nenterprise source systems.\\r\\n• Designed and implemented end-to-end real-time streaming pipelines using Microsoft Fabric Real-Time \\r\\nIntelligence (RTI) on the cloud data platform: ingested live event streams via Eventstream from sources \\r\\nincluding the Genesis API and Power Automate, persisted data into Eventhouse and KQL Database, \\r\\nauthored KQL QuerySets for low-latency analytics, built Real-Time Dashboards for live operational \\r\\nmonitoring, and configured Activator to trigger automated alerts on threshold breaches. Enabled sub-second \\r\\ndata freshness for financial and operational use cases.\\r\\n• Delivered CI/CD pipelines via Azure DevOps for cloud-native notebook and pipeline deployments. Applied \\r\\nPython performance tuning on Databricks, Azure Fabric, and GCP BigQuery, reducing process costs by \\r\\n20% as measured on the relevant workloads.\\r\\n• Managed and mentored a team of 3 AI Data Engineers to deliver Generative AI and LLM-based solutions: (1) \\r\\nan LLM-powered conversational data platform, (2) a contextual RAG system with vector database retrieval for \\r\\nAHT and Finance P&L insights, and (3) a legal clause classifier using OCR and Azure Document Intelligence.\\r\\n• Designed a unified ingestion framework for CSV, JSON, and Parquet files, standardising pipeline onboarding \\r\\nacross the data lakehouse and improving team-wide development efficiency.\\r\\n• Accelerated data processing by approximately 30% through Delta Lake OPTIMIZE/ZORDER tuning and \\r\\nApache Spark SQL query optimisation, based on observed query run-time improvements.\\r\\n• Processed structured and unstructured data (CSV, JSON, Parquet, PDFs) into governed Delta Lake tables. \\r\\nEnforced data governance standards including schema enforcement, data quality checks, and Unity Catalog \\r\\naccess controls for downstream reliability.\"}, {\"title\": \"Cloud Consultant\", \"company\": \"Teleperformance\", \"endDate\": \"Fri Feb 10\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Wed Aug 10\", \"description\": \"• Developed CI/CD pipelines in Azure DevOps for seamless deployment of cloud resources and applications, \\r\\nreducing manual deployment steps.\\r\\n• Automated Azure resource monitoring using PowerShell scripts, enabling proactive alerting and reducing \\r\\nmanual oversight overhead.\\r\\n• Supported cloud infrastructure provisioning and onboarding activities, building foundational expertise across \\r\\nAzure services that directly informed subsequent data engineering work.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2021\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech, Mechanical Engineering\", \"result\": \"72\", \"institution\": \"Inderprastha Engineering College,\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1776442445-907.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('9381ab71-3177-4520-b9dc-c38200ef93c4','9fa1e2f3-d721-4e91-96e5-381756049bb9','	MES professional with 9+ years of experience in automotive manufacturing, specializing in MES operations, system integration, implementation, configuration, production support, and manufacturing system optimization.\r\n	Strong expertise in Siemens OpsCen','	MES professional with 9+ years of experience in automotive manufacturing, specializing in MES operations, system integration, implementation, configuration, production support, and manufacturing system optimization.\r\n	Strong expertise in Siemens OpsCenter MES, PLC Integration, SCADA, Production Buffer System (PBS), DSA Server, SQL Server, Jasper Reports, SSRS, XML, and XSLT.\r\n	Experienced in Greenfield plant implementation, new model launches, production line commissioning, MES-ERP integration, system testing, UAT, deployment, and production stabilization.\r\n	Strong hands-on experience across Body Shop, Paint Shop, General Assembly, Trim & Chassis, and Powertrain manufacturing processes.\r\n	Experienced in integrating MES with PLC, SCADA, ERP, PBS, RFID, barcode scanners, printers, conveyors, and other shop-floor systems.\r\n	Strong expertise in SQL database analysis, troubleshooting, report development, system monitoring, root-cause analysis, and production issue resolution.\r\n	Effective communicator with strong cross-functional coordination, stakeholder manage