iguration, robotics logic, and MES integration.\\r\\n\\tWorked with RFID, barcode systems, SQL, and Tibero databases for manufacturing applications and traceability.\\r\\n\\tSupported MES activities for SAP, JIS, IQIS, and EV projects.\\r\\n\\tMonitored application health and system availability through process monitoring and production system monitoring.\\r\\n\\tCreated and configured new devices and production configurations based on manufacturing requirements.\\r\\n\\tCreated and maintained forms, conditions, and configurations for new vehicle models.\\r\\n\\tAdded and modified robotics codes and conditions in BSM for new and existing vehicle models.\\r\\n\\tCreated and configured PLC thread programs for production equipment and OEM EOL machines.\\r\\n\\tTroubleshot MES, PLC, robotics, and shop-floor communication issues to support uninterrupted production.\"}, {\"title\": \"Senior MES Operations Specialist\", \"company\": \"Vinfast Auto India Pvt Ltd\", \"endDate\": \"Thu Jan 01\", \"isCurrent\": true, \"startDate\": \"Tue Jun 03\", \"description\": \"\\tLead MES operations and technical support for automotive manufacturing, covering MES configuration, PLC integration, SCADA, PBS, Line Builder, reporting, and shop-floor system integration.\\r\\n\\tConfigure and deploy Siemens Opcenter MES production lines, including process routing, operations, stations, resources, materials, and product configurations.\\r\\n\\tLead MES activities for Greenfield plant implementation, including MES design, configuration, commissioning, testing, deployment, production launch, and stabilization.\\r\\n\\tSupport new model launches and new production line implementation, including end-to-end MES configuration and production validation.\\r\\n\\tConfigure and maintain Line Builder integration between MES and PLC systems.\\r\\n\\tDesign and develop Jasper Reports for Production Broadcast Sheets, operator instructions, manufacturing documents, and production reports.\\r\\n\\tDevelop Microsoft Report Builder (SSRS) reports for production, quality, logistics, traceability, and management reporting.\\r\\n\\tPerform SQL Server data analysis, query development, optimization, troubleshooting, and validation for MES databases and reporting requirements.\\r\\n\\tDevelop and maintain XML files and XSLT transformations for data exchange and connector integration between MES and external systems.\\r\\n\\tConfigure and support DSA Server integration for reliable manufacturing data communication.\\r\\n\\tInstall, configure, monitor, and troubleshoot MES applications across production servers and client systems.\\r\\n\\tIntegrate conveyor systems with MES to support material flow, vehicle tracking, and production traceability.\\r\\n\\tDesign and configure SCADA/Andon screens to display real-time production status, downtime, and key manufacturing KPIs.\\r\\n\\tIntegrate and support the Production Buffer System (PBS) with MES for vehicle sequencing and production flow management.\\r\\n\\tConfigure MES processes for Body Shop, Paint Shop, and General Assembly operations.\\r\\n\\tImplement and deploy E-Sector project production lines and manufacturing workflows.\\r\\n\\tDevelop and maintain MES interfaces with PLCs, barcode scanners, RFID devices, label printers, conveyors, and other shop-floor equipment.\\r\\n\\tConfigure and support Manifest Kitting processes in coordination with Logistics teams to ensure accurate parts sequencing and line-side material availability.\\r\\n\\tMonitor and troubleshoot interfaces between MES, ERP, PLC, SCADA, PBS, Logistics, and third-party systems.\\r\\n\\tAnalyze production incidents, perform root-cause analysis, and implement corrective actions to minimize production downtime.\\r\\n\\tSupport engineering changes, new model launches, process improvements, and manufacturing configuration updates.\\r\\n\\tExecute system testing, User Acceptance Testing (UAT), production validation, commissioning, and post-deployment support.\\r\\n\\tPrepare technical documentation, SOPs, troubleshooting guides, and provide training to MES users and production teams.\\r\\n\\tEnsure production traceability, manufacturing data integrity, system reliability, and high MES availability.\\r\\n\\tDrive continuous improvement initiatives to improve manufacturing efficiency, system performance, production traceability, and operational stability.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2012\", \"degree\": \"Computer Applications\", \"result\": \"7.4\", \"institution\": \"ANNA UNIVERSITY\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/gurumoorthy-g-1790846209-571.docx\", \"title\": \"GURUMOORTHY G\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('93919c1f-1751-49d2-804c-52e0325b3e8c','3e0ca524-3c5b-4042-850c-b8ea546b44ba','Professional',NULL,'Professional',1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','PUBLIC','2025-05-23 20:37:10.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('93923992-3dbe-4d46-88fa-c0b691600398','18b269e2-995d-4d02-bd67-48712eb53977','Junior .NET Full Stack Developer',NULL,'Junior .NET Full Stack Developer',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Java\", \"CSS\", \"JavaScript\", \"HTML\", \"Bootstrap\", \"Bootstrap\", \"ABAP\", \"MYSQL\", \"PHP\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-15 06:21:10.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"Junior .NET Full Stack Developer\", \"company\": \"Greysoft\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('9393344d-93a2-4bf4-ae78-dbf4fa41d323','23cc4ffd-e3bd-4bdc-af0d-86355647172b','Test Resume218','Test Resume218','Software Deve',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Informatica\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-26 08:09:57.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Deve\", \"company\": \"Technics\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[{\"year\": \"\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech\", \"result\": \"\", \"institution\": \"