evOps\", \"Confluence\", \"Excel\", \"Agile\", \"Kanban\", \"MS Project\", \"Power BI\", \"Tableau\", \"SQL Server\", \"SSRS\", \"DAX\", \"PowerPoint\", \"Sharepoint\", \"Scrum Framework\", \"Waterfall Methodology\", \"SDLC\"]','PUBLIC','2026-10-17 01:14:31.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Project Manager\", \"company\": \"Alpha & Omega\", \"endDate\": \"Thu Oct 15\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Sun Sep 10\", \"description\": \"• Manage end-to-end coordination for 3 active client accounts in a fast-paced IT staffing environment, serving as the primary \\r\\npoint of contact for all project-related communication. \\r\\n• Conduct regular client calls to gather requirements, provide project updates, communicate risk, and align on priorities and \\r\\ntimelines. \\r\\n• Prepare and deliver status reports, meeting minutes (MoM), and dashboards to keep clients and internal leadership fully \\r\\ninformed. \\r\\nResource Coordination & Team Management \\r\\n• Oversee a bench of 15 active IT consultants — assigning work, tracking availability, and ensuring optimal resource utilization \\r\\nacross client projects. \\r\\n• Coordinate with internal teams to match consultant profiles to client requirements and facilitate smooth onboarding and \\r\\ntransitions. \\r\\n• Monitor consultant performance and project progress, proactively identifying and resolving blockers to maintain delivery \\r\\ntimelines. \\r\\nProject Execution & Documentation \\r\\n• Manage multiple projects simultaneously in a remote setup using Jira for task tracking, Microsoft Teams and Zoom for \\r\\ncollaboration, and Excel for reporting and resource planning. \\r\\n• Facilitate Agile ceremonies including Daily Stand-ups, Sprint Planning, and Retrospectives to drive team productivity and sprint \\r\\ncompletion. \\r\\n• Maintain comprehensive project documentation including project plans, risk registers, and status trackers to ensure \\r\\ntransparency across all stakeholders. \\r\\n• Adapt quickly to dynamic client needs and shifting priorities, demonstrating high flexibility and ownership in a challenging \\r\\nenvironment\"}, {\"title\": \"Business Intelligence Developer\", \"company\": \"CommScope\", \"endDate\": \"Tue Jun 20\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Thu Jun 10\", \"description\": \"Project Coordination & Agile Delivery \\r\\n• Coordinated end-to-end delivery of BI projects, managing timelines, stakeholder expectations, and cross-functional \\r\\ndependencies across engineering, sales, and operations teams. \\r\\n• Facilitated Agile ceremonies — Daily Stand-ups, Sprint Planning, and Retrospectives — ensuring consistent sprint delivery and \\r\\nteam alignment. \\r\\n• Tracked project risks and issues proactively, developing mitigation plans and escalating blockers to maintain delivery \\r\\nmomentum. \\r\\nReporting, Documentation & Stakeholder Communication \\r\\n• Prepared and maintained project plans, status reports, MoMs, and Power BI dashboards for senior leadership and client-facing \\r\\nreviews. \\r\\n• Delivered an enterprise-wide Power BI dashboard suite used by 200+ stakeholders, completing the project 2 weeks ahead of \\r\\nschedule. \\r\\n• Automated 15+ manual data pipelines, reducing data latency from 24 hours to near real-time and cutting manual reporting \\r\\neffort by ~40%. \\r\\n• Leveraged AI tools (Microsoft Copilot, ChatGPT) to accelerate documentation, reporting workflows, and meeting summaries.\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1792158434-811.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('93da6d28-118a-44a6-8081-d40a6c6786f3','7c5f0e89-63fd-40c0-9bbe-58f1c3b93dfc','.net full stack developer',NULL,'.net full stack developer',2,600000.00,NULL,NULL,'[\"Wordpress\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-23 16:46:52.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \".net full stack developer\", \"company\": \"Incentives Software Private LImited\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]',600000.00,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('93de2fef-6f23-4869-bcef-2713e813a42b','55d889a6-fb14-42f6-a571-00e4d0cc384b','Test Resume435','Test Resume435','Software Deve',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"OT Exstream\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-26 18:03:00.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Deve\", \"company\": \"John Deere\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[{\"year\": \"\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech\", \"result\": \"\", \"institution\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('93e6a48c-d9e3-49ec-a91c-b45bc4a45cf1','2013ea2b-e4f2-46b9-9812-c999054b6378','Senior PI Engineer with over 5 years of experience implementing, integrating, and administering AVEVA/OSIsoft PI\r\nSystems across manufacturing and industrial environments. Proficient across the full PI Suite, including PI Data Archive,\r\nPI AF, PI Vision, ','Senior PI Engineer with over 5 years of experience implementing, integrating, and administering AVEVA/OSIsoft PI\r\nSystems across manufacturing and industrial environments. Proficient across the full PI Suite, including PI Data Archive,\r\nPI AF, PI Vision, and PI Interfaces/Connectors, with strong expertise in PowerShell scripting for workflow automation and\r\ndata pipeline optimization. Experienced in designing dashboards that enhance data visibility and in integrating PI data to\r\nsupport predictive maintenance and operational efficiency. Well-versed in retrieving data through industrial communication\r\nprotocols such as OPC DA, OPC HDA, PI-to-PI, and PI PerfMon with a solid understanding of IT-OT security practices.\r\nCertified AVEVA PI Infrastructure Specialist, AVEVA PI Installation Specialist, and PI Connect Data Services Associate.','PI Data Engineer',4,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1772452700-141.pdf',NULL,'[\".NET\", \"API\", \"C#\", \"SQL\", \"SCADA\", \"LabVantage\", \"PI System (OSIsoft)\"]','PUBLIC','2026-03-03 00:26:49.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"PI Data Engineer\", \"company\": \"Cognizant Technology Solutions -\", \"endDate\": \"Thu Mar 26\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Wed Mar 06\", \"description\": \"Designed and maintained enterprise-scale PI AF data models, enabling standardized asset and process hierarchies\\r\\nacross multiple manufacturing sites.\\r\\n• Led PI historian architecture design and documentation, ensuring alignment with enterprise IT/OT standards and\\r\\nsecurity best practices.\\r\\n• Migrated more than 100 legacy C# calculations into PI AF Analyses, improving maintainability, governance, and\\r\\nlong-term supportability.\\r\\n• Integrated MS SQL Server, AWS Redshift, and AWS Timestream with PI Server to retrieve data from external\\r\\nsources to enable advanced analytics and reporting.\\r\\n• Developed PI Vision dashboards for operational KPIs, process monitoring, and system health, contributing to a 35%\\r\\nreduction in MTTR.\\r\\n• Implemented PI PerfMon-based monitoring and automated administrative tasks using PowerShell, improving system\\r\\nreliability and proactive fault detection.\\r\\n• Authored SOPs, architecture diagrams, and governance documentation supporting audit readiness.\\r\\n• Integrated ProcessMiner analytics with PI Historian data to support process optimization and data-driven decisionmaking\"}, {\"title\": \"MES PI Engineer\", \"company\": \"LTIMindtree\", \"endDate\": \"Fri Apr 12\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Wed Oct 07\", \"description\": \"nergy Domain, Oct 2020 - Apr 2024\\r\\n• Supported PI Historian integration with DCS/SCADA source systems across refinery environments.\\r\\n• Built and maintained PI tags and AF hierarchies aligned with production assets and process flows.\\r\\n• Executed PI interface upgrades, migration, remediation activities, and performance tuning.\\r\\n• Developed PI Vision dashboards for real-time operational visibility and system health monitoring, reducing\\r\\ntroubleshooting time by 30%.\\r\\n• Integrated LabVantage data with PI Historian to enable lab-to-process correlation in regulated environments.\\r\\n• Troubleshot complex IT/OT data flow issues across automation systems, historians, and enterprise IT layers.\\r\\n• Supported GxP-aligned documentation reviews, change control, and validation activities.\\r\\n• Resolved PI DataLink, PI Builder, and interface-related issues to maintain data continuity and historian performance.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2020\", \"degree\": \"Electronics\", \"result\": \"Yes\", \"institution\": \"Anna University\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1772452700-141.pdf\", \"title\": \"cv\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('93e82c6d-dff6-4f8b-bc50-87913db3a42b','7c11ecd3-58ff-44db-b7ee-973cfe24239b','Test Resume80','Test Resume80','Software Deve',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Marklogic\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-26 14:41:57.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Deve\", \"company\": \"Concentrix\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[{\"year\": \"\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech\", \"result\": \"\", \"institution\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('93f307a1-5246-4f23-89ec-2bccae671f47','3625d773-e8a0-485b-9742-bc31271f11cc','Test Resume442','Test Resume442','Software Deve',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Automation\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-25 11:23:03.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Deve\", \"company\": \"UST\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[{\"year\": \"\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech\", \"result\": \"\", \"institution\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('93f55460-8df1-4a45-8044-01fed31d5e58','ee9790b1-9362-4c1f-ae76-d9ba4675125f','Azure Devops Engineer',NULL,'Azure Devops Engineer',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','PUBLIC','2025-05-16 11:31:52.000000','20