ineer\", \"company\": \"L&T\", \"endDate\": \"Thu Mar 26\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Wed Aug 09\", \"description\": \"Roles and Responsibilities:\\r\\n•\\tSpearheaded the design and development of scalable ETL/ELT data pipelines using Azure Synapse Analytics, modernizing legacy SSIS pipelines and database objects to support L&T’s cloud data warehouse initiatives. \\r\\n•\\tBuilt robust data ingestion frameworks to extract, transform, and load enterprise data (including infrastructure, project, and operational datasets) into a centralized Azure Data Lakehouse for advanced analytics and reporting. \\r\\n•\\tImplemented seamless data integration between on-premises SQL Server systems and Azure services such as ADLS Gen2, Blob Storage, and external APIs to enable unified data access across L&T business units. \\r\\n•\\tDeveloped and optimized ETL pipelines using Azure Data Factory and Azure Synapse, leveraging SQL Pools (Dedicated & Serverless), external tables, and views for efficient data lakehouse architecture. \\r\\n•\\tUtilized Spark, PySpark, SQL, and Kusto queries to perform large-scale data processing, transformation, and validation ensuring high data quality and consistency across platforms\"}, {\"title\": \"Software Engineer\", \"company\": \"L&T\", \"endDate\": \"Thu Mar 26\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Wed Aug 09\", \"description\": \"Roles and Responsibilities:\\r\\n•\\tSpearheaded the design and development of scalable ETL/ELT data pipelines using Azure Synapse Analytics, modernizing legacy SSIS pipelines and database objects to support L&T’s cloud data warehouse initiatives. \\r\\n•\\tBuilt robust data ingestion frameworks to extract, transform, and load enterprise data (including infrastructure, project, and operational datasets) into a centralized Azure Data Lakehouse for advanced analytics and reporting. \\r\\n•\\tImplemented seamless data integration between on-premises SQL Server systems and Azure services such as ADLS Gen2,