oftware Exports Pvt. Ltd.\", \"company\": \"Full Stack Java Developer\", \"endDate\": \"Wed May 20\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Tue Apr 15\", \"description\": \"• Architected and developed ETL-based Microservices using Spring Boot for large-scale data processing \\r\\npipelines \\r\\n• Designed and optimized data transformation workflows for high-volume, high-throughput data systems \\r\\n• Integrated Apache Kafka for real-time event-driven processing across distributed services \\r\\n• Built and deployed React.js-based frontend dashboards for ETL monitoring, pipeline status tracking, and \\r\\ndata reconciliation views \\r\\n• Leveraged AWS services (EC2, S3, CloudWatch) for cloud-based deployments, log monitoring, and \\r\\nscalable storage of processed datasets \\r\\n• Deployed and managed containerized environments using Docker and Kubernetes on on-premises and \\r\\nAWS infrastructure \\r\\n• Built and maintained CI/CD pipelines using Jenkins for automated builds, testing, and deployments \\r\\n• Engineered Hibernate/JPA ORM layers optimized for MySQL, Oracle DB, and PostgreSQL \\r\\n• Developed responsive UI components using React.js, HTML5, CSS3, and JavaScript \\r\\n• Implemented robust error-handling and retry mechanisms in data loaders, ensuring zero data loss and high \\r\\navailability during large-scale migrations.\"}, {\"title\": \"Java Backend Developer\", \"company\": \"ANTS IT Solutions Pvt. Ltd\", \"endDate\": \"Thu Mar 20\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Thu Mar 10\", \"description\": \"• Designed and developed scalable microservices using Spring Boot and REST APIs for enterprise-grade \\r\\nplatforms \\r\\n• Implemented OAuth2/SSO-based authentication and authorization using Spring Security \\r\\n• Integrated Apache Kafka for asynchronous, real-time communication across distributed services \\r\\n• Containerized applications and streamlined delivery using Docker, Kubernetes, and Jenkins CI/CD \\r\\npipelines \\r\\n• Authored