ced DAX measures including time intelligence, YTD, MTD, rolling averages, and KPIs.  Used Power Query (M language) for data extraction, transformation, cleansing, and shaping.  Created reusable datasets and dataflows to ensure consistency across reports.  Implement drill-down, drill-through, tooltips, bookmarks, and advanced visuals  Applied Row-Level Security (RLS) to control data access based on user roles.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2015\", \"degree\": \"Computer Science\", \"result\": \"Yes\", \"institution\": \"Sri Venkateswara University\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1773144152-312.pdf\", \"title\": \"cv\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('966dad88-dc55-4feb-b4e3-ce1b744e1fdc','43ef5cf7-e7f4-420e-8bc2-3bf0e87093db','Test Resume434','Test Resume434','Software Deve',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','PUBLIC','2025-05-24 21:28:47.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Deve\", \"company\": \"TCS\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[{\"year\": \"\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech\", \"result\": \"\", \"institution\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('966fcba1-a769-4fff-a567-e9bee4ebb4d8','fd7c15fa-b22c-4ad6-a163-50a089d996de','non voice process',NULL,'non voice process',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Content Management\", \"Financial Accounting\", \"Accounts Payable\", \"Business Analysis\", \"Invoice Processing\", \"MS Office\", \"QuickBooks\", \"SAP FICO\", \"Pivot Tables\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-13 17:01:50.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"non voice process\", \"company\": \"Accenture in India\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('967207ad-1e40-448c-bd64-d41604d49c58','b576a33a-a168-499e-a8e4-063357f993a2','Test Resume681','Test Resume681','Software Deve',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"AWS DevOps\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-25 12:01:41.000000','2026-10