ogram category. Additionally, if we \\r\\nencounter an existing program with identical details, we must merge it into the existing program group. These programs, in turn, \\r\\nplay a vital role in the creation of offers. Once an offer is crafted and approved by the marketing manager, it proceeds to the \\r\\nupstream system, where it is eventually displayed on the FCA Incentive website. \\r\\nSkills: Swagger, Junit, Jenkins, SonarQube, CI/CD, Spring boot, Microservices, Rest API, Azure, MySQL.\"}, {\"title\": \"Full Stack Java Developer\", \"company\": \"D.S Infotech Pvt. Ltd. (Client Company: TCS)\", \"endDate\": \"Sun Jul 31\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Sat Apr 10\", \"description\": \"Software Analysis, Designing, Implementing, Developing, Testing & Maintaining applications using Java per the \\r\\nrequirements.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2016\", \"degree\": \"Bachelor of Engineering In Computers\", \"result\": \"63.93%\", \"institution\": \"University of Pune\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1768245779-540.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('99d9b53a-9325-4b30-9413-bdc2afe82eba','7516f9d2-2959-434a-9035-15513ba4a891','Results-driven IT professional with 5+ years of experience in software development, system support, and IT\r\ninfrastructure management. Proven expertise in low-code application development, SQL Server database\r\ndesign and optimization, and API integrations','Results-driven IT professional with 5+ years of experience in software development, system support, and IT\r\ninfrastructure management. Proven expertise in low-code application development, SQL Server database\r\ndesign and optimization, and API integrations, delivering scalable solutions for clients across digital banking,\r\nERP systems, and enterprise applications. Skilled in cloud infrastructure (AWS, GCP), WordPress\r\ndevelopment, and system administration, with a strong background in project planning, stakeholder\r