opfloor systems.- Worked closely with Production, Quality, Supply Chain, Maintenance, and IT teams to improve MES adoption and\\r\\noperational efficiency.- Supported MES validation, sustainment, and controlled rollout of new software releases in live production\\r\\nenvironments- Supported PLC–MES integration using Beckhoff PLCs (TwinCAT), including communication troubleshooting,\\r\\ncontroller replacement support, and functional validation.- Performed shopfloor connectivity diagnostics to ensure reliable data exchange between equipment, MES, and SPC\\r\\nsystems.- Enabled wireless SPC data acquisition using IBRIT devices, supporting real-time measurement capture, quality\\r\\ncompliance, and analysis.- Provided L3 MES application support for PM-MES, PM-SPC, and Substation modules, including defect analysis,\\r\\nissue resolution, and functional troubleshooting.\\r\\n- Managed MES master data (users, stations, equipment, catalogs), ensuring data integrity and consistent execution\\r\\nacross shopfloor operations.\"}, {\"title\": \"Junior Engineer\", \"company\": \"Klassic Wheels\", \"endDate\": \"Sat Dec 10\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Wed Dec 15\", \"description\": \"- Gained hands-on exposure to shopfloor production operations, process flow, quality checks, and manufacturing\\r\\ndiscipline in an automotive environment.- Supported daily production activities and adhered to standard operating and quality procedures.Hands-on\\r\\nexposure to shopfloor production operations, process flow, quality checks, and manufacturing discipline.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2020\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech/B.E. | Mechanical\", \"result\": \"73\", \"institution\": \"Savitribai Phule Pune Univesity\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1768940831-32.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('9b798c76-8344-4938-a209-de2afbe5c592','96e6ac51-4b6c-40f4-950f-4813b052f8c2','Test Resume953','Test Resume953','Software Deve',2,NULL,NULL,