ystem guidelines.\r\nReviewing and approving the test scripts, IV, OV, PV, test summary reports and\r\nchange tickets for implementing in validation and production environment in\r\nservicenow.\r\nHandling & managing/leading the team for the day to day basis activities and\r\nassigning the tasks on priority basis including Incidents, User support, problem\r\nmanagement etc.\r\nMaintaining and reviewing ITRA(IT risk assessment), ITPSE(IT Periodic system\r\nevaluation), URR(User review report).\r\nPerformed deviation handling, CAPA, RCA and defect life cycle.\r\nPerformed Decommissioning of the retired systems following the QMS guidelines.\r\nResponsible for full life cycle of IT system management.\r\nExpertise in both Agile and Waterfall testing methodologies allows me to adapt to\r\nvarious project environments, ensuring high-quality deliverables that meet stringent\r\nregulatory standards.\r\nSkilled in Change Management and Computer System Validation, including the\r\ndevelopment of Validation Plans.\r\nExpertise in executing IQ, OQ, IQSR, OQSR, VSR, and PSR, along with comprehensive\r\nreporting and Data Visualization.\r\nActively involved in preparing UAT scripts, focusing on Product Qualification (PQ),\r\nOperational Qualifications (OQ), and Configuration Verification (CV).\r\nGained valuable international experience by working onsite in Germany and\r\nSweden, providing testing and customer support for clients like Merck and\r\nGalderma.\r\nCultivated a diverse skill set that includes Manual Testing, Configuration, Data\r\nVisualization, and Change Management, underpinned by a thorough\r\ncomprehension of Software Development Lifecycle (SDLC) methodologies.\r\nRealized substantial enhancements in system compliance and audit preparedness by\r\nconducting thorough reviews and approvals of installation and operational\r\nverification protocols, thereby bolstering overall system integrity.\r\nExhibited outstanding leadership and communication capabilities, adeptly\