ange implementation following Quality Management System guidelines.\\r\\nReviewing and approving the test scripts, IV, OV, PV, test summary reports and change tickets for implementing in validation\\r\\nand production environment in servicenow.\\r\\nHandling & managing/leading the team for the day to day basis activities and assigning the tasks on priority basis including\\r\\nIncidents, User support, problem management etc.\\r\\nMaintaining and reviewing ITRA(IT risk assessment), ITPSE(IT Periodic system evaluation), URR(User review report).\\r\\nPerformed deviation handling, disaster recovery, CAPA, RCA and defect life cycle.\"}, {\"title\": \"Senior QA Engineer\", \"company\": \"Genpact\", \"endDate\": \"Tue Aug 03\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Wed Nov 21\", \"description\": \"Managed various Computer System Validation projects to validate software for the Pharmaceuticals and Life Sciences industry.\\r\\nDeveloped test scripts for configurations and prepared Configuration Specification and Functional Specification Documents.\\r\\nWrote effective SQL scripts for data migration testing, database testing, and report testing.\\r\\nTransformed communication and cooperation between departments from a reactive approach to a proactive one, enhancing\\r\\ncollaboration across the entire product value chain.\\r\\nWorked on SQL scripting and ETL testing skills, focusing on OLAP Data Warehouse, TM1 Planning Analytics, and data\\r\\nvisualization for BI Cognos reports.\\r\\nPerformed data analytical testing for IBM TM1 Planning Analytics, BI systems, Power BI, and Cognos.\\r\\nDeveloped and designed ETL test cases, scenarios, and scripts to ensure the quality of Data Warehouse and BI applications\"}, {\"title\": \"Validation Consultant\", \"company\": \"Arisglobal Software Private Limited\", \"endDate\": \"Thu Nov 01\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Mon Dec 15\", \"description\": \"Maintained and updated the traceability matrix to ensure complete coverage