t, converted Scala\r\nSpark pipel','DataEngineer with3+yearsbuilding and optimizingETL/ELT pipelines on AzureData Factory,Azure Databricks, PySpark\r\n,Fabric and SQL. Led a multi-terabyte Elasticsearch to Azure AI Search migration for an enterprise retail client, converted Scala\r\nSpark pipelines to Python to support a client\'s move to serverless compute, and built real-time IoT data pipelines across many cold\r\nstorage units using Delta Lake, Delta Live Tables and Event Hubs , Kafka. Comfortable owning a workstream inside a small,\r\nsenior-heavy team (architect, lead, manager) and delivering client-facing Power BI reporting alongside the pipeline work.','SoftwareEngineer',2,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/vishal-morey-1791874581-21.pdf',NULL,'[\"Azure\", \"Fabric\", \"Kafka\", \"SQL\", \"Pyspark\", \"Power BI\"]','PUBLIC','2026-10-13 18:24:38.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"SoftwareEngineer\", \"company\": \"Impetus Technologies India Pvt. Ltd.\", \"endDate\": \"Thu Jan 01\", \"isCurrent\": true, \"startDate\": \"Thu Jun 15\", \"description\": \"• Ledthe migration of a multi-terabyte, historical sales dataset plus ~200GB of near-real-time and batch data from\\r\\nElasticsearch to Azure AI Search for enterprise retail client Mattress Firm, the largest engagement on the team at ~12 months,\\r\\nwith no disruption to production search.\\r\\n• Migrated enterprise search workloads fromElasticsearch to Azure AI Search, reducing infrastructure overhead, improving\\r\\nscalability, and simplifying platform management.\\r\\n• Migrated Scala applications to Python on Databricks for Cummins, simplifying deployment through Python wheel packages and\\r\\njob cluster parameterization., working as 1 of 2 developers in a 5-person pod (developer, developer, lead, architect, manager).\\r\\n• Appliedmodular packaging, parallelism and multithreading patterns to the converted pipelines to improve maintainability and\\r\\nexecution efficiency on serverless clusters.\\r\\n• Builtand tuned sentiment-analysis pipelines on customer feedback data using Delta Live Tables, with data quality checks\\r\\nembedded in the pipeline (profiling, cleansing, validation rules).\\r\\n• Implemented CI/CD pipelines for automated deployment across dev/test/prod Databricks environments.\\r\\n• Builtreal-time ingestion pipelines for IoT sensor data across cold-storage units, streaming per-second temperature/sensor\\r\\nreadings through Azure Event Hubs into ADLS Gen2 using Delta Lake.\\r\\n• Transformed and loadedstreaming and batch data into Azure Synapse Analytics using Azure Data Factory, supporting\\r\\ndownstream reporting on a ~1-year project timeline.\\r\\n• BuiltPowerBIdashboardsgiving operations teams real-time visibility into cold-storage sensor conditions for monitoring and\\r\\nalerting.\\r\\n• Workedwithina5–10persondeliveryteamacrossconcurrent client projects.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2022\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech / B.E., Electronics & Telecommunication\", \"result\": \"8\", \"institution\": \"Pune University\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/vishal-morey-1791874581-21.pdf\", \"title\": \"VISHAL MOREY\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('a4b7016b-53a1-4e20-bd18-7f9fa7a5b887','55aaa4a2-2888-47fb-862d-22eeaf63fe86','Informatica Administrator',NULL,'Informatica Administrator',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Microsoft SQL Server\", \"Microsoft SQL Server\", \"UNIX\", \"Oracle\", \"Oracle\", \"UNIX\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-14 17:48:22.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"Informatica Administrator\", \"company\": \"Aspire Systems India\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]',620000.00,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('a4c12a58-c234-4554-a14a-a96168f10172','d77c3186-4cea-43c7-ad16-3473d6868129','Business-focused Data Analyst with 3+ years of experience partnering with sales and finance stakeholders to\r\ntranslate business requirements into scalable Power BI and SQL-driven analytics solutions. Experienced in KPI\r\ndefinition, data validation, dashbo','Business-focused Data Analyst with 3+ years of experience partnering with sales and finance stakeholders to\r\ntranslate business requirements into scalable Power BI and SQL-driven analytics solutions. Experienced in KPI\r\ndefinition, data validation, dashboard optimization, and executive reporting to support strategic decision-making.','Power BI Developer',4,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1766385886-734.pdf',NULL,'[\"ETL\", \"Data Analysis\", \"Azure\", \"DAX\", \"Python\", \"Pandas\", \"Numpy\", \"Power BI\", \"SQL\"]','PUBLIC','2025-12-22 19:12:10.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Power BI Developer\", \"company\": \"Tata Consultancy Services\", \"endDate\": \"Sat Jan 24\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Wed Jan 15\", \"description\": \"• Developed complex SQL queries and Power BI semantic models, reducing report load times by up to\\r\\n40%.\\r\\n• Automated end-to-end reporting workflows using Power BI Service and On-Prem Gateway, saving\\r\\nhours of manual effort per cycle.\\r\\n• Built and optimized DAX measures and calculated tables, improving reporting accuracy and efficiency\\r\\nby ˜25%.\"}, {\"title\": \"Data Analyst\", \"company\": \"Microline Informatiion Systems, Pune\", \"endDate\": \"Wed Oct 01\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Thu Dec 09\", \"description\": \"• Designed star-schema data models using Power BI and SQL Server, improving report refresh performance\\r\\nby 25–30%.\\r\\n• Partnered with sales and finance stakeholders to gather business requirements and build executive Power\\r\\nBI dashboards tracking revenue, margins, discounts, and regional KPIs, enabling faster decision-making.\\r\\n• Optimized DAX measures, reducing dashboard load times by 30% on high-volume datasets.\\r\\n• Implemented row-level security (RLS) and drill-through for secure, role-based analytics.\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,