C-suite stakeholders across domestic and international markets \r\n(DACH, BENELUX, Middle East, India). Known for consistently achieving revenue \r\ntargets, delivering consultative value, and ensuring measurable client ROI.','Senior Business Development Associate',8,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1754312163-114.pdf',NULL,'[\"End-to-End Sales\", \"IT Services\", \"Cloud Sales\", \"Consultative Selling\", \"Competitive Market Analysis\", \"Strategic Thinking\", \"Relationship Management (RM)\", \"Revenue Growth Strategies\", \"Pipeline Management\"]','PUBLIC','2025-08-04 12:48:03.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Senior Business Development Associate\", \"company\": \"Unthinkable Solutions\", \"endDate\": \"Thu Aug 14\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Tue Feb 14\", \"description\": \" Own and drive the complete sales lifecycle for complex IT, SaaS, and cloud deals \\r\\nacross DACH, BENELUX, Middle East, and India — from identifying strategic \\r\\nprospects to closing multi-year contracts. \\r\\n Engage directly with C-level executives and senior decision-makers to uncover \\r\\nbusiness needs, deliver tailored value propositions, and position solutions aligned \\r\\nwith client goals. \\r\\n Build and manage a healthy sales pipeline, forecasting accurately and ensuring \\r\\nconsistent quarterly and annual target achievement.  \\r\\n Lead high-value negotiations, structuring enterprise contracts with favorable terms \\r\\nthat protect margins and strengthen long-term partnerships. \\r\\n Develop and execute account expansion plans, driving upselling and cross-selling of \\r\\nadditional services to grow share of wallet by 15–20% per client. \\r\\n Collaborate with solution architects and delivery teams to craft compelling \\r\\ntechnical proposals that meet complex requirements and deliver clear ROI. \\r\\n Coach and mentor a small team of sales professionals to adopt an end-to-end \\r\\nconsultative selling approach, raising team win r