ude 4.5 Opus, GPT-4o, and open-source Mixtral models with LangChain and LangGraph frameworks.\r\n• Core competencies: ML, DL, NLP, GenAI, Agentic AI, workflow orchestration, API development (FastAPI), and\r\nscalable solution architecture using Python for production-ready implementations.\r\n• OCR Engineering: Built a hybrid OCR solution dynamically routing documents to AWS Textract or open-source tools\r\n(Pytesseract, H-OCR, PDF Plumber) based on image quality for cost optimization and accuracy.\r\n• Microservices & Messaging: Proficient in building distributed microservices architectures with RabbitMQ for\r\nasynchronous, event-driven communication.\r\n• Cloud & DevOps: Experience deploying solutions on Amazon EKS with GitOps practices using Tekton (CI) and Argo\r\nCD (CD) for automated, declarative CI/CD pipelines.\r\n• Performance Optimization: Skilled in parallel computation and memory-efficient processing using DASK for handling\r\nlarge-scale data workloads.\r\n• End-to-End Delivery: Proven ability to deliver GenAI solutions from ideation to production deployment while\r\nadhering to SDLC best practices.\r\n• Seeking to contribute technical expertise, problem-solving abilities, and leadership skills to drive organizational\r\nimpact while continuously advancing professional growth.','Lead GenAI Engineer)',4,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1773304898-480.pdf',NULL,'[\"Artificial Intelligence\", \"Github\", \"AWS\", \"Docker\", \"Kubernetes\", \"MYSQL\", \"Mongo DB\", \"Fast API\", \"Deep Learning\", \"LLM Fine-tuning\", \"Python\"]','PUBLIC','2026-03-12 20:09:44.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Lead GenAI Engineer)\", \"company\": \"Carelon Global Solutions\", \"endDate\": \"Fri Apr 03\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Wed Feb 10\", \"description\": \"ICA Engine – Medical Record Analysis: Developed a RAG pipeline that leverages policy documents and medical\\r\\nrecords to intelligently perform claims audits using LLMs. Employing the ChatGPT 5 & 4.0 model to extract necessary\\r\\ninsights for the audit process.\\r\\n Key Conditions Analyzed:\\r\\n➢ Section Extraction: Identifies and summarizes key sections of the medical records for quick reference to business\\r\\nauditors.\\r\\n➢ Condition Detail Extraction: Specifically extracts detailed information related to surgeon roles, role validation and\\r\\ndrugs tested from the processed text of medical records.\\r\\n• Assistant Surgeon (AS) • Urinary trach infection\\r\\n• SIU labs Pre-pay & Post-pay • Oligohydramnios\\r\\nHyderabad, India +91 9550222278 rohansirigiripet@gmail.com LinkedIn\\r\\n➢ Memory & Parallel Processing: Utilized DASK for distributed parallel processing of document chunks, enabling\\r\\nefficient memory management and scalable handling of large medical record datasets.\\r\\n➢ Microservices Architecture: Built 7 microservices (Workflow, OCR, Doc Embedder, Execute Prompts, Custom\\r\\nSolutions, Consolidation, Sanity) with RabbitMQ for async inter-service communication.\\r\\n➢ Cloud Deployment: Deployed on Amazon EKS with Tekton CI pipelines and Argo CD for GitOps-based continuous\\r\\ndelivery.\\r\\nKey Technologies Utilized: OpenAI ( GPT 5 & 4o), Qdrant DB, Mongo DB, prompt engineering, SQL, FAST API, RabbitMQ\\r\\nand GPT vision model\"}, {\"title\": \"Application Development Analyst\", \"company\": \"Accenture,\", \"endDate\": \"Wed Feb 05\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Thu Nov 10\", \"description\": \"Role in Project:\\r\\nCenturyLink, Inc. is the largest American telecommunications company. It uses End to End value of Telecom services from\\r\\nOrder to Cash. I work in Order provisioning, called ASRI Portal. I have been working as an integral part of the Automation\\r\\nteam to get scenarios automated using Python and Machine learning.\\r\\nResponsibilities:\\r\\nUser Feedback Analysis: (Text Classification):\\r\\nWe have created a model, where it takes user feedback as input given by the customers from resolved tickets on a daily\\r\\nbasis & using Navis bayes sentiment analyzer it will classify the feedback into positive and negative sentiment, which\\r\\nhelps in capturing performance of individuals.\\r\\n• Text Embedding model: sentence-transformers/all-mpnet-base-v2. • Vector database: FAISS.\\r\\n• Spacy, Python and fuzzy regex\\r\\n• Programming Language – Python, HTML, CSS, Jinja2 • Web Framework - Flask\\r\\n• Database – Sqlite3\\r\\nTechnology used in back end:\\r\\n• Experience in resolving application issues using PL/SQL and database is ORACLE.\\r\\n• Worked with business users/managers to raise different application enhancements through User Stories.\\r\\n• Regularly identifying recurring issues with concerned applications and raising Problem Records with the help of\\r\\nthe PRB manager.\\r\\n• Worked with different teams to resolve application outages within the defined SLA.\\r\\n• Identifying and fixing defects related to various applications with the help of Tier-4 team\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2018\", \"degree\": \"Computer Science\", \"result\": \"Yes\", \"institution\": \"- INSOFE (International school of Engineering)\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1773304898-480.pdf\", \"title\": \"cv\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('aa8cf93c-d9da-4342-b0a2-99544b34caf1','01c6990e-f60c-401d-a85f-a593b35f1da6','Test Resume193','Test Resume193','Software Deve',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"React\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-26 08:09:56.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Deve\", \"company\": \"Ardour Analytics India Pvt. Ltd\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[{\"year\": \"\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech\", \"result\": \"\", \"institution\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('aa8fd018-91e7-4a84-8a5c-964656c8a4b5','882e45c7-487f-4744-bae4-7d02c5c5a8bd','Test Resume708','Test Resume708','Software Deve',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Azure\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-25 12:0