eloper with 6 years of expertise in designing and building scalable web applications using C#, ASP.NET Core, ASP.NET MVC, Web API, and SQL Server. Skilled in Entity Framework Core, LINQ, and database\r\noptimisation. Proficient in front-end development with Angular, JavaScript, Type Script, HTML, and CSS. Strong\r\nexposure to Azure DevOps, CI/CD pipelines and Agile methodologies. Committed to writing clean, maintainable code\r\nand delivering high-quality software solutions','Software Engineer',2,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1767959366-63.pdf',NULL,'[\".NET\", \".NET CORE\", \"ASP.NET\", \"Angular\", \"Microservices\", \"Azure\", \"Git\", \"JavaScript\", \"Github\", \"Docker\", \"HTML\", \"CSS\", \"SQL\"]','PUBLIC','2026-01-10 00:17:31.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Engineer\", \"company\": \"Civica Resource Pvt Ltd\", \"endDate\": \"Fri Jan 30\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Thu Dec 05\", \"description\": \"Designed and developed comprehensive HR and\\r\\npayroll systems with modules for people\\r\\nmanagement, payroll processing, and time and\\r\\nattendance tracking. Leveraged SQL Server capabilities to create complex\\r\\nstored procedures, triggers, views, and user-defined\\r\\nfunctions, with an emphasis on high performance and\\r\\nerror handling. Built and maintained web applications using MVC\\r\\n(Razor view engine, models, partial views, layout\\r\\nviews), and ASP.NET Core. Integrated web services\\r\\nand developed APIs for seamless data exchange. Coordinated effectively within cross-functional\\r\\nteams, supporting SCRUM/Agile methodology with a\\r\\nfocus on meeting Sprint goals and delivering high- quality software. Developed and optimized LINQ queries and Lambda\\r\\nexpressions in C# for efficient data manipulation\\r\\nwithin applications. Utilized Report Wizard, Report Builder, and Report\\r\\nManager to develop, deploy, and manage reports\\r\\ntailored to business requirements.\\r\\nImplemented database access and ORM using Entity\\r\\nFramework Core with LINQ for efficient data\\r\\noperations. Developed secure APIs with JWT authentication &\\r\\nrole-based authorization in ASP.NET Core. Built custom middleware for logging and exception\\r\\nhandling using Serilog in ASP.NET Core. Configured CI/CD pipelines in Azure DevOps for\\r\\nautomated builds and deployments.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2019\", \"degree\": \"Computer Science\", \"result\": \"Yes\", \"institution\": \"BE in Computer Engineering GTU\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1767959366-63.pdf\", \"title\": \"cv\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('aaf4546d-6cd5-4730-9628-291577bd357f','5c0e5a91-c8a3-47f1-a1cb-4b6d1bd9b6f0','Test Resume728','Test Resume728','Software Deve',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"React\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-26 09:36:02.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Deve\", \"company\": \"Technics\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[{\"year\": \"\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech\", \"result\": \"\", \"institution\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('aaf6a994-a2d1-472a-8823-cdd6b412ba4f','63bf42c7-b0dd-45be-bc13-39b72a76cded','To leverage my expertise in MES DevOps management, agile project management, \r\nand training within the pharmaceutical industry to design, develop, integrate, and \r\noptimize manufacturing execution systems. I aim to ensure compliance with \r\nregulatory stan','To leverage my expertise in MES DevOps management, agile project management, \r\nand training within the pharmaceutical industry to design, develop, integrate, and \r\noptimize manufacturing execution systems. I aim to ensure compliance with \r\nregulatory standards, enhance product quality through electronic batch records, and \r\ndrive digital transformation initiatives. By leading several vital projects, finalizing \r\narchitecture, and ensuring successful project delivery, I strive to improve \r\nmanufacturing performance, visibility, and traceability, ultimately contributing to \r\noperational excellence and efficiency. \r\nPreviously, as an MES Specialist, I engaged in discussions with customers to \r\nunderstand their requirements, which were then used to design systems integrated \r\ninto their plants. I have experience with all aspects of the project, from functional \r\ndesign specifications and software development to testing and commissioning on\r\nsite with customers. Earlier in my career, I worked with automation and control \r\nsystems, providing me with a holistic view of projects. This perspective enables me \r\nto contribute to MES development in a way that facilitates easier integration with the \r\ncontrol layer. Additionally, I have experience with both SCADA and PLCs, allowing \r\nme to assist with the control layer.','PROJECT ENGINEER (AUTOMATION)',6,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/ritesh-sangave-1792155514-133.pdf',NULL,'[\"Java\", \"HTML\", \".NET\", \"SQL\", \"Python\", \"Powershell\", \"Mendix\", \"SQL Server\", \"Oracle\"]','PUBLIC','2026-10-17 00:21:34.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"PROJECT ENGINEER (AUTOMATION)\", \"company\": \"SOFTCON SYSTEMS PVT. LTD.\", \"endDate\": \"Tue Nov 30\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Mon Jan 01\", \"description\": \"• Experience in automation products (PLC, HMI, SCADA, BATCH, DBM) with \\r\\nPharma & Food domains. \\r\\n• PLC programming in S88 standard as per the control narrative provided. \\r\\n• HMI & SCADA development with ISA 101 standard as per the P&ID. \\r\\n• Implemented High availability architecture of PLC - SCADA & FT Historian \\r\\n(OSI-PI).  \\r\\n• Database management such as Microsoft SQL Server Standard and OSI \\r\\nPI (FT Historian) \\r\\n• Customized Reporting in SSRS Reporting and Ethernet Printing. \\r\\n• VIRTUAL PLATFORMS - Azure Cloud - VM ware - vSphere \\r\\n \\r\\n• DOCUMENTATION / VALIDATION - ALCOA - GAMP - V Module - 21 CFR \\r\\n \\r\\n• MICROSOFT - Excel - Word - Power Point \\r\\n \\r\\n   COMPETENCE \\r\\n \\r\\n• ROCKWELL SOFTWARE’S - Logix 500/ Studio 5000 - FT View Enterprises (SCADA) - FT Historian - FT Vantage Point - FT Transaction Manager - FT Batch - FT Asset Centre - Thin Manager - Kepware Server OPC \\r\\n \\r\\n• SIEMENS SOFTWARE’S - OpCenter Execution Pharma - Simatic Manager - Wincc  - PCS Batch - TIA Portal \\r\\n \\r\\n   LANGUAGES \\r\\n - English - German (A1) - FreNCH (A1) - Hindi - Marathi \\r\\n \\r\\n  ACHIEVEMENTS \\r\\n - Bravo for Training MES OpCenter \\r\\nEXPH training to Site. - Employee of the year in 2020 (at \\r\\nSoftcon). - Received appreciation emails from \\r\\nvarious customers. - Event Manager at MIT College of \\r\\nENGG. - Distinction throughout B.E. \\r\\n \\r\\n \\r\\n 3 \\r\\n• Configuration & calibration of field instruments like temperature transmitter, \\r\\npressure transmitter, pH transmitter etc. \\r\\n• Bench Test, Pre-FAT, FAT testing as per project schedule and SAT at the \\r\\ncustomer end. \\r\\n• Project documentation. (CSV, IQ, OQ, FS, hardware and software data \\r\\nsheets, operational manual, DS etc.) \\r\\n• Operational and maintenance training on executed projects to clients.\"}, {\"title\": \"MES SOLUTION ENGINEER\", \"company\": \"SIEMENS LTD.\", \"endDate\": \"Fri Jun 21\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Mon Dec 06\", \"description\": \"• Experience in MES OpCenter EXPH with Process like Cell & Gene Therapy \\r\\n& Blood Plasma Injectable Filling line. \\r\\n• Planning workshop with customer to gather requirements of business \\r\\nprocess, design and implement MES solutions for Life Sciences Industry. \\r\\n• Different types of label & barcodes (Inventory sampling) printing,  \\r\\n• Implement Opcenter EXPH, SAMS Integration with customer\'s existing \\r\\nERP/SAP system and LIMS system. \\r\\n• Write robust, readable code to extend the functionality of the standard \\r\\nproduct (VBS transactions, custom scripts). \\r\\n• Experience in MES system interface with Simatic batch. \\r\\n• Worked on data handling and dashboard with Oracle, Process historian & \\r\\nSQL. \\r\\n• In-depth knowledge and experience of recipe authoring, designing and \\r\\nconfiguration ISA S88 and S95 standards. \\r\\n• Installation, Migration and support for OpCenter EXPH. \\r\\n• Project documentation FS/DS/TPS/SMT with design modules like EM, FM, \\r\\nPIM, PIR, SM and WD modules of Opcenter EXPH and designing SMDS \\r\\ndocument for RA recipes following cGMP procedures. \\r\\n• Conduct recipe authoring and pharma suite development training for new \\r\\njoiners and customer training. \\r\\n• Worked with an agile approach & Follow Azure DevOps for sprint-wise \\r\\nactivity planning (Project management). \\r\\n• Hosting deliverables of business process packages to end users.\"}, {\"title\": \"MES DEVOPS ENGINEER (TECH - FUNCTIONAL EXPERT)\", \"company\": \"SANOFI HEALTHCARE INDIA LTD.\", \"endDate\": \"Thu Jan 01\", \"isCurrent\": true, \"startDate\": \"Mon Jul 08\", \"description\": \"• Expertise in implementing process projects such as weighing and \\r\\ndispensing, tablet packaging, solids manufacturing, vaccine manufacturing, \\r\\nand filling processes. \\r\\n• Managed and led projects, supporting various sites using JIRA to implement \\r\\nAgile (Scrum) methodology for effective project management and team \\r\\ncapability. \\r\\n• Collaborated with cross-functional teams to ensure timely project delivery. \\r\\n• Served as a Scrum Master, facilitating sprint planning, daily standups, sprint \\r\\nreviews, retrospectives, and ensuring timely sprint deliverables. \\r\\n• Communicated with stakeholders regarding project plans and progress. \\r\\n• Led the team through requirement gathering, development phases, dry \\r\\nruns, FAT (Factory Acceptance Testing), and P1 incident resolution. \\r\\n• Supported the implementation of Nimy Band architecture within the \\r\\nOpcenter EXPH environment. Deployed Mendix tool application \\r\\narchitecture. \\r\\n• Assisted the AIMS team in incident resolution. \\r\\n• Led the PI review topic globally across all Sanofi sites. \\r\\n• Officially trained over 7 sites to implement the Opcenter EXPH MES solution \\r\\nAlso, Led the MARS MES Academy to develop various training modules, \\r\\npractice challenges, administration, and interface. Transitioned several \\r\\nmodules to the I - Learn platform to streamline training efforts. \\r\\n 2 \\r\\n• Traveled to various sites, including Tuas - Singapore, Tours - France, \\r\\nScoppito - Italy and Shenzhen - China to lead and support projects, provide \\r\\nMES training, and calculate final KPI standardization. Collaborated with \\r\\nSiemens and the block factory team to standardize block editing digital rules \\r\\nacross Sanofi globally. Demonstrated strong networking skills and \\r\\nrepresented the Sanofi global team across all Sanofi sites.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2017\", \"degree\": \"B.E. - ELECTRONICS AND  COMMUNICATION\", \"result\": \"7.61\", \"institution\": \"MIT of Engineering, Aurangabad.\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/ritesh-sangave-1792155514-133.pdf\", \"title\": \"RITESH SANGAVE\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('aaf829ab-6090-46ac-8459-949e91c58b09','b4a6f4fc-dd49-46f8-baf3-1de9ea133ce3','Sr. Android Application Developer',NULL,'Sr. Android Application Developer',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"KOTLIN\", \"Core Java\", \"Android SDK\", \"Android\", \"Android SDK\", \"Core Java\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-14 17:17:39.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"Sr. Android Application Developer\", \"company\": \"Kiya.ai\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('aafbb638-f88f-4ab7-9255-b1beb18fb3a8','2579ec7f-3123-4528-9d5b-693187f235dd','php developer',NULL,'php developer',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Laravel\", \"Wordpress\", \"PHP\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-1