 for business stakeholders\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2020\", \"degree\": \"Bachelor of Science in Information Technology (B.Sc.IT)\", \"result\": \"60\", \"institution\": \"Mumbai University\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1767713533-336.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('acb01588-e800-446e-9432-659b5b4104c7','9508b132-8222-4263-874f-7534cbe12d46','QA Engineer with 8.11 years of experience in Quality Assurance (QA), Manual Testing, and Test \r\nAutomation. Expertise in Tricentis Tosca (v16.0 & v24.1), Selenium WebDriver, API Testing, Database \r\nTesting, SQL, CI/CD, Jenkins, and Agile Scrum. Proven tra','QA Engineer with 8.11 years of experience in Quality Assurance (QA), Manual Testing, and Test \r\nAutomation. Expertise in Tricentis Tosca (v16.0 & v24.1), Selenium WebDriver, API Testing, Database \r\nTesting, SQL, CI/CD, Jenkins, and Agile Scrum. Proven track record of testing enterprise applications \r\nacross Healthcare, Industrial Automation, Petrochemical, E-commerce, Telecom, and Financial \r\nServices domains. Skilled in designing and developing scalable automation frameworks, executing end\r\nto-end functional, integration, and regression testing, integrating automation suites with CI/CD \r\npipelines, and delivering high-quality software solutions in Agile environments.','Automation Testing Specialist',1,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1787252064-329.pdf',NULL,'[\"Automation Testing\", \"Jenkins\", \"Agile\", \"JIRA\", \"QA Management\", \"Manual Testing\", \"Tricentis TOSCA\", \"Selenium Webdriver\", \"API testing\", \"SQL\", \"CI/CD\", \"Scrum Framework\", \"API testing\", \"SAP\"]','PUBLIC','2026-08-21 06:22:01.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[]','[{\"year\": \"2015\", \"degree\": \"Bachelor of Engineering in Computer Science and Engineering\", \"result\": \"72\", \"institution\": \"VTU UNIVERSITY\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1787252064-329.pdf\", \"