ble and occluded regions.\\r\\n￿Weather &Appearance Style Transfer\\r\\n• Developed unpaired image-to-image translation pipelines to synthesize weather, illumination and camera-appearance varia\\r\\ntions while preserving road geometry and semantic content to reduce data re-collection under different environmental conditions.\\r\\n• Researched GAN and diffusion-based architectures, fine-tuned CycleGAN-Turbo/Stable-Diffusion-based methods using LoRA,\\r\\nfor transformations such as day/night, sunny/rainy, morning/evening; experimented with various content and style losses.\\r\\n• Addedsemantic-mask-guided cross-attention to CycleGAN-Turbo, enabling source-image features to attend to a reference image\\r\\nalongside text conditioning to apply localized weather effects and improve visual realism.\\r\\n￿ Semantic Segmentation & Camera-LiDAR Annotation Tool\\r\\n• Designed and developed a ROS-based client-server annotation system integrating Grounding DINO and SAM2 for automatic\\r\\nobject detection, interactive semantic segmentation, and human-in-the-loop mask refinement.\\r\\n• Implementedimageandvideoworkflows, includingtemporalmaskpropagation, positive/negative click-based correction, image\\r\\nto-point-cloud mask projection and refinement with synchronized RGB/point-cloud views.\\r\\n• Debugged and reduced SAM2 GPUmemoryconsumption via lazy frame loading, persistent inference state and mixed-precision\\r\\ninference, scaling video segmentation to large, long driving sequences.\\r\\n￿HD Mapping&Multimodal Data\\r\\n• Contributed to an HD-map generation workflow using camera images, LiDAR point clouds, vehicle poses, and semantic segmen\\r\\ntation to extract static road and lane elements.\\r\\n• WorkedwithLanelet2maprepresentations to model lanes, directions, road elements, traffic signs, and connectivity across junctions\\r\\nfor downstream autonomous-driving planning.\\r\\n• Researchedimage-based, LiDAR-based, andcamera-LiDARfusionapproachesPTV3,Segnet4Dforsemanticmappingandpoint\\r\\ncloud labelling, including multi-frame alignment and transformation between camera, LiDAR, and world coordinate systems.\\r\\n• Worked on PTP time synchronization for multimodal data logging, aligning camera and LiDAR capture to a master clock, and\\r\\ndiagnosed data drops in the sensor-streaming-to-ROS integration layer\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2022\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech. in Computer Science (Specialization in Data Science & ML)\", \"result\": \"8.32\", \"institution\": \"ITM University\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/shivani-khandelwal-1791364098-221.pdf\", \"title\": \"Shivani Khandelwal\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('add03759-791f-41f6-bcc5-8a9808051532','1b952d52-2b73-435c-8821-31abb13074b5','Senior Web Developer',NULL,'Senior Web Developer',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"JQUERY\", \"JavaScript\", \"JavaScript\", \"PHP\", \"Symfony\", \"PHP\", \"Node JS\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-14 17:08:53.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"Senior Web Developer\", \"company\": \"Midas\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('add152ad-76cf-4091-a298-62a657141033','8edc605e-342c-4438-8bef-e7c6eb21ffa6','Results-driven Senior QA Consultant with 7+ years of experience in manual and automation testing\r\nacross banking, telecom, and insurance domains (including Loan Management Systems). Currently\r\nhandling QA Lead responsibilities such as team management, spr','Results-driven Senior QA Consultant with 7+ years of experience in manual and automation testing\r\nacross banking, telecom, and insurance domains (including Loan Management Systems). Currently\r\nhandling QA Lead responsibilities such as team management, sprint planning, test strategy, and\r\nautomation roadmap. Expert in Selenium, Cucumber BDD, TestNG, Rest Assured, and CI/CD\r\nintegration. Seeking a QA Lead / SDET role to drive automation strategy, le