 FastAPI, PHP, and Laravel. Strong expertise in RESTful API development,\r\nbackend architecture (MVC/MVT), database design and optimization using MySQL and PL/SQL. Experienced in\r\nAgile methodologies, code reviews, unit testing, and performance optimization','Software Developer',4,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1769679391-118.pdf',NULL,'[\"Flask\", \"JavaScript\", \"AWS\", \"Python\", \"REST API\", \"MYSQL\", \"SQL\", \"Fast API\"]','PUBLIC','2026-01-29 22:04:36.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Developer\", \"company\": \"Expediens E-solution Ltd.\", \"endDate\": \"Thu Feb 05\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Tue Feb 06\", \"description\": \"Planned and executed multi-channel advertising campaigns across digital and offline platforms.\\r\\n• Managed end-to-end campaign workflows including content coordination and release schedules.\\r\\n• Ensured brand consistency and compliance with regulatory guidelines.\\r\\n• Coordinated with cross-functional teams for campaign execution and reporting.\\r\\n• Improved campaign reach and engagement through structured planning and monitoring\"}, {\"title\": \"Software Developer\", \"company\": \"Ginger Webs Pvt. Ltd.\", \"endDate\": \"Wed Jan 31\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Thu Mar 11\", \"description\": \"Designed and developed a web-based application for candidate registration and official processes.\\r\\n• Automated admit card generation and score publishing to reduce manual workload.\\r\\n• Implemented secure data handling and validation mechanisms.\\r\\n• Improved processing efficiency and reduced turnaround time.\\r\\n• Ensured smooth and consistent user experience across devices.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2015\", \"degree\": \"Computer Science\", \"result\": \"Yes\", \"institution\": \"RGPV\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1769679391-118.pdf\", \"title\": \"cv\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('afeecca5-584e-44ac-b482-39ae91f9b018','1fa16711-78b2-4163-a7ce-73528bee9a84','Results-driven Azure Data Engineer with 3+ years of experience at Accenture designing and delivering enterprise-grade ETL/ELT \r\npipelines, cloud lakehouse architectures, and large-scale Big Data solutions on Microsoft Azure. Proven track record of process','Results-driven Azure Data Engineer with 3+ years of experience at Accenture designing and delivering enterprise-grade ETL/ELT \r\npipelines, cloud lakehouse architectures, and large-scale Big Data solutions on Microsoft Azure. Proven track record of processing 1 \r\nbillion+ records using Azure Databricks and Delta Lake on ADLS Gen2, achieving a 50% reduction in pipeline execution time, and \r\ncutting data refresh cycles from 4 hours to under 2 hours. Expertise spans the full data engineering lifecycle — from medallion \r\narchitecture design and ADF pipeline development to CI/CD deployment, data governance, and performance optimisation. \r\nRecognised twice as Star of the Month and inducted into Accenture\'s Hall of Fame for sustained delivery excellence. Immediate \r\njoiner targeting high-impact Data Engineering roles across BFSI, Big 4 Consulting, and technology organisations.','Azure Data Engineer',4,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1782134965-366.pdf',NULL,'[\"ETL\", \"ETL\", \"Azure Databricks\", \"Pyspark\", \"Spark\", \"Delta Lake\", \"ADF\", \"ADLS Gen2\", \"Snowflake\", \"Azure Functions\", \"Azure Synapse Analytics\", \"Snowflake\", \"Python\", \"SQL\", \"Pyspark\"]','PUBLIC','2026-06-23 00:56:10.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Azure Data Engineer\", \"company\": \"Accenture\", \"endDate\": \"Mon Jun 15\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Thu Oct 05\", \"description\": \"Designing and delivering production-grade data pipelines and lakehouse architectures on Microsoft Azure, processing 10M+ \\r\\nrecords daily and scaling to 1 billion+ records for enterprise analytics and AI use cases. \\r\\n▸ Lakehouse Architecture & Medallion Design: Architected scalable Bronze, Silver, and Gold medallion layers on Azure \\r\\nDatabricks and Delta Lake (ADLS Gen2) — processing up to 1 billion records with optimised PySpark workflows, enabling \\r\\ndownstream AI/ML consumption and real-time analytics. Leveraged Azure Synapse Analytics for large-scale SQL-based \\r\\ntransformations and ad-hoc analytical workloads. \\r\\n▸ Cloud Data Warehousing (Synapse & Snowflake): Worked with Azure Synapse Analytics for distributed query execution and \\r\\nSynapse Pipelines for orchestration. Applied Snowflake for cloud-native data warehousing, utilising its multi-cluster \\r\\narchitecture, zero-copy cloning, and time-travel capabilities to support enterprise reporting and analytics use cases. \\r\\n▸ ADF Pipeline Development & SSIS Migration: Spearheaded end-to-end migration of legacy SSIS and Control-M workflows to \\r\\nAzure Data Factory, engineering ETL/ELT pipelines ingesting from SQL databases, flat files, and REST APIs. Reduced pipeline \\r\\nmaintenance overhead by 30% through incremental loading frameworks using watermark and change-data-capture (CDC) \\r\\npatterns. \\r\\n▸ Performance Engineering & Optimisation: Achieved 50% reduction in report execution time through advanced SQL indexing, \\r\\nquery refactoring, partition pruning strategies, and incremental load design — cutting data refresh cycles from 4 hours to \\r\\nunder 2 hours across critical business pipelines. \\r\\n▸ SQL Server & Data Modelling: Engineered and optimised 100+ SQL Server objects including Stored Procedures, Views, \\r\\nFunctions, and Indexes. Designed star and snowflake schema models supporting dimensional analytics and multi-business\\r\\nunit reporting.\"}, {\"title\": \"Data Engineer & BI Analyst\", \"company\": \"Accenture\", \"endDate\": \"Fri Oct 20\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Sat Sep 10\", \"description\": \"Foundation data engineering role focused on delivering analytics solutions, establishing governance frameworks, and building the \\r\\nSQL and data modelling expertise underpinning current senior engineering work. \\r\\n▸ Data Governance & Access Control: Implemented Role-Based Access Control (RBAC) and Row-Level Security (RLS) \\r\\nframeworks in SQL Server and Power BI — establishing secure, policy-driven data access across enterprise reporting layers. \\r\\n▸ BI Platform Migration (Tableau → Power BI): Led full-lifecycle migration from Tableau to Power BI, rebuilding semantic \\r\\nmodels, validating data consistency across source and target, and optimising DAX measures to match business KPIs. \\r\\n▸ ETL Pipeline Development: Developed and maintained Azure Data Factory pipelines for data ingestion, transformation, and \\r\\nloading into SQL Server — establishing foundational data engineering practices aligned with enterprise standards. \\r\\n▸ Executive Dashboard Delivery: Collaborated directly with business stakeholders to translate KPI requirements into \\r\\ninteractive Power BI dashboards, delivering actionable insights across sales, operations, and finance functions. \\r\\n▸ Data Quality & Reconciliation: Designed and executed source-to-target validation frameworks and data quality checks to \\r\\nensure accuracy, completeness, and consistency of reporting data across multiple business domains. \\r\\nStack: Power BI • DAX • SQL Server • Tableau • Azure Data Factory • RBAC • Row-Level Security • Git\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2022\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech — Computer Science & Engineering\", \"result\": \"72\", \"institution\": \"Sree Vidyanikethan Engineering College\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1782134965-366.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('affd8a28-e64f-498f-b254-f58883337168','68f6bb9e-f876-473b-9601-b81108c9936c','Full-Stack Developer',NULL,'Full-Stack Developer',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Adobe Experience Manager\", \"Java\", \"CQ5\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-15 03:19:52.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": 