extraction initiatives at Xoriant Solutions Pvt. Ltd., Generative AI, OCR, and Agentic AI-based solutions. Awarded \r\nas Agile Employee of the Year – 2023 at Narola Infotech for delivering impactful AI innovations across diverse business domains.','Data Scientist',4,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1779985540-783.pdf',NULL,'[\"Flask\", \"Django\", \"Machine Learning\", \"Github\", \"Azure DevOps\", \"Docker\", \"HTML\", \"CSS\", \"Bootstrap\", \"Python\", \"Selenium\", \"LangChain\", \"LLM Fine-tuning\", \"Deep Learning\", \"Hugging Face\", \"Azure Functions\"]','PUBLIC','2026-05-29 03:52:17.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Data Scientist\", \"company\": \"Xoriant Solutions Pvt Ltd\", \"endDate\": \"Wed May 20\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Wed Apr 10\", \"description\": \"Overview: \\r\\n           Automated the manual entity extraction of multi-page manufacturing quotes that earlier consumed 60% more manual effort and caused 70% \\r\\n        longer turnaround time due to complex formats and lack of batch processing.  \\r\\n      Key Contributions & Achievements: \\r\\n• Designed and implemented an AI-powered entity extraction pipeline using Python, Azure Form Recognizer, and GPT-4o, improving extraction \\r\\naccuracy and scalability by 50%. \\r\\n• Integrated YOLOv8 models for table and field detection within scanned PDFs, enabling structured data extraction from unstructured documents. \\r\\n• Developed a Flask-based web interface with MongoDB backend and Azure Blob Storage integration, reducing manual verification effort by 60%. \\r\\n• Optimized performance by deploying asynchronous processing on Linux servers for extraction and PDF conversion connectors on Windows VMs, \\r\\ncutting processing time by 45%. \\r\\n• Implemented CI/CD pipelines using Azure DevOps and version control with Git, ensuring consistent, testable, and modular code deployment. \\r\\n• Collaborated in Agile sprints with AI engineers and product owners, performing code reviews, feedback loops, and iterative model fine-tuning for \\r\\nbetter extraction accuracy. \\r\\n• Impact: Reduced manual effort by >60%, shortened quote processing by 70%, and delivered a robust, scalable Generative AI solution for industrial \\r\\ndocument automation.\"}, {\"title\": \"Data Scientist\", \"company\": \"Narola Infotech Solutions LLP\", \"endDate\": \"Mon Apr 15\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Wed Nov 10\", \"description\": \"• Language Comprehension: Utilized GPT-3.5 for advanced language understanding. Implemented the Faster Whisper model for accurate multimedia \\r\\ntranscription from the inputs containing videos & PDFs. \\r\\n• Content Processing: Leveraged Recursive Character Text Splitter, Chroma DB, and Pinecone for efficient content processing. \\r\\n• Enhanced Content Generation: Automated PPT creation and integrated interactive question-answering features. Developed assignments and Q&A \\r\\ncomponents for enriched learning experience. Used MySQL for streamlined dumping extracted content and retrieval of it. \\r\\n• Impact: Redefined virtual training with AI-driven transcription and engagement by reducing around 42% of time for manual course generation as per \\r\\nfeedback. Deployed on AWS Lambda using Flask for scalable, cloud-based accessibility.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2016\", \"degree\": \"Bachelor of Engineering in Computer Science and Engineering\", \"result\": \"68\", \"institution\": \"D.Y. Patil University\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1779985540-783.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('b03413da-2ab0-475e-9bdf-19927c44aed0','a48c137f-8e17-4978-895f-97674f2698c0','Technical Support Engineer',NULL,'Technical Support Engineer',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','PUBLIC','2025-05-13 17:33:48.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"Technical Support Engineer\", \"company\": \"Statiq\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"descri