ement \r\nskills can be applied and be a part of company growth with a welcome \r\nattitude for the new learning experience.','MANUFACTURING IT OPERATIONS SUPPORT- MES',6,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1769598330-292.pdf',NULL,'[\"C++\", \"Java\", \"Mes\", \"Industrial Automation\", \"SCADA\", \"HMI\", \"SQL Server\", \"Oracle\", \"Kepware\", \"Root Cause Analysis\"]','PUBLIC','2026-01-28 23:22:44.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"MANUFACTURING IT OPERATIONS SUPPORT- MES\", \"company\": \"Mahindra Integrated Business Solution\", \"endDate\": \"Tue Jan 20\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Thu Mar 10\", \"description\": \" Hands-on experience with Rockwell FTPC Support. \\r\\n Working with the FTPC team for continuous support, and enhancement. \\r\\n FTPC Deployment understanding and development of basic level change \\r\\nrequests. \\r\\n Developments on Event sheet, Forms, Subroutine, and FTPC object. \\r\\n Implementation of MES functionalities for shop floor operation which include  \\r\\nOrder management, Production booking, Order tracking, Error proofing and  \\r\\nOrder Sequence display \\r\\n MES BOM, VIN, Attributes, Part master configuration. \\r\\n Good knowledge of Rockwell FTPC architecture. \\r\\n Responsible for Diagnostic screen changes to capture critical alarm of events \\r\\n Good understanding and experience in Rockwell FTPC and other Rockwell \\r\\nproducts like EIG, Purge, Live Transfer, etc. \\r\\n Handling change request on the shop floor and deploying them in a production \\r\\nenvironment. \\r\\n Development of Quality Inspection Data (QID) forms.\"}, {\"title\": \"PROJECT ENGINEER- MES\", \"company\": \"Sigma Industrial Automation & solution\", \"endDate\": \"Fri Feb 25\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Fri Apr 10\", \"description\": \" New change requests in genealogy, data acquisition, and tracking as per users’ \\r\\nrequirements \\r\\n Machine connectivity, Live data acquisition from OEM machine & data log in \\r\\nSQL \\r\\n Root Cause Analysis (RCA) & given final solution for attended issues \\r\\n Line Interlocking system on the line for error-proofing with maintenance. \\r\\n Andon Screen modification in Assembly Line \\r\\no Station Fault Display, Fault scrolling message, Production Data \\r\\n Build Sheet and Barcode Print Functionality through VBA code in SCADA \\r\\n Data capturing in MES using Datalogger in KEPSEVER  \\r\\n Data logging in SQL database using Alarm and Event setup in Factory talk with \\r\\nthe studio \\r\\n Good knowledge of the manufacturing process. \\r\\n Shop floor Makino machine connected with Fanuc MT-Link is a software \\r\\nsolution.\"}, {\"title\": \"AUTOMATION ENGINEER (MES- CONTROL)\", \"company\": \"MESTECH (A Rockwell Automation Company)\", \"endDate\": \"Thu Apr 30\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Tue Jun 05\", \"description\": \" Data handling in PLC and DB with the help of Kepware and Link Master OPC \\r\\n New Project implementation Development & Deployment. \\r\\n Table creation and query execution in MS SQL \\r\\n Order Sequencing, Order Management, and Serial Generation, in PLC \\r\\n Daily Health check-up of MES systems which includes applications, Hardware & \\r\\nSoftware \\r\\n Serial and R232 Port Scanner connected on PLC \\r\\n Prn file creation new printer configuration and installation with SCADA, \\r\\ntroubleshooting and resolution of barcode print-related issues.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2020\", \"degree\": \"B.E.(INSTRUMENTATION)\", \"result\": \"72\", \"institution\": \"North Maharashtra University Jalgaon\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1769598330-292.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('b15fb016-8106-4406-9671-622cc4c89820','de128a77-cd88-4798-ab43-48fa0e7907b9','Technical Support Engineer 2',NULL,'Technical Support Engineer 2',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Microsoft Office\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-13 17:39:01.000000','2026-10-