"Github\", \"JIRA\", \"SAP ME\", \"SAP MII Development\", \"Sap UI5\", \"SAP FIORI\", \"Node JS\", \"SAP PCo\", \"PLC\", \"SCADA\", \"Spring\", \"Oracle\", \"PL/SQL\"]','PUBLIC','2025-12-04 04:03:31.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Team Manager\", \"company\": \"Fujitsu\", \"endDate\": \"Sun Nov 30\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Thu Mar 10\", \"description\": \"Working on various configurations and data set up in SAP DMC, this client is into manufacturing several construction materials, helping them implement the solution for different production lines.\\r\\nalong with project activities currently involved in a few biddings with different clients, helping Fujitsu in team building activities in DMC, helping them with training, material etc. also working with SAP to help them build add-ons in DMC.\\r\\n\\r\\nApplication Environment:\\r\\nTechnologies Used: - DMC, Cloud foundry, DMCi, SAC, SAP CPI, Node js, JavaScript, SAP UI5\\r\\n\\r\\nResponsibilities:\\r\\n•\\tSet up ready to work DMC environment.\\r\\n•\\tResponsible for leading the communication with client.\\r\\n•\\tDocumenting all the configurations.\\r\\n•\\tBuilding custom pods in DMC.\\r\\n•\\tIntegrating shop floor systems with DMC.\\r\\n•\\tS4HANA integration with DMC.\\r\\n•\\tResponsible for making the solution robust and optimized.\\r\\n•\\tHelping them with go-live activities and post hyper-care support.\\r\\n•\\tResponsible for coordinating with other teams for Application readiness testing.\"}, {\"title\": \"Business Consultant\", \"company\": \"SAP\", \"endDate\": \"Wed Mar 30\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Thu Feb 08\", \"description\": \"Worked as a leader and developer and created custom MTA (Multi Target Applications), using CAP (Cloud Application Programming) model in SAP BTP (Business Technology Platform, Cloud Foundry). This is an internal SAP product which has been built from scratch.\\r\\n\\r\\nApplication Environment:\\r\\nTechnologies Used: - SAP UI5, CAP, Node Js, JavaScript, JIRA\\r\\n\\r\\nResponsibilities:\\r\\n•\\tResponsible for handling use cases, plan, and assign it to team.\\r\\n•\\tResponsible for building various applications, FLP configurations, backend integrations.\\r\\n•\\tResponsible for several client communications and assist them with their issues on JIRA.\\r\\n•\\tResponsible for various developments, unit and integration testing of screens and deploy the same.\"}, {\"title\": \"System Engineer\", \"company\": \"IBM India Pvt. Ltd.\", \"endDate\": \"Fri Jun 30\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Wed Jul 15\", \"description\": \"Project: SAP ME Implementation @ Railway project in UK  \\r\\nSupported one of our clients in the UK, which is a railway-based project implemented using SAP MII, SAP ME, where we monitor the raw materials, the produced finished goods, data coming from legacy system.We have done some MII and ME enhancements and supported them with production issues.\\r\\n\\r\\nApplication Environment:\\r\\nTechnologies Used: - SAP ME, SAP MII, SAP MEINT, JAVA \\r\\n\\r\\nResponsibilities:\\r\\n•\\tResponsible for leading the discussing with client, gathering requirements from client.\\r\\n•\\tMEINT workflow configuration\\r\\n•\\tME SDK development\\r\\n•\\tResponsible for building several custom PODs, custom plugins and activity hooks in SAP ME.\\r\\n•\\tResponsible for creation of logics from Sap MII transaction.\\r\\n•\\tResponsible for coordinating with other teams for Application readiness testing.\\r\\n\\r\\nProject: SAP MII Implementation @ Middle East Petroleum Company\\t\\t \\r\\nIt is a petrochemical industry-based project implemented using SAP MII, where daily material balance, daily operation report, SAP ERP integration and utility dashboards have been developed on SAP MII. I have worked on developing utility dashboards which are based on real time utility data coming from OSI PI tags to manage monthly reconciliation plant data based on actual figures.  I have designed web pages using SAP UI5 and equally have worked on back-end logic development, using BLS, MDO Queries, Xacute Queries.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2013\", \"degree\": \"B.E (CSE)\", \"result\": \"63\", \"institution\": \"University of Mumbai\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1764777610-653.docx\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('b2f74218-774b-47be-b422-a57ad4281fdd','5cb506a8-19b4-4e9f-bdcc-188b7931b13c','Experienced Application Support Analyst over 5 \r\nyears of experience in supporting Java-based \r\napplications on Linux/Unix platforms. Skilled in \r\nincident management, root cause analysis, and \r\nautomation scripting to enhance system \r\nperformance and rel','Experienced Application Support Analyst over 5 \r\nyears of experience in supporting Java-based \r\napplications on Linux/Unix platforms. Skilled in \r\nincident management, root cause analysis, and \r\nautomation scripting to enhance system \r\nperformance and reliability. Proficient in MySQL \r\ndatabase management, backend troubleshooting, \r\nand bridge call handling. Recognized for strong \r\nproblem-solving, collaboration, and a \r\ncommitment to delivering efficient and reliable \r\ntechnical support in fast-paced environments.','Application Development & Support Analyst / Sr Analys',2,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/samiksha-sonone-1791537326-699.pdf',NULL,'[\"Linux\", \"JIRA\", \"Confluence\", \"Java\", \"HTML\", \"UNIX\", \"MYSQL\", \"ServiceNow\", \"Splunk\"]','PUBLIC','2026-10-09 20:39:49.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Application Development & Support Analyst / Sr Analys\", \"company\": \"Accenture Solutions Private Limited\", \"endDate\": \"Thu Jan 01\", \"isCurrent\": true, \"startDate\": \"Thu May 13\", \"description\": \" Provide L2/L3 production support for business\\r\\ncritical applications in Linux/Unix environments, \\r\\nensuring high availability and SLA compliance \\r\\n Administer and maintain the ServiceNow ITSM \\r\\nplatform, supporting Incident, Problem, Change, \\r\\nDemand, and Service Request modules \\r\\n Lead incident and problem management, \\r\\nperforming root cause analysis (RCA) and \\r\\nimplementing permanent corrective actions \\r\\n Participate in major incident bridge calls, \\r\\ncoordinating with cross-functional teams and \\r\\nstakeholders \\r\\n Design, develop, and optimize Bash/Shell \\r\\nautomation scripts to reduce manual effort and \\r\\nrecurring incidents \\r\\n Execute risk-aware change management, \\r\\nincluding impact assessment, implementation, \\r\\nand post-deployment validation \\r\\n Perform backend troubleshooting using Linux \\r\\ncommands, log analysis, and MySQL \\r\\nqueries/jobs \\r\\n Schedule, monitor, and optimize MySQL \\r\\ndatabase jobs to improve performance and \\r\\nreliability \\r\\n Create and maintain RCA reports, RFCs, SOPs, \\r\\nand knowledge articles in compliance with audit \\r\\nstandards \\r\\n Mentor junior analysts and enforce production \\r\\nsupport best practices and operational controls.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2020\", \"degree\": \"Bachelor of Technology - Computer  Engineering\", \"result\": \"7.1\", \"institution\": \"North Maharashtra University\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/samiksha-sonone-1791537326-699.pdf\", \"title\": \"Samiksha Sonone\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('b2f8db68-900a-483d-8678-f62a6f0b0b50','28471264-9926-43ae-9883-e173b664635c','Test Resume136','Test Resume136','Software Deve',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"AWS\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-26 20:46:54.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Deve\", \"company\": \"Value Labs \", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[{\"year\": \"\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech\", \"result\": \"\", \"institution\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('b302865a-2382-4067-8875-f6bd09bd108a','cbe3d23d-5a47-4e23-b0eb-4977f3a55555',