ntrol, control systems designs, configuration, and commissioning. \r\nAn immense passion towards technology and a craving towards learning makes me open to challenging opportunities in \r\nvarious engineering sectors.','TECH LEAD - OT SECURITY:',4,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1776050297-3.pdf',NULL,'[]','PUBLIC','2026-04-13 14:47:36.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"TECH LEAD - OT SECURITY:\", \"company\": \"L&T Technology services\", \"endDate\": \"Tue Mar 31\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Fri Jun 10\", \"description\": \"• Creating cybersecurity reference architecture in line with IEC 62443, NIST, ISO 27001. \\r\\n• Review and assessment of clients’ security posture in line with emerging threats and assess risk \\r\\nthat may possess. \\r\\n• Selection and deployment of security monitoring tool such as Claroty  for asset inventory, \\r\\ndetecting threats, vulnerabilities and risk analysis.  \\r\\n• Reviewing existing architecture and proposing a high-level design architecture of the plant network \\r\\npertaining to the Purdue model and IEC 62443 standards. \\r\\n• Gap and risk assessment in the client environment and proposing a roadmap for implementation. \\r\\n• Assessing current maturity level of the infrastructure and proposing a target maturity level for the clients \\r\\nas per C2M2 model. \\r\\n• Defining a security control, policies and procedures for the client as a part of cybersecurity practices.  \\r\\n• Integration of Continuous Threat Detection (CTD) tool with Security Information and Event \\r\\nmanagement (SIEM) tool to get the real time threat update from the customer environment. \\r\\n• Actively worked with Secure Remote Access (SRA) tool to give a safe and secure remote access to \\r\\nthe employees of the customer/third party vendor access.\"}, {\"title\": \"Deputy Manager – Operational Technology & OT Cybersecurity\", \"company\": \"The Ramco Cements Limited\", \"endDate\": \"Fri May 20\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Tue May 05\", \"description\": \"• Conducted a frequent gap analysis for the OT components present in the plant aligning with the IEC 62443, \\r\\nNIST standards. \\r\\n• Identification of IT/OT convergence touch points and mitigating them to remove the security risk. \\r\\n• Provided the high-level architecture defining the zones, switches, firewall, security tools aligning to Purdue \\r\\nmodel. \\r\\n• System hardening, OS patch updating, OT devices/software firmware update, AV tool update, log management \\r\\nwas done as a part to close the gaps. \\r\\n• Good understanding of the protocols such as ETHERNET IP,HART, MODBUS, PROFINET, \\r\\nBLUETOOTH,TCP/UDP, SNMP AND SMTP. \\r\\n• Proficient in using database systems such as IFix and OPC communication. \\r\\n• Engaging in preparing calibration records for ISO9001, IS14001, IS50001. \\r\\n• Maintenance and commissioning of AC drives (ACS850, ACS580, F7, A1000,616G5, GA700) and DC \\r\\ndrive (LnToR). \\r\\n• Periodic calibration of Analyzer (O2, Co, So2, Nox) - Rosemount (XSTREAM), Abb Gas (A02020), PM2.5 \\r\\n& PM10 (BAM 1020), and stack monitor (Sick SP100) Systems and Ph meter (Liquisys-M). \\r\\n• Maintenance of X-ray analyzer(ARL9900-XRF)system ,benchtop X-ray analyzer (SPECTRA IQ ii & \\r\\nXEPOSC),XRD (Aeris-Panalytical) and Gamma ray analyzer. \\r\\n• Calibration of all field transmitters with the Hart communicator 475 and loop checking. \\r\\n• Knowledge in Camera selection/installation (Dahua camera, E-switch &NVR) \\r\\nand UPS (Numeric, Consul) system. \\r\\n• Configuration and installation of smart MCC SIEMENS LTMR80E through Ethernet/IP protocol to PLC. \\r\\n• Installation and commissioning of Linear control valve (SIEMENS S2) and butterfly valve YT3300. \\r\\n• Proficient in communication protocols such as RS232/RS485, Ethernet and Modbus. \\r\\n• Periodic backup of all the software and applications of automation systems \\r\\n• Engineering solutions to critical and repetitive problems occurring in the plant. \\r\\n• Configuration and installation of smart MCC SIEMENS LTMR80E and YASKAWA VFD (GA700) through \\r\\nEthernet/IP protocol to PLC.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2014\", \"degree\": \"Bachelor\'s degree, Instrumentation & Control Engineering\", \"result\": \"68\", \"institution\": \"Anna University\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1776050297-3.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('b3a08cf1-f163-434a-9869-46423149bedc','085a2b34-8a48-4933-b4af-02c76f7c6092','Test Resume172','Test Resume172','Software Deve',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Automation\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-26 17:25:56.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Deve\", \"company\": \"Capgemini\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[{\"year\": \"\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech\", \"result\": \"\", \"institution\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('b3a1b621-603c-412f-952e-8fc717ccfb46','015607d8-469b-4073-b18d-13754d86e17a','International Voice Process',NULL,'International Voice Process',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Knowledge Management\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-13 17:01:55.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"International Voice Process\", \"company\": \"Concentrix\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('b3ad8392-156e-422d-9039-3be42be6dedb','205c855b-ad90-4187-92c5-708dc28883ad','CEO/ President/ Founder',NULL,'CEO/ President/ Founder',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Drupal\", \"A/B Testing\", \"Magento\", \"AdWords\", \"Business Development\", \"Business Strategy\", \"Management\", \"Lead Generation\", \"Digital Marketing\", \"Financial Analysis\", \"E-Commerce\", \"Android\", \"IOS\", \"IOS Development\", \".NET\", \"Graphic Design\", \"Microsoft Excel\", \"Illustrator\", \"Data Analysis\", \"Business Analysis\", \"ASP.NET\", \"C++\", \"Direct Sales\", 