 \"Rockwell Factorytalk\", \"Warehouse Management Systems\", \"MS SQL Server\", \"Oracle\", \"TOAD\", \"DBeaver\", \"ServiceNow\", \"Python\"]','PUBLIC','2026-01-16 23:41:21.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"MES Analyst\", \"company\": \"Accenture\", \"endDate\": \"Sat Jan 10\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Tue Dec 10\", \"description\": \" Experienced Played a key role in the Level 3 Global Application Support team for a major US \\r\\npharmaceutical client, supporting MES operations across 32 global manufacturing sites. \\r\\n Demonstrated strong expertise in Siemens Opcenter EX PH and Rockwell FTPC, including \\r\\nmodule configuration, recipe design, testing, and end-to-end production support from raw \\r\\nmaterial handling to packaging. \\r\\n Developed a solid understanding of MES integrations with SAP, Label Management Systems, \\r\\nWarehouse Management Systems, and AMPS, including ActiveMQ message flow and IDOC \\r\\nanalysis. \\r\\n Gained extensive knowledge of server/database configurations, application services, work \\r\\ncenter setup, equipment binding, and order/batch releases for live shop-floor operations. \\r\\n Investigated and resolved production-related issues by replicating scenarios, performing root\\r\\ncause analysis, and providing effective resolutions to end users. \\r\\n Contributed to the training and testing of a Generative AI chatbot, improving user \\r\\ntroubleshooting efficiency through updated knowledge resources. \\r\\n Acted as the key coordinator for Service Portal testing, facilitating user access automation. \\r\\n Created and maintained change controls, deviations, CAPA records, and RFC documentation \\r\\nin alignment with regulatory and SOP requirements. \\r\\n Implemented hotfixes in QA and Production environments to address critical EBR application \\r\\nissues while ensuring system stability and compliance.\"}, {\"title\": \"MES Associate\", \"company\": \"Accenture\", \"endDate\": \"Sat Nov 25\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Sun Oct 10\", \"description\": \"Ensured seamless global MES operations by optimizing system performance, providing \\r\\nproactive client support, and resolving issues efficiently. Played a key role in minimizing \\r\\ndowntime, enhancing operational efficiency, and maintaining compliance within a high\\r\\navailability manufacturing environment. \\r\\n Delivered high-quality MES support to global manufacturing sites, resolving high-priority \\r\\nproduction issues, minimizing downtime, and ensuring stable, efficient operations across \\r\\nMES, WMS, and integrated systems. \\r\\n Analyzed and optimized MES communication with SAP, ActiveMQ, and Rockwell FTPS \\r\\ninterfaces, improving cross-system reliability, server performance, and overall application \\r\\nstability. \\r\\n Created comprehensive end-user enablement materials—including Knowledge Base videos, \\r\\nKBAs, and SOP-aligned work instructions—to streamline troubleshooting and reduce \\r\\nrecurring support tickets. \\r\\n Specialized in label management, printer configuration, database systems, and critical \\r\\nsupport activities such as GCCs, outages, and hyper-care, ensuring uninterrupted MES \\r\\ncontinuity in regulated manufacturing environments. \\r\\n Worked with cross-functional teams to enhance MES integrations, resolve issues proactively, \\r\\nand improve system performance.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2021\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech(ECE)\", \"result\": \"72\", \"institution\": \"Geethanjali College of Engineering\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1768562657-304.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('b3df46f9-0601-4012-b52a-51fa0c085caa','a1b68230-8c8d-443b-b096-fcb27ebc7b46','Test Resume44','Test Resume44','Software Deve',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Power BI\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-26 14:41:53.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Deve\", \"company\": \"Capgemini \