8 years of experience across Mobile Application Development, Android Engineering, Flutter Development, REST API Integration, and Cross-Platform Application Development within Banking, Fleet Management,','•	Mobile Application Engineering Professional: Nearly 8 years of experience across Mobile Application Development, Android Engineering, Flutter Development, REST API Integration, and Cross-Platform Application Development within Banking, Fleet Management, Construction Technology, and Transportation domains. \r\n•	Enterprise Mobility Solution Developer: Last associated with Piston Tech Pvt. Ltd. as Sr. Mobile Application Developer, delivering scalable applications focused on fuel management, OCR processing, QR-based validation, and real-time tracking systems. \r\n•	Cross-Platform Development Specialist: Spearheaded development of robust mobile applications using Flutter, Kotlin, Java, Dart, REST APIs, MVVM, MVC, Clean Architecture, Bloc, Cubit, and GetX for high-performance and scalable deployments. \r\n•	API & Application Architecture Expert: Built secure and scalable mobile ecosystems through third-party integrations, reusable components, push notification systems, and real-time synchronization frameworks aligned with enterprise requirements. \r\n•	Scalable Application Delivery Contributor: Successfully delivered 10+ mobile applications across Android and hybrid platforms, supporting enterprise mobility and customer-focused digital transformation initiatives. \r\n•	User Experience & Engagement Enhancer: Elevated user satisfaction by 78% and strengthened user engagement by 80% through performance optimization, intuitive mobile experiences, and streamlined application workflows. \r\n•	Business-Aligned Technology Enabler: Recognized for combining strong technical expertise with operational understanding to deliver secure, scalable, and business-driven mobile solutions across enterprise and consumer environments.','Sr. Mobile Application Developer',6,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\