uctured datasets and scalable integration of operational data.\\r\\n• Designed and implemented multi-cloud ingestion pipelines leveraging AWS Glue for serverless ETL orchestration and AWS Lambda for\\r\\nevent-driven data processing, enabling seamless integration alongside Azure-based workloads.\\r\\n• Built metadata-driven ETL frameworks enabling dynamic pipeline execution, standardized audit logging, automated error handling,\\r\\nreprocessing, and SCD2 versioning, reducing new pipeline development effort by ~30–40%.\\r\\n• Designed and implemented secure data pipelines for payroll, finance, and compliance-critical datasets, using PGP\\r\\nencryption/decryption, key-based handling, and secure SFTP transfers, meeting enterprise security and audit requirements.\\r\\n• Led API-based data integration design for enterprise SaaS and operational systems, implementing retry logic, idempotency, and failure\\r\\nrecovery, achieving >99.5% pipeline reliability.\\r\\n• Acted as data architecture lead for cross-functional teams, driving design reviews, architectural decisions, coding standards, and\\r\\nproduction readiness across multiple initiatives.\\r\\n• Optimized platform performance and cost through query tuning, pipeline refactoring, and storage optimization, improving end-to-end\\r\\nruntimes by 25–35% and data availability from T+1 to near-real-time.\\r\\n• Served as a technical bridge between business, analytics, and engineering teams, translating complex requirements into scalable,\\r\\nmaintainable data architectures adopted across projects.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2023\", \"degree\": \"Computer Science\", \"result\": \"Yes\", \"institution\": \"Indian Institute of Technology\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1776248626-44.pdf\", \"title\": \"cv\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('b4b721b8-fe6a-4c84-8478-522f751a7fa4','7e919a78-73ae-4f4c-9aef-4cbf8b426356','Jr.Python/Django Developer',NULL,'Jr.Python/Django Developer',2,NULL,NULL