 10\", \"description\": \"• Designed, developed, and maintained enterprise-grade full-stack web applications using Blazor, Razor Pages, C#, and ASP.NET \\r\\nCore MVC across the entire application stack. \\r\\n• Built and consumed RESTful Web APIs enabling seamless component and microservice communication across the product suite. \\r\\n• Designed scalable, reusable UI components for Spreadsheet, Data Grid, Dashboard, and Gantt Chart modules, spanning front\\r\\nend rendering and back-end data services. \\r\\n• Implemented virtualization, filtering, sorting, and grouping to render high-volume enterprise datasets efficiently in the \\r\\nSpreadsheet component. \\r\\n• Applied Dependency Injection across services to improve modularity, testability, and long-term maintainability. \\r\\n• Architected the database layer with Entity Framework and Microsoft SQL Server, designing schemas and optimizing queries to \\r\\nsupport high-throughput CRUD workflows. \\r\\n• Used LINQ extensively for server-side data processing and core business logic. \\r\\n• Owned end-to-end performance optimization, debugging, and critical issue resolution spanning the UI, API, and database layers. \\r\\n• Built custom ASP.NET Core middleware for request logging and authentication. \\r\\n• Authored NUnit and Playwright automated test suites, reducing regression issues across releases. \\r\\n• Participated in Agile ceremonies (sprint planning, estimation, code reviews) throughout the SDLC. \\r\\n• Mentored junior developers on full-stack .NET/Blazor best practices, debugging, and performance optimization. \\r\\n• Led optimization of the Syncfusion Gantt Chart component for Blazor, resolving key performance bottlenecks and improving user \\r\\nexperience by 25%.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2022\", \"degree\": \"Bachelor of Engineering — Electronics & Communication Engineering\", \"result\": \"7.1\", \"institution\": \"Ramco Institute of Technology\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uplo