 database schemas in MySQL to enhance system performance.\\r\\n• Wrote unit and integration tests using JUnit/TestNG to automate testing and ensure code quality.\\r\\n• Applied problem-solving skills to debug and resolve complex issues in system-level software.\\r\\n• Collaborated in an Agile team environment, contributing to sprints, code reviews, and DevOps pipelines.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2023\", \"degree\": \"Bachelor of Technology in Computer Science\", \"result\": \"72\", \"institution\": \"DKTE’s Textile and Engineering Institute\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1770066221-277.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('b5d72a5e-1555-4643-9931-5649609f5f3a','7a8b3151-bc7e-456c-b2d2-5293de6027c4','Python-focused Data Engineer with 4+ years of experience building and automating cloud data engineering solutions using \r\nPython, PySpark, and SQL. Skilled in developing Python-based ETL/ELT frameworks, custom data processing scripts, and \r\nworkflow autom','Python-focused Data Engineer with 4+ years of experience building and automating cloud data engineering solutions using \r\nPython, PySpark, and SQL. Skilled in developing Python-based ETL/ELT frameworks, custom data processing scripts, and \r\nworkflow automation on Snowflake, AWS S3, and Apache Airflow (Python DAGs). Experienced in using Python for data \r\nvalidation, quality checks, API-based integrations, and orchestration logic, alongside Snowflake SQL and dbt for \r\ntransformation. Strong track record of using Python to reduce manual effort, improve pipeline reliability, and accelerate \r\ndelivery of analytics-ready data for BI reporting.','Data Engineer',4,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1790064179-53.pdf',NULL,'[\"AWS\", \"Microsoft Azure Platform\", \"Data Integration\", \"Data Warehousing\", \"Data Modeling\", \"KPI Reporting\", \"JIRA\", \"Python\", \"Pandas\", \"Pyspark\", \"SQL\", \"Snowflake\", \"S3\", \"Pyspark\", \"Snowflake\", \"SQL\", \"MYSQL\", \"Oracle\", \"PL/SQL\", \"Data Engineer\", \"Power BI\", \"Tableau\"]','PUBLIC','2026-09-22 19:27:37.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Data Engineer\", \"company\": \"Tech Mahindra\", \"endDate\": \"Mon Aug 10\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Tue Sep 10\", \"description\": \"• Develop Python-based ETL/ELT pipelines using PySpark, Snowflake, and AWS S3 for merchant onboarding, transaction, \\r\\nsettlement, and reconciliation data, processing 100,000+ daily transaction records for downstream analytics.\\r\\n• Author Python scripts and Airflow DAGs (written in Python) to automate orchestration of data ingestion workflows \\r\\nintegrated with Snowflake and AWS S3, cutting manual processing effort by 30% and improving on-time delivery.\\r\\n• Build reusable Python modules and Snowflake SQL stored procedures to transform raw data into analytics-ready datasets, \\r\\napplying joins, aggregations, derived fields, and SCD Type 2 change tracking across multiple source tables.\\r\\n• Write Python-based data quality and validation scripts to profile and monitor curated data models, complementing \\r\\npartitioning/clustering strategies that reduced average query runtime and improved performance by 35%.\\r\\n• Use Python (boto3) to enforce role-based access control, automate data masking routines, and generate audit logs with the \\r\\nsecurity team, maintaining full compliance across quarterly reviews.\\r\\n• Automate Power BI data refresh and preprocessing using Python scripts, giving business users visibility into merchant \\r\\ntransactions, settlement status, and payment trends, adopted by 20+ business users.\\r\\n• Develop Python monitoring scripts to parse Snowflake and Airflow logs, proactively detecting pipeline failures to maintain \\r\\n99%+ reliability and cutting settlement reconciliation turnaround time by 25%.\"}, {\"title\": \"Associate\", \"company\": \"Cognizant Technology Solutions\", \"endDate\": \"Fri May 10\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Thu Feb 10\", \"description\": \"• Built Python and PySpark scripts to consolidate policy, claims, and customer data from multiple enterprise source systems \\r\\ninto Snowflake via AWS S3 staging layers, creating a unified, analytics-ready data warehouse for the Pacific Life Insurance \\r\\nprogram.\\r\\n• Combined Python scripting with dbt to build modular, version-controlled transformation models on top of Snowflake, \\r\\nstandardizing raw insurance data into reusable datasets and reducing manual transformation effort across reporting teams.\\r\\n• Wrote Python-based Airflow DAGs to schedule, orchestrate, and monitor end-to-end data workflows, ensuring reliable, on\\r\\ntime refreshes of policy and claims pipelines feeding downstream BI tools.\\r\\n• Developed Python utilities alongside PL/SQL procedures and Snowflake SQL transformations to migrate legacy insurance \\r\\nreporting logic into the modern cloud data warehouse, applying joins, aggregations, and derived fields.\\r\\n• Created Python data validation and cleansing scripts in partnership with QA and business teams, catching and resolving \\r\\n95%+ of discrepancies in customer and claims records prior to release.\\r\\n• Automated data feeds for Power BI and Tableau dashboards using Python, tracking policy issuance, claims turnaround, and \\r\\ncustomer retention KPIs, giving stakeholders self-serve visibility into insurance performance metrics.\\r\\n• Used Git for version control of Python and SQL pipeline code and Jira to manage sprint deliverables, contributing to a 20% \\r\\nfaster requirement turnaround and a 15% reduction in production defects through code reviews and UAT validation.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2021\", \"degree\": \"Bachelor of Engineering (BE), Electronics and Communication Engineering\", \"result\": \"7.96\", \"institution\": \"Francis Xavier Engineering College, Anna University\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1790064179-