. My\\r\\n responsibilities include developing end-to-end AI systems, integrating\\r\\n advanced techniques such as Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG),\\r\\n Natural Language Processing (NLP), and computer vision. I collaborate closely\\r\\n with stakeholders to deliver scalable, production-ready solutions that drive\\r\\n innovation and efficiency across industries, including finance and engineering,\\r\\n while ensuring alignment with client objectives and industry standards\"}, {\"title\": \"Data Scientist\", \"company\": \"PlanetEye Farm-AI\", \"endDate\": \"Thu Jul 31\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Fri May 10\", \"description\": \"Spearheaded data analysis, engineering, and AI/ML model development for\\r\\n Earth Observation, Agricultural solutions, Infrastructure solutions, and 3D\\r\\n modelling/Digital twinning, leveraging advanced AI technologies.\\r\\n Developed sophisticated algorithms for crop identification and monitoring using\\r\\n Machine Learning and Deep Learning, analyzing hyper-spectral signatures\\r\\n and diverse wavelength imagery. Expertise in SAR and near-infrared imagery\\r\\n to assess current conditions and forecast crop health and vegetation indices,\\r\\n with applications utilised by state government bodies.\\r\\n Engineered road and infrastructure monitoring algorithms, contributing to\\r\\n a comprehensive Road Asset Management System (RAMS). Pioneered\\r\\n road distress detection and analysis through satellite imagery and GIS\\r\\n tools, creating innovative products for traffic monitoring, management, and\\r\\n infrastructure analysis through video and satellite data.\\r\\n Delivered research-driven solutions for pollution tracking and environmental\\r\\n challenges. Advanced 3D modelling capabilities, transforming 2D\\r\\n image datasets into Digital Elevation Models (DEMs) and accurate 3D\\r\\n representations, optimising surface and terrain modelling processes, and\\r\\n reducing reliance on LIDAR in surveys.\"}, {