0 and Bordero 2.0 (now MPM) for order management in the Body Shop.\r\n•	Currently working as Shift In-Charge, managing operations across Assembly, Body Shop, Paint Shop, and Powertrain plants.\r\n•	Effective collaborator with Process, BOM, Quality, and PLC teams to translate manufacturing needs into robust MES configurations and data-driven insights.','MES Support Engineer',2,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1771393441-71.docx',NULL,'[\"HTML\", \"CSS\", \"Jit Compiler\", \"Kepware\", \"SCADA\", \"SQL\", \"Power BI\"]','PUBLIC','2026-02-18 18:11:51.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"MES Support Engineer\", \"company\": \"Rein Solutions\", \"endDate\": \"Fri Feb 27\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Tue Aug 12\", \"description\": \"As an MES Support Engineer at Rein Solutions, I have been a core contributor to MES transformation initiatives, plant operations, system integrations, and frontline manufacturing support for Fiat India Automotives Pvt. Ltd. My role spans requirement gathering, MES module configuration, deployment support, system testing, production incident resolution, and cross-functional collaboration. I also serve as the Shift In-Charge, overseeing operations and technical issue resolution across Assembly, Body Shop, Paint Shop, and Powertrain plants.\\r\\nKey Responsibilities:\\r\\n•\\tMES 2.0 Implementation & Rollout\\r\\no\\tLead engineer for MES 2.0 implementation across Assembly, Body Shop, and Paint Shop.\\r\\no\\tManaged requirement gathering, gap analysis, system testing, UAT, and go-live deployment.\\r\\no\\tConfigured 120+ MES stations for traceability, genealogy, torque validation, label printing, and error-proofing.\\r\\n•\\tReal-Time Production Support & Troubleshooting\\r\\no\\tProvided 24x7 MES support, ensuring production continuity and real-time resolution of shopfloor incidents.\\r\\no\\tTroubleshot hardware and software issues involving barcode scanners, torque tools, and sniffers.\\r\\n•\\tSystem Integration & Data Analytics\\r\\no\\tLed KEPWARE OPC integration \\r\\no\\tProvided SQL-based data to Quality, Central Tech, and Process Tech teams for defect analysis.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2021\", \"degree\": \"physics\", \"result\": \"Yes\", \"institution\": \"Rajarshi Shahu College, Latur\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1771393441-71.docx\", \"title\": \"cv\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('b7ba87cc-631d-4a91-a287-d7b56f06561e','a473d852-6bd8-4358-8d08-76546e9f6108','Test Resume351','Test Resume351','Software Deve',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Mainframe\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-25 18:11:19.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Deve\", \"company\": \"O2F Info Solution\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[{\"year\": \"\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech\", \"result\": \"\", \"institution\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('b7c577d4-758d-4c9a-9803-0c99e85aabd5','67d87f8d-9699-40b0-b93a-09bd76fb9cd5','Voice Process Executive',NULL,'Voice Process Executive',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Customer Support\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-13 17:01:55.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"Voice Process Executive\", \"company\": \"Cognizant Technology Solutions\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('b7d02b7a-fc58-4b79-afb8-6ad6c7e1cfc4','39dc60dc-dd52-4696-80cd-222e4f09d8f9','.NET Developer',NULL,'.NET Developer',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Java Developer\", \".NET CORE\", \"HTML\", \".NET Framework\", \"ASP.NET MVC\", \"ADO.NET\", \"C#\", \"Entity Framework\", \".NET\", \"Visual Studio\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-15 06:21:13.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \".NET Developer\", \"company\": \"ThinkQuotient Software Private Limited\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),