00','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Deve\", \"company\": \"Wipro\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[{\"year\": \"\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech\", \"result\": \"\", \"institution\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('b80530ad-364d-48da-bd9b-744963ac204c','c7737d69-34be-4f31-91c1-1b430dfcdc2d','Software Developer',NULL,'Software Developer',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Mainframe\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-23 12:38:12.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Developer\", \"company\": \"Societe Generale\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]',1600000.00,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('b8136682-52ad-45ed-bb02-7ff1ce5de67c','8eb55b63-2d3d-4e8a-a7a9-6bb86a447893','AI/ML Engineer and Data Scientist with 5+ years of experience designing, developing, and deploying enterprise-grade Machine Learning, Generative AI, Agentic AI, and intelligent automation solutions. Experienced in building production-ready LLM application','AI/ML Engineer and Data Scientist with 5+ years of experience designing, developing, and deploying enterprise-grade Machine Learning, Generative AI, Agentic AI, and intelligent automation solutions. Experienced in building production-ready LLM applications, RAG systems, multi-agent architectures, AI assistants, semantic search pipelines, and conversational AI platforms. Strong expertise in Python, LangChain, LangGraph, OpenAI, Gemini, RAG, FastAPI, vector databases, prompt engineering, tool calling, and cloud-based AI applications. Experienced in designing intelligent agents capable of reasoning over enterprise data, selecting tools dynamically, maintaining conversation state, and executing multi-step workflows with human-in-the-loop controls.','AI/ML Engineer',2,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/ashish-singh-cv-1790150564-274.pdf',NULL,'[\"AI/ML\"]','PUBLIC','2026-09-23 19:26:51.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"AI/ML Engineer\", \"company\": \"Deloitte\", \"endDate\": \"Thu Jan 01\", \"isCurrent\": true, \"startDate\": \"Mon May 10\", \"description\": \"• Designed and implemented end-to-end Generative AI and Machine Learning solutions for enterprise NLP,forecasting, knowledge management, and intelligent automation use cases. • Developed an AI-powered enterprise knowledge assistant using LangChain and Gemini API for natural-language querying, contextual reasoning, and intelligent analysis of enterprise data. • Built production-grade RAG pipelines for internal PDFs, SharePoint documents, and enterprise databases using document ingestion, chunking, embeddings, semantic retrieval, and query re-ranking. • Designed Agentic AI workflows capable of dynamically selecting tools, routing user requests, retrieving contextual information, and executing multi-step tasks based on user intent. • Implemented LangChain and LangGraph-based agent architectures for stateful conversational workflows, tool orchestration, and complex enterprise use cases. • Developed specialized AI agents for different business capabilities and implemented routing logic to select the appropriate agent based on user intent and available tools. • Implemented Human-in-the-Loop controls for sensitive AI operations by separating read-only information retrieval from transactional or action-oriented tools. • Developed production-ready FastAPI microservices and REST APIs for serving Generative AI and Machine Learning applications. • Implemented conversational state management, context handling, prompt orchestration, and multi-step workflow execution for enterprise AI assistants. • Integrated OpenAI and Gemini APIs with enterprise applications for text generation, contextual question answering, summarization, classification, and reasoning workflows. • Builtsemantic retrieval systems using embeddings and vector databases to improve contextual grounding and reduce irrelevant information in LLM responses. • Implemented document processing workflows including document chunking, metadata extraction, embedding generation, indexing, retrieval, and contextual response generation. • Developed supervised and deep learning models for fraud detection, forecasting, NLP, and computer vision applications. • Integrated AI and ML systems with Power BI dashboards to provide automated insights, business intelligence.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2021\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech / B.E. in Artificial Intelligence and Data Science\", \"result\": \"7.4\", \"institution\": \"GL Bajaj Institute of Technology & Management\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/ashish-singh-cv-1790150564-274.pdf\", \"title\": \"ASHISH SINGH CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('b813c90d-5f4c-4d80-9905-e199a5e8988b','2a17cb9d-1942-45e0-9e2f-3ffd5b3166b9','Informatica Developer',NULL,'Informatica Developer',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Jenkins\", \"Git\", \"Linux\", \"Informatica\", \"Data Warehousing\", \"Agile Methodology\", \"SQL\", \"Oracle\", \"Informatica PowerCenter\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-14 17:53:06.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"Informatica Developer\", \"company\": \"Tata Consultancy Services\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('b81646ec-d30b-4f77-baac-463381edc09c','d0e970b5-9f6d-43ab-bd61-ab28081f4e66','Test Resume98','Test Resume98','Software Deve',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"AWS\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-27 04:02:07.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Deve\", \"company\": \"Trianz Holding Private Limited\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[{\"year\": \"\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech\", \"result\": \"\", \"institution\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('b81788dc-bb8c-4451-b98a-934493d0f04f','f16aeb03-eed3-4ed8-9309-ebf6d746df95','Test Resume123','Test Resume123','Sof