ity, and automated Email/WhatsApp communication workflows. \\r\\n• Grasim Industries (Aditya Birla Group) – Energy Consumption Forecasting System \\r\\no Developed and deployed a production-grade time-series forecasting system to predict daily energy consumption for industrial plants \\r\\nusing a custom “Golden Batch” model. Leveraged historical data to learn optimal energy-to-production ratios and enable data-driven \\r\\nefficiency optimization. \\r\\no Designed robust feature engineering pipelines to ingest, clean, and aggregate multi-source telemetry including production volumes, \\r\\nenergy readings, and equipment-level sensor data. Transformed raw time-series into structured, model-ready datasets across a \\r\\nhierarchical Plant → Line → Equipment topology. \\r\\no Built end-to-end ML deployment workflows including model serialization (Pickle), scheduled inference (APScheduler), and real-time \\r\\nprediction streaming via MQTT to InfluxDB on AWS EC2. \\r\\no Implemented automated retraining and benchmarking pipelines using rolling production data to ensure model adaptability, sustained \\r\\naccuracy, and performance over time.\"}, {\"title\": \"Data Science Intern\", \"company\": \"Faclon Labs\", \"endDate\": \"Wed Oct 15\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Sat Apr 05\", \"description\": \"• Auto-Expression Resolver – Agentic AI Query-to-Function Engine  \\r\\no Architected and deployed a production-grade Agentic AI system that converts natural language queries into IoT analytical function \\r\\nexpressions, reducing manual query effort by ~60% and enabling intuitive interaction with complex analytics workflows. \\r\\no Designed a RAG pipeline with hybrid semantic search over structured function metadata using Qdrant vector database, improving \\r\\nquery-to-function mapping accuracy through high-relevance context grounding. \\r\\no Engineered Claude Agent SDK-based tools and MCP integrations with WebSocket streaming, enabling real-time response generation, \\r\\ncontext-aware reasoning, and ~40% latency reduction, along with Langfuse-based observability for LLM monitoring, tracing, and cost \\r\\noptimization. \\r\\n• JSW Cement Nandyal – Energy Optimization & Root Cause Analytics System \\r\\no Engineered scalable analytics modules for real-time industrial IoT sensor data and developed a Root Cause Analysis (RCA) framework \\r\\nto detect inefficiencies, anomalous equipment behavior, and key drivers of energy loss across plant operations. \\r\\no Built automated ETL pipelines, scheduled reporting workflows, and interactive dashboards to deliver daily operational insights, driving \\r\\n~10% improvement in plant productivity and enabling data-driven process optimization. \\r\\no Implemented scalable backend services using FastAPI, Celery, and RabbitMQ to automate analytics workflows and support high-volume \\r\\nindustrial monitoring, contributing to ~40% reduction in operational costs.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2025\", \"degree\": \"Master’s in Computer Applications (MCA)\", \"result\": \"6.80\", \"institution\": \"PIBM, Savitribai Phule Pune University\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1781023323-301.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('ba0eee5e-1f4e-40da-84b6-198e7fa80f73','68485708-2b3a-44e1-9716-e0ef3d01f356','Informatica Product 360 Developer',NULL,'Informatica Product 360 Developer',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','PUBLIC','2025-05-14 17:52:58.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"Informatica Product 360 Developer\", \"company\": \"Ugam Solutions\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('ba220979-bbd1-4e4f-8c44-a1608fe9f60e','6040a9a4-1f85-41bb-b6bd-18a2e6608fbc','Enthusiastic Programmer (C++)',NULL,'Enthusiastic Programmer (C++)',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"C++\", \"CSS\", \"HTML\", \"C\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-16 11:13:41.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.0