l Support Engineer',8,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/bhargav-bose-1791463006-724.pdf',NULL,'[\"Camstar\", \"Java\", \"Linux\", \"Siemens\", \"Python\", \"PostgreSQL\", \"MS Power Point\"]','PUBLIC','2026-10-08 23:44:04.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"L2 Technical Support Engineer\", \"company\": \"Consero Global\", \"endDate\": \"Fri Jul 24\", \"isCurrent\": true, \"startDate\": \"Wed Jul 22\", \"description\": \"• Supported CAMSTAR/Opcenter MES for daily production, ensuring high system uptime and minimal \\r\\ndisruption to shop-floor operations. \\r\\n• Partnered with cross-functional manufacturing and quality teams to resolve critical production and \\r\\nintegration issues. \\r\\n• Analyzed and optimized database performance (OLTP/ODS), enhancing overall system performance. \\r\\nReduced database growth and improved MES performance via targeted cleanup and optimization \\r\\nscripts. \\r\\n• Assisted in design and deployment of workflow enhancements validated by Siemens, resulting in \\r\\n$150k annual savings. \\r\\n• Managed MES data flows between ERP (Infor A+ / IBM i) and MES, resolving frequent work-order \\r\\ninconsistencies. \\r\\n• Authored technical documentation, job logs, and system training material for support teams and \\r\\nusers.\"}, {\"title\": \"Consultant\", \"company\": \"Capgemini\", \"endDate\": \"Thu Jul 23\", \"isCurrent\": true, \"startDate\": \"Wed Oct 15\", \"description\": \"• Supported CAMSTAR/Opcenter MES for daily production, ensuring high system uptime and minimal \\r\\ndisruption to shop-floor operations. \\r\\n• Partnered with cross-functional manufacturing and quality teams to resolve critical production and \\r\\nintegration issues. \\r\\n• Analyzed and optimized database performance (OLTP/ODS), enhancing overall system performance. \\r\\nReduced database growth and improved MES performance via targeted cleanup and optimization \\r\\nscripts. \\r\\n• Assisted in design and deployment of workflow enhancements validated by Siemens, resulting in \\r\\n$150k annual savings. \\r\\n• Managed MES data flows between ERP (Infor A+ / IBM i) and MES, resolving frequent work-order \\r\\ninconsistencies. \\r\\n• Authored technical documentation, job logs, and system training material for support teams and \\r\\nusers. \\r\\nAssociate Consultant | Jan 2024 – Oct 2025 \\r\\n• Coordinated with multiple teams who depended on our application as source of truth while \\r\\nmigrating our application from existing cloud infrastructure to newly provisioned infrastructure as \\r\\npart of corporate restructuring. \\r\\n• Monitored and compiled daily and weekly reports for ETL processes, batch processes and health \\r\\nmetrics for our AWS resources. \\r\\n• At one point, clients in LATAM region required part hierarchy data related to regulatory compliance \\r\\non an urgent basis. Our database instance was such that even the most optimized query would run \\r\\nout of resources to generate the dataset. With the help of my Product Owner, a new solution was \\r\\nbuilt from scratch and within 3 weeks, the full dataset was delivered. We even received an \\r\\nappreciation mail from LATAM region’s Director of Quality Assurance! :-) \\r\\nSenior Analyst | Jan 2023 – Dec 2023  \\r\\n• Identified a resource heavy DB batch process that delayed business activities. It was scheduled to \\r\\nrun every night hence changes requested during the day would only reflect the day after. \\r\\n• Modeled an equivalent API process in Spring Boot which ran on a separate thread thereby reducing \\r\\nthe time for the application to reflect changes from 1 full day to a few hours. \\r\\n• Handled a very important database that maintained product and part hierarchy data for medical \\r\\ndevices and eventually became the SPOC for any requirements/issues related to it. \\r\\nData Analyst | April 2021 – Dec 2022  \\r\\n• Worked with a very reputable US-based Healthcare client on a business requirement which needed \\r\\nsignificant changes to the existing database architecture. \\r\\n• Documented all the tables and visualized their relationships in the form of ER-diagrams. This \\r\\nsimplified the process of collecting feedback from various stakeholders and helped our team come \\r\\nup with an implementation plan. \\r\\n• Collaborated with my seniors in tracking and resolving any issues faced while implementing the \\r\\nchanges. \\r\\n• Redesigned all Spotfire BI reports to work with our changes while removing bottlenecks which \\r\\nimproved loading times by 20-50%.\"}, {\"title\": \"Coding Teacher\", \"company\": \"Remote\", \"endDate\": \"Fri Mar 12\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Tue Feb 09\", \"description\": \"Taught children and researched and compiled curriculum for JavaScript coursework.\"}, {\"title\": \"Student Trainee\", \"company\": \"Tech Mahindra\", \"endDate\": \"Thu Jul 25\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Tue Jun 18\", \"description\": \"• 6-week internship on testing and debugging Spring Boot application.  \\r\\n• Gained exposure to Agile Framework of software development and Microservices Architecture.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2020\", \"degree\": \"Bachelor’s in technology | Computer Science and Engineering\", \"result\": \"7.67\", \"institution\": \"RVS College of Engineering and Technology\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/bhargav-bose-1791463006-724.pdf\", \"title\": \"Bhargav Bose\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('be6fc2e0-66be-414a-88df-8842bcc6f712','fdf53eb9-a973-4e09-8701-7d4859a7477a','Test Resume130','Test Resume130','Software Deve',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Java\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-25 17:19:12.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Deve\", \"company\": \"Capgemini \", \"endDate\": \"Mon May 26\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Mon May 26\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[{\"year\": \"\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech\", \"result\": \"\", \"institution\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NUL