ka, Docker, Kubernetes, Jenkins, GitLab CI\"}, {\"title\": \"Software Enginee\", \"company\": \"Aditi Consulting (Client: Leading U.S. Telecom Provider)\", \"endDate\": \"Thu Jun 19\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Thu Sep 14\", \"description\": \"Designed and developed a route calculation module to optimize voice traffic routing based on cost and network\\r\\nperformance.\\r\\nIntegrated real-time cost feeds from multiple telecom carriers to enable dynamic, cost-efficient routing decisions.\\r\\nSecured microservices by integrating CyberArk for password retrieval and ensured seamless connectivity with Cassandra.\\r\\nImproved system performance by processing millions of records using vendor and dial code filters with multithreading.\\r\\nEnhanced network cost-efficiency and reliability.\\r\\nEnsured high code quality by writing unit tests with Mockito.\\r\\nBuilt a GraphQL API interface for querying optimized routing data, integrating with CommerceTools for efficient data\\r\\nmodeling and flexible client-side consumption.\\r\\nTechnologies\\r\\n: Java, Spring Boot, Cassandra, Redis, Kafka, Docker, Kubernetes, Jenkins, GitLab CI, ArgoCD\"}, {\"title\": \"Software Engineer\", \"company\": \"Pure Software Pvt. Ltd\", \"endDate\": \"Tue Sep 12\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Tue Dec 14\", \"description\": \"Developed APIs for loan restructuring during COVID-19, enabling flexible repayment for impacted users.\\r\\nBuilt APIs for seamless customer onboarding and end-to-end loan lifecycle management.\\r\\nUtilized Camunda to manage and visualize API workflows.\\r\\nWrote unit tests using Mockito and collaborated on E2E testing.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2019\", \"degree\": \"BTech (CSE)\", \"result\": \"72\", \"institution\": \"Accurate institute of management and technology (A.K.T.U)\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1768158389-946.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('bf16d17f-4728-4ec2-82f8-7085a