astructure.\r\n•	Implemented LLM-powered Terraform assistants to generate and optimize AWS/Azure/GCP IaC from natural-language requirements, reducing manual effort and errors.\r\n•	Built AI-driven validation and drift-detection workflows that compare live cloud resources with Terraform state and assist in remediation through PR suggestions.\r\n•	Successfully developed Python applications using Streamlit to generate Terraform code automatically based on user inputs and architecture descriptions.\r\n•	Implemented AI-assisted Jenkins pipelines that auto-create PRs, trigger builds, and push generated Terraform and application code to GitHub repositories.\r\n•	Designed and implemented LangChain prompts, chains, memory, callbacks, and RAG pipelines to enable context-aware automation and knowledge retrieval.\r\n•	Built agentic AI systems with multi-cloud modules (AWS/Azure/GCP) and IaC modules (Terraform) to automate provisioning, validation, and optimization.\r\n•	Implemented Prompt → Ollama → LLM workflows to leverage local open-source LLMs for IaC generation and DevOps task automation.\r\n•	Developed a sentence-transformation model using Hugging Face community resources for semantic similarity and text-embedding use cases.\r\n•	Successfully created an incident management tool using Prometheus, Alertmanager, and Amazon SNS to notify developers in real time, enabling faster issue detection and resolution.\r\n•	Strong hands-on experience in Python for automation, backend development, and cloud/DevOps scripting','Senior Cloud & AI Automation Engineer',4,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1773836247-482.pdf',NULL,'[\"DevOps\", \"Python\", \"RAG Pipelines\", \"LLM Fine-tuning\", \"Generative AI\", \"Python\", \"LangChain\"]','PUBLIC','2026-03-18 23:45:09.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Senior Cloud & AI Automation Engineer\", \"company\": \"CestasoftPvt Ltd\", \"endDate\": \"Thu Apr 02\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Wed Jul 20\", \"description\": \"•\\t