LLMs, Generative AI, and Agentic AI. Applies statistical methods (EDA, hypothesisdriv','Data Scientist with hands-on experience across the full spectrum of Data Science and AI — from statistical analysis and classical Machine Learning to Deep Learning, NLP, LLMs, Generative AI, and Agentic AI. Applies statistical methods (EDA, hypothesisdriven feature engineering, time-series analysis) and ML algorithms (XGBoost, LightGBM, Random Forest) to build accurate forecasting and classification systems, and Deep Learning/NLP (transformer-based classification, NER, summarization, sentiment analysis) to extract structured insight from unstructured text and documents. Builds LLM-powered GenAI systems — hybrid RAG pipelines for grounded, hallucination-controlled generation — and designs multi-Agent, Agentic AI architectures (LangGraph/LangChain) with planning, retrieval, tool-calling, and escalation agents that automate complex, multi-step workflows end-to-end. Consistently focused on turning these systems into measurable business outcomes through rigorous evaluation and production-grade MLOps. Key Outcomes: 75% Automated Ticket Resolution · 80% Faster Response Time · 40% Lower Support Cost · Grounded Contract Q&A with Full Clause Citations · <10% MAPE Forecast Accuracy · 20% Fewer Stockouts','DATA SCIENTIST',2,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/amit-kumar-1790154177-274.pdf',NULL,'[\"Data Science\"]','PUBLIC','2026-09-23 20:28:30.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"DATA SCIENTIST\", \"company\": \"LEGALEX SERVICES LLP\", \"endDate\": \"Thu Jan 01\", \"isCurrent\": true, \"startDate\": \"Wed Aug 03\", \"description\": \"Designed and delivered production-grade Data Science and AI systems spanning statistical analysis, Machine Learning, Deep Learning, NLP, LLM-powered GenAI, and Agentic AI — covering customer support automation, enterprise knowledge assistants, NLP-based review analytics, and demand forecasting for multiple business units. ● Architected multi-agent LLM systems using LangGraph/LangChain with specialized agents (planning, intent detection, authentication, retrieval, tool calling, response generation, quality checking, escalation), enabling complex workflows to be automated end-to-end rather than handled as single-shot LLM calls. ● Built and tuned RAG pipelines end-to-end — document ingestion, cleaning, chunking with overlap, embedding generation, vector storage (Pinecone/FAISS), top-k semantic and hybrid retrieval, similarity-threshold filtering, and re-ranking — to improve groundedness and reduce hallucination in generated responses. ● Integrated LLM agents with enterprise systems via tool calling into Order Management, CRM, Inventory, Payment, and Shipping APIs, plus Email, SMS, and WhatsApp Business API channels, enabling agents to take real actions rather than only answer questions. ● Implemented short-term (conversation) and long-term (customer profile, order history, preferences) memory using Redis and PostgreSQL to support personalized, context-aware multi-turn interactions.● Developed and validated forecasting and NLP models using XGBoost, LightGBM, and transformer-based architectures (BART), and evaluated systems against both AI metrics (intent accuracy, retrieval precision/recall, groundedness, hallucination rate) and business KPIs (FRT, AHT, FCR, CSAT, ticket deflection, escalation rate). ● Instituted security and compliance controls across GenAI systems — role-based access control, authentication, PII masking, encrypted data storage, audit logging, rate limiting, and secure API key management — aligned with GDPR and enterprise data-handling policies. ● Owned production deployment and reliability: containerized services with Docker, orchestrated with Kubernetes with autoscaling, built CI/CD pipelines (GitHub Actions/Jenkins), and set up centralized logging, alerting, and monitoring dashboards (Grafana, LangSmith, Langfuse) with defined rollback and disaster-recovery procedures. ● Led design reviews and mentored team members on RAG and agentic AI best practices, and collaborated cross-functionally with product, support, and operations teams to translate business requirements into agentic AI/ML solutions, iterating on chunking strategy, top-k, similarity thresholds, and model choice based on faithfulness and relevance evaluations.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2023\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech in Computer Science and Engineering\", \"result\": \"7.4\", \"institution\": \"Dr. A. P. J. Abdul Kalam Technical University, Lucknow\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/amit-kumar-1790154177-274.pdf\", \"title\": \"AMIT KUMAR\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('c14008e5-e920-4da3-bac3-6570a4bcfb43','847c8775-a6a7-4f0e-a96a-4d10cad152c3','Test Resume100','Test Resume100','Software Deve',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"LoadRunner\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-26 13:16:45.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Deve\", \"company\": \"IBM\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[{\"year\": \"\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech\", \"result\": \"\", \"institution\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('c142958f-36ae-420c-9687-1176d693a849','0a4b4480-bcec-40e9-a267-32a157b3fa4d','Detail-oriented and highly organized LIMS professional with 3 years of experience in Laboratory Information \r\nManagement Systems (LIMS), particularly Caliber LIMS. Adept at managing master data, sample workflows, data \r\nintegrity, user training, system va','Detail-oriented and highly organized LIMS professional with 3 years of experience in Laboratory Information \r\nManagement Systems (LIMS), particularly Caliber LIMS. Adept at managing master data, sample workflows, data \r\nintegrity, user training, system validation, and troubleshooting. Strong background in pharmaceutical laboratory \r\nenvironments, ensuring full compliance with GMP, GLP, and regulatory standards, along with quality control analysis. \r\nSkilled in data manag