ization, \r\ndashboard development, and business intelligence solutions. \r\n• Strong expertise in Power BI, DAX, SQL Server, SSRS, Tableau, and Snowflake. \r\n• Experienced in data ','• Power BI Developer with 5+ years of IT experience specializing in data visualization, \r\ndashboard development, and business intelligence solutions. \r\n• Strong expertise in Power BI, DAX, SQL Server, SSRS, Tableau, and Snowflake. \r\n• Experienced in data modeling, report automation, RLS security, Power Platform (Power \r\nApps, Power Automate), and end-to-end report deployment using on-premises gateways \r\nand Git version control. \r\n• Proven ability to develop, maintain, and optimize scalable BI solutions following SDLC best \r\npractices. \r\n• Good knowledge in Software Development Life Cycle (SDLC). \r\n• Good adaptability and effective communication skills','Consultant – Development',6,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1777229867-586.pdf',NULL,'[\"Github\", \"Data Warehousing\", \"ETL\", \"Power BI\", \"Tableau\", \"SSRS\", \"SQL Server\", \"Snowflake\", \"DAX\", \"PowerApps\", \"SDLC\"]','PUBLIC','2026-04-27 06:26:00.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Consultant – Development\", \"company\": \"Absolutdata Research & Analytics Solutions Pvt Ltd\", \"endDate\": \"Wed Aug 31\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Fri Jun 10\", \"description\": \"Engaged as a BI consultant to design and deliver analytical dashboards enabling business       \\r\\nteams to measure event performance, ROI, and customer engagement.                   \\r\\n      Responsibilities: \\r\\n• Designed and developed interactive Power BI dashboards to track KPIs, event ROI, and \\r\\nengagement metrics. \\r\\n• Built optimized DAX measures and tabular data models to enhance report performance \\r\\nand scalability. \\r\\n• Implemented Row-Level Security (RLS) to ensure secure, role-based data access. \\r\\n• Published and managed datasets and reports in Power BI Service with scheduled refresh \\r\\nusing on-premises data gateway. \\r\\n• Collaborated with business users to validate data accuracy and usability.\"}, {\"title\": \"Senior Software Engineer\", \"company\": \"Advantage One Human Resourcing Pvt Ltd\", \"endDate\": \"Fri Feb 25\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Wed Mar 10\", \"description\": \"Led BI development initiatives focused on cloud migration, advanced analytics, and embedded    \\r\\nreporting solutions.   \\r\\n      Responsibilities: \\r\\n• Migrated 25+ Power BI reports and datasets from SQL Server to Snowflake, improving \\r\\nscalability and reducing query execution time by 40%. \\r\\n• Developed complex SQL queries, views, and stored procedures to support analytical reporting. \\r\\n• Designed and implemented embedded Power BI reports within third-party business \\r\\napplications. \\r\\n• Partnered with stakeholders to gather requirements and translate them into production-ready \\r\\ndashboards. \\r\\n• Ensured adherence to SDLC processes including development, testing, and deployment.\"}, {\"title\": \"Senior Software Engineer\", \"company\": \"Cyient Ltd,\", \"endDate\": \"Sun Sep 20\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Fri Mar 15\", \"description\": \"Delivered enterprise BI solutions for global mining and manufacturing clients, supporting large-scale     \\r\\noperational and analytical reporting. \\r\\n \\r\\n  Responsibilities: \\r\\n• Designed and delivered 3+ Power BI and SSRS dashboards for mining and manufacturing \\r\\nanalytics (Rio Tinto). \\r\\n• Created interactive reports with drill-down, drill-through, and parameterized views. \\r\\n• Improved report performance and data accuracy through optimized data models and SQL query \\r\\ntuning. \\r\\n• Supported system testing, user acceptance testing (UAT), and production deployments. \\r\\n• Worked closely with cross-functional teams to ensure business requirements were met.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2020\", \"degree\": \"Bachelor of Technology in Computer Science\", \"result\": \"75\", \"institution\": \"Jawaharlal Nehru technological university\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1777229867-586.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('c16909b9-f888-4830-8814-f9164acbe47b','ef3944be-2f97-45c6-b33a-1c1b87f61e8b','Project Manager with 12 years of experience in pharmaceutical and automation \r\nindustries, specializing in digital transformation and IT/OT integration. Proficient in \r\nMES- OPCenter, Historian- OSI PI, GE Proficy, DCS, SCADA, PLC, and ICS/OT \r\nsecurity, ','Project Manager with 12 years of experience in pharmaceutical and automation \r\nindustries, specializing in digital transformation and IT/OT integration. Proficient in \r\nMES- OPCenter, Historian- OSI PI, GE Proficy, DCS, SCADA, PLC, and ICS/OT \r\nsecurity, with a strong track record of managing complex projects and enhancing \r\noperational efficiency. Experienced in consulting with stakeholders to define project \r\nscopes and deliver results within budget and timelines. Recognized for fostering \r\ncollaboration and aligning digital initiatives with business objectives to drive growth.','Manager - OT- Digitalization',12,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1766549918-659.pdf',NULL,'[\"Mes Digital Transformation\", \"Historian\", \"Mes\", \"OSI PI\", \"GE Proficy\", \"Siemens\", \"Opcenter\", \"Werum PAS-X\", \"SCADA\", \"GE iFIX\", \"WinCC\", \"DCS\", \"Rockwell FTPS\", \"Kepware\", \"Mitsubishi\", \"Project Management\"]','PUBLIC','2025-12-24 16:24:57.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Manager - OT- Digitalization\", \"company\": \"Cipla\", \"endDate\": \"Sat Dec 20\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Wed Feb 05\", \"description\": \"Led OT projects focusing on digital transformation, IT-OT \\r\\nintegration, and system governance. Worked closely with API \\r\\nand formulation process. \\r\\nConverted manufacturing manual processes into MES solutions \\r\\nusing OPcenter/Werum PAS-X modules. Selected Historian \\r\\nplatforms including OSI PI, GE Proficy, and Rockwell FTHSE. \\r\\nDCS system  Upgradation,  \\r\\nDirected digitalisation initiatives involving SAP PPM, Comos, \\r\\nBMS, UMS systems, data logger module, and compliance \\r\\nprocedures. \\r\\nInvolved in OT Data Centre design: load calculation, VM \\r\\nselection, hardware selection, and resource calculation. \\r\\nIntegrated central data historian with DCS, SCADA, and PLC \\r\\nsystems for improved monitoring. \\r\\nProvide technical support while resolving complex issues\"}, {\"title\": \"Manager- Manufacturing OT\", \"company\": \"Piramal Pharma Limited\", \"endDate\": \"Thu Feb 20\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Sun Dec 10\", \"description\": \"Led implementation of DCS, SCADA, and PLC systems, ensuring \\r\\nproject execution and upgrades. \\r\\nDesigned infrastructure and analyzed risks to optimize \\r\\nmanufacturing processes. \\r\\nDeployed NextGen solutions for maximum uptime and 24/7/365 \\r\\nsystem availability. \\r\\nArchitected project infrastructure including control networking, \\r\\nVM allocation, IP segmentation, and data backup solutions. \\r\\nCollected data from DCS, Remote PLC, and SCADA for storage \\r\\nin Central Historian. \\r\\nDeveloped digitization roadmaps for MES implementation and \\r\\ndigital factory integration with Cloud/Web Data Solutions.\"}, {\"title\": \"Sr, Project Executive Engineer\", \"company\": \"Sarla Advantech\", \"endDate\": \"Sat Nov 25\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Sun Jun 05\", \"description\": \"Data integration of Production Equipment with DATA Historian \\r\\nUsing Kepware, GE Historian , Ifix, SQL, Werum Pasx, SCADA. \\r\\nGeneration of the Reports as and when Required. Maintaining \\r\\nold DATA and records of Production Equipment. ? Maintaining \\r\\nserver of DATA Historian server. IQ OQ of production \\r\\nEquipment which are integrated in DATA Historian. ? Sharing of \\r\\nPlant equipment DATA with OSI PI server for DATA Monitoring \\r\\nand process. integration of new equipment into DATA Historian \\r\\nas per requirement generation of Batch Report.\"}, {\"title\": \"Program Engineer\", \"company\": \"ACG Engineering\", \"endDate\": \"Mon Jun 20\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Tue Jan 05\", \"description\": \"Designing of Pharma eqipment lik Coating ,FBD ,RMG, \\r\\nBlender,Compression,Packing and other equipment use for \\r\\nTablet manufacturing, Handon experience on Formulation \\r\\nprocess \\r\\nworked on Green and brown field project of Formulation \\r\\nExecuted equipment level programming and testing on-site to \\r\\nmeet user requirements. \\r\\nConducted IQ, OQ, and PQ execution with comprehensive \\r\\ndocumentation for compliance. \\r\\nProvided after-sales support for breakdowns and retrofitting of \\r\\nproduction equipment.\"}, {\"title\": \"Project Engineer\", \"company\": \"Electromates Robotics and Automation\", \"endDate\": \"Wed Jan 20\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Tue Dec 05\", \"description\": \"Working as a project engineer in Mitsubishi Electric, I was \\r\\nlooking into an automation project, Project discussion and \\r\\nfinalizing Process, designing the logic Flow, development of PLC \\r\\n, HMI, SCADA programming, PLC control selection, and \\r\\nimplementation of the project from beginning to installation and \\r\\ncommissioning. Design of control panel field wiring planning \\r\\nand selection of hardware. Providing services for Mitsubishi \\r\\nproducts. Machine upgradation, retrofitting and upgrading PLC \\r\\nand HMI. Plant-level automation. Data handling traceability. Line \\r\\nautomation process automation.\"}, {\"title\": \"Programmer and Control Design Engineer\", \"company\": \"AMSEEK SOLUTION\", \"endDate\": \"Wed Nov 15\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Thu Apr 10\", \"description\": \"Discussion on project with client, collecting basic information of \\r\\nthe project, Designing of con