y plans for critical healthcare workloads using Azure-native tools.\\r\\n• Explored and documentedDevSecOpsstrategies for healthcare data security automation with Azure Key Vault,\\r\\nIAM roles, and GitHub Actions.\\r\\n• Conducted performance tuning of SQL/Teradata queries to reduce query execution times.\\r\\n• Migrated and optimized data from on-premises SQL Server to Azure SQL Database, focusing on schema design\\r\\nand performance tuning.\\r\\n• Designed Cosmos DB document models for efficient JSON-based patient record storage and retrieval.\\r\\n• Implemented ADF pipelinesintegrating Azure SQL, Blob Storage, and on-premises hospitalsystems, enhancing\\r\\ndata transformation and accessibility for analytics.\\r\\n• Applied data warehousing methodologies and data modeling conceptsto design relationalmodelssupporting\\r\\nhealthcare reporting.\\r\\n• Partnered with cross-functional teams to improve analytics service functionality, stability, and performance\\r\\nthrough capacity planning and optimization.\\r\\n• Participated in infrastructure design discussions to ensure seamless integration between Azure data services\\r\\nand healthcare applications.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2021\", \"degree\": \"Computer Science\", \"result\": \"Yes\", \"institution\": \"Vikram Simhapuri University\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1776773316-241.pdf\", \"title\": \"cv\", \"isDefault\": false}, {\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1776773317-390.pdf\", \"title\": \"cv\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('c4d0dbec-d525-47d2-b1db-cabcdaa76ccc','be6c7e64-bbc8-411f-a626-c93e554ba2ab','Software Developer',NULL,'Software Developer',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Java\", \"Angular 8\", \"Core Java\", \"J2EE\", \"Microservices\", \"Teamwork\", \"Problem Solving\", \"Spring MVC\", \"MYSQL\", \"Spring Boot Microservices\", \"REST API\", \"Oracle\", \"Spring MVC\", \"Spring Boot\", \"SQL\", \"RDBMS\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-14 17:00:29.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000'