cription\": \"Worked on catalogue-related datasets by updating, correcting, manipulating, deleting, and modifying records using SQL queries and Excel VBA macros for multiple Amazon websites\\r\\nand marketplaces including European, American, and Asian regions.\\r\\n• Performed backfilling of product data for Amazon.fr and Amazon.co.uk with 100% accuracy and achieved a backfilling rate of 60%+, leveraging SQL queries and Python automation\\r\\n(Selenium) to process and validate large datasets.\\r\\n• Built automation scripts using JavaScript, Tampermonkey, Python, and Flask, reducing manual search efforts by 30% and improving turnaround time for key tasks.\\r\\n• Took ownership of ad-hoc tasks by collating multi-team data using JSON and Excel, generating insights and recommendations to improve operational efficiency.\\r\\n• Worked on backfilling of data for products sold on Amazon web site (Amazon.fr) and (Amazon.co.uk) with 100% accuracy and a backfilling rate of minimum of 60% and above by searching and sorting large data\\r\\nsets using SQL queries and automating manual task using Python and selenium frameworks\\r\\n• Improved backend process reliability by optimizing SQL queries and automating data validation workflows, reducing error rates and manual rework by 20%.\\r\\n• Collaborated across teams to integrate automation solutions with existing backend systems, showcasing expertise in Python, Flask, SQL, and Selenium to streamline large-scale data\\r\\nhandling and reporting\"}, {\"title\": \"FULL STACK DEVELOPER\", \"company\": \"WALTANCE SERVICES\", \"endDate\": \"Mon May 15\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Wed Mar 10\", \"description\": \"Project Details: Build an e-commerce integration platform which allowed merchants and sellers to sell across multiple e-commerce platforms and mange inventories.\\r\\n• Authentication & Security: Integrated OAuth, JWT authentication, and two-factor authentication (2FA) for secure merchant and customer access\\r\\n• Database & Business Logic: Designed relational database schemas in PostgreSQL/MySQL, implemented inventory management logic and order synchronization across multiple platforms\\r\\n• Microservices & API Integration: Developed and optimized API services for seamless interaction between merchants and multiple e-commerce platforms\\r\\n• UI/UX Implementation: Translated Figma designs into responsive user experience across devices\\r\\n• Back-End Development: worked on the backend using Python, DJANGO, GraphQL and PostgreSQL and third-party APIs focusing on secure and efficient data handling.\\r\\n• API Development & Integration: Built and documented RESTful APIs using Swagger, ensuring seamless integration with third-party services\\r\\n• Unit Testing: Wrote unit test cases for the application using PYTEST unit testing library\\r\\n• Roles and responsibilities: end-to-end to development, unit testing and integrating APIs\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2022\", \"degree\": \"Computer Science\", \"result\": \"Yes\", \"institution\": \"Indian Institute of Technology Kharagpur\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('c6f3312a-c324-4d5d-adbd-4e90300eb5d6','090955b1-f5d5-471a-b4a0-a5ec648bfa3f','OSIsoft PI Consultant with 3+ years of experience in industrial projects, specializing in PI Vision, PI Asset \r\nFramework (AF), and PI System administration. Skilled in real-time data visualization, system monitoring, \r\ntroubleshooting, and SLA-driven inc','OSIsoft PI Consultant with 3+ years of experience in industrial projects, specializing in PI Vision, PI Asset \r\nFramework (AF), and PI System administration. Skilled in real-time data visualization, system monitoring, \r\ntroubleshooting, and SLA-driven incident and change management.','Senior System Engineer',2,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1771939603-81.pdf',NULL,'[\"Java\", \"Angular\", \"HTML\", \"CSS\", \"OPC UA\", \"Spring Boot\", \"MYSQL\", \"ServiceNow\", \"AVEVA System\", \"SOP Development\", \"SLA Adherence\", \"Root Cause Analysis\"]','PUBLIC','2026-02-25 01:44:13.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Senior System Engineer\", \"company\": \"Infosys Limited\", \"endDate\": \"Fri Feb 20\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Sat Nov 05\", \"description\": \"• 3+ years of experience administering and supporting AVEVA PI Systems. \\r\\nNov’2022 – Present \\r\\n• Strong expertise in PI Asset Framework (AF), including creation and maintenance of AF elements, \\r\\nattributes, hierarchies, and templates for asset-based data modelling. \\r\\n• Managed and supported PI System components using PI System Management Tools, PI System \\r\\nExplorer, PI ICU, PI Vision, PI Datalink, and PI Builder for stable operations. \\r\\n• Created, modified, and maintained PI tags, resolving data quality and performance issues. \\r\\n• Supported PI Interfaces (OPC DA, RDBMS, UFL) using PI ICU, performing health monitoring and \\r\\nresolving interface communication and data latency issues. \\r\\n• Monitored and optimized data flow from PI Interfaces to the PI Data Archive, proactively identifying \\r\\nand resolving data loss, latency, and buffering issues. \\r\\n• Created PI Vision dashboards for real-time tracking of assets, including battery status and location, \\r\\nsupporting proactive operational management. \\r\\n• Implemented and maintained PI Notifications for event-driven alerts and operational thresholds, \\r\\nenhancing proactive monitoring and issue resolution. \\r\\n• Performed incident management, service request management and root cause analysis (RCA) for \\r\\nrecurring issues. \\r\\n• Addressed user-reported incidents efficiently, minimizing service impact. \\r\\n• Performed PI System health checks and monthly patching to ensure secure, stable operations. \\r\\n• Created and maintained SOPs and troubleshooting guides to improve support processes. \\r\\n• Managed deliverables, consistently meeting SLA targets for incidents, requests, and problems.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"