A/HMI Development, and Commissioning, including 3+ years of Ignition SCADA experience (Perspective & Vision). Hands-on expertise with Siemens S7-300/','Senior Automation Engineer with 9+ years of experience across Industrial Automation, PLC Programming, SCADA/HMI Development, and Commissioning, including 3+ years of Ignition SCADA experience (Perspective & Vision). Hands-on expertise with Siemens S7-300/1200/1500 PLCs, WinCC, Ignition SCADA, OPC UA, MQTT, Modbus TCP/RTU, and Profinet across Automotive, Steel, Pharmaceutical, Water Treatment, and Oil & Gas industries. Delivered Greenfield and Brownfield automation projects, including onsite international commissioning assignments in Shanghai, China (SCANIA) and Johannesburg, South Africa (Alfeco Group), along with remote SCADA support for global clients such as ExxonMobil Corporation. Experienced in FAT, SAT, IQ/OQ, 21 CFR Part 11 validation, MES/Historian integration, and customer-facing technical support.','Junior Engineer',10,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/samir-maharana-1790244220-574.pdf',NULL,'[\"SCADA\"]','PUBLIC','2026-09-24 21:06:02.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Junior Engineer\", \"company\": \"Precise Industrial Solutions Pvt. Ltd.\", \"endDate\": \"Thu Mar 08\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Thu Apr 06\", \"description\": \"• Assisted with PLC/SCADA commissioning for pharmaceutical automation projects. • Performed FAT, SAT, I/O verification, and loop checking. • Supported panel testing, troubleshooting, and system startup.\"}, {\"title\": \"Project Engineer\", \"company\": \"Active System (Siemens System House)\", \"endDate\": \"Thu Mar 03\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Wed May 02\", \"description\": \"• Delivered turnkey industrial automation projects for Steel, Pharmaceutical, Water Treatment, and Manufacturing industries as part of a Siemens Authorized System House. • Developed Siemens PLC applications using TIA Portal and STEP 7 (LAD, STL, SCL), and designed WinCC SC