rofinet, Siemens S7 communication, and GSD files for seamless integration of third-party industrial devices. • Validated IO Lists and cause-effect matrices against Functional Design Specifications (FDS) prior to PLC I/O testing, signal verification, and system commissioning. • Participated in FAT, SAT, on-site commissioning, troubleshooting, and production startup activities. • Coordinated with mechanical, electrical, commissioning, and production teams, plus international suppliers, to ensure timely project completion and successful system handover. • Supported production ramp-up by troubleshooting PLC, SCADA, and industrial communication issues, minimizing downtime during commissioning.\"}, {\"title\": \"Automation Engineer\", \"company\": \"LTIMindtree Ltd.\", \"endDate\": \"Thu Jan 01\", \"isCurrent\": true, \"startDate\": \"Tue Jun 11\", \"description\": \"• Develop and enhance Ignition SCADA toolkit applications supporting ExxonMobil\'s global operations. • Integrate Ignition SCADA with PI System and SQL databases for real-time production data exchange. • Support digital transformation initiatives for Canada and Malaysia production facilities. • Build Python scripts to automate reporting and operational workflows. • Improve application reliability by diagnosing and resolving production issues.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2014\", \"degree\": \"Electronics & Communication Engineering\", \"result\": \"7.4\", \"institution\": \"Biju Patnaik University of Technology\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/samir-maharana-1790244220-574.pdf\", \"title\": \"Samir Maharana\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('c8d38ea6-1205-4844-8d84-443101a65aca','b5116a4e-8ff4-45ad-aadc-ea861aca7a35','Test Resume363','Test Resume363','Software Deve',4,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Guidewire Automation Testing\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-25 18:15:30.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Deve\", \"company\": \"Capgemini\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": fa