tes at Cognizant, Certified Ignition 8.1, Rockwell & Siemens Engineer. experienced in leading cross-functional delivery teams across India, Europe, and America.','Sr. Associate – IoT – (Offshore Team Lead)',10,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/hardik-kumar-mistri-1790239281-1.pdf',NULL,'[\"SCADA\"]','PUBLIC','2026-09-24 20:02:24.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Sr. Associate – IoT – (Offshore Team Lead)\", \"company\": \"Cognizant Technology Solutions\", \"endDate\": \"Thu Jan 01\", \"isCurrent\": true, \"startDate\": \"Wed Dec 11\", \"description\": \"▸ Global OEE/MES App Deployment Across Global manufacturing sites for Medical Device Manufacturer. Machine Integration, Ignition 8.x, PostgreSQL, Snowflake, Power BI, Kepware, MQTT, OPC UA, Modbus, Qlik, and Linux infrastructure. ▸ Device onboarding onto the OEE platform, App Version deployments, configuring device connections, UDT structures, and Ignition tag databases for new facilities. ▸ Conduct training sessions for new team members, lead a team of 3 engineers.  ▸ Supported chatbot implementation by feeding OEE App Content to LLM Model.\"}, {\"title\": \"Sr. Engineer – Digital Manufacturing\", \"company\": \"L&T Technology & Services\", \"endDate\": \"Wed Dec 11\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Wed May 11\", \"description\": \"▸ Deployment of EMS applications across global manufacturing plants, managing end-to-end delivery from project kick-off through go-live, hyper care, and final handover using Ignition, Rockwell, Siemens, Kepware, Grafana, and PostgreSQL Tech.  ▸ Designed and implemented OT-IT integration architectures leveraging MQTT, OPC UA, EtherNet/IP, and PROFINET with secure communication, authentication, and data exchange frameworks.  ▸ Coordinated cross-functional teams across India, Europe, and the USA, driving multi-vendor PLC, SCADA, and industrial device connectivity integrations.  ▸ Developed Functional Design Specifications (FDS), PLC programs, and Ignition applications, delivered user training, shop-floor support, project documentation, and phased project closures.\"}, {\"title\": \"Sr. Project Engineer\", \"company\": \"Sarla Technologies\", \"endDate\": \"Thu Apr 14\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Thu Jul 15\", \"description\": \"▸ Led multiple automation projects using Rockwell ControlLogix / CompactLogix PLCs (Studio 5000 v33) and FactoryTalk View SE/ME for US-based edible oil and pharmaceutical clients. ▸ Implemented Customized ISA-88 Batch standard architecture and full 21 CFR Part 11 compliance for biopharmaceutical batch management system; passed GxP compliance audit. ▸ Managed end-to-end project lifecycle from requirements through FAT/SAT, validation, and go-live support.\"}, {\"title\": \"Sr. Project Engineer\", \"company\": \"Kevin Technologies\", \"endDate\": \"Thu Jul 15\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Thu Mar 04\", \"description\": \"▸ Played a key role in COVID-19 vaccine plant automation, delivering PLC, SCADA, and HMI solutions from design and development through commissioning and production support. ▸ Managed end-to-end delivery of PLC/SCADA automation projects, spanning design, development, FAT, SAT. ▸ Engineered standardized UDTs, reusable templates, and IEC 61131-3-compliant PLC code for dashboards, faceplates, alarm systems, and access control for rapid deployment. ▸ Coordinate with equipment vendors and installation contractors to ensure seamless Automation system integration.\"}, {\"title\": \"Project Lead\", \"company\": \"Saral Controls\", \"endDate\": \"Tue Feb 09\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Thu Mar 10\", \"description\": \"▸ Delivered 15+ industrial automation projects across Pharma and Dairy sectors with 100% on-time delivery. Mar 2016 – Feb 2021 ▸ Managed cross-functional teams of 5+ engineers throughout the project lifecycle, including resource training. ▸ Owned full project lifecycle for PLC/SCADA automation — design, development, FAT, SAT, handover. ▸ Built reusable UDTs,