 hands-on focus on \r\nPython, Computer Vision and Edge AI since March 2025. Experienced in developing and deploying real-time applications using \r\nPython, OpenCV, YOLO, PyTorch, TensorRT and Flask, including object detection, multi-object tracking, face recognition, gesture \r\ndetection and camera-based automation on NVIDIA Jetson Orin NX. Strong software engineering background in React.js, Firebase, \r\nREST APIs and production application delivery. Targeting AI/ML and Computer Vision engineering opportunities.','Software Engineer | AI/ML, Computer Vision & Full-Stack Development',4,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1788134873-614.pdf',NULL,'[\"Computer Vision\", \"AI/ML\", \"JavaScript\", \"HTML\", \"CSS3\", \"Flask\", \"Linux\", \"Flutter\", \"Firebase\", \"AWS\", \"Git\", \"Python\", \"OpenCV\", \"PyTorch\", \"TensorRT\", \"Numpy\", \"Scikit\", \"Pandas\", \"Scikit\", \"NVIDIA Jetson\", \"Raspberry PI\", \"React\", \"React Native\", \"REST API\", \"Node JS\", \"VSCode\", \"Code Reviews\", \"Unit Testing\", \"Integration Testing\"]','PUBLIC','2026-08-31 11:34:06.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Engineer | AI/ML, Computer Vision & Full-Stack Development\", \"company\": \"Spherenex\", \"endDate\": \"Thu Aug 20\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Mon Mar 10\", \"description\": \"• Designed and developed a real-time AI-based milk powder bag counting and worker-monitoring system using Python, OpenCV, \\r\\nYOLO, Flask and TensorRT for manual truck loading and unloading operations. \\r\\n• Implemented an editable Truck ROI-based counting mechanism with multi-object tracking, tracker-ID reconnection, occlusion \\r\\nhandling and duplicate-count prevention to identify bags entering and exiting the truck area. \\r\\n• Integrated person detection, worker registration and identification, worker-to-bag association, worker-wise bag counting, live video \\r\\nmonitoring, event history and reporting. \\r\\n• Optimised AI inference and deployed the Computer Vision solution on NVIDIA Jetson Orin NX; integrated USB and RTSP camera \\r\\nstreams with automatic reconnection, watchdog monitoring and Linux systemd auto-start. \\r\\n• Developed Python-based Computer Vision modules for face recognition and gesture detection using real-time camera input. \\r\\n• Designed and developed a multi-role full-stack web application for Customers, Vendors, Delivery Partners and Administrators \\r\\nusing React.js and Firebase, including Custom Claims, Security Rules and reusable responsive components. \\r\\n• Integrated Razorpay Orders API, payment capture and refunds, and handled failed payments, retries, cancellations and payment \\r\\nreconciliation. \\r\\n• Worked in Agile delivery, participating in sprint planning, requirement discussions, code reviews, client demonstrations, \\r\\ndeployment testing and production releases.\"}, {\"title\": \"React JS Developer\", \"company\": \"Digicrop Agriculture Solutions Pvt. Ltd.\", \"endDate\": \"Wed Mar 05\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Sun Oct 10\", \"description\": \"Designed and developed architectures & user interfaces for web applications using React JS, HTML, CSS, and JavaScript. \\r\\nDeveloped responsive web designs using CSS frameworks. \\r\\n• Integrated REST APIs and handled data flow between the server and the client-side to fetch and display real-time data for \\r\\nweather, soil moisture and historical crop data. \\r\\n• Develop, test, and maintain high-quality mobile applications using React Native across Android. \\r\\n• Worked closely with the back-end development team to integrate server-side APIs using Node.JS and AWS to build server-side \\r\\nAPIs and integrate them with front-end applications. \\r\\n• Written clean and scalable code while following coding standards and best practices. Collaborated with the UX/UI, design & \\r\\ndevelopment team to create with ensuring a seamless and intuitive user experience. \\r\\n• Resolved various incidents and enhancement requests. Utilized debugging tools like Chrome Developer Tools to identify and fix \\r\\nissues. Managed version control using Git. \\r\\n• Involved in requirement grooming sessions and collaborating with team members to deliver the stories in agile methodology. \\r\\n• Participated in code reviews, release activities & performed Unit testing and Integration testing of implemented functionalities of \\r\\nthe modules in Test and Production environment applications to ensure user friendly & error-free solution.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2022\", \"degree\": \"Bachelor of Engineering in Computer Science\", \"result\": \"73\", \"institution\": \"Visvesvaraya Technological University\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1788134873-614.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('cc5f556f-be2b-44ee-a8bc-d17cc3c88709','b8f1eaf4-0d69-4335-8b94-eb2160213aa1','Test Resume170','Test Resume170','Software Deve',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Azure\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-24 21:17:19.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Deve\", \"company\": \"TCS\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[{\"year\": \"\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech\", \"result\": \"\", \"institution\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('cc611d81-2483-41a7-a411-c4a679236591','8c4156e1-fe47-4376-9d4e-f5ac77234b66','Test Resume328','Test Resume328','Software Deve',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\".NET CORE\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-26 08:31:17.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Deve\", \"company\": \"PWC\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[{\"year\": \"\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech\", \"result\": \"\", \"institution\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('cc71cf4d-082f-4840-8afa-ec353961db6f','cac75170-8295-4ccb-b680-1db0392b7673','International Voice Process',NULL,'International Voice Process',2,NULL,NULL