\r\nhands-on Playwright automation using JavaScript. Experienced in designing and maintaining UI automation using Page\r\nObject Model, fixtures, locators, hooks, cross-browser testing, trace analysis, screenshots and HTML reporting. Hands-on\r\nexperience in API testing using Playwright API testing and Postman, covering GET, POST, PUT, PATCH and DELETE\r\noperations. Experienced with GitHub and GitHub Actions for source control and CI/CD execution, along with JIRA-based\r\ndefect management and Agile/Scrum delivery. Strong background in functional, regression, UAT, smoke, end-to-end and\r\ncross-browser testing across banking and insurance applications','Software Engineer',4,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1791990687-849.pdf',NULL,'[\"Java\", \"Github\", \"Functional Scenario Testing\", \"JIRA\", \"Agile\", \"Playwright\", \"Pom (Project Object Model)\", \"Cross-Browser Compatibility\", \"API testing\", \"Postman\", \"REST API\"]','PUBLIC','2026-10-15 02:38:31.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Engineer\", \"company\": \"BO IT Solutions Private Limited\", \"endDate\": \"Fri Oct 16\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Tue Feb 10\", \"description\": \"• Design and maintain Playwright automation using JavaScript for end-to-end and regression testing of enterprise web\\r\\napplications.\\r\\n• Develop reusable automation components using Page Object Model (POM), fixtures, locators and hooks to improve\\r\\nmaintainability and reduce test duplication.\\r\\n• Execute cross-browser automation and analyze failures using Playwright Trace Viewer, screenshots and HTML reports.\\r\\n• Automate and execute API test scenarios using Playwright API testing and Postman, covering GET, POST, PUT, PATCH\\r\\nand DELETE operations with request/response validation.\\r\\n• Integrate automated test execution with GitHub Actions to support continuous testing and faster feedback during\\r\\ndevelopment and releases.\\r\\n• Collaborate with developers, QA members and other stakeholders in Agile/Scrum ceremonies including daily stand-ups,\\r\\nsprint activities and defect discussions.\\r\\n• Support functional, smoke, regression and end-to-end validation and contribute to defect identification, reporting and\\r\\nretesting.\"}, {\"title\": \"Test Analyst – Runtime\", \"company\": \"Functionize Software Pvt. Ltd.\", \"endDate\": \"Sat Jan 10\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Mon Nov 15\", \"description\": \"• Designed and executed manual test cases for functional, regression and UAT testing of banking and insurance\\r\\napplications.\\r\\n• Managed the end-to-end defect lifecycle in JIRA, including defect identification, logging, prioritization support, retesting\\r\\nand closure.\\r\\n• Prepared test scenarios and test cases covering functional, regression, cross-browser and API testing across multiple\\r\\nenvironments.\\r\\n• Performed manual API testing using Postman to validate request/response payloads, status codes, authentication flows\\r\\nand data accuracy.\\r\\n• Performed cross-browser testing on Chrome, Firefox and Edge to validate UI behavior and consistency.\\r\\n• Executed retesting and regression verification for defect fixes and supported production release validation.\\r\\n• Collaborated with developers, product managers and DevOps teams in Agile/Scrum ceremonies and sprint activities\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2019\", \"degree\": \"Bachelor of Technology (B.Tech) – Computer Science & Engineering\", \"result\": \"7.08\", \"institution\": \"Ashokrao Mane Group of Institutions\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1791990687-849.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('cc78a08f-73b0-4f5f-ab28-f19abf846786','6d66d60a-1953-4988-8e10-30c2ec926893','Customer Support Engineer',NULL,'Customer Support Engineer',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','PUBLIC','2025-05-13 17:33:39.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"Customer Support Engineer\", \"company\": \"Sysnet G