 Sep 24\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Wed Jul 31\", \"description\": \"Proficient in recipe authoring,recipe testing\\r\\n Expertise in troubleshooting Syncade issues,SC consumer,Behaviours etc\\r\\n Proficient in ServiceNow incident management,change management etc\\r\\n Supporting cell therapy processes by ensuring efficient MES functionality and \\r\\ndata management\\r\\n Experienced in working with DeltaV batch processes and gaining knowledge in \\r\\nDeltaV Batch Executive\\r\\n Managing a team and ensuring project goals and deadlines are met\\r\\n Coordinating with business stakeholders for seamless communication\"}, {\"title\": \"Application Development Senior Analyst\", \"company\": \"Accenture\", \"endDate\": \"Fri Aug 30\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Fri Jul 09\", \"description\": \"Experienced in MES Syncade,eBR management,recipe \\r\\ntesting,troubleshhoting etc,strong knowledge of pharma industry regulatory \\r\\ncontext(GxP)\\r\\n Proficient in Syncade SC Consumer,Familiar with RA tool,Behaviour editor \\r\\netc\\r\\n Expertise in Syncade Modules: Order Management(OM), Material \\r\\nManagement (MM), Inventory Management (IM), and Equipment Tracking \\r\\n(ET) modules\\r\\n Familiar with version control using TortoiseSVN, ensuring proper \\r\\nmanagement of project files and documentation in the Polarion Application\\r\\n Proficient in utilizing ServiceNow to manage and resolve incidents and \\r\\nexpert in Change Management in Pharma\\r\\n Proficient in utilizing OSI PI for data acquisition, analysis & visualization to \\r\\nenhance Manufacturing Execution Systems(MES) processes\\r\\n Experience in developing and executing SAT ,UAT and regression tests  in HP \\r\\nALM\\r\\n Linux server handling and deployment of new functionalities/patches etc\\r\\n Demonstrated expertise in diagnosing and resolving complex level 2 & 3 \\r\\ntechnical issues, ensuring minimal downtime and optimal system \\r\\nperformance.\"}, {\"title\": \"MES Engineer\", \"company\": \"TeamLease (Strides Pharma)\", \"endDate\": \"Tue Jun 29\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Mon Oct 14\", \"description\": \"Designed and implemented a robust data acquisition system for diverse \\r\\npharma machineries and field devices, utilizing OPC (OLE for Process \\r\\nControl) and other communication methods to seamlessly transfer shop \\r\\nfloor and lab information to the centralized DCS (DeltaV) system\\r\\n Proficient in integrating various pharma equipments with DeltaV,OPC \\r\\nmirroring,DeltaV module creation etc\\r\\n Proficient in Syncade MES suite-Recipe authoring,workflows & user training\\r\\n Worked on SCADA , Kepware,OPC ,XML & SQL Server\\r\\n Testing and validation of equipments with Computer System Validation \\r\\n(CSV) team\\r\\n Integrated MES (Syncade) to enable electronic Batch Manufacturing Record \\r\\n(eBMR) realization, ensuring compliance with regulatory requirements\\r\\n Proficient in configuring IPQA equipments,printers etc with MES system\\r\\n Familiar with ISA-88 and ISA-95 standars and GMP/cGMP regulations related \\r\\nto electronic systems including 21CFR part 11.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2018\", \"degree\": \"Bachelor of Technology •  Applied Electronics &  Instrumentation\", \"result\": \"7.3\", \"institution\": \"St. Joseph\'s College of Engineering and  Technology\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1759230565-119.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('ced41794-2880-4ec9-9fa6-ca1e17af9a7f','73e88722-cc59-4f34-bd00-fbfd4338ad2e','Seeking an exciting and challenging career in IT industry wherein my knowledge will prove effective towards the growth and development of the organisation and myself.','Seeking an exciting and challenging career in IT industry wherein my knowledge will prove effective towards the growth and development of the organisation and myself.','Responsibilities',4,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/smrutishree-mishra-1790577946-565.pdf',NULL,'[\"Quality Engineering\"]','PUBLIC','2026-09-28 18:12:27.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Responsibilities\", \"company\": \"SALONIQUE\", \"endDate\": \"Wed Apr 10\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Thu Jul 15\", \"description\": \"Involved in Automation Testing with experience in Java and Selenium . Developed and enhanced a Hybrid Automation Framework with knowledge of TestNG, including the use of various annotations, assertions, and test configurations. Experienced in API Testing using Postman, validating request/response flows. Participated in test execution, captured defects, and managed issue tracking using JIRA, ensuring clear documentation and timely resolution. Responsible for Functional Testing and Usability Testing to ensure application quality and user experience. Contributed to Selenium automation development, creating and maintaining automated test scripts ,Executed Selenium test suites, validated results, analyzed failures, and reported defects .\"}, {\"title\": \"Quality Engineer\", \"company\": \"Clinisys PVT LTD\", \"endDate\": \"Thu Jan 01\", \"isCurrent\": true, \"startDate\": \"Wed Apr 03\", \"description\": \"4+ years of professional experience in Software Testing with strong expertise in Test Planning, Test Design, Automation Framework Development,Scripting, Test Execution, Defect Reporting andTracking. Designed and developed a complete Playwright automation framework from scratch using POM, reusable fixtures, and datadriven execution for multi-role Persona testing. Implemented Playwright MCP modules (Planner, Generator, Healer) to accelerate script generation, improve maintainability, and automate debugging and healing. Built an AI-powered product-specific agent using Copilot Studio for test case design, and generating product-contextual insights using uploaded product documentation. Automated regression test suites using Typescript (Playwright) and Exprience in Java (Selenium),, increasing test coverage and reducing manual effort. Worked in the Validation (UAT) team to perform end-to-end workflow validation and ensure product release readiness. Executed HL7 interface testing by simulating analyzer messages and validating system responses across integrated systems. Performed API testing using Postman and verified functional and business logic across endpoints. Participated in CI/CD-based test execution and contributed to GitHub repository management. Collaborated with development teams for defect analysis, prioritization, triage, and delivery of quality releases. Prepared test cases, test data, and detailed test execution reports aligned with business requirements.\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/smrutishree-mishra-1790577946-565.pdf\", \"title\": \"Smrutishree Mishra\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('ced868bc-9759-415e-a609-4627387931c8','c23b125d-d5de-4160-a0e6-0bbe5aef0a2a','HR Executive',NULL,'HR Executive',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"HR\", \"SAP\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-14 19:32:25.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"HR Executive\", \"company\": \"Right life HR solutions\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('cedb4677-633b-4a28-85b4-59a6be6931f7','51587f82-cf78-4b75-86ab-3dee27324ca4','Software Developer',NULL,'Software Developer',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\".NET\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-23 12:38:14.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Developer\", \"company\": \"Concentrics\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]',550000.00,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('cedc2f52-54c3-42be-8f2f-56e8f7a77345','bea8d789-bf93-4247-9b9c-0f1f3dcee983','ERP Implementation Consultant',NULL,'ERP Implementation Consultant',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Advanced Excel\", \"ERP Implementation\", \"MS Office\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-15 03:43:12.000000','2026-10-21 0