ing) \\r\\n• Validated financial reports by reconciling system-generated outputs against SME-provided expected results, \\r\\nensuring data accuracy, calculation correctness, and compliance with business rules. (Data Accuracy, Business Rule \\r\\nValidation) \\r\\n• Logged, tracked, and verified defects using Jira, ensuring effective defect lifecycle management and timely closure \\r\\nthrough collaboration with development teams. (Defect Management) \\r\\n• Executed automation suites via Jenkins CI/CD pipelines, ensuring build stability across environments. (CI/CD)  \\r\\n• Collaborated daily with global stakeholders through A-UAT and A-PROD calls, supporting requirement \\r\\nclarifications, and issue resolution across multiple releases, contributing to on-time delivery and smoother \\r\\ntesting cycles. (Stakeholder Management, Client Communication) \\r\\n• Actively participated in defect triage and RCA calls, providing functional and technical analysis to support timely \\r\\nresolution and improve overall test quality. (Quality Improvement) \\r\\n• Ensured timely completion of BAU activities to support seamless EUC go-live readiness. (BAU Support, Release \\r\\nReadiness) \\r\\n• Provided QA sign-off for 40+ production deployments, enabling on-time releases with zero post-production critical \\r\\ndefects. (Release Management, Quality Assurance)  \\r\\n• Led and mentored a team of 2–3 QA engineers and provided KT to new joiners on application workflows, testing \\r\\nprocesses, and automation framework, ensuring high-quality and timely test execution. (Leadership, Mentorship, \\r\\nOwnership)\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2025\", \"degree\": \"Master of Technology (MTECH)\", \"result\": \"71\", \"institution\": \"Deogiri Institute of Engineering and Management Studies\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1771934091-738.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('d12c1c8e-8165-41ae-be73-e65c3a25a38a','26673e0f-0428-455d-8