.js, Express.js, Django REST Framework and FastAPI with OOP, MVC, Swagger/OpenAPI, JWT \\r\\nauthentication, RBAC, structured logging, and error handling, reducing leadership reporting time by 40%.  \\r\\n● Developed React.js single-page applications with protected routing, lazy loading, and real-time KPI \\r\\ndashboards, while integrating Microsoft Entra ID (Azure AD) and Microsoft Graph API for enterprise SSO and \\r\\nOutlook automation, reducing stakeholder decision lag by 60% and saving 3+ hours/week of manual \\r\\ncoordination.  \\r\\n● Designed and optimized PostgreSQL databases using UUID-based schema design, indexing, foreign-key \\r\\nconstraints, and audit trails to ensure scalable performance, data integrity, and compliance across all governance \\r\\nmodules.  \\r\\n● Strengthened production security and deployment by performing OWASP ZAP penetration testing and \\r\\nPostman API validation, remediating 10+ critical vulnerabilities, while administering Ubuntu Linux, Nginx, PM2, \\r\\nSSL/TLS, and GitHub Actions CI/CD for reliable production releases.\"}, {\"title\": \"Full Stack Software Engineer\", \"company\": \"Qamar Infotech\", \"endDate\": \"Mon Nov 10\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Tue Aug 05\", \"description\": \"● Served as the sole engineer for a PHP, MySQL, and JavaScript-based KYC verification portal, designing a 3-tier RBAC \\r\\nidentity management system and PHPMailer/Mailgun notification pipeline supporting 500+ monthly alerts, reducing case \\r\\nbacklog from 5 days to under 1 day and improving throughput by 89%.  \\r\\n● Redesigned 8+ responsive UI screens using Figma, applying accessibility best practices and responsive design principles \\r\\nthat reduced user error rates by 35% during UAT with 10+ stakeholders.  \\r\\n● Managed end-to-end deployment on Hostinger Cloud with GitHub CI/CD and SSL, maintaining 99.9% uptime, while \\r\\nleveraging GitHub Copilot and ChatGPT to accelerate development, testing, and debugging, reducing project delivery from \\r\\n16 weeks to 11 weeks.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2025\", \"degree\": \"B.E. Mechanical Engineering\", \"result\": \"72\", \"institution\": \"Government College of Engineering,\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1785249636-591.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('d134ca7c-2599-436a-a4c4-499c3ea36eea','a3d76736-ffc3-46d2-a10e-23e047ae0111','Test Resume35','Test Resume35','Software Deve',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Automation\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-25 20:15:58.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Deve\", \"company\": \"Achyutas\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[{\"year\": \"\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech\", \"result\": \"\", \"institution\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('d135044f-75f5-49e3-af89-db163d7d14e7','e609724c-e0d1-41e1-8a13-0e27e66e53a2','Looking for a challenging career in an organization that will provide me an opportunity to apply my skills and \r\nexperience for the advancement of the organization and my continued growth.','Looking for a challenging career in an organization that will provide me an opportunity to apply my skills and \r\nexperience for the advancement of the organization and my continued growth.','ADO.NET Specialist',1,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1746559910-121.pdf',NULL,'[\"ADO.NET\", \"Mendix Modules\", \"HTML\", \"ASP.NET\", \"ASP.NET MVC\", \"Angular\", \"Windows Server\", \"MS SQL Server\", \"XML\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-06 19:26:14.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1746559910-121.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('d13d2f3d-f8a3-4add-9ab1-75cb92656fae','26db5215-90cc-481a-9d70-5427bc49b112','\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n.\r\nSolution Architect with 14+ years of experience delivering Manufacturing Digital Transformation, Industrial Automation, IT-OT \r\nIntegration, and Track & Trace solutions across Automotive, Manufacturing, Pharmaceutical, Wareho','\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n.\r\nSolution Architect with 14+ years of experience delivering Manufacturing Digital Transformation, Industrial Automation, IT-OT \r\nIntegration, and Track & Trace solutions across Automotive, Manufacturing, Pharmaceutical, Warehouse, and Supply Chain industries. \r\nSpecialized in bridging the gap between Operational Technology (OT) and Information Technology (IT) by integrating PLCs, HMIs, \r\nSCADA systems, industrial devices, MES platforms, enterprise applications, databases, and cloud technologies to create connected \r\nmanufacturing ecosystems. \r\nSuccessfully architected and delivered multiple manufacturing applications involving Product Traceability, Track & Trace, Barcode/QR \r\nCode Management, Production Monitoring, Industrial Data Acquisition, and Shop Floor System Integration. Implemented 5+ end-to\r\nend Traceability Solutions for Automotive Assembly Lines enabling product genealogy, process validation, production tracking, and \r\nmanufacturing compliance. \r\nStrong expertise in Ignition SCADA, Industrial IoT, OPC UA, MQTT, Modbus Communication, C#.Net, ASP.Net Core, SQL Server, and \r\nmanufacturing system integration. Extensive experience in integrating barcode printers, barcode scanners, torque machines, leak test \r\nmachines, sensors, PLCs, HMIs, and enterprise applications into unified manufacturing solutions. \r\nCurrently working as a Solution Architect driving Manufacturing Digitalization initiatives involving MES, Proficy Operations Hub, Tulip, \r\nHighByte Intelligence Hub, MuleSoft, Snowflake, Unified Namespace (UNS), and Industry 4.0 technologies. Actively involved in \r\ncustomer consulting, architecture reviews, solution design, technical leadership, and digital transformation programs. \r\nExperienced in conducting technical workshops, mentoring engineering teams, and training