olume claim batches. \\r\\n• Tracked and managed denied/rejected claims; monitored resubmission pipelines and updated data fields in MS Excel trackers and internal \\r\\nsystems to reflect current claim lifecycle status. \\r\\n• Designed and maintained MS Excel-based MIS dashboards and Google Sheets trackers to summarize claim volumes — pending, approved, \\r\\nand rejected — providing actionable operational snapshots for team leadership. \\r\\n• Conducted regular data audits and quality-control checks; prepared structured operational reports in MS Word and MS PowerPoint for \\r\\ninternal review meetings, converting raw claim data into decision-ready summaries. \\r\\n• Documented claims handling SOPs to support process improvement initiatives, reducing re-work and improving team efficiency across the \\r\\noperations workflow\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2023\", \"degree\": \"Bachelor of Business Administration (BBA / BMS)\", \"result\": \"73\", \"institution\": \"Ch. Charan Singh University (CCSU)\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1781021434-138.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('d15425b8-5669-496b-8d9f-d535c561f2bd','fbf818ba-b9f5-48a1-b8cc-e72b5d0113cd','Test Resume179','Test Resume179','Software Deve',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Power BI\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-26 14:53:33.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Deve\", \"company\": \"Tech M\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[{\"year\": \"\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech\", \"result\": \"\", \"institution\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('d15da674-b116-4c7d-9b9b-905fe1d54495','7298be3e-eea1-4335-88fd-20dc2cc22ae2','Team Lead (Ecommerce) & Lead Software Engineer - Artificial Intelligence + E-commerce Development',NULL,'Team Lead (Ecommerce) & Lead Software Engineer - Artificial Intelligence + E-commerce Development',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Computer Programming\", \"E-Commerce\