ponse quality, \r\nRAG workflows, hallucination, groundedness, factual accuracy, regression, and AI security scenarios. \r\n• Practical exposure to GPT, Claude, Llama, LangChain, LlamaIndex, Hugging Face, embeddings, vector database \r\nconcepts, Agentic AI workflows, and tool/function calling. \r\n• Skilled in web, mobile, and REST API validation using Playwright, Selenium, Appium, Postman, and REST-Assured, \r\nwith Python used for AI API validation and data-driven LLM testing. \r\n• Experienced in Jenkins-based CI/CD execution, failure analysis, reusable automation design, cross-browser \r\nregression, defect management, and release-quality validation. \r\n• Comfortable working in Agile/Scrum teams across requirement analysis, estimation, sprint ceremonies, defect \r\ntriage, regression planning, and release support.','Automation Engineer & GenAi Tester',2,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/arun-yogan-1791795430-249.pdf',NULL,'[\"Java\", \"JavaScript\", \"Jenkins\", \"JIRA\", \"Playwright\", \"Selenium Webdriver\", \"Cucumber(BDD)\", \"TestNG\", \"SQL\", \"Python\", \"LangChain\"]','PUBLIC','2026-10-12 20:17:27.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Automation Engineer & GenAi Tester\", \"company\": \"TCS\", \"endDate\": \"Thu Jun 18\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Thu Mar 10\", \"description\": \"Project 1: Vaultzen | QA Automation & GenAI Test Engineer | Nov 2025 – June 2026 \\r\\nDomain: Banking \\r\\nProject Overview: Vaultzen is a modern digital banking platform designed to provide secure, simple, and convenient \\r\\nfinancial services. \\r\\nTechnologies: Playwright, JavaScript, Python, Appium, Cucumber, Postman, REST-Assured, Jenkins, Git, JIRA, \\r\\nChatGPT, GitHub Copilot, LangChain, LLM APIs \\r\\n• Built and maintained Playwright automation using JavaScript, Cucumber BDD, Page Object Model, reusable \\r\\nfixtures, utility methods, test-data components, and stable locator strategies for critical web workflows. \\r\\n• Automated end-to-end regression scenarios across web flows, while validating Android and iOS workflows with \\r\\nAppium and backend services with Postman and REST-Assured. \\r\\n• Validated GenAI/LLM responses for relevance, consistency, factual accuracy, groundedness, hallucination risk, and \\r\\ncontextual correctness across business scenarios. \\r\\n• Tested RAG-based workflows by checking retrieval relevance, source grounding, context quality, and the \\r\\nrelationship between retrieved evidence and generated answers. \\r\\n• Covered prompt, negative, adversarial, and AI security scenarios including prompt injection, jailbreak behavior, \\r\\nsensitive-data exposure, safety, and toxicity checks. \\r\\n• Created reusable AI regression datasets and Python-based validation utilities for AI API testing, response \\r\\ncomparison, and data-driven LLM evaluation. \\r\\n• Applied evaluation measures such as F1 Score, Exact Match, factual accuracy, context relevance, groundedness, \\r\\nhallucination rate, and grounding rate where appropriate to the use case. \\r\\n• Integrated web, API, mobile, and AI regression suites into Jenkins pipelines and investigated failures using logs, \\r\\ntraces, screenshots, test reports, and application evidence. \\r\\n• Used ChatGPT and GitHub Copilot to accelerate test-case design, automation development, debugging, and \\r\\nframework improvements, while managing defects in JIRA and collaborating with QA, development, and AI teams. \\r\\nProject 2: TrendCart | Automation Engineer | Jan 2025 - Oct 2025 \\r\\nDomain: Ecommerce \\r\\nProject Overview: TrendCart is a modern e-commerce platform designed to provide a simple and convenient online \\r\\nshopping experience. \\r\\nTechnologies: Playwright, JavaScript, Cucumber, Appium, Postman, Git, JIRA, Applitools, Testim, GitHub Copilot \\r\\n• Developed and maintained Playwright with JavaScript automation. \\r\\n• Created reusable Page Objects, fixtures, utility methods, and Cucumber step definitions to support maintainable \\r\\nand scalable test automation. \\r\\n• Performed cross-browser validation on Chromium, Firefox, and WebKit and investigated browser-specific behavior \\r\\nand execution failures. \\r\\n• Handled dynamic UI elements, asynchronous network requests, multiple tabs, pop-ups, and synchronization using \\r\\nPlaywright locators and auto-waiting capabilities. \\r\\n• Automated Android and iOS application workflows using Appium and validated REST APIs through Postman for \\r\\nstatus codes, payloads, authentication, and business rules. \\r\\n• Used Applitools and Testim for selected visual and AI-assisted test automation activities, with GitHub Copilot \\r\\nsupporting automation development and debugging. \\r\\n• Executed smoke, sanity, functional, and regression suites as part of release validation and performed root-cause \\r\\nanalysis for application, environment, test-data, locator, and synchronization failures. \\r\\n2 \\r\\n• Logged and tracked defects in JIRA, participated in defect triage and Agile ceremonies, and communicated test \\r\\nexecution and release status to the team. \\r\\nProject 3: Vynance | Test Engineer | July 2023 - Nov 2024 \\r\\nDomain: Finance \\r\\nProject Overview: Vynance is a modern finance platform designed to simplify personal financial management and \\r\\ninvestment tracking. \\r\\nTechnologies: Selenium, Java, Playwright, JavaScript, Cucumber, Appium, Postman, REST-Assured, Git, JIRA, Jenkins \\r\\n• Designed and maintained a hybrid BDD automation framework using Selenium WebDriver, Java, Cucumber, and \\r\\nPage Object Model for core banking workflows. \\r\\n• Automated regression scenarios for customer login, account information, transactions, and other business-critical \\r\\nfunctions. \\r\\n• Introduced Playwright with JavaScript for selected modern web modules and created reusable automation \\r\\ncomponents for new application areas. \\r\\n• Developed Appium-based tests for Android and iOS flows and API validations using Postman and REST-Assured to \\r\\nverify backend services and data integrity. \\r\\n• Built reusable utilities for synchronization, browser setup, screenshots, test-data handling, and common \\r\\napplication actions. \\r\\n• Executed functional, integration, smoke, sanity, and regression testing across releases and analyzed Jenkins \\r\\npipeline failures. \\r\\n• Maintained automation code in Git using branching and code-review practices and managed defects through JIRA. \\r\\n• Collaborated with developers, business analysts, and QA team members during requirement discussions, defect \\r\\ntriage, and Agile ceremonies. \\r\\nProject 4: VitaCareX | Test Engineer | March 2022 - May 2023 \\r\\nDomain: Healthcare \\r\\nProject Overview: VitaCareX is a modern healthcare platform designed to simplify patient care and healthcare \\r\\nmanagement. \\r\\nTechnologies: Java, Selenium WebDriver, TestNG, Git, JIRA \\r\\n• Reviewed user stories, functional requirements, and acceptance criteria to identify manual and automation test \\r\\ncoverage. \\r\\n• Prepared and executed functional, integration, system, and regression test cases for application workflows. \\r\\n• Identified repetitive and business-critical scenarios for automation and developed Selenium WebDriver scripts \\r\\nusing Java, TestNG. \\r\\n• Contributed reusable components to the automation framework and maintained regression suites for critical \\r\\napplication modules. \\r\\n• Executed automation suites, performed root-cause analysis for failed tests, and managed defects in JIRA with clear \\r\\nsteps, expected results, and evidence. \\r\\n• Retested resolved defects, completed regression for impacted areas, and prepared execution and defect-summary \\r\\nreports for QA and development discussions.\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/arun-yogan-1791795430-249.pdf\", \"title\": \"Arun Yogan\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('d17beabb-a2d4-455a-9e65-