ample labeling and \\r\\nintake. \\r\\n•  Production Incident & Ticket Resolution: Serve as the primary L2/L3 escalation point for ServiceNow and Jira \\r\\nincident tickets, managing operational requests, application access, role assignments, and endpoint verification within \\r\\nstrict ITIL SLAs. \\r\\n•  API, Security & Application Troubleshooting: Investigate failures across IIS-hosted .NET/C# and Unix/Linux \\r\\nplatforms (QLIMS, TOPCAT); troubleshoot REST API timeouts, payload errors, 403 Forbidden access issues, \\r\\nSSO/Azure AD login failures, and VPN connectivity problems. \\r\\n•  Log Diagnostics & SQL Validation: Conduct deep-dive root cause analysis using Windows Event Viewer, Linux \\r\\nsyslog, IIS logs, and Azure Log Analytics; execute SQL validation queries across SQL Server, Oracle, and MySQL to \\r\\nresolve data inconsistencies. \\r\\n•  GxP Compliance & Self-Service Support: Enforce strict adherence to 21 CFR Part 11 and GxP regulatory \\r\\ncompliance standards for all production data updates; conduct post-incident reviews (PIR/RCA) and guide end-users on \\r\\nAI-powered self-service chatbots to reduce ticket volume.\"}, {\"title\": \"Contract Executive – IT & Process Support\", \"company\": \"Project People Services Pvt. Ltd.\", \"endDate\": \"Wed Dec 04\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Tue Jun 09\", \"description\": \"•  Incident & Escalation Management: Managed production support operations and ticket resolution lifecycles in \\r\\nalignment with ITIL frameworks, acting as the key escalation bridge between business units, IT, and software \\r\\ndevelopment teams. \\r\\n•  SQL Troubleshooting & Data Validation: Performed complex SQL queries and data analysis across enterprise \\r\\ndatabases to identify root causes, correct data anomalies, and verify system integration consistency. \\r\\n•  Integration & API Support: Assisted in troubleshooting application workflow issues, API data exchange failures, and \\r\\nsystem integration 