stom MES code development, enhancing modularity, \\r\\nmaintainability, and performance across implementations.  \\r\\n• Strategized and synchronized multi-vendor and internal repositories, enabling standardized \\r\\nversion control, full traceability, and compliance with ISO 9001 quality management standards.  \\r\\n• Delivered zero production downtime deployments through structured release planning, \\r\\nstakeholder coordination, and rollback strategies.  \\r\\n• Provided L3 production support, resolving critical production issues via root-cause analysis and \\r\\nimplementing preventive fixes.  \\r\\n• Acted as primary technical point of contact across product owners, SAP, AES, and production \\r\\nteams, ensuring alignment with operational and business objectives.\"}, {\"title\": \"Software Engineer\", \"company\": \"Roima Intelligence\", \"endDate\": \"Tue Dec 10\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Wed Jul 10\", \"description\": \"• Prepared and configured Windows servers for MES deployment, including installation of MES, \\r\\ndatabase, and supporting components, ensuring successful system setup and execution.  \\r\\n• Implemented and supported AVEVA System Platform (WorkTasks/ArchestrA) solutions \\r\\nalongside MES implementations, improving production visibility and operational monitoring.  \\r\\n• Designed and implemented custom widgets and forms using React, JavaScript, and Kendo UI \\r\\nfor the Operations module.  \\r\\n• Built end-to-end Operations UI screens for FMCG clients, aligning system functionality with \\r\\nshop-floor processes and user requirements.  \\r\\n• Created and configured WorkTasks/ArchestrA workflows, including task flows, event triggers, \\r\\nand state transitions, and performed debugging and root-cause analysis for workflow and data \\r\\nissues.  \\r\\n• Developed and optimized MySQL stored procedures and queries, improving ERP-to-system \\r\\ndata synchronization and reducing latency.  \\r\\n• Implemented MQTT-based real-time notification systems for production alerts and events.  \\r\\n• Configured and maintained MQTT brokers and clients, troubleshooting data pipelines using \\r\\nMQTT Explorer and AVEVA Object Viewer.  \\r\\n• Monitored and debugged end-to-end data flows, ensuring data consistency and system \\r\\nstability.  \\r\\n• Supported and resolved ongoing production issues using Supervisor utilities and platform \\r\\ntools, ensuring stable MES/AVEVA operations.\"}, {\"title\": \"Software Engineer\", \"company\": \"LTIMindtree\", \"endDate\": \"Sun Jun 30\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Thu Mar 10\", \"description\": \"• Developed, migrated, and supported 200+ global websites using SDL Tridion Sites, ensuring \\r\\nhigh availability and consistent content delivery. \\r\\n• Led migration of legacy PHP websites to SDL Tridion, designing templates, schemas, and \\r\\ncomponents aligned with content architecture standards.  \\r\\n• Developed and maintained ASP.NET MVC-based modules, including a custom warranty \\r\\nmanagement solution for product lifecycle tracking and customer support.  \\r\\n• Deployed and managed applications on VPS environments, including domain configuration, \\r\\nhosting setup, and release management.  \\r\\n• Configured web servers and environments (IIS), handling application deployment, SSL setup, \\r\\nand domain routing.  \\r\\n• Resolved complex ASP.NET MVC backend issues, maintaining 24/7 production availability and \\r\\nsystem stability.  \\r\\n• Coordinated with vendors for payment gateway, analytics, and SEO integrations, ensuring \\r\\nseamless third-party connectivity.  \\r\\n• Delivered root cause analysis (RCA) and implemented permanent fixes within SLA, reducing \\r\\nrecurring production issues.  \\r\\n• Improved website performance using Lighthouse and PageSpeed, achieving 30–40% reduction \\r\\nin page load time.  \\r\\n• Monitored and optimized application performance and uptime, proactively identifying bottlenecks \\r\