 for role-based access control, ensuring secure access to storage accounts, pipelines, and data \\r\\nresources. \\r\\n Worked extensively on Microsoft Azure services including ADLS Gen2, Azure SQL Database, and Azure Data \\r\\nFactory to build \\r\\n scalable and reliable cloud-based data engineering solutions. \\r\\n Developed data processing solutions using Microsoft Fabric, \\r\\n leveraging Lakehouse, Data Engineering, and Fabric Pipelines to ingest, transform, and manage large-scale \\r\\ndatasets. \\r\\n Designed and implemented ETL pipelines following the Medallion Architecture (Bronze, Silver, Gold) to \\r\\ntransform raw data into \\r\\n clean, curated, and analytics-ready datasets using PySpark and SQL.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2019\", \"degree\": \"Bachelor of Engineering (B.E)\", \"result\": \"73\", \"institution\": \"Sant Gadge Baba Amravati University\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1776441480-468.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('d4d3c43c-da2f-4345-912c-6af9c589c4ea','4a75bd2b-fbc5-4546-9635-164b8d6fde09','Mechanical Engineer Maintenance',NULL,'Mechanical Engineer Maintenance',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"MS Office\", \"SAP Mm\", \"Reliability Engineering\", \"Troubleshooting\", \"SAP Mm\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-14 16:33:03.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"Mechanical Engineer Maintenance\", \"company\": \"OQ Refinery\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]',500000.00,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('d4ddeb56-b947-4d68-92bf-c60b2a5d183d','2e7b63aa-53fb-4b35-9f92-66ecc5d18034','Fullstack Software Developer with nearly three years of experience in designing scalable microservices using Java and Spring Boot;\r\nrecognized for improving system reliability across large-scale HR platforms. Achievements include reducing manual HR effort','Fullstack Software Developer with nearly three years of experience in designing sc