l performance, enabling faster and more informed business decisions.\\r\\n• Developed end-to-end BI solutions using Power BI to visualize healthcare KPIs, operational metrics, and research\\r\\noutcomes.\\r\\n• Automated data refresh workflows using Power BI Service and On-Premises Gateway, reducing manual reporting time by 60%.\\r\\n• Designed dynamic slicer-driven dashboards and multi-level filters (visual, page, and report-level) for customized\\r\\nanalytical views.\\r\\n• Deployed reports to Power BI Service, configured refresh schedules, and managed workspace access.\\r\\n• Enabled self-service BI for users by building user-friendly, interactive reports with slicers, drill downs, and filters.\\r\\n• Designed and implemented efficient data models with calculated measures and KPIs using DAX.\\r\\n• Utilized Power Query for data cleaning, transformation, and merging multi-source data into unified semantic models\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2021\", \"degree\": \"Computer Science\", \"result\": \"Yes\", \"institution\": \"| ST JOSEPH’S COLLEGE\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1771849001-259.pdf\", \"title\": \"cv\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('d5f79a05-7cfa-4210-9239-eda6d1821901','db30dd34-515d-4a85-a0e7-b785b976e669','Data Engineer with 4+ years of experience in Banking and Financial Services, specializing in ETL pipeline \r\ndevelopment, SQL, Azure Data Factory (ADF), PySpark, and Databricks. Strong experience in customer \r\nonboarding (KYC), campaign automation, complai','Data Engineer with 4+ years of experience in Banking and Financial Services, specializing in ETL pipeline \r\ndevelopment, SQL, Azure Data Factory (ADF), PySpark, and Databricks. Strong experience in customer \r\nonboarding (KYC), campaign automation, complaint management systems, and vendor coordination. \r\nHands-on exposure to legacy ETL migration to ADF, and currently gaining experience in GCP data stack \r\n(BigQuery, Airflow).','Data Engineer',2,NULL