\", \"Angular\", \"C++\", \"Java\", \"JavaScript\", \"Github\", \"Python\", \"LangChain\", \"NLP\", \"Spring Boot\", \"REST API\", \"PostgreSQL\", \"React JS\", \"MYSQL\", \"VSCode\", \"MS Excel\"]','PUBLIC','2025-10-13 13:18:04.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Data Scientist\", \"company\": \"Chinmay Finlease Limited\", \"endDate\": \"Sat Oct 04\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Tue Apr 30\", \"description\": \"• Email Automation Agent (Planner–Executor–Synthesizer Architecture): Designed an LLM-powered\\r\\n email response system using LangGraph and LangChain with agentic workflows. Architected modular\\r\\n agents—Planner (task breakdown), Executor (tool use), and Synthesizer (response assembly)—to enable\\r\\n intelligent multi-step reasoning. Attached multiple prompt templates to agents for dynamic behavior control.\\r\\n Integrated a custom RAG setup for document grounding and built function-calling logic to query internal\\r\\n databases for user-specific actions (e.g., account info, KYC steps). Result: 60% reduction in manual email load\\r\\n and improved SLA adherence.\\r\\n • Promptanswers.ai Assistant (ChatGPT-style Backend with Multi-RAG): Built an internal AI\\r\\n assistant akin to the backend of ChatGPT, capable of document understanding and tool integration. Designed\\r\\n a flexible RAG pipeline with multi-source retrieval from PDFs, policies, emails, and large-format files. Enabled\\r\\n Co-RAG-like processing—handling arbitrary files and attaching retrieval-enhanced prompts on the fly.\\r\\n Integrated live web search and tools (Gmail, ArXiv, Wikipedia) using function-calling agents. Engineered an\\r\\n async task router and minimal web UI to support real-time streaming and tool orchestration. Now used\\r\\n internally to resolve policy and ops queries autonomously, reducing reliance on senior staff.\\r\\n • WhatsApp Support Chatbot: Built a LLM-backed chatbot that understands customer intent and handles\\r\\n queries over WhatsApp. Used Chain-of-Thought prompting for multi-step reasoning (e.g., EMI status, due\\r\\n date logic). Designed fallback routing for sensitive queries. Helped reduce live agent workload and improved\\r\\n f\\r\\n irst-response time by 40%.\\r\\n • Document Intelligence System: Designed a pipeline to automatically detect and extract key fields (Name,\\r\\n DOB, PAN, Aadhaar, etc.) from uploaded documents. Used AWS Textract for OCR and layered it with\\r\\n prompt-engineered LLMs to validate and correct extractions. This reduced manual review time by over 60%\\r\\n and improved onboarding accuracy. Personally iterated on noisy document cases to improve LLM chain\\r\\n reliability.\\r\\n • Bank Transaction Tagging Pipeline: Built an ML-powered system to categorize bank statement entries\\r\\n (e.g., EMI, Salary, Rent). Trained SVM and XGBoost models on a custom-labeled dataset. Integrated\\r\\n Aho-Corasick for rule-based fallback to ensure high precision. Result: tagging latency dropped from minutes\\r\\n to sub-second, enabling real-time processing during customer checks.\\r\\n • Credit Scoring Engine: Led development of a logistic regression model for creditworthiness prediction using\\r\\n features from income, spending, and transactional patterns. Cleaned data from 10K+ loan applicants,\\r\\n performed feature selection, and optimized thresholding based on business feedback. Helped risk team reject\\r\\n low-probability cases early, reducing NPA risk.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2024\", \"degree\": \"Electronics Engineering\", \"result\": \"7.8\", \"institution\": \"Birla Vishvakrma Mahavidyalaya\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1760362507-634.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('d9d0a031-5e25-4289-af7c-4b53af15f28b','b2c1e927-c9ec-48aa-87ee-3b6cfd50492d','Professional',NULL,'Professional',1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','PUBLIC','2025-05-23 20:37:12.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]'