country datasets from diverse sources like APIs, SFTP, CSV, JSON, and Parquet into Azure Data \r\nLake Storage (ADLS Gen2). \r\n• Data Transformation: Performed data wrangling, cleansing, and transformation in Azure \r\nDatabricks using PySpark, implementing partitioning, caching, schema evolution, and UDFs to \r\nenhance performance and reliability. \r\n• Cloud Data Integration: Built incremental and event-driven data pipelines in ADF using Change \r\nData Capture (CDC) and Azure Event Triggers, implementing data validation, schema mapping, \r\nand monitoring via Azure Monitor to ensure accuracy and reliability. \r\n• Analytics & Visualization: Delivered analytics-ready datasets to Azure Synapse Analytics and \r\nPower BI, creating interactive dashboards that improved reporting efficiency and business decisions. \r\n• API & Data Security: Enforced RBAC, data quality checks, and pipeline monitoring to maintain \r\ncompliance, security, and lineage across Azure environments.','Azure Data Engineer',2,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1766376242-826.pdf',NULL,'[\"Java\", \"Azure SQL Database\", \"Azure Monitor\", \"Data Pipelines\", \"DevOps\", \"Data Validation\", \"Github\", \"Git Version Control\", \"Python\", \"Azure Databricks\", \"Pyspark\", \"MYSQL\", \"Scala\", \"ADF\", \"Azure Data Lake Storage\", \"Azure Functions\", \"Orchestration\", \"Delta Lake\", \"triggers\", \"Power BI\", \"DAX\", \"CI/CD\", \"Role-Based Access Control (Rbac)\"]','PUBLIC','2025-12-22 16:11:36.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Azure Data Engineer\", \"company\": \"Infoview Systems\", \"endDate\": \"Wed Jul 30\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Wed Jan 05\", \"description\": \"Developed and automated ETL pipelines using Azure Data Factory (ADF) to ingest and process \\r\\nmulti-source data into Azure Data Lake Storage Gen2 (ADLS) for analytics. Streamlined data \\r\\ningestion and transformation using SQL and Excel, ensuring high data accuracy across systems. \\r\\n• Tr