 Analytics\"]','PUBLIC','2026-09-28 18:28:53.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Associate Analyst\", \"company\": \"Zifo Scientific Informatics\", \"endDate\": \"Mon May 15\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Wed Jul 06\", \"description\": \"• Developed R Shiny dashboards integrated with LabVantage LIMS databases to provide interactive access to laboratory and analytical data. • Supported LabVantage LIMS configuration activities and developed an understanding of laboratory workflows, system configuration, and structured laboratory data. • Worked with SQL and relational databases to retrieve, transform, validate, and analyze laboratory data. • Supported master data creation and maintenance based on customer requirements and approved SOPs. • Assisted with data integration activities involving multiple source formats, including Excel and database sources. • Collaborated with stakeholders to understand business requirements and translate them into technical solutions. • Supported testing, troubleshooting, and resolution of LIMS/application issues during implementation and postdeployment activities. • Prepared technical documentation and user-facing materials to support LIMS workflows and system usage.\"}, {\"title\": \"Data Research Analyst\", \"company\": \"Zifo Scientific Informatics\", \"endDate\": \"Wed Apr 08\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Mon Jun 12\", \"description\": \"• Configured and customized LabVantage LIMS to support customer-specific laboratory workflows, data management requirements, and system configurations. • Performed data profiling, cleansing, validation, and quality checks on customer data to ensure accuracy, consistency, and compliance with defined requirements. • Designed relational data models comprising entities, attributes, primary keys, foreign keys, and relationships to support structured laboratory master and transactional data. • Worked extensively with Oracle, Microsoft SQL Server (MSSQL), and PostgreSQL databases for data storage, querying, integration, and application development. • Created and maintained master data manually using customer-approved SOPs and business rules, ensuring consistent and controlled laboratory data across the system. • Supported data stewardship activities by maintaining and validating laboratory master data against approved SOPs and business rules, resolving data-quality issues, and coordinating with stakeholders. • Applied Master Data Management principles to create, maintain, validate, and govern laboratory master data based on customer SOPs, business rules, and data-quality requirements. • Integrated data from multiple sources including SOPs, Excel files, and databases, transforming and loading information into structured database/LIMS environments. • Developed and worked with REST APIs for system and data integration requirements. • Supported application and LIMS deployments across Development, Validation, and Production environments, including migration and verification of configurations and data.• Worked with AWS services/environments to support data and application requirements. • Developed comprehensive LIMS training materials by analyzing and documenting end-to-end laboratory workflows for customer, supporting a large user base in effective adoption of LabVantage LIMS. • Collaborated with business and technical stakeholders to understand requirements and translate them into LIMS configurations, data models, integrations, and analytical solutions. • Workedwithin GxP and21CFRPart11regulatedenvironments, following controlled processes for data integrity, validation, documentation, and system changes. • Developed modular R Shiny applications integrated with PostgreSQL and Elasticsearch, including role-based access control, supporting secure analytics for 1,000+ users. • Built ETL workflows for healthcare data and developed automated data ingestion and transformation processes for downstream analytics. • Developed automated testing frameworks using testthat and shinytest to improve application reliability and software quality.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2022\", \"degree\": \"Msc\", \"result\": \"7.2\", \"institution\": \"Pondicherry University\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/muhthar-hassan-shajahan-1790578978-834.pdf\", \"title\": \"MUHTHAR HASSAN SHAJAHAN\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('e00d31fc-f63a-48ab-8229-c976248fa507','6aca3bc6-82b9-4cd9-9f95-9e55df8a67d6','Results-driven IT professional with 10.4 years of experience specializing in TrackWise, Crystal Reports, and \r\nSalesforce with proven expertise in system implementation, customization, and reporting solutions. Adept at leading \r\ncross-functional teams, de','Results-driven IT professional with 10.4 years of experience specializing in TrackWise, Crystal Reports, and \r\nSalesforce with proven expertise in system implementation, customization, and reporting solutions. Adept at leading \r\ncross-functional teams, delivering process improvements, and ensuring high-quality project execution. Strong \r\nexperience as a Team Lead, managing end-to-end project lifecycles, mentoring team members, and driving \r\ncollaboration to meet business objectives. Recognized for configuration, analytical problem-solving, stakeholder \r\nmanagement, and delivering value-driven solutions aligned with organizational goals.','Senior Consultant',4,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1776703635-336.pdf',NULL,'[\"GAMP5\", \"Java\", \"Trackwise configuration\", \"Trackwise Developer\", \"21 CFR Part 11\", \"SAP Crystal Reports\", \"MS SQL Developer\"]','PUBLIC','2026-04-21 04:16:26.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Senior Consultant\", \"company\": \"Infosys\", \"endDate\": \"Thu Feb 26\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Mon Sep 27\", \"description\": \"•  Team Lead with 10.4 years of experience in TrackWise Implementation, Configuration, Migration, and \\r\\nSupport for Biotechnology and Pharmaceutical clie