 & 21 CFR Part 11 compliance, with a strong focus on system quality and \\r\\nregulatory standards. \\r\\n•  Recognized for excellent communication, client interaction, and cross-functional collaboration with the \\r\\nability to manage multiple projects simultaneously. \\r\\nTools Proficiency \\r\\n▪ MS SQL Server 2008R2 and MS SQL Server 2012 \\r\\n▪ TrackWise 8.5 – 10.4 \\r\\n▪ SAP Crystal Reports 2008 & 2013 \\r\\n▪ Microsoft Visio 2013 \\r\\n▪ IDE -Visual Studio 2008, Visual Studio 2010, Visual Studio 2012, Eclipse( java).\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1776703635-336.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('e00f64eb-623c-41d1-8193-9e97394066bd','20b43fdf-ae20-43b6-b269-70acf55fccef','Test Resume163','Test Resume163','Software Deve',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\".NET\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-25 10:56:24.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Deve\", \"company\": \"Mindteck\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[{\"year\": \"\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech\", \"result\": \"\", \"institution\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('e0129624-fcfc-4786-bf21-b50298ef4265','b7aa04e3-e859-4985-9c99-7ff9e64ab103','Test Resume268','Test Resume268','Software Deve',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Guidewire Automation Testing\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-24 21:19:42.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Deve\", \"company\": \"TCS\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[{\"year\": \"\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech\", \"result\": \"\", \"institution\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('e017f31d-9ea4-4ca0-932e-2dd7628005c5','f44ba8ad-c19c-44d0-90e1-73f606af2d66','Test Resume230','Test Resume230','Software Deve',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"OT Exstream\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-27 04:19:29.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Deve\", \"company\": \"Capgem