rvices and selected UAT workloads, improving scalability and \\r\\nreducing infrastructure costs.   \\r\\n• Configure Application Load Balancers, Auto Scaling Groups, and Route 53 DNS services.   \\r\\n• Automate infrastructure provisioning using Terraform (Infrastructure as Code).   \\r\\n• Built and maintained CI/CD pipelines using Jenkins, GitHub Actions, and ArgoCD, \\r\\nreducing deployment time by 40% and eliminating significant manual intervention. \\r\\n• Managed and supported 200+ application workloads on Kubernetes clusters, maintaining \\r\\n99.95% service uptime  \\r\\n• Implemented real-time monitoring and alerting using Datadog, Prometheus, Grafana, \\r\\nand ELK Stack, improving incident detection and resolution time.   \\r\\n• Collaborate with development and application teams during production releases and \\r\\nchange implementation.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2019\", \"degree\": \"Bachelor of Science (B.Sc)\", \"result\": \"78\", \"institution\": \"SSR Degree College, Krishna University\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1785160215-815.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('e2cd3689-ec58-4abf-9873-48a23037a465','9dd4a607-8997-4b18-80e6-45df5daeb2ed','Informatica Technical lead with 7 years Experience',NULL,'Informatica Technical lead with 7 years Experience',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Informatica\", \"Informatica\", \"Oracle\", \"SQL\", \"UNIX\", \"Oracle\", \"UNIX\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-14 17:58:26.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"Informatica Technical lead with 7 years Experience\", \"company\": \"ABC Consultants\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('e2d22d74-a419-4a83-b47c-b02422d9e2d4','9c3abd74-845e-4e7a-93da-1a86ab7e62c4','Test Resume610','Test Resume610','Software Deve',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Java\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-24 21:38:22.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"titl