,'[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('e431a372-e4b6-4281-aad3-e2718ffb22eb','a8bbae34-51af-4e17-8f6c-32097a1e49a4','Results-driven Full Stack Developer with 5 years of professional experience in designing, developing, and deploying scalable enterprise \r\napplications. Proven expertise in Java, Spring Boot, Microservices, Kafka, and cloud-native technologies. Strong back','Results-driven Full Stack Developer with 5 years of professional experience in designing, developing, and deploying scalable enterprise \r\napplications. Proven expertise in Java, Spring Boot, Microservices, Kafka, and cloud-native technologies. Strong background in building \r\nsecure, high-performance distributed systems, optimizing application performance, and delivering robust backend services for fintech, \r\nCRM, e-commerce, and blockchain-based solutions.','Senior Full Stack Engineer (React.js + Java)',4,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1777318536-122.pdf',NULL,'[\"Java\", \"Hibernate\", \"JPA (Java Persistence Api)\", \"Microservices\", \"Kafka\", \"Maven\", \"Gradle\", \"JIRA\", \"Python\", \"Typescript\", \"MYSQL\", \"MYSQL\", \"React JS\", \"Spring Boot\", \"Spring Cloud\", \"REST API\", \"PostgreSQL\", \"Mongo DB\"]','PUBLIC','2026-04-28 07:04:38.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Senior Full Stack Engineer (React.js + Java)\", \"company\": \"AllDigital\", \"endDate\": \"Thu Dec 25\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Wed Jan 10\", \"description\": \"● Architected and implemented microservices solutions that increased scalability and improved fault tolerance by 45%. \\r\\n● Developed Kafka-based event-driven systems for handling millions of real-time transactions. \\r\\n● Reduced API response times from 300ms to 80ms through database and backend performance optimization. \\r\\n● Strengthened platform security by implementing JWT authentication and client-side encryption. \\r\\n● Managed deployment of Dockerized services on AWS ECS and automated delivery pipelines through CI/CD.\"}, {\"title\": \"Java Full Stack Developer\", \"company\": \"Dial2Web\", \"endDate\": \"Wed Dec 20\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Sun Jan 10\", \"description\": \"● Developed RESTful services for enterprise-grade applications using Spring Boot and MySQL. \\r\\n● Enhanced performance with multithreading and Redis caching for high-volume systems. \\r\\n● Delivered scalable backend solutions for e-commerce, CRM, and fintech clients. \\r\\n● Supported migration from monolithic architecture to microservices, improving extensibility and maintainability.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2021\", \"degree\": \"Bachelor of Computer Applications (BCA)\", \"result\": \"75\", \"institution\": \"P.D. Pandya College\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1777318536-122.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('e432d44b-55ff-4212-aa42-bbaddfa37f6c','42d6d601-4534-4aff-abf1-1bf9e3afa65a','Results-oriented Data Scientist with 4 years of experience in AI and data solutions, specializing in Generative AI and LLMs. Proficient with open-source models like Mistral, Phi, and LLaMA, and well-versed in transformer architecture and fine-tuning techn','Results-oriented Data Scientist with 4 years of experience in AI and data solutions, specializing in Generative AI and LLMs. Proficient with open-source models like Mistral, Phi, and LLaMA, and well-versed in transformer architecture and fine-tuning techniques such as PEFT, LoRA, QLoRA, and RLHF. Skilled in GenAI frameworks including LangChain, LlamaIndex, and agentic tools like CrewAI, AutoGen, and LangGraph. Delivered impactful projects like a RAG-based IT Helpdesk Chatbot using Ollama and an XGBoost-powered inventory optimization system. Strong foundation in Python, SQL, Power BI, and Excel, with hands-on experience in ETL pipelines, cloud deployment (AWS EC2), and real-time analytics. Familiar with Model Context Protocol (MCP) for advanced LLM integration.','Data Scientist',4,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/raghvendra-sharma-1790152809-844.pdf',NULL,'[\"Data Science\"]','PUBLIC','2026-09-23 20:05:15.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Data Scientist\", \"company\": \"P2P System Pvt.Ltd., Noida\", \"endDate\": \"Thu Jan 01\", \"isCurrent\": true, \"startDate\": \"Fri Jul 01\", \"description\": \"IT Helpdesk Chatbot (Mistral | RAG Architecture | FastAPI) ● Objective: Developed a domain-specific AI chatbot using Retrieval Augmented Generation (RAG) architecture to automate IT support for internal employees, improving accuracy and reducing dependency on manual ticket resolution. ● Methodology: Preprocessed 10,000+ IT FAQs and support tickets, generated dense embeddings using Sentence Transformers, and indexed them in FAISS for efficient retrieval. Used Mistral-7B 4bit quantized LLM to generate contextual responses. Developed a FastAPI backend with a fallback confidence scoring layer for handling uncertain queries. Deployed the solution on an AWS EC2 GPU-enabled server for scalable organizational access. ● Achievements/Impact: Enabled accurate retrieval and generation of IT support answers with 85%+ retrieval precision. Automated resolution of ~65% employee queries without human intervention. Reduced average IT ticket response time by over 45%. Improved chatbot reliability and maintainability through dynamic retrieval instead of expensive model fine-tuning. Inventory Optimization using Machine Learning (XGBoost|Python|SQL) ● Objective: Developed a predictive inventory management system to optimize stock levels, minimize stockouts, and reduce holding costs. ● Methodology: Built and trained an XGBoost-based forecasting model using historical sales and inventory data. Applied feature engineering to improve demand prediction accuracy. Designed SQL-based ETL pipelines for real-time data processing and reporting. Developed Power BI dashboards for inventory monitoring and insights. ● Achievements/Impact: Boosted demand prediction accuracy by 25%, cutting stockouts by 20%. Optimized stock levels, reducing holding costs by 15%, and enhanced decision-making with real-time analytics.\"}, {\"title\": \"DATA ANALYST\", \"company\": \"P2P System Pvt.Ltd., Noida\", \"endDate\": \"Thu Jul 07\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Wed Jan 05\", \"description\": \"Retail Sales Analytics Dashboard (Excel | SQL | Power BI): ● Data Modeling & Extraction: Leveraged SQL for data extraction and built a robust data model in Power BI to analyze ₹1.57M+ in sales and ₹175K+ in profit across multiple business dimensions. ● Performance Tracking & Visualization: Developed custom DAX measures and dynamic visuals to track sales by Category/Sub-Category, monitor profit trends, evaluate ship modes, and assess state-level performance. ● Business Intelligence & Insights Delivery: Enabled strategic decision-making using interactive filters, slicers, and drill-through pages — highlighting key trends across customer segments, payment modes, and regions. Crime Lab Data Visualization (SQL | Power BI | Web Integration): ● Data Extraction & Modeling: Migrated 100+ Crystal Reports to Power BI using SQL queries with import mode for clean, filtered data loading. ● Interactive Reporting: Built map-based reports to visualize crime data by city, enabling dynamic selection and drill-down insights. ● Web Integration & Impact: Developed a custom web page with clickable city maps linked to Power BI reports, embedded into the client’s website. Resulted in 70% reduction in manual effort and faster, more intuitive data access for stakeholders.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2022\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech in Computer Science and Engineering\", \"result\": \"7.0\", \"institution\": \"AMITY UNIVERSITY\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/raghvendra-sharma-1790152809-844.pdf\", \"title\": \"Raghvendra Sharma\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('e43e8bc5-d6cb-4da8-b9df-b4ae2f305de9','8b74ca17-e430-4a00-a875-b62f3e11c243','Test Resume429','T