urposes.\\r\\nMaintained comprehensive project documentation including system design, workflow configurations, database\\r\\nschemas, integration flows, and change logs.\\r\\nPrepared user manuals and training materials to support end-users and facilitate onboarding of new team\\r\\nmembers.\\r\\nCustomized MES applications to meet specific manufacturing requirements through workflow configuration,\\r\\nUI enhancements, and data collection setup.\\r\\nWorked on diverse medical manufacturing projects including Suture, Finished Needle, Braiding, and Mesh,\\r\\ndemonstrating adaptability across domains\"}, {\"title\": \"MES\", \"company\": \"CAPGEMINI TECHNOLOGY SERVICES LIMITED\", \"endDate\": \"Thu Jan 01\", \"isCurrent\": true, \"startDate\": \"Fri Apr 04\", \"description\": \"Designed and implemented end-to-end laboratory workflows in Siemens Opcenter LIMS based on user stories\\r\\nand business requirements.\\r\\nConfigured and maintained core LIMS entities including Method Definitions, Parameter Definitions, Parameter\\r\\nProfiles, Sample Types, and Specifications.\\r\\nDeveloped and managed sample lifecycle processes including sample creation, test assignment, result entry,\\r\\nreview, and approval workflows.\\r\\nConfigured specification limits and result evaluation logic to ensure compliance with quality standards.\\r\\nCustomized InfoCards and InfoFields for structured data capture, metadata management, and enhanced user\\r\\ninterface experience.\\r\\nImplemented dynamic workflow routing based on sample type, test results, and business rules.\\r\\nUtilized SQL Server Management Studio (SSMS) for writing queries, data validation, backend data analysis, and\\r\\nreport generation.\\r\\nSupported master data management including maintenance of methods, parameters, instruments, and lab\\r\\nrelated configurations.\\r\\nCollaborated with Quality, Manufacturing, and IT teams to align LIMS workflows with shop floor and quality\\r\\nprocesses.\\r\\nSupported UAT activities and ensured workflows meet functional and compliance requirements.\\r\\nManaged deployment and version control of configurations across Test, QAE, and Production environments\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2020\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech in Information Technology\", \"result\": \"8.5\", \"institution\": \".\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/shivani-patil-1790844262-462.pdf\", \"title\": \"SHIVANI PATIL\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('e81c94d9-eece-4fa3-b66d-8b8dbff404ab','c61f87da-1cbb-4bd6-bfae-eb1b3494498c','Chief Executive Officer(CEO)',NULL,'Chief Executive Officer(CEO)',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Financial Planning\", \"Media Planning\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-16 10:25:38.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"Chief Executive Officer(CEO)\", \"company\": \"Self-Employed\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('e824ae0b-e60b-489a-a70a-83183c47882f','30e2f1c0-13c7-47ae-b5fb-17024a8ce2c3','Dynamic and goal-oriented professional with experience in investigation, sales, and business operations.\r\nCompleted a comprehensive Data Analytics program with hands-on skills in Python, SQL, Machine learning,\r\nExcel and Power BI/Tableau. Adept at improvi','Dynamic and goal-oriented professional with experience in investigation, sales, and business operations.\r\nCompleted a comprehensive Data Analytics program with hands-on skills in Python, SQL, Machine learning,\r\nExcel and Power BI/Tableau. Adept at improving data-driven decision-making. Strong attention to detail,\r\nstakeholder communication, and process-improvement mindset. Seeking a Data Analyst or Business Analyst\r\nrole to apply analytical skills and contribute to impactful business outcomes','Professional',1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','PUBLIC','2026-04-02 04:16:15.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('e8258eae-4e2a-41a7-bf5