 Support \r\nwithin Banking & Financial Services. Skilled in designing and maintaining CI/CD pipelines, deploying containerized workloads with \r\nDocker and Kubernetes and provisioning cloud infrastructure as code with Terraform and Ansible. Experienced in Linux system \r\nadministration, Git/GitHub version control, and Apache Tomcat application deployment, alongside managing core AWS services and \r\nMicrosoft Azure services including secure network architecture design, container security and code quality scanning, and driving \r\nobservability. Strong track record in release management, production deployment support, and incident/root-cause resolution within Agile \r\nteams delivering secure, scalable, high-availability enterprise banking applications.','Cloud DevOps Engineer',4,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1788723770-103.pdf',NULL,'[\"AWS\", \"EC2\", \"Microsoft Azure Platform\", \"Blob Storage\", \"Linux\", \"APACHE TOMCAT\", \"Azure DevOps\", \"Docker\", \"Kubernetes\", \"Ansible\", \"S3\", \"Subnets\", \"CloudFront\", \"SNS (Simple Notification Service)\", \"SQS\", \"RHEL\", \"Ubuntu\", \"GitHub Actions\", \"TerraForm\"]','PUBLIC','2026-09-07 07:08:25.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Cloud DevOps Engineer\", \"company\": \"Capgemini India Pvt. Ltd\", \"endDate\": \"Tue Oct 14\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Fri Jun 10\", \"description\": \"• Designed, built, and troubleshot CI/CD pipelines using Jenkins and GitHub Actions, standardizing build and deployment automation \\r\\nand ensuring reliable, repeatable execution across multiple environments. \\r\\n• Automated infrastructure provisioning and release pipelines using Azure DevOps and ARM Templates. \\r\\n• Automated repetitive operational tasks using Shell/Bash scripting and Ansible, reducing manual intervention and deployment \\r\\nturnaround time. \\r\\n• Leveraged Kiro, an AI-powered IDE, to generate and optimize Terraform and Ansible scripts — accelerating infrastructure-as-code \\r\\ndevelopment, reducing manual coding effort, and cutting cloud infrastructure costs through leaner, more efficient resource definitions. \\r\\n• Built Docker images and deployed containerized applications to Amazon EKS, managing Kubernetes Deployments, Services, \\r\\nConfigMaps, and Secrets at scale. \\r\\n• Provisioned and managed Azure Kubernetes Service (AKS) clusters and Azure DevOps pipelines to support containerized workload \\r\\ndeployments alongside AWS EKS, enabling hybrid cloud deployments. \\r\\n• Provisioned and maintained AWS infrastructure using Terraform across EC2, S3, IAM, VPC, RDS, EKS, ECS, CloudFront, and SNS, \\r\\nmaintaining configuration consistency across environments. \\r\\n• Designed and implemented secure Amazon VPC architecture with public/private subnets across multiple Availability Zones to isolate \\r\\napplication, database, and management tiers for a banking workload. \\r\\n• Configured Internet Gateways and NAT Gateways to enable secure outbound access for private-subnet resources while reducing direct \\r\\ninternet exposure. \\r\\n• Defined and maintained route tables, Security Groups, and Network ACLs to enforce least-privilege access and segment traffic across \\r\\ntiers. \\r\\n• Implemented VPC endpoints and peering connections for secure, private connectivity between AWS services and hybrid environments. \\r\\n• Provisioned and managed Microsoft Azure resources including Virtual Machines, AKS clusters, Blob Storage, and Azure Active \\r\\nDirectory to support hybrid cloud banking deployments.\"}, {\"title\": \"Senior Software Engineer\", \"company\": \"Capgemini India Pvt. Ltd\", \"endDate\": \"Tue May 10\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Wed May 08\", \"description\": \"• Monitored application health and system availability for a high-volume credit card origination platform integrated with retail partners \\r\\n(Amazon, Walmart). \\r\\n• Investigated and resolved production incidents within SLA timelines; 