 manage\\r\\n order, Report production/ Downtime, Shift handover, SAP\\r\\n OEE KPI\'s, data handle screens for no ECC integration\\r\\n version, custom dashboard designs etc. I worked on SAP\\r\\n RISE for BMI to migrate MII to cloud from on premise.\"}, {\"title\": \"SAP MII Developer\", \"company\": \"IBM India\", \"endDate\": \"Mon Jan 03\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Mon Jun 10\", \"description\": \"Project and Assets \\r\\nNestle: I worked as an SAP MII and UI5 developer which\\r\\n includes Schedulers, Workflow(SAP OEE - SAP ECC\\r\\n integration), BLS design, Translations, UI5 pages,\\r\\n fragments, utils.js and XSLT transformation . Apart from\\r\\n that, I worked on SAP OEE which includes Manage Order,\\r\\n Stoppages, PO Validation, PO Summary Report, Waste\\r\\n and Rework, Report Speed Loss, Report quantity, KPI and\\r\\n Confirmation. \\r\\nADO Sanity Check Tool: ADO Sanity check tool is\\r\\n developed to maintain ADO hygiene. It will generate a\\r\\n report for every sprint and send that report to all\\r\\n associated persons to take action for their items to\\r\\n maintain ADO hygiene. Developed two versions one in\\r\\n SAP MII and python and the second version developed in\\r\\n Django. \\r\\nDevOps Automation Tool: DevOps Automation tool is\\r\\n developed to integrate phases and tools used in DevOps\\r\\n in a single place. I worked as full stake developer for the\\r\\n planning, Code, and Monitor phase of DevOps.\\r\\n Technologies used: React JS, Django.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2019\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech CSE\", \"result\": \"63\", \"institution\": \"Rajasthan Technical University\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1764775671-356.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('eaefa536-255a-42cd-be4e-8404d394a501','4d5ee616-6fd1-4dd0-8dd4-bccc19d17b55','MEAN Stack Developer with 5.9 years of experience, primarily focused on Angular front\r\nend development, building and maintaining enterprise web applications across FinTech \r\nand Banking domains. Delivered and enhanced 7+ enterprise modules as part of a le','MEAN Stack Developer with 5.9 years of experience, primarily focused on Angular front\r\nend development, building and maintaining enterprise web applications across FinTech \r\nand Banking domains. Delivered and enhanced 7+ enterprise modules as part of a lean 2-4 \r\nmember engineering team at Credopay. Deep expertise in Angular (v13-v19), TypeScript, \r\nRxJS, NgRx, Angular Material, and PrimeNG, with hands-on experience migrating \r\napplications to Standalone Components and Angular Signals, and implementing Native \r\nFederation for micro-frontend architecture — improving application performance through \r\nlazy loading and server-side pagination. Also contributes on the backend, building and \r\nintegrating REST API endpoints and resolving production issues using Node.js and NestJS. \r\nRecognized with Employee of the Month (3 times) and an Appreciation Award (2 times) \r\nfor consistent, high-quality delivery','Software Engineer - MEAN Stack Developer',4,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1785161088-421.pdf',NULL,'[\"Angular\", \"JavaScript\", \"HTML5\", \"CSS3\", \"Bootstrap\", \"Express.js\", \"JWT (Json Web Tokens)\", \"Github\", \"JIRA\", \"Azure DevOps\", \"Typescript\", \"Tailwind CSS\", \"RxJs\", \"NgRx\", \"Node JS\", \"REST API\", \"Mongo DB\", \"VSCode\", \"Figma\", \"Adobe XD\"]','PUBLIC','2026-07-28 01:31:12.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Engineer - MEAN Stack Developer\", \"company\": \"Credopay\", \"endDate\": \"Tue May 05\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Tue Apr 05\", \"description\": \"•  Designed and developed enterprise web applications primarily using Angular and \\r\\nTypeScript, collaborating within a lean 2-4 member engineering team alongside \\r\\nNode.js/NestJS backend services.\\r\\n•  Led the migration of enterprise applications from Angular 13 to Angular 19, adopting \\r\\nStandalone Components and Angular Signals platform-wide.\\r\\n•  Architected Native Federation (Micro Frontends) and reusable Angular libraries, cutting \\r\\nduplicate code and improving load performance across teams.\\r\\n•  Converted Figma and Adobe XD designs into pixel-perfect, mobile-friendly Angular \\r\\ninterfaces.\\r\\n•  Built and integrated REST API endpoints for new features and resolved production \\r\\nbackend issues using Node.js, NestJS, and Express.js.\\r\\n•  Delivered and enhanced 7+ enterprise modules, including Merchant Management, \\r\\nTerminal Management System (TMS), Settlement, Reporting, Aggregator Management, \\r\\nand Loan Repayment.\\r\\n•  Integrated payment gateway services and improved application performance through \\r\\nlazy loading, server-side pagination, and reusable component architecture.\\r\\n•  Partnered with QA, backend, and business teams during Agile sprints, production \\r\\ndeployments, UAT, and release cycles.\\r\\nKey Achievements: Modernized enterprise applications from Angular 13 to Angular 19; built \\r\\nreusable Angular libraries adopted across teams; Employee of the Month x3; Appreciation \\r\\nAward x2.\"}, {\"title\": \"Frontend Developer\", \"company\": \"Colan Infotech Pvt Ltd\", \"endDate\": \"Wed Apr 20\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Fri Feb 05\", \"description\": \"•  Built 15+ responsive web pages and reusable UI components using HTML5, CSS3, \\r\\nJavaScript, Bootstrap, and jQuery.\\r\\n•  Converted Figma designs into production-ready web interfaces, cutting design-to\\r\\ndeployment turnaround time.\\r\\n•  Created a reusable component library and integrated 10+ REST API endpoints across \\r\\nclient projects.\\r\\n•  Independently owned end-to-end front-end development for the Infogence project.\\r\\nEDUCATION\\r\\nMaster of Computer Applications \\r\\n(MCA)\\r\\nJain University, Bangalore\\r\\nBachelor of Computer Applications \\r\\n(BCA)\\r\\nBharath University of Arts and Science\\r\\nTECHNICAL SKILLS\\r\\nFrontend\\r\\nAngular (v13-v19)   •   TypeScript   •   \\r\\nJavaScript (ES6+)   •   HTML5   •   CSS3   •   \\r\\nSCSS   •   Angular Material   •   PrimeNG   • \\r\\nBootstrap   •   Tailwind CSS   •   RxJS   •   \\r\\nNgRx\\r\\nBackend\\r\\nNode.js   •   NestJS   •   Express.js   •   REST \\r\\nAPI Development   •   Feature Integration   \\r\\n•   Production Bug Fixing\\r\\nDatabase\\r\\nMongoDB\\r\\nAuth\\r\\nJWT Authentication   •   Role-Based Access \\r\\nControl (RBAC)\\r\\nArchitecture\\r\\nNative Federation   •   Angular Libraries   • \\r\\nMicro Frontends   •   Standalone \\r\\nComponents\\r\\nTools\\r\\nGit   •   GitHub   •   Azure DevOps   •   Jira   \\r\\n•   Postman   •   SonarQube   •   VS Code   • \\r\\nFigma   •   Adobe XD\\r\\nCORE EXPERTISE\\r\\n  ★Angular (v13-v19)\\r\\n  ★TypeScript & JavaScript (ES6+)\\r\\n  ★RxJS & NgRx\\r\\n  ★Standalone Components & Angular \\r\\nSignals\\r\\n  ★Native Federation (Micro Frontends)\\r\\n  ★Angular Material & PrimeNG\\r\\n  ★Responsive UI Development\\r\\n  ★REST API Integration\\r\\n  ★Reusable Component Architecture\\r\\n  ★Agile Scrum\\r\\nAWARDS & RECOGNITION\\r\\n•  Employee of the Month - 3 Times\\r\\n•  Appreciation Award - 2 Times\\r\\n•  Collaborated with backend developers and QA teams across 20+ Agile sprint cycles to \\r\\ndeliver high-quality applications.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2020\", \"degree\": \"MCA: Computer Application\", \"result\": \"63\", \"institution\": \"Jain University\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1785161088-421.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('eaf31a20-421e-4ec0-954d-cf2f567555bb','995b9caa-0ef9-4d13-8a9f-c405e2051ce8','Mysql DBA',NULL,'Mysql DBA',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','PUBLIC','2025-05-14 13:04:31.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"Mysql DBA\", \"company\": \"Spino Technologies Pvt.Ltd\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[]','[]