 Validators, Listeners.\\r\\n Responsible for end user issue resolution.\\r\\n Develop custom utilities to update life-cycle, views, type and \\r\\nattributes.\"}, {\"title\": \"Windchill Developer\", \"company\": \"ITC Infotech\", \"endDate\": \"Thu Mar 30\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Thu Jul 15\", \"description\": \" Understand the existing customization on the current version of \\r\\nthe Windchill.\\r\\n Developed custom RnD change process workflow templates, \\r\\nlife-cycle templates, type and attributes and OIR.\\r\\n Overall handled issues/tickets related to the application within \\r\\ndefined SLA at different levels (L1, L2, and L3). Involved and \\r\\ncontributed to activities like customer requirement analysis, \\r\\ndesign, deployment, configuration and validation.\\r\\n Responsible for Business Administration like Participants \\r\\nAdministration, Team Administration, Life cycle Administration, \\r\\nType and Attribute Management. Creation of Users, Groups, \\r\\nTeams, Roles and defining of access controls using Policy \\r\\nAdministration.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2019\", \"degree\": \"B. E. ( Mechanical ) Engineering\", \"result\": \"75\", \"institution\": \"ADCET Ashta, Sangli  (Shivaji University )\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1778612332-251.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('eb6ecb0e-2a30-4889-9b84-8b05b00923a0','89666856-cc31-4517-aa61-2bacb43564d8','IoT & IIoT Engineer with 6+ years of experience in designing, developing, supporting, and deploying \r\nedge-to-cloud industrial IoT solutions across manufacturing and mobility domains. Skilled in edge \r\ncomputing, software development, embedded systems, in','IoT & IIoT Engineer with 6+ years of experience in designing, developing, supporting, and deploying \r\nedge-to-cloud industrial IoT solutions across manufacturing and mobility domains. Skilled in edge \r\ncomputing, software development, embedded system