ate transformation for AR projection systems.\\r\\n5 Managed graphical object lifecycle and rendering synchronization.\\r\\n6 Developed SVG-based resource provider module for dynamic icon retrieval.\\r\\n7 Utilized STL containers (map, vector) for efficient resource management.\\r\\n8 Implemented caching mechanism to reduce disk access and improve response latency.\\r\\n9 Enhanced rendering throughput and runtime performance of AR HUD system.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2020\", \"degree\": \"Bachelor of Technology in Computer Science\", \"result\": \"68\", \"institution\": \"CMR College of Engineering and Technology\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1777393171-657.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('ebe1d2c0-bb7c-423a-8e5a-1ab239732ebe','792e6a82-2051-4aef-a53f-51d3d0c5d788','Software Developer',NULL,'Software Developer',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"CSS\", \"Django\", \"Django Rest Framework\", \"HTML\", \"Django Framework\", \"Sqlalchemy\", \"Python\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-14 17:00:51.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Developer\", \"company\": \"WebProby\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('ebe2f8e8-cbdb-4e74-932f-c5828007d975','3ee78e02-ddfc-4ab4-a3e7-98ea69076b1b','4 Years experienced Data Engineer specializing in designing and optimizing scalable data pipelines using Databricks, PySpark, and Apache\r\nSpark on the Azure platform. Skilled in building robust ETL/ELT\r\nworkflows leveraging Databricks Lakehouse architectu','4 Years experienced Data Engineer specializing in designing and optimizing scalable data pipelines using Databricks, PySpark, and Apache\r\nSpark on the Azure platform. Skilled in building robust ETL/ELT\r\nworkflows leveraging Databricks Lakehouse architecture, Delta Lake,\r\nand Unity Catalog for enterprise-grade data solutions. Proficient in\r\nimplementing medallion architecture, data modeling, and orchestrating workflows through Azure Data Factory and Databricks Workflows. Strong expertise in modern software development practices including Agile methodologies and Git-based version control. Experienced with Azure ecosystem including ADLS Gen2, Key Vault, and\r\nvarious databases (Azure SQL DB, Cosmos DB, PostgreSQL, Oracle). Committed to delivering high performance, secure, and GDPRcompliant data solutions that power actionable business intelligence\r\nthrough PowerBI analytics.','Data Engineer',2,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1776860165-476.pdf',NULL,'[\"Azure\", \"Data Modeling\", \"Github\", \"Python\", \"Pyspark\", \"MYSQL\", \"Data Migration\"]','PUBLIC','2026-04-22 23:44:57.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Data Engineer\", \"company\": \"PwC\", \"endDate\": \"Fri Apr 24\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Wed Jul 16\", \"description\": \"Migrated SAS analytics workflows to Databricks by converting SAS\\r\\nscripts to PySpark using the CORIOS conversion tool\\r\\n• Reviewed, updated, and optimized auto-generated PySpark code to\\r\\nmeet coding best practices and performance benchmarks\\r\\n• Validated functional parity between SAS and PySpark by conducting thorough output comparisons and reconciliation testing\\r\\n• Ensured data accuracy and consistency across migration by implementing systematic validation frameworks\\r\\n• Collaborated with cross-functional teams to integrate migrated\\r\\nworkflows into Databricks jobs for production deployment\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2017\", \"degree\": \"Computer Science\", \"result\": \"Yes\", \"institution\": \"AISSMS\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1776860165-476.pdf\", \"title\": \"cv\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('ebec53e8-6045-4eab-bf4c-d8556f43bf9e','87d186d8-5624-45c1-90eb-bd3a50635024','QMS Engineer',NULL,'QMS Engineer',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','PUBLIC','2025-05-13 19:38:47.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{