gree\": \"B.Tech\", \"result\": \"\", \"institution\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('ebfe2f27-359b-4c08-a033-69c8013ca5a9','b81f433c-0c93-4fed-ac40-82448096581d','Strong communicator with proven experience in client interactions, requirement\r\ngathering, functional-technical workshops, and preparation of detailed design\r\ndocuments.\r\n hands-on expertise in integrating SAP S/4HANA and ECC systems using SAP CPI and SA','Strong communicator with proven experience in client interactions, requirement\r\ngathering, functional-technical workshops, and preparation of detailed design\r\ndocuments.\r\n hands-on expertise in integrating SAP S/4HANA and ECC systems using SAP CPI and SAP\r\nCloud Connector to enable secure and seamless cloud-to-on-premise connectivity.\r\n Deep working knowledge of IDoc, SOAP, SFTP, OData, JMS, ProcessDirect, HTTP,\r\nSuccessFactors, and Mail adapters, covering both synchronous and asynchronous\r\nscenarios.\r\n Advanced skills in complex data transformations (XML ↔ JSON, XML ↔ CSV, JSON ↔\r\nXML) with Groovy scripting for dynamic processing, validations, enrichment, and custom\r\nbusiness logic automation.\r\n Well-versed in SAP CPI patterns including Content Modifier, Enricher, Splitter, Gather,\r\nMulticast, Message Mapping, Request-Reply, and robust handling of variables, headers,\r\nand properties.\r\n Strong understanding of security concepts—OAuth 2.0, SAML, SSH keys, Keystore\r\nmanagement, certificate handling, public/private key encryption, and secure credential\r\nstorage.\r\n Configured ALE/IDoc connectivity across SAP systems: created Logical Systems, RFC\r\nDestinations, Ports, Partner Profiles, and distribution models for fault-tolerant data\r\nexchange.\r\n Skilled in full-cycle testing—Unit, Integration, E2E, UAT—and proficient in CTS+\r\ntransport management for migrating CPI artifacts across landscapes.\r\n Worked closely with business and functional teams to perform production monitoring,\r\nroot-cause analysis, incident resolution, and L2/L3 support for critical integrations.\r\n Supported production deployments,system restarts, and failover activities during both\r\nplanned maintenance and emergency situations.','SAP CPI consultant',2,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1767344734-514.pdf',NULL,'[\"SAP\", \"SAP ABAP\", \"SAP PI\", \"SAP PO\", \"SAP Mm\", \"SAP BI\", \"SAP S4 HANA\", \"SAP Basis\", \"SAP PP\"]','PUBLIC','2026-01-02 21:26:26.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"SAP CPI consultant\", \"company\": \"CYNOSURE SOFTWARE PRIVATE LIMITED.\", \"endDate\": \"Wed Dec 03\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Thu Mar 07\", \"description\": \"Analyzed business processes related to manufacturing, supply chain, logistics, and plant\\r\\noperations, and designed integration solutions to support Delphi’s global facility transitions\\r\\nand system restructuring activities.\\r\\n Developed and enhanced SAP CPI interfaces to streamline data exchange across SAP\\r\\nECC/S/4HANA, warehouse management solutions, and third-party logistics (3PL) partners.\\r\\n Designed and implemented integration scenarios such as IDoc ↔File, Proxy ↔JDBC, SFTP\\r\\n↔SAP, and SOAP/REST-based interfaces supporting production planning, inventory\\r\\nmovement, material master updates, and order processing.\\r\\n Set up secure communication using SFTP, HTTPS, and certificate-based authentication to\\r\\nenable reliable connectivity with external vendors, suppliers, and legacy systems during\\r\\ntransition.\\r\\n Created reusable CPI artifacts including value mappings, content modifiers, exception\\r\\nsubprocesses, and Groovy scripts to improve reusability and reduce maintenance effort.\\r\\n Performed end-to-end testing (Unit, SIT, UAT) including mock data simulations for material\\r\\nmovement, order creation, shipment, and invoicing-related interfaces.\\r\\nInternal\\r\\n Monitored and resolved issues using CPI Web UI, PI Message Monitor, Runtime Workbench,\\r\\nand NWA; handled error analysis, payload corrections, retries, and system-level\\r\\ncommunication failures.\\r\\n Collaborated with functional consultants, manufacturing teams, network teams, and\\r\\nexternal vendors for requirement gathering, design discussions, and cutover planning.\\r\\n Prepared technical documentation, interface catalogs, and deployment instructions,\\r\\nensuring traceability and alignment with Delphi’s audit and compliance standards.\\r\\n Provided hypercare and production support, managing high-priority tickets, analyzing\\r\\nrecurring issues, implementing fixes, and ensuring minimal downtime for business-critical\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2017\", \"degree\": \"Computer Science\", \"result\": \"Yes\", \"institution\": \"Mallareddy college of Engineering\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1767344734-514.pdf\", \"title\": \"cv\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('ec049cd6-ca09-4772-ad82-bc47cc11b3e8','8b031605-0035-4558-a6a1-1afb99abd22b','MYSQL Database Administrator',NULL,'MYSQL Database Administrator',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Database\", \"SQL\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-14 13:04:32.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"MYSQL Database Administrator\", \"company\": \"Moreal infotech, Pune,Maharastra\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('ec06a61e-df10-4a66-a999-a92e319ce58e','22c49e77-2c91-47db-b5d1-3f4a073dccdd','Test Resume197','Test Resume197','Professional',1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','PUBLIC','2025-05-26 20:53:30.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[]','[{\"year\": \"\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech\", \"result\": \"\", \"institution\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('ec0b4533-16c5-4f18-973c-af5c4df289e1','3dcb37e7-29cc-4ced-94c4-d2ff6fcce332','Test Resume154','Test Resume154','Software Deve',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\".NET\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-26 17:25:53.000000','2026-10-21 0