pdf',NULL,'[\"SCADA\"]','PUBLIC','2026-09-24 18:24:32.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Automation & Sales Proposal Engineer\", \"company\": \"“Electronic Instrumentation & Control Pvt. Ltd”\", \"endDate\": \"Wed Dec 05\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Thu Jan 07\", \"description\": \"Job work & Responsibility:  - Factory Acceptance Test & commission of control panel for various automation projects on factory floor. - Internal Test Report, Inspection Test Report, Factory Acceptance Test Report and third-party inspection reports of control Panel. - Visited many sites for commissioning of project and problem troubleshooting, data communication and HMI graphics updating.  - Drawing up the electrical wiring of power and control instruments in AutoCAD-Electrical software.  - Had done projects with Engineering India Limited (EIL), Technip India consultant. - Attended inquiries and provided technical quotation with bills of material to customer for both hazardous & safe area application. After getting approval from customer end, commercial offer with terms shared. - Visited sites for commissioning: (1) Bharat Petroleum Corporation Limited (Mahul, Mumbai), (2) Reliance Industries Limited (Patalganga, New-Mumbai), (3) National Thermal Power Corporation -NTPC (Barh, Bihar), (4) SRF Limited Chemical Plant (Dahej, Gujarat), and many others for the Oil & Gas sector for the compressor commissioning.\"}, {\"title\": \"Application Engineer\", \"company\": \"“Alteem Instruments”\", \"endDate\": \"Fri Apr 09\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Thu Jan 03\", \"description\": \"Job work & Responsibility:  - Automation of machines like Rotogravure, Slitting & Solvent base/less. - Developing the application of printing machines and continuous updating graphics of human interface machine (HMI). - Calibration of instruments like loadcells and ultrasonics sensors. - PLC programming & designing of SCADA/HMI graphics and their tagging according to the applica