 the kernel parameters in Linux Systems. \r\n Upgrading and downgrading kernel and OS upgrading. \r\n Patches updating from Red Hat Subscription. \r\n Performa',' Around 1+ years of work experience as Linux Admin. \r\n Installation, troubleshooting and changing the kernel parameters in Linux Systems. \r\n Upgrading and downgrading kernel and OS upgrading. \r\n Patches updating from Red Hat Subscription. \r\n Performance & Capacity management using monitoring tools. \r\n Technical support for in-house programmers. \r\n Remote Server Administration and Troubleshooting in Linux. \r\n Installation and configuration of third-party packages. \r\n Write/debug shell programs for cron, security checking, backup, etc. \r\n Experience in trouble shooting and performance tuning. \r\n Managed users, groups, and ftp accounts, permissions and security for clients. \r\n Handling Linux Based Networking, Web server, FTP server, DNS server, Samba Server, \r\nDHCP server, NFS server, NIS server, \r\n Creation of file systems and checking the NFS auto mount file systems functionality. \r\n Installation, upgradation and troubleshooting of Linux. \r\n Managing and resolving server and user level issues. \r\n Securing and managing network with firewall &iptables, creating rules to filter traffic \r\n Maintaining better Co – ordination between the team members. \r\n Good knowledge of identifying and solving problems and enjoy working in a team.','Linux Admin(L1)',2,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1763913788-424.pdf',NULL,'[\"IP Routing\", \"DNS\", \"DHCP\", \"Linux\", \"TCP\", \"SSH\"]','PUBLIC','2025-11-24 04:24:27.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Linux Admin(L1)\", \"company\": \"Microland  ltd\", \"endDate\": \"Thu Nov 20\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Thu Feb 15\", \"description\": \" Installation, Configuration and Maintenance of VMware Server and Virtual Machines. \\r\\n Creating volumes and managing file system using Logical Volume Manager (LVM). \\r\\n File System administration (creating and increasing file systems). \\r\\n File System capacity management and integrity checking. \\r\\n User and group administration. \\r\\n Configuring crontab and scheduling the jobs. \\r\\n Implementing disk quotas and ACL’s for users. \\r\\n Editing configuration and other files using editors like vi and vim. \\r\\n Network configuration and virtual network interface setup on serers. \\r\\n Providing sudo access to the users and configuring aliases. \\r\\n Installing of software packages and patches. \\r\\n Troubleshooting boot process issues. \\r\\n Backup and recovery using tools like tar and dump. \\r\\n Configuring File sharing services like NFS. \\r\\n Installation, Configuration and Administration of various versions of Redhat Linux \\r\\n Configuring and Maintaining DHCP Server, NIS Server, NFS Server, FTP Server and \\r\\nClients. Kernel installing and fine tuning \\r\\n Remote system administration using tools like SSH, Telnet, and Rlogin. \\r\\n Planning and implementing system upgrades including hardware, operating system and \\r\\n Installation, configuration and administration of VMware. \\r\\n Experience in Using YUM Repository. \\r\\n Monitoring & regularly taking back up of the server data. \\r\\n Installation and Management of various Open source Software’s. \\r\\n Use of LVM for dynamically extending and reducing partitions. \\r\\n Monitored hardware and software functionality 24/7 to ensure their connectivity and \\r\\navailability. \\r\\n Managed users and groups, File/Directory Permissions under Linux \\r\\n Installation of Application like Apache Web server, MS IIS, Oracle. \\r\\n Troubleshooting ADS, DNS, DHCP server & clients, Monitoring & Troubleshooting Domain \\r\\nrelated issues. \\r\\n NFS server configuration and maintenance. \\r\\n Use of LVM for dynamically extending and reducing partitions. \\r\\n Experience in Using YUM Repository. \\r\\n Monitoring & regularly taking backup of the server data.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2024\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech (EEE)\", \"result\": \"65\", \"institution\": \"JNTUA\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1763913788-424.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('ecbea111-0a4e-4f41-bc83-b0b057b830c9','6e3efc04-740c-4361-874a-bd01a96a271e','Dedicated IT professional with 3.6 years of experience in Mainframe application development and support\r\n seeking assignments in Software development /Management with an organization with high repute.','Dedicated IT professional with 3.6 years of experience in Mainframe application development and support\r\n seeking assignments in Software development /Management with an organization with high repute.','COBOL Specialist',1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"COBOL\", \"IMS (IP Multimedia Subsystem)\", \"Change Management\", \"SQL\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-06 08:16:01.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('ecbee026-c59e-4343-af53-175338b1d9b5','0012dbbc-1ada-4d81-a9e4-aa63c0e8dc52','Full Stack Developer',NULL,'Full Stack Developer',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"CSS\", \"JavaScript\", \"Java IDE\", \"HTML\", \"Bootstrap\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-15 03:19:52.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"Full Stack Developer\", \"company\": \"QSpiders Global\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('ecc69043-969b-4ae7-aae2-782cd472526b','aabaf0ae-bb6f-4753-b82f-18674a556236','Test Resume429','Test Resume429','Software Deve',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Azure\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-24 21:28:46.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Deve\", \"company\": \"TCS\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[{\"year\": \"\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech\", \"result\": \"\", \"institution\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NUL