l, and manufacturing domains. Currently driving data visualization and KPI reporting initiatives at a ','Results driven Power BI Developer with 4.5+ years of experience building scalable BI solutions and interactive dashboards across sales,\r\nmarketing, retail, and manufacturing domains. Currently driving data visualization and KPI reporting initiatives at a fast-growing EB1A\r\nfocused startup, and previously delivered enterprise-grade BI projects at TCS for global clients. Skilled in Power BI (Desktop, Pro, Service),\r\nSQL, DAX, data modelling, and Azure-based data integration. Adept at transforming complex datasets into actionable insights that\r\naccelerate decision-making and business growth. Certified in Power BI (PL-300), Azure Fundamentals (AZ-900), and Azure Administrator (AZ104).','Power Bi Developer',4,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1772712124-942.pdf',NULL,'[\"ETL\", \"Azure\", \"KPI Analysis\", \"KPI Measurement\", \"Power BI\", \"SQL\"]','PUBLIC','2026-03-06 00:30:54.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Power Bi Developer\", \"company\": \"Ithaca Technologies\", \"endDate\": \"Tue Mar 24\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Wed Mar 12\", \"description\": \"Currently working as a Power BI Developer to accelerate growth and strategic decision-making for a startup focused on providing Visa\\r\\nservices to professionals working in US. My role involves closely collaborating with the Sales and Marketing teams to design and develop\\r\\ninteractive Power BI dashboards that provide real-time visibility into key performance metrics such as lead conversion rates, campaign\\r\\nROI, customer engagement, and revenue trends and also to identify high-potential EB1A candidates, optimize outreach strategies, and\\r\\nallocate resources more effectively. These dashboards have become a central decision-making tool for leadership, helping to boost\\r\\nqualified lead conversions, streamline sales efforts, and enhance marketing efficiency.\"}, {\"title\