s make faster, data-driven decisions that improved performance and efficiency.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2021\", \"degree\": \"Electronics\", \"result\": \"Yes\", \"institution\": \"Vignan’s Institute of Information Technology,\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1772712124-942.pdf\", \"title\": \"cv\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('eced3de4-0322-4f5f-a3ee-9cb5ece25f38','a8e0fe9f-b822-4709-950b-0562a4fd8ee8','Test Resume152','Test Resume152','Software Deve',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Guidewire Automation Testing\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-25 20:23:00.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Deve\", \"company\": \"Accenture\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[{\"year\": \"\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech\", \"result\": \"\", \"institution\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('eced5135-a9d0-447f-bea8-9dd4102ffb1d','58e3fbf4-4391-4dc1-817c-bb0f4bdffa8d','Test Resume795','Test Resume795','Software Deve',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"ASP.NET\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-26 09:45:50.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Deve\", \"company\": \"Mphasis\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[{\"year\": \"\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech\", \"result\": \"\", \"institution\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('ecf612f7-0a79-4abb-879a-9791623fdf06','b35d0a18-c2ab-47b5-b091-bbe67aa028d0','C++ Developer',NULL,'C++ Developer',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"C++\", \"UNIX\", \"C\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-16 11:13:30.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"C++ Developer\", \"company\": \"Micro Focus\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('ecf63493-e066-4d4a-b762-65da678bd1ab','6982ad1e-fa2e-46fc-a059-12789695878a','Dedicated and results-driven Java Developer with a Master\'s in Technology from Nagpur