.\\r\\n• Orchestrated Databricks/Notebook activities to convert data from Parquet to\\r\\nDelta format, enabling ACID transactions and faster reads.\\r\\n• Developed separate ingestion pipelines for file-based data, handling multiple\\r\\nformats and automating schema handling.\\r\\n• Designed application-specific ETL pipelines to apply complex business\\r\\ntransformations and load curated data into the Governed layer.\\r\\n• Loaded transformed data into Azure Synapse Analytics / Data Warehouse for\\r\\nenterprise reporting.\\r\\n• Optimized pipeline performance using parallel processing, partitioning, and\\r\\nincremental data loads.\\r\\n• Designed incremental load (CDC-based / watermark-based) pipelines to\\r\\nhandle large-scale data efficiently.\\r\\n• Implemented Unity Catalog-based governance mod\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2021\", \"degree\": \"Computer Science\", \"result\": \"Yes\", \"institution\": \"Jayawantrao Sawant College\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1776249470-598.pdf\", \"title\": \"cv\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('eeda0488-b0da-41f6-afc5-cd58f53eea48','2f618b17-f468-45a6-92bb-8d73c2349d71','Operations leader with a proven record of shaping DAU, user engagement, data annotation, content moderation, and\r\nuser feedback ecosystemsfor leading app platforms. Trusted to build teams, processes and frameworks that transformed\r\nDailyhunt and Josh into','Operations leader with a proven record of shaping DAU, user engagement, data annotation, content moderation, and\r\nuser feedback ecosystemsfor leading app platforms. Trusted to build teams, processes and frameworks that transformed\r\nDailyhunt and Josh into top consumer apps. Partnered with agencies and cross-functional teams to design scalable\r\nsystems, safeguard trust, and strengthen compliance. Recognized for combining editorial strategy with platform\r\ngovernance, delivering strategic vendor savings while elevating user experience, user engagement and user retention\r\nacross diverse audiences','Dy Director - User Engagement & Data Annotation',4,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1767617833-754.pdf',NULL,'[\"Data Analytics\", \"Content\", \"Content Management\", \"User Administration\", \"Vendor\", \"Vendor Management\", \"Vendor Coordination\", \"Stakeholder Communication\"]','PUBLIC','2026-01-06 01:24:36.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Dy Director - User Engagement & Data Annotation\", \"company\": \"Eterno Infotech Pvt Ltd (Josh & Dailyhunt\", \"endDate\": \"Thu Aug 21\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Wed Aug 11\", \"description\": \"• Entrusted with dual mandate across Josh and Dailyhunt, later focusing exclusively on Josh, leading teams &\\r\\nsystems for user engagement and retention, data annotation, content moderation, and user feedback\\r\\n• Strategized data annotation of 2.4+ lakh daily video uploads, applying a 36 different tags and labels with\\r\\ndescriptive metadata to make it understandable and usable for machine learning (ML) models\\r\\n• Directed content moderation of the video contents to safeguard app’s content quality and compliance\\r\\n• Negotiated with 3 external agencies, driving vendor savings while sustaining content throughput & reliability\\r\\n• Simplified workflows with new SOPs and review tiers, cutting process effort by nearly 60% and improving team’s\\r\\nwell-being during high-volume moderation\\r\\n• Oversaw user feedback resolution, raising CSAT from 64% to 96% by ensuring timely ticket closure and channeling\\r\\ninsights back to product and partnership teams\\r\\n• Partnered with product, engineering and marketing teams to define user engagement campaigns, driving steady\\r\\nYoY DAU engagement gains of 9–12%\\r\\n• Supported Dailyhunt’s expansion into MENA region, adapting content playbooks to local sensitivities and ensuring\\r\\nsmooth coordination with remote teams\"}, {\"title\": \"Associate Director\", \"company\": \"Verse Innovation Pvt. Ltd. (Da