n explore, compare price and book a wide range of services catering to their travels needs.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2021\", \"degree\": \"Mechanical Engineering\", \"result\": \"Yes\", \"institution\": \"Amravati University\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1767961370-914.pdf\", \"title\": \"cv\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('efba5495-03aa-4101-bd85-b5fd1c9b98ab','889afd70-441d-4d05-9cde-55f37a92abbd','Test Resume325','Test Resume325','Software Deve',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Mainframe\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-25 17:37:45.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Deve\", \"company\": \"Capgemini\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[{\"year\": \"\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech\", \"result\": \"\", \"institution\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('efc8974a-e61d-4f0f-8dd3-8359bb5a4158','c7548518-6448-49fc-93d6-b02f6b717c40','Results-driven consulting professional with extensive experience in upstream, midstream, downstream, finance and  \r\nminerals industries with a proven track record of successful implementation in oil and gas practices and process optimization \r\nprocesses.','Results-driven consulting professional with extensive experience in upstream, midstream, downstream, finance and  \r\nminerals industries with a proven track record of successful implementation in oil and gas practices and process optimization \r\nprocesses.','ENERGY CONSULTANT',6,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1782744671-960.pdf',NULL,'[\"SAS\", \"Python\", \"SQL\", \"Tableau\", \"Power BI\"]','PUBLIC','2026-06-30 02:19:03.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"ENERGY CONSULTANT\", \"company\": \"INSPIRA ENTERPRISE\", \"endDate\": \"Sat Jun 20\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Fri Feb 10\", \"description\": \"Experienced Business Analysist & Solutions Architect with a proven track record of successfully driving \\r\\ncomplex digital transformation initiatives across the energy sector. Proven ability to translate client business \\r\\nneeds into innovative and impactful technology solutions, while effectively managing stakeholder and customer \\r\\nrelationships. Expertise in leading the design and implementation of an 8-block asset management automation \\r\\nproject for OQ Oman, demonstrating strong project management and solution delivery capabilities. Successfully \\r\\nconceptualized AI/ML-powered solutions for Gas Foam detection in upstream and midstream operations for \\r\\nADNOC, showcasing expertise in advanced analytics and predictive modeling. Contributed to regulatory \\r\\ncompliance by developing policies and procedures for Zatca\'s risk analytics platform. Deep understanding of \\r\\nupstream oil & gas operations, having delivered critical projects for ONGC India, including the development of an \\r\\ninventory platform, Stuck Pipe detection systems, and Reservoir Top-Down Modeling. Proven ability to lead project \\r\\nlifecycle from inception to completion, including the development of Business Requirement Documents (BRDs) and \\r\\nStatements of Work (SOWs), gathering and analyzing requirements, designing and validating solutions, and \\r\\nensuring successful project delivery. Strong analytical and problem-solving skills with a focus on client satisfaction \\r\\nand achieving business outcomes.\"}, {\"title\": \"ENERGY CONSULTANT & ANALYST\", \"company\": \"NUPEAK IT SOLUTIONS\", \"endDate\": \"Fri Feb 10\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Wed May 05\", \"description\": \"Results-oriented Consultant & Analyst with a proven track record of delivering impactful digital \\r\\ntransformation projects within the energy sector. Successfully led the conceptualization and implementation of \\r\\na critical gas pipeline reconciliation and leak detection system for GAIL India, encompassing a 17,500 km network. \\r\\nThis project, incorporating AI/ML for gas pressure wave prediction, significantly enhanced operational efficiency \\r\\nand safety. Demonstrated expertise in data integration, working extensively with SCADA and OFM systems and \\r\\nOPC connections. Furthermore, spearheaded the development of an asset health monitoring system for NRL, \\r\\nencompassing over 200 assets across the entire refinery. Possesses strong project management and leadership \\r\\nskills, adept at developing comprehensive Business Requirements Documents (BRDs) and detailed Statements of \\r\\nWork (SOWs), effectively gathering and analyzing stakeholder needs, fostering strong customer and stakeholder \\r\\nengagement, and ensuring successful project delivery.\"}, {\"title\": \"ENERGY ANALYST\", \"company\": \"GEOLOGIX LIMITED\", \"endDate\": \"Tue Feb 28\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Fri Jan 10\", \"description\": \"Highly motivated and results-oriented Business Analyst with a proven track record of delivering innovative \\r\\nAI/ML solutions. Successfully developed a real-time object detection and size estimation platform for oil rig drill \\r\\ncuttings, leveraging a custom TensorFlow-based network and OpenCV for accurate classification and dimensional \\r\\nanalysis. This solution minimized human error and optimized operational efficiency. Demonstrated expertise in \\r\\ndesigning and developing scalable applications, including cloud deployments on DJango. Proven ability to \\r\\neffectively collaborate with cross-functional teams, including software development and testing, to gather and \\r\\nanalyze requirements, define project scope, and ensure successful project delivery while meeting client needs and \\r\\neffectively managing stakeholder expectations.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2017\", \"degree\": \"MASTER OF SCIENCE – ENERGY MANAGEMENT\", \"result\": \"63.3\", \"institution\": \"UNIVERSITY OF TEXAS\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1782744671-960.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('efd6426d-6b53-4782-b0