ing good relationship with clients to extract\\r\\nmore business and SaaS renewals.\\r\\n Making and implementing BrewSight business & marketing strategies.\\r\\n Making content for solutions and presentation for different use cases.\\r\\n Coordinating with the partner companies and cross-functional teams to design and\\r\\ndevelop end-to-end solution for the customer.\\r\\n Overviewing the project execution and development team to deliver the outcome on\\r\\ntime.\\r\\n Coordinating with data science team in their activity of generating use cases for\\r\\npredictive and prescriptive insights using Data analytics, ML/AI\\r\\n Post sales, overviewing customer support and resolving issues if any arises\"}, {\"title\": \"Sr. Engineer (Marketing)\", \"company\": \"Static Earthing Solutions Pvt. Ltd\", \"endDate\": \"Tue Oct 24\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Fri Aug 07\", \"description\": \" Responsible for revenue generation and business development via selling Newson Gale\\r\\nmake products to various targeted industries and sectors.\\r\\n Responsible for pre-sales, product presentation and demonstration.\\r\\n Conducting site visit to suggest them better product and solution for static earthing.\\r\\n Suggesting them solutions by giving brief technical details according to the\\r\\nInternational standards.\\r\\n Submitting techno-commercial offer, negotiating price, sales terms and conditions.\\r\\n Coordinating with data science team Making marketing plan/strategy to achieve my\\r\\nyearly target as well as company’s\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2020\", \"degree\": \"PGDBM\", \"result\": \"Yes\", \"institution\": \"The Maharaja Sayajirao University of Baroda, Vadodara\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1764767273-729.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('f1819c72-2b35-4082-ae69-4d24bab74bd7','9c611bdc-bc1a-4f30-90b6-4b679491451e','Helathcare ,non voice process, claims,adjustment',NULL,'Helathcar