th Selenium Strong in SDLC, STLC, Proficiency \r\nin Agile Sprint.\r\n Hands on Experience of different types of testing like Sanity, GUI, Functional Testing, Re-Testing, \r\nRegression Testing, Globalization Testing and Database Testing, Browser Compatibility Testing.\r\n Hands on experience of handling I frames, Mouse hover actions, Popups and List Box using Action Class \r\nand Select Class.\r\n Experience in Build Management Tool which is Maven for the Data Driven Framework.\r\n Automated all Functional and Regression scenarios using Selenium WebDriver.\r\n Automated all Functional and Regression scenarios using Postman.\r\n Hands on experience of CURD & API Testing using POSTMAN tool.\r\n Experience in Creating Mock Test data for System Testing, UAT, and regression testing.\r\n Strong understanding of Java & OOPS concepts, Arrays, Collection.\r\n Performed Tester activities for Manual as well as Automation testing execute, maintain & enhance the \r\nexisting new Automation test suite.\r\n Skilled in Test Planning, Test Case Design, Execution, and Defect Management.\r\n Conducted API Testing with Postman optimizing response validation accuracy by 35%.\r\n Hands-on experience in Database Testing (SQL Server 2014).\r\n Proficient in JIRA effectively managing defects','Software Test Engineer',4,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1786118214-57.pdf',NULL,'[\"Automation Testing\", \"Java\", \"JavaScript\", \"JIRA\", \"Manual Testing\", \"Regression\", \"Selenium\", \"API testing\", \"Playwright\", \"Postman\", \"Selenium\", \"Pom (Project Object Model)\"]','PUBLIC','2026-08-08 03:23:46.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Test Engineer\", \"company\": \"Accenture\", \"endDate\": \"Sat Aug 15\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Mon Sep 15\", \"description\": \" Tested a web-based Insurance Management application supporting end-to-end insurance workflows \\r\\nincluding customer registration, policy creation, premium calc