eraging \\r\\nLangGraph, OCR, OpenSearch indexing, Anthropic, Gemini and LLMs to autonomously process and validate \\r\\nhealthcare claims against hospital tariff structures, enabling scalable anomaly detection and enhanced operational \\r\\nefficiency. The system orchestrated intelligent AI Agents for document parsing, claim identification, and anomaly \\r\\ndetection, enabling scalable claim fraud detection and significantly enhancing operational efficiency in healthcare billing \\r\\nworkflows. \\r\\nConversational Voicebot - Designed and deployed a conversational voicebot using GPT real-time models and Chainlit \\r\\nto automate outbound calls for policy renewal reminders and customer engagement. Integrated Speech-to-Text (STT) and \\r\\nText-to-Speech (TTS) pipelines for fluid, human-like interactions. The system dynamically interpreted user responses, \\r\\nhandled multi-turn dialogues, and provided personalized policy information using LLM-driven context management. \\r\\nLeveraged tools such as Whisper, Chainlit, Docker, GPT-4 to orchestrate scalable, event-driven workflows for proactive \\r\\ncustomer outreach.\"}, {\"title\": \"Data Scientist\", \"company\": \"ATOS\", \"endDate\": \"Sat Sep 30\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Sun Oct 10\", \"description\": \"Led the development of an automated ticket categorization system for ServiceNow using Natural Language Processing \\r\\n(NLP), word embeddings (Word2Vec), and a combination of machine learning and deep learning techniques. \\r\\nDeployed scalable pipelines on AWS with integrated MLOps for continuous training and monitoring. The solution \\r\\nsignificantly improved ticket routing accuracy, operational efficiency, and response time—achieving a 24% increase in \\r\\nclassification accuracy compared to the baseline system. \\r\\nDeveloped an Advanced Semantic Analysis Tool to analyze customer reviews and provide actionable insights into \\r\\ncustomer satisfaction using GPT3, NLP, API integration, semantic analysis \\r\\nDelivered predictive models for customer churn using various machine learning algorithms. Designed and trained models \\r\\nto identify at-risk customers, enabling proactive retention strategies and improving customer lifetime value. \\r\\nApplied statistical analysis, time series modeling, Bayesian inference, natural language processing (NLP), and \\r\\nmachine learning techniques to large-scale datasets for data mining and feature engineering. Developed robust analytical \\r\\npipelines to extract actionable insights, enhance model performance, and support downstream predictive tasks across \\r\\ndiverse business domains.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2019\", \"degree\": \"MTech (Data Science and Analytics)\", \"result\": \"68\", \"institution\": \"MIT Pune\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1778528591-171.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('f396977c-e101-439e-8b76-4cadaef7e2ff','39b6880c-39f8-4759-bb2c-2fca9ae059bf','Specialized in SAP MM, SRM, WM, Master Data Management with proven expertise \r\nin MDG end-user training and consulting. Skilled in ABAP debugging, BAPIs, \r\nFunction Modules, and integration through Postman and APIs','Specialized in SAP MM, SRM, WM, Master Data Management with proven expertise \r\nin MDG end-user training and consulting. Skilled in ABAP debugging, BAPIs, \r\nFunction Modules, and integration through Postman and APIs','SAP Integration Specialist',1,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1775444187-71.pdf',NULL,'[\"SAP Integration\", \"SAP S4 HANA\", \"SAP Mm\", \"ITSM\", \"Test Scripts\"]','PUBLIC','2026-04-06 14:11:52.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[]','[{\"year\": \"2017\", \"degree\": \"Masters in computer application\", \"result\": \"72\", \"institution\": \"Techno Main Salt Lake\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1775444187-71.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('f39a8ba4-81e9-49fc-8503-2f72c1d0dc1