ent System (DMS). \\r\\n• Supported analytical testing for biopharmaceutical molecules: Therapeutic Proteins and Monoclonal Antibodies \\r\\n(mAbs). \\r\\n• Executed Analytical Method Validation for biochemical and protein characterization methods \\r\\n• Performed routine and stability testing of Drug Substance (DS), Drug Product (DP), and stability samples using \\r\\nSDS-PAGE, Western Blot, and Capillary Zone Electrophoresis (CZE). \\r\\n• Conducted method validation and qualification for Monoclonal Antibodies using CE-SDS and SDS-PAGE, \\r\\nincluding specificity, precision, accuracy, and robustness assessments. \\r\\n• Managed incident reporting, deviation handling, and root cause investigations within the biochemical \\r\\ndepartment, ensuring timely closure and CAPA implementation in compliance with GMP and Quality Systems. \\r\\n• Proven capability to handle parallel LIMS and analytical laboratory tasks, coordinating across QC, and Quality \\r\\nteams.\"}, {\"title\": \"Analytical development and Product characterization.\", \"company\": \"BioGenomics\", \"endDate\": \"Tue Dec 15\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Mon Jun 10\", \"description\": \"• Handled instruments like HPLC, UV Visible Spectroscopy and CE instrument. \\r\\n• Performed protein characterization and purity analysis using Capillary Zone Electrophoresis (CZE). \\r\\n• Developed and optimized analytical methods for biosimilar characterization using Capillary Isoelectric Focusing \\r\\n(cIEF)\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2016\", \"degree\": \"M.Sc. Bioanalytical science\", \"result\": \"68\", \"institution\": \"University of Mumbai\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1768494583-639.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('f4596b57-cbb8-49b1-8d65-9a3634ae93c4','9dbca6b7-4498-400d-94b3-a067f388ea78','CEO-Education & Placement',NULL,'CEO-Education & Placement',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','PUBLIC','2025-05-16 10:34:48.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.00000