ed complex Tableau workbooks, including layered LOD calculations and nested \\r\\ntable calculations. \\r\\n Recreated advanced KPI logic, trend analysis, forecasting visuals, and drill-down hierarchies in \\r\\nPower BI. \\r\\n Built optimized star-schema data models to improve report refresh time and reduce memory usage. \\r\\n Used Power Query to clean, transform, and standardize raw data before loading into the model. \\r\\n Created reusable DAX measure templates for calculations such as YoY, MoM, Rolling Averages, \\r\\nand Variance Analysis. \\r\\n Implemented incremental refresh to reduce dataset size and improve gateway performance. \\r\\n Designed custom tooltips, bookmarks, page navigation, and conditional formatting for improved \\r\\nUI/UX. \\r\\n Conducted requirement-gathering sessions with business stakeholders to map Tableau KPIs to Power \\r\\nBI outputs. \\r\\n Identified logic gaps and data inconsistencies between Tableau and Power BI, and coordinated with \\r\\ndata engineering teams to resolve them. \\r\\n Worked with QA teams to complete test case validation, visual accuracy checks, and performance \\r\\nbenchmarking. \\r\\n Prepared documentation covering dashboard logic, data source mapping, DAX calculations, and \\r\\nmigration guidelines. \\r\\n Automated data loading by configuring Power BI Gateway for scheduled refresh. \\r\\n Provided training sessions and walk-throughs to business users transitioning from Tableau to Power \\r\\nBI. \\r\\n Reduced number of visuals and optimized layout to meet Power BI best practices.\"}, {\"title\": \"Power BI Developer\", \"company\": \"Bhavan Software India (P) Ltd.\", \"endDate\": \"Fri Apr 04\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Wed Jan 18\", \"description\": \" Imported data from MS SQL Database views using Direct Mode connection and created filter parameters to \\r\\ncustomize data for specific years in Power Query. \\r\\n Created new DAX measures for the Company Stats Report for the Client\'s Schematic Model, validated the goal \\r\\namount with client data and DAX logic. \\r\\n Requirement gathering the main aim of developing this automation retail management system is to bring the \\r\\ncustomers into the store and fulfil their buying needs. \\r\\n Implemented grouping in the model based on club names and regions to meet client mapping requirements. \\r\\n Created sample reports with Analysed excel data-sets and gave overview to client. \\r\\n Write SQL quires based on tables and created views. \\r\\n Developed the Payroll Report comprising Commission, PT Commission, Supplementary Commission, \\r\\nMembership Commission, PT Event Hour, Membership Join Bonus, PT Event Hour with Rates tabs based on \\r\\nclient calls attendance and gathering requirements. \\r\\n Designed a Paginated Report for the Sales Leader Tab in the Company Stats Report to export employee data \\r\\nwith specific requirements including conditional formatting, in Excel, CSV, and PDF formats. \\r\\n Currently engaged in migrating the V8 version schematic models into Synapse Views and validating the \\r\\nreports. \\r\\n Optimizing the performance tuning of the Schematic Power BI Huge models, around 4 GB in size, by using the \\r\\nBravo Tool and reducing it to 1 GB to achieve better performance\"}, {\"title\": \"Power BI Developer\", \"company\": \"Adani Groups\", \"endDate\": \"Tue Dec 20\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Thu Dec 12\", \"description\": \"  Imported data from SQL Server DB to Power BI to generate reports. \\r\\n Involved created required Measures and Calculated Columns using DAX.  \\r\\n Generated computed tables in Power BI by using DAX.  \\r\\n Involved in working on Dax Functions like Date and Time Function, information Function, filter \\r\\nLogical, and Text.  \\r\\n Published Power BI Reports to the APP Workspace and created the APPs for the Users to consume \\r\\nthe developed reports.  \\r\\n  Implemented RLS (Row Level Security) for the Reports. Hierarchy level, page level and visual level.  \\r\\n Installed and Configured Power BI Gateways to keep the dashboards and reports up to date by \\r\\nscheduling them.  \\r\\n Published reports and dashboards using Power BI. \\r\\n As per the Client requirements developed the reports in the form of Matrix, Table, Drill Through, and \\r\\nInvolved in unit testing.  \\r\\n Design the different types of Dashboards using Power BI visualizations (Charts, Bubbles Maps, Tree \\r\\nMap, Slicer, and KPI)  \\r\\n Good understanding of SQL concepts like Grouping, Sub Queries, Functions, etc. \\r\\n  Involved in creating the groups and Content Packs in Power BI  \\r\\n Using Power BI Gateways for manual refresh and automatic refresh.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2017\", \"degree\": \"B.com (Bachelor of Commerce)\", \"result\": \"63\", \"institution\": \"Sri Venkateshwara University\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1773689853-976.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('fbc020d8-b97b-4d80-abc5-c1fa12d0dff1','d53259a0-4998-484e-a28d-c7293fd368fe','Having 1.2 years of experience in designing and developing enterprise applications and products using core \r\njava, Spring, Spring Boot, Microservices, RESTful Web services, Spring MVC, JIRA, Agile Methodology, \r\nHibernate and Junit. Skilled in Database ap','Having 1.2 years of experience in designing and developing enterprise applications and products using core \r\njava, Spring, Spring Boot, Microservices, RESTful Web services, Spring MVC, JIRA, Agile Methodology, \r\nHibernate and Junit. Skilled in Database application development, application Maintenance and bug fixing.','Software Engineer',2,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1757667037-484.pdf',NULL,'[\"Core Java\", \"Java 8+\", \"Hibernate\", \"APACHE TOMCAT\", \"Eclipse\", \"JIRA\", \"RESTFUL\", \"Spring\", \"Spring Boot\", \"Spring Boot Microservices\", \"MYSQL\", \"Postman\", \"Windows 10\", \"Windows XP\"]','PUBLIC','2025-09-12 08:36:39.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Engineer\", \"company\": \"Capgemini\", \"endDate\": \"Thu Feb 09\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Wed Jan 26\", \"description\": \"Description : The Auto Account Loading functionality (AAL) was introduced in the UK in 2016/2017. The \\r\\nsolution was built for BIB to HSBC Group Net migration and utilized real time account loading combined \\r\\nwith real time entitlements. \\r\\nDuring a live scenarios where the customer was utilized AAL, the client also had auto entitlements enabled \\r\\nwhich meant that AAR was also making sure the user entitlements were set up for each user, account and service. \\r\\nThis created heavy load on the Mainframe CICS Regions and impacted the HSBC Group Net Service. To, \\r\\naddress this issue, the online auto account loading functionality was removed, and a MF batch functionality was \\r\\nadded to support auto account loading and demised online AAL flow. The Technology used was Java 7.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2021\", \"degree\": \"Bachelors of Engineering\", \"result\": \"73\", \"institution\": \"MGI-COET\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1757667037-484.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('fbc28f05-6a8c-40ed-9e42-a64358af6e1e','605bc831-247e-47d8-bb7e-d1d6fdaf9e44','DevOps Engineer with 4 years of experience in AWS cloud infrastructure, CI/CD automation, Kubernetes \r\norchestration, and Infrastructure as Code (IaC). Skilled in Jenkins, GitHub Actions, Docker, Terraform, and AWS \r\nEKS for deploying scalable and secure ','DevOps Engineer with 4 years of experience in AWS cloud infrastructure, CI/CD automation, Kubernetes \r\norchestration, and Infrastructure as Code (IaC). Skilled in Jenkins, GitHub Actions, Docker, Terraform, and AWS \r\nEKS for deploying scalable and secure applications. Experienced in implementing blue-green and canary \r\ndeployments, monitorin