er-reviewed deployments. \\r\\n• Optimized Kubernetes cluster resource utilization, improving application performance and reducing \\r\\ninfrastructure costs. \\r\\n• Performed AWS cost optimization by right-sizing EC2 instances, configuring Auto Scaling Groups, and \\r\\nmonitoring utilization metrics using CloudWatch.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2021\", \"degree\": \"Bachelor of Technology (Computer Science & Engineering)\", \"result\": \"8.0\", \"institution\": \"MGVR Engineering College\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1784836069-33.pdf\", \"title\": \"CV\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('fbc8b2d0-ed3f-41c2-b9c7-8399935541fd','96d60dae-3556-4c60-9de8-c1397b3987c6','Test Resume700','Test Resume700','Software Deve',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Azure\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-25 12:01:43.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Deve\", \"company\": \"Accenture\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[{\"year\": \"\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech\", \"result\": \"\", \"institution\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('fbde009b-f3c2-4cb7-9349-dad49747076b','93e4e777-df02-4d00-8e8c-c9b68fc496a8','An IT Professional with 5 years experience in Power BI, SQL, ServiceNow, Data\r\nModelling, Excel, BI tools\r\n• Proficiency in Power BI features like Data Analytics: SQL/MYSQL, DAX Language,\r\nData Management, Data Interpretation and Data Modeling.\r\n• 5 years','An IT Professional with 5 years experience in Power BI, SQL, ServiceNow, Data\r\nModelling, Excel, BI tools\r\n• Proficiency in Power BI features like Data Analytics: SQL/MYSQL, DAX Language,\r\nData Management, Data Interpretation and Data Modeling.\r\n• 5 years of experience in data analysis, including data collection, cleaning and\r\nvisualization\r\n• Developed Dashboards in Power BI using diffferent visualizations available.\r\n• Designed and deployed reports with Drill Down, Drill Through and Drop-down menu\r\noption in Power BI.\r\n• Strong knowledge on visualizations like Bar charts, Column charts, Matrix\r\n• Successfully implemented a Power BI solution for a large manufacturing client, resulting\r\nin a 40% reduction in manual repoting time\r\n• Excellent analytical and problem solving skills with experience in writing SQL Qureies.','Consultant',6,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1768900648-720.pdf',NULL,'[\"Data\", \"Data Analysis\", \"Data Analyst\", \"Power BI\", \"SQL\", \"DAX\", \"SQL Server\"]','PUBLIC','2026-01-20 21:45:28.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Consultant\", \"company\": \"KPMG\", \"endDate\": \"Fri Jan 30\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Tue Jan 07\", \"description\": \"Working as a Senior Power BI Consultant, responsible for end-to-end data analytics and\\r\\nvisualization solutions.\\r\\n• Involved in the full project lifecycle - from requirement gathering and data modeling to\\r\\nreport development and production deployment.\\r\\n• Designed and implemented interactive dashboards and reports using Microsoft Power BI\\r\\nintegrated with Microsoft Fabric.\\r\\n• Collaborated closely with business stakeholders to translate business requirements into\\r\\neffective analytical solutions.\\r\\n• Built data pipelines and optimized data refresh performance using Fabric Dataflows and\\r\\nLakehouse integration.\\r\\n• Ensured data quality and accuracy through validation, version control, and adherence to\\r\\nbest practices in BI development.\\r\\n• Worked on Row-Level Security (RLS) and publishing reports to Power BI Service for\\r\\nenterprise-wide consumption.\\r\\n• Participated in peer reviews, troubleshooting visualization issues, and providing technical\\r\\nmentorship to junior team members.\"}, {\"title\": \"POWER DEVELOPER\", \"company\": \"Klaus IT Solutions-Toyota Kirloskar Motors Pvt Ltd\", \"endDate\": \"Thu Jan 23\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Thu Mar 07\", \"description\": \"Work experience in Powe