lytics solution for features and capabilities.\\r\\n• Publishing the weekly, monthly, quarterly and yearly reports to the management from\\r\\ndifferent ticketing tools.\\r\\n• Preparing KPI Dashboards for the management using the data from different tool.\\r\\n• Building reports and dashboards in Service Now, Oracle ticketing tool for the team in\\r\\norder to help them monitor the queue better and achieve the SLA’s.\\r\\n• Updating/Maintaining the confluence page for the Weekly/Monthly metrics. Participated\\r\\nin troubleshooting visualization performance issues.\\r\\n• Assessing the business requirements and create user friendly dashboards using Power BI\\r\\nand other visualization tools\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2018\", \"degree\": \"Computer Science\", \"result\": \"Yes\", \"institution\": \"SEA College of Engineering and Technology\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/cv-1768900648-720.pdf\", \"title\": \"cv\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('fbe274da-cfdf-4a71-aa8a-b63f47ac962b','c964b1b2-d4f6-48b5-a6e5-6e191bc2316c','Full Stack Developer with 6+ years building scalable, responsive web applications. Expert in Angular, TypeScript for frontend and Java, Spring Boot,\r\nMySQL, Hibernate for backend. Proficient in RxJS, NgRx state management, RESTful APIs, Spring Security, a','Full Stack Developer with 6+ years building scalable, responsive web applications. Expert in Angular, TypeScript for frontend and Java, Spring Boot,\r\nMySQL, Hibernate for backend. Proficient in RxJS, NgRx state management, RESTful APIs, Spring Security, and Docker. Passionate about\r\ndelivering high-quality, secure solutions and continuous innovation.','Associate Consultant',4,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1767122147-209.pdf',NULL,'[\"Angular\", \"HTML\", \"CSS\", \"JavaScript\", \"Bootstrap\", \"Java\", \"Hibernate\", \"Docker\", \"Typescript\", \"Spring Boot\", \"MYSQL\", \"Swagger\"]','PUBLIC','2025-12-31 07:41:35.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"tit