\\r\\n \\r\\n \\r\\n \\r\\n \\r\\n \\r\\n \\r\\n \\r\\n \\r\\n \\r\\n \\r\\n \\r\\nDesigned and developed Industrial Automation Application using Micrologix, RSLogix 5000, Studio 5000, FactoryTalk \\r\\nView, Ignition Vision, Kepware and Historian. \\r\\nProgrammed PLCs using ladder logic and FBD ensuring compliance with functional requirements and safety \\r\\nstandards. Releasing the part list for all-in-house & brought-out-items. \\r\\nCreated SCADA and HMI interfaces using Factory Talk View with PlantPAx Object Library to provide real-time \\r\\nmonitoring and control of production lines. \\r\\nCollaborated with cross-functional teams to integrate Rockwell Automation solutions into larger systems, ensuring \\r\\nseamless operation and efficient communication between devices. \\r\\nDeveloped SSRS Reports for Batch, Alarm and Events. \\r\\nUtilized SQL queries to retrieve and transform data from databases, incorporating it into SSRS reports. \\r\\nConfigured and maintained network devices, including routers, switches, firewalls, and wireless access points, \\r\\nensuring adherence to security policies and industry best practices. \\r\\nStrong understanding of regulatory requirements, including 21 CFR Part 11, GxP, and data integrity principles. \\r\\nDelivered high-quality L1 and L2 support in a 24x5 model, resolving customer issues related to Rockwell applications, \\r\\nand cloud-integrated IIoT deployments. \\r\\nHandled customer queries via email and call, resolving issues within the required time limits and escalating critical \\r\\nproblems to Rockwell Support teams as needed. \\r\\nSupported Installation, Configuration and Licensing of Windows Server, Rockwell Software, Kepware, Historian and \\r\\nVM Setup \\r\\nConfigured end-to-end connectivity between PLC, SCADA, and HMI systems to Kepware using OPC UA, Modbus and \\r\\nTCP-IP protocols, enabling low-latency edge analytics and cloud streaming. \\r\\nPrepared comprehensive documentation, including functional specifications, system architecture diagrams, and \\r\\nuser manuals. \\r\\nProvided technical support and training to clients on the operation and maintenance of Rockwell Automation \\r\\nsystems.\"}, {\"title\": \"Project Engineer\", \"company\": \"Sarla Technologies\", \"endDate\": \"Wed Feb 09\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Thu Sep 02\", \"description\": \"Developed automation solutions using PLCs from Rockwell Automation (Allen-Bradley), Siemens, and Mitsubishi \\r\\nElectric for different industrial clients. \\r\\n \\r\\n \\r\\n \\r\\n \\r\\n \\r\\n \\r\\n \\r\\n \\r\\n \\r\\n \\r\\nDesigned and developed advanced SCADA and HMI applications using FactoryTalk View, GE iFIX, Ignition, and Beijer \\r\\nHMI, enabling real-time monitoring, control, and visualization of plant operations.  \\r\\nDeveloped and implemented L2 Integration solutions using Kepware, GE IFIX Scada and GE IFIX Historian products \\r\\nfor various industrial clients. \\r\\nSuccessfully executed blender machine upgrade projects (L1 to L2) at Mylan Pharmaceuticals using Mitsubishi PLCs \\r\\nand Beijer HMIs, enhancing automation capabilities and production efficiency.  \\r\\nDesigned and implemented multi-vendor PLC connectivity (Allen-Bradley, Siemens, Mitsubishi) using OPC UA, \\r\\nModbus TCP/IP, and custom drivers in both Kepware and GE Proficy tools. \\r\\nIntegrated MQTT and REST API connectors within Kepware for seamless data flow into Azure IoT Hub and resolved \\r\\nissues via protocol-level log analysis. \\r\\nHandled customer queries via email and ZOHO ticketing platform, ensuring SLA compliance and escalating critical \\r\\nissues to L3 or cloud engineering teams as needed. \\r\\nAnalyzed Kepware and system logs (/var/log/, journalctl, Kepware diagnostic logs) to trace root causes of data loss, \\r\\nconnection timeouts, or abnormal tag behaviors. \\r\\nInvestigated Windows Event Viewer logs (Application, System, and Security) to identify root causes of Kepware \\r\\nruntime failures and communication issues. \\r\\nWorked extensively with historians and reporting tools, including SSRS, to design automated reports, data logging \\r\\nsystems, and performance analytics for industrial processes.  \\r\\nPerformed regular backups, project version control, and restoration of SCADA databases to minimize downtime and \\r\\nensure disaster recovery readiness.\"}, {\"title\": \"Software Engineer (MES)\", \"company\": \"Candor Software Solutions\", \"endDate\": \"Thu Mar 16\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Thu Mar 10\", \"description\": \" \\r\\nMarch 2022 – March 2023 \\r\\nGujarat, India \\r\\nDesigned and Developed pharmaceutical batch recipes in Syncade, supporting end-to-end packaging processes in \\r\\ncompliance with site requirements. \\r\\n \\r\\n \\r\\n \\r\\n \\r\\n \\r\\n \\r\\n \\r\\n \\r\\n \\r\\nDesigned and developed Syncade workflows for multiple pharmaceutical packaging operations, aligning MES logic \\r\\nwith validated manufacturing procedures. \\r\\nDeveloped and maintained Recipe Parameter XML and Equipment Parameter XML, ensuring accurate \\r\\nparameterization, equipment mapping, and process consistency across batches. \\r\\nPerformed recipe testing on Development (DEV) servers, followed by formal testing on Quality (QA) servers, \\r\\nensuring readiness for validated production use. \\r\\nConducted Operational Qualification (OQ) and Performance Qualification (PQ) activities, including protocol \\r\\nauthoring, execution, and documentation, to validate recipe functionality and system performance. \\r\\nEnsured compliance with GMP standards and 21 CFR Part 11, maintaining audit-ready MES systems and validated \\r\\nbatch manufacturing processes. \\r\\nDelivered shop-floor MES application support for Emerson Syncade web-based MES, ensuring uninterrupted \\r\\npharmaceutical batch execution and minimal production downtime. \\r\\nDelivered MES support during live production, monitoring batch execution and resolving Syncade application issues \\r\\nin real time to prevent batch failures. \\r\\nCreated and maintained MES validation and support documentation, including test plans, test cases, execution \\r\\nreports, deviation reports, and incident records. \\r\\nConducted Root Cause Analysis (RCA) for recurring MES and batch execution issues, implementing corrective and \\r\\npreventive actions and escalating critical issues with clear technical findings.\"}, {\"title\": \"Senior Developer (MES)\", \"company\": \"Tata Technologies (TataMotors – Sanand)\", \"endDate\": \"Fri Dec 19\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Fri Aug 11\", \"description\": \"Designed, developed, and enhanced Rockwell FactoryTalk Production Centre (FTPC) MES forms and PLC programs \\r\\nfor production booking, order start, part genealogy, and operational tracking, supporting high-volume automotive \\r\\nmanufacturing. \\r\\n \\r\\n \\r\\n \\r\\n \\r\\n \\r\\n \\r\\n \\r\\n \\r\\n \\r\\n \\r\\nImplemented PLC-MES communication using Kepware for secure and reliable data acquisition from shop-floor \\r\\nmachines. \\r\\nConfigured Kepware Advanced Data logger plug-in to capture real-time machine data and persist it into SQL Server \\r\\nfor production and quality analytics. \\r\\nUtilized FactoryTalk Transaction Manager (FTTM) to Fetch production and master data from SQL Server during live \\r\\nmanufacturing operations \\r\\nSupported MES-OT-IT integration, ensuring seamless data flow between PLCs, MES applications, SQL databases, and \\r\\ndownstream enterprise systems. \\r\\nProvided L2/L3 production support for MES applications by diagnosing system failures, data mismatches, and \\r\\nintegration issues, performing root cause analysis (RCA) and implementing permanent corrective actions. \\r\\nHandled critical MES production incidents and downtime events, collaborating with controls, production, and IT \\r\\nteams to restore services and minimize manufacturing losses. \\r\\nDelivered L1/L2 application support through ITSM ticketing tools, resolving user incidents related to production \\r\\ndata, reports, genealogy, and system availability within SLA. \\r\\nInvestigated and resolved PLC-MES-SQL data flow issues, including communication failures, data latency, and \\r\\ntransaction errors. \\r\\nPerformed regular backups of MES databases and application servers, ensuring data integrity, disaster recovery \\r\\nreadiness, and compliance with operational standards. \\r\\nSupported on-premises MES infrastructure, including edge systems, industrial networks, and integration \\r\\nmiddleware.\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2016\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech in Electrical\", \"result\": \"7.61\", \"institution\": \"RK University\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[{\"url\": \"/uploads/resumes/dhaval-mehta-1791965692-557.pdf\", \"title\": \"Dhaval Mehta\", \"isDefault\": false}]','[]'),('fdde2d4d-969e-4761-8126-579120094cfc','f2708194-c14a-43c9-87b8-ce5bc15d3ac8','Test Resume407','Test Resume407','Software Deve',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Duck Creek Testing\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-24 21:27:17.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Deve\", \"company\": \"TCS\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[{\"year\": \"\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech\", \"result\": \"\", \"institution\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('fddf819f-5c5a-4b7c-9c07-47825b76e01b','ed5e9c10-25a7-423a-8f54-7acbd6c3dd59','php,mysql developer',NULL,'php,mysql developer',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"C++\", \"C#\", \"C\", \"Oracle\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-14 12:57:03.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:04.000000','[{\"title\": \"php,mysql developer\", \"company\": \"softwarecompany\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('fde58430-b537-40ba-9c8e-40073443a858','3a7132a9-7d1f-4850-aa74-8536fb2a7b99','Test Resume4