ution\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('fea5d42c-4bd1-4c1a-9da8-00335908602f','61e9dbc9-f967-468a-b024-6ccf87ea3696','Test Resume480','Test Resume480','Software Deve',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Java\"]','PUBLIC','2025-05-25 18:32:05.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Software Deve\", \"company\": \"Valuelabs\", \"endDate\": \"\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}]','[{\"year\": \"\", \"degree\": \"B.Tech\", \"result\": \"\", \"institution\": \"\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]',NULL,NULL,'[]','[]','[]'),('fea6e4cd-91d0-4d1d-9065-20e5ee456379','6e15dacb-6c5b-418c-85e1-d88e02d43b6e','Salesforce professional with 3+ years of experience supporting and configuring enterprise Salesforce platforms in SLA\r\ndriven, regulated environments, including a Salesforce-based Quality Management System (QMS - OneTrack) and \r\nTrackWise (on-prem COTS QM','Salesforce professional with 3+ years of experience supporting and configuring enterprise Salesforce platforms in SLA\r\ndriven, regulated environments, including a Salesforce-based Quality Management System (QMS - OneTrack) and \r\nTrackWise (on-prem COTS QMS). Skilled in platform configuration and administration – user account and access \r\nmanagement, permission sets, page layout configuration, picklist and lookup filter configuration, Flows, validation rules, \r\nand Data Loader – along with incident/problem/change management and end-to-end support for major deployments. \r\nExperienced gathering requirements directly from business stakeholders and translating them into scalable Salesforce \r\nconfiguration changes and minor enhancements, including bulk data updates and production data management under \r\nstringent timelines. Consistently achieved 95%+ on-time issue resolution while collaborating across cross-functional and \r\nquality teams. Currently looking to grow further into enhancements and configuration work, with a strong interest in \r\ngaining more hands-on experience in this area.','Application Support Engineer – TrackWise On-Prem (COTS)',4,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/shobana-annadurai-1791464852-886.pdf',NULL,'[\"JIRA\", \"Confluence\", \"Salesforce\", \"Trackwise configuration\", \"Root Cause Analysis\", \"QMS System\", \"ServiceNow\", \"ITSM\"]','PUBLIC','2026-10-09 00:30:02.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Application Support Engineer – TrackWise On-Prem (COTS)\", \"company\": \"Cognizant Technology Solutions\", \"endDate\": \"Fri Mar 21\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Fri Nov 18\", \"description\": \"● Provided production support for the TrackWise QMS application, ensuring minimal downtime and resolving \\r\\napproximately 10 issues per month.\\r\\n● Performed SSL certificate updates and renewals to ensure secure system connectivity and compliance.\\r\\n● Executed data updates using PR Import Utility, ensuring accurate and timely data management in Production.\\r\\n● Prepared Weekly Status Reports (WSR) and Monthly Status Reports (MSR) capturing application performance \\r\\nmetrics with 97%+ accuracy to support data-driven business decisions.\\r\\n● Managed configuration changes including selection value migrations, migrating over 100 selection values to \\r\\nreduce manual errors.\\r\\n● Performed database maintenance and production data updates, ensuring data accuracy and system reliability.\\r\\nNotable Achievements\\r\\n● Reduced Salesforce issue resolution timeline by approximately 60% through structured troubleshooting within \\r\\nSLA timelines.\\r\\n● Executed bulk data inserts and updates in the Interface DB to ensure backend data accuracy while meeting critical \\r\\nbusiness timelines.\\r\\n● Delivered business requirements through timely issue resolution and minor enhancement releases, earning business \\r\\ntrust\"}, {\"title\": \"Salesforce Administrator / Application Support Analyst\", \"company\": \"Cognizant Technology Solutions\", \"endDate\": \"Thu Jan 01\", \"isCurr