 join an interactive organization \r\nthat offers me a constructive \r\nworkplace for communicating and \r\ninteracting with utilization of \r\nManagement and Engineering skills \r\nwhich will grows me professionally to \r\nachieve company Goal.','Automation Engineer',6,NULL,'/uploads/resumes/cv-1778012216-996.pdf',NULL,'[\"Java\", \"JIRA\", \"Azure DevOps\", \"Maven\", \"Github\", \"Cucumber(BDD)\", \"TestNG\", \"Playwright\", \"API testing\", \"Postman\", \"SQL\", \"Manual Testing\", \"CI/CD\"]','PUBLIC','2026-05-06 07:43:40.000000','2026-10-21 07:09:05.000000','[{\"title\": \"Automation Engineer\", \"company\": \"Neutrino Tech Systems\", \"endDate\": \"Wed May 20\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Wed Apr 10\", \"description\": \"Tools and Technologies: JAVA Selenium Playwright Automation, \\r\\nMaven, Cucumber, Swagger, API Testing, REST- Assured, Postman, \\r\\nFootprint Desktop, Footprint Mobile, OMS, GXP Manager, \\r\\nMicroservices. \\r\\n Experienced in GxP tools, warehouse management systems, and order \\r\\ncreation processes, with expertise in pack verification, picking, and system \\r\\nvalidation to ensure compliance and operational efficiency.\\r\\n Experienced in API and PQ/OQ testing, ensuring system performance and \\r\\ncompliance with operational and regulatory standards. Conducted OQ \\r\\nto verify functionality and PQ to validate real- world performance in line \\r\\nwith GxP env. \\r\\n Managed patient enrollment, benefits verification, and prior \\r\\nauthorizations \\r\\n Copay/financial assistance and pharmacy referrals \\r\\n Coordinated hub case management with HCPs, payers, and pharmacies \\r\\n An end-to-end testing framework used to automate browser testing for web \\r\\napps using Playwright Framework \\r\\n  An automated process that builds, tests, and deploys code whenever changes \\r\\nare pushed to the repository using CICD Pipelines\"}, {\"title\": \"Automation Engineer\", \"company\": \"EXPERIS IT PVT LTD\", \"endDate\": \"Wed May 31\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Thu Nov 10\", \"description\": \" Determining the testing scope and developing test strategy \\r\\ndocuments for both manual and automated testing\\r\\n Gaining understanding of the application from business analysts \\r\\nand creating test scenarios and cases through automation\\r\\n Establishing automation frameworks and tackling new challenges during \\r\\nthe setup\\r\\n Developing the project\'s base functionality and writing automation \\r\\nscripts using Selenium Java\\r\\n Managing user stories and tracking defects with Jira\\r\\n Executing automated tests for each release\\r\\n Generating and analyzing automation reports\\r\\n Participating in daily stand-ups, sprint planning, sprint reviews, \\r\\nbacklog refinement, and retrospective meetings\\r\\n Utilizing the BDD Cucumber framework\"}, {\"title\": \"Automation Engineer\", \"company\": \"INFOGAIN SOLUTIONS PVT LTD\", \"endDate\": \"Thu Sep 15\", \"isCurrent\": false, \"startDate\": \"Tue Oct 05\", \"description\": \"Responsible for testing deliverables, prioritizes and monitors activities to meet \\r\\nsuch dates for individual assigned features.\\r\\n Identified End to End Test Scenarios, Test Cases and Test Data.\\r\\nPerforming Functional Testing, Regression Testing. \\r\\n Active participation in weekly/daily status calls with the client.\\r\\n Work with cross-functional teams to ensure \\r\\nquality throughout the software development \\r\\nlifecycle and Follow-through and conduct post- \\r\\nrelease/post- implementation testing\\r\\n Track quality assurance metrics, like defect densities and open defect \\r\\ncounts\\r\\n Effectively report bugs and errors to development teams\\r\\n Have experience in sending the daily or weekly test/bug status reports\"}]','[{\"year\": \"2016\", \"degree\": \"Bachelor of Civil Engineering\", \"result\": \"68\", \"institution\": \"Pune University\"}]','[]','[]','[]','[]'