uot; /&gt;&amp;nbsp;Configure and implement Opcenter modules (MES, APS, RD&amp;amp;L, etc.).&lt;br data-start=&quot;899&quot; data-end=&quot;902&quot; /&gt;&amp;nbsp;Create comprehensive technical documentation.&lt;br data-start=&quot;950&quot; data-end=&quot;953&quot; /&gt;&amp;nbsp;Perform system integration, testing, and issue resolution.&lt;br data-start=&quot;1014&quot; data-end=&quot;1017&quot; /&gt;&amp;nbsp;Provide training and ongoing support to end-users.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;hr data-start=&quot;1072&quot; data-end=&quot;1075&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;1077&quot; data-end=&quot;1120&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1081&quot; data-end=&quot;1118&quot;&gt;Required Skills &amp;amp; Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1121&quot; data-end=&quot;1600&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;4+ years of hands-on experience with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1160&quot; data-end=&quot;1180&quot;&gt;Siemens Opcenter&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Semi (Execution, APS, RD&amp;amp;L, etc.)&lt;br data-start=&quot;1209&quot; data-end=&quot;1212&quot; /&gt;&amp;nbsp;Solid understanding of &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1237&quot; data-end=&quot;1271&quot;&gt;MES, PLM, and Manufacturing IT&lt;/strong&gt; systems&lt;br data-start=&quot;1279&quot; data-end=&quot;1282&quot; /&gt;&amp;nbsp;Proficiency in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1299&quot; data-end=&quot;1322&quot;&gt;SQL, JavaScript, C#&lt;/strong&gt;, or other relevant languages&lt;br data-start=&quot;1351&quot; data-end=&quot;1354&quot; /&gt;&amp;nbsp;Experience with databases such as &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1390&quot; data-end=&quot;1412&quot;&gt;Oracle, SQL Server&lt;/strong&gt;, etc.&lt;br data-start=&quot;1418&quot; data-end=&quot;1421&quot; /&gt;&amp;nbsp;Strong skills in business process modeling and workflow management&lt;br data-start=&quot;1489&quot; data-end=&quot;1492&quot; /&gt;&amp;nbsp;Excellent problem-solving and analytical thinking&lt;br data-start=&quot;1543&quot; data-end=&quot;1546&quot; /&gt;&amp;nbsp;Strong team player with great communication skills&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',500000.00,2500000.00,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-19 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-06-09 05:44:13.000000','2025-11-21 04:59:20.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"C#\", \"JavaScript\", \"Mes\", \"Opcenter\", \"Opcenter Connect Cloud\", \"Opcenter Connect Mom\", \"PLM Software (Product Lifecycle Management)\", \"Siemens Opcenter\", \"SQL Server\", \"Team Player\"]','[\"&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;104&quot; data-end=&quot;125&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;108&quot; data-end=&quot;125&quot;&gt;Job Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\\r\\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;127&quot; data-end=&quot;699&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;127&quot; data-end=&quot;192&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;129&quot; data-end=&quot;192&quot;&gt;Competitive salary based on experience and industry standards&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;193&quot; data-end=&quot;257&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;195&quot; data-end=&quot;257&quot;&gt;Flexible work arrangements (hybrid or remote, if applicable)&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;258&quot; data-end=&quot;318&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;260&quot; data-end=&quot;318&quot;&gt;Comprehensive health insurance (medical, dental, vision)&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;319&quot; data-end=&quot;388&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;321&quot; data-end=&quot;388&quot;&gt;Paid time off including vacation, sick leave, and public holidays&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;389&quot; data-end=&quot;433&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;391&quot; data-end=&quot;433&quot;&gt;Performance-based bonuses and incentives&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;434&quot; data-end=&quot;499&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;436&quot; data-end=&quot;499&quot;&gt;Opportunities for career growth, training, and certifications&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('032591fb-7a31-4d52-96f6-94cea206487d','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','STARLIMS Application Consultant','starlims-application-consultant-279-279','&lt;p data-start=&quot;73&quot; data-end=&quot;419&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced STARLIMS Application Consultants for a leading Top MNC to work on enterprise-level laboratory informatics and regulated laboratory system projects. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in STARLIMS implementation, configuration, customization, and application support within regulated laboratory environments.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;421&quot; data-end=&quot;856&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for participating in the complete STARLIMS project lifecycle, including requirements gathering, design, development, testing, deployment, upgrades, enhancements, and post-go-live support. The role includes configuring STARLIMS modules such as Sample Management, Workflow &amp;amp; Testing, Results &amp;amp; Reporting, Stability, Environmental Monitoring, and QC modules based on business and laboratory requirements.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;858&quot; data-end=&quot;1154&quot;&gt;Professionals should have strong hands-on experience with STARLIMS scripting, SQL databases, REST/SOAP web services, custom reports, and enterprise integrations. Experience supporting integrations with ELN, SDMS, ERP (SAP), MES, laboratory instruments, and middleware systems is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1156&quot; data-end=&quot;1566&quot;&gt;The role also involves troubleshooting application, interface, performance, and data-related issues while ensuring compliance with GxP, data integrity, audit trail, and validation standards. Candidates should possess strong communication, stakeholder management, analytical thinking, and documentation skills to work effectively with laboratory users, Quality teams, IT teams, vendors, and global stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-07-20 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-05-22 02:19:46.000000','2026-05-22 02:19:46.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Crystal Report\", \"RESTFUL APIS\", \"SOAP\", \"SQL Server\", \"Electronic Lab Notebook (ELN)\", \"Validation Documentation\", \"STARLIMS Configuration\", \"STARLIMS Customization\", \"LIMS Project Lifecycle Management\", \"Sample Management\", \"STARLIMS Scripting\", \"SDMS Integration\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1582&quot; data-end=&quot;1620&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1uxllaf&quot; data-start=&quot;1621&quot; data-end=&quot;1671&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-level STARLIMS projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;figprm&quot; data-start=&quot;1672&quot; data-end=&quot;1752&quot;&gt;Work on global laboratory informatics and digital transformation initiatives&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;4qpkz8&quot; data-start=&quot;1753&quot; data-end=&quot;1806&quot;&gt;Career growth in LIMS &amp;amp; Laboratory Systems domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;qo05xv&quot; data-start=&quot;1807&quot; data-end=&quot;1872&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global cross-functional teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;2lee9a&quot; data-start=&quot;1873&quot; data-end=&quot;1928&quot;&gt;Professional and compliance-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;1929&quot; data-end=&quot;1972&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('037b9167-ebd9-49d2-8619-e4d54692a18f','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Institutional Business Development Manager','institutional-business-development-manager-131-131','&lt;p data-start=&quot;240&quot; data-end=&quot;804&quot;&gt;We are hiring a dynamic and self-driven &lt;strong data-start=&quot;280&quot; data-end=&quot;326&quot;&gt;Institutional Business Development Manager&lt;/strong&gt; to join our growing team. The ideal candidate will have a strong background in Sales &amp;amp; Marketing and will be responsible for driving B2B and institutional partnerships. You will plan and execute marketing and networking strategies, manage promotional and digital marketing campaigns for exhibitions, and support the business development team in identifying new growth opportunities. This is a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;720&quot; data-end=&quot;751&quot;&gt;full-time office-based role&lt;/strong&gt; with no field work. Immediate joiners are preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;hr data-start=&quot;806&quot; data-end=&quot;809&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;811&quot; data-end=&quot;840&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;814&quot; data-end=&quot;840&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;841&quot; data-end=&quot;1405&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;841&quot; data-end=&quot;922&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;843&quot; data-end=&quot;922&quot;&gt;Develop and execute &lt;strong data-start=&quot;863&quot; data-end=&quot;920&quot;&gt;B2B networking and institutional marketing strategies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;923&quot; data-end=&quot;994&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;925&quot; data-end=&quot;994&quot;&gt;Collaborate with internal teams to support key business initiatives&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;995&quot; data-end=&quot;1076&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;997&quot; data-end=&quot;1076&quot;&gt;Manage promotional activities and &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1031&quot; data-end=&quot;1058&quot;&gt;digital media campaigns&lt;/strong&gt; for exhibitions&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1077&quot; data-end=&quot;1150&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1079&quot; data-end=&quot;1150&quot;&gt;Conduct market and client research to identify business opportunities&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1151&quot; data-end=&quot;1211&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1153&quot; data-end=&quot;1211&quot;&gt;Maintain strong relationships with institutional clients&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1212&quot; data-end=&quot;1266&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1214&quot; data-end=&quot;1266&quot;&gt;Assist in brand positioning and marketing planning&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1267&quot; data-end=&quot;1341&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1269&quot; data-end=&quot;1341&quot;&gt;Prepare reports, presentations, and business development documentation&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1342&quot; data-end=&quot;1405&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1344&quot; data-end=&quot;1405&quot;&gt;Work closely with senior management to drive revenue growth&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Gurugram',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-19 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-11-21 05:52:36.000000','2025-11-21 05:52:36.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"B2B\", \"Business Development\", \"Communication\", \"Marketing\", \"MS Excel\", \"MS Office\", \"Negotiation\", \"Networking\", \"Sales\", \"Word\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1940&quot; data-end=&quot;2010&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1942&quot; data-end=&quot;2010&quot;&gt;Opportunity to grow in a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1967&quot; data-end=&quot;2008&quot;&gt;fast-paced and expanding organization&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2011&quot; data-end=&quot;2082&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2013&quot; data-end=&quot;2082&quot;&gt;Work in a strategic role driving B2B and institutional partnerships&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2083&quot; data-end=&quot;2137&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2085&quot; data-end=&quot;2137&quot;&gt;Full-time &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2095&quot; data-end=&quot;2116&quot;&gt;office-based role&lt;/strong&gt; with no field work&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2138&quot; data-end=&quot;2193&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2140&quot; data-end=&quot;2193&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and performance-based incentives&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2194&quot; data-end=&quot;2252&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2196&quot; data-end=&quot;2252&quot;&gt;Exposure to marketing, branding, and digital campaigns&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2253&quot; data-end=&quot;2302&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2255&quot; data-end=&quot;2302&quot;&gt;Supportive and collaborative work environment&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2303&quot; data-end=&quot;2352&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2305&quot; data-end=&quot;2352&quot;&gt;Career development and learning opportunities&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2353&quot; data-end=&quot;2395&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2355&quot; data-end=&quot;2395&quot;&gt;Quick onboarding for immediate joiners&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Haryana'),('04172fb9-c960-454e-a2a5-d93b65656ff3','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Senior Data Engineer','senior-data-engineer-9-9','Must-Have Skills: 6&amp;ndash;9 years of experience with PySpark, Apache Spark, Flink, NiFi, Kafka, and other data engineering technologies. Strong proficiency in SQL, RDBMS, and Hadoop technologies. Familiarity with the Cloudera Tech Stack, including Hive, Impala, and HDFS. Good-to-Have Skills: Hands-on experience with Flink and Kudu streaming. Knowledge of Informatica workflow migration. Automation of workflows using CI/CD pipelines. Experience with Airflow or similar workflow engines. BFSI industry experience, especially with cloud technologies (Azure, AWS, Google Cloud). Key Responsibilities: Develop and optimize Spark pipelines for batch and streaming data. Design and implement ETL pipelines using PySpark and other tools. Migrate existing implementations to Spark-based solutions. Work with programming languages like Scala, Java, and Python. Utilize tools like Kafka and Jupyter Notebooks for streaming and development.','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',250000.00,300000.00,'₹',1,'India','Mumbai/Bandra',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2025-07-02 18:30:00',0,0,'2025-05-04 17:21:24.000000','2025-05-04 17:21:24.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"AC\", \"Academic Performance Tracking\", \"Advanced Materials\", \"Apache Ant\", \"API Design\", \"Assembly Line\", \"Building Codes\", \"Circuit Switching\", \"Cloud AWS\", \"Cosmetics\", \"CRM Management\"]','[\"Perks &amp;amp; Benefits: Competitive salary package Career growth opportunities Comprehensive health insurance Hybrid work model Performance-based incentives Learning and development programs\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Maharashtra'),('051681e1-3413-44e8-a347-66b195e0601d','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','OT Security Consultant','ot-security-consultant-196-196','1. Conduct site-level risk assessments, vulnerability analyses, and provide mitigation strategies while supporting incident response planning and remediation. &lt;br /&gt;2. Experience with Industrial control system / Operational technology (PLC/SCADA/Historian / DCS/ MES) &lt;br /&gt;3. Good understanding of Server dimensioning, DMZ and perdue model. Knowledge of Firewall rules and VLAN Mapping &lt;br /&gt;4. Working knowledge of Current OT security standards like NIST 800-82, ISA99, NERC, IEC-62443&lt;br /&gt;5. Deep knowledge of ICS Components and interface protocols (IEC61850-8-1, IEC61850-9-2, IEC 60870-5-101/104, MODBUS, OPC, C37.118, SNMP, NTP, SFTP, SSH) &lt;br /&gt;6. Good to know MS Visio to create network reference architecture and data flow diagram. Inventory preparation&amp;rsquo;s coordination with Plant team, Local partners, internal stakeholders.','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'INR',1,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-04-21 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-02-20 22:33:34.000000','2026-02-20 22:33:34.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Mes\", \"Opc\", \"PLC\", \"PLC Systems\", \"Risk Assessment\", \"SCADA\", \"SCADA Systems\", \"SNMP\", \"SSH\", \"DCS\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;Competitive salary package with performance-based incentives&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;65&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;67&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;Health insurance coverage and statutory benefits (PF &amp;amp; Gratuity)&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;134&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;136&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on large-scale enterprise energy management projects&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;211&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;213&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;Strong career growth and learning opportunities&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;263&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;265&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;Collaborative and professional work environment&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('055bfa8c-d135-48b7-94ba-1ceed0e73a11','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','SAP ME / MII Developer','sap-me-mii-developer-264-264','Key Responsibilities:&amp;nbsp; &lt;br /&gt;Integration of SAP ME &amp;amp; MII with ERP and custom applications&amp;nbsp; &lt;br /&gt;Provide plant floor application support across geographies&amp;nbsp; &lt;br /&gt;Work on Incident, Change &amp;amp; Problem Management (ITIL Process)&amp;nbsp; &lt;br /&gt;Ensure SLA-based service delivery and high system availability&amp;nbsp; &lt;br /&gt;Participate in transition and Agile release activities&amp;nbsp; &lt;br /&gt;Create functional &amp;amp; technical documentation&amp;nbsp; &lt;br /&gt;Collaborate with support &amp;amp; project teams for upgrades and issue resolution&amp;nbsp;&lt;br /&gt;Good to Have:&amp;nbsp; Experience in SAP UI5, AJAX, HTML5-based applications&amp;nbsp; &lt;br /&gt;Knowledge of SAP Solution Manager&amp;nbsp; &lt;br /&gt;Database management &amp;amp; integration standards&amp;nbsp; Development of PoCs and reports','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Pune',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-07-10 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-05-11 15:33:29.000000','2026-05-11 15:33:29.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Agile Methodology\", \"AJAX\", \"ERP\", \"HTML5\", \"ITIL\", \"Java\", \"JavaScript\", \"SAP\", \"Sap UI5\", \"Kepware\", \"SAP ME\", \"SAP MII Development\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;346&quot; data-end=&quot;384&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1j92orx&quot; data-start=&quot;385&quot; data-end=&quot;430&quot;&gt;Exposure to global manufacturing projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;n7suym&quot; data-start=&quot;431&quot; data-end=&quot;476&quot;&gt;Career growth in SAP Manufacturing domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1jllh2p&quot; data-start=&quot;477&quot; data-end=&quot;521&quot;&gt;Hybrid/enterprise-level work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;2izsm8&quot; data-start=&quot;522&quot; data-end=&quot;571&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience with SAP ERP integrations&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;xv0req&quot; data-start=&quot;572&quot; data-end=&quot;608&quot;&gt;Collaborative Agile team culture&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;609&quot; data-end=&quot;652&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Maharashtra'),('057e3853-21b6-4dc3-80ee-f59985e6eefc','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','iOS Developer – Fresher','ios-developer-fresher-357-357','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;65&quot; data-end=&quot;381&quot;&gt;We are hiring enthusiastic &lt;strong data-start=&quot;92&quot; data-end=&quot;118&quot;&gt;iOS Developer Freshers&lt;/strong&gt; for a leading Top MNC to work on real-world mobile application development projects. This is an excellent opportunity for fresh graduates and early-career professionals who are passionate about iOS development, Swift, Objective-C, and modern mobile technologies.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;383&quot; data-end=&quot;788&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for developing, testing, releasing, and maintaining iOS applications while working throughout the complete Software Development Life Cycle (SDLC). The role includes building iOS applications and Proof-of-Concepts (POCs), implementing new features, debugging application issues, improving performance, and collaborating with backend and cross-functional development teams.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;790&quot; data-end=&quot;1179&quot;&gt;Candidates should have a strong understanding of &lt;strong data-start=&quot;839&quot; data-end=&quot;934&quot;&gt;Swift, Objective-C, iOS SDK, Cocoa Touch, Xcode, Git, and the macOS development environment&lt;/strong&gt;. Basic knowledge of networking concepts, VPN, WebSockets, and Mobile Device Management (MDM) is preferred. Candidates should demonstrate strong problem-solving, communication, learning ability, and enthusiasm for mobile application development.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1181&quot; data-end=&quot;1552&quot;&gt;The role also provides an opportunity to work with experienced developers and global teams, learn modern iOS development practices, participate in technical discussions, and contribute to enterprise-grade mobile applications. Freshers with strong academic projects, internships, personal iOS applications, or hands-on Swift development experience are encouraged to apply.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Entry',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-10 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-08-12 03:04:14.000000','2026-08-12 03:04:14.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"API Integration\", \"Git\", \"IOS\", \"Ios App Development\", \"Objective C\", \"Swift\", \"VPN\", \"Xcode\", \"Cocoa Touch\", \"WebSocket\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;hbysa9&quot; data-start=&quot;1568&quot; data-end=&quot;1619&quot;&gt;Opportunity to start your career with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1aif870&quot; data-start=&quot;1620&quot; data-end=&quot;1685&quot;&gt;Exposure to real-world enterprise iOS application development&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;x2n75d&quot; data-start=&quot;1686&quot; data-end=&quot;1762&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience with Swift, Objective-C, Xcode, and iOS technologies&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;10qp6bc&quot; data-start=&quot;1763&quot; data-end=&quot;1836&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with experienced mobile development professionals&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1fsexqq&quot; data-start=&quot;1837&quot; data-end=&quot;1892&quot;&gt;Exposure to global teams and international projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1e8koxm&quot; data-start=&quot;1893&quot; data-end=&quot;1953&quot;&gt;Opportunity to learn modern mobile development practices&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;un4ih7&quot; data-start=&quot;1954&quot; data-end=&quot;2013&quot;&gt;Career growth in iOS and Mobile Application Development&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;vfuj5t&quot; data-start=&quot;2014&quot; data-end=&quot;2065&quot;&gt;Professional and collaborative work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('05dfc7d7-46fc-45b9-be4b-d92314b1af28','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Online Product Sales Executive','online-product-sales-executive-19-19','Job Description: We are looking for a skilled and proactive Online Product Sales Executive with 3+ years of experience to drive product sales through online platforms. The ideal candidate will be responsible for managing product listings, optimizing online sales strategies, and ensuring customer satisfaction. Key Responsibilities: Manage and optimize product listings on e-commerce platforms (Amazon, Flipkart, Shopify, etc.). Develop and implement online sales strategies to meet revenue targets. Monitor and analyze online sales performance and customer trends. Handle customer inquiries, complaints, and order fulfillment efficiently. Collaborate with the marketing team for promotions and ad campaigns. Negotiate and manage partnerships with online distributors. Ensure accurate and timely product information updates across platforms. Generate sales reports and recommend strategies for improvement. Key Skills: E-commerce sales management (Amazon, Flipkart, etc.) Online product listing and optimization Digital marketing and SEO knowledge Data analysis and reporting CRM and e-commerce tools proficiency Strong communication and negotiation skills Customer relationship management Ability to meet sales targets and deadlines','Sales','Contract','Mid',22000.00,40000.00,'₹',1,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2025-07-03 18:30:00',0,0,'2025-05-05 02:51:08.000000','2025-05-05 02:51:08.000000','IN