; data-start=&quot;390&quot; data-end=&quot;425&quot;&gt;Strong expertise in LabVantage LIMS&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;426&quot; data-end=&quot;494&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;428&quot; data-end=&quot;494&quot;&gt;Proficient in Java and Oracle/MS SQL (knowledge of .NET is a plus)&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;495&quot; data-end=&quot;601&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;497&quot; data-end=&quot;601&quot;&gt;Experience with workflows, customization, integration, implementation, upgrade, and migration activities&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;602&quot; data-end=&quot;650&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;604&quot; data-end=&quot;650&quot;&gt;Familiarity with Jasper Reports implementation&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;651&quot; data-end=&quot;713&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;653&quot; data-end=&quot;713&quot;&gt;Competence in application administration and troubleshooting&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;714&quot; data-end=&quot;801&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;716&quot; data-end=&quot;801&quot;&gt;Successfully completed at least 2 end-to-end LIMS implementations or upgrade projects&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;802&quot; data-end=&quot;852&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;804&quot; data-end=&quot;852&quot;&gt;Excellent communication and client-facing skills&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;853&quot; data-end=&quot;914&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;855&quot; data-end=&quot;914&quot;&gt;Minimum 3 years of experience in manufacturing environments&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&q