quot; data-end=&quot;693&quot;&gt;sensor configuration and testing to installation, commissioning, onboarding, and IoT platform monitoring&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;696&quot; data-end=&quot;1012&quot;&gt;Candidates should have hands-on knowledge of &lt;strong data-start=&quot;741&quot; data-end=&quot;874&quot;&gt;P&amp;amp;IDs, PFDs, hook-up drawings, loop wiring, control panels, sensor communication, LoRaWAN, gateways, and industrial IoT platforms&lt;/strong&gt;. Lead-level candidates will additionally be responsible for technical guidance, customer coordination, and project management activities.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-23 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-08-25 02:35:54.000000','2026-08-25 02:35:54.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Access Control Systems\", \"Sensors\", \"Industrial IoT (IIoT)\", \"Industrial Instrumentation\", \"Sensors & Sensor Communication\", \"Control Panel Engineering\", \"P&ID Interpretation\", \"LoRaWAN\", \"IoT Platform Integration\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1027&quot; data-end=&quot;1074&quot; data-section-id=&quot;rdheb3&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a leading global MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1075&quot; data-end=&quot;1144&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1w7t7r&quot;&gt;Exposure to &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1089&quot; data-end=&quot;1144&quot;&gt;Industrial IoT and smart manufacturing technologies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1145&quot; data-end=&quot;1207&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1i93tup&quot;&gt;Work on advanced sensor and wireless communication solutions&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1208&quot; data-end=&quot;1279&quot; data-section-id=&quot;3c0bca&quot;&gt;Exposure to &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1222&quot; data-end=&quot;1279&quot;&gt;LoRaWAN, IoT platforms, and connected instrumentation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1280&quot; data-end=&quot;1352&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1r1ehzx&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work directly with customers and technical stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1353&quot; data-end=&quot;1418&quot; data-section-id=&quot;k5jcvl&quot;&gt;Career growth in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1372&quot; data-end=&quot;1418&quot;&gt;Instrumentation, Automation &amp;amp; Industry 4.0&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1419&quot; data-end=&quot;1489&quot; data-section-id=&quot;xg8wew&quot;&gt;Opportunity to lead technical activities and guide engineering teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1490&quot; data-end=&quot;1559&quot; data-section-id=&quot;7k7cr8&quot;&gt;Exposure to end-to-end sensor deployment and commissioning projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('06ce39cf-8897-4887-bd4f-e97bb8b8c3d0','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Functional Consultant','functional-consultant-249-249','&amp;sect; Master&amp;rsquo;s degree in Business, Enterprise functions, Inter-department handshakes etc. &lt;br /&gt;&amp;sect; 10+ years of experience in relevant Functional Consultant role. &lt;br /&gt;&amp;sect; Strong knowledge of enterprise organization design and operating models, with the ability to understand functional, regional, and shared-services structures&lt;br /&gt;&amp;sect; Skilled in market research and competitive intelligence, including the ability to analyze public disclosures, industry reports, analyst publications, and benchmarking databases to study global peers &lt;br /&gt;&amp;sect; Deep expertise in functional and workforce benchmarking, covering metrics such as spans and layers, role mix, headcount ratios, governance models, and functional maturity indicators. &lt;br /&gt;&amp;sect; Strong analytical structuring and insight generation skills, enabling meaningful synthesis of qualitative and quantitative data into trends, best practices, and implications.&lt;br /&gt;&amp;sect; Sound understanding of organization change management principles, allowing assessment of change impact, adoption risk, and implementation feasibility of proposed org structure models.&lt;br /&gt;&amp;sect; Strong analytical, problem-solving, and critical thinking skills.&lt;br /&gt;&amp;sect; strong stakeholder collaboration and consulting facilitation skills, enabling effective engagement with Business Analysts and domain consultants through structured discussions and workshops','Information Technology','Contract','Entry',NULL,NULL,'INR',1,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-06-15 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-04-16 21:00:10.000000','2026-04-16 21:00:10.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Business Analyst\", \"Design\", \"Functional Consultant\", \"Structured Products\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1b8ludi&quot; data-start=&quot;57&quot; data-end=&quot;112&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and performance-based incentives&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;wa1cqy&quot; data-start=&quot;113&quot; data-end=&quot;152&quot;&gt;Health insurance (medical coverage)&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1elu4nz&quot; data-start=&quot;153&quot; data-end=&quot;191&quot;&gt;Paid leaves (casual, sick, earned)&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1sa4caw&quot; data-start=&quot;192&quot; data-end=&quot;243&quot;&gt;Flexible working hours / Work-from-home options&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;17iplkr&quot; data-start=&quot;244&quot; data-end=&quot;288&quot;&gt;Career growth and learning opportunities&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1uu5yk4&quot; data-start=&quot;289&quot; data-end=&quot;327&quot;&gt;Training and certification support&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('07741c6f-3ab8-4c85-b995-bb7ba5c4afbe','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Alfresco Developer','alfresco-developer-70-70','&lt;p data-start=&quot;166&quot