t;, and &lt;strong data-start=&quot;812&quot; data-end=&quot;832&quot;&gt;Containerization&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;836&quot; data-end=&quot;939&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;838&quot; data-end=&quot;939&quot;&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional teams to create and maintain comprehensive project documentation.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;940&quot; data-end=&quot;1030&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;942&quot; data-end=&quot;1030&quot;&gt;Establish and maintain strong relationships with stakeholders and third-party vendors.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-19 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-07-01 12:43:55.000000','2025-11-21 04:49:47.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Agile\", \"App Services\", \"Docker\", \"Document Object Model\", \"Domain Model and Security\", \"Good Communication Skills\", \"Java\", \"Problem-Solving Skills\", \"REST API\", \"Spring Framework\", \"Kubernetes\", \"Alfresco Fundamentals\", \"Architectural Components\", \"Alfresco Development Framework\"]','[\"&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1777&quot; data-end=&quot;2066&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1777&quot; data-end=&quot;1832&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1779&quot; data-end=&quot;1832&quot;&gt;Competitive salary aligned with industry standards.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1833&quot; data-end=&quot;1911&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1835&quot; data-end=&quot;1911&quot;&gt;Exposure to cutting-edge technologies and advanced development frameworks.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1912&quot; data-end=&quot;1963&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1914&quot; data-end=&quot;1963&quot;&gt;Opportunities to grow as a leader in the field.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1964&quot; data-end=&quot;2014&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1