d maintain IAM solutions, including identity provisioning, access control, authentication, and authorization mechanisms.&lt;br /&gt;Design IAM workflows, policies, and procedures to ensure secure and efficient access management using SAAS Identity &amp;amp; Access Management platforms.&lt;br /&gt;Strong understanding of access control, authentication &amp;amp; authorization.&lt;br /&gt;Manage user onboarding, offboarding, and role changes, ensuring adherence to security policies and compliance requirements.&lt;br /&gt;Must have experience in SCIM REST API, Java, JSON, XML,Webservices, Install, customize, configure, and support identity provisioning and governance tools.&lt;br /&gt;Troubleshoot and resolve L2/L3 technical issues related to IAM configurations, connector integrations, customizations and support hypercare for different project rollouts &amp;amp; phases.&lt;br /&gt;Define and enforce access control policies, including role-based access control (RBAC), least privilege principle, and segregation of duties (SoD).&lt;br /&gt;Perform unit testing, integration testing, and validation of the IAM solutions to ensure they meet quality and security standards.&lt;br /&gt;Good to have exposure on Bean Shell,Groovy,Shell scripting &amp;amp; hands on Terraform script but desired.&lt;br /&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional teams, including IT, security, and compliance, to ensure IAM aligns with business goals.','Information Technology','Full-time','Mid',NULL,NULL,'INR',1,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2025-08-08 18:30:00',0,0,'2025-06-10 10:10:15.000000','2025-06-10 10:10:16.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Administration\", \"IAM Roles And Policies\"]','[]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('08b17199-bfa4-4ecb-8ea7-2b2d3846515d','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','LIMS Sample manager Technical SME','lims-sample-manager-technical-sme-216-216','&amp;middot; Manage and support instrument integrations with the LIMS system