 Validation domain&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;zzss3i&quot; data-start=&quot;2065&quot; data-end=&quot;2119&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and learning-driven environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'West Bengal'),('091d6449-8efe-4b1f-9875-4d9fc591c92a','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Java Developer','java-developer-10-10','Job Description: We are seeking an experienced and highly skilled Java Developer with 5+ years of hands-on experience to join our team. The ideal candidate will be responsible for designing, developing, and maintaining high-performance, scalable, and reliable Java-based applications. You will collaborate with cross-functional teams to deliver innovative solutions while adhering to best practices and coding standards. Key Responsibilities: Design, develop, and maintain Java-based applications using Java 8/11/17+. Build and integrate RESTful and SOAP APIs. Develop and optimize microservices architecture using Spring Boot and Spring Cloud. Implement efficient and scalable multi-threaded applications. Write clean, modular, and testable code following OOP principles and design patterns. Utilize Hibernate, JPA, or similar ORM frameworks for database interactions. Perform unit testing using JUnit, TestNG, or Mockito. Optimize application performance and ensure security compliance. Collaborate with DevOps teams to implement CI/CD pipelines. Troubleshoot production issues and provide effective solutions. Key Responsibilities: Design, develop, and maintain Java-based applications using Java 8/11/17+. Build and integrate RESTful and SOAP APIs. Develop and optimize microservices architecture using Spring Boot and Spring Cloud. Implement efficient and scalable multi-threaded applications. Write clean, modular, and testable code following OOP principles and design patterns. Utilize Hibernate, JPA, or similar ORM frameworks for database interactions. Perform unit testing using JUnit, TestNG, or Mockito. Optimize application performance and ensure security compliance. Collaborate with DevOps teams to implement CI/CD pipelines. Troubleshoot production issues and provide effective solutions. Required Skills: 5+ years of hands-on experience in Java development. Strong knowledge of Java 8/11/17+ and Spring Framework (Spring Boot, Spring MVC, Spring Data, Spring Security). Experience in RESTful and SOAP API development. Proficiency with SQL and experience with databases such as MySQL, PostgreSQL, or Oracle. Familiarity with NoSQL databases (MongoDB, Redis) is a plus. Strong understanding of microservices architecture and containerization using Docker and Kubernetes. Experience with message brokers (RabbitMQ, Kafka, or ActiveMQ). Proficiency with version control systems (Git, GitHub, GitLab). Experience with Agile methodologies. Excellent problem-solving and debugging skills.','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',200000.00,500000.00,'₹',1,'India','Chennai',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2025-07-02 18:30:00',0,0,'2025-05-04 17:29:41.000000','2025-05-04 17:29:41.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Advanced Java\", \"ASP.NET\", \"Core Java\", \"Git\", \"Github\", \"Java 8+\", \"Java Architecture\", \"Java Developer\", \"Java Full Stack\", \"Java Gui\", \"Java IDE\", \"Java JSP\", \"Java Modules\"]','[\"Perks &amp;amp; Benefits: Competitive salary package Career growth opportunities Comprehensive health insurance Hybrid work model Performance-based incentives Learning and development programs\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Tamil Nadu'),('094c8a63-884c-4c38-83ac-bd9f20c6dcb8','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','DCS Engineer','dcs-engineer-168-168','&lt;p data-start=&quot;147&quot; data-end=&quot;650&quot;&gt;The DCS Engineer will be responsible for designing, configuring, testing, and troubleshooting Distributed Control Systems (DCS) within industrial automation environments. The role includes working with SCADA, PLC systems, HMI configurations, and industrial communication protocols such as Modbus and OPC UA.&lt;br data-start=&quot;454&quot; data-end=&quot;457&quot; /&gt;The ideal candidate will have strong hands-on experience in process automation and digital solutions, along with proficiency in Functional Block and Structured Text programming for DCS control.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;652&quot; data-end=&quot;810&quot;&gt;You will be involved in system configuration, runtime diagnostics, integration testing, security testing, and resolving issues using advanced debugging tools.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Full-time','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Hyderabad',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-04-10 06:00:00',0,0,'2025-12-11 15:31:38.000000','2026-02-09 17:46:57.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Automation\", \"PLC\", \"SCADA\", \"DCS\", \"HMI\", \"Modbus\", \"OPC UA\", \"Functional Block\"]','[\"&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1808&quot; data-end=&quot;2221&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1808&quot; data-end=&quot;1850&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1810&quot; data-end=&quot;1850&quot;&gt;Competitive salary based on experience&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1851&quot; data-end=&quot;1916&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1853&quot; data-end=&quot;1916&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on advanced industrial automation systems&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1917&quot; data-end=&quot;1978&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1919&quot; data-end=&quot;1978&quot;&gt;Exposure to EcoStruxure Foxboro &amp;amp; modern DCS technologies&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1979&quot; data-end=&quot;2044&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1981&quot; data-end=&quot;2044&quot;&gt;Professional growth in process automation &amp;amp; digital solutions&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2045&quot; data-end=&quot;2107&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2047&quot; data-end=&quot;2107&quot;&gt;Collaborative and high-performance engineering environment&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2108&quot; data-end=&quot;2165&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2110&quot; data-end=&quot;2165&quot;&gt;Training opportunities for advanced DCS / SCADA tools&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2166&quot; data-end=&quot;2221&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2168&quot; data-end=&quot;2221&quot;&gt;Health insurance and company-wide employee benefits&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Telangana'),('0992fd0e-4aef-466e-8368-6de09b60aa6c','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Solution Architect – AVEVA MES','solution-architect-aveva-mes-341-341','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;72&quot; data-end=&quot;457&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced Solution Architects &amp;ndash; AVEVA MES for a leading Top MNC to drive enterprise-scale Manufacturing IT, Manufacturing Execution Systems (MES), and Smart Manufacturing transformation initiatives. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in AVEVA MES, Manufacturing Operations Management (MOM), enterprise solution architecture, and Industry 4.0 technologies.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;459&quot; data-end=&quot;904&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for designing, architecting, and delivering end-to-end AVEVA MES solutions for global manufacturing organizations. The role includes defining enterprise MES architectures, translating business requirements into scalable technical solutions, leading digital manufacturing initiatives, supporting MES implementation and migration programs, and ensuring seamless integration with enterprise and shop-floor systems.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;906&quot; data-end=&quot;1373&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with AVEVA MES, AVEVA System Platform, AVEVA Work Tasks (Skelta BPM), AVEVA MDM, AVEVA Enterprise Integrator, AVEVA InTouch, AVEVA OMI, Microsoft SQL Server, C#/.NET, and enterprise manufacturing solutions. Strong knowledge of ISA-95, ISA-88, MESA standards, GMP compliance, production scheduling, OEE, genealogy, traceability, ERP integration, industrial automation, and manufacturing best practices is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1375&quot; data-end=&quot;1890&quot;&gt;The role also involves leading customer workshops, conducting site assessments, preparing Functional Requirement Specifications (FRS) and Functional Design Specifications (FDS), supporting SIT, UAT, validation activities, and collaborating with global business stakeholders, delivery teams, automation engineers, and solution architects to deliver enterprise-grade MES solutions. Candidates should possess strong leadership, consulting, communication, stakeholder management, analytical, and problem-solving skills.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Pune',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-09-13 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-07-16 02:51:23.000000','2026-07-16 02:51:23.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"ERP Integration\", \"Mes\", \"Mes Oee\", \"AVEVA System\", \"AVEVA Intouch HMI\", \"AVEVA MES\", \"AVEVA Work Tasks\", \"AVEVA MDM\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1906&quot; data-end=&quot;1944&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1jb3rem&quot; data-start=&quot;1945&quot; data-end=&quot;2029&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale MES and Smart Manufacturing transformation projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ae7wl8&quot; data-start=&quot;2030&quot; data-end=&quot;2096&quot;&gt;Work on advanced AVEVA MES, MOM, and Industry 4.0 technologies&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1b78xst&quot; data-start=&quot;2097&quot; data-end=&quot;2176&quot;&gt;Career growth in Solution Architecture and Digital Manufacturing Consulting&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;13qji02&quot; data-start=&quot;2177&quot; data-end=&quot;2254&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global manufacturing and technology teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot; data-start=&quot;2255&quot; data-end=&quot;2310&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;2311&quot; data-end=&quot;2354&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Maharashtra'),('09cb3a5e-0f13-48c8-9f18-9fa1b70fe245','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','LabVantage LIMS Consultant','labvantage-lims-consultant-36-36','&lt;p data-start=&quot;225&quot; data-end=&quot;561&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;225&quot; data-end=&quot;265&quot;&gt;Job Role: LabVantage LIMS Consultant&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br data-start=&quot;265&quot; data-end=&quot;268&quot; /&gt;We are seeking an experienced LabVantage LIMS Consultant with strong hands-on experience in Java/.NET-based LIMS application development. The ideal candidate will have a background in LabVantage LIMS, including workflows, customization, integration, implementation, upgradation, and migration.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;563&quot; data-end=&quot;588&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;563&quot; data-end=&quot;588&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;589&quot; data-end=&quot;1047&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;589&quot; data-end=&quot;660&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;591&quot; data-end=&quot;660&quot;&gt;Develop and maintain Java or .NET-based LabVantage LIMS applications.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;661&quot; data-end=&quot;704&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;663&quot; data-end=&quot;704&quot;&gt;Administer and configure LabVantage LIMS.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;705&quot; data-end=&quot;770&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;707&quot; data-end=&quot;770&quot;&gt;Develop and manage workflows, customizations, and integrations.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;771&quot; data-end=&quot;831&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;773&quot; data-end=&quot;831&quot;&gt;Troubleshoot and debug application issues related to LIMS.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;832&quot; data-end=&quot;906&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;834&quot; data-end=&quot;906&quot;&gt;Collaborate with manufacturing and quality teams to gather requirements.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;907&quot; data-end=&quot;971&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;909&quot; data-end=&quot;971&quot;&gt;Ensure smooth upgradation and migration of LabVantage systems.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;972&quot; data-end=&quot;1047&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;974&quot; data-end=&quot;1047&quot;&gt;Communicate effectively with clients and provide technical documentation.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1049&quot; data-end=&quot;1066&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1049&quot; data-end=&quot;1066&quot;&gt;Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1067&quot; data-end=&quot;1326&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1067&quot; data-end=&quot;1127&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1069&quot; data-end=&quot;1127&quot;&gt;5&amp;ndash;15 years of experience in LIMS or Java/.NET development.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1128&quot; data-end=&quot;1199&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1130&quot; data-end=&quot;1199&quot;&gt;At least 3 years of experience in a manufacturing or R&amp;amp;D environment.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1200&quot; data-end=&quot;1263&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1202&quot; data-end=&quot;1263&quot;&gt;Strong analytical, communication, and customer-facing skills.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1264&quot; data-end=&quot;1326&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1266&quot; data-end=&quot;1326&quot;&gt;Bachelor&#039;s degree in Computer Science, IT, or related field.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',1000000.00,2000000.00,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-20 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-05-21 20:30:37.000000','2025-11-21 17:51:43.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\".NET\", \"Java\", \"Lims\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1368&quot; data-end=&quot;1425&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1370&quot; data-end=&quot;1425&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on global LabVantage LIMS projects.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1426&quot; data-end=&quot;1491&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1428&quot; data-end=&quot;1491&quot;&gt;Exposure to manufacturing, quality, and R&amp;amp;D industry processes.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1492&quot; data-end=&quot;1547&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1494&quot; data-end=&quot;1547&quot;&gt;Competitive salary with performance-based incentives.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1548&quot; data-end=&quot;1615&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1550&quot; data-end=&quot;1615&quot;&gt;Professional growth through cross-functional project involvement.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1616&quot; data-end=&quot;1677&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1618&quot; data-end=&quot;1677&quot;&gt;Flexible work environment with a supportive technical team.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1678&quot; data-end=&quot;1757&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1680&quot; data-end=&quot;1757&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience with advanced LIMS configuration and migration practices.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('09fa3835-cfe3-49ef-ab38-03ded7c5b881','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Generative AI Engineer','generative-ai-engineer-310-310','&lt;p data-start=&quot;64&quot; data-end=&quot;376&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced Generative AI Engineers for a leading Top MNC to work on next-generation Artificial Intelligence, Machine Learning, and Generative AI solutions. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in deep learning, large language models, AI model development, and cloud-based AI platforms.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;378&quot; data-end=&quot;744&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for designing, developing, training, and deploying advanced Generative AI models using modern AI architectures such as GPT, GANs, and Variational Autoencoders (VAEs). The role includes building scalable AI/ML pipelines, optimizing model performance, evaluating AI solutions, and delivering production-ready intelligent applications.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;746&quot; data-end=&quot;1075&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with Python, TensorFlow, PyTorch, Keras, Hugging Face, SpaCy, NLTK, and Azure Cloud Services. Strong knowledge of Natural Language Processing (NLP), machine learning algorithms, deep learning techniques, software engineering principles, and AI model optimization is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1077&quot; data-end=&quot;1450&quot;&gt;The role also involves collaborating with Data Scientists, Product Managers, AI Researchers, and Engineering teams to deliver enterprise-grade AI solutions, researching emerging AI technologies, mentoring junior engineers, and establishing AI development best practices. Candidates should possess excellent analytical, communication, innovation, and problem-solving skills.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Hyderabad',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-08-24 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-06-26 03:27:38.000000','2026-06-26 03:27:38.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Artificial Intelligence\", \"Machine Learning\", \"Python\", \"Generative AI\", \"NLP\", \"PyTorch\", \"TensorFlow\", \"Deep Learning\", \"Hugging Face\", \"GPT-4V\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot; data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1466&quot; data-end=&quot;1504&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1gr0ud4&quot; data-start=&quot;1505&quot; data-end=&quot;1577&quot;&gt;Exposure to cutting-edge Generative AI and Machine Learning projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1tex9ov&quot; data-start=&quot;1578&quot; data-end=&quot;1648&quot;&gt;Work on enterprise-scale AI and Digital Transformation initiatives&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot; data-section-id=&quot;12mcwph&quot; data-start=&quot;1649&quot; data-end=&quot;1716&quot;&gt;Career growth in Artificial Intelligence &amp;amp; Generative AI domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot; data-section-id=&quot;zc03ak&quot; data-start=&quot;1717&quot; data-end=&quot;1793&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global AI research and engineering teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot; data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot; data-start=&quot;1794&quot; data-end=&quot;1849&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;1850&quot; data-end=&quot;1893&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Telangana'),('0ac58135-61a5-4a3c-8eba-d944f505a580','17565d96-d8e6-40f7-9164-89949657dabc','e28d7456-6b42-4900-abc8-e9302f5153c5','Backend Sales Executive','backend-sales-executive-57-57','Key Responsibilities:&lt;br /&gt;&bull; Handle backend sales operations including quotation preparation, order processing, and invoice&lt;br /&gt;generation&lt;br /&gt;&bull; Coordinate with field sales team to manage customer requirements and ensure timely&lt;br /&gt;communication&lt;br /&gt;&bull; Follow up on inquiries and quotations shared with clients&lt;br /&gt;&bull; Maintain and update CRM and sales reports&lt;br /&gt;&bull; Assist in the preparation of sales proposals and presentations&lt;br /&gt;&bull; Communicate with customers for follow-ups, payment reminders, and documentation&lt;br /&gt;&bull; Work closely with the logistics and operations team for smooth order dispatch and delivery.','Sales','Full-time','Entry',12000.00,15000.00,'₹',1,'India','Ghaziabad',0,1,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-03-31 06:00:00',0,0,'2025-06-16 09:08:20.000000','2025-12-23 17:07:55.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Cold Calling\", \"Quotation\", \"Sales\"]','[\"As per the Company Standereds\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Uttar Pradesh'),('0ade40b2-c5d6-40d5-a8ef-80eee10d8b9e','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Back End Developer','back-end-developer-42-42','&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;423&quot; data-end=&quot;444&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;427&quot; data-end=&quot;444&quot;&gt;Job Overview:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;446&quot; data-end=&quot;1031&quot;&gt;We are seeking an experienced Back End Developer to join our team for the development of the &lt;strong data-start=&quot;539&quot; data-end=&quot;610&quot;&gt;Next Gen MITS (Manufacturing, Inventory, and Transportation System)&lt;/strong&gt; application. This is an exciting opportunity to contribute to the design, development, and implementation of a robust enterprise-level system with a focus on various business functionalities including Receiving, Production, Shipping, Transportation, Invoicing, and Finance. The ideal candidate will play a key role in backend development with expertise in AWS services, microservices architecture, and .NET technologies.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;hr data-start=&quot;1033&quot; data-end=&quot;1036&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;1038&quot; data-end=&quot;1067&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1042&quot; data-end=&quot;1067&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1068&quot; data-end=&quot;2046&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1068&quot; data-end=&quot;1239&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1070&quot; data-end=&quot;1239&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1070&quot; data-end=&quot;1094&quot;&gt;Design &amp;amp; Development&lt;/strong&gt;: Work on the backend design and development of the Next Gen MITS application, focusing on the integration and orchestration of various services.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1240&quot; data-end=&quot;1359&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1242&quot; data-end=&quot;1359&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1242&quot; data-end=&quot;1261&quot;&gt;API Development&lt;/strong&gt;: Build and maintain Restful APIs and integrate with other services and systems using API Gateway.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1360&quot; data-end=&quot;1469&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1362&quot; data-end=&quot;1469&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1362&quot; data-end=&quot;1380&quot;&gt;Cloud Services&lt;/strong&gt;: Utilize AWS services such as Lambda, Fargate, and S3 for scalable and secure solutions.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1470&quot; data-end=&quot;1583&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1472&quot; data-end=&quot;1583&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1472&quot; data-end=&quot;1495&quot;&gt;Database Management&lt;/strong&gt;: Work with PostgreSQL and Aurora databases for efficient data management and retrieval.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1584&quot; data-end=&quot;1730&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1586&quot; data-end=&quot;1730&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1586&quot; data-end=&quot;1616&quot;&gt;Microservices Architecture&lt;/strong&gt;: Implement domain-driven design with macro, micro, and nano services to ensure modular and scalable architecture.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1731&quot; data-end=&quot;1895&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1733&quot; data-end=&quot;1895&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1733&quot; data-end=&quot;1750&quot;&gt;Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;: Work closely with cross-functional teams including product managers, front-end developers, and QA engineers to ensure smooth project execution.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1896&quot; data-end=&quot;2046&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1898&quot; data-end=&quot;2046&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1898&quot; data-end=&quot;1924&quot;&gt;Continuous Improvement&lt;/strong&gt;: Continuously monitor the performance of developed services and make improvements to enhance reliability and scalability.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;hr data-start=&quot;2048&quot; data-end=&quot;2051&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;2053&quot; data-end=&quot;2090&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2057&quot; data-end=&quot;2090&quot;&gt;Required Skills &amp;amp; Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2092&quot; data-end=&quot;2964&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2092&quot; data-end=&quot;2219&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2094&quot; data-end=&quot;2219&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2094&quot; data-end=&quot;2118&quot;&gt;AWS Lambda &amp;amp; Fargate&lt;/strong&gt;: Expertise in AWS Lambda and Fargate for serverless application development (Proficiency Level: E2).&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2220&quot; data-end=&quot;2358&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2222&quot; data-end=&quot;2358&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2222&quot; data-end=&quot;2241&quot;&gt;AWS S3 &amp;amp; Aurora&lt;/strong&gt;: Solid experience in using AWS S3 for storage and Aurora for relational database management (Proficiency Level: E2).&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2359&quot; data-end=&quot;2481&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2361&quot; data-end=&quot;2481&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2361&quot; data-end=&quot;2375&quot;&gt;PostgreSQL&lt;/strong&gt;: Strong hands-on experience with PostgreSQL for database design and optimization (Proficiency Level: E2).&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2482&quot; data-end=&quot;2600&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2484&quot; data-end=&quot;2600&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2484&quot; data-end=&quot;2501&quot;&gt;Microservices&lt;/strong&gt;: In-depth understanding of microservices architecture and design patterns (Proficiency Level: E2).&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2601&quot; data-end=&quot;2702&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2603&quot; data-end=&quot;2702&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2603&quot; data-end=&quot;2616&quot;&gt;.NET &amp;amp; C#&lt;/strong&gt;: Extensive experience in .NET and C# for backend development (Proficiency Level: E2).&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2703&quot; data-end=&quot;2817&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2705&quot; data-end=&quot;2817&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2705&quot; data-end=&quot;2730&quot;&gt;ETL, Data Engineering&lt;/strong&gt;: Experience with ETL processes and data engineering practices (Proficiency Level: E1).&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2818&quot; data-end=&quot;2964&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2820&quot; data-end=&quot;2964&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2820&quot; data-end=&quot;2850&quot;&gt;Restful APIs &amp;amp; API Gateway&lt;/strong&gt;: Experience in developing and maintaining RESTful APIs, and working with AWS API Gateway (Proficiency Level: E1).&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;2971&quot; data-end=&quot;3000&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2975&quot; data-end=&quot;2999&quot;&gt;Desired Competencies&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;h4 data-start=&quot;3002&quot; data-end=&quot;3021&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3007&quot; data-end=&quot;3020&quot;&gt;Must-Have&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/h4&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;3022&quot; data-end=&quot;3605&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;3022&quot; data-end=&quot;3138&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;3024&quot; data-end=&quot;3138&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3024&quot; data-end=&quot;3049&quot;&gt;Hands-on AWS Services&lt;/strong&gt;: Practical experience working with AWS services such as Lambda, Fargate, S3, and others.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;3139&quot; data-end=&quot;3305&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;3141&quot; data-end=&quot;3305&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3141&quot; data-end=&quot;3172&quot;&gt;Backend Development for MVP&lt;/strong&gt;: Experience working on the backend of a Minimum Viable Product (MVP), focusing on key business functionalities and rapid iterations.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;3306&quot; data-end=&quot;3435&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;3308&quot; data-end=&quot;3435&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3308&quot; data-end=&quot;3338&quot;&gt;Microservices Architecture&lt;/strong&gt;: Proven experience in designing and developing applications based on microservices architecture.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;3436&quot; data-end=&quot;3605&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;3438&quot; data-end=&quot;3605&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3438&quot; data-end=&quot;3470&quot;&gt;Standardization &amp;amp; Automation&lt;/strong&gt;: Experience working on standardization of processes and automating various aspects of backend development, deployment, and monitoring.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',500000.00,2500000.00,'₹',0,'India','Pune',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-30 06:00:00',0,0,'2025-06-06 08:18:49.000000','2026-05-12 14:55:06.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"AWS\", \"AWS Fargate\", \"AWS Lambda\", \"Backend Development\", \"PostgreSQL\", \"RESTFUL APIS\"]','[\"&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;89&quot; data-end=&quot;110&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;93&quot; data-end=&quot;109&quot;&gt;Job Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/h3&gt;\\r\\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;112&quot; data-end=&quot;898&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;112&quot; data-end=&quot;192&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;114&quot; data-end=&quot;192&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;114&quot; data-end=&quot;136&quot;&gt;Competitive Salary&lt;/strong&gt;: Attractive pay package based on experience and skills.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;193&quot; data-end=&quot;272&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;195&quot; data-end=&quot;272&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;195&quot; data-end=&quot;216&quot;&gt;Health &amp;amp; Wellness&lt;/strong&gt;: Comprehensive medical insurance and wellness programs.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;273&quot; data-end=&quot;358&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;275&quot; data-end=&quot;358&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;275&quot; data-end=&quot;302&quot;&gt;Remote Work Flexibility&lt;/strong&gt;: Option to work from any location (remote flexibility).&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;359&quot; data-end=&quot;457&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;361&quot; data-end=&quot;457&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;361&quot; data-end=&quot;387&quot;&gt;Learning &amp;amp; Development&lt;/strong&gt;: Opportunities for continuous learning, training, and certifications.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;458&quot; data-end=&quot;534&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;460&quot; data-end=&quot;534&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;460&quot; data-end=&quot;477&quot;&gt;Career Growth&lt;/strong&gt;: Clear path for career progression and leadership roles.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;535&quot; data-end=&quot;641&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;537&quot; data-end=&quot;641&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;537&quot; data-end=&quot;558&quot;&gt;Work-Life Balance&lt;/strong&gt;: Flexible working hours and paid time off to maintain a healthy work-life balance.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Maharashtra'),('0b517ba3-c5f5-473f-8feb-aa1dc5c0f259','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','AVEVA MES','aveva-mes-276-276','&lt;p data-start=&quot;63&quot; data-end=&quot;297&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced AVEVA MES Developers for a leading Top MNC through TCS engagement. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in AVEVA MES, AVEVA System Platform, Wonderware MES, and industrial automation technologies.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;299&quot; data-end=&quot;608&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for developing, implementing, and supporting MES applications using the AVEVA Suite for enterprise manufacturing environments. The role includes system platform deployment, environment setup, MES workflow understanding, and end-to-end application development and maintenance.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;610&quot; data-end=&quot;955&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with AVEVA Work Tasks (Skelta BPM), AVEVA MDM, SQL scripting, .NET/C# development, and MES lifecycle implementation projects. Strong understanding of manufacturing operations, performance and quality modules, along with industrial automation standards such as ISA-95 and ISA-88, is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;957&quot; data-end=&quot;1250&quot;&gt;The role also involves integration with PLC, OPC, SCADA, Wonderware Historian, and Object Integration Server technologies. Candidates should possess strong troubleshooting, analytical, communication, and client-handling skills to support global manufacturing projects and technical operations.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'INR',0,'India','Pune',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-07-20 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-05-22 01:43:26.000000','2026-05-22 01:43:26.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\".NET Development\", \"AvevaWonderware\", \"C#\", \"Mes API Development\", \"SQL\", \"AVEVA System\", \"AVEVA MES\", \"ISA-95\", \"ISA-88\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;16tpspo&quot; data-start=&quot;1266&quot; data-end=&quot;1316&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC through TCS&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;dhap5i&quot; data-start=&quot;1317&quot; data-end=&quot;1368&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-level AVEVA MES projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;acdy3w&quot; data-start=&quot;1369&quot; data-end=&quot;1446&quot;&gt;Work on advanced Manufacturing Execution Systems and automation solutions&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;127edrt&quot; data-start=&quot;1447&quot; data-end=&quot;1502&quot;&gt;Career growth in MES &amp;amp; Industrial Automation domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;8vszhn&quot; data-start=&quot;1503&quot; data-end=&quot;1567&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global manufacturing clients&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;45fk39&quot; data-start=&quot;1568&quot; data-end=&quot;1623&quot;&gt;Professional and technology-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;1624&quot; data-end=&quot;1667&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Maharashtra'),('0c184144-b806-42a1-8959-2311213861b4','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Java Apache Camel Developer','java-apache-camel-developer-150-150','&lt;p data-start=&quot;305&quot; data-end=&quot;725&quot;&gt;We are seeking an experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;335&quot; data-end=&quot;366&quot;&gt;Java Apache Camel Developer&lt;/strong&gt; to design, build, and deliver scalable enterprise applications. The ideal candidate will have strong expertise in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;481&quot; data-end=&quot;497&quot;&gt;Apache Camel&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong data-start=&quot;499&quot; data-end=&quot;507&quot;&gt;Java&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong data-start=&quot;509&quot; data-end=&quot;524&quot;&gt;Spring Boot&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong data-start=&quot;526&quot; data-end=&quot;543&quot;&gt;Microservices&lt;/strong&gt;, and modern UI frameworks. You will be responsible for integration development, front-end enhancements, backend engineering, API development, and end-to-end application performance.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;727&quot; data-end=&quot;758&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;731&quot; data-end=&quot;756&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;759&quot; data-end=&quot;1491&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;759&quot; data-end=&quot;865&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;761&quot; data-end=&quot;865&quot;&gt;Develop and maintain integration workflows using &lt;strong data-start=&quot;810&quot; data-end=&quot;826&quot;&gt;Apache Camel&lt;/strong&gt; and enterprise integration patterns.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;866&quot; data-end=&quot;961&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;868&quot; data-end=&quot;961&quot;&gt;Build scalable backend services using &lt;strong data-start=&quot;906&quot; data-end=&quot;958&quot;&gt;Java 8+, Spring Boot, Microservices architecture&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;962&quot; data-end=&quot;1059&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;964&quot; data-end=&quot;1059&quot;&gt;Work with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;974&quot; data-end=&quot;1006&quot;&gt;AngularJS / ReactJS / NodeJS&lt;/strong&gt; to develop intuitive and responsive UI components.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1060&quot; data-end=&quot;1146&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1062&quot; data-end=&quot;1146&quot;&gt;Develop and maintain &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1083&quot; data-end=&quot;1101&quot;&gt;REST/SOAP APIs&lt;/strong&gt; for seamless communication across systems.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1147&quot; data-end=&quot;1231&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1149&quot; data-end=&quot;1231&quot;&gt;Write optimized SQL queries and work with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1191&quot; data-end=&quot;1218&quot;&gt;PostgreSQL / SQL Server&lt;/strong&gt; databases.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1232&quot; data-end=&quot;1320&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1234&quot; data-end=&quot;1320&quot;&gt;Conduct unit tests using &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1259&quot; data-end=&quot;1289&quot;&gt;JEST, Jasmine, Mocha, Chai&lt;/strong&gt; to ensure high-quality code.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1321&quot; data-end=&quot;1425&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1323&quot; data-end=&quot;1425&quot;&gt;Collaborate with product owners, architects, and cross-functional teams to deliver robust solutions.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1426&quot; data-end=&quot;1491&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1428&quot; data-end=&quot;1491&quot;&gt;Participate in code reviews and follow best coding practices.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Full-time','Entry',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Pune',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-24 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-11-26 02:56:11.000000','2025-11-26 02:56:11.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Angular JS\", \"Bootstrap\", \"CSS\", \"HTML5\", \"Java 8+\", \"Microservices Architectures\", \"Node JS\", \"PostgreSQL\", \"React JS\", \"REST Webservices\", \"SAAS\", \"SOAP\", \"Spring Boot\", \"SQL\", \"SQL Server\", \"Jest\", \"Jasmine\", \"Mocha\", \"Chai.Js\", \"Apache Camel\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2139&qu