749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Cimplicity Engineer','cimplicity-engineer-327-327','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;61&quot; data-end=&quot;420&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced Cimplicity Engineers for a leading Top MNC to work on enterprise-scale Industrial Automation, HMI/SCADA, and Smart Manufacturing projects. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in GE Proficy Cimplicity, Cimplicity Tracker, SCADA application development, and industrial system integration within manufacturing environments.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;422&quot; data-end=&quot;821&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for designing, developing, implementing, and supporting GE Proficy Cimplicity HMI/SCADA applications for industrial automation systems. The role includes creating and maintaining HMI screens, developing application scripts, troubleshooting production issues, supporting system enhancements, and integrating SCADA applications with enterprise and shop-floor systems.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;823&quot; data-end=&quot;1164&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with GE Proficy Cimplicity, Cimplicity Tracker, HMI/SCADA screen development, scripting, application support, and industrial automation solutions. Strong knowledge of manufacturing systems, industrial communication, SCADA integration, troubleshooting, and production support is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1166&quot; data-end=&quot;1581&quot;&gt;The role also involves collaborating with cross-functional project teams, supporting system integration activities, preparing technical documentation, mentoring junior engineers, and ensuring high system availability and performance. Candidates should possess strong analytical, communication, troubleshooting, and problem-solving skills with the ability to work independently in fast-paced industrial environments&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Chennai',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-09-05 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-07-08 02:46:00.000000','2026-07-08 02:46:00.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Industrial Automation\", \"Manufacturing Execution Systems\", \"GE Proficy Cimplicity\", \"Cimplicity Tracker\", \"HMI Development\", \"SCADA Development\", \"Screen Scripting\", \"GE Proficy Suite\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1597&quot; data-end=&quot;1635&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;mjtz5&quot; data-start=&quot;1636&quot; data-end=&quot;1709&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale Industrial Automation and SCADA projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;a5lm0b&quot; data-start=&quot;1710&quot; data-end=&quot;1789&quot;&gt;Work on advanced GE Proficy Cimplicity and Smart Manufacturing technologies&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;h9f9au&quot; data-start=&quot;1790&quot; data-end=&quot;1847&quot;&gt;Career growth in Industrial Automation &amp;amp; SCADA domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1g8u6de&quot; data-start=&quot;1848&quot; data-end=&quot;1923&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global automation and engineering teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot; data-start=&quot;1924&quot; data-end=&quot;1979&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;1980&quot; data-end=&quot;2023&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Tamil Nadu'),('0d88b8cb-567a-441d-8447-d9fb4267ec4f','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','MES Developer','mes-developer-214-214','&lt;p&gt;&amp;middot; MES Emerson Syncade system development &lt;br /&gt;(Preferably having working/configuration knowledge in MES, Manufacturing Suite &amp;ndash; Aspen, AMS: IP21, A1PE, APRM, etc)&lt;br /&gt;&amp;middot; Hands on SQL Scripting&lt;br /&gt;&amp;middot; Pharma Knowledge/Validation Process&lt;br /&gt;&amp;middot; Good to have Pharma OEE expertise (not mandatory)&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Entry',NULL,NULL,'INR',1,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-05-17 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-03-18 17:35:10.000000','2026-03-18 17:35:10.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"AMS Professional\", \"Aspen HYSYS\", \"Mes\", \"SQL\", \"IP21\", \"Emerson Syncade MES\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;Competitive salary package with performance-based incentives&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;65&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;67&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;Health insurance coverage and statutory benefits (PF &amp;amp; Gratuity)&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;134&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;136&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on large-scale enterprise energy management projects&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;211&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;213&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;Strong career growth and learning opportunities&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;263&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;265&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;Collaborative and professional work environment&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('0dae8ab3-1b02-416e-a6f0-2433f55a3b04','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','AVEVA MES Consultant','aveva-mes-consultant-60-60','We are looking for an experienced AVEVA MES Consultant to join our team. If you have expertise in industrial automation and MES implementation and are passionate about delivering technology solutions, we&amp;rsquo;d love to hear from you!&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Design, develop, and implement AVEVA MES systems across various projects.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional teams to gather and analyze requirements.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Perform system integration and testing to ensure smooth functionality.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Work on lifecycle MES implementations and system upgrades.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Provide training and support for end-users and clients.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Troubleshoot and resolve technical issues in a timely manner.','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',500000.00,1500000.00,'₹',1,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-19 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-07-01 08:56:06.000000','2025-11-21 04:57:28.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\".NET\", \"ERP Integration\", \"JavaScript\", \"Mes Architect\", \"Mom\", \"SCADA\", \"SQL\", \"AVEVA MES\"]','[\"Competitive salary based on experience.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Opportunity to work with global clients on cutting-edge technology.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Comprehensive health and wellness benefits.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Flexible work arrangements (remote or hybrid, if applicable).&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Professional growth opportunities through certifications and training.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Paid leave, including vacation, sick leave, and public holidays.\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('0e231d89-e4b7-4561-897c-4362ab749ea1','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Empower 3 CDS & NuGenesis 9 Deployment and Support Lead','empower-3-cds-nugenesis-9-deployment-and-support-lead-343-343','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;97&quot; data-end=&quot;569&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;123&quot; data-end=&quot;183&quot;&gt;Empower 3 CDS &amp;amp; NuGenesis 9 Deployment and Support Leads&lt;/strong&gt; for a leading Top MNC to support enterprise-scale Laboratory Informatics, Chromatography Data Systems (CDS), Scientific Data Management Systems (SDMS), and Digital Laboratory Transformation initiatives. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in Waters Empower 3 CDS, NuGenesis SDMS/ELN, laboratory system administration, validation, and regulated pharmaceutical environments.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;571&quot; data-end=&quot;1046&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for deploying, configuring, administering, and supporting Waters Empower 3 CDS and NuGenesis 9 SDMS/ELN platforms across global laboratory environments. The role includes system installation and configuration, chromatography instrument integration, laboratory workflow customization, user and security management, system upgrades, patch management, troubleshooting, and production support while ensuring compliance with regulatory standards.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1048&quot; data-end=&quot;1550&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with Waters Empower 3 CDS, NuGenesis SDMS, NuGenesis ELN, HPLC, UPLC, GC instrument integration, laboratory workflow configuration, file capture, print capture templates, user administration, security management, validation activities (IQ, OQ, PQ), and enterprise system integration. Strong knowledge of GxP, FDA 21 CFR Part 11, EU GMP Annex 11, ALCOA+ Data Integrity principles, SOP creation, change control, and laboratory compliance is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1552&quot; data-end=&quot;2056&quot;&gt;The role also involves collaborating with laboratory scientists, quality assurance teams, IT administrators, validation teams, and global business stakeholders to deliver reliable laboratory informatics solutions. Candidates will support enterprise laboratory transformation initiatives, perform root cause analysis, prepare technical documentation, manage incidents, and ensure high system availability. Strong analytical, communication, stakeholder management, and problem-solving skills are essential.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Hyderabad',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-09-15 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-07-18 03:11:38.000000','2026-07-18 03:11:38.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"CSV\", \"ERP\", \"Gxp Compliance\", \"OQ\", \"PQ\", \"Role-Based Access Control (Rbac)\", \"Electronic Lab Notebook (ELN)\", \"21 CFR Part 11\", \"SDMS Integration\", \"Waters Empower\", \"Chromatography Data Systems (CDS)\", \"LIMS Integration\", \"ELN Integration\", \"Waters Empower CDS\", \"NuGenesis SDMS Administration\", \"NuGenesis ELN Administration\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;2072&quot; data-end=&quot;2110&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;12yjmd7&quot; data-start=&quot;2111&quot; data-end=&quot;2213&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale Laboratory Informatics and Digital Laboratory Transformation projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;11xsrw2&quot; data-start=&quot;2214&quot; data-end=&quot;2293&quot;&gt;Work with advanced Waters Empower 3 CDS and NuGenesis SDMS/ELN technologies&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;svxamc&quot; data-start=&quot;2294&quot; data-end=&quot;2370&quot;&gt;Career growth in Laboratory Informatics, CDS, SDMS, and Life Sciences IT&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1n46o5e&quot; data-start=&quot;2371&quot; data-end=&quot;2452&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global pharmaceutical and life sciences teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot; data-start=&quot;2453&quot; data-end=&quot;2508&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;2509&quot; data-end=&quot;2552&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Telangana'),('0e433bcb-4224-4ef0-9d1f-02ee4901fef3','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','UI Developer (Angular)','ui-developer-angular-132-132','&lt;p data-start=&quot;198&quot; data-end=&quot;715&quot;&gt;A top multinational company is looking for an experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;256&quot; data-end=&quot;272&quot;&gt;UI Developer&lt;/strong&gt; with strong expertise in Angular 16+, TypeScript, RxJS, and state-management tools like NgRX. The ideal candidate will be responsible for building scalable, high-performance, and visually appealing web applications. You will work with cross-functional teams, write high-quality code, integrate APIs, and contribute to architecture and design discussions. Experience with NodeJS, cloud technologies, and monitoring tools is a strong advantage.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;717&quot; data-end=&quot;863&quot;&gt;This is an excellent opportunity to join a global, innovation-driven organization where you can contribute to world-class enterprise applications.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;hr data-start=&quot;865&quot; data-end=&quot;868&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;870&quot; data-end=&quot;899&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;873&quot; data-end=&quot;899&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;900&quot; data-end=&quot;1628&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;900&quot; data-end=&quot;989&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;902&quot; data-end=&quot;989&quot;&gt;Develop rich and dynamic UI components using &lt;strong data-start=&quot;947&quot; data-end=&quot;987&quot;&gt;Angular 16+, TypeScript, RxJS &amp;amp; NgRX&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;990&quot; data-end=&quot;1060&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;992&quot; data-end=&quot;1060&quot;&gt;Build scalable front-end architecture for enterprise-level syste