9-02 02:23:18.000000','2026-09-02 02:23:18.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Automation SDET\", \"Automation Testing\", \"C++\", \"Debugging Skills\", \"Design Patterns\", \"Functional Scenario Testing\", \"Jenkins\", \"Mes\", \"Multithreading\", \"OOPS\", \"Python\", \"Root Cause Analysis\", \"Scripting\", \"Unit Testing\", \"CI/CD\", \"Integration Testing\", \"SolidWorks\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;rdheb3&quot; data-start=&quot;1274&quot; data-end=&quot;1321&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a leading global MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;vsimwd&quot; data-start=&quot;1322&quot; data-end=&quot;1389&quot;&gt;Exposure to advanced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1345&quot; data-end=&quot;1389&quot;&gt;MES and manufacturing software platforms&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;i97h5m&quot; data-start=&quot;1390&quot; data-end=&quot;1449&quot;&gt;Work on high-performance and large-scale C++ applications&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;l9a2m9&quot; data-start=&quot;1450&quot; data-end=&quot;1521&quot;&gt;Exposure to &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1464&quot; data-end=&quot;1521&quot;&gt;Semiconductor Manufacturing and Industrial Technology&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1d6aeui&quot; data-start=&quot;1522&quot; data-end=&quot;1586&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on modern C++ and advanced test automation&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;oqv0m4&quot; data-start=&quot;1587&quot; data-end=&quot;1652&quot;&gt;Experience with CI/CD and modern software engineering practices&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1vffrfl&quot; data-start=&quot;1653&quot; data-end=&quot;1714&quot;&gt;Collaboration with global development and engineering teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Telangana'),('10b9b628-847a-4871-aa04-44f994498647','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','ASP .Net Developer','asp-net-developer-1-1','ASP .Net Developer','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',500000.00,700000.00,'₹',1,'India','Pune',0,1,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-31 06:00:00',0,0,'2025-05-03 17:09:07.000000','2026-05-12 14:49:36.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\".NET\", \"ASP.NET MVC\", \"C#\", \"HTML\", \"MYSQL\"]','[\"ASP .Net Developer\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Maharashtra'),('11185161-3d00-4855-99e4-fbfa6c8f2f55','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','PLC Engineer – Siemens S7 (Industrial Automation & Equipment Remediation)  Job Description','plc-engineer-siemens-s7-industrial-automation-equipment-remediation-job-description-315-315','&lt;p data-start=&quot;115&quot; data-end=&quot;430&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced PLC Engineers for a leading Top MNC to work on Industrial Automation, Equipment Remediation, and Smart Manufacturing projects. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in Siemens S7 PLC programming, TIA Portal, industrial automation systems, and brownfield equipment modernization.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;432&quot; data-end=&quot;784&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for developing, modifying, testing, and optimizing Siemens S7 PLC programs for manufacturing and industrial automation environments. The role includes equipment remediation, PLC logic redevelopment, HMI and SCADA integration, and seamless connectivity between shop-floor automation systems and enterprise applications.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;786&quot; data-end=&quot;1144&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with Siemens S7 PLCs, TIA Portal, Step 7, PLC/HMI/SCADA integration, OPC-UA, Kepware, SQL databases, and industrial communication protocols such as PROFINET and PROFIBUS. Strong understanding of manufacturing automation, equipment commissioning, validation, and enterprise system integration is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1146&quot; data-end=&quot;1515&quot;&gt;The role also involves supporting Factory Acceptance Testing (FAT), Site Acceptance Testing (SAT), IQ/OQ/UAT activities, commissioning, Hypercare support, technical documentation, SOP preparation, and troubleshooting. Candidates will collaborate with OEMs, MES teams, IT teams, and automation engineers to deliver reliable and compliant industrial automation solutions.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'INR',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-08-28 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-06-30 03:28:46.000000','2026-06-30 03:28:46.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"ERP\", \"Industrial Automation\", \"PLC Programming\", \"SAP\", \"SCADA\", \"Siemens\", \"Profinet\", \"HMI\", \"Siemens Tia Portal\", \"Kepware\", \"OPC UA\", \"Profibus\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1531&quot; data-end=&quot;1569&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1402v26&quot; data-start=&quot;1570&quot; data-end=&quot;1633&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale Industrial Automation projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;11n2mh7&quot; data-start=&quot;1634&quot; data-end=&quot;1697&quot;&gt;Work on Siemens S7 PLC and Smart Manufacturing technologies&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1rxjyxk&quot; data-start=&quot;1698&quot; data-end=&quot;1771&quot;&gt;Career growth in Industrial Automation &amp;amp; Digital Manufacturing domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;13mqfss&quot; data-start=&quot;1772&quot; data-end=&quot;1842&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global OEMs and automation experts&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;45fk39&quot; data-start=&quot;1843&quot; data-end=&quot;1898&quot;&gt;Professional and technology-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;1899&quot; data-end=&quot;1942&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('1125cd91-2f77-4aca-864d-5f3a92a6736c','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Knowledge Lead – Cyber Security Documentation & Governance','knowledge-lead-cyber-security-documentation-governance-187-187','&lt;p data-start=&quot;188&quot; data-end=&quot;501&quot;&gt;We are seeking an experienced Knowledge Lead to own end-to-end cybersecurity documentation, governance artifacts, and audit-ready deliverables. The role focuses on SOPs, runbooks, handover packs, training content, and final security posture reporting while coordinating with multiple technical and business teams.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;512&quot; data-end=&quot;526&quot;&gt;Key Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;529&quot; data-end=&quot;932&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;529&quot; data-end=&quot;569&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;531&quot; data-end=&quot;569&quot;&gt;Technical documentation &amp;amp; governance&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;570&quot; data-end=&quot;597&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;572&quot; data-end=&quot;597&quot;&gt;SOP / Runbook authoring&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;598&quot; data-end=&quot;640&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;600&quot; data-end=&quot;640&quot;&gt;Handover &amp;amp; reversibility documentation&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;641&quot; data-end=&quot;686&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;643&quot; data-end=&quot;686&quot;&gt;Audit evidence &amp;amp; compliance documentation&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;687&quot; data-end=&quot;724&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;689&quot; data-end=&quot;724&quot;&gt;Final posture &amp;amp; summary reporting&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;725&quot; data-end=&quot;768&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;727&quot; data-end=&quot;768&quot;&gt;Version control &amp;amp; repository management&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;769&quot; data-end=&quot;802&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;771&quot; data-end=&quot;802&quot;&gt;Training material development&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;803&quot; data-end=&quot;833&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;805&quot; data-end=&quot;833&quot;&gt;Documentation gap analysis&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;834&quot; data-end=&quot;882&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;836&quot; data-end=&quot;882&quot;&gt;Stakeholder coordination (Client / OEM / SI)&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;883&quot; data-end=&quot;932&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;885&quot; data-end=&quot;932&quot;&gt;Clear technical &amp;amp; non-technical communication&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Chennai',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-04-10 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-02-09 18:32:22.000000','2026-02-09 18:32:22.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"SOP Development\", \"Technical Documentation\", \"Technical Support\", \"OEM\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1044&quot; data-end=&quot;1107&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1046&quot; data-end=&quot;1107&quot;&gt;Opportunity to lead critical cybersecurity knowledge assets&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1108&quot; data-end=&quot;1173&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1110&quot; data-end=&quot;1173&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-level audits and governance frameworks&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1174&quot; data-end=&quot;1217&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1176&quot; data-end=&quot;1217&quot;&gt;Work with cross-functional global teams&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1218&quot; data-end=&quot;1292&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1220&quot; data-end=&quot;1292&quot;&gt;Strong career growth in security governance &amp;amp; documentation leadership&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1293&quot; data-end=&quot;1362&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1295&quot; data-end=&quot;1362&quot;&gt;High-visibility role supporting go-live and operational readiness&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Tamil Nadu'),('1157c3e2-ff4d-4686-bd89-514e33ac6243','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','HighByte Developer','highbyte-developer-149-149','&lt;p data-start=&quot;167&quot; data-end=&quot;500&quot;&gt;We are looking for an experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;201&quot; data-end=&quot;223&quot;&gt;HighByte Developer&lt;/strong&gt; who can design, configure, and implement data integration solutions using &lt;strong data-start=&quot;298&quot; data-end=&quot;327&quot;&gt;HighByte Intelligence Hub&lt;/strong&gt;. The role involves building scalable &lt;strong data-start=&quot;365&quot; data-end=&quot;392&quot;&gt;Unified Namespace (UNS)&lt;/strong&gt; architectures, integrating OT and IT systems, and ensuring smooth data flow across enterprise environments.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;502&quot; data-end=&quot;806&quot;&gt;The ideal candidate will work closely with automation teams, MES engineers, and enterprise IT to model industrial data, set up brokers, configure communication protocols, and apply ISA-95 standards. Experience in the &lt;strong data-start=&quot;719&quot; data-end=&quot;736&quot;&gt;pharma domain&lt;/strong&gt;, especially with GxP-compliant processes, will be a strong advantage.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;808&quot; data-end=&quot;835&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;808&quot; data-end=&quot;833&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;836&quot; data-end=&quot;1405&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;836&quot; data-end=&quot;920&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;838&quot; data-end=&quot;920&quot;&gt;Install, configure, and develop applications using &lt;strong data-start=&quot;889&quot; data-end=&quot;918&quot;&gt;HighByte Intelligence Hub&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;921&quot; data-end=&quot;989&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;923&quot; data-end=&quot;989&quot;&gt;Build, deploy, and manage &lt;strong data-start=&quot;949&quot; data-end=&quot;976&quot;&gt;UNS (Unified Namespace)&lt;/strong&gt; structures&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;990&quot; data-end=&quot;1047&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;992&quot; data-end=&quot;1047&quot;&gt;Set up and integrate MQTT brokers (HiveMQ, Mosquitto)&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1048&quot; data-end=&quot;1132&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1050&quot; data-end=&quot;1132&quot;&gt;Work with industrial communication protocols such as &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1103&quot; data-end=&quot;1130&quot;&gt;OPC UA, MQTT, REST APIs&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1133&quot; data-end=&quot;1207&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1135&quot; data-end=&quot;1207&quot;&gt;Implement ISA-95 hierarchical modeling and mapping for OT&amp;ndash;IT data flow&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1208&quot; data-end=&quot;1264&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1210&quot; data-end=&quot;1264&quot;&gt;Integrate HighByte with PLC, SCADA, MES, ERP systems&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1265&quot; data-end=&quot;1330&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1267&quot; data-end=&quot;1330&quot;&gt;Support pharma workflows with adherence to &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1310&quot; data-end=&quot;1328&quot;&gt;GxP compliance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1331&quot; data-end=&quot;1405&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1333&quot; data-end=&quot;1405&quot;&gt;Handle data modeling, transformation, and real-time data orchestration&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Full-time','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-24 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-11-26 02:32:12.000000','2025-11-26 02:32:12.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Configurations\", \"Data Modeling\", \"Gxp Compliance\", \"Installation\", \"Mes\", \"PLC\", \"SCADA\", \"MQTT\", \"HiveMQ\", \"HighByte\", \"Unified Namespace (UNS)\", \"Mosquitto\"]','[\"&lt;p data-start=&quot;807&quot; data-end=&quot;926&quot;&gt;Work with a top MNC in Industry 4.0&lt;br data-start=&quot;844&quot; data-end=&quot;847&quot; /&gt;Exposure to modern OT&amp;ndash;IT integration&lt;br data-start=&quot;885&quot; data-end=&quot;888&quot; /&gt;Excellent career growth &amp;amp; learning&lt;/p&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('118e5844-834c-4f2c-aa6a-7da3e241d19a','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Senior MES RedHat Administrator','senior-mes-redhat-administrator-335-335','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;73&quot; data-end=&quot;480&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced Senior MES RedHat Administrators for a leading Top MNC to support enterprise-scale Manufacturing Execution System (MES) infrastructure and Digital Manufacturing transformation initiatives. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in Red Hat OpenShift, Red Hat Enterprise Linux (RHEL), Kubernetes, infrastructure automation, and Critical Manufacturing (CM) MES environments.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;482&quot; data-end=&quot;915&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for administering, deploying, maintaining, and optimizing highly available Red Hat infrastructure supporting Critical Manufacturing MES platforms. The role includes managing OpenShift clusters, Kubernetes deployments, CI/CD pipelines, infrastructure automation, system monitoring, troubleshooting production issues, and ensuring maximum availability, performance, and security of MES infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;917&quot; data-end=&quot;1336&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with Red Hat OpenShift Administration, RHEL infrastructure management, Kubernetes orchestration, OpenShift deployments, High Availability (HA) cluster management, and CI/CD automation. Strong understanding of Critical Manufacturing (CM) MES infrastructure, manufacturing environments, infrastructure optimization, and enterprise platform administration is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1338&quot; data-end=&quot;1844&quot;&gt;The role also involves collaborating with customers, SMEs, DevOps teams, infrastructure engineers, and global project teams to deliver reliable and scalable MES platforms. Candidates will gather technical requirements, support solution implementation, conduct infrastructure testing, prepare technical documentation, troubleshoot complex infrastructure issues, and drive continuous improvement initiatives. Strong analytical, communication, stakeholder management, and problem-solving skills are essential.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-09-11 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-07-14 02:45:30.000000','2026-07-14 02:45:30.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Change Management\", \"DevOps\", \"Kubernetes\", \"Mes\", \"System Design\", \"OpenShift\", \"CI/CD\", \"RHEL\", \"Critical Manufacturing\", \"Red Hat OpenShift Administration\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1860&quot; data-end=&quot;1898&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;xdabsb&quot; data-start=&quot;1899&quot; data-end=&quot;1985&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale MES Infrastructure and Digital Manufacturing projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;5edjsd&quot; data-start=&quot;1986&quot; data-end=&quot;2079&quot;&gt;Work with advanced Red Hat OpenShift, Kubernetes, and Critical Manufacturing technologies&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1b39szl&quot; data-start=&quot;2080&quot; data-end=&