d=&quot;362&quot;&gt;Python and distributed systems&lt;/strong&gt; to design, build, and support complex, cloud-native applications. The role involves close collaboration with end users, global engineering teams, and DevOps functions to deliver scalable, high-performance full-stack and data engineering solutions.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;hr data-start=&quot;612&quot; data-end=&quot;615&quot; /&gt;\\r\\n&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;617&quot; data-end=&quot;644&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;620&quot; data-end=&quot;644&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;\\r\\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;645&quot; data-end=&quot;1290&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;645&quot; data-end=&quot;726&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;647&quot; data-end=&quot;726&quot;&gt;Design, develop, and support &lt;strong data-start=&quot;676&quot; data-end=&quot;711&quot;&gt;complex full-stack applications&lt;/strong&gt; using Python&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;727&quot; data-end=&quot;790&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;729&quot; data-end=&quot;790&quot;&gt;Build and maintain &lt;strong data-start=&quot;748&quot; data-end=&quot;788&quot;&gt;distributed and cloud-native systems&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;791&quot; data-end=&quot;900&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;793&quot; data-end=&quot;900&quot;&gt;Work closely with end users to gather functional requirements and translate them into technical solutions&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;901&quot; data-end=&quot;966&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;903&quot; data-end=&quot;966&quot;&gt;Design and implement &lt;strong data-start=&quot;924&quot; data-end=&quot;943&quot;&gt;CI/CD pipelines&lt;/strong&gt; and DevOps practices&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;967&quot; data-end=&quot;1044&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;969&quot; data-end=&quot;1044&quot;&gt;Collaborate with global engineering teams on solution design and delivery&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1045&quot; data-end=&quot;1099&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1047&quot; data-end=&quot;1099&quot;&gt;Develop and support &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1067&quot; data-end=&quot;1097&quot;&gt;data engineering solutions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1100&quot; data-end=&quot;1148&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1102&quot; data-end=&quot;1148&quot;&gt;Work with both &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1117&quot; data-end=&quot;1146&quot;&gt;RDBMS and NoSQL databases&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1149&quot; data-end=&quot;1217&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1151&quot; data-end=&quot;1217&quot;&gt;Ensure scalability, reliability, and performance of applications&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1218&quot; data-end=&quot;1290&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1220&quot; data-end=&quot;1290&quot;&gt;Research and adopt new tools, frameworks, and technologies as needed&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('12dbacbb-19d5-4943-818b-3762d89b36f7','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Front End Developer','front-end-developer-43-43','&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;314&quot; data-end=&quot;335&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;318&quot; data-end=&quot;334&quot;&gt;Job Overview&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;337&quot; data-end=&quot;875&quot;&gt;We are seeking an experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;367&quot; data-end=&quot;390&quot;&gt;Front End Developer&lt;/strong&gt; to join our team and help design and develop the &lt;strong data-start=&quot;440&quot; data-end=&quot;511&quot;&gt;Next Gen MITS (Manufacturing, Inventory, and Transportation System)&lt;/strong&gt; application. This is a great opportunity for those with strong expertise in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;588&quot; data-end=&quot;599&quot;&gt;Angular&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong data-start=&quot;601&quot; data-end=&quot;608&quot;&gt;AWS&lt;/strong&gt;, and modern frontend development practices to contribute to a complex, enterprise-level application. The role requires a focus on creating scalable, modular front-end components, and working collaboratively with back-end developers to deliver a high-quality product.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;hr data-start=&quot;877&quot; data-end=&quot;880&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;882&quot; data-end=&quot;911&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;886&quot; data-end=&quot;910&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;912&quot; data-end=&quot;1867&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;912&quot; data-end=&quot;1029&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;914&quot; data-end=&quot;1029&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;914&quot; data-end=&quot;943&quot;&gt;Design &amp;amp; Develop Frontend&lt;/strong&gt;: Build robust, scalable, and user-friendly front-end components using &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1014&quot; data-end=&quot;1028&quot;&gt;Angular 19&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1030&quot; data-end=&quot;1167&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1032&quot; data-end=&quot;1167&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1032&quot; data-end=&quot;1062&quot;&gt;Reusable Component Library&lt;/strong&gt;: Create and maintain a library of reusable components to enhance development efficiency and consistency.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1168&quot; data-end=&quot;1332&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1170&quot; data-end=&quot;1332&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1170&quot; data-end=&quot;1198&quot;&gt;Collaborate with Backend&lt;/strong&gt;: Work closely with the back-end team to integrate front-end components with back-end services, including AWS services and PostgreSQL.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1333&quot; data-end=&quot;1451&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1335&quot; data-end=&quot;1451&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1335&quot; data-end=&quot;1363&quot;&gt;UX and UI Implementation&lt;/strong&gt;: Implement frontend features based on UX designs and ensure a seamless user experience.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1452&quot; data-end=&quot;1565&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1454&quot; data-end=&quot;1565&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1454&quot; data-end=&quot;1482&quot;&gt;Code Review &amp;amp; Mentorship&lt;/strong&gt;: Guide and mentor junior developers, reviewing code deliveries for best practices.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1566&quot; data-end=&quot;1709&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1568&quot; data-end=&quot;1709&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1568&quot; data-end=&quot;1600&quot;&gt;Standardization &amp;amp; Automation&lt;/strong&gt;: Work on the standardization of development processes and the automation of tasks in the frontend lifecycle.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1710&quot; data-end=&quot;1867&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1712&quot; data-end=&quot;1867&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1712&quot; data-end=&quot;1738&quot;&gt;Continuous Improvement&lt;/strong&gt;: Participate in continuous improvement initiatives for improving the scalability, usability, and performance of the application.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;hr data-start=&quot;1869&quot; data-end=&quot;1872&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;1874&quot; data-end=&quot;1911&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1878&quot; data-end=&quot;1910&quot;&gt;Required Skills &amp;amp; Experience&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1913&quot; data-end=&quot;2513&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1913&quot; data-end=&quot;2052&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1915&quot; data-end=&quot;2052&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1915&quot; data-end=&quot;1929&quot;&gt;Angular 19&lt;/strong&gt;: Advanced expertise in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1953&quot; data-end=&quot;1967&quot;&gt;Angular 19&lt;/strong&gt; for building scalable and responsive front-end applications (Proficiency Level: E3).&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2053&quot; data-end=&quot;2171&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2055&quot; data-end=&quot;2171&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2055&quot; data-end=&quot;2074&quot;&gt;AWS S3 &amp;amp; Aurora&lt;/strong&gt;: Experience with AWS S3 for storage and Aurora for database integration (Proficiency Level: E2).&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2172&quot; data-end=&quot;2295&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2174&quot; data-end=&quot;2295&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2174&quot; data-end=&quot;2188&quot;&gt;PostgreSQL&lt;/strong&gt;: Strong experience in working with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2224&quot; data-end=&quot;2238&quot;&gt;PostgreSQL&lt;/strong&gt; for data storage and management (Proficiency Level: E2).&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2296&quot; data-end=&quot;2396&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2298&quot; data-end=&quot;2396&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2298&quot; data-end=&quot;2315&quot;&gt;Microservices&lt;/strong&gt;: Experience working with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2341&quot; data-end=&quot;2358&quot;&gt;microservices&lt;/strong&gt; architecture (Proficiency Level: E1).&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2397&quot; data-end=&quot;2513&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2399&quot; data-end=&quot;2513&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2399&quot; data-end=&quot;2409&quot;&gt;GitHub&lt;/strong&gt;: Familiarity with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2428&quot; data-end=&quot;2438&quot;&gt;GitHub&lt;/strong&gt; for version control and collaborative development (Proficiency Level: E1).&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;hr data-start=&quot;2515&quot; data-end=&quot;2518&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;2520&quot; data-end=&quot;2549&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2524&quot; data-end=&quot;2548&quot;&gt;Desired Competencies&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;h4 data-start=&quot;2551&quot; data-end=&quot;2570&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2556&quot; data-end=&quot;2569&quot;&gt;Must-Have&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/h4&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2571&quot; data-end=&quot;3062&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2571&quot; data-end=&quot;2675&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2573&quot; data-end=&quot;2675&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2573&quot; data-end=&quot;2587&quot;&gt;Angular 19&lt;/strong&gt;: Hands-on experience in developing complex front-end applications using &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2660&quot; data-end=&quot;2674&quot;&gt;Angular 19&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2676&quot; data-end=&quot;2796&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2678&quot; data-end=&quot;2796&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2678&quot; data-end=&quot;2710&quot;&gt;Frontend Development for MVP&lt;/strong&gt;: Experience in building and maintaining the frontend of MVPs based on &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2781&quot; data-end=&quot;2795&quot;&gt;UX designs&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2797&quot; data-end=&quot;2936&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2799&quot; data-end=&quot;2936&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2799&quot; data-end=&quot;2822&quot;&gt;Reusable Components&lt;/strong&gt;: Ability to design and develop reusable frontend components to streamline development and enhance UI consistency.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2937&quot; data-end=&quot;3062&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2939&quot; data-end=&quot;3062&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2939&quot; data-end=&quot;2971&quot;&gt;Standardization &amp;amp; Automation&lt;/strong&gt;: Worked on automating frontend development processes and standardizing codebase practices.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;h4 data-start=&quot;3064&quot; data-end=&quot;3086&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3069&quot; data-end=&quot;3085&quot;&gt;Good-to-Have&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/h4&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;3087&quot; data-end=&quot;3364&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;3087&quot; data-end=&quot;3198&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;3089&quot; data-end=&quot;3198&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3089&quot; data-end=&quot;3115&quot;&gt;Full Stack Development&lt;/strong&gt;: Experience in designing and developing both frontend and backend of applications.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;3199&quot; data-end=&quot;3364&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;3201&quot; data-end=&quot;3364&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3201&quot; data-end=&quot;3225&quot;&gt;Domain-Driven Design&lt;/strong&gt;: Experience working with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;3251&quot; data-end=&quot;3282&quot;&gt;Macro, Micro, Nano Services&lt;/strong&gt; in a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;3288&quot; data-end=&quot;3312&quot;&gt;Domain-Driven Design&lt;/strong&gt; approach, using &lt;strong data-start=&quot;3329&quot; data-end=&quot;3345&quot;&gt;AWS services&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong data-start=&quot;3350&quot; data-end=&quot;3363&quot;&gt;.NET (C#)&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',500000.00,2500000.00,'₹',0,'India','Hyderabad',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2025-08-04 18:30:00',0,0,'2025-06-06 08:34:43.000000','2025-06-06 08:34:43.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Angular\", \"Aurora\", \"AWS\", \"Frontend Development\", \"Full Stack Development\", \"Github\", \"PostgreSQL\", \"UX Design\"]','[\"&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;89&quot; data-end=&quot;110&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;93&quot; data-end=&quot;109&quot;&gt;Job Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/h3&gt;\\r\\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;112&quot; data-end=&quot;898&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;112&quot; data-end=&quot;192&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;114&quot; data-end=&quot;192&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;114&quot; data-end=&quot;136&quot;&gt;Competitive Salary&lt;/strong&gt;: Attractive pay package based on experience and skills.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;193&quot; data-end=&quot;272&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;195&quot; data-end=&quot;272&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;195&quot; data-end=&quot;216&quot;&gt;Health &amp;amp; Wellness&lt;/strong&gt;: Comprehensive medical insurance and wellness programs.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;273&quot; data-end=&quot;358&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;275&quot; data-end=&quot;358&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;275&quot; data-end=&quot;302&quot;&gt;Remote Work Flexibility&lt;/strong&gt;: Option to work from any location (remote flexibility).&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;359&quot; data-end=&quot;457&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;361&quot; data-end=&quot;457&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;361&quot; data-end=&quot;387&quot;&gt;Learning &amp;amp; Development&lt;/strong&gt;: Opportunities for continuous learning, training, and certifications.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;458&quot; data-end=&quot;534&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;460&quot; data-end=&quot;534&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;460&quot; data-end=&quot;477&quot;&gt;Career Growth&lt;/strong&gt;: Clear path for career progression and leadership roles.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;535&quot; data-end=&quot;641&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;537&quot; data-end=&quot;641&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;537&quot; data-end=&quot;558&quot;&gt;Work-Life Balance&lt;/strong&gt;: Flexible working hours and paid time off to maintain a healthy work-life balance.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;642&quot; data-end=&quot;731&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;644&quot; data-end=&quot;731&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;644&quot; data-end=&quot;668&quot;&gt;Employee Recognition&lt;/strong&gt;: Rewards and recognition programs for outstanding performance.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Telangana'),('1319b625-4493-4dd0-89ab-bbf00474abef','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','IT Support Analyst – MES (PAS-X)','it-support-analyst-mes-pas-x-324-324','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;74&quot; data-end=&quot;439&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced IT Support Analysts &amp;ndash; MES (PAS-X) for a leading Top MNC to support enterprise pharmaceutical manufacturing and digital manufacturing initiatives. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in Koerber/Werum PAS-X MES, Manufacturing Execution Systems (MES), application support, and regulated pharmaceutical manufacturing environments.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;441&quot; data-end=&quot;853&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for providing L1/L2 support for PAS-X MES applications, ensuring system availability, resolving production issues, and supporting manufacturing operations across global sites. The role includes incident, problem, and change management, PAS-X upgrades, release support, validation activities, and maintaining high-quality service delivery in compliance with regulatory standards.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;855&quot; data-end=&quot;1214&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with Koerber/Werum PAS-X MES, Electronic Batch Records (EBR), GxP compliance, MES SaaS platforms, SAP integration, Historian systems, LIMS, and ITIL-based support processes. Strong knowledge of pharmaceutical manufacturing processes, data integrity, ServiceNow or Jira, and production support is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1216&quot; data-end=&quot;1674&quot;&gt;The role also involves collaborating with QA teams, manufacturing sites, vendors, and business stakeholders to support manufacturing operations such as weighing, dispensing, packaging, and batch execution. Candidates will maintain support documentation, knowledge articles, runbooks, ensure audit readiness, and contribute to continuous service improvements. Strong analytical, communication, stakeholder management, and problem-solving skills are essential.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Hyderabad',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-09-01 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-07-03 19:05:24.000000','2026-07-03 19:05:24.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Data Integrity\", \"Gxp Compliance\", \"ITIL\", \"JIRA\", \"Manufacturing Execution Systems\", \"ServiceNow\", \"Werum PAS-X\", \"EBR\", \"Emerson Syncade MES\", \"Koerber PAS-X MES\", \"L1 Application Support\", \"L2 Application Support\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1690&quot; data-end=&quot;1728&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;m1hb3a&quot; data-start=&quot;1729&quot; data-end=&quot;1813&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale PAS-X MES and pharmaceutical manufacturing projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j4v9b0&quot; data-start=&quot;1814&quot; data-end=&quot;1884&quot;&gt;Work on global digital manufacturing and Life Sciences initiatives&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;15tcho0&quot; data-start=&quot;1885&quot; data-end=&quot;1955&quot;&gt;Career growth in MES &amp;amp; Pharmaceutical Manufacturing Systems domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1rz4f2g&quot; data-start=&quot;1956&quot; data-end=&quot;2032&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with international manufacturing and IT teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;2lee9a&quot; data-start=&quot;2033&quot; data-end=&quot;2088&quot;&gt;Professional and compliance-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;2089&quot; data-end=&quot;2132&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Telangana'),('132b688d-2ec6-43eb-bf38-7b10413a9526','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','IT Business Partner – Supply Chain Analytics','it-business-partner-supply-chain-analytics-329-329','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;86&quot; data-end=&quot;465&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced IT Business Partners &amp;ndash; Supply Chain Analytics for a leading Top MNC to drive enterprise-wide Supply Chain Digital Transformation, ERP modernization, and business analytics initiatives. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in supply chain processes, ERP systems, business intelligence, stakeholder management, and data-driven decision-making.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;467&quot; data-end=&quot;912&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for partnering with Supply Chain, Procurement, Logistics, and Manufacturing teams to identify business opportunities, define digital solutions, and deliver analytics platforms that improve operational performance. The role includes gathering business requirements, implementing ERP-enabled supply chain solutions, developing KPI dashboards, ensuring data governance, and driving continuous process improvements.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;914&quot; data-end=&quot;1292&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with ERP systems such as SAP, including Materials Management (MM), Production Planning (PP), Sales &amp;amp; Distribution (SD), and Logistics modules. Strong expertise in Power BI, Tableau, SAP Analytics Cloud, dashboard development, data pipeline automation, master data management, and business intelligence solutions is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1294&quot; data-end=&quot;1702&quot;&gt;The role also involves collaborating with cross-functional IT teams, managing solution deployments, supporting production environments, enabling Control Tower initiatives, training business users, prioritizing business demands, and aligning technology roadmaps with organizational objectives. Candidates should possess strong analytical, communication, stakeholder management, and business consulting skills.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-09-05 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-07-08 03:01:40.000000','2026-07-08 03:01:40.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"ERP Implementation\", \"KPI Analysis\", \"Power BI\", \"Supply Chain Management\", \"Tableau\", \"Supply Chain Analytics\", \"Procurement Processes\", \"SAP ERP\", \"Materials Management (MM)\", \"Production Planning (PP)\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1718&quot; data-end=&quot;1756&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1knw2er&quot; data-start=&quot;1757&quot; data-end=&quot;1834&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale Supply Chain Digital Transformation projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1txae1h&quot; data-start=&quot;1835&quot; data-end=&quot;1907&quot;&gt;Work on advanced ERP, Business Intelligence, and Analytics solutions&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;mgyjh4&quot; data-start=&quot;1908&quot; data-end=&quot;1981&quot;&gt;Career growth in Supply Chain Technology &amp;amp; Business Consulting domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1avrkhr&quot; data-start=&quot;1982&quot; data-end=&quot;2046&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global business and IT teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot; data-start=&quot;2047&quot; data-end=&quot;2102&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;2103&quot; data-end=&quot;2146&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('135c9787-9f35-4d66-a974-89d8cdefcb6e','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Senior Software Engineer - Node.js | AWS | Microservices','senior-software-engineer-nodejs-aws-microservices-88-88','We are looking for a Senior Software Engineer with strong experience in building scalable backend services and architecting highly available web applications. You&#039;ll work with cross-functional teams, contribute to architectural decisions, and play a key role in developing APIs and backend services in a cloud-native environment.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;The ideal candidate will have hands-on expertise in Node.js, TypeScript, AWS, and cloud infrastructure automation, and will contribute to designing solutions that scale across enterprise systems and integrate with third-party SaaS platforms.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;You&rsquo;ll also mentor junior and mid-level engineers while aligning with business goals and collaborating with product management and API producers.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Architect and develop scalable web applications and APIs&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Collaborate with internal product and external API teams&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Align with product strategy and lead backend engineering decisions&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Mentor junior and mid-level developers&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Drive cloud-native development using AWS services and infrastructure-as-code&lt;br /&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Required Skills &amp;amp; Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;10+ years of experience in backend development with solid data model design&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Strong proficiency with Node.js (ExpressJS, NestJS)&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Familiarity with ReactJS for frontend tasks&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Expertise in TypeScript, ORM tools like Prisma.io, Sequelize, or TypeORM&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Solid knowledge of SQL (MySQL, PostgreSQL) and NoSQL (DynamoDB, Redis)&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Hands-on with AWS cloud services (Lambda, ECR, API Gateway, VPCs, IAM, Terraform)&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Experience with Kafka, Confluent, Kinesis for event-based systems&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Understanding of API security, infrastructure setup, and cloud automation&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Integration experience with third-party SaaS platforms','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-30 06:00:00',0,0,'2025-08-01 14:40:34.000000','2026-05-06 20:52:30.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"API\", \"API Gateway\", \"Architecture\", \"AWS\", \"AWS Lambda\", \"Backend\", \"Backend Development\", \"Cloud\", \"Developer APIs\", \"DynamoDB\", \"Express.js\", \"Infrastructure\", \"Integrations\", \"Kafka\", \"Kinesis\", \"Microservices\", \"MYSQL\", \"Node JS\", \"PostgreSQL\", \"React JS\", \"Redis Cache\", \"SAAS\", \"Sequential\", \"TerraForm\", \"Typescript\"]','[\"Remote Work Flexibility&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Work with Modern Tech Stack &amp;amp; Cloud Infrastructure&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Collaborative &amp;amp; Growth-Oriented Environment&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Opportunities to Mentor and Lead Engineering Efforts\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('137b3af7-3fae-4cfc-985f-3c010dce7b2d','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','ThingWorx developers','thingworx-developers-212-212','1. Hands on Experience in latest Version of ThingWorx 10.x mandatory &lt;br /&gt;2. Hands on Experience in ThingWorx Analytics, Kepware and manufacturing apps&lt;br /&gt;3. Hands on experience in creating ThingWorx custom extension using by java or .NET.&lt;br /&gt;4. Hands on experience in design &amp;amp; development in PTC ThingWorx client SDK and edge development, mashup (views) and web application development&lt;br /&gt;5. Experience in Industrial Gateway Client/Server communications. &lt;br /&gt;6. Experience in KEPWare and OPC client installations and configuration. &lt;br /&gt;7. Expertise in MES implementations.&lt;br /&gt;8. Expertise in multisite installation, federated architecture, Integration with other clouds like AWS, Azure and Other legacy systems like ERP, SAP &lt;br /&gt;9. Experience in SPC analysis, yield improvement &lt;br /&gt;10. Experience in implementing FSU apps and DPM applications for clients &lt;br /&gt;11. Experience in upgrading ThingWorx 9.x to 10.x&lt;br /&gt;12. Experience in HA architecture','Information Technology','Contract','Entry',NULL,NULL,'INR',1,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-05-05 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-03-07 02:00:57.000000','2026-03-07 02:00:57.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"ERP\", \"Mes\", \"Opc\", \"SAP\", \"ThingWorx\", \"Kepware OPC\", \"Kepware\", \"ThingWorx Applications\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;Competitive salary package with performance-based incentives&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;65&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;67&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;Health insurance coverage and statutory benefits (PF &amp;amp; Gratuity)&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;134&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;136&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on large-scale enterprise energy management projects&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;211&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;213&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;Strong career growth and learning opportunities&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;263&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;265&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;Collaborative and professional work environment&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('14a1b011-a2d3-4e07-b253-c2f26fe0521d','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','ORTEMS Developer & Support Engineer','ortems-developer-support-engineer-360-360','&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced &lt;strong&gt;ORTEMS Developers &amp;amp; Support Engineers&lt;/strong&gt; for a leading Top MNC to work on global &lt;strong&gt;DELMIA ORTEMS Advanced Planning &amp;amp; Scheduling (APS)&lt;/strong&gt; projects across Discrete Manufacturing, Automotive, Defense, Hi-Tech, and Wire Harness industries.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;The ideal candidate should have strong hands-on experience in &lt;strong&gt;DELMIA ORTEMS configuration, customization, development, integration, deployment, and production support&lt;/strong&gt;. The role involves designing and supporting advanced planning and scheduling solutions, optimizing finite-capacity production schedules, and integrating ORTEMS with MES and ERP platforms.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Candidates should have strong expertise in &lt;strong&gt;Advanced Planning &amp;amp; Scheduling (APS), Finite Capacity Scheduling, MS SQL/SQL Server/Oracle, MES integration with Apriso or Siemens Opcenter, and ERP integration with SAP&lt;/strong&gt;. Experience with production planning, manufacturing execution, setup and changeover logic, reporting, scheduling optimization, and troubleshooting is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The role also includes participation in &lt;strong&gt;SIT, UAT, functional testing, deployment, release management, post-go-live support, and production issue resolution&lt;/strong&gt;. Candidates should be comfortable working with global customers and cross-functional manufacturing, MES, ERP, and IT teams.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-18 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-08-20 02:49:35.000000','2026-08-20 02:49:35.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"ERP\", \"Mes Configuration\", \"Microsoft SQL Server\", \"MYSQL\", \"Oracle\", \"SAP\", \"UAT\", \"DELMIA ORTEMS\", \"ORTEMS Configuration\", \"ORTEMS Customization\", \"ORTEMS Development\", \"ORTEMS Integration\", \"Siemens Opcenter Integration\", \"DELMIA Apriso Integration\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to work with a leading Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li&gt;Exposure to global APS and digital manufacturing transformation projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li&gt;Work with customers across Automotive, Defense, Hi-Tech, and Wire Harness manufacturing&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with DELMIA ORTEMS and advanced scheduling technologies&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li&gt;Exposure to MES and ERP integration environments&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to work on end-to-end APS implementation and support programs&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li&gt;Global project exposure and collaboration with cross-functional teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li&gt;Career growth in APS, Manufacturing IT, and Digital Manufacturing&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('14e30c09-f5eb-4a7e-a46b-f4978988f62d','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Application Management Support Engineer (Avaloq Platform)','application-management-support-engineer-avaloq-platform-76-76','&lt;p data-start=&quot;235&quot; data-end=&quot;556&quot;&gt;Are you passionate about maintaining a stable and secure operating platform for global financial services? Join us as an &lt;strong data-start=&quot;356&quot; data-end=&quot;399&quot;&gt;Application Management Support Engineer&lt;/strong&gt;, where you&#039;ll work on the &lt;strong data-start=&quot;426&quot; data-end=&quot;445&quot;&gt;Avaloq platform&lt;/strong&gt; and its integration with other key systems, ensuring smooth operations for local and international branches.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;558&quot; data-end=&quot;831&quot;&gt;Your role will involve collaborating with business users, resolving issues, and transitioning monitoring activities. You&amp;rsquo;ll also support future enhancements across platforms while ensuring seamless collaboration between Run-the-Bank (RTB) and Change-the-Bank (CTB) teams.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;hr data-start=&quot;833&quot; data-end=&quot;836&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;838&quot; data-end=&quot;869&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;842&quot; data-end=&quot;867&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;870&quot; data-end=&quot;1263&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;870&quot; data-end=&quot;948&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;872&quot; data-end=&quot;948&quot;&gt;Follow end-to-end incident management processes and ensure SLA compliance.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;949&quot; data-end=&quot;1027&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;951&quot; data-end=&quot;1027&quot;&gt;Analyze and assess the impact of issues, implementing long-term solutions.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1028&quot; data-end=&quot;1120&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1030&quot; data-end=&quot;1120&quot;&gt;Work with CTB and business teams for effective issue resolution and process transitions.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1121&quot; data-end=&quot;1190&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1123&quot; data-end=&quot;1190&quot;&gt;Support testing cycles and ensure solutions are production-ready.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1191&quot; data-end=&quot;1263&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1193&quot; data-end=&quot;1263&quot;&gt;Coordinate production implementations with release management teams.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;hr data-start=&quot;1265&quot; data-end=&quot;1268&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;1270&quot; data-end=&quot;1297&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1274&quot; data-end=&quot;1295&quot;&gt;Must-Have Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1298&quot; data-end=&quot;1584&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1298&quot; data-end=&quot;1360&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1300&quot; data-end=&quot;1360&quot;&gt;Proven experience in RTB or CTB within financial services.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1361&quot; data-end=&quot;1422&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1363&quot; data-end=&quot;1422&quot;&gt;Strong knowledge of ITIL Incident and Problem Management.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1423&quot; data-end=&quot;1489&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1425&quot; data-end=&quot;1489&quot;&gt;Hands-on expertise with Avaloq Core Platform parameterization.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1490&quot; data-end=&quot;1533&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1492&quot; data-end=&quot;1533&quot;&gt;Proficiency in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1507&quot; data-end=&quot;1516&quot;&gt;P/SQL&lt;/strong&gt; and Oracle DB.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1534&quot; data-end=&quot;1584&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1536&quot; data-end=&quot;1584&quot;&gt;Familiarity with Avaloq&amp;rsquo;s ICE code repository.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;hr data-start=&quot;1586&quot; data-end=&quot;1589&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;1591&quot; data-end=&quot;1621&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1595&quot; data-end=&quot;1619&quot;&gt;Good-to-Have Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1622&quot; data-end=&quot;1726&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1622&quot; data-end=&quot;1664&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1624&quot; data-end=&quot;1664&quot;&gt;Fluency in English (German is a plus).&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1665&quot; data-end=&quot;1726&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1667&quot; data-end=&quot;1726&quot;&gt;Analytical mindset with excellent problem-solving skills.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-19 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-07-01 13:43:21.000000','2025-11-21 04:48:36.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Analytical Thinking\", \"Communication Skills\", \"Oracle\", \"PL/SQL\", \"Problem Solving\", \"ITIL framework\", \"Avaloq Parameterization\", \"ICE Code Repository\", \"Run-the-Bank Operations\", \"Change-the-Bank Collaboration\"]','[\"&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1753&quot; data-end=&quot;2084&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1753&quot; data-end=&quot;1823&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1755&quot; data-end=&quot;1823&quot;&gt;Work with leading financial systems and cutting-edge technologies.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1824&quot; data-end=&quot;1896&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1826&quot; data-end=&quot;1896&quot;&gt;Opportunities to enhance technical expertise in the Avaloq platform.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1897&quot; data-end=&quot;1958&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1899&quot; data-end=&quot;1958&quot;&gt;Collaborate with international teams for global exposure.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1959&quot; data-end=&quot;2020&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1961&quot; data-end=&quot;2020&quot;&gt;Competitive compensation aligned with industry standards.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2021&quot; data-end=&quot;2084&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2023&quot; data-end=&quot;2084&quot;&gt;Learning and development opportunities to grow your career.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('158a1677-813c-48ee-93a7-f8098192420f','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','IT Support Analyst – MES (PAS-X)','it-support-analyst-mes-pas-x-324-324','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;74&quot; data-end=&quot;439&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced IT Support Analysts &amp;ndash; MES (PAS-X) for a leading Top MNC to support enterprise pharmaceutical manufacturing and digital manufacturing initiatives. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in Koerber/Werum PAS-X MES, Manufacturing Execution Systems (MES), application support, and regulated pharmaceutical manufacturing environments.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;441&quot; data-end=&quot;853&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for providing L1/L2 support for PAS-X MES applications, ensuring system availability, resolving production issues, and supporting manufacturing operations across global sites. The role includes incident, problem, and change management, PAS-X upgrades, release support, validation activities, and maintaining high-quality service delivery in compliance with regulatory standards.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;855&quot; data-end=&quot;1214&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with Koerber/Werum PAS-X MES, Electronic Batch Records (EBR), GxP compliance, MES SaaS platforms, SAP integration, Historian systems, LIMS, and ITIL-based support processes. Strong knowledge of pharmaceutical manufacturing processes, data integrity, ServiceNow or Jira, and production support is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1216&quot; data-end=&quot;1674&quot;&gt;The role also involves collaborating with QA teams, manufacturing sites, vendors, and business stakeholders to support manufacturing operations such as weighing, dispensing, packaging, and batch execution. Candidates will maintain support documentation, knowledge articles, runbooks, ensure audit readiness, and contribute to continuous service improvements. Strong analytical, communication, stakeholder management, and problem-solving skills are essential.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Hyderabad',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-09-01 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-07-03 19:05:24.000000','2026-07-03 19:05:24.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Data Integrity\", \"Gxp Compliance\", \"ITIL\", \"JIRA\", \"Manufacturing Execution Systems\", \"ServiceNow\", \"Werum PAS-X\", \"EBR\", \"Emerson Syncade MES\", \"Koerber PAS-X MES\", \"L1 Application Support\", \"L2 Application Support\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1690&quot; data-end=&quot;1728&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;m1hb3a&quot; data-start=&quot;1729&quot; data-end=&quot;1813&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale PAS-X MES and pharmaceutical manufacturing projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j4v9b0&quot; data-start=&quot;1814&quot; data-end=&quot;1884&quot;&gt;Work on global digital manufacturing and Life Sciences initiatives&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;15tcho0&quot; data-start=&quot;1885&quot; data-end=&quot;1955&quot;&gt;Career growth in MES &amp;amp; Pharmaceutical Manufacturing Systems domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1rz4f2g&quot; data-start=&quot;1956&quot; data-end=&quot;2032&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with international manufacturing and IT teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;2lee9a&quot; data-start=&quot;2033&quot; data-end=&quot;2088&quot;&gt;Professional and compliance-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;2089&quot; data-end=&quot;2132&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Telangana'),('1597165e-3ac6-4e29-93a7-e28d430f5d2c','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Application Developer – GE Plant Apps','application-developer-ge-plant-apps-143-143','&lt;p data-start=&quot;258&quot; data-end=&quot;594&quot;&gt;We are seeking an experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;288&quot; data-end=&quot;329&quot;&gt;Application Developer (GE Plant Apps)&lt;/strong&gt; to join a leading global organization driving digital transformation in manufacturing.&lt;br data-start=&quot;416&quot; data-end=&quot;419&quot; /&gt;In this role, you will work on implementing, customizing, and supporting &lt;strong data-start=&quot;492&quot; data-end=&quot;517&quot;&gt;GE Plant Applications&lt;/strong&gt; across modules like Production, Quality, Efficiency, and Data Integration.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;596&quot; data-end=&quot;876&quot;&gt;You will collaborate with manufacturing, quality, and automation teams to design scalable solutions, develop SQL-driven logic, integrate shop-floor systems, and ensure seamless MES operations.&lt;br data-start=&quot;788&quot; data-end=&quot;791&quot; /&gt;Candidates with experience in regulated environments (like Pharma) will be preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;hr data-start=&quot;878&quot; data-end=&quot;881&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;883&quot; data-end=&quot;913&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;886&quot; data-end=&quot;913&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;914&quot; data-end=&quot;1481&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;914&quot; data-end=&quot;1010&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;916&quot; data-end=&quot;1010&quot;&gt;Develop, configure, and support &lt;strong data-start=&quot;948&quot; data-end=&quot;973&quot;&gt;GE Plant Apps modules&lt;/strong&gt; (Production, Quality, Efficiency).&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1011&quot; data-end=&quot;1087&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1013&quot; data-end=&quot;1087&quot;&gt;Design and implement SQL-based logic, queries, triggers, and procedures.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1088&quot; data-end=&quot;1159&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1090&quot; data-end=&quot;1159&quot;&gt;Integrate MES with ERP, LIMS, SCADA, PLCs using APIs or middleware.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1160&quot; data-end=&quot;1232&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1162&quot; data-end=&quot;1232&quot;&gt;Troubleshoot MES performance issues and provide long-term solutions.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1233&quot; data-end=&quot;1304&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1235&quot; data-end=&quot;1304&quot;&gt;Develop MES reports, dashboards, and analytics for production KPIs.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1305&quot; data-end=&quot;1391&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1307&quot; data-end=&quot;1391&quot;&gt;Work closely with cross-functional teams to understand manufacturing requirements.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1392&quot; data-end=&quot;1481&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1394&quot; data-end=&quot;1481&quot;&gt;Ensure compliance with GMP, GxP, and other regulatory standards (preferred for pharma).&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Full-time','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-20 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-11-22 04:07:12.000000','2025-11-22 04:07:12.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"ERP\", \"KPIS\", \"Lims\", \"Mes Reporting\", \"Production\", \"Quality\", \"SCADA\", \"SQL\", \"Stored Procedures\", \"Database Design\", \"Pharma\", \"GE Plant Apps\", \"Efficiency Modules\"]','[\"&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1507&quot; data-end=&quot;1859&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1507&quot; data-end=&quot;1557&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1509&quot; data-end=&quot;1557&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1536&quot; data-end=&quot;1554&quot;&gt;Top Global MNC&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1558&quot; data-end=&quot;1627&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1560&quot; data-end=&quot;1627&quot;&gt;Exposure to large-scale &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1584&quot; data-end=&quot;1624&quot;&gt;MES &amp;amp; Digital Manufacturing projects&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1628&quot; data-end=&quot;1678&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1630&quot; data-end=&quot;1678&quot;&gt;Attractive salary package based on experience.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1679&quot; data-end=&quot;1741&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1681&quot; data-end=&quot;1741&quot;&gt;Chance to work with the latest manufacturing technologies.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1742&quot; data-end=&quot;1807&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1744&quot; data-end=&quot;1807&quot;&gt;Career growth in Industry 4.0 and Smart Manufacturing domain.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1808&quot; data-end=&quot;1859&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1810&quot; data-end=&quot;1859&quot;&gt;Collaborative and innovation-driven work culture.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('15e00300-8a64-48ba-966e-a44e69983203','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','MES OT Validation Engineer','mes-ot-validation-engineer-79-79','&lt;p data-start=&quot;355&quot; data-end=&quot;705&quot;&gt;We are hiring a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;371&quot; data-end=&quot;401&quot;&gt;MES OT Validation Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; with 6&amp;ndash;8 years of experience in validating manufacturing execution systems (MES), preferably Rockwell or Honeywell. The ideal candidate will have hands-on experience in protocol development (IQ/OQ/PQ), regulatory compliance (GAMP, FDA, GMP), and system integrations with tools like LIMS, SAP, and Kneat.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;707&quot; data-end=&quot;855&quot;&gt;You&#039;ll play a critical role in ensuring the accuracy, compliance, and functionality of MES platforms across life sciences or regulated environments.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;868&quot; data-end=&quot;902&quot;&gt;Responsibilities / Key Duties:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;903&quot; data-end=&quot;1626&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;903&quot; data-end=&quot;1002&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;905&quot; data-end=&quot;1002&quot;&gt;Develop &amp;amp; execute validation protocols (IQ/OQ/PQ) for Rockwell, Honeywell, or similar MES tools&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1003&quot; data-end=&quot;1076&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1005&quot; data-end=&quot;1076&quot;&gt;Ensure compliance with FDA, GMP, GAMP, and other regulatory standards&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1077&quot; data-end=&quot;1156&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1079&quot; data-end=&quot;1156&quot;&gt;Collaborate with IT, Quality, and Manufacturing teams for system validation&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1157&quot; data-end=&quot;1219&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1159&quot; data-end=&quot;1219&quot;&gt;Perform risk assessments and develop mitigation strategies&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1220&quot; data-end=&quot;1291&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1222&quot; data-end=&quot;1291&quot;&gt;Maintain documentation in line with regulatory and company policies&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1292&quot; data-end=&quot;1360&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1294&quot; data-end=&quot;1360&quot;&gt;Troubleshoot MES tools during validation and post-implementation&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1361&quot; data-end=&quot;1409&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1363&quot; data-end=&quot;1409&quot;&gt;Provide training &amp;amp; support to MES/LIMS users&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1410&quot; data-end=&quot;1475&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1412&quot; data-end=&quot;1475&quot;&gt;Contribute to continuous improvement in validation approaches&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1476&quot; data-end=&quot;1553&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1478&quot; data-end=&quot;1553&quot;&gt;Interface MES with LIMS, SAP, and assist in end-to-end MES implementation&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1554&quot; data-end=&quot;1626&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1556&quot; data-end=&quot;1626&quot;&gt;Use &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1560&quot; data-end=&quot;1589&quot;&gt;Kneat Validation Software&lt;/strong&gt; for test execution (preferred skill)&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Noida',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-19 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-07-11 07:46:44.000000','2025-11-21 04:47:32.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Agile Methodology\", \"Cross-Functional\", \"Data Integrity\", \"Documentation\", \"GAMP5\", \"IQ\", \"Lims\", \"Mes Validation Processes\", \"OQ\", \"PQ\", \"Protocols\", \"Risk Assessment\", \"Rockwell Software\", \"SAP Integration\", \"Validation\", \"Honeywell EPKS\"]','[\"&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2351&quot; data-end=&quot;2610&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2351&quot; data-end=&quot;2423&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2353&quot; data-end=&quot;2423&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2376&quot; data-end=&quot;2421&quot;&gt;global compliance and validation projects&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2424&quot; data-end=&quot;2483&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2426&quot; data-end=&quot;2483&quot;&gt;Exposure to &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2438&quot; data-end=&quot;2464&quot;&gt;regulated environments&lt;/strong&gt; in life sciences&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2484&quot; data-end=&quot;2562&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2486&quot; data-end=&quot;2562&quot;&gt;Work with latest MES platforms and tools like &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2532&quot; data-end=&quot;2560&quot;&gt;Kneat &amp;amp; SAP integrations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2563&quot; data-end=&quot;2610&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2565&quot; data-end=&quot;2610&quot;&gt;Be part of a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2578&quot; data-end=&quot;2610&quot;&gt;cross-functional global team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Uttar Pradesh'),('167b6668-1f03-4a87-9b57-76e7befd41dc','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','MES Camstar Developer','mes-camstar-developer-307-307','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;63&quot; data-end=&quot;416&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced MES Camstar Developers for a leading Top MNC to work on enterprise-scale Manufacturing Execution System (MES) and digital manufacturing transformation projects. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in Siemens Opcenter Core (Camstar), MES implementations, workflow development, and manufacturing system integrations.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;418&quot; data-end=&quot;723&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for designing, developing, and implementing MES solutions using Siemens Opcenter Core/Camstar. The role includes developing CIO/MIO maps, workflows, portal customizations, factory models, and supporting end-to-end MES implementation activities across manufacturing sites.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;725&quot; data-end=&quot;1053&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with Camstar Portal Development, CIO/MIO interface connectivity, system upgrades, SQL development, database management, and enterprise system integrations. Strong knowledge of ERP, LIMS, equipment integration, HMI systems, and manufacturing validation processes is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1055&quot; data-end=&quot;1456&quot;&gt;The role also involves supporting production incidents, managing enhancement requests, translating business requirements into technical solutions, coordinating implementation activities, and ensuring successful project delivery. Candidates should possess strong leadership, communication, stakeholder management, and problem-solving skills with experience working in global manufacturing environments.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'INR',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-08-23 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-06-25 02:50:28.000000','2026-06-25 02:50:28.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Camstar\", \"Camstar MOM Connect\", \"Camstar MES Solutions\", \"CSV\", \"Database User Management\", \"ERP Integration\", \"MES Integration\", \"SQL Server\", \"Camstar Portal Studio\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1472&quot; data-end=&quot;1510&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;gmnzlb&quot; data-start=&quot;1511&quot; data-end=&quot;1580&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale MES and Smart Manufacturing projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1w6wv49&quot; data-start=&quot;1581&quot; data-end=&quot;1646&quot;&gt;Work on advanced Siemens Opcenter Core (Camstar) technologies&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;11ve40r&quot; data-start=&quot;1647&quot; data-end=&quot;1702&quot;&gt;Career growth in MES &amp;amp; Digital Manufacturing domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;uhu09b&quot; data-start=&quot;1703&quot; data-end=&quot;1765&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global manufacturing teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;u3fkj9&quot; data-start=&quot;1766&quot; data-end=&quot;1834&quot;&gt;Leadership opportunities in implementation and solution delivery&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot; data-start=&quot;1835&quot; data-end=&quot;1890&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;1891&quot; data-end=&quot;1934&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('17039dfa-1dcd-48e4-9380-98cc45228fe6','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','React Native Developer','react-native-developer-30-30','&lt;h2 class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;304&quot; data-end=&quot;349&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;310&quot; data-end=&quot;347&quot;&gt;Job Title: React Native Developer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;350&quot; data-end=&quot;449&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;350&quot; data-end=&quot;365&quot;&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 5&ndash;10 Years&lt;br data-start=&quot;376&quot; data-end=&quot;379&quot; /&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;379&quot; data-end=&quot;392&quot;&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt;&nbsp;Chennai&lt;br data-start=&quot;421&quot; data-end=&quot;424&quot; /&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;424&quot; data-end=&quot;437&quot;&gt;Job Type:&lt;/strong&gt; Full-time&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;451&quot; data-end=&quot;480&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;455&quot; data-end=&quot;480&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ol data-start=&quot;481&quot; data-end=&quot;1133&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;481&quot; data-end=&quot;565&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;484&quot; data-end=&quot;565&quot;&gt;Develop and maintain high-performance mobile applications using &lt;strong data-start=&quot;548&quot; data-end=&quot;564&quot;&gt;React Native&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;566&quot; data-end=&quot;673&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;569&quot; data-end=&quot;673&quot;&gt;Implement complex UI components and ensure seamless user experiences across platforms (iOS and Android).&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;674&quot; data-end=&quot;783&quot;&gt;\r