Must-Have Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1161&quot; data-end=&quot;1417&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1161&quot; data-end=&quot;1222&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1163&quot; data-end=&quot;1222&quot;&gt;Strong proficiency in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1185&quot; data-end=&quot;1221&quot;&gt;React Native and React ecosystem&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1223&quot; data-end=&quot;1279&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1225&quot; data-end=&quot;1279&quot;&gt;Experience with hooks, Virtual DOM, lifecycle methods.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1280&quot; data-end=&quot;1334&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1282&quot; data-end=&quot;1334&quot;&gt;Proven track record of building complex mobile apps.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1335&quot; data-end=&quot;1417&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1337&quot; data-end=&quot;1417&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1362&quot; data-end=&quot;1371&quot;&gt;Redux&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1373&quot; data-end=&quot;1386&quot;&gt;REST APIs&lt;/strong&gt;, and performance optimization.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',500000.00,2500000.00,'₹',0,'India','Chennai',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-30 06:00:00',0,0,'2025-05-15 13:20:31.000000','2026-05-12 14:53:09.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"React\", \"React Native\"]','[\"&lt;h3 class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;84&quot; data-end=&quot;104&quot;&gt;Job Benefits&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Competitive Salary &amp;amp; performance bonuses&lt;br /&gt;Flexible Work Hours &amp;amp; hybrid/remote options&lt;br /&gt;Health Insurance for employees &amp;amp; dependent&lt;br /&gt;Learning &amp;amp; Development programs&lt;br /&gt;Cutting-Edge Projects with global teams&lt;br /&gt;Team Outings, hackathons &amp;amp; cultural event&lt;br /&gt;International Exposure &amp;amp; career growth opportunities&lt;/h3&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Tamil Nadu'),('17468bf1-ad81-4520-aa54-a2f92eccf16a','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Global Master Data Consultant','global-master-data-consultant-170-170','&lt;p data-start=&quot;176&quot; data-end=&quot;724&quot;&gt;We are looking for an experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;210&quot; data-end=&quot;243&quot;&gt;Global Master Data Consultant&lt;/strong&gt; to support enterprise-wide master data transformation initiatives. The role involves data migration, cleansing, harmonization, governance, and SAP MDG implementation across global business units. The consultant will work closely with cross-functional and cross-regional teams to align local requirements with global data standards, support testing activities, manage change, and ensure high-quality master data throughout project lifecycles including cutover and hypercare phases.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;hr data-start=&quot;726&quot; data-end=&quot;729&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;731&quot; data-end=&quot;758&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;734&quot; data-end=&quot;758&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;759&quot; data-end=&quot;1617&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;759&quot; data-end=&quot;815&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;761&quot; data-end=&quot;815&quot;&gt;Data preparation for &lt;strong data-start=&quot;782&quot; data-end=&quot;815&quot;&gt;data conversion and migration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;816&quot; data-end=&quot;893&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;818&quot; data-end=&quot;893&quot;&gt;Master data &lt;strong data-start=&quot;830&quot; data-end=&quot;893&quot;&gt;cleansing, standardization, harmonization, and localization&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;894&quot; data-end=&quot;959&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;896&quot; data-end=&quot;959&quot;&gt;SAP S/4HANA master data &lt;strong data-start=&quot;920&quot; data-end=&quot;959&quot;&gt;value mapping and data construction&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;960&quot; data-end=&quot;1021&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;962&quot; data-end=&quot;1021&quot;&gt;Cross-workstream coordination for data element requirements&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1022&quot; data-end=&quot;1066&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1024&quot; data-end=&quot;1066&quot;&gt;Test data creation and &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1047&quot; data-end=&quot;1066&quot;&gt;data validation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1067&quot; data-end=&quot;1101&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1069&quot; data-end=&quot;1101&quot;&gt;Bug investigation and resolution&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1102&quot; data-end=&quot;1138&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1104&quot; data-end=&quot;1138&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1104&quot; data-end=&quot;1138&quot;&gt;Change management and training&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1139&quot; data-end=&quot;1196&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1141&quot; data-end=&quot;1196&quot;&gt;Master Data Governance using &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1170&quot; data-end=&quot;1196&quot;&gt;SAP MDG (CRUD process)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1197&quot; data-end=&quot;1250&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1199&quot; data-end=&quot;1250&quot;&gt;Functional requirements gathering and documentation&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1251&quot; data-end=&quot;1304&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1253&quot; data-end=&quot;1304&quot;&gt;Alignment of local requirements to global solutions&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1305&quot; data-end=&quot;1351&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1307&quot; data-end=&quot;1351&quot;&gt;Supervision of outsourced testing activities&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1352&quot; data-end=&quot;1385&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1354&quot; data-end=&quot;1385&quot;&gt;Testing MDG workflows and tools&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1386&quot; data-end=&quot;1421&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1388&quot; data-end=&quot;1421&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1388&quot; data-end=&quot;1421&quot;&gt;Cutover and hypercare support&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1422&quot; data-end=&quot;1497&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1424&quot; data-end=&quot;1497&quot;&gt;Project task tracking using &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1452&quot; data-end=&quot;1497&quot;&gt;ADO, Jira, Target Process, Clarity, Excel&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1498&quot; data-end=&quot;1617&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1500&quot; data-end=&quot;1534&quot;&gt;Maintain and update documentation:&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1537&quot; data-end=&quot;1617&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1537&quot; data-end=&quot;1559&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1539&quot; data-end=&quot;1559&quot;&gt;Data Definition (DD)&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1562&quot; data-end=&quot;1590&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1564&quot; data-end=&quot;1590&quot;&gt;Field Mapping Design (FMD)&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1593&quot; data-end=&quot;1617&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1595&quot; data-end=&quot;1617&quot;&gt;Functional Design (FD&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Full-time','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Chennai',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-02-14 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-12-16 21:36:36.000000','2025-12-16 21:36:36.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"JIRA\", \"Microsoft Excel\", \"PowerPoint\", \"SAP\", \"SAP S4 HANA\", \"Test Plans\", \"Word\", \"Data Migration\", \"Master Data Management (MDM)\", \"harmonization\", \"Fiori UI\", \"ADO\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2992&quot; data-end=&quot;3063&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2994&quot; data-end=&quot;3063&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on &lt;strong data-start=&quot;3017&quot; data-end=&quot;3063&quot;&gt;global SAP S/4HANA transformation projects&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;3064&quot; data-end=&quot;3124&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;3066&quot; data-end=&quot;3124&quot;&gt;Exposure to &lt;strong data-start=&quot;3078&quot; data-end=&quot;3124&quot;&gt;multi-country, cross-cultural environments&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;3125&quot; data-end=&quot;3195&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;3127&quot; data-end=&quot;3195&quot;&gt;Career growth in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;3144&quot; data-end=&quot;3195&quot;&gt;Master Data Governance &amp;amp; Digital Transformation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;3196&quot; data-end=&quot;3267&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;3198&quot; data-end=&quot;3267&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience with enterprise-scale data governance initiatives&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;3268&quot; data-end=&quot;3320&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;3270&quot; data-end=&quot;3320&quot;&gt;International travel opportunities (up to &lt;strong data-start=&quot;3312&quot; data-end=&quot;3319&quot;&gt;25%&lt;/strong&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Tamil Nadu'),('1782d4a2-7fbf-47da-a7b5-e3f8bc65f3f9','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','MES Functional Consultant','mes-functional-consultant-378-378','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;206&quot; data-end=&quot;418&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;232&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;MES Functional Consultants&lt;/strong&gt; for a leading Top MNC to work on large-scale &lt;strong data-start=&quot;308&quot; data-end=&quot;417&quot;&gt;Manufacturing Execution System (MES), Digital Manufacturing, and Manufacturing IT transformation projects&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;420&quot; data-end=&quot;777&quot;&gt;The ideal candidate should have &lt;strong data-start=&quot;452&quot; data-end=&quot;480&quot;&gt;5&amp;ndash;12 years of experience&lt;/strong&gt; in MES functional consulting, implementation, requirement gathering, manufacturing processes, and system integration. Candidates with hands-on experience in platforms such as &lt;strong data-start=&quot;656&quot; data-end=&quot;762&quot;&gt;DELMIA Apriso, Siemens SIMATIC IT, GE Proficy, SAP ME/MII, Rockwell MES, or similar COTS MES platforms&lt;/strong&gt; are preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;779&quot; data-end=&quot;1115&quot;&gt;The role involves working closely with customers and manufacturing stakeholders to understand business requirements, perform functional analysis and fit-gap assessments, prepare &lt;strong data-start=&quot;957&quot; data-end=&quot;1067&quot;&gt;Requirement Traceability Matrices (RTM), Functional Design Specifications (FDS), functional test scenarios&lt;/strong&gt;, and support SIT/UAT and validation activities.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1117&quot; data-end=&quot;1361&quot;&gt;The consultant will be responsible for supporting the complete MES implementation lifecycle, including requirement gathering, solution design, configuration support, testing, deployment, troubleshooting, user training, and post-go-live support.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-31 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-09-02 02:12:34.000000','2026-09-02 02:12:34.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Delmia Apriso\", \"GE Proficy AMS\", \"Mes\", \"Mes Administrator\", \"Mes Solutions Architect\", \"Mom\", \"PFDs\", \"Siemens Tia Portal\", \"Rockwell FTPS\", \"SAP ME\", \"ISA-95\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;i3mxm7&quot; data-start=&quot;1668&quot; data-end=&quot;1712&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a leading Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;ku1ot&quot; data-start=&quot;1713&quot; data-end=&quot;1773&quot;&gt;Exposure to large-scale global MES implementation programs&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1wsc7th&quot; data-start=&quot;1774&quot; data-end=&quot;1842&quot;&gt;Work across Manufacturing IT and Digital Manufacturing initiatives&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;79b8p8&quot; data-start=&quot;1843&quot; data-end=&quot;1910&quot;&gt;Exposure to multiple MES platforms and manufacturing technologies&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1sx3ity&quot; data-start=&quot;1911&quot; data-end=&quot;1998&quot;&gt;Opportunity to interact directly with global customers and manufacturing stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ga21hn&quot; data-start=&quot;1999&quot; data-end=&quot;2098&quot;&gt;Experience across Automotive, Chemical, Passenger Vehicle, and Hi-Tech manufacturing environments&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;17rn4sn&quot; data-start=&quot;2099&quot; data-end=&quot;2177&quot;&gt;Exposure to Industry 4.0, Smart Manufacturing, and Shop-floor Digitalization&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1hdbsdb&quot; data-start=&quot;2178&quot; data-end=&quot;2261&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with SAP, PLM, automation, and enterprise integration systems&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('17ef9982-7404-4490-81c6-cce29609dc61','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','PLC Engineer','plc-engineer-328-328','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;54&quot; data-end=&quot;374&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced PLC Engineers for a leading Top MNC to work on advanced Industrial Automation, Control Systems, and Drilling Rig Automation projects. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in PLC programming, SCADA systems, HMI development, industrial networking, and automation system commissioning.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;376&quot; data-end=&quot;781&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for designing, developing, testing, implementing, and supporting PLC-based automation solutions for drilling rigs and industrial control systems. The role includes PLC programming, SCADA and HMI development, control system integration, troubleshooting, commissioning, and ensuring reliable operation of automation systems across manufacturing and industrial environments.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;783&quot; data-end=&quot;1228&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with Allen-Bradley PLCs (preferred), Siemens PLCs, SCADA systems, HMI development, Variable Frequency Drives (ABB &amp;amp; GE Converteam), industrial PCs, servers, industrial communication protocols, and industrial networking. Strong understanding of control system design, Factory Acceptance Testing (FAT), Site Acceptance Testing (SAT), commissioning, and industrial safety standards is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1230&quot; data-end=&quot;1667&quot;&gt;The role also involves collaborating with engineering, operations, and field service teams, preparing technical documentation, supporting customer acceptance testing, mentoring junior engineers, and providing onsite support at domestic and international project locations. Candidates should possess strong analytical, communication, troubleshooting, and problem-solving skills with the ability to work in dynamic industrial environments.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-09-05 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-07-08 02:50:37.000000','2026-07-08 02:50:37.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Industrial Automation\", \"PLC Programming\", \"SCADA Systems\", \"Siemens\", \"Integration Testing\", \"Allen-Bradley\", \"FAT / SAT\", \"HMI Development\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1683&quot; data-end=&quot;1721&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;fvlnx3&quot; data-start=&quot;1722&quot; data-end=&quot;1804&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale Industrial Automation and Control System projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;nxnoru&quot; data-start=&quot;1805&quot; data-end=&quot;1878&quot;&gt;Work on advanced PLC, SCADA, and Drilling Rig Automation technologies&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1o99mak&quot; data-start=&quot;1879&quot; data-end=&quot;1950&quot;&gt;Career growth in Industrial Automation &amp;amp; Control Engineering domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;13q8xbv&quot; data-start=&quot;1951&quot; data-end=&quot;2026&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global engineering and operations teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;x0g28h&quot; data-start=&quot;2027&quot; data-end=&quot;2074&quot;&gt;Domestic and international project exposure&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot; data-start=&quot;2075&quot; data-end=&quot;2130&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;2131&quot; data-end=&quot;2174&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('182a903c-d62f-4638-9b7b-dcaefc2a3115','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Cloud Engineer','cloud-engineer-254-254','&lt;p data-start=&quot;2633&quot; data-end=&quot;2656&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2633&quot; data-end=&q