3941ab-3de4-479e-bc9f-a34246766c85','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Digital Marketing Specialist','digital-marketing-specialist-126-126','&lt;p data-start=&quot;179&quot; data-end=&quot;643&quot;&gt;We are looking for a passionate and results-driven &lt;strong data-start=&quot;230&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;Digital Marketing Specialist&lt;/strong&gt; to join our client in Pune (Wakad). The ideal candidate will be responsible for planning, executing, and optimizing digital marketing campaigns across multiple platforms. You will manage SEO/SEM strategies, create engaging social media content, monitor campaign performance, and collaborate with internal teams to achieve marketing goals. Immediate or quick joiners are preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;hr data-start=&quot;645&quot; data-end=&quot;648&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;650&quot; data-end=&quot;680&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;654&quot; data-end=&quot;680&quot;&gt;✅ Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;681&quot; data-end=&quot;1052&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;681&quot; data-end=&quot;740&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;683&quot; data-end=&quot;740&quot;&gt;Plan, execute, and optimize digital marketing campaigns&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;741&quot; data-end=&quot;813&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;743&quot; data-end=&quot;813&quot;&gt;Manage SEO and SEM strategies to improve traffic and search rankings&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;814&quot; data-end=&quot;866&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;816&quot; data-end=&quot;866&quot;&gt;Develop and manage engaging social media content&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;867&quot; data-end=&quot;924&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;869&quot; data-end=&quot;924&quot;&gt;Monitor KPIs and prepare detailed performance reports&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;925&quot; data-end=&quot;976&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;927&quot; data-end=&quot;976&quot;&gt;Conduct market research and competitor analysis&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;977&quot; data-end=&quot;1052&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;979&quot; data-end=&quot;1052&quot;&gt;Collaborate with internal teams to support overall marketing objectives&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',300000.00,500000.00,'₹',0,'India','Pune',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-19 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-11-21 05:10:00.000000','2025-11-21 05:10:00.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Digital Marketing\", \"Digital Media\", \"Email Marketing\", \"Google Ad Words\", \"Google Analytics\", \"Marketing\", \"Meta Business Suite\", \"Production Planning & Control (PPC)\", \"SEM\", \"SEO\", \"Social Media Marketing\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;90&quot; data-end=&quot;132&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;92&quot; data-end=&quot;132&quot;&gt;Competitive salary based on experience&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;133&quot; data-end=&quot;196&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;135&quot; data-end=&quot;196&quot;&gt;Fixed &lt;strong data-start=&quot;141&quot; data-end=&quot;165&quot;&gt;5 Days Working (WFO)&lt;/strong&gt; for better work-life balance&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;197&quot; data-end=&quot;259&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;199&quot; data-end=&quot;259&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on diverse digital marketing campaigns&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;260&quot; data-end=&quot;331&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;262&quot; data-end=&quot;331&quot;&gt;Skill development &amp;amp; training support to grow in SEO, SEM &amp;amp; paid ads&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;332&quot; data-end=&quot;379&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;334&quot; data-end=&quot;379&quot;&gt;Collaborative and positive work environment&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;380&quot; data-end=&quot;444&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;382&quot; data-end=&quot;444&quot;&gt;Exposure to the latest trends and tools in digital marketing&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;445&quot; data-end=&quot;500&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;447&quot; data-end=&quot;500&quot;&gt;Career growth opportunities within the organization&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;501&quot; data-end=&quot;532&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;503&quot; data-end=&quot;532&quot;&gt;Immediate joining advantage&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Maharashtra'),('1854e205-4c15-4b55-ade2-62d3f86e54fa','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','AVEVA MES','aveva-mes-276-276','&lt;p data-start=&quot;63&quot; data-end=&quot;297&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced AVEVA MES Developers for a leading Top MNC through TCS engagement. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in AVEVA MES, AVEVA System Platform, Wonderware MES, and industrial automation technologies.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;299&quot; data-end=&quot;608&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for developing, implementing, and supporting MES applications using the AVEVA Suite for enterprise manufacturing environments. The role includes system platform deployment, environment setup, MES workflow understanding, and end-to-end application development and maintenance.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;610&quot; data-end=&quot;955&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with AVEVA Work Tasks (Skelta BPM), AVEVA MDM, SQL scripting, .NET/C# development, and MES lifecycle implementation projects. Strong understanding of manufacturing operations, performance and quality modules, along with industrial automation standards such as ISA-95 and ISA-88, is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;957&quot; data-end=&quot;1250&quot;&gt;The role also involves integration with PLC, OPC, SCADA, Wonderware Historian, and Object Integration Server technologies. Candidates should possess strong troubleshooting, analytical, communication, and client-handling skills to support global manufacturing projects and technical operations.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'INR',0,'India','Pune',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-07-20 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-05-22 01:43:26.000000','2026-05-22 01:43:26.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\".NET Development\", \"AvevaWonderware\", \"C#\", \"Mes API Development\", \"SQL\", \"AVEVA System\", \"AVEVA MES\", \"ISA-95\", \"ISA-88\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;16tpspo&quot; data-start=&quot;1266&quot; data-end=&quot;1316&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC through TCS&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;dhap5i&quot; data-start=&quot;1317&quot; data-end=&quot;1368&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-level AVEVA MES projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;acdy3w&quot; data-start=&quot;1369&quot; data-end=&quot;1446&quot;&gt;Work on advanced Manufacturing Execution Systems and automation solutions&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;127edrt&quot; data-start=&quot;1447&quot; data-end=&quot;1502&quot;&gt;Career growth in MES &amp;amp; Industrial Automation domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;8vszhn&quot; data-start=&quot;1503&quot; data-end=&quot;1567&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global manufacturing clients&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;45fk39&quot; data-start=&quot;1568&quot; data-end=&quot;1623&quot;&gt;Professional and technology-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;1624&quot; data-end=&quot;1667&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Maharashtra'),('18e1e400-a358-4230-bc40-ab6c75a69475','895c2926-0596-411