,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2025-11-21 18:30:00',0,0,'2025-09-23 13:20:44.000000','2025-09-23 13:20:45.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Data Analysis\", \"Data Models\", \"IOT\", \"Stakeholder Communication\", \"System Validation\"]','[\"Opportunity to work on IoT-driven digital transformation projects&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Exposure to Tulip app design &amp;amp; frontline operations platform&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Career growth in Industry 4.0 and IoT development&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Collaborative work environment with product &amp;amp; service teams\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Maharashtra'),('1acfa5e2-075b-4885-8fb9-bb24edf43ffc','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Java Developer','java-developer-10-10','Job Description: We are seeking an experienced and highly skilled Java Developer with 5+ years of hands-on experience to join our team. The ideal candidate will be responsible for designing, developing, and maintaining high-performance, scalable, and reliable Java-based applications. You will collaborate with cross-functional teams to deliver innovative solutions while adhering to best practices and coding standards. Key Responsibilities: Design, develop, and maintain Java-based applications using Java 8/11/17+. Build and integrate RESTful and SOAP APIs. Develop and optimize microservices architecture using Spring Boot and Spring Cloud. Implement efficient and scalable multi-threaded applications. Write clean, modular, and testable code following OOP principles and design patterns. Utilize Hibernate, JPA, or similar ORM frameworks for database interactions. Perform unit testing using JUnit, TestNG, or Mockito. Optimize application performance and ensure security compliance. Collaborate with DevOps teams to implement CI/CD pipelines. Troubleshoot production issues and provide effective solutions. Key Responsibilities: Design, develop, and maintain Java-based applications using Java 8/11/17+. Build and integrate RESTful and SOAP APIs. Develop and optimize microservices architecture using Spring Boot and Spring Cloud. Implement efficient and scalable multi-threaded applications. Write clean, modular, and testable code following OOP principles and design patterns. Utilize Hibernate, JPA, or similar ORM frameworks for database interactions. Perform unit testing using JUnit, TestNG, or Mockito. Optimize application performance and ensure security compliance. Collaborate with DevOps teams to implement CI/CD pipelines. Troubleshoot production issues and provide effective solutions. Required Skills: 5+ years of hands-on experience in Java development. Strong knowledge of Java 8/11/17+ and Spring Framework (Spring Boot, Spring MVC, Spring Data, Spring Security). Experience in RESTful and SOAP API development. Proficiency with SQL and experience with databases such as MySQL, PostgreSQL, or Oracle. Familiarity with NoSQL databases (MongoDB, Redis) is a plus. Strong understanding of microservices architecture and containerization using Docker and Kubernetes. Experience with message brokers (RabbitMQ, Kafka, or ActiveMQ). Proficiency with version control systems (Git, GitHub, GitLab). Experience with Agile methodologies. Excellent problem-solving and debugging skills.','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',200000.00,500000.00,'₹',1,'India','Chennai',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2025-07-02 18:30:00',0,0,'2025-05-04 17:29:41.000000','2025-05-04 17:29:41.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Advanced Java\", \"ASP.NET\", \"Core Java\", \"Git\", \"Github\", \"Java 8+\", \"Java Architecture\", \"Java Developer\", \"Java Full Stack\", \"Java Gui\", \"Java IDE\", \"Java JSP\", \"Java Modules\"]','[\"Perks &amp;amp; Benefits: Competitive salary package Career growth opportunities Comprehensive health insurance Hybrid work model Performance-based incentives Learning and development programs\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Tamil Nadu'),('1b17d0d9-94d7-40d0-b134-38f492e8df89','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Senior GenAI Developer','senior-genai-developer-213-213','&amp;middot; Design and build LLM-powered applications using RAG, prompt engineering, and agentic patterns&lt;br /&gt;&amp;middot; Develop document intelligence pipelines (ingestion, chunking, embedding, retrieval) &lt;br /&gt;&amp;middot; Implement multi-agent orchestration using LangChain / LlamaIndex / Semantic Kernel &lt;br /&gt;&amp;middot; Integrate GenAI solutions with enterprise platforms (SharePoint, APIs, SDLC tools) &lt;br /&gt;&amp;middot; Optimize prompts, retrieval strategies, latency, and cost&lt;br /&gt;&amp;middot; Deploy solutions using Docker, Kubernetes, and CI/CD pipelines &lt;br /&gt;&amp;middot; Apply Responsible AI, security, and governance guardrails','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'INR',1,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-05-17 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-03-18 17:31:49.000000','2026-03-18 17:31:49.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"API\", \"Docker\", \"Kubernetes\", \"Python\", \"SDLC\", \"Semantic Web\", \"CI/CD\", \"Generative AI\", \"LangChain\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;Competitive salary package with performance-based incentives&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;65&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;67&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;Health insurance coverage and statutory benefits (PF &amp;amp; Gratuity)&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;134&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;136&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on large-scale enterprise energy management projects&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;211&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;213&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;Strong career growth and learning opportunities&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;263&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;265&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;Collaborative and professional work environment&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('1b56a063-a970-4c56-ac45-51a59704f31d','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','MES Solution Architect - MOM Design Authority Consultant','mes-solution-architect-mom-design-authority-consultant-119-119','&lt;!--StartFragment --&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf0&quot;&gt;We are looking for an experienced professional to lead Manufacturing Operations Management (MOM) architecture and integration across ERP, PLM, MES, WMS, and LIMS systems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf0&quot;&gt;The ideal candidate will act as a Design Authority, ensuring architectural consistency, system interoperability, and alignment with Industry 4.0 and Smart Manufacturing goals.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;!--StartFragment --&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf0&quot;&gt;Define and maintain the MOM architectural vision across enterprise systems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf0&quot;&gt;Lead architectural governance and integration design across multiple workstreams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf0&quot;&gt;Coordinate with partners (Accenture, ITC, Dassault, etc.) to align technical deliverables.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf0&quot;&gt;Oversee deployment models, DR/HA strategies, and system readiness for Go Live.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf0&quot;&gt;Identify risks, enforce best practices, and support cross-functional teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf0&quot;&gt;&lt;!--EndFragment --&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;!--EndFragment --&gt;','Information Technology','Full-time','Entry',NULL,NULL,'INR',1,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2025-12-13 18:30:00',0,0,'2025-10-15 11:30:27.000000','2025-10-15 11:30:27.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"ERP\", \"Leadership\", \"Lims\", \"Mes\", \"Mes Industry 4.0\", \"MES Integration\", \"Mes Support\", \"Mom\", \"PLM Software (Product Lifecycle Management)\", \"Risk Management\", \"Rockwell Software\", \"Siemens\", \"Solution Architect\", \"Stakeholder Management\", \"Enterprise Architect\"]','[\"Opportunity to lead end-to-end architecture for a cutting-edge smart manufacturing program.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Exposure to Industry 4.0 technologies and enterprise-level integration.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Collaborative and innovative work environment with cross-functional global teams.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Competitive compensation and growth opportunities\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('1bfd91ec-3a5b-45d1-8381-1b894906ea3d','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Software Engineer (Kotlin / Java / Python - Microservices)','software-engineer-kotlin-java-python-microservices-113-113','&lt;br /&gt;The position is for a Backend or Full Stack Developer with 4&amp;ndash;6 years of experience.&lt;br /&gt;The candidate should be skilled in Kotlin, Java, or Python and have hands-on experience in microservices architecture and messaging systems (AWS SNS/SQS).&lt;br /&gt;Knowledge of frontend technologies (React, CSS, HTML) is a plus','Information Technology','Contract','Entry',NULL,NULL,'INR',1,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2025-12-05 18:30:00',0,0,'2025-10-07 13:55:19.000000','2025-10-07 13:55:51.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"AWS\", \"CSS\", \"HTML\", \"Java\", \"KOTLIN\", \"Microservices\", \"Python\", \"React\", \"SNS (Simple Notification Service)\"]','[\"Opportunity to work with a global brand&amp;nbsp;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Competitive salary and performance bonuses&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Exposure to latest cloud and frontend technologies\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('1c16d859-5b14-4769-8b6f-4a163238f1e1','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Honeywell PHD Historian Technical SME','honeywell-phd-historian-technical-sme-207-207','&amp;middot; Install, configure and maintain the Honeywell PHD historian and associated interfaces.&lt;br /&gt;&amp;bull; Monitor system health, troubleshoot issues and ensure data integrity and availability. &lt;br /&gt;&amp;bull; Work closely with process engineers, IT and operations teams to understand data requirements and implement historian solutions.&lt;br /&gt;&amp;bull; Manage historian points/tags, user access and system security. &lt;br /&gt;&amp;bull; Develop and maintain documentation related to historian architecture, configuration and standard operating procedures.&lt;br /&gt;&amp;bull; Support data extraction, reporting and integration with other plant information systems and applications. &lt;br /&gt;&amp;bull; Plan and execute historian upgrades, patches and migrations as required. &lt;br /&gt;&amp;bull; Ensure compliance with Santos&#039; cybersecurity, data governance and backup policies.&lt;br /&gt;&amp;bull; Provide training and support to end users on historian tools and data access methods','Information Technology','Contract','Entry',NULL,NULL,'INR',1,'India','Pune',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-05-04 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-03-05 23:52:32.000000','2026-03-05 23:52:34.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Data Integration\", \"Historian\", \"Oil\", \"Security\", \"SQL Server\", \"DevOps AWS\", \"Honeywell EPKS\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;Competitive salary package with performance-based incentives&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;65&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;67&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;Health insurance coverag