&quot; data-end=&quot;507&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;442&quot; data-end=&quot;507&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;442&quot; data-end=&quot;473&quot;&gt;Onsite Travel Opportunities&lt;/strong&gt; (based on project requirements)&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;508&quot; data-end=&quot;579&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;510&quot; data-end=&quot;579&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;510&quot; data-end=&quot;541&quot;&gt;Supportive Work Environment&lt;/strong&gt; with cross-functional collaboration&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('1ca36863-8232-4b6f-92e7-7e4fbd1cee24','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Tulip Developer','tulip-developer-105-105','We are looking for an experienced Tulip Developer with 4+ years of expertise in Tulip development and support. The role involves designing and developing Tulip applications, understanding frontline operations, and ensuring seamless process streamlining. You will work closely with cross-functional teams, assist in project status meetings, and provide Tulip software support for product-related issues.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Key responsibilities include coordinating with product teams on roadmaps and innovations, analyzing IoT data for insights, developing data models and dashboards to support IoT initiatives, and managing new feature requests including experimentation, testing, rollouts, and system upgrades. This role requires strong collaboration, problem-solving, and communication skills to drive successful Tulip implementation and support.','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Pune',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2025-11-21 18:30:00',0,0,'2025-09-23 13:20:44.000000','2025-09-23 13:20:45.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Data Analysis\", \"Data Models\", \"IOT\", \"Stakeholder Communication\", \"System Validation\"]','[\"Opportunity to work on IoT-driven digital transformation projects&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Exposure to Tulip app design &amp;amp; frontline operations platform&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Career growth in Industry 4.0 and IoT development&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Collaborative work environment with product &amp;amp; service teams\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Maharashtra'),('1cc24b9b-39b0-481e-8970-b2c77ee733db','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Vision Data Scientist','vision-data-scientist-224-224','1. Extensive Hands-on experience in Machine Learning model design, model training and optimization; especially CNN, RCNN, Faster RCNN, RL networks.&lt;br /&gt;2. Experience in defining solution architecture for training and model inference, choose models/algorithms, &lt;br /&gt;3. Exposure to Tensorflow, Caffe /TensorRT/ONNX &lt;br /&gt;4. Excellent coding skill in Python/Pytorch &lt;br /&gt;5. Exposure to OpenCV/Openvino&lt;br /&gt;6. Experience in multithreading will be added advantage&lt;br /&gt;7. Experience in mentoring team&lt;br /&gt;8. Exposure Gen AI &amp;amp; AI agent for vision (Azure open AI/ AWS Gen AI suite/ Nvidia NeMo) would be added advantage.','Information Technology','Contract','Entry',NULL,NULL,'INR',1,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-05-25 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-03-26 20:13:54.000000','2026-03-26 20:13:54.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Azure\", \"Azure  CLI\", \"IT Networking\", \"Python\", \"Generative AI\", \"PyTorch\", \"OpenCV\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;Competitive salary package with performance-based incentives&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;65&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;67&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;Health insurance coverage and statutory benefits (PF &amp;amp; Gratuity)&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;134&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;136&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on large-scale enterprise energy management projects&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;211&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;213&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;Strong career growth and learning opportunities&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;263&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;265&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;Collaborative and professional work environment&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('1d1c8592-9fb3-4a4d-b796-8b3cea27ce5a','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Tuplip Developer','tuplip-developer-107-107','&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an experienced Tulip Developer with 4+ years of expertise in Tulip development and support. The role involves designing and developing Tulip applications, understanding frontline operations, and ensuring seamless process streamlining. You will work closely with cross-functional teams, assist in project status meetings, and provide Tulip software support for product-related issues.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Key responsibilities include coordinating with product teams on roadmaps and innovations, analyzing IoT data for insights, developing data models and dashboards to support IoT initiatives, and managing new feature requests including experimentation, testing, rollouts, and system upgrades. This role requires strong collaboration, problem-solving, and communication skills to drive successful Tulip implementation and support.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Pune',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2025-11-22 18:30:00',0,0,'2025-09-24 08:35:44.000000','2026-10-21 07:10:20.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Java\", \"Spring Boot\", \"SQL\", \"Microservices\"]','[\"Opportunity to work on IoT-driven digital transformation projects&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Exposure to Tulip app design &amp;amp; frontline operations platform&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Career growth in Industry 4.0 and IoT development&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Collaborative work environment with product &amp;amp; service teams\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Maharashtra'),('1e4f8cba-f3af-4bd5-86f5-87f5684bea58','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Mail Gateway / Postfix Administrator – Technology Services','mail-gateway-postfix-administrator-technology-services-77-77','&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;655&quot; data-end=&quot;677&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;659&quot; data-end=&quot;677&quot;&gt;Role Overview:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;678&quot; data-end=&quot;953&quot;&gt;You will be responsible for supporting and maintaining &lt;strong data-start=&quot;733&quot; data-end=&quot;769&quot;&gt;Postfix messaging infrastructure&lt;/strong&gt;, performing high-level system administration, and collaborating with cross-functional teams to ensure the resilience, scalability, and security of the global mail gateway environment.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;hr data-start=&quot;955&quot; data-end=&quot;958&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;960&quot; data-end=&quot;989&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;964&quot; data-end=&quot;989&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;990&quot; data-end=&quot;1500&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;990&quot; data-end=&quot;1089&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;992&quot; data-end=&quot;1089&quot;&gt;Provide &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1000&quot; data-end=&quot;1019&quot;&gt;Level 3 support&lt;/strong&gt; for &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1024&quot; data-end=&quot;1060&quot;&gt;Postfix messaging infrastructure&lt;/strong&gt; across global environments&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1090&quot; data-end=&quot;1155&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1092&quot; data-end=&quot;1155&quot;&gt;Conduct &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1100&quot; data-end=&quot;1153&quot;&gt;stability, configuration, and integration testing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1156&quot; data-end=&quot;1221&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1158&quot; data-end=&quot;1221&quot;&gt;Deploy and support new &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1181&quot; data-end=&quot;1205&quot;&gt;Linux infrastructure&lt;/strong&gt; in production&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1222&quot; data-end=&quot;1297&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1224&quot; data-end=&quot;1297&quot;&gt;Assist in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1234&quot; data-end=&quot;1268&quot;&gt;hardware and software upgrades&lt;/strong&gt;, ensuring smooth migration&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1298&quot; data-end=&quot;1408&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1300&quot; data-end=&quot;1408&quot;&gt;Manage and troubleshoot issues related to &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1342&quot; data-end=&quot;1370&quot;&gt;Mailhost, Postfix, Linux&lt;/strong&gt;, and &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1376&quot; data-end=&quot;1406&quot;&gt;Exchange / Exchange Online&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1409&quot; data-end=&quot;1500&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1411&quot; data-end=&quot;1500&quot;&gt;Collaborate with engineering teams to &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1449&quot; data-end=&quot;1477&quot;&gt;standardize and simplify&lt;/strong&gt; the mail environment&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;hr data-start=&quot;1502&quot; data-end=&quot;1505&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;1507&quot; data-end=&quot;1532&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1511&quot; data-end=&quot;1532&quot;&gt;Must-Have Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1533&quot; data-end=&quot;1973&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1533&quot; data-end=&quot;1649&quot;&g