ta-end=&quot;1973&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1916&quot; data-end=&quot;1973&quot;&gt;Familiarity with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1933&quot; data-end=&quot;1973&quot;&gt;SMTP configuration and distributions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;hr data-start=&quot;1975&quot; data-end=&quot;1978&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;1980&quot; data-end=&quot;2001&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1984&quot; data-end=&quot;2001&quot;&gt;Good-to-Have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2002&quot; data-end=&quot;2173&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2002&quot; data-end=&quot;2096&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2004&quot; data-end=&quot;2096&quot;&gt;Experience working in large, regulated enterprises, especially in the &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2074&quot; data-end=&quot;2094&quot;&gt;finance industry&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2097&quot; data-end=&quot;2173&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2099&quot; data-end=&quot;2173&quot;&gt;Exposure to complex IT infrastructure and compliance-driven environments&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',500000.00,2500000.00,'₹',0,'India','Hyderabad',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-19 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-07-01 13:44:23.000000','2025-11-21 04:48:24.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Configurations\", \"Finance\", \"Hardware\", \"Integration\", \"Linux\", \"Perl\", \"Shell\", \"Software\", \"Testing\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;123&quot; data-end=&quot;158&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;125&quot; data-end=&quot;158&quot;&gt;Exposure to latest technologies&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;159&quot; data-end=&quot;209&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;161&quot; data-end=&quot;209&quot;&gt;Opportunities for upskilling and certification&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;210&quot; data-end=&quot;255&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;212&quot; data-end=&quot;255&quot;&gt;Supportive and collaborative work culture&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;256&quot; data-end=&quot;288&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;258&quot; data-end=&quot;288&quot;&gt;Health and wellness benefits&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;289&quot; data-end=&quot;322&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;291&quot; data-end=&quot;322&quot;&gt;Work-life balance initiatives&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Telangana'),('1e542f68-338c-4ea6-95f8-2d7dbdb36fde','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Full Stack Developer','full-stack-developer-233-233','&amp;middot; .NET Framework and C# for Backend Development &lt;br /&gt;&amp;middot; Angular and JavaScript for Frontend Development &lt;br /&gt;&amp;middot; Database Design and T-SQL &lt;br /&gt;&amp;middot; Web API Development &lt;br /&gt;&amp;middot; Version Control (Git/TFS)','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'INR',1,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-05-30 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-03-31 22:09:58.000000','2026-03-31 22:09:58.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\".NET\", \".NET CORE\", \"ASP.NET Core Web API\", \"C#\", \"Github\", \"MYSQL\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;Competitive salary package with performance-based incentives&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;65&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;67&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;Health insurance coverage and statutory benefits (PF &amp;amp; Gratuity)&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;134&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;136&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on large-scale enterprise energy management projects&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;211&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;213&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;Strong career growth and learning opportunities&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;263&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;265&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;Collaborative and professional work environment&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('1ea94f3b-7a7d-4f88-9cb2-cf0526ac6a8d','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','UI Developer (Angular)','ui-developer-angular-132-132','&lt;p data-start=&quot;198&quot; data-end=&quot;715&quot;&gt;A top multinational company is looking for an experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;256&quot; data-end=&quot;272&quot;&gt;UI Developer&lt;/strong&gt; with strong expertise in Angular 16+, TypeScript, RxJS, and state-management tools like NgRX. The ideal candidate will be responsible for building scalable, high-performance, and visually appealing web applications. You will work with cross-functional teams, write high-quality code, integrate APIs, and contribute to architecture and design discussions. Experience with NodeJS, cloud technologies, and monitoring tools is a strong advantage.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;717&quot; data-end=&quot;863&quot;&gt;This is an excellent opportunity to join a global, innovation-driven organization where you can contribute to world-class enterprise applications.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;hr data-start=&quot;865&quot; data-end=&quot;868&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;870&quot; data-end=&quot;899&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;873&quot; data-end=&quot;899&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;900&quot; data-end=&quot;1628&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;900&quot; data-end=&quot;989&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;902&quot; data-end=&quot;989&quot;&gt;Develop rich and dynamic UI components using &lt;strong data-start=&quot;947&quot; data-end=&quot;987&quot;&gt;Angular 16+, TypeScript, RxJS &amp;amp; NgRX&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;990&quot; data-end=&quot;1060&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;992&quot; data-end=&quot;1060&quot;&gt;Build scalable front-end architecture for enterprise-level systems&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1061&quot; data-end=&quot;1139&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1063&quot; data-end=&quot;1139&quot;&gt;Work with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1073&quot; data-end=&quot;1093&quot;&gt;Angular Material&lt;/strong&gt;, reusable components, and responsive design&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1140&quot; data-end=&quot;1198&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1142&quot; data-end=&quot;1198&quot;&gt;Collaborate with backend teams on REST API integration&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1199&quot; data-end=&quot;1245&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1201&quot; data-end=&quot;1245&quot;&gt;Write unit tests using &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1224&quot; data-end=&quot;1243&quot;&gt;Karma &amp;amp; Jasmine&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1246&quot; data-end=&quot;1307&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1248&quot; data-end=&quot;1307&quot;&gt;Troubleshoot, debug, and optimize application performance&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1308&quot; data-end=&quot;1380&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1310&quot; data-end=&quot;1380&quot;&gt;Follow best practices in UI/UX, code quality, and clean architecture&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1381&quot; data-end=&quot;1447&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1383&quot; data-end=&quot;1447&quot;&gt;Work in an Agile/Scrum environment with cross-functional teams&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1448&quot; data-end=&quot;1551&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1450&quot; data-end=&quot;1551&quot;&gt;(Optional) Work with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1471&quot; data-end=&quot;1487&quot;&gt;Tailwind CSS&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1489&quot; data-end=&quot;1500&quot;&gt;Grafana&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1502&quot; data-end=&quot;1519&quot;&gt;OpenTelemetry&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1521&quot; data-end=&quot;1535&quot;&gt;Kubernetes&lt;/strong&gt;, or &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1540&quot; data-end=&quot;1549&quot;&gt;Azure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1552&quot; data-end=&quot;1628&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1554&quot; data-end=&quot;1628&quot;&gt;Participate in technical reviews, architecture discussions &amp;amp; solutioning&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Full-time','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Hyderabad',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-19 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-11-21 06:09:42.000000','2025-11-21 06:09:42.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Angular\", \"Azure\", \"CSS3\", \"Grafana\", \"HTML5\", \"KarmaJS\", \"Microservices\", \"Node JS\", \"RESTFUL APIS\", \"Typescript\", \"UI-UX\", \"Unit Testing\", \"Kubernetes\", \"Tailwind CSS\", \"Responsive Design\", \"RxJs\", \"Jasmine\", \"NgRx\", \"OpenTelemetry\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2318&quot; data-end=&quot;2379&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2320&quot; data-end=&quot;2379&quot;&gt;Work with a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2332&quot; data-end=&quot;2350&quot;&gt;Top Global MNC&lt;/strong&gt; and modern UI technologies&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2380&quot; data-end=&quot;2443&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2382&quot; data-end=&quot;2443&quot;&gt;Opportunity to build high-impact enterprise UI applications&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2444&quot; data-end=&quot;2506&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2446&quot; data-end=&quot;2506&quot;&gt;Exposure to cloud, Kubernetes, and modern monitoring tools&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2507&quot; data-end=&quot;2556&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2509&quot; data-end=&quot;2556&quot;&gt;Competitive salary &amp;amp; performance-based growth&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2557&quot; data-end=&quot;2615&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2559&quot; data-end=&quot;2615&quot;&gt;Collaborative, innovative, and global work environment&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2616&quot; data-end=&quot;2675&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2618&quot; data-end=&quot;2675&quot;&gt;Continuous learning and skill-enhancement opportunities&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2676&quot; data-end=&quot;2728&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2678&quot; data-end=&quot;2728&quot;&gt;Long-term project stability &amp;amp; career progression&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Telangana'),('1f37d4b7-1262-4ef0-a5b8-b6e229a84594','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Track & Trace / TraceLink Consultant','track-trace-tracelink-consultant-326-326','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;78&quot; data-end=&quot;447&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced Track &amp;amp; Trace / TraceLink Consultants for a leading Top MNC to work on enterprise Pharmaceutical Serialization, Track &amp;amp; Trace, and Supply Chain Compliance projects. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in the TraceLink platform, serialization solutions, system integrations, and regulated pharmaceutical manufacturing environments.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;449&quot; data-end=&quot;891&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for implementing, configuring, supporting, and enhancing Track &amp;amp; Trace solutions using the TraceLink platform to ensure regulatory compliance and supply chain visibility. The role includes configuring serialization and aggregation processes, supporting EPCIS and GS1 standards, managing production support activities, troubleshooting complex issues, and ensuring seamless integration with enterprise systems.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;893&quot; data-end=&quot;1267&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with TraceLink, serialization, aggregation, EPCIS, GS1 standards, ITIL-based support processes, system integration, compliance reporting, and pharmaceutical supply chain operations. Strong understanding of GxP regulations, FDA compliance, UAT, defect management, incident management, and root cause analysis is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1269&quot; data-end=&quot;1740&quot;&gt;The role also involves collaborating with business stakeholders, manufacturing teams, CMOs, IT teams, and external partners to deliver enterprise-grade Track &amp;amp; Trace solutions. Candidates will support testing, production deployments, compliance initiatives, documentation, and continuous improvement activities while ensuring regulatory and business requirements are met. Strong analytical, communication, stakeholder management, and problem-solving skills are essential.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-09-01 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-07-03 19:15:58.000000','2026-07-03 19:15:58.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"ITIL\", \"System Validation\", \"Change Control Management\", \"TraceLink Platform\", \"Track & Trace Solutions\", \"Pharmaceutical Serialization\", \"Aggregation Solutions\", \"EPCIS Standards\", \"UAT (User Acceptance Testing)\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1756&quot; data-end=&quot;1794&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1a7a9sc&quot; data-start=&quot;1795&quot; data-end=&quot;1883&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale Pharmaceutical Serialization and Track &amp;amp; Trace projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1kwyhyh&quot; data-start=&quot;1884&quot; data-end=&quot;1954&quot;&gt;Work on global TraceLink implementation and compliance initiatives&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1n9hitp&quot; data-start=&quot;1955&quot; data-end=&quot;2026&quot;&gt;Career growth in Pharmaceutical Supply Chain &amp;amp; Serialization domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;lx4whh&quot; data-start=&quot;2027&quot; data-end=&quot;2106&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with international business and technology teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;2lee9a&quot; data-start=&quot;2107&quot; data-end=&quot;2162&quot;&gt;Professional and compliance-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;2163&quot; data-end=&quot;2206&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('1f429207-5cfd-410b-8bba-9578884fd4ec','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Computer Vision Expert','computer-vision-expert-300-300','&lt;p data-start=&quot;64&quot; data-end=&quot;429&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced Computer Vision Experts for a leading Top MNC to work on advanced Artificial Intelligence, Visual Language Models (VLMs), Multi-Modal AI, and next-generation computer vision solutions. The ideal candidate should have deep expertise in computer vision algorithms, deep learning frameworks, model optimization, and enterprise AI deployments.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;431&quot; data-end=&quot;806&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for designing, developing, and deploying state-of-the-art computer vision and multi-modal AI solutions for complex business and industrial use cases. The role includes building and optimizing models for object detection, image segmentation, image classification, OCR, scene understanding, image captioning, and visual reasoning applications.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;808&quot; data-end=&quot;1126&quot;&gt;Professionals should have strong hands-on experience with PyTorch, TensorFlow, OpenCV, HuggingFace, Detectron2, and modern Visual Language Models such as CLIP, BLIP, Flamingo, and GPT-4V. Expertise in training, fine-tuning, serving, and optimizing large-scale AI models for production environments is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1128&quot; data-end=&quot;1514&quot;&gt;The role also involves implementing model serving architectures, improving inference performance, enabling hardware acceleration, supporting MLOps practices, and collaborating with AI researchers, data scientists, and engineering teams to deliver enterprise-grade AI solutions. Candidates should possess strong analytical thinking, innovation, communication, and problem-solving skills.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-08-22 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-06-24 03:00:35.000000','2026-06-24 03:00:35.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Computer Vision\", \"PyTorch\", \"TensorFlow\", \"OpenCV\", \"Hugging Face\", \"Visual Language Models (VLMs)\", \"Multi-Modal AI\", \"YOLO\", \"U-Net\", \"GPT-4V\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1530&quot; data-end=&quot;1568&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;txbc6x&quot; data-start=&quot;1569&quot; data-end=&quot;1646&quot;&gt;Exposure to cutting-edge AI, Computer Vision, and Multi-Modal AI projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1c7uxn5&quot; data-start=&quot;1647&quot; data-end=&quot;1718&quot;&gt;Work on advanced Visual Language Models and Generative AI solutions&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1j2czl6&quot; data-start=&quot;1719&quot; data-end=&quot;1788&quot;&gt;Career growth in Artificial Intelligence &amp;amp; Computer Vision domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;zc03ak&quot; data-start=&quot;1789&quot; data-end=&quot;1865&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global AI research and engineering teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot; data-start=&quot;1866&quot; data-end=&quot;1921&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;1922&quot; data-end=&quot;1965&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('1fb1ebc0-24de-4db8-a21a-5c54e98ede16','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','MES Developer – Emerson Syncade','mes-developer-emerson-syncade-287-287','&lt;p data-start=&quot;73&quot; data-end=&quot;431&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced MES Developers for a leading Top MNC to work on Manufacturing Execution System (MES) projects with a strong focus on Emerson Syncade and pharmaceutical manufacturing environments. The ideal candidate should have hands-on experience in MES development, configuration, and support activities within regulated manufacturing industries.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;433&quot; data-end=&quot;798&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for developing, configuring, and maintaining Emerson Syncade MES solutions while supporting manufacturing operations and digital transformation initiatives. The role includes understanding business and manufacturing requirements, implementing MES enhancements, executing test cases, and ensuring system reliability and performance.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;800&quot; data-end=&quot;1051&quot;&gt;Professionals should have strong knowledge of MES environments and manufacturing suites such as Aspen, AMS IP21, A1PE, and APRM. Experience with SQL scripting, validation processes, and pharmaceutical manufacturing operations will be highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1053&quot; data-end=&quot;1401&quot;&gt;The role also involves project planning, stakeholder communication, risk management, documentation updates, customer support, and coordination with technical and business teams. Candidates should possess strong analytical, troubleshooting, communication, and problem-solving skills to support successful MES project delivery and ongoing operations.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-08-08 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-06-10 01:59:41.000000','2026-06-10 01:59:41.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Aspen HYSYS\", \"Manufacturing Execution Systems\", \"Mes Configuration\", \"MES Development\", \"Risk Management\", \"System Design\", \"Test Case Preparation\", \"Emerson Syncade MES\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1417&quot; data-end=&quot;1455&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;19ty62p&quot; data-start=&quot;1456&quot; data-end=&quot;1516&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-level MES implementation projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1460knm&quot; data-start=&quot;1517&quot; data-end=&quot;1589&quot;&gt;Work on Emerson Syncade and manufacturing digitalization initiatives&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1t0cbpi&quot; data-start=&quot;1590&quot; data-end=&quot;1652&quot;&gt;Career growth in MES &amp;amp; Pharmaceutical Manufacturing domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;141aabr&quot; data-start=&quot;1653&quot; data-end=&quot;1732&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global stakeholders and manufacturing teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;45fk39&quot; data-start=&quot;1733&quot; data-end=&quot;1788&quot;&gt;Professional and technology-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;1789&quot; data-end=&quot;1832&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('1fb21135-239e-41d3-86ac-608d95ce67ff','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Power Apps Developer','power-apps-developer-5-5','Key Skills &amp;amp; Expertise:&lt;br /&gt;Power Apps: Canvas Apps &amp;amp; Model-driven Apps&lt;br /&gt;Power Automate &amp;amp; Power BI for visualization and automation&lt;br /&gt;Dataverse &amp;amp; Database Management&lt;br /&gt;Web Development skills&lt;br /&gt;Azure Experience &ndash; Data Engineering, Data Lake, DWH Development&lt;br /&gt;Agile Project Experience (Preferred)&lt;br /&gt;Strong Programming &amp;amp; Data Modelling Skills&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Role &amp;amp; Responsibilities:&lt;br /&gt;Develop, test, and manage Power Apps applications&lt;br /&gt;Work closely with business users &amp;amp; stakeholders to understand and deliver solutions&lt;br /&gt;Design, develop, and maintain mobile apps for iOS &amp;amp; Android using Power Apps&lt;br /&gt;Ensure compliance with industry standards and best practices&lt;br /&gt;Drive innovation and new feature development on the Power Apps platform','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',150000.00,200000.00,'₹',1,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-30 06:00:00',0,0,'2025-05-04 16:40:43.000000','2026-05-06 18:02:22.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Academic Performance Tracking\", \"Advanced C#\", \"Adventure Travel\", \"Animal Production\", \"BGP\", \"BGP Routing\", \"Closing\", \"Cloud AWS\", \"Cloud Storage\", \"Content\", \"Content Strategy\", \"Custom Database Platforms\"]','[\"&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1160&quot; data-end=&quot;1350&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1160&quot; data-end=&quot;1190&quot;&gt;Competitive salary package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1191&quot; data-end=&quot;1222&quot;&gt;Career growth opportunities&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1223&quot; data-end=&quot;1257&quot;&gt;Comprehensive health insurance&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1258&quot; data-end=&quot;1279&quot;&gt;Hybrid work model&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1280&quot; data-end=&quot;1312&quot;&gt;Performance-based incentives&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1313&quot; data-end=&quot;1350&quot;&gt;Learning and development programs&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('1fd72fa7-300f-403f-9e2d-12fe39da817a','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Data Modeler','data-modeler-124-124','We are seeking a highly skilled Data Modeler with hands-on experience in Dimensional Data Modeling and strong analytical abilities. The ideal candidate will design and develop conceptual, logical, and physical data models, ensure data consistency and accuracy, and work closely with business teams to transform requirements into optimized data structures. The role involves data profiling, data governance, and source-to-target mapping to support robust data-driven solutions.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;br /&gt;1. Perform data analysis and data profiling to identify business needs.&lt;br /&gt;2. Build conceptual, logical, and physical data models for business systems.&lt;br /&gt;3. Conduct data model walkthroughs with business teams and review boards.&lt;br /&gt;4. Incorporate feedback to improve model accuracy and efficiency.&lt;br /&gt;5. Develop source-to-target mappings aligned with target data models.','Information Technology','Full-time','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2025-12-26 18:30:00',0,0,'2025-10-28 13:50:37.000000','2025-10-28 13:50:37.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Data Management\", \"Data Modeling\", \"Microsoft Azure Platform\", \"NoSQL\", \"RDBMS\"]','[\"1. Opportunity to work with top-tier clients across industries.&lt;br /&gt;2. Flexible PAN India location with remote options.&lt;br /&gt;3. Career growth in advanced data modeling and analytics technologies.\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('208ef147-1f7c-4e2f-9bf0-07f44a273305','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Ortems Developer & Support Engineer','ortems-developer-support-engineer-221-221','&amp;Oslash; Configure and customize DELMIA ORTEM planning and scheduling models&lt;br /&gt;&amp;Oslash; Develop finite capacity schedules considering resources, constraints, setup times, and priorities&lt;br /&gt;&amp;Oslash; Create and maintain planning scenarios and simulations &lt;br /&gt;&amp;Oslash; Optimize production schedules for OTD, throughput, and resource utilization &lt;br /&gt;&amp;Oslash; Integrate ORTEM with MES systems like Apriso, Siemens Opcenter for execution feedback&lt;br /&gt;&amp;Oslash; Map orders, routings, BOMs, resources, constraints and calendars &lt;br /&gt;&amp;Oslash; Handle real-time data exchange between planning (ORTEM) and execution (MES) and ERP (SAP) system','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'INR',1,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-05-25 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-03-26 20:04:01.000000','2026-03-26 20:04:01.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Apriso\", \"Delmia Apriso\", \"ERP\", \"MYSQL\", \"Opcenter\", \"Oracle\", \"SAP\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;Competitive salary package with performance-based incentives&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;65&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;67&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;Health insurance coverage and statutory benefits (PF &amp;amp; Gratuity)&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;134&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;136&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on large-scale enterprise energy management projects&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;211&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;213&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;Strong career growth and learning opportunities&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;263&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;265&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;Collaborative and professional work environment&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('21241593-c204-4f63-95d3-a8663030a7f8','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Ignition Architect','ignition-architect-46-46','&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;388&quot; data-end=&quot;411&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;392&quot; data-end=&quot;409&quot;&gt;Role Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;412&quot; data-end=&quot;729&quot;&gt;We are seeking a highly skilled &lt;strong data-start=&quot;444&quot; data-end=&quot;466&quot;&gt;Ignition Architect&lt;/strong&gt; to lead the design and implementation of Ignition SCADA systems in manufacturing environments. The ideal candidate will bring deep technical expertise in Ignition architecture, scripting, and integration, along with strong communication and client-facing skills.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;731&quot; data-end=&quot;759&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;735&quot; data-end=&quot;759&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ol data-start=&quot;760&quot; data-end=&quot;1505&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;760&quot; data-end=&quot;906&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;763&quot; data-end=&quot;906&quot;&gt;Understand project requirements and architect solutions using Ignition or authorized 3rd-party modules tailored for manufacturing operations.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;907&quot; data-end=&quot;1019&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;910&quot; data-end=&quot;1019&quot;&gt;Develop detailed technical and commissioning plans while considering technical and operational constraints.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1020&quot; data-end=&quot;1163&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1023&quot; data-end=&quot;1163&quot;&gt;Design and implement control/SCADA systems including databases, tag providers, enterprise architectures, and scripting (Python, VB, etc.).&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1164&quot; data-end=&quot;1312&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1167&quot; data-end=&quot;1312&quot;&gt;Utilize knowledge of backend computing infrastructure including compute hardware, networking, virtualization, operating systems, and databases.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1313&quot; data-end=&quot;1416&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1316&quot; data-end=&quot;1416&quot;&gt;Work closely with client stakeholders for requirement analysis, enhancements, and ongoing support.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1417&quot; data-end=&quot;1505&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1420&quot; data-end=&quot;1505&quot;&gt;Lead and collaborate with offshore teams for solution design, planning, and delivery.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ol&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;1507&quot; data-end=&quot;1531&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1511&quot; data-end=&quot;1531&quot;&gt;Must-Have Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1532&quot; data-end=&quot;1843&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1532&quot; data-end=&quot;1608&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1534&quot; data-end=&quot;1608&quot;&gt;Strong hands-on experience with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1566&quot; data-end=&quot;1606&quot;&gt;Ignition SCADA architecture &amp;amp; design&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1609&quot; data-end=&quot;1659&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1611&quot; data-end=&quot;1659&quot;&gt;Expertise in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1624&quot; data-end=&quot;1644&quot;&gt;Python scripting&lt;/strong&gt; for Ignition&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1660&quot; data-end=&quot;1745&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1662&quot; data-end=&quot;1745&quot;&gt;Familiarity with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1679&quot; data-end=&quot;1696&quot;&gt;Ignition Edge&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1698&quot; data-end=&quot;1720&quot;&gt;Enterprise modules&lt;/strong&gt;, and &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1726&quot; data-end=&quot;1743&quot;&gt;Tag Providers&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1746&quot; data-end=&quot;1792&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1748&quot; data-end=&quot;1792&quot;&gt;Preferred: &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1759&quot; data-end=&quot;1790&quot;&gt;Ignition Gold Certification&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1793&quot; data-end=&quot;1843&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1795&quot; data-end=&quot;1843&quot;&gt;Excellent communication and interpersonal skills&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;1845&quot; data-end=&quot;1865&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1849&quot; data-end=&quot;1865&quot;&gt;Good-to-Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1866&quot; data-end=&quot;1959&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1866&quot; data-end=&quot;1908&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1868&quot; data-end=&quot;1908&quot;&gt;Background in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1882&quot; data-end=&quot;1906&quot;&gt;manufacturing domain&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1909&quot; data-end=&quot;1959&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1911&quot; data-end=&quot;1959&quot;&gt;Strong &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1918&quot; data-end=&quot;1959&quot;&gt;analytical and problem-solving skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',500000.00,2500000.00,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-19 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-06-06 10:08:25.000000','2025-11-21 04:59:55.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Analytical Skills\", \"Architect\", \"Good Communication Skills\", \"Problem-Solving Skills\", \"Python\", \"SCADA\", \"Enterprise Architect\"]','[\"&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;117&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;ob Benefits&lt;/h3&gt;\\r\\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;135&quot; data-end=&quot;996&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;135&quot; data-end=&quot;192&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;137&quot; data-end=&quot;192&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;137&quot; data-end=&quot;159&quot;&gt;Competitive Salary&lt;/strong&gt; based on skills and experience&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;193&quot; data-end=&quot;296&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;195&quot; data-end=&quot;296&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;195&quot; data-end=&quot;236&quot;&gt;Opportunities for Learning and Growth&lt;/strong&gt; through continuous skill development and project exposure&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;297&quot; data-end=&quot;384&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;299&quot; data-end=&quot;384&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;299&quot; data-end=&quot;330&quot;&gt;Supportive Work Environment&lt;/strong&gt; with experienced leadership and collaborative teams&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;385&quot; data-end=&quot;470&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;387&quot; data-end=&quot;470&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;387&quot; data-end=&quot;412&quot;&gt;Flexible Work Options&lt;/strong&gt; depending on project requirements and role expectations&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;471&quot; data-end=&quot;584&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;473&quot; data-end=&quot;584&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;473&quot; data-end=&quot;508&quot;&gt;Exposure to Latest Technologies&lt;/strong&gt; including cloud platforms, microservices, and modern front-end frameworks&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;585&quot; data-end=&quot;643&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;587&quot; data-end=&quot;643&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;587&quot; data-end=&quot;619&quot;&gt;Health and Wellness Programs&lt;/strong&gt; as per company policy&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('2199147c-a697-43de-9762-3ae34f1f036a','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Werum PAS-X MES MBR Designer','werum-pas-x-mes-mbr-designer-270-270','&lt;p data-start=&quot;70&quot; data-end=&quot;395&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced Werum PAS-X MES MBR Designers for a leading Top MNC to work on pharmaceutical MES and digital manufacturing projects. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in Werum PAS-X MES, Master Batch Record (MBR) design, validation processes, and regulated pharmaceutical manufacturing environments.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;397&quot; data-end=&quot;760&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for designing, configuring, validating, and supporting electronic Master Batch Records (MBRs/GMBRs/PMBRs) within the Werum PAS-X MES platform. The role involves collaborating with QA, Process Engineering, Automation, and Manufacturing teams to ensure compliance with pharmaceutical industry standards and regulatory requirements.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;762&quot; data-end=&quot;1046&quot;&gt;Professionals should have experience in MES integration with SAP ERP systems, L2/L3 automation systems, serialization platforms, and pharmaceutical manufacturing processes. Strong knowledge of GMP, GAMP 5, CFR Part 11, data integrity, and validation methodologies is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1048&quot; data-end=&quot;1420&quot;&gt;The role also includes troubleshooting MES and MBR-related issues, supporting MES implementation activities, and contributing to process standardization and harmonization initiatives across manufacturing sites. Candidates should possess excellent analytical, communication, and documentation skills with the ability to work in highly regulated pharmaceutical environments.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Mumbai',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-07-10 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-05-12 03:12:36.000000','2026-05-12 03:12:36.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"GAMP5\", \"Mes Troubleshooting\", \"Regulatory Compliance\", \"Werum PAS-X\", \"GMP\", \"21 CFR Part 11\", \"MBRs\", \"Pharmaceutical Manufacturing Processes\", \"GMBR\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1436&quot; data-end=&quot;1474&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1r7u6nf&quot; data-start=&quot;1475&quot; data-end=&quot;1544&quot;&gt;Exposure to pharmaceutical MES and digital manufacturing projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;9avew8&quot; data-start=&quot;1545&quot; data-end=&quot;1601&quot;&gt;Work on enterprise-level Werum PAS-X implementations&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1klavax&quot; data-start=&quot;1602&quot; data-end=&quot;1653&quot;&gt;Career growth in Pharma MES &amp;amp; Automation domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;3uidrc&quot; data-start=&quot;1654&quot; data-end=&quot;1717&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global pharmaceutical teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;2lee9a&quot; data-start=&quot;1718&quot; data-end=&quot;1773&quot;&gt;Professional and compliance-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;1774&quot; data-end=&quot;1817&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Maharashtra'),('21a6a5d1-1a04-462c-96fd-d6882c1f6eee','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Intune SME Engineer','intune-sme-engineer-61-61','&lt;p data-start=&quot;183&quot; data-end=&quot;411&quot;&gt;Are you a skilled professional with expertise in Microsoft Intune, Windows Autopilot, and Windows OS? Join our team as an &lt;strong data-start=&quot;308&quot; data-end=&quot;331&quot;&gt;Intune SME Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; and be part of exciting projects in cutting-edge IT infrastructure solutions.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;413&quot; data-end=&quot;440&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;413&quot; data-end=&quot;438&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;441&quot; data-end=&quot;1307&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;441&quot; data-end=&quot;547&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;443&quot; data-end=&quot;547&quot;&gt;Develop and maintain Surface release builds, including validation processes and deployment automation.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;548&quot; data-end=&quot;675&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;550&quot; data-end=&quot;675&quot;&gt;Provide third-line engineering support for escalated issues related to Microsoft Intune, Windows Autopilot, and Windows OS.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;676&quot; data-end=&quot;769&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;678&quot; data-end=&quot;769&quot;&gt;Design and manage a structured knowledge base with comprehensive technical documentation.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;770&quot; data-end=&quot;904&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;772&quot; data-end=&quot;904&quot;&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional teams to improve operational processes through scripting, automation, and workflow optimization.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;905&quot; data-end=&quot;989&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;907&quot; data-end=&quot;989&quot;&gt;Support endpoint hardening, compliance standards, and risk reduction strategies.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;990&quot; data-end=&quot;1081&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;992&quot; data-end=&quot;1081&quot;&gt;Create and manage Intune Configuration Profiles, Compliance Policies, and MDM controls.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1082&quot; data-end=&quot;1202&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1084&quot; data-end=&quot;1202&quot;&gt;Oversee the lifecycle of Windows devices and deploy enterprise applications using PowerShell App Deployment Toolkit.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1203&quot; data-end=&quot;1307&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1205&quot; data-end=&quot;1307&quot;&gt;Implement patch management, vulnerability remediation, and certificate-based authentication workflows&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',1500000.00,3000000.00,'₹',1,'India','Hyderabad',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-19 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-07-01 10:40:13.000000','2025-11-21 04:57:17.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Automation\", \"Azure Active Directory\", \"Scripting\", \"Windows OS\", \"PowerShell App Deployment Toolkit\", \"Mobile Device Management\", \"Microsoft Intune\", \"Windows Autopilot\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1500&quot; data-end=&quot;1531&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1502&quot; data-end=&quot;1531&quot;&gt;Competitive salary package.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1532&quot; data-end=&quot;1591&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1534&quot; data-end=&quot;1591&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on large-scale enterprise projects.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1592&quot; data-end=&quot;1653&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1594&quot; data-end=&quot;1653&quot;&gt;Comprehensive health insurance (medical, dental, vision).&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1654&quot; data-end=&quot;1722&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1656&quot; data-end=&quot;1722&quot;&gt;Paid leave, including vacation, sick leave, and public holidays.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1723&quot; data-end=&quot;1793&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1725&quot; data-end=&quot;1793&quot;&gt;Growth opportunities through certifications and learning programs.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1794&quot; data-end=&quot;1877&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1796&quot; data-end=&quot;1877&quot;&gt;Exposure to cutting-edge technologies and innovative IT infrastructure solutions.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Telangana'),('22ea8feb-bdc1-4077-9416-b6e1b2d915af','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','PHP Developer','php-developer-20-20','&lt;h2&gt;PHP Developer&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',250000.00,500000.00,'₹',1,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2025-07-03 18:30:00',0,0,'2025-05-05 02:57:09.000000','2025-05-05 02:57:10.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Advanced JavaScript\", \"CSS\", \"CSS3\", \"HTML\", \"HTML5\", \"JavaScript\", \"Laravel\", \"Laravel Framework\", \"PHP\", \"PHP Development\"]','[]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('235677b1-583b-4c04-9070-963b2fa38154','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Robotics, Automation & Simulation SME','robotics-automation-simulation-sme-296-296','&lt;p data-start=&quot;79&quot; data-end=&quot;514&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced Robotics, Automation &amp;amp; Simulation Subject Matter Experts (SMEs) for a leading Top MNC to drive advanced automation, smart manufacturing, and Industry 4.0 transformation initiatives. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in industrial robotics, autonomous mobile robots (AMRs), automated guided vehicles (AGVs), collaborative robots (Cobots), manufacturing simulation, and digital factory solutions.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;516&quot; data-end=&quot;914&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for leading automation solution design, robotics deployment programs, simulation projects, and manufacturing optimization initiatives across global manufacturing environments. The role includes evaluating automation opportunities, developing technical solutions, conducting simulation studies, and supporting end-to-end implementation and commissioning activities.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;916&quot; data-end=&quot;1322&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with industrial robots, controls engineering, PLCs, HMIs, material handling systems, and manufacturing simulation tools such as FlexSim, Tecnomatix, and AnyLogic. Strong knowledge of discrete event simulation (DES), plant layout planning, logistics optimization, bottleneck analysis, line balancing, and operational performance improvement is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1324&quot; data-end=&quot;1686&quot;&gt;The role also involves collaborating with OEMs, customers, engineering teams, and global stakeholders, creating technical proposals, performing effort estimations, and mentoring simulation and automation teams. Candidates should possess strong leadership, communication, analytical, and problem-solving skills to drive large-scale digital manufacturing programs.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-08-22 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-06-24 02:39:42.000000','2026-06-24 02:39:42.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"C++\", \"FlexSim\", \"PLC Programming\", \"Python\", \"Tecnomatix\", \"HMI\", \"Discrete Event Simulation\", \"Industrial Robotics\", \"Automated Guided Vehicles (AGVs)\", \"Autonomous Mobile Robots (AMRs)\", \"Manufacturing Automation\", \"Manufacturing Simulation\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1702&quot; data-end=&quot;1740&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1txfhvi&quot; data-start=&quot;1741&quot; data-end=&quot;1800&quot;&gt;Exposure to advanced Robotics and Industry 4.0 projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;12rjjvq&quot; data-start=&quot;1801&quot; data-end=&quot;1857&quot;&gt;Work on cutting-edge Smart Manufacturing initiatives&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1k0bg1f&quot; data-start=&quot;1858&quot; data-end=&quot;1930&quot;&gt;Leadership role in automation and simulation transformation programs&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;11fq9w6&quot; data-start=&quot;1931&quot; data-end=&quot;2004&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global OEMs and manufacturing leaders&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;549l3i&quot; data-start=&quot;2005&quot; data-end=&quot;2077&quot;&gt;Career growth in Robotics, Automation &amp;amp; Digital Manufacturing domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot; data-start=&quot;2078&quot; data-end=&quot;2133&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;2134&quot; data-end=&quot;2177&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('2387c409-e4da-491d-8b25-52202791b3c1','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Software Engineer / API & Integration Expert','software-engineer-api-integration-expert-272-272','&lt;p data-start=&quot;86&quot; data-end=&quot;414&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced Software Engineers / API &amp;amp; Integration Experts for a leading Top MNC to work on enterprise-level ERP, MES, PLM, and business system integration projects. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in API development, enterprise application integration, and scalable system connectivity solutions.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;416&quot; data-end=&quot;740&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for developing, managing, and maintaining interfaces between ERP, MES, PLM, and other enterprise applications. The role includes designing secure and scalable APIs, building integration workflows, troubleshooting interface issues, and ensuring smooth communication between business systems.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;742&quot; data-end=&quot;1007&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with REST APIs, microservices architecture, enterprise integration platforms, and system optimization. Strong knowledge of security standards, compliance protocols, testing, and validation processes is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1009&quot; data-end=&quot;1336&quot;&gt;The role also involves preparing interface documentation, supporting deployment activities, monitoring integrations, and collaborating with cross-functional technical and business teams to deliver reliable enterprise integration solutions. Candidates should possess strong analytical, problem-solving, and communication skills.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-07-12 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-05-14 03:35:05.000000','2026-05-14 03:35:05.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"API Integration\", \"Data Testing\", \"ERP Integration\", \"Microservices\", \"REST API\", \"System Design\", \"Validation\", \"API Development\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1352&quot; data-end=&quot;1390&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;12ngfli&quot; data-start=&quot;1391&quot; data-end=&quot;1444&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-level integration projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;52sdwm&quot; data-start=&quot;1445&quot; data-end=&quot;1494&quot;&gt;Work on ERP, MES, and PLM system integrations&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ru9hft&quot; data-start=&quot;1495&quot; data-end=&quot;1551&quot;&gt;Career growth in API &amp;amp; Enterprise Integration domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1saf85k&quot; data-start=&quot;1552&quot; data-end=&quot;1612&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with modern integration technologies&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;9wn5a9&quot; data-start=&quot;1613&quot; data-end=&quot;1664&quot;&gt;Collaborative and professional work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;1665&quot; data-end=&quot;1708&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('23b4a649-a879-47c0-acd3-f24d9ded1e36','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Software Engineer - Android Developer (Fresher)','software-engineer-android-developer-fresher-102-102','We are hiring Android Developer Freshers for our Bangalore office. This role is ideal for recent graduates who are passionate about building mobile applications and want to start their career in Android app development.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Assist in designing, coding, testing, and maintaining Android applications.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Write clean, efficient, and maintainable code in Java/Kotlin.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional teams to define, design, and deliver features.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Debug and fix issues to improve application performance.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Stay updated with the latest Android trends and tools.','Information Technology','Contract','Executive',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-19 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-09-17 10:37:13.000000','2025-11-21 00:44:26.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Android\", \"Android SDK\", \"Firebase\", \"Git Version Control\", \"Good Communication\", \"Java\", \"JSON\", \"KOTLIN\", \"Material Specification\", \"OOPS\", \"Problem Solving\", \"Push\", \"RESTFUL APIS\", \"SQLITE\", \"Teamwork\", \"UI-UX\", \"Visual Studio\", \"XML Creation\"]','[\"Opportunity to work with a Top MNC and global teams.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Hands-on training with real-time projects.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Guidance and mentorship from experienced developers.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Competitive salary with career growth opportunities.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Collaborative, learning-friendly work environment.\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('23d104d2-fe04-4521-b7b8-9e0822300159','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','MES Validation (CSV) Specialist','mes-validation-csv-specialist-306-306','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;152&quot; data-end=&quot;552&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced MES Validation (CSV) Specialists for a leading Top MNC to support enterprise Manufacturing Execution System (MES) validation and compliance initiatives across global manufacturing sites. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in Siemens Opcenter Execution (Camstar), Computer System Validation (CSV), GAMP 5 methodologies, and regulated manufacturing environments.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;554&quot; data-end=&quot;912&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for planning, executing, and managing MES validation activities throughout the system lifecycle. The role includes preparing validation documentation, supporting Electronic Batch Record (EBR) implementations, conducting risk assessments, and ensuring compliance with regulatory requirements such as FDA and EU GMP standards.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;914&quot; data-end=&quot;1236&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with MES workflows, recipes, equipment modeling, master data management, validation testing, and system integration validation. Strong understanding of GAMP 5 Category 4/5 systems, CSV V-Model methodology, audit readiness, and quality compliance processes is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1238&quot; data-end=&quot;1585&quot;&gt;The role also involves collaborating with global quality teams, manufacturing sites, business stakeholders, and technical teams to support multi-site validation programs, validation testing activities, and regulatory inspections. Candidates should possess excellent documentation, communication, stakeholder management, and problem-solving skills.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-08-23 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-06-25 02:47:11.000000','2026-06-25 02:47:11.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"CapIQ\", \"CSV\", \"GAMP5\", \"Mes\", \"Mes Infrastructure\", \"OQ\", \"PQ\", \"QMS System\", \"Siemens Opcenter\", \"SOAP\", \"Validation\", \"EBR\", \"Change Control Management\", \"Master Data Management (MDM)\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1601&quot; data-end=&quot;1639&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ixsuln&quot; data-start=&quot;1640&quot; data-end=&quot;1701&quot;&gt;Exposure to global MES validation and compliance projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;97tu98&quot; data-start=&quot;1702&quot; data-end=&quot;1769&quot;&gt;Work on advanced Siemens Opcenter Execution (Camstar) platforms&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;vrruui&quot; data-start=&quot;1770&quot; data-end=&quot;1822&quot;&gt;Career growth in CSV, MES &amp;amp; Life Sciences domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ag73mq&quot; data-start=&quot;1823&quot; data-end=&quot;1894&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global quality and validation teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;2lee9a&quot; data-start=&quot;1895&quot; data-end=&quot;1950&quot;&gt;Professional and compliance-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;1951&quot; data-end=&quot;1994&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('23eb6c56-5f1a-4383-8dae-560296263899','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Senior SQL Developer / Database Administrator (10+ Years Experience)','senior-sql-developer-database-administrator-10-years-experience-127-127','&lt;p data-start=&quot;198&quot; data-end=&quot;670&quot;&gt;We are hiring an experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;227&quot; data-end=&quot;276&quot;&gt;Senior SQL Developer / Database Administrator&lt;/strong&gt; for a top MNC. The ideal candidate will be responsible for designing, developing, securing, and optimizing large-scale databases. The role involves database administration, performance tuning, writing complex SQL queries, and managing cloud-based SQL environments. You will work closely with cross-functional teams to ensure seamless data operations, high availability, and system reliability.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;hr data-start=&quot;672&quot; data-end=&quot;675&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;677&quot; data-end=&quot;706&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;680&quot; data-end=&quot;706&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;707&quot; data-end=&quot;1310&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;707&quot; data-end=&quot;753&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;709&quot; data-end=&quot;753&quot;&gt;Design, develop and maintain SQL databases&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;754&quot; data-end=&quot;840&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;756&quot; data-end=&quot;840&quot;&gt;Implement database backup strategies, disaster recovery plans &amp;amp; security protocols&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;841&quot; data-end=&quot;912&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;843&quot; data-end=&quot;912&quot;&gt;Optimize database performance through tuning and query optimization&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;913&quot; data-end=&quot;997&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;915&quot; data-end=&quot;997&quot;&gt;Develop and execute complex SQL queries, stored procedures, functions &amp;amp; triggers&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;998&quot; data-end=&quot;1056&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1000&quot; data-end=&quot;1056&quot;&gt;Manage SQL Server instances including SSRS, SSIS, SSAS&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1057&quot; data-end=&quot;1111&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1059&quot; data-end=&quot;1111&quot;&gt;Monitor, troubleshoot, and resolve database issues&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1112&quot; data-end=&quot;1185&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1114&quot; data-end=&quot;1185&quot;&gt;Manage Azure SQL Managed Instances and cloud-based database solutions&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1186&quot; data-end=&quot;1231&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1188&quot; data-end=&quot;1231&quot;&gt;Automate tasks using PowerShell scripting&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1232&quot; data-end=&quot;1310&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1234&quot; data-end=&quot;1310&quot;&gt;Ensure high availability, scalability, and reliability of database systems&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Full-time','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Hyderabad',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-19 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-11-21 05:17:57.000000','2025-11-21 05:17:57.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Azure SQL Database\", \"Cloud Platforms\", \"Database\", \"Design\", \"SQL\", \"SQL Performance Tuning\", \"SQL Query Optimization\", \"Ssas Cubes\", \"Troubleshooting\", \"SSIS\", \"SSRS\", \"Transact-SQL(T-SQL)\"]','[\"&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1816&quot; data-end=&quot;2234&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1816&quot; data-end=&quot;1896&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1818&quot; data-end=&quot;1896&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1845&quot; data-end=&quot;1856&quot;&gt;Top MNC&lt;/strong&gt; and advanced enterprise-level systems&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1897&quot; data-end=&quot;1933&quot;&g