ering, operations, quality, vendors).&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Maintain a RAID tracker (Risks, Assumptions, Issues, Dependencies) and drive mitigation &amp;amp; resolution with owners.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Monitor integrated dependencies between industrial and digital milestones; escalate when slippage threatens go-live.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Provide clear, decisive recommendations and status updates to senior leadership and steering committees.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Ensure governance inputs and prepare materials for steering-committee forums.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Coordinate vendor deliveries, factory acceptance tests (FAT), site acceptance tests (SAT), and cutover planning.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Ensure quality of deliverables and adherence to change control processes during commissioning.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Consolidated reporting: timeline health, deliverable status, risk heatmap, and corrective actions.','Infrastructure Management','Full-time','Entry',NULL,NULL,'INR',1,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2025-12-12 18:30:00',0,0,'2025-10-14 07:26:49.000000','2025-10-14 07:26:49.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Advanced Excel\", \"AvevaWonderware\", \"Change Management\", \"Confluence\", \"Critical Path Management\", \"Cross-Functional\", \"Data Analysis\", \"ERP Integration\", \"JIRA\", \"Manufacturing\", \"Mes\", \"Mes Scada Integration\", \"Mom\", \"MS Project\", \"Performance Tracking\", \"PLC\", \"Primavera\", \"Project Management\", \"Risk Management\", \"Siemens Opcenter\", \"Stakeholder Management\", \"Rockwell Factorytalk\"]','[\"Competitive salary and performance bonus&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Health insurance and family coverage&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Provident Fund / statutory benefits and paid time off&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Travel allowance / site-visit reimbursements&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Learning &amp;amp; certification sponsorship (PMP/MES tools)&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Flexible/hybrid working (office + site visits) depending on project phase&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Relocation or travel support if required for specific site activities\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('24376419-d7d3-4e8a-aa74-33e5a13a5a2b','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','MES Developer (C++, .Net)','mes-developer-c-net-201-201','o Strong hands-on experience in C++ and .NET (C#, ASP.NET) development. &lt;br /&gt;o Experience in developing, customizing, and supporting MES (Manufacturing Execution Systems) or similar industrial automation solutions.&lt;br /&gt;o Proficiency in object-oriented programming, design patterns, and software architecture. &lt;br /&gt;o Experience with relational databases (Oracle, SQL Server) and writing complex queries. &lt;br /&gt;o Familiarity with SDLC, Agile/Scrum practices, and version control systems (e.g., Git).&lt;br /&gt;o Ability to write clean, maintainable, and well-documented code.&lt;br /&gt;o Strong debugging, troubleshooting, and problem-solving skills.&lt;br /&gt;o Experience with MES platforms (Critical Manufacturing, GE Proficy, custom MES).','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'INR',1,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-04-26 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-02-25 19:20:08.000000','2026-02-25 19:20:08.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\".NET\", \"Agile\", \"Angular\", \"ASP.NET\", \"C++\", \"DevOps\", \"Docker\", \"Github\", \"Mes\", \"MYSQL\", \"Opc\", \"Oracle\", \"React\", \"SDLC\", \"SECS/GEM Standards\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;Competitive salary package with performance-based incentives&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;65&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;67&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;Health insurance coverage and statutory benefits (PF &amp;amp; Gratuity)&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;134&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;136&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on large-scale enterprise energy management projects&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;211&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;213&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;Strong career growth and learning opportunities&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;263&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;265&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;Collaborative and professional work environment&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('2439a110-2c4a-4c02-b2a7-4404d2bb0cab','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Ortems Specialist','ortems-specialist-118-118','formance and integration with enterprise systems.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Design and configure Ortems scheduling architecture and ensure seamless integration with Apriso MES.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Determine SQL environment setup (shared/dedicated) based on performance and partitioning needs.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Plan and define use cases in collaboration with scheduling consultants.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Coordinate with infrastructure teams to ensure CPU, RAM, and network requirements.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Support Azure-to-On-prem environment transitions for Ortems.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Act as a liaison among scheduling teams, IT architects, and manufacturing stakeholders.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Maintain and update technical documentation and configuration specifications.','Infrastructure Management','Full-time','Entry',NULL,NULL,'INR',1,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2025-12-12 18:30:00',0,0,'2025-10-14 09:22:35.000000','2025-10-15 11:22:17.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Apriso\", \"Azure Cloud Networking\", \"Cross-Functional\", \"Database Management\", \"Documentation\", \"Logistics\", \"Mes\", \"MES Integration\", \"MS SQL Server\", \"Scheduling\", \"Stakeholder Management\", \"Supply Chain\"]','[\"Opportunity to work on global manufacturing systems&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Exposure to Azure and advanced scheduling tools&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Work with cross-functional teams in SCM, Logistics, and Manufacturing&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Career growth in MES &amp;amp; Smart Factory technologies&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Collaborative and innovative work environment\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('258fcd86-c4bc-48cb-9833-00ff2b941a7b','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Werum PAS-X MES Manager','werum-pas-x-mes-manager-165-165','&lt;p data-start=&quot;300&quot; data-end=&quot;886&quot;&gt;The Werum PAS-X MES Manager will be responsible for leading, managing, and delivering PAS-X MES implementation and enhancement projects across global or site-level manufacturing facilities. This role involves architecting MES systems aligned with business and IT strategy, ensuring GMP compliance, integrating PAS-X with enterprise systems, and driving digital transformation within pharmaceutical manufacturing environments. The manager will collaborate with cross-functional teams, oversee system lifecycle activities, and ensure adherence to data integrity and regulatory guidelines.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;925&quot; data-end=&quot;1683&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;925&quot; data-end=&quot;1021&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;927&quot; data-end=&quot;1021&quot;&gt;Lead PAS-X MES implementation, configuration, and support across global/site-level projects.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1022&quot; data-end=&quot;1103&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1024&quot; data-end=&quot;1103&quot;&gt;Define, maintain, and enhance MES architecture aligned with enterprise goals.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1104&quot; data-end=&quot;1210&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1106&quot; data-end=&quot;1210&quot;&gt;Integrate PAS-X MES with ERP systems (SAP), Level 2/3 automation systems, and serialization platforms.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1211&quot; data-end=&quot;1303&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1213&quot; data-end=&quot;1303&quot;&gt;Drive digital transformation and standardization initiatives across manufacturing sites.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1304&quot; data-end=&quot;1401&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1306&quot; data-end=&quot;1401&quot;&gt;Manage system lifecycle activities including upgrades, patches, and performance improvements.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1402&quot; data-end=&quot;1485&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1404&quot; data-end=&quot;1485&quot;&gt;Ensure compliance with GMP, GAMP 5, CFR Part 11, and data integrity principles.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1486&quot; data-end=&quot;1576&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1488&quot; data-end=&quot;1576&quot;&gt;Collaborate with IT, Quality, and Manufacturing teams to harmonize business processes.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1577&quot; data-end=&quot;1632&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1579&quot; data-end=&quot;1632&quot;&gt;Support regulatory audits and validation processes.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1633&quot; data-end=&quot;1683&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1635&quot; data-end=&quot;1683&quot;&gt;Manage vendors and multi-site teams effectively.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Full-time','Entry',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-02-07 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-12-10 05:15:36.000000','2025-12-10 05:15:36.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"ERP Systems\", \"GAMP5\", \"Mes\", \"Pharmaceutical\", \"SAP ERP HCM\", \"Werum PAS-X\", \"GMP\", \"21 CFR Part 11\", \"EBR\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1785&quot; data-end=&quot;1831&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1787&quot; data-end=&quot;1831&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and performance bonuses&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1832&quot; data-end=&quot;1869&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1834&quot; data-end=&quot;1869&quot;&gt;Health insurance &amp;amp; life insurance&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1870&quot; data-end=&quot;1915&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1872&quot; data-end=&quot;1915&quot;&gt;Opportunities for global project exposure&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1916&quot; data-end=&quot;1970&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1918&quot; data-end=&quot;1970&quot;&gt;Professional development and certification support&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1971&quot; data-end=&quot;2022&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1973&quot; data-end=&quot;2022&quot;&gt;Work-from-home flexibility depending on project&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2023&quot; data-end=&quot;2054&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2025&quot; data-end=&quot;2054&quot;&gt;Onsite travel opportunities&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2055&quot; data-end=&quot;2087&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2057&quot; data-end=&quot;2087&quot;&gt;Paid leaves and annual bonus&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2088&quot; data-end=&quot;2118&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2090&quot; data-end=&quot;2118&quot;&gt;Employee wellness programs&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('261ab4f2-e74f-4c1a-9cce-8e4b7fc3848b','2e150e1a-ce0f-490f-b609-ee1f5954ef02','e28d7456-6b42-4900-abc8-e9302f5153c5','Backend Sales Executive','backend-sales-executive-57-57','Key Responsibilities:&lt;br /&gt;&bull; Handle backend sales operations including quotation preparation, order processing, and invoice&lt;br /&gt;generation&lt;br /&gt;&bull; Coordinate with field sales team to manage customer requirements and ensure timely&lt;br /&gt;communication&lt;br /&gt;&bull; Follow up on inquiries and quotations shared with clients&lt;br /&gt;&bull; Maintain and update CRM and sales reports&lt;br /&gt;&bull; Assist in the preparation of sales proposals and presentations&lt;br /&gt;&bull; Communicate with customers for follow-ups, payment reminders, and documentation&lt;br /&gt;&bull; Work closely with the logistics and operations team for smooth order dispatch and delivery.','Sales','Full-time','Entry',12000.00,15000.00,'₹',1,'India','Ghaziabad',0,1,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-03-31 06:00:00',0,0,'2025-06-16 09:08:20.000000','2025-12-23 17:07:55.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Cold Calling\", \"Quotation\", \"Sales\"]','[\"As per the Company Standereds\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Uttar Pradesh'),('26805d72-4b5f-4187-8cb0-b5eec50a4149','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Senior Android Developer (Xamarin / .NET MAUI)','senior-android-developer-xamarin-net-maui-154-154','&lt;p data-start=&quot;182&quot; data-end=&quot;617&quot;&gt;We are looking for a highly skilled &lt;strong data-start=&quot;218&quot; data-end=&quot;246&quot;&gt;Senior Android Developer&lt;/strong&gt; with strong expertise in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;272&quot; data-end=&quot;297&quot;&gt;Xamarin and .NET MAUI&lt;/strong&gt; to join our team. The ideal candidate will be responsible for designing, developing, enhancing, and maintaining high-quality mobile applications. You will work on migrating existing Xamarin Android applications to .NET MAUI, ensuring smooth performance, scalability, and reliability across devices and Android versions.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;619&quot; data-end=&quot;917&quot;&gt;The role requires strong experience in C#, API integration, PostgreSQL, and mobile architectural patterns. You will also support troubleshooting, debugging, and resolving issues in a timely manner. Experience in web technologies, Python, and manufacturing domain systems will be an added advantage.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;hr data-start=&quot;919&quot; data-end=&quot;922&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h1 data-start=&quot;924&quot; data-end=&quot;952&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;928&quot; data-end=&quot;952&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;953&quot; data-end=&quot;1770&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;953&quot; data-end=&quot;1033&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;955&quot; data-end=&quot;1033&quot;&gt;Develop and enhance mobile applications using &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1001&quot; data-end=&quot;1012&quot;&gt;Xamarin&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1017&quot; data-end=&quot;1030&quot;&gt;.NET MAUI&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1034&quot; data-end=&quot;1122&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1036&quot; data-end=&quot;1122&quot;&gt;Understand, analyze, and work on existing Xamarin applications for new enhancements.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1123&quot; data-end=&quot;1191&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1125&quot; data-end=&quot;1191&quot;&gt;Lead migration of current Xamarin Android apps to &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1175&quot; data-end=&quot;1188&quot;&gt;.NET MAUI&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1192&quot; data-end=&quot;1260&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1194&quot; data-end=&quot;1260&quot;&gt;Implement clean, scalable, and maintainable mobile architecture.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1261&quot; data-end=&quot;1375&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1263&quot; data-end=&quot;1375&quot;&gt;Perform &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1271&quot; data-end=&quot;1287&quot;&gt;unit testing&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1289&quot; data-end=&quot;1312&quot;&gt;integration testing&lt;/strong&gt;, and ensure application reliability across Android versions.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1376&quot; data-end=&quot;1477&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1378&quot; data-end=&quot;1477&quot;&gt;Build and deliver deployable packages to the &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1423&quot; data-end=&quot;1444&quot;&gt;Google Play Store&lt;/strong&gt; or other deployment platforms.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1478&quot; data-end=&quot;1552&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1480&quot; data-end=&quot;1552&quot;&gt;Troubleshoot and resolve application issues within expected timelines.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1553&quot; data-end=&quot;1608&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1555&quot; data-end=&quot;1608&quot;&gt;Develop responsive and user-friendly UI components.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1609&quot; data-end=&quot;1681&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1611&quot; data-end=&quot;1681&quot;&gt;Work on API integration and database operations with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1664&quot; data-end=&quot;1678&quot;&gt;PostgreSQL&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1682&quot; data-end=&quot;1770&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1684&quot; data-end=&quot;1770&quot;&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional teams and provide technical guidance where required.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Full-time','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-31 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-12-02 16:38:52.000000','2025-12-02 16:38:52.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\".NET\", \"API Integration\", \"C#\", \"ERP\", \"Mes\", \"PostgreSQL\", \"Python\", \"Web Services\", \"Xamarin\", \"Android Development\", \".NET MAUI\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2723&quot; data-end=&quot;2753&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2725&quot; data-end=&quot;2753&quot;&gt;Competitive salary package&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2754&quot; data-end=&quot;2793&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2756&quot; data-end=&quot;2793&quot;&gt;Health insurance / medical coverage&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2794&quot; data-end=&quot;2820&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2796&quot; data-end=&quot;2820&quot;&gt;Flexible working hours&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2821&quot; data-end=&quot;2879&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2823&quot; data-end=&quot;2879&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on modern technologies (.NET MAUI)&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2880&quot; data-end=&quot;2917&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2882&quot; data-end=&quot;2917&quot;&gt;Learning and development programs&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2918&quot; data-end=&quot;2965&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2920&quot; data-end=&quot;2965&quot;&gt;Career growth with leadership opportunities&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2966&quot; data-end=&quot;3034&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2968&quot; data-end=&quot;3034&quot;&gt;Exposure to manufacturing IT systems and enterprise applications&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('271c7570-88c0-4ba4-8d00-5296a6e1797b','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Watson LIMS Support Analyst','watson-lims-support-analyst-371-371','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;65&quot; data-end=&quot;221&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;91&quot; data-end=&quot;123&quot;&gt;Watson LIMS Support Analysts&lt;/strong&gt; for a leading global MNC to join an enterprise-level &lt;strong data-start=&quot;177&quot; data-end=&quot;215&quot;&gt;Application and Production Support&lt;/strong&gt; team.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;223&quot; data-end=&quot;460&quot;&gt;The ideal candidate should have strong hands-on experience with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;287&quot; data-end=&quot;306&quot;&gt;IBM Watson LIMS&lt;/strong&gt;, L2/L3 application support, SQL, relational databases, incident and problem management, LIMS configuration, integrations, and production troubleshooting.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;462&quot; data-end=&quot;728&quot;&gt;The role involves supporting critical Watson LIMS applications, resolving production issues within defined SLAs, performing &lt;strong data-start=&quot;586&quot; data-end=&quot;615&quot;&gt;Root Cause Analysis (RCA)&lt;/strong&gt;, maintaining LIMS workflows and configurations, and supporting upgrades, patches, deployments, and integrations.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;730&quot; data-end=&quot;912&quot;&gt;Candidates should be comfortable working across &lt;strong data-start=&quot;778&quot; data-end=&quot;810&quot;&gt;Linux / Windows environments&lt;/strong&gt;, application integrations, middleware, scripting, and ITSM tools such as ServiceNow, JIRA, or Remedy.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Pune',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-25 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-08-27 02:47:01.000000','2026-08-27 02:47:01.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Oracle\", \"Root Cause Analysis (RCA)\", \"SLA Management\", \"SQL\", \"SQL Server\", \"Workflow\", \"Production Support\", \"IBM Watson LIMS\", \"Watson LIMS Support\", \"L2 / L3 Application Support\", \"LIMS Customization\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;927&quot; data-end=&quot;974&quot; data-section-id=&quot;rdheb3&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a leading global MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;975&quot; data-end=&quot;1034&quot; data-section-id=&quot;376ew0&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-level &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1006&quot; data-end=&quot;1034&quot;&gt;LIMS application support&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1035&quot; data-end=&quot;1090&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1q4mndw&quot;&gt;Work on critical laboratory and business applications&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1091&quot; data-end=&quot;1156&quot; data-section-id=&quot;mzw40z&quot;&gt;Experience with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1109&quot; data-end=&quot;1156&quot;&gt;L2/L3 production support and ITSM processes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1157&quot; data-end=&quot;1232&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1j48v27&quot;&gt;Exposure to LIMS configuration, customization, integrations, and upgrades&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1233&quot; data-end=&quot;1309&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1w74zoo&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with SQL, APIs, middleware, and scripting technologies&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1310&quot; data-end=&quot;1350&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1grs5e1&quot;&gt;Exposure to Cloud and DevOps practices&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1351&quot; data-end=&quot;1420&quot; data-section-id=&quot;7gmtua&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global IT and business stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1421&quot; data-end=&quot;1497&quot; data-section-id=&quot;18mjbbb&quot;&gt;Career growth in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1440&quot; data-end=&quot;1497&quot;&gt;LIMS, Laboratory Informatics, and Application Support&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1498&quot; data-end=&quot;1556&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1wuw381&quot;&gt;Experience with enterprise-scale production environments&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Maharashtra'),('2775cec2-16cc-46e5-ada6-6e37f7c7dc8c','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Quintiq Developer – DELMIA Quintiq','quintiq-developer-delmia-quintiq-355-355','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;76&quot; data-end=&quot;435&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;102&quot; data-end=&quot;124&quot;&gt;Quintiq Developers&lt;/strong&gt; for a leading Top MNC to support enterprise-scale Supply Chain Planning, Production Scheduling, Optimization, and Digital Manufacturing initiatives. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in DELMIA Quintiq, QUILL programming, optimization solutions, enterprise integrations, and software development.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;437&quot; data-end=&quot;833&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for designing, developing, configuring, and supporting DELMIA Quintiq solutions across enterprise planning environments. The role includes developing scheduling and planning applications, building integrations with enterprise systems, implementing optimization and auto-planning solutions, developing automated testing frameworks, and supporting CI/CD pipelines.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;835&quot; data-end=&quot;1250&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;886&quot; data-end=&quot;1133&quot;&gt;DELMIA Quintiq Scheduler, Macro Planner, Company Planner, Demand Planner, QUILL, UML/Object-Oriented Modeling, SOAP, REST APIs, SFTP, Java, C, C++, JavaScript, AngularJS, jQuery, SQL, NoSQL, Oracle, SQL Server, Git, Azure DevOps, JSON, and XML&lt;/strong&gt;. Strong understanding of optimization techniques such as Linear Programming, Heuristics, and AI is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1252&quot; data-end=&quot;1740&quot;&gt;The role also involves collaborating with business stakeholders, supply chain teams, solution architects, developers, and global delivery teams to translate business requirements into scalable planning solutions. Candidates will develop unit, integration, and end-to-end testing solutions, maintain CI/CD pipelines, troubleshoot technical issues, and contribute to continuous improvement. Strong analytical, communication, stakeholder management, and problem-solving skills are essential.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Entry',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-09 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-08-11 03:50:06.000000','2026-08-11 03:50:06.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Angular\", \"C++\", \"Java\", \"JavaScript\", \"JQUERY\", \"OOPS\", \"REST API\", \"SOAP\", \"SQL\", \"Supply Chain Management\", \"UML\", \"Quintiq Scheduler\", \"DELMIA Quintiq\", \"Quintiq Macro Planner\", \"Quintiq Company Planner\", \"Quintiq Demand Planner\", \"QUILL Programming\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1756&quot; data-end=&quot;1794&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1b15olh&quot; data-start=&quot;1795&quot; data-end=&quot;1885&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale Supply Chain Planning and Digital Transformation projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;pu5zs5&quot; data-start=&quot;1886&quot; data-end=&quot;1962&quot;&gt;Work with advanced DELMIA Quintiq planning and optimization technologies&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;piyrsp&quot; data-start=&quot;1963&quot; data-end=&quot;2053&quot;&gt;Career growth in Supply Chain Technology, Manufacturing IT, and Optimization Solutions&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;vq0hl0&quot; data-start=&quot;2054&quot; data-end=&quot;2126&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global business and technology teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1r7qena&quot; data-start=&quot;2127&quot; data-end=&quot;2202&quot;&gt;Exposure to advanced scheduling, planning, and optimization initiatives&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot; data-start=&quot;2203&quot; data-end=&quot;2258&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;2259&quot; data-end=&quot;2302&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('27b1a8ef-de40-40ff-9288-0bfd9ce0aac1','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','MES Solution Architect - MOM Design Authority Consultant','mes-solution-architect-mom-design-authority-consultant-116-116','We are looking for an experienced MES Solution Architect to lead the Manufacturing Operations Management (MOM) architecture and integration strategy across ERP, PLM, MES, WMS, and LIMS systems. The ideal candidate will act as a Design Authority, ensuring architectural consistency, partner coordination, and alignment with Industry 4.0 and smart manufacturing goals. You&amp;rsquo;ll drive system integration, oversee governance, and ensure readiness from design to Go Live.','Information Technology','Full-time','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2025-12-11 18:30:00',0,0,'2025-10-13 05:56:17.000000','2025-10-13 05:56:17.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"ERP\", \"Leadership\", \"Lims\", \"Mes\", \"Mes Industry 4.0\", \"MES Integration\", \"Mes Support\", \"Mom\", \"PLM Software (Product Lifecycle Management)\", \"Risk Management\", \"Rockwell Software\", \"Siemens\", \"Solution Architect\", \"Stakeholder Management\", \"Enterprise Architect\"]','[\"Opportunity to lead end-to-end architecture for a cutting-edge smart manufacturing program.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Exposure to Industry 4.0 technologies and enterprise-level integration.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Collaborative and innovative work environment with cross-functional global teams.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Competitive compensation and growth opportunities.\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('27bd57b8-9a9b-48c8-88a4-0cf9b51ec4d5','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Software Engineer','software-engineer-87-87','We are looking for passionate Software Engineers who are enthusiastic about building high-quality, scalable, and reliable applications for Industrial IoT. You&amp;rsquo;ll be part of a cross-functional, autonomous team working on cloud-based platforms that help power and scale industrial solutions globally.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Your role will focus on designing, developing, and deploying applications with strong emphasis on availability, performance, and DevOps principles. You&amp;rsquo;ll take ownership, collaborate with top engineers, and contribute to systems that impact how we feed the world and protect the planet.','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',1,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-19 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-08-01 13:02:21.000000','2025-11-21 04:44:34.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Automation Testing\", \"AWS\", \"Cloud Computing\", \"CSS\", \"Debugging Skills\", \"Deployment\", \"DevOps\", \"Distributed Control Systems\", \"Git\", \"Google Pub\", \"Google Sub\", \"HTML\", \"Java\", \"KOTLIN\", \"Messaging Systems\", \"Microservices\", \"Python\", \"React\", \"REST API\", \"SNS (Simple Notification Service)\", \"Software Development\", \"SQS (Simple Queue Service)\", \"CI/CD\"]','[\"Opportunity to work on cutting-edge cloud and IoT technologies&lt;br /&gt;Be part of a collaborative, autonomous product team&lt;br /&gt;Exposure to DevOps and microservices-based architectures&lt;br /&gt;Ownership of features from design to deployment&lt;br /&gt;Work alongside some of the best software engineers in the industry&lt;br /&gt;Encouraging workplace for learning, innovation, and team growth\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('27cb1c40-67a0-4450-87c2-eb88c953f980','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','SAP Consultant','sap-consultant-220-220','&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;ERP Consultant:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Lead SAP integration design and delivery for Loftware Cloud engagement for pharma major. Own interface architecture, data mapping, and controls. Ensure data accuracy through rigorous testing and validation. Coordinate with global site teams to support cutover, stabilization, and post‑go‑live support across multi‑region Loftware implementations, while managing risks, governance, and stakeholder communication effectively globally.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Entry',NULL,NULL,'INR',1,'India','Kolkata',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-05-24 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-03-25 16:37:42.000000','2026-03-25 16:37:44.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Mes\", \"SAP\", \"SAP ABAP\", \"SAP BI\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;Competitive salary package with performance-based incentives&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;65&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;67&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;Health insurance coverage and statutory benefits (PF &amp;amp; Gratuity)&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;134&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;136&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on large-scale enterprise energy management projects&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;211&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;213&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;Strong career growth and learning opportunities&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;263&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;265&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;Collaborative and professional work environment&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'West Bengal'),('27e0e059-f36d-43f8-a84c-9df9d5394a92','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Senior LabVantage LIMS Developer','senior-labvantage-lims-developer-228-228','&lt;p&gt;Strong hands-on experience in LabVantage LIMS development and configuration&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;middot; Experience supporting e2e LIMS implementation and deployments&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;middot; Develop and configure custom workflows, scripts and system configurations in LabVantage&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;middot; Experience integrating lab instruments and external systems (LabVantage SDMS, CI, ELN, SAP...)&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;middot; Experience with SQL, relational databases and data modeling&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;middot; Experience building system integrations using APIs, web services, or middleware&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;middot; Participate in system enhancements, upgrades, troubleshooting and technical improvements&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;middot; Work closely with IT LIMS team and laboratory stakeholders to implement technical solutions&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;middot; Fluent English communication skills&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Entry',NULL,NULL,'INR',1,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-05-30 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-03-31 21:19:57.000000','2026-03-31 21:19:57.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Lims\", \"MYSQL\", \"SAP Integration\", \"LabVantage\", \"LabVantage LIMS\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;Competitive salary package with performance-based incentives&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;65&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;67&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;Health insurance coverage and statutory benefits (PF &amp;amp; Gratuity)&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;134&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;136&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on large-scale enterprise energy management projects&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;211&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;213&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;Strong career growth and learning opportunities&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;263&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;265&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;Collaborative and professional work environment&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('27e2dd68-1c73-42a6-bdf9-afa6c23d7b18','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Werum PAS-X MES Manager','werum-pas-x-mes-manager-165-165','&lt;p data-start=&quot;300&quot; data-end=&quot;886&quot;&gt;The Werum PAS-X MES Manager will be responsible for leading, managing, and delivering PAS-X MES implementation and enhancement projects across global or site-level manufacturing facilities. This role involves architecting MES systems aligned with business and IT strategy, ensuring GMP compliance, integrating PAS-X with enterprise systems, and driving digital transformation within pharmaceutical manufacturing environments. The manager will collaborate with cross-functional teams, oversee system lifecycle activities, and ensure adherence to data integrity and regulatory guidelines.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;925&quot; data-end=&quot;1683&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;925&quot; data-end=&quot;1021&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;927&quot; data-end=&quot;1021&quot;&gt;Lead PAS-X MES implementation, configuration, and support across global/site-level projects.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1022&quot; data-end=&quot;1103&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1024&quot; data-end=&quot;1103&quot;&gt;Define, maintain, and enhance MES architecture aligned with enterprise goals.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1104&quot; data-end=&quot;1210&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1106&quot; data-end=&quot;1210&quot;&gt;Integrate PAS-X MES with ERP systems (SAP), Level 2/3 automation systems, and serialization platforms.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1211&quot; data-end=&quot;1303&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1213&quot; data-end=&quot;1303&quot;&gt;Drive digital transformation and standardization initiatives across manufacturing sites.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1304&quot; data-end=&quot;1401&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1306&quot; data-end=&quot;1401&quot;&gt;Manage system lifecycle activities including upgrades, patches, and performance improvements.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1402&quot; data-end=&quot;1485&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1404&quot; data-end=&quot;1485&quot;&gt;Ensure compliance with GMP, GAMP 5, CFR Part 11, and data integrity principles.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1486&quot; data-end=&quot;1576&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1488&quot; data-end=&quot;1576&quot;&gt;Collaborate with IT, Quality, and Manufacturing teams to harmonize business processes.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1577&quot; data-end=&quot;1632&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1579&quot; data-end=&quot;1632&quot;&gt;Support regulatory audits and validation processes.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1633&quot; data-end=&quot;1683&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1635&quot; data-end=&quot;1683&quot;&gt;Manage vendors and multi-site teams effectively.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Full-time','Entry',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-02-07 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-12-10 05:15:36.000000','2025-12-10 05:15:36.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"ERP Systems\", \"GAMP5\", \"Mes\", \"Pharmaceutical\", \"SAP ERP HCM\", \"Werum PAS-X\", \"GMP\", \"21 CFR Part 11\", \"EBR\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1785&quot; data-end=&quot;1831&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1787&quot; data-end=&quot;1831&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and performance bonuses&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1832&quot; data-end=&quot;1869&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1834&quot; data-end=&quot;1869&quot;&gt;Health insurance &amp;amp; life insurance&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1870&quot; data-end=&quot;1915&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1872&quot; data-end=&quot;1915&quot;&gt;Opportunities for global project exposure&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1916&quot; data-end=&quot;1970&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1918&quot; data-end=&quot;1970&quot;&gt;Professional development and certification support&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1971&quot; data-end=&quot;2022&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1973&quot; data-end=&quot;2022&quot;&gt;Work-from-home flexibility depending on project&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2023&quot; data-end=&quot;2054&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2025&quot; data-end=&quot;2054&quot;&gt;Onsite travel opportunities&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2055&quot; data-end=&quot;2087&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2057&quot; data-end=&quot;2087&quot;&gt;Paid leaves and annual bonus&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2088&quot; data-end=&quot;2118&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2090&quot; data-end=&quot;2118&quot;&gt;Employee wellness programs&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('286034e8-9d48-4272-aeed-f3983c29b5ed','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','LabVantage Developer','labvantage-developer-311-311','&lt;p data-start=&quot;62&quot; data-end=&quot;468&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced LabVantage Developers for a leading Top MNC to work on enterprise-scale Laboratory Information Management System (LIMS) projects for global pharmaceutical and life sciences clients. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in LabVantage LIMS development, configuration, customization, system administration, and production support within regulated laboratory environments.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;470&quot; data-end=&quot;884&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for designing, developing, configuring, installing, upgrading, and maintaining LabVantage LIMS applications to support laboratory operations and business requirements. The role includes implementing system enhancements, handling production support activities, managing incidents and change requests, and ensuring high system availability and performance across global deployments.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;886&quot; data-end=&quot;1203&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with LabVantage LIMS, Core Java, Jasper Reports, XML, SQL, RDBMS, NoSQL databases, SDMS modules, and JBoss application server. Strong knowledge of application development, database management, deployment processes, and enterprise laboratory workflows is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1205&quot; data-end=&quot;1644&quot;&gt;The role also involves collaborating with global clients, laboratory users, business stakeholders, and technical teams to deliver enterprise-grade laboratory solutions. Candidates will support production environments, perform technical change management, develop customized reports, and ensure compliance with industry standards and best practices. Strong analytical, communication, documentation, and problem-solving skills are essential.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Noida',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-08-24 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-06-26 03:31:38.000000','2026-06-26 03:31:38.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Core Java\", \"Jasper Reports\", \"NoSQL\", \"RDBMS\", \"SQL Server\", \"XML\", \"LabVantage\", \"LabVantage LIMS\", \"Change Control Management\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1660&quot; data-end=&quot;1698&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1xmivuy&quot; data-start=&quot;1699&quot; data-end=&quot;1783&quot;&gt;Exposu