start=&quot;358&quot; data-end=&quot;431&quot;&gt;AI/ML model development, optimization, and deployment on edge devices&lt;/strong&gt;, along with expertise in TensorFlow Lite, PyTorch Mobile, ONNX, Python, C/C++, computer vision, and embedded systems.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;551&quot; data-end=&quot;793&quot;&gt;The role involves developing lightweight AI inference pipelines, optimizing models for resource-constrained environments, integrating AI solutions with embedded and IoT platforms, and enabling real-time AI-powered decision-making at the edge.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;18w7bso&quot; data-start=&quot;795&quot; data-end=&quot;818&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;820&quot; data-end=&quot;1967&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;4s1kpi&quot; data-start=&quot;820&quot; data-end=&quot;892&quot;&gt;Design, develop, and deploy &lt;strong data-start=&quot;850&quot; data-end=&quot;891&quot;&gt;AI/ML models for Edge AI applications&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1nb7l85&quot; data-start=&quot;893&quot; data-end=&quot;952&quot;&gt;Build lightweight and efficient edge inference pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ua7eyp&quot; data-start=&quot;953&quot; data-end=&quot;1012&quot;&gt;Optimize AI models for resource-constrained environments.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1mxnm1s&quot; data-start=&quot;1013&quot; data-end=&quot;1098&quot;&gt;Perform &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1023&quot; data-end=&quot;1097&quot;&gt;model quantization, pruning, compression, and performance optimization&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;rtafmh&quot; data-start=&quot;1099&quot; data-end=&quot;1179&quot;&gt;Deploy AI models on &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1121&quot; data-end=&quot;1178&quot;&gt;Raspberry Pi, NVIDIA Jetson, and similar edge devices&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1pthkry&quot; data-start=&quot;1180&quot; data-end=&quot;1242&quot;&gt;Integrate AI models with embedded systems and IoT platforms.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-27 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-08-29 00:53:25.000000','2026-08-29 00:53:26.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"AI/ML\", \"C++\", \"Embedded Systems\", \"Machine Learning\", \"Python\", \"Raspberry PI\", \"PyTorch\", \"TensorFlow\", \"NVIDIA Jetson\", \"Edge AI\", \"ONNX\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1n6cily&quot; data-start=&quot;1982&quot; data-end=&quot;2055&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2011&quot; data-end=&quot;2022&quot;&gt;Top MNC&lt;/strong&gt; on advanced Edge AI initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1jr7h49&quot; data-start=&quot;2056&quot; data-end=&quot;2156&quot;&gt;Exposure to &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2070&quot; data-end=&quot;2155&quot;&gt;Generative AI, Computer Vision, Embedded AI, and real-time inference technologies&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;w6jl9f&quot; data-start=&quot;2157&quot; data-end=&quot;2234&quot;&gt;Work with leading edge hardware such as &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2199&quot; data-end=&quot;2233&quot;&gt;NVIDIA Jetson and Raspberry Pi&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;hgsvzi&quot; data-start=&quot;2235&quot; data-end=&quot;2318&quot;&gt;Opportunity to build and optimize production-grade AI models for edge deployment.&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;xtgmfk&quot; data-start=&quot;2319&quot; data-end=&quot;2391&quot;&gt;Exposure to &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2333&quot; data-end=&quot;2390&quot;&gt;MLOps, Docker, Kubernetes, CI/CD, and AI accelerators&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;a903ru&quot; data-start=&quot;2392&quot; data-end=&quot;2482&quot;&gt;Work on real-world AI applications involving anomaly detection and predictive analytics.&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('2a1f44b3-3c09-4ff3-9bd5-0fe1f0cbf66d','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Wonderware SCADA Engineer / Developer','wonderware-scada-engineer-developer-178-178','&lt;p data-start=&quot;223&quot; data-end=&quot;596&quot;&gt;We are looking for an experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;257&quot; data-end=&quot;286&quot;&gt;Wonderware SCADA Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; to design, develop, troubleshoot, and support industrial automation and SCADA systems across manufacturing environments. The role involves PLC programming, SCADA configuration, system optimization, and close collaboration with HMI and automation teams to deliver reliable and fault-tolerant control solutions.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;hr data-start=&quot;598&quot; data-end=&quot;601&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;603&quot; data-end=&quot;630&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;606&quot; data-end=&quot;630&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;631&quot; data-end=&quot;1365&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;631&quot; data-end=&quot;721&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;633&quot; data-end=&quot;721&quot;&gt;Develop, configure, and maintain &lt;strong data-start=&quot;666&quot; data-end=&quot;719&quot;&gt;Wonderware SCADA and System Platform applications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;722&quot; data-end=&quot;796&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;724&quot; data-end=&quot;796&quot;&gt;Program and troubleshoot &lt;strong data-start=&quot;749&quot; data-end=&quot;757&quot;&gt;PLCs&lt;/strong&gt; (Mitsubishi, Siemens, Allen-Bradley)&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;797&quot; data-end=&quot;876&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;799&quot; data-end=&quot;876&quot;&gt;Diagnose and resolve issues in existing &lt;strong data-start=&quot;839&quot; data-end=&quot;874&quot;&gt;PLC, SCADA, and control systems&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;877&quot; data-end=&quot;957&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;879&quot; data-end=&quot;957&quot;&gt;Configure and manage industrial communication protocols and control networks&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;958&quot; data-end=&quot;1056&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;960&quot; data-end=&quot;1056&quot;&gt;Work closely with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;978&quot; data-end=&quot;1014&quot;&gt;HMI design and development teams&lt;/strong&gt; to optimize usability and data exchange&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1057&quot; data-end=&quot;1145&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1059&quot; data-end=&quot;1145&quot;&gt;Design &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1066&quot; data-end=&quot;1103&quot;&gt;fault-tolerant automation systems&lt;/strong&gt; with robust error handling and recovery&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1146&quot; data-end=&quot;1219&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1148&quot; data-end=&quot;1219&quot;&gt;Implement &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1158&quot; data-end=&quot;1217&quot;&gt;state machines, data acquisition, and PID control logic&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1220&quot; data-end=&quot;1294&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1222&quot; data-end=&quot;1294&quot;&gt;Ensure adherence to industrial automation standards and best practices&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1295&quot; data-end=&quot;1365&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1297&quot; data-end=&quot;1365&quot;&gt;Support customer requirement gathering and solution implementation&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-03-23 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-01-22 22:00:44.000000','2026-01-22 22:00:45.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"AvevaWonderware\", \"Industrial Automation\", \"MS SQL Server\", \"PLC Programming\", \"SCADA\", \"Siemens\", 