abases and cloud platforms.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1102&quot; data-end=&quot;1173&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1104&quot; data-end=&quot;1173&quot;&gt;Work with both &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1119&quot; data-end=&quot;1146&quot;&gt;SQL and NoSQL databases&lt;/strong&gt; for application storage.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1174&quot; data-end=&quot;1236&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1176&quot; data-end=&quot;1236&quot;&gt;Collaborate with frontend teams using HTML and JavaScript.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1237&quot; data-end=&quot;1314&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1239&quot; data-end=&quot;1314&quot;&gt;Participate in architecture design, code reviews, and performance tuning.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1315&quot; data-end=&quot;1379&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1317&quot; data-end=&quot;1379&quot;&gt;Deploy and troubleshoot applications in AWS cloud environment.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Full-time','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Chennai',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-20 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-11-22 04:16:53.000000','2025-11-22 04:16:53.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\".NET CORE\", \"AWS Lambda Layers\", \"C#\", \"Cloud\", \"EC2\", \"ECS\", \"EKS\", \"HTML\", \"JavaScript\", \"Microservices\", \"NoSQL\", \"REST API\", \"SQL\", \"AWS RDS\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1405&quot; data-end=&quot;1474&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1407&quot; data-end=&quot;1474&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1434&quot; data-end=&quot;1471&quot;&gt;top-tier tech-driven organization&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1475&quot; data-end=&quot;1542&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1477&quot; data-end=&quot;1542&quot;&gt;Hands-on work with modern cloud technologies and microservices.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-star