;717&quot;&gt;Empower Enterprise architecture, system administration, configuration, upgrades, migrations, user management, DAC, and legacy version decommissioning&lt;/strong&gt;. The candidate will be responsible for maintaining application stability, supporting technical infrastructure, and ensuring effective operation of Empower environments across laboratory operations.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-11-10 07:00:00',0,0,'2026-09-12 02:35:16.000000','2026-09-12 02:35:16.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"CDS Views\", \"Change Management\", \"CSV\", \"Gxp Compliance\", \"ITIL\", \"Pharmacy\", \"DAC Management\", \"Waters Empower\", \"Chromatography Data Systems (CDS)\", \"Waters Empower CDS\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;iofbfz&quot; data-start=&quot;1613&quot; data-end=&quot;1661&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a leading &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1650&quot; data-end=&quot;1661&quot;&gt;Top MNC&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;156ye9x&quot; data-start=&quot;1662&quot; data-end=&quot;1721&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1693&quot; data-end=&quot;1721&quot;&gt;Empower CDS environments&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1p1gmyi&quot; data-start=&quot;1722&quot; data-end=&quot;1782&quot;&gt;Work within &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1736&quot; data-end=&quot;1774&quot;&gt;Pharma, Healthcare &amp;amp; Life Sciences&lt;/strong&gt; domains&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1mc9so6&quot; data-start=&quot;1783&quot; data-end=&quot;1858&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience with Empower upgrades, migrations, and administration&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1s6njm&quot; data-start=&quot;1859&quot; data-end=&quot;1926&quot;&gt;Exposure to analytical laboratory and chromatography environments&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;jwmqws&quot; data-start=&quot;1927&quot; data-end=&quot;1985&quot;&gt;Experience working in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1951&quot; data-end=&quot;1985&quot;&gt;GMP/GxP-regulated environments&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('2beb586b-3818-4223-a121-daed5cb025c0','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Backend developer(JAVA)','backend-developerjava-195-195','&lt;p&gt;Thorough and deep understanding of Java JDK 17+, our foundational programming language&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;bull; Spring Framework &amp;amp; AOP v5.2+&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;bull; Proven experience working with, and a deep understanding of Spring Boot 2.7+ and its modules (Web, Data JPA, Security OAuth2) and ability to explain complex use-cases related to persistency and web security&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;bull; Experience with our build system Maven v3+&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;bull; Experience with containerization and deployments tools eg. Docker v20+ and Kaniko, Helm (charts) v3+ wrt Kubernetes deployments&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;bull; Experience working with CI/CD tools like GitLab SCM &amp;amp; pipelines and JFrog Artifactory&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;bull; Strong knowledge working with different types of SQL and NoSQL databases such as PostgreSQL v12+, MongoDB v4+ and Neo4J v4+&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;bull; Proficient in working with DevOps engineers on Cloud deployments (eg. Azure subscriptions)&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;bull; Experience in Agile/Scrum &amp;amp; (pref.) SAFe (Scaled Agile Framework) and enabling tooling &amp;ndash; Atlassian Jira Cloud / Jira Align&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;bull; Strong skills working in a full-stack environment, leading the development of REST API&amp;rsquo;s with both software development skills and experience in design and development of secure and high-performance applications&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;bull; Having good experience in testing stack &amp;ndash; Junit / Mockito&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;bull; Experience with software quality &amp;amp; vulnerability testing &amp;ndash; SonarQube and Blackduck&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;bull; Proficient in writing software documentation on Atlassian Wiki&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'INR',1,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-04-18 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-02-17 19:56:10.000000','2026-02-17 19:56:43.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Agile\", \"Consuming REST API Services\", \"Core Java\", \"Docker\", \"Github\", \"Java 8+\", \"Kubernetes\", \"Maven\", \"Mockito\", \"Mongo DB\", \"MYSQL\", \"Oauth 2.0\", \"PostgreSQL\", \"Spring Batch\", \"Spring Boot\", \"Spring MVC\", \"Springboot Microservices\", \"Scrum Master\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;Competitive salary package with performance-based incentives&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;65&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;67&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;Health insurance coverage and statutory benefits (PF &amp;amp; Gratuity)&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;134&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;136&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on large-scale enterprise energy management projects&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;211&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;213&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;Strong career growth and learning opportunities&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;263&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;265&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;Collaborative and professional work environment&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('2c74a3dd-b3a5-44ba-ab12-1824ae620066','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Tech Lead – OB Portal (Kafka, Cosmos DB)','tech-lead-ob-portal-kafka-cosmos-db-28-28','&lt;h3 class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;159&quot; data-end=&quot;220&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;163&quot; data-end=&quot;177&quot;&gt;Job Title:&lt;/strong&gt; Tech Lead &amp;ndash; OB Portal (Kafka, Cosmos DB)&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;221&quot; data-end=&quot;391&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;221&quot; data-end=&quot;234&quot;&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Chennai, India (Offshore)&lt;br data-start=&quot;260&quot; data-end=&quot;263&quot; /&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;263&quot; data-end=&quot;278&quot;&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 6+ years total, with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;300&quot; data-end=&quot;335&quot;&gt;3+ years of relevant experience&lt;/strong&gt; in Kafka &amp;amp; Cosmos DB&lt;br data-start=&quot;356&quot; data-end=&quot;359&quot; /&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;359&quot; data-end=&quot;379&quot;&gt;Employment Type:&lt;/strong&gt; Full-time&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;398&quot; data-end=&quot;420&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;402&quot; data-end=&quot;418&quot;&gt;Job Summary:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;421&quot; data-end=&quot;783&quot;&gt;We are seeking a skilled and experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;462&quot; data-end=&quot;475&quot;&gt;Tech Lead&lt;/strong&gt; to join our offshore team in Chennai to lead the development and support of OB Portal systems leveraging &lt;strong data-start=&quot;581&quot; data-end=&quot;597&quot;&gt;Apache Kafka&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong data-start=&quot;602&quot; data-end=&quot;621&quot;&gt;Azure Cosmos DB&lt;/strong&gt;. The ideal candidate will have a strong background in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;676&quot; data-end=&quot;705&quot;&gt;event-driven architecture&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong data-start=&quot;707&quot; data-end=&quot;736&quot;&gt;real-time data processing&lt;/strong&gt;, and &lt;strong data-start=&quot;742&quot; data-end=&quot;782&quot;&gt;cloud-native application development&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;790&quot; data-end=&quot;819&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;794&quot; data-end=&quot;819&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;821&quot; data-end=&quot;1771&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;821&quot; data-end=&quot;934&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;823&quot; data-end=&quot;934&quot;&gt;Lead the architecture, design, and implementation of scalable data pipelines using &lt;strong data-start=&quot;906&quot; data-end=&quot;915&quot;&gt;Kafka&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong data-start=&quot;920&quot; data-end=&quot;933&quot;&gt;Cosmos DB&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;935&quot; data-end=&quot;1046&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;937&quot; data-end=&quot;1046&quot;&gt;Develop, test, and deploy &lt;strong data-start=&quot;963&quot; data-end=&quot;996&quot;&gt;Kafka producers and consumers&lt;/strong&gt; for handling high-volume, real-time data streams.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1047&quot; data-end=&quot;1169&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1049&quot; data-end=&quot;1169&quot;&gt;Design and optimize data models, partitioning strategies, and indexing in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1123&quot; data-end=&quot;1136&quot;&gt;Cosmos DB&lt;/strong&gt; for performance and scalability.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1170&quot; data-end=&quot;1275&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1172&quot; data-end=&quot;1275&quot;&gt;Implement &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1182&quot; data-end=&quot;1202&quot;&gt;Kafka Connectors&lt;/strong&gt; to integrate with diverse data sources and targets, including Cosmos DB.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1276&quot; data-end=&quot;1360&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1278&quot; data-end=&quot;1360&quot;&gt;Develop microservices and APIs based on &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1318&quot; data-end=&quot;1359&quot;&gt;Kafka-based event-driven architecture&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1361&quot; data-end=&quot;1445&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1363&quot; data-end=&quot;1445&quot;&gt;Ensure data reliability, availability, and performance across distributed systems.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1446&quot; data-end=&quot;1545&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1448&quot; data-end=&quot;1545&quot;&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional teams to define technical requirements and system architecture.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1546&quot; data-end=&quot;1673&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1548&quot; data-end=&quot;1673&quot;&gt;Leverage &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1557&quot; data-end=&quot;1575&quot;&gt;Azure services&lt;/strong&gt; like &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1581&quot; data-end=&quot;1598&quot;&gt;Function Apps&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1600&quot; data-end=&quot;1614&quot;&gt;Event Hubs&lt;/strong&gt;, and others for supporting application and data workflows.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1674&quot; data-end=&quot;1771&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1676&quot; data-end=&quot;1771&quot;&gt;Troubleshoot production issues, perform root cause analysis, and implement effective solutions.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1778&quot; data-end=&quot;1815&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1782&quot; data-end=&quot;1815&quot;&gt;Required Skills &amp;amp; Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1817&quot; data-end=&quot;2569&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1817&quot; data-end=&quot;1933&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1819&quot; data-end=&quot;1933&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1819&quot; data-end=&quot;1854&quot;&gt;3+ years of hands-on experience&lt;/strong&gt; with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1860&quot; data-end=&quot;1876&quot;&gt;Apache Kafka&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;ndash; including setup, configuration, and stream processing.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1934&quot; data-end=&quot;2047&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1936&quot; data-end=&quot;2047&quot;&gt;Proven expertise in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1956&quot; data-end=&quot;1975&quot;&gt;Azure Cosmos DB&lt;/strong&gt; (NoSQL/SQL API) &amp;ndash; data modeling, query tuning, and operational support.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2048&quot; data-end=&quot;2136&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2050&quot; data-end=&quot;2136&quot;&gt;Solid experience with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2072&quot; data-end=&quot;2089&quot;&gt;Kafka Connect&lt;/strong&gt;, Schema Registry, and Avro/JSON serialization.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2137&quot; data-end=&quot;2225&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2139&quot; data-end=&quot;2225&quot;&gt;Strong proficiency in designing &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2171&quot; data-end=&quot;2205&quot;&gt;real-time, distributed systems&lt;/strong&gt; and data pipelines.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2226&quot; data-end=&quot;2322&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2228&quot; data-end=&quot;2322&quot;&gt;Proficient in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2242&quot; data-end=&quot;2261&quot;&gt;Azure ecosystem&lt;/strong&gt;, especially Function Apps, Event Hubs, and monitoring tools.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2323&quot; data-end=&quot;2430&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2325&quot; data-end=&quot;2430&quot;&gt;Experience in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2339&quot; data-end=&quot;2368&quot;&gt;microservices development&lt;/strong&gt; using any modern backend language (Java, .NET, Python, etc.).&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2431&quot; data-end=&quot;2505&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2433&quot; data-end=&quot;2505&quot;&gt;Familiarity with CI/CD tools and DevOps practices in cloud environments.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2506&quot; data-end=&quot;2569&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2508&quot; data-end=&quot;2569&quot;&gt;Strong problem-solving, communication, and leadership skills.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;hr class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2571&quot; data-end=&quot;2574&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2576&quot; data-end=&quot;2609&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2580&quot; data-end=&quot;2609&quot;&gt;Preferred Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2611&quot; data-end=&quot;2806&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2611&quot; data-end=&quot;2687&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2613&quot; data-end=&quot;2687&quot;&gt;Azure certification (e.g., Azure Developer Associate, Azure Data Engineer)&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2688&quot; data-end=&quot;2730&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2690&quot; data-end=&quot;2730&quot;&gt;Experience working in Agile/Scrum teams.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2731&quot; data-end=&quot;2806&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2733&quot; data-end=&quot;2806&quot;&gt;Familiarity with security and compliance best practices for data systems.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',500000.00,2500000.00,'₹',0,'India','Chennai',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2025-07-13 18:30:00',0,0,'2025-05-15 12:37:26.000000','2025-05-16 14:25:41.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Cosmos DB\", \"Kafka\"]','[\"&lt;h3 class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;75&quot; data-end=&quot;96&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;79&quot; data-end=&quot;96&quot;&gt;Job Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\\r\\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;98&quot; data-end=&quot;479&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;98&quot; data-end=&quot;154&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;100&quot; data-end=&quot;154&quot;&gt;Competitive salary with performance-based incentives&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;155&quot; data-end=&quot;202&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;157&quot; data-end=&quot;202&quot;&gt;Flexible work hours and hybrid work options&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;203&quot; data-end=&quot;251&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;205&quot; data-end=&quot;251&quot;&gt;Health insurance for employee and dependents&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;252&quot; data-end=&quot;290&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;254&quot; data-end=&quot;290&quot;&gt;Provident Fund &amp;amp; Gratuity benefits&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;291&quot; data-end=&quot;345&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;293&quot; data-end=&quot;345&quot;&gt;Paid time off (annual leave, sick leave, holidays)&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;346&quot; data-end=&quot;381&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;348&quot; data-end=&quot;381&quot;&gt;Learning &amp;amp; development programs&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;382&quot; data-end=&quot;429&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;384&quot; data-end=&quot;429&quot;&gt;Onsite/offshore collaboration opportunities&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;430&quot; data-end=&quot;479&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;432&quot; data-end=&quot;479&quot;&gt;Supportive and collaborative work environment&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Tamil Nadu'),('2d4d4cb6-f692-47ec-a1e7-18b794b42634','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Watson LIMS Support Analyst','watson-lims-support-analyst-371-371','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;65&quot; data-end=&quot;221&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;91&quot; data-end=&quot;123&quot;&gt;Watson LIMS Support Analysts&lt;/strong&gt; for a leading global MNC to join an enterprise-level &lt;strong data-start=&quot;177&quot; data-end=&quot;215&quot;&gt;Application and Production Support&lt;/strong&gt; team.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;223&quot; data-end=&quot;460&quot;&gt;The ideal candidate should have strong hands-on experience with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;287&quot; data-end=&quot;306&quot;&gt;IBM Watson LIMS&lt;/strong&gt;, L2/L3 application support, SQL, relational databases, incident and problem management, LIMS configuration, integrations, and production troubleshooting.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;462&quot; data-end=&quot;728&quot;&gt;The role involves supporting critical Watson LIMS applications, resolving production issues within defined SLAs, performing &lt;strong data-start=&quot;586&quot; data-end=&quot;615&quot;&gt;Root Cause Analysis (RCA)&lt;/strong&gt;, maintaining LIMS workflows and configurations, and supporting upgrades, patches, deployments, and integrations.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;730&quot; data-end=&quot;912&quot;&gt;Candidates should be comfortable working across &lt;strong data-start=&quot;778&quot; data-end=&quot;810&quot;&gt;Linux / Windows environments&lt;/strong&gt;, application integrations, middleware, scripting, and ITSM tools such as ServiceNow, JIRA, or Remedy.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Pune',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-25 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-08-27 02:47:01.000000','2026-08-27 02:47:01.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Oracle\", \"Root Cause Analysis (RCA)\", \"SLA Management\", \"SQL\", \"SQL Server\", \"Workflow\", \"Production Support\", \"IBM Watson LIMS\", \"Watson LIMS Support\", \"L2 / L3 Application Support\", \"LIMS Customization\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;927&quot; data-end=&quot;974&quot; data-section-id=&quot;rdheb3&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a leading global MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;975&quot; data-end=&quot;1034&quot; data-section-id=&quot;376ew0&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-level &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1006&quot; data-end=&quot;1034&quot;&gt;LIMS application support&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1035&quot; data-end=&quot;1090&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1q4mndw&quot;&gt;Work on critical laboratory and business applications&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1091&quot; data-end=&quot;1156&quot; data-section-id=&quot;mzw40z&quot;&gt;Experience with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1109&quot; data-end=&quot;1156&quot;&gt;L2/L3 production support and ITSM processes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1157&quot; data-end=&quot;1232&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1j48v27&quot;&gt;Exposure to LIMS configuration, customization, integrations, and upgrades&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1233&quot; data-end=&quot;1309&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1w74zoo&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with SQL, APIs, middleware, and scripting technologies&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1310&quot; data-end=&quot;1350&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1grs5e1&quot;&gt;Exposure to Cloud and DevOps practices&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1351&quot; data-end=&quot;1420&quot; data-section-id=&quot;7gmtua&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global IT and business stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1421&quot; data-end=&quot;1497&quot; data-section-id=&quot;18mjbbb&quot;&gt;Career growth in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1440&quot; data-end=&quot;1497&quot;&gt;LIMS, Laboratory Informatics, and Application Support&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1498&quot; data-end=&quot;1556&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1wuw381&quot;&gt;Experience with enterprise-scale production environments&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Maharashtra'),('2d64ec2c-cf6f-4c00-bdcd-5a533f6243d2','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Oracle SQL Developer','oracle-sql-developer-12-12','Job Description: We are seeking a highly skilled and experienced Oracle SQL Developer with 7+ years of hands-on experience to join our team. The ideal candidate will be responsible for designing, developing, and optimizing Oracle database solutions. You will collaborate with cross-functional teams to develop and maintain complex SQL queries, PL/SQL scripts, and stored procedures, ensuring high performance, data accuracy, and reliability. Key Responsibilities: Design, develop, and optimize Oracle SQL queries, stored procedures, functions, and triggers. Create and maintain PL/SQL scripts for data extraction, transformation, and loading (ETL). Perform database performance tuning and query optimization. Develop and implement complex data models and database structures. Collaborate with application developers to integrate SQL queries with front-end applications. Troubleshoot and resolve database-related issues and bugs. Ensure data integrity, security, and consistency through proper validation and indexing. Design and maintain data migration scripts and routines. Collaborate with data analysts and business stakeholders to understand reporting requirements. Document SQL scripts, data flows, and database architecture. Ensure compliance with best practices and security standards. Required Skills: 7+ years of experience as an Oracle SQL Developer. Strong proficiency in Oracle SQL and PL/SQL programming. Hands-on experience with Oracle Database (11g, 12c, 19c). Expertise in writing complex queries, joins, and subqueries. Experience with performance tuning (SQL profiling, indexing, and query optimization). Proficiency in data modeling and schema design. Hands-on experience with ETL processes and data migration. Strong knowledge of Oracle stored procedures, triggers, and functions. Familiarity with database security practices and data encryption. Experience with version control systems (Git, SVN). Excellent problem-solving and analytical skills.','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',300000.00,600000.00,'₹',1,'India','Mumbai',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-31 06:00:00',0,0,'2025-05-04 18:59:18.000000','2026-05-12 14:51:12.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Microsoft SQL Server\", \"MS SQL Server\", \"MYSQL\", \"Oracle\", \"PL/SQL\"]','[\"Perks &amp;amp; Benefits: Competitive salary package Career growth opportunities Comprehensive health insurance Hybrid work model Performance-based incentives Learning and development programs\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Maharashtra'),('2dcc1f35-6656-43d7-8099-34581a3d54d7','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','LIMS Techno Functional Lead','lims-techno-functional-lead-229-229','&amp;middot; Experience in RDNET and LIMS Application&lt;br /&gt;&amp;middot; Responsible for improving and maintaining LIMS Processes and products for clients by understanding the business process and requirements of a client.&lt;br /&gt;&amp;middot; Experience in Design &amp;amp; maintain Databases, Backup and data recovery, SQL and .net code review.&lt;br /&gt;&amp;middot; Maintained SQL scripts indexes and complex queries for analysis and extraction.&lt;br /&gt;&amp;middot; Provide day-to-day System Support to Business for issues/queries/requirements within agreed SLAs.&lt;br /&gt;&amp;middot; Handson in ASP.net, MVC, SQL language skills &amp;middot; Knowledge of CoRE Reporting Tool, SSRS, SSIS, Crystal Reports.&lt;br /&gt;&amp;middot; Experience in integrations with RDNET and LIMS application &lt;br /&gt;&amp;middot; Knowledge of the Equipment interfaces with LIMS system &lt;br /&gt;&amp;middot; Ability to communicate clearly and accurately both orally and in writing.&lt;br /&gt;&amp;middot; Excellent interpersonal skills. &amp;middot; Good Verbal communication &amp;amp; Technical documentation skills &amp;middot; Language: English','Information Technology','Contract','Entry',NULL,NULL,'INR',1,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-05-30 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-03-31 21:22:47.000000','2026-03-31 21:22:47.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Lims\", \"MYSQL\", \"SSRS\", \"SSRS Report Building\", \"LabWare LIMS\", \"LabVantage LIMS\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;Competitive salary package with performance-based incentives&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;65&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;67&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;Health insurance coverage and statutory benefits (PF &amp;amp; Gratuity)&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;134&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;136&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on large-scale enterprise energy management projects&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt