f-af82-51064aa5ef6b','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','MES Technical Architect','mes-technical-architect-318-318','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;65&quot; data-end=&quot;453&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced MES Technical Architects for a leading Top MNC to drive enterprise-scale Digital Manufacturing, Industrial IoT (IIoT), and Industry 4.0 transformation initiatives within pharmaceutical manufacturing environments. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in MES architecture, industrial automation, OT/IT integration, and enterprise manufacturing systems.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;455&quot; data-end=&quot;900&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for designing, architecting, and implementing end-to-end Manufacturing Execution System (MES) and Industrial IoT solutions for global pharmaceutical manufacturing facilities. The role includes developing scalable OT/IT architectures, designing industrial data models, integrating shop-floor automation systems with enterprise applications, and delivering secure, reliable, and compliant manufacturing solutions.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;902&quot; data-end=&quot;1273&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with MES, PLC, SCADA, DCS, Industrial IoT platforms, ISA-95 standards, Unified Namespace (UNS), OPC UA, MQTT, REST APIs, and industrial data architecture. Strong knowledge of pharmaceutical manufacturing processes, GxP compliance, industrial communication protocols, edge computing, and cloud integration is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1275&quot; data-end=&quot;1682&quot;&gt;The role also involves preparing technical solution proposals, architecture diagrams, implementation roadmaps, and collaborating with business stakeholders, manufacturing teams, automation engineers, and enterprise architects. Candidates will lead technical discussions, ensure regulatory compliance, optimize system performance, and drive digital transformation initiatives across manufacturing operations.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Pune',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-08-30 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-07-02 02:34:55.000000','2026-07-02 02:34:55.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Edge Computing\", \"Gxp Compliance\", \"Manufacturing Execution Systems\", \"Mes Architect\", \"PLC\", \"REST API\", \"SCADA\", \"DCS\", \"OPC UA\", \"MQTT\", \"ISA-95\", \"Pharmaceutical Manufacturing Processes\", \"Industrial IoT (IIoT)\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1698&quot; data-end=&quot;1736&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;14j18tz&quot; data-start=&quot;1737&quot; data-end=&quot;1814&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale MES and Industry 4.0 transformation projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;2xy2y8&quot; data-start=&quot;1815&quot; data-end=&quot;1904&quot;&gt;Work on advanced Industrial IoT, Smart Manufacturing, and Digital Factory initiatives&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;3knqwv&quot; data-start=&quot;1905&quot; data-end=&quot;1992&quot;&gt;Leadership role in enterprise architecture and manufacturing modernization programs&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;13qji02&quot; data-start=&quot;1993&quot; data-end=&quot;2070&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global manufacturing and technology teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot; data-start=&quot;2071&quot; data-end=&quot;2126&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;2127&quot; data-end=&quot;2170&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Maharashtra'),('2f2e0ab5-6ac1-4545-b880-2af93eee3758','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Application Migration SME_QMS','application-migration-sme-qms-245-245','&amp;bull; Experience working in life sciences or pharmaceutical environments.&lt;br /&gt;&amp;bull; Exposure to regulated laboratory systems and instrument integrations&lt;br /&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;bull; Knowledge of document management, quality management, and laboratory information systems.&lt;br /&gt;&amp;bull; Hands-on experience with large-scale enterprise domain consolidation projects. &amp;bull; Understanding of identity and access management practices in enterprise environments. &lt;br /&gt;&amp;bull; Familiarity with system integration architectures and enterprise application data flows.','Information Technology','Contract','Entry',NULL,NULL,'INR',1,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-06-15 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-04-16 20:50:05.000000','2026-04-16 20:50:05.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"ERP\", \"Functional Risk Assessments\", \"Gxp Compliance\", \"Life Sciences\", \"QMS System\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1b8ludi&quot; data-start=&quot;57&quot; data-end=&quot;112&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and performance-based incentives&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;wa1cqy&quot; data-start=&quot;113&quot; data-end=&quot;152&quot;&gt;Health insurance (medical coverage)&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1elu4nz&quot; data-start=&quot;153&quot; data-end=&quot;191&quot;&gt;Paid leaves (casual, sick, earned)&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1sa4caw&quot; data-start=&quot;192&quot; data-end=&quot;243&quot;&gt;Flexible working hours / Work-from-home options&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;17iplkr&quot; data-start=&quot;244&quot; data-end=&quot;288&quot;&gt;Career growth and learning opportunities&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1uu5yk4&quot; data-start=&quot;289&quot; data-end=&quot;327&quot;&gt;Training and certification support&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('2f4fa757-46cc-4a75-93f9-97cdbce89dee','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','iOS Developer – Fresher','ios-developer-fresher-357-357','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;65&quot; data-end=&quot;381&quot;&gt;We are hiring enthusiastic &lt;strong data-start=&quot;92&quot; data-end=&quot;118&quot;&gt;iOS Developer Freshers&lt;/strong&gt; for a leading Top MNC to work on real-world mobile application development projects. This is an excellent opportunity for fresh graduates and early-career professionals who are passionate about iOS development, Swift, Objective-C, and modern mobile technologies.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;383&quot; data-end=&quot;788&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for developing, testing, releasing, and maintaining iOS applications while working throughout the complete Software Development Life Cycle (SDLC). The role includes building iOS applications and Proof-of-Concepts (POCs), implementing new features, debugging application issues, improving performance, and collaborating with backend and cross-functional development teams.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;790&quot; data-end=&quot;1179&quot;&gt;Candidates should have a strong understanding of &lt;strong data-start=&quot;839&quot; data-end=&quot;934&quot;&gt;Swift, Objective-C, iOS SDK, Cocoa Touch, Xcode, Git, and the macOS development environment&lt;/strong&gt;. Basic knowledge of networking concepts, VPN, WebSockets, and Mobile Device Management (MDM) is preferred. Candidates should demonstrate strong problem-solving, communication, learning ability, and enthusiasm for mobile application development.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1181&quot; data-end=&quot;1552&quot;&gt;The role also provides an opportunity to work with experienced developers and global teams, learn modern iOS development practices, participate in technical discussions, and contribute to enterprise-grade mobile applications. Freshers with strong academic projects, internships, personal iOS applications, or hands-on Swift development experience are encouraged to apply.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Entry',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-10 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-08-12 03:04:14.000000','2026-08-12 03:04:14.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"API Integration\", \"Git\", \"IOS\", \"Ios App Development\", \"Objective C\", \"Swift\", \"VPN\", \"Xcode\", \"Cocoa Touch\", \"WebSocket\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;hbysa9&quot; data-start=&quot;1568&quot; data-end=&quot;1619&quot;&gt;Opportunity to start your career with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1aif870&quot; data-start=&quot;1620&quot; data-end=&quot;1685&quot;&gt;Exposure to real-world enterprise iOS application development&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;x2n75d&quot; data-start=&quot;1686&quot; data-end=&quot;1762&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience with Swift, Objective-C, Xcode, and iOS technologies&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;10qp6bc&quot; data-start=&quot;1763&quot; data-end=&quot;1836&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with experienced mobile development professionals&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1fsexqq&quot; data-start=&quot;1837&quot; data-end=&quot;1892&quot;&gt;Exposure to global teams and international projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1e8koxm&quot; data-start=&quot;1893&quot; data-end=&quot;1953&quot;&gt;Opportunity to learn modern mobile development practices&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;un4ih7&quot; data-start=&quot;1954&quot; data-end=&quot;2013&quot;&gt;Career growth in iOS and Mobile Application Development&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;vfuj5t&quot; data-start=&quot;2014&quot; data-end=&quot;2065&quot;&gt;Professional and collaborative work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('2fa0fb1b-e682-41bf-a542-b2bb71da7214','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','MES Validation (CSV) Specialist','mes-validation-csv-specialist-306-306','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;152&quot; data-end=&quot;552&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced MES Validation (CSV) Specialists for a leading Top MNC to support enterprise Manufacturing Execution System (MES) validation and compliance initiatives across global manufacturing sites. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in Siemens Opcenter Execution (Camstar), Computer System Validation (CSV), GAMP 5 methodologies, and regulated manufacturing environments.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;554&quot; data-end=&quot;912&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for planning, executing, and managing MES validation activities throughout the system lifecycle. The role includes preparing validation documentation, supporting Electronic Batch Record (EBR) implementations, conducting risk assessments, and ensuring compliance with regulatory requirements such as FDA and EU GMP standards.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;914&quot; data-end=&quot;1236&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with MES workflows, recipes, equipment modeling, master data management, validation testing, and system integration validation. Strong understanding of GAMP 5 Category 4/5 systems, CSV V-Model methodology, audit readiness, and quality compliance processes is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1238&quot; data-end=&quot;1585&quot;&gt;The role also involves collaborating with global quality teams, manufacturing sites, business stakeholders, and technical teams to support multi-site validation programs, validation testing activities, and regulatory inspections. Candidates should possess excellent documentation, communication, stakeholder management, and problem-solving skills.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,