;&gt;DELMIA Quintiq Software Expert (SwE) / Quintiq Specialist (QS)&lt;/strong&gt; to join a leading Top MNC and work on enterprise-level &lt;strong data-start=&quot;256&quot; data-end=&quot;327&quot;&gt;Quintiq planning, scheduling, modeling, integration, and deployment&lt;/strong&gt; projects.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;339&quot; data-end=&quot;580&quot;&gt;The ideal candidate should have a strong background in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;394&quot; data-end=&quot;443&quot;&gt;DELMIA Quintiq development and implementation&lt;/strong&gt;, with hands-on experience in complex modeling, architecture, troubleshooting, performance optimization, and end-to-end project delivery.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;582&quot; data-end=&quot;831&quot;&gt;The candidate will take ownership of Quintiq modeling activities, resolve complex technical and performance challenges, and collaborate closely with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;731&quot; data-end=&quot;830&quot;&gt;business consultants, customers, suppliers, project managers, and global cross-functional teams&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;18w7bso&quot; data-start=&quot;833&quot; data-end=&quot;856&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;858&quot; data-end=&quot;1958&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;693s5e&quot; data-start=&quot;858&quot; data-end=&quot;932&quot;&gt;Own end-to-end &lt;strong data-start=&quot;875&quot; data-end=&quot;906&quot;&gt;Quintiq modeling activities&lt;/strong&gt; and project deliverables.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;sfskk8&quot; data-start=&quot;933&quot; data-end=&quot;1006&quot;&gt;Design, develop, configure, and implement &lt;strong data-start=&quot;977&quot; data-end=&quot;1005&quot;&gt;DELMIA Quintiq solutions&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;g4biow&quot; data-start=&quot;1007&quot; data-end=&quot;1077&quot;&gt;Work on complex Quintiq models and planning/scheduling requirements.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ozftpy&quot; data-start=&quot;1078&quot; data-end=&quot;1144&quot;&gt;Perform Quintiq integration, deployment, and release activities.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1t75q1d&quot; data-start=&quot;1145&quot; data-end=&quot;1219&quot;&gt;Analyze and resolve complex modeling and application performance issues.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1e1mqrc&quot; data-start=&quot;1220&quot; data-end=&quot;1309&quot;&gt;Use &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1226&quot; data-end=&quot;1284&quot;&gt;Quintiq Profiler and performance troubleshooting tools&lt;/strong&gt; to identify bottlenecks.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;qi027f&quot; data-start=&quot;1310&quot; data-end=&quot;1382&quot;&gt;Optimize Quintiq models for performance, scalability, and reliability.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-27 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-08-29 00:32:33.000000','2026-08-29 00:32:33.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Agile Methodology\", \"Quintiq\", \"DELMIA Quintiq\", \"Quintiq Macro Planner\", \"Quintiq Company Planner\", \"Quintiq Demand Planner\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1nc4xd1&quot; data-start=&quot;1973&quot; data-end=&quot;2051&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2002&quot; data-end=&quot;2013&quot;&gt;Top MNC&lt;/strong&gt; on enterprise-scale Quintiq projects.&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1xmha9r&quot; data-start=&quot;2052&quot; data-end=&quot;2142&quot;&gt;Exposure to complex &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2074&quot; data-end=&quot;2141&quot;&gt;planning, scheduling, optimization, and manufacturing solutions&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;84px3f&quot; data-start=&quot;2143&quot; data-end=&quot;2197&quot;&gt;Work with global customers and cross-cultural teams.&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1yr2wa2&quot; data-start=&quot;2198&quot; data-end=&quot;2279&quot;&gt;Opportunity to solve challenging &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2233&quot; data-end=&quot;2278&quot;&gt;Quintiq modeling and performance problems&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1p7x0va&quot; data-start=&quot;2280&quot; data-end=&quot;2353&quot;&gt;Exposure to advanced Quintiq architecture, integration, and deployment.&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;ura13i&quot; data-start=&quot;2354&quot; data-end=&quot;2449&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with business consultants, technical experts, and project leaders.&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('30b3ed22-fc63-4cb2-a9d6-b773fa741c4b','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Senior Empower Support','senior-empower-support-389-389','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;112&quot; data-end=&quot;509&quot;&gt;We are looking for an experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;146&quot; data-end=&quot;185&quot;&gt;Senior Empower Support Professional&lt;/strong&gt; with 5+ years of hands-on experience supporting &lt;strong data-start=&quot;234&quot; data-end=&quot;276&quot;&gt;Empower CDS / Empower Customer Support&lt;/strong&gt; environments. The role is ideal for professionals with strong exposure to &lt;strong data-start=&quot;351&quot; data-end=&quot;428&quot;&gt;Pharma, Healthcare, Life Sciences, and analytical laboratory environments&lt;/strong&gt;, supporting business-critical laboratory applications in regulated environments.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;511&quot; data-end=&quot;915&quot;&gt;The ideal candidate should have strong experience in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;564&quot; data-end=&quot;717&quot;&gt;Empower Enterprise architecture, system administration, configuration, upgrades, migrations, user management, DAC, and legacy version decommissioning&lt;/strong&gt;. The candidate will be responsible for maintaining application stability, supporting technical infrastructure, and ensuring effective operation of Empower environments across laboratory operations.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-11-10 07:00:00',0,0,'2026-09-12 02:35:16.000000','2026-09-12 02:35:16.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"CDS Views\", \"Change Management\", \"CSV\", \"Gxp Compliance\", \"ITIL\", \"Pharmacy\", \"DAC Management\", \"Waters Empower\", \"Chromatography Data Systems (CDS)\", \"Waters Empower CDS\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;iofbfz&quot; data-start=&quot;1613&quot; data-end=&quot;1661&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a leading &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1650&quot; data-end=&quot;1661&quot;&gt;Top MNC&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;156ye9x&quot; data-start=&quot;1662&quot; data-end=&quot;1721&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1693&quot; data-end=&quot;1721&quot;&gt;Empower CDS environments&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1p1gmyi&quot; data-start=&quot;1722&quot; data-end=&quot;1782&quot;&gt;Work within &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1736&quot; data-end=&quot;1774&quot;&gt;Pharma, Healthcare &amp;amp; Life Sciences&lt;/strong&gt; domains&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1mc9so6&quot; data-start=&quot;1783&quot; data-end=&quot;1858&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience with Empower upgrades, migrations, and administration&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1s6njm&quot; data-start=&quot;1859&quot; data-end=&quot;1926&quot;&gt;Exposure to analytical laboratory and chromatography environments&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;jwmqws&quot; data-start=&quot;1927&quot; data-end=&quot;1985&quot;&gt;Experience working in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1951&quot; data-end=&quot;1985&quot;&gt;GMP/GxP-regulated environments&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('30f067e3-9aeb-4977-b88e-b0d897bbf717','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Quintiq Developer – DELMIA Quintiq','quintiq-developer-delmia-quintiq-355-355','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;76&quot; data-end=&quot;435&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;102&quot; data-end=&quot;124&quot;&gt;Quintiq Developers&lt;/strong&gt; for a leading Top MNC to support enterprise-scale Supply Chain Planning, Production Scheduling, Optimization, and Digital Manufacturing initiatives. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in DELMIA Quintiq, QUILL programming, optimization solutions, enterprise integrations, and software development.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;437&quot; data-end=&quot;833&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for designing, developing, configuring, and supporting DELMIA Quintiq solutions across enterprise planning environments. The role includes developing scheduling and planning applications, building integrations with enterprise systems, implementing optimization and auto-planning solutions, developing automated testing frameworks, and supporting CI/CD pipelines.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;835&quot; data-end=&quot;1250&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;886&quot; data-end=&quot;1133&quot;&gt;DELMIA Quintiq Scheduler, Macro Planner, Company Planner, Demand Planner, QUILL, UML/Object-Oriented Modeling, SOAP, REST APIs, SFTP, Java, C, C++, JavaScript, AngularJS, jQuery, SQL, NoSQL, Oracle, SQL Server, Git, Azure DevOps, JSON, and XML&lt;/strong&gt;. Strong understanding of optimization techniques such as Linear Programming, Heuristics, and AI is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1252&quot; data-end=&quot;1740&quot;&gt;The role also involves collaborating with business stakeholders, supply chain teams, solution architects, developers, and global delivery teams to translate business requirements into scalable planning solutions. Candidates will develop unit, integration, and end-to-end testing solutions, maintain CI/CD pipelines, troubleshoot technical issues, and contribute to continuous improvement. Strong analytical, communication, stakeholder management, and problem-solving skills are essential.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Entry',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-09 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-08-11 03:50:06.000000','2026-08-11 03:50:06.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Angular\", \"C++\", \"Java\", \"JavaScript\", \"JQUERY\", \"OOPS\", \"REST API\", \"SOAP\", \"SQL\", \"Supply Chain Management\", \"UML\", \"Quintiq Scheduler\", \"DELMIA Quintiq\", \"Quintiq Macro Planner\", \"Quintiq Company Planner\", \"Quintiq Demand Planner\", \"QUILL Programming\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1756&quot; data-end=&quot;1794&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1b15olh&quot; data-start=&quot;1795&quot; data-end=&quot;1885&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale Supply Chain Planning and Digital Transformation projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;pu5zs5&quot; data-start=&quot;1886&quot; data-end=&quot;1962&quot;&gt;Work with advanced DELMIA Quintiq planning and optimization technologies&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;piyrsp&quot; data-start=&quot;1963&quot; data-end=&quot;2053&quot;&gt;Career growth in Supply Chain Technology, Manufacturing IT, and Optimization Solutions&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;vq0hl0&quot; data-start=&quot;2054&quot; data-end=&quot;2126&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global business and technology teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1r7qena&quot; data-start=&quot;2127&quot; data-end=&quot;2202&quot;&gt;Exposure to advanced scheduling, planning, and optimization initiatives&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot; data-start=&quot;2203&quot; data-end=&quot;2258&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;2259&quot; data-end=&quot;2302&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('3165e65e-f31e-43b4-9985-ef8aeb529ba5','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Empower Support Specialist','empower-support-specialist-137-137','&lt;p data-start=&quot;254&quot; data-end=&quot;570&quot;&gt;We are looking for an experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;288&quot; data-end=&quot;318&quot;&gt;Empower Support Specialist&lt;/strong&gt; to join a leading global Pharma &amp;amp; Life Sciences organization. The ideal candidate will support and maintain the &lt;strong data-start=&quot;431&quot; data-end=&quot;460&quot;&gt;Empower Enterprise System&lt;/strong&gt;, ensuring smooth upgrades, integrations, and technical operations within a regulated &lt;strong data-start=&quot;546&quot; data-end=&quot;557&quot;&gt;GMP/GxP&lt;/strong&gt; environment.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;572&quot; data-end=&quot;800&quot;&gt;You will work closely with laboratory teams, IT service management, and cross-functional stakeholders to deliver high-quality support, troubleshoot issues, and implement solutions that optimize system performance and compliance.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;h1 data-start=&quot;807&quot; data-end=&quot;836&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;809&quot; data-end=&quot;836&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;837&quot; data-end=&quot;1475&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;837&quot; data-end=&quot;924&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;839&quot; data-end=&quot;924&quot;&gt;Provide end-to-end support for &lt;strong data-start=&quot;870&quot; data-end=&quot;922&quot;&gt;Empower Enterprise system setup and ar