chitecture, Azure cloud technologies, ServiceNow, AI/GenAI platforms, enterprise integration, and security architecture.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;429&quot; data-end=&quot;904&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for designing end-to-end enterprise solution architectures that integrate ServiceNow, Azure AI, observability platforms, knowledge repositories, and enterprise applications. The role includes defining scalable cloud architectures, designing secure API-based integration strategies, establishing architectural standards, ensuring compliance with enterprise governance policies, and delivering high-performance, resilient enterprise solutions.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;906&quot; data-end=&quot;1380&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with Azure Architecture, ServiceNow Architecture, Enterprise Integration, AI/GenAI Architecture, API Design, cloud-native application architecture, security frameworks, and modern integration technologies. Strong understanding of Azure services, microservices architecture, event-driven integration, observability platforms, identity and access management, governance, and enterprise security best practices is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1382&quot; data-end=&quot;1901&quot;&gt;The role also involves collaborating with solution architects, AI engineers, backend developers, cloud engineers, business stakeholders, and global delivery teams to translate business requirements into scalable technical solutions. Candidates will define technology roadmaps, mentor engineering teams, conduct architecture reviews, ensure solution quality, and drive enterprise architecture best practices. Strong leadership, communication, stakeholder management, analytical, and problem-solving skills are essential.&lt;/p&gt;','Infrastructure Management','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-09-20 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-07-23 02:10:41.000000','2026-07-23 02:10:41.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"AI/ML\", \"API Design\", \"API Integration\", \"Azure\", \"Microsoft Azure Platform\", \"REST API\", \"Risk Management\", \"ServiceNow\", \"Technical Support\", \"IAM - Configuration & Management\", \"Solution Design\", \"OpenAI\", \"Enterprise Architecture\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1917&quot; data-end=&quot;1955&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;13a767z&quot; data-start=&quot;1956&quot; data-end=&quot;2035&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale Cloud, AI, and Digital Transformation projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1hbxxyh&quot; data-start=&quot;2036&quot; data-end=&quot;2125&quot;&gt;Work with modern Azure, ServiceNow, AI/GenAI, and Enterprise Integration technologies&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1vwzff4&quot; data-start=&quot;2126&quot; data-end=&quot;2214&quot;&gt;Career growth in Enterprise Architecture, Cloud Architecture, and AI Solution Design&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1pynldn&quot; data-start=&quot;2215&quot; data-end=&quot;2290&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global engineering and technology teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot; data-start=&quot;2291&quot; data-end=&quot;2346&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;2347&quot; data-end=&quot;2390&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('355f93bb-92cf-4a43-ac7d-df0968bfa140','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Application Migration SME_LIMS','application-migration-sme-lims-244-244','&amp;bull; Understanding of application landscapes including Laboratory systems. &lt;br /&gt;&amp;bull; Ability to perform application impact assessments during Active Directory (AD) domain migration. &lt;br /&gt;&amp;bull; Experience working with application owners, technical owners, and SMEs to identify authentication dependencies, integrations, and risks.&lt;br /&gt;&amp;bull; Ability to prepare Application Assessment Reports and document migration impacts. &lt;br /&gt;&amp;bull; Understanding of GxP regulated environments and evaluation of GxP archival feasibility during system migrations. &amp;bull; Ability to manage end-to-end application migration activities, including planning, validation, and post-migration checks. Technical &amp;bull; Strong knowledge of Active Directory environments and domain migration concepts. &lt;br /&gt;&amp;bull; Experience assessing server-level and application-level dependencies during domain migrations&lt;br /&gt;. &amp;bull; Ability to create and maintain:&lt;br /&gt;&amp;bull; Migration Runbooks &lt;br /&gt;&amp;bull; Migration Cookbooks&lt;br /&gt;&amp;bull; Architecture diagrams with data flows&lt;br /&gt;&amp;bull; Application Assessment Report&lt;br /&gt;&amp;bull; Understanding of authentication mechanisms, service accounts, and access dependencies within enterprise applications. &lt;br /&gt;&amp;bull; Experience coordinating with infrastructure, security, and application support teams during migrations.','Information Technology','Contract','Entry',NULL,NULL,'INR',1,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-06-15 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-04-16 20:47:40.000000','2026-04-16 20:47:41.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Lims\", \"LabWare LIMS\", \"LabVantage LIMS\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1b8ludi&quot; data-start=&quot;57&quot; data-end=&quot;112&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and performance-based incentives&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;wa1cqy&quot; data-start=&quot;113&quot; data-end=&quot;152&quot;&gt;Health insurance (medical coverage)&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1elu4nz&quot; data-start=&quot;153&quot; data-end=&quot;191&quot;&gt;Paid leaves (casual, sick, earned)&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1sa4caw&quot; data-start=&quot;192&quot; data-end=&quot;243&quot;&gt;Flexible working hours / Work-from-home options&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;17iplkr&quot; data-start=&quot;244&quot; data-end=&quot;288&quot;&gt;Career growth and learning opportunities&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1uu5yk4&quot; data-start=&quot;289&quot; data-end=&quot;327&quot;&gt;Training and certification support&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('356027ba-c2d3-43fa-b270-863cc1f12a05','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Frontend Developer (Angular + React)','frontend-developer-angular-react-129-129','&lt;p data-start=&quot;207&quot; data-end=&quot;700&quot;&gt;A top multinational company is hiring an experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;260&quot; data-end=&quot;282&quot;&gt;Frontend Developer&lt;/strong&gt; with strong expertise in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;308&quot; data-end=&quot;347&quot;&gt;Angular (13+), ReactJS, and Node.js&lt;/strong&gt;. The ideal candidate will work on large-scale, enterprise-level web applications, collaborating closely with cross-functional teams. You will be responsible for designing responsive UI components, integrating RESTful APIs, optimizing performance, and contributing to CI/CD workflows. Experience in MES or industrial automation domains is a strong plus.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;hr data-start=&quot;702&quot; data-end=&quot;705&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;707&quot; data-end=&quot;736&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;710&quot; data-end=&quot;736&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;737&quot; data-end=&quot;1457&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;737&quot; data-end=&quot;819&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;739&quot; data-end=&quot;819&quot;&gt;Develop web applications using &lt;strong data-start=&quot;770&quot; data-end=&quot;787&quot;&gt;Angular (13+)&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong data-start=&quot;789&quot; data-end=&quot;800&quot;&gt;ReactJS&lt;/strong&gt;, and &lt;strong data-start=&quot;806&quot; data-end=&quot;817&quot;&gt;Node.js&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;820&quot; data-end=&quot;884&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;822&quot; data-end=&quot;884&quot;&gt;Build reusable, scalable, and high-performance UI components&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;885&quot; data-end=&quot;926&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;887&quot; data-end=&quot;926&quot;&gt;Integrate and manage &lt;strong data-start=&quot;908&quot; data-end=&quot;924&quot;&gt;RESTful APIs&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;927&quot; data-end=&quot;1001&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;929&quot; data-end=&quot;1001&quot;&gt;Write clean, maintainable code using &lt;strong data-start=&quot;966&quot; data-end=&quot;999&quot;&gt;TypeScript, ES6+, HTML5, CSS3&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1002&quot; data-end=&quot;1055&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1004&quot; data-end=&quot;1055&quot;&gt;Implement state management using &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1037&quot; data-end=&quot;1053&quot;&gt;NgRx / Redux&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1056&quot; data-end=&quot;1124&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1058&quot; data-end=&quot;1124&quot;&gt;Perform debugging, troubleshooting, and performance optimization&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1125&quot; data-end=&quot;1178&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1127&quot; data-end=&quot;1178&quot;&gt;Write unit tests using &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1150&quot; data-end=&quot;1176&quot;&gt;Jest / Jasmine / Karma&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1179&quot; data-end=&quot;1238&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1181&quot; data-end=&quot;1238&quot;&gt;Work with CI/CD pipelines and version control (&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1228&quot; data-end=&quot;1235&quot;&gt;Git&lt;/strong&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1239&quot; data-end=&quot;1299&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1241&quot; data-end=&quot;1299&quot;&gt;Utilize Docker for containerized application development&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1300&quot; data-end=&quot;1377&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1302&quot; data-end=&quot;1377&quot;&gt;Collaborate with designers, backend teams &amp;amp; product owners in Agile/Scrum&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1378&quot; data-end=&quot;1457&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1380&quot; data-end=&quot;1457&quot;&gt;Work on applications related to &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1412&quot; data-end=&quot;1443&quot;&gt;MES / Industrial Automation&lt;/strong&gt; (preferred)&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Full-time','Mid',NULL,NULL,'INR',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-19 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-11-21 05:37:23.000000','2025-11-21 05:37:23.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"CSS3\", \"Django\", \"Docker\", \"Git\", \"HTML5\", \"Industrial Automation\", \"Mes\", \"Microservices\", \"Node JS\", \"React\", \"Redux\", \"REST API\", \"Typescript\", \"Unit Testing\", \"CI/CD\", \"NgRx\", \"Angular (13+)\", \"ES6+\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2018&quot; data-end=&quot;2067&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2020&quot; data-end=&quot;2067&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2047&quot; data-end=&quot;2065&quot;&gt;Top Global MNC&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2068&quot; data-end=&quot;2120&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2070&quot; data-end=&quot;2120&quot;&gt;Work with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2080&quot; data-end=&quot;2118&quot;&gt;cutting-edge frontend technologies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2121&quot; data-end=&quot;2178&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2123&quot; data-end=&quot;2178&quot;&gt;Contribute to &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2137&quot; data-end=&quot;2176&quot;&gt;large-scale enterprise applications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2179&quot; data-end=&quot;2233&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2181&quot; data-end=&quot;2233&quot;&gt;Exposure to &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2193&quot; data-end=&quot;2231&quot;&gt;MES / Industrial Automation domain&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2234&quot; data-end=&quot;2293&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2236&quot; data-end=&quot;2293&quot;&gt;Excellent career growth and long-term project stability&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2294&quot; data-end=&quot;2346&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2296&quot; data-end=&quot;2346&quot;&gt;Highly collaborative and innovative work culture&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2347&quot; data-end=&quot;2391&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2349&quot; data-end=&quot;2391&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and employee benefits&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2392&quot; data-end=&quot;2439&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2394&quot; data-end=&quot;2439&quot;&gt;Continuous learning with modern tech stacks&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('35de8013-517e-4ca3-ad32-53965e3e4b48','78245df0-b94d-4541-87d3-a40e115b62a2','b9745af6-2f9b-4b9c-92ab-6fb310858bca','IAM developer','iam-developer-54-54','Years of Experience: 3-5 Years direct experience in IAM Design, Implementation, Security Administration &amp;amp; Configuration.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Shift Time: Same IST - 12 to 9 or 11 to 8 - Flexible with US Calls &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Project duration: 3 months (extendable basis)&lt;br /&gt;Location: Remote&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;JD-Key pointers:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Develop, implement, and maintain IAM solutions, including identity provisioning, access control, authentication, and authorization mechanisms.&lt;br /&gt;Design IAM workflows, policies, and procedures to ensure secure and efficient access management using SAAS Identity &amp;amp; Access Management platforms.&lt;br /&gt;Strong understanding of access control, authentication &amp;amp; authorization.&lt;br /&gt;Manage user onboarding, offboarding, and role changes, ensuring adherence to security policies and compliance requirements.&lt;br /&gt;Must have experience in SCIM REST API, Java, JSON, XML,Webservices, Install, customize, configure, and support identity provisioning and governance tools.&lt;br /&gt;Troubleshoot and resolve L2/L3 technical issues related to IAM configurations, connector integrations, customizations and support hypercare for different project rollouts &amp;amp; phases.&lt;br /&gt;Define and enforce access control policies, including role-based access control (RBAC), least privilege principle, and segregation of duties (SoD).&lt;br /&gt;Perform unit testing, integration testing, and validation of the IAM solutions to ensure they meet quality and security standards.&lt;br /&gt;Good to have exposure on Bean Shell,Groovy,Shell scripting &amp;amp; hands on Terraform script but desired.&lt;br /&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional teams, including IT, security, and compliance, to ensure IAM aligns with business goals.','Information Technology','Full-time','Mid',NULL,NULL,'INR',1,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2025-08-08 18:30:00',0,0,'2025-06-10 10:10:15.000000','2025-06-10 10:10:16.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Administration\", \"IAM Roles And Policies\"]','[]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('368db299-2613-45d1-9df2-267e63a12f86','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Graphics Designer','graphics-designer-278-278','&lt;p data-start=&quot;69&quot; data-end=&quot;342&quot;&gt;We are hiring creative and passionate Graphics Designer Freshers for a leading Top MNC based in Bangalore. This is an excellent opportunity for fresh graduates who are interested in building their career in graphic designing, visual content creation, and creative branding.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;344&quot; data-end=&quot;657&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for designing engaging visual content for digital platforms, presentations, social media, and marketing materials. The role includes working with design tools like Canva, Photoshop, Illustrator, and other creative platforms to create professional and visually appealing graphics.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;659&quot; data-end=&quot;925&quot;&gt;Professionals should have a good understanding of design principles, creativity, typography, color combinations, and layout concepts. Basic awareness of AI tools such as ChatGPT, Copilot, Claude, and other AI-assisted content/design tools will be an added advantage.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;927&quot; data-end=&quot;1238&quot;&gt;The role also involves collaborating with internal teams, understanding creative requirements, and delivering high-quality visual content within timelines. Candidates should possess strong communication skills, attention to detail, creativity, and a willingness to learn in a professional corporate environment.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-07-20 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-05-22 02:02:31.000000','2026-05-22 02:02:32.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Adobe Illustrator\", \"Adobe InDesign\", \"Adobe Photoshop\", \"Canva\", \"Graphic Design\", \"Illustrator Adobe\", \"Social Media Promotion\", \"Typography\", \"Copilot\", \"Adobe XD\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1254&quot; data-end=&quot;1292&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1s4fksp&quot; data-start=&quot;1293&quot; data-end=&quot;1360&quot;&gt;Excellent opportunity for freshers to start their design career&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;mw3cs&quot; data-start=&quot;1361&quot; data-end=&quot;1415&quot;&gt;Exposure to professional corporate design projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ft4w2z&quot; data-start=&quot;1416&quot; data-end=&quot;1470&quot;&gt;Work with experienced creative and marketing teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;kdcvhx&quot; data-start=&quot;1471&quot; data-end=&quot;1527&quot;&gt;Career growth in Graphic Designing &amp;amp; Creative domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;pux9gi&quot; data-start=&quot;1528&quot; data-end=&quot;1584&quot;&gt;Learning opportunity with modern AI and design tools&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;vfuj5t&quot; data-start=&quot;1585&quot; data-end=&quot;1636&quot;&gt;Professional and collaborative work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('37bd2cf7-c200-42e3-bedd-953bbe605147','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Project Manager / Program Manager – AMI Program Development & Rollout','project-manager-program-manager-ami-program-development-rollout-373-373','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;249&quot; data-end=&quot;522&quot;&gt;We are looking for an experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;283&quot; data-end=&quot;320&quot;&gt;Project Manager / Program Manager&lt;/strong&gt; to lead a complex &lt;strong data-start=&quot;339&quot; data-end=&quot;389&quot;&gt;AMI Program Development and Multi-Site Rollout&lt;/strong&gt; involving &lt;strong data-start=&quot;400&quot; data-end=&quot;521&quot;&gt;AI/ML, Computer Vision, Edge AI, Digital Manufacturing, Data, Platform, DevOps/MLOps, and Infrastructure technologies&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;524&quot; data-end=&quot;901&quot;&gt;The ideal candidate will be responsible for owning &lt;strong data-start=&quot;575&quot; data-end=&quot;606&quot;&gt;end-to-end program delivery&lt;/strong&gt;, including planning, execution, pilot deployment, multi-site rollout, stabilization, and transition to operations. The role requires strong experience in managing complex technology programs, distributed cross-functional teams, customer stakeholders, vendors, and multiple deployment locations.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;903&quot; data-end=&quot;1135&quot;&gt;The candidate will work closely with teams across &lt;strong data-start=&quot;953&quot; data-end=&quot;1075&quot;&gt;AI/ML, Computer Vision, Data Engineering, Platform, DevOps/MLOps, Edge Computing, Testing, Infrastructure, and Support&lt;/strong&gt; to ensure successful program execution and timely delivery.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;18w7bso&quot; data-start=&quot;1137&quot; data-end=&quot;1160&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1162&quot; data-end=&quot;2321&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;26v3n9&quot; data-start=&quot;1162&quot; data-end=&quot;1272&quot;&gt;Own end-to-end program delivery from &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1201&quot; data-end=&quot;1271&quot;&gt;planning through execution, rollout, stabilization, and transition&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1nzbrdo&quot; data-start=&quot;1273&quot; data-end=&quot;1381&quot;&gt;Lead complex technology programs involving &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1318&quot; data-end=&quot;1380&quot;&gt;AI/ML, Computer Vision, Edge AI, and Digital Manufacturing&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;rooys3&quot; data-start=&quot;1382&quot; data-end=&quot;1513&quot;&gt;Manage distributed cross-functional teams across AI/ML, Data, Platform, DevOps/MLOps, Edge, Testing, Infrastructure, and Support.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;ys2g25&quot; data-start=&quot;1514&quot; data-end=&quot;1611&quot;&gt;Define program scope, &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1538&quot; data-end=&quot;1610&quot;&gt;WBS, milestones, budgets, resources, dependencies, and critical path&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1a1b8o4&quot; data-start=&quot;1612&quot; data-end=&quot;1693&quot;&gt;Drive pilot/reference-site deployments and subsequent multi-site rollout waves.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;gcvajb&quot; data-start=&quot;1694&quot; data-end=&quot;1766&quot;&gt;Establish &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1706&quot; data-end=&quot;1765&quot;&gt;site-readiness, deployment-readiness, and go-live gates&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1rlth9i&quot; data-start=&quot;1767&quot; data-end=&quot;1852&quot;&gt;Manage RAID items, risks, issues, dependencies, changes, vendors, and stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1149arj&quot; data-start=&quot;1853&quot; data-end=&quot;1920&quot;&gt;Lead customer governance meetings and executive reporting forums.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;14ldelu&quot; data-start=&quot;1921&quot; data-end=&quot;1988&quot;&gt;Drive decision-making across technical and business stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;20yr7k&quot; data-start=&quot;1989&quot; data-end=&quot;2082&quot;&gt;Coordinate model/data readiness, validation, release management, and deployment activities.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1r3lq2a&quot; data-start=&quot;2083&quot; data-end=&quot;2161&quot;&gt;Ensure successful transition from implementation to steady-state operations.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1xtpzmb&quot; data-start=&quot;2162&quot; data-end=&quot;2234&quot;&gt;Develop rollout playbooks, governance models, and operating processes.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;q8b8zs&quot; data-start=&quot;2235&quot; data-end=&quot;2321&quot;&gt;Monitor program KPIs, delivery timelines, quality, budget, and resource utilization.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Entry',NU