and performance-based incentives&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;wa1cqy&quot; data-start=&quot;113&quot; data-end=&quot;152&quot;&gt;Health insurance (medical coverage)&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1elu4nz&quot; data-start=&quot;153&quot; data-end=&quot;191&quot;&gt;Paid leaves (casual, sick, earned)&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1sa4caw&quot; data-start=&quot;192&quot; data-end=&quot;243&quot;&gt;Flexible working hours / Work-from-home options&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;17iplkr&quot; data-start=&quot;244&quot; data-end=&quot;288&quot;&gt;Career growth and learning opportunities&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1uu5yk4&quot; data-start=&quot;289&quot; data-end=&quot;327&quot;&gt;Training and certification support&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('381fb878-a4a8-414b-8783-a6fec014411d','5c88e4d2-4e38-4e15-817b-a19fe3090e8c','537b19b2-0785-46b6-9899-ed1f166a0469','Senior Full Stack Engineer (Next.js & NestJS)','senior-full-stack-engineer-nextjs-nestjs','Lead design and development of enterprise multi-tenant web applications using Next.js App Router and NestJS microservices.','Engineering','Full-time','Senior',140000.00,180000.00,'USD',1,'United States','San Francisco, CA',1,1,'[{\"id\": \"q1\", \"options\": [\"1-2 Years\", \"3-5 Years\", \"5+ Years\"], \"isRequired\": true, \"questionText\": \"How many years of commercial experience do you have with Next.js & NestJS?\", \"questionType\": \"CHOICE\"}, {\"id\": \"q2\", \"isRequired\": true, \"questionText\": \"Are you legally authorized to work in the US or work remotely?\", \"questionType\": \"YES_NO\"}]','PUBLISHED','2026-12-06 05:55:39',0,0,'2026-10-07 05:55:39.407215','2026-10-16 05:31:40.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Next.js\", \"NestJS\", \"TypeScript\", \"Node.js\", \"Tailwind CSS\"]',NULL,'ANY',0,5,NULL),('38530d37-900f-449f-9287-152b8fc28c24','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','SAP DM / SAP BTP Developer','sap-dm-sap-btp-developer-314-314','&lt;p data-start=&quot;68&quot; data-end=&quot;410&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced SAP DM / SAP BTP Developers for a leading Top MNC to work on an 18-month enterprise Manufacturing Digital Transformation project. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in SAP Digital Manufacturing (SAP DM/DMC), SAP Business Technology Platform (SAP BTP), SAP UI5, and cloud-native application development.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;412&quot; data-end=&quot;816&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for designing, developing, deploying, and maintaining SAP Digital Manufacturing solutions and SAP BTP applications based on manufacturing and business requirements. The role includes developing custom SAP DM plugins, CAP services, SAP UI5 applications, and cloud-native solutions while ensuring scalability, reliability, and seamless integration with enterprise systems.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;818&quot; data-end=&quot;1171&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with SAP DM, SAP BTP, SAP UI5, JavaScript, Node.js, CAP Framework, SAP Business Application Studio (BAS), SQL, PL/SQL, and manufacturing data configuration. Strong understanding of SAP cloud technologies, application architecture, API integrations, and manufacturing execution processes is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1173&quot; data-end=&quot;1590&quot;&gt;The role also involves collaborating with business users, technical teams, and global stakeholders, participating in solution design workshops, mentoring junior developers, and supporting deployment, enhancements, and production activities. Candidates should possess excellent analytical, communication, troubleshooting, and problem-solving skills with a passion for delivering innovative SAP manufacturing solutions.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Pune',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-08-28 06