nce, scalability, and reliability of applications&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1306&quot; data-end=&quot;1358&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1308&quot; data-end=&quot;1358&quot;&gt;Continuously research and adopt new technologies&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-03-23 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-01-22 22:14:04.000000','2026-01-22 22:14:05.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"DevOps\", \"Kafka\", \"Kubernetes\", \"NoSQL\", \"Python\", \"RDBMS\", \"Spark\", \"SQL\", \"Pyspark\", \"CI/CD\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2248&quot; data-end=&quot;2319&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2250&quot; data-end=&quot;2319&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2273&quot; data-end=&quot;2317&quot;&gt;large-scale data and streaming platforms&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2320&quot; data-end=&quot;2399&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2322&quot; data-end=&quot;2399&quot;&gt;Exposure to &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2334&quot; data-end=&quot;2363&quot;&gt;cutting-edge technologies&lt;/strong&gt; like Kafka, Spark, and Kubernetes&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2400&quot; data-end=&quot;2456&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2402&quot; data-end=&quot;2456&quot;&gt;High-impact role with direct stakeholder interaction&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2457&quot; data-end=&quot;2520&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2459&quot; data-end=&quot;2520&quot;&gt;Collaborative environment with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2490&quot; data-end=&quot;2518&quot;&gt;global engineering teams&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2521&quot; data-end=&quot;2583&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2523&quot; data-end=&quot;2583&quot;&gt;Strong career growth and continuous learning opportunities&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('3a76f1e5-c1dc-4c49-a362-e9679d3f6bea','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','LabWare LIMS Consultant','labware-lims-consultant-41-41','We are seeking an experienced LabWare LIMS Consultant to join our dynamic team. The ideal candidate will have hands-on experience in LabWare LIMS configuration, development, and implementation. You will be responsible for system customization, report development, and ensuring compliance with quality and regulatory standards.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;br /&gt;&amp;nbsp;Configure and customize LabWare LIMS as per client requirements&lt;br /&gt;&amp;nbsp;Develop and implement workflows, templates, and system functionalities&lt;br /&gt;&amp;nbsp;Design and generate LIMS reports and dashboards&lt;br /&gt;&amp;nbsp;Collaborate with business analysts and lab users to gather system requirements&lt;br /&gt;&amp;nbsp;Integrate LIMS with other lab instruments and enterprise systems&lt;br /&gt;&amp;nbsp;Perform unit testing, system validation, and troubleshooting&lt;br /&gt;&amp;nbsp;Create and maintain system documentation and SOPs&lt;br /&gt;&amp;nbsp;Provide support during system go-live and post-implementation&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Requirements:&lt;br /&gt;&amp;nbsp;5+ years of experience in LabWare LIMS&lt;br /&gt;&amp;nbsp;LabWare Certified Consultant preferred&lt;br /&gt;&amp;nbsp;Strong knowledge of LabWare configuration and scripting&lt;br /&gt;&amp;nbsp;Experience with report development and LIMS validation&lt;br /&gt;&amp;nbsp;Good understanding of regulatory requirements (GMP, GLP)&lt;br /&gt;&amp;nbsp;Excellent problem-solving and communication skills','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',700000.00,1200000.00,'₹',0,'India','Pune',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-19 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-05-31 11:02:12.000000','2025-11-21 06:28:15.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Lims\", \"LabWare LIMS\"]','[\"Competitive salary based on experience&lt;br /&gt;&amp;nbsp;Comprehensive health insurance coverage&lt;br /&gt;&amp;nbsp;Hybrid/Remote work flexibility (if applicable)&lt;br /&gt;&amp;nbsp;Ongoing training and certification support&lt;br /&gt;&amp;nbsp;Career growth opportunities within a global team&lt;br /&gt;&amp;nbsp;Performance-based incentives and bonuses&lt;br /&gt;&amp;nbsp;Supportive and collaborative work environment&lt;br /&gt;&amp;nbsp;Paid time off, holidays, and wellness initiatives\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Maharashtra'),('3b0874d4-b615-4e7b-b2ff-61df475ea801','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Presales Consultant – Pharma Digital Manufacturing','presales-consultant-pharma-digital-manufacturing-336-336','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;92&quot; data-end=&quot;519&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced Presales Consultants &amp;ndash; Pharma Digital Manufacturing for a leading Top MNC to drive enterprise-scale Digital Manufacturing, Smart Factory, and Industry 4.0 transformation initiatives for global pharmaceutical organizations. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in Manufacturing IT, MES/MOM, Connected Plant solutions, presales consulting, solution architecture, and business transformation.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;521&quot; data-end=&quot;955&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for leading end-to-end presales engagements, from opportunity qualification and solution discovery to proposal development and deal closure. The role includes designing Connected Plant and Manufacturing IT solutions, conducting customer workshops, preparing technical and commercial proposals, defining solution architectures, and presenting value-driven digital transformation strategies to clients.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;957&quot; data-end=&quot;1365&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with Pharma Digital Manufacturing, MES/MOM platforms, IT/OT integration, Industry 4.0, IIoT, cloud technologies, AI, analytics, and enterprise manufacturing systems. Strong understanding of production, quality, inventory, material management, supply chain planning, traceability solutions, and pharmaceutical regulatory compliance (CSV, GMP) is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1367&quot; data-end=&quot;1833&quot;&gt;The role also involves collaborating with delivery teams, domain SMEs, solution architects, and business stakeholders to develop scalable and innovative manufacturing solutions. Candidates will prepare RFP/RFI responses, support commercial solutioning, conduct maturity assessments, define technology roadmaps, and drive strategic customer engagements. Strong communication, stakeholder management, consulting, presentation, and problem-solving skills are essential.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-09-11 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-07-14 02:53:28.000000','2026-07-14 02:53:28.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Agile\", \"CSV\", \"Mes\", \"Mes Industry 4.0\", \"Mom Solutions\", \"SDLC\", \"Supply Chain Management\", \"IIoT\", \"Generative AI\", \"Smart Manufacturing\", \"GMP\", \"Solution Design\", \"Industrial IT/OT\", \"Scrum Framework\", \"Pharma Digital Manufacturing\", \"Connected Plant Solutions\", \"Presales Consulting\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1849&quot; data-end=&quot;1887&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;68qjvb&quot; data-start=&quot;1888&quot; data-end=&quot;1983&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale Digital Manufacturing and Industry 4.0 transformation programs&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1fmg89i&quot; data-start=&quot;1984&quot; data-end=&quot;2060&quot;&gt;Work on advanced Connected Plant, MES/MOM, AI, IIoT, and Cloud solutions&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1r8wft4&quot; data-start=&quot;2061&quot; data-end=&quot;2143&quot;&gt;Career growth in Presales, Solution Architecture, and Manufacturing Consulting&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1avb4eg&quot; data-start=&quot;2144&quot; data-end=&quot;2238&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global customers, business leaders, and technology experts&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot; data-start=&quot;2239&quot; data-end=&quot;2294&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;2295&quot; data-end=&quot;2338&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('3b125de4-c9bf-4df8-b111-e2dcf9ef1fd0','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Technical Support and System Engineer','technical-support-and-system-engineer-99-99','We are looking for a fresher to join our team as a Technical Support and System Engineer. The role involves working on Linux-based systems, networking, and virtualization technologies, along with providing technical support, installation, configuration, and troubleshooting of our secure access solution CACHATTO. You will be working closely with clients and cross-functional teams, supporting both pre-sales and post-sales activities, with opportunities to learn and grow in system engineering and customer-facing roles.','Information Technology','Contract','Executive',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-19 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-09-08 06:37:11.000000','2025-11-21 04:42:45.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Active Directory\", \"CentOS\", \"Documentation\", \"Email Support\", \"Linux\", \"Networking\", \"Office 365\", \"PostgreSQL\", \"Presentation Skills\", \"SSH\", \"Strong Communication Skills.\", \"Troubleshooting\", \"UNIX Shells\", \"Virtualization\", \"Web Development\"]','[\"Opportunity to work on Linux, Networking, Virtualization &amp;amp; Cloud technologies&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Exposure to customer-facing role with a leading Japanese product (CACHATTO)&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Learning and career growth in Technical Support &amp;amp; System Engineering&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Work with multicultural teams across India, Japan, and Singapore&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Full-time role with Saturday &amp;amp; Sunday weekly offs&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Travel allowance and on-site exposure across India\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('3b1be6e0-50f2-423e-9d2e-1f18e31b4c1f','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Cority Developer/Analyst','cority-developeranalyst-40-40','&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;88&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;92&quot; data-end=&quot;106&quot;&gt;Job Title:&lt;/strong&gt; Cority Developer/Analyst&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;134&quot; data-end=&quot;160&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;134&quot; data-end=&quot;158&quot;&gt;Experience Required:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;161&quot; data-end=&quot;223&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;161&quot; data-end=&quot;223&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;163&quot; data-end=&quot;223&quot;&gt;Minimum 3+ years of experience as a Cority Developer/Analyst&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;hr data-start=&quot;225&quot; data-end=&quot;228&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;230&quot; data-end=&quot;263&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;234&quot; data-end=&quot;263&quot;&gt;Roles &amp;amp; Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;264&quot; data-end=&quot;536&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;264&quot; data-end=&quot;330&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;266&quot; data-end=&quot;330&quot;&gt;Troubleshooting and resolving technical issues and user requests&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;331&quot; data-end=&quot;401&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;333&quot; data-end=&quo