a','Pune',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-19 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-05-27 10:29:59.000000','2025-11-21 06:28:50.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Analyst\", \"Database\", \"Developer Tools\", \"Escalation Management\", \"Technical Support\", \"Troubleshooting\", \"Verbal and Written Communication\"]','[\"&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;61&quot; data-end=&quot;82&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;65&quot; data-end=&quot;82&quot;&gt;Job Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\\r\\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;83&quot; data-end=&quot;353&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;83&quot; data-end=&quot;113&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;85&quot; data-end=&quot;113&quot;&gt;Competitive salary package&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;114&quot; data-end=&quot;138&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;116&quot; data-end=&quot;138&quot;&gt;Flexible work shifts&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;139&quot; data-end=&quot;196&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;141&quot; data-end=&quot;196&quot;&gt;Opportunities for career growth and skill development&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;197&quot; data-end=&quot;240&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;199&quot; data-end=&quot;240&quot;&gt;Exposure to global clients and projects&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;241&quot; data-end=&quot;295&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;243&quot; data-end=&quot;295&quot;&gt;Supportive team and collaborative work environment&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Maharashtra'),('3b366f55-8d24-4ed3-9e51-e2550ca045e8','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','MES Technical Architect','mes-technical-architect-318-318','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;65&quot; data-end=&quot;453&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced MES Technical Architects for a leading Top MNC to drive enterprise-scale Digital Manufacturing, Industrial IoT (IIoT), and Industry 4.0 transformation initiatives within pharmaceutical manufacturing environments. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in MES architecture, industrial automation, OT/IT integration, and enterprise manufacturing systems.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;455&quot; data-end=&quot;900&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for designing, architecting, and implementing end-to-end Manufacturing Execution System (MES) and Industrial IoT solutions for global pharmaceutical manufacturing facilities. The role includes developing scalable OT/IT architectures, designing industrial data models, integrating shop-floor automation systems with enterprise applications, and delivering secure, reliable, and compliant manufacturing solutions.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;902&quot; data-end=&quot;1273&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with MES, PLC, SCADA, DCS, Industrial IoT platforms, ISA-95 standards, Unified Namespace (UNS), OPC UA, MQTT, REST APIs, and industrial data architecture. Strong knowledge of pharmaceutical manufacturing processes, GxP compliance, industrial communication protocols, edge computing, and cloud integration is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1275&quot; data-end=&quot;1682&quot;&gt;The role also involves preparing technical solution proposals, architecture diagrams, implementation roadmaps, and collaborating with business stakeholders, manufacturing teams, automation engineers, and enterprise architects. Candidates will lead technical discussions, ensure regulatory compliance, optimize system performance, and drive digital transformation initiatives across manufacturing operations.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Pune',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-08-30 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-07-02 02:34:55.000000','2026-07-02 02:34:55.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Edge Computing\", \"Gxp Compliance\", \"Manufacturing Execution Systems\", \"Mes Arc