per to join our dynamic team! If you have a strong background in ServiceNow ITSM, Integrations, and Automation, this is the perfect opportunity for you to elevate your career.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;What You&#039;ll Be Doing:&lt;br /&gt;Lead the development and implementation of ServiceNow solutions across various ITSM modules.&lt;br /&gt;Integrate ServiceNow with external systems using REST and SOAP.&lt;br /&gt;Work with Service Catalogs, Workflows, and Flow Designer to automate business processes.&lt;br /&gt;Optimize system performance with client-side and server-side scripting.&lt;br /&gt;Manage incident, problem, change, and knowledge management processes.&lt;br /&gt;Design reports and dashboards for better service management visibility.&lt;br /&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional teams to deliver high-quality ServiceNow solutions.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;What We&amp;rsquo;re Looking For:&lt;br /&gt;5+ years of hands-on experience with ServiceNow ITSM (CMDB, SecOps, AIOPS, Change Management, Event Management).&lt;br /&gt;Strong expertise in ServiceNow platform fundamentals (instance cloning, upgrades, plugins, etc.).&lt;br /&gt;ServiceNow certifications (CAD/CSA) are a must.&lt;br /&gt;Experience with Rest/SOAP integrations, SLA configuration, and Flow Designer.&lt;br /&gt;Excellent communication skills and the ability to work in a collaborative team environment.&lt;br /&gt;Comfortable working US overlapping hours (12 PM IST to 10 PM IST).&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;br /&gt;Exciting opportunities for career growth and skill development.&lt;br /&gt;Collaborative, inclusive, and dynamic work culture.&lt;br /&gt;Competitive compensation and benefits package.&lt;br /&gt;Ready to take your career to the next level?&lt;br /&gt;Apply now at &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:shashank@camzyinfotech.com&quot;&gt;shashank@camzyinfotech.com&lt;/a&gt; or share this opportunity with your network!','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',500000.00,2500000.00,'₹',0,'India',