=&quot;1853&quot;&gt;ACE/IIB&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1856&quot; data-end=&quot;1928&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1858&quot; data-end=&quot;1928&quot;&gt;Strong communication, flexibility, and ability to work independently&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1929&quot; data-end=&quot;2005&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1931&quot; data-end=&quot;2005&quot;&gt;Understanding of &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1948&quot; data-end=&quot;1961&quot;&gt;DevSecOps&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1963&quot; data-end=&quot;1983&quot;&gt;containerization&lt;/strong&gt; (Docker/Kubernetes)&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',500000.00,2500000.00,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-19 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-07-01 12:21:41.000000','2025-11-21 04:50:02.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Agile\", \"Agile Methodology\", \"Angular\", \"Docker\", \"Kubernetes\", \"SOAP\", \"Guidewire ClaimCenter\", \"Scrum Master\", \"Guidewire\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;162&quot; data-end=&quot;218&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;164&quot; data-end=&quot;218&quot;&gt;Exposure to cloud technologies and modern tech stack&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;219&quot; data-end=&quot;275&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;221&quot; data-end=&quot;275&quot;&gt;Opportunities for continuous learning and upskilling&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;276&quot; data-end=&quot;325&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;278&quot; data-end=&quot;325&quot;&gt;Collaborative and supportive team environment&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;326&quot; data-end=&quot;370&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;328&quot; data-end=&quot;370&quot;&gt;Career growth with leadership mentorship&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;371&quot; data-end=&quot;403&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;373&quot; data-end=&quot;403&quot;&gt;Health and wellness benefits&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;404&quot; data-end=&quot;441&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;406&quot; data-end=&quot;441&quot;&gt;Strong focus on work-life balance&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('3d36f57f-a59d-493b-b452-d44da07d9699','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Digital Manufacturing Architect','digital-manufacturing-architect-356-356','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;73&quot; data-end=&quot;524&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;99&quot; data-end=&quot;135&quot;&gt;Digital Manufacturing Architects&lt;/strong&gt; for a leading Top MNC to drive enterprise-scale Digital Manufacturing, Manufacturing Execution Systems (MES), Manufacturing Operations Management (MOM), Automation, and Industry 4.0 transformation initiatives. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in manufacturing architecture, solution design, industrial data platforms, IIoT, Digital Twin, and enterprise system integration.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;526&quot; data-end=&quot;982&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for defining future-state manufacturing architectures, driving Future Factory and MOM standardization initiatives, and supporting global manufacturing transformation programs. The role includes participating in architecture workshops, defining manufacturing data and automation architectures, developing Digital Twin strategies, establishing IIoT integration landscapes, and evaluating emerging manufacturing technologies.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;984&quot; data-end=&quot;1442&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1035&quot; data-end=&quot;1276&quot;&gt;MES/MOM, Digital Manufacturing, Automation, Solution Architecture, Manufacturing Data Architecture, System Integration, IIoT, Digital Twin, SCADA, PLM, Cloud Technologies, ISA-95, Unified Namespace (UNS), and Manufacturing Data Platforms&lt;/strong&gt;. Strong understanding of WMS/WES, shopfloor systems, industrial connectivity, cloud-based manufacturing platforms, and Industry 4.0 technologies is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1444&quot; data-end=&quot;1896&quot;&gt;The role also involves developing Digital Twin information, technical, and integration architecture playbooks, supporting Proofs of Concept (PoCs), preparing technology recommendations and executive presentations, and collaborating with global manufacturing, engineering, automation, IT, and business stakeholders. Candidates should possess strong architecture, consulting, communication, stakeholder management, analytical, and problem-solving skills.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-10 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-08-12 02:46:13.000000','2026-08-12 02:46:13.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Digital Twin Technology\", \"Industrial Automation\", \"Mes\", \"Mes Industry 4.0\", \"Mom\", \"PLM Software (Product Lifecycle Management)\", \"SCADA\", \"Solution Architect\", \"Smart Manufacturing\", \"Unified Namespace (UNS)\", \"Digital Manufacturing\", \"ISA-95\", \"Industrial IoT (IIoT)\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1912&quot; data-end=&quot;1950&quot; data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1951&quot; data-end=&quot;2038&quot; data-section-id=&quot;14a2ot&quot;&gt;Exposure to global Digital Manufacturing and Future Factory transformation programs&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2039&quot; data-end=&quot;2120&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1fcdgkc&quot;&gt;Work with advanced MES/MOM, IIoT, Digital Twin, and Industry 4.0 technologies&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2121&quot; data-end=&quot;2200&quot; data-section-id=&quot;izghhw&quot;&gt;Career growth in Digital Manufacturing and Enterprise Solution Architecture&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2201&quot; data-end=&quot;2292&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1rvjwsb&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global manufacturing, engineering, and technology teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2293&quot; data-end=&quot;2368&quot; data-section-id=&quot;nsakq9&quot;&gt;Exposure to emerging manufacturing technologies and innovation-led PoCs&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2369&quot; data-end=&quot;2424&quot; data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2425&quot; data-end=&quot;2503&quot; data-section-id=&quot;18hn3xh&quot;&gt;Opportunity to influence enterprise-wide manufacturing technology strategy&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('3d6f861d-dcf4-484a-b05c-746cd73c939c','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Sales Champion – Cloud and IMS (Infrastructure Management Services)','sales-champion-cloud-and-ims-infrastructure-management-services-111-111','Key Responsibilities: &amp;bull; Develop and execute sales strategies for IMS &amp;amp; Cloud solutions. &amp;bull; Drive complete sales cycles: prospecting &amp;rarr; proposal &amp;rarr; closure. &amp;bull; Acquire new clients and farm existing accounts. &amp;bull; Collaborate with pre-sales and technical teams for solution design. &amp;bull; Build strong relationships with CXOs and IT leaders. Requirements: &amp;bull; 3&amp;ndash;8 years of IT/IMS/Cloud solution sales experience. &amp;bull; Proven record of hunting and closing enterprise-level deals. &amp;bull; Knowledge of IT infra (cloud, networking, data center, security, EUC). &amp;bull; Strong communication, negotiation, and client engagement skills. &amp;bull; Cloud certifications (AWS/Azure/GCP) are an added advantage.','Sales','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',1,'India','Central Delhi',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2025-11-27 18:30:00',0,0,'2025-09-29 07:42:47.000000','2025-09-29 07:42:48.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Account Management\", \"AWS\", \"Azure\", \"Cloud Infrastructure Management\", \"Cloud Management\", \"Cloud Sales\", \"CRM\", \"Google Cloud\", \"Solution Selling®\"]','[\"&amp;bull; Opportunity to shape the future of innovative Microsoft Surface products. &amp;bull; Work in a dynamic, global environment with cross-functional collaboration. &amp;bull; Career growth and development in a leading technology space.\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Delhi'),('3dffe234-1d7d-4c6f-8282-0c0717583c74','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Application Migration SME_DMS','application-migration-sme-dms-246-246','&amp;bull; Understanding of enterprise application landscapes including Document Management Systems. &amp;bull; Ability to perform application impact assessments during Active Directory (AD) domain migration.&lt;br /&gt;&amp;bull; Experience working with application owners, technical owners, and SMEs to identify authentication dependencies, integrations, and risks. &lt;br /&gt;&amp;bull; Ability to prepare Application Assessment Reports and document migration impacts. &lt;br /&gt;&amp;bull; Understanding of GxP regulated environments and evaluation of GxP archival feasibility during system migrations.&lt;br /&gt;&amp;bull; Ability to manage end-to-end application migration activities, including planning, validation, and post-migration checks. Technical &lt;br /&gt;&amp;bull; Strong knowledge of Active Directory environments and domain migration concepts. &lt;br /&gt;&amp;bull; Experience assessing server-level and application-level dependencies during domain migrations. &lt;br /&gt;&amp;bull; Ability to create and maintain: &lt;br /&gt;&amp;bull; Migration Runbooks &amp;bull; Migration Cookbooks &amp;bull; Architecture diagrams with data flows &lt;br /&gt;&amp;bull; Applicati