tions on behalf of clients. Conduct market research to identify property trends and pricing. Manage property listings, maintain accurate records, and update CRM databases. Build and maintain strong client relationships. Ensure compliance with all legal and regulatory real estate requirements. Key Skills: Proven experience in real estate sales or a similar role. Strong negotiation and communication skills. Knowledge of local real estate market trends. Ability to manage multiple clients and properties simultaneously. Proficiency in CRM software and MS Office. Excellent presentation and interpersonal skills.','Sales','Contract','Mid',250000.00,300000.00,'₹',1,'India','Pune',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2025-07-03 18:30:00',0,0,'2025-05-05 02:45:41.000000','2025-05-05 02:45:41.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Accessories Knowledge\", \"Adaptability\", \"Air Transportation\", \"Amusement Park\", \"Arcade\", \"Body Cameras\", \"Consumer Applications\", \"Consumer Behavior\", \"Consumer Behavior Analysis\", \"Data Entry Operator\", \"Diagnosis\", \"EHS Compilance\", \"Regulatory\"]','[\"Job Benefits: Competitive Salary + Commission: Attractive compensation with performance-based incentives. Flexible Work Hours: Options for remote work or flexible scheduling. Professional Development: Training programs and certifications to enhance skills. Health Insurance: Comprehensive health and wellness coverage. Travel Allowance: Reimbursement for client visits and site inspections. Career Growth Opportunities: Clear career progression path with promotion prospects. Employee Discounts: Special rates on property purchases and rentals.\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Maharashtra'),('3f72bbd6-3d4d-4b93-ba46-397a6f576c43','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Senior SCADA Engineer','senior-scada-engineer-320-320','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;63&quot; data-end=&quot;443&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced Senior SCADA Engineers for a leading Top MNC to work on next-generation Smart Manufacturing, Industrial Automation, and Digital Factory transformation projects. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in SCADA systems, PLC programming, industrial communication protocols, and automation system integration for complex manufacturing environments.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;445&quot; data-end=&quot;827&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for leading the complete lifecycle of SCADA and PLC projects, including solution design, development, testing, commissioning, deployment, and handover. The role includes designing scalable SCADA architectures, implementing real-time monitoring systems, integrating PLC and SCADA platforms, and supporting Smart Factory and Industry 4.0 initiatives.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;829&quot; data-end=&quot;1253&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with Siemens TIA Portal, Rockwell Automation, Beckhoff TwinCAT, Omron Sysmac, Ignition SCADA, Siemens WinCC, AVEVA SCADA, FactoryTalk View, and Building Management Systems (BMS). Strong knowledge of industrial communication protocols such as OPC UA, MQTT, Modbus, Ethernet/IP, and PROFINET, along with industrial control systems and cybersecurity practices, is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1255&quot; data-end=&quot;1724&quot;&gt;The role also involves coordinating with Process, Facilities, Quality, EHS, and Operations teams, supporting Factory Acceptance Testing (FAT), Site Acceptance Testing (SAT), commissioning activities, troubleshooting automation systems, and ensuring reliable, secure, and high-performance manufacturing operations. Candidates should possess strong leadership, communication, analytical, and problem-solving skills with experience in enterprise-scale automation projects.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Ahmedabad',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-08-30 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-07-02 02:44:38.000000','2026-07-02 02:44:38.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Industrial Automation\", \"PLC\", \"PLC Programming\", \"SCADA\", \"Profinet\", \"Siemens Tia Portal\", \"Modbus\", \"AVEVA MES\", \"OPC UA\", \"MQTT\", \"Rockwell FTPS\", \"Ethernet\", \"Beckhoff\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1740&quot; data-end=&quot;1778&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1styg6k&quot; data-start=&quot;1779&quot; data-end=&quot;1866&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale Smart Manufacturing and Industrial Automation projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;9ujpem&quot; data-start=&quot;1867&quot; data-end=&quot;1936&quot;&gt;Work on cutting-edge SCADA, PLC, and Digital Factory technologies&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;dlbhff&quot; data-start=&quot;1937&quot; data-end=&quot;2008&quot;&gt;Career growth in Industrial Automation &amp;amp; Smart Manufacturing domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1g8u6de&quot; data-start=&quot;2009&quot; data-end=&quot;2084&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global automation and engineering teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot; data-start=&quot;2085&quot; data-end=&quot;2140&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;2141&quot; data-end=&quot;2184&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Gujarat'),('408bd39b-21b3-4686-9d90-7c61ec9fc4bc','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Omniverse Developer','omniverse-developer-267-267','&lt;p data-start=&quot;61&quot; data-end=&quot;397&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced Omniverse Developers for a leading Top MNC to work on next-generation smart manufacturing, robotics simulation, and digital twin solutions. The ideal candidate should have strong hands-on expertise in NVIDIA Omniverse, Isaac SIM, robotics simulation, Python development, and industrial automation technologies.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;399&quot; data-end=&quot;799&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for designing, developing, and implementing advanced simulation environments and digital twin applications for manufacturing and industrial use cases. The role involves working closely with cross-functional teams including developers, AI engineers, automation specialists, and designers to build scalable and innovative solutions using NVIDIA ecosystem technologies.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;801&quot; data-end=&quot;1147&quot;&gt;The selected professional will contribute to robotics simulation workflows, synthetic data generation, AI model training pipelines, and autonomous navigation systems for industrial automation. The role also requires integration of Omniverse solutions with cloud platforms such as Azure and AWS, along with IoT devices and enterprise applications.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1149&quot; data-end=&quot;1440&quot;&gt;Candidates should have experience in developing simulation-based applications for factory automation, AMR navigation, path planning, and AI-driven quality inspection systems. Knowledge of industrial digital twins, real-time visualization, and smart factory concepts will be highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1442&quot; data-end=&quot;1644&quot;&gt;The role demands strong analytical thinking, problem-solving abilities, and collaboration skills to deliver enterprise-grade solutions for global manufacturing and industrial transformation initiatives.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Pune',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-07-10 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-05-12 02:13:12.000000','2026-05-12 02:13:12.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"AWS\", \"Azure Cloud Networking\", \"Digital Twin Technology\", \"Python\", \"NVIDIA Omniverse\", \"Robotics Simulation\", \"Factory Automation\", \"Synthetic Data Generation\", \"cuOpt\", \"3D Workflows\", \"Omniverse Developer\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1660&quot; data-end=&quot;1698&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1gwlbf5&quot; data-start=&quot;1699&quot; data-end=&quot;1753&quot;&gt;Exposure to advanced NVIDIA Omniverse technologies&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;vxvnsj&quot; data-start=&quot;1754&quot; data-end=&quot;1811&quot;&gt;Work on real-world Digital Twin and Robotics projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;dyiqss&quot; data-start=&quot;1812&quot; data-end=&quot;1876&quot;&gt;Opportunity to contribute to Smart Manufacturing initiatives&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1gyo669&quot; data-start=&quot;1877&quot; data-end=&quot;1938&quot;&gt;Experience with AI-driven industrial automation solutions&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;17ef2vo&quot; data-start=&quot;1939&quot; data-end=&quot;1992&quot;&gt;Exposure to cloud-integrated simulation platforms&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1sway1z&quot; data-start=&quot;1993&quot; data-end=&quot;2050&quot;&gt;Collaborative and innovation-focused work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ppg6uo&quot; data-start=&quot;2051&quot; data-end=&quot;2104&quot;&gt;Career growth in AI, Robotics &amp;amp; Simulation domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;dwyt3s&quot; data-start=&quot;2105&quot; data-end=&quot;2157&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and enterprise-level projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Maharashtra'),('40bba46c-5306-4368-8b66-eafe0d7e7a6b','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','TIBCO EBX MDM Developer','tibco-ebx-mdm-developer-68-68','&lt;p data-start=&quot;164&quot; data-end=&quot;399&quot;&gt;We are seeking a skilled &lt;strong data-start=&quot;189&quot; data-end=&quot;216&quot;&gt;TIBCO EBX MDM Developer&lt;/strong&gt; with 10&amp;ndash;12 years of experience to join our dynamic team. The ideal candidate will have hands-on expertise in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;326&quot; data-end=&quot;343&quot;&gt;TIBCO EBX MDM&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong data-start=&quot;345&quot; data-end=&quot;353&quot;&gt;Java&lt;/strong&gt;, and related data warehousing technologies.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;hr data-start=&quot;401&quot; data-end=&quot;404&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;406&quot; data-end=&quot;432&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;410&quot; data-end=&quot;430&quot;&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;433&quot; data-end=&quot;902&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;433&quot; data-end=&quot;556&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;435&quot; data-end=&quot;556&quot;&gt;Implement and configure the data model within MDM, as per logical models defined by analysts and data governance teams.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;557&quot; data-end=&quot;637&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;559&quot; data-end=&quot;637&quot;&gt;Translate business requirements into the &lt;strong data-start=&quot;600&quot; data-end=&quot;613&quot;&gt;TIBCO EBX&lt;/strong&gt; reference data model.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;638&quot; data-end=&quot;701&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;640&quot; data-end=&quot;701&quot;&gt;Lead migration projects from EBX6.1.X to EBX6.2 and beyond.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;702&quot; data-end=&quot;779&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;704&quot; data-end=&quot;779&quot;&gt;Develop web applications using frameworks like &lt;strong data-start=&quot;751&quot; data-end=&quot;761&quot;&gt;Spring&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong data-start=&quot;766&quot; data-end=&quot;776&quot;&gt;Struts&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;780&quot; data-end=&quot;836&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;782&quot; data-end=&quot;836&quot;&gt;Create ETL data mappings and perform data profiling.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;837&quot; data-end=&quot;902&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;839&quot; data-end=&quot;902&quot;&gt;Collaborate with teams to maintain and enhance MDM solutions.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-19 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-07-01 12:21:32.000000','2025-11-21 04:55:43.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Core Java\", \"Data Warehousing\", \"ETL Processes\", \"MS SQL Server\", \"MYSQL\", \"Oracle\", \"Spring Framework\", \"TIBCO EBX MDM\", \"Struts Framework\", \"Data Governance\", \"Migration Processes\", \"EBX6 Development\"]','[\"&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1166&quot; data-end=&quot;1476&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1166&quot; data-end=&quot;1219&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1168&quot; data-end=&quot;1219&quot;&gt;Competitive salary aligned with market standards.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1220&quot; data-end=&quot;1299&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1222&quot; data-end=&quot;1299&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with cutting-edge MDM and data governance technologies.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1300&quot; data-end=&quot;1366&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1302&quot; data-end=&quot;1366&quot;&gt;Professional growth through leadership and technical training.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1367&quot; data-end=&quot;1428&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1369&quot; data-end=&quot;1428&quot;&gt;Exposure to a diverse and collaborative team environment.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1429&quot; data-end=&quot;1476&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1431&quot; data-end=&quot;1476&quot;&gt;Flexible work arrangements (if applicable).&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('40c991f4-e478-4250-9cc7-aa5bcda27749','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Lead Databricks Engineer / Senior Databricks Engineer','lead-databricks-engineer-senior-databricks-engineer-235-235','Data Pipeline Development &lt;br /&gt;&amp;bull; Design and develop scalable ETL/ELT pipelines using Azure Databricks (Spark / PySpark).&lt;br /&gt;&amp;bull; Implement efficient data transformations and optimization techniques for large datasets. &lt;br /&gt;&amp;bull; Work with Delta Lake to ensure reliable, high-quality data layers. Database &amp;amp; SQL Development&lt;br /&gt;&amp;bull; Develop, optimize, and maintain complex SQL queries, functions, and stored procedures.&lt;br /&gt;&amp;bull; Perform performance tuning and troubleshooting on SQL Server environments. Analytics Enablement &lt;br /&gt;&amp;bull; Support Power BI datasets and dashboards by preparing clean, well-modeled data.&lt;br /&gt;&amp;bull; Collaborate with business and analytics teams to understand data requirements and translate them into technical solutions.','Information Technology','Contract','Entry',NULL,NULL,'INR',1,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-06-02 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-04-03 18:29:49.000000','2026-04-03 18:29:49.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"ETL\", \"MS SQL Server\", \"MYSQL\", \"Oracle\", \"Oracle ERP\", \"Spark\", \"Pyspark\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;Competitive salary package with performance-based incentives&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;65&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;67&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;Health insurance coverage and statutory benefits (PF &amp;amp; Gratuity)&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;134&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;136&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on large-scale enterprise energy management projects&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;211&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;213&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;Strong career growth and learning opportunities&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;263&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;265&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;Collaborative and professional work environment&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('411a619d-4ba2-40b8-a8eb-3037904893e5','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Senior SCADA Engineer – Ignition / PLC / Industrial Automation','senior-scada-engineer-ignition-plc-industrial-automation-385-385','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;100&quot; data-end=&quot;507&quot;&gt;We are looking for an experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;134&quot; data-end=&quot;159&quot;&gt;Senior SCADA Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; to join a high-tech &lt;strong data-start=&quot;180&quot; data-end=&quot;214&quot;&gt;battery manufacturing facility&lt;/strong&gt; and lead the design, development, integration, commissioning, and support of advanced SCADA and industrial automation systems. The role will involve working on large-scale plant automation environments with strong exposure to SCADA, PLC, BMS, data acquisition, and smart factory technologies.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;509&quot; data-end=&quot;905&quot;&gt;The ideal candidate should have strong hands-on expertise in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;570&quot; data-end=&quot;678&quot;&gt;Ignition SCADA, PLC systems, Siemens TIA Portal, Rockwell Automation, Beckhoff TwinCAT, and Omron Sysmac&lt;/strong&gt;. The candidate will be responsible for developing robust SCADA and PLC architectures and managing the complete automation lifecycle, including &lt;strong data-start=&quot;822&quot; data-end=&quot;904&quot;&gt;design, FAT, SAT, commissioning, integration, handover, and production support&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;907&quot; data-end=&quot;1252&quot;&gt;The role will also involve leading &lt;strong data-start=&quot;942&quot; data-end=&quot;1067&quot;&gt;SCADA vendor technical scope, system integration, implementation, diagnostics, alarm management, and real-time monitoring&lt;/strong&gt;. The engineer will work closely with Process, Facilities, EHS, Quality, and other plant engineering teams to ensure reliable and effective automation across the manufacturing facility.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Surat',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-11-10 07:00:00',0,0,'2026-09-12 01:23:14.000000','2026-09-12 01:23:14.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Ignition\", \"Industrial Automation\", \"PLC Programming\", \"SCADA\", \"Profinet\", \"Rockwell Factorytalk\", \"Siemens Tia Portal\", \"Modbus\", \"OPC UA\", \"MQTT\", \"Ethernet\", \"Beckhoff\", \"Allen-Bradley\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;iofbfz&quot; data-start=&quot;1508&quot; data-end=&quot;1556&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a leading &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1545&quot; data-end=&quot;1556&quot;&gt;Top MNC&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;3yna1q&quot; data-start=&quot;1557&quot; data-end=&quot;1623&quot;&gt;Exposure to next-generation &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1587&quot; data-end=&quot;1623&quot;&gt;battery manufacturing automation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;xqsxme&quot; data-start=&quot;1624&quot; data-end=&quot;1667&quot;&gt;Work on large-scale SCADA and PLC systems&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;74uoox&quot; data-start=&quot;1668&quot; data-end=&quot;1740&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1695&quot; data-end=&quot;1740&quot;&gt;Ignition SCADA and multiple PLC platforms&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1hhtu2l&quot; data-start=&quot;1741&quot; data-end=&quot;1799&quot;&gt;Exposure to &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1755&quot; data-end=&quot;1787&quot;&gt;Smart Factory / Industry 4.0&lt;/strong&gt; initiatives&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;jywec0&quot; data-start=&quot;1800&quot; data-end=&quot;1859&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with BMS and plant automation systems&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Gujarat'),('4149902b-a169-49c5-aba9-6906ea14c903','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Senior Full Stack Developer – Kafka & PySpark','senior-full-stack-developer-kafka-pyspark-180-180','&lt;p data-start=&quot;245&quot; data-end=&quot;649&quot;&gt;We are looking for a highly experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;285&quot; data-end=&quot;316&quot;&gt;Senior Full Stack Developer&lt;/strong&gt; with strong expertise in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;342&quot; data-end=&quot;372&quot;&gt;Python, Kafka, and PySpark&lt;/strong&gt; to design, build, and support scalable, distributed data engineering solutions. The role involves close collaboration with end users and global engineering teams, leveraging cloud-native and DevOps practices to deliver high-performance, real-time and batch processing systems.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;hr data-start=&quot;651&quot; data-end=&quot;654&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;656&quot; data-end=&quot;683&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;659&quot; data-end=&quot;683&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;684&quot; data-end=&quot;1358&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;684&quot; data-end=&quot;770&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;686&quot; data-end=&quot;770&quot;&gt;Design, develop, and support &lt;strong data-start=&quot;715&quot; data-end=&quot;768&quot;&gt;complex full-stack and data engineering solutions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;771&quot; data-end=&quot;830&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;773&quot; data-end=&quot;830&quot;&gt;Build and maintain &lt;strong data-start=&quot;792&quot; data-end=&quot;815&quot;&gt;distributed systems&lt;/strong&gt; using Python&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;831&quot; data-end=&quot;892&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;833&quot; data-end=&quot;892&quot;&gt;Develop and manage &lt;strong data-start=&quot;852&quot; data-end=&quot;890&quot;&gt;streaming applications using Kafka&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;893&quot; data-end=&quot;960&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;895&quot; data-end=&quot;960&quot;&gt;Implement large-scale data processing using &lt;strong data-start=&quot;939&quot; data-end=&quot;958&quot;&gt;Spark / PySpark&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;961&quot; data-end=&quot;1049&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;963&quot; data-end=&quot;1049&quot;&gt;Work with end users to gather requirements and translate them into technical designs&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1050&quot; data-end=&quot;1120&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1052&quot; data-end=&quot;1120&quot;&gt;Design and implement &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1073&quot; data-end=&quot;1092&quot;&gt;CI/CD pipelines&lt;/strong&gt; and DevOps best practices&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1121&quot; data-end=&quot;1192&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1123&quot; data-end=&quot;1192&quot;&gt;Collaborate with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1140&quot; data-end=&quot;1168&quot;&gt;global engineering teams&lt;/strong&gt; for solution delivery&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1193&quot; data-end=&quot;1236&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1195&quot; data-end=&quot;1236&quot;&gt;Work with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1205&quot; data-end=&quot;1234&quot;&gt;RDBMS and NoSQL databases&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1237&quot; data-end=&quot;1305&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1239&quot; data-end=&quot;1305&quot;&gt;Ensure performance, scalability, and reliability of applications&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1306&quot; data-end=&quot;1358&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1308&quot; data-end=&quot;1358&quot;&gt;Continuously research and adopt new technologies&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-03-23 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-01-22 22:14:04.000000','2026-01-22 22:14:05.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"DevOps\", \"Kafka\", \"Kubernetes\", \"NoSQL\", \"Python\", \"RDBMS\", \"Spark\", \"SQL\", \"Pyspark\", \"CI/CD\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2248&quot; data-end=&quot;2319&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2250&quot; data-end=&quot;2319&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2273&quot; data-end=&quot;2317&quot;&gt;large-scale data and streaming platforms&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2320&quot; data-end=&quot;2399&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2322&quot; data-end=&quot;2399&quot;&gt;Exposure to &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2334&quot; data-end=&quot;2363&quot;&gt;cutting-edge technologies&lt;/strong&gt; like Kafka, Spark, and Kubernetes&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2400&quot; data-end=&quot;2456&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2402&quot; data-end=&quot;2456&quot;&gt;High-impact role with direct stakeholder interaction&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2457&quot; data-end=&quot;2520&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2459&quot; data-end=&quot;2520&quot;&gt;Collaborative environment with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2490&quot; data-end=&quot;2518&quot;&gt;global engineering teams&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2521&quot; data-end=&quot;2583&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2523&quot; data-end=&quot;2583&quot;&gt;Strong career growth and continuous learning opportunities&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('41a4defd-b818-42ab-8683-497ecf00a86d','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Solution Architect – Robotics & Automation','solution-architect-robotics-automation-331-331','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;84&quot; data-end=&quot;450&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced Solution Architects &amp;ndash; Robotics &amp;amp; Automation for a leading Top MNC to drive enterprise-scale Smart Manufacturing, Industrial Automation, and Industry 4.0 transformation initiatives. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in robotics, automation architecture, OT/IT integration, manufacturing systems, and digital factory solutions.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;452&quot; data-end=&quot;862&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for designing and delivering end-to-end robotics and automation architectures for manufacturing plants, enabling highly automated and intelligent production environments. The role includes architecting solutions across Robotics, PLC, SCADA, MES, ERP, and Industrial IoT platforms while leading digital transformation programs focused on Lights-Out and Dark Factory operations.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;864&quot; data-end=&quot;1320&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with industrial robotics, collaborative robots (Cobots), Autonomous Mobile Robots (AMRs), Automated Guided Vehicles (AGVs), PLCs, SCADA systems, MES, ERP integration, industrial communication protocols, and manufacturing automation. Strong knowledge of robotics cell design, machine integration, material handling automation, vision inspection systems, and industrial control architectures is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1322&quot; data-end=&quot;1812&quot;&gt;The role also involves defining enterprise automation standards, reusable solution frameworks, vendor strategies, and technology roadmaps. Candidates will lead IT/OT integration initiatives, automation simulations, commissioning activities, and global deployment programs while collaborating with engineering, manufacturing, operations, and business stakeholders. Strong leadership, communication, stakeholder management, analytical thinking, and solution architecture skills are essential.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Hyderabad',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-09-05 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-07-08 03:28:54.000000','2026-07-08 03:28:54.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"ERP Integration\", \"Mes\", \"Mes Solutions Architect\", \"PLC Programming\", \"SCADA Systems\", \"Industry 4.0 Solutioning\", \"Industrial IoT (IIoT)\", \"Industrial Robotics\", \"Automated Guided Vehicles (AGVs)\", \"Autonomous Mobile Robots (AMRs)\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1828&quot; data-end=&quot;1866&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;qgzfa&quot; data-start=&quot;1867&quot; data-end=&quot;1954&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale Robotics, Automation, and Smart Manufacturing projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;ftw6vp&quot; data-start=&quot;1955&quot; data-end=&quot;2039&quot;&gt;Work on Industry 4.0, Digital Factory, and Intelligent Manufacturing initiatives&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1552z8u&quot; data-start=&quot;2040&quot; data-end=&quot;2113&quot;&gt;Career growth in Industrial Automation &amp;amp; Solution Architecture domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1pynldn&quot; data-start=&quot;2114&quot; data-end=&quot;2189&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global engineering and technology teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot; data-start=&quot;2190&quot; data-end=&quot;2245&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;2246&quot; data-end=&quot;2289&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Telangana'),('41aa5934-4113-4e85-b1da-c1aa1c8a09a5','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Mendix Developer','mendix-developer-11-11','&lt;p data-start=&quot;407&quot; data-end=&quot;828&quot;&gt;We are seeking an experienced&nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;437&quot; data-end=&quot;457&quot;&gt;Mendix Developer&lt;/strong&gt;&nbsp;with&nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;463&quot; data-end=&quot;498&quot;&gt;5+ years of hands-on experience&lt;/strong&gt;&nbsp;to join our team. The ideal candidate will be responsible for designing, developing, and deploying&nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;598&quot; data-end=&quot;623&quot;&gt;low-code applications&lt;/strong&gt;&nbsp;using the&nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;634&quot; data-end=&quot;653&quot;&gt;Mendix platform&lt;/strong&gt;. You will collaborate with cross-functional teams to deliver scalable and high-performance solutions, ensuring they meet business requirements and adhere to best practices.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;835&quot; data-end=&quot;866&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;839&quot; data-end=&quot;864&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;867&quot; data-end=&quot;1778&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;867&quot; data-end=&quot;958&quot;&gt;Design, develop, and deploy&nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;897&quot; data-end=&quot;920&quot;&gt;Mendix applications&lt;/strong&gt;&nbsp;using best practices and standards.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;959&quot; data-end=&quot;1064&quot;&gt;Collaborate with stakeholders to gather requirements and translate them into&nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1038&quot; data-end=&quot;1061&quot;&gt;technical solutions&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1065&quot; data-end=&quot;1134&quot;&gt;Build and integrate&nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1087&quot; data-end=&quot;1131&quot;&gt;microflows, nanoflows, and domain models&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1135&quot; data-end=&quot;1218&quot;&gt;Customize and extend&nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1158&quot; data-end=&quot;1173&quot;&gt;Mendix apps&lt;/strong&gt;&nbsp;using&nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1180&quot; data-end=&quot;1215&quot;&gt;Java, JavaScript, and REST APIs&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1219&quot; data-end=&quot;1305&quot;&gt;Implement&nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1231&quot; data-end=&quot;1255&quot;&gt;user interfaces (UI)&lt;/strong&gt;&nbsp;using Mendix&rsquo;s page editor and styling options.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1306&quot; data-end=&quot;1390&quot;&gt;Perform&nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1316&quot; data-end=&quot;1336&quot;&gt;data integration&lt;/strong&gt;&nbsp;with external systems using&nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1365&quot; data-end=&quot;1387&quot;&gt;SOAP/REST services&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1391&quot; data-end=&quot;1474&quot;&gt;Ensure application security by configuring&nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1436&quot; data-end=&quot;1471&quot;&gt;access rules and authentication&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1475&quot; data-end=&quot;1545&quot;&gt;Conduct&nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1485&quot; data-end=&quot;1542&quot;&gt;unit testing, debugging, and performance optimization&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1546&quot; data-end=&quot;1637&quot;&gt;Collaborate with DevOps teams to implement&nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1591&quot; data-end=&quot;1610&quot;&gt;CI/CD pipelines&lt;/strong&gt;&nbsp;for Mendix applications.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1638&quot; data-end=&quot;1696&quot;&gt;Maintain and improve&nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1661&quot; data-end=&quot;1693&quot;&gt;existing Mendix applications&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1697&quot; data-end=&quot;1778&quot;&gt;Create and manage&nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1717&quot; data-end=&quot;1744&quot;&gt;technical documentation&lt;/strong&gt;&nbsp;for applications and processes&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1697&quot; data-end=&quot;1778&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;1785&quot; data-end=&quot;1811&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1789&quot; data-end=&quot;1809&quot;&gt;Required Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1812&quot; data-end=&quot;2516&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1812&quot; data-end=&quot;1899&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1814&quot; data-end=&quot;1826&quot;&gt;5+ years&lt;/strong&gt;&nbsp;of hands-on experience in&nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1853&quot; data-end=&quot;1896&quot;&gt;Mendix low-code application development&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1900&quot; data-end=&quot;1965&quot;&gt;Proficiency with&nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1919&quot; data-end=&quot;1940&quot;&gt;Mendix Studio Pro&lt;/strong&gt;&nbsp;and&nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1945&quot; data-end=&quot;1962&quot;&gt;Mendix Studio&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1966&quot; data-end=&quot;2035&quot;&gt;Strong knowledge of&nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1988&quot; data-end=&quot;2032&quot;&gt;microflows, nanoflows, and domain models&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2036&quot; data-end=&quot;2106&quot;&gt;Experience with&nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2054&quot; data-end=&quot;2077&quot;&gt;Java and JavaScript&lt;/strong&gt;&nbsp;for custom Mendix actions.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2107&quot; data-end=&quot;2175&quot;&gt;Familiarity with&nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2126&quot; data-end=&quot;2151&quot;&gt;RESTful and SOAP APIs&lt;/strong&gt;&nbsp;for data integration.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2176&quot; data-end=&quot;2249&quot;&gt;Experience with&nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2194&quot; data-end=&quot;2211&quot;&gt;SQL databases&lt;/strong&gt;&nbsp;(PostgreSQL, MySQL, or SQL Server).&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2250&quot; data-end=&quot;2316&quot;&gt;Strong understanding of&nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2276&quot; data-end=&quot;2303&quot;&gt;UI/UX design principles&lt;/strong&gt;&nbsp;in Mendix.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2317&quot; data-end=&quot;2400&quot;&gt;Experience with&nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2335&quot; data-end=&quot;2358&quot;&gt;Agile methodologies&lt;/strong&gt;&nbsp;and version control systems (Git, SVN).&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2401&quot; data-end=&quot;2466&quot;&gt;Ability to troubleshoot and optimize&nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2440&quot; data-end=&quot;2463&quot;&gt;Mendix applications&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2467&quot; data-end=&quot;2516&quot;&gt;Strong problem-solving and analytical skills&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',200000.00,400000.00,'₹',1,'India','Pune',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-11-30 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-05-04 17:47:41.000000','2026-05-12 14:50:52.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Administrative Services\", \"AI Support\", \"Arts\", \"Java\", \"JavaScript\", \"Logistics\", \"Mendix Modules\", \"Mendix Rapid\", \"Mendix Studio Pro 9\", \"Microflows\", \"Microsoft Office Tools\", \"Mobile Apps\", \"Nanoflows\", \"REST API\", \"SOAP\"]','[\"&lt;div class=&quot;job-header benefits&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;div class=&quot;contentbox&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;3205&quot; data-end=&quot;3462&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;3205&quot; data-end=&quot;3258&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and performance-based bonuses.&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;3259&quot; data-end=&quot;3298&quot;&gt;Health insurance and paid time off.&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;3299&quot; data-end=&quot;3349&quot;&gt;Flexible work hours and remote/hybrid options.&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;3350&quot; data-end=&quot;3406&quot;&gt;Professional development and training opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;3407&quot; data-end=&quot;3462&quot;&gt;Collaborative and growth-oriented work environment.&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/div&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/div&gt;\\r\\n&lt;div class=&quot;job-header&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;div class=&quot;contentbox&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;h3&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/div&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/div&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Maharashtra'),('41b3ebec-0666-4107-811c-b4e7120ebca3','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','OT Engineer (Ignition SCADA)','ot-engineer-ignition-scada-319-319','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;70&quot; data-end=&quot;444&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced OT Engineers for a leading Top MNC to work on enterprise-scale Industrial Automation, Operational Technology (OT), and Digital Transformation projects. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in Ignition SCADA, industrial communication protocols, SCADA system development, and OT/IT integration within manufacturing and process industries.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;446&quot; data-end=&quot;898&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for designing, developing, implementing, and supporting Ignition SCADA applications for industrial automation environments. The role includes configuring Ignition Gateway, developing Vision and Perspective applications, managing tag structures, creating reusable libraries, implementing historian and alarm management solutions, and integrating SCADA systems with PLCs, enterprise applications, and industrial devices.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;900&quot; data-end=&quot;1241&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with Ignition SCADA Core/Gold, ISA-95 standards, OPC UA, MQTT, Modbus, SQL database integration, industrial networking, and SCADA architecture. Strong understanding of OT/IT integration, commissioning, validation, production support, and industrial automation best practices is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1243&quot; data-end=&quot;1709&quot;&gt;The role also involves performing system testing, commissioning, troubleshooting, performance optimization, preparing technical documentation, and collaborating with automation engineers, MES teams, IT teams, and business stakeholders to deliver scalable and reliable industrial automation solutions. Candidates should possess strong analytical thinking, communication, and problem-solving skills with a passion for Smart Manufacturing and Industry 4.0 technologies.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Pune',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-08-30 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-07-02 02:39:27.000000','2026-07-02 02:39:27.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Ignition\", \"Historian\", \"MS SQL Server\", \"PLC Programming\", \"SCADA\", \"Modbus\", \"OPC UA\", \"MQTT\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1725&quot; data-end=&quot;1763&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;mjtz5&quot; data-start=&quot;1764&quot; data-end=&quot;1837&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale Industrial Automation and SCADA projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ig72h1&quot; data-start=&quot;1838&quot; data-end=&quot;1910&quot;&gt;Work on advanced Ignition SCADA and Smart Manufacturing technologies&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;5bm7e&quot; data-start=&quot;1911&quot; data-end=&quot;1976&quot;&gt;Career growth in OT, SCADA &amp;amp; Industrial Digitalization domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1g8u6de&quot; data-start=&quot;1977&quot; data-end=&quot;2052&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global automation and engineering teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot; data-start=&quot;2053&quot; data-end=&quot;2108&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;2109&quot; data-end=&quot;2152&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Maharashtra'),('41c484ba-499a-41b5-8fe2-1e5cd96812e5','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Discrete Event Simulation (DES) Engineer','discrete-event-simulation-des-engineer-51-51','&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;371&quot; data-end=&quot;392&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;375&quot; data-end=&quot;390&quot;&gt;Job Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;393&quot; data-end=&quot;744&quot;&gt;We are looking for a highly skilled and motivated &lt;strong data-start=&quot;443&quot; data-end=&quot;487&quot;&gt;Discrete Event Simulation (DES) Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; to join our team. In this role, you will design, develop, and optimize simulation models for manufacturing, logistics, and service operations. Your expertise will help drive data-based decisions and continuous improvement across various industrial systems.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;hr data-start=&quot;746&quot; data-end=&quot;749&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;751&quot; data-end=&quot;781&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;755&quot; data-end=&quot;779&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;782&quot; data-end=&quot;1413&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;782&quot; data-end=&quot;901&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;784&quot; data-end=&quot;901&quot;&gt;Develop, validate, and maintain discrete event simulation models for operational analysis and process optimization.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;902&quot; data-end=&quot;989&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;904&quot; data-end=&quot;989&quot;&gt;Identify system bottlenecks and recommend improvements based on simulation results.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;990&quot; data-end=&quot;1078&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;992&quot; data-end=&quot;1078&quot;&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional teams to gather data and define system parameters.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1079&quot; data-end=&quot;1151&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1081&quot; data-end=&quot;1151&quot;&gt;Conduct experiments and sensitivity analyses using simulation tools.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1152&quot; data-end=&quot;1238&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1154&quot; data-end=&quot;1238&quot;&gt;Interpret simulation outcomes and present actionable insights to key stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1239&quot; data-end=&quot;1316&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1241&quot; data-end=&quot;1316&quot;&gt;Integrate simulation models with real-world data and analytics platforms.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1317&quot; data-end=&quot;1413&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1319&quot; data-end=&quot;1413&quot;&gt;Stay current with emerging trends, tools, and best practices in DES and industrial operations.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;hr data-start=&quot;1415&quot; data-end=&quot;1418&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;1420&quot; data-end=&quot;1453&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1424&quot; data-end=&quot;1451&quot;&gt;Required Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1454&quot; data-end=&quot;2196&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1454&quot; data-end=&quot;1574&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1456&quot; data-end=&quot;1574&quot;&gt;Bachelor&#039;s or Master&amp;rsquo;s degree in Industrial Engineering, Operations Research, Systems Engineering, or related field.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1575&quot; data-end=&quot;1662&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1577&quot; data-end=&quot;1662&quot;&gt;6+ years of hands-on experience in discrete event simulation and model development.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1663&quot; data-end=&quot;1757&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1665&quot; data-end=&quot;1757&quot;&gt;Expertise in simulation tools such as &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1703&quot; data-end=&quot;1742&quot;&gt;AnyLogic, FlexSim, Plant Simulation&lt;/strong&gt;, or similar.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1758&quot; data-end=&quot;1853&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1760&quot; data-end=&quot;1853&quot;&gt;Proficiency in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1775&quot; data-end=&quot;1796&quot;&gt;Python, VBA, Java&lt;/strong&gt;, or other scripting languages for model customization.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1854&quot; data-end=&quot;1930&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1856&quot; data-end=&quot;1930&quot;&gt;Strong knowledge of manufacturing, logistics, or supply chain processes.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1931&quot; data-end=&quot;2019&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1933&quot; data-end=&quot;2019&quot;&gt;Analytical mindset with solid statistical analysis and problem-solving capabilities.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2020&quot; data-end=&quot;2125&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2022&quot; data-end=&quot;2125&quot;&gt;Strong communication skills with the ability to explain complex models to non-technical stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2126&quot; data-end=&quot;2196&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2128&quot; data-end=&quot;2196&quot;&gt;Proven ability to manage multiple projects and meet tight deadlines.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',500000.00,2500000.00,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-19 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-06-10 04:33:12.000000','2025-11-21 04:58:49.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"AnyLogic\", \"FlexSim\", \"Industrial Engineering\", \"Model Maker\", \"Python\", \"Simulation\", \"VBA\", \"Discrete\", \"Discrete Mes\", \"Discrete Event Simulation\"]','[\"&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;190&quot; data-end=&quot;215&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;197&quot; data-end=&quot;213&quot;&gt;Job Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\\r\\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;217&quot; data-end=&quot;1067&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;217&quot; data-end=&quot;292&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;219&quot; data-end=&quot;292&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;219&quot; data-end=&quot;241&quot;&gt;Competitive Salary&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;ndash; Aligned with industry standards and experience&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;293&quot; data-end=&quot;374&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;295&quot; data-end=&quot;374&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;295&quot; data-end=&quot;316&quot;&gt;Health &amp;amp; Wellness&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;ndash; Comprehensive medical insurance (self and dependents)&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;375&quot; data-end=&quot;458&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;377&quot; data-end=&quot;458&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;377&quot; data-end=&quot;400&quot;&gt;Flexible Work Hours&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;ndash; Hybrid/remote work options depending on project needs&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;459&quot; data-end=&quot;532&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;461&quot; data-end=&quot;532&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;461&quot; data-end=&quot;484&quot;&gt;Performance Bonuses&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;ndash; Based on individual and company performance&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;533&quot; data-end=&quot;626&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;535&quot; data-end=&quot;626&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;535&quot; data-end=&quot;561&quot;&gt;Learning &amp;amp; Development&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;ndash; Access to training programs, certifications, and conferences&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('41c7b692-8c4f-4ff1-806e-5b02e6379f60','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Systems Engineer – MES','systems-engineer-mes-338-338','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;64&quot; data-end=&quot;455&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced Systems Engineers &amp;ndash; MES for a leading Top MNC to support enterprise-scale Manufacturing Execution System (MES), Manufacturing Operations Management (MOM), and Smart Manufacturing initiatives. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in Dassault DELMIA Apriso MES, enterprise system integration, manufacturing automation, and digital transformation projects.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;457&quot; data-end=&quot;873&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for designing, configuring, implementing, and supporting Dassault DELMIA Apriso MES solutions across manufacturing facilities. The role includes developing MES applications, configuring manufacturing workflows, integrating MES with enterprise and shop-floor systems, commissioning equipment interfaces, troubleshooting production issues, and driving continuous process improvements.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;875&quot; data-end=&quot;1271&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with DELMIA Apriso MES, C# programming, SQL databases, Manufacturing Execution Systems (MES), Manufacturing Operations Management (MOM), ISA-95, ISA-88 standards, and enterprise application integration. Strong understanding of ERP, PLM, WMS, LIMS, QMS, SCADA, WCS, Industrial IoT, automation systems, and manufacturing operations is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1273&quot; data-end=&quot;1723&quot;&gt;The role also involves collaborating with engineering, automation, manufacturing, and IT teams to deliver scalable MES solutions, conduct technical workshops, prepare system documentation, provide end-user training, and support enterprise digital manufacturing initiatives. Candidates should possess strong analytical, communication, stakeholder management, leadership, and problem-solving skills with experience in global manufacturing environments.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Ahmedabad',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-09-13 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-07-16 02:12:26.000000','2026-07-16 02:12:26.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"C#\", \"ERP\", \"Lims\", \"Mes\", \"Mes Compliance\", \"Mes Configuration\", \"MES Development\", \"Microsoft SQL Server\", \"Mom Systems\", \"PLM Software (Product Lifecycle Management)\", \"SCADA\", \"SQL\", \"ISA-95\", \"ISA-88\", \"Dassault DELMIA Apriso MES\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1739&quot; data-end=&quot;1777&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1e3dqkd&quot; data-start=&quot;1778&quot; data-end=&quot;1864&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale MES and Digital Manufacturing transformation projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;14gxcgv&quot; data-start=&quot;1865&quot; data-end=&quot;1945&quot;&gt;Work with advanced Dassault DELMIA Apriso MES and Smart Factory technologies&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1pswt5&quot; data-start=&quot;1946&quot; data-end=&quot;2028&quot;&gt;Career growth in Manufacturing Execution Systems (MES) and Industry 4.0 domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;11crmfv&quot; data-start=&quot;2029&quot; data-end=&quot;2120&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global engineering, manufacturing, and technology teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot; data-start=&quot;2121&quot; data-end=&quot;2176&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;2177&quot; data-end=&quot;2220&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Gujarat'),('41cd28eb-b80a-41af-810e-c3fc7ff23aad','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Knowledge Lead – Cyber Security Documentation & Governance','knowledge-lead-cyber-security-documentation-governance-187-187','&lt;p data-start=&quot;188&quot; data-end=&quot;501&quot;&gt;We are seeking an experienced Knowledge Lead to own end-to-end cybersecurity documentation, governance artifacts, and audit-ready deliverables. The role focuses on SOPs, runbooks, handover packs, training content, and final security posture reporting while coordinating with multiple technical and business teams.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;512&quot; data-end=&quot;526&quot;&gt;Key Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;529&quot; data-end=&quot;932&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;529&quot; data-end=&quot;569&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;531&quot; data-end=&quot;569&quot;&gt;Technical documentation &amp;amp; governance&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;570&quot; data-end=&quot;597&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;572&quot; data-end=&quot;597&quot;&gt;SOP / Runbook authoring&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;598&quot; data-end=&quot;640&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;600&quot; data-end=&quot;640&quot;&gt;Handover &amp;amp; reversibility documentation&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;641&quot; data-end=&quot;686&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;643&quot; data-end=&quot;686&quot;&gt;Audit evidence &amp;amp; compliance documentation&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;687&quot; data-end=&quot;724&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;689&quot; data-end=&quot;724&quot;&gt;Final posture &amp;amp; summary reporting&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;725&quot; data-end=&quot;768&quot;