a-end=&quot;1292&quot;&gt;Strong career growth in security governance &amp;amp; documentation leadership&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1293&quot; data-end=&quot;1362&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1295&quot; data-end=&quot;1362&quot;&gt;High-visibility role supporting go-live and operational readiness&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Tamil Nadu'),('42059373-8ee5-41b4-b27b-d10077b274a8','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Senior .NET Developer','senior-net-developer-164-164','&lt;p data-start=&quot;168&quot; data-end=&quot;737&quot;&gt;We are hiring a Senior .NET Developer with strong backend and database development expertise. The ideal candidate will be responsible for full-stack development with a key focus on backend services, database design, optimization, and system integration. The role involves working on enterprise-grade applications such as SiGAC, Tririga, and ICHEM, supporting their development, testing, and maintenance. You will also manage source control using GitHub, run integration test cases, troubleshoot database issues, and ensure high-quality, performance-optimized solutions.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;hr data-start=&quot;739&quot; data-end=&quot;742&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;744&quot; data-end=&quot;774&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;750&quot; data-end=&quot;774&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;775&quot; data-end=&quot;1274&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;775&quot; data-end=&quot;850&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;777&quot; data-end=&quot;850&quot;&gt;Full-stack development with strong focus on backend and database layers&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;851&quot; data-end=&quot;938&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;853&quot; data-end=&quot;938&quot;&gt;Support development, testing, and sustaining activities for enterprise applications&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;939&quot; data-end=&quot;1005&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;941&quot; data-end=&quot;1005&quot;&gt;Manage source control using GitHub and ensure coding standards&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1006&quot; data-end=&quot;1073&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1008&quot; data-end=&quot;1073&quot;&gt;Design, develop, and optimize SAP HANA and PostgreSQL databases&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1074&quot; data-end=&quot;1141&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1076&quot; data-end=&quot;1141&quot;&gt;Execute integration testing and resolve database-related issues&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1142&quot; data-end=&quot;1214&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1144&quot; data-end=&quot;1214&quot;&gt;Understand third-party systems, business processes, and integrations&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1215&quot; data-end=&quot;1274&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1217&quot; data-end=&quot;1274&quot;&gt;Perform database troubleshooting and performance tuning&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Full-time','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-02-06 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-12-08 16:40:59.000000','2025-12-08 16:40:59.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\".NET CORE\", \".NET Framework\", \"AWS\", \"Azure\", \"C#\", \"Cloud\", \"Entity Framework\", \"Github\", \"Optimization\", \"PostgreSQL\", \"SAP Hana\", \"SQL\", \"Web API\", \"Database Design\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1818&quot; data-end=&quot;1859&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1820&quot; data-end=&quot;1859&quot;&gt;Work on enterprise-level applications&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1860&quot; data-end=&quot;1916&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1862&quot; data-end=&quot;1916&quot;&gt;Exposure to modern backend and database technologies&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1917&quot; data-end=&quot;1961&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1919&quot; data-end=&quot;1961&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with cloud platforms&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1962&quot; data-end=&quot;2008&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1964&quot; data-end=&quot;2008&quot;&gt;Career growth and leadership opportunities&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2009&quot; data-end=&quot;2056&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2011&quot; data-end=&quot;2056&quot;&gt;Collaborative professional work environment&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('4233cec4-8376-480c-98b0-40dedbe2c2f5','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','VCP MO Engineer','vcp-mo-engineer-157-157','&lt;p data-start=&quot;244&quot; data-end=&quot;591&quot;&gt;We are seeking an experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;274&quot; data-end=&quot;293&quot;&gt;VCP MO Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; with strong technical, analytical, and communication skills to manage, monitor, and support customer environments. The ideal candidate should have hands-on experience with Linux administration, orchestration tools (Docker, Kubernetes, Mesosphere), scripting tools, databases, and monitoring tools.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;593&quot; data-end=&quot;882&quot;&gt;The role involves software installation, deployment, environment monitoring, and adherence to ITSM processes such as Incident, Change, and Problem Management. The candidate will work with global teams across Europe, USA, APAC, and India and may be required to travel to customer locations.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Full-time','Entry',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-31 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-12-03 02:48:48.000000','2025-12-03 02:48:48.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Ansible\", \"Docker\", \"Grafana\", \"Hadoop Ecosystem\", \"Kubernetes\", \"Linux\", \"Linux Administration\", \"Mongo DB\", \"Splunk\", \"TerraForm\", \"Problem Management\", \"DCOS\", \"Mesosphere\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;957&quot; data-end=&quot;999&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;959&quot; data-end=&quot;999&quot;&gt;Competitive salary based on experience&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1000&quot; data-end=&quot;1047&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1002&quot; data-end=&quot;1047&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with top global clients&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1048&quot; data-end=&quot;1120&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1050&quot; data-end=&quot;1120&quot;&gt;Exposure to advanced cloud, orchestration, and Big Data technologies&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1121&quot; data-end=&quot;1171&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1123&quot; data-end=&quot;1171&quot;&gt;Work with global teams across multiple regions&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1172&quot; data-end=&quot;1248&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1174&quot; data-end=&quot;1248&quot;&gt;Career growth opportunities into cloud, DevOps, and platform engineering&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1249&quot; data-end=&quot;1303&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1251&quot; data-end=&quot;1303&quot;&gt;Travel opportunities (as per project requirements)&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1304&quot; data-end=&quot;1356&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1306&quot; data-end=&quot;1356&quot;&gt;Professional development &amp;amp; certification support&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('42438069-c636-475c-ae22-f4f59803f75c','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Governance, Risk & Compliance (GRC) Specialist','governance-risk-compliance-grc-specialist-185-185','We are seeking an experienced Governance, Risk &amp; Compliance (GRC) Specialist to lead cyber-risk governance and compliance activities across complex programs. The role focuses on risk register ownership, compliance mapping, audit readiness, and residual risk management, ensuring alignment with international security standards and customer governance frameworks.\r\nKey Responsibilities\r\nOwn and maintain the Cyber Risk Register across all project phases\r\nAuthor, update, and manage the Security Insurance Plan (SIP)\r\nBuild and maintain Compliance Traceability Matrices\r\nMap and validate controls against IEC 62443, IEC 62351, ISO 27002\r\nPrepare and manage audit and CERT evidence packs\r\nTrack remediation actions and log compensating controls\r\nDocument residual risks and facilitate formal risk acceptance and sign-off\r\nAlign governance activities with customer policies and RACI models\r\nCoordinate with OEM, Customer, and delivery teams on dependencies\r\nSupport FAT/SAT readiness from a compliance and governance perspective\r\nConduct periodic risk reviews, reporting, and steering committee updates\r\nMaintain document versioning, traceability, and approval workflows\r\nEscalate high-severity risks to governance boards and stakeholders\r\nSupport operations readiness and ongoing audit posture\r\nContribute to final security posture reviews and lessons-learned','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-04-10 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-02-09 18:00:30.000000','2026-02-09 18:00:30.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Cybersecurity\", \"IEC Standards\", \"Data Governance\", \"OEM\", \"IEC 62443\", \"IEC 62351\", \"RACI development\", \"SIP authoring\"]','[\"High-visibility role owning end-to-end cyber governance and compliance\\r\\nHands-on exposure to international cybersecurity standards\\r\\nWork closely with customer governance boards, OEMs, and delivery teams\\r\\nOpportunity to influence security posture and risk decisions\\r\\nStrong professional growth in OT / IT security governance and compliance\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('425d0174-9c73-47c8-8455-5e0083b056a1','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Senior SSIS/ETL Developer','senior-ssisetl-developer-202-202','&lt;p&gt;&amp;middot; Design &amp;amp; Development: Lead the end-to-end design, development, and deployment of robust ETL/ELT solutions using SQL Server Integration Services (SSIS) for complex data integration and migration.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;middot; SQL Mastery: Develop and optimize complex T-SQL (Stored Procedures, Functions, Views, Triggers, Indexes) for data transformation, ensuring high performance and data integrity.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;middot; Performance Tuning: Proactively identify, troubleshoot, and resolve performance bottlenecks in SQL Server and SSIS packages.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;middot; Data Warehousing: Apply strong Data Warehousing (DWH) concepts to build efficient data models and metadata.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;middot; Collaboration: Work closely with business analysts, architects, and testing teams to gather requirements and deliver integrated solutions.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;middot; DevOps &amp;amp; Automation: Implement and maintain CI/CD pipelines for SSIS deployments, leveraging tools like GIT,DevOPS&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Technical Skills:&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;middot; SSIS: Expert-level experience in building, deploying (SSIS Catalog), and managing SSIS packages.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;middot; SQL server: Advanced SQL, T-SQL, Stored Procedures, Functions, Performance Tuning, Indexing.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;middot; ETL/DWH Deep understanding of ETL processes, Data Warehousing principles, Metadata Management.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;middot; Version Control: Git, GitHub.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'INR',1,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-04-26 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-02-25 19:24:30.000000','2026-02-25 19:24:30.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Agile\", \"Azure\", \"ETL\", \"ETL Processes\", \"Github\", \"Mes Scrum Methodology\", \"MYSQL\", \"Power BI\", \"Powershell\", \"SSIS\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;Competitive salary package with performance-based incentives&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;65&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;67&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;Health insurance coverage and statutory benefits (PF &amp;amp; Gratuity)&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;134&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;136&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on large-scale enterprise energy management projects&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;211&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;213&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;Strong career growth and learning opportunities&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;263&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;265&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;Collaborative and professional work environment&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('428538ae-6c46-4ac9-babf-c1a5a4e4ef1b','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Sample Manager LIMS SME','sample-manager-lims-sme-53-53','&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;334&quot; data-end=&quot;360&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;341&quot; data-end=&quot;358&quot;&gt;Role Summary:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;361&quot; data-end=&quot;654&quot;&gt;We are seeking an experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;391&quot; data-end=&quot;417&quot;&gt;SampleManager LIMS SME&lt;/strong&gt; to support the design, development, customization, and integration of SampleManager LIMS systems. The ideal candidate will have strong technical skills in LIMS and related technologies, and a passion for optimizing laboratory processes.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;hr data-start=&quot;656&quot; data-end=&quot;659&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;661&quot; data-end=&quot;693&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;668&quot; data-end=&quot;693&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;694&quot; data-end=&quot;1319&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;694&quot; data-end=&quot;769&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;696&quot; data-end=&quot;769&quot;&gt;Design, develop, configure, and support SampleManager LIMS applications&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;770&quot; data-end=&quot;847&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;772&quot; data-end=&quot;847&quot;&gt;Gather user requirements and maintain system documentation and procedures&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;848&quot; data-end=&quot;909&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;850&quot; data-end=&quot;909&quot;&gt;Perform performance tuning and upgrade existing codebases&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;910&quot; data-end=&quot;980&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;912&quot; data-end=&quot;980&quot;&gt;Work on version upgrades/migrations and custom module enhancements&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;981&quot; data-end=&quot;1045&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;983&quot; data-end=&quot;1045&quot;&gt;Manage complete product configuration and analysis workflows&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1046&quot; data-end=&quot;1108&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1048&quot; data-end=&quot;1108&quot;&gt;Integrate laboratory instruments using Integration Manager&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1109&quot; data-end=&quot;1176&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1111&quot; data-end=&quot;1176&quot;&gt;Maintain and configure static data and manage sample life cycle&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1177&quot; data-end=&quot;1251&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1179&quot; data-end=&quot;1251&quot;&gt;Conduct training sessions for end-users and support go-live activities&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1252&quot; data-end=&quot;1319&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1254&quot; data-end=&quot;1319&quot;&gt;Implement and evaluate product enhancements and system upgrades&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;hr data-start=&quot;1321&quot; data-end=&quot;1324&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;1326&quot; data-end=&quot;1363&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1333&quot; data-end=&quot;1363&quot;&gt;Technical Skills Required:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1364&quot; data-end=&quot;1720&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1364&quot; data-end=&quot;1437&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1366&quot; data-end=&quot;1437&quot;&gt;Expertise in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1379&quot; data-end=&quot;1401&quot;&gt;SampleManager LIMS&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1403&quot; data-end=&quot;1410&quot;&gt;VGL&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1412&quot; data-end=&quot;1435&quot;&gt;Integration Manager&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1438&quot; data-end=&quot;1500&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1440&quot; data-end=&quot;1500&quot;&gt;Strong programming knowledge in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1472&quot; data-end=&quot;1480&quot;&gt;.Net&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1482&quot; data-end=&quot;1489&quot;&gt;VB6&lt;/strong&gt;, and SQL&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1501&quot; data-end=&quot;1562&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1503&quot; data-end=&quot;1562&quot;&gt;Experience with Windows environments and cloud deployment&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1563&quot; data-end=&quot;1648&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1565&quot; data-end=&quot;1648&quot;&gt;In-depth knowledge of sample workflows, analysis configurations, and calculations&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1649&quot; data-end=&quot;1720&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1651&quot; data-end=&quot;1720&quot;&gt;Experience in LIMS migration, integration, and validation processes&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;hr data-start=&quot;1722&quot; data-end=&quot;1725&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;1727&quot; data-end=&quot;1769&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1734&quot; data-end=&quot;1769&quot;&gt;Managerial &amp;amp; Additional Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1770&quot; data-end=&quot;2039&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1770&quot; data-end=&quot;1832&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1772&quot; data-end=&quot;1832&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1772&quot; data-end=&quot;1808&quot;&gt;SampleManager LIMS Certification&lt;/strong&gt; is an added advantage&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1833&quot; data-end=&quot;1881&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1835&quot; data-end=&quot;1881&quot;&gt;Exposure to other LIMS platforms (preferred)&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1882&quot; data-end=&quot;1929&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1884&quot; data-end=&quot;1929&quot;&gt;Experience in mentoring/training LIMS teams&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1930&quot; data-end=&quot;1986&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1932&quot; data-end=&quot;1986&quot;&gt;Strong customer interaction and communication skills&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1987&quot; data-end=&quot;2039&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1989&quot; data-end=&quot;2039&quot;&gt;Good documentation and problem-solving abilities&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',500000.00,2500000.00,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-19 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-06-10 09:46:18.000000','2025-11-21 04:58:26.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\".NET\", \"Cloud Migration\", \"Communication Skills\", \"Lims\", \"Manager\", \"Problem-Solving Skills\", \"SQL\", \"VB\"]','[\"&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;224&quot; data-end=&quot;248&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;231&quot; data-end=&quot;247&quot;&gt;Job Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/h3&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;250&quot; data-end=&quot;901&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;253&quot; data-end=&quot;283&quot;&gt;Competitive Salary Package&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br data-start=&quot;334&quot; data-end=&quot;337&quot; /&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;340&quot; data-end=&quot;360&quot; data-is-only-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;Health Insurance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;455&quot; data-end=&quot;478&quot;&gt;Performance Bonuses&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br data-start=&quot;478&quot; data-end=&quot;481&quot; /&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;565&quot; data-end=&quot;596&quot;&gt;Career Growth Opportunities&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;602&quot; data-end=&quot;632&quot;&gt;Employee Wellness Programs&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br data-start=&quot;632&quot; data-end=&quot;635&quot; /&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;638&quot; data-end=&quot;679&quot;&gt;Friendly &amp;amp; Collaborative Work Culture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br data-start=&quot;679&quot; data-end=&quot;682&quot; /&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;685&quot; data-end=&quot;724&quot;&gt;Team Outings, Events &amp;amp; Celebrations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br data-start=&quot;771&quot; data-end=&quot;774&quot; /&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;777&quot; data-end=&quot;814&quot;&gt;Work on Leading-Edge Technologies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br data-start=&quot;814&quot; data-end=&quot;817&quot; /&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;820&quot; data-end=&quot;860&quot;&gt;Diverse &amp;amp; Inclusive Work Environment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br data-start=&quot;860&quot; data-end=&quot;863&quot; /&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;866&quot; data-end=&quot;899&quot;&gt;Recognition &amp;amp; Rewards Program&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('42c09436-a6ce-43ff-a10e-a47cdb48cc10','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Maintenance Engineer – Master Data Specialist | SAP EAM/MM','maintenance-engineer-master-data-specialist-sap-eammm-384-384','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;96&quot; data-end=&quot;466&quot;&gt;We are looking for an experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;130&quot; data-end=&quot;179&quot;&gt;Maintenance Engineer &amp;ndash; Master Data Specialist&lt;/strong&gt; with strong expertise in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;205&quot; data-end=&quot;274&quot;&gt;SAP EAM/MM, SAP S/4HANA EAM &amp;amp; MM, and Oil &amp;amp; Gas Plant Maintenance&lt;/strong&gt;. The role will be responsible for managing and maintaining high-quality maintenance, asset, equipment, material, and technical master data across upstream, midstream, and refinery operations.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;468&quot; data-end=&quot;879&quot;&gt;The ideal candidate should have a strong engineering background in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;535&quot; data-end=&quot;619&quot;&gt;Mechanical, Instrumentation, Electrical Engineering, or relevant technical trade&lt;/strong&gt;, combined with hands-on experience in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;658&quot; data-end=&quot;696&quot;&gt;Oil &amp;amp; Gas maintenance environments&lt;/strong&gt;. The candidate will work on SAP EAM/MM master data, including technical objects, assets, maintenance plans, BOMs, measuring points, materials, and associated technical documentation.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;881&quot; data-end=&quot;1227&quot;&gt;The role requires strong understanding of &lt;strong data-start=&quot;923&quot; data-end=&quot;1040&quot;&gt;maintenance strategies, plant equipment, P&amp;amp;IDs, work instructions, data sheets, SLDs, and technical documentation&lt;/strong&gt;. The candidate will collaborate closely with Site, Reliability, Integrity, Projects, Operations, and HSE teams to ensure accurate, consistent, and business-ready maintenance master data.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-11-02 07:00:00',0,0,'2026-09-04 04:09:28.000000','2026-09-04 04:09:29.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Power BI\", \"SAP (Oil Module)\", \"SAP FIORI\", \"SAP S4 HANA\", \"Mesosphere\", \"Master Data Management (MDM)\", \"SAP GUI\", \"UAT (User Acceptance Testing)\", \"SAP EAM & MM\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;iofbfz&quot; data-start=&quot;1539&quot; data-end=&quot;1587&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a leading &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1576&quot; data-end=&quot;1587&quot;&gt;Top MNC&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;inkeli&quot; data-start=&quot;1588&quot; data-end=&quot;1660&quot;&gt;Exposure to large-scale &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1614&quot; data-end=&quot;1660&quot;&gt;Oil &amp;amp; Gas and Plant Maintenance operations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;15p13hn&quot; data-start=&quot;1661&quot; data-end=&quot;1712&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1688&quot; data-end=&quot;1712&quot;&gt;SAP S/4HANA EAM &amp;amp; MM&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;y354p5&quot; data-start=&quot;1713&quot; data-end=&quot;1748&quot;&gt;Exposure to SAP GUI and &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1739&quot; data-end=&quot;1748&quot;&gt;Fiori&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1m1vs7c&quot; data-start=&quot;1749&quot; data-end=&quot;1829&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on enterprise-scale &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1791&quot; data-end=&quot;1829&quot;&gt;Maintenance Master Data Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1xq5b61&quot; data-start=&quot;1830&quot; data-end=&quot;1910&quot;&gt;Collaboration with Reliability, Integrity, Operations, Projects, and HSE teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;yvvkc0&quot; data-start=&quot;1911&quot; data-end=&quot;1992&quot;&gt;Exposure to asset management, maintenance strategies, and reliability practicesoil&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('439fc93b-6888-45dc-8092-42c9472c1176','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Back End Developer','back-end-developer-42-42','&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;423&quot; data-end=&quot;444&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;427&quot; data-end=&quot;444&quot;&gt;Job Overview:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;446&quot; data-end=&quot;1031&quot;&gt;We are seeking an experienced Back End Developer to join our team for the development of the &lt;strong data-start=&quot;539&quot; data-end=&quot;610&quot;&gt;Next Gen MITS (Manufacturing, Inventory, and Transportation System)&lt;/strong&gt; application. This is an exciting opportunity to contribute to the design, development, and implementation of a robust enterprise-level system with a focus on various business functionalities including Receiving, Production, Shipping, Transportation, Invoicing, and Finance. The ideal candidate will play a key role in backend development with expertise in AWS services, microservices architecture, and .NET technologies.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;hr data-start=&quot;1033&quot; data-end=&quot;1036&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;1038&quot; data-end=&quot;1067&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1042&quot; data-end=&quot;1067&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1068&quot; data-end=&quot;2046&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1068&quot; data-end=&quot;1239&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1070&quot; data-end=&quot;1239&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1070&quot; data-end=&quot;1094&quot;&gt;Design &amp;amp; Development&lt;/strong&gt;: Work on the backend design and development of the Next Gen MITS application, focusing on the integration and orchestration of various services.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1240&quot; data-end=&quot;1359&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1242&quot; data-end=&quot;1359&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1242&quot; data-end=&quot;1261&quot;&gt;API Development&lt;/strong&gt;: Build and maintain Restful APIs and integrate with other services and systems using API Gateway.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1360&quot; data-end=&quot;1469&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1362&quot; data-end=&quot;1469&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1362&quot; data-end=&quot;1380&quot;&gt;Cloud Services&lt;/strong&gt;: Utilize AWS services such as Lambda, Fargate, and S3 for scalable and secure solutions.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1470&quot; data-end=&quot;1583&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1472&quot; data-end=&quot;1583&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1472&quot; data-end=&quot;1495&quot;&gt;Database Management&lt;/strong&gt;: Work with PostgreSQL and Aurora databases for efficient data management and retrieval.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1584&quot; data-end=&quot;1730&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1586&quot; data-end=&quot;1730&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1586&quot; data-end=&quot;1616&quot;&gt;Microservices Architecture&lt;/strong&gt;: Implement domain-driven design with macro, micro, and nano services to ensure modular and scalable architecture.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1731&quot; data-end=&quot;1895&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1733&quot; data-end=&quot;1895&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1733&quot; data-end=&quot;1750&quot;&gt;Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;: Work closely with cross-functional teams including product managers, front-end developers, and QA engineers to ensure smooth project execution.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1896&quot; data-end=&quot;2046&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1898&quot; data-end=&quot;2046&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1898&quot; data-end=&quot;1924&quot;&gt;Continuous Improvement&lt;/strong&gt;: Continuously monitor the performance of developed services and make improvements to enhance reliability and scalability.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;hr data-start=&quot;2048&quot; data-end=&quot;2051&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;2053&quot; data-end=&quot;2090&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2057&quot; data-end=&quot;2090&quot;&gt;Required Skills &amp;amp; Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2092&quot; data-end=&quot;2964&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2092&quot; data-end=&quot;2219&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2094&quot; data-end=&quot;2219&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2094&quot; data-end=&quot;2118&quot;&gt;AWS Lambda &amp;amp; Fargate&lt;/strong&gt;: Expertise in AWS Lambda and Fargate for serverless application development (Proficiency Level: E2).&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2220&quot; data-end=&quot;2358&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2222&quot; data-end=&quot;2358&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2222&quot; data-end=&quot;2241&quot;&gt;AWS S3 &amp;amp; Aurora&lt;/strong&gt;: Solid experience in using AWS S3 for storage and Aurora for relational database management (Proficiency Level: E2).&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2359&quot; data-end=&quot;2481&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2361&quot; data-end=&quot;2481&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2361&quot; data-end=&quot;2375&quot;&gt;PostgreSQL&lt;/strong&gt;: Strong hands-on experience with PostgreSQL for database design and optimization (Proficiency Level: E2).&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2482&quot; data-end=&quot;2600&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2484&quot; data-end=&quot;2600&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2484&quot; data-end=&quot;2501&quot;&gt;Microservices&lt;/strong&gt;: In-depth understanding of microservices architecture and design patterns (Proficiency Level: E2).&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2601&quot; data-end=&quot;2702&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2603&quot; data-end=&quot;2702&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2603&quot; data-end=&quot;2616&quot;&gt;.NET &amp;amp; C#&lt;/strong&gt;: Extensive experience in .NET and C# for backend development (Proficiency Level: E2).&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2703&quot; data-end=&quot;2817&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2705&quot; data-end=&quot;2817&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2705&quot; data-end=&quot;2730&quot;&gt;ETL, Data Engineering&lt;/strong&gt;: Experience with ETL processes and data engineering practices (Proficiency Level: E1).&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2818&quot; data-end=&quot;2964&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2820&quot; data-end=&quot;2964&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2820&quot; data-end=&quot;2850&quot;&gt;Restful APIs &amp;amp; API Gateway&lt;/strong&gt;: Experience in developing and maintaining RESTful APIs, and working with AWS API Gateway (Proficiency Level: E1).&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;2971&quot; data-end=&quot;3000&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2975&quot; data-end=&quot;2999&quot;&gt;Desired Competencies&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;h4 data-start=&quot;3002&quot; data-end=&quot;3021&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3007&quot; data-end=&quot;3020&quot;&gt;Must-Have&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/h4&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;3022&quot; data-end=&quot;3605&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;3022&quot; data-end=&quot;3138&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;3024&quot; data-end=&quot;3138&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3024&quot; data-end=&quot;3049&quot;&gt;Hands-on AWS Services&lt;/strong&gt;: Practical experience working with AWS services such as Lambda, Fargate, S3, and others.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;