ry&lt;/strong&gt;: Attractive pay package based on experience and skills.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;193&quot; data-end=&quot;272&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;195&quot; data-end=&quot;272&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;195&quot; data-end=&quot;216&quot;&gt;Health &amp;amp; Wellness&lt;/strong&gt;: Comprehensive medical insurance and wellness programs.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;273&quot; data-end=&quot;358&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;275&quot; data-end=&quot;358&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;275&quot; data-end=&quot;302&quot;&gt;Remote Work Flexibility&lt;/strong&gt;: Option to work from any location (remote flexibility).&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;359&quot; data-end=&quot;457&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;361&quot; data-end=&quot;457&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;361&quot; data-end=&quot;387&quot;&gt;Learning &amp;amp; Development&lt;/strong&gt;: Opportunities for continuous learning, training, and certifications.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;458&quot; data-end=&quot;534&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;460&quot; data-end=&quot;534&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;460&quot; data-end=&quot;477&quot;&gt;Career Growth&lt;/strong&gt;: Clear path for career progression and leadership roles.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;535&quot; data-end=&quot;641&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;537&quot; data-end=&quot;641&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;537&quot; data-end=&quot;558&quot;&gt;Work-Life Balance&lt;/strong&gt;: Flexible working hours and paid time off to maintain a healthy work-life balance.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Maharashtra'),('449ad1f0-a10f-44f0-9f52-d6a2ed1c0437','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','AWS DevOps Engineer','aws-devops-engineer-13-13','&lt;p data-start=&quot;413&quot; data-end=&quot;854&quot;&gt;We are seeking a skilled and experienced&nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;454&quot; data-end=&quot;477&quot;&gt;AWS DevOps Engineer&lt;/strong&gt;&nbsp;with&nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;483&quot; data-end=&quot;518&quot;&gt;3+ years of hands-on experience&lt;/strong&gt;&nbsp;to join our team. The ideal candidate will be responsible for&nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;581&quot; data-end=&quot;642&quot;&gt;building, deploying, and maintaining cloud infrastructure&lt;/strong&gt;&nbsp;on&nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;646&quot; data-end=&quot;653&quot;&gt;AWS&lt;/strong&gt;&nbsp;using&nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;660&quot; data-end=&quot;680&quot;&gt;DevOps practices&lt;/strong&gt;. You will collaborate with development, operations, and security teams to&nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;755&quot; data-end=&quot;851&quot;&gt;automate processes, implement CI/CD pipelines, and ensure system reliability and scalability&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;861&quot; data-end=&quot;892&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;865&quot; data-end=&quot;890&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;413&quot; data-end=&quot;854&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;893&quot; data-end=&quot;1995&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;893&quot; data-end=&quot;997&quot;&gt;Design, implement, and maintain&nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;927&quot; data-end=&quot;955&quot;&gt;AWS cloud infrastructure&lt;/strong&gt;&nbsp;using&nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;962&quot; data-end=&quot;994&quot;&gt;Infrastructure as Code (IaC)&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;998&quot; data-end=&quot;1121&quot;&gt;Develop and manage&nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1019&quot; data-end=&quot;1038&quot;&gt;CI/CD pipelines&lt;/strong&gt;&nbsp;using tools like&nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1056&quot; data-end=&quot;1118&quot;&gt;Jenkins, GitLab CI/CD, GitHub Actions, or AWS CodePipeline&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1122&quot; data-end=&quot;1234&quot;&gt;Automate deployment and infrastructure management processes using&nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1190&quot; data-end=&quot;1231&quot;&gt;Terraform, CloudFormation, or Ansible&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1235&quot; data-end=&quot;1313&quot;&gt;Ensure&nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1244&quot; data-end=&quot;1292&quot;&gt;high availability, scalability, and security&lt;/strong&gt;&nbsp;of cloud services.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1314&quot; data-end=&quot;1390&quot;&gt;Monitor and optimize&nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1337&quot; data-end=&quot;1354&quot;&gt;AWS resources&lt;/strong&gt;&nbsp;(EC2, S3, RDS, Lambda, ECS, EKS).&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1391&quot; data-end=&quot;1477&quot;&gt;Troubleshoot and resolve&nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1418&quot; data-end=&quot;1443&quot;&gt;infrastructure issues&lt;/strong&gt;&nbsp;to maintain system reliability.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1478&quot; data-end=&quot;1566&quot;&gt;Implement and manage&nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1501&quot; data-end=&quot;1531&quot;&gt;containerized applications&lt;/strong&gt;&nbsp;using&nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1538&quot; data-end=&quot;1563&quot;&gt;Docker and Kubernetes&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1567&quot; data-end=&quot;1641&quot;&gt;Configure and manage&nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1590&quot; data-end=&quot;1638&quot;&gt;AWS IAM roles, policies, and security groups&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1642&quot; data-end=&quot;1743&quot;&gt;Perform&nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1652&quot; data-end=&quot;1685&quot;&gt;log management and monitoring&lt;/strong&gt;&nbsp;using&nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1692&quot; data-end=&quot;1740&quot;&gt;CloudWatch, ELK Stack, or Prometheus/Grafana&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1744&quot; data-end=&quot;1833&quot;&gt;Collaborate with developers to ensure&nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1784&quot; data-end=&quot;1804&quot;&gt;code deployments&lt;/strong&gt;&nbsp;and releases are seamless.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1834&quot; data-end=&quot;1922&quot;&gt;Write and maintain&nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1855&quot; data-end=&quot;1881&quot;&gt;scripts for automation&lt;/strong&gt;&nbsp;using&nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1888&quot; data-end=&quot;1919&quot;&gt;Python, Bash, or PowerShell&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1923&quot; data-end=&quot;1995&quot;&gt;Ensure&nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1932&quot; data-end=&quot;1953&quot;&gt;cost optimization&lt;/strong&gt;&nbsp;and compliance with AWS best practices.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1923&quot; data-end=&quot;1995&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;2002&quot; data-end=&quot;2028&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2006&quot; data-end=&quot;2026&quot;&gt;Required Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2029&quot; data-end=&quot;2797&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2029&quot; data-end=&quot;2110&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2031&quot; data-end=&quot;2043&quot;&gt;3+ years&lt;/strong&gt;&nbsp;of experience in&nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2061&quot; data-end=&quot;2083&quot;&gt;DevOps engineering&lt;/strong&gt;&nbsp;with a focus on&nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2100&quot; data-end=&quot;2107&quot;&gt;AWS&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2111&quot; data-end=&quot;2213&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience with&nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2138&quot; data-end=&quot;2154&quot;&gt;AWS services&lt;/strong&gt;&nbsp;(EC2, S3, RDS, Lambda, IAM, CloudFront, CloudFormation).&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2214&quot; data-end=&quot;2276&quot;&gt;Proficiency in&nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2231&quot; data-end=&quot;2273&quot;&gt;CI/CD pipeline creation and management&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2277&quot; data-end=&quot;2364&quot;&gt;Experience with&nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2295&quot; data-end=&quot;2327&quot;&gt;Infrastructure as Code (IaC)&lt;/strong&gt;&nbsp;tools (Terraform, CloudFormation).&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2365&quot; data-end=&quot;2451&quot;&gt;Strong skills in&nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2384&quot; data-end=&quot;2404&quot;&gt;containerization&lt;/strong&gt;&nbsp;(Docker) and&nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2418&quot; data-end=&quot;2435&quot;&gt;orchestration&lt;/strong&gt;&nbsp;(Kubernetes).&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2452&quot; data-end=&quot;2535&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience with&nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2479&quot; data-end=&quot;2502&quot;&gt;scripting languages&lt;/strong&gt;&nbsp;(Python, Bash, or PowerShell).&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2536&quot; data-end=&quot;2614&quot;&gt;Familiarity with&nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2555&quot; data-end=&quot;2575&quot;&gt;monitoring tools&lt;/strong&gt;&nbsp;(CloudWatch, Prometheus, ELK Stack).&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2615&quot; data-end=&quot;2691&quot;&gt;Experience with&nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2633&quot; data-end=&quot;2660&quot;&gt;version control systems&lt;/strong&gt;&nbsp;(Git, GitLab, or Bitbucket).&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2692&quot; data-end=&quot;2740&quot;&gt;Strong problem-solving and debugging skills.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2741&quot; data-end=&quot;2797&quot;&gt;Familiarity with&nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2760&quot; data-end=&quot;2794&quot;&gt;Agile and DevOps methodologies&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',250000.00,500000.00,'₹',1,'India','Hyderabad',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-31 06:00:00',0,0,'2025-05-04 19:09:47.000000','2026-05-12 14:51:53.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Agile\", \"AWS\", \"AWS Certified Networking\", \"AWS Cloud Engineer\", \"AWS CodeBuild\", \"AWS CodeCommit\", \"AWS CodePipeline\", \"AWS Data Pipeline\", \"AWS DevOps\", \"AWS Marketplace\", \"AWS Organizations\", \"AWS Systems Manager\", \"DevOps\", \"Scripting\"]','[\"&lt;ul data-start=&quot;3452&quot; data-end=&quot;3714&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;3452&quot; data-end=&quot;3505&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and performance-based bonuses.&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;3506&quot; data-end=&quot;3545&quot;&gt;Health insurance and paid time off.&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;3546&quot; data-end=&quot;3596&quot;&gt;Flexible work hours and remote/hybrid options.&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;3597&quot; data-end=&quot;3658&quot;&gt;Professional development and certification reimbursement.&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;3659&quot; data-end=&quot;3714&quot;&gt;Collaborative and growth-oriented work environment.&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Telangana'),('44e2e078-3561-4c68-a05b-41322b8bfc41','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Full Stack Developer','full-stack-developer-290-290','&lt;p data-start=&quot;62&quot; data-end=&quot;363&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced Full Stack Developers for a leading Top MNC to work on enterprise-grade web applications, APIs, and digital transformation projects. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in React JS, C#, .NET technologies, SQL Server, and modern application development practices.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;365&quot; data-end=&quot;691&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for designing, developing, and maintaining scalable front-end and back-end applications. The role includes building responsive user interfaces using React JS, developing robust APIs and backend services using C#, .NET, and .NET Core, and ensuring high application performance and reliability.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;693&quot; data-end=&quot;982&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with Web APIs, REST APIs, SQL Server, Microservices architecture, and messaging platforms such as Active MQ. Strong knowledge of application design, database optimization, debugging, and software development best practices is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;984&quot; data-end=&quot;1347&quot;&gt;The role also involves troubleshooting complex application issues, optimizing backend performance, collaborating with Product Owners and business stakeholders, and contributing to development and enhancement projects. Candidates should possess strong analytical, problem-solving, and communication skills with the ability to work in fast-paced Agile environments.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-08-08 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-06-10 02:24:06.000000','2026-06-10 02:24:06.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\".NET\", \".NET CORE\", \"ActiveMQ\", \"Agile\", \"API Integration\", \"Backend Development\", \"C#\", \"Debugging Skills\", \"Frontend Development\", \"Full Stack Development\", \"React JS\", \"RESTFUL APIS\", \"SQL Query Optimization\", \"SQL Server\", \"Web API\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1363&quot; data-end=&quot;1401&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;pwpeen&quot; data-start=&quot;1402&quot; data-end=&quot;1467&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale application development projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1hyzd6b&quot; data-start=&quot;1468&quot; data-end=&quot;1529&quot;&gt;Work on modern Full Stack and Microservices architectures&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;17b139y&quot; data-start=&quot;1530&quot; data-end=&quot;1598&quot;&gt;Career growth in Software Development &amp;amp; Digital Solutions domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;14c1c93&quot; data-start=&quot;1599&quot; data-end=&quot;1664&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global teams and stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot; data-start=&quot;1665&quot; data-end=&quot;1720&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;1721&quot; data-end=&quot;1764&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('451c3a87-e22b-499c-9ff5-4f2f34e5a006','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Business Analyst with SQL – Insurance Domain','business-analyst-with-sql-insurance-domain-66-66','&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;537&quot; data-end=&quot;555&quot;&gt;Role Overview:&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;556&quot; data-end=&quot;837&quot;&gt;As a Business Analyst, you will be responsible for requirement gathering, data analysis, and preparing solution documents while working closely with clients and internal stakeholders. If you enjoy transforming business needs into clear technical requirements, this role is for you.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;839&quot; data-end=&quot;864&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;865&quot; data-end=&quot;1345&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;865&quot; data-end=&quot;950&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;867&quot; data-end=&quot;950&quot;&gt;Lead &lt;strong data-start=&quot;872&quot; data-end=&quot;915&quot;&gt;requirement analysis and data gathering&lt;/strong&gt; with regular customer interaction.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;951&quot; data-end=&quot;1045&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;953&quot; data-end=&quot;1045&quot;&gt;Perform &lt;strong data-start=&quot;961&quot; data-end=&quot;978&quot;&gt;data analysis&lt;/strong&gt; across databases and prepare &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1008&quot; data-end=&quot;1023&quot;&gt;data models&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1028&quot; data-end=&quot;1044&quot;&gt;data mapping&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1046&quot; data-end=&quot;1156&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1048&quot; data-end=&quot;1156&quot;&gt;Create &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1055&quot; data-end=&quot;1096&quot;&gt;Business Requirement Documents (BRDs)&lt;/strong&gt; including use cases, solution approach, and detailed flows.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1157&quot; data-end=&quot;1264&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1159&quot; data-end=&quot;1264&quot;&gt;Collaborate with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1176&quot; data-end=&quot;1225&quot;&gt;SMEs, Product Owners, and Solution Architects&lt;/strong&gt; to align business and technical goals.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1265&quot; data-end=&quot;1345&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1267&quot; data-end=&quot;1345&quot;&gt;Work in an &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1278&quot; data-end=&quot;1299&quot;&gt;agile environment&lt;/strong&gt; and manage communication across stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;1347&quot; data-end=&quot;1368&quot;&gt;Must-Have Skills:&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1369&quot; data-end=&quot;1716&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1369&quot; data-end=&quot;1448&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1371&quot; data-end=&quot;1448&quot;&gt;6+ years of Business Analysis experience with strong hands-on &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1433&quot; data-end=&quot;1447&quot;&gt;SQL skills&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1449&quot; data-end=&quot;1539&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1451&quot; data-end=&quot;1539&quot;&gt;Strong understanding of &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1475&quot; data-end=&quot;1492&quot;&gt;data modeling&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1494&quot; data-end=&quot;1510&quot;&gt;data mapping&lt;/strong&gt;, and business process flows.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1540&quot; data-end=&quot;1609&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1542&quot; data-end=&quot;1609&quot;&gt;Experience in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1556&quot; data-end=&quot;1576&quot;&gt;Insurance domain&lt;/strong&gt; (functional knowledge required).&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1610&quot; data-end=&quot;1664&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1612&quot; data-end=&quot;1664&quot;&gt;Ability to engage both business and technical teams.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1665&quot; data-end=&quot;1716&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1667&quot; data-end=&quot;1716&quot;&gt;Excellent documentation and communication skills.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;1718&quot; data-end=&quot;1735&quot;&gt;Good-to-Have:&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1736&quot; data-end=&quot;1862&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1736&quot; data-end=&quot;1773&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1738&quot; data-end=&quot;1773&quot;&gt;Experience with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1754&quot; data-end=&quot;1772&quot;&gt;Data Migration&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1774&quot; data-end=&quot;1808&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1776&quot; data-end=&quot;1808&quot;&gt;Insurance domain certifications.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1809&quot; data-end=&quot;1862&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1811&quot; data-end=&quot;1862&quot;&gt;Exposure to &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1823&quot; data-end=&quot;1845&quot;&gt;Actuarial concepts&lt;/strong&gt; or &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1849&quot; data-end=&quot;1861&quot;&gt;Power BI&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',500000.00,2500000.00,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-19 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-07-01 11:44:49.000000','2025-11-21 04:56:18.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Business Analyst\", \"Data Modeling\", \"Insurance\", \"Mapping\", \