04-03 21:39:35.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Angular\", \"AWS\", \"Azure SQL Database\", \"Consuming REST API Services\", \"Docker\", \"Python\", \"React\", \"Snowflake\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;Competitive salary package with performance-based incentives&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;65&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;67&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;Health insurance coverage and statutory benefits (PF &amp;amp; Gratuity)&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;134&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;136&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on large-scale enterprise energy management projects&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;211&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;213&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;Strong career growth and learning opportunities&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;263&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;265&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;Collaborative and professional work environment&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('4554fcd9-2e2e-4d6f-9755-c4ae7d0040de','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Full Stack Software Engineer','full-stack-software-engineer-370-370','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;66&quot; data-end=&quot;361&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;92&quot; data-end=&quot;125&quot;&gt;Full Stack Software Engineers&lt;/strong&gt; for a leading MNC with opportunities in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;166&quot; data-end=&quot;186&quot;&gt;Bangalore / Pune&lt;/strong&gt;. The ideal candidate should have strong hands-on expertise in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;249&quot; data-end=&quot;360&quot;&gt;Java, Spring Boot, Microservices, Angular, REST APIs, Azure Cloud, CI/CD, DevOps, and database technologies&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;363&quot; data-end=&quot;610&quot;&gt;The role involves developing scalable full-stack applications, designing and implementing backend and frontend solutions, building RESTful microservices, working with Azure cloud resources, and contributing to architecture and technical decisions.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;612&quot; data-end=&quot;836&quot;&gt;The candidate will work closely with multidisciplinary teams across &lt;strong data-start=&quot;680&quot; data-end=&quot;762&quot;&gt;engineering, operations, cybersecurity, automation, and digital transformation&lt;/strong&gt; to deliver secure, scalable, and high-performing enterprise applications.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-25 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-08-27 02:39:53.000000','2026-08-27 02:39:53.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Angular\", \"API Integration\", \"Azure Cloud Networking\", \"DevOps\", \"Github\", \"Java\", \"Microservices Architectures\", \"REST API\", \"Spring Boot\", \"SonarQube\", \"CI/CD\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;851&quot; data-end=&quot;898&quot; data-section-id=&quot;rdheb3&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a leading global MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;899&quot; data-end=&quot;975&quot; data-section-id=&quot;wv7j07&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale &lt;strong data-start=&quot;930&quot; data-end=&quot;975&quot;&gt;cloud and digital transformation projects&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;976&quot; data-end=&quot;1059&quot; data-section-id=&quot;3bjg6i&quot;&gt;Work with modern technologies including &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1018&quot; data-end=&quot;1059&quot;&gt;Java, Spring Boot, Angular, and Azure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1060&quot; data-end=&quot;1123&quot; data-section-id=&quot;sclcb3&quot;&gt;Opportunity to contribute to architecture and solution design&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1124&quot; data-end=&quot;1185&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1br1c3e&quot;&gt;Exposure to DevOps, CI/CD, monitoring, and cloud deployment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1186&quot; data-end=&quot;1253&quot; data-section-id=&quot;xvaclq&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with emerging &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1222&quot; data-end=&quot;1253&quot;&gt;AI development accelerators&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1254&quot; data-end=&quot;1305&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1rt07v0&quot;&gt;Collaboration with multidisciplinary global teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1306&quot; data-end=&quot;1372&quot; data-section-id=&quot;oc64q0&quot;&gt;Career growth across software engineering and cloud technologies&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1373&quot; data-end=&quot;1457&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1me3ktf&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on performance, scalability, and cost optimization initiatives&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('45a90440-27a0-4292-b61c-69729c04a603','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Systems Engineer – MES','systems-engineer-mes-338-338','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;64&quot; data-end=&quot;455&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced Systems Engineers &amp;ndash; MES for a leading Top MNC to support enterprise-scale Manufacturing Execution System (MES), Manufacturing Operations Management (MOM), and Smart Manufacturing initiatives. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in Dassault DELMIA Apriso MES, enterprise system integration, manufacturing automation, and digital transformation projects.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;457&quot; data-end=&quot;873&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for designing, configuring, implementing, and supporting Dassault DELMIA Apriso MES solutions across manufacturing facilities. The role includes developing MES applications, configuring manufacturing workflows, integrating MES with enterprise and shop-floor systems, commissioning equipment interfaces, troubleshooting production issues, and driving continuous process improvements.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;875&quot; data-end=&quot;1271&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with DELMIA Apriso MES, C# programming, SQL databases, Manufacturing Execution Systems (MES), Manufacturing Operations Management (MOM), ISA-95, ISA-88 standards, and enterprise application integration. Strong understanding of ERP, PLM, WMS, LIMS, QMS, SCADA, WCS, Industrial IoT, automation systems, and manufacturing operations is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1273&quot; data-end=&quot;1723&quot;&gt;The role also involves collaborating with engineering, automation, manufacturing, and IT teams to deliver scalable MES solutions, conduct technical workshops, prepare system documentation, provide end-user training, and support enterprise digital manufacturing initiatives. Candidates should possess strong analytical, communication, stakeholder management, leadership, and problem-solving skills with experience in global manufacturing environments.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Ahmedabad',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-09-13 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-07-16 02:12:26.000000','2026-07-16 02:12:26.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"C#\", \"ERP\", \"Lims\", \"Mes\", \"Mes Compliance\", \"Mes Configuration\", \"MES Development\", \"Microsoft SQL Server\", \"Mom Systems\", \"PLM Software (Product Lifecycle Management)\", \"SCADA\", \"SQL\", \"ISA-95\", \"ISA-88\", \"Dassault DELMIA Apriso MES\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1739&quot; da