 data-start=&quot;257&quot; data-end=&quot;286&quot;&gt;Wonderware SCADA Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; to design, develop, troubleshoot, and support industrial automation and SCADA systems across manufacturing environments. The role involves PLC programming, SCADA configuration, system optimization, and close collaboration with HMI and automation teams to deliver reliable and fault-tolerant control solutions.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;hr data-start=&quot;598&quot; data-end=&quot;601&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;603&quot; data-end=&quot;630&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;606&quot; data-end=&quot;630&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;631&quot; data-end=&quot;1365&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;631&quot; data-end=&quot;721&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;633&quot; data-end=&quot;721&quot;&gt;Develop, configure, and maintain &lt;strong data-start=&quot;666&quot; data-end=&quot;719&quot;&gt;Wonderware SCADA and System Platform applications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;722&quot; data-end=&quot;796&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;724&quot; data-end=&quot;796&quot;&gt;Program and troubleshoot &lt;strong data-start=&quot;749&quot; data-end=&quot;757&quot;&gt;PLCs&lt;/strong&gt; (Mitsubishi, Siemens, Allen-Bradley)&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;797&quot; data-end=&quot;876&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;799&quot; data-end=&quot;876&quot;&gt;Diagnose and resolve issues in existing &lt;strong data-start=&quot;839&quot; data-end=&quot;874&quot;&gt;PLC, SCADA, and control systems&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;877&quot; data-end=&quot;957&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;879&quot; data-end=&quot;957&quot;&gt;Configure and manage industrial communication protocols and control networks&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;958&quot; data-end=&quot;1056&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;960&quot; data-end=&quot;1056&quot;&gt;Work closely with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;978&quot; data-end=&quot;1014&quot;&gt;HMI design and development teams&lt;/strong&gt; to optimize usability and data exchange&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1057&quot; data-end=&quot;1145&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1059&quot; data-end=&quot;1145&quot;&gt;Design &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1066&quot; data-end=&quot;1103&quot;&gt;fault-tolerant automation systems&lt;/strong&gt; with robust error handling and recovery&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1146&quot; data-end=&quot;1219&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1148&quot; data-end=&quot;1219&quot;&gt;Implement &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1158&quot; data-end=&quot;1217&quot;&gt;state machines, data acquisition, and PID control logic&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1220&quot; data-end=&quot;1294&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1222&quot; data-end=&quot;1294&quot;&gt;Ensure adherence to industrial automation standards and best practices&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1295&quot; data-end=&quot;1365&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1297&quot; data-end=&quot;1365&quot;&gt;Support customer requirement gathering and solution implementation&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-03-23 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-01-22 22:00:44.000000','2026-01-22 22:00:45.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"AvevaWonderware\", \"Industrial Automation\", \"MS SQL Server\", \"PLC Programming\", \"SCADA\", \"Siemens\", \"Ethernet\", \"Mitsubishi\", \"Allen-Bradley\", \"ArchestrA\", \"Fieldbus\", \"VB Scripting\", \"Wonderware OMI\", \"Skelta\"]','[\"&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2198&quot; data-end=&quot;2526&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2198&quot; data-end=&quot;2271&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2200&quot; data-end=&quot;2271&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2223&quot; data-end=&quot;2269&quot;&gt;large-scale industrial automation projects&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2272&quot; data-end=&quot;2341&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2274&quot; data-end=&quot;2341&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2299&quot; data-end=&quot;2339&quot;&gt;Wonderware and leading PLC platforms&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2342&quot; data-end=&quot;2407&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2344&quot; data-end=&quot;2407&quot;&gt;Exposure to diverse manufacturing and industrial environments&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2408&quot; data-end=&quot;2472&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2410&quot; data-end=&quot;2472&quot;&gt;Career growth in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2427&quot; data-end=&quot;2470&quot;&gt;SCADA, MES, and automation technologies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2473&quot; data-end=&quot;2526&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2475&quot; data-end=&quot;2526&quot;&gt;Collaborative, technology-driven work environment&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('462371af-0f19-467d-852b-8037c2a4bdbb','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Digital Tech Lead – Industrial IT/OT Architect','digital-tech-lead-industrial-itot-architect-271-271','&lt;p data-start=&quot;88&quot; data-end=&quot;370&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced professionals for the role of Digital Tech Lead &amp;ndash; Industrial IT/OT Architect with a leading Top MNC. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in Industrial Digital Transformation, Manufacturing IT solutions, and enterprise-level IT/OT architecture.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;372&quot; data-end=&quot;755&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for leading Digital Factory initiatives, managing manufacturing technology platforms, and driving enterprise-wide industrial digital solutions. The role includes designing and implementing Industrial Information Systems, ensuring architecture consistency across manufacturing applications, and supporting large-scale digital transformation programs.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;757&quot; data-end=&quot;1068&quot;&gt;Professionals should have strong exposure to MES, SCADA, IIoT platforms, enterprise integration, and manufacturing automation systems. The role also requires collaboration with global IT, Engineering, Operations, and business stakeholders to deliver scalable and standardized manufacturing technology solutions.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1070&quot; data-end=&quot;1353&quot;&gt;The selected candidate will lead technical discussions, manage Agile project delivery, oversee quality and support frameworks, and mentor cross-functional teams. Strong leadership, analytical thinking, communication, and stakeholder management skills are essential for this position.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-07-12 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-05-14 03:29:31.000000','2026-05-14 03:29:31.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Automation\", \"Digital Transformation\", \"Documentation\", \"IOT\", \"Mes\", \"SCADA\", \"Industrial IT/OT\", \"Manufacturing Digital Platforms\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1369&quot; data-end=&quot;1407&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;fzquuh&quot; data-start=&quot;1408&quot; data-end=&quot;1465&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise digital manufacturing projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j1ar82&quot; data-start=&quot;1466&quot; data-end=&quot;1532&quot;&gt;Leadership role in Industrial IT/OT transformation initiatives&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;12ibx50&quot; data-start=&quot;1533&quot; data-end=&quot;1581&quot;&gt;Work on advanced MES, SCADA &amp;amp; IIoT platforms&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;14c1c93&quot; data-start=&quot;1582&quot; data-end=&quot;1647&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global teams and stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;jsmwv4&quot; data-start=&quot;1648&quot; data-end=&quot;1716&quot;&gt;Career growth in Digital Manufacturing &amp;amp; Enterprise Architecture&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot; data-start=&quot;1717&quot; data-end=&quot;1772&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;1773&quot; data-end=&quot;1816&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('46354e39-e496-44d3-a7f7-24a3134127c8','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','DotNet WPF Developers','dotnet-wpf-developers-2-2','DotNet WPF Developers','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',250000.00,550000.00,'₹',1,'India','Mumbai',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2025-07-02 18:30:00',0,0,'2025-05-04 16:05:43.000000','2025-05-04 16:05:43.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Accounting & Taxation\", \"Aircraft Monitoring\", \"AnyLogic\", \"Architecture\", \"Brownfield\", \"Chemical Compatibility\", \"Diagnostic Systems\"]','[]','No Preference',1,5,'Maharashtra'),('466e8b8e-8cb5-4833-b48e-2b08ab2a77a4','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','MES Camstar Developer – Siemens Opcenter Core','mes-camstar-developer-siemens-opcenter-core-358-358','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;87&quot; data-end=&quot;481&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;113&quot; data-end=&quot;139&quot;&gt;MES Camstar Developers&lt;/strong&gt; for a leading Top MNC to work on enterprise-scale Manufacturing Execution System (MES) projects across the &lt;strong data-start=&quot;247&quot; data-end=&quot;285&quot;&gt;Pharmaceutical and Medical Devices&lt;/strong&gt; manufacturing domain. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in Siemens Opcenter Core / Camstar, MES implementation, manufacturing workflows, system integration, and production support.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;483&quot; data-end=&quot;880&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for designing, developing, configuring, customizing, and supporting Siemens Opcenter Core (Camstar) solutions across manufacturing sites. The role includes developing CIO/MIO Maps and workflows, implementing Factory Models, supporting Camstar upgrades, resolving production incidents, and delivering scalable MES solutions aligned with manufacturing requirements.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;882&quot; data-end=&quot;1302&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;933&quot; data-end=&quot;1146&quot;&gt;Siemens Opcenter Core / Camstar Designer, Camstar Portal Development, CIO/MIO Maps, workflow development, MES implementation, Factory Model development, Azure Kubernetes, SQL, and enterprise system integration&lt;/strong&gt;. Strong knowledge of ERP, LIMS, equipment, HMI integration, manufacturing validation, and regulated Pharma/Medical Device environments is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-10 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-08-12 03:19:10.000000','2026-08-12 03:19:10.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Azure Kubernetes Service\", \"Camstar\", \"Camstar Designer\", \"ERP Integration\", \"Incident Reporting\", \"Kubernetes\", \"Mes\", \"PLC\", \"REST API\", \"REST Webservices\", \"SCADA\", \"Siemens Opcenter\", \"SQL\", \"HMI\", \"CI/CD\", \"OPC UA\", \"LIMS Integration\", \"CIO Workflow Development\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1760&quot; data-end=&quot;1798&quot; data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1799&quot; data-end=&quot;1871&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1qh1jlj&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale Siemens Opcenter / Camstar MES projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1872&quot; data-end=&quot;1950&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1dkpqg9&quot;&gt;Work on Pharma and Medical Device manufacturing transformation initiatives&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1951&quot; data-end=&quot;2020&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1b01j63&quot;&gt;Career growth in MES, Manufacturing IT, and Digital Manufacturing&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2021&quot; data-end=&quot;2098&quot; data-section-id=&quot;13qji02&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global manufacturing and technology teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2099&quot; data-end=&quot;2166&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1opagvv&quot;&gt;Exposure to regulated manufacturing and validation environments&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2167&quot; data-end=&quot;2222&quot; data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2223&quot; data-end=&quot;2291&quot; data-section-id=&quot;ty38as&quot;&gt;Opportunity to lead technical activities and mentor team members&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('46949dd3-f5a1-4bd1-9ff6-3214e4de9a22','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','CM Senior Developer – Back End','cm-senior-developer-back-end-367-367','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;68&quot; data-end=&quot;257&quot;&gt;We are hiring an experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;97&quot; data-end=&quot;131&quot;&gt;CM Senior Developer &amp;ndash; Back End&lt;/strong&gt; for a leading MNC to work on advanced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;170&quot; data-end=&quot;256&quot;&gt;Manufacturing Execution System (MES) and Advanced Manufacturing software solutions&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;259&quot; data-end=&quot;464&quot;&gt;The ideal candidate should have strong hands-on expertise in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;320&quot; data-end=&quot;400&quot;&gt;C# / .NET Core, Object-Oriented Programming, relational databases, and T-SQL&lt;/strong&gt;, along with prior experience working with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;443&quot; data-end=&quot;463&quot;&gt;MES applications&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;466&quot; data-end=&quot;770&quot;&gt;The role involves designing, developing, enhancing, and extending enterprise-grade manufacturing software solutions. The candidate will contribute to &lt;strong data-start=&quot;616&quot; data-end=&quot;726&quot;&gt;technical architecture, solution design, code quality, performance optimization, and innovative approaches&lt;/strong&gt; to complex software engineering challenges.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;772&quot; data-end=&quot;938&quot;&gt;This is an excellent opportunity for professionals who want to work on modern manufacturing technology and contribute to large-scale &lt;strong data-start=&quot;905&quot; data-end=&quot;927&quot;&gt;MES / Industry 4.0&lt;/strong&gt; solutions.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Pune',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-23 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-08-25 02:43:15.000000','2026-08-25 02:43:15.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\".NET CORE\", \"Backend Development\", \"C#\", \"Mes\", \"OOPS\", \"SQL Server\", \"Transact-SQL(T-SQL)\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;rdheb3&quot; data-start=&quot;953&quot; data-end=&quot;1000&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a leading global MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;9wttd1&quot; data-start=&quot;1001&quot; data-end=&quot;1064&quot;&gt;Work on advanced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1020&quot; data-end=&quot;1064&quot;&gt;MES and manufacturing software platforms&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;8ov67w&quot; data-start=&quot;1065&quot; data-end=&quot;1123&quot;&gt;Exposure to large-scale Advanced Manufacturing solutions&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1dfdc4c&quot; data-start=&quot;1124&quot; data-end=&quot;1197&quot;&gt;Opportunity to contribute to technical architecture and solution design&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1vascov&quot; data-start=&quot;1198&quot; data-end=&quot;1288&quot;&gt;Exposure to modern technologies including &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1242&quot; data-end=&quot;1288&quot;&gt;.NET Core, Docker, Kubernetes, and Angular&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1lqoeyn&quot; data-start=&quot;1289&quot; data-end=&quot;1344&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work in Agile development environments&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;115w72b&quot; data-start=&quot;1345&quot; data-end=&quot;1402&quot;&gt;Collaboration with experienced global engineering teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ff7r0g&quot; data-start=&quot;1403&quot; data-end=&quot;1462&quot;&gt;Career growth toward &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1426&quot; data-end=&quot;1456&quot;&gt;Technical Lead / Architect&lt;/strong&gt; roles&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;m52ttp&quot; data-start=&quot;1463&quot; data-end=&quot;1545&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on innovative Industry 4.0 and smart manufacturing solutions&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Maharashtra'),('47009c8f-68f5-4cf9-85d6-830a53d8c07d','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Online Product Sales Executive','online-product-sales-executive-19-19','Job Description: We are looking for a skilled and proactive Online Product Sales Executive with 3+ years of experience to drive product sales through online platforms. The ideal candidate will be responsible for managing product listings, optimizing online sales strategies, and ensuring customer satisfaction. Key Responsibilities: Manage and optimize product listings on e-commerce platforms (Amazon, Flipkart, Shopify, etc.). Develop and implement online sales strategies to meet revenue targets. Monitor and analyze online sales performance and customer trends. Handle customer inquiries, complaints, and order fulfillment efficiently. Collaborate with the marketing team for promotions and ad campaigns. Negotiate and manage partnerships with online distributors. Ensure accurate and timely product information updates across platforms. Generate sales reports and recommend strategies for improvement. Key Skills: E-commerce sales management (Amazon, Flipkart, etc.) Online product listing and optimization Digital marketing and SEO knowledge Data analysis and reporting CRM and e-commerce tools proficiency Strong communication and negotiation skills Customer relationship management Ability to meet sales targets and deadlines','Sales','Contract','Mid',22000.00,40000.00,'₹',1,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2025-07-03 18:30:00',0,0,'2025-05-05 02:51:08.000000','2025-05-05 02:51:08.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Adaptability\", \"Circuit Breakers\", \"Content Creation for Talent Engagement\", \"Corporate Governance\", \"Digital Transformation\", \"eCommerce\"]','[\"Job Benefits: Competitive salary based on experience. Free meals during working hours. Paid time off and flexible working hours. Supportive and friendly work environment. Opportunity to showcase creativity through cooking. Potential for long-term employment.\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('471443b8-5d50-4d02-befb-80dfed7b7f4e','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Oracle Developer','oracle-developer-128-128','&lt;p data-start=&quot;194&quot; data-end=&quot;756&quot;&gt;We are hiring an experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;223&quot; data-end=&quot;243&quot;&gt;Oracle Developer&lt;/strong&gt; to join a top MNC and work on enterprise-level applications. The ideal candidate will have strong hands-on expertise in Oracle Database 19c+, PL/SQL development, SQL performance tuning, and integration with Manufacturing Execution Systems (MES). You will be responsible for designing scalable database solutions, optimizing queries, performing data migration, and collaborating with cross-functional teams in an Agile environment. Candidates with exposure to cloud DB services and DevOps tools will be preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;hr data-start=&quot;758&quot; data-end=&quot;761&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;763&quot; data-end=&quot;792&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;766&quot; data-end=&quot;792&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;793&quot; data-end=&quot;1599&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;793&quot; data-end=&quot;887&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;795&quot; data-end=&quot;887&quot;&gt;Develop and optimize &lt;strong data-start=&quot;816&quot; data-end=&quot;831&quot;&gt;PL/SQL code&lt;/strong&gt;, stored procedures, triggers, and complex SQL queries&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;888&quot; data-end=&quot;984&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;890&quot; data-end=&quot;984&quot;&gt;Work on &lt;strong data-start=&quot;898&quot; data-end=&quot;922&quot;&gt;Oracle Database 19c+&lt;/strong&gt; including performance tuning, normalization &amp;amp; schema design&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;985&quot; data-end=&quot;1064&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;987&quot; data-end=&quot;1064&quot;&gt;Integrate database workflows with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1021&quot; data-end=&quot;1062&quot;&gt;MES (Manufacturing Execution Systems)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1065&quot; data-end=&quot;1133&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1067&quot; data-end=&quot;1133&quot;&gt;Participate in the full &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1091&quot; data-end=&quot;1099&quot;&gt;SDLC&lt;/strong&gt; using Agile/Scrum methodologies&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1134&quot; data-end=&quot;1192&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1136&quot; data-end=&quot;1192&quot;&gt;Perform &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1144&quot; data-end=&quot;1162&quot;&gt;data migration&lt;/strong&gt;, database backup &amp;amp; recovery&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1193&quot; data-end=&quot;1266&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1195&quot; data-end=&quot;1266&quot;&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional teams to deliver scalable solutions&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1267&quot; data-end=&quot;1315&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1269&quot; data-end=&quot;1315&quot;&gt;Work with version control tools like &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1306&quot; data-end=&quot;1313&quot;&gt;Git&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1316&quot; data-end=&quot;1386&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1318&quot; data-end=&quot;1386&quot;&gt;Implement CI/CD pipelines using &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1350&quot; data-end=&quot;1369&quot;&gt;Jenkins / Azure&lt;/strong&gt; (nice to have)&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1387&quot; data-end=&quot;1460&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1389&quot; data-end=&quot;1460&quot;&gt;Manage and support cloud-based databases (&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1431&quot; data-end=&quot;1457&quot;&gt;Oracle Cloud / AWS RDS&lt;/strong&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1461&quot; data-end=&quot;1521&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1463&quot; data-end=&quot;1521&quot;&gt;Write and execute &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1481&quot; data-end=&quot;1504&quot;&gt;Linux Shell scripts&lt;/strong&gt; for automation&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1522&quot; data-end=&quot;1599&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1524&quot; data-end=&quot;1599&quot;&gt;Maintain documentation and follow best practices for database development&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Full-time','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-19 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-11-21 05:30:15.000000','2025-11-21 05:30:15.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Agile\", \"DevOps\", \"Git\", \"Indexing\", \"Jenkins\", \"Linux\", \"MES Integration\", \"Oracle\", \"PL/SQL\", \"SDLC\", \"Shell Scripts\", \"SQL\", \"SQL Performance Tuning\", \"Stored Procedures\", \"Scrum Master\", \"Database Design\", \"Data Migration\", \"triggers\", \"normalization\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2234&quot; data-end=&quot;2305&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2236&quot; data-end=&quot;2305&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2263&quot; data-end=&quot;2274&quot;&gt;Top MNC&lt;/strong&gt; on enterprise-level projects&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2306&quot; data-end=&quot;2359&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2308&quot; data-end=&quot;2359&quot;&gt;Competitive salary with strong career advancement&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2360&quot; data-end=&quot;2433&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2362&quot; data-end=&quot;2433&quot;&gt;Work on cutting-edge &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2383&quot; data-end=&quot;2398&quot;&gt;Oracle 19c+&lt;/strong&gt; databases and cloud technologies&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2434&quot; data-end=&quot;2491&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2436&quot; data-end=&quot;2491&quot;&gt;Exposure to MES integration and advanced data systems&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2492&quot; data-end=&quot;2554&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2494&quot; data-end=&quot;2554&quot;&gt;Collaborative team culture and strong learning environment&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2555&quot; data-end=&quot;2596&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2557&quot; data-end=&quot;2596&quot;&gt;Access to modern DevOps &amp;amp; CI/CD tools&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2597&quot; data-end=&quot;2671&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2599&quot; data-end=&quot;2671&quot;&gt;Long-term career growth in Oracle development &amp;amp; cloud data engineering&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2672&quot; data-end=&quot;2739&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2674&quot; data-end=&quot;2739&quot;&gt;Stable and secure work environment with global project exposure&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('4715bb3a-1c91-4635-8930-51f164df35c3','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Governance, Risk & Compliance (GRC) Specialist','governance-risk-compliance-grc-specialist-185-185','We are seeking an experienced Governance, Risk &amp; Compliance (GRC) Specialist to lead cyber-risk governance and compliance activities across complex programs. The role focuses on risk register ownership, compliance mapping, audit readiness, and residual risk management, ensuring alignment with international security standards and customer governance frameworks.\r\nKey Responsibilities\r\nOwn and maintain the Cyber Risk Register across all project phases\r\nAuthor, update, and manage the Security Insurance Plan (SIP)\r\nBuild and maintain Compliance Traceability Matrices\r\nMap and validate controls against IEC 62443, IEC 62351, ISO 27002\r\nPrepare and manage audit and CERT evidence packs\r\nTrack remediation actions and log compensating controls\r\nDocument residual risks and facilitate formal risk acceptance and sign-off\r\nAlign governance activities with customer policies and RACI models\r\nCoordinate with OEM, Customer, and delivery teams on dependencies\r\nSupport FAT/SAT readiness from a compliance and governance perspective\r\nConduct periodic risk reviews, reporting, and steering committee updates\r\nMaintain document versioning, traceability, and approval workflows\r\nEscalate high-severity risks to governance boards and stakeholders\r\nSupport operations readiness and ongoing audit posture\r\nContribute to final security posture reviews and lessons-learned','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-04-10 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-02-09 18:00:30.000000','2026-02-09 18:00:30.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Cybersecurity\", \"IEC Standards\", \"Data Governance\", \"OEM\", \"IEC 62443\", \"IEC 62351\", \"RACI development\", \"SIP authoring\"]','[\"High-visibility role owning end-to-end cyber governance and compliance\\r\\nHands-on exposure to international cybersecurity standards\\r\\nWork closely with customer governance boards, OEMs, and delivery teams\\r\\nOpportunity to influence security posture and risk decisions\\r\\nStrong professional growth in OT / IT security governance and compliance\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('474e2254-752e-40ac-943a-f383b605796e','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Senior LabVIEW Developer','senior-labview-developer-369-369','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;95&quot; data-end=&quot;276&quot;&gt;We are hiring an experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;124&quot; data-end=&quot;145&quot;&gt;LabVIEW Developer&lt;/strong&gt; for a leading MNC to work on advanced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;184&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;Real-Time, Data Acquisition, Industrial Automation, and Test &amp;amp; Measurement&lt;/strong&gt; applications.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;278&quot; data-end=&quot;475&quot;&gt;The ideal candidate should have strong hands-on expertise in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;339&quot; data-end=&quot;474&quot;&gt;NI LabVIEW 2017+, LabVIEW Real-Time, DAQ, NI Network Streams, OOP, sensors, instrumentation, and industrial communication protocols&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;477&quot; data-end=&quot;728&quot;&gt;The role involves developing and maintaining large-scale LabVIEW applications, integrating measurement systems and industrial equipment, implementing real-time solutions, and working with platforms such as &lt;strong data-start=&quot;683&quot; data-end=&quot;727&quot;&gt;cRIO, PXI, NI TestStand, and ATE systems&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Pune',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-25 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-08-27 02:33:18.000000','2026-08-27 02:33:18.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Data Accuracy\", \"Industrial Automation\", \"Sensors\", \"TCP\", \"Modbus\", \"OPC UA\", \"MQTT\", \"NI LabVIEW 2017+\", \"LabVIEW Real-Time (RT)\", \"NI Network Streams\", \"cRIO\", \"PXI\", \"Automated Test Equipment\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;rdheb3&quot; data-start=&quot;743&quot; data-end=&quot;790&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a leading global MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;832yre&quot; data-start=&quot;791&quot; data-end=&quot;862&quot;&gt;Exposure to large-scale &lt;strong data-start=&quot;817&quot; data-end=&quot;862&quot;&gt;LabVIEW and Real-Time automation projects&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1gn16p3&quot; data-start=&quot;863&quot; data-end=&quot;916&quot;&gt;Work with advanced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;884&quot; data-end=&quot;916&quot;&gt;NI hardware and test systems&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;135h0d2&quot; data-start=&quot;917&quot; data-end=&quot;992&quot;&gt;Exposure to industrial communication protocols and connected test systems&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;cyceta&quot; data-start=&quot;993&quot; data-end=&quot;1081&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1018&quot; data-end=&quot;1081&quot;&gt;DAQ, instrumentation, sensors, and measurement technologies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;3phx8f&quot; data-start=&quot;1082&quot; data-end=&quot;1148&quot;&gt;Experience with enterprise-scale LabVIEW application development&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1vts9iw&quot; data-start=&quot;1149&quot; data-end=&quot;1210&quot;&gt;Exposure to modern development and source-control practices&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1pz0q1v&quot; data-start=&quot;1211&quot; data-end=&quot;1301&quot;&gt;Career growth in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1230&quot; data-end=&quot;1301&quot;&gt;Industrial Automation, Test &amp;amp; Measurement, and Engineering Software&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Maharashtra'),('478bfbce-fd66-41e5-a515-4e79f14762c8','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','AI/ML Engineer','aiml-engineer-297-297','&lt;p data-start=&quot;56&quot; data-end=&quot;408&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced AI/ML Engineers for a leading Top MNC to work on enterprise-scale Artificial Intelligence, Generative AI, and Agentic AI transformation initiatives. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in Azure AI technologies, machine learning model development, cloud-native AI solutions, and advanced data processing platforms.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;410&quot; data-end=&quot;770&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for designing, developing, and deploying scalable Agentic AI and Generative AI solutions using the Azure AI ecosystem. The role includes building intelligent AI applications, developing and optimizing machine learning models, integrating AI capabilities into enterprise platforms, and ensuring high-performance AI deployments.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;772&quot; data-end=&quot;1059&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with Azure Machine Learning, Azure OpenAI Services, PromptFlow, Databricks, Python, and PySpark. Strong knowledge of AI model fine-tuning, prompt engineering, cloud-based AI architectures, and large-scale data processing is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1061&quot; data-end=&quot;1462&quot;&gt;The role also involves troubleshooting AI/ML solutions, improving model performance, researching emerging AI technologies, and collaborating with business stakeholders, data engineers, and development teams to deliver innovative enterprise AI solutions. Candidates should possess strong analytical thinking, communication, and problem-solving skills with a passion for next-generation AI technologies.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Pune',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-08-22 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-06-24 02:44:13.000000','2026-06-24 02:44:13.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Artificial Intelligence\", \"Machine Learning\", \"Python\", \"Pyspark\", \"Azure Databricks\", \"Generative AI\", \"LLM Fine-tuning\", \"Agentic AI\", \"PromptFlow\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1478&quot; data-end=&quot;1516&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;nrj93i&quot; data-start=&quot;1517&quot; data-end=&quot;1588&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale AI and Digital Transformation projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;5ma4m4&quot; data-start=&quot;1589&quot; data-end=&quot;1655&quot;&gt;Work on cutting-edge Generative AI and Agentic AI technologies&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;4lu7s&quot; data-start=&quot;1656&quot; data-end=&quot;1726&quot;&gt;Career growth in Artificial Intelligence &amp;amp; Machine Learning domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;srp47p&quot; data-start=&quot;1727&quot; data-end=&quot;1794&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global AI and engineering teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot; data-start=&quot;1795&quot; data-end=&quot;1850&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;1851&quot; data-end=&quot;1894&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Maharashtra'),('47cd41d4-ad9f-4e3a-aeee-5400aea6458c','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','GE Proficy Developer / MES Developer','ge-proficy-developer-mes-developer-382-382','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;239&quot; data-end=&quot;443&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;265&quot; data-end=&quot;310&quot;&gt;GE Proficy Developers / MES Professionals&lt;/strong&gt; for a leading &lt;strong data-start=&quot;325&quot; data-end=&quot;336&quot;&gt;Top MNC&lt;/strong&gt; to work on enterprise-scale &lt;strong data-start=&quot;365&quot; data-end=&quot;405&quot;&gt;Manufacturing Execution System (MES)&lt;/strong&gt; and plant-floor technology solutions.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;445&quot; data-end=&quot;647&quot;&gt;The ideal candidate should have strong hands-on experience with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;509&quot; data-end=&quot;646&quot;&gt;GE Proficy Plant Applications / Proficy MES, GE Cimplicity, SQL Server, SSRS, Historian, OPC interfaces, SCADA, and .NET technologies&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;649&quot; data-end=&quot;988&quot;&gt;The role involves designing, developing, configuring, testing, deploying, and supporting MES applications across manufacturing environments. Candidates should have a strong understanding of &lt;strong data-start=&quot;839&quot; data-end=&quot;987&quot;&gt;manufacturing processes, plant-floor systems, MES integration, production workflows, quality, inventory, order management, and plant performance&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;990&quot; data-end=&quot;1155&quot;&gt;Experience with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1006&quot; data-end=&quot;1130&quot;&gt;MES implementation, global rollouts, multi-site deployments, production support, system integration, and troubleshooting&lt;/strong&gt; will be highly valuable.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',N