nior-labview-developer-369-369','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;95&quot; data-end=&quot;276&quot;&gt;We are hiring an experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;124&quot; data-end=&quot;145&quot;&gt;LabVIEW Developer&lt;/strong&gt; for a leading MNC to work on advanced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;184&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;Real-Time, Data Acquisition, Industrial Automation, and Test &amp;amp; Measurement&lt;/strong&gt; applications.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;278&quot; data-end=&quot;475&quot;&gt;The ideal candidate should have strong hands-on expertise in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;339&quot; data-end=&quot;474&quot;&gt;NI LabVIEW 2017+, LabVIEW Real-Time, DAQ, NI Network Streams, OOP, sensors, instrumentation, and industrial communication protocols&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;477&quot; data-end=&quot;728&quot;&gt;The role involves developing and maintaining large-scale LabVIEW applications, integrating measurement systems and industrial equipment, implementing real-time solutions, and working with platforms such as &lt;strong data-start=&quot;683&quot; data-end=&quot;727&quot;&gt;cRIO, PXI, NI TestStand, and ATE systems&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Pune',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-25 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-08-27 02:33:18.000000','2026-08-27 02:33:18.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Data Accuracy\", \"Industrial Automation\", \"Sensors\", \"TCP\", \"Modbus\", \"OPC UA\", \"MQTT\", \"NI LabVIEW 2017+\", \"LabVIEW Real-Time (RT)\", \"NI Network Streams\", \"cRIO\", \"PXI\", \"Automated Test Equipment\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;rdheb3&quot; data-start=&quot;743&quot; data-end=&quot;790&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a leading global MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;832yre&quot; data-start=&quot;791&quot; data-end=&quot;862&quot;&gt;Exposure to large-scale &lt;strong data-start=&quot;817&quot; data-end=&quot;862&quot;&gt;LabVIEW and Real-Time automation projects&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1gn16p3&quot; data-start=&quot;863&quot; data-end=&quot;916&quot;&gt;Work with advanced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;884&quot; data-end=&quot;916&quot;&gt;NI hardware and test systems&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;135h0d2&quot; data-start=&quot;917&quot; data-end=&quot;992&quot;&gt;Exposure to industrial communication protocols and connected test systems&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;cyceta&quot; data-start=&quot;993&quot; data-end=&quot;1081&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1018&quot; data-end=&quot;1081&quot;&gt;DAQ, instrumentation, sensors, and measurement technologies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;3phx8f&quot; data-start=&quot;1082&quot; data-end=&quot;1148&quot;&gt;Experience with enterprise-scale LabVIEW application development&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1vts9iw&quot; data-start=&quot;1149&quot; data-end=&quot;1210&quot;&gt;Exposure to modern development and source-control practices&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1pz0q1v&quot; data-start=&quot;1211&quot; data-end=&quot;1301&quot;&gt;Career growth in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1230&quot; data-end=&quot;1301&quot;&gt;Industrial Automation, Test &amp;amp; Measurement, and Engineering Software&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Maharashtra'),('485f6465-0bc5-43bb-bb7d-dff9e309ddda','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','HighByte Developer','highbyte-developer-149-149','&lt;p data-start=&quot;167&quot; data-end=&quot;500&quot;&gt;We are looking for an experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;201&quot; data-end=&quot;223&quot;&gt;HighByte Developer&lt;/strong&gt; who can design, configure, and implement data integration solutions using &lt;strong data-start=&quot;298&quot; data-end=&quot;327&quot;&gt;HighByte Intelligence Hub&lt;/strong&gt;. The role involves building scalable &lt;strong data-start=&quot;365&quot; data-end=&quot;392&quot;&gt;Unified Namespace (UNS)&lt;/strong&gt; architectures, integrating OT and IT systems, and ensuring smooth data flow across enterprise environments.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;502&quot; data-end=&quot;806&quot;&gt;The ideal candidate will work closely with automation teams, MES engineers, and enterprise IT to model industrial data, set up brokers, configure communication protocols, and apply ISA-95 standards. Experience in the &lt;strong data-start=&quot;719&quot; data-end=&quot;736&quot;&gt;pharma domain&lt;/strong&gt;, especially with GxP-compliant processes, will be a strong advantage.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;808&quot; data-end=&quot;835&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;808&quot; data-end=&quot;833&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;836&quot; data-end=&quot;1405&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;836&quot; data-end=&quot;920&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;838&quot; data-end=&quot;920&quot;&gt;Install, configure, and develop applications using &lt;strong data-start=&quot;889&quot; data-end=&quot;918&quot;&gt;HighByte Intelligence Hub&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;921&quot; data-end=&quot;989&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;923&quot; data-end=&quot;989&quot;&gt;Build, deploy, and manage &lt;strong data-start=&quot;949&quot; data-end=&quot;976&quot;&gt;UNS (Unified Namespace)&lt;/strong&gt; structures&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;990&quot; data-end=&quot;1047&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;992&quot; data-end=&quot;1047&quot;&gt;Set up and integrate MQTT brokers (HiveMQ, Mosquitto)&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1048&quot; data-end=&quot;1132&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1050&quot; data-end=&quot;1132&quot;&gt;Work with industrial communication protocols such as &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1103&quot; data-end=&quot;1130&quot;&gt;OPC UA, MQTT, REST APIs&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1133&quot; data-end=&quot;1207&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1135&quot; data-end=&quot;1207&quot;&gt;Implement ISA-95 hierarchical modeling and mapping for OT&amp;ndash;IT data flow&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1208&quot; data-end=&quot;1264&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1210&quot; data-end=&quot;1264&quot;&gt;Integrate HighByte with PLC, SCADA, MES, ERP systems&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1265&quot; data-end=&quot;1330&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1267&quot; data-end=&quot;1330&quot;&gt;Support pharma workflows with adherence to &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1310&quot; data-end=&quot;1328&quot;&gt;GxP compliance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1331&quot; data-end=&quot;1405&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1333&quot; data-end=&quot;1405&quot;&gt;Handle data modeling, transformation, and real-time data orchestration&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Full-time','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-24 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-11-26 02:32:12.000000','2025-11-26 02:32:12.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Configurations\", \"Data Modeling\", \"Gxp Compliance\", \"Installation\", \"Mes\", \"PLC\", \"SCADA\", \"MQTT\", \"HiveMQ\", \"HighByte\", \"Unified Namespace (UNS)\", \"Mosquitto\"]','[\"&lt;p data-start=&quot;807&quot; data-end=&quot;926&quot;&gt;Work with a top MNC in Industry 4.0&lt;br data-start=&quot;844&quot; data-end=&quot;847&quot; /&gt;Exposure to modern OT&amp;ndash;IT integration&lt;br data-start=&quot;885&quot; data-end=&quot;888&quot; /&gt;Excellent career growth &amp;amp; learning&lt;/p&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('488c656d-ae17-4a5b-bd23-0465dcc3d52a','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee