a-start=&quot;61&quot; data-end=&quot;459&quot;&gt;We are hiring enthusiastic &lt;strong data-start=&quot;88&quot; data-end=&quot;112&quot;&gt;Tulip Jr. Developers&lt;/strong&gt; for a leading Top MNC to support enterprise-scale Smart Manufacturing, Manufacturing Execution Systems (MES), and Shopfloor Digitalization initiatives. This is an excellent opportunity for professionals with 2&amp;ndash;5 years of experience who are passionate about low-code application development, manufacturing technologies, and Industry 4.0 solutions.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;461&quot; data-end=&quot;919&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for developing, configuring, testing, and supporting Tulip applications used to digitize manufacturing operations and shopfloor processes. The role includes building user-friendly interfaces, configuring workflows, integrating manufacturing data, troubleshooting application issues, performing unit testing, maintaining technical documentation, and supporting continuous improvements under the guidance of senior developers.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;921&quot; data-end=&quot;1305&quot;&gt;Professionals should have a solid understanding of the Tulip platform, SQL, database concepts, application development fundamentals, UI configuration, workflow logic, APIs, JSON, XML, software testing, debugging, and Software Development Life Cycle (SDLC). Exposure to Manufacturing Execution Systems (MES), shopfloor applications, and Agile development practices is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1307&quot; data-end=&quot;1763&quot;&gt;The role also involves collaborating with solution architects, senior developers, business analysts, QA teams, and manufacturing stakeholders to deliver scalable manufacturing applications. Candidates should be eager to learn Tulip best practices, contribute to Agile sprint activities, maintain development artifacts, and support digital manufacturing transformation initiatives. Strong analytical, communication, and problem-solving skills are essential.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Pune',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-09-19 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-07-21 19:46:43.000000','2026-07-21 19:46:43.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Agile Methodology\", \"JSON\", \"Mes\", \"REST API\", \"SQL\", \"Unit Testing\", \"XML\", \"Tulip Platform\", \"Tulip Application Development\", \"Low-Code Application Development\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1779&quot; data-end=&quot;1817&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;77q0ey&quot; data-start=&quot;1818&quot; data-end=&quot;1899&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale Smart Manufacturing and Digital Factory projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;ox26tx&quot; data-start=&quot;1900&quot; data-end=&quot;1986&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience with the Tulip low-code platform and Industry 4.0 technologies&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;15j194c&quot; data-start=&quot;1987&quot; data-end=&quot;2067&quot;&gt;Career growth in Manufacturing IT, MES, and Low-Code Application Development&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;13qji02&quot; data-start=&quot;2068&quot; data-end=&quot;2145&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global manufacturing and technology teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot; data-start=&quot;2146&quot; data-end=&quot;2201&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;2202&quot; data-end=&quot;2245&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Maharashtra'),('4995a516-f04e-446a-9e38-78c2e1d744d7','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Labware LIMS, LIMS Basic, Windows, Cloud.','labware-lims-lims-basic-windows-cloud-231-231','1. Requirement gathering and configuration/development of Laboratory Information Management System (LIMS) e.g. LabWare 2. Interact with Project team, Business Representatives and Business QA to understand the scope and purpose of the business process work stream &lt;br /&gt;3. Work on Labware LIMS/ELN Architecture, Labware Database Structures, SAP Crystal Reports, Oracle - PL/SQL&lt;br /&gt;4. Work on Labware Modules like LIMS/ELN Stability, EM, Inventory,Storage Location Management, Instrument Interfaces, Lot, Sample Management for Clinical Trial &amp;amp;amp; Manufacturing Domain. &lt;br /&gt;5. Responsible for writing code, testing script and test script execution&lt;br /&gt;6. Facilitate effective and efficient meetings with the client and internal team. Work with the client and/or team to develop strategies and action plans based on the outcomes of those meetings.&lt;br /&gt;7. Responsible for resolving technical issues in Labware LIMS/ELN, including Interfaces to ERP, Label Printing Software, MDM and all modules &lt;br /&gt;8. Deployment of developed methods in testing environment and test script execution with client.&lt;br /&gt;9. Support activities like Hypercare after go live, Process Improvement &amp;amp;amp; Automation,Impact analysis and replication of application issues etc.&lt;br /&gt;10. Identify process improvements opportunities to enhance efficiency and/or quality within workstreams and lead their implementation.','Information Technology','Contract','Entry',NULL,NULL,'INR',1,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-05-30 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-03-31 21:26:31.000000','2026-03-31 21:26:31.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"ERP\", \"Lims\", \"MYSQL\", \"Oracle\", \"SAP\", \"LabWare LIMS\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;Competitive salary package with performance-based incentives&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;65&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;67&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;Health insurance coverage and statutory benefits (PF &amp;amp; Gratuity)&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;134&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;136&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on large-scale enterprise energy management projects&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;211&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;213&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;Strong career growth and learning opportunities&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;263&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;265&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;Collaborative and professional work environment&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('49d2b850-d9b4-4be7-8524-745012c33d79','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','AVEVA MES Technical Implementation Specialist','aveva-mes-technical-implementation-specialist-85-85','We&rsquo;re seeking a skilled AVEVA MES Implementation Specialist with strong technical hands-on expertise in MES configuration, ArchestrA Object toolkit, and System Platform integration. This role is with a leading global client (BD/Nokian Tyres) for driving manufacturing digitization. Key Responsibilities: Configure and customize AVEVA MES Performance &amp;amp; Operations modules Deploy MES packages and integrate into client infrastructure Manage end-to-end MES projects across plant operations Work with System Platform, ArchestrA Object toolkit, and database structures Develop attribute models and create attribute hierarchies Enable MES reporting and real-time visibility with SQL/API/web services Ensure complete rollout of MES solutions to the shop floor','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-08-31 06:00:00',0,0,'2025-07-29 06:57:58.000000','2026-05-06 20:51:32.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"API Integration\", \"Configurations\", \"Deployment\", \"Mes Architect\", \"Operations Management\", \"SQL\", \"AVEVA MES\"]','[\"Opportunity to work with global manufacturers (BD/Nokian Tyres) Involvement in full-lifecycle MES projects Work on leading industrial digitalization technologies Competitive salary and project-based growth Direct collaboration with client&rsquo;s operations and engineering teams\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('49fbd50a-33f3-4a7d-81c4-fc67c4997918','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Senior QA Engineer (TOSCA)','senior-qa-engineer-tosca-293-293','&lt;p data-start=&quot;68&quot; data-end=&quot;359&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced Senior QA Engineers with strong expertise in Tricentis TOSCA for a leading Top MNC. The ideal candidate should have hands-on experience in test automation, CI/CD integration, quality assurance processes, and enterprise application testing across multiple platforms.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;361&quot; data-end=&quot;676&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for designing, developing, executing, and maintaining automated test scripts using Tricentis TOSCA. The role includes performing functional, integration, regression, and performance testing while ensuring application quality, reliability, and compliance with business requirements.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;678&quot; data-end=&quot;997&quot;&gt;Professionals should have strong experience integrating TOSCA with Jenkins and CI/CD pipelines, building automation frameworks using BDD/TDD methodologies, and automating Web, Desktop, Mobile, and API testing. Strong knowledge of SQL, database testing, JIRA, HP ALM, and Agile development practices is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;999&quot; data-end=&quot;1367&quot;&gt;The role also involves monitoring test execution, analyzing automation failures, improving framework stability, creating manual test cases for new features, and collaborating with developers, QA leads, and stakeholders to ensure high-quality software delivery. Candidates should possess excellent analytical, troubleshooting, communication, and problem-solving skills.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-08-22 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-06-24 02:24:07.000000','2026-06-24 02:24:07.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Automation Testing\", \"Jenkins\", \"Manual Functional Testing\", \"API testing\", \"Cucumber(BDD)\", \"CI/CD\", \"Visual Regression Testing\", \"Tricentis TOSCA\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1383&quot; data-end=&quot;1421&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;4rcl1r&quot; data-start=&quot;1422&quot; data-end=&quot;1482&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale automation testing projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;125o968&quot; data-start=&quot;1483&quot; data-end=&quot;1540&quot;&gt;Work on advanced QA automation and CI/CD technologies&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1qm0vqv&quot; data-start=&quot;1541&quot; data-end=&quot;1607&quot;&gt;Career growth in Software Testing &amp;amp; Quality Engineering domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;iz6fk7&quot; data-start=&quot;1608&quot; data-end=&quot;1675&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global development and QA teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot; data-start=&quot;1676&quot; data-end=&quot;1731&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;1732&quot; data-end=&quot;1775&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('4bee9acb-d7ba-4135-9d9d-4ebea587c4d7','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Digital Marketing Executive','digital-marketing-executive-135-135','Looking for a Digital Marketing Specialist with strong experience in SEO, SEM, Social Media Marketing, Google Ads, Analytics &amp;amp; Content Strategy. Role involves campaign management, optimization, reporting and cross-team collaboration.&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1971&quot; data-end=&quot;2043&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1973&quot; data-end=&quot;2043&quot;&gt;Bachelor&amp;rsquo;s degree in Marketing, Communications, IT, or related field&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2044&quot; data-end=&quot;2080&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2046&quot; data-end=&quot;2080&quot;&gt;1&amp;ndash;3 years of relevant experience&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2081&quot; data-end=&quot;2149&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2083&quot; data-end=&quot;2149&quot;&gt;Experience with Google Tools, Meta Ads Manager &amp;amp; Analytics tools&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Marketing','Contract','Entry',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Pune',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-20 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-11-21 17:32:58.000000','2025-11-21 17:32:58.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Communication Skills\", \"Digital Marketing\", \"Digital Marketing Skills\", \"Google Ad Words\", \"Google Analytics\", \"SEO\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2191&quot; data-end=&quot;2222&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2193&quot; data-end=&quot;2222&quot;&gt;Growing tech-driven company&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2223&quot; data-end=&quot;2279&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2225&quot; data-end=&quot;2279&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on impactful digital initiatives&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2280&quot; data-end=&quot;2330&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2282&quot; data-end=&quot;2330&quot;&gt;Collaborative and learning-focused environment&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2331&quot; data-end=&quot;2400&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2333&quot; data-end=&quot;2400&quot;&gt;Work directly on marketing for IT infrastructure &amp;amp; cloud products&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Maharashtra'),('4d441297-cf42-488e-9882-09471b810943','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Oracle WebLogic Administrator','oracle-weblogic-administrator-151-151','&lt;p data-start=&quot;250&quot; data-end=&quot;642&quot;&gt;We are seeking an experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;280&quot; data-end=&quot;313&quot;&gt;Oracle WebLogic Administrator&lt;/strong&gt; with strong hands-on expertise in Middleware Administration, Application Deployments, and Server Management. The ideal candidate will be responsible for managing WebLogic environments, automating deployments, ensuring high availability, and optimizing system performance across multi-platform environments (AIX, Linux, Windows).&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;644&quot; data-end=&quot;993&quot;&gt;The candidate will work on domain creation, configuration of Forms and Reports, SSL/TLS certificates, patching using Ansible, resource tuning, and managing disaster recovery activities. Experience in warehouse environments will be an added advantage. The role also includes incident management, job scheduling, and monitoring using enterprise tools.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;hr data-start=&quot;995&quot; data-end=&quot;998&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;1000&quot; data-end=&quot;1031&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1003&quot; data-end=&quot;1031&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1033&quot; data-end=&quot;2190&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1033&quot; data-end=&quot;1173&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1035&quot; data-end=&quot;1173&quot;&gt;Administer &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1046&quot; data-end=&quot;1085&quot;&gt;Oracle WebLogic Server (9i/12c/14c)&lt;/strong&gt; and other middleware platforms like &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1122&quot; data-end=&quot;1170&quot;&gt;JBoss, Apache Tomcat, IIS, Fusion Middleware&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1174&quot; data-end=&quot;1284&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1176&quot; data-end=&quot;1284&quot;&gt;Perform &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1184&quot; data-end=&quot;1256&quot;&gt;installation, configuration, troubleshooting, and performance tuning&lt;/strong&gt; of middleware components.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1285&quot; data-end=&quot;1377&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1287&quot; data-end=&quot;1377&quot;&gt;Work on &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1295&quot; data-end=&quot;1338&quot;&gt;application deployments (JAR, WAR, EAR)&lt;/strong&gt; and manage &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1350&quot; data-end=&quot;1374&quot;&gt;SSL/TLS certificates&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1378&quot; data-end=&quot;1487&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1380&quot; data-end=&quot;1487&quot;&gt;Complete &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1389&quot; data-end=&quot;1422&quot;&gt;domain creation/configuration&lt;/strong&gt;, Oracle Forms &amp;amp; Reports setup, and server resource management.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1488&quot; data-end=&quot;1559&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1490&quot; data-end=&quot;1559&quot;&gt;Execute &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1498&quot; data-end=&quot;1542&quot;&gt;WebLogic patching (PSU/Critical Updates)&lt;/strong&gt; using Ansible.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1560&quot; data-end=&quot;1657&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1562&quot; data-end=&quot;1657&quot;&gt;Configure Admin/Managed Servers, JDBC Pools, JMS components, clusters, and tuning parameters.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1658&quot; data-end=&quot;1750&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1660&quot; data-end=&quot;1750&quot;&gt;Work with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1670&quot; data-end=&quot;1698&quot;&gt;F5 BIG-IP load balancing&lt;/strong&gt;, and tools like Nagios, Dynatrace, and New Relic.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1751&quot; data-end=&quot;1859&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1753&quot; data-end=&quot;1859&quot;&gt;Handle &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1760&quot; data-end=&quot;1807&quot;&gt;incident management, Autosys job scheduling&lt;/strong&gt;, and troubleshoot heap memory/server hang issues.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1860&quot; data-end=&quot;1947&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1862&quot; data-end=&quot;1947&quot;&gt;Support &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1870&quot; data-end=&quot;1900&quot;&gt;disaster recovery planning&lt;/strong&gt;, environment refresh, and backup procedures.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1948&quot; data-end=&quot;2043&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1950&quot; data-end=&quot;2043&quot;&gt;Leverage automation tools like &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1981&quot; data-end=&quot;2001&quot;&gt;Ansible, Jenkins&lt;/strong&gt;, and scripting to streamline processes.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2044&quot; data-end=&quot;2141&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2046&quot; data-end=&quot;2141&quot;&gt;Experience in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2060&quot; data-end=&quot;2094&quot;&gt;Oracle Database, Linux Red Hat&lt;/strong&gt;, and deployments across AIX, Linux, Windows.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2142&quot; data-end=&quot;2190&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2144&quot; data-end=&quot;2190&quot;&gt;Warehouse project experience is an added plus.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Full-time','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-24 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-11-26 03:20:54.0000