b applications using Node.js / NodeJS and React.js / ReactJS&lt;br /&gt;Design and build RESTful APIs and backend services&lt;br /&gt;Create responsive, user-friendly frontend interfaces&lt;br /&gt;Integrate frontend with backend services efficiently&lt;br /&gt;Optimize applications for maximum speed and scalability&lt;br /&gt;Write clean, maintainable, and reusable code&lt;br /&gt;Collaborate with product, QA, and DevOps teams for smooth delivery&lt;br /&gt;Participate in code reviews and follow best coding practices','Information Technology','Contract','Entry',NULL,NULL,'INR',1,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-06-02 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-04-03 20:44:05.000000','2026-04-03 20:44:05.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"AWS\", \"Consuming REST API Services\", \"Docker\", \"JavaScript\", \"Mongo DB\", \"Node.JS\", \"React\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;Competitive salary package with performance-based incentives&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;65&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;67&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;Health insurance coverage and statutory benefits (PF &amp;amp; Gratuity)&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;134&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;136&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on large-scale enterprise energy management projects&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;211&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;213&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;Strong career growth and learning opportunities&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;263&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;265&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;Collaborative and professional work environment&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('4e77a42c-652f-4445-8f3f-f8aea2dc0dcc','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','QA Automation Engineer','qa-automation-engineer-316-316','&lt;p data-start=&quot;64&quot; data-end=&quot;439&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced QA Automation Engineers for a leading Top MNC to work on enterprise software testing, automation framework development, and manufacturing domain applications. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in automation testing, framework development, software quality assurance, and test automation for both infrastructure and functional testing.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;441&quot; data-end=&quot;814&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for designing, developing, maintaining, and executing automated and manual test scripts to ensure the quality, stability, and performance of enterprise applications. The role includes building automation frameworks, validating software across multiple releases, creating test cases, managing test data, and performing database validations.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;816&quot; data-end=&quot;1225&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with automation framework development, programming languages such as C, C++, C#, Java, Python, Perl, Shell Scripting, and Tcl/Tk, along with strong knowledge of Windows Client/Server environments, legacy desktop applications, SQL, debugging, and troubleshooting. Experience with Microsoft Sysinternals, UNIX utilities, and root cause analysis is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1227&quot; data-end=&quot;1579&quot;&gt;The role also involves collaborating with development teams throughout the Software Development Lifecycle (SDLC), identifying defects, improving automation coverage, enhancing product quality, and contributing to continuous testing initiatives. Candidates should possess strong analytical thinking, communication, debugging, and problem-solving skills.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-08-28 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-06-30 03:43:22.000000','2026-06-30 03:43:22.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"C Programming\", \"C#\", \"C++\", \"Functional Scenario Testing\", \"Java\", \"Python\", \"Quality Assurance (QA)\", \"Shell\", \"Test Case Preparation\", \"Manual Testing\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1595&quot; data-end=&quot;1633&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;4rcl1r&quot; data-start=&quot;1634&quot; data-end=&quot;1694&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale automation testing projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;18geotp&quot; data-start=&quot;1695&quot; data-end=&quot;1774&quot;&gt;Work on advanced QA automation frameworks and enterprise software solutions&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1qm0vqv&quot; data-start=&quot;1775&quot; data-end=&quot;1841&quot;&gt;Career growth in Software Testing &amp;amp; Quality Engineering domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;iz6fk7&quot; data-start=&quot;1842&quot; data-end=&quot;1909&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global development and QA teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot; data-start=&quot;1910&quot; data-end=&quot;1965&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;1966&quot; data-end=&quot;2009&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('4f01540a-233c-4705-8866-94d954ac11a7','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','SCADA Engineer – Ignition','scada-engineer-ignition-182-182','&lt;p data-start=&quot;227&quot; data-end=&quot;595&quot;&gt;We are looking for an experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;261&quot; data-end=&quot;290&quot;&gt;SCADA Engineer &amp;ndash; Ignition&lt;/strong&gt; to architect, design, and develop &lt;strong data-start=&quot;325&quot; data-end=&quot;359&quot;&gt;Ignition-based SCADA solutions&lt;/strong&gt; for &lt;strong data-start=&quot;364&quot; data-end=&quot;411&quot;&gt;CM20 test-bench and laboratory environments&lt;/strong&gt;. The role involves building scalable, web-based SCADA applications, configuring Edge/MQTT pipelines, integrating lab equipment, and connecting on-prem systems to cloud data platforms.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;hr data-start=&quot;597&quot; data-end=&quot;600&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;602&quot; data-end=&quot;629&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;605&quot; data-end=&quot;629&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;630&quot; data-end=&quot;1426&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;630&quot; data-end=&quot;724&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;632&quot; data-end=&quot;724&quot;&gt;Architect, design, and develop &lt;strong data-start=&quot;663&quot; data-end=&quot;691&quot;&gt;Ignition SCADA solutions&lt;/strong&gt; for CM20 test-bench operations&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;725&quot; data-end=&quot;824&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;727&quot; data-end=&quot;824&quot;&gt;Build reusable components including &lt;strong data-start=&quot;763&quot; data-end=&quot;822&quot;&gt;UDTs, templates, perspective views, and tag hierarchies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;825&quot; data-end=&quot;906&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;827&quot; data-end=&quot;906&quot;&gt;Configure &lt;strong data-start=&quot;837&quot; data-end=&quot;864&quot;&gt;MQTT and Edge pipelines&lt;/strong&gt; for near-real-time lab data acquisition&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;907&quot; data-end=&quot;999&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;909&quot; data-end=&quot;999&quot;&gt;Implement alarm strategies, historian tagging, data optimization, and retention policies&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1000&quot; data-end=&quot;1083&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1002&quot; data-end=&quot;1083&quot;&gt;Perform &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1010&quot; data-end=&quot;1037&quot;&gt;stress and load testing&lt;/strong&gt; of SCADA modules for production simulations&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1084&quot; data-end=&quot;1154&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1086&quot; data-end=&quot;1154&quot;&gt;Execute testing, documentation, and deployment in lab environments&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1155&quot; data-end=&quot;1222&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1157&quot; data-end=&quot;1222&quot;&gt;Develop troubleshooting guides, SOPs, and operational playbooks&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1223&quot; data-end=&quot;1302&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1225&quot; data-end=&quot;1302&quot;&gt;Integrate SCADA with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1246&quot; data-end=&quot;1300&quot;&gt;IoT platforms, LIMS, MES, and analytics dashboards&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1303&quot; data-end=&quot;1361&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1305&quot; data-end=&quot;1361&quot;&gt;Set up and manage &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1323&quot; data-end=&quot;1359&quot;&gt;cloud data pipelines (AWS/Azure)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1362&quot; data-end=&quot;1426&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1364&quot; data-end=&quot;1426&quot;&gt;Configure and maintain &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1387&quot; data-end=&quot;1426&quot;&gt;API servers and Linux-based systems&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Noida',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-06-16 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-01-22 22:30:06.000000','2026-04-18 03:55:07.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"API Integration\", \"AWS\", \"Azure\", \"Cloud Platforms\", \"Lims\", \"Linux\", \"Mes\", \"Mom Systems\", \"PLC\", \"Python\", \"SCADA\", \"Siemens\", \"OPC UA\", \"MQTT\", \"Allen-Bradley\", \"CM20 environments\", \"ISA-95\", \"ISA-88\"]','[\"&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2291&quot; data-end=&quot;2665&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2291&quot; data-end=&quot;2373&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2293&quot; data-end=&quot;2373&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2316&quot; data-end=&quot;2371&quot;&gt;advanced lab automation and CM20 test-bench systems&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2374&quot; data-end=&quot;2454&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2376&quot; data-end=&quot;2454&quot;&gt;Hands-on exposure to &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2397&quot; data-end=&quot;2452&quot;&gt;Ignition, IoT, Edge, and cloud-based data pipelines&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2455&quot; data-end=&quot;2528&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2457&quot; data-end=&quot;2528&quot;&gt;Work at the intersection of &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2485&quot; data-end=&quot;2526&quot;&gt;SCADA, IoT, and digital manufacturing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2529&quot; data-end=&quot;2592&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2531&quot; data-end=&quot;2592&quot;&gt;Strong technical ownership and architectural responsibility&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2593&quot; data-end=&quot;2665&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2595&quot; data-end=&quot;2665&quot;&gt;Career growth in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2612&quot; data-end=&quot;2665&quot;&gt;industrial digitalization and smart lab platforms&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Uttar Pradesh'),('4f97db92-839d-472b-b6bc-75a04139e211','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Frontend Developer (Angular + React)',