/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;927&quot; data-end=&quot;1001&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;929&quot; data-end=&quot;1001&quot;&gt;Write clean, maintainable code using &lt;strong data-start=&quot;966&quot; data-end=&quot;999&quot;&gt;TypeScript, ES6+, HTML5, CSS3&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1002&quot; data-end=&quot;1055&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1004&quot; data-end=&quot;1055&quot;&gt;Implement state management using &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1037&quot; data-end=&quot;1053&quot;&gt;NgRx / Redux&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1056&quot; data-end=&quot;1124&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1058&quot; data-end=&quot;1124&quot;&gt;Perform debugging, troubleshooting, and performance optimization&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1125&quot; data-end=&quot;1178&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1127&quot; data-end=&quot;1178&quot;&gt;Write unit tests using &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1150&quot; data-end=&quot;1176&quot;&gt;Jest / Jasmine / Karma&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1179&quot; data-end=&quot;1238&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1181&quot; data-end=&quot;1238&quot;&gt;Work with CI/CD pipelines and version control (&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1228&quot; data-end=&quot;1235&quot;&gt;Git&lt;/strong&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1239&quot; data-end=&quot;1299&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1241&quot; data-end=&quot;1299&quot;&gt;Utilize Docker for containerized application development&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1300&quot; data-end=&quot;1377&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1302&quot; data-end=&quot;1377&quot;&gt;Collaborate with designers, backend teams &amp;amp; product owners in Agile/Scrum&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1378&quot; data-end=&quot;1457&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1380&quot; data-end=&quot;1457&quot;&gt;Work on applications related to &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1412&quot; data-end=&quot;1443&quot;&gt;MES / Industrial Automation&lt;/strong&gt; (preferred)&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Full-time','Mid',NULL,NULL,'INR',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-19 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-11-21 05:37:23.000000','2025-11-21 05:37:23.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"CSS3\", \"Django\", \"Docker\", \"Git\", \"HTML5\", \"Industrial Automation\", \"Mes\", \"Microservices\", \"Node JS\", \"React\", \"Redux\", \"REST API\", \"Typescript\", \"Unit Testing\", \"CI/CD\", \"NgRx\", \"Angular (13+)\", \"ES6+\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2018&quot; data-end=&quot;2067&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2020&quot; data-end=&quot;2067&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2047&quot; data-end=&quot;2065&quot;&gt;Top Global MNC&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2068&quot; data-end=&quot;2120&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2070&quot; data-end=&quot;2120&quot;&gt;Work with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2080&quot; data-end=&quot;2118&quot;&gt;cutting-edge frontend technologies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2121&quot; data-end=&quot;2178&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2123&quot; data-end=&quot;2178&quot;&gt;Contribute to &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2137&quot; data-end=&quot;2176&quot;&gt;large-scale enterprise applications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2179&quot; data-end=&quot;2233&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2181&quot; data-end=&quot;2233&quot;&gt;Exposure to &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2193&quot; data-end=&quot;2231&quot;&gt;MES / Industrial Automation domain&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2234&quot; data-end=&quot;2293&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2236&quot; data-end=&quot;2293&quot;&gt;Excellent career growth and long-term project stability&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2294&quot; data-end=&quot;2346&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2296&quot; data-end=&quot;2346&quot;&gt;Highly collaborative and innovative work culture&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2347&quot; data-end=&quot;2391&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2349&quot; data-end=&quot;2391&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and employee benefits&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2392&quot; data-end=&quot;2439&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2394&quot; data-end=&quot;2439&quot;&gt;Continuous learning with modern tech stacks&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('4fbaa7c2-14a5-4471-8cd1-6799e794d286','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Opcenter Execution Core Designer','opcenter-execution-core-designer-304-304','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;74&quot; data-end=&quot;389&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced Opcenter Execution Core Designers for a leading Top MNC to work on enterprise-scale Manufacturing Execution System (MES) projects. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in Siemens Opcenter Execution Core, .NET technologies, SQL Server, and manufacturing application development.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;391&quot; data-end=&quot;728&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for designing, developing, enhancing, and supporting Opcenter Execution Core applications for manufacturing environments. The role includes implementing business logic using CLF and CDO frameworks, supporting system integrations, optimizing application performance, and ensuring reliable MES operations.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;730&quot; data-end=&quot;1034&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with .NET, C#, MVC Framework, MS SQL Server, stored procedures, database optimization, API development, and system integration activities. Strong knowledge of GIT version control, technical documentation, and ITIL-based support processes is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1036&quot; data-end=&quot;1389&quot;&gt;The role also involves incident resolution, bug fixing, performance tuning, deployment support, requirement analysis, and collaboration with business and functional teams. Candidates should possess strong analytical, troubleshooting, communication, and problem-solving skills with the ability to work independently in complex manufacturing environments.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-08-23 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-06-25 02:36:25.000000','2026-06-25 02:36:25.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\".NET\", \"API Integration\", \"C#\", \"ITIL\", \"MS SQL Server\", \"MVC\", \"Siemens Opcenter\", \"SQL Server\", \"Change Control Management\", \"Opcenter MDD\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1405&quot; data-end=&quot;1443&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1qqs5nn&quot; data-start=&quot;1444&quot; data-end=&quot;1506&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale Siemens Opcenter MES projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;16fr91r&quot; data-start=&quot;1507&quot; data-end=&quot;1595&quot;&gt;Work on advanced Manufacturing Execution Systems and Smart Manufacturing initiatives&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1kmt4tx&quot; data-start=&quot;1596&quot; data-end=&quot;1658&quot;&gt;Career growth in MES &amp;amp; Manufacturing Digitalization domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;13qji02&quot; data-start=&quot;1659&quot; data-end=&quot;1736&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global manufacturing and technology teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot; data-start=&quot;1737&quot; data-end=&quot;1792&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;1793&quot; data-end=&quot;1836&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('50378acd-cc1f-4309-ab2a-154578da684b','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Senior AI Engineer (GenAI / Machine Learning)','senior-ai-engineer-genai-machine-learning-347-347','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;87&quot; data-end=&quot;508&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;113&quot; data-end=&quot;136&quot;&gt;Senior AI Engineers&lt;/strong&gt; for a leading Top MNC to design and deliver enterprise-scale Artificial Intelligence, Generative AI (GenAI), and Machine Learning solutions. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in Large Language Models (LLMs), Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG), AI architecture, and intelligent automation to drive next-generation enterprise AI transformation initiatives.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;510&quot; data-end=&quot;1006&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for designing, developing, and deploying enterprise-grade GenAI and Machine Learning solutions for intelligent incident management, recommendation systems, similarity matching, resolution prediction, and root-cause analysis. The role includes building RAG-based AI applications, developing AI-powered knowledge retrieval systems, integrating AI models with enterprise platforms, defining AI architecture, and implementing continuous feedback learning mechanisms.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1008&quot; data-end=&quot;1409&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with Azure OpenAI, Machine Learning, Generative AI, RAG Architecture, LangChain, Semantic Kernel, Python, Vector Databases, AI model orchestration, and enterprise system integration. Strong understanding of LLMs, prompt engineering, AI agents, embeddings, semantic search, ServiceNow integration, and scalable AI solution architecture is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1411&quot; data-end=&quot;1924&quot;&gt;The role also involves collaborating with solution architects, data engineers, backend engineers, business stakeholders, and global delivery teams to build scalable AI platforms and intelligent automation solutions. Candidates will mentor junior AI engineers, establish AI development best practices, optimize model performance, and ensure secure, responsible, and enterprise-ready AI implementations. Strong leadership, communication, stakeholder management, analytical, and problem-solving skills are essential.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-09-20 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-07-23 01:46:59.000000','2026-07-23 01:46:59.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Agent Maintenance\", \"Azure\", \"Machine Learning\", \"Python\", \"Generative AI\", \"Prompt Engineering\", \"LangChain\", \"Vector Store\", \"LLM Fine-tuning\", \"RAG Pipelines\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1940&quot; data-end=&quot;1978&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1fwcla9&quot; data-start=&quot;1979&quot; data-end=&quot;2066&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale AI, Generative AI, and Intelligent Automation projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;t6o54h&quot; data-start=&quot;2067&quot; data-end=&quot;2167&quot;&gt;Work with the latest Large Language Models (LLMs), RAG, AI Agents, and Azure OpenAI technologies&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1a7ievx&quot; data-start=&quot;2168&quot; data-end=&quot;2262&quot;&gt;Career growth in Artificial Intelligence, Machine Learning, and Enterprise AI Architecture&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;irffqr&quot; data-start=&quot;2263&quot; data-end=&quot;2343&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global AI, engineering, and technology teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot; data-start=&quot;2344&quot; data-end=&quot;2399&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;2400&quot; data-end=&quot;2443&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('509716cc-af25-4c1b-b657-3e7b912afe14','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Full Stack Technical Lead (React.js + .NET Core)','full-stack-technical-lead-reactjs-net-core-317-317','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;90&quot; data-end=&quot;447&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced Full Stack Technical Leads for a leading Top MNC to work on enterprise-scale application development and digital transformation projects. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in React.js, .NET Core, cloud-ready application architecture, and technical leadership with experience delivering scalable enterprise solutions.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;449&quot; data-end=&quot;842&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for leading the design, architecture, development, and deployment of high-performance full-stack applications using React.js and .NET Core. The role includes building responsive user interfaces, developing secure REST APIs, optimizing application performance, designing scalable architectures, and ensuring software quality through best engineering practices.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;844&quot; data-end=&quot;1225&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with React.js, TypeScript, JavaScript, HTML5, CSS3, .NET Core, C#, REST APIs, JWT authentication, role-based access control (RBAC), SQL databases, and enterprise application development. Strong knowledge of Snowflake, Oracle Database, MS SQL Server, GitHub, Visual Studio, VS Code, Postman, and Agile methodologies is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1227&quot; data-end=&quot;1634&quot;&gt;The role also involves mentoring development teams, conducting code reviews, collaborating with Product Owners and business stakeholders, optimizing ETL and database processes, resolving production issues, and driving continuous improvement initiatives. Candidates should possess strong leadership, communication, analytical, and problem-solving skills with the ability to lead cross-functional Agile teams.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-08-30 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-07-02 02:29:35.000000','2026-07-02 02:29:35.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\".NET CORE\", \"API Gateway\", \"C#\", \"CSS3\", \"ETL\", \"HTML5\", \"JavaScript\", \"JWT (Json Web Tokens)\", \"Microsoft SQL Server\", \"Oracle\", \"React JS\", \"Snowflake\", \"Typescript\", \"Rest API Integration\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1650&quot; data-end=&quot;1688&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1cw906g&quot; data-start=&quot;1689&quot; data-end=&quot;1753&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale Full Stack Development projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;5mqpvd&quot; data-start=&quot;1754&quot; data-end=&quot;1824&quot;&gt;Work on modern React.js, .NET Core, and cloud-enabled technologies&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;19n27u9&quot; data-start=&quot;1825&quot; data-end=&quot;1894&quot;&gt;Leadership role in enterprise application development initiatives&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;91jw72&quot; data-start=&quot;1895&quot; data-end=&quot;1968&quot;&gt;Career growth in Full Stack Development &amp;amp; Technical Leadership domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;16va6xi&quot; data-start=&quot;1969&quot; data-end=&quot;2041&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global engineering and product teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot; data-start=&quot;2042&quot; data-end=&quot;2097&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;2098&quot; data-end=&quot;2141&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('50c9d254-5774-4ac8-94c7-ac40e0d4a9bf','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Software Engineer (Kotlin / Java / Python - Microservices)','software-engineer-kotlin-java-python-microservices-112-112','We are hiring a skilled Software Engineer with 4&amp;ndash;6 years of experience in backend and frontend development. The ideal candidate should have hands-on expertise in Kotlin, Java or Python, and experience building scalable microservices with AWS messaging systems (SNS/SQS).','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2025-12-05 18:30:00',0,0,'2025-10-07 13:32:10.000000','2025-10-07 13:32:10.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"AWS\", \"CSS\", \"HTML\", \"Java\", \"KOTLIN\", \"Microservices\", \"Python\", \"React\", \"SNS (Simple Notification Service)\", \"SQS\"]','[\"Opportunity to work with a global brand (Yara)&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Competitive salary and performance bonuses&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Exposure to latest cloud and frontend technologies\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('50d4af02-c2d6-49c9-b15e-76a913ca4f66','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Solution Architect – Robotics & Automation','solution-architect-robotics-automation-331-331','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;84&quot; data-end=&quot;450&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced Solution Architects &amp;ndash; Robotics &amp;amp; Automation for a leading Top MNC to drive enterprise-scale Smart Manufacturing, Industrial Automation, and Industry 4.0 transformation initiatives. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in robotics, automation architecture, OT/IT integration, manufacturing systems, and digital factory solutions.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;452&quot; data-end=&quot;862&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for designing and delivering end-to-end robotics and automation architectures for manufacturing plants, enabling highly automated and intelligent production environments. The role includes architecting solutions across Robotics, PLC, SCADA, MES, ERP, and Industrial IoT platforms while leading digital transformation programs focused on Lights-Out and Dark Factory operations.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;864&quot; data-end=&quot;1320&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with industrial robotics, collaborative robots (Cobots), Autonomous Mobile Robots (AMRs), Automated Guided Vehicles (AGVs), PLCs, SCADA systems, MES, ERP integration, industrial communication protocols, and manufacturing automation. Strong knowledge of robotics cell design, machine integration, material handling automation, vision inspection systems, and industrial control architectures is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1322&quot; data-end=&quot;1812&quot;&gt;The role also involves defining enterprise automation standards, reusable solution frameworks, vendor strategies, and technology roadmaps. Candidates will lead IT/OT integration initiatives, automation simulations, commissioning activities, and global deployment programs while collaborating with engineering, manufacturing, operations, and business stakeholders. Strong leadership, communication, stakeholder management, analytical thinking, and solution architecture skills are essential.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Hyderabad',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-09-05 0