yle=&quot;font-family: verdana, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Execute and manage production scripts&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Improve finance/ops workflows and documentation&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional teams&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Automate manual processes and ensure observability&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Follow best practices in version control and deployment&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Bachelor&rsquo;s in CS or related field&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;5+ years in software development with .NET&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Strong OOP and DSA fundamentals&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Experience with ReactJS and SQL Server&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Proficient in Git&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Good to Have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Azure cloud experience&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Power BI / Power Automate knowledge&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Domain knowledge in finance/insurance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',2000000.00,3000000.00,'₹',1,'India','PAN India',0,1,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-03-31 06:00:00',0,0,'2025-08-21 10:06:01.000000','2025-12-23 17:05:05.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\".NET\", \".NET CORE\", \"Angular\", \"Azure\", \"React JS\", \"CI/CD\"]','[\"&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt;&nbsp;Pune (Hybrid)&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\\r\\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&nbsp;5+ Years&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\\r\\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shift Time:&lt;/strong&gt;&nbsp;2:00 PM &ndash; 11:00 PM IST&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\\r\\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Notice Period:&lt;/strong&gt;&nbsp;Immediate to 15 days&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\\r\\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Must-Have Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&nbsp;.NET, React or Angular, Azure, CI/CD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('52b42d05-c2a4-4fb4-aacb-05e8162a4544','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','MES Camstar Developer (Siemens Opcenter Core / Camstar)','mes-camstar-developer-siemens-opcenter-core-camstar-348-348','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;97&quot; data-end=&quot;502&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;123&quot; data-end=&quot;149&quot;&gt;MES Camstar Developers&lt;/strong&gt; for a leading Top MNC to support enterprise-scale Manufacturing Execution System (MES) implementations across Medical Devices and Pharmaceutical manufacturing environments. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in Siemens Opcenter Core (Camstar), MES application development, system integration, and manufacturing digitalization initiatives.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;504&quot; data-end=&quot;954&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for designing, developing, configuring, and supporting Siemens Opcenter Core / Camstar solutions for global manufacturing sites. The role includes developing CIO/MIO workflows and interfaces, configuring Factory Models, building Camstar Portal applications, supporting MES upgrades, integrating enterprise and shopfloor systems, resolving production issues, and delivering scalable manufacturing execution solutions.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;956&quot; data-end=&quot;1426&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with Siemens Opcenter Core (Camstar), Camstar Designer, Camstar Portal Development, CIO/MIO Workflow Development, COA, CIO &amp;amp; MIO Interface Connectivity, Factory Model implementation, Azure Kubernetes, SQL development, MES implementation, and enterprise system integration. Strong knowledge of ERP, LIMS, Equipment Integration, HMI, Computer System Validation (CSV), and regulated manufacturing processes is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1428&quot; data-end=&quot;1947&quot;&gt;The role also involves collaborating with business stakeholders, manufacturing teams, automation engineers, architects, validation teams, and global delivery teams to gather requirements, support site deployments, lead implementation activities, resolve production incidents, and ensure successful delivery of enterprise MES projects. Candidates should possess strong analytical, communication, stakeholder management, leadership, and problem-solving skills with experience working in global manufacturing environments.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-09-20 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-07-23 01:54:17.000000','2026-07-23 01:54:17.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Camstar\", \"Camstar Designer\", \"CSV\", \"ERP Implementation\", \"Lims\", \"Mes\", \"Microsoft SQL Server\", \"Siemens Opcenter\", \"SQL Server\", \"AKS\", \"HMI\", \"Camstar Portal Development\", \"CIO Workflow Development\", \"MIO Workflow Development\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1963&quot; data-end=&quot;2001&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1jb3rem&quot; data-start=&quot;2002&quot; data-end=&quot;2086&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale MES and Smart Manufacturing transformation projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1jy1h0e&quot; data-start=&quot;2087&quot; data-end=&quot;2183&quot;&gt;Work with advanced Siemens Opcenter Core (Camstar) technologies and Industry 4.0 initiatives&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;nk4w4z&quot; data-start=&quot;2184&quot; data-end=&quot;2268&quot;&gt;Career growth in Manufacturing Execution Systems (MES) and Digital Manufacturing&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;13qji02&quot; data-start=&quot;2269&quot; data-end=&quot;2346&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global manufacturing and technology teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot; data-start=&quot;2347&quot; data-end=&quot;2402&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;2403&quot; data-end=&quot;2446&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('52d5903e-fb6e-41ba-83fe-aa03334cb19e','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Data & Analytics Specialist','data-analytics-specialist-339-339','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;69&quot; data-end=&quot;461&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced Data &amp;amp; Analytics Specialists for a leading Top MNC to work on enterprise-scale Data Analytics, Business Intelligence, and Digital Transformation initiatives. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in data analytics, business intelligence, data engineering, and visualization technologies to deliver actionable business insights across enterprise functions.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;463&quot; data-end=&quot;888&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for analyzing complex datasets, designing and developing interactive dashboards, building scalable ETL pipelines, and implementing data models that support business intelligence and analytics initiatives. The role includes transforming raw data into meaningful insights, optimizing reporting solutions, ensuring data quality, and enabling data-driven decision-making across the organization.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;890&quot; data-end=&quot;1222&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with Python, SQL, Power BI, Tableau, ETL tools, data modeling, data warehousing, and modern cloud-based analytics platforms. Strong knowledge of Snowflake, Amazon Redshift, Google BigQuery, Azure Data Factory, Informatica, Talend, and enterprise reporting solutions is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1224&quot; data-end=&quot;1645&quot;&gt;The role also involves collaborating with business stakeholders, data engineers, data scientists, and cross-functional teams to gather requirements, develop analytics solutions, improve data governance, optimize database performance, and support predictive analytics and machine learning initiatives. Candidates should possess strong analytical thinking, communication, stakeholder management, and problem-solving skills.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-09-13 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-07-16 02:23:45.000000','2026-07-16 02:23:45.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Business Intelligence\", \"Data Analytics\", \"Data Integration\", \"Data Modeling\", \"Data Validation\", \"Data Warehousing\", \"ETL\", \"Informatica\", \"PostgreSQL\", \"Power BI\", \"Python\", \"Snowflake\", \"SQL\", \"Tableau\", \"ADF\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1661&quot; data-end=&quot;1699&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;93976g&quot; data-start=&quot;1700&quot; data-end=&quot;1782&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale Data Analytics and Business Intelligence projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1pc816z&quot; data-start=&quot;1783&quot; data-end=&quot;1869&quot;&gt;Work with modern cloud analytics, data engineering, and visualization technologies&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;m286vf&quot; data-start=&quot;1870&quot; data-end=&quot;1950&quot;&gt;Career growth in Data Analytics, Business Intelligence, and Data Engineering&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;vq0hl0&quot; data-start=&quot;1951&quot; data-end=&quot;2023&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global business and technology teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot; data-start=&quot;2024&quot; data-end=&quot;2079&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;2080&quot; data-end=&quot;2123&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('52f83056-ad49-4929-9f65-1dbabd55d2d0','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Senior/Junior Backend Developer – Cosmos DB & Kafka','seniorjunior-backend-developer-cosmos-db-kafka-32-32','&lt;h2 class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;258&quot; data-end=&quot;280&quot;&gt;Job Title:&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;281&quot; data-end=&quot;338&quot;&gt;Senior/Junior Backend Developer &ndash; Cosmos DB &amp;amp; Kafka&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;340&quot; data-end=&quot;361&quot;&gt;Experience:&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;362&quot; data-end=&quot;374&quot;&gt;3 to 5+ Years&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;376&quot; data-end=&quot;395&quot;&gt;Location:&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;396&quot; data-end=&quot;461&quot;&gt;Chennai (Preferred) / Pan India (Remote/Hybrid Options Available)&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;463&quot; data-end=&quot;482&quot;&gt;Job Type:&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;483&quot; data-end=&quot;494&quot;&gt;Full-time&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;501&quot; data-end=&quot;523&quot;&gt;Job Summary:&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;524&quot; data-end=&quot;795&quot;&gt;We are looking for experienced Backend Developers (Senior/Junior levels) with strong expertise in Apache Kafka and Azure Cosmos DB. You will play a key role in designing and implementing scalable, real-time backend solutions for mission-critical applications.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;802&quot; data-end=&quot;831&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;832&quot; data-end=&quot;1439&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;832&quot; data-end=&quot;948&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;834&quot; data-end=&quot;948&quot;&gt;Design, develop, and maintain backend systems and data pipelines using Apache Kafka and Azure Cosmos DB.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;949&quot; data-end=&quot;1019&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;951&quot; data-end=&quot;1019&quot;&gt;Implement real-time data streaming and event-driven architectures.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1020&quot; data-end=&quot;1106&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1022&quot; data-end=&quot;1106&quot;&gt;Develop Kafka producers and consumers to handle high-volume, low-latency data.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1107&quot; data-end=&quot;1193&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1109&quot; data-end=&quot;1193&quot;&gt;Optimize data models and queries within Cosmos DB for performance and scalability.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1194&quot; data-end=&quot;1272&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1196&quot; data-end=&quot;1272&quot;&gt;Work with Kafka Connect for data integration across sources and sinks.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1273&quot; data-end=&quot;1358&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1275&quot; data-end=&quot;1358&quot;&gt;Collaborate with frontend, DevOps, and QA teams for end-to-end solution delivery.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1359&quot; data-end=&quot;1439&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1361&quot; data-end=&quot;1439&quot;&gt;Leverage Azure cloud services like Function Apps, Event Hubs, etc.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1446&quot; data-end=&quot;1470&quot;&gt;Required Skills:&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1471&quot; data-end=&quot;1946&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1471&quot; data-end=&quot;1520&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1473&quot; data-end=&quot;1520&quot;&gt;3&ndash;5+ years of backend development experience.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1521&quot; data-end=&quot;1617&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1523&quot; data-end=&quot;1617&quot;&gt;Strong hands-on experience with Apache Kafka (producers, consumers, topics, partitions).&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1618&quot; data-end=&quot;1714&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1620&quot; data-end=&quot;1714&quot;&gt;Proficiency in working with Cosmos DB (NoSQL), including query tuning and data modeling.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1715&quot; data-end=&quot;1783&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1717&quot; data-end=&quot;1783&quot;&gt;Familiarity with Kafka Connect for source/sink integrations.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1784&quot; data-end=&quot;1892&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1786&quot; data-end=&quot;1892&quot;&gt;Solid knowledge of RESTful APIs, data structures, and backend frameworks (Node.js, Java, or Python).&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1893&quot; data-end=&quot;1946&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1895&quot; data-end=&quot;1946&quot;&gt;Experience working with Azure cloud services.Good-to-Have:&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1975&quot; data-end=&quot;2174&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1975&quot; data-end=&quot;2023&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1977&quot; data-end=&quot;2023&quot;&gt;Knowledge of microservices architecture.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2024&quot; data-end=&quot;2113&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2026&quot; data-end=&quot;2113&quot;&gt;Experience with stream processing frameworks (e.g., Apache Flink, Kafka Streams).&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2114&quot; data-end=&quot;2174&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2116&quot; data-end=&quot;2174&quot;&gt;Familiarity with CI/CD pipelines and DevOps tools.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',500000.00,2500000.00,'₹',0,'India','Chennai',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-30 06:00:00',0,0,'2025-05-15 13:52:02.000000','2026-05-12 14:53:32.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Azure\", \"Azure Cosmos DB\", \"Cosmos DB\", \"DevOps\", \"Event Hubs\", \"Kafka\", \"Kafka Security\"]','[\"&lt;h3 class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2181&quot; data-end=&quot;2202&quot;&gt;Job Benefits:&lt;/h3&gt;\\r\\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2203&quot; data-end=&quot;2468&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2203&quot; data-end=&quot;2256&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2205&quot; data-end=&quot;2256&quot;&gt;Competitive salary with performance incentives&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2257&quot; data-end=&quot;2313&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2259&quot; data-end=&quot;2313&quot;&gt;Flexible work hours and hybrid/remote flexibility&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2314&quot; data-end=&quot;2359&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2316&quot; data-end=&quot;2359&quot;&gt;Health insurance and wellness benefits&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2360&quot; data-end=&quot;2410&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2362&quot; data-end=&quot;2410&quot;&gt;Upskilling opportunities and certifications&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2411&quot; data-end=&quot;2468&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2413&quot; data-end=&quot;2468&quot;&gt;Exposure to global projects and cloud technologies&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Tamil Nadu'),('535fa93e-98fb-42cf-aad9-5059bcc0e92e','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Power Apps / Power Automate Developer','power-apps-power-automate-developer-303-303','&lt;p data-start=&quot;79&quot; data-end=&quot;405&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced Power Apps / Power Automate Developers for a leading Top MNC to work on enterprise automation, digital transformation, and Microsoft Power Platform initiatives. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in Power Apps, Power Automate, Copilot technologies, and Microsoft ecosystem integrations.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;407&quot; data-end=&quot;758&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for designing, developing, and deploying business applications and automated workflows using Microsoft Power Platform technologies. The role includes building Canvas and Model-Driven Apps, creating cloud and desktop automation flows, and implementing scalable low-code/no-code solutions to improve business processes.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;760&quot; data-end=&quot;1052&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with Dataverse, SharePoint, Microsoft 365 integrations, Power Automate, Power Apps, and third-party API integrations. Strong knowledge of Copilot Studio, Power Virtual Agents, AI Builder, and Azure OpenAI integration concepts is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1054&quot; data-end=&quot;1446&quot;&gt;The role also involves developing AI-powered chatbots, optimizing automation solutions, implementing governance standards, monitoring platform performance, and collaborating with business and technical teams to deliver innovative enterprise solutions. Candidates should possess strong analytical, communication, and problem-solving skills with a passion for automation and digital innovation.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-08-22 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-06-24 03:22:16.000000','2026-06-24 03:22:17.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Azure\", \"Canvas Apps\", \"Microsoft 365 Integration\", \"Dataverse\", \"Microsoft Power Apps\", \"Microsoft Power Automate\", \"Copilot Studio\", \"Microsoft Power Platform\", \"SharePoint Integration\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1462&quot; data-end=&quot;1500&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;snpizq&quot; data-start=&quot;1501&quot; data-end=&quot;1557&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale Power Platform projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;5c4879&quot; data-start=&quot;1558&quot; data-end=&quot;1632&quot;&gt;Work on advanced Microsoft Copilot and AI-powered automation solutions&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;wmya4&quot; data-start=&quot;1633&quot; data-end=&quot;1702&quot;&gt;Career growth in Low-Code/No-Code Development &amp;amp; Automation domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;vq0hl0&quot; data-start=&quot;1703&quot; data-end=&quot;1775&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global business and technology teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot; data-start=&quot;1776&quot; data-end=&quot;1831&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;1832&quot; data-end=&quot;1875&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('538571b9-c73f-440d-a68a-b4f8e322c834','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Developer - Labeling','developer-labeling-234-234','&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;Loftware Developer:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Responsible for leading ASPAC Loftware on‑premises to cloud migrations, owning end‑to‑end program delivery. Manage milestones, governance, vendors, risks, and dependencies. Drive global stakeholder alignment and execute zero‑disruption, compliant multisite cutovers across China, Japan, India, and Singapore, ensuring business continuity, performance, and scalability within regulated manufacturing and enterprise labeling environments globally.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Working knowledge in Loftware is required. Understanding Cloud and migration project background is a plus point.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Entry',NULL,NULL,'INR',1,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-05-31 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-04-01 20:01:47.000000','2026-04-01 20:17:55.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Mes\", \"SAP\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;Competitive salary package with performance-based incentives&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;65&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;67&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;Health insurance coverage and statutory benefits (PF &amp;amp; Gratuity)&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;134&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;136&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on large-scale enterprise energy management projects&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;211&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;213&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;Strong career growth and learning opportunities&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;263&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;265&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;Collaborative and professional work environment&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('545dbd5b-fe26-4e91-9391-3cc9462f9292','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','LIMS Labware Developer / Support Specialist','lims-labware-developer-support-specialist-280-280','&lt;p data-start=&quot;85&quot; data-end=&quot;390&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced LIMS Labware Developers / Support Specialists for a leading Top MNC in the Pharma and Life Sciences domain. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in Labware LIMS configuration, customization, deployment, and support activities within regulated laboratory environments.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;392&quot; data-end=&quot;751&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for handling Labware LIMS development, implementation, deployment, and support activities across global laboratory systems. The role includes configuring and customizing Labware LIMS modules, troubleshooting application issues, supporting L1/L2/L3 operations, and ensuring smooth functioning of enterprise laboratory systems.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;753&quot; data-end=&quot;1064&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with instrument interfaces, CDS systems such as OpenLab and ATLAS, enterprise application integrations, reporting tools, and SQL databases. Strong knowledge of Java, J2EE, JBoss Server, Oracle/MS SQL, CSV processes, and GxP compliance standards is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1066&quot; data-end=&quot;1443&quot;&gt;The role also involves working closely with clients and business users to understand requirements, support upgrades and implementation projects, mentor team members, and maintain global Labware LIMS instances. Candidates should possess strong analytical, troubleshooting, communication, and documentation skills with experience in pharmaceutical and life sciences environments.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-07-20 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-05-22 02:28:42.000000','2026-05-22 02:28:42.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"CDS Views\", \"CSV\", \"Gxp Compliance\", \"J2EE\", \"Java\", \"Jboss\", \"MS SQL Server\", \"Oracle\", \"Pharmaceutical\", \"Technical Support (L1, L2, L3)\", \"LabWare LIMS\", \"Atlas UI\", \"LabVantage LIMS\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1459&quot; data-end=&quot;1497&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;bhyf3x&quot; data-start=&quot;1498&quot; data-end=&quot;1552&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-level Labware LIMS projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;43h2oq&quot; data-start=&quot;1553&quot; data-end=&quot;1609&quot;&gt;Work on global pharmaceutical and laboratory systems&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;2sbwzk&quot; data-start=&quot;1610&quot; data-end=&quot;1658&quot;&gt;Career growth in LIMS &amp;amp; Life Sciences domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;o2e7cv&quot; data-start=&quot;1659&quot; data-end=&quot;1726&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with international teams and clients&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;2lee9a&quot; data-start=&quot;1727&quot; data-end=&quot;1782&quot;&gt;Professional and compliance-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;1783&quot; data-end=&quot;1826&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('54d51158-e1dd-4e4c-a245-8051581cc4fb','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Lead Databricks Engineer / Senior Databricks Engineer','lead-databricks-engineer-senior-databricks-engineer-235-235','Data Pipeline Development &lt;br /&gt;&a