a83-d1de1e725d54','TrakSYS Consultant','traksys-consultant-268-268','&lt;p data-start=&quot;60&quot; data-end=&quot;346&quot;&gt;We are hiring skilled TrakSYS Consultants for a leading Top MNC to work on enterprise-level digital manufacturing and MES projects. The ideal candidate should have hands-on experience in TrakSYS application support, customization, implementation, and manufacturing process environments.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;348&quot; data-end=&quot;674&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for working on TrakSYS implementation, upgrade, and support activities across manufacturing projects. The role includes gathering business requirements, configuring MES solutions, troubleshooting application issues, and supporting manufacturing operations for process and discrete industries.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;676&quot; data-end=&quot;905&quot;&gt;Professionals should have strong technical expertise in C# .NET, MS SQL, T-SQL, and SQL query debugging. Experience with MES integrations involving SAP, Labware LIMS, and other manufacturing applications will be highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;907&quot; data-end=&quot;1174&quot;&gt;The role also requires collaboration with business users, stakeholders, and technical teams to optimize manufacturing processes and deliver efficient MES solutions. Strong communication, analytical thinking, and client-handling skills are essential for this position.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-07-10 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-05-12 02:36:17.000000','2026-05-12 02:36:17.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\".NET\", \"C#\", \"Mes\", \"MES Integration\", \"MS SQL Server\", \"SAP Integration\", \"LabWare LIMS\", \"Manufacturing Process Optimization\", \"TrakSYS\", \"TrakSYS Customization\", \"TrakSYS Support\", \"Discrete Manufacturing\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1190&quot