/&gt;- Troubleshoot, debug, and resolve technical issues in BRM/ECE environments.&lt;br /&gt;- Stay updated with the latest industry trends and Oracle BRM best practices.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Requirements:&lt;br /&gt;- 5+ years of experience with Oracle BRM and ECE.&lt;br /&gt;- Strong understanding of telecom industry billing systems.&lt;br /&gt;- Expertise in PDC, ECE, and opcode development.&lt;br /&gt;- Excellent problem-solving and analytical skills.&lt;br /&gt;- Strong communication and collaboration skills.','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-19 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-08-27 11:00:54.000000','2025-11-21 04:43:22.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Billing Systems\", \"Cross-Functional Teams\", \"Enterprise\", \"Oracle\", \"Oracle ERP\", \"Oracle Forms 6i\", \"Pricing Strategies\", \"Problem Solving\", \"Technical\", \"Telecom\", \"Troubleshooting\"]','[\"- Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;br /&gt;- 100% Remote work flexibility (Work from anywhere in India)&lt;br /&gt;- Opportunity to work on complex and challenging telecom projects&lt;br /&gt;- Professional growth and continuous learning opportunities&lt;br /&gt;- Collaborative and innovative work culture\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('553c559f-04c7-4a09-8e1b-8e7e6bbc2e64','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','SDET / C++ Developer / Tester','sdet-c-developer-tester-380-380','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;234&quot; data-end=&quot;452&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;260&quot; data-end=&quot;313&quot;&gt;SDET / C++ Developers / Test Automation Engineers&lt;/strong&gt; for a leading &lt;strong data-start=&quot;328&quot; data-end=&quot;339&quot;&gt;Top MNC&lt;/strong&gt; working on complex, high-performance software solutions in the &lt;strong data-start=&quot;403&quot; data-end=&quot;444&quot;&gt;Manufacturing, Semicondu