art=&quot;954&quot; data-end=&quot;1022&quot;&gt;Develop and optimize &lt;strong data-start=&quot;975&quot; data-end=&quot;993&quot;&gt;MS SQL queries&lt;/strong&gt; for Trackwise applications&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1023&quot; data-end=&quot;1092&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1025&quot; data-end=&quot;1092&quot;&gt;Provide timely &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1040&quot; data-end=&quot;1074&quot;&gt;support for application issues&lt;/strong&gt; and escalations&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1093&quot; data-end=&quot;1176&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1095&quot; data-end=&quot;1176&quot;&gt;Collaborate with offshore and onshore teams to ensure high-quality deliverables&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1177&quot; data-end=&quot;1232&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1179&quot; data-end=&quot;1232&quot;&gt;Maintain compliance with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1204&quot; data-end=&quot;1232&quot;&gt;IT and quality standards&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'INR',1,'India','Hyderabad',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-06-16 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-04-18 04:01:02.000000','2026-04-18 04:01:02.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Apache Kafka\", \"ITIL\", \"MS SQL Server\", \"EQMS Developer\", \"Trackwise Developer\", \"Trackwise configuration\"]','[\"&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1925&quot; data-end=&quot;2284&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1925&quot; data-end=&quot;2009&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1927&quot; data-end=&quot;2009&quot;&gt;Work with a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1939&quot; data-end=&quot;1973&quot;&gt;leading company in dermatology&lt;/strong&gt; focused on advancing patient care&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2010&quot; data-end=&quot;2103&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2012&quot; data-end=&quot;2103&quot;&gt;Opportunity to grow &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2032&quot; data-end=&quot;2047&quot;&gt;technically&lt;/strong&gt; and gain deep &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2062&quot; data-end=&quot;2101&quot;&gt;domain expertise in quality systems&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2104&quot; data-end=&quot;2163&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2106&quot; data-end=&quot;2163&quot;&gt;Exposure to &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2118&quot; data-end=&quot;2152&quot;&gt;Trackwise/EQMS implementations&lt;/strong&gt; at scale&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2164&quot; data-end=&quot;2221&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2166&quot; data-end=&quot;2221&quot;&gt;Collaborate with a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2185&quot; data-end=&quot;2219&quot;&gt;global, offshore delivery team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2222&quot; data-end=&quot;2284&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2224&quot; data-end=&quot;2284&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2247&quot; data-end=&quot;2282&quot;&gt;regulatory-compliant IT systems&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Telangana'),('5625a984-bd02-4897-9bf5-dd42893c27b8','5c88e4d2-4e38-4e15-817b-a19fe3090e8c','537b19b2-0785-46b6-9899-ed1f166a0469','Lead Cloud & DevOps Architect','lead-cloud-devops-architect','Looking for an expert Kubernetes and AWS Cloud Architect to lead infrastructure scalability.','Engineering','Full-time','Mid',3000000.00,4500000.00,'USD',1,'United States','Bengaluru',1,0,'[]','PUBLISHED','2026-12-10 05:37:56',0,0,'2026-10-11 05:37:56.492787','2026-10-16 05:31:40.000000','INTERNAL','https://careers.camzytech.com/jobs/devops-lead','[\"AWS\", \"Kubernetes\", \"Docker\", \"Terraform\", \"Microservices\"]',NULL,'ANY',0,5,NULL),('56402697-e855-4855-9a54-601c48fbacbd','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','MES Camstar Developer (Siemens Opcenter Core / Camstar)','mes-camstar-developer-siemens-opcenter-core-camstar-348-348','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;97&quot; data-end=&quot;502&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;123&quot; data-end=&quot;149&quot;&gt;MES Camstar Developers&lt;/strong&gt; for a leading Top MNC to support enterprise-scale Manufacturing Execution System (MES) implementations across Medical Devices and Pharmaceutical manufacturing environments. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in Siemens Opcenter Core (Camstar), MES application development, system integration, and manufacturing digitalization initiatives.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;504&quot; data-end=&quot;954&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for designing, developing, configuring, and supporting Siemens Opcenter Core / Camstar solutions for global manufacturing sites. The role includes developing CIO/MIO workflows and interfaces, configuring Factory Models, building Camstar Portal applications, supporting MES upgrades, integrating enterprise and shopfloor systems, resolving production issues, and delivering scalable manufacturing execution solutions.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;956&quot; data-end=&quot;1426&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with Siemens Opcenter Core (Camstar), Camstar Designer, Camstar Portal Development, CIO/MIO Workflow Development, COA, CIO &amp;amp; MIO Interface Connectivity, Factory Model implementation, Azure Kubernetes, SQL development, MES implementation, and enterprise system integration. Strong knowledge of ERP, LIMS, Equipment Integration, HMI, Computer System Validation (CSV), and regulated manufacturing processes is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1428&quot; data-end=&quot;1947&quot;&gt;The role also involves collaborating with business stakeholders, manufacturing teams, automation engineers, architects, validation teams, and global delivery teams to gather requirements, support site deployments, lead implementation activities, resolve production incidents, and ensure successful delivery of enterprise MES projects. Candidates should possess strong analytical, communication, stakeholder management, leadership, and problem-solving skills with experience working in global manufacturing environments.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-09-20 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-07-23 01:54:17.000000','2026-07-23 01:54:17.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Camstar\", \"Camstar Designer\", \"CSV\", \"ERP Implementation\", \"Lims\", \"Mes\", \"Microsoft SQL Server\", \"Siemens Opcenter\", \"SQL Server\", \"AKS\", \"HMI\", \"Camstar Portal Development\", \"CIO Workflow Development\", \"MIO Workflow Development\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1963&quot; data-end=&quot;2001&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1jb3rem&quot; data-start=&quot;2002&quot; data-end=&quot;2086&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale MES and Smart Manufacturing transformation projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1jy1h0e&quot; data-start=&quot;2087&quot; data-end=&quot;2183&quot;&gt;Work with advanced Siemens Opcenter Core (Camstar) technologies and Industry 4.0 initiatives&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;nk4w4z&quot; data-start=&quot;2184&quot; data-end=&quot;2268&quot;&gt;Career growth in Manufacturing Execution Systems (MES) and Digital Manufacturing&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;13qji02&quot; data-start=&quot;2269&quot; data-end=&quot;2346&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global manufacturing and technology teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot; data-start=&quot;2347&quot; data-end=&quot;2402&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;2403&quot; data-end=&quot;2446&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('56635f94-a578-4b00-b76c-762a490dd608','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Computer Vision Expert','computer-vision-expert-387-387','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;100&quot; data-end=&quot;477&quot;&gt;We are looking for an experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;134&quot; data-end=&quot;160&quot;&gt;Computer Vision Expert&lt;/strong&gt; with 10+ years of strong hands-on experience in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;209&quot; data-end=&quot;325&quot;&gt;Computer Vision, Deep Learning, Visual Language Models (VLMs), Multimodal AI, and production-grade AI deployment&lt;/strong&gt;. The role will focus on designing, developing, optimizing, and deploying advanced vision and multimodal AI solutions for enterprise-scale applications.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;479&quot; data-end=&quot;913&quot;&gt;The ideal candidate should have deep expertise across &lt;strong data-start=&quot;533&quot; data-end=&quot;732&quot;&gt;object detection, image segmentation, image classification, OCR, image captioning, scene understanding, pose estimation, depth estimation, facial recognition, and camera-based inference pipelines&lt;/strong&gt;. Strong experience with modern computer vision architectures such as YOLO, Faster R-CNN, SSD, U-Net, Mask R-CNN, DeepLab, ResNet, EfficientNet, and Vision Transformers is expected.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-11-10 07:00:00',0,0,'2026-09-12 01:58:53.000000','2026-09-12 01:58:53.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Computer Vision\", \"PyTorch\", \"TensorFlow\", \"OpenCV\", \"Tesseract OCR\", \"Hugging Face\", \"YOLO\", \"U-Net\", \"GPT-4V\", \"Faster R-CNN\", \"SSD\", \"Mask R-CNN\", \"Multimodal AI\", \"Flamingo\", \"DeepLab\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;iofbfz&quot; data-start=&quot;1715&quot; data-end=&quot;1763&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a leading &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1752&quot; data-end=&quot;1763&quot;&gt;Top MNC&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;166gzem&quot; data-start=&quot;1764&quot; data-end=&quot;1830&quot;&gt;Work on advanced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1783&quot; data-end=&quot;1820&quot;&gt;Computer Vision and Multimodal AI&lt;/strong&gt; solutions&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;8zrbh&quot; data-start=&quot;1831&quot; data-end=&quot;1889&quot;&gt;Exposure to &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1845&quot; data-end=&quot;1889&quot;&gt;Visual Language Models and Generative AI&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;lmb58o&quot; data-start=&quot;1890&quot; data-end=&quot;1951&quot;&gt;Opportunity to build production-grade AI solutions at scale&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1mvco6z&quot; data-start=&quot;1952&quot; data-end=&quot;2017&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience with modern Deep Learning and AI frameworks&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1cgbluc&quot; data-start=&quot;2018&quot; data-end=&quot;2082&quot;&gt;Exposure to GPU/TPU-based AI deployment and model optimization&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('56792f13-7c8b-43e0-b79e-2355021da631','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Automation & Robotics Engineer – Connectivity Specialist','automation-robotics-engineer-connectivity-specialist-274-274','&lt;p data-start=&quot;98&quot; data-end=&quot;443&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced Automation &amp;amp; Robotics Engineers &amp;ndash; Connectivity Specialists for a leading Top MNC to work on Industrial Automation, Robotics, IoT Connectivity, and Smart Manufacturing projects. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in industrial machine connectivity, real-time data monitoring, and Industry 4.0 technologies.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;445&quot; data-end=&quot;776&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for integrating industrial machines, robotics systems, and IoT-enabled devices within manufacturing environments. The role includes developing and maintaining industrial connectivity solutions using OPCUA, MQTT, PLC, and SCADA technologies to support seamless communication across factory systems.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;778&quot; data-end=&quot;1071&quot;&gt;Professionals should have experience in real-time and batch data collection systems, dashboard development, factory performance monitoring, and industrial networking protocols. Strong knowledge of automation system integration, troubleshooting, and smart factory solutions is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1073&quot; data-end=&quot;1402&quot;&gt;The role also involves supporting production monitoring initiatives, training end users on connected systems, and collaborating with automation, operations, and IT/OT teams to improve manufacturing efficiency and connectivity infrastructure. Candidates should possess strong analytical, problem-solving, and communication skills.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-07-12 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-05-14 03:45:53.000000','2026-05-14 03:45:53.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Industrial Automation\", \"IOT\", \"PLC\", \"Robotics\", \"SCADA\", \"OPC UA\", \"MQTT\", \"Smart Manufacturing\", \"Factory Automation\", \"Industrial IT/OT\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1418&quot; data-end=&quot;1456&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1metyg4&quot; data-start=&quot;1457&quot; data-end=&quot;1518&quot;&gt;Exposure to Industry 4.0 and Smart Manufacturing projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;uxjazj&quot; data-start=&quot;1519&quot; data-end=&quot;1582&quot;&gt;Work on advanced Industrial Automation &amp;amp; Robotics solutions&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;10xvzoe&quot; data-start=&quot;1583&quot; data-end=&quot;1641&quot;&gt;Career growth in Automation, IoT &amp;amp; Connectivity domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;uhu09b&quot; data-start=&quot;1642&quot; data-end=&quot;1704&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global manufacturing teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;45fk39&quot; data-start=&quot;1705&quot; data-end=&quot;1760&quot;&gt;Professional and technology-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;1761&quot; data-end=&quot;1804&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('586ea0be-5705-431e-87fc-7b108ef05044','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','LabVantage Developer','labvantage-developer-311-311','&lt;p data-start=&quot;62&quot; data-end=&quot;468&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced LabVantage Developers for a leading Top MNC to work on enterprise-scale Laboratory Information Management System (LIMS) projects for global pharmaceutical and life sciences clients. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in LabVantage LIMS development, configuration, customization, system administration, and production support within regulated laboratory environments.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;470&quot; data-end=&quot;884&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for designing, developing, configuring, installing, upgrading, and maintaining LabVantage LIMS applications to support laboratory operations and business requirements. The role includes implementing system enhancements, handling production support activities, managing incidents and change requests, and ensuring high system availability and performance across global deployments.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;886&quot; data-end=&quot;1203&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with LabVantage LIMS, Core Java, Jasper Reports, XML, SQL, RDBMS, NoSQL databases, SDMS modules, and JBoss application server. Strong knowledge of application development, database management, deployment processes, and enterprise laboratory workflows is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1205&quot; data-end=&quot;1644&quot;&gt;The role also involves collaborating with global clients, laboratory users, business stakeholders, and technical teams to deliver enterprise-grade laboratory solutions. Candidates will support production environments, perform technical change management, develop customized reports, and ensure compliance with industry standards and best practices. Strong analytical, communication, documentation, and problem-solving skills are essential.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Noida',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-08-24 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-06-26 03:31:38.000000','2026-06-26 03:31:38.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Core Java\", \"Jasper Reports\", \"NoSQL\", \"RDBMS\", \"SQL Server\", \"XML\", \"LabVantage\", \"LabVantage LIMS\", \"Change Control Management\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1660&quot; data-end=&quot;1698&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1xmivuy&quot; data-start=&quot;1699&quot; data-end=&quot;1783&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale LabVantage LIMS implementation and support projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;jgrixg&quot; data-start=&quot;1784&quot; data-end=&quot;1870&quot;&gt;Work with global pharmaceutical and life sciences clients across the US and Europe&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;6wfdjr&quot; data-start=&quot;1871&quot; data-end=&quot;1945&quot;&gt;Career growth in Laboratory Informatics &amp;amp; Digital Laboratory Solutions&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;i1fuo0&quot; data-start=&quot;1946&quot; data-end=&quot;2024&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with international business and technical teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;2lee9a&quot; data-start=&quot;2025&quot; data-end=&quot;2080&quot;&gt;Professional and compliance-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;2081&quot; data-end=&quot;2124&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Uttar Pradesh'),('58953ffb-00d1-4cd9-9470-73eba1dee117','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Empower 3 CDS & NuGenesis 9 Deployment and Support Lead','empower-3-cds-nugenesis-9-deployment-and-support-lead-343-343','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;97&quot; data-end=&quot;569&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;123&quot; data-end=&quot;183&quot;&gt;Empower 3 CDS &amp;amp; NuGenesis 9 Deployment and Support Leads&lt;/strong&gt; for a leading Top MNC to support enterprise-scale Laboratory Informatics, Chromatography Data Systems (CDS), Scientific Data Management Systems (SDMS), and Digital Laboratory Transformation initiatives. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in Waters Empower 3 CDS, NuGenesis SDMS/ELN, laboratory system administration, validation, and regulated pharmaceutical environments.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;571&quot; data-end=&quot;1046&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for deploying, configuring, administering, and supporting Waters Empower 3 CDS and NuGenesis 9 SDMS/ELN platforms across global laboratory environments. The role includes system installation and configuration, chromatography instrument integration, laboratory workflow customization, user and security management, system upgrades, patch management, troubleshooting, and production support while ensuring compliance with regulatory standards.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1048&quot; data-end=&quot;1550&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with Waters Empower 3 CDS, NuGenesis SDMS, NuGenesis ELN, HPLC, UPLC, GC instrument integration, laboratory workflow configuration, file capture, print capture templates, user administration, security management, validation activities (IQ, OQ, PQ), and enterprise system integration. Strong knowledge of GxP, FDA 21 CFR Part 11, EU GMP Annex 11, ALCOA+ Data Integrity principles, SOP creation, change control, and laboratory compliance is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1552&quot; data-end=&quot;2056&quot;&gt;The role also involves collaborating with laboratory scientists, quality assurance teams, IT administrators, validation teams, and global business stakeholders to deliver reliable laboratory informatics solutions. Candidates will support enterprise laboratory transformation initiatives, perform root cause analysis, prepare technical documentation, manage incidents, and ensure high system availability. Strong analytical, communication, stakeholder management, and problem-solving skills are essential.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Hyderabad',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-09-15 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-07-18 03:11:38.000000','2026-07-18 03:11:38.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"CSV\", \"ERP\", \"Gxp Compliance\", \"OQ\", \"PQ\", \"Role-Based Access Control (Rbac)\", \"Electronic Lab Notebook (ELN)\", \"21 CFR Part 11\", \"SDMS Integration\", \"Waters Empower\", \"Chromatography Data Systems (CDS)\", \"LIMS Integration\", \"ELN Integration\", \"Waters Empower CDS\", \"NuGenesis SDMS Administration\", \"NuGenesis ELN Administration\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;2072&quot; data-end=&quot;2110&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;12yjmd7&quot; data-start=&quot;2111&quot; data-end=&quot;2213&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale Laboratory Informatics and Digital Laboratory Transformation projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;11xsrw2&quot; data-start=&quot;2214&quot; data-end=&quot;2293&quot;&gt;Work with advanced Waters Empower 3 CDS and NuGenesis SDMS/ELN technologies&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;svxamc&quot; data-start=&quot;2294&quot; data-end=&quot;2370&quot;&gt;Career growth in Laboratory Informatics, CDS, SDMS, and Life Sciences IT&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1n46o5e&quot; data-start=&quot;2371&quot; data-end=&quot;2452&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global pharmaceutical and life sciences teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot; data-start=&quot;2453&quot; data-end=&quot;2508&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;2509&quot; data-end=&quot;2552&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Telangana');
INSERT INTO `job_postings` VALUES ('58ba07fe-641e-430b-bfe5-3ca1783e37d1','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Senior Data Engineer – Informatica / IICS / Python / SQL','senior-data-engineer-informatica-iics-python-sql-62-62','&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;509&quot; data-end=&quot;538&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;513&quot; data-end=&quot;538&quot;&gt;Job Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;540&quot; data-end=&quot;1673&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;540&quot; data-end=&quot;644&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;542&quot; data-end=&quot;644&quot;&gt;Develop and maintain robust data integration solutions using Informatica (IICS), Python, MDM, and SQL.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;645&quot; data-end=&quot;760&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;647&quot; data-end=&quot;760&quot;&gt;Design end-to-end data pipelines to support complex business requirements in a cloud-based technical environment.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;761&quot; data-end=&quot;916&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;763&quot; data-end=&quot;916&quot;&gt;Participate in all phases of cloud development: requirements gathering, design, development, deployment, maintenance, performance tuning, and monitoring.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;917&quot; data-end=&quot;1024&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;919&quot; data-end=&quot;1024&quot;&gt;Contribute to strategies around data transformation, change management, and business process improvement.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1025&quot; data-end=&quot;1122&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1027&quot; data-end=&quot;1122&quot;&gt;Work with geospatial databases and integrate third-party and internal APIs for data enrichment.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1123&quot; data-end=&quot;1236&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1125&quot; data-end=&quot;1236&quot;&gt;Create and implement automated data quality checks and alerting mechanisms to ensure integrity and consistency.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1237&quot; data-end=&quot;1371&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1239&quot; data-end=&quot;1371&quot;&gt;Collaborate with product owners, business analysts, and other stakeholders to ensure deliverables meet business objectives and SLAs.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1372&quot; data-end=&quot;1483&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1374&quot; data-end=&quot;1483&quot;&gt;Follow Agile methodologies and implement CI/CD and DevOps practices to modernize the existing infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1484&quot; data-end=&quot;1589&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1486&quot; data-end=&quot;1589&quot;&gt;Develop unit and integration test cases, and support seamless migration from development to production.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1590&quot; data-end=&quot;1673&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1592&quot; data-end=&quot;1673&quot;&gt;Provide on-call production support for applications across multiple environments.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;hr data-start=&quot;1675&quot; data-end=&quot;1678&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;1680&quot; data-end=&quot;1712&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1684&quot; data-end=&quot;1712&quot;&gt;Qualifications &amp;amp; Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1714&quot; data-end=&quot;2406&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1714&quot; data-end=&quot;1828&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1716&quot; data-end=&quot;1828&quot;&gt;Minimum 10 years of hands-on experience as a Data Engineer, with a strong focus on Informatica PowerCenter/IICS.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1829&quot; data-end=&quot;1902&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1831&quot; data-end=&quot;1902&quot;&gt;Deep understanding of data integration tools, techniques, and patterns.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1903&quot; data-end=&quot;2006&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1905&quot; data-end=&quot;2006&quot;&gt;Strong SQL expertise with hands-on experience in RDBMS platforms like Oracle, SQL Server, or DB2/UDB.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2007&quot; data-end=&quot;2106&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2009&quot; data-end=&quot;2106&quot;&gt;Proficiency in Python, UNIX Shell Scripting, or similar technologies (ArcPy scripting is a plus).&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2107&quot; data-end=&quot;2178&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2109&quot; data-end=&quot;2178&quot;&gt;Excellent analytical, problem-solving, and troubleshooting abilities.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2179&quot; data-end=&quot;2301&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2181&quot; data-end=&quot;2301&quot;&gt;Experience working in Agile teams, with a solid understanding of story refinement, task breakdown, and sprint execution.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2302&quot; data-end=&quot;2406&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2304&quot; data-end=&quot;2406&quot;&gt;Strong communication and collaboration skills, with the ability to work across cross-functional teams.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',500000.00,2500000.00,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-19 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-07-01 11:08:20.000000','2025-11-21 04:57:06.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Agile Methodology\", \"Oracle\", \"Python\", \"Shell Scripts\", \"SQL\", \"UNIX Shells\", \"IBM MDM\", \"Informatica PowerCenter\"]','[\"&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;81&quot; data-end=&quot;102&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;85&quot; data-end=&quot;102&quot;&gt;Job Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\\r\\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;104&quot; data-end=&quot;364&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;104&quot; data-end=&quot;156&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;106&quot; data-end=&quot;156&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and performance-based bonuses&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;157&quot; data-end=&quot;186&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;159&quot; data-end=&quot;186&quot;&gt;Health insurance coverage&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;187&quot; data-end=&quot;235&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;189&quot; data-end=&quot;235&quot;&gt;Opportunities for learning and career growth&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;236&quot; data-end=&quot;283&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;238&quot; data-end=&quot;283&quot;&gt;Flexible work hours and remote work options&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;284&quot; data-end=&quot;333&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;286&quot; data-end=&quot;333&quot;&gt;Supportive and collaborative work environment&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;334&quot; data-end=&quot;364&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;336&quot; data-end=&quot;364&quot;&gt;Paid time off and holidays&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('58e1e32c-98d1-4a13-9d08-20c312dd2af3','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','React Native Developer','react-native-developer-31-31','&lt;h2 class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;304&quot; data-end=&quot;349&quot;&gt;Job Title: React Native Developer&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;350&quot; data-end=&quot;449&quot;&gt;Experience: 5&amp;ndash;10 Years&lt;br data-start=&quot;376&quot; data-end=&quot;379&quot; /&gt;Location:&amp;nbsp;Chennai&lt;br data-start=&quot;421&quot; data-end=&quot;424&quot; /&gt;Job Type: Full-time&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;451&quot; data-end=&quot;480&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ol data-start=&quot;481&quot; data-end=&quot;1133&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;481&quot; data-end=&quot;565&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;484&quot; data-end=&quot;565&quot;&gt;Develop and maintain high-performance mobile applications using React Native.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;566&quot; data-end=&quot;673&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;569&quot; data-end=&quot;673&quot;&gt;Implement complex UI components and ensure seamless user experiences across platforms (iOS and Android).&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;674&quot; data-end=&quot;783&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;677&quot; data-end=&quot;783&quot;&gt;Utilize React fundamentals such as components, props, state, hooks, and lifecycle methods effectively.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;784&quot; data-end=&quot;865&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;787&quot; data-end=&quot;865&quot;&gt;Integrate mobile applications with REST APIs and handle asynchronous data.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;866&quot; data-end=&quot;936&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;869&quot; data-end=&quot;936&quot;&gt;Optimize application performance, memory usage, and responsiveness.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;937&quot; data-end=&quot;996&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;940&quot; data-end=&quot;996&quot;&gt;Implement Redux or other state management solutions.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;997&quot; data-end=&quot;1062&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1000&quot; data-end=&quot;1062&quot;&gt;Participate in code reviews, testing, and debugging processes.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1063&quot; data-end=&quot;1133&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1066&quot; data-end=&quot;1133&quot;&gt;Handle CI/CD pipelines and participate in deployment workflows.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ol&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1135&quot; data-end=&quot;1160&quot;&gt;Must-Have Skills:&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1161&quot; data-end=&quot;1417&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1161&quot; data-end=&quot;1222&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1163&quot; data-end=&quot;1222&quot;&gt;Strong proficiency in React Native and React ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1223&quot; data-end=&quot;1279&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1225&quot; data-end=&quot;1279&quot;&gt;Experience with hooks, Virtual DOM, lifecycle methods.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1280&quot; data-end=&quot;1334&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1282&quot; data-end=&quot;1334&quot;&gt;Proven track record of building complex mobile apps.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1335&quot; data-end=&quot;1417&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1337&quot; data-end=&quot;1417&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience with Redux, REST APIs, and performance optimization.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',500000.00,2500000.00,'₹',0,'India','Chennai',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2025-07-13 18:30:00',0,0,'2025-05-15 13:27:00.000000','2025-05-16 14:09:24.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Agile\", \"Android\", \"CI Pipelines\", \"Deployment\", \"IOS\", \"React\", \"React JS\", \"React Native\", \"React Router\", \"React.JS\", \"Redux\", \"REST API\"]','[\"&lt;h3 class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;84&quot; data-end=&quot;104&quot;&gt;Job Benefits&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Competitive Salary &amp;amp; performance bonuses&lt;br /&gt;Flexible Work Hours &amp;amp; hybrid/remote options&lt;br /&gt;Health Insurance for employees &amp;amp; dependent&lt;br /&gt;Learning &amp;amp; Development programs&lt;br /&gt;Cutting-Edge Projects with global teams&lt;br /&gt;Team Outings, hackathons &amp;amp; cultural event&lt;br /&gt;International Exposure &amp;amp; career growth opportunities&lt;/h3&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Tamil Nadu'),('59092e95-f771-4097-b75b-fa0ade4aa48b','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','MES Camstar Developer – Siemens Opcenter Core','mes-camstar-developer-siemens-opcenter-core-358-358','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;87&quot; data-end=&quot;481&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;113&quot; data-end=&quot;139&quot;&gt;MES Camstar Developers&lt;/strong&gt; for a leading Top MNC to work on enterprise-scale Manufacturing Execution System (MES) projects across the &lt;strong data-start=&quot;247&quot; data-end=&quot;285&quot;&gt;Pharmaceutical and Medical Devices&lt;/strong&gt; manufacturing domain. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in Siemens Opcenter Core / Camstar, MES implementation, manufacturing workflows, system integration, and production support.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;483&quot; data-end=&quot;880&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for designing, developing, configuring, customizing, and supporting Siemens Opcenter Core (Camstar) solutions across manufacturing sites. The role includes developing CIO/MIO Maps and workflows, implementing Factory Models, supporting Camstar upgrades, resolving production incidents, and delivering scalable MES solutions aligned with manufacturing requirements.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;882&quot; data-end=&quot;1302&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;933&quot; data-end=&quot;1146&quot;&gt;Siemens Opcenter Core / Camstar Designer, Camstar Portal Development, CIO/MIO Maps, workflow development, MES implementation, Factory Model development, Azure Kubernetes, SQL, and enterprise system integration&lt;/strong&gt;. Strong knowledge of ERP, LIMS, equipment, HMI integration, manufacturing validation, and regulated Pharma/Medical Device environments is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-10 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-08-12 03:19:10.000000','2026-08-12 03:19:10.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Azure Kubernetes Service\", \"Camstar\", \"Camstar Designer\", \"ERP Integration\", \"Incident Reporting\", \"Kubernetes\", \"Mes\", \"PLC\", \"REST API\", \"REST Webservices\", \"SCADA\", \"Siemens Opcenter\", \"SQL\", \"HMI\", \"CI/CD\", \"OPC UA\", \"LIMS Integration\", \"CIO Workflow Development\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1760&quot; data-end=&quot;1798&quot; data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1799&quot; data-end=&quot;1871&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1qh1jlj&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale Siemens Opcenter / Camstar MES projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1872&quot; data-end=&quot;1950&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1dkpqg9&quot;&gt;Work on Pharma and Medical Device manufacturing transformation initiatives&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1951&quot; data-end=&quot;2020&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1b01j63&quot;&gt;Career growth in MES, Manufacturing IT, and Digital Manufacturing&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2021&quot; data-end=&quot;2098&quot; data-section-id=&quot;13qji02&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global manufacturing and technology teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2099&quot; data-end=&quot;2166&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1opagvv&quot;&gt;Exposure to regulated manufacturing and validation environments&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2167&quot; data-end=&quot;2222&quot; data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2223&quot; data-end=&quot;2291&quot; data-section-id=&quot;ty38as&quot;&gt;Opportunity to lead technical activities and mentor team members&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('592ae9f6-bc96-4fb2-ba83-b7a0ec91b11d','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Track & Trace / TraceLink Consultant','track-trace-tracelink-consultant-326-326','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;78&quot; data-end=&quot;447&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced Track &amp;amp; Trace / TraceLink Consultants for a leading Top MNC to work on enterprise Pharmaceutical Serialization, Track &amp;amp; Trace, and Supply Chain Compliance projects. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in the TraceLink platform, serialization solutions, system integrations, and regulated pharmaceutical manufacturing environments.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;449&quot; data-end=&quot;891&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for implementing, configuring, supporting, and enhancing Track &amp;amp; Trace solutions using the TraceLink platform to ensure regulatory compliance and supply chain visibility. The role includes configuring serialization and aggregation processes, supporting EPCIS and GS1 standards, managing production support activities, troubleshooting complex issues, and ensuring seamless integration with enterprise systems.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;893&quot; data-end=&quot;1267&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with TraceLink, serialization, aggregation, EPCIS, GS1 standards, ITIL-based support processes, system integration, compliance reporting, and pharmaceutical supply chain operations. Strong understanding of GxP regulations, FDA compliance, UAT, defect management, incident management, and root cause analysis is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1269&quot; data-end=&quot;1740&quot;&gt;The role also involves collaborating with business stakeholders, manufacturing teams, CMOs, IT teams, and external partners to deliver enterprise-grade Track &amp;amp; Trace solutions. Candidates will support testing, production deployments, compliance initiatives, documentation, and continuous improvement activities while ensuring regulatory and business requirements are met. Strong analytical, communication, stakeholder management, and problem-solving skills are essential.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-09-01 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-07-03 19:15:58.000000','2026-07-03 19:15:58.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"ITIL\", \"System Validation\", \"Change Control Management\", \"TraceLink Platform\", \"Track & Trace Solutions\", \"Pharmaceutical Serialization\", \"Aggregation Solutions\", \"EPCIS Standards\", \"UAT (User Acceptance Testing)\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1756&quot; data-end=&quot;1794&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1a7a9sc&quot; data-start=&quot;1795&quot; data-end=&quot;1883&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale Pharmaceutical Serialization and Track &amp;amp; Trace projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1kwyhyh&quot; data-start=&quot;1884&quot; data-end=&quot;1954&quot;&gt;Work on global TraceLink implementation and compliance initiatives&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1n9hitp&quot; data-start=&quot;1955&quot; data-end=&quot;2026&quot;&gt;Career growth in Pharmaceutical Supply Chain &amp;amp; Serialization domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;lx4whh&quot; data-start=&quot;2027&quot; data-end=&quot;2106&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with international business and technology teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;2lee9a&quot; data-start=&quot;2107&quot; data-end=&quot;2162&quot;&gt;Professional and compliance-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;2163&quot; data-end=&quot;2206&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('598b810e-7abf-4695-81f3-515f6a7dfc83','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','MES Developer (7–8 Years Experience)','mes-developer-7-8-years-experience-130-130','&lt;p data-start=&quot;187&quot; data-end=&quot;689&quot;&gt;A top MNC is hiring an experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;222&quot; data-end=&quot;239&quot;&gt;MES Developer&lt;/strong&gt; with strong expertise in C++, .NET, and MES platforms. The role involves developing, customizing, and supporting MES applications used in manufacturing and semiconductor environments. You will collaborate with cross-functional engineering teams, integrate MES with automation systems, optimize workflows, and ensure stable system performance. Candidates with exposure to automation protocols, cloud, CI/CD, and frontend frameworks will be preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;hr data-start=&quot;691&quot; data-end=&quot;694&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;696&quot; data-end=&quot;725&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;699&quot; data-end=&quot;725&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;726&quot; data-end=&quot;1524&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;726&quot; data-end=&quot;807&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;728&quot; data-end=&quot;807&quot;&gt;Develop and customize &lt;strong data-start=&quot;750&quot; data-end=&quot;770&quot;&gt;MES applications&lt;/strong&gt; using C++ / C# / .NET technologies&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;808&quot; data-end=&quot;883&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;810&quot; data-end=&quot;883&quot;&gt;Integrate MES solutions with automation tools and manufacturing systems&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;884&quot; data-end=&quot;946&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;886&quot; data-end=&quot;946&quot;&gt;Write, optimize, and troubleshoot &lt;strong data-start=&quot;920&quot; data-end=&quot;944&quot;&gt;SQL / Oracle queries&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;947&quot; data-end=&quot;1019&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;949&quot; data-end=&quot;1019&quot;&gt;Implement design patterns, OOP principles, and scalable architecture&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1020&quot; data-end=&quot;1094&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1022&quot; data-end=&quot;1094&quot;&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional teams in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1065&quot; data-end=&quot;1080&quot;&gt;Agile/Scrum&lt;/strong&gt; environment&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1095&quot; data-end=&quot;1143&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1097&quot; data-end=&quot;1143&quot;&gt;Work with version control tools like &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1134&quot; data-end=&quot;1141&quot;&gt;Git&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1144&quot; data-end=&quot;1216&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1146&quot; data-end=&quot;1216&quot;&gt;Participate in CI/CD pipeline setup using &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1188&quot; data-end=&quot;1214&quot;&gt;Jenkins / Azure DevOps&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1217&quot; data-end=&quot;1304&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1219&quot; data-end=&quot;1304&quot;&gt;Develop and support applications using &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1258&quot; data-end=&quot;1287&quot;&gt;Angular / React / Node.js&lt;/strong&gt; (good to have)&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1305&quot; data-end=&quot;1382&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1307&quot; data-end=&quot;1382&quot;&gt;Utilize &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1315&quot; data-end=&quot;1360&quot;&gt;Linux, shell scripting, networking basics&lt;/strong&gt; in MES integrations&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1383&quot; data-end=&quot;1457&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1385&quot; data-end=&quot;1457&quot;&gt;Work with automation communication protocols like &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1435&quot; data-end=&quot;1455&quot;&gt;SECS/GEM, OPC-UA&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1458&quot; data-end=&quot;1524&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1460&quot; data-end=&quot;1524&quot;&gt;Support MES operations in manufacturing / semiconductor domain&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Full-time','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Pune',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-19 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-11-21 05:46:53.000000','2025-11-21 05:46:53.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\".NET\", \"Agile\", \"Angular\", \"ASP.NET\", \"Azure\", \"C#\", \"C++\", \"Design Patterns\", \"Docker\", \"Git\", \"Jenkins\", \"Linux\", \"Mes\", \"Mes Customization\", \"MS SQL Server\", \"Networking\", \"Node JS\", \"OOPS\", \"Oracle\", \"React\", \"SDLC\", \"Shell Scripts\", \"Scrum Master\", \"CI/CD\", \"OPC UA\", \"SECS/GEM Standards\", \"Complex Queries\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2291&quot; data-end=&quot;2354&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2293&quot; data-end=&quot;2354&quot;&gt;Work with a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2305&quot; data-end=&quot;2323&quot;&gt;Top Global MNC&lt;/strong&gt; with long-term career growth&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2355&quot; data-end=&quot;2430&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2357&quot; data-end=&quot;2430&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2380&quot; data-end=&quot;2428&quot;&gt;cutting-edge MES and automation technologies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2431&quot; data-end=&quot;2497&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2433&quot; data-end=&quot;2497&quot;&gt;Exposure to &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2445&quot; data-end=&quot;2495&quot;&gt;semiconductor &amp;amp; high-tech manufacturing domain&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2498&quot; data-end=&quot;2547&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2500&quot; data-end=&quot;2547&quot;&gt;Collaborative and innovative work environment&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2548&quot; data-end=&quot;2599&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2550&quot; data-end=&quot;2599&quot;&gt;Competitive salary &amp;amp; performance-based benefits&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2600&quot; data-end=&quot;2675&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2602&quot; data-end=&quot;2675&quot;&gt;Work with modern tools like CI/CD, cloud, Docker &amp;amp; automation protocols&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2676&quot; data-end=&quot;2723&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2678&quot; data-end=&quot;2723&quot;&gt;Continuous learning and development support&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2724&quot; data-end=&quot;2769&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2726&quot; data-end=&quot;2769&quot;&gt;Stable projects with global team exposure&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Maharashtra'),('5adadf5b-54d9-4348-a6d6-53e47d062f67','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Azure Administrator','azure-administrator-215-215','&lt;p&gt;1. Manage Azure Subscriptions &amp;amp; Resources &amp;middot; Oversee Azure subscriptions, resource allocation, cost governance, and tagging standards. &amp;middot; Ensure compliance with organizational policies and optimize resource spend. &lt;br /&gt;2. Implement &amp;amp; Manage Azure Storage Solutions &amp;middot; Configure, secure, and monitor Azure storage accounts, blob storage, file shares, and backup vaults. &amp;middot; Ensure storage availability, performance, and lifecycle policies. &lt;br /&gt;3. Configure &amp;amp; Manage Virtual Networks (VNet) &amp;middot; Design and maintain VNets, subnets, NSGs, firewalls, and VPN/ExpressRoute connectivity. &amp;middot; Ensure secure and reliable network communication. &lt;br /&gt;4. Manage Identities &amp;amp; Access (Azure AD)&amp;middot; Administer users, groups, roles, and RBAC policies. &amp;middot; Implement conditional access and identity protection policies. &lt;br /&gt;5. Deploy &amp;amp; Manage Compute Resources &amp;middot; Provision and manage virtual machines, scale sets, containers, and associated compute workloads. &amp;middot; Optimize configurations for performance and cost.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Entry',NULL,NULL,'INR',1,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-05-17 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-03-18 17:57:29.000000','2026-03-18 17:57:29.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Azure\", \"Azure  Security\", \"Azure Basics\", \"Azure Data Engineer\", \"Azure Firewall\", \"VPN\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;Competitive salary package with performance-based incentives&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;65&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;67&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;Health insurance coverage and statutory benefits (PF &amp;amp; Gratuity)&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;134&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;136&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on large-scale enterprise energy management projects&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;211&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;213&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;Strong career growth and learning opportunities&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;263&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;265&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;Collaborative and professional work environment&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('5b01ed0f-1ab8-4cb5-b15b-b1ac27d76e95','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','MES Solution Architect - MOM Design Authority Consultant','mes-solution-architect-mom-design-authority-consultant-119-119','&lt;!--StartFragment --&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf0&quot;&gt;We are looking for an experienced professional to lead Manufacturing Operations Management (MOM) architecture and integration across ERP, PLM, MES, WMS, and LIMS systems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf0&quot;&gt;The ideal candidate will act as a Design Authority, ensuring architectural consistency, system interoperability, and alignment with Industry 4.0 and Smart Manufacturing goals.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;!--StartFragment --&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf0&quot;&gt;Define and maintain the MOM architectural vision across enterprise systems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf0&quot;&gt;Lead architectural governance and integration design across multiple workstreams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf0&quot;&gt;Coordinate with partners (Accenture, ITC, Dassault, etc.) to align technical deliverables.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf0&quot;&gt;Oversee deployment models, DR/HA strategies, and system readiness for Go Live.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf0&quot;&gt;Identify risks, enforce best practices, and support cross-functional teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;cf0&quot;&gt;&lt;!--EndFragment --&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;!--EndFragment --&gt;','Information Technology','Full-time','Entry',NULL,NULL,'INR',1,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2025-12-13 18:30:00',0,0,'2025-10-15 11:30:27.000000','2025-10-1