rmance and ensure high availability&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;16hnnfa&quot; data-start=&quot;855&quot; data-end=&quot;919&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;857&quot; data-end=&quot;919&quot;&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional teams for issue resolution&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;pn346a&quot; data-start=&quot;920&quot; data-end=&quot;998&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;922&quot; data-end=&quot;998&quot;&gt;Deliver &lt;strong data-start=&quot;930&quot; data-end=&quot;956&quot;&gt;regular status updates&lt;/strong&gt; to clients on incidents and resolutions&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;185zbx&quot; data-start=&quot;999&quot; data-end=&quot;1056&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1001&quot; data-end=&quot;1056&quot;&gt;Maintain proper documentation for incidents and fixes&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Entry',NULL,NULL,'INR',1,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-05-17 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-03-18 18:05:29.000000','2026-03-18 18:05:29.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"MES Order Processing\", \"Mes\", \"Mes Applications\", \"Mes Oee\", \"OEE Analysis\", \"L2/L3 Support\", \"Wonderware OMI\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;Competitive salary package with performance-based incentives&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;65&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;67&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;Health insurance coverage and statutory benefits (PF &amp;amp; Gratuity)&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;134&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;136&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on large-scale enterprise energy management projects&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;211&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;213&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;Strong career growth and learning opportunities&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;263&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;265&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;Collaborative and professional work environment&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('5b95a212-f0f1-4545-879c-18a084266d00','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Senior Data Engineer','senior-data-engineer-145-145','&lt;p data-start=&quot;127&quot; data-end=&quot;515&quot;&gt;We are hiring a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;143&quot; data-end=&quot;167&quot;&gt;Senior Data Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; with strong expertise in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;193&quot; data-end=&quot;235&quot;&gt;Azure, Databricks, Python, and PySpark&lt;/strong&gt;. The role involves building and maintaining scalable data pipelines, developing ETL processes, designing data models, and improving data quality. You will work closely with cross-functional teams to deliver reliable, high-performance data solutions for enterprise-level projects.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Full-time','Mid',NULL,NULL,'INR',0,'India','Pune',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-24 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-11-25 16:34:45.000000','2025-11-25 16:34:45.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Azure\", \"Azure SQL Database\", \"Data Lake\", \"ETL\", \"Java\", \"Python\", \"Scala\", \"SQL\", \"Pyspark\", \"Azure Databricks\"]','[\"Exposure to global projects, cutting-edge Azure technologies, growth-focused environment, collaborative work culture.\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Maharashtra'),('5c2fee05-3a28-4424-81f7-c497a51336c3','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Aveva PI','aveva-pi-230-230','&lt;blockquote&gt;\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;Minimum 7-10 years of experience in&amp;nbsp;AVEVA&amp;nbsp;PI&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;in Pharma&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Academic degree in relevant profession&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Experience in connectivity to equipment&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Validation methodology and tools&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with middleware platforms (Kepware, Cogent,&amp;nbsp;PI)&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with reporting tools&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;/blockquote&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Entry',NULL,NULL,'INR',1,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-05-30 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-03-31 21:24:16.000000','2026-03-31 21:24:16.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"AvevaWonderware\", \"AVEVA System\", \"AVEVA MES\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;Competitive salary package with performance-based incentives&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;65&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;67&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;Health insurance coverage and statutory benefits (PF &amp;amp; Gratuity)&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;134&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;136&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on large-scale enterprise energy management projects&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;211&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;213&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;Strong career growth and learning opportunities&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;263&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;265&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;Collaborative and professional work environment&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('5c32d3ae-68b2-4072-afd5-d9159e168678','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','MES Techno-Functional Consultant','mes-techno-functional-consultant-140-140','&lt;p data-start=&quot;218&quot; data-end=&quot;650&quot;&gt;A Top MNC is seeking an experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;254&quot; data-end=&quot;290&quot;&gt;MES Techno-Functional Consultant&lt;/strong&gt; to support end-to-end implementation, configuration, and integration of Manufacturing Execution Systems (MES) within regulated Pharma/Life Sciences environments.&lt;br data-start=&quot;452&quot; data-end=&quot;455&quot; /&gt;The role involves working closely with business stakeholders, mapping manufacturing processes, customizing MES workflows, and integrating MES with enterprise systems such as ERP, LIMS, and SCADA.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;652&quot; data-end=&quot;827&quot;&gt;The ideal candidate should have strong domain knowledge in pharma manufacturing processes along with hands-on technical experience in MES configuration and system integration.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;hr data-start=&quot;829&quot; data-end=&quot;832&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h1 data-start=&quot;834&quot; data-end=&quot;859&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;836&quot; data-end=&quot;859&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;860&quot; data-end=&quot;1641&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;860&quot; data-end=&quot;979&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;862&quot; data-end=&quot;979&quot;&gt;Configure and customize MES platforms such as &lt;strong data-start=&quot;908&quot; data-end=&quot;971&quot;&gt;Rockwell FTPS, Siemens Opcenter, Werum PAS-X, GE Plant Apps&lt;/strong&gt;, etc.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;980&quot; data-end=&quot;1101&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;982&quot; data-end=&quot;1101&quot;&gt;Perform &lt;strong data-start=&quot;990&quot; data-end=&quot;1020&quot;&gt;functional process mapping&lt;/strong&gt; for pharma workflows (batch execution, weigh &amp;amp; dispense, material management).&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1102&quot; data-end=&quot;1216&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1104&quot; data-end=&quot;1216&quot;&gt;Integrate MES with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1123&quot; data-end=&quot;1149&quot;&gt;ERP, LIMS, SCADA, PLCs&lt;/strong&gt;, and middleware systems using APIs, OPC UA, and other protocols.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1217&quot; data-end=&quot;1332&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1219&quot; data-end=&quot;1332&quot;&gt;Translate business requirements into MES recipes, workflows, master batch records (MBRs), and functional specs.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1333&quot; data-end=&quot;1404&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1335&quot; data-end=&quot;1404&quot;&gt;Support validation activities including &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1375&quot; data-end=&quot;1401&quot;&gt;IQ/OQ/PQ documentation&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1405&quot; data-end=&quot;1490&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1407&quot; data-end=&quot;1490&quot;&gt;Work with cross-functional teams including QA, Manufacturing, IT, and Automation.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1491&quot; data-end=&quot;1569&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1493&quot; data-end=&quot;1569&quot;&gt;Provide technical troubleshooting, enhancements, and post-go-live support.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1570&quot; data-end=&quot;1641&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1572&quot; data-end=&quot;1641&quot;&gt;Ensure compliance with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1595&quot; data-end=&quot;1607&quot;&gt;GMP, GxP&lt;/strong&gt;, and pharma regulatory standards.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Full-time','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-20 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-11-22 03:39:18.000000','2025-11-22 03:39:18.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"ERP\", \"Gxp Compliance\", \"Lims\", \"Mes\", \"OQ\", \"PLC\", \"PQ\", \"SCADA\", \"Siemens Opcenter\", \"Werum PAS-X\", \"OPC UA\", \"GMP\", \"Rockwell FTPS\", \"GE Plant Apps\", \"MES Recipes\", \"MBRs\"]','[\"&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2870&quot; data-end=&quot;3341&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2870&quot; data-end=&quot;2952&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2872&quot; data-end=&quot;2952&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2899&quot; data-end=&quot;2921&quot;&gt;leading global MNC&lt;/strong&gt; in Pharma/Manufacturing Tech&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2953&quot; data-end=&quot;3030&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2955&quot; data-end=&quot;3030&quot;&gt;Work on &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2963&quot; data-end=&quot;3028&quot;&gt;cutting-edge MES &amp;amp; Pharma 4.0 digital transformation projects&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;3031&quot; data-end=&quot;3095&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;3033&quot; data-end=&quot;3095&quot;&gt;Exposure to advanced MES platforms &amp;amp; enterprise integrations&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;3096&quot; data-end=&quot;3144&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;3098&quot; data-end=&quot;3144&quot;&gt;Collaborative work culture with global teams&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;3145&quot; data-end=&quot;3198&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;3147&quot; data-end=&quot;3198&quot;&gt;Continuous learning &amp;amp; certification opportunities&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;3199&quot; data-end=&quot;3263&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;3201&quot; data-end=&quot;3263&quot;&gt;Competitive salary, performance bonuses &amp;amp; career progression&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;3264&quot; data-end=&quot;3341&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;3266&quot; data-end=&quot;3341&quot;&gt;Work on high-impact systems improving quality, compliance, and efficiency&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('5c3ea9c1-58b7-4f08-ab0a-bbab60827694','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','ORTEMS Developer & Support Engineer','ortems-developer-support-engineer-386-386','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;94&quot; data-end=&quot;460&quot;&gt;We are looking for experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;125&quot; data-end=&quot;165&quot;&gt;ORTEMS Developer &amp;amp; Support Engineers&lt;/strong&gt; to join a leading Top MNC and work on advanced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;213&quot; data-end=&quot;233&quot;&gt;DELMIA ORTEM APS&lt;/strong&gt; solutions for manufacturing and production planning environments. The role involves designing, configuring, customizing, developing, and supporting Advanced Planning &amp;amp; Scheduling solutions for complex manufacturing operations.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;462&quot; data-end=&quot;858&quot;&gt;The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;514&quot; data-end=&quot;682&quot;&gt;DELMIA ORTEM / ORTEM APS, finite-capacity production scheduling, production planning, scheduling logic, constraints, priorities, setup times, and planning scenarios&lt;/strong&gt;. The candidate will work on developing optimized production schedules while considering resources, capacity, manufacturing constraints, calendars, and changeover requirements.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;860&quot; data-end=&quot;1194&quot;&gt;The role also involves integrating ORTEM with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;906&quot; data-end=&quot;966&quot;&gt;MES platforms such as DELMIA Apriso and Siemens Opcenter&lt;/strong&gt;, along with ERP systems, preferably &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1003&quot; data-end=&quot;1010&quot;&gt;SAP&lt;/strong&gt;. The engineer will handle data mapping for orders, BOMs, routings, resources, constraints, and calendars, while supporting real-time data exchange between ORTEM, MES, and ERP systems.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-11-10 07:00:00',0,0,'2026-09-12 01:31:50.000000','2026-09-12 01:31:50.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Delmia Apriso\", \"ERP Integration\", \"Java\", \"MES Integration\", \"MS SQL Server\", \"Oracle\", \"SAP\", \"Siemens Opcenter\", \"UAT\", \"ORTEMS Configuration\", \"ORTEMS Development\", \"Advanced Planning & Scheduling\", \"BOMs\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;iofbfz&quot; data-start=&quot;1578&quot; data-end=&quot;1626&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a leading &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1615&quot; data-end=&quot;1626&quot;&gt;Top MNC&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;jl23el&quot; data-start=&quot;1627&quot; data-end=&quot;1698&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1658&quot; data-end=&quot;1698&quot;&gt;APS and Manufacturing Digitalization&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1qcedrh&quot; data-start=&quot;1699&quot; data-end=&quot;1754&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1726&quot; data-end=&quot;1754&quot;&gt;DELMIA ORTEM / ORTEM APS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;kw9q5n&quot; data-start=&quot;1755&quot; data-end=&quot;1822&quot;&gt;Exposure to MES platforms such as &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1791&quot; data-end=&quot;1822&quot;&gt;Apriso and Siemens Opcenter&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1no8lt2&quot; data-start=&quot;1823&quot; data-end=&quot;1885&quot;&gt;Experience with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1841&quot; data-end=&quot;1885&quot;&gt;SAP and manufacturing system integration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1yc0c2m&quot; data-start=&quot;1886&quot; data-end=&quot;1956&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on advanced finite-capacity scheduling solutions&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;12ncxp7&quot; data-start=&quot;1957&quot; data-end=&quot;2016&quot;&gt;Exposure to global manufacturing operations and processes&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('5c6a87d8-e14f-4adf-9cc1-87a20e2b3460','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Project Manager / Program Manager – AMI Program Development & Rollout','project-manager-program-manager-ami-program-development-rollout-373-373','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;249&quot; data-end=&quot;522&quot;&gt;We are looking for an experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;283&quot; data-end=&quot;320&quot;&gt;Project Manager / Program Manager&lt;/strong&gt; to lead a complex &lt;strong data-start=&quot;339&quot; data-end=&quot;389&quot;&gt;AMI Program Development and Multi-Site Rollout&lt;/strong&gt; involving &lt;strong data-start=&quot;400&quot; data-end=&quot;521&quot;&gt;AI/ML, Computer Vision, Edge AI, Digital Manufacturing, Data, Platform, DevOps/MLOps, and Infrastructure technologies&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;524&quot; data-end=&quot;901&quot;&gt;The ideal candidate will be responsible for owning &lt;strong data-start=&quot;575&quot; data-end=&quot;606&quot;&gt;end-to-end program delivery&lt;/strong&gt;, including planning, execution, pilot deployment, multi-site rollout, stabilization, and transition to operations. The role requires strong experience in managing complex technology programs, distributed cross-functional teams, customer stakeholders, vendors, and multiple deployment locations.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;903&quot; data-end=&quot;1135&quot;&gt;The candidate will work closely with teams across &lt;strong data-start=&quot;953&quot; data-end=&quot;1075&quot;&gt;AI/ML, Computer Vision, Data Engineering, Platform, DevOps/MLOps, Edge Computing, Testing, Infrastructure, and Support&lt;/strong&gt; to ensure successful program execution and timely delivery.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;18w7bso&quot; data-start=&quot;1137&quot; data-end=&quot;1160&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1162&quot; data-end=&quot;2321&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;26v3n9&quot; data-start=&quot;1162&quot; data-end=&quot;1272&quot;&gt;Own end-to-end program delivery from &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1201&quot; data-end=&quot;1271&quot;&gt;planning through execution, rollout, stabilization, and transition&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1nzbrdo&quot; data-start=&quot;1273&quot; data-end=&quot;1381&quot;&gt;Lead complex technology programs involving &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1318&quot; data-end=&quot;1380&quot;&gt;AI/ML, Computer Vision, Edge AI, and Digital Manufacturing&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;rooys3&quot; data-start=&quot;1382&quot; data-end=&quot;1513&quot;&gt;Manage distributed cross-functional teams across AI/ML, Data, Platform, DevOps/MLOps, Edge, Testing, Infrastructure, and Support.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;ys2g25&quot; data-start=&quot;1514&quot; data-end=&quot;1611&quot;&gt;Define program scope, &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1538&quot; data-end=&quot;1610&quot;&gt;WBS, milestones, budgets, resources, dependencies, and critical path&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1a1b8o4&quot; data-start=&quot;1612&quot; data-end=&quot;1693&quot;&gt;Drive pilot/reference-site deployments and subsequent multi-site rollout waves.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;gcvajb&quot; data-start=&quot;1694&quot; data-end=&quot;1766&quot;&gt;Establish &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1706&quot; data-end=&quot;1765&quot;&gt;site-readiness, deployment-readiness, and go-live gates&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1rlth9i&quot; data-start=&quot;1767&quot; data-end=&quot;1852&quot;&gt;Manage RAID items, risks, issues, dependencies, changes, vendors, and stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1149arj&quot; data-start=&quot;1853&quot; data-end=&quot;1920&quot;&gt;Lead customer governance meetings and executive reporting forums.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;14ldelu&quot; data-start=&quot;1921&quot; data-end=&quot;1988&quot;&gt;Drive decision-making across technical and business stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;20yr7k&quot; data-start=&quot;1989&quot; data-end=&quot;2082&quot;&gt;Coordinate model/data readiness, validation, release management, and deployment activities.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1r3lq2a&quot; data-start=&quot;2083&quot; data-end=&quot;2161&quot;&gt;Ensure successful transition from implementation to steady-state operations.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1xtpzmb&quot; data-start=&quot;2162&quot; data-end=&quot;2234&quot;&gt;Develop rollout playbooks, governance models, and operating processes.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;q8b8zs&quot; data-start=&quot;2235&quot; data-end=&quot;2321&quot;&gt;Monitor program KPIs, delivery timelines, quality, budget, and resource utilization.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Entry',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-27 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-08-29 00:27:03.000000','2026-08-29 00:27:04.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"API\", \"Cloud Platforms\", \"Computer Vision\", \"Cyber Security\", \"IOT\", \"Scrum Master\", \"Digital Manufacturing\", \"MLOps\", \"NVIDIA Jetson\", \"TensorRT\", \"Balena\", \"PMP / PRINCE2\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;37rvmb&quot; data-start=&quot;2336&quot; data-end=&quot;2431&quot;&gt;Opportunity to lead a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2360&quot; data-end=&quot;2430&quot;&gt;large-scale AI/ML and Digital Manufacturing transformation program&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;dn8e4s&quot; data-start=&quot;2432&quot; data-end=&quot;2528&quot;&gt;Exposure to &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2446&quot; data-end=&quot;2527&quot;&gt;Computer Vision, Edge AI, MLOps, IoT, and advanced manufacturing technologies&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;v76r0f&quot; data-start=&quot;2529&quot; data-end=&quot;2597&quot;&gt;Experience managing complex &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2559&quot; data-end=&quot;2596&quot;&gt;multi-site technology deployments&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;xojo40&quot; data-start=&quot;2598&quot; data-end=&quot;2685&quot;&gt;Collaboration with global technology, engineering, manufacturing, and business teams.&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;8fqc9r&quot; data-start=&quot;2686&quot; data-end=&quot;2765&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work directly with senior customer and executive stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;vr6etu&quot; data-start=&quot;2766&quot; data-end=&quot;2857&quot;&gt;Exposure to emerging &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2789&quot; data-end=&quot;2843&quot;&gt;AI, Edge Computing, Cloud, and Manufacturing IT/OT&lt;/strong&gt; technologies.&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('5c7a6b49-75cb-43ff-934c-4811d22df657','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Data Pipeline Engineer – OT–IT Integration','data-pipeline-engineer-ot-it-integration-199-199','&lt;p&gt;&amp;middot; End-to-end pipelines: Design, implement, and operate batch/streaming flows from SCADA, MES, and Historians to cloud/enterprise (Azure/AWS/GCP); Experience in Azure Event Hubs/Event Grid is plus.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;middot; UNS &amp;amp; modeling: Apply UNS (ISA-95/88), data modeling, and metadata management; ensure data quality, lineage, and governance.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;middot; Industrial integration: Connect (Ignition, HighByte, HiveMQ advantageous) using OPC UA, MQTT, BACnet, Modbus; build/consume RESTful APIs and connectors for SCADA, MES, LIMS, Historians.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;middot; Design schemas and tune performance across SQL and NoSQL stores.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;middot; Security &amp;amp; reliability: implement authN/authZ best practices; Design for scalability, resilience, and cost efficiency.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;middot; Dev practices: use Git/GitHub (branching, reviews, releases) and create clear architecture diagrams, process flows, and specifications.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'INR',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-04-21 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-02-20 22:45:54.000000','2026-02-20 22:46:48.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Github\", \"Lims\", \"Mes\", \"NoSQL\", \"SCADA\", \"SQL\", \"Modbus\", \"MQTT\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;Competitive salary package with performance-based incentives&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;65&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;67&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;Health insurance coverage and statutory benefits (PF &amp;amp; Gratuity)&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;134&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;136&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on large-scale enterprise energy management projects&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;211&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;213&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;Strong career growth and learning opportunities&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;263&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;265&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;Collaborative and professional work environment&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('5e06424d-3d3b-4453-baf3-68973bf4c36a','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Senior/Junior Backend Developer – Cosmos DB & Kafka','seniorjunior-backend-developer-cosmos-db-kafka-32-32','&lt;h2 class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;258&quot; data-end=&quot;280&quot;&gt;Job Title:&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;281&quot; data-end=&quot;338&quot;&gt;Senior/Junior Backend Developer &ndash; Cosmos DB &amp;amp; Kafka&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;340&quot; data-end=&quot;361&quot;&gt;Experience:&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;362&quot; data-end=&quot;374&quot;&gt;3 to 5+ Years&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;376&quot; data-end=&quot;395&quot;&gt;Location:&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;396&quot; data-end=&quot;461&quot;&gt;Chennai (Preferred) / Pan India (Remote/Hybrid Options Available)&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;463&quot; data-end=&quot;482&quot;&gt;Job Type:&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;483&quot; data-end=&quot;494&quot;&gt;Full-time&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;501&quot; data-end=&quot;523&quot;&gt;Job Summary:&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;524&quot; data-end=&quot;795&quot;&gt;We are looking for experienced Backend Developers (Senior/Junior levels) with strong expertise in Apache Kafka and Azure Cosmos DB. You will play a key role in designing and implementing scalable, real-time backend solutions for mission-critical applications.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;802&quot; data-end=&quot;831&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;832&quot; data-end=&quot;1439&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;832&quot; data-end=&quot;948&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;834&quot; data-end=&quot;948&quot;&gt;Design, develop, and maintain backend systems and data pipelines using Apache Kafka and Azure Cosmos DB.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;949&quot; data-end=&quot;1019&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;951&quot; data-end=&quot;1019&quot;&gt;Implement real-time data streaming and event-driven architectures.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1020&quot; data-end=&quot;1106&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1022&quot; data-end=&quot;1106&quot;&gt;Develop Kafka producers and consumers to handle high-volume, low-latency data.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1107&quot; data-end=&quot;1193&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1109&quot; data-end=&quot;1193&quot;&gt;Optimize data models and queries within Cosmos DB for performance and scalability.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1194&quot; data-end=&quot;1272&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1196&quot; data-end=&quot;1272&quot;&gt;Work with Kafka Connect for data integration across sources and sinks.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1273&quot; data-end=&quot;1358&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1275&quot; data-end=&quot;1358&quot;&gt;Collaborate with frontend, DevOps, and QA teams for end-to-end solution delivery.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1359&quot; data-end=&quot;1439&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1361&quot; data-end=&quot;1439&quot;&gt;Leverage Azure cloud services like Function Apps, Event Hubs, etc.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1446&quot; data-end=&quot;1470&quot;&gt;Required Skills:&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1471&quot; data-end=&quot;1946&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1471&quot; data-end=&quot;1520&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1473&quot; data-end=&quot;1520&quot;&gt;3&ndash;5+ years of backend development experience.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1521&quot; data-end=&quot;1617&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1523&quot; data-end=&quot;1617&quot;&gt;Strong hands-on experience with Apache Kafka (producers, consumers, topics, partitions).&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1618&quot; data-end=&quot;1714&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1620&quot; data-end=&quot;1714&quot;&gt;Proficiency in working with Cosmos DB (NoSQL), including query tuning and data modeling.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1715&quot; data-end=&quot;1783&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1717&quot; data-end=&quot;1783&quot;&gt;Familiarity with Kafka Connect for source/sink integrations.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1784&quot; data-end=&quot;1892&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1786&quot; data-end=&quot;1892&quot;&gt;Solid knowledge of RESTful APIs, data structures, and backend frameworks (Node.js, Java, or Python).&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1893&quot; data-end=&quot;1946&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1895&quot; data-end=&quot;1946&quot;&gt;Experience working with Azure cloud services.Good-to-Have:&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1975&quot; data-end=&quot;2174&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1975&quot; data-end=&quot;2023&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1977&quot; data-end=&quot;2023&quot;&gt;Knowledge of microservices architecture.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2024&quot; data-end=&quot;2113&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2026&quot; data-end=&quot;2113&quot;&gt;Experience with stream processing frameworks (e.g., Apache Flink, Kafka Streams).&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2114&quot; data-end=&quot;2174&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2116&quot; data-end=&quot;2174&quot;&gt;Familiarity with CI/CD pipelines and DevOps tools.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',500000.00,2500000.00,'₹',0,'India','Chennai',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-30 06:00:00',0,0,'2025-05-15 13:52:02.000000','2026-05-12 14:53:32.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Azure\", \"Azure Cosmos DB\", \"Cosmos DB\", \"DevOps\", \"Event Hubs\", \"Kafka\", \"Kafka Security\"]','[\"&lt;h3 class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2181&quot; data-end=&quot;2202&quot;&gt;Job Benefits:&lt;/h3&gt;\\r\\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2203&quot; data-end=&quot;2468&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2203&quot; data-end=&quot;2256&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2205&quot; data-end=&quot;2256&quot;&gt;Competitive salary with performance incentives&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2257&quot; data-end=&quot;2313&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2259&quot; data-end=&quot;2313&quot;&gt;Flexible work hours and hybrid/remote flexibility&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2314&quot; data-end=&quot;2359&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2316&quot; data-end=&quot;2359&quot;&gt;Health insurance and wellness benefits&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2360&quot; data-end=&quot;2410&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2362&quot; data-end=&quot;2410&quot;&gt;Upskilling opportunities and certifications&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2411&quot; data-end=&quot;2468&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2413&quot; data-end=&quot;2468&quot;&gt;Exposure to global projects and cloud technologies&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Tamil Nadu'),('5eaf7097-dfa0-4ea3-be74-f3609ec55adc','68ff0280-318d-4060-b1ea-8ef60e01d8bc','57dd62c0-fa9c-4260-b0ac-cafbea47cb72','Immediate opening for Servicenow Solution Architect @ 8+ Years , Remote','immediate-opening-for-servicenow-solution-architect-at-8-years-remote-98-98','Job Role: Servicenow Solution Architect&lt;br /&gt;Location: Remote&lt;br /&gt;Experience: 8+ Years&lt;br /&gt;Notice Period: Immediate to 15 Days&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;br /&gt;* Lead end-to-end architecture, design, and implementation of ServiceNow solutions for Sales, Order Management, SCM, and FSM modules.&lt;br /&gt;* Collaborate with business and technical stakeholders to gather requirements and translate them into ServiceNow platform solutions.&lt;br /&gt;* Design integrations between ServiceNow and external business systems like ERP, CRM, logistics, and telephony systems.&lt;br /&gt;* Lead configuration and customization of ServiceNow modules including CSM (Customer Service Management), FSM (Field Service Management), and others related to order lifecycle and supply chain.&lt;br /&gt;* Develop technical specifications, high-level and detailed design documents.&lt;br /&gt;* Ensure architecture compliance with enterprise standards, scalability, and security best practices.&lt;br /&gt;* Provide technical leadership during implementation, testing, deployment, and production support.&lt;br /&gt;* Optimize and enhance existing ServiceNow applications and workflows for sales and supply chain processes.&lt;br /&gt;* Build reusable workflows, automation scripts, and business rules aligned with best practices.&lt;br /&gt;* Collaborate with integration teams for API, web services (REST, SOAP), MID server, and data orchestration.&lt;br /&gt;* Provide mentorship and guidance to developers and junior architects.&lt;br /&gt;* Maintain awareness of ServiceNow platform updates and new features related to Sales and SCM domains.&lt;br /&gt;* Conduct technical workshops and presentations for stakeholders and project teams.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks &amp;amp; Regards,&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Arun&nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Talent Acquisition Specialist&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Creeno Solutions Pvt Ltd&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;C.K House, 3rd Floor,&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;MIG 65, Dharma Reddy Colony,&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Phase-II, Hyder Nagar,&nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Hyderabad, Telangana - 500 072.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contact:&nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;9392352955&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Email: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:arun.m@creenosolutions.com&quot;&gt;arun.m@creenosolutions.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;URL:&lt;/strong&gt;&nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.creenosolutions.com/&quot;&gt;www.creenosolutions.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;','Services','Contract','Entry',NULL,NULL,'INR',1,'India','PAN India',0,1,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-07-31 06:00:00',0,0,'2025-09-02 06:00:12.000000','2026-05-04 00:14:55.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Field Service Management\", \"Order Management\", \"Sales\", \"ServiceNow\", \"Supply Chain Management\"]','[\"As per company Standered\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('5ebd940e-30da-46e0-a462-815696bd52a3','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Tulip Support Analyst','tulip-support-analyst-121-121','We are looking for an experienced Tulip Support Analyst with 7&amp;ndash;8 years of experience to provide high-level application and technical support for Tulip systems within a GxP-regulated environment. The candidate will be responsible for troubleshooting, incident resolution, system configuration, and ensuring compliance with pharma/life science standards.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;---&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;1. Provide high-level Tulip application support as required.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;2. Perform root cause analysis and problem resolution within scope.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;3. Configure and maintain Tulip application functionalities.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;4. Collaborate with business users to understand and resolve operational issues.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;5. Suggest process improvements and support innovation initiatives.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;---&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Must-Have Skills&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Minimum 2 years of experience in Tulip Platform Support.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Strong knowledge of Tulip product features.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Experience in pharma/life sciences domain with GxP systems.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Expertise in CSV (Computer System Validation) and Quality &amp;amp; Compliance (Q&amp;amp;C).&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Proven ability to provide application support for multiple sites globally.','Information Technology','Full-time','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Noida',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2025-12-21 18:30:00',0,0,'2025-10-23 11:26:05.000000','2025-10-23 11:26:05.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"CSV\", \"Data Analytics\", \"Gxp Compliance\", \"Life Sciences\", \"Pharma Industry\", \"Python\", \"Quality\", \"ServiceNow\", \"SQL\", \"UI Creation\"]','[\"1. Opportunity to work on global pharma/life science projects using Tulip MES platform.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;2. Exposure to cutting-edge digital manufacturing and analytics tools.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;3. Collaborative and innovative work culture encouraging process automation.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;4. Continuous learning and skill enhancement with emerging technologies.\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Uttar Pradesh'),('5ecccd21-05d2-4e00-abbb-21941f88c22b','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Syncade MES Consultant (Master MES L3 Support)','syncade-mes-consultant-master-mes-l3-support-325-325','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;88&quot; data-end=&quot;442&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced Syncade MES Consultants for a leading Top MNC to support enterprise Pharmaceutical and Biotech Manufacturing projects across global locations. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in Emerson Syncade MES, Manufacturing Execution Systems (MES), Electronic Batch Records (EBR), and regulated manufacturing environments.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;444&quot; data-end=&quot;865&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for developing, supporting, enhancing, and maintaining Emerson Syncade MES solutions to optimize manufacturing operations and ensure regulatory compliance. The role includes developing production procedures, providing L3 application support, troubleshooting complex production issues, supporting system enhancements, and delivering validated MES solutions for global manufacturing sites.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;867&quot; data-end=&quot;1290&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with Emerson Syncade MES, Electronic Batch Records (EBR), Production Procedure Development, HP ALM testing, Computer System Validation (CSV), IQ/OQ documentation, ISA-95 (S95) models, and pharmaceutical manufacturing processes. Strong understanding of data integrity, regulatory compliance, IT lifecycle management, and validated manufacturing environments is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1292&quot; data-end=&quot;1685&quot;&gt;The role also involves collaborating with business users, manufacturing teams, QA, validation teams, and global IT stakeholders to deliver reliable MES solutions, manage change requests, support continuous improvement initiatives, and maintain compliance with regulatory standards. Candidates should possess strong analytical, communication, stakeholder management, and problem-solving skills.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-09-01 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-07-03 19:09:17.000000','2026-07-03 19:09:17.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"CSV\", \"IQ\", \"Manufacturing Execution Systems\", \"Mes Troubleshooting\", \"OQ\", \"Emerson Syncade MES\", \"Master Data Management (MDM)\", \"ISA-95\", \"L2 Application Support\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1701&quot; data-end=&quot;1739&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;3gslfz&quot; data-start=&quot;1740&quot; data-end=&quot;1812&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale Pharmaceutical and Biotech MES projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;vski8o&quot; data-start=&quot;1813&quot; data-end=&quot;1891&quot;&gt;Work on global Emerson Syncade MES implementations and support initiatives&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;jwvtzw&quot; data-start=&quot;1892&quot; data-end=&quot;1962&quot;&gt;Career growth in MES &amp;amp; Pharmaceutical Digital Manufacturing domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;lx4whh&quot; data-start=&quot;1963&quot; data-end=&quot;2042&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with international business and technology teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;2lee9a&quot; data-start=&quot;2043&quot; data-end=&quot;2098&quot;&gt;Professional and compliance-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;2099&quot; data-end=&quot;2142&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('5f68893b-0fe7-41af-a9fe-69901063f3c6','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','MES Consultant – Aveva/Wonderware','mes-consultant-avevawonderware-81-81','We are hiring skilled MES Consultants (Aveva/Wonderware) with 4 to 8 years of experience to join a top industrial automation team working across PAN India.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;The ideal candidate will work on MES platform implementation, configuration, and support, with exposure to modules such as Operations, Performance, Quality, and Inventory.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Responsibilities include:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Technical support and troubleshooting for MES Applications&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;MES system deployment, patch management, and security&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;SQL scripting and working with MES databases&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Creating MES workflows and custom dashboards&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Bug fixing and coordination with development/engineering teams&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Involvement in full MES lifecycle and production support','Information Technology','Contract','Entry',NULL,NULL,'INR',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-19 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-07-23 05:49:33.000000','2025-11-21 04:46:50.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\".NET\", \"AvevaWonderware\", \"C#\", \"Historian\", \"JavaScript\", \"Manufacturing/Production\", \"Mes Optimization\", \"Mes Workflow Design\", \"Patch Management\", \"SQL\", \"Troubleshooting\", \"VB\", \"AVEVA MES\"]','[\"Work with a top-tier client in the industrial automation space&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Exposure to enterprise MES systems (Aveva/Wonderware)&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Flexible PAN India deployment opportunities&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Training and upskilling on modern MES tools&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Collaborative and professional work environment&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Opportunity to work on critical manufacturing tech solutions\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('5fc8a2e6-3626-48ed-b452-d1bd8a560be4','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','KMC – Process Engineering Lead','kmc-process-engineering-lead-152-152','&lt;p data-start=&quot;261&quot; data-end=&quot;843&quot;&gt;The &lt;strong data-start=&quot;265&quot; data-end=&quot;293&quot;&gt;Process Engineering Lead&lt;/strong&gt; will be responsible for driving plant engineering initiatives, collaborating with global and regional teams, developing engineering standards, and supporting digital transformation across process plants. The role involves interpreting engineering drawings, preparing process engineering documents, performing process calculations, and identifying opportunities for improvement through technology-driven solutions. The candidate will work closely with cross-functional teams to standardize engineering procedures and support overall project delivery.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;1894&quot; data-end=&quot;1923&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1899&quot; data-end=&quot;1923&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;ol data-start=&quot;1924&quot; data-end=&quot;2554&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1924&quot; data-end=&quot;2014&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1927&quot; data-end=&quot;2014&quot;&gt;Collaborate with global technology leads and regional teams for standard development.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2015&quot; data-end=&quot;2092&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2018&quot; data-end=&quot;2092&quot;&gt;Support plant teams in creating engineering standards and documentation.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2093&quot; data-end=&quot;2205&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2096&quot; data-end=&quot;2205&quot;&gt;Work with project delivery teams to gather essential engineering inputs such as PFDs, layouts, quotes, etc.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2206&quot; data-end=&quot;2297&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2209&quot; data-end=&quot;2297&quot;&gt;Identify opportunities for process and operational improvement using new technologies.&lt;/p&