ata-section-id=&quot;1j8qgoe&quot; data-start=&quot;1273&quot; data-end=&quot;1340&quot;&gt;Provide L2/L3 support and troubleshoot complex production issues.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;17ylils&quot; data-start=&quot;1341&quot; data-end=&quot;1430&quot;&gt;Perform system administration, maintenance, debugging, and performance troubleshooting.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;szi4wj&quot; data-start=&quot;1431&quot; data-end=&quot;1513&quot;&gt;Design and support integrations with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1470&quot; data-end=&quot;1512&quot;&gt;laboratory instruments and CDS systems&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1uraifr&quot; data-start=&quot;1514&quot; data-end=&quot;1592&quot;&gt;Work with platforms such as &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1544&quot; data-end=&quot;1571&quot;&gt;Empower, OpenLab, ATLAS&lt;/strong&gt;, or similar systems.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;179szey&quot; data-start=&quot;1593&quot; data-end=&quot;1666&quot;&gt;Integrate LabVantage with enterprise applications and external systems.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-27 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-08-29 00:47:00.000000','2026-08-29 00:47:01.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Jasper Reports\", \"Java\", \"Oracle\", \"SQL\", \"Trouble Shooting\", \"LabVantage LIMS\", \"Agilent OpenLab\", \"Chromatography Data Systems (CDS)\", \"LIMS Integration\", \"LabVantage Application Support\", \"Empower Administration\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;sha30i&quot; data-start=&quot;2094&quot; data-end=&quot;2177&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2123&quot; data-end=&quot;2134&quot;&gt;Top MNC&lt;/strong&gt; on global LIMS transformation initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;vvmf3z&quot; data-start=&quot;2178&quot; data-end=&quot;2260&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2209&quot; data-end=&quot;2259&quot;&gt;LabVantage implementation and support projects&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;bc06vj&quot; data-start=&quot;2261&quot; data-end=&quot;2347&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with pharmaceutical, life sciences, and laboratory environments.&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;icm0gw&quot; data-start=&quot;2348&quot; data-end=&quot;2426&quot;&gt;International exposure with opportunities across &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2399&quot; data-end=&quot;2425&quot;&gt;India, Belgium, and EU&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1db1tnk&quot; data-start=&quot;2427&quot; data-end=&quot;2499&quot;&gt;Work on LIMS, laboratory instrument, CDS, and enterprise integrations.&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;19h52vk&quot; data-start=&quot;2500&quot; data-end=&quot;2557&quot;&gt;Exposure to modern &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2521&quot; data-end=&quot;2556&quot;&gt;DevOps and deployment practices&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;q6y7qa&quot; data-start=&quot;2558&quot; data-end=&quot;2629&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with global customers and cross-functional teams.&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('60278cc4-5a30-4f5e-8346-8694c5d38a27','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','AI / ML Engineer','ai-ml-engineer-96-96','We are hiring AI/ML Engineers (3&ndash;12 years) for PAN India (Full-Time). You will design and build production-grade AI solutions using Cloud AI services and GenAI models, with robust cloud/on-prem pipelines. Work spans deep learning, neural networks, chatbots, and image processing. You&rsquo;ll operate independently, contribute as an SME, and collaborate closely with cross-functional teams.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;br /&gt;- Design and develop applications using AI tools and Cloud AI services.&lt;br /&gt;- Build cloud or on-prem MLOps pipelines with production-ready quality.&lt;br /&gt;- Apply GenAI models (LLMs, embeddings, RAG) as part of end-to-end solutions.&lt;br /&gt;- Implement deep learning and classical ML (NNs, regression, trees, clustering).&lt;br /&gt;- Design and develop chatbots and image processing solutions.&lt;br /&gt;- Participate actively in technical discussions and solution design; mentor as needed.&lt;br /&gt;- Troubleshoot, optimize, and document models, data flows, and services.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Required Skills &amp;amp; Qualifications:&lt;br /&gt;- Must-have: Proficiency in MLOps (model training, CI/CD for ML, monitoring).&lt;br /&gt;- Strong grasp of statistics and ML algorithms (regression, classification, trees, clustering).&lt;br /&gt;- Experience with data visualization tools (Tableau or Power BI).&lt;br /&gt;- Solid data wrangling: cleaning, transformation, normalization, feature engineering.&lt;br /&gt;- Hands-on with Python and ML/DL frameworks (e.g., scikit-learn, TensorFlow/PyTorch).&lt;br /&gt;- Experience with at least one cloud (AWS/GCP/Azure) and containerization (Docker).&lt;br /&gt;- Strong problem-solving, communication, and collaboration skills.','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-30 06:00:00',0,0,'2025-08-27 11:32:15.000000','2026-05-06 20:52:57.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"AI/ML\", \"AWS\", \"Azure\", \"Chatbots\", \"Cloud\", \"Computer Vision\", \"Data Cleaning\", \"Data Transcription\", \"GCP\", \"Image Recognition\", \"Machine Learning\", \"Power BI\", \"Python\", \"SQL\", \"Tableau\", \"Data Modeling\", \"CI/CD\", \"Generative AI\", \"NLP\", \"LLM Fine-tuning\"]','[\"- Competitive salary and performance bonuses&lt;br /&gt;- 100% PAN India flexibility (remote/hybrid per project)&lt;br /&gt;- Work on real-world GenAI and production-scale AI platforms&lt;br /&gt;- Upskilling: certifications, trainings, conferences&lt;br /&gt;- Health benefits and wellness programs&lt;br /&gt;- Collaborative, fast-paced, innovation-driven culture\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('602fd778-67cc-4e48-b219-0a8dc7b3e849','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Fleet Engineer – Edge Device & Fleet Management','fleet-engineer-edge-device-fleet-management-375-375','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;85&quot; data-end=&quot;286&quot;&gt;We are looking for experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;116&quot; data-end=&quot;135&quot;&gt;Fleet Engineers&lt;/strong&gt; to join a leading Top MNC and work on large-scale &lt;strong data-start=&quot;186&quot; data-end=&quot;273&quot;&gt;Linux-based Edge Computing, IoT, Edge AI, and containerized device fleet management&lt;/strong&gt; initiatives.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;288&quot; data-end=&quot;512&quot;&gt;The ideal candidate should have strong hands-on experience managing distributed Linux-based edge devices, containerized applications, &lt;strong data-start=&quot;422&quot; data-end=&quot;511&quot;&gt;BalenaCloud, Docker, CI/CD, remote device troubleshooting, networking, and automation&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;514&quot; data-end=&quot;744&quot;&gt;The role involves managing the complete edge-device lifecycle, deploying applications across distributed fleets, executing OTA updates, monitoring device health, troubleshooting remotely, and automating fleet management processes.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;18w7bso&quot; data-start=&quot;746&quot; data-end=&quot;769&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;771&quot; data-end=&quot;1864&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;bopv9c&quot; data-start=&quot;771&quot; data-end=&quot;860&quot;&gt;Provision, configure, and onboard Linux-based edge devices into &lt;strong data-start=&quot;837&quot; data-end=&quot;859&quot;&gt;BalenaCloud fleets&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;16o4mw9&quot; data-start=&quot;861&quot; data-end=&quot;967&quot;&gt;Manage the complete device lifecycle, including registration, updates, maintenance, and decommissioning.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1sxoda9&quot; data-start=&quot;968&quot; data-end=&quot;1054&quot;&gt;Deploy and monitor containerized applications across distributed edge-device fleets.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;cogsl7&quot; data-start=&quot;1055&quot; data-end=&quot;1146&quot;&gt;Manage fleet-wide environment variables, device configurations, and application releases.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;oe6ivk&quot; data-start=&quot;1147&quot; data-end=&quot;1239&quot;&gt;Plan and execute &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1166&quot; data-end=&quot;1214&quot;&gt;OTA (Over-the-Air) software/firmware updates&lt;/strong&gt; with minimal disruption.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;hkuahl&quot; data-start=&quot;1240&quot; data-end=&quot;1317&quot;&gt;Troubleshoot remote edge devices, analyze logs, and diagnose system issues.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Kolkata',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-27 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-08-29 00:38:34.000000','2026-08-29 00:38:35.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"API Integration\", \"Bash\", \"Docker\", \"Github\", \"Gitlab Ci\", \"Jenkins\", \"Linux\", \"Shell\", \"Ubuntu\", \"GitHub Actions\", \"Balena\", \"BalenaCloud\", \"balenaCLI\", \"Docker Compose\", \"Raspberry Pi OS\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1bsoq9k&quot; data-start=&quot;1879&quot; data-end=&quot;1962&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1908&quot; data-end=&quot;1919&quot;&gt;Top MNC&lt;/strong&gt; on large-scale Edge Computing initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1pkw7r8&quot; data-start=&quot;1963&quot; data-end=&quot;2050&quot;&gt;Exposure to &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1977&quot; data-end=&quot;2049&quot;&gt;Edge AI, IoT, Docker, BalenaCloud, and distributed device management&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;ml8y4h&quot; data-start=&quot;2051&quot; data-end=&quot;2115&quot;&gt;Experience managing enterprise-scale Linux edge-device fleets.&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1fgf7hl&quot; data-start=&quot;2116&quot; data-end=&quot;2200&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with modern &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2150&quot; data-end=&quot;2199&quot;&gt;CI/CD, automation, and container technologies&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;i9o62e&quot; data-start=&quot;2201&quot; data-end=&quot;2269&quot;&gt;Exposure to cloud IoT platforms and edge deployment architectures.&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'West Bengal'),('60e8ce64-ec0f-4955-8e9c-840d54168fce','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','MES Developer / Connect IoT Expert','mes-developer-connect-iot-expert-379-379','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;222&quot; data-end=&quot;469&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;248&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot;&gt;MES Developers / Equipment Integration / Connect IoT Experts&lt;/strong&gt; for a leading Top MNC to work on advanced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;355&quot; data-end=&quot;459&quot;&gt;Manufacturing Execution Systems (MES), Industrial IoT, Factory Automation, and Equipment Integration&lt;/strong&gt; projects.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;471&quot; data-end=&quot;773&quot;&gt;The ideal candidate should have &lt;strong data-start=&quot;503&quot; data-end=&quot;537&quot;&gt;8+ years of overall experience&lt;/strong&gt;, including at least &lt;strong data-start=&quot;558&quot; data-end=&quot;649&quot;&gt;4+ years of hands-on experience in Equipment Integration and Critical Manufacturing MES&lt;/strong&gt;. Strong expertise in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;671&quot; data-end=&quot;760&quot;&gt;C#/.NET Core, SQL/T-SQL, OOP, MES development, and industrial communication protocols&lt;/strong&gt; is required.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;775&quot; data-end=&quot;1036&quot;&gt;The role involves developing and customizing MES applications across backend and frontend layers, integrating manufacturing equipment with MES platforms, and implementing reliable communication using &lt;strong data-start=&quot;975&quot; data-end=&quot;1035&quot;&gt;OPC, SECS/GEM, HSMS, MQTT, RS-232, FTP, APIs, and TCP/IP&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1038&quot; data-end=&quot;1365&quot;&gt;The candidate will work closely with manufacturing, automation, engineering, and IT teams to design and implement scalable &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1161&quot; data-end=&quot;1197&quot;&gt;MES and Industrial IoT solutions&lt;/strong&gt;. Responsibilities include equipment connectivity, MES customization, application development, integration troubleshooting, testing, deployment, and production support.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-31 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-09-02 02:18:03.000000','2026-09-02 02:18:03.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\".NET CORE\", \"Angular\", \"C#\", \"Equipment\", \"Mes\", \"OOPS\", \"REST API\", \"SQL\", \"TCP\", \"Transact-SQL\", \"OPC UA\", \"SECS/GEM Standards\", \"MQTT\", \"Factory Automation\", \"Industrial IoT (IIoT)\", \"Critical Manufacturing\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;i3mxm7&quot; data-start=&quot;1654&quot; data-end=&quot;1698&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a leading Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;ipo660&quot; data-start=&quot;1699&quot; data-end=&quot;1766&quot;&gt;Exposure to global MES and Industrial IoT transformation programs&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;t9ag3w&quot; data-start=&quot;1767&quot; data-end=&quot;1826&quot;&gt;Work on advanced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1786&quot; data-end=&quot;1816&quot;&gt;Critical Manufacturing MES&lt;/strong&gt; solutions&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;105f6c&quot; data-start=&quot;1827&quot; data-end=&quot;1898&quot;&gt;Exposure to Factory Automation and Equipment Integration technologies&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;161hf50&quot; data-start=&quot;1899&quot; data-end=&quot;2001&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1926&quot; data-end=&quot;2001&quot;&gt;OPC, SECS/GEM, HSMS, MQTT, APIs, and industrial communication protocols&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;qp5sse&quot; data-start=&quot;2002&quot; data-end=&quot;2080&quot;&gt;International customer interaction and potential Sweden travel opportunities&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;7xcjm3&quot; data-start=&quot;2081&quot; data-end=&quot;2173&quot;&gt;Exposure to modern technologies across &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2122&quot; data-end=&quot;2173&quot;&gt;MES, IoT, automation, and digital manufacturing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;19sv6p0&quot; data-start=&quot;2174&quot; data-end=&quot;2233&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on large-scale manufacturing projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('61104786-13ac-4f07-8840-5d3f702a6d2d','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','ThingWorx Developer (5+ Years Experience)','thingworx-developer-5-years-experience-52-52','&lt;p data-start=&quot;210&quot; data-end=&quot;408&quot;&gt;Job Details:&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;430&quot; data-end=&quot;592&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;433&quot; data-end=&quot;442&quot;&gt;Role:&lt;/strong&gt; ThingWorx Developer&lt;br data-start=&quot;462&quot; data-end=&quot;465&quot; /&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;468&quot; data-end=&quot;483&quot;&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 5+ Years&lt;br data-start=&quot;492&quot; data-end=&quot;495&quot; /&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;498&quot; data-end=&quot;512&quot;&gt;Locations:&lt;/strong&gt; Pune | Bangalore | Chennai&lt;br data-start=&quot;539&quot; data-end=&quot;542&quot; /&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;545&quot; data-end=&quot;562&quot;&gt;Availability:&lt;/strong&gt; Immediate Joiners Preferred&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;594&quot; data-end=&quot;622&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;623&quot; data-end=&quot;1015&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Develop, deploy, and maintain ThingWorx-based IIoT applications&lt;br data-start=&quot;688&quot; data-end=&quot;691&quot; /&gt;&amp;nbsp;Integrate with SCADA, MES, PLCs, and enterprise systems&lt;br data-start=&quot;748&quot; data-end=&quot;751&quot; /&gt;&amp;nbsp;Configure ThingWorx Mashups, Services, and Data Models&lt;br data-start=&quot;807&quot; data-end=&quot;810&quot; /&gt;&amp;nbsp;Implement REST APIs, WebSockets, MQTT, Kepware, and Edge devices&lt;br data-start=&quot;876&quot; data-end=&quot;879&quot; /&gt;&amp;nbsp;Work with ThingWorx Analytics, Machine Learning, and Predictive Maintenance&lt;br data-start=&quot;956&quot; data-end=&quot;959&quot; /&gt;&amp;nbsp;Optimize performance and ensure application security&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;1017&quot; data-end=&quot;1040&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Required Skills:&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1041&quot; data-end=&quot;1393&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;5+ years of experience in ThingWorx development&lt;br data-start=&quot;1091&quot; data-end=&quot;1094&quot; /&gt;&amp;nbsp;Strong understanding of MQTT, OPC UA, REST, WebSockets&lt;br data-start=&quot;1151&quot; data-end=&quot;1154&quot; /&gt;&amp;nbsp;Hands-on with Edge computing, Kepware, SCADA &amp;amp; MES integration&lt;br data-start=&quot;1219&quot; data-end=&quot;1222&quot; /&gt;&amp;nbsp;Proficient in JavaScript, Java, SQL, and Web Services&lt;br data-start=&quot;1278&quot; data-end=&quot;1281&quot; /&gt;&amp;nbsp;Solid grasp of Industrial IoT architecture&lt;br data-start=&quot;1326&quot; data-end=&quot;1329&quot; /&gt;&amp;nbsp;Strong debugging, analytic