ical-sme-209-209','&amp;middot; Manage and support instrument integrations with the LIMS system &lt;br /&gt;&amp;middot; Oversee LIMS upgrades, patches, and change management activities to ensure system stability &lt;br /&gt;&amp;middot; Provide L2/L3 support for troubleshooting and resolving complex issues within SampleManager LIMS&lt;br /&gt;&amp;middot; Configure and maintain LIMS master data, including products, sampling plans, specifications, and methods &lt;br /&gt;&amp;middot; Troubleshoot application errors, user access issues, and data discrepancies, ensuring minimal system downtime&lt;br /&gt;&amp;middot; Ensure that LIMS documentation is up to date (SOPs, user guides, system configuration)','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'INR',1,'India','Pune',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-05-04 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-03-05 23:59:00.000000','2026-03-05 23:59:00.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"AWS\", \"Lims\", \"MS SQL Server\", \"SOP Development\", \"ITIL framework\", \"L2/L3 Support\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;Competitive salary package with performance-based incentives&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;65&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;67&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;Health insurance coverage and statutory benefits (PF &amp;amp; Gratuity)&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;134&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;136&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on large-scale enterprise energy management projects&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;211&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;213&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;Strong career growth and learning opportunities&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;263&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;265&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;Collaborative and professional work environment&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Maharashtra'),('6156507c-a472-4a74-9d00-6de9008ad8a0','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Developer - Labeling','developer-labeling-234-234','&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;Loftware Developer:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Responsible for leading ASPAC Loftware on‑premises to cloud migrations, owning end‑to‑end program delivery. Manage milestones, governance, vendors, risks, and dependencies. Drive global stakeholder alignment and execute zero‑disruption, compliant multisite cutovers across China, Japan, India, and Singapore, ensuring business continuity, performance, and scalability within regulated manufacturing and enterprise labeling environments globally.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Working knowledge in Loftware is required. Understanding Cloud and migration project background is a plus point.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Entry',NULL,NULL,'INR',1,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-05-31 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-04-01 20:01:47.000000','2026-04-01 20:17:55.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Mes\", \"SAP\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;Competitive salary package with performance-based incentives&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;65&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;67&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;Health insurance coverage and statutory benefits (PF &amp;amp; Gratuity)&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;134&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;136&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on large-scale enterprise energy management projects&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;211&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;213&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;Strong career growth and learning opportunities&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;263&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;265&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;Collaborative and professional work environment&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('61a17c52-593b-4c49-9f6d-a3c4829b713d','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Backend Data Engineer','backend-data-engineer-346-346','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;63&quot; data-end=&quot;422&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;89&quot; data-end=&quot;115&quot;&gt;Backend Data Engineers&lt;/strong&gt; for a leading Top MNC to build enterprise-scale data engineering solutions supporting AI, analytics, and intelligent IT operations platforms. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in modern data engineering, cloud-based data platforms, API integrations, and enterprise data pipeline development.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;424&quot; data-end=&quot;917&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for designing, developing, and maintaining scalable data pipelines that integrate ServiceNow, observability platforms, runbooks, knowledge repositories, RCA documents, and other enterprise data sources into AI platforms. The role includes extracting and transforming operational data, building robust ingestion frameworks, creating optimized data models, managing vector databases, and preparing high-quality datasets for AI and machine learning applications.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;919&quot; data-end=&quot;1251&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with Python, SQL, Azure Data Factory, Azure Databricks, API integration, data modeling, and ServiceNow data integration. Strong knowledge of ETL/ELT processes, cloud data engineering, data quality, data lineage, metadata management, and enterprise data architecture is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1253&quot; data-end=&quot;1704&quot;&gt;The role also involves collaborating with AI engineers, data scientists, solution architects, and business stakeholders to deliver reliable, scalable, and secure data solutions. Candidates will optimize SQL queries, improve data processing performance, ensure data governance, and support AI-driven initiatives by enabling high-quality data pipelines. Strong analytical, communication, stakeholder management, and problem-solving skills are essential.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-09-20 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-07-23 01:36:42.000000','2026-07-23 01:36:42.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"API Integration\", \"Azure Key Vault\", \"Data Integration\", \"Data Modeling\", \"ETL\", \"Python\", \"Root Cause Analysis (RCA)\", \"SQL\", \"ADF\", \"Azure Databricks\", \"Metadata Management\", \"ELT Pipelines\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1720&quot; data-end=&quot;1758&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;tx54tn&quot; data-start=&quot;1759&quot; data-end=&quot;1842&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale AI, Data Engineering, and Cloud Analytics projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;sryw5o&quot; data-start=&quot;1843&quot; data-end=&quot;1919&quot;&gt;Work with modern Azure cloud technologies and intelligent data platforms&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ben0oy&quot; data-start=&quot;1920&quot; data-end=&quot;1990&quot;&gt;Career growth in Data Engineering, AI, and Cloud Data Architecture&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=