ations, and technical operations within a regulated &lt;strong data-start=&quot;546&quot; data-end=&quot;557&quot;&gt;GMP/GxP&lt;/strong&gt; environment.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;572&quot; data-end=&quot;800&quot;&gt;You will work closely with laboratory teams, IT service management, and cross-functional stakeholders to deliver high-quality support, troubleshoot issues, and implement solutions that optimize system performance and compliance.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;h1 data-start=&quot;807&quot; data-end=&quot;836&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;809&quot; data-end=&quot;836&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;837&quot; data-end=&quot;1475&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;837&quot; data-end=&quot;924&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;839&quot; data-end=&quot;924&quot;&gt;Provide end-to-end support for &lt;strong data-start=&quot;870&quot; data-end=&quot;922&quot;&gt;Empower Enterprise system setup and architecture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;925&quot; data-end=&quot;1037&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;927&quot; data-end=&quot;1037&quot;&gt;Manage &lt;strong data-start=&quot;934&quot; data-end=&quot;954&quot;&gt;Empower upgrades&lt;/strong&gt;, including system configuration, DAC setup, user management, and version control&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1038&quot; data-end=&quot;1116&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1040&quot; data-end=&quot;1116&quot;&gt;Work in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1048&quot; data-end=&quot;1083&quot;&gt;GMP/GxP laboratory environments&lt;/strong&gt; and support relevant workflows&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1117&quot; data-end=&quot;1216&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1119&quot; data-end=&quot;1216&quot;&gt;Develop and maintain &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1140&quot; data-end=&quot;1169&quot;&gt;custom fields and reports&lt;/strong&gt; for Empower Chromatography Data System (CDS)&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1217&quot; data-end=&quot;1307&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1219&quot; data-end=&quot;1307&quot;&gt;Provide &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1227&quot; data-end=&quot;1262&quot;&gt;application integration support&lt;/strong&gt; across laboratory and enterprise platforms&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1308&quot; data-end=&quot;1405&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1310&quot; data-end=&quot;1405&quot;&gt;Deliver &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1318&quot; data-end=&quot;1349&quot;&gt;incident, change management&lt;/strong&gt;, and implementation services following ITIL processes&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1406&quot; data-end=&quot;1475&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1408&quot; data-end=&quot;1475&quot;&gt;Ensure compliance, documentation accuracy, and system reliability&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Full-time','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Pune',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-20 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-11-22 00:21:12.000000','2025-11-22 00:21:12.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Gxp Compliance\", \"Healthcare\", \"Life Sciences\", \"ITIL framework\", \"Pharma\", \"DAC Management\", \"Stakeholder Handling\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2491&quot; data-end=&quot;2563&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2493&quot; data-end=&quot;2563&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2520&quot; data-end=&quot;2561&quot;&gt;top global Pharma &amp;amp; Life Sciences MNC&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2564&quot; data-end=&quot;2646&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2566&quot; data-end=&quot;2646&quot;&gt;Exposure to &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2578&quot; data-end=&quot;2644&quot;&gt;latest Empower versions, lab systems, and enterprise platforms&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2647&quot; data-end=&quot;2713&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2649&quot; data-end=&quot;2713&quot;&gt;Work in a highly regulated, cutting-edge environment (GMP/GxP)&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2714&quot; data-end=&quot;2776&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2716&quot; data-end=&quot;2776&quot;&gt;Professional growth via &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2740&quot; data-end=&quot;2774&quot;&gt;ITIL-driven service management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2777&quot; data-end=&quot;2849&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2779&quot; data-end=&quot;2849&quot;&gt;Stable, long-term career path with continuous learning opportunities&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2850&quot; data-end=&quot;2895&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2852&quot; data-end=&quot;2895&quot;&gt;Collaborative and supportive work culture&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2896&quot; data-end=&quot;2946&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2898&quot; data-end=&quot;2946&quot;&gt;Competitive compensation &amp;amp; performance rewards&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Maharashtra'),('6333e650-1f5c-4a0a-8a32-27fb40e621f9','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Java Spring Boot Developer','java-spring-boot-developer-7-7','Key Qualifications: Strong proficiency in Java programming Hands-on experience with Spring Boot framework Knowledge of RESTful web services and API development Familiarity with SQL and database technologies Experience with cloud platforms like AWS or Azure (a plus) Understanding of CI/CD pipelines and containerization tools like Docker and Kubernetes Expertise in microservices design and software development principles Excellent problem-solving, analytical, and communication skills Responsibilities: Collaborate with SMEs, Business Managers, and Onsite SPOCs to understand functional requirements Design, develop, implement, test, and monitor software components using Java, microservices, and Spring Boot Provide technical leadership for financial systems deployed across multiple countries and channels Work closely with Business Analysts, Data Architects, ETL Developers, and Project Managers to deliver robust solutions','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',200000.00,300000.00,'₹',1,'India','Chennai',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-30 06:00:00',0,0,'2025-05-04 16:59:49.000000','2026-05-12 14:50:30.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Advanced Java\", \"Analytical Skill\", \"Analytics\", \"ASP.NET Core\", \"Core Java\", \"Import Mappings\", \"Java\", \"Java Full Stack\", \"JVM (Java Virtual Machine)\", \"Spring Boot\", \"Spring Boot Microservices\"]','[\"Perks &amp;amp; Benefits: Competitive salary package Career growth opportunities Comprehensive health insurance Hybrid work model Performance-based incentives Learning and development programs\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Tamil Nadu'),('63b7ee2b-700b-4a5c-8e4a-0ed11724fccd','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Oracle WebLogic Administrator','oracle-weblogic-administrator-151-151','&lt;p data-start=&quot;250&quot; data-end=&quot;642&quot;&gt;We are seeking an experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;280&quot; data-end=&quot;313&quot;&gt;Oracle WebLogic Administrator&lt;/strong&gt; with strong hands-on expertise in Middleware Administration, Application Deployments, and Server Management. The ideal candidate will be responsible for managing WebLogic environments, automating deployments, ensuring high availability, and optimizing system performance across multi-platform environments (AIX, Linux, Windows).&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;644&quot; data-end=&quot;993&quot;&gt;The candidate will work on domain creation, configuration of Forms and Reports, SSL/TLS certificates, patching using Ansible, resource tuning, and managing disaster recovery activities. Experience in warehouse environments will be an added advantage. The role also includes incident management, job scheduling, and monitoring using enterprise tools.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;hr data-start=&quot;995&quot; data-end=&quot;998&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;1000&quot; data-end=&quot;1031&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1003&quot; data-end=&quot;1031&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1033&quot; data-end=&quot;2190&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1033&quot; data-end=&quot;1173&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1035&quot; data-end=&quot;1173&quot;&gt;Administer &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1046&quot; data-end=&quot;1085&quot;&gt;Oracle WebLogic Server (9i/12c/14c)&lt;/strong&gt; and other middleware platforms like &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1122&quot; data-end=&quot;1170&quot;&gt;JBoss, Apache Tomcat, IIS, Fusion Middleware&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1174&quot; data-end=&quot;1284&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1176&quot; data-end=&quot;1284&quot;&gt;Perform &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1184&quot; data-end=&quot;1256&quot;&gt;installation, configuration, troubleshooting, and performance tuning&lt;/strong&gt; of middleware components.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1285&quot; data-end=&quot;1377&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1287&quot; data-end=&quot;1377&quot;&gt;Work on &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1295&quot; data-end=&quot;1338&quot;&gt;application deployments (JAR, WAR, EAR)&lt;/strong&gt; and manage &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1350&quot; data-end=&quot;1374&quot;&gt;SSL/TLS certificates&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1378&quot; data-end=&quot;1487&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1380&quot; data-end=&quot;1487&quot;&gt;Complete &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1389&quot; data-end=&quot;1422&quot;&gt;domain creation/configuration&lt;/strong&gt;, Oracle Forms &amp;amp; Reports setup, and server resource management.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1488&quot; data-end=&quot;1559&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1490&quot; data-end=&quot;1559&quot;&gt;Execute &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1498&quot; data-end=&quot;1542&quot;&gt;WebLogic patching (PSU/Critical Updates)&lt;/strong&gt; using Ansible.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1560&quot; data-end=&quot;1657&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1562&quot; data-end=&quot;1657&quot;&gt;Configure Admin/Managed Servers, JDBC Pools, JMS components, clusters, and tuning parameters.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1658&quot; data-end=&quot;1750&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1660&quot; data-end=&quot;1750&quot;&gt;Work with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1670&quot; data-end=&quot;1698&quot;&gt;F5 BIG-IP load balancing&lt;/strong&gt;, and tools like Nagios, Dynatrace, and New Relic.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1751&quot; data-end=&quot;1859&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1753&quot; data-end=&quot;1859&quot;&gt;Handle &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1760&quot; data-end=&quot;1807&quot;&gt;incident management, Autosys job scheduling&lt;/strong&gt;, and troubleshoot heap memory/server hang issues.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1860&quot; data-end=&quot;1947&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1862&quot; data-end=&quot;1947&quot;&gt;Support &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1870&quot; data-end=&quot;1900&quot;&gt;disaster recovery planning&lt;/strong&gt;, environment refresh, and backup procedures.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1948&quot; data-end=&quot;2043&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1950&quot; data-end=&quot;2043&quot;&gt;Leverage automation tools like &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1981&quot; data-end=&quot;2001&quot;&gt;Ansible, Jenkins&lt;/strong&gt;, and scripting to streamline processes.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2044&quot; data-end=&quot;2141&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2046&quot; data-end=&quot;2141&quot;&gt;Experience in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2060&quot; data-end=&quot;2094&quot;&gt;Oracle Database, Linux Red Hat&lt;/strong&gt;, and deployments across AIX, Linux, Windows.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2142&quot; data-end=&quot;2190&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2144&quot; data-end=&quot;2190&quot;&gt;Warehouse project experience is an added plus.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Full-time','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-24 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-11-26 03:20:54.000000','2025-11-26 03:20:54.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"AIX\", \"Ansible\", \"APACHE TOMCAT\", \"Dynatrace\", \"Jboss\", \"Jenkins\", \"Nagios\", \"New Relic\", \"OpenSSL\", \"Oracle Forms 6i\", \"Python 3\", \"Scripting\", \"Shell\", \"IIS\", \"Oracle WebLogic Server (9i/12c/14c)\", \"Oracle Database\", \"Linux Red Hat\", \"JAR\", \"TLS\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2900&quot; data-end=&quot;2930&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2902&quot; data-end=&quot;2930&quot;&gt;Competitive Salary Package&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2931&quot; data-end=&quot;2961&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2933&quot; data-end=&quot;2961&quot;&gt;Health &amp;amp; Medical Insurance&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2962&quot; data-end=&quot;2999&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2964&quot; data-end=&quot;2999&quot;&gt;Professional Growth Opportunities&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;3000&quot; data-end=&quot;3053&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;3002&quot; data-end=&quot;3053&quot;&gt;Exposure to Enterprise-Level Middleware Platforms&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;3054&quot; data-end=&quot;3117&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;3056&quot; data-end=&quot;3117&quot;&gt;Work with Modern Automation Tools (Ansible, Jenkins, Azure)&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;3118&quot; data-end=&quot;3160&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;3120&quot; data-end=&quot;3160&quot;&gt;Supportive Team &amp;amp; Learning Environment&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;3161&quot; data-end=&quot;3191&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;3163&quot; data-end=&quot;3191&quot;&gt;Performance-based Incentives&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('63c74766-b6c6-4133-b114-da1b5c783377','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','System Engineer – IT/OT Integration (Life Sciences)','system-engineer-itot-integration-life-sciences-198-198','&lt;p&gt;&amp;middot; Install, commission, and support IT-OT and related IT application solutions in production.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;middot; Develop and maintain UNIX shell and Windows scripts for automation and operations.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;middot; Configure secure industrial networks and OT&amp;rarr;IT data flows; ensure reliability and compliance.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;middot; Connect platforms (Ignition, HiveMQ; HighByte advantageous) using OPC UA, MQTT, BACnet, Modbus.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;middot; Design system architectures; produce clear installation/integration diagrams and runbooks.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;middot; Collaborate in agile teams; engage confidently with technical and business stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;middot; Databases: Install, design and query across SQL and NoSQL stores; support historian connectivity.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'INR',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-04-21 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-02-20 22:41:24.000000','2026-02-20 22:42:29.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"IT\", \"Life Sciences\", \"MYSQL\", \"NoSQL\", \"Modbus\", \"OPC UA\", \"MQTT\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;Competitive salary package with performance-based incentives&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;65&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;67&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;Health insurance coverage and statutory benefits (PF &amp;amp; Gratuity)&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;134&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;136&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on large-scale enterprise energy management projects&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;211&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;213&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;Strong career growth and learning opportunities&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;263&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;265&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;Collaborative and professional work environment&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('64c450aa-5bac-4d17-9f69-c64b1f2b5094','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','CM MES Modeler / Functional Consultant','cm-mes-modeler-functional-consultant-277-277','&lt;p data-start=&quot;80&quot; data-end=&quot;432&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced CM MES Modeler / Functional Consultants for a leading Top MNC to work on enterprise-level Manufacturing Execution System (MES) implementation and rollout projects. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in Critical Manufacturing MES solutions, manufacturing operations, and customer-facing implementation activities.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;434&quot; data-end=&quot;766&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for working on MES implementation, configuration, modeling, rollout, and support activities across manufacturing environments. The role includes understanding customer requirements, configuring MES solutions, collaborating with global teams, and supporting manufacturing digitalization initiatives.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;768&quot; data-end=&quot;1045&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience in Critical Manufacturing MES implementations, manufacturing process understanding, and direct client interaction. Candidates with certification in Critical Manufacturing Professional / Associate &amp;ndash; Modeler will be highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1047&quot; data-end=&quot;1308&quot;&gt;The role also requires close collaboration with customer teams and internal stakeholders across US and India locations to ensure successful delivery of MES projects. Strong communication, analytical thinking, and teamwork skills are essential for this position.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'INR',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-07-20 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-05-22 01:56:13.000000','2026-05-22 01:56:13.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Client Interaction\", \"Functional Consultant\", \"Manufacturing\", \"Mes\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1324&quot; data-end=&quot;1362&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;19cr3ne&quot; data-start=&quot;1363&quot; data-end=&quot;1417&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise MES implementation projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1zhs5z&quot; data-start=&quot;1418&quot; data-end=&quot;1467&quot;&gt;Work on global manufacturing rollout programs&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;13aq81t&quot; data-start=&quot;1468&quot; data-end=&quot;1515&quot;&gt;Career growth in Manufacturing &amp;amp; MES domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;4uzf8e&quot; data-start=&quot;1516&quot; data-end=&quot;1571&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with international teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;45fk39&quot; data-start=&quot;1572&quot; data-end=&quot;1627&quot;&gt;Professional and technology-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;1628&quot; data-end=&quot;1671&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('64f549f5-1a86-427a-a73b-5bfa4743c39f','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','AVEVA MES Specialist','aveva-mes-specialist-27-27','&lt;p&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Design, develop, and implement AVEVA MES solutions to support manufacturing operations.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Customize MES applications for clients to align with their production workflows and KPIs.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Work on integration of MES with ERP systems (e.g., SAP), PLCs, and SCADA systems.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Troubleshoot and resolve technical issues related to MES applications.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Participate in requirements gathering, functional design, and solution architecture discussions.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Provide support for system upgrades, testing, and documentation.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional teams across IT, operations, and engineering.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Required Skills &amp;amp; Experience:&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Mandatory experience with AVEVA MES (formerly Wonderware MES) &amp;ndash; minimum of 3 years.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of MES modules such as Operations, Quality, Performance, and Inventory.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with AVEVA System Platform, InTouch, and Historian is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Experience with integration protocols (OPC, SQL, XML, REST APIs).&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Exposure to production systems, batch management, and real-time manufacturing data analysis.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Good problem-solving and communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Ability to work independently and in team environments.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Preferred Qualifications:&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Experience with implementation in pharmaceutical, food &amp;amp; beverage, automotive, or discrete manufacturing industries.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Certification in AVEVA MES or related platforms is a strong advantage.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Experience with Industry 4.0 and digital transformation projects.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',500000.00,2500000.00,'₹',0,'India','Pune',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-19 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-05-14 06:21:25.000000','2025-11-21 06:30:07.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"ERP\", \"ERP Systems\", \"Historian\", \"Mes\", \"Mes Industry 4.0\", \"PLC\", \"Problem-Solving Skills\", \"SAP\", \"SCADA\", \"SCADA Systems\", \"AVEVA Intouch HMI\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2397&quot; data-end=&quot;2489&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2399&quot; data-end=&quot;2489&quot;&gt;Work with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2409&quot; data-end=&quot;2441&quot;&gt;global manufacturing leaders&lt;/strong&gt; and participate in cutting-edge MES projects.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2490&quot; data-end=&quot;2568&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2492&quot; data-end=&quot;2568&quot;&gt;Competitive compensation, career advancement, and a collaborative culture.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2569&quot; data-end=&quot;2631&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2571&quot; data-end=&quot;2631&quot;&gt;Exposure to a wide range of industries and AVEVA ecosystems.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Maharashtra'),('65425c3e-bcf3-48d3-b148-886a4e455f42','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Data Modeler','data-modeler-124-124','We are seeking a highly skilled Data Modeler with hands-on experience in Dimensional Data Modeling and strong analytical abilities. The ideal candidate will design and develop conceptual, logical, and physical data models, ensure data consistency and accuracy, and work closely with business teams to transform requirements into optimized data structures. The role involves data profiling, data governance, and source-to-target mapping to support robust data-driven solutions.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;br /&gt;1. Perform data analysis and data profiling to identify business needs.&lt;br /&gt;2. Build conceptual, logical, and physical data models for business systems.&lt;br /&gt;3. Conduct data model walkthroughs with business teams and review boards.&lt;br /&gt;4. Incorporate feedback to improve model accuracy and efficiency.&lt;br /&gt;5. Develop source-to-target mappings aligned with target data models.','Information Technology','Full-time','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2025-12-26 18:30:00',0,0,'2025-10-28 13:50:37.000000','2025-10-28 13:50:37.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Data Management\", \"Data Modeling\", \"Microsoft Azure Platform\", \"NoSQL\", \"RDBMS\"]','[\"1. Opportunity to work with top-tier clients across industries.&lt;br /&gt;2. Flexible PAN India location with remote options.&lt;br /&gt;3. Career growth in advanced data modeling and analytics technologies.\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('655a2e5f-6ecc-4f79-b97c-6dcad2f7ce8e','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Data Analyst','data-analyst-16-16','Job Description: We are seeking an experienced and detail-oriented Data Analyst with 5+ years of hands-on experience to join our team. The ideal candidate will be responsible for analyzing large datasets, generating insights, and creating data visualizations to support business decisions. You will collaborate with cross-functional teams to develop reports, identify trends, and improve data-driven strategies. Key Responsibilities: Collect, clean, and analyze large and complex datasets from multiple sources. Develop and maintain data models, dashboards, and reports using tools like Power BI, Tableau, or Excel. Use SQL to extract, manipulate, and analyze data from relational databases. Perform data validation and quality checks to ensure accuracy and consistency. Identify trends, patterns, and correlations in data to provide actionable insights. Collaborate with stakeholders to define data requirements and develop analytical solutions. Design and implement data visualizations to present complex information clearly. Support ad-hoc data analysis requests from business teams. Automate and streamline data extraction and reporting processes. Ensure data security, privacy, and compliance with organizational standards. Document data sources, processes, and methodologies. Required Skills: 5+ years of experience as a Data Analyst or in a similar role. Strong proficiency in SQL for data extraction and manipulation. Hands-on experience with data visualization tools (Power BI, Tableau, QlikView, or Looker). Proficiency in Excel (pivot tables, VLOOKUP, and advanced formulas). Experience with ETL processes and data cleansing techniques. Strong analytical and problem-solving skills. Familiarity with statistical analysis and data modeling. Ability to interpret complex data sets and provide meaningful insights. Knowledge of data governance and privacy regulations. Excellent communication skills with the ability to present findings effectively.','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',300000.00,600000.00,'₹',1,'India','Mumbai',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2025-07-03 18:30:00',0,0,'2025-05-04 20:52:58.000000','2025-05-04 20:52:58.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Analytical Skill\", \"Big Data\", \"Data Analysis\", \"Data Analyst\", \"ETL\", \"ETL Processes\", \"MS SQL Server\", \"MYSQL\", \"Pivot\", \"Pivot Tables\", \"SQL\", \"VLOOKUP\"]','[\"Competitive salary and performance-based bonuses. Health insurance and paid time off. Flexible work hours and remote/hybrid options. Professional development and training opportunities. Collaborative and growth-oriented work environment.\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Maharashtra'),('6684e0c6-72b0-4995-a4a2-554567065e0d','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','ASP .Net Developer','asp-net-developer-1-1','ASP .Net Developer','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',500000.00,700000.00,'₹',1,'India','Pune',0,1,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-31 06:00:00',0,0,'2025-05-03 17:09:07.000000','2026-05-12 14:49:36.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\".NET\", \"ASP.NET MVC\", \"C#\", \"HTML\", \"MYSQL\"]','[\"ASP .Net Developer\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Maharashtra'),('66a6cc8d-e6c4-4f5c-9e32-642f6b1a31da','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Sales Champion – Cloud and IMS (Infrastructure Management Services)','sales-champion-cloud-and-ims-infrastructure-management-services-111-111','Key Responsibilities: &amp;bull; Develop and execute sales strategies for IMS &amp;amp; Cloud solutions. &amp;bull; Drive complete sales cycles: prospecting &amp;rarr; proposal &amp;rarr; closure. &amp;bull; Acquire new clients and farm existing accounts. &amp;bull; Collaborate with pre-sales and technical teams for solution design. &amp;bull; Build strong relationships with CXOs and IT leaders. Requirements: &amp;bull; 3&amp;ndash;8 years of IT/IMS/Cloud solution sales experience. &amp;bull; Proven record of hunting and closing enterprise-level deals. &amp;bull; Knowledge of IT infra (cloud, networking, data center, security, EUC). &amp;bull; Strong communication, negotiation, and client engagement skills. &amp;bull; Cloud certifications (AWS/Azure/GCP) are an added advantage.','Sales','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',1,'India','Central Delhi',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2025-11-27 18:30:00',0,0,'2025-09-29 07:42:47.000000','2025-09-29 07:42:48.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Account Management\", \"AWS\", \"Azure\", \"Cloud Infrastructure Management\", \"Cloud Management\", \"Cloud Sales\", \"CRM\", \"Google Cloud\", \"Solution Selling®\"]','[\"&amp;bull; Opportunity to shape the future of innovative Microsoft Surface products. &amp;bull; Work in a dynamic, global environment with cross-functional collaboration. &amp;bull; Career growth and development in a leading technology space.\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Delhi'),('66f6c398-78af-49e9-a8ab-b692aec481c7','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','SAP DM Technical Lead','sap-dm-technical-lead-222-222','&lt;strong&gt;&amp;middot; 10+ years of experience in SAP ME and SAP DM(C)&lt;br /&gt;&amp;middot; Should have participated in at least 3-4 end to end implementations&lt;br /&gt;&amp;middot; Should possess knowledge of Discrete and Process industries &lt;br /&gt;&amp;middot; Should have experience in DMC areas like BOM, Routing, Data Collection, Resource Orchestration, Shopfloor Designer, Interface to SAP S/4HANA &lt;br /&gt;&amp;middot; Should have hands-on working knowledge of Production Process Designer&lt;br /&gt;&amp;middot; Should have experience in gathering business requirements, providing conceptual and detailed designs, performing necessary SAP DM configurations, writing detail specifications, testing, production go-live and support &amp;middot; Should have good understanding on SAP DM configuration and POD customization and how to configure and attached the custom developed plugin/pages in SAP DM POD and Fiori apps. &lt;br /&gt;&amp;middot; Should know how to develop custom code in SAP BAS and guide and assist new joiners for development. Should know how to deploy this code in SAP DM.&lt;br /&gt;&amp;middot; Knowledge of SAP S/4HANA integration workflows is required &lt;br /&gt;&amp;middot; Should possess knowledge of shopfloor systems and its integration to SAP Production Connector (SAP PrCo) &amp;middot; Should have knowledge of SQL/PL SQL&lt;/strong&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Entry',NULL,NULL,'INR',1,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-05-25 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-03-26 20:07:06.000000','2026-03-26 20:07:06.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Certified SAP Consultant\", \"SAP\", \"SAP ABAP\", \"SAP BW\", \"SAP PO\", \"SAP PP\", \"SAP S4 HANA\", \"SAP DM\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;Competitive salary package with performance-based incentives&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;65&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;67&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;Health insurance coverage and statutory benefits (PF &amp;amp; Gratuity)&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;134&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;136&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on large-scale enterprise energy management projects&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;211&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;213&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;Strong career growth and learning opportunities&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;263&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;265&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;Collaborative and professional work environment&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('66fc1b85-9504-46ed-a124-2a31c0385aea','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Fleet Engineer – Edge Device & Fleet Management','fleet-engineer-edge-device-fleet-management-375-375','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;85&quot; data-end=&quot;286&quot;&gt;We are looking for experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;116&quot; data-end=&quot;135&quot;&gt;Fleet Engineers&lt;/strong&gt; to join a leading Top MNC and work on large-scale &lt;strong data-start=&quot;186&quot; data-end=&quot;273&quot;&gt;Linux-based Edge Computing, IoT, Edge AI, and containerized device fleet management&lt;/strong&gt; initiatives.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;288&quot; data-end=&quot;512&quot;&gt;The ideal candidate should have strong hands-on experience managing distributed Linux-based edge devices, containerized applications, &lt;strong data-start=&quot;422&quot; data-end=&quot;511&quot;&gt;BalenaCloud, Docker, CI/CD, remote device troubleshooting, networking, and automation&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;514&quot; data-end=&quot;744&quot;&gt;The role involves managing the complete edge-device lifecycle, deploying applications across distributed fleets, executing OTA updates, monitoring device health, troubleshooting remotely, and automating fleet management processes.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;18w7bso&quot; data-start=&quot;746&quot; data-end=&quot;769&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;771&quot; data-end=&quot;1864&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;bopv9c&quot; data-start=&quot;771&quot; data-end=&quot;860&quot;&gt;Provision, configure, and onboard Linux-based edge devices into &lt;strong data-start=&quot;837&quot; data-end=&quot;859&quot;&gt;BalenaCloud fleets&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;16o4mw9&quot; data-start=&quot;861&quot; data-end=&quot;967&quot;&gt;Manage the complete device lifecycle, including registration, updates, maintenance, and decommissioning.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1sxoda9&quot; data-start=&quot;968&quot; data-end=&quot;1054&quot;&gt;Deploy and monitor containerized applications across distributed edge-device fleets.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;cogsl7&quot; data-start=&quot;1055&quot; data-end=&quot;1146&quot;&gt;Manage fleet-wide environment variables, device configurations, and application releases.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;oe6ivk&quot; data-start=&quot;1147&quot; data-end=&quot;1239&quot;&gt;Plan and execute &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1166&quot; data-end=&quot;1214&quot;&gt;OTA (Over-the-Air) software/firmware updates&lt;/strong&gt; with minimal disruption.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;hkuahl&quot; data-start=&quot;1240&quot; data-end=&quot;1317&quot;&gt;Troubleshoot remote edge devices, analyze logs, and diagnose system issues.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Kolkata',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-27 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-08-29 00:38:34.000000','2026-08-29 00:38:35.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"API Integration\", \"Bash\", \"Docker\", \"Github\", \"Gitlab Ci\", \"Jenkins\", \"Linux\", \"Shell\", \"Ubuntu\", \"GitHub Actions\", \"Balena\", \"BalenaCloud\", \"balenaCLI\", \"Docker Compose\", \"Raspberry Pi OS\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1bsoq9k&quot; data-start=&quot;1879&quot; data-end=&quot;1962&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1908&quot; data-end=&quot;1919&quot;&gt;Top MNC&lt;/strong&gt; on large-scale Edge Computing initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1pkw7r8&quot; data-start=&quot;1963&quot; data-end=&quot;2050&quot;&gt;Exposure to &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1977&quot; data-end=&quot;2049&quot;&gt;Edge AI, IoT, Docker, BalenaCloud, and distributed device management&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;ml8y4h&quot; data-start=&quot;2051&quot; data-end=&quot;2115&quot;&gt;Experience managing enterprise-scale Linux edge-device fleets.&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1fgf7hl&quot; data-start=&quot;2116&quot; data-end=&quot;2200&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with modern &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2150&quot; data-end=&quot;2199&quot;&gt;CI/CD, automation, and container technologies&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;i9o62e&quot; data-start=&quot;2201&quot; data-end=&quot;2269&quot;&gt;Exposure to cloud IoT platforms and edge deployment architectures.&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'West Bengal'),('67321c2c-3fad-4fed-b174-06b864f84f00','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Tulip Developer','tulip-developer-108-108','&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an experienced Tulip Developer with 4+ years of expertise in Tulip development and support. The role involves designing and developing Tulip applications, understanding frontline operations, and ensuring seamless process streamlining. You will work closely with cross-functional teams, assist in project status meetings, and provide Tulip software support for product-related issues.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Key responsibilities include coordinating with product teams on roadmaps and innovations, analyzing IoT data for insights, developing data models and dashboards to support IoT initiatives, and managing new feature requests including experimentation, testing, rollouts, and system upgrades. This role requires strong collaboration, problem-solving, and communication skills to drive successful Tulip implementation and support.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',1,'India','Pune',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2025-11-22 18:30:00',0,0,'2025-09-24 08:39:05.000000','2025-09-24 08:39:05.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Data Analysis\", \"Data Models\", \"IOT\", \"Stakeholder Communication\", \"System Validation\"]','[\"Opportunity to work on IoT-driven digital transformation projects&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Exposure to Tulip app design &amp;amp; frontline operations platform&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Career growth in Industry 4.0 and IoT development&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Collaborative work environment with product &amp;amp; service teams\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Maharashtra'),('6737f0c9-3539-4106-a2bd-c4d6eeb4360d','3702dc9f-c9da-4b9e-953f-d33f763e189c','03405083-d488-4f2b-b894-70962cac2b62','Hiring GW Configurator','hiring-gw-configurator-38-38','&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Description for GW Configurator&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;table&gt;\r\n&lt;tbody&gt;\r\n&lt;tr&gt;\r\n&lt;td width=&quot;93&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Job Title:&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/td&gt;\r\n&lt;td width=&quot;503&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;GW Configurator&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/td&gt;\r\n&lt;/tr&gt;\r\n&lt;tr&gt;\r\n&lt;td width=&quot;93&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Primary Skill:&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/td&gt;\r\n&lt;td width=&quot;503&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;P&amp;amp;C Insurance Knowledge, Configuration and customization of GW InsuranceSuite, Willing to learn SQL/PLSQL and GW Database schema and relations.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/td&gt;\r\n&lt;/tr&gt;\r\n&lt;tr&gt;\r\n&lt;td width=&quot;93&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Secondary Skill:&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/td&gt;\r\n&lt;td width=&quot;503&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;SQL/PLSQl&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/td&gt;\r\n&lt;/tr&gt;\r\n&lt;tr&gt;\r\n&lt;td width=&quot;93&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Location:&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/td&gt;\r\n&lt;td width=&quot;503&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Hyderabad&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/td&gt;\r\n&lt;/tr&gt;\r\n&lt;tr&gt;\r\n&lt;td width=&quot;93&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Experience&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/td&gt;\r\n&lt;td width=&quot;503&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;7+ Years&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/td&gt;\r\n&lt;/tr&gt;\r\n&lt;/tbody&gt;\r\n&lt;/table&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;About the job&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a highly skilled Guidewire Configurator to join our insurance technology team. The ideal candidate will be responsible for configuring and customizing the Guidewire InsuranceSuite (PolicyCenter, BillingCenter, or ClaimCenter) to meet business and technical requirements. You will work closely with business analysts, developers, testers, and stakeholders to ensure seamless implementation and support of Guidewire solutions.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Know your team (&ldquo;Legacy Rewired, Engineering the Future&rdquo;)&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;At ValueMomentum&rsquo; s Technology Solution Centre(TSC), we are a team of passionate engineers who thrive on tackling complex business challenges with innovative solutions while transforming the P&amp;amp;C insurance value chain. We achieve this through strong engineering foundation and continuously refining our processes, methodologies, tools, agile delivery teams, and core engineering archetypes. Our core expertise lies in six key areas: Cloud TSC, Application TSC, Data TSC, Core TSC, Quality TSC, and Domain expertise.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Join a team that invests in your growth. Our Infinity Program empowers you to build your career with role-specific skill development leveraging immersive learning platforms. You&#039;ll have the opportunity to showcase your talents by contributing to impactful projects.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Job Responsibilities:&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Configure business rules, user interface (UI), and data model components within Guidewire PolicyCenter, BillingCenter, or ClaimCenter.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with business analysts to understand functional requirements and translate them into technical specifications.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Implement changes using Guidewire&#039;s Gosu programming language where scripting is needed.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Participate in design sessions and provide input on configuration best practices.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Troubleshoot and resolve issues related to Guidewire configuration and integration.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Perform unit testing and support system/integration testing phases.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Ensure configurations follow company standards, performance best practices, and security protocols.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Maintain documentation for all configuration changes and enhancements.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with QA and development teams to deliver high-quality Guidewire solutions&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Stay updated on Guidewire version upgrades and new feature capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Learn SQL/PLSQL and understand entity relationships within the Guidewire schema, including related diagrams, with the goal of transitioning into a Guidewire Data Analyst role within 45 days.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Begin performing responsibilities of a Guidewire Data Analyst within 2 to 3 months.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Requirements:&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Minimum 3+ years of hands-on experience with Guidewire configuration (PolicyCenter, BillingCenter, or ClaimCenter).&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Proficient in Guidewire Studio and configuration of data model, UI, and business rules.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Experience with Gosu scripting language.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Understanding of Agile software development methodologies.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with web services (SOAP/REST), XML, and integration frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and problem-solving skill.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and collaboration skills.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Must Have:&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;GW configuration expertise&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Gosu programming language&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with RESTful web services&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;P&amp;amp;C Insurance Knowledge&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Good to Have&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Agile knowledge&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;GW certifications&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;About the Company:&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.valuemomentum.com/&quot;&gt;ValueMomentum &lt;/a&gt;is amongst the fastest growing insurance-focused IT services providers in North America. Leading insurers trust ValueMomentum with their core, digital and data transformation initiatives. Having grown consistently every year by 24%, we have now grown to over 4000 employees. ValueMomentum is committed to integrity and to ensuring that each team and employee is successful. We foster an open work culture where employees&#039; opinions are valued. We believe in teamwork and cultivate a sense of fun, fellowship, and pride among our employees.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Benefits:&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;We at Value Momentum offer you the opportunity to grow by working alongside the experts. Some of the benefits you can avail are:&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation package comparable to the best in the&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Career Advancement: Individual Career Development, coaching and mentoring programs for professional and leadership skill development.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Comprehensive training and certification&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Performance Management: Goal Setting, continuous feedback and year-end Reward &amp;amp; recognition for the extraordinary performers.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Benefits: Comprehensive health benefits, wellness and fitness Paid time off and holidays.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Culture: A highly transparent organization with an open-door policy and a vibrant culture&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;and a vibrant culture&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',2000000.00,3000000.00,'₹',1,'India','Hyderabad',0,1,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-07-31 06:00:00',0,0,'2025-05-22 07:06:18.000000','2026-05-04 00:15:59.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Database\", \"Microsoft SQL\", \"Guidewire PolicyCenter\", \"Guidewire QA\", \"Guidewire Integration\", \"Guidewire PC\", \"Guidewire Manual Testing\"]','[\"All Benifites as per Company Norms\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Telangana'),('6743fd64-7ab8-477f-b22a-09b086bd716c','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Lead Generation Specialist','lead-generation-specialist-237-237','Key Responsibilities &lt;br /&gt;● Generate qualified leads for custom software, web, and mobile app development services &lt;br /&gt;● Identify and target potential clients across USA, Europe, Australia, and other global markets &lt;br /&gt;● Execute outbound strategies via LinkedIn, email campaigns, cold outreach, and other channels &lt;br /&gt;● Engage with prospects, nurture conversations, and schedule introductory/discovery calls with the internal team &lt;br /&gt;● Build and maintain a consistent pipeline of meeting-ready opportunities &lt;br /&gt;● Research companies, decision-makers, and market trends to identify new opportunities &lt;br /&gt;● Collaborate closely with the sales team for smooth handover of scheduled calls &lt;br /&gt;● Maintain and update lead data and activity in CRM tools &lt;br /&gt;● Continuously optimize outreach and messaging for better response and booking rates Required Skills &amp;amp; Experience','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'INR',1,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-06-02 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-04-03 20:40:05.000000','2026-04-03 20:40:05.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"App Marketing\", \"CRM\", \"Lead Generation\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;Competitive salary package with performance-based incentives&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;65&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;67&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;Health insurance coverage and statutory benefits (PF &amp;amp; Gratuity)&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;134&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;136&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on large-scale enterprise energy management projects&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;211&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;213&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;Strong career growth and learning opportunities&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;263&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;265&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;Collaborative and professional work environment&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('67c65808-bc6d-4860-8be4-39bcd53ca5c7','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','DotNet WPF Developers','dotnet-wpf-developers-2-2','DotNet WPF Developers','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',250000.00,550000.00,'₹',1,'India','Mumbai',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2025-07-02 18:30:00',0,0,'2025-05-04 16:05:43.000000','2025-05-04 16:05:43.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Accounting & Taxation\", \"Aircraft Monitoring\", \"AnyLogic\", \"Architecture\", \"Brownfield\", \"Chemical Compatibility\", \"Diagnostic Systems\"]','[]','No Preference',1,5,'Maharashtra'),('68498421-4bbd-4f9e-8939-868ac762122a','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','MES Integration Developer','mes-integration-developer-142-142','&lt;p data-start=&quot;248&quot; data-end=&quot;606&quot;&gt;A Top MNC is looking for a highly experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;294&quot; data-end=&quot;337&quot;&gt;MES Integration Developer (12&amp;ndash;15 Years)&lt;/strong&gt; to lead end-to-end MES integrations across Pharma manufacturing environments.&lt;br data-start=&quot;415&quot; data-end=&quot;418&quot; /&gt;The role involves designing, developing, customizing, and maintaining integrations between MES platforms and enterprise systems such as ERP, LIMS, SCADA, and shop-floor automation systems.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;608&quot; data-end=&quot;834&quot;&gt;The ideal candidate will have strong experience with MES tools (FTPS, Opcenter, PAS-X, GE Plant Apps), API/OPC UA integrations, scripting, SQL, and deep knowledge of pharma manufacturing processes like Batch Execution and EBR.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;hr data-start=&quot;836&quot; data-end=&quot;839&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h1 data-start=&quot;841&quot; data-end=&quot;868&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;843&quot; data-end=&quot;866&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;869&quot; data-end=&quot;1688&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;869&quot; data-end=&quot;996&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;871&quot; data-end=&quot;996&quot;&gt;Develop, customize &amp;amp; maintain integrations for MES platforms (Rockwell FTPS, Siemens Opcenter, Werum PAS-X, GE Plant Apps).&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;997&quot; data-end=&quot;1089&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;999&quot; data-end=&quot;1089&quot;&gt;Design and implement interfaces with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1036&quot; data-end=&quot;1062&quot;&gt;ERP, LIMS, SCADA, PLCs&lt;/strong&gt;, and middleware systems.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1090&quot; data-end=&quot;1179&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1092&quot; data-end=&quot;1179&quot;&gt;Develop workflows, recipes, and integration logic for pharma manufacturing workflows.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1180&quot; data-end=&quot;1272&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1182&quot; data-end=&quot;1272&quot;&gt;Build SQL queries, stored procedures &amp;amp; data transformation logic for integration layers.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1273&quot; data-end=&quot;1350&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1275&quot; data-end=&quot;1350&quot;&gt;Implement REST APIs, OPC UA communication, and event-driven integrations.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1351&quot; data-end=&quot;1447&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1353&quot; data-end=&quot;1447&quot;&gt;Collaborate with MES functional, IT, QA, and automation teams to ensure seamless operations.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1448&quot; data-end=&quot;1543&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1450&quot; data-end=&quot;1543&quot;&gt;Support interface validations, testing, documentation, and compliance activities (GMP/GxP).&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1544&quot; data-end=&quot;1625&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1546&quot; data-end=&quot;1625&quot;&gt;Troubleshoot integration issues and optimize performance across environments.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1626&quot; data-end=&quot;1688&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1628&quot; data-end=&quot;1688&quot;&gt;Contribute to Pharma 4.0 digital transformation initiatives.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Full-time','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-20 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-11-22 03:58:12.000000','2025-11-22 03:58:12.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"CSV\", \"ERP\", \"JavaScript\", \"Lims\", \"Mes\", \"Mes Gxp Compliance\", \"MES Integration\", \"Opcenter\", \"Pharma Industry\", \"Python\", \"SCADA\", \"SDLC\", \"Werum PAS-X\", \"OPC UA\", \"GMP\", \"Rockwell FTPS\", \"GE Plant Apps\", \"EBR\"]','[\"&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2782&quot; data-end=&quot;3232&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2782&quot; data-end=&quot;2869&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2784&quot; data-end=&quot;2869&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2811&quot; data-end=&quot;2829&quot;&gt;top global MNC&lt;/strong&gt; in Pharma &amp;amp; Industrial Digitalization&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2870&quot; data-end=&quot;2938&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2872&quot; data-end=&quot;2938&quot;&gt;Exposure to &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2884&quot; data-end=&quot;2936&quot;&gt;advanced MES platforms &amp;amp; enterprise integrations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2939&quot; data-end=&quot;3001&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2941&quot; data-end=&quot;3001&quot;&gt;Chance to lead high-impact digital transformation projects&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;3002&quot; data-end=&quot;3065&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;3004&quot; data-end=&quot;3065&quot;&gt;Excellent career growth in Pharma 4.0 &amp;amp; Smart Manufacturing&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;3066&quot; data-end=&quot;3120&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;3068&quot; data-end=&quot;3120&quot;&gt;Learning, certification &amp;amp; upskilling opportunities&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;3121&quot; data-end=&quot;3171&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;3123&quot; data-end=&quot;3171&quot;&gt;Competitive salary with performance incentives&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;3172&quot; data-end=&quot;3232&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;3174&quot; data-end=&quot;3232&quot;&gt;Collaborative work culture with global engineering teams&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('68d915d7-a72c-4b56-91d8-ed5a832e9323','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','MES Techno-Functional Consultant','mes-techno-functional-consultant-140-140','&lt;p data-start=&quot;218&quot; data-end=&quot;650&quot;&gt;A Top MNC is seeking an experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;254&quot; data-end=&quot;290&quot;&gt;MES Techno-Functional Consultant&lt;/strong&gt; to support end-to-end implementation, configuration, and integration of Manufacturing Execution Systems (MES) within regulated Pharma/Life Sciences environments.&lt;br data-start=&quot;452&quot; data-end=&quot;455&quot; /&gt;The role involves working closely with business stakeholders, mapping manufacturing processes, customizing MES workflows, and integrating MES with enterprise systems such as ERP, LIMS, and SCADA.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;652&quot; data-end=&quot;827&quot;&gt;The ideal candidate should have strong domain knowledge in pharma manufacturing processes along with hands-on technical experience in MES configuration and system integration.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;hr data-start=&quot;829&quot; data-end=&quot;832&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h1 data-start=&quot;834&quot; data-end=&quot;859&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;836&quot; data-end=&quot;859&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;860&quot; data-end=&quot;1641&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;860&quot; data-end=&quot;979&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;862&quot; data-end=&quot;979&quot;&gt;Configure and customize MES platforms such as &lt;strong data-start=&quot;908&quot; data-end=&quot;971&quot;&gt;Rockwell FTPS, Siemens Opcenter, Werum PAS-X, GE Plant Apps&lt;/strong&gt;, etc.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;980&quot; data-end=&quot;1101&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;982&quot; data-end=&quot;1101&quot;&gt;Perform &lt;strong data-start=&quot;990&quot; data-end=&quot;1020&quot;&gt;functional process mapping&lt;/strong&gt; for pharma workflows (batch execution, weigh &amp;amp; dispense, material management).&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1102&quot; data-end=&quot;1216&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1104&quot; data-end=&quot;1216&quot;&gt;Integrate MES with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1123&quot; data-end=&quot;1149&quot;&gt;ERP, LIMS, SCADA, PLCs&lt;/strong&gt;, and middleware systems using APIs, OPC UA, and other protocols.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1217&quot; data-end=&quot;1332&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1219&quot; data-end=&quot;1332&quot;&gt;Translate business requirements into MES recipes, workflows, master batch records (MBRs), and functional specs.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1333&quot; data-end=&quot;1404&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1335&quot; data-end=&quot;1404&quot;&gt;Support validation activities including &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1375&quot; data-end=&quot;1401&quot;&gt;IQ/OQ/PQ documentation&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1405&quot; data-end=&quot;1490&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1407&quot; data-end=&quot;1490&quot;&gt;Work with cross-functional teams including QA, Manufacturing, IT, and Automation.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1491&quot; data-end=&quot;1569&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1493&quot; data-end=&quot;1569&quot;&gt;Provide technical troubleshooting, enhancements, and post-go-live support.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1570&quot; data-end=&quot;1641&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1572&quot; data-end=&quot;1641&quot;&gt;Ensure compliance with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1595&quot; data-end=&quot;1607&quot;&gt;GMP, GxP&lt;/strong&gt;, and pharma regulatory standards.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Full-time','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-20 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-11-22 03:39:18.000000','2025-11-22 03:39:18.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"ERP\", \"Gxp Compliance\", \"Lims\", \"Mes\", \"OQ\", \"PLC\", \"PQ\", \"SCADA\", \"Siemens Opcenter\", \"Werum PAS-X\", \"OPC UA\", \"GMP\", \"Rockwell FTPS\", \"GE Plant Apps\", \"MES Recipes\", \"MBRs\"]','[\"&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2870&quot; data-end=&quot;3341&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2870&quot; data-end=&quot;2952&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2872&quot; data-end=&quot;2952&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2899&quot; data-end=&quot;2921&quot;&gt;leading global MNC&lt;/strong&gt; in Pharma/Manufacturing Tech&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2953&quot; data-end=&quot;3030&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2955&quot; data-end=&quot;3030&quot;&gt;Work on &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2963&quot; data-end=&quot;3028&quot;&gt;cutting-edge MES &amp;amp; Pharma 4.0 digital transformation projects&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;3031&quot; data-end=&quot;3095&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;3033&quot; data-end=&quot;3095&quot;&gt;Exposure to advanced MES platforms &amp;amp; enterprise integrations&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;3096&quot; data-end=&quot;3144&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;3098&quot; data-end=&quot;3144&quot;&gt;Collaborative work culture with global teams&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;3145&quot; data-end=&quot;3198&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;3147&quot; data-end=&quot;3198&quot;&gt;Continuous learning &amp;amp; certification opportunities&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;3199&quot; data-end=&quot;3263&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;3201&quot; data-end=&quot;3263&quot;&gt;Competitive salary, performance bonuses &amp;amp; career progression&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;3264&quot; data-end=&quot;3341&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;3266&quot; data-end=&quot;3341&quot;&gt;Work on high-impact systems improving quality, compliance, and efficiency&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('690fd38e-2b0f-43a7-9c3b-8c59718aeb48','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Werum PAS-X MES MBR Designer','werum-pas-x-mes-mbr-designer-270-270','&lt;p data-start=&quot;70&quot; data-end=&quot;395&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced Werum PAS-X MES MBR Designers for a leading Top MNC to work on pharmaceutical MES and digital manufacturing projects. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in Werum PAS-X MES, Master Batch Record (MBR) design, validation processes, and regulated pharmaceutical manufacturing environments.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;397&quot; data-end=&quot;760&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for designing, configuring, validating, and supporting electronic Master Batch Records (MBRs/GMBRs/PMBRs) within the Werum PAS-X MES platform. The role involves collaborating with QA, Process Engineering, Automation, and Manufacturing teams to ensure compliance with pharmaceutical industry standards and regulatory requirements.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;762&quot; data-end=&quot;1046&quot;&gt;Professionals should have experience in MES integration with SAP ERP systems, L2/L3 automation systems, serialization platforms, and pharmaceutical manufacturing processes. Strong knowledge of GMP, GAMP 5, CFR Part 11, data integrity, and validation methodologies is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1048&quot; data-end=&quot;1420&quot;&gt;The role also includes troubleshooting MES and MBR-related issues, supporting MES implementation activities, and contributing to process standardization and harmonization initiatives across manufacturing sites. Candidates should possess excellent analytical, communication, and documentation skills with the ability to work in highly regulated pharmaceutical environments.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Mumbai',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-07-10 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-05-12 03:12:36.000000','2026-05-12 03:12:36.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"GAMP5\", \"Mes Troubleshooting\", \"Regulatory Compliance\", \"Werum PAS-X\", \"GMP\", \"21 CFR Part 11\", \"MBRs\", \"Pharmaceutical Manufacturing Processes\", \"GMBR\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1436&quot; data-end=&quot;1474&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1r7u6nf&quot; data-start=&quot;1475&quot; data-end=&quot;1544&quot;&gt;Exposure to pharmaceutical MES and digital manufacturing projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;9avew8&quot; data-start=&quot;1545&quot; data-end=&quot;1601&quot;&gt;Work on enterprise-level Werum PAS-X implementations&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1klavax&quot; data-start=&quot;1602&quot; data-end=&quot;1653&quot;&gt;Career growth in Pharma MES &amp;amp; Automation domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;3uidrc&quot; data-start=&quot;1654&quot; data-end=&quot;1717&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global pharmaceutical teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;2lee9a&quot; data-start=&quot;1718&quot; data-end=&quot;1773&quot;&gt;Professional and compliance-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;1774&quot; data-end=&quot;1817&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Maharashtra'),('695b86fa-672a-45e8-a815-733600a27508','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Data Engineer – Python & Power Automate','data-engineer-python-power-automate-181-181','&lt;p data-start=&quot;240&quot; data-end=&quot;560&quot;&gt;We are looking for a skilled &lt;strong data-start=&quot;269&quot; data-end=&quot;286&quot;&gt;Data Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; with strong expertise in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;312&quot; data-end=&quot;347&quot;&gt;Python, SQL, and Power Automate&lt;/strong&gt; to design, build, and optimize data pipelines and automation solutions. The role involves working with modern cloud and DevOps tools to deliver scalable, efficient data processing and workflow automation systems.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;hr data-start=&quot;562&quot; data-end=&quot;565&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;567&quot; data-end=&quot;594&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;570&quot; data-end=&quot;594&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;595&quot; data-end=&quot;1264&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;595&quot; data-end=&quot;665&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;597&quot; data-end=&quot;665&quot;&gt;Design, develop, and maintain &lt;strong data-start=&quot;627&quot; data-end=&quot;663&quot;&gt;data pipelines and ETL processes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;666&quot; data-end=&quot;754&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;668&quot; data-end=&quot;754&quot;&gt;Write and optimize &lt;strong data-start=&quot;687&quot; data-end=&quot;702&quot;&gt;SQL queries&lt;/strong&gt; for data extraction, transformation, and analysis&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;755&quot; data-end=&quot;834&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;757&quot; data-end=&quot;834&quot;&gt;Develop data processing solutions using &lt;strong data-start=&quot;797&quot; data-end=&quot;832&quot;&gt;Python libraries and frameworks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;835&quot; data-end=&quot;905&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;837&quot; data-end=&quot;905&quot;&gt;Implement and manage &lt;strong data-start=&quot;858&quot; data-end=&quot;903&quot;&gt;automation workflows using Power Automate&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;906&quot; data-end=&quot;973&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;908&quot; data-end=&quot;973&quot;&gt;Use &lt;strong data-start=&quot;912&quot; data-end=&quot;941&quot;&gt;GitHub and GitHub Actions&lt;/strong&gt; for version control and CI/CD&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;974&quot; data-end=&quot;1048&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;976&quot; data-end=&quot;1048&quot;&gt;Provision and manage cloud infrastructure using &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1024&quot; data-end=&quot;1046&quot;&gt;AWS CDK, Terraform&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1049&quot; data-end=&quot;1107&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1051&quot; data-end=&quot;1107&quot;&gt;Optimize database design, performance, and scalability&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1108&quot; data-end=&quot;1198&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1110&quot; data-end=&quot;1198&quot;&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional teams to understand data and automation requirements&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1199&quot; data-end=&quot;1264&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1201&quot; data-end=&quot;1264&quot;&gt;Ensure data quality, security, and best engineering practices&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-03-23 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-01-22 22:21:42.000000','2026-01-22 22:21:43.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Code (IaC) Tools\", \"Github\", \"Python\", \"SQL\", \"TerraForm\", \"CI/CD\", \"Power Automate\", \"AWS CDK\", \"Data Engineer\", \"GitHub Actions\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1310&quot; data-end=&quot;1382&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1312&quot; data-end=&quot;1382&quot;&gt;Strong proficiency in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1334&quot; data-end=&quot;1344&quot;&gt;Python&lt;/strong&gt; for data engineering and processing&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1383&quot; data-end=&quot;1452&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1385&quot; data-end=&quot;1452&quot;&gt;Advanced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1394&quot; data-end=&quot;1401&quot;&gt;SQL&lt;/strong&gt; skills (querying, optimization, database design)&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1453&quot; data-end=&quot;1491&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1455&quot; data-end=&quot;1491&quot;&gt;Experience with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1471&quot; data-end=&quot;1489&quot;&gt;Power Automate&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1492&quot; data-end=&quot;1540&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1494&quot; data-end=&quot;1540&quot;&gt;Expertise with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1509&quot; data-end=&quot;1538&quot;&gt;GitHub and GitHub Actions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1541&quot; data-end=&quot;1612&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1543&quot; data-end=&quot;1612&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1568&quot; data-end=&quot;1612&quot;&gt;AWS CDK, Terraform, or similar IaC tools&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('6a7015b5-3ee9-49d8-840d-b5c731136715','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','MES Scrum Master','mes-scrum-master-308-308','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;58&quot; data-end=&quot;396&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced MES Scrum Masters for a leading Top MNC to drive Agile delivery and digital manufacturing transformation programs. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in Scrum methodologies, Manufacturing Execution Systems (MES), stakeholder management, and Agile project delivery within manufacturing environments.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;398&quot; data-end=&quot;770&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for leading Agile teams, facilitating Scrum ceremonies, and ensuring successful delivery of MES implementation and enhancement projects. The role includes coaching teams on Agile best practices, removing delivery impediments, managing stakeholder expectations, and driving continuous improvement initiatives across manufacturing programs.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;772&quot; data-end=&quot;1116&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience in Manufacturing Execution Systems, Agile/Scrum frameworks, sprint planning, backlog management, governance processes, and service delivery management. Experience with Siemens Opcenter Core (Camstar), end-to-end MES implementations, and manufacturing transformation initiatives is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1118&quot; data-end=&quot;1473&quot;&gt;The role also involves monitoring Agile metrics, managing customer relationships, ensuring SLA compliance, facilitating governance reviews, coordinating cross-functional teams, and supporting Product Owners in backlog prioritization. Candidates should possess strong leadership, communication, conflict resolution, negotiation, and problem-solving skills.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-08-23 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-06-25 02:54:10.000000','2026-06-25 02:54:10.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Agile Methodology\", \"KPI MONITORING\", \"Mes\", \"Siemens Opcenter\", \"SLA Management\", \"Stakeholder Management\", \"Scrum Master\", \"Change Control Management\", \"Scrum Framework\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1489&quot; data-end=&quot;1527&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;rhfow6&quot; data-start=&quot;1528&quot; data-end=&quot;1606&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale MES and Manufacturing Transformation programs&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;x4z2au&quot; data-start=&quot;1607&quot; data-end=&quot;1682&quot;&gt;Leadership role in Agile delivery and digital manufacturing initiatives&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;13qji02&quot; data-start=&quot;1683&quot; data-end=&quot;1760&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global manufacturing and technology teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1lbrefl&quot; data-start=&quot;1761&quot; data-end=&quot;1835&quot;&gt;Career growth in Agile Delivery, MES &amp;amp; Manufacturing Technology domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot; data-start=&quot;1836&quot; data-end=&quot;1891&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;1892&quot; data-end=&quot;1935&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('6a9ee359-519e-45f3-9748-902f67b11217','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Data Analyst','data-analyst-241-241','What you&amp;rsquo;ll be doing:&lt;br /&gt;Working with raw data and transforming it into actionable insights&lt;br /&gt;Writing efficient SQL queries for data extraction and analysis&lt;br /&gt;Creating dashboards and reports for internal teams&lt;br /&gt;Identifying trends, patterns, and anomalies in datasets&lt;br /&gt;Collaborating with business and tech teams to improve decision-making&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;What we&amp;rsquo;re looking for:&lt;br /&gt;0&amp;ndash;2 years of experience (freshers with strong skills can apply)&lt;br /&gt;Good knowledge of SQL, Excel, and data analysis concepts&lt;br /&gt;Basic understanding of tools like Power BI, Tableau, or similar&lt;br /&gt;Strong analytical thinking and problem-solving mindset','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'INR',1,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-06-02 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-04-03 20:55:33.000000','2026-04-03 20:55:33.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Azure SQL Database\", \"Data Analyst\", \"Data Analytics\", \"Data Center Automation\", \"Data Collection\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;Competitive salary package with performance-based incentives&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;65&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;67&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;Health insurance coverage and statutory benefits (PF &amp;amp; Gratuity)&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;134&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;136&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&