ata-end=&quot;860&quot;&gt;Provide subject matter expertise on &lt;strong data-start=&quot;793&quot; data-end=&quot;858&quot;&gt;MedTech regulations, digital health, and compliance standards&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;861&quot; data-end=&quot;962&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;863&quot; data-end=&quot;962&quot;&gt;Assess business processes, application usage, and system alignment with MedTech operational needs&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;963&quot; data-end=&quot;1083&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;965&quot; data-end=&quot;1083&quot;&gt;Perform &lt;strong data-start=&quot;973&quot; data-end=&quot;1020&quot;&gt;Application Portfolio Rationalization (APR)&lt;/strong&gt; assessments across clinical, quality, and regulatory systems&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1084&quot; data-end=&quot;1168&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1086&quot; data-end=&quot;1168&quot;&gt;Advise on modernization, consolidation, and digital transformation opportunities&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1169&quot; data-end=&quot;1295&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1171&quot; data-end=&quot;1295&quot;&gt;Evaluate compliance readiness including &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1211&quot; data-end=&quot;1234&quot;&gt;21 CFR Part 11, GxP&lt;/strong&gt;, and define &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1247&quot; data-end=&quot;1293&quot;&gt;risk-based validation strategies (CSV/CSA)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1296&quot; data-end=&quot;1412&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1298&quot; data-end=&quot;1412&quot;&gt;Collaborate with IT, business, and compliance teams to ensure recommendations meet regulatory and business goals&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1413&quot; data-end=&quot;1501&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1415&quot; data-end=&quot;1501&quot;&gt;Develop assessment documentation, cost-benefit analysis, and transformation roadmaps&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1502&quot; data-end=&quot;1565&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1504&quot; data-end=&quot;1565&quot;&gt;Present findings and recommendations to senior stakeholders&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Pune',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-03-17 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-01-16 18:28:25.000000','2026-01-16 18:28:25.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"CSV\", \"ERP\", \"Mes\", \"PLM Software (Product Lifecycle Management)\", \"QMS System\", \"21 CFR Part 11\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2729&quot; data-end=&quot;2812&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2731&quot; data-end=&quot;2812&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2754&quot; data-end=&quot;2810&quot;&gt;strategic APR and digital transformation initiatives&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2813&quot; data-end=&quot;2884&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2815&quot; data-end=&quot;2884&quot;&gt;Exposure to &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2827&quot; data-end=&quot;2882&quot;&gt;global MedTech regulatory and compliance landscapes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2885&quot; data-end=&quot;2941&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2887&quot; data-end=&quot;2941&quot;&gt;High-impact consulting role with senior stakeholders&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2942&quot; data-end=&quot;3004&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2944&quot; data-end=&quot;3004&quot;&gt;Long-term engagement within a specialized MedTech practice&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;3005&quot; data-end=&quot;3057&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;3007&quot; data-end=&quot;3057&quot;&gt;Collaborative, cross-functional work environment&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Maharashtra'),('6add59b2-0c0c-43ca-b4b4-bab4b2a16834','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Senior Android Developer (Xamarin / .NET MAUI)','senior-android-developer-xamarin-net-maui-154-154','&lt;p data-start=&quot;182&quot; data-end=&quot;617&quot;&gt;We are looking for a highly skilled &lt;strong data-start=&quot;218&quot; data-end=&quot;246&quot;&gt;Senior Android Developer&lt;/strong&gt; with strong expertise in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;272&quot; data-end=&quot;297&quot;&gt;Xamarin and .NET MAUI&lt;/strong&gt; to join our team. The ideal candidate will be responsible for designing, developing, enhancing, and maintaining high-quality mobile applications. You will work on migrating existing Xamarin Android applications to .NET MAUI, ensuring smooth performance, scalability, and reliability across devices and Android versions.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;619&quot; data-end=&quot;917&quot;&gt;The role requires strong experience in C#, API integration, PostgreSQL, and mobile architectural patterns. You will also support troubleshooting, debugging, and resolving issues in a timely manner. Experience in web technologies, Python, and manufacturing domain systems will be an added advantage.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;hr data-start=&quot;919&quot; data-end=&quot;922&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h1 data-start=&quot;924&quot; data-end=&quot;952&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;928&quot; data-end=&quot;952&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;953&quot; data-end=&quot;1770&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;953&quot; data-end=&quot;1033&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;955&quot; data-end=&quot;1033&quot;&gt;Develop and enhance mobile applications using &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1001&quot; data-end=&quot;1012&quot;&gt;Xamarin&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1017&quot; data-end=&quot;1030&quot;&gt;.NET MAUI&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1034&quot; data-end=&quot;1122&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1036&quot; data-end=&quot;1122&quot;&gt;Understand, analyze, and work on existing Xamarin applications for new enhancements.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1123&quot; data-end=&quot;1191&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1125&quot; data-end=&quot;1191&quot;&gt;Lead migration of current Xamarin Android apps to &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1175&quot; data-end=&quot;1188&quot;&gt;.NET MAUI&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1192&quot; data-end=&quot;1260&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1194&quot; data-end=&quot;1260&quot;&gt;Implement clean, scalable, and maintainable mobile architecture.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1261&quot; data-end=&quot;1375&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1263&quot; data-end=&quot;1375&quot;&gt;Perform &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1271&quot; data-end=&quot;1287&quot;&gt;unit testing&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1289&quot; data-end=&quot;1312&quot;&gt;integration testing&lt;/strong&gt;, and ensure application reliability across Android versions.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1376&quot; data-end=&quot;1477&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1378&quot; data-end=&quot;1477&quot;&gt;Build and deliver deployable packages to the &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1423&quot; data-end=&quot;1444&quot;&gt;Google Play Store&lt;/strong&gt; or other deployment platforms.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1478&quot; data-end=&quot;1552&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1480&quot; data-end=&quot;1552&quot;&gt;Troubleshoot and resolve application issues within expected timelines.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1553&quot; data-end=&quot;1608&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1555&quot; data-end=&quot;1608&quot;&gt;Develop responsive and user-friendly UI components.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1609&quot; data-end=&quot;1681&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1611&quot; data-end=&quot;1681&q