ases&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong data-start=&quot;606&quot; data-end=&quot;625&quot;&gt;Azure Data Lake&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;629&quot; data-end=&quot;747&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;631&quot; data-end=&quot;747&quot;&gt;Collaborate with Product Owners and Solution Architects to deliver high-quality solutions in an Agile environment.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;748&quot; data-end=&quot;824&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;750&quot; data-end=&quot;824&quot;&gt;Lead and mentor a team of Data Engineers to deliver exceptional results.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;825&quot; data-end=&quot;897&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;827&quot; data-end=&quot;897&quot;&gt;Execute Proof of Concepts (PoCs) and ensure timely project delivery.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',700000.00,2000000.00,'₹',0,'India','Hyderabad',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-19 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-07-01 11:42:10.000000','2025-11-21 04:56:28.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Agile Methodology\", \"Cloud\", \"DevOps\", \"SQL\", \"Pyspark\", \"Azure Databricks\", \"Azure Data Lake Storage\", \"Big Data technologies\", \"Delta Lake\"]','[\"&lt;ul data-start=&quot;924&quot; data-end=&quot;1221&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;924&quot; data-end=&quot;961&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;926&quot; data-end=&quot;961&quot;&gt;Competitive compensation package.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;962&quot; data-end=&quot;1048&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;964&quot; data-end=&quot;1048&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with the latest technologies in Big Data and Azure ecosystems.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1049&quot; data-end=&quot;1119&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1051&quot; data-end=&quot;1119&quot;&gt;Professional growth with training and certification opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;