eading Top MNC to work on enterprise-scale MES and Manufacturing Digital Transformation projects. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in DELMIA Apriso/FlexNet, MES implementations, manufacturing operations, and large-scale upgrade programs.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;378&quot; data-end=&quot;721&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for designing, developing, upgrading, and supporting Apriso MES solutions across global manufacturing environments. The role includes executing Apriso version upgrade projects, developing customized MES applications, implementing integrations, and providing technical leadership throughout project lifecycles.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;723&quot; data-end=&quot;1043&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with Apriso Process Builder, Screen Framework, AJAX, HTML, JavaScript, .NET, CSS, SQL Server, and T-SQL development. Strong knowledge of machine integration, ERP integration, OPC connectivity, deployment management, and manufacturing execution processes is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1045&quot; data-end=&quot;1407&quot;&gt;The role also involves leading development teams, resolving complex technical challenges, supporting HyperCare activities, managing release deployments through GPM, and collaborating directly with customers and stakeholders to ensure successful project delivery. Candidates should possess strong leadership, communication, analytical, and problem-solving skills.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Pune',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-08-23 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-06-25 02:42:32.000000','2026-06-25 02:42:32.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\".NET Development\", \"AJAX\", \"Apriso\", \"CSS\", \"Delmia Apriso\", \"FlexSim\", \"HTML\", \"JavaScript\", \"Mes Deployment\", \"MYSQL\", \"Transact-SQL\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1423&quot; data-end=&quot;1461&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1tv5fk7&quot; data-start=&quot;1462&quot; data-end=&quot;1540&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale MES and Manufacturing Transformation projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;dh0rgw&quot; data-start=&quot;1541&quot; data-end=&quot;1609&quot;&gt;Work on advanced DELMIA Apriso and Smart Manufacturing solutions&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1kmt4tx&quot; data-start=&quot;1610&quot; data-end=&quot;1672&quot;&gt;Career growth in MES &amp;amp; Manufacturing Digitalization domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;8vszhn&quot; data-start=&quot;1673&quot; data-end=&quot;1737&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global manufacturing clients&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1x0zm8v&quot; data-start=&quot;1738&quot; data-end=&quot;1797&quot;&gt;Leadership opportunities in technical solution delivery&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot; data-start=&quot;1798&quot; data-end=&quot;1853&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;1854&quot; data-end=&quot;1897&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Maharashtra'),('6d99701b-9370-4524-acd0-c154fca9b436','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','PHP Developer','php-developer-20-20','&lt;h2&gt;PHP Developer&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',250000.00,500000.00,'₹',1,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2025-07-03 18:30:00',0,0,'2025-05-05 02:57:09.000000','2025-05-05 02:57:10.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Advanced JavaScript\", \"CSS\", \"CSS3\", \"HTML\", \"HTML5\", \"JavaScript\", \"Laravel\", \"Laravel Framework\", \"PHP\", \"PHP Development\"]','[]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('6e69ae43-0d81-48d2-bf17-1158fd91d5ce','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','AVEVA MES Specialist','aveva-mes-specialist-27-27','&lt;p&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Design, develop, and implement AVEVA MES solutions to support manufacturing operations.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Customize MES applications for clients to align with their production workflows and KPIs.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Work on integration of MES with ERP systems (e.g., SAP), PLCs, and SCADA systems.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Troubleshoot and resolve technical issues related to MES applications.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Participate in requirements gathering, functional design, and solution architecture discussions.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Provide support for system upgrades, testing, and documentation.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional teams across IT, operations, and engineering.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Required Skills &amp;amp; Experience:&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Mandatory experience with AVEVA MES (formerly Wonderware MES) &amp;ndash; minimum of 3 years.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of MES modules such as Operations, Quality, Performance, and Inventory.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with AVEVA System Platform, InTouch, and Historian is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Experience with integration protocols (OPC, SQL, XML, REST APIs).&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Exposure to production systems, batch management, and real-time manufacturing data analysis.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Good problem-solving and communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Ability to work independently and in team environments.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Preferred Qualifications:&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Experience with implementation in pharmaceutical, food &amp;amp; beverage, automotive, or discrete manufacturing industries.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Certification in AVEVA MES or related platforms is a strong advantage.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Experience with Industry 4.0 and digital transformation projects.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',500000.00,2500000.00,'₹',0,'India','Pune',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-19 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-05-14 06:21:25.000000','2025-11-21 06:30:07.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"ERP\", \"ERP Systems\", \"Historian\", \"Mes\", \"Mes Industry 4.0\", \"PLC\", \"Problem-Solving Skills\", \"SAP\", \"SCADA\", \"SCADA Systems\", \"AVEVA Intouch HMI\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2397&quot; data-end=&quot;2489&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2399&quot; data-end=&quot;2489&quot;&gt;Work with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2409&quot; data-end=&quot;2441&quot;&gt;global manufacturing leaders&lt;/strong&gt; and participate in cutting-edge MES projects.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2490&quot; data-end=&quot;2568&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2492&quot; data-end=&quot;2568&quot;&gt;Competitive compensation, career advancement, and a collaborative culture.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2569&quot; data-end=&quot;2631&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2571&quot; data-end=&quot;2631&quot;&gt;Exposure to a wide range of industries and AVEVA ecosystems.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Maharashtra'),('6ee4851f-254d-4c43-99c5-8ba41a891cee','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Senior AWS Architect','senior-aws-architect-45-45','&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;473&quot; data-end=&quot;491&quot;&gt;Job Overview&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;492&quot; data-end=&quot;915&quot;&gt;We are looking for an experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;526&quot; data-end=&quot;543&quot;&gt;AWS Architect&lt;/strong&gt; to lead the architectural design and implementation of a large-scale digital transformation project. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in AWS solutions, microservices architecture, and full-stack .NET development. This role is pivotal in ensuring scalable, secure, and cost-efficient cloud-native application delivery using Domain Driven Design principles.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;917&quot; data-end=&quot;943&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;944&quot; data-end=&quot;1839&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;944&quot; data-end=&quot;1047&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;946&quot; data-end=&quot;1047&quot;&gt;End-to-end responsibility for architecture, design, and deployment of the Next Gen MITS application&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1048&quot; data-end=&quot;1178&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1050&quot; data-end=&quot;1178&quot;&gt;Lead cloud-native solution architecture using AWS services including Lambda, Fargate, and other compute/integration components&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1179&quot; data-end=&quot;1341&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1181&quot; data-end=&quot;1341&quot;&gt;Design and implement Domain-Driven Micro, Macro, and Nano services for critical application modules such as Production, Invoicing, Transportation, and Finance&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1342&quot; data-end=&quot;1456&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1344&quot; data-end=&quot;1456&quot;&gt;Drive architectural improvements, cost optimization, cloud security, observability, and automation initiatives&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1457&quot; data-end=&quot;1567&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1459&quot; data-end=&quot;1567&quot;&gt;Support technical teams in agile delivery, ensuring adherence to design patterns and reusable architecture&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1568&quot; data-end=&quot;1726&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1570&quot; data-end=&quot;1726&quot;&gt;Collaborate across squads for integration with systems such as Oracle, file stores, camera systems, and L2 systems from a data/API engineering perspective&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1727&quot; data-end=&quot;1839&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1729&quot; data-end=&quot;1839&quot;&gt;Maintain architecture lifecycle documentation, checklists, and reviews, ideally aligned with TOGAF practices&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;1841&quot; data-end=&quot;1863&quot;&gt;Must-Have Skills&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1864&quot; data-end=&quot;2212&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1864&quot; data-end=&quot;1910&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1866&quot; data-end=&quot;1910&quot;&gt;AWS Solution Architecture (E3 proficiency)&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1911&quot; data-end=&quot;1958&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1913&quot; data-end=&quot;1958&quot;&gt;Microservices architecture (E2 proficiency)&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1959&quot; data-end=&quot;2011&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1961&quot; data-end=&quot;2011&quot;&gt;.NET, C# full-stack development (E2 proficiency)&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2012&quot; data-end=&quot;2050&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2014&quot; data-end=&quot;2050&quot;&gt;Agile methodology (E1 proficiency)&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2051&quot; data-end=&quot;2131&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2053&quot; data-end=&quot;2131&quot;&gt;Hands-on with AWS services like Lambda, Fargate, CloudWatch, S3, API Gateway&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2132&quot; data-end=&quot;2212&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2134&quot; data-end=&quot;2212&quot;&gt;Strong understanding of Domain Driven Design and cloud-native best practices&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;2214&quot; data-end=&quot;2239&quot;&gt;Good-to-Have Skills&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&qu