p;bull; HTML5 / CSS3 / JavaScript&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;bull; Angular 14+ / TypeScript / Javascript (ES5/ES6)&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;bull; Experience with reactive frameworks like NgRx / RxJS&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;bull; NodeJS 18+&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;bull; Google Material design &amp;amp; Angular Material libs&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;bull; Experience working with CI/CD tools like GitLab SCM &amp;amp; pipelines and JFrog Artifactory&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;bull; Proficient in working with DevOps engineers on Cloud deployments (eg. Azure subscriptions)&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;bull; Experience in Agile/Scrum &amp;amp; (pref.) SAFe (Scaled Agile Framework) and enabling tooling &amp;ndash; Atlassian Jira Cloud / Jira Align&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;bull; Strong skills and experience in design and development of secure and high-performance applications&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;bull; Experience with software quality &amp;amp; vulnerability testing &amp;ndash; SonarQube and Blackduck&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;bull; Proficient in writing software documentation on Atlassian Wiki&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Entry',NULL,NULL,'INR',1,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-04-18 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-02-17 19:51:01.000000','2026-02-17 19:51:01.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Advanced JavaScript\", \"AWS\", \"Azure\", \"CSS\", \"HTML5\", \"JavaScript\", \"JIRA\", \"Typescript\", \"SonarQube\", \"Generative AI\", \"Angular (13+)\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;Competitive salary package with performance-based incentives&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;65&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;67&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;Health insurance coverage and statutory benefits (PF &amp;amp; Gratuity)&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;134&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;136&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on large-scale enterprise energy management projects&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;211&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;213&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;Strong career growth and learning opportunities&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;263&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;265&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;Collaborative and professional work environment&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('70fbf8ed-635c-44d3-a6e9-86e59f3ff706','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Senior IoT Engineer','senior-iot-engineer-161-161','&lt;p data-start=&quot;171&quot; data-end=&quot;775&quot;&gt;We are seeking a highly experienced Senior IoT Engineer with over 8 years of expertise in industrial IoT systems. The role involves leading the modernization of OPC Publisher architecture, designing and implementing secure bi-directional communication patterns, and developing scalable industrial data workflows across cloud and edge environments. The engineer will work on telemetry routing, cloud-to-edge communication, industrial protocol integration, and ensure secure, reliable plant-level IoT systems. This is a hands-on technical leadership role in a distributed, production-grade IoT environment.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-02-03 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-12-05 15:03:07.000000','2025-12-05 15:03:07.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"AWS\", \"Azure\", \"Cloud\", \"Cybersecurity\", \"Distributed Control Systems\", \"Docker\", \"Edge Computing\", \"GCP\", \"Kafka\", \"Kubernetes\", \"REST API\", \"CI/CD\", \"OPC UA\", \"MQTT\", \"RPC Protocols\", \"Industrial Automation Systems\", \"Telemetry Aggregation\", \"IoT Engineering\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1474&quot; data-end=&quot;1516&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1476&quot; data-end=&quot;1516&quot;&gt;Competitive salary based on experience&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1517&quot; data-end=&quot;1537&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1519&quot; data-end=&quot;1537&quot;&gt;Health insurance&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1538&quot; data-end=&quot;1555&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1540&quot; data-end=&quot;1555&quot;&gt;Paid time off&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1556&quot; data-end=&quot;1592&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1558&quot; data-end=&quot;1592&quot;&gt;Professional development support&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1593&quot; data-end=&quot;1656&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1595&quot; data-end=&quot;1656&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on cutting-edge industrial IoT projects&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1657&quot; data-end=&quot;1690&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1659&quot; data-end=&quot;1690&quot;&gt;Long-term full-time stability&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('7164b849-9a09-43ac-aeb1-3ceee438edf2','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','MES Senior Developer – Opcenter Execution Semiconductor Platform','mes-senior-developer-opcenter-execution-semiconductor-platform-285-285','&lt;p data-start=&quot;106&quot; data-end=&quot;410&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced MES Senior Developers for a leading Top MNC to work on Siemens Opcenter Execution Semiconductor Platform projects. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in Opcenter Execution, MES development, semiconductor manufacturing processes, and enterprise system integrations.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;412&quot; data-end=&quot;766&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for designing, developing, configuring, and supporting MES solutions using Opcenter EX Core, MDD, Semiconductor, and Electronics modules. The role includes technical design, software enhancements, code reviews, testing, deployment support, and ensuring high-quality MES implementations across manufacturing environments.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;768&quot; data-end=&quot;1067&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with Designer, Portal Studio, Connect MOM, Mendix, Visual Studio, REST APIs, OData protocols, SQL Stored Procedures, and enterprise integrations. Strong knowledge of SAP, PLM, machine integration, and manufacturing execution systems is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1069&quot; data-end=&quot;1410&quot;&gt;The role also involves performing unit testing, functional testing, integration testing, data migration activities, cutover planning, UAT support, and go-live assistance. Candidates will work closely with customers, business stakeholders, and project teams while maintaining technical documentation and providing ongoing application support.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Pune',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-08-08 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-06-10 01:42:26.000000','2026-06-10 01:42:26.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Data Integration\", \"MES Development\", \"MYSQL\", \"Opcenter Connect Mom\", \"PLM Software (Product Lifecycle Management)\", \"REST API\", \"SAP Integration\", \"Siemens Opcenter\", \"Unit Testing\", \"Mendix\", \"OData Protocols\", \"Machine Integrator\", \"Opcenter EX Core\", \"Opcenter MDD\", \"Opcenter Electronics\", \"UAT Support\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1426&quot; data-end=&quot;1464&quot; data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1465&quot; data-end=&quot;1542&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1iurg5v&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-level MES and semiconductor manufacturing projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1543&quot; data-end=&quot;1593&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1ye70h4&quot;&gt;Work on advanced Siemens Opcenter technologies&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1594&quot; data-end=&quot;1647&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1dtrcoo&quot;&gt;Career growth in MES &amp;amp; Smart Manufacturing domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1648&quot; data-end=&quot;1710&quot; data-section-id=&quot;uhu09b&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global manufacturing teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1711&quot; data-end=&quot;1766&quot; data-section-id=&quot;45fk39&quot;&gt;Professional and technology-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1767&quot; data-end=&quot;1810&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Maharashtra'),('71c1d169-b1a1-4c43-9591-40f199426c2c','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','OBIEE-OAS-PV IT Consultant / IT Analyst','obiee-oas-pv-it-consultant-it-analyst-361-361','&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced &lt;strong&gt;OBIEE-OAS-PV IT Consultants / IT Analysts&lt;/strong&gt; for a leading global organization operating in the &lt;strong&gt;Pharmaceutical, Life Sciences, and Dermatology&lt;/strong&gt; domain. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in Oracle Business Intelligence, analytics, SQL, and Pharmacovigilance (PV) application support.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for developing and supporting &lt;strong&gt;OBIEE/OAS reports, dashboards, analytics, and metadata models&lt;/strong&gt;, while working closely with Pharmacovigilance and Drug Safety teams. The role involves analyzing PV data, validating reporting outputs, troubleshooting business intelligence solutions, and ensuring accurate delivery of safety-related reports and analytics.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with &lt;strong&gt;OBIEE Report Development, Oracle SQL, OBIEE/OAS Dashboards, RPD, Metadata Layer, Pharmacovigilance, Oracle PV Application Support, PV Data Analysis, and Data Validation&lt;/strong&gt;. Knowledge of GxP and Computer System Validation (CSV) requirements within regulated pharmaceutical environments is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The role also involves collaborating with global business users, Drug Safety teams, IT stakeholders, and technical teams to gather requirements, resolve production issues, enhance reporting solutions, and ensure compliance with applicable pharmaceutical and pharmacovigilance standards.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-18 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-08-20 03:13:13.000000','2026-08-20 03:13:14.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Business Intelligence\", \"Data Analysis\", \"Gxp Compliance\", \"Oracle\", \"SQL Query Optimization\", \"RPD Development\", \"OBIEE Migration\", \"Oracle BI\", \"OBIEE\", \"OBIEE Report Development\", \"OBIEE Dashboards\", \"OBIEE Metadata Layer\", \"Pharmacovigilance (PV)\", \"PV Data Analysis\", \"PV Data Validation\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to work with a leading global Life Sciences organization&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale OBIEE/OAS analytics projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Pharmacovigilance and Drug Safety functions&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li&gt;Exposure to regulated pharmaceutical and GxP environments&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to work with Oracle PV and safety reporting platforms&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li&gt;Technical and domain growth in Business Intelligence and Pharmacovigilance&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li&gt;Collaboration with global IT, business, and safety teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li&gt;Career growth across Life Sciences technology and analytics&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('71d48336-2baa-47ec-bc51-00afb1edbab4','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Azure Engineer – Systems Monitoring','azure-engineer-systems-monitoring-72-72','&lt;p data-start=&quot;310&quot; data-end=&quot;531&quot;&gt;Are you passionate about monitoring and automation in the Azure ecosystem? We&amp;rsquo;re looking for an &lt;strong data-start=&quot;406&quot; data-end=&quot;445&quot;&gt;Azure Engineer (Systems Monitoring)&lt;/strong&gt; to design and maintain scalable monitoring solutions across our cloud infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;hr data-start=&quot;533&quot; data-end=&quot;536&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;538&quot; data-end=&quot;567&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;542&quot; data-end=&quot;567&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;568&quot; data-end=&quot;1226&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;568&quot; data-end=&quot;687&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;570&quot; data-end=&quot;687&quot;&gt;Design, configure, and maintain &lt;strong data-start=&quot;602&quot; data-end=&quot;619&quot;&gt;Azure Monitor&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong data-start=&quot;621&quot; data-end=&quot;638&quot;&gt;Log Analytics&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong data-start=&quot;640&quot; data-end=&quot;650&quot;&gt;alerts&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong data-start=&quot;652&quot; data-end=&quot;666&quot;&gt;dashboards&lt;/strong&gt;, and &lt;strong data-start=&quot;672&quot; data-end=&quot;685&quot;&gt;workbooks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;688&quot; data-end=&quot;781&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;690&quot; data-end=&quot;781&quot;&gt;Leverage &lt;strong data-start=&quot;699&quot; data-end=&quot;729&quot;&gt;Kusto Query Language (KQL)&lt;/strong&gt; or &lt;strong data-start=&quot;733&quot; data-end=&quot;743&quot;&gt;Python&lt;/strong&gt; for deep data analysis and querying&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;782&quot; data-end=&quot;870&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;784&quot; data-end=&quot;870&quot;&gt;Use &lt;strong data-start=&quot;788&quot; data-end=&quot;807&quot;&gt;Azure Functions&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong data-start=&quot;812&quot; data-end=&quot;826&quot;&gt;PowerShell&lt;/strong&gt; for automation and operational efficiency&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;871&quot; data-end=&quot;954&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;873&quot; data-end=&quot;954&quot;&gt;Implement &lt;strong data-start=&quot;883&quot; data-end=&quot;909&quot;&gt;infrastructure as code&lt;/strong&gt; using &lt;strong data-start=&quot;916&quot; data-end=&quot;929&quot;&gt;Terraform&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong data-start=&quot;931&quot; data-end=&quot;938&quot;&gt;ARM&lt;/strong&gt;, or &lt;strong data-start=&quot;943&quot; data-end=&quot;952&quot;&gt;Bicep&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;955&quot; data-end=&quot;1022&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;957&quot; data-end=&quot;1022&quot;&gt;Build and maintain &lt;strong data-start=&quot;976&quot; data-end=&quot;996&quot;&gt;DevOps pipelines&lt;/strong&gt; using &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1003&quot; data-end=&quot;1020&quot;&gt;GitHub/GitLab&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1023&quot; data-end=&quot;1128&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1025&quot; data-end=&quot;1128&quot;&gt;Monitor infrastructure, manage escalations, and ensure timely resolution to maintain system stability&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1129&quot; data-end=&quot;1226&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1131&quot; data-end=&quot;1226&quot;&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional teams to improve monitoring practices and incident response&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;hr data-start=&quot;1228&quot; data-end=&quot;1231&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;1233&quot; data-end=&quot;1258&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1237&quot; data-end=&quot;1258&quot;&gt;Must-Have Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1259&quot; data-end=&quot;1751&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1259&quot; data-end=&quot;1342&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1261&quot; data-end=&quot;1342&quot;&gt;Strong experience with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1284&quot; data-end=&quot;1301&quot;&gt;Azure Monitor&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1303&quot; data-end=&quot;1320&quot;&gt;Log Analytics&lt;/strong&gt;, and alerting tools&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1343&quot; data-end=&quot;1422&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1345&quot; data-end=&quot;1422&quot;&gt;Hands-on knowledge of &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1367&quot; data-end=&quot;1374&quot;&gt;KQL&lt;/strong&gt; or &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1378&quot; data-end=&quot;1388&quot;&gt;Python&lt;/strong&gt; for data querying and scripting&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1423&quot; data-end=&quot;1515&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1425&quot; data-end=&quot;1515&quot;&gt;Experience with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1441&quot; data-end=&quot;1460&quot;&gt;Azure Functions&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1462&quot; data-end=&quot;1486&quot;&gt;PowerShell scripting&lt;/strong&gt;, and automation techniques&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1516&quot; data-end=&quot;1581&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1518&quot; data-end=&quot;1581&quot;&gt;Familiarity with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1535&quot; data-end=&quot;1548&quot;&gt;Terraform&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1550&quot; data-end=&quot;1557&quot;&gt;ARM&lt;/strong&gt;, or &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1562&quot; data-end=&quot;1571&quot;&gt;Bicep&lt;/strong&gt; for IaC&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1582&quot; data-end=&quot;1653&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1584&quot