n tech stack&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;219&quot; data-end=&quot;275&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;221&quot; data-end=&quot;275&quot;&gt;Opportunities for continuous learning and upskilling&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;276&quot; data-end=&quot;325&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;278&quot; data-end=&quot;325&quot;&gt;Collaborative and supportive team environment&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;326&quot; data-end=&quot;370&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;328&quot; data-end=&quot;370&quot;&gt;Career growth with leadership mentorship&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;371&quot; data-end=&quot;403&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;373&quot; data-end=&quot;403&quot;&gt;Health and wellness benefits&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;404&quot; data-end=&quot;441&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;406&quot; data-end=&quot;441&quot;&gt;Strong focus on work-life balance&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Telangana'),('71d59a8b-7784-48bc-b29c-b9d5c642b77d','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Process Engineer / Data Analyst','process-engineer-data-analyst-273-273','&lt;p data-start=&quot;73&quot; data-end=&quot;403&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced Process Engineers / Data Analysts for a leading Top MNC to work on industrial digital transformation, manufacturing analytics, and process optimization initiatives. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in industrial data analysis, reporting, process improvement, and data visualization tools.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;405&quot; data-end=&quot;754&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for analyzing production and operational data, identifying improvement opportunities, and translating business requirements into data-driven solutions. The role includes developing KPIs, dashboards, quality reports, and performance monitoring systems to support manufacturing and operational excellence initiatives.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;756&quot; data-end=&quot;1022&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with Power BI, Tableau, Excel, SQL, and manufacturing analytics solutions. Strong understanding of industrial digitalization, continuous improvement methodologies, and process optimization techniques is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1024&quot; data-end=&quot;1309&quot;&gt;The role also requires collaboration with operations teams, IT/OT experts, and business stakeholders to support data-driven decision-making and improve manufacturing performance. Candidates should possess strong analytical thinking, problem-solving abilities, and communication skills.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-07-12 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-05-14 03:40:30.000000','2026-05-14 03:40:30.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Advanced Excel\", \"Data Analysis\", \"Data Validation\", \"Data Visualization\", \"KPI Reporting\", \"Power BI\", \"SQL\", \"Tableau\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1325&quot; data-end=&quot;1363&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;8ue3l6&quot; data-start=&quot;1364&quot; data-end=&quot;1422&quot;&gt;Exposure to industrial digital transformation projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1pi0y5s&quot; data-start=&quot;1423&quot; data-end=&quot;1495&quot;&gt;Work on manufacturing analytics and process optimization initiatives&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1u2c6fv&quot; data-start=&quot;1496&quot; data-end=&quot;1565&quot;&gt;Career growth in Industrial Data Analytics &amp;amp; Manufacturing domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1djpck1&quot; data-start=&quot;1566&quot; data-end=&quot;1630&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with cross-functional IT/OT teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot; data-start=&quot;1631&quot; data-end=&quot;1686&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;1687&quot; data-end=&quot;1730&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('722a6adc-384d-4737-8c90-6cbf807087a3','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Responsible AI Engineer','responsible-ai-engineer-302-302','&lt;p data-start=&quot;65&quot; data-end=&quot;410&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced Responsible AI Engineers for a leading Top MNC to work on enterprise-scale AI Governance, Responsible AI, Risk Management, and Compliance initiatives. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in AI governance frameworks, ethical AI practices, risk assessment, regulatory compliance, and AI lifecycle management.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;412&quot; data-end=&quot;791&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for evaluating AI and Generative AI solutions to ensure compliance with organizational governance standards, regulatory requirements, and ethical AI principles. The role includes assessing AI applications for privacy, fairness, explainability, transparency, security, and operational risks while supporting enterprise AI transformation programs.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;793&quot; data-end=&quot;1091&quot;&gt;Professionals should have experience in AI governance, technology risk management, compliance processes, and Responsible AI assessments. Strong understanding of AI risk classification frameworks, bias detection, privacy controls, governance reviews, and AI lifecycle management is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1093&quot; data-end=&quot;1511&quot;&gt;The role also involves collaborating with Data Science, Product, Engineering, Legal, Risk, and Compliance teams to establish governance processes, conduct Responsible AI review forums, prepare assessment reports, and recommend mitigation strategies. Candidates should possess excellent analytical, communication, stakeholder management, and problem-solving skills with a passion for ethical and trustworthy AI systems.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-08-22 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-06-24 03:16:21.000000','2026-06-24 03:16:21.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Generative AI\", \"LLM Fine-tuning\", \"Data Lineage\", \"Responsible AI\", \"AI Governance\", \"AI Risk Assessment\", \"Ethical AI Frameworks\", \"Explainable AI (XAI)\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1527&quot; data-end=&quot;1565&quot; data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1566&quot; data-end=&quot;1624&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1qhk4dl&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale AI Governance initiatives&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1625&quot; data-end=&quot;1691&quot; data-section-id=&quot;qan40c&quot;&gt;Work on cutting-edge Responsible AI and Generative AI programs&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1692&quot; data-end=&quot;1751&quot; data-section-id=&quot;walrho&quot;&gt;Career growth in AI Governance &amp;amp; Risk Management domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1752&quot; data-end=&quot;1825&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1xqjez6&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global AI, Compliance, and Risk teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1826&quot; data-end=&quot;1881&quot; data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1882&quot; data-end=&quot;1925&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('72598e30-02c5-47d