rt=&quot;772&quot; data-end=&quot;798&quot;&gt;instrument integration&lt;/strong&gt; and ensure seamless lab workflow automation&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;28bo2x&quot; data-start=&quot;845&quot; data-end=&quot;921&quot;&gt;Understand and manage &lt;strong data-start=&quot;869&quot; data-end=&quot;919&quot;&gt;data flow, system architecture, and interfaces&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;3c1sjs&quot; data-start=&quot;922&quot; data-end=&quot;1001&quot;&gt;Participate in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;939&quot; data-end=&quot;961&quot;&gt;testing activities&lt;/strong&gt; (functional, regression, UAT support)&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;12x6v78&quot; data-start=&quot;1002&quot; data-end=&quot;1093&quot;&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional teams including QA, business analysts, and developers&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1eyq5ec&quot; data-start=&quot;1094&quot; data-end=&quot;1163&quot;&gt;Ensure compliance with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1119&quot; data-end=&quot;1161&quot;&gt;GxP, regulatory, and quality standards&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;3v06xo&quot; data-start=&quot;1170&quot; data-end=&quot;1196&quot;&gt;&lt;span role=&quot;text&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1177&quot; data-end=&quot;1196&quot;&gt;Required Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;10xx8uu&quot; data-start=&quot;1198&quot; data-end=&quot;1224&quot;&gt;&lt;span role=&quot;text&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1204&quot; data-end=&quot;1224&quot;&gt;Mandatory Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1225&quot; data-end=&quot;1600&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;yt9et5&quot; data-start=&quot;1225&quot; data-end=&quot;1292&quot;&gt;Strong experience in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1248&quot; data-end=&quot;1290&quot;&gt;Thermo Fisher Sample Manager (SM) LIMS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;w78v20&quot; data-start=&quot;1293&quot; data-end=&quot;1365&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1318&quot; data-end=&quot;1363&quot;&gt;LIMS Implementation / Upgrade / Migration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;12q0mc5&quot; data-start=&quot;1366&quot; data-end=&quot;1416&quot;&gt;Expertise in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1381&quot; data-end=&quot;1414&quot;&gt;Configuration &amp;amp; Customization&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1b5w1ip&quot; data-start=&quot;1417&quot; data-end=&quot;1476&quot;&gt;Knowledge of &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1432&quot; data-end=&quot;1474&quot;&gt;Instrument Integration &amp;amp; Lab Workflows&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1wj7twy&quot; data-start=&quot;1477&quot; data-end=&quot;1538&quot;&gt;Good understanding of &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1501&quot; data-end=&quot;1536&quot;&gt;System Architecture &amp;amp; Data Flow&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;6ymhd2&quot; data-start=&quot;1539&quot; data-end=&quot;1600&quot;&gt;Experience in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1555&quot; data-end=&quot;1598&quot;&gt;Testing (Functional / Regression / UAT)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;228cvl&quot; data-start=&quot;1602&quot; data-end=&quot;1624&quot;&gt;&lt;span role=&quot;text&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1608&quot; data-end=&quot;1624&quot;&gt;Good to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1625&quot; data-end=&quot;1806&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1jimhx0&quot; data-start=&quot;1625&quot; data-end=&quot;1698&quot;&gt;Exposure to &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1639&quot; data-end=&quot;1659&quot;&gt;DevOps practices&lt;/strong&gt; (CI/CD, version control, deployment)&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1u9opc1&quot; data-start=&quot;1699&quot; data-end=&quot;1754&quot;&gt;Knowledge of &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1714&quot; data-end=&quot;1752&quot;&gt;GxP, FDA, and compliance standards&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;wrdniw&quot; data-start=&quot;1755&quot; data-end=&quot;1806&quot;&gt;Experience in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1771&quot; data-end=&quot;1804&quot;&gt;Pharma / Life Sciences domain&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Pune',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-06-16 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-04-18 04:09:39.000000','2026-04-18 04:09:39.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"DevOps\", \"Gxp Compliance\", \"Life Sciences\", \"Manual Functional Testing\", \"Pharma Industry\", \"UAT\", \"LabWare LIMS\", \"LabVantage LIMS\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;24ts3i&quot; data-start=&quot;1833&quot; data-end=&quot;1897&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1862&quot; data-end=&quot;1895&quot;&gt;Top MNC in Life Sciences &amp;amp; IT&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1op8s2s&quot; data-start=&quot;1898&quot; data-end=&quot;1953&quot;&gt;Exposure to &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1912&quot; data-end=&quot;1951&quot;&gt;global LIMS implementation projects&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1dqlei5&quot; data-start=&quot;1954&quot; data-end=&quot;2022&quot;&gt;Work on &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1964&quot; data-end=&quot;2020&quot;&gt;cutting-edge lab automation &amp;amp; digital transformation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1b8ludi&quot; data-start=&quot;2023&quot; data-end=&quot;2078&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and performance-based incentives&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;bie91f&quot; data-start=&quot;2079&quot; data-end=&quot;2127&quot;&gt;Career growth in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2098&quot; data-end=&quot;2125&quot;&gt;high-demand LIMS domain&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1e4iak1&quot; data-start=&quot;2128&quot; data-end=&quot;2182&quot;&gt;Collaborative and learning-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Maharashtra'),('72a5b77b-58ba-4eec-9165-461c9e2aede5','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Senior Data Engineer','senior-data-engineer-9-9','Must-Have Skills: 6&amp;ndash;9 years of experience with PySpark, Apache Spark, Flink, NiFi, Kafka, and other data engineering technologies. Strong proficiency in SQL, RDBMS, and Hadoop technologies. Familiarity with the Cloudera Tech Stack, including Hive, Impala, and HDFS. Good-to-Have Skills: Hands-on experience with Flink and Kudu streaming. Knowledge of Informatica workflow migration. Automation of workflows using CI/CD pipelines. Experience with Airflow or similar workflow engines. BFSI industry experience, especially with cloud technologies (Azure, AWS, Google Cloud). Key Responsibilities: Develop and optimize Spark pipelines for batch and streaming data. Design and implement ETL pipelines using PySpark and other tools. Migrate existing implementations to Spark-based solutions. Work with programming languages like Scala, Java, and Python. Utilize tools like Kafka and Jupyter Notebooks for streaming and development.','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',250000.00,300000.00,'₹',1,'India','Mumbai/Bandra',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2025-07-02 18:30:00',0,0,'2025-05-04 17:21:24.000000','2025-05-04 17:21:24.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"AC\", \"Academic Performance Tracking\", \"Advanced Materials\", \"Apache Ant\", \"API Design\", \"Assembly Line\", \"Building Codes\", \"Circuit Switching\", \"Cloud AWS\", \"Cosmetics\", \"CRM Management\"]','[\"Perks &amp;amp; Benefits: Competitive salary package Career growth opportunities Comprehensive health insurance Hybrid work model Performance-based incentives Learning and development programs\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Maharashtra'),('72a9411f-36ec-4ff0-b7df-c38d950d40bd','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Apriso Solution Architect (DELMIA Apriso MES)','apriso-solution-architect-delmia-apriso-mes-342-342','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;87&quot; data-end=&quot;505&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced Apriso Solution Architects for a leading Top MNC to drive enterprise-scale Manufacturing Execution System (MES), Manufacturing Operations Management (MOM), and Smart Manufacturing transformation initiatives. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in Dassault Syst&amp;egrave;mes DELMIA Apriso MES, enterprise solution architecture, manufacturing processes, and digital transformation programs.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;507&quot; data-end=&quot;943&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for designing, architecting, and delivering end-to-end DELMIA Apriso MES solutions across global manufacturing organizations. The role includes conducting fit-gap analysis, defining solution architecture, translating business requirements into technical solutions, leading implementation programs, supporting system upgrades, and ensuring seamless integration between enterprise and shop-floor systems.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;945&quot; data-end=&quot;1534&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with DELMIA Apriso MES (2016&amp;ndash;2025), Manufacturing Operations Management (MOM), Apriso Screen Framework, Process Builder, Global Process Manager (GPM), machine integration, business integration, ERP integration using XSLT, OPC DA/UA, RS232 communication, JavaScript, C# scripting, SQL Server, Oracle Database, and performance optimization. Strong knowledge of production execution, order management, quality management, warehouse operations, maintenance management, time and labor management, and complex assembly processes is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1536&quot; data-end=&quot;2099&quot;&gt;The role also involves leading technical architecture, preparing Functional and Technical Design documents, supporting RFI/RFQ/RFP responses, effort estimation, project planning, customer workshops, solution reviews, and mentoring development teams. Candidates will collaborate with business stakeholders, manufacturing teams, automation engineers, and global delivery teams to deliver scalable, secure, and high-performance MES solutions. Strong leadership, consulting, stakeholder management, communication, analytical, and problem-solving skills are essential.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Entry',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Pune',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-09-15 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-07-18 03:06:02.000000','2026-07-18 03:06:02.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"AJAX\", \"Apriso\", \"C#\", \"ERP\", \"GPM Deployment\", \"JavaScript\", \"Mes\", \"Mes Implementation\", \"Microsoft SQL Server\", \"Mom Systems\", \"Oracle\", \"Solution Architect\", \"Transact-SQL\", \"OPC UA\", \"Dassault DELMIA Apriso MES\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;2115&quot; data-end=&quot;2153&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1r9fmxd&quot; data-start=&quot;2154&quot; data-end=&quot;2244&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale MES, MOM, and Smart Manufacturing transformation projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ng2d7s&quot; data-start=&quot;2245&quot; data-end=&quot;2313&quot;&gt;Work on advanced DELMIA Apriso MES and Industry 4.0 technologies&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1b78xst&quot; data-start=&quot;2314&quot; data-end=&quot;2393&quot;&gt;Career growth in Solution Architecture and Digital Manufacturing Consulting&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;13qji02&quot; data-start=&quot;2394&quot; data-end=&quot;2471&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global manufacturing and technology teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot; data-start=&quot;2472&quot; data-end=&quot;2527&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;2528&quot; data-end=&quot;2571&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Maharashtra'),('7349b9c2-5e0f-48e4-97ca-21ad991401b4','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Senior MES RedHat Administrator','senior-mes-redhat-administrator-335-335','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;73&quot; data-end=&quot;480&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced Senior MES RedHat Administrators for a leading Top MNC to support enterprise-scale Manufacturing Execution System (MES) infrastructure and Digital Manufacturing transformation initiatives. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in Red Hat OpenShift, Red Hat Enterprise Linux (RHEL), Kubernetes, infrastructure automation, and Critical Manufacturing (CM) MES environments.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;482&quot; data-end=&quot;915&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for administering, deploying, maintaining, and optimizing highly available Red Hat infrastructure supporting Critical Manufacturing MES platforms. The role includes managing OpenShift clusters, Kubernetes deployments, CI/CD pipelines, infrastructure automation, system monitoring, troubleshooting production issues, and ensuring maximum availability, performance, and security of MES infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;917&quot; data-end=&quot;1336&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with Red Hat OpenShift Administration, RHEL infrastructure management, Kubernetes orchestration, OpenShift deployments, High Availability (HA) cluster management, and CI/CD automation. Strong understanding of Critical Manufacturing (CM) MES infrastructure, manufacturing environments, infrastructure optimization, and enterprise platform administration is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1338&quot; data-end=&quot;1844&quot;&gt;The role also involves collaborating with customers, SMEs, DevOps teams, infrastructure engineers, and global project teams to deliver reliable and scalable MES platforms. Candidates will gather technical requirements, support solution implementation, conduct infrastructure testing, prepare technical documentation, troubleshoot complex infrastructure issues, and drive continuous improvement initiatives. Strong analytical, communication, stakeholder management, and problem-solving skills are essential.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-09-11 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-07-14 02:45:30.000000','2026-07-14 02:45:30.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Change Management\", \"DevOps\", \"Kubernetes\", \"Mes\", \"System Design\", \"OpenShift\", \"CI/CD\", \"RHEL\", \"Critical Manufacturing\", \"Red Hat OpenShift Administration\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1860&quot; data-end=&quot;1898&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;xdabsb&quot; data-start=&quot;1899&quot; data-end=&quot;1985&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale MES Infrastructure and Digital Manufacturing projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;5edjsd&quot; data-start=&quot;1986&quot; data-end=&quot;2079&quot;&gt;Work with advanced Red Hat OpenShift, Kubernetes, and Critical Manufacturing technologies&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1b39szl&quot; data-start=&quot;2080&quot; data-end=&quot;2156&quot;&gt;Career growth in MES Infrastructure, DevOps, and Platform Administration&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1xg8ter&quot; data-start=&quot;2157&quot; data-end=&quot;2238&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global infrastructure and manufacturing teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot; data-start=&quot;2239&quot; data-end=&quot;2294&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;2295&quot; data-end=&quot;2338&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('743c3ace-6f39-416e-a9f8-c74ea3977f96','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Quintiq Specialist','quintiq-specialist-269-269','&lt;p data-start=&quot;60&quot; data-end=&quot;368&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced Quintiq Specialists for a leading Top MNC to work on enterprise-level supply chain, workforce planning, and optimization projects. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in Quintiq Scheduler, Demand Planning, Workforce Planning, and algorithm-based optimization solutions.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;370&quot; data-end=&quot;716&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for designing, implementing, and supporting Quintiq-based planning and scheduling solutions for global enterprise projects. The role includes analyzing business planning challenges, developing optimization algorithms, validating solutions during SIT/UAT phases, and supporting end-to-end Quintiq implementations.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;718&quot; data-end=&quot;976&quot;&gt;Professionals should have experience in supply chain demand planning, workforce management, forecast management, and shift scheduling solutions. Strong knowledge of Quintiq optimizers, solution debugging, and business process improvement is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;978&quot; data-end=&quot;1299&quot;&gt;The role also involves working directly with clients and stakeholders to provide consulting support, manage change requests, and deliver SLA-based services. Candidates should possess excellent analytical, communication, and problem-solving skills with the ability to handle complex planning and optimization requirements.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-07-10 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-05-12 03:02:03.000000','2026-05-12 03:02:04.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"SLA Management\", \"Supply Chain Agreements\", \"Quintiq\", \"Quintiq Scheduler\", \"Workforce Planner\", \"QPLC Methodology\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1315&quot; data-end=&quot;1353&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;vtguah&quot; data-start=&quot;1354&quot; data-end=&quot;1421&quot;&gt;Exposure to global supply chain and workforce planning projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;mgxw31&quot; data-start=&quot;1422&quot; data-end=&quot;1473&quot;&gt;Work on enterprise-level optimization solutions&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1tks50r&quot; data-start=&quot;1474&quot; data-end=&quot;1524&quot;&gt;Career growth in Quintiq &amp;amp; Supply Chain domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;m3lb3u&quot; data-start=&quot;1525&quot; data-end=&quot;1582&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with international clients&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot; data-start=&quot;1583&quot; data-end=&quot;1638&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;1639&quot; data-end=&quot;1682&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('74867f4f-1f5a-4bb5-b6a0-8b959a37e737','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','React Native Developer','react-native-developer-31-31','&lt;h2 class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;304&quot; data-end=&quot;349&quot;&gt;Job Title: React Native Developer&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;350&quot; data-end=&quot;449&quot;&gt;Experience: 5&amp;ndash;10 Years&lt;br data-start=&quot;376&quot; data-end=&quot;379&quot; /&gt;Location:&amp;nbsp;Chennai&lt;br data-start=&quot;421&quot; data-end=&quot;424&quot; /&gt;Job Type: Full-time&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;451&quot; data-end=&quot;480&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ol data-start=&quot;481&quot; data-end=&quot;1133&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;481&quot; data-end=&quot;565&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;484&quot; data-end=&quot;565&quot;&gt;Develop and maintain high-performance mobile applications using React Native.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;566&quot; data-end=&quot;673&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;569&quot; data-end=&quot;673&quot;&gt;Implement complex UI components and ensure seamless user experiences across platforms (iOS and Android).&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;674&quot; data-end=&quot;783&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;677&quot; data-end=&quot;783&quot;&gt;Utilize React fundamentals such as components, props, state, hooks, and lifecycle methods effectively.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;784&quot; data-end=&quot;865&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;787&quot; data-end=&quot;865&quot;&gt;Integrate mobile applications with REST APIs and handle asynchronous data.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;866&quot; data-end=&quot;936&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;869&quot; data-end=&quot;936&quot;&gt;Optimize application performance, memory usage, and responsiveness.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;937&quot; data-end=&quot;996&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;940&quot; data-end=&quot;996&quot;&gt;Implement Redux or other state management solutions.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;997&quot; data-end=&quot;1062&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1000&quot; data-end=&quot;1062&quot;&gt;Participate in code reviews, testing, and debugging processes.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1063&quot; data-end=&quot;1133&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1066&quot; data-end=&quot;1133&quot;&gt;Handle CI/CD pipelines and participate in deployment workflows.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ol&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1135&quot; data-end=&quot;1160&quot;&gt;Must-Have Skills:&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1161&quot; data-end=&quot;1417&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1161&quot; data-end=&quot;1222&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1163&quot; data-end=&quot;1222&quot;&gt;Strong proficiency in React Native and React ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1223&quot; data-end=&quot;1279&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1225&quot; data-end=&quot;1279&quot;&gt;Experience with hooks, Virtual DOM, lifecycle methods.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1280&quot; data-end=&quot;1334&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1282&quot; data-end=&quot;1334&quot;&gt;Proven track record of building complex mobile apps.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1335&quot; data-end=&quot;1417&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1337&quot; data-end=&quot;1417&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience with Redux, REST APIs, and performance optimization.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',500000.00,2500000.00,'₹',0,'India','Chennai',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2025-07-13 18:30:00',0,0,'2025-05-15 13:27:00.000000','2025-05-16 14:09:24.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Agile\", \"Android\", \"CI Pipelines\", \"Deployment\", \"IOS\", \"React\", \"React JS\", \"React Native\", \"React Router\", \"React.JS\", \"Redux\", \"REST API\"]','[\"&lt;h3 class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;84&quot; data-end=&quot;104&quot;&gt;Job Benefits&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Competitive Salary &amp;amp; performance bonuses&lt;br /&gt;Flexible Work Hours &amp;amp; hybrid/remote options&lt;br /&gt;Health Insurance for employees &amp;amp; dependent&lt;br /&gt;Learning &amp;amp; Development programs&lt;br /&gt;Cutting-Edge Projects with global teams&lt;br /&gt;Team Outings, hackathons &amp;amp; cultural event&lt;br /&gt;International Exposure &amp;amp; career growth opportunities&lt;/h3&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Tamil Nadu'),('748bbf2c-ac68-493a-b5a4-21eee3adb0d1','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Wonderware MES Support Executive','wonderware-mes-support-executive-190-190','We are looking for an experienced Wonderware MES Support Executive to provide 24/7 Level-3 technical support for Wonderware MES solutions across multiple sites. The role focuses on troubleshooting, performance optimization, and ensuring smooth MES operations in a manufacturing/CPG environment.&lt;br /&gt;Provide 24/7 L3 technical support for Wonderware MES suite&lt;br /&gt;Troubleshoot MES issues across multiple production sites&lt;br /&gt;Support MES configurations, performance, and OEE monitoring&lt;br /&gt;Handle incident management and root cause analysis&lt;br /&gt;Coordinate with customers and provide regular status updates&lt;br /&gt;Work on MS SQL queries, stored procedures, and reports&lt;br /&gt;Ensure high availability and stability of MES systems','Information Technology','Contract','Entry',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Hyderabad',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-04-11 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-02-10 19:04:25.000000','2026-02-10 19:04:25.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Historian\", \"Mes\", \"MS SQL Server\", \"Stored Procedures\", \"OEE Analysis\", \"AVEVA Intouch HMI\", \"SSRS\", \"ArchestrA\", \"Wonderware OMI\", \"Skelta\"]','[\"Opportunity to work on enterprise-scale MES implementations&lt;br /&gt;Exposure to multi-site global manufacturing environments&lt;br /&gt;12-month contractual assignment with immediate joining&lt;br /&gt;Strong learning and domain expertise growth in MES &amp;amp; CPG&lt;br /&gt;Collaborative customer-facing role\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Telangana'),('7621ddbe-80d1-4c1a-aff6-7c892332983c','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','ThingWorx developers','thingworx-developers-212-212','1. Hands on Experience in latest Version of ThingWorx 10.x mandatory &lt;br /&gt;2. Hands on Experience in ThingWorx Analytics, Kepware and manufacturing apps&lt;br /&gt;3. Hands on experience in creating ThingWorx custom extension using by java or .NET.&lt;br /&gt;4. Hands on experience in design &amp;amp; development in PTC ThingWorx client SDK and edge development, mashup (views) and web application development&lt;br /&gt;5. Experience in Industrial Gateway Client/Server communications. &lt;br /&gt;6. Experience in KEPWare and OPC client installations and configuration. &lt;br /&gt;7. Expertise in MES implementations.&lt;br /&gt;8. Expertise in multisite installation, federated architecture, Integration with other clouds like AWS, Azure and Other legacy systems like ERP, SAP &lt;br /&gt;9. Experience in SPC analysis, yield improvement &lt;br /&gt;10. Experience in implementing FSU apps and DPM applications for clients &lt;br /&gt;11. Experience in upgrading ThingWorx 9.x to 10.x&lt;br /&gt;12. Experience in HA architecture','Information Technology','Contract','Entry',NULL,NULL,'INR',1,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-05-05 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-03-07 02:00:57.000000','2026-03-07 02:00:57.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"ERP\", \"Mes\", \"Opc\", \"SAP\", \"ThingWorx\", \"Kepware OPC\", \"Kepware\", \"ThingWorx Applications\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;Competitive salary package with performance-based incentives&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;65&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;67&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;Health insurance coverage and statutory benefits (PF &amp;amp; Gratuity)&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;134&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;136&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on large-scale enterprise energy management projects&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;211&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;213&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;Strong career growth and learning opportunities&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;263&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;265&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;Collaborative and professional work environment&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('762d78e2-bf41-4c84-ada4-54e60b60796a','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','LabVantage LIMS Developer','labvantage-lims-developer-359-359','&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced &lt;strong&gt;LabVantage LIMS Developers&lt;/strong&gt; for a leading Top MNC to work on digital laboratory transformation initiatives across the &lt;strong&gt;Pharmaceutical, Life Sciences, and Healthcare&lt;/strong&gt; domains. The ideal candidate should have strong hands-on experience in LabVantage LIMS development, configuration, customization, administration, integrations, and production support.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for developing and customizing LabVantage workflows, forms, reports, dashboards, and laboratory applications. The role also involves supporting LabVantage installation, upgrades, patching, environment management, troubleshooting, and application administration.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Professionals should have strong technical expertise in &lt;strong&gt;LabVantage LIMS, Java, SQL, Web Services, System Integrations, Laboratory Instrument Integration, and BarTender Label Printing&lt;/strong&gt;. Experience with Computer System Validation (CSV), GxP, 21 CFR Part 11, and regulated pharmaceutical environments is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The role requires collaboration with global stakeholders, laboratory teams, QA, IT, and business users to understand requirements, deliver LIMS solutions, resolve production issues, and support continuous improvement initiatives.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-18 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-08-20 02:39:05.000000','2026-08-20 02:39:05.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"API Integration\", \"CSV\", \"Documentation\", \"Java\", \"MYSQL\", \"REST API\", \"System Design\", \"Validation\", \"Web Services\", \"LabVantage LIMS\", \"21 CFR Part 11\", \"Laboratory Equipment Support\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale LIMS and laboratory digitalization projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li&gt;Work with Pharmaceutical, Life Sciences, and Healthcare clients&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li&gt;Exposure to LabVantage configuration, development, integrations, and administration&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li&gt;Experience with regulated GxP and validated laboratory environments&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global stakeholders and technical teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li&gt;Career growth in LIMS and Laboratory Informatics&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li&gt;Professional and collaborative work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('763cfe71-3709-4a0c-bc75-ed291b532003','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Tulip Jr. Developer','tulip-jr-developer-345-345','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;61&quot; data-end=&quot;459&quot;&gt;We are hiring enthusiastic &lt;strong data-start=&quot;88&quot; data-end=&quot;112&quot;&gt;Tulip Jr. Developers&lt;/strong&gt; for a leading Top MNC to support enterprise-scale Smart Manufacturing, Manufacturing Execution Systems (MES), and Shopfloor Digitalization initiatives. This is an excellent opportunity for professionals with 2&amp;ndash;5 years of experience who are passionate about low-code application development, manufacturing technologies, and Industry 4.0 solutions.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;461&quot; data-end=&quot;919&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for developing, configuring, testing, and supporting Tulip applications used to digitize manufacturing operations and shopfloor processes. The role includes building user-friendly interfaces, configuring workflows, integrating manufacturing data, troubleshooting application issues, performing unit testing, maintaining technical documentation, and supporting continuous improvements under the guidance of senior developers.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;921&quot; data-end=&quot;1305&quot;&gt;Professionals should have a solid understanding of the Tulip platform, SQL, database concepts, application development fundamentals, UI configuration, workflow logic, APIs, JSON, XML, software testing, debugging, and Software Development Life Cycle (SDLC). Exposure to Manufacturing Execution Systems (MES), shopfloor applications, and Agile development practices is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1307&quot; data-end=&quot;1763&quot;&gt;The role also involves collaborating with solution architects, senior developers, business analysts, QA teams, and manufacturing stakeholders to deliver scalable manufacturing applications. Candidates should be eager to learn Tulip best practices, contribute to Agile sprint activities, maintain development artifacts, and support digital manufacturing transformation initiatives. Strong analytical, communication, and problem-solving skills are essential.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Pune',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-09-19 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-07-21 19:46:43.000000','2026-07-21 19:46:43.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Agile Methodology\", \"JSON\", \"Mes\", \"REST API\", \"SQL\", \"Unit Testing\", \"XML\", \"Tulip Platform\", \"Tulip Application Development\", \"Low-Code Application Development\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1779&quot; data-end=&quot;1817&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;77q0ey&quot; data-start=&quot;1818&quot; data-end=&quot;1899&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale Smart Manufacturing and Digital Factory projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;ox26tx&quot; data-start=&quot;1900&quot; data-end=&quot;1986&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience with the Tulip low-code platform and Industry 4.0 technologies&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;15j194c&quot; data-start=&quot;1987&quot; data-end=&quot;2067&quot;&gt;Career growth in Manufacturing IT, MES, and Low-Code Application Development&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;13qji02&quot; data-start=&quot;2068&quot; data-end=&quot;2145&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global manufacturing and technology teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot; data-start=&quot;2146&quot; data-end=&quot;2201&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;2202&quot; data-end=&quot;2245&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Maharashtra'),('7651cded-0395-4fe5-aeb1-732bd5f35954','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Digital Manufacturing Architect','digital-manufacturing-architect-356-356','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;73&quot; data-end=&quot;524&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;99&quot; data-end=&quot;135&quot;&gt;Digital Manufacturing Architects&lt;/strong&gt; for a leading Top MNC to drive enterprise-scale Digital Manufacturing, Manufacturing Execution Systems (MES), Manufacturing Operations Management (MOM), Automation, and Industry 4.0 transformation initiatives. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in manufacturing architecture, solution design, industrial data platforms, IIoT, Digital Twin, and enterprise system integration.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;526&quot; data-end=&quot;982&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for defining future-state manufacturing architectures, driving Future Factory and MOM standardization initiatives, and supporting global manufacturing transformation programs. The role includes participating in architecture workshops, defining manufacturing data and automation architectures, developing Digital Twin strategies, establishing IIoT integration landscapes, and evaluating emerging manufacturing technologies.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;984&quot; data-end=&quot;1442&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1035&quot; data-end=&quot;1276&quot;&gt;MES/MOM, Digital Manufacturing, Automation, Solution Architecture, Manufacturing Data Architecture, System Integration, IIoT, Digital Twin, SCADA, PLM, Cloud Technologies, ISA-95, Unified Namespace (UNS), and Manufacturing Data Platforms&lt;/strong&gt;. Strong understanding of WMS/WES, shopfloor systems, industrial connectivity, cloud-based manufacturing platforms, and Industry 4.0 technologies is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1444&quot; data-end=&quot;1896&quot;&gt;The role also involves developing Digital Twin information, technical, and integration architecture playbooks, supporting Proofs of Concept (PoCs), preparing technology recommendations and executive presentations, and collaborating with global manufacturing, engineering, automation, IT, and business stakeholders. Candidates should possess strong architecture, consulting, communication, stakeholder management, analytical, and problem-solving skills.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-10 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-08-12 02:46:13.000000','2026-08-12 02:46:13.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Digital Twin Technology\", \"Industrial Automation\", \"Mes\", \"Mes Industry 4.0\", \"Mom\", \"PLM Software (Product Lifecycle Management)\", \"SCADA\", \"Solution Architect\", \"Smart Manufacturing\", \"Unified Namespace (UNS)\", \"Digital Manufacturing\", \"ISA-95\", \"Industrial IoT (IIoT)\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1912&quot; data-end=&quot;1950&quot; data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1951&quot; data-end=&quot;2038&quot; data-section-id=&quot;14a2ot&quot;&gt;Exposure to global Digital Manufacturing and Future Factory transformation programs&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2039&quot; data-end=&quot;2120&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1fcdgkc&quot;&gt;Work with advanced MES/MOM, IIoT, Digital Twin, and Industry 4.0 technologies&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2121&quot; data-end=&quot;2200&quot; data-section-id=&quot;izghhw&quot;&gt;Career growth in Digital Manufacturing and Enterprise Solution Architecture&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2201&quot; data-end=&quot;2292&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1rvjwsb&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global manufacturing, engineering, and technology teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2293&quot; data-end=&quot;2368&quot; data-section-id=&quot;nsakq9&quot;&gt;Exposure to emerging manufacturing technologies and innovation-led PoCs&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2369&quot; data-end=&quot;2424&quot; data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2425&quot; data-end=&quot;2503&quot; data-section-id=&quot;18hn3xh&quot;&gt;Opportunity to influence enterprise-wide manufacturing technology strategy&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('76ba7893-6c93-4a0e-8934-b59d604d4519','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Ignition Engineer','ignition-engineer-48-48','&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;414&quot; data-end=&quot;432&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;418&quot; data-end=&quot;430&quot;&gt;Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;433&quot; data-end=&quot;739&quot;&gt;We are looking for skilled &lt;strong data-start=&quot;460&quot; data-end=&quot;482&quot;&gt;Ignition Engineers&lt;/strong&gt; to support the design, development, and deployment of SCADA systems using Inductive Automation&amp;rsquo;s Ignition platform. This role demands strong technical expertise in control systems, scripting, and SCADA infrastructure, ideally in manufacturing environments.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;741&quot; data-end=&quot;769&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;745&quot; data-end=&quot;769&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ol data-start=&quot;770&quot; data-end=&quot;1423&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;770&quot; data-end=&quot;890&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;773&quot; data-end=&quot;890&quot;&gt;Understand and interpret project requirements to design solutions using Ignition or authorized third-party modules.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;891&quot; data-end=&quot;986&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;894&quot; data-end=&quot;986&quot;&gt;Prepare technical development and commissioning plans considering operational constraints.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;987&quot; data-end=&quot;1112&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;990&quot; data-end=&quot;1112&quot;&gt;Design SCADA/control systems including database interfaces, data reporting, analytics, and scripting (Python, VB, etc.).&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1113&quot; data-end=&quot;1195&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1116&quot; data-end=&quot;1195&quot;&gt;Provide support in design, testing, and implementation of project components.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1196&quot; data-end=&quot;1282&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1199&quot; data-end=&quot;1282&quot;&gt;Work with clients for requirement analysis, change requests, and ongoing support.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1283&quot; data-end=&quot;1423&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1286&quot; data-end=&quot;1423&quot;&gt;Apply knowledge of backend manufacturing infrastructure such as virtualization, networking, compute systems, OS, and database management.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ol&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;1425&quot; data-end=&quot;1449&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1429&quot; data-end=&quot;1449&quot;&gt;Must-Have Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1450&quot; data-end=&quot;1786&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1450&quot; data-end=&quot;1521&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1452&quot; data-end=&quot;1521&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1477&quot; data-end=&quot;1519&quot;&gt;Ignition SCADA design and architecture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1522&quot; data-end=&quot;1596&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1524&quot; data-end=&quot;1596&quot;&gt;Strong &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1531&quot; data-end=&quot;1551&quot;&gt;Python scripting&lt;/strong&gt; experience within the Ignition environment&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1597&quot; data-end=&quot;1693&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1599&quot; data-end=&quot;1693&quot;&gt;Experience with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1615&quot; data-end=&quot;1691&quot;&gt;Ignition Edge, Enterprise modules, Tag Providers, and Foundation drivers&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1694&quot; data-end=&quot;1741&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1696&quot; data-end=&quot;1741&quot;&gt;Good communication and interpersonal skills&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1742&quot; data-end=&quot;1786&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1744&quot; data-end=&quot;1786&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1744&quot; data-end=&quot;1758&quot;&gt;Preferred:&lt;/strong&gt; Ignition Gold Certification&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;1788&quot; data-end=&quot;1808&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1792&quot; data-end=&quot;1808&quot;&gt;Good-to-Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1809&quot; data-end=&quot;1923&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1809&quot; data-end=&quot;1873&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1811&quot; data-end=&quot;1873&quot;&gt;Domain experience in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1832&quot; data-end=&quot;1871&quot;&gt;Manufacturing/Industrial Automation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1874&quot; data-end=&quot;1923&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1876&quot; data-end=&quot;1923&quot;&gt;Strong analytical and issue-resolution skills&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',500000.00,2500000.00,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-19 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-06-06 10:22:53.000000','2025-11-21 04:59:43.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Communication Skills\", \"Industrial Automation\", \"Manufacturing\", \"Python\", \"SCADA\", \"SCADA Systems\", \"Scripting\", \"VB\"]','[\"&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;117&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;Job Benefits&lt;/h3&gt;\\r\\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;135&quot; data-end=&quot;996&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;135&quot; data-end=&quot;192&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;137&quot; data-end=&quot;192&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;137&quot; data-end=&quot;159&quot;&gt;Competitive Salary&lt;/strong&gt; based on skills and experience&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;193&quot; data-end=&quot;296&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;195&quot; data-end=&quot;296&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;195&quot; data-end=&quot;236&quot;&gt;Opportunities for Learning and Growth&lt;/strong&gt; through continuous skill development and project exposure&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;297&quot; data-end=&quot;384&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;299&quot; data-end=&quot;384&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;299&quot; data-end=&quot;330&quot;&gt;Supportive Work Environment&lt;/strong&gt; with experienced leadership and collaborative teams&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;385&quot; data-end=&quot;470&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;387&quot; data-end=&quot;470&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;387&quot; data-end=&quot;412&quot;&gt;Flexible Work Options&lt;/strong&gt; depending on project requirements and role expectations&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;471&quot; data-end=&quot;584&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;473&quot; data-end=&quot;584&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;473&quot; data-end=&quot;508&quot;&gt;Exposure to Latest Technologies&lt;/strong&gt; including cloud platforms, microservices, and modern front-end frameworks&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('77405569-5bd9-461c-af11-7e32c00cd1e4','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Collibra Engineer','collibra-engineer-298-298','&lt;p data-start=&quot;59&quot; data-end=&quot;390&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced Collibra Engineers for a leading Top MNC to work on enterprise-scale Data Governance, Metadata Management, and Data Marketplace initiatives. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in Collibra platform development, governance frameworks, data cataloging, and enterprise data management solutions.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;392&quot; data-end=&quot;725&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for designing, developing, enhancing, and maintaining Collibra-based Data Governance solutions and Data Marketplace capabilities. The role includes managing metadata frameworks, implementing governance policies, enhancing Collibra metamodels, and supporting enterprise-wide data governance programs.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;727&quot; data-end=&quot;1063&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with Collibra Data Governance, Collibra Data Marketplace, Collibra Metamodel customization, and governance workflow implementation. Strong understanding of data governance frameworks, metadata management, data quality processes, and enterprise data management practices is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1065&quot; data-end=&quot;1412&quot;&gt;The role also involves collaborating with business stakeholders, data stewards, data architects, and technical teams to drive governance adoption, improve data accessibility, and ensure compliance with organizational data standards. Candidates should possess excellent analytical, communication, stakeholder management, and problem-solving skills.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-08-22 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-06-24 02:49:24.000000','2026-06-24 02:49:25.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Stakeholder Management\", \"Metadata Management\", \"Collibra\", \"Collibra Data Governance\", \"Collibra Metamodel\", \"Data Lineage\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1428&quot; data-end=&quot;1466&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;79c1d&quot; data-start=&quot;1467&quot; data-end=&quot;1527&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale Data Governance initiatives&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;19oeocd&quot; data-start=&quot;1528&quot; data-end=&quot;1591&quot;&gt;Work on advanced Collibra and Metadata Management solutions&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1kr89jb&quot; data-start=&quot;1592&quot; data-end=&quot;1653&quot;&gt;Career growth in Data Governance &amp;amp; Data Management domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;182irwx&quot; data-start=&quot;1654&quot; data-end=&quot;1725&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global business and technical teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot; data-start=&quot;1726&quot; data-end=&quot;1781&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;1782&quot; data-end=&quot;1825&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('775bd3e0-c70c-4ddd-aad5-eb30b8f8048e','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','AVEVA MES Technical Implementation Specialist','aveva-mes-technical-implementation-specialist-85-85','We&rsquo;re seeking a skilled AVEVA MES Implementation Specialist with strong technical hands-on expertise in MES configuration, ArchestrA Object toolkit, and System Platform integration. This role is with a leading global client (BD/Nokian Tyres) for driving manufacturing digitization. Key Responsibilities: Configure and customize AVEVA MES Performance &amp;amp; Operations modules Deploy MES packages and integrate into client infrastructure Manage end-to-end MES projects across plant operations Work with System Platform, ArchestrA Object toolkit, and database structures Develop attribute models and create attribute hierarchies Enable MES reporting and real-time visibility with SQL/API/web services Ensure complete rollout of MES solutions to the shop floor','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-08-31 06:00:00',0,0,'2025-07-29 06:57:58.000000','2026-05-06 20:51:32.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"API Integration\", \"Configurations\", \"Deployment\", \"Mes Architect\", \"Operations Management\", \"SQL\", \"AVEVA MES\"]','[\"Opportunity to work with global manufacturers (BD/Nokian Tyres) Involvement in full-lifecycle MES projects Work on leading industrial digitalization technologies Competitive salary and project-based growth Direct collaboration with client&rsquo;s operations and engineering teams\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('7766d080-d31d-4bbc-be80-c49a4f0f94da','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Sales Professional (AMC / IT Services)','sales-professional-amc-it-services-120-120','&lt;p data-start=&quot;214&quot; data-end=&quot;424&quot;&gt;Looking for a motivated &lt;strong data-start=&quot;238&quot; data-end=&quot;267&quot;&gt;Sales Executive / Manager&lt;/strong&gt; with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;273&quot; data-end=&quot;299&quot;&gt;4+ years of experience&lt;/strong&gt; in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;303&quot; data-end=&quot;341&quot;&gt;Annual Maintenance Contracts (AMC)&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong data-start=&quot;343&quot; data-end=&quot;372&quot;&gt;Facility Management (FMS)&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong data-start=&quot;374&quot; data-end=&quot;385&quot;&gt;NOC/SOC&lt;/strong&gt;, and &lt;strong data-start=&quot;391&quot; data-end=&quot;421&quot;&gt;Techno-Commercial IT Sales&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;426&quot; data-end=&quot;446&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;429&quot; data-end=&quot;444&quot;&gt;Key Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\