r system customization, report development, and ensuring compliance with quality and regulatory standards.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;br /&gt;&amp;nbsp;Configure and customize LabWare LIMS as per client requirements&lt;br /&gt;&amp;nbsp;Develop and implement workflows, templates, and system functionalities&lt;br /&gt;&amp;nbsp;Design and generate LIMS reports and dashboards&lt;br /&gt;&amp;nbsp;Collaborate with business analysts and lab users to gather system requirements&lt;br /&gt;&amp;nbsp;Integrate LIMS with other lab instruments and enterprise systems&lt;br /&gt;&amp;nbsp;Perform unit testing, system validation, and troubleshooting&lt;br /&gt;&amp;nbsp;Create and maintain system documentation and SOPs&lt;br /&gt;&amp;nbsp;Provide support during system go-live and post-implementation&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Requirements:&lt;br /&gt;&amp;nbsp;5+ years of experience in LabWare LIMS&lt;br /&gt;&amp;nbsp;LabWare Certified Consultant preferred&lt;br /&gt;&amp;nbsp;Strong knowledge of LabWare configuration and scripting&lt;br /&gt;&amp;nbsp;Experience with report development and LIMS validation&lt;br /&gt;&amp;nbsp;Good understanding of regulatory requirements (GMP, GLP)&lt;br /&gt;&amp;nbsp;Excellent problem-solving and communication skills','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',700000.00,1200000.00,'₹',0,'India','Pune',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-19 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-05-31 11:02:12.000000','2025-11-21 06:28:15.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Lims\", \"LabWare LIMS\"]','[\"Competitive salary based on experience&lt;br /&gt;&amp;nbsp;Comprehensive health insurance coverage&lt;br /&gt;&amp;nbsp;Hybrid/Remote work flexibility (if applicable)&lt;br /&gt;&amp;nbsp;Ongoing training and certification support&lt;br /&gt;&amp;nbsp;Career growth opportunities within a global team&lt;br /&gt;&amp;nbsp;Performance-based incentives and bonuses&lt;br /&gt;&amp;nbsp;Supportive and collaborative work environment&lt;br /&gt;&amp;nbsp;Paid time off, holidays, and wellness initiatives\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Maharashtra'),('7803f2c4-3695-40aa-975f-3881acd821fb','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Vision Data Scientist','vision-data-scientist-224-224','1. Extensive Hands-on experience in Machine Learning model design, model training and optimization; especially CNN, RCNN, Faster RCNN, RL networks.&lt;br /&gt;2. Experience in defining solution architecture for training and model inference, choose models/algorithms, &lt;br /&gt;3. Exposure to Tensorflow, Caffe /TensorRT/ONNX &lt;br /&gt;4. Excellent coding skill in Python/Pytorch &lt;br /&gt;5. Exposure to OpenCV/Openvino&lt;br /&gt;6. Experience in multithreading will be added advantage&lt;br /&gt;7. Experience in mentoring team&lt;br /&gt;8. Exposure Gen AI &amp;amp; AI agent for vision (Azure open AI/ AWS Gen AI suite/ Nvidia NeMo) would be added advantage.','Information Technology','Contract','Entry',NULL,NULL,'INR',1,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-05-25 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-03-26 20:13:54.000000','2026-03-26 20:13:54.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Azure\", \"Azure  CLI\", \"IT Networking\", \"Python\", \"Generative AI\", \"PyTorch\", \"OpenCV\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;Competitive salary package with performance-based incentives&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;65&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;67&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;Health insurance coverage and statutory benefits (PF &amp;amp; Gratuity)&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;134&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;136&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on large-scale enterprise energy management projects&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;211&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-star