ion skills and the ability to work in a collaborative team environment.&lt;br /&gt;Comfortable working US overlapping hours (12 PM IST to 10 PM IST).&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;br /&gt;Exciting opportunities for career growth and skill development.&lt;br /&gt;Collaborative, inclusive, and dynamic work culture.&lt;br /&gt;Competitive compensation and benefits package.&lt;br /&gt;Ready to take your career to the next level?&lt;br /&gt;Apply now at &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:shashank@camzyinfotech.com&quot;&gt;shashank@camzyinfotech.com&lt;/a&gt; or share this opportunity with your network!','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',500000.00,2500000.00,'₹',0,'India','Pune',0,1,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-19 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-05-19 12:55:37.000000','2025-11-21 06:29:26.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Automation\", \"CAD\", \"REST API\", \"ServiceNow\", \"SLA Management\", \"SOAP\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary structure&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li&gt;Remote work flexibility (Pan India)&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to work on global projects and cutting-edge LIMS solutions&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li&gt;Fast-track career development in a high-demand domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li&gt;Supportive and collaborative work culture&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li&gt;Health insurance and paid time off&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li&gt;Continuous learning and internal upskilling opportunities&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Maharashtra'),('7842c8f9-d8f0-4a82-8312-19929518b8a8','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','AWS Architect / Lead','aws-architect-lead-266-266','Design scalable cloud architectures &lt;br /&gt;Lead AWS implementation &amp;amp; migration projects &lt;br /&gt;Ensure security &amp;amp; compliance standards&lt;br /&gt;Optimize cloud cost &amp;amp; performance &lt;br /&gt;Mentor technical teams &amp;amp; solve complex challenges','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Hy