grations&lt;/strong&gt;, while supporting enterprise-grade applications like &lt;strong data-start=&quot;573&quot; data-end=&quot;602&quot;&gt;SiGAC, Tririga, and ICHEM&lt;/strong&gt;. The role also requires strong troubleshooting skills, hands-on experience in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;681&quot; data-end=&quot;700&quot;&gt;CI/CD pipelines&lt;/strong&gt;, and working on &lt;strong data-start=&quot;717&quot; data-end=&quot;740&quot;&gt;integration testing&lt;/strong&gt; in a production environment.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;771&quot; data-end=&quot;960&quot;&gt;You will collaborate closely with cross-functional teams, understand complex business processes, and contribute to system integrations while ensuring smooth deployment and high performance.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;hr data-start=&quot;962&quot; data-end=&quot;965&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;967&quot; data-end=&quot;994&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Key Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;995&quot; data-end=&quot;1588&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;995&quot; data-end=&quot;1073&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;997&quot; data-end=&quot;1073&quot;&gt;Full Stack development across &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1027&quot; data-end=&quot;1071&quot;&gt;frontend, backend, and middleware layers&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1074&quot; data-end=&quot;1135&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1076&quot; data-end=&quot;1135&quot;&gt;Perform &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1084&quot; data-end=&quot;1133&quot;&gt;testing, CI/CD execution, and troubleshooting&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1136&quot; data-end=&quot;1221&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1138&quot; data-end=&quot;1221&quot;&gt;Support development and sustainment of &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1177&quot; data-end=&quot;1219&quot;&gt;SiGAC, Tririga, and ICHEM applications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1222&quot; data-end=&quot;1303&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1224&quot; data-end=&quot;1303&quot;&gt;Execute &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1232&quot; data-end=&quot;1258&quot;&gt;integration test cases&lt;/strong&gt;, identify defects, and fix issues promptly&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1304&quot; data-end=&quot;1359&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1306&quot; data-end=&quot;1359&quot;&gt;Work on &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1314&quot; data-end=&quot;1357&quot;&gt;API development and APIGEE integrations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1360&quot; data-end=&quot;1452&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1362&quot; data-end=&quot;1452&quot;&gt;Gain understanding of &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1384&quot; data-end=&quot;1450&quot;&gt;third-party tools, business workflows, and system integrations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1453&quot; data-end=&quot;1514&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1455&quot; data-end=&quot;1514&quot;&gt;Apply strong &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1468&quot; data-end=&quot;1512&quot;&gt;analytical and production support skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1515&quot; data-end=&quot;1588&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1517&quot; data-end=&quot;1588&quot;&gt;Maintain clear &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1532&quot; data-end=&quot;1568&quot;&gt;verbal and written communication&lt;/strong&gt; with stakeholders&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Full-time','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-02-06 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-12-08 15:58:48.000000','2025-12-08 15:58:48.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"API Integration\", \"AWS\", \"Docker\", \"Integration\", \"JavaScript\", \"Kubernetes\", \"Node.JS\", \"Oracle\", \"PL/SQL\", \"React JS\", \"RESTFUL\", \"Typescript\", \"CI/CD\", \"Azure Cloud Ecosystem\", \"CaaS\", \"APIGEE\", \"SiGAC\", \"Tririga\", \"ICHEM\"]','[\"&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2251&quot; data-end=&quot;2630&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2251&quot; data-end=&quot;2281&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2253&quot; data-end=&quot;2281&quot;&gt;Competitive salary package&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2282&quot; data-end=&quot;2352&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2284&quot; data-end=&quot;2352&quot;&gt;Exposure to &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2296&quot; data-end=&quot;2350&quot;&gt;enterprise-level applications &amp;amp; cloud technologies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2353&quot; data-end=&quot;2433&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2355&quot; data-end=&quot;2433&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2378&quot; data-end=&quot;2431&quot;&gt;modern Full Stack &amp;amp; container-based architectures&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2434&quot; data-end=&quot;2494&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2436&quot; data-end=&quot;2494&quot;&gt;Career growth with advanced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2464&quot; data-end=&quot;2492&quot;&gt;DevOps &amp;amp; CI/CD practices&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2495&quot; data-end=&quot;2547&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2497&quot; data-end=&quot;2547&quot;&gt;Professional learning &amp;amp; upskilling opportunities&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2548&quot; data-end=&quot;2589&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2550&quot; data-end=&quot;2589&quot;&gt;Work with experienced technical teams&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2590&quot; data-end=&quot;2630&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2592&quot; data-end=&quot;2630&quot;&gt;Stable long-term project environment&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('78e66857-dd1a-42c2-84fe-b9419a5df9a6','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Instrumentation Engineer / Instrumentation Lead','instrumentation-engineer-instrumentation-lead-366-366','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;85&quot; data-end=&quot;369&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;111&quot; data-end=&quot;164&quot;&gt;Instrumentation Engineers / Instrumentation Leads&lt;/strong&gt; for a leading MNC in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;186&quot; data-end=&quot;194&quot;&gt;Pune&lt;/strong&gt;. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;248&quot; data-end=&quot;368&quot;&gt;industrial instrumentation, sensors, control systems, wireless communication, IoT platforms, and field commissioning&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;371&quot; data-end=&quot;694&quot;&gt;The role involves working on sensor-based industrial solutions, understanding customer requirements, selecting appropriate instrumentation and communication technologies, and supporting the complete lifecycle from &lt;strong data-start=&quot;585&quot; data-end=&quot;693&quot;&gt;sensor configuration and testing to installation, commissioning, onboarding, and IoT platform monitoring&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;696&quot; data-end=&quot;1012&quot;&gt;Candidates should have hands-on knowledge of &lt;strong data-start=&quot;741&quot; data-end=&quot;874&quot;&gt;P&amp;amp;IDs, PFDs, hook-up drawings, loop wiring, control panels, sensor communication, LoRaWAN, gateways, and industrial IoT platforms&lt;/strong&gt;. Lead-level candidates will additionally be responsible for technical guidance, customer coordination, and project management activities.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-23 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-08-25 02:35:54.000000','2026-08-25 02:35:54.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Access Control Systems\", \"Sensors\", \"Industrial IoT (IIoT)\", \"Industrial Instrumentation\", \"Sensors & Sens