ashtra'),('79940480-54a9-40ee-9bf8-0641d8c98b28','e4fcc22e-b28e-4b81-9457-c8fd7a1a3a64','f2ca2973-f7d7-4cae-9c41-82d067af0ad7','Account Executive','account-executive-172-172','Identify and prospect new business opportunities through outbound and inbound channels&lt;br /&gt;Manage the complete sales cycle: discovery, presentation, negotiation, and closure&lt;br /&gt;Build and maintain strong relationships with clients and key decision-makers&lt;br /&gt;Understand client needs and propose suitable solutions/products&lt;br /&gt;Meet or exceed monthly and quarterly sales targets&lt;br /&gt;Maintain accurate records of sales activities in CRM tools&lt;br /&gt;Collaborate with marketing, product, and customer success teams&lt;br /&gt;Prepare sales reports, forecasts, and pipeline updates&lt;br /&gt;Upsell and cross-sell products/services to existing customers','Finance','Contract','Entry',15000.00,25000.00,'₹',1,'India','Ahmedabad',0,1,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-08-31 06:00:00',0,0,'2025-12-18 22:16:26.000000','2026-05-04 00:15:28.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Accounting\"]','[\"Collaborate with marketing, product, and customer success teams\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Gujarat'),('79b98a53-f3d6-4797-8fc7-0262caa90b48','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Ortems Specialist','ortems-specialist-115-115','We are hiring an Ortems Specialist responsible for designing, configuring, and integrating Ortems scheduling environments with Apriso MES and related systems. The role involves planning, implementation, infrastructure coordination, and cross-functional stakeholder engagement to ensure optimal scheduling performance and integration with enterprise systems.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Design and configure Ortems scheduling architecture and ensure seamless integration with Apriso MES.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Determine SQL environment setup (shared/dedicated) based on performance and partitioning needs.&lt;b