&gt;large-scale manufacturing transformation and MES implementation projects&lt;/strong&gt;. The ideal candidate will have strong expertise in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;436&quot; data-end=&quot;471&quot;&gt;Critical Manufacturing (CM) MES&lt;/strong&gt;, with hands-on experience in modeling, implementation, and client interaction.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;4fjve3&quot; data-start=&quot;552&quot; data-end=&quot;585&quot;&gt;&lt;span role=&quot;text&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;559&quot; data-end=&quot;583&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;586&quot; data-end=&quot;1228&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;f4fjl1&quot; data-start=&quot;586&quot; data-end=&quot;674&quot;&gt;Design, configure, and implement &lt;strong data-start=&quot;621&quot; data-end=&quot;672&quot;&gt;MES solutions using Critical Manufacturing (CM)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;bb56mh&quot; data-start=&quot;675&quot; data-end=&quot;749&quot;&gt;Work on &lt;strong data-start=&quot;685&quot; data-end=&quot;747&quot;&gt;end-to-end MES implementations, rollouts, and enhancements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;5p7mhm&quot; data-start=&quot;750&quot; data-end=&quot;839&quot;&gt;Perform &lt;strong data-start=&quot;760&quot; data-end=&quot;813&quot;&gt;system modeling, configuration, and customization&lt;/strong&gt; based on business needs&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;qtyftx&quot; data-start=&quot;840&quot; data-end=&quot;917&quot;&gt;Collaborate with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;859&quot; data-end=&quot;915&quot;&gt;clients, stakeholders, and global teams (US &amp;amp; India)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;pcq9fz&quot; data-start=&quot;918&quot; data-end=&quot;995&quot;&gt;Analyze manufacturing processes and translate them into &lt;strong data-start=&quot;976&quot; data-end=&quot;993&quot;&gt;MES workflows&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1tspswf&quot; data-start=&quot;996&quot; data-end=&quot;1067&quot;&gt;Support &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1006&quot; data-end=&quot;1065&quot;&gt;testing, deployment, and post-implementation activities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1k1qxac&quot; data-start=&quot;1068&quot; data-end=&quot;1140&quot;&gt;Ensure alignment with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1092&quot; data-end=&quot;1138&quot;&gt;manufacturing standards and best practices&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;183vv1p&quot; data-start=&quot;1141&quot; data-end=&quot;1228&quot;&gt;Act as a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1152&quot; data-end=&quot;1177&quot;&gt;functional consultant&lt;/strong&gt; for client discussions and requirement gathering&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;hr data-start=&quot;1230&quot; data-end=&quot;1233&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;e36knw&quot; data-start=&quot;1235&quot; data-end=&quot;1263&quot;&gt;&lt;span role=&quot;text&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1242&quot; data-end=&quot;1261&quot;&gt;Required Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;qoxvh2&quot; data-start=&quot;1265&quot; data-end=&quot;1293&quot;&gt;&lt;span role=&quot;text&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1271&quot; data-end=&quot;1291&quot;&gt;Mandatory Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1294&quot; data-end=&quot;1758&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;7mu20o&quot; data-start=&quot;1294&quot; data-end=&quot;1360&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1296&quot; data-end=&quot;1358&quot;&gt;CM Professional Certified Modeler (Critical Manufacturing)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1gsuua0&quot; data-start=&quot;1361&quot; data-end=&quot;1421&quot;&gt;5&amp;ndash;8+ years of experience in the &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1395&quot; data-end=&quot;1419&quot;&gt;Manufacturing domain&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1cuga6c&quot; data-start=&quot;1422&quot; data-end=&quot;1493&quot;&gt;Minimum 2+ years of experience in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1458&quot; data-end=&quot;1491&quot;&gt;MES implementation &amp;amp; rollouts&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1nb5hfr&quot; data-start=&quot;1494&quot; data-end=&quot;1562&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1521&quot; data-end=&quot;1560&quot;&gt;Critical Manufacturing MES platform&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;npniv9&quot; data-start=&quot;1563&quot; data-end=&quot;1643&quot;&gt;Strong understanding of &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1589&quot; data-end=&quot;1641&quot;&gt;MES concepts, workflows, and system architecture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;194cwid&quot; data-start=&quot;1644&quot; data-end=&quot;1700&quot;&gt;Excellent &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1656&quot; data-end=&quot;1698&quot;&gt;communication and client-facing skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1b18gii&quot; data-start=&quot;1701&quot; data-end=&quot;1758&quot;&gt;Experience working with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1727&quot; data-end=&quot;1756&quot;&gt;global teams (US &amp;amp; India)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;17kbv01&quot; data-start=&quot;1760&quot; data-end=&quot;1784&quot;&gt;&lt;span role=&quot;text&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1766&quot; data-end=&quot;1782&quot;&gt;Good to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1785&quot; data-end=&quot;2083&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;18zfk7u&quot; data-start=&quot;1785&quot; data-end=&quot;1865&quot;&gt;Certification: &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1802&quot; data-end=&quot;1863&quot;&gt;Critical Manufacturing Professional / Associate &amp;ndash; Modeler&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;ke0a3t&quot; data-start=&quot;1866&quot; data-end=&quot;1932&quot;&gt;Exposure to &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1880&quot; data-end=&quot;1930&quot;&gt;Industry 4.0 / Smart Manufacturing initiatives&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1x94tbr&quot; data-start=&quot;1933&quot; data-end=&quot;2002&quot;&gt;Knowledge of &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1948&quot; data-end=&quot;2000&quot;&gt;integration with ERP systems (SAP, Oracle, etc.)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;uw6we7&quot; data-start=&quot;2003&quot; data-end=&quot;2083&quot;&gt;Experience in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2019&quot; data-end=&quot;2081&quot;&gt;semiconductor / electronics / pharma manufacturing domains&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-06-16 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-04-18 04:33:42.000000','2026-04-18 04:33:42.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Business Critical System Monitoring\", \"Manufacturing\", \"Mes\"]','[\"&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2112&quot; data-end=&quot;2512&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1nu2mfj&quot; data-start=&quot;2112&quot; data-end=&quot;2197&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2141&quot; data-end=&quot;2195&quot;&gt;Top MNC on high-impact MES transformation projects&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ake9qn&quot; data-start=&quot;2198&quot; data-end=&quot;2278&quot;&gt;Exposure to &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2212&quot; data-end=&quot;2276&quot;&gt;global manufacturing environments and advanced MES platforms&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1vmrsxu&quot; data-start=&quot;2279&quot; data-end=&quot;2345&quot;&gt;Work with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2291&quot; data-end=&quot;2343&quot;&gt;international clients and cross-functional teams&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1yryykw&quot; data-start=&quot;2346&quot; data-end=&quot;2400&quot;&gt;Strong career growth in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2372&quot; data-end=&quot;2398&quot;&gt;high-demand MES domain&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1dfgu9y&quot; data-start=&quot;2401&quot; data-end=&quot;2445&quot;&gt;Opportunities for &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2421&quot; data-end=&quot;2443&quot;&gt;onsite assignments&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;by3mnq&quot; data-start=&quot;2446&quot; data-end=&quot;2512&quot;&gt;Competitive compensation and continuous learning opportunities&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('7b607372-b9f7-4f17-a2a4-a4409e5d8101','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Data Analyst','data-analyst-16-16','Job Description: We are seeking an experienced and detail-oriented Data Analyst with 5+ years of hands-on experience to join our team. The ideal candidate will be responsible for analyzing large datasets, generating insights, and creating data visualizations to support business decisions. You will collaborate with cross-functional teams to develop reports, identify trends, and improve data-driven strategies. Key Responsibilities: Collect, clean, and analyze large and complex datasets from multiple sources. Develop and maintain data models, dashboards, and reports using tools like Power BI, Tableau, or Excel. Use SQL to extract, manipulate, and analyze data from relational databases. Perform data validation and quality checks to ensure accuracy and consistency. Identify trends, patterns, and correlations in data to provide actionable insights. Collaborate with stakeholders to define data requirements and develop analytical solutions. Design and implement data visualizations to present complex information clearly. Support ad-hoc data analysis requests from business teams. Automate and streamline data extraction and reporting processes. Ensure data security, privacy, and compliance with organizational standards. Document data sources, processes, and methodologies. Required Skills: 5+ years of experience as a Data Analyst or in a similar role. Strong proficiency in SQL for data extraction and manipulation. Hands-on experience with data visualization tools (Power BI, Tableau, QlikView, or Looker). Proficiency in Excel (pivot tables, VLOOKUP, and advanced formulas). Experience with ETL processes and data cleansing techniques. Strong analytical and problem-solving skills. Familiarity with statistical analysis and data modeling. Ability to interpret complex data sets and provide meaningful insights. Knowledge of data governance and privacy regulations. Excellent communication skills with the ability to present findings effectively.','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',300000.00,600000.00,'₹',1,'India','Mumbai',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2025-07-03 18:30:00',0,0,'2025-05-04 20:52:58.000000','2025-05-04 20:52:58.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Analytical Skill\", \"Big Data\", \"Data Analysis\", \"Data Analyst\", \"ETL\", \"ETL Processes\", \"MS SQL Server\", \"MYSQL\", \"Pivot\", \"Pivot Tables\", \"SQL\", \"VLOOKUP\"]','[\"Competitive salary and performance-based bonuses. Health insurance and paid time off. Flexible work hours and remote/hybrid options. Professional development and training opportunities. Collaborative and growth-oriented work environment.\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Maharashtra'),('7b8990eb-0aa6-408a-a694-6dd6f6a5785b','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','OBIEE / OAS Report Developer','obiee-oas-report-developer-291-291','&lt;p data-start=&quot;70&quot; data-end=&quot;434&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced OBIEE / OAS Report Developers for a leading Top MNC to work on enterprise-scale Business Intelligence, Analytics, and Reporting solutions. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in Oracle Business Intelligence Enterprise Edition (OBIEE), Oracle Analytics Server (OAS), dashboard development, and data visualization technologies.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;436&quot; data-end=&quot;750&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for designing, developing, and maintaining enterprise reporting solutions using OBIEE and OAS platforms. The role includes creating dashboards, reports, BI Publisher solutions, RPD development, and implementing scalable analytics architectures to support business decision-making.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;752&quot; data-end=&quot;1094&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience in RPD development across Physical, Business Model &amp;amp; Mapping (BMM), and Presentation layers, along with strong SQL query writing and optimization skills. Experience with OAS/OBIEE migration, upgrade projects, security configuration, performance tuning, and production support is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1096&quot; data-end=&quot;1453&quot;&gt;The role also involves troubleshooting reporting issues, optimizing analytics performance, implementing data-level security, collaborating with business stakeholders, and supporting enterprise BI initiatives. Candidates should possess strong analytical, problem-solving, and communication skills with the ability to deliver high-quality reporting solutions.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Hyderabad',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-08-08 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-06-10 02:40:13.000000','2026-06-10 02:40:13.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Oracle WMS\", \"Performance Tracking\", \"SQL\", \"ITIL framework\", \"OBIEE 11g/12c\", \"Oracle Analytics Server (OAS)\", \"RPD Development\", \"BI Publisher Reports\", \"OAS Migration\", \"OBIEE Migration\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1469&quot; data-end=&quot;1507&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ria9io&quot; data-start=&quot;1508&quot; data-end=&quot;1566&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale BI and Analytics projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;2u04qe&quot; data-start=&quot;1567&quot; data-end=&quot;1617&quot;&gt;Work on advanced Oracle Analytics technologies&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;wvbkj3&quot; data-start=&quot;1618&quot; data-end=&quot;1684&quot;&gt;Career growth in Business Intelligence &amp;amp; Data Analytics domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;182irwx&quot; data-start=&quot;1685&quot; data-end=&quot;1756&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global business and technical teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot; data-start=&quot;1757&quot; data-end=&quot;1812&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;1813&quot; data-end=&quot;1856&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Telangana'),('7cc907a2-d5f7-4054-bd02-5a3dfafb2ddd','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Senior Business Development Manager','senior-business-development-manager-4-4','Senior Business Development Manager','Management','Contract','Mid',150000.00,200000.00,'₹',1,'India','Kurnool',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2025-07-02 18:30:00',0,0,'2025-05-04 16:33:08.000000','2025-05-04 16:33:08.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Classified\", \"Commercial Photography\", \"Control Framework\"]','[]','No Preference',1,5,'Andhra Pradesh'),('7cd2ce9e-33e0-4204-97da-80949bf984f2','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','MES Developer / Connect IoT Expert','mes-developer-connect-iot-expert-379-379','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;222&quot; data-end=&quot;469&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;248&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot;&gt;MES Developers / Equipment Integration / Connect IoT Experts&lt;/strong&gt; for a leading Top MNC to work on advanced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;355&quot; data-end=&quot;459&quot;&gt;Manufacturing Execution Systems (MES), Industrial IoT, Factory Automation, and Equipment Integration&lt;/strong&gt; projects.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;471&quot; data-end=&quot;773&quot;&gt;The ideal candidate should have &lt;strong data-start=&quot;503&quot; data-end=&quot;537&quot;&gt;8+ years of overall experience&lt;/strong&gt;, including at least &lt;strong data-start=&quot;558&quot; data-end=&quot;649&quot;&gt;4+ years of hands-on experience in Equipment Integration and Critical Manufacturing MES&lt;/strong&gt;. Strong expertise in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;671&quot; data-end=&quot;760&quot;&gt;C#/.NET Core, SQL/T-SQL, OOP, MES development, and industrial communication protocols&lt;/strong&gt; is required.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;775&quot; data-end=&quot;1036&quot;&gt;The role involves developing and customizing MES applications across backend and frontend layers, integrating manufacturing equipment with MES platforms, and implementing reliable communication using &lt;strong data-start=&quot;975&quot; data-end=&quot;1035&quot;&gt;OPC, SECS/GEM, HSMS, MQTT, RS-232, FTP, APIs, and TCP/IP&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1038&quot; data-end=&quot;1365&quot;&gt;The candidate will work closely with manufacturing, automation, engineering, and IT teams to design and implement scalable &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1161&quot; data-end=&quot;1197&quot;&gt;MES and Industrial IoT solutions&lt;/strong&gt;. Responsibilities include equipment connectivity, MES customization, application development, integration troubleshooting, testing, deployment, and production support.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-31 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-09-02 02:18:03.000000','2026-09-02 02:18:03.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\".NET CORE\", \"Angular\", \"C#\", \"Equipment\", \"Mes\", \"OOPS\", \"REST API\", \"SQL\", \"TCP\", \"Transact-SQL\", \"OPC UA\", \"SECS/GEM Standards\", \"MQTT\", \"Factory Automation\", \"Industrial IoT (IIoT)\", \"Critical Manufacturing\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;i3mxm7&quot; data-start=&quot;1654&quot; data-end=&quot;1698&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a leading Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;ipo660&quot; data-start=&quot;1699&quot; data-end=&quot;1766&quot;&gt;Exposure to global MES and Industrial IoT transformation programs&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;t9ag3w&quot; data-start=&quot;1767&quot; data-end=&quot;1826&quot;&gt;Work on advanced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1786&quot; data-end=&quot;1816&quot;&gt;Critical Manufacturing MES&lt;/strong&gt; solutions&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;105f6c&quot; data-start=&quot;1827&quot; data-end=&quot;1898&quot;&gt;Exposure to Factory Automation and Equipment Integration technologies&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;161hf50&quot; data-start=&quot;1899&quot; data-end=&quot;2001&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1926&quot; data-end=&quot;2001&quot;&gt;OPC, SECS/GEM, HSMS, MQTT, APIs, and industrial communication protocols&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;qp5sse&quot; data-start=&quot;2002&quot; data-end=&quot;2080&quot;&gt;International customer interaction and potential Sweden travel opportunities&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;7xcjm3&quot; data-start=&quot;2081&quot; data-end=&quot;2173&quot;&gt;Exposure to modern technologies across &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2122&quot; data-end=&quot;2173&quot;&gt;MES, IoT, automation, and digital manufacturing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;19sv6p0&quot; data-start=&quot;2174&quot; data-end=&quot;2233&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on large-scale manufacturing projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('7cf22c52-43ba-46a2-902e-de75ebe3e215','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','LIMS Support Engineer','lims-support-engineer-166-166','&lt;p data-start=&quot;182&quot; data-end=&quot;730&quot;&gt;We are seeking a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;199&quot; data-end=&quot;224&quot;&gt;LIMS Support Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; with 4&amp;ndash;6 years of experience to provide technical support, configuration, and enhancement for LIMS applications. The ideal candidate should have hands-on experience with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;395&quot; data-end=&quot;416&quot;&gt;any LIMS platform&lt;/strong&gt;, strong understanding of &lt;strong data-start=&quot;442&quot; data-end=&quot;460&quot;&gt;ITIL processes&lt;/strong&gt;, and the ability to work closely with cross-functional teams to ensure smooth lab operations.&lt;br data-start=&quot;554&quot; data-end=&quot;557&quot; /&gt;You will be responsible for troubleshooting issues, performing system changes, managing workflows, training users, and ensuring system stability for production environments.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;hr data-start=&quot;732&quot; data-end=&quot;735&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;737&quot; data-end=&quot;766&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;742&quot; data-end=&quot;766&quot;&gt;Job Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;767&quot; data-end=&quot;1359&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;767&quot; data-end=&quot;865&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;769&quot; data-end=&quot;865&quot;&gt;Provide technical support and issue resolution for LIMS users across different business units.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;866&quot; data-end=&quot;958&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;868&quot; data-end=&quot;958&quot;&gt;Perform &lt;strong data-start=&quot;876&quot; data-end=&quot;931&quot;&gt;LIMS configuration, customization, and enhancements&lt;/strong&gt; as per lab requirements.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;959&quot; data-end=&quot;1065&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;961&quot; data-end=&quot;1065&quot;&gt;Manage and implement &lt;strong data-start=&quot;982&quot; data-end=&quot;1001&quot;&gt;change requests&lt;/strong&gt; including scripting, workflow updates, and system validation.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1066&quot; data-end=&quot;1165&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1068&quot; data-end=&quot;1165&quot;&gt;Perform &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1076&quot; data-end=&quot;1128&quot;&gt;system testing, user training, and documentation&lt;/strong&gt; based on change control processes.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1166&quot; data-end=&quot;1275&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1168&quot; data-end=&quot;1275&quot;&gt;Collaborate with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1185&quot; data-end=&quot;1217&quot;&gt;IT, QA, and Scientific teams&lt;/strong&gt; to gather requirements and deliver effective solutions.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1276&quot; data-end=&quot;1359&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1278&quot; data-end=&quot;1359&quot;&gt;Work as part of the &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1298&quot; data-end=&quot;1325&quot;&gt;production support team&lt;/strong&gt;, following ITIL best practices.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Full-time','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-02-09 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-12-11 15:13:42.000000','2025-12-11 15:13:42.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\".NET\", \"C#\", \"Configurations\", \"ITIL\", \"Lims\", \"Scripting\", \"SQL\", \"Troubleshooting\", \"Validation\", \"Workflows\"]','[\"&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1947&quot; data-end=&quot;2281&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1947&quot; data-end=&quot;1977&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1949&quot; data-end=&quot;1977&quot;&gt;Competitive salary package&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1978&quot; data-end=&quot;2020&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1980&quot; data-end=&quot;2020&quot;&gt;Health insurance and wellness benefits&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2021&quot; data-end=&quot;2081&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2023&quot; data-end=&quot;2081&quot;&gt;Opportunities to work with cross-functional global teams&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2082&quot; data-end=&quot;2140&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2084&quot; data-end=&quot;2140&quot;&gt;Professional growth in LIMS and lab informatics domain&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2141&quot; data-end=&quot;2204&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2143&quot; data-end=&quot;2204&quot;&gt;Work-life balance and hybrid work model (company dependent)&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2205&quot; data-end=&quot;2281&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2207&quot; data-end=&quot;2281&quot;&gt;Exposure to LIMS enhancements, support, integrations, and ITIL processes&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('7d13f6bb-5238-4f4a-b910-7aa64e396851','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','CDS (Chromatography Data System) Developer','cds-chromatography-data-system-developer-292-292','&lt;p data-start=&quot;84&quot; data-end=&quot;425&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced CDS (Chromatography Data System) Developers for a leading Top MNC to work on enterprise laboratory informatics and pharmaceutical digital transformation projects. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in CDS platforms, laboratory workflows, system integrations, and regulated pharmaceutical environments.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;427&quot; data-end=&quot;785&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for configuring, customizing, developing, and supporting Chromatography Data Systems such as Waters Empower, Agilent OpenLab, and Thermo Chromeleon. The role includes developing chromatography methods, processing methods, report templates, and workflow solutions to support laboratory operations and compliance requirements.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;787&quot; data-end=&quot;1087&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with CDS integrations, SQL scripting, database management, system optimization, and troubleshooting instrument-to-CDS communication issues. Strong knowledge of LIMS, ELN integrations, laboratory systems, and data management practices is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1089&quot; data-end=&quot;1425&quot;&gt;The role also involves supporting validation activities, ensuring compliance with GxP, 21 CFR Part 11, and ALCOA+ requirements, collaborating with laboratory users and stakeholders, and maintaining system performance and reliability. Candidates should possess strong analytical, communication, documentation, and problem-solving skills.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-08-08 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-06-10 02:52:05.000000','2026-06-10 02:52:05.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"CSV\", \"Gxp Compliance\", \"SQL Query Optimization\", \"SQL Server\", \"21 CFR Part 11\", \"Waters Empower\", \"Agilent OpenLab\", \"Thermo Chromeleon\", \"Chromatography Data Systems (CDS)\", \"CDS Configuration\", \"LIMS Integration\", \"ELN Integration\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1441&quot; data-end=&quot;1479&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;h0w714&quot; data-start=&quot;1480&quot; data-end=&quot;1544&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale laboratory informatics projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;qjk558&quot; data-start=&quot;1545&quot; data-end=&quot;1621&quot;&gt;Work on advanced Chromatography Data Systems and laboratory technologies&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1mv2qqd&quot; data-start=&quot;1622&quot; data-end=&quot;1688&quot;&gt;Career growth in Pharmaceutical IT &amp;amp; Laboratory Systems domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;7vdbhd&quot; data-start=&quot;1689&quot; data-end=&quot;1761&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global laboratory and business teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot; data-start=&quot;1762&quot; data-end=&quot;1817&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;1818&quot; data-end=&quot;1861&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('7e4b5cf8-c581-4d7a-ac94-041d7d6f0523','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','IFIX SCADA Consultant','ifix-scada-consultant-167-167','We are seeking an experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;199&quot; data-end=&quot;224&quot;&gt;IFIX SCADA Consultant&lt;/strong&gt; with strong expertise in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;250&quot; data-end=&quot;265&quot;&gt;GE iFIX 6.5&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong data-start=&quot;267&quot; data-end=&quot;281&quot;&gt;GE IGS 7.8&lt;/strong&gt;, and industrial automation systems. The role involves providing &lt;strong data-start=&quot;346&quot; data-end=&quot;365&quot;&gt;L2 &amp;amp; L3 support&lt;/strong&gt;, troubleshooting SCADA issues, performing system updates, handling server patching, and coordinating with key users and external vendors. The consultant will work on support, monitoring, development, and shutdown activities related to iFIX SCADA environments.','Information Technology','Full-time','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Hyderabad',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-02-09 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-12-11 15:25:17.000000','2025-12-11 15:25:17.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"PLC\", \"SCADA\", \"GE iFIX\", \"IGS OPC\", \"Historian Server\", \"L2/L3 Support\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;754&quot; data-end=&quot;796&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;756&quot; data-end=&quot;796&quot;&gt;Competitive salary based on experience&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;797&quot; data-end=&quot;836&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;799&quot; data-end=&quot;836&quot;&gt;Health insurance &amp;amp; medical coverage&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;837&quot; data-end=&quot;876&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;839&quot; data-end=&quot;876&quot;&gt;PF/ESI and other statutory benefits&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;877&quot; data-end=&quot;961&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;879&quot; data-end=&quot;961&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on GE SCADA systems in a fast-growing industrial environment&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;962&quot; data-end=&quot;1046&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;964&quot; data-end=&quot;1046&quot;&gt;Skill enhancement through hands-on exposure to SCADA, OPC, and Historian servers&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1047&quot; data-end=&quot;1117&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1049&quot; data-end=&quot;1117&quot;&gt;Work with cross-functional teams and industrial automation experts&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Telangana'),('7e6e8f5a-5f3f-423d-99cc-d7c2c8d3419f','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Android Developer (Fresher)','android-developer-fresher-321-321','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;69&quot; data-end=&quot;436&quot;&gt;We are hiring passionate Android Developers (Freshers) for a leading Top MNC to work on innovative mobile application development projects. This is an excellent opportunity for recent graduates who are eager to build high-quality Android applications, learn modern mobile technologies, and kickstart their careers in a collaborative and technology-driven environment.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;438&quot; data-end=&quot;787&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for developing, testing, maintaining, and enhancing Android applications under the guidance of experienced developers. The role includes implementing user-friendly interfaces, integrating REST APIs, debugging applications, optimizing performance, and ensuring high-quality mobile experiences across Android devices.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;789&quot; data-end=&quot;1115&quot;&gt;Professionals should have a good understanding of Java and/or Kotlin, Android Studio, Android SDK, XML-based UI development, REST APIs, JSON, SQLite or Room Database, and Git version control. Familiarity with Material Design principles, Android application lifecycle, and software development fundamentals is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1117&quot; data-end=&quot;1460&quot;&gt;The role also involves collaborating with UI/UX designers, backend developers, QA teams, and senior engineers to deliver scalable and reliable mobile applications. Candidates should possess strong analytical thinking, problem-solving abilities, communication skills, and a willingness to learn emerging Android technologies and best practices.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Entry',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-08-30 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-07-02 02:50:29.000000','2026-07-02 02:50:29.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Android SDK\", \"Debugging Skills\", \"Git Version Control\", \"Github\", \"Java\", \"JSON\", \"KOTLIN\", \"REST API\", \"SQLITE\", \"XML\", \"Android Development\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;hbysa9&quot; data-start=&quot;1476&quot; data-end=&quot;1527&quot;&gt;Opportunity to start your career with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;ti6lmy&quot; data-start=&quot;1528&quot; data-end=&quot;1597&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience in enterprise Android application development&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1nbjvso&quot; data-start=&quot;1598&quot; data-end=&quot;1666&quot;&gt;Learn from experienced mobile application developers and mentors&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;98nsl0&quot; data-start=&quot;1667&quot; data-end=&quot;1736&quot;&gt;Exposure to modern Android technologies and development practices&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;czxgvp&quot; data-start=&quot;1737&quot; data-end=&quot;1788&quot;&gt;Career growth in Mobile Application Development&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;vfuj5t&quot; data-start=&quot;1789&quot; data-end=&quot;1840&quot;&gt;Professional and collaborative work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ea1g5y&quot; data-start=&quot;1841&quot; data-end=&quot;1885&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and employee benefits&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;8fiq87&quot; data-start=&quot;1886&quot; data-end=&quot;1945&quot;&gt;Continuous learning and skill development opportunities&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('7e869cec-8b94-4e62-8ed6-1ded5e753b58','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Senior Business Development Manager','senior-business-development-manager-4-4','Senior Business Development Manager','Management','Contract','Mid',150000.00,200000.00,'₹',1,'India','Kurnool',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2025-07-02 18:30:00',0,0,'2025-05-04 16:33:08.000000','2025-05-04 16:33:08.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Classified\", \"Commercial Photography\", \"Control Framework\"]','[]','No Preference',1,5,'Andhra Pradesh'),('7ec51784-a2e8-49ec-b2a1-1c41b1d56c94','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Senior Software Engineer - Node.js | AWS | Microservices','senior-software-engineer-nodejs-aws-microservices-88-88','We are looking for a Senior Software Engineer with strong experience in building scalable backend services and architecting highly available web applications. You&#039;ll work with cross-functional teams, contribute to architectural decisions, and play a key role in developing APIs and backend services in a cloud-native environment.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;The ideal candidate will have hands-on expertise in Node.js, TypeScript, AWS, and cloud infrastructure automation, and will contribute to designing solutions that scale across enterprise systems and integrate with third-party SaaS platforms.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;You&rsquo;ll also mentor junior and mid-level engineers while aligning with business goals and collaborating with product management and API producers.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Architect and develop scalable web applications and APIs&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Collaborate with internal product and external API teams&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Align with product strategy and lead backend engineering decisions&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Mentor junior and mid-level developers&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Drive cloud-native development using AWS services and infrastructure-as-code&lt;br /&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Required Skills &amp;amp; Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;10+ years of experience in backend development with solid data model design&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Strong proficiency with Node.js (ExpressJS, NestJS)&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Familiarity with ReactJS for frontend tasks&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Expertise in TypeScript, ORM tools like Prisma.io, Sequelize, or TypeORM&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Solid knowledge of SQL (MySQL, PostgreSQL) and NoSQL (DynamoDB, Redis)&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Hands-on with AWS cloud services (Lambda, ECR, API Gateway, VPCs, IAM, Terraform)&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Experience with Kafka, Confluent, Kinesis for event-based systems&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Understanding of API security, infrastructure setup, and cloud automation&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Integration experience with third-party SaaS platforms','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-30 06:00:00',0,0,'2025-08-01 14:40:34.000000','2026-05-06 20:52:30.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"API\", \"API Gateway\", \"Architecture\", \"AWS\", \"AWS Lambda\", \"Backend\", \"Backend Development\", \"Cloud\", \"Developer APIs\", \"DynamoDB\", \"Express.js\", \"Infrastructure\", \"Integrations\", \"Kafka\", \"Kinesis\", \"Microservices\", \"MYSQL\", \"Node JS\", \"PostgreSQL\", \"React JS\", \"Redis Cache\", \"SAAS\", \"Sequential\", \"TerraForm\", \"Typescript\"]','[\"Remote Work Flexibility&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Work with Modern Tech Stack &amp;amp; Cloud Infrastructure&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Collaborative &amp;amp; Growth-Oriented Environment&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Opportunities to Mentor and Lead Engineering Efforts\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('7ed497f8-acf2-4757-9f28-76a6c7ad19a0','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Business Development - IT Infrastructure Specialist','business-development-it-infrastructure-specialist-80-80','&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a results-driven Business Development Specialist with 5+ years of experience in IT Infrastructure Sales. The ideal candidate will be responsible for generating leads, closing enterprise-level deals, managing client relationships, and driving revenue growth in cloud services, networking, storage, and datacenter solutions across Delhi and nearby regions. This is a full-time opportunity with a leading IT System Integrator.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',1500000.00,2000000.00,'₹',1,'India','New Delhi',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-19 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-07-17 08:51:27.000000','2025-11-21 04:47:09.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Cisco Routers\", \"Client Acquisition\", \"Cloud Infrastructure\", \"Cloud Sales\", \"Data Center\", \"Enterprise\", \"Firewalls\", \"IT Infrastructure\", \"IT Networking\", \"Switches\"]','[\"Competitive Salary + Performance-Based Incentives&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Opportunity to work with a reputed IT solutions provider&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Leadership and team management responsibilities&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Exposure to enterprise and government clients&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Career growth in high-demand IT Infrastructure industry&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Product and technology training from global OEMs&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Collaborative and growth-driven work culture\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Delhi'),('7edf381f-679e-4abb-bfb3-98a21f4501a4','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Factory Automation Engineer - SECS/GEM MES','factory-automation-engineer-secsgem-mes-58-58','We are seeking a highly skilled Factory Automation - SECS/GEM MES Engineer with expertise in semiconductor manufacturing processes. The ideal candidate will have in-depth knowledge of SECS/GEM standards (SEMI E30 and related protocols) and experience configuring and integrating equipment for efficient factory automation.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Work on semiconductor manufacturing processes, adhering to SECS/GEM standards.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Configure and integrate SECS/GEM interfaces for various manufacturing equipment.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Develop communication protocols and define data collection variables.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Manage Siemens Camstar/OpCenter systems and create equipment recipes.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Monitor real-time data from sensors and equipment.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Implement statistical process control (SPC) and analyze performance metrics.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Maintain and enhance test automation frameworks for continuous improvement.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Provide thorough documentation and ensure good compliance practices.','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',500000.00,2500000.00,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-19 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-06-25 08:28:07.000000','2025-12-29 21:33:02.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Camstar\", \"Communication Skills\", \"Opcenter\", \"Problem-Solving Skills\", \"Siemens Opcenter\", \"Semiconductor Manufacturing Processes\", \"SECS/GEM Standards\", \"GUI Design\", \"Statistical Process Control\"]','[\"Competitive salary package and performance-based incentives.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Opportunity to work on advanced semiconductor technologies.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Exposure to cutting-edge factory automation and SECS/GEM standards.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;A supportive and collaborative work environment.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Opportunities for professional growth and skill enhancement.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Health insurance and wellness programs.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Flexible work hours and leave policies.\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('7f3dbfd8-2a6b-4938-8578-44571fdf65b3','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','LabWare LIMS Consultant / Specialist','labware-lims-consultant-specialist-323-323','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;78&quot; data-end=&quot;502&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced LabWare LIMS Consultants / Specialists for a leading Top MNC to work on enterprise Laboratory Information Management System (LIMS) implementation, support, and digital laboratory transformation projects. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in LabWare LIMS configuration, customization, SQL development, laboratory workflows, and regulated pharmaceutical and life sciences environments.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;504&quot; data-end=&quot;911&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for implementing, configuring, customizing, and supporting LabWare LIMS solutions to meet laboratory and business requirements. The role includes developing workflows, reports, templates, and screens, performing system validation, supporting production environments, troubleshooting application issues, and ensuring system performance, stability, and regulatory compliance.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;913&quot; data-end=&quot;1280&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with LabWare LIMS, LIMS Basic scripting, SQL development, database management, ITIL processes, and enterprise application support. Strong knowledge of laboratory operations, system validation (IQ/OQ/PQ), GxP regulations, FDA compliance, and integrations with ERP, MES, ELN, and laboratory instruments is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1282&quot; data-end=&quot;1732&quot;&gt;The role also involves collaborating with QA, QC, laboratory users, IT teams, and business stakeholders to deliver enterprise-grade laboratory solutions. Candidates will support implementation projects, manage production issues, prepare compliance documentation, optimize application performance, and contribute to continuous improvement initiatives. Strong analytical, communication, stakeholder management, and problem-solving skills are essential.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-09-01 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-07-03 18:50:25.000000','2026-07-03 18:50:25.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Compliance Reporting\", \"CSV\", \"Database Management\", \"ERP\", \"Gxp Compliance\", \"IQ\", \"ITIL\", \"Lims\", \"MYSQL\", \"OQ\", \"PQ\", \"System Validation\", \"Workflow Configuration\", \"LabWare LIMS\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1748&quot; data-end=&quot;1786&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;40zchx&quot; data-start=&quot;1787&quot; data-end=&quot;1868&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale LabWare LIMS implementation and support projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;xhvcpx&quot; data-start=&quot;1869&quot; data-end=&quot;1952&quot;&gt;Work with global Pharmaceutical, Life Sciences, and Manufacturing organizations&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;6wfdjr&quot; data-start=&quot;1953&quot; data-end=&quot;2027&quot;&gt;Career growth in Laboratory Informatics &amp;amp; Digital Laboratory Solutions&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;i1fuo0&quot; data-start=&quot;2028&quot; data-end=&quot;2106&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with international business and technical teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;2lee9a&quot; data-start=&quot;2107&quot; data-end=&quot;2162&quot;&gt;Professional and compliance-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;2163&quot; data-end=&quot;2206&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('7f6d17d5-d733-4e40-aa30-57f2b8fe2215','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','MES Engineer – Application Support','mes-engineer-application-support-294-294','&lt;p data-start=&quot;76&quot; data-end=&quot;427&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced MES Engineers &amp;ndash; Application Support for a leading Top MNC to support enterprise Manufacturing Execution System (MES) applications in pharmaceutical manufacturing environments. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in MES application support, troubleshooting, incident management, and production support activities.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;429&quot; data-end=&quot;802&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for providing L2 application support, monitoring MES systems, troubleshooting application issues, and ensuring uninterrupted manufacturing operations. The role includes managing incidents, resolving service requests, performing root cause analysis, and coordinating with cross-functional teams to maintain system stability and performance.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;804&quot; data-end=&quot;1103&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with MES platforms, preferably Rockwell PharmaSuite, along with strong SQL and database query skills. Experience with ServiceNow (SNOW), application maintenance, production support processes, and pharmaceutical manufacturing systems is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1105&quot; data-end=&quot;1446&quot;&gt;The role also involves supporting system enhancements, managing user issues, maintaining support documentation, and ensuring compliance with operational and quality standards. Candidates should possess strong analytical, communication, troubleshooting, and problem-solving skills with the ability to work in a fast-paced support environment.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-08-22 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-06-24 02:27:45.000000','2026-06-24 02:27:45.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Mes\", \"ServiceNow\", \"SQL\", \"Pharma\", \"Rockwell FTPS\", \"L2/L3 Support\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1462&quot; data-end=&quot;1500&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;6jypnz&quot; data-start=&quot;1501&quot; data-end=&quot;1559&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise pharmaceutical MES environments&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;qofhfs&quot; data-start=&quot;1560&quot; data-end=&quot;1618&quot;&gt;Work on advanced Manufacturing Execution Systems (MES)&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1t0cbpi&quot; data-start=&quot;1619&quot; data-end=&quot;1681&quot;&gt;Career growth in MES &amp;amp; Pharmaceutical Manufacturing domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1l8m4sm&quot; data-start=&quot;1682&quot; data-end=&quot;1724&quot;&gt;Long-term stable project opportunities&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;45fk39&quot; data-start=&quot;1725&quot; data-end=&quot;1780&quot;&gt;Professional and technology-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;1781&quot; data-end=&quot;1824&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('7f844315-b91f-4d85-8977-3e4a6dee9487','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','CSV Engineer – MES Systems (Emerson Syncade Preferred)','csv-engineer-mes-systems-emerson-syncade-preferred-159-159','&lt;p data-start=&quot;300&quot; data-end=&quot;696&quot;&gt;We are seeking an experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;330&quot; data-end=&quot;383&quot;&gt;CSV Engineer with strong MES validation expertise&lt;/strong&gt; to support system validation, documentation, and quality compliance activities in a regulated manufacturing environment. The ideal candidate will lead validation deliverables, execute UAT, and ensure regulatory compliance across MES implementations&amp;mdash;preferably with hands-on experience in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;672&quot; data-end=&quot;695&quot;&gt;Emerson Syncade MES&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;698&quot; data-end=&quot;880&quot;&gt;This role requires strong collaboration with business, IT, and quality stakeholders to deliver audit-ready, validated MES solutions aligned with operational and regulatory standards.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;hr data-start=&quot;882&quot; data-end=&quot;885&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;887&quot; data-end=&quot;916&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;892&quot; data-end=&quot;916&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;918&quot; data-end=&quot;957&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Computer System Validation (CSV)&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;958&quot; data-end=&quot;1322&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;958&quot; data-end=&quot;1114&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;960&quot; data-end=&quot;1024&quot;&gt;Develop, review, and maintain validation deliverables including:&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1027&quot; data-end=&quot;1114&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1027&quot; data-end=&quot;1043&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1029&quot; data-end=&quot;1043&quot;&gt;Test scripts&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1046&quot; data-end=&quot;1070&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1048&quot; data-end=&quot;1070&quot;&gt;Validation protocols&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1073&quot; data-end=&quot;1114&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1075&quot; data-end=&quot;1114&quot;&gt;System Life Cycle (SLC) documentation&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1115&quot; data-end=&quot;1180&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1117&quot; data-end=&quot;1180&quot;&gt;Execute &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1125&quot; data-end=&quot;1158&quot;&gt;User Acceptance Testing (UAT)&lt;/strong&gt; and document results.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1181&quot; data-end=&quot;1269&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1183&quot; data-end=&quot;1269&quot;&gt;Support &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1191&quot; data-end=&quot;1209&quot;&gt;Change Control&lt;/strong&gt; activities by assessing impacts and updating documentation.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1270&quot; data-end=&quot;1322&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1272&quot; data-end=&quot;1322&quot;&gt;Ensure complete traceability and audit compliance.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;1324&quot; data-end=&quot;1351&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;MES System Expertise&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1352&quot; data-end=&quot;1606&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1352&quot; data-end=&quot;1416&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1354&quot; data-end=&quot;1416&quot;&gt;Work extensively on &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1374&quot; data-end=&quot;1415&quot;&gt;Manufacturing Execution Systems (MES)&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1417&quot; data-end=&quot;1526&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1419&quot; data-end=&quot;1466&quot;&gt;Strong exposure to &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1438&quot; data-end=&quot;1461&quot;&gt;Emerson Syncade MES&lt;/strong&gt; for:&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1469&quot; data-end=&quot;1526&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1469&quot; data-end=&quot;1489&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1471&quot; data-end=&quot;1489&quot;&gt;Recipe authoring&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1492&quot; data-end=&quot;1509&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1494&quot; data-end=&quot;1509&quot;&gt;Configuration&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1512&quot; data-end=&quot;1526&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1514&quot; data-end=&quot;1526&quot;&gt;Validation&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1527&quot; data-end=&quot;1606&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1529&quot; data-end=&quot;1606&quot;&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional teams to design and validate MES solutions.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;1608&quot; data-end=&quot;1645&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Compliance &amp;amp; Quality Assurance&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1646&quot; data-end=&quot;1782&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1646&quot; data-end=&quot;1726&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1648&quot; data-end=&quot;1668&quot;&gt;Ensure adherence to:&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1671&quot; data-end=&quot;1726&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1671&quot; data-end=&quot;1680&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1673&quot; data-end=&quot;1680&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1673&quot; data-end=&quot;1680&quot;&gt;GxP&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1683&quot; data-end=&quot;1692&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1685&quot; data-end=&quot;1692&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1685&quot; data-end=&quot;1692&quot;&gt;FDA&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1695&quot; data-end=&quot;1726&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1697&quot; data-end=&quot;1726&quot;&gt;Other regulatory guide