ES\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;99&quot; data-end=&quot;154&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;101&quot; data-end=&quot;154&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and performance-based incentives&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;155&quot; data-end=&quot;238&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;157&quot; data-end=&quot;238&quot;&gt;Exposure to large-scale &lt;strong data-start=&quot;181&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;MES &amp;amp; Validation projects&lt;/strong&gt; in regulated environments&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;239&quot; data-end=&quot;317&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;241&quot; data-end=&quot;317&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;266&quot; data-end=&quot;315&quot;&gt;advanced manufacturing and automation systems&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;318&quot; data-end=&quot;397&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;320&quot; data-end=&quot;397&quot;&gt;Strong career growth in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;344&quot; data-end=&quot;395&quot;&gt;CSV, Quality, and Digital Manufacturing domains&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;398&quot; data-end=&quot;443&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;400&quot; data-end=&quot;443&quot;&gt;Onsite and client-facing project exposure&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;444&quot; data-end=&quot;536&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;446&quot; data-end=&quot;536&quot;&gt;Learning &amp;amp; upskilling opportunities on &lt;strong data-start=&quot;485&quot; data-end=&quot;508&quot;&gt;Emerson Syncade MES&lt;/strong&gt; and compliance frameworks&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;537&quot; data-end=&quot;576&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;539&quot; data-end=&quot;576&quot;&gt;Stable long-term project engagement&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;577&quot; data-end=&quot;629&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;579&quot; data-end=&quot;629&quot;&gt;Collaborative work environment with global teams&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;630&quot; data-end=&quot;672&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;632&quot; data-end=&quot;672&quot;&gt;Leadership and mentoring opportunities&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;673&quot; data-end=&quot;728&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;675&quot; data-end=&quot;728&quot;&gt;Work-life balance with structured project schedules&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('7fa649f8-56c0-4c3e-8daa-0e3231ff8490','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Senior LabVantage LIMS Developer','senior-labvantage-lims-developer-228-228','&lt;p&gt;Strong hands-on experience in LabVantage LIMS development and configuration&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;middot; Experience supporting e2e LIMS implementation and deployments&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;middot; Develop and configure custom workflows, scripts and system configurations in LabVantage&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;middot; Experience integrating lab instruments and external systems (LabVantage SDMS, CI, ELN, SAP...)&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;middot; Experience with SQL, relational databases and data modeling&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;middot; Experience building system integrations using APIs, web services, or middleware&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;middot; Participate in system enhancements, upgrades, troubleshooting and technical improvements&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;middot; Work closely with IT LIMS team and laboratory stakeholders to implement technical solutions&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;middot; Fluent English communication skills&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Entry',NULL,NULL,'INR',1,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-05-30 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-03-31 21:19:57.000000','2026-03-31 21:19:57.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Lims\", \"MYSQL\", \"SAP Integration\", \"LabVantage\", \"LabVantage LIMS\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;Competitive salary package with performance-based incentives&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;65&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;67&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;Health insurance coverage and statutory benefits (PF &amp;amp; Gratuity)&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;134&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;136&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on large-scale enterprise energy management projects&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;211&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;213&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;Strong career growth and learning opportunities&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;263&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;265&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;Collaborative and professional work environment&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('7fc99b46-c359-4120-9920-68907b8b0146','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Scrum Master','scrum-master-286-286','&lt;p data-start=&quot;54&quot; data-end=&quot;395&quot;&gt;We are hiring an experienced Scrum Master for a leading Top MNC to drive Agile delivery for enterprise-scale Manufacturing Execution Systems (MES) and digital transformation projects. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in Agile methodologies, Scrum practices, stakeholder management, and software delivery lifecycle management.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;397&quot; data-end=&quot;786&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for facilitating Agile ceremonies, including Sprint Planning, Daily Standups, Sprint Reviews, and Retrospectives while ensuring adherence to Scrum principles and best practices. The role involves working closely with Product Owners, Development Teams, Business Stakeholders, and Project Managers to deliver high-quality solutions on time and within scope.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;788&quot; data-end=&quot;1161&quot;&gt;Professionals should have experience managing Agile and Waterfall project environments, tracking delivery metrics, monitoring sprint health, managing risks and dependencies, and driving continuous improvement initiatives. Strong knowledge of SDLC, DevOps practices, Agile reporting, and project management tools such as JIRA, Confluence, and MS Project is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1163&quot; data-end=&quot;1491&quot;&gt;The role also requires coordination between onsite and offshore teams, stakeholder communication, issue resolution, and process optimization to improve productivity, quality, and project outcomes. Candidates with MES, Manufacturing Automation, Semiconductor, or Electronics Manufacturing experience will have an added advantage.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Pune',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-08-08 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-06-10 01:51:18.000000','2026-06-10 01:51:18.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Agile Methodology\", \"Confluence\", \"DevOps\", \"JIRA\", \"Waterfall Methodology\", \"Scrum Master\", \"Sprint Planning\", \"Scrum Framework\", \"Sprint Reviews\", \"Sprint Retrospectives\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1507&quot; data-end=&quot;1545&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;d1dw51&quot; data-start=&quot;1546&quot; data-end=&quot;1613&quot;&gt;Exposure to large-scale MES and digital transformation projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ab92bx&quot; data-start=&quot;1614&quot; data-end=&quot;1659&quot;&gt;Leadership role in Agile project delivery&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;14c1c93&quot; data-start=&quot;1660&quot; data-end=&quot;1725&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global teams and stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1vc6d2e&quot; data-start=&quot;1726&quot; data-end=&quot;1789&quot;&gt;Career growth in Agile Delivery &amp;amp; Project Management domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot; data-start=&quot;1790&quot; data-end=&quot;1845&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;1846&quot; data-end=&quot;1889&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Maharashtra'),('80517f88-cf4a-4f63-af13-f4000741cb0b','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','SAP DM / SAP BTP Developer','sap-dm-sap-btp-developer-314-314','&lt;p data-start=&quot;68&quot; data-end=&quot;410&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced SAP DM / SAP BTP Developers for a leading Top MNC to work on an 18-month enterprise Manufacturing Digital Transformation project. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in SAP Digital Manufacturing (SAP DM/DMC), SAP Business Technology Platform (SAP BTP), SAP UI5, and cloud-native application development.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;412&quot; data-end=&quot;816&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for designing, developing, deploying, and maintaining SAP Digital Manufacturing solutions and SAP BTP applications based on manufacturing and business requirements. The role includes developing custom SAP DM plugins, CAP services, SAP UI5 applications, and cloud-native solutions while ensuring scalability, reliability, and seamless integration with enterprise systems.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;818&quot; data-end=&quot;1171&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with SAP DM, SAP BTP, SAP UI5, JavaScript, Node.js, CAP Framework, SAP Business Application Studio (BAS), SQL, PL/SQL, and manufacturing data configuration. Strong understanding of SAP cloud technologies, application architecture, API integrations, and manufacturing execution processes is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1173&quot; data-end=&quot;1590&quot;&gt;The role also involves collaborating with business users, technical teams, and global stakeholders, participating in solution design workshops, mentoring junior developers, and supporting deployment, enhancements, and production activities. Candidates should possess excellent analytical, communication, troubleshooting, and problem-solving skills with a passion for delivering innovative SAP manufacturing solutions.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Pune',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-08-28 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-06-30 03:15:47.000000','2026-06-30 03:15:47.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"JavaScript\", \"MVC\", \"Node.JS\", \"PL/SQL\", \"Sap UI5\", \"SQL\", \"SAP DM\", \"SAP OEE\", \"SAP BTP\", \"SAP Digital Manufacturing\", \"SAP Business Application Studio (SAP BAS)\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1606&quot; data-end=&quot;1644&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;5xs02m&quot; data-start=&quot;1645&quot; data-end=&quot;1712&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale SAP Digital Manufacturing projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;s216jm&quot; data-start=&quot;1713&quot; data-end=&quot;1775&quot;&gt;Work on cutting-edge SAP BTP and cloud-native technologies&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;pf4dr1&quot; data-start=&quot;1776&quot; data-end=&quot;1817&quot;&gt;18-month long-term project engagement&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1wfxilv&quot; data-start=&quot;1818&quot; data-end=&quot;1888&quot;&gt;Career growth in SAP Manufacturing &amp;amp; Digital Transformation domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;fm4t10&quot; data-start=&quot;1889&quot; data-end=&quot;1966&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global SAP consultants and business teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot; data-start=&quot;1967&quot; data-end=&quot;2022&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;2023&quot; data-end=&quot;2066&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Maharashtra'),('806ccaa0-c739-4fed-8262-808d1f669a64','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','LabWare LIMS Developer','labware-lims-developer-299-299','&lt;p data-start=&quot;64&quot; data-end=&quot;407&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced LabWare LIMS Developers for a leading Top MNC to work on enterprise laboratory informatics and digital transformation projects within the Pharma and Life Sciences domain. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in LabWare LIMS configuration, customization, implementation, deployment, and support activities.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;409&quot; data-end=&quot;744&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for developing, configuring, customizing, and maintaining LabWare LIMS solutions to support laboratory operations and business requirements. The role includes participating in implementation, upgrade, deployment, and enhancement projects while ensuring system reliability, compliance, and performance.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;746&quot; data-end=&quot;1098&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with LabWare LIMS package development, application troubleshooting, system administration, instrument interfaces, CDS integrations, and enterprise application integrations. Strong knowledge of Java, J2EE, JBoss Server, Oracle/MS SQL databases, reporting tools, and laboratory workflows is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1100&quot; data-end=&quot;1448&quot;&gt;The role also involves supporting L1, L2, and L3 activities, mentoring team members, collaborating with global clients and stakeholders, and ensuring compliance with Computer System Validation (CSV), GxP regulations, and industry best practices. Candidates should possess strong analytical, communication, documentation, and problem-solving skills.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-08-22 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-06-24 02:53:52.000000','2026-06-24 02:53:52.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"CSV\", \"Gxp Compliance\", \"J2EE\", \"Java\", \"Jboss\", \"MS SQL Server\", \"Oracle\", \"LabWare LIMS\", \"L2/L3 Support\", \"STARLIMS Customization\", \"Agilent OpenLab\", \"Chromatography Data Systems (CDS)\", \"LIMS Integration\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1464&quot; data-end=&quot;1502&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;rfwbzn&quot; data-start=&quot;1503&quot; data-end=&quot;1557&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale LabWare LIMS projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1yplwh&quot; data-start=&quot;1558&quot; data-end=&quot;1613&quot;&gt;Work on global Pharma and Life Sciences initiatives&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1flwegv&quot; data-start=&quot;1614&quot; data-end=&quot;1671&quot;&gt;Career growth in LIMS &amp;amp; Laboratory Informatics domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1mfsq9e&quot; data-start=&quot;1672&quot; data-end=&quot;1746&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with international clients and stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;2lee9a&quot; data-start=&quot;1747&quot; data-end=&quot;1802&quot;&gt;Professional and compliance-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;1803&quot; data-end=&quot;1846&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('808e26ff-e8af-4fe3-a375-166449eaf8b6','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','LIMS Labware Developer / Support Specialist','lims-labware-developer-support-specialist-280-280','&lt;p data-start=&quot;85&quot; data-end=&quot;390&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced LIMS Labware Developers / Support Specialists for a leading Top MNC in the Pharma and Life Sciences domain. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in Labware LIMS configuration, customization, deployment, and support activities within regulated laboratory environments.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;392&quot; data-end=&quot;751&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for handling Labware LIMS development, implementation, deployment, and support activities across global laboratory systems. The role includes configuring and customizing Labware LIMS modules, troubleshooting application issues, supporting L1/L2/L3 operations, and ensuring smooth functioning of enterprise laboratory systems.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;753&quot; data-end=&quot;1064&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with instrument interfaces, CDS systems such as OpenLab and ATLAS, enterprise application integrations, reporting tools, and SQL databases. Strong knowledge of Java, J2EE, JBoss Server, Oracle/MS SQL, CSV processes, and GxP compliance standards is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1066&quot; data-end=&quot;1443&quot;&gt;The role also involves working closely with clients and business users to understand requirements, support upgrades and implementation projects, mentor team members, and maintain global Labware LIMS instances. Candidates should possess strong analytical, troubleshooting, communication, and documentation skills with experience in pharmaceutical and life sciences environments.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-07-20 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-05-22 02:28:42.000000','2026-05-22 02:28:42.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"CDS Views\", \"CSV\", \"Gxp Compliance\", \"J2EE\", \"Java\", \"Jboss\", \"MS SQL Server\", \"Oracle\", \"Pharmaceutical\", \"Technical Support (L1, L2, L3)\", \"LabWare LIMS\", \"Atlas UI\", \"LabVantage LIMS\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1459&quot; data-end=&quot;1497&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;bhyf3x&quot; data-start=&quot;1498&quot; data-end=&quot;1552&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-level Labware LIMS projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;43h2oq&quot; data-start=&quot;1553&quot; data-end=&quot;1609&quot;&gt;Work on global pharmaceutical and laboratory systems&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;2sbwzk&quot; data-start=&quot;1610&quot; data-end=&quot;1658&quot;&gt;Career growth in LIMS &amp;amp; Life Sciences domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;o2e7cv&quot; data-start=&quot;1659&quot; data-end=&quot;1726&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with international teams and clients&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;2lee9a&quot; data-start=&quot;1727&quot; data-end=&quot;1782&quot;&gt;Professional and compliance-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;1783&quot; data-end=&quot;1826&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('80ad46cd-2084-4dcd-9ffc-cbe58b632143','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','LIMS SampleManager Consultant / Specialist','lims-samplemanager-consultant-specialist-322-322','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;84&quot; data-end=&quot;485&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced LIMS SampleManager Consultants / Specialists for a leading Top MNC to support enterprise laboratory informatics and digital laboratory transformation initiatives. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in Thermo Fisher SampleManager LIMS, laboratory workflows, system administration, application support, and regulated pharmaceutical and life sciences environments.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;487&quot; data-end=&quot;884&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for configuring, administering, supporting, and enhancing Thermo Fisher SampleManager LIMS to meet business and laboratory requirements. The role includes managing master data, user administration, system configuration, troubleshooting production issues, implementing system enhancements, and ensuring high availability and performance of laboratory applications.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;886&quot; data-end=&quot;1270&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with SampleManager LIMS administration, laboratory sample management processes, system integrations, ITIL-based support processes, and enterprise application support. Strong knowledge of LIMS configuration, ELN, ERP, laboratory instrument integration, GxP regulations, FDA compliance, and laboratory quality processes is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1272&quot; data-end=&quot;1731&quot;&gt;The role also involves collaborating with laboratory users, QA, R&amp;amp;D, IT teams, business stakeholders, and global project teams to deliver enterprise-grade laboratory solutions. Candidates will support production environments, resolve application issues, manage documentation, ensure regulatory compliance, and contribute to continuous improvement initiatives. Strong analytical, communication, stakeholder management, and problem-solving skills are essential.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-09-01 06:0