951&quot;&gt;consulting-grade deliverables&lt;/strong&gt;, including reports, executive summaries, and presentations&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1mg36c9&quot; data-start=&quot;1013&quot; data-end=&quot;1103&quot;&gt;Perform both &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1028&quot; data-end=&quot;1074&quot;&gt;quantitative and qualitative data analysis&lt;/strong&gt; to support decision-making&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1yyrk44&quot; data-start=&quot;1104&quot; data-end=&quot;1191&quot;&gt;Collaborate with stakeholders and leadership teams to align on strategic objectives&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;e36knw&quot; data-start=&quot;1198&quot; data-end=&quot;1226&quot;&gt;&lt;span role=&quot;text&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1205&quot; data-end=&quot;1224&quot;&gt;Required Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;13d4o62&quot; data-start=&quot;1228&quot; data-end=&quot;1251&quot;&gt;&lt;span role=&quot;text&quot;&gt;✅ &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1234&quot; data-end=&quot;1249&quot;&gt;Core Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1252&quot; data-end=&quot;1611&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1vd1eho&quot; data-start=&quot;1252&quot; data-end=&quot;1307&quot;&gt;Strong &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1261&quot; data-end=&quot;1305&quot;&gt;analytical and problem-solving abilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;t5g6pr&quot; data-start=&quot;1308&quot; data-end=&quot;1383&quot;&gt;Expertise in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1323&quot; data-end=&quot;1381&quot;&gt;report writing, storylining, and business storytelling&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1jefx9i&quot; data-start=&quot;1384&quot; data-end=&quot;1449&quot;&gt;Excellent &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1396&quot; data-end=&quot;1447&quot;&gt;stakeholder management and communication skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1jqqspv&quot; data-start=&quot;1450&quot; data-end=&quot;1546&quot;&gt;Understanding of &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1469&quot; data-end=&quot;1544&quot;&gt;enterprise organization structures, operating models, and value streams&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1xwc0w2&quot; data-start=&quot;1547&quot; data-end=&quot;1611&quot;&gt;Experience in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1563&quot; data-end=&quot;1609&quot;&gt;data analysis (quantitative &amp;amp; qualitative)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'INR',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-06-16 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-04-18 04:16:23.000000','2026-04-18 04:16:23.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Business Analyst\", \"Data Analysis\", \"Stakeholder Management\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;9wet9p&quot; data-start=&quot;1845&quot; data-end=&quot;1921&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1874&quot; data-end=&quot;1919&quot;&gt;Top MNC on high-impact strategic projects&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;6nq3j2&quot; data-start=&quot;1922&quot; data-end=&quot;2003&quot;&gt;Exposure to &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1936&quot; data-end=&quot;2001&quot;&gt;enterprise-level consulting and organizational transformation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;k72dl1&quot; data-start=&quot;2004&quot; data-end=&quot;2074&quot;&gt;Strong career growth in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2030&quot; data-end=&quot;2072&quot;&gt;business consulting &amp;amp; analytics domain&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;qfqr0m&quot; data-start=&quot;2075&quot; data-end=&quot;2136&quot;&gt;Competitive compensation and performance-based incentives&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1rkki1o&quot; data-start=&quot;2137&quot; data-end=&quot;2193&quot;&gt;Collaborative and leadership-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;jkwoeo&quot; data-start=&quot;2194&quot; data-end=&quot;2274&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work closely with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2229&quot; data-end=&quot;2272&quot;&gt;senior stakeholders and decision-makers&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('82f33870-6f0b-4b71-89f9-b1cfa97f319a','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','OT Engineer – Ignition SCADA','ot-engineer-ignition-scada-49-49','&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;385&quot; data-end=&quot;403&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;389&quot; data-end=&quot;401&quot;&gt;Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;404&quot; data-end=&quot;671&quot;&gt;We are looking for &lt;strong data-start=&quot;423&quot; data-end=&quot;451&quot;&gt;experienced OT Engineers&lt;/strong&gt; with strong hands-on expertise in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;486&quot; data-end=&quot;504&quot;&gt;Ignition SCADA&lt;/strong&gt; to support the design, integration, and deployment of automation solutions across various industrial sectors such as manufacturing, automotive, pharma, and oil &amp;amp; gas.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;673&quot; data-end=&quot;701&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;677&quot; data-end=&quot;701&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ol data-start=&quot;702&quot; data-end=&quot;1193&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;702&quot; data-end=&quot;807&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;705&quot; data-end=&quot;807&quot;&gt;Understand business and process requirements to design and implement Ignition SCADA-based solutions.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;808&quot; data-end=&quot;925&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;811&quot; data-end=&quot;925&quot;&gt;Program and configure Ignition SCADA systems using relevant modules for visualization, control, and integration.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;926&quot; data-end=&quot;1006&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;929&quot; data-end=&quot;1006&quot;&gt;Perform system testing, commissioning, and provide post-deployment support.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1007&quot; data-end=&quot;1107&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1010&quot; data-end=&quot;1107&quot;&gt;Integrate SCADA systems with PLCs, third-party devices, and databases using standard protocols.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1108&quot; data-end=&quot;1193&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1111&quot; data-end=&quot;1193&quot;&gt;Stay informed on developments in Ignition SCADA and other automation technologies.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ol&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;1195&quot; data-end=&quot;1219&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1199&quot; data-end=&quot;1219&quot;&gt;Must-Have Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1220&quot; data-end=&quot;1791&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1220&quot; data-end=&quot;1317&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1222&quot; data-end=&quot;1317&quot;&gt;Strong hands-on experience in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1252&quot; data-end=&quot;1270&quot;&gt;Ignition SCADA&lt;/strong&gt; project design, scripting, and configuration&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1318&quot; data-end=&quot;1411&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1320&quot; data-end=&quot;1411&quot;&gt;Proficient in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1334&quot; data-end=&quot;1341&quot;&gt;SQL&lt;/strong&gt;, OPC UA, MQTT, Modbus, and other industrial communication protocols&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1412&quot; data-end=&quot;1528&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1414&quot; data-end=&quot;1528&quot;&gt;Capable of designing and integrating SCADA systems for diverse domains (Manufacturing, Automotive, Pharma, etc.)&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1529&quot; data-end=&quot;1612&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1531&quot; data-end=&quot;1612&quot;&gt;Experience with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1547&quot; data-end=&quot;1567&quot;&gt;Ignition modules&lt;/strong&gt; (Vision, Perspective, Tag Historian, etc.)&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1613&quot; data-end=&quot;1692&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1615&quot; data-end=&quot;1692&quot;&gt;Strong communication skills with attention to detail and system reliability&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1693&quot; data-end=&quot;1791&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1695&quot; data-end=&quot;1791&quot;&gt;Good understanding of &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1717&quot; data-end=&quot;1727&quot;&gt;ISA-95&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1729&quot; data-end=&quot;1746&quot;&gt;MES functions&lt;/strong&gt;, and certified in Ignition SCADA (preferred)&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;1793&quot; data-end=&quot;1820&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1797&quot; data-end=&quot;1820&quot;&gt;Good-to-Have Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1821&quot; data-end=&quot;2011&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1821&quot; data-end=&quot;1862&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1823&quot; data-end=&quot;1862&quot;&gt;Python scripting for SCADA automation&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1863&quot; data-end=&quot;1946&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1865&quot; data-end=&quot;1946&quot;&gt;Familiarity with industry standards and best practices in industrial automation&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1947&quot; data-end=&quot;2011&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1949&quot; data-end=&quot;2011&quot;&gt;Willingness to stay updated with evolving SCADA technologies&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',500000.00,2500000.00,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-19 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-06-06 10:35:25.000000','2025-11-21 04:59:32.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Engineer\", \"Historian\", \"Industrial Automation\", \"Pharma Industry\", \"Python\", \"SCADA\", \"SCADA Systems\"]','[\"&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;2877&quot; data-end=&quot;2895&quot;&gt;Job Benefits&lt;/h3&gt;\\r\\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2896&quot; data-end=&quot;3206&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2896&quot; data-end=&quot;2943&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2898&quot; data-end=&quot;2943&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and long-term engagement&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2944&quot; data-end=&quot;3023&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2946&quot; data-end=&quot;3023&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-level cloud architecture and modern design practices&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;3024&quot; data-end=&quot;3076&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;3026&quot; data-end=&quot;3076&quot;&gt;Collaborative, cross-functional team environment&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;3077&quot; data-end=&quot;3149&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;3079&quot; data-end=&quot;3149&quot;&gt;Opportunities for leadership, innovation, and architecture ownership&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;3150&quot; data-end=&quot;3206&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;3152&quot; data-end=&quot;3206&quot;&gt;Access to internal learning and development programs&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('82f80d7d-9395-4c53-8d2e-76a21fb0c0c3','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Automation & Robotics Engineer – Connectivity Specialist','automation-robotics-engineer-connectivity-specialist-274-274','&lt;p data-start=&quot;98&quot; data-end=&quot;443&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced Automation &amp;amp; Robotics Engineers &amp;ndash; Connectivity Specialists for a leading Top MNC to work on Industrial Automation, Robotics, IoT Connectivity, and Smart Manufacturing projects. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in industrial machine connectivity, real-time data monitoring, and Industry 4.0 technologies.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;445&quot; data-end=&quot;776&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for integrating industrial machines, robotics systems, and IoT-enabled devices within manufacturing environments. The role includes developing and maintaining industrial connectivity solutions using OPCUA, MQTT, PLC, and SCADA technologies to support seamless communication across factory systems.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;778&quot; data-end=&quot;1071&quot;&gt;Professionals should have experience in real-time and batch data collection systems, dashboard development, factory performance monitoring, and industrial networking protocols. Strong knowledge of automation system integration, troubleshooting, and smart factory solutions is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1073&quot; data-end=&quot;1402&quot;&gt;The role also involves supporting production monitoring initiatives, training end users on connected systems, and collaborating with automation, operations, and IT/OT teams to improve manufacturing efficiency and connectivity infrastructure. Candidates should possess strong analytical, problem-solving, and communication skills.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-07-12 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-05-14 03:45:53.000000','2026-05-14 03:45:53.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Industrial Automation\", \"IOT\", \"PLC\", \"Robotics\", \"SCADA\", \"OPC UA\", \"MQTT\", \"Smart Manufacturing\", \"Factory Automation\", \"Industrial IT/OT\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1418&quot; data-end=&quot;1456&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1metyg4&quot; data-start=&quot;1457&quot; data-end=&quot;1518&quot;&gt;Exposure to Industry 4.0 and Smart Manufacturing projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;uxjazj&quot; data-start=&quot;1519&quot; data-end=&quot;1582&quot;&gt;Work on advanced Industrial Automation &amp;amp; Robotics solutions&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;10xvzoe&quot; data-start=&quot;1583&quot; data-end=&quot;1641&quot;&gt;Career growth in Automation, IoT &amp;amp; Connectivity domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;uhu09b&quot; data-start=&quot;1642&quot; data-end=&quot;1704&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global manufacturing teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;45fk39&quot; data-start=&quot;1705&quot; data-end=&quot;1760&quot;&gt;Professional and technology-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;1761&quot; data-end=&quot;1804&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('83f96d50-fc18-467a-8294-ffed848c2a43','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Technical Support & System Engineer – Fresher','technical-support-system-engineer-fresher-283-283','&lt;p data-start=&quot;87&quot; data-end=&quot;406&quot;&gt;We are hiring enthusiastic and motivated Freshers for the role of Technical Support &amp;amp; System Engineer with a leading Top MNC in Bangalore. This is an excellent opportunity for candidates looking to build a career in Technical Support, Linux Administration, Networking, System Engineering, and IT Infrastructure Support.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;408&quot; data-end=&quot;722&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for providing technical assistance, system monitoring, troubleshooting, and supporting IT infrastructure environments. The role includes working with Linux servers, networking technologies, virtualization platforms, and enterprise support tools to ensure smooth system operations.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;724&quot; data-end=&quot;1020&quot;&gt;Professionals should have basic knowledge of Linux administration (CentOS/RHEL preferred), networking concepts, SSH, shell scripting, virtualization technologies, Active Directory, Office 365, and database fundamentals. Knowledge of GitHub and any programming language will be an added advantage.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1022&quot; data-end=&quot;1383&quot;&gt;The role also involves collaborating with internal teams and clients, supporting deployment and maintenance activities, troubleshooting technical issues, and providing user support. Candidates should possess strong communication, analytical, problem-solving, and presentation skills along with a willingness to travel across India for client support activities.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Entry',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-08-08 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-06-10 01:24:42.000000','2026-06-10 01:24:42.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Github\", \"IT Networking\", \"Linux Administration\", \"Microsoft Dynamics 365\", \"PostgreSQL\", \"SSH\", \"System Validation\", \"VMware\", \"Hypervisor\", \"UNIX Shell Scripting\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1399&quot; data-end=&quot;1437&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1dphtya&quot; data-start=&quot;1438&quot; data-end=&quot;1483&quot;&gt;Excellent career opportunity for freshers&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i8ltj8&quot; data-start=&quot;1484&quot; data-end=&quot;1553&quot;&gt;Hands-on exposure to Linux, Networking, and System Administration&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1kluokj&quot; data-start=&quot;1554&quot; data-end=&quot;1618&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on enterprise IT infrastructure projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;hvcfyf&quot; data-start=&quot;1619&quot; data-end=&quot;1691&quot;&gt;Learning and growth in Technical Support &amp;amp; System Engineering domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;psy5h0&quot; data-start=&quot;1692&quot; data-end=&quot;1740&quot;&gt;Exposure to client-facing support activities&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;45fk39&quot; data-start=&quot;1741&quot; data-end=&quot;1796&quot;&gt;Professional and technology-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('842ba69f-c880-44f0-ae27-2d3528bd77a2','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Digital Lead – Manufacturing Control Tower / Self-Optimizing Plants','digital-lead-manufacturing-control-tower-self-optimizing-plants-153-153','The Digital Lead will drive Digital Manufacturing and Industry 4.0 initiatives across Smart Factory pillars, specifically Manufacturing Control Tower and Self-Optimizing Plants. This role involves leading digital transformation programs, engaging with global and regional Smart Factory teams, evaluating technologies, and designing innovative digital solutions.\r\n\r\nThe candidate will work closely with customers to identify pain points, define requirements, create solution concepts, and manage the end-to-end implementation of digital transformation use cases. The role also requires collaboration with global partners, internal technical teams, and business stakeholders to standardize technologies, develop roadmaps, and guide Smart Factory transformation efforts across multiple Operating Entities.','Information Technology','Full-time','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Chennai',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-26 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-11-28 02:36:49.000000','2025-11-28 02:36:49.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"AI/ML\", \"Azure\", \"Cloud\", \"Data Integration\", \"Digital Twin Technology\", \"IOT\", \"Mes\", \"PLC\", \"Project Management\", \"SCADA\", \"Digital Manufacturing\", \"Industry 4.0 Solutioning\", \"Edge Connectivity\", \"Factory Systems\", \"Solution Design\"]','[\"Opportunity to lead global Smart Factory initiatives\\r\\nWork with advanced Industry 4.0 technologies (AI/ML, Digital Twins, IoT, Cloud)\\r\\nExposure to cross-functional global teams\\r\\nLeadership role in Digital Manufacturing transformation\\r\\nCompetitive compensation with performance-based rewards\\r\\nCareer growth in Industry 4.0 and Digital Strategy\\r\\nLearning &amp; certification support (Azure, IoT, Data platforms)\\r\\nWork with global clients and partners in CPG/Manufacturing\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Tamil Nadu'),('84967035-5fc0-49e4-b938-346918c77026','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Senior SQL Developer / Database Administrator (10+ Years Experience)','senior-sql-developer-database-administrator-10-years-experience-127-127','&lt;p data-start=&quot;198&quot; data-end=&quot;670&quot;&gt;We are hiring an experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;227&quot; data-end=&quot;276&quot;&gt;Senior SQL Developer / Database Administrator&lt;/strong&gt; for a top MNC. The ideal candidate will be responsible for designing, developing, securing, and optimizing large-scale databases. The role involves database administration, performance tuning, writing complex SQL queries, and managing cloud-based SQL environments. You will work closely with cross-functional teams to ensure seamless data operations, high availability, and system reliability.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;hr data-start=&quot;672&quot; data-end=&quot;675&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;677&quot; data-end=&quot;706&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;680&quot; data-end=&quot;706&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;707&quot; data-end=&quot;1310&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;707&quot; data-end=&quot;753&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;709&quot; data-end=&quot;753&quot;&gt;Design, develop and maintain SQL databases&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;754&quot; data-end=&quot;840&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;756&quot; data-end=&quot;840&quot;&gt;Implement database backup strategies, disaster recovery plans &amp;amp; security protocols&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;841&quot; data-end=&quot;912&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;843&quot; data-end=&quot;912&quot;&gt;Optimize database performance through tuning and query optimization&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;913&quot; data-end=&quot;997&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;915&quot; data-end=&quot;997&quot;&gt;Develop and execute complex SQL queries, stored procedures, functions &amp;amp; triggers&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;998&quot; data-end=&quot;1056&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1000&quot; data-end=&quot;1056&quot;&gt;Manage SQL Server instances including SSRS, SSIS, SSAS&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1057&quot; data-end=&quot;1111&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1059&quot; data-end=&quot;1111&quot;&gt;Monitor, troubleshoot, and resolve database issues&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1112&quot; data-end=&quot;1185&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1114&quot; data-end=&quot;1185&quot;&gt;Manage Azure SQL Managed Instances and cloud-based database solutions&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1186&quot; data-end=&quot;1231&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1188&quot; data-end=&quot;1231&quot;&gt;Automate tasks using PowerShell scripting&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1232&quot; data-end=&quot;1310&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1234&quot; data-end=&quot;1310&quot;&gt;Ensure high availability, scalability, and reliability of database systems&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Full-time','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Hyderabad',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-19 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-11-21 05:17:57.000000','2025-11-21 05:17:57.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Azure SQL Database\", \"Cloud Platforms\", \"Database\", \"Design\", \"SQL\", \"SQL Performance Tuning\", \"SQL Query Optimization\", \"Ssas Cubes\", \"Troubleshooting\", \"SSIS\", \"SSRS\", \"Transact-SQL(T-SQL)\"]','[\"&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1816&quot; data-end=&quot;2234&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1816&quot; data-end=&quot;1896&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1818&quot; data-end=&quot;1896&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1845&quot; data-end=&quot;1856&quot;&gt;Top MNC&lt;/strong&gt; and advanced enterprise-level systems&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1897&quot; data-end=&quot;1933&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1899&quot; data-end=&quot;1933&quot;&gt;Competitive compensation package&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1934&quot; data-end=&quot;1981&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1936&quot; data-end=&quot;1981&quot;&gt;Work with modern cloud technologies (Azure)&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1982&quot; data-end=&quot;2048&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1984&quot; data-end=&quot;2048&quot;&gt;Career growth in database engineering and cloud data solutions&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2049&quot; data-end=&quot;2113&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2051&quot; data-end=&quot;2113&quot;&gt;Exposure to high-performance &amp;amp; large-scale data environments&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2114&quot; data-end=&quot;2176&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2116&quot; data-end=&quot;2176&quot;&gt;Supportive work culture and collaborative team environment&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2177&quot; data-end=&quot;2234&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2179&quot; data-end=&quot;2234&quot;&gt;Skill enhancement &amp;amp; continuous learning opportunities&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Telangana'),('84b30778-e7b5-42e6-85fd-838410987145','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Android Developer (Fresher)','android-developer-fresher-321-321','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;69&quot; data-end=&quot;436&quot;&gt;We are hiring passionate Android Developers (Freshers) for a leading Top MNC to work on innovative mobile application development projects. This is an excellent opportunity for recent graduates who are eager to build high-quality Android applications, learn modern mobile technologies, and kickstart their careers in a collaborative and technology-driven environment.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;438&quot; data-end=&quot;787&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for developing, testing, maintaining, and enhancing Android applications under the guidance of experienced developers. The role includes implementing user-friendly interfaces, integrating REST APIs, debugging applications, optimizing performance, and ensuring high-quality mobile experiences across Android devices.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;789&quot; data-end=&quot;1115&quot;&gt;Professionals should have a good understanding of Java and/or Kotlin, Android Studio, Android SDK, XML-based UI development, REST APIs, JSON, SQLite or Room Database, and Git version control. Familiarity with Material Design principles, Android application lifecycle, and software development fundamentals is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1117&quot; data-end=&quot;1460&quot;&gt;The role also involves collaborating with UI/UX designers, backend developers, QA teams, and senior engineers to deliver scalable and reliable mobile applications. Candidates should possess strong analytical thinking, problem-solving abilities, communication skills, and a willingness to learn emerging Android technologies and best practices.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Entry',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-08-30 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-07-02 02:50:29.000000','2026-07-02 02:50:29.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Android SDK\", \"Debugging Skills\", \"Git Version Control\", \"Github\", \"Java\", \"JSON\", \"KOTLIN\", \"REST API\", \"SQLITE\", \"XML\", \"Android Development\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;hbysa9&quot; data-start=&quot;1476&quot; data-end=&quot;1527&quot;&gt;Opportunity to start your career with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;ti6lmy&quot; data-start=&quot;1528&quot; data-end=&quot;1597&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience in enterprise Android application development&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1nbjvso&quot; data-start=&quot;1598&quot; data-end=&quot;1666&quot;&gt;Learn from experienced mobile application developers and mentors&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;98nsl0&quot; data-start=&quot;1667&quot; data-end=&quot;1736&quot;&gt;Exposure to modern Android technologies and development practices&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;czxgvp&quot; data-start=&quot;1737&quot; data-end=&quot;1788&quot;&gt;Career growth in Mobile Application Development&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;vfuj5t&quot; data-start=&quot;1789&quot; data-end=&quot;1840&quot;&gt;Professional and collaborative work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ea1g5y&quot; data-start=&quot;1841&quot; data-end=&quot;1885&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and employee benefits&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;8fiq87&quot; data-start=&quot;1886&quot; data-end=&quot;1945&quot;&gt;Continuous learning and skill development opportunities&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('84fd9900-86ea-49ba-8106-2b01341add6e','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Senior AI Engineer – GenAI / Machine Learning','senior-ai-engineer-genai-machine-learning-368-368','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;83&quot; data-end=&quot;322&quot;&gt;We are hiring an experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;112&quot; data-end=&quot;134&quot;&gt;Senior AI Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; for a leading MNC to design and develop enterprise-grade &lt;strong data-start=&quot;192&quot; data-end=&quot;252&quot;&gt;Generative AI, Machine Learning, and RAG-based solutions&lt;/strong&gt; focused on intelligent incident management and enterprise operations.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;324&quot; data-end=&quot;537&quot;&gt;The ideal candidate should have strong hands-on expertise in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;385&quot; data-end=&quot;536&quot;&gt;Azure OpenAI, Generative AI, Machine Learning, RAG Architecture, Python, LangChain / Semantic Kernel, Vector Databases, and enterprise integrations&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;539&quot; data-end=&quot;832&quot;&gt;The role involves designing AI architecture and model strategies, developing intelligent recommendation engines, building incident similarity and matching solutions, implementing root-cause classification models, and integrating AI capabilities with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;789&quot; data-end=&quot;831&quot;&gt;ServiceNow and observability platforms&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;834&quot; data-end=&quot;1021&quot;&gt;This is an excellent opportunity for senior AI professionals looking to work on &lt;strong data-start=&quot;914&quot; data-end=&quot;1020&quot;&gt;enterprise-scale GenAI, intelligent automation, AI agents, and next-generation IT operations solutions&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Entry',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-23 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-08-25 02:50:44.000000','2026-08-25 02:50:44.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"API Integration\", \"Artificial Intelligence\", \"Azure\", \"Machine Learning\", \"Python\", \"Semantic Search\", \"ServiceNow\", \"Azure Data Lake Storage\", \"Generative AI\", \"Prompt Engineering\", \"LangChain\", \"Vector Store\", \"LLM Fine-tuning\", \"OpenAI\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;rdheb3&quot; data-start=&quot;1036&quot; data-end=&quot;1083&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a leading global MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ho1nuw&quot; data-start=&quot;1084&quot; data-end=&quot;1158&quot;&gt;Work on enterprise-scale &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1111&quot; data-end=&quot;1158&quot;&gt;Generative AI and Machine Learning projects&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1nfev0s&quot; data-start=&quot;1159&quot; data-end=&quot;1227&quot;&gt;Exposure to &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1173&quot; data-end=&quot;1227&quot;&gt;Azure OpenAI, RAG, LLMs, and AI-powered automation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;c8upx8&quot; data-start=&quot;1228&quot; data-end=&quot;1288&quot;&gt;Opportunity to design AI architecture and model strategies&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;ysvnv8&quot; data-start=&quot;1289&quot; data-end=&quot;1365&quot;&gt;Work on real-world &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1310&quot; data-end=&quot;1355&quot;&gt;AIOps and intelligent incident management&lt;/strong&gt; use cases&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;15e9h5w&quot; data-start=&quot;1366&quot; data-end=&quot;1429&quot;&gt;Exposure to ServiceNow and enterprise observability platforms&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;10yaokc&quot; data-start=&quot;1430&quot; data-end=&quot;1497&quot;&gt;Opportunity to mentor AI engineers and lead technical initiatives&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;176xwzo&quot; data-start=&quot;1498&quot; data-end=&quot;1563&quot;&gt;Work with modern AI frameworks and vector database technologies&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ql69eh&quot; data-start=&quot;1564&quot; data-end=&quot;1647&quot;&gt;Strong career growth in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1590&quot; data-end=&quot;1647&quot;&gt;GenAI, AI Engineering, and Enterprise AI Architecture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('85181b28-3e40-40d9-a267-0a398a631210','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Data & Analytics Specialist','data-analytics-specialist-339-339','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;69&quot; data-end=&quot;461&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced Data &amp;amp; Analytics Specialists for a leading Top MNC to work on enterprise-scale Data Analytics, Business Intelligence, and Digital Transformation initiatives. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in data analytics, business intelligence, data engineering, and visualization technologies to deliver actionable business insights across enterprise functions.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;463&quot; data-end=&quot;888&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for analyzing complex datasets, designing and developing interactive dashboards, building scalable ETL pipelines, and implementing data models that support business intelligence and analytics initiatives. The role includes transforming raw data into meaningful insights, optimizing reporting solutions, ensuring data quality, and enabling data-driven decision-making across the organization.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;890&quot; data-end=&quot;1222&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with Python, SQL, Power BI, Tableau, ETL tools, data modeling, data warehousing, and modern cloud-based analytics platforms. Strong knowledge of Snowflake, Amazon Redshift, Google BigQuery, Azure Data Factory, Informatica, Talend, and enterprise reporting solutions is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1224&quot; data-end=&quot;1645&quot;&gt;The role also involves collaborating with business stakeholders, data engineers, data scientists, and cross-functional teams to gather requirements, develop analytics solutions, improve data governance, optimize database performance, and support predictive analytics and machine learning initiatives. Candidates should possess strong analytical thinking, communication, stakeholder management, and problem-solving skills.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-09-13 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-07-16 02:23:45.000000','2026-07-16 02:23:45.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Business Intelligence\", \"Data Analytics\", \"Data Integration\", \"Data Modeling\", \"Data Validation\", \"Data Warehousing\", \"ETL\", \"Informatica\", \"PostgreSQL\", \"Power BI\", \"Python\", \"Snowflake\", \"SQL\", \"Tableau\", \"ADF\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1661&quot; data-end=&quot;1699&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;93976g&quot; data-start=&quot;1700&quot; data-end=&quot;1782&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale Data Analytics and Business Intelligence projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1pc816z&quot; data-start=&quot;1783&quot; data-end=&quot;1869&quot;&gt;Work with modern cloud analytics, data engineering, and visualization technologies&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;m286vf&quot; data-start=&quot;1870&quot; data-end=&quot;1950&quot;&gt;Career growth in Data Analytics, Business Intelligence, and Data Engineering&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;vq0hl0&quot; data-start=&quot;1951&quot; data-end=&quot;2023&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global business and technology teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot; data-start=&quot;2024&quot; data-end=&quot;2079&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;2080&quot; data-end=&quot;2123&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('85889953-a7dc-4c73-82e3-6ad30c32be5f','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','LIMS Techno Functional Lead','lims-techno-functional-lead-229-229','