art=&quot;264&quot; data-end=&quot;292&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;266&quot; data-end=&quot;292&quot;&gt;Leadership opportunities&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;377&quot; data-end=&quot;400&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;379&quot; data-end=&quot;400&quot;&gt;Mentorship programs&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;377&quot; data-end=&quot;400&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;379&quot; data-end=&quot;400&quot;&gt;Strong market presence&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;401&quot; data-end=&quot;433&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;403&quot; data-end=&quot;433&quot;&gt;Exposure to new technologies&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('865992dd-ae16-48cf-aad4-d91858d67eff','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Collibra Engineer','collibra-engineer-298-298','&lt;p data-start=&quot;59&quot; data-end=&quot;390&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced Collibra Engineers for a leading Top MNC to work on enterprise-scale Data Governance, Metadata Management, and Data Marketplace initiatives. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in Collibra platform development, governance frameworks, data cataloging, and enterprise data management solutions.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;392&quot; data-end=&quot;725&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for designing, developing, enhancing, and maintaining Collibra-based Data Governance solutions and Data Marketplace capabilities. The role includes managing metadata frameworks, implementing governance policies, enhancing Collibra metamodels, and supporting enterprise-wide data governance programs.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;727&quot; data-end=&quot;1063&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with Collibra Data Governance, Collibra Data Marketplace, Collibra Metamodel customization, and governance workflow implementation. Strong understanding of data governance frameworks, metadata management, data quality processes, and enterprise data management practices is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1065&quot; data-end=&quot;1412&quot;&gt;The role also involves collaborating with business stakeholders, data stewards, data architects, and technical teams to drive governance adoption, improve data accessibility, and ensure compliance with organizational data standards. Candidates should possess excellent analytical, communication, stakeholder management, and problem-solving skills.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-08-22 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-06-24 02:49:24.000000','2026-06-24 02:49:25.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Stakeholder Management\", \"Metadata Management\", \"Collibra\", \"Collibra Data Governance\", \"Collibra Metamodel\", \"Data Lineage\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1428&quot; data-end=&quot;1466&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;79c1d&quot; data-start=&quot;1467&quot; data-end=&quot;1527&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale Data Governance initiatives&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;19oeocd&quot; data-start=&quot;1528&quot; data-end=&quot;1591&quot;&gt;Work on advanced Collibra and Metadata Management solutions&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1kr89jb&quot; data-start=&quot;1592&quot; data-end=&quot;1653&quot;&gt;Career growth in Data Governance &amp;amp; Data Management domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;182irwx&quot; data-start=&quot;1654&quot; data-end=&quot;1725&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global business and technical teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot; data-start=&quot;1726&quot; data-end=&quot;1781&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;1782&quot; data-end=&quot;1825&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('866dba85-4584-4aa6-ac4f-3357a070936c','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Sr .NET Azure Lead/Developer','sr-net-azure-leaddeveloper-67-67','&lt;p data-start=&quot;158&quot; data-end=&quot;405&quot;&gt;We are looking for an experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;192&quot; data-end=&quot;225&quot;&gt;Sr. .Net Azure Lead/Developer&lt;/strong&gt; to join our team. If you have a passion for designing, developing, and delivering cutting-edge solutions using &lt;strong data-start=&quot;337&quot; data-end=&quot;350&quot;&gt;.NET Core&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong data-start=&quot;355&quot; data-end=&quot;376&quot;&gt;Azure Development&lt;/strong&gt;, this is the role for you.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;407&quot; data-end=&quot;434&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;407&quot; data-end=&quot;432&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;435&quot; data-end=&quot;977&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;435&quot; data-end=&quot;524&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;437&quot; data-end=&quot;524&quot;&gt;Lead and contribute to the design and architecture of .Net and Azure-based solutions.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;525&quot; data-end=&quot;635&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;527&quot; data-end=&quot;635&quot;&gt;Develop, deploy, and maintain &lt;strong data-start=&quot;557&quot; data-end=&quot;576&quot;&gt;Azure Functions&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong data-start=&quot;578&quot; data-end=&quot;600&quot;&gt;Azure App Services&lt;/strong&gt;, and containerized applications.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;636&quot; data-end=&quot;753&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;638&quot; data-end=&quot;753&quot;&gt;Build and integrate APIs and microservices with robust unit testing frameworks like &lt;strong data-start=&quot;722&quot; data-end=&quot;750&quot;&gt;MSTest, NUnit, and XUnit&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;754&quot; data-end=&quot;872&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;756&quot; data-end=&quot;872&quot;&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional teams to execute Agile delivery practices and ensure seamless project execution.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;873&quot; data-end=&quot;977&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;875&quot; data-end=&quot;977&quot;&gt;Drive complex solutions with minimal supervision and mentor team members in adopting best practices.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',1000000.00,2000000.00,'₹',0,'India','Hyderabad',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-19 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-07-01 12:00:53.000000','2025-11-21 04:56:05.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\".NET CORE\", \".NET Framework\", \"Agile\", \"Angular\", \"API Design\", \"API Integration\", \"Azure App Service\", \"Azure Developer Associate\", \"Docker\", \"NUnit Testing\", \"React JS\", \"Strong Communication Skills.\", \"Unit Testing\", \"Api Management\"]','[\"&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1004&quot; data-end=&quot;1377&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1004&quot; data-end=&quot;1073&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1006&quot; data-end=&quot;1073&quot;&gt;Competitive compensation package aligned with industry standards.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1074&quot; data-end=&quot;1178&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1076&quot; data-end=&quot;1178&quot;&gt;Opportunities to work on advanced technologies like &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1128&quot; data-end=&quot;1141&quot;&gt;.NET Core&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1146&quot; data-end=&quot;1175&quot;&gt;Azure Cloud PaaS services&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1179&quot; data-end=&quot;1259&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1181&quot; data-end=&quot;1259&quot;&gt;Professional growth with leadership opportunities and certification support.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1260&quot; data-end=&quot;1312&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1262&quot; data-end=&quot;1312&quot;&gt;A collaborative and innovative work environment.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1313&quot; data-end=&quot;1377&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1315&quot; data-end=&quot;1377&quot;&gt;Flexible work arrangements and a focus on work-life balance.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Telangana'),('876d37e2-fd2a-48eb-9a80-26195ac711fd','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Software Engineer (Kotlin / Java / Python - Microservices)','software-engineer-kotlin-java-python-microservices-113-113','&lt;br /&gt;The position is for a Backend or Full Stack Developer with 4&amp;ndash;6 years of experience.&lt;br /&gt;The candidate should be skilled in Kotlin, Java, or Python and have hands-on experience in microservices architecture and messaging systems (AWS SNS/SQS).&lt;br /&gt;Knowledge of frontend technologies (React, CSS, HTML) is a plus','Information Technology','Contract','Entry',NULL,NULL,'INR',1,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2025-12-05 18:30:00',0,0,'2025-10-07 13:55:19.000000','2025-10-07 13:55:51.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"AWS\", \"CSS\", \"HTML\", \"Java\", \"KOTLIN\", \"Microservices\", \"Python\", \"React\", \"SNS (Simple Notification Service)\"]','[\"Opportunity to work with a global brand&amp;nbsp;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Competitive salary and performance bonuses&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Exposure to latest cloud and frontend technologies\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('8795e16a-fad6-4700-aa31-95afd8c590dd','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Senior Python Developer','senior-python-developer-17-17','Job Description: We are seeking a highly skilled and experienced Senior Python Developer to join our team. The ideal candidate will be responsible for designing, developing, and deploying scalable Python applications, collaborating with cross-functional teams, and ensuring code quality and performance. You will work on backend development, API integrations, and data processing pipelines, contributing to the continuous improvement of our systems Key Responsibilities: Design and develop scalable and efficient Python applications. Build and maintain RESTful APIs and microservices. Collaborate with front-end developers, DevOps, and data teams to deliver full-stack solutions. Write clean, maintainable, and well-documented code following best practices. Optimize and refactor existing code to improve performance and reliability. Work with databases (SQL and NoSQL) to design and manage data models. Develop and integrate with third-party APIs and services. Implement and manage CI/CD pipelines for automated testing and deployment. Conduct code reviews and provide mentorship to junior developers. Troubleshoot and debug complex issues in production environments. Stay updated with the latest Python frameworks, libraries, and technologies. Required Skills: 5+ years of experience in Python development. Strong proficiency in Python frameworks (Django, Flask, or FastAPI). Experience with API development and integration. Proficiency in SQL and NoSQL databases (PostgreSQL, MySQL, MongoDB, or Redis). Experience with version control systems (Git, GitHub, GitLab, or Bitbucket). Strong understanding of data structures and algorithms. Experience with Docker and containerized applications. Hands-on experience with unit testing and debugging. Familiarity with cloud platforms (AWS, Azure, or GCP). Proficiency in writing and optimizing SQL queries. Strong problem-solving skills and attention to detail.','Information Technology','Contract','Entry',300000.00,600000.00,'₹',1,'India','Hyderabad',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2025-07-03 18:30:00',0,0,'2025-05-05 02:38:20.000000','2025-05-05 02:38:20.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"API\", \"API Gateway\", \"Azure API Management\", \"Basic Python\", \"Core Python\", \"Python 3\", \"Python Fullstack\"]','[\"Perks &amp;amp; Benefits: Competitive salary package Career growth opportunities Comprehensive health insurance Hybrid work model Performance-based incentives Learning and development programs\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Telangana'),('879ddd2c-6390-4682-aaad-fc645c8fd6b3','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Full Stack Developer (React JS, C#, Dotnet, SQL)','full-stack-developer-react-js-c-dotnet-sql-243-243','1. React JS, Dotnet and SQL &lt;br /&gt;2. Very good hands-on exp (5 + years) in the above skill sets &lt;br /&gt;3. Exp in Development and Enhancement project.&lt;br /&gt;4. Able to debug complex API&#039;s and stored procedure.&lt;br /&gt;5. Good communication skills&lt;br /&gt;6. Hands on exp in Active MQ/Microservices&lt;br /&gt;7. Good in Rest API','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',1,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-05-30 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-04-07 17:23:09.000000','2026-04-07 17:23:09.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\".NET\", \".NET CORE\", \".NET Framework\", \".NET Framework 6\", \"C#\", \"JavaScript\", \"MYSQL\", \"Node JS\", \"React\", \"React JS\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1b8ludi&quot; data-start=&quot;57&quot; data-end=&quot;112&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and performance-based incentives&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;wa1cqy&quot; data-start=&quot;113&quot; data-end=&quot;152&quot;&gt;Health insurance (medical coverage)&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1elu4nz&quot; data-start=&quot;153&quot; data-end=&quot;191&quot;&gt;Paid leaves (casual, sick, earned)&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1sa4caw&quot; data-start=&quot;192&quot; data-end=&quot;243&quot;&gt;Flexible working hours / Work-from-home options&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;17iplkr&quot; data-start=&quot;244&quot; data-end=&quot;288&quot;&gt;Career growth and learning opportunities&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1uu5yk4&quot; data-start=&quot;289&quot; data-end=&quot;327&quot;&gt;Training and certification support&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('87c99d6d-29ad-4804-9942-a36cab4f43a1','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','MES Developer – Emerson Syncade','mes-developer-emerson-syncade-287-287','&lt;p data-start=&quot;73&quot; data-end=&quot;431&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced MES Developers for a leading Top MNC to work on Manufacturing Execution System (MES) projects with a strong focus on Emerson Syncade and pharmaceutical manufacturing environments. The ideal candidate should have hands-on experience in MES development, configuration, and support activities within regulated manufacturing industries.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;433&quot; data-end=&quot;798&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for developing, configuring, and maintaining Emerson Syncade MES solutions while supporting manufacturing operations and digital transformation initiatives. The role includes understanding business and manufacturing requirements, implementing MES enhancements, executing test cases, and ensuring system reliability and performance.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;800&quot; data-end=&quot;1051&quot;&gt;Professionals should have strong knowledge of MES environments and manufacturing suites such as Aspen, AMS IP21, A1PE, and APRM. Experience with SQL scripting, validation processes, and pharmaceutical manufacturing operations will be highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1053&quot; data-end=&quot;1401&quot;&gt;The role also involves project planning, stakeholder communication, risk management, documentation updates, customer support, and coordination with technical and business teams. Candidates should possess strong analytical, troubleshooting, communication, and problem-solving skills to support successful MES project delivery and ongoing operations.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-08-08 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-06-10 01:59:41.000000','2026-06-10 01:59:41.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Aspen HYSYS\", \"Manufacturing Execution Systems\", \"Mes Configuration\", \"MES Development\", \"Risk Management\", \"System Design\", \"Test Case Preparation\", \"Emerson Syncade MES\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1417&quot; data-end=&quot;1455&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;19ty62p&quot; data-start=&quot;1456&quot; data-end=&quot;1516&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-level MES implementation projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1460knm&quot; data-start=&quot;1517&quot; data-end=&quot;1589&quot;&gt;Work on Emerson Syncade and manufacturing digitalization initiatives&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1t0cbpi&quot; data-start=&quot;1590&quot; data-end=&quot;1652&quot;&gt;Career growth in MES &amp;amp; Pharmaceutical Manufacturing domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;141aabr&quot; data-start=&quot;1653&quot; data-end=&quot;1732&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global stakeholders and manufacturing teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;45fk39&quot; data-start=&quot;1733&quot; data-end=&quot;1788&quot;&gt;Professional and technology-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;1789&quot; data-end=&quot;1832&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('87caf799-8b7c-4b4c-a3c0-def13d0baf9f','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Apriso Senior Developer','apriso-senior-developer-305-305','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;65&quot; data-end=&quot;376&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced Apriso Senior Developers for a leading Top MNC to work on enterprise-scale MES and Manufacturing Digital Transformation projects. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in DELMIA Apriso/FlexNet, MES implementations, manufacturing operations, and large-scale upgrade programs.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;378&quot; data-end=&quot;721&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for designing, developing, upgrading, and supporting Apriso MES solutions across global manufacturing environments. The role includes executing Apriso version upgrade projects, developing customized MES applications, implementing integrations, and providing technical leadership throughout project lifecycles.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;723&quot; data-end=&quot;1043&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with Apriso Process Builder, Screen Framework, AJAX, HTML, JavaScript, .NET, CSS, SQL Server, and T-SQL development. Strong knowledge of machine integration, ERP integration, OPC connectivity, deployment management, and manufacturing execution processes is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1045&quot; data-end=&quot;1407&quot;&gt;The role also involves leading development teams, resolving complex technical challenges, supporting HyperCare activities, managing release deployments through GPM, and collaborating directly with customers and stakeholders to ensure successful project delivery. Candidates should possess strong leadership, communication, analytical, and problem-solving skills.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Pune',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-08-23 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-06-25 02:42:32.000000','2026-06-25 02:42:32.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\".NET Development\", \"AJAX\", \"Apriso\", \"CSS\", \"Delmia Apriso\", \"FlexSim\", \"HTML\", \"JavaScript\", \"Mes Deployment\", \"MYSQL\", \"Transact-SQL\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1423&quot; data-end=&quot;1461&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1tv5fk7&quot; data-start=&quot;1462&quot; data-end=&quot;1540&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale MES and Manufacturing Transformation projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;dh0rgw&quot; data-start=&quot;1541&quot; data-end=&quot;1609&quot;&gt;Work on advanced DELMIA Apriso and Smart Manufacturing solutions&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1kmt4tx&quot; data-start=&quot;1610&quot; data-end=&quot;1672&quot;&gt;Career growth in MES &amp;amp; Manufacturing Digitalization domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;8vszhn&quot; data-start=&quot;1673&quot; data-end=&quot;1737&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global manufacturing clients&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1x0zm8v&quot; data-start=&quot;1738&quot; data-end=&quot;1797&quot;&gt;Leadership opportunities in technical solution delivery&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot; data-start=&quot;1798&quot; data-end=&quot;1853&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;1854&quot; data-end=&quot;1897&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Maharashtra'),('87eadeed-ce3c-4391-a042-509dd576398c','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Wonderware MES Support Executive – Aveva Wonderware Suite','wonderware-mes-support-executive-aveva-wonderware-suite-33-33','&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot; data-start=&quot;467&quot; data-end=&quot;493&quot;&gt;Job Description:&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot; data-start=&quot;494&quot; data-end=&quot;795&quot;&gt;We are seeking a skilled Wonderware MES Support Executive with hands-on experience in supporting Aveva Wonderware MES solutions. The ideal candidate will have strong technical troubleshooting skills, MES configuration knowledge, and the ability to provide L3 support across multiple sites.&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;832&quot; data-end=&quot;1419&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;832&quot; data-end=&quot;930&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;834&quot; data-end=&quot;930&quot;&gt;Provide 24/7 L3 technical support for Wonderware MES Suite (Operations, Performance, OEE).&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;931&quot; data-end=&quot;1084&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;933&quot; data-end=&quot;1084&quot;&gt;Configure, troubleshoot, and support Wonderware ArchestrA IDE, MES, System Platform, InTouch, Historian, Skelta Workflow, and Information Server.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1085&quot; data-end=&quot;1168&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1087&quot; data-end=&quot;1168&quot;&gt;Handle incident resolution and communicate regular status updates to customers.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1169&quot; data-end=&quot;1254&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1171&quot; data-end=&quot;1254&quot;&gt;Develop and troubleshoot MS SQL Stored Procedures as part of MES integration.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1255&quot; data-end=&quot;1344&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1257&quot; data-end=&quot;1344&quot;&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional teams to ensure seamless MES operation and support.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1345&quot; data-end=&quot;1419&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1347&quot; data-end=&quot;1419&quot;&gt;Ensure documentation and knowledge base updates for all resolved issues.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\nMust-Have Skills:&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1452&quot; data-end=&quot;1939&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot; data-start=&quot;1452&quot; data-end=&quot;1514&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div data-start=&quot;1454&quot; data-end=&quot;1514&quot;&gt;5+ years of experience in Wonderware MES Suite support&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot; data-start=&quot;1515&quot; data-end=&quot;1738&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div data-start=&quot;1517&quot; data-end=&quot;1532&quot;&gt;Expertise in:&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1535&quot; data-end=&quot;1738&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1535&quot; data-end=&quot;1601&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1537&quot; data-end=&quot;1601&quot;&gt;Wonderware ArchestrA IDE, MES Operations, Performance, OEE&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1604&quot; data-end=&quot;1687&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1606&quot; data-end=&quot;1687&quot;&gt;System Platform, Historian, InTouch, Skelta Workflow, Enterprise Integrator&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1690&quot; data-end=&quot;1738&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1692&quot; data-end=&quot;1738&quot;&gt;MS SQL programming and stored procedures&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot; data-start=&quot;1739&quot; data-end=&quot;1799&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div data-start=&quot;1741&quot; data-end=&quot;1799&quot;&gt;Strong troubleshooting and customer communication skills&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot; data-start=&quot;1800&quot; data-end=&quot;1862&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div data-start=&quot;1802&quot; data-end=&quot;1862&quot;&gt;Experience in the CPG (Consumer Packaged Goods) domain&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1863&quot; data-end=&quot;1939&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot; data-start=&quot;1865&quot; data-end=&quot;1939&quot;&gt;Degree in Electrical, Electronics, ECE, or Instrumentation Engineering&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',500000.00,2500000.00,'₹',0,'India','Pune',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2025-07-13 18:30:00',0,0,'2025-05-15 14:09:30.000000','2025-05-19 04:48:38.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"AvevaWonderware\", \"Historian\", \"Mes\", \"Mes Support\", \"Mes Workflow Automation\", \"MS SQL Server\", \"SCADA\", \"SCADA Systems\", \"AVEVA System\", \"AVEVA Intouch HMI\"]','[\"&lt;h3 class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1946&quot; data-end=&quot;1967&quot;&gt;Job Benefits:&lt;/h3&gt;\\r\\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1968&quot; data-end=&quot;2221&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1968&quot; data-end=&quot;2036&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1970&quot; data-end=&quot;2036&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with global industrial automation leaders&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2037&quot; data-end=&quot;2095&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2039&quot; data-end=&quot;2095&quot;&gt;Skill enhancement in MES/SCADA/Automation platforms&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2096&quot; data-end=&quot;2127&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2098&quot; data-end=&quot;2127&quot;&gt;Competitive compensation&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2128&quot; data-end=&quot;2180&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2130&quot; data-end=&quot;2180&quot;&gt;Work flexibility depending on site/project&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2181&quot; data-end=&quot;2221&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2183&quot; data-end=&quot;2221&quot;&gt;Pan India deployment and exposure&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Maharashtra'),('88475616-a21f-4274-add0-774126f07421','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Technical Architect','technical-architect-350-350','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;61&quot; data-end=&quot;427&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;87&quot; data-end=&quot;111&quot;&gt;Technical Architects&lt;/strong&gt; for a leading Top MNC to drive enterprise-scale Digital Transformation, Cloud Modernization, and AI-powered enterprise solutions. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in enterprise architecture, Azure cloud technologies, ServiceNow, AI/GenAI platforms, enterprise integration, and security architecture.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;429&quot; data-end=&quot;904&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for designing end-to-end enterprise solution architectures that integrate ServiceNow, Azure AI, observability platforms, knowledge repositories, and enterprise applications. The role includes defining scalable cloud architectures, designing secure API-based integration strategies, establishing architectural standards, ensuring compliance with enterprise governance policies, and delivering high-performance, resilient enterprise solutions.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;906&quot; data-end=&quot;1380&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with Azure Architecture, ServiceNow Architecture, Enterprise Integration, AI/GenAI Architecture, API Design, cloud-native application architecture, security frameworks, and modern integration technologies. Strong understanding of Azure services, microservices architecture, event-driven integration, observability platforms, identity and access management, governance, and enterprise security best practices is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1382&quot; data-end=&quot;1901&quot;&gt;The role also involves collaborating with solution architects, AI engineers, backend developers, cloud engineers, business stakeholders, and global delivery teams to translate business requirements into scalable technical solutions. Candidates will define technology roadmaps, mentor engineering teams, conduct architecture reviews, ensure solution quality, and drive enterprise architecture best practices. Strong leadership, communication, stakeholder management, analytical, and problem-solving skills are essential.&lt;/p&gt;','Infrastructure Management','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-09-20 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-07-23 02:10:41.000000','2026-07-23 02:10:41.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"AI/ML\", \"API Design\", \"API Integration\", \"Azure\", \"Microsoft Azure Platform\", \"REST API\", \"Risk Management\", \"ServiceNow\", \"Technical Support\", \"IAM - Configuration & Management\", \"Solution Design\", \"OpenAI\", \"Enterprise Architecture\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1917&quot; data-end=&quot;1955&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;13a767z&quot; data-start=&quot;1956&quot; data-end=&quot;2035&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale Cloud, AI, and Digital Transformation projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1hbxxyh&quot; data-start=&quot;2036&quot; data-end=&quot;2125&quot;&gt;Work with modern Azure, ServiceNow, AI/GenAI, and Enterprise Integration technologies&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1vwzff4&quot; data-start=&quot;2126&quot; data-end=&quot;2214&quot;&gt;Career growth in Enterprise Architecture, Cloud Architecture, and AI Solution Design&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1pynldn&quot; data-start=&quot;2215&quot; data-end=&quot;2290&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global engineering and technology teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot; data-start=&quot;2291&quot; data-end=&quot;2346&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;2347&quot; data-end=&quot;2390&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('887bf936-de17-4706-a476-8821b3e1f9d8','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','BEV Consultant – Siemens OpCenter','bev-consultant-siemens-opcenter-351-351','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;75&quot; data-end=&quot;484&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;101&quot; data-end=&quot;139&quot;&gt;BEV Consultants &amp;ndash; Siemens OpCenter&lt;/strong&gt; for a leading Top MNC to support large-scale Manufacturing IT, Manufacturing Execution System (MES), and Battery Electric Vehicle (BEV) manufacturing transformation initiatives. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in Siemens OpCenter Discrete, MES configuration, manufacturing workflows, system integration, and production support.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;486&quot; data-end=&quot;944&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for configuring and customizing Siemens OpCenter Discrete modules, developing user interfaces, workflows, and data models, and supporting manufacturing operations across production, quality, logistics, and production control processes. The role involves working on a major battery manufacturing plant / Manufacturing Operations Management (MOM) implementation and delivering reliable MES solutions for shop-floor operations.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;946&quot; data-end=&quot;1377&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with Siemens OpCenter Discrete, OpCenter configuration, MES implementation and support, SQL, C#/Python/JavaScript, API and Web Services, MES-to-ERP integration, and MES-to-PLC integration. Experience troubleshooting production issues, optimizing MES performance, performing unit and system testing, and providing Tier-3 technical support during production launches is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-09 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-08-11 02:52:46.000000','2026-08-11 02:52:47.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"API Integration\", \"C#\", \"Data Modeling\", \"JavaScript\", \"Mes\", \"Mes Implementation\", \"PLC Systems\", \"Python\", \"Siemens Opcenter\", \"SQL\", \"Workflow Configuration\", \"Siemens OpCenter Discrete\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1763&quot; data-end=&quot;1801&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;571r7h&quot; data-start=&quot;1802&quot; data-end=&quot;1882&quot;&gt;Exposure to large-scale Siemens OpCenter MES and MOM implementation projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;10ohnwl&quot; data-start=&quot;1883&quot; data-end=&quot;1965&quot;&gt;Work on cutting-edge BEV, battery manufacturing, and Smart Factory initiatives&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;7607zf&quot; data-start=&quot;1966&quot; data-end=&quot;2035&quot;&gt;Career growth in Manufacturing IT, MES, and Digital Manufacturing&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;13qji02&quot; data-start=&quot;2036&quot; data-end=&quot;2113&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global manufacturing and technology teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;lbdux7&quot; data-start=&quot;2114&quot; data-end=&quot;2174&quot;&gt;Exposure to MES-ERP and MES-PLC integration environments&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot; data-start=&quot;2175&quot; data-end=&quot;2230&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('88de5f6f-d555-44d0-a8fc-440003af19a5','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Technical Support & System Engineer – Fresher','technical-support-system-engineer-fresher-283-283','&lt;p data-start=&quot;87&quot; data-end=&quot;406&quot;&gt;We are hiring enthusiastic and motivated Freshers for the role of Technical Support &amp;amp; System Engineer with a leading Top MNC in Bangalore. This is an excellent opportunity for candidates looking to build a career in Technical Support, Linux Administration, Networking, System Engineering, and IT Infrastructure Support.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;408&quot; data-end=&quot;722&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for providing technical assistance, system monitoring, troubleshooting, and supporting IT infrastructure environments. The role includes working with Linux servers, networking technologies, virtualization platforms, and enterprise support tools to ensure smooth system operations.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;724&quot; data-end=&quot;1020&quot;&gt;Professionals should have basic knowledge of Linux administration (CentOS/RHEL preferred), networking concepts, SSH, shell scripting, virtualization technologies, Active Directory, Office 365, and database fundamentals. Knowledge of GitHub and any programming language will be an added advantage.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1022&quot; data-end=&quot;1383&quot;&gt;The role also involves collaborating with internal teams and clients, supporting deployment and maintenance activities, troubleshooting technical issues, and providing user support. Candidates should possess strong communication, analytical, problem-solving, and pr