er-emerson-syncade-pharma-domain-103-103','We are looking for an experienced MES Developer with expertise in Emerson Syncade system development. The role involves working on manufacturing execution systems, configuration, development, and integration with pharma manufacturing applications. The candidate will be responsible for managing project plans, resources, risks, and deliverables while coordinating with multiple stakeholders.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Development and configuration in MES (Emerson Syncade) and Manufacturing Suite (Aspen, AMS: IP21, AIPE, APRM, etc.)&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Manage and control project plans, finances, risks, and dependencies.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Provide weekly status reports to stakeholders.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Identify, escalate, and resolve project issues.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Ensure overall quality of deliverables and manage TCS team.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Execute system test cases based on requirements.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Create/update documents required for tech refresh projects.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Understand technical data shared by client sites.','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-30 06:00:00',0,0,'2025-09-23 06:31:33.000000','2026-05-06 18:03:31.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"AMS Professional\", \"Aspen HYSYS\", \"Manufacturing\", \"Mes\", \"Mes Oee\", \"Pharmaceutical\", \"Scripting\", \"SQL\", \"Strong Product And Application Knowledge\", \"Validation Processes\", \"Emerson DeltaV\"]','[\"Opportunity to work on global pharma projects with a leading client.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Exposure to MES (Emerson Syncade) and Pharma OEE systems.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Collaborative work environment across cross-functional teams.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Long-term growth opportunities with cutting-edge MES technologies.\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('8c4f6556-e1f7-4550-8f5a-a9889b3460c5','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','MES offshore lead','mes-offshore-lead-248-248','&amp;middot; Experience in Pharma&lt;br /&gt;&amp;middot; Hands on experience of any of MES application, &lt;br /&gt;&amp;middot; Must have MES configuration &amp;amp; development experience. &lt;br /&gt;&amp;middot; Work Order management, batch management, label printing, material consumption, bill of materials, audit trail and historian, training management, resource management&lt;br /&gt;&amp;middot; Hands on experience on database like SQL server &amp;middot; MES Production support','Information Technology','Contract','Entry',NULL,NULL,'INR',1,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-06-15 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-04-16 20:57:01.000000','2026-04-16 20:57:01.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Label Print Configuration\", \"Labelling\", \"Mes\", \"MYSQL\", \"Pharmaceuticals\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1b8ludi&quot; data-start=&quot;57&quot; data-end=&quot;112&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and performance-based incentives&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;wa1cqy&quot; data-start=&quot;113&quot; data-end=&quot;152&quot;&gt;Health insurance (medical coverage)&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1elu4nz&quot; data-start=&quot;153&quot; data-end=&quot;191&quot;&gt;Paid leaves (casual, sick, earned)&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1sa4caw&quot; data-start=&quot;192&quot; data-end=&quot;243&quot;&gt;Flexible working hours / Work-from-home options&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;17iplkr&quot; data-start=&quot;244&quot; data-end=&quot;288&quot;&gt;Career growth and learning opportunities&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1uu5yk4&quot; data-start=&quot;289&quot; data-end=&quot;327&quot;&gt;Training and certification support&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('8c6eac01-21f4-4353-be52-24b1b109756b','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','EAM / Cognos / BI Specialist','eam-cognos-bi-specialist-147-147','&lt;p data-start=&quot;258&quot; data-end=&quot;682&quot;&gt;We are seeking a highly skilled &lt;strong data-start=&quot;290&quot; data-end=&quot;352&quot;&gt;Hexagon EAM &amp;ndash; BI Report Developer &amp;amp; Integration Specialist&lt;/strong&gt; to design, build, and optimize business intelligence reports and integrations across enterprise systems. The ideal candidate will have strong expertise in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;508&quot; data-end=&quot;520&quot;&gt;Power BI&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong data-start=&quot;522&quot; data-end=&quot;537&quot;&gt;EAM systems&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong data-start=&quot;539&quot; data-end=&quot;546&quot;&gt;SQL&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong data-start=&quot;548&quot; data-end=&quot;558&quot;&gt;Python&lt;/strong&gt;, and &lt;strong data-start=&quot;564&quot; data-end=&quot;590&quot;&gt;API-based integrations&lt;/strong&gt;, with hands-on experience in working with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;633&quot; data-end=&quot;659&quot;&gt;data lake environments&lt;/strong&gt; such as Snowflake/UDH.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;684&quot; data-end=&quot;908&quot;&gt;The role requires a strong understanding of &lt;strong data-start=&quot;728&quot; data-end=&quot;775&quot;&gt;Enterprise Asset Management (EAM) processes&lt;/strong&gt;, as well as the ability to transform complex operational data into insightful dashboards and analytics for business decision-making.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;910&quot; data-end=&quot;939&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;914&quot; data-end=&quot;939&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;941&quot; data-end=&quot;1968&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;941&quot; data-end=&quot;1039&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;943&quot; data-end=&quot;1039&quot;&gt;Develop and maintain &lt;strong data-start=&quot;964&quot; data-end=&quot;997&quot;&gt;Power BI dashboards &amp;amp; reports&lt;/strong&gt; using data sourced from the EAM system.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1040&quot; data-end=&quot;1154&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1042&quot; data-end=&quot;1154&quot;&gt;Collaborate with business teams to gather reporting requirements and convert them into technical BI solutions.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1155&quot; data-end=&quot;1257&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1157&quot; data-end=&quot;1257&quot;&gt;Manage &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1164&quot; data-end=&quot;1195&quot;&gt;EAMS Procurement interfaces&lt;/strong&gt; involving SFTP protocols and SQL Server-based integrations.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1258&quot; data-end=&quot;1392&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1260&quot; data-end=&quot;1392&quot;&gt;Integrate data from &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1280&quot; data-end=&quot;1328&quot;&gt;Snowflake Data Lake / Unified Data Hub (UDH)&lt;/strong&gt; using APIs, Python scripts, and ReactJS components as needed.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1393&quot; data-end=&quot;1477&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1395&quot; data-end=&quot;1477&quot;&gt;Ensure data &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1407&quot; data-end=&quot;1450&quot;&gt;accuracy, consistency, and optimization&lt;/strong&gt; across all BI solutions.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1478&quot; data-end=&quot;1589&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1480&quot; data-end=&quot;1589&quot;&gt;Work closely with EAM functional consultants to understand workflows, data structures, and reporting needs.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1590&quot; data-end=&quot;1689&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1592&quot; data-end=&quot;1689&quot;&gt;Implement data &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1607&quot; data-end=&quot;1652&quot;&gt;validation, transformation, and cleansing&lt;/strong&gt; processes to improve data quality.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1690&quot; data-end=&quot;1797&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1692&quot; data-end=&quot;1797&quot;&gt;Provide production support, troubleshooting, and enhancements for existing BI reports and integrations.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1798&quot; data-end=&quot;1968&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1800&quot; data-end=&quot;1968&quot;&gt;Prepare and maintain &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1821&quot; data-end=&quot;1848&quot;&gt;technical documentation&lt;/strong&gt;, including data models, specifications, and integration flow diagrams (Infor or Hexagon DatabridgePro Dataflow Studio).&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Full-time','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-24 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-11-26 01:39:12.000000','2025-11-26 01:39:12.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"API Integration\", \"Automation\", \"Data Integrity\", \"Data Lake\", \"Data Modeling\", \"Data Validation\", \"ETL Processes\", \"JSON\", \"Power BI\", \"Python\", \"React JS\", \"REST API\", \"Scripting\", \"Snowflake\", \"SQL Server\", \"Stored Procedures\", \"Performance Tuning\", \"Power Query\", \"DAX\", \"Hexagon\", \"UDH\", \"SFTP\", \"Infor EAM Systems\"]','[\"&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2827&quot; data-end=&quot;3407&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2827&quot; data-end=&quot;2887&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2829&quot; data-end=&quot;2887&quot;&gt;Competitive compensation aligned with industry standards&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2888&quot; data-end=&quot;2969&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2890&quot; data-end=&quot;2969&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2915&quot; data-end=&quot;2967&quot;&gt;cutting-edge EAM, BI, and Data Lake technologies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2970&quot; data-end=&quot;3033&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2972&quot; data-end=&quot;3033&quot;&gt;Exposure to large-scale enterprise systems and global teams&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;3034&quot; data-end=&quot;3124&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;3036&quot; data-end=&quot;3124&quot;&gt;Learning and career growth opportunities in BI, Data Engineering, and EAM integrations&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;3125&quot; data-end=&quot;3201&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;3127&quot; data-end=&quot;3201&quot;&gt;Supportive work culture that encourages innovation and skill development&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;3202&quot; data-end=&quot;3264&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;3204&quot; data-end=&quot;3264&quot;&gt;Chance to work on end-to-end BI &amp;amp; integration architecture&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;3265&quot; data-end=&quot;3333&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;3267&quot; data-end=&quot;3333&quot;&gt;Stable and long-term career progression in a top MNC environment&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;3334&quot; data-end=&quot;3407&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;3336&quot; data-end=&quot;3407&quot;&gt;Flexible working environment depending on project/client requirements&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('8cd0c59b-af35-4343-be62-a68e41b0c872','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Wonderware/AVEVA Tools Specialist','wonderwareaveva-tools-specialist-59-59','We are hiring a Wonderware/AVEVA Tools Specialist to join our dynamic team!&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;As an AVEVA Project Engineer, you will play a pivotal role in developing and implementing innovative solutions using Wonderware/AVEVA tools to optimize processes and systems. You will work closely with cross-functional teams to drive operational excellence and deliver value to our clients.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Design, configure, and implement Wonderware/AVEVA System Platform solutions.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Collaborate with teams to integrate MES/MDM systems, OSI PI, and Batch Management solutions.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Work on AVEVA Work Tasks/Skelta modules to optimize workflows.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Provide technical expertise and troubleshooting support for Wonderware/AVEVA tools.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Create and maintain detailed technical documentation and reports.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Required Skills &amp;amp; Qualifications:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;2-10 years of hands-on experience with Wonderware/AVEVA tools.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Expertise in System Platform, MES/MDM, OSI PI, and Batch Management.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Familiarity with AVEVA Work Tasks/Skelta and process automation.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Strong understanding of industrial software systems and data management.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Excellent problem-solving and communication skills.&lt;br /&gt;If you&#039;re ready to make an impact and take your career to the next level, we want to hear from you!','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',500000.00,2000000.00,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-19 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-07-01 08:19:10.000000','2025-11-21 04:57:39.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"AvevaWonderware\", \"MES Order Processing\", \"Industrial Automation\", \"MYSQL\", \"PI System (OSIsoft)\", \"PLC\", \"PLC Programming\", \"Process Control Systems\", \"SCADA Systems\", \"DCS\"]','[\"Competitive salary aligned with industry standards.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Opportunity to work with cutting-edge Wonderware/AVEVA tools and technologies.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Professional growth through exposure to advanced industrial automation systems.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Comprehensive health insurance for you and your family.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Paid time off, including vacation, sick leave, and public holidays.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Training and certification opportunities in Wonderware/AVEVA and related technologies.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Collaborative and innovative work environment.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Chance to work with a dynamic and talented team on impactful projects.\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('8ce391e1-46c6-4492-b119-1837a7a1957b','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','LabX Specialist','labx-specialist-332-332','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;57&quot; data-end=&quot;409&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced LabX Specialists for a leading Top MNC to support enterprise laboratory digitalization and laboratory informatics initiatives. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in Mettler Toledo LabX Software, laboratory instrument integration, system administration, and regulated pharmaceutical or life sciences environments.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;411&quot; data-end=&quot;850&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for configuring, administering, supporting, and optimizing Mettler Toledo LabX Software to ensure efficient laboratory operations and regulatory compliance. The role includes system configuration, instrument integration, user administration, troubleshooting, validation support, data integrity management, and collaboration with laboratory and IT teams to deliver reliable laboratory automation solutions.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;852&quot; data-end=&quot;1265&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with LabX configuration, system administration, analytical instrument integration, Computer System Validation (CSV), GxP regulations, 21 CFR Part 11 compliance, audit trail management, and laboratory automation. Strong understanding of QC/QA laboratory processes, laboratory digitalization, end-user support, and regulated laboratory environments is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1267&quot; data-end=&quot;1686&quot;&gt;The role also involves collaborating with QA, QC, IT teams, laboratory users, and business stakeholders to support implementation projects, system upgrades, documentation, SOP preparation, user training, and continuous improvement initiatives. Candidates should possess strong analytical, communication, stakeholder management, and problem-solving skills while ensuring compliance with quality and regulatory standards.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Hyderabad',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-09-11 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-07-14 02:18:05.000000','2026-07-14 02:18:05.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"CapIQ\", \"CSV\", \"Data Integrity\", \"Gxp Compliance\", \"OQ\", \"PQ\", \"Quality Control (Audit)\", \"21 CFR Part 11\", \"Mettler Toledo LabX Software\", \"LabX Configuration\", \"Laboratory Instrument Integration\", \"Titrator Integration\", \"Balance Integration\", \"pH Meter Integration\", \"Laboratory Automation\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1702&quot; data-end=&quot;1740&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;sj0lu9&quot; data-start=&quot;1741&quot; data-end=&quot;1808&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale Laboratory Digitalization projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;um7fb3&quot; data-start=&quot;1809&quot; data-end=&quot;1882&quot;&gt;Work with advanced Laboratory Informatics and Automation technologies&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;rjc7p9&quot; data-start=&quot;1883&quot; data-end=&quot;1967&quot;&gt;Career growth in Laboratory Information Systems and Digital Laboratory Solutions&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1dbe3vl&quot; data-start=&quot;1968&quot; data-end=&quot;2042&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global laboratory and technology teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;2lee9a&quot; data-start=&quot;2043&quot; data-end=&quot;2098&quot;&gt;Professional and compliance-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;2099&quot; data-end=&quot;2142&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Telangana'),('8d554826-c246-4281-be22-b8eec256a222','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','ReactJs Developer','reactjs-developer-247-247','Mandate Skills:&lt;br /&gt;1. Strong experience in React JS&lt;br /&gt;2. Hands-on experience with MERN Stack (MongoDB, Express.js, React, Node.js)&lt;br /&gt;3. Experience with Redux / Context API&lt;br /&gt;4. Knowledge of cloud platforms (AWS/Azure)&lt;br /&gt;5. Familiarity with Docker or CI/CD pipelines&lt;br /&gt;6. Basic understanding of testing frameworks','Information Technology','Contract','Entry',NULL,NULL,'INR',1,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-06-15 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-04-16 20:54:48.000000','2026-04-16 20:54:48.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"MYSQL\", \"React\", \"React Integration\", \"React JS\", \"React Native\", \"React.JS\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1b8ludi&quot; data-start=&quot;57&quot; data-end=&quot;112&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and performance-based incentives&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;wa1cqy&quot; data-start=&quot;113&quot; data-end=&quot;152&quot;&gt;Health insurance (medical coverage)&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1elu4nz&quot; data-start=&quot;153&quot; data-end=&quot;191&quot;&gt;Paid leaves (casual, sick, earned)&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1sa4caw&quot; data-start=&quot;192&quot; data-end=&quot;243&quot;&gt;Flexible working hours / Work-from-home options&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;17iplkr&quot; data-start=&quot;244&quot; data-end=&quot;288&quot;&gt;Career growth and learning opportunities&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1uu5yk4&quot; data-start=&quot;289&quot; data-end=&quot;327&quot;&gt;Training and certification support&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('8d89298c-0479-42c5-be14-b0359cde291f','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Digital Marketing Specialist','digital-marketing-specialist-126-126','&lt;p data-start=&quot;179&quot; data-end=&quot;643&quot;&gt;We are looking for a passionate and results-driven &lt;strong data-start=&quot;230&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;Digital Marketing Specialist&lt;/strong&gt; to join our client in Pune (Wakad). The ideal candidate will be responsible for planning, executing, and optimizing digital marketing campaigns across multiple platforms. You will manage SEO/SEM strategies, create engaging social media content, monitor campaign performance, and collaborate with internal teams to achieve marketing goals. Immediate or quick joiners are preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;hr data-start=&quot;645&quot; data-end=&quot;648&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;650&quot; data-end=&quot;680&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;654&quot; data-end=&quot;680&quot;&gt;✅ Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;681&quot; data-end=&quot;1052&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;681&quot; data-end=&quot;740&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;683&quot; data-end=&quot;740&quot;&gt;Plan, execute, and optimize digital marketing campaigns&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;741&quot; data-end=&quot;813&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;743&quot; data-end=&quot;813&quot;&gt;Manage SEO and SEM strategies to improve traffic and search rankings&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;814&quot; data-end=&quot;866&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;816&quot; data-end=&quot;866&quot;&gt;Develop and manage engaging social media content&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;867&quot; data-end=&quot;924&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;869&quot; data-end=&quot;924&quot;&gt;Monitor KPIs and prepare detailed performance reports&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;925&quot; data-end=&quot;976&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;927&quot; data-end=&quot;976&quot;&gt;Conduct market research and competitor analysis&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;977&quot; data-end=&quot;1052&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;979&quot; data-end=&quot;1052&quot;&gt;Collaborate with internal teams to support overall marketing objectives&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',300000.00,500000.00,'₹',0,'India','Pune',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-19 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-11-21 05:10:00.000000','2025-11-21 05:10:00.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Digital Marketing\", \"Digital Media\", \"Email Marketing\", \"Google Ad Words\", \"Google Analytics\", \"Marketing\", \"Meta Business Suite\", \"Production Planning & Control (PPC)\", \"SEM\", \"SEO\", \"Social Media Marketing\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;90&quot; data-end=&quot;132&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;92&quot; data-end=&quot;132&quot;&gt;Competitive salary based on experience&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;133&quot; data-end=&quot;196&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;135&quot; data-end=&quot;196&quot;&gt;Fixed &lt;strong data-start=&quot;141&quot; data-end=&quot;165&quot;&gt;5 Days Working (WFO)&lt;/strong&gt; for better work-life balance&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;197&quot; data-end=&quot;259&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;199&quot; data-end=&quot;259&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on diverse digital marketing campaigns&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;260&quot; data-end=&quot;331&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;262&quot; data-end=&quot;331&quot;&gt;Skill development &amp;amp; training support to grow in SEO, SEM &amp;amp; paid ads&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;332&quot; data-end=&quot;379&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;334&quot; data-end=&quot;379&quot;&gt;Collaborative and positive work environment&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;380&quot; data-end=&quot;444&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;382&quot; data-end=&quot;444&quot;&gt;Exposure to the latest trends and tools in digital marketing&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;445&quot; data-end=&quot;500&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;447&quot; data-end=&quot;500&quot;&gt;Career growth opportunities within the organization&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;501&quot; data-end=&quot;532&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;503&quot; data-end=&quot;532&quot;&gt;Immediate joining advantage&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Maharashtra'),('8dcfaa8e-cd54-464e-b16e-628182253d9e','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Computer Vision Expert','computer-vision-expert-300-300','&lt;p data-start=&quot;64&quot; data-end=&quot;429&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced Computer Vision Experts for a leading Top MNC to work on advanced Artificial Intelligence, Visual Language Models (VLMs), Multi-Modal AI, and next-generation computer vision solutions. The ideal candidate should have deep expertise in computer vision algorithms, deep learning frameworks, model optimization, and enterprise AI deployments.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;431&quot; data-end=&quot;806&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for designing, developing, and deploying state-of-the-art computer vision and multi-modal AI solutions for complex business and industrial use cases. The role includes building and optimizing models for object detection, image segmentation, image classification, OCR, scene understanding, image captioning, and visual reasoning applications.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;808&quot; data-end=&quot;1126&quot;&gt;Professionals should have strong hands-on experience with PyTorch, TensorFlow, OpenCV, HuggingFace, Detectron2, and modern Visual Language Models such as CLIP, BLIP, Flamingo, and GPT-4V. Expertise in training, fine-tuning, serving, and optimizing large-scale AI models for production environments is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1128&quot; data-end=&quot;1514&quot;&gt;The role also involves implementing model serving architectures, improving inference performance, enabling hardware acceleration, supporting MLOps practices, and collaborating with AI researchers, data scientists, and engineering teams to deliver enterprise-grade AI solutions. Candidates should possess strong analytical thinking, innovation, communication, and problem-solving skills.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-08-22 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-06-24 03:00:35.000000','2026-06-24 03:00:35.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Computer Vision\", \"PyTorch\", \"TensorFlow\", \"OpenCV\", \"Hugging Face\", \"Visual Language Models (VLMs)\", \"Multi-Modal AI\", \"YOLO\", \"U-Net\", \"GPT-4V\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1530&quot; data-end=&quot;1568&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;txbc6x&quot; data-start=&quot;1569&quot; data-end=&quot;1646&quot;&gt;Exposure to cutting-edge AI, Computer Vision, and Multi-Modal AI projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1c7uxn5&quot; data-start=&quot;1647&quot; data-end=&quot;1718&quot;&gt;Work on advanced Visual Language Models and Generative AI solutions&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1j2czl6&quot; data-start=&quot;1719&quot; data-end=&quot;1788&quot;&gt;Career growth in Artificial Intelligence &amp;amp; Computer Vision domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;zc03ak&quot; data-start=&quot;1789&quot; data-end=&quot;1865&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global AI research and engineering teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot; data-start=&quot;1866&quot; data-end=&quot;1921&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;1922&quot; data-end=&quot;1965&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('8e2b1ba6-066f-411b-8424-0106070296cf','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Senior Java Full Stack Developer (Microservices + Angular)','senior-java-full-stack-developer-microservices-angular-97-97','We are hiring experienced Full Stack Java Developers with strong expertise in Java, Microservices, and Angular, specifically for the Banking &amp;amp; Insurance domain. This role requires hands-on experience in building scalable, cloud-native solutions with AWS, databases, and CI/CD pipelines. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;br /&gt;- Design, develop, and optimize scalable microservices in Java.&lt;br /&gt;- Build user-friendly Angular-based frontends for enterprise applications.&lt;br /&gt;- Work on cloud-native deployments and solutions in AWS.&lt;br /&gt;- Develop and maintain SQL/NoSQL database systems (Oracle preferred).&lt;br /&gt;- Implement CI/CD pipelines using GitLab for smooth deployments.&lt;br /&gt;- Collaborate with cross-functional teams to deliver mission-critical applications.&lt;br /&gt;- Contribute to system architecture and ensure performance, security, and scalability.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Key Requirements:&lt;br /&gt;- 5&amp;ndash;8 years of experience in full-stack Java development.&lt;br /&gt;- Strong expertise in Java, Microservices, Angular.&lt;br /&gt;- Hands-on experience with AWS cloud services.&lt;br /&gt;- Proficiency in SQL/NoSQL, Oracle databases.&lt;br /&gt;- Knowledge of GitLab CI/CD.&lt;br /&gt;- Domain knowledge in Banking and/or Insurance applications.&lt;br /&gt;- Strong problem-solving skills, team collaboration, and communication.','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-19 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-08-27 11:56:29.000000','2025-11-21 04:43:05.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Angular\", \"API Banking\", \"API Integration\", \"AWS\", \"Cloud Native\", \"Enterprise Applications\", \"Full Stack Development\", \"Gitlab\", \"Insurance\", \"Java\", \"Microservices\", \"NoSQL\", \"Oracle\", \"Problem Solving\", \"RESTFUL\", \"Spring Boot\", \"SQL\", \"System Design\", \"CI/CD\"]','[\"- Competitive salary (₹18 LPA &amp;ndash; ₹21 LPA, based on experience).&lt;br /&gt;- 100% Remote &amp;ndash; work from anywhere in India.&lt;br /&gt;- Opportunity to work on mission-critical Banking &amp;amp; Insurance applications.&lt;br /&gt;- Exposure to scalable cloud-native architecture and modern tech stacks.&lt;br /&gt;- Career growth and professional development opportunities.&lt;br /&gt;- Fast-paced, innovative, and collaborative work environment.\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('8e844a9b-7e82-47d1-8c6f-d498d65008e6','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Senior GenAI Developer','senior-genai-developer-213-213','&amp;middot; Design and build LLM-powered applications using RAG, prompt engineering, and agentic patterns&lt;br /&gt;&amp;middot; Develop document intelligence pipelines (ingestion, chunking, embedding, retrieval) &lt;br /&gt;&amp;middot; Implement multi-agent orchestration using LangChain / LlamaIndex / Semantic Kernel &lt;br /&gt;&amp;middot; Integrate GenAI solutions with enterprise platforms (SharePoint, APIs, SDLC tools) &lt;br /&gt;&amp;middot; Optimize prompts, retrieval strategies, latency, and cost&lt;br /&gt;&amp;middot; Deploy solutions using Docker, Kubernetes, and CI/CD pipelines &lt;br /&gt;&amp;middot; Apply Responsible AI, security, and governance guardrails','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'INR',1,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-05-17 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-03-18 17:31:49.000000','2026-03-18 17:31:49.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"API\", \"Docker\", \"Kubernetes\", \"Python\", \"SDLC\", \"Semantic Web\", \"CI/CD\", \"Generative AI\", \"LangChain\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;Competitive salary package with performance-based incentives&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;65&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;67&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;Health insurance coverage and statutory benefits (PF &amp;amp; Gratuity)&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;134&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;136&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on large-scale enterprise energy management projects&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;211&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;213&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;Strong career growth and learning opportunities&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;263&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;265&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;Collaborative and professional work environment&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('8eac6bef-0ba9-4172-ade1-b45dcbd62ea3','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Application Management Support Engineer (Avaloq Platform)','application-management-support-engineer-avaloq-platform-76-76','&lt;p data-start=&quot;235&quot; data-end=&quot;556&quot;&gt;Are you passionate about maintaining a stable and secure operating platform for global financial services? Join us as an &lt;strong data-start=&quot;356&quot; data-end=&quot;399&quot;&gt;Application Management Support Engineer&lt;/strong&gt;, where you&#039;ll work on the &lt;strong data-start=&quot;426&quot; data-end=&quot;445&quot;&gt;Avaloq platform&lt;/strong&gt; and its integration with other key systems, ensuring smooth operations for local and international branches.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;558&quot; data-end=&quot;831&quot;&gt;Your role will involve collaborating with business users, resolving issues, and transitioning monitoring activities. You&amp;rsquo;ll also support future enhancements across platforms while ensuring seamless collaboration between Run-the-Bank (RTB) and Change-the-Bank (CTB) teams.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;hr data-start=&quot;833&quot; data-end=&quot;836&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;838&quot; data-end=&quot;869&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;842&quot; data-end=&quot;867&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;870&quot; data-end=&quot;1263&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;870&quot; data-end=&quot;948&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;872&quot; data-end=&quot;948&quot;&gt;Follow end-to-end incident management processes and ensure SLA compliance.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;949&quot; data-end=&quot;1027&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;951&quot; data-end=&quot;1027&quot;&gt;Analyze and assess the impact of issues, implementing long-term solutions.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1028&quot; data-end=&quot;1120&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1030&quot; data-end=&quot;1120&quot;&gt;Work with CTB and business teams for effective issue resolution and process transitions.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1121&quot; data-end=&quot;1190&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1123&quot; data-end=&quot;1190&quot;&gt;Support testing cycles and ensure solutions are production-ready.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1191&quot; data-end=&quot;1263&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1193&quot; data-end=&quot;1263&quot;&gt;Coordinate production implementations with release management teams.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;hr data-start=&quot;1265&quot; data-end=&quot;1268&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;1270&quot; data-end=&quot;1297&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1274&quot; data-end=&quot;1295&quot;&gt;Must-Have Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1298&quot; data-end=&quot;1584&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1298&quot; data-end=&quot;1360&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1300&quot; data-end=&quot;1360&quot;&gt;Proven experience in RTB or CTB within financial services.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1361&quot; data-end=&quot;1422&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1363&quot; data-end=&quot;1422&quot;&gt;Strong knowledge of ITIL Incident and Problem Management.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1423&quot; data-end=&quot;1489&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1425&quot; data-end=&quot;1489&quot;&gt;Hands-on expertise with Avaloq Core Platform parameterization.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1490&quot; data-end=&quot;1533&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1492&quot; data-end=&quot;1533&quot;&gt;Proficiency in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1507&quot; data-end=&quot;1516&quot;&gt;P/SQL&lt;/strong&gt; and Oracle DB.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1534&quot; data-end=&quot;1584&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1536&quot; data-end=&quot;1584&quot;&gt;Familiarity with Avaloq&amp;rsquo;s ICE code repository.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;hr data-start=&quot;1586&quot; data-end=&quot;1589&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;1591&quot; data-end=&quot;1621&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1595&quot; data-end=&quot;1619&quot;&gt;Good-to-Have Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1622&quot; data-end=&quot;1726&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1622&quot; data-end=&quot;1664&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1624&quot; data-end=&quot;1664&quot;&gt;Fluency in English (German is a plus).&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1665&quot; data-end=&quot;1726&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1667&quot; data-end=&quot;1726&quot;&gt;Analytical mindset with excellent problem-solving skills.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-19 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-07-01 13:43:21.000000','2025-11-21 04:48:36.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Analytical Thinking\", \"Communication Skills\", \"Oracle\", \"PL/SQL\", \"Problem Solving\", \"ITIL framework\", \"Avaloq Parameterization\", \"ICE Code Repository\", \"Run-the-Bank Operations\", \"Change-the-Bank Collaboration\"]','[\"&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1753&quot; data-end=&quot;2084&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1753&quot; data-end=&quot;1823&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1755&quot; data-end=&quot;1823&quot;&gt;Work with leading financial systems and cutting-edge technologies.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1824&quot; data-end=&quot;1896&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1826&quot; data-end=&quot;1896&quot;&gt;Opportunities to enhance technical expertise in the Avaloq platform.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1897&quot; data-end=&quot;1958&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1899&quot; data-end=&quot;1958&quot;&gt;Collaborate with international teams for global exposure.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1959&quot; data-end=&quot;2020&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1961&quot; data-end=&quot;2020&quot;&gt;Competitive compensation aligned with industry standards.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2021&quot; data-end=&quot;2084&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2023&quot; data-end=&quot;2084&quot;&gt;Learning and development opportunities to grow your career.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('8eb935eb-2f62-48ef-abd3-3bc1be52a382','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','LabVantage Solution Architect','labvantage-solution-architect-312-312','&lt;p data-start=&quot;71&quot; data-end=&quot;465&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced LabVantage Solution Architects for a leading Top MNC to lead enterprise-scale Laboratory Information Management System (LIMS) implementation and digital laboratory transformation projects. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in LabVantage solution architecture, system design, configuration, enterprise integrations, and regulated laboratory environments.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;467&quot; data-end=&quot;886&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for designing end-to-end LabVantage LIMS solutions aligned with business, quality, and regulatory requirements. The role includes leading solution architecture, conducting requirements workshops, defining functional and technical designs, configuring workflows, security, master data, reports, dashboards, and ensuring successful implementation across multiple laboratory environments.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;888&quot; data-end=&quot;1275&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with LabVantage configuration, administration, customization, Java, JavaScript, HTML, JSP, Groovy, SQL, database design, API integrations, SDMS connectivity, and laboratory instrument integration. Strong understanding of laboratory operations, quality systems, enterprise architecture, and compliance-driven environments is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1277&quot; data-end=&quot;1724&quot;&gt;The role also involves providing technical leadership to development teams, reviewing solution designs, governing implementation activities, supporting enterprise integrations, and collaborating with business stakeholders, laboratory users, and global project teams. Candidates should possess strong leadership, analytical, communication, documentation, and problem-solving skills with the ability to deliver enterprise-grade laboratory solutions.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-08-24 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-06-26 03:37:17.000000','2026-06-26 03:37:17.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Database Fine Tuning\", \"Groovy\", \"HTML\", \"Java\", \"JavaScript\", \"JSP\", \"RESTFUL APIS\", \"SQL\", \"Workflow\", \"LabVantage\", \"LabVantage LIMS\", \"Solution Design\", \"Master Data Management (MDM)\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1740&quot; data-end=&quot;1778&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;bp4tda&quot; data-start=&quot;1779&quot; data-end=&quot;1851&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale LabVantage LIMS implementation projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;w9qg6s&quot; data-start=&quot;1852&quot; data-end=&quot;1925&quot;&gt;Work with global pharmaceutical, manufacturing, and R&amp;amp;D organizations&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;q3zpu0&quot; data-start=&quot;1926&quot; data-end=&quot;2000&quot;&gt;Career growth in Laboratory Informatics &amp;amp; Solution Architecture domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;i1fuo0&quot; data-start=&quot;2001&quot; data-end=&quot;2079&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with international business and technical teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;144xvrk&quot; data-start=&quot;2080&quot; data-end=&quot;2159&quot;&gt;Leadership role in enterprise digital laboratory transformation initiatives&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;2160&quot; data-end=&quot;2203&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('8ef18eda-0d00-4e8b-82ca-112babe2935b','218df43f-f01c-4414-895e-5368d129091f','b9745af6-2f9b-4b9c-92ab-6fb310858bca','IAM developer','iam-developer-55-55','Years of Experience: 3-5 Years direct experience in IAM Design, Implementation, Security Administration &amp;amp; Configuration.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Shift Time: Same IST - 12 to 9 or 11 to 8 - Flexible with US Calls &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Project duration: 3 months (extendable basis)&lt;br /&gt;Location: Remote&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;JD-Key pointers:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Develop, implement, and maintain IAM solutions, including identity provisioning, access control, authentication, and authorization mechanisms.&lt;br /&gt;Design IAM workflows, policies, and procedures to ensure secure and efficient access management using SAAS Identity &amp;amp; Access Management platforms.&lt;br /&gt;Strong understanding of access control, authentication &amp;amp; authorization.&lt;br /&gt;Manage user onboarding, offboarding, and role changes, ensuring adherence to security policies and compliance requirements.&lt;br /&gt;Must have experience in SCIM REST API, Java, JSON, XML,Webservices, Install, customize, configure, and support identity provisioning and governance tools.&lt;br /&gt;Troubleshoot and resolve L2/L3 technical issues related to IAM configurations, connector integrations, customizations and support hypercare for different project rollouts &amp;amp; phases.&lt;br /&gt;Define and enforce access control policies, including role-based access control (RBAC), least privilege principle, and segregation of duties (SoD).&lt;br /&gt;Perform unit testing, integration testing, and validation of the IAM solutions to ensure they meet quality and security standards.&lt;br /&gt;Good to have exposure on Bean Shell,Groovy,Shell scripting &amp;amp; hands on Terraform script but desired.&lt;br /&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional teams, including IT, security, and compliance, to ensure IAM aligns with business goals.','Information Technology','Full-time','Mid',NULL,NULL,'INR',1,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2025-08-08 18:30:00',0,0,'2025-06-10 10:10:16.000000','2025-06-10 10:10:16.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Administration\", \"IAM Roles And Policies\"]','[]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('8ef54c24-2109-4240-86f1-0fb81062a4ad','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Beamex CMX Specialist','beamex-cmx-specialist-337-337','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;63&quot; data-end=&quot;485&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced Beamex CMX Specialists for a leading Top MNC to support enterprise Calibration Management, Computer System Validation (CSV), and Digital Asset Management initiatives in regulated manufacturing environments. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in Beamex CMX Calibration Management Software, calibration workflows, validation activities, and pharmaceutical or life sciences industries.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;487&quot; data-end=&quot;941&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for configuring, administering, supporting, and optimizing the Beamex CMX Calibration Management System to ensure accurate calibration scheduling, instrument lifecycle management, and regulatory compliance. The role includes managing calibration records, maintaining instrument master data, supporting Computer System Validation (CSV), preparing validation documentation, and ensuring compliance with industry standards.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;943&quot; data-end=&quot;1344&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with Beamex CMX, calibration management, asset management, instrument lifecycle processes, IQ/OQ/PQ validation, GxP, GMP, ISO 17025, and 21 CFR Part 11 compliance. Strong knowledge of calibration scheduling, compliance reporting, SAP PM/MM integration, enterprise asset management systems, and laboratory or manufacturing environments is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1346&quot; data-end=&quot;1778&quot;&gt;The role also involves collaborating with QA, Engineering, Maintenance, Validation, and IT teams to deliver reliable calibration management solutions, support audits, troubleshoot application issues, generate compliance reports and dashboards, prepare SOPs and user manuals, and drive continuous improvement initiatives. Candidates should possess strong analytical, communication, stakeholder management, and problem-solving skills.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-09-13 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-07-16 02:05:17.000000','2026-07-16 02:05:17.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"CapIQ\", \"CSV\", \"Gxp Compliance\", \"OQ\", \"PQ\", \"GMP\", \"21 CFR Part 11\", \"Beamex CMX\", \"Calibration Management\", \"Calibration Scheduling\", \"SAP PM Integration\", \"SAP MM Integration\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1794&quot; data-end=&quot;1832&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;kkk1f2&quot; data-start=&quot;1833&quot; data-end=&quot;1923&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale Calibration Management and Digital Manufacturing projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1cu8f6l&quot; data-start=&quot;1924&quot; data-end=&quot;1991&quot;&gt;Work with advanced Beamex CMX and Asset Management technologies&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;bf28ml&quot; data-start=&quot;1992&quot; data-end=&quot;2077&quot;&gt;Career growth in Calibration Management &amp;amp; Computer System Validation (CSV) domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1icv5lc&quot; data-start=&quot;2078&quot; data-end=&quot;2166&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global engineering, quality, and manufacturing teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;2lee9a&quot; data-start=&quot;2167&quot; data-end=&quot;2222&quot;&gt;Professional and compliance-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;2223&quot; data-end=&quot;2266&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('8f5b2643-3b1a-4ce3-a3a7-b3fc8b857f74','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Aveva PI','aveva-pi-230-230','&lt;blockquote&gt;\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;Minimum 7-10 years of experience in&amp;nbsp;AVEVA&amp;nbsp;PI&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;in Pharma&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Academic degree in relevant profession&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Experience in connectivity to equipment&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Validation methodology and tools&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with middleware platforms (Kepware, Cogent,&amp;nbsp;PI)&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with reporting tools&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;/blockquote&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Entry',NULL,NULL,'INR',1,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-05-30 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-03-31 21:24:16.000000','2026-03-31 21:24:16.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"AvevaWonderware\", \"AVEVA System\", \"AVEVA MES\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;Competitive salary package with performance-based incentives&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;65&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;67&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;Health insurance coverage and statutory benefits (PF &amp;amp; Gratuity)&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;134&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;136&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on large-scale enterprise energy management projects&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;211&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;213&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;Strong career growth and learning opportunities&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;263&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;265&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;Collaborative and professional work environment&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('8fa7272c-5ed9-4e10-ad1d-7f58118e7719','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Full Stack Developer','full-stack-developer-44-44','&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;540&quot; data-end=&quot;558&quot;&gt;Job Overview&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;559&quot; data-end=&quot;915&quot;&gt;We are seeking skilled and experienced Full Stack Developers to join a large-scale digital transformation project focused on the design, development, and implementation of the Next Gen MITS application. This role requires strong technical expertise across both front-end and back-end technologies and experience with cloud-based microservices architecture.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;917&quot; data-end=&quot;943&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;944&quot; data-end=&quot;1476&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;944&quot; data-end=&quot;1037&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;946&quot; data-end=&quot;1037&quot;&gt;Design and develop both front-end and back-end components using .NET, Angular 19, and AWS&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1038&quot; data-end=&quot;1119&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1040&quot; data-end=&quot;1119&quot;&gt;Develop Micro, Macro, and Nano services using a Domain-Driven Design approach&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1120&quot; data-end=&quot;1210&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1122&quot; data-end=&quot;1210&quot;&gt;Guide and support the technical team; review deliverables for quality and completeness&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1211&quot; data-end=&quot;1333&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1213&quot; data-end=&quot;1333&quot;&gt;Collaborate with architects and stakeholders to implement robust design patterns and effective observability using AWS&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1334&quot; data-end=&quot;1476&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1336&quot; data-end=&quot;1476&quot;&gt;Contribute to key application modules including Receiving, Production, Shipping, Transportation, Invoicing, Finance, and Handheld services&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;1478&quot; data-end=&quot;1500&quot;&gt;Must-Have Skills&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1501&quot; data-end=&quot;1820&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1501&quot; data-end=&quot;1530&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1503&quot; data-end=&quot;1530&quot;&gt;.NET, C# (E2 proficiency)&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1531&quot; data-end=&quot;1571&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1533&quot; data-end=&quot;1571&quot;&gt;Angular 19, PrimeNG (E2 proficiency)&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1572&quot; data-end=&quot;1624&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1574&quot; data-end=&quot;1624&quot;&gt;AWS Lambda, Fargate, S3, Aurora (E2 proficiency)&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1625&quot; data-end=&quot;1656&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1627&quot; data-end=&quot;1656&quot;&gt;PostgreSQL (E1 proficiency)&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1657&quot; data-end=&quot;1699&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1659&quot; data-end=&quot;1699&quot;&gt;ETL, Data Engineering (E1 proficiency)&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1700&quot; data-end=&quot;1747&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1702&quot; data-end=&quot;1747&quot;&gt;Microservices Architecture (E2 proficiency)&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1748&quot; data-end=&quot;1758&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1750&quot; data-end=&quot;1758&quot;&gt;GitHub&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1759&quot; data-end=&quot;1771&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1761&quot; data-end=&quot;1771&quot;&gt;Power BI&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1772&quot; data-end=&quot;1820&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1774&quot; data-end=&quot;1820&quot;&gt;Strong understanding of Domain-Driven Design&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;1822&quot; data-end=&quot;1840&quot;&gt;Good-to-Have&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1841&quot; data-end=&quot;2006&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1841&quot; data-end=&quot;1903&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1843&quot; data-end=&quot;1903&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience in large enterprise-level applications&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1904&quot; data-end=&quot;1953&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1906&quot; data-end=&quot;1953&quot;&gt;Strong problem-solving and code review skills&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1954&quot; data-end=&quot;2006&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1956&quot; data-end=&quot;2006&quot;&gt;Ability to collaborate with cross-functional teams&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',500000.00,2500000.00,'₹',0,'India','Gurugram',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-19 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-06-06 09:06:29.000000','2025-11-21 06:28:00.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\".NET\", \"AWS\", \"AWS Lambda\", \"ETL\", \"Full Stack Development\", \"Github\", \"Microservices Architectures\", \"PostgreSQL\", \"Power BI\"]','[\"&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;117&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;Job Benefits&lt;/h3&gt;\\r\\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;135&quot; data-end=&quot;996&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;135&quot; data-end=&quot;192&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;137&quot; data-end=&quot;192&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;137&quot; data-end=&quot;159&quot;&gt;Competitive Salary&lt;/strong&gt; based on skills and experience&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;193&quot; data-end=&quot;296&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;195&quot; data-end=&quot;296&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;195&quot; data-end=&quot;236&quot;&gt;Opportunities for Learning and Growth&lt;/strong&gt; through continuous skill development and project exposure&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;297&quot; data-end=&quot;384&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;299&quot; data-end=&quot;384&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;299&quot; data-end=&quot;330&quot;&gt;Supportive Work Environment&lt;/strong&gt; with experienced leadership and collaborative teams&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;385&quot; data-end=&quot;470&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;387&quot; data-end=&quot;470&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;387&quot; data-end=&quot;412&quot;&gt;Flexible Work Options&lt;/strong&gt; depending on project requirements and role expectations&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;471&quot; data-end=&quot;584&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;473&quot; data-end=&quot;584&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;473&quot; data-end=&quot;508&quot;&gt;Exposure to Latest Technologies&lt;/strong&gt; including cloud platforms, microservices, and modern front-end frameworks&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Haryana'),('900ef402-e228-46f8-8392-108cb6c21c83','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Senior Data Engineer','senior-data-engineer-284-284','&lt;p data-start=&quot;62&quot; data-end=&quot;386&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced Senior Data Engineers for a leading Top MNC to work on enterprise-scale data engineering, cloud infrastructure, and analytics transformation projects. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in Python, SQL, AWS cloud technologies, data architecture, and scalable data pipeline development.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;388&quot; data-end=&quot;767&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for designing, building, and maintaining robust data architectures and high-performance data pipelines to support business intelligence, analytics, and operational reporting requirements. The role includes developing scalable cloud-based data solutions, ensuring data quality, optimizing performance, and implementing best engineering practices.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;769&quot; data-end=&quot;1085&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with Python development, advanced SQL, database design, GitHub, GitHub Actions, AWS CDK, Terraform, and cloud-native data engineering solutions. Strong understanding of data modeling, ETL/ELT processes, infrastructure as code, and cloud architecture is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1087&quot; data-end=&quot;1398&quot;&gt;The role also involves creating and maintaining technical documentation, improving engineering efficiency, reviewing code quality, and collaborating with cross-functional teams to deliver enterprise-grade data solutions. Candidates should possess excellent analytical, problem-solving, and communication skills.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-08-08 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-06-10 01:30:46.000000','2026-06-10 01:30:46.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Python\", \"SQL\", \"Database Design\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1414&quot; data-end=&quot;1452&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;69ydlb&quot; data-start=&quot;1453&quot; data-end=&quot;1511&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale data engineering projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;odidie&quot; data-start=&quot;1512&quot; data-end=&quot;1573&quot;&gt;Work on advanced AWS cloud and data platform technologies&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1l489fm&quot; data-start=&quot;1574&quot; data-end=&quot;1626&quot;&gt;Career growth in Data Engineering &amp;amp; Cloud domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1a77kja&quot; data-start=&quot;1627&quot; data-end=&quot;1687&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global engineering teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot; data-start=&quot;1688&quot; data-end=&quot;1743&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;1744&quot; data-end=&quot;1787&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('903fcc0f-610c-4975-811f-23af8d2f4c22','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Lead architecture','lead-architecture-200-200','&lt;p&gt;&amp;sect; Architect and design end‑to‑end OT&amp;rarr;IT data integrations (batch/streaming) from SCADA, MES, Historians to enterprise/cloud (Azure/AWS/GCP); Experience in Azure Event Hubs/Event Grid is a plus.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;sect; Apply UNS (ISA‑95/88), industrial data modeling, and metadata management; enforce data quality, lineage, governance, and security-by-design.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;sect; Integrate industrial platforms (Ignition, HiveMQ, HighByte advantageous) via OPC UA, MQTT, BACnet, Modbus; build/govern RESTful APIs and connectors for SAP, SCADA, MES, LIMS, Historians.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;sect; Define and socialize application/integration/infrastructure standards, lead architecture for enterprise IT and digital transformation in regulated manufacturing.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;sect; Deploy/support enterprise applications with reliability, compliance, and operability, design for scalability, resilience, and cost efficiency.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;sect; Perform schema design and performance tuning across SQL/NoSQL datastores.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;sect; Produce and maintain clear architecture artifacts (diagrams, process/sequence flows, specifications); provide guidance to cross‑functional delivery teams.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;sect; Experience in manufacturing or life sciences with OT/IT interoperability; familiarity with GxP, regulated data flows, and enterprise data governance is advantageous.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Entry',NULL,NULL,'INR',1,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-04-26 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-02-25 19:15:06.000000','2026-02-25 19:15:07.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"AWS\", \"Azure\", \"Gxp Compliance\", \"Lims\", \"MYSQL\", \"Opc\", \"PLC\", \"SAP\", \"SCADA\", \"Modbus RTU\", \"Modbus\", \"MQTT\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;Competitive salary package with performance-based incentives&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;65&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;67&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;Health insurance coverage and statutory benefits (PF &amp;amp; Gratuity)&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;134&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;136&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on large-scale enterprise energy management projects&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;211&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;213&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;Strong career growth and learning opportunities&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;263&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;265&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;Collaborative and professional work environment&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('90561c84-79c8-4f09-b9ce-2a0bbf90f0d8','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Control Automation Engineer','control-automation-engineer-210-210','&lt;p&gt;&amp;middot; Implement Equipment Automation (EA) solution, integrated with other key factory and business systems, for our customers&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;middot; Support EA solution and help set up an offshore support model in APAC.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;middot; Guide the team to navigate issues and partner with teams beyond EA including MES and Tool software teams&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;middot; Coordinate with customer&amp;rsquo;s systems administration and IT teams on deploying, configuring, developing and deploying EA solutions.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;middot; Present technical information to customers including technical contributors and managers.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;middot; Create, evolve, and implement EA application training and/or demonstrations&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;middot; Knowledge base contribution/management&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;middot; Deep engagement with internal customers and end users.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;middot; Improve operations through continuous improvement standards such as: 8D, Six Sigma, Kaizen, 5-Whys.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'INR',1,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-05-05 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-03-07 01:48:36.000000','2026-03-07 01:48:36.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Kaizen\", \"Mes\", \"Mes ERP Integration\", \"Six Sigma\", \"Six Sigma (DMAIC)\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;Competitive salary package with performance-based incentives&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;65&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;67&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;Health insurance coverage and statutory benefits (PF &amp;amp; Gratuity)&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;134&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;136&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on large-scale enterprise energy management projects&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;211&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;213&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;Strong career growth and learning opportunities&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;263&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;265&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;Collaborative and professional work environment&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('90a440b3-93aa-48a3-842a-81368c52b302','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','LIMS Developer (Labware LIMS)','lims-developer-labware-lims-104-104','We are looking for an experienced LIMS Developer with strong expertise in Labware LIMS configuration, customization, deployment, and support. The ideal candidate should have 3&amp;ndash;7 years of hands-on experience in global LIMS implementations, system administration, and troubleshooting. You will be responsible for handling end-to-end Labware LIMS projects including implementation, upgrade, integration with third-party applications, and ensuring compliance with GxP and Computer System Validation (CSV) requirements.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;The role demands excellent technical knowledge in SQL, Java/J2EE, JBoss Server, and reporting tools, along with strong analytical and communication skills. Candidates must come from a Pharma/Life Sciences background and should have independently handled at least one full LIMS implementation or upgrade project.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Configure, customize, and deploy Labware LIMS applications.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Build deployment packages and ensure smooth implementation.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Perform LIMS system administration, maintenance, and troubleshooting.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Develop and implement instrument interfaces, CDS systems (e.g., OpenLab, ATLAS), and other third-party integrations.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Implement enterprise application interfaces for seamless data flow.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Handle Level-1, Level-2, and Level-3 support activities for LIMS applications.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Ensure compliance with GxP, CSV, and regulatory requirements.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Generate reports using reporting tools and create complex SQL queries.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Collaborate with clients, act as a liaison, and manage customer expectations.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Mentor and guide junior team members on LIMS-related tasks.','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2025-11-21 18:30:00',0,0,'2025-09-23 07:22:06.000000','2025-09-23 07:22:07.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Administration\", \"Configurations\", \"Debugging Skills\", \"Deployment\", \"Enterprise\", \"Gxp Compliance\", \"Instruments\", \"J2EE\", \"Java\", \"Jboss\", \"Lims\", \"MS SQL Developer\", \"Oracle\", \"Pharma Industry\", \"Reporting Tools\", \"SQL\", \"Trouble Shooting\", \"LabWare LIMS\"]','[\"Opportunity to work on global LIMS projects&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Exposure to latest Labware LIMS versions&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Career growth in Pharma/Life Sciences domain&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Client interaction &amp;amp; mentoring responsibilities&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Competitive salary &amp;amp; supportive work culture\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('90a6ba85-abf0-4c53-9473-a0024940e2c6','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Guidewire Senior Developer – ClaimCenter','guidewire-senior-developer-claimcenter-69-69','&lt;p data-start=&quot;305&quot; data-end=&quot;522&quot;&gt;Are you a passionate Guidewire professional with hands-on ClaimCenter configuration expertise? Join our dynamic team to build scalable insurance solutions with the latest in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;479&quot; data-end=&quot;521&quot;&gt;Guidewire, GOSU, and Java technologies&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;hr data-start=&quot;524&quot; data-end=&quot;527&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;529&quot; data-end=&quot;558&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;533&quot; data-end=&quot;558&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;559&quot; data-end=&quot;1198&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;559&quot; data-end=&quot;663&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;561&quot; data-end=&quot;663&quot;&gt;Design, develop, configure, and maintain applications using &lt;strong data-start=&quot;621&quot; data-end=&quot;661&quot;&gt;Guidewire ClaimCenter (v8 or higher)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;664&quot; data-end=&quot;783&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;666&quot; data-end=&quot;783&quot;&gt;Work on &lt;strong data-start=&quot;674&quot; data-end=&quot;703&quot;&gt;ClaimCenter configuration&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong data-start=&quot;705&quot; data-end=&quot;712&quot;&gt;LOB&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong data-start=&quot;714&quot; data-end=&quot;729&quot;&gt;permissions&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong data-start=&quot;731&quot; data-end=&quot;740&quot;&gt;rules&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong data-start=&quot;742&quot; data-end=&quot;754&quot;&gt;entities&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong data-start=&quot;756&quot; data-end=&quot;767&quot;&gt;widgets&lt;/strong&gt;, and &lt;strong data-start=&quot;773&quot; data-end=&quot;781&quot;&gt;PCFs&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;784&quot; data-end=&quot;871&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;786&quot; data-end=&quot;871&quot;&gt;Build and test using &lt;strong data-start=&quot;807&quot; data-end=&quot;823&quot;&gt;GOSU Classes&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong data-start=&quot