&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;865&quot; data-end=&quot;1345&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;865&quot; data-end=&quot;950&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;867&quot; data-end=&quot;950&quot;&gt;Lead &lt;strong data-start=&quot;872&quot; data-end=&quot;915&quot;&gt;requirement analysis and data gathering&lt;/strong&gt; with regular customer interaction.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;951&quot; data-end=&quot;1045&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;953&quot; data-end=&quot;1045&quot;&gt;Perform &lt;strong data-start=&quot;961&quot; data-end=&quot;978&quot;&gt;data analysis&lt;/strong&gt; across databases and prepare &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1008&quot; data-end=&quot;1023&quot;&gt;data models&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1028&quot; data-end=&quot;1044&quot;&gt;data mapping&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1046&quot; data-end=&quot;1156&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1048&quot; data-end=&quot;1156&quot;&gt;Create &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1055&quot; data-end=&quot;1096&quot;&gt;Business Requirement Documents (BRDs)&lt;/strong&gt; including use cases, solution approach, and detailed flows.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1157&quot; data-end=&quot;1264&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1159&quot; data-end=&quot;1264&quot;&gt;Collaborate with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1176&quot; data-end=&quot;1225&quot;&gt;SMEs, Product Owners, and Solution Architects&lt;/strong&gt; to align business and technical goals.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1265&quot; data-end=&quot;1345&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1267&quot; data-end=&quot;1345&quot;&gt;Work in an &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1278&quot; data-end=&quot;1299&quot;&gt;agile environment&lt;/strong&gt; and manage communication across stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;1347&quot; data-end=&quot;1368&quot;&gt;Must-Have Skills:&lt;/h3&gt;\r