d28f037f960','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Front End Developer','front-end-developer-43-43','&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;314&quot; data-end=&quot;335&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;318&quot; data-end=&quot;334&quot;&gt;Job Overview&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;337&quot; data-end=&quot;875&quot;&gt;We are seeking an experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;367&quot; data-end=&quot;390&quot;&gt;Front End Developer&lt;/strong&gt; to join our team and help design and develop the &lt;strong data-start=&quot;440&quot; data-end=&quot;511&quot;&gt;Next Gen MITS (Manufacturing, Inventory, and Transportation System)&lt;/strong&gt; application. This is a great opportunity for those with strong expertise in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;588&quot; data-end=&quot;599&quot;&gt;Angular&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong data-start=&quot;601&quot; data-end=&quot;608&quot;&gt;AWS&lt;/strong&gt;, and modern frontend development practices to contribute to a complex, enterprise-level application. The role requires a focus on creating scalable, modular front-end components, and working collaboratively with back-end developers to deliver a high-quality product.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;hr data-start=&quot;877&quot; data-end=&quot;880&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;882&quot; data-end=&quot;911&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;886&quot; data-end=&quot;910&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;912&quot; data-end=&quot;1867&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;912&quot; data-end=&quot;1029&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;914&quot; data-end=&quot;1029&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;914&quot; data-end=&quot;943&quot;&gt;Design &amp;amp; Develop Frontend&lt;/strong&gt;: Build robust, scalable, and user-friendly front-end components using &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1014&quot; data-end=&quot;1028&quot;&gt;Angular 19&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1030&quot; data-end=&quot;1167&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1032&quot; data-end=&quot;1167&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1032&quot; data-end=&quot;1062&quot;&gt;Reusable Component Library&lt;/strong&gt;: Create and maintain a library of reusable components to enhance development efficiency and consistency.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1168&quot; data-end=&quot;1332&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1170&quot; data-end=&quot;1332&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1170&quot; data-end=&quot;1198&quot;&gt;Collaborate with Backend&lt;/strong&gt;: Work closely with the back-end team to integrate front-end components with back-end services, including AWS services and PostgreSQL.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1333&quot; data-end=&quot;1451&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1335&quot; data-end=&quot;1451&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1335&quot; data-end=&quot;1363&quot;&gt;UX and UI Implementation&lt;/strong&gt;: Implement frontend features based on UX designs and ensure a seamless user experience.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1452&quot; data-end=&quot;1565&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1454&quot; data-end=&quot;1565&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1454&quot; data-end=&quot;1482&quot;&gt;Code Review &amp;amp; Mentorship&lt;/strong&gt;: Guide and mentor junior developers, reviewing code deliveries for best practices.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1566&quot; data-end=&quot;1709&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1568&quot; data-end=&quot;1709&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1568&quot; data-end=&quot;1600&quot;&gt;Standardization &amp;amp; Automation&lt;/strong&gt;: Work on the standardization of development processes and the automation of tasks in the frontend lifecycle.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1710&quot; data-end=&quot;1867&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1712&quot; data-end=&quot;1867&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1712&quot; data-end=&quot;1738&quot;&gt;Continuous Improvement&lt;/strong&gt;: Participate in continuous improvement initiatives for improving the scalability, usability, and performance of the application.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;hr data-start=&quot;1869&quot; data-end=&quot;1872&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;1874&quot; data-end=&quot;1911&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1878&quot; data-end=&quot;1910&quot;&gt;Required Skills &amp;amp; Experience&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1913&quot; data-end=&quot;2513&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1913&quot; data-end=&quot;2052&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1915&quot; data-end=&quot;2052&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1915&quot; data-end=&quot;1929&quot;&gt;Angular 19&lt;/strong&gt;: Advanced expertise in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1953&quot; data-end=&quot;1967&quot;&gt;Angular 19&lt;/strong&gt; for building scalable and responsive front-end applications (Proficiency Level: E3).&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2053&quot; data-end=&quot;2171&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2055&quot; data-end=&quot;2171&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2055&quot; data-end=&quot;2074&quot;&gt;AWS S3 &amp;amp; Aurora&lt;/strong&gt;: Experience with AWS S3 for storage and Aurora for database integration (Proficiency Level: E2).&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2172&quot; data-end=&quot;2295&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2174&quot; data-end=&quot;2295&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2174&quot; data-end=&quot;2188&quot;&gt;PostgreSQL&lt;/strong&gt;: Strong experience in working with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2224&quot; data-end=&quot;2238&quot;&gt;PostgreSQL&lt;/strong&gt; for data storage and management (Proficiency Level: E2).&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2296&quot; data-end=&quot;2396&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2298&quot; data-end=&quot;2396&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2298&quot; data-end=&quot;2315&quot;&gt;Microservices&lt;/strong&gt;: Experience working with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2341&quot; data-end=&quot;2358&quot;&gt;microservices&lt;/strong&gt; architecture (Proficiency Level: E1).&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2397&quot; data-end=&quot;2513&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2399&quot; data-end=&quot;2513&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2399&quot; data-end=&quot;2409&quot;&gt;GitHub&lt;/strong&gt;: Familiarity with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2428&quot; data-end=&quot;2438&quot;&gt;GitHub&lt;/strong&gt; for version control and collaborative development (Proficiency Level: E1).&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;hr data-start=&quot;2515&quot; data-end=&quot;2518&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;2520&quot; data-end=&quot;2549&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2524&quot; data-end=&quot;2548&quot;&gt;Desired Competencies&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;h4 data-start=&quot;2551&quot; data-end=&quot;2570&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2556&quot; data-end=&quot;2569&quot;&gt;Must-Have&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/h4&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2571&quot; data-end=&quot;3062&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2571&quot; data-end=&quot;2675&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2573&quot; data-end=&quot;2675&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2573&quot; data-end=&quot;2587&quot;&gt;Angular 19&lt;/strong&gt;: Hands-on experience in developing complex front-end applications using &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2660&quot; data-end=&quot;2674&quot;&gt;Angular 19&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2676&quot; data-end=&quot;2796&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2678&quot; data-end=&quot;2796&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2678&quot; data-end=&quot;2710&quot;&gt;Frontend Development for MVP&lt;/strong&gt;: Experience in building and maintaining the frontend of MVPs based on &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2781&quot; data-end=&quot;2795&quot;&gt;UX designs&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2797&quot; data-end=&quot;2936&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2799&quot; data-end=&quot;2936&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2799&quot; data-end=&quot;2822&quot;&gt;Reusable Components&lt;/strong&gt;: Ability to design and develop reusable frontend components to streamline development and enhance UI consistency.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2937&quot; data-end=&quot;3062&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2939&quot; data-end=&quot;3062&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2939&quot; data-end=&quot;2971&quot;&gt;Standardization &amp;amp; Automation&lt;/strong&gt;: Worked on automating frontend development processes and standardizing codebase practices.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;h4 data-start=&quot;3064&quot; data-end=&quot;3086&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3069&quot; data-end=&quot;3085&quot;&gt;Good-to-Have&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/h4&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;3087&quot; data-end=&quot;3364&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;3087&quot; data-end=&quot;3198&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;3089&quot; data-end=&quot;3198&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3089&quot; data-end=&quot;3115&quot;&gt;Full Stack Development&lt;/strong&gt;: Experience in designing and developing both frontend and backend of applications.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;3199&quot; data-end=&quot;3364&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;3201&quot; data-end=&quot;3364&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3201&quot; data-end=&quot;3225&quot;&gt;Domain-Driven Design&lt;/strong&gt;: Experience working with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;3251&quot; data-end=&quot;3282&quot;&gt;Macro, Micro, Nano Services&lt;/strong&gt; in a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;3288&quot; data-end=&quot;3312&quot;&gt;Domain-Driven Design&lt;/strong&gt; approach, using &lt;strong data-start=&quot;3329&quot; data-end=&quot;3345&quot;&gt;AWS services&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong data-start=&quot;3350&quot; data-end=&quot;3363&quot;&gt;.NET (C#)&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',500000.00,2500000.00,'₹',0,'India','Hyderabad',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2025-08-04 18:30:00',0,0,'2025-06-06 08:34:43.000000','2025-06-06 08:34:43.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Angular\", \"Aurora\", \"AWS\", \"Frontend Development\", \"Full Stack Development\", \"Github\", \"PostgreSQL\", \"UX Design\"]','[\"&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;89&quot; data-end=&quot;110&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;93&quot; data-end=&quot;109&quot;&gt;Job Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/h3&gt;\\r\\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;112&quot; data-end=&quot;898&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;112&quot; data-end=&quot;192&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;114&quot; data-end=&quot;192&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;114&quot; data-end=&quot;136&quot;&gt;Competitive Salary&lt;/strong&gt;: Attractive pay package based on experience and skills.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;193&quot; data-end=&quot;272&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;195&quot; data-end=&quot;272&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;195&quot; data-end=&quot;216&quot;&gt;Health &amp;amp; Wellness&lt;/strong&gt;: Comprehensive medical insurance and wellness programs.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;273&quot; data-end=&quot;358&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;275&quot; data-end=&quot;358&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;275&quot; data-end=&quot;302&quot;&gt;Remote Work Flexibility&lt;/strong&gt;: Option to work from any location (remote flexibility).&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;359&quot; data-end=&quot;457&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;361&quot; data-end=&quot;457&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;361&quot; data-end=&quot;387&quot;&gt;Learning &amp;amp; Development&lt;/strong&gt;: Opportunities for continuous learning, training, and certifications.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;458&quot; data-end=&quot;534&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;460&quot; data-end=&quot;534&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;460&quot; data-end=&quot;477&quot;&gt;Career Growth&lt;/strong&gt;: Clear path for career progression and leadership roles.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;535&quot; data-end=&quot;641&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;537&quot; data-end=&quot;641&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;537&quot; data-end=&quot;558&quot;&gt;Work-Life Balance&lt;/strong&gt;: Flexible working hours and paid time off to maintain a healthy work-life balance.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;642&quot; data-end=&quot;731&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;644&quot; data-end=&quot;731&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;644&quot; data-end=&quot;668&quot;&gt;Employee Recognition&lt;/strong&gt;: Rewards and recognition programs for outstanding performance.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Telangana'),('936f77d3-79ce-4e24-b169-e0c2b6dcafb1','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','OBIEE-OAS-PV IT Consultant / IT Analyst','obiee-oas-pv-it-consultant-it-analyst-361-361','&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced &lt;strong&gt;OBIEE-OAS-PV IT Consultants / IT Analysts&lt;/strong&gt; for a leading global organization operating in the &lt;strong&gt;Pharmaceutical, Life Sciences, and Dermatology&lt;/strong&gt; domain. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in Oracle Business Intelligence, analytics, SQL, and Pharmacovigilance (PV) application support.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for developing and supporting &lt;strong&gt;OBIEE/OAS reports, dashboards, analytics, and metadata models&lt;/strong&gt;, while working closely with Pharmacovigilance and Drug Safety teams. The role involves analyzing PV data, validating reporting outputs, troubleshooting business intelligence solutions, and ensuring accurate delivery of safety-related reports and analytics.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with &lt;strong&gt;OBIEE Report Development, Oracle SQL, OBIEE/OAS Dashboards, RPD, Metadata Layer, Pharmacovigilance, Oracle PV Application Support, PV Data Analysis, and Data Validation&lt;/strong&gt;. Knowledge of GxP and Computer System Validation (CSV) requirements within regulated pharmaceutical environments is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The role also involves collaborating with global business users, Drug Safety teams, IT stakeholders, and technical teams to gather requirements, resolve production issues, enhance reporting solutions, and ensure compliance with applicable pharmaceutical and pharmacovigilance standards.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-18 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-08-20 03:13:13.000000','2026-08-20 03:13:14.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Business Intelligence\", \"Data Analysis\", \"Gxp Compliance\", \"Oracle\", \"SQL Query Optimization\", \"RPD Development\", \"OBIEE Migration\", \"Oracle BI\", \"OBIEE\", \"OBIEE Report Development\", \"OBIEE Dashboards\", \"OBIEE Metadata Layer\", \"Pharmacovigilance (PV)\", \"PV Data Analysis\", \"PV Data Validation\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to work with a leading global Life Sciences organization&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale OBIEE/OAS analytics projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Pharmacovigilance and Drug Safety functions&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li&gt;Exposure to regulated pharmaceutical and GxP environments&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to work with Oracle PV and safety reporting platforms&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li&gt;Technical and domain growth in Business Intelligence and Pharmacovigilance&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li&gt;Collaboration with global IT, business, and safety teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li&gt;Career growth across Life Sciences technology and analytics&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('939ca54c-581d-4090-8f4a-fd5c8eac6fe2','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Azure Cloud Developer','azure-cloud-developer-226-226','Skilled Azure Cloud &amp;amp; Python Developer with hands-on experience in Azure App Service, Datafactory, Azure Web Application, Azure DevOps, VueJs for frontend, FastAPI for backend development, API management, and troubleshooting. The ideal candidate should be proficient in maintaining backend services along with in-depth understanding of Microsoft Azure services to support integration and deployment needs.','Information Technology','Contract','Entry',NULL,NULL,'INR',1,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-05-25 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-03-26 20:20:07.000000','2026-03-26 20:20:07.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Azure\", \"Azure  CLI\", \"Azure  Security\", \"Azure  Storage\", \"Azure Cloud Networking\", \"Data and Analytics\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;Competitive salary package with performance-based incentives&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;65&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;67&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;Health insurance coverage and statutory benefits (PF &amp;amp; Gratuity)&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;134&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;136&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on large-scale enterprise energy management projects&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;211&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;213&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;Strong career growth and learning opportunities&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;263&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;265&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;Collaborative and professional work environment&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('939e1171-7e76-41cf-bc71-399dbae37176','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','PostgreSQL Developer / Database Specialist','postgresql-developer-database-specialist-381-381','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;189&quot; data-end=&quot;435&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;215&quot; data-end=&quot;263&quot;&gt;PostgreSQL Developers / Database Specialists&lt;/strong&gt; for a leading &lt;strong data-start=&quot;278&quot; data-end=&quot;289&quot;&gt;Top MNC&lt;/strong&gt; to work on enterprise-scale &lt;strong data-start=&quot;318&quot; data-end=&quot;359&quot;&gt;MES (Manufacturing Execution Systems)&lt;/strong&gt; and data-layer solutions within the &lt;strong data-start=&quot;396&quot; data-end=&quot;427&quot;&gt;Semiconductor Manufacturing&lt;/strong&gt; domain.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;437&quot; data-end=&quot;684&quot;&gt;The ideal candidate should have strong hands-on expertise in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;498&quot; data-end=&quot;683&quot;&gt;PostgreSQL development and administration, SQL, PL/pgSQL, stored procedures, schema design, database migration, query optimization, indexing, execution plans, and performance tuning&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;686&quot; data-end=&quot;940&quot;&gt;The role involves developing and maintaining robust database solutions for data-intensive manufacturing applications, troubleshooting database performance issues, supporting database migrations, and ensuring reliability and scalability of the data layer.&