1017&quot;&gt;queries, stored procedures, and functions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1020&quot; data-end=&quot;1094&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1022&quot; data-end=&quot;1094&quot;&gt;Troubleshoot and resolve application/database issues using &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1081&quot; data-end=&quot;1092&quot;&gt;RCA/RCF&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1095&quot; data-end=&quot;1158&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1097&quot; data-end=&quot;1158&quot;&gt;Integrate systems using &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1121&quot; data-end=&quot;1156&quot;&gt;WCF, Web Services, and Web APIs&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1159&quot; data-end=&quot;1219&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1161&quot; data-end=&quot;1219&quot;&gt;Assist in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1171&quot; data-end=&quot;1217&quot;&gt;migrating VB.Net applications to .NET Core&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1220&quot; data-end=&quot;1299&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1222&quot; data-end=&quot;1299&quot;&gt;Collaborate with business and technical teams to deliver reliable solutions&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1300&quot; data-end=&quot;1371&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1302&quot; data-end=&quot;1371&quot;&gt;Perform application enhancements, debugging, and performance tuning&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1372&quot; data-end=&quot;1438&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1374&quot; data-end=&quot;1438&quot;&gt;Support deployment activities and ensure application stability&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Full-time','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-20 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-11-22 03:12:42.000000','2025-11-22 03:12:42.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\".NET Framework\", \"ASP.NET\", \"C#\", \"Deployment\", \"MS SQL Server\", \"MVC Frameworks\", \"Oracle\", \"PL/SQL\", \"Root Cause Analysis (RCA)\", \"SQL\", \"VB.NET\", \"WCF\", \"Web Services\", \"IIS\", \"Windows Forms\", \"RCF\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2280&quot; data-end=&quot;2359&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2282&quot; data-end=&quot;2359&quot;&gt;Work with a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2294&quot; data-end=&quot;2312&quot;&gt;Top Global MNC&lt;/strong&gt; known for innovation &amp;amp; technology excellence&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2360&quot; data-end=&quot;2441&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2362&quot; data-end=&quot;2441&quot;&gt;Opportunity to contribute to &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2391&quot; data-end=&quot;2439&quot;&gt;critical shopfloor &amp;amp; enterprise applications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2442&quot; data-end=&quot;2506&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2444&quot; data-end=&quot;2506&quot;&gt;Exposure to &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2456&quot; data-end=&quot;2482&quot;&gt;modernization projects&lt;/strong&gt; (.NET Core migration)&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2507&quot; data-end=&quot;2571&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2509&quot; data-end=&quot;2571&quot;&gt;Professional development and skill enhancement opportunities&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2572&quot; data-end=&quot;2635&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2574&quot; data-end=&quot;2635&quot;&gt;Collaborative, stable, and growth-oriented work environment&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2636&quot; data-end=&quot;2687&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2638&quot; data-end=&quot;2687&quot;&gt;Competitive salary &amp;amp; performance-based benefits&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('94fbfed7-3778-464e-9a5f-5e47acf742f3','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','MES Developer (7–8 Years Experience)','mes-developer-7-8-years-experience-130-130','&lt;p data-start=&quot;187&quot; data-end=&quot;689&quot;&gt;A top MNC is hiring an experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;222&quot; data-end=&quot;239&quot;&gt;MES Developer&lt;/strong&gt; with strong expertise in C++, .NET, and MES platforms. The role involves developing, customizing, and supporting MES applications used in manufacturing and semiconductor environments. You will collaborate with cross-functional engineering teams, integrate MES with automation systems, optimize workflows, and ensure stable system performance. Candidates with exposure to automation protocols, cloud, CI/CD, and frontend frameworks will be preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;hr data-start=&quot;691&quot; data-end=&quot;694&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;696&quot; data-end=&quot;725&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;699&quot; data-end=&quot;725&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;726&quot; data-end=&quot;1524&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;726&quot; data-end=&quot;807&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;728&quot; data-end=&quot;807&quot;&gt;Develop and customize &lt;strong data-start=&quot;750&quot; data-end=&quot;770&quot;&gt;MES applications&lt;/strong&gt; using C++ / C# / .NET technologies&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;808&quot; data-end=&quot;883&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;810&quot; data-end=&quot;883&quot;&gt;Integrate MES solutions with automation tools and manufacturing systems&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;884&quot; data-end=&quot;946&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;886&quot; data-end=&quot;946&quot;&gt;Write, optimize, and troubleshoot &lt;strong data-start=&quot;920&quot; data-end=&quot;944&quot;&gt;SQL / Oracle queries&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;947&quot; data-end=&quot;1019&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;949&quot; data-end=&quot;1019&quot;&gt;Implement design patterns, OOP principles, and scalable architecture&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1020&quot; data-end=&quot;1094&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1022&quot; data-end=&quot;1094&quot;&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional teams in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1065&quot; data-end=&quot;1080&quot;&gt;Agile/Scrum&lt;/strong&gt; environment&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1095&quot; data-end=&quot;1143&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1097&quot; data-end=&quot;1143&quot;&gt;Work with version control tools like &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1134&quot; data-end=&quot;1141&quot;&gt;Git&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1144&quot; data-end=&quot;1216&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1146&quot; data-end=&quot;1216&quot;&gt;Participate in CI/CD pipeline setup using &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1188&quot; data-end=&quot;1214&quot;&gt;Jenkins / Azure DevOps&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1217&quot; data-end=&quot;1304&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1219&quot; data-end=&quot;1304&quot;&gt;Develop and support applications using &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1258&quot; data-end=&quot;1287&quot;&gt;Angular / React / Node.js&lt;/strong&gt; (good to have)&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1305&quot; data-end=&quot;1382&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1307&quot; data-end=&quot;1382&quot;&gt;Utilize &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1315&quot; data-end=&quot;1360&quot;&gt;Linux, shell scripting, networking basics&lt;/strong&gt; in MES integrations&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1383&quot; data-end=&quot;1457&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1385&quot; data-end=&quot;1457&quot;&gt;Work with automation communication protocols like &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1435&quot; data-end=&quot;1455&quot;&gt;SECS/GEM, OPC-UA&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1458&quot; data-end=&quot;1524&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-star