ineering (B.E.), Technology (B. Tech), Computer Applications (M.C.A), or any equivalent qualification&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',500000.00,1200000.00,'₹',0,'India','Pune',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-19 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-05-27 10:29:59.000000','2025-11-21 06:28:50.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Analyst\", \"Database\", \"Developer Tools\", \"Escalation Management\", \"Technical Support\", \"Troubleshooting\", \"Verbal and Written Communication\"]','[\"&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;61&quot; data-end=&quot;82&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;65&quot; data-end=&quot;82&quot;&gt;Job Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\\r\\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;83&quot; data-end=&quot;353&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;83&quot; data-end=&quot;113&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;85&quot; data-end=&quot;113&quot;&gt;Competitive salary package&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;114&quot; data-end=&quot;138&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;116&quot; data-end=&quot;138&quot;&gt;Flexible work shifts&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;139&quot; data-end=&quot;196&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;141&quot; data-end=&quot;196&quot;&gt;Opportunities for career growth and skill development&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;197&quot; data-end=&quot;240&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;199&quot; data-end=&quot;240&quot;&gt;Exposure to global clients and projects&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;241&quot; data-end=&quot;295&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;243&quot; data-end=&quot;295&quot;&gt;Supportive team and collaborative work environment&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Maharashtra'),('97d199e2-1ba8-4019-9cc7-b8fcc89fabeb','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Computer Vision Expert','computer-vision-expert-387-387','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;100&quot; data-end=&quot;477&quot;&gt;We are looking for an experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;134&quot; data-end=&quot;160&quot;&gt;Computer Vision Expert&lt;/strong&gt; with 10+ years of strong hands-on experience in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;209&quot; data-end=&quot;325&quot;&gt;Computer Vision, Deep Learning, Visual Language Models (VLMs), Multimodal AI, and production-grade AI deployment&lt;/strong&gt;. The role will focus on designing, developing, optimizing, and deploying advanced vision and multimodal AI solutions for enterprise-scale applications.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;479&quot; data-end=&quot;913&quot;&gt;The ideal candidate should have deep expertise across &lt;strong data-start=&quot;533&quot; data-end=&quot;732&quot;&gt;object detection, image segmentation, image classification, OCR, image captioning, scene understanding, pose estimation, depth estimation, facial recognition, and camera-based inference pipelines&lt;/strong&gt;. Strong experience with modern computer vision architectures such as YOLO, Faster R-CNN, SSD, U-Net, Mask R-CNN, DeepLab, ResNet, EfficientNet, and Vision Transformers is expected.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-11-10 07:00:00',0,0,'2026-09-12 01:58:53.000000','2026-09-12 01:58:53.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Computer Vision\", \"PyTorch\", \"TensorFlow\", \"OpenCV\", \"Tesseract OCR\", \"Hugging Face\", \"YOLO\", \"U-Net\", \"GPT-4V\", \"Faster R-CNN\", \"SSD\", \"Mask R-CNN\", \"Multimodal AI\", \"Flamingo\", \"DeepLab\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;iofbfz&quot; data-start=&quot;1715&quot; data-end=&quot;1763&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a leading &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1752&quot; data-end=&quot;1763&quot;&gt;Top MNC&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;166gzem&quot; data-start=&quot;1764&quot; data-end=&quot;1830&quot;&gt;Work on advanced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1783&quot; data-end=&quot;1820&quot;&gt;Computer Vision and Multimodal AI&lt;/strong&gt; solutions&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;8zrbh&quot; data-start=&quot;1831&quot; data-end=&quot;1889&quot;&gt;Exposure to &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1845&quot; data-end=&quot;1889&quot;&gt;Visual Language Models and Generative AI&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;lmb58o&quot; data-start=&quot;1890&quot; data-end=&quot;1951&quot;&gt;Opportunity to build production-grade AI solutions at scale&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1mvco6z&quot; data-start=&quot;1952&quot; data-end=&quot;2017&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience with modern Deep Learning and AI frameworks&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1cgbluc&quot; data-start=&quot;2018&quot; data-end=&quot;2082&quot;&gt;Exposure to GPU/TPU-based AI deployment and model optimization&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('987f076c-4254-468e-b331-58a34b26ad22','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','CM Senior Developer – Back End','cm-senior-developer-back-end-367-367','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;68&quot; data-end=&quot;257&quot;&gt;We are hiring an experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;97&quot; data-end=&quot;131&quot;&gt;CM Senior Developer &amp;ndash; Back End&lt;/strong&gt; for a leading MNC to work on advanced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;170&quot; data-end=&quot;256&quot;&gt;Manufacturing Execution System (MES) and Advanced Manufacturing software solutions&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;259&quot; data-end=&quot;464&quot;&gt;The ideal candidate should have strong hands-on expertise in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;320&quot; data-end=&quot;400&quot;&gt;C# / .NET Core, Object-Oriented Programming, relational databases, and T-SQL&lt;/strong&gt;, along with prior experience working with &lt;strong data-start=