y: verdana, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shift Time:&lt;/strong&gt;&nbsp;2:00 PM &ndash; 11:00 PM IST&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Notice Period:&lt;/strong&gt;&nbsp;Immediate to 15 days&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Must-Have Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&nbsp;.NET, React or Angular, Azure, CI/CD&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We are looking for a skilled developer with a strong foundation in OOP, DSA, and a solid Microsoft tech stack. You&#039;ll be working on high-performance applications that support finance and operations workflows.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Build scalable applications using C#/.NET Core and Web APIs&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Develop frontend with ReactJS and TypeScript&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Execute and manage production scripts&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Improve finance/ops workflows and documentation&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional teams&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Automate manual processes and ensure observability&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Follow best practices in version control and deployment&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Bachelor&rsquo;s in CS or related field&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;5+ years in software development with .NET&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Strong OOP and DSA fundamentals&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Experience with ReactJS and SQL Server&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Proficient in Git&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Good to Have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Azure cloud experience&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Power BI / Power Automate knowledge&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Domain knowledge in finance/insurance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',2000000.00,3000000.00,'₹',1,'India','PAN India',0,1,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-03-31 06:00:00',0,0,'2025-08-21 10:06:01.000000','2025-12-23 17:05:05.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\".NET\", \".NET CORE\", \"Angular\", \"Azure\", \"React JS\", \"CI/CD\"]','[\"&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt;&nbsp;Pune (Hybrid)&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\\r\\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&nbsp;5+ Years&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\\r\\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shift Time:&lt;/strong&gt;&nbsp;2:00 PM &ndash; 11:00 PM IST&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\\r\\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Notice Period:&lt;/strong&gt;&nbsp;Immediate to 15 days&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\\r\\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Must-Have Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&nbsp;.NET, React or Angular, Azure, CI/CD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('99daa30f-c757-494e-ac83-2012381fc524','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Ignition Engineer','ignition-engineer-48-48','&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;414&quot; data-end=&quot;432&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;418&quot; data-end=&quot;430&quot;&gt;Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;433&quot; data-end=&quot;739&quot;&gt;We are looking for skilled &lt;strong data-start=&quot;460&quot; data-end=&quot;482&quot;&gt;Ignition Engineers&lt;/strong&gt; to support the design, development, and deployment of SCADA systems using Inductive Automation&amp;rsquo;s Ignition platform. This role demands strong technical expertise in control systems, scripting, and SCADA infrastructure, ideally in manufacturing environments.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;741&quot; data-end=&quot;769&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;745&quot; data-end=&quot;769&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ol data-start=&quot;770&quot; data-end=&quot;1423&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;770&quot; data-end=&quot;890&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;773&quot; data-end=&quot;890&quot;&gt;Understand and interpret project requirements to design solutions using Ignition or authorized third-party modules.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;891&quot; data-end=&quot;986&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;894&quot; data-end=&quot;986&quot;&gt;Prepare technical development and commissioning plans considering operational constraints.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;987&quot; data-end=&quot;1112&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;990&quot; data-end=&quot;1112&quot;&gt;Design SCADA/control systems including database interfaces, data reporting, analytics, and scripting (Python, VB, etc.).&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1113&quot; data-end=&quot;1195&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1116&quot; data-end=&quot;1195&quot;&gt;Provide support in design, testing, and implementation of project components.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1196&quot; data-end=&quot;1282&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1199&quot; data-end=&quot;1282&quot;&gt;Work with clients for requirement analysis, change requests, and ongoing support.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1283&quot; data-end=&quot;1423&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1286&quot; data-end=&quot;1423&quot;&gt;Apply knowledge of backend manufacturing infrastructure such as virtualization, networking, compute systems, OS, and database management.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ol&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;1425&quot; data-end=&quot;1449&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1429&quot; data-end=&quot;1449&quot;&gt;Must-Have Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1450&quot; data-end=&quot;1786&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1450&quot; data-end=&quot;1521&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1452&quot; data-end=&quot;1521&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1477&quot; data-end=&quot;1519&quot;&gt;Ignition SCADA design and architecture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1522&quot; data-end=&quot;1596&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1524&quot; data-end=&quot;1596&quot;&gt;Strong &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1531&quot; data-end=&quot;1551&quot;&gt;Python scripting&lt;/strong&gt; experience within the Ignition environment&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1597&quot; data-end=&quot;1693&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1599&quot; data-end=&quot;1693&quot;&gt;Experience with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1615&quot; data-end=&quot;1691&quot;&gt;Ignition Edge, Enterprise modules, Tag Providers, and Foundation drivers&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1694&quot; data-end=&quot;1741&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1696&quot; data-end=&quot;1741&quot;&gt;Good communication and interpersonal skills&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1742&quot; data-end=&quot;1786&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1744&quot; data-end=&quot;1786&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1744&quot; data-end=&quot;1758&quot;&gt;Preferred:&lt;/strong&gt; Ignition Gold Certification&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;1788&quot; data-end=&quot;1808&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1792&quot; data-end=&quot;1808&quot;&gt;Good-to-Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1809&quot; data-end=&quot;1923&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1809&quot; data-end=&quot;1873&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1811&quot; data-end=&quot;1873&quot;&gt;Domain experience in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1832&quot; data-end=&quot;1871&quot;&gt;Manufacturing/Industrial Automation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1874&quot; data-end=&quot;1923&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1876&quot; data-end=&quot;1923&quot;&gt;Strong analytical and issue-resolution skills&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',500000.00,2500000.00,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-19 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-06-06 10:22:53.000000','2025-11-21 04:59:43.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Communication Skills\", \"Industrial Automation\", \"Manufacturing\", \"Python\", \"SCADA\", \"SCADA Systems\", \"Scripting\", \"VB\"]','[\"&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;117&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;Job Benefits&lt;/h3&gt;\\r\\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;135&quot; data-end=&quot;996&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;135&quot; data-end=&quot;192&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;137&quot; data-end=&quot;192&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;137&quot; data-end=&quot;159&quot;&gt;Competitive Salary&lt;/strong&gt; based on skills and experience&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;193&quot; data-end=&quot;296&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;195&quot; data-end=&quot;296&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;195&quot; data-end=&quot;236&quot;&gt;Opportunities for Learning and Growth&lt;/strong&gt; through continuous skill development and project exposure&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;297&quot; data-end=&quot;384&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;299&quot; data-end=&quot;384&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;299&quot; data-end=&quot;330&quot;&gt;Supportive Work Environment&lt;/strong&gt; with experienced leadership and collaborative teams&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;385&quot; data-end=&quot;470&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;387&quot; data-end=&quot;470&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;387&quot; data-end=&quot;412&quot;&gt;Flexible Work Options&lt;/strong&gt; depending on project requirements and role expectations&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;471&quot; data-end=&quot;584&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;473&quot; data-end=&quot;584&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;473&quot; data-end=&quot;508&quot;&gt;Exposure to Latest Technologies&lt;/strong&gt; including cloud platforms, microservices, and modern front-end frameworks&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('99eebbec-b099-4d77-a785-ebfd14d69a0d','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Cimplicity Engineer','cimplicity-engineer-327-327','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;61&quot; data-end=&quot;420&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced Cimplicity Engineers for a leading Top MNC to work on enterprise-scale Industrial Automation, HMI/SCADA, and Smart Manufacturing projects. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in GE Proficy Cimplicity, Cimplicity Tracker, SCADA application development, and industrial system integration within manufacturing environments.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;422&quot; data-end=&quot;821&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for designing, developing, implementing, and supporting GE Proficy Cimplicity HMI/SCADA applications for industrial automation systems. The role includes creating and maintaining HMI screens, developing application scripts, troubleshooting production issues, supporting system enhancements, and integrating SCADA applications with enterprise and shop-floor systems.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;823&quot; data-end=&quot;1164&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with GE Proficy Cimplicity, Cimplicity Tracker, HMI/SCADA screen development, scripting, application support, and industrial automation solutions. Strong knowledge of manufacturing systems, industrial communication, SCADA integration, troubleshooting, and production support is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1166&quot; data-end=&quot;1581&quot;&gt;The role also involves collaborating with cross-functional project teams, supporting system integration activities, preparing technical documentation, mentoring junior engineers, and ensuring high system availability and performance. Candidates should possess strong analytical, communication, troubleshooting, and problem-solving skills with the ability to work independently in fast-paced industrial environments&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Chennai',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-09-05 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-07-08 02:46:00.000000','2026-07-08 02:46:00.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Industrial Automation\", \"Manufacturing Execution Systems\", \"GE Proficy Cimplicity\", \"Cimplicity Tracker\", \"HMI Development\", \"SCADA Development\", \"Screen Scripting\", \"GE Proficy Suite\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1597&quot; data-end=&quot;1635&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;mjtz5&quot; data-start=&quot;1636&quot; data-end=&quot;1709&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale Industrial Automation and SCADA projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;a5lm0b&quot; data-start=&quot;1710&quot; data-end=&quot;1789&quot;&gt;Work on advanced GE Proficy Cimplicity and Smart Manufacturing technologies&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;h9f9au&quot; data-start=&quot;1790&quot; data-end=&quot;1847&quot;&gt;Career growth in Industrial Automation &amp;amp; SCADA domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1g8u6de&quot; data-start=&quot;1848&quot; data-end=&quot;1923&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global automation and engineering teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot; data-start=&quot;1924&quot; data-end=&quot;1979&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;1980&quot; data-end=&quot;2023&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Tamil Nadu'),('99f563a7-b5dd-4a00-aba8-bf70eb3c0e30','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Senior Java Spring Boot Developer','senior-java-spring-boot-developer-169-169','&lt;p data-start=&quot;214&quot; data-end=&quot;658&quot;&gt;We are looking for skilled &lt;strong data-start=&quot;241&quot; data-end=&quot;272&quot;&gt;Java Spring Boot Developers&lt;/strong&gt; to design, develop, and maintain scalable, secure, and high-performance applications. The role involves working on microservices-based architectures, RESTful APIs, and modern CI/CD practices while collaborating in an Agile team environment. Candidates will contribute to application development, testing, performance optimization, and issue resolution across the application lifecycle.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;hr data-start=&quot;660&quot; data-end=&quot;663&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;665&quot; data-end=&quot;683&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;669&quot; data-end=&quot;683&quot;&gt;Key Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;684&quot; data-end=&quot;1227&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;684&quot; data-end=&quot;728&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;686&quot; data-end=&quot;728&quot;&gt;Strong proficiency in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;708&quot; data-end=&quot;728&quot;&gt;Java programming&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;729&quot; data-end=&quot;769&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;731&quot; data-end=&quot;769&quot;&gt;Expertise in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;744&quot; data-end=&quot;769&quot;&gt;Spring Boot framework&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;770&quot; data-end=&quot;816&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;772&quot; data-end=&quot;816&quot;&gt;Experience in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;786&quot; data-end=&quot;816&quot;&gt;Microservices architecture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;817&quot; data-end=&quot;853&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;819&quot; data-end=&quot;853&quot;&gt;RESTful API design and consumption&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;854&quot; data-end=&quot;908&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;856&quot; data-end=&quot;908&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;881&quot; data-end=&quot;908&quot;&gt;SQL and NoSQL databases&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;909&quot; data-end=&quot;957&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;911&quot; data-end=&quot;957&quot;&gt;Knowledge of &lt;strong data-start=&quot;924&quot; data-end=&quot;957&quot;&gt;CI/CD tools and methodologies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;958&quot; data-end=&quot;996&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;960&quot; data-end=&quot;996&quot;&gt;Unit testing and integration testing&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;997&quot; data-end=&quot;1034&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;999&quot; data-end=&quot;1034&quot;&gt;Application security implementation&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1035&quot; data-end=&quot;1077&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1037&quot; data-end=&quot;1077&quot;&gt;Performance optimization and scalability&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1078&quot; data-end=&quot;1126&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1080&quot; data-end=&quot;1126&quot;&gt;Strong verbal and written communication skills&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1127&quot; data-end=&quot;1179&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1129&quot; data-end=&quot;1179&quot;&gt;Experience working in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1151&quot; data-end=&quot;1179&quot;&gt;Agile/Scrum environments&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1180&quot; data-end=&quot;1227&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1182&quot; data-end=&quot;1227&quot;&gt;Team collaboration and problem-solving skills&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Full-time','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Pune',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-02-14 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-12-16 21:26:04.000000','2025-12-16 21:26:04.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Agile\", \"Java\", \"Microservices Architectures\", \"NoSQL\", \"RESTFUL APIS\", \"Spring Boot\", \"SQL\", \"System Performance Optimization\", \"Unit Testing\", \"Scrum Master\", \"CI/CD\", \"Integration Testing\"]','[\"&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1542&quot; data-end=&quot;1856&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1542&quot; data-end=&quot;1582&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1544&quot; data-end=&quot;1582&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1571&quot; data-end=&quot;1582&quot;&gt;Top MNC&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1583&quot; data-end=&quot;1639&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1585&quot; data-end=&quot;1639&quot;&gt;Exposure to large-scale, enterprise-level applications&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1640&quot; data-end=&quot;1682&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1642&quot; data-end=&quot;1682&quot;&gt;Collaborative and Agile work environment&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1683&quot; data-end=&quot;1734&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1685&quot; data-end=&quot;1734&quot;&gt;Career growth and skill enhancement opportunities&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1735&quot; data-end=&quot;1793&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1737&quot; data-end=&quot;1793&quot;&gt;Work on modern technologies like microservices and CI/CD&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1794&quot; data-end=&quot;1856&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1796&quot; data-end=&quot;1856&quot;&gt;Competitive compensation package (as per industry standards)&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Maharashtra'),('9a41b8d6-082c-41c0-8a20-e194e55c51e0','a4c3a0f9-8feb-4596-9784-9bdd46767957','57dd62c0-fa9c-4260-b0ac-cafbea47cb72','Immediate opening for Servicenow Solution Architect @ 8+ Years , Remote','immediate-opening-for-servicenow-solution-architect-at-8-years-remote-98-98','Job Role: Servicenow Solution Architect&lt;br /&gt;Location: Remote&lt;br /&gt;Experience: 8+ Years&lt;br /&gt;Notice Period: Immediate to 15 Days&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;br /&gt;* Lead end-to-end architecture, design, and implementation of ServiceNow solutions for Sales, Order Management, SCM, and FSM modules.&lt;br /&gt;* Collaborate with business and technical stakeholders to gather requirements and translate them into ServiceNow platform solutions.&lt;br /&gt;* Design integrations between ServiceNow and external business systems like ERP, CRM, logistics, and telephony systems.&lt;br /&gt;* Lead configuration and customization of ServiceNow modules including CSM (Customer Service Management), FSM (Field Service Management), and others related to order lifecycle and supply chain.&lt;br /&gt;* Develop technical specifications, high-level and detailed design documents.&lt;br /&gt;* Ensure architecture compliance with enterprise standards, scalability, and security best practices.&lt;br /&gt;* Provide technical leadership during implementation, testing, deployment, and production support.&lt;br /&gt;* Optimize and enhance existing ServiceNow applications and workflows for sales and supply chain processes.&lt;br /&gt;* Build reusable workflows, automation scripts, and business rules aligned with best practices.&lt;br /&gt;* Collaborate with integration teams for API, web services (REST, SOAP), MID server, and data orchestration.&lt;br /&gt;* Provide mentorship and guidance to developers and junior architects.&lt;br /&gt;* Maintain awareness of ServiceNow platform updates and new features related to Sales and SCM domains.&lt;br /&gt;* Conduct technical workshops and presentations for stakeholders and project teams.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks &amp;amp; Regards,&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Arun&nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Talent Acquisition Specialist&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Creeno Solutions Pvt Ltd&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;C.K House, 3rd Floor,&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;MIG 65, Dharma Reddy Colony,&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Phase-II, Hyder Nagar,&nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Hyderabad, Telangana - 500 072.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contact:&nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;9392352955&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Email: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:arun.m@creenosolutions.com&quot;&gt;arun.m@creenosolutions.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;URL:&lt;/strong&gt;&nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.creenosolutions.com/&quot;&gt;www.creenosolutions.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;','Services','Contract','Entry',NULL,NULL,'INR',1,'India','PAN India',0,1,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-07-31 06:00:00',0,0,'2025-09-02 06:00:12.000000','2026-05-04 00:14:55.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Field Service Management\", \"Order Management\", \"Sales\", \"ServiceNow\", \"Supply Chain Management\"]','[\"As per company Standered\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('9af99106-55c8-4c97-a89a-2773b0ad3f15','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','MES Camstar Developer','mes-camstar-developer-307-307','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;63&quot; data-end=&quot;416&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced MES Camstar Developers for a leading Top MNC to work on enterprise-scale Manufacturing Execution System (MES) and digital manufacturing transformation projects. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in Siemens Opcenter Core (Camstar), MES implementations, workflow development, and manufacturing system integrations.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;418&quot; data-end=&quot;723&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for designing, developing, and implementing MES solutions using Siemens Opcenter Core/Camstar. The role includes developing CIO/MIO maps, workflows, portal customizations, factory models, and supporting end-to-end MES implementation activities across manufacturing sites.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;725&quot; data-end=&quot;1053&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with Camstar Portal Development, CIO/MIO interface connectivity, system upgrades, SQL development, database management, and enterprise system integrations. Strong knowledge of ERP, LIMS, equipment integration, HMI systems, and manufacturing validation processes is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1055&quot; data-end=&quot;1456&quot;&gt;The role also involves supporting production incidents, managing enhancement requests, translating business requirements into technical solutions, coordinating implementation activities, and ensuring successful project delivery. Candidates should possess strong leadership, communication, stakeholder management, and problem-solving skills with experience working in global manufacturing environments.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'INR',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-08-23 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-06-25 02:50:28.000000','2026-06-25 02:50:28.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Camstar\", \"Camstar MOM Connect\", \"Camstar MES Solutions\", \"CSV\", \"Database User Management\", \"ERP Integration\", \"MES Integration\", \"SQL Server\", \"Camstar Portal Studio\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1472&quot; data-end=&quot;1510&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;gmnzlb&quot; data-start=&quot;1511&quot; data-end=&quot;1580&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale MES and Smart Manufacturing projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1w6wv49&quot; data-start=&quot;1581&quot; data-end=&quot;1646&quot;&gt;Work on advanced Siemens Opcenter Core (Camstar) technologies&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;11ve40r&quot; data-start=&quot;1647&quot; data-end=&quot;1702&quot;&gt;Career growth in MES &amp;amp; Digital Manufacturing domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;uhu09b&quot; data-start=&quot;1703&quot; data-end=&quot;1765&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global manufacturing teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;u3fkj9&quot; data-start=&quot;1766&quot; data-end=&quot;1834&quot;&gt;Leadership opportunities in implementation and solution delivery&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot; data-start=&quot;1835&quot; data-end=&quot;1890&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;1891&quot; data-end=&quot;1934&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('9b052c04-0f22-4589-bc1e-8ede58744d83','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','SAP DM / BTP Developer','sap-dm-btp-developer-365-365','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;60&quot; data-end=&quot;269&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;86&quot; data-end=&quot;113&quot;&gt;SAP DM / BTP Developers&lt;/strong&gt; for a leading Top MNC to work on &lt;strong data-start=&quot;147&quot; data-end=&quot;219&quot;&gt;SAP Digital Manufacturing and SAP Business Technology Platform (BTP)&lt;/strong&gt; development projects in the manufacturing domain.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;271&quot; data-end=&quot;525&quot;&gt;The ideal candidate should have strong hands-on experience in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;333&quot; data-end=&quot;433&quot;&gt;SAP Digital Manufacturing (SAP DM/DMC), SAP BTP, SAP UI5, JavaScript, Node.js, and CAP Framework&lt;/strong&gt;, along with a solid understanding of MVC architecture and manufacturing data configuration.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;527&quot; data-end=&quot;880&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for developing and deploying &lt;strong data-start=&quot;590&quot; data-end=&quot;644&quot;&gt;custom plugins, BTP applications, and CAP services&lt;/strong&gt; for SAP Digital Manufacturing. The role involves understanding manufacturing business requirements, designing technical solutions, configuring manufacturing data, and collaborating with business stakeholders and cross-functional teams.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;882&quot; data-end=&quot;1078&quot;&gt;Professionals with strong communication skills, client-facing experience, and the ability to work independently will be highly preferred. Manufacturing domain knowledge will be an added advantage.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Pune',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-23 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-08-25 02:20:43.000000','2026-08-25 02:20:43.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"CapIQ\", \"Git\", \"JavaScript\", \"MVC\", \"Node.JS\", \"PL/SQL\", \"SAP\", \"SAP BI\", \"SQL\", \"VSCode\", \"SAP UI5 Developer\", \"SAP DM\", \"SAP BTP\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;i3mxm7&quot; data-start=&quot;1093&quot; data-end=&quot;1137&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a leading Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;nyc4z5&quot; data-start=&quot;1138&quot; data-end=&quot;1202&quot;&gt;Exposure to &lt;strong data-start