gineer&lt;/strong&gt; with a strong background in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;293&quot; data-end=&quot;334&quot;&gt;Voice and Video products and services&lt;/strong&gt;? Join our team to work on cutting-edge technologies and provide L3 operational support for global voice services!&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;452&quot; data-end=&quot;479&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;452&quot; data-end=&quot;477&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;480&quot; data-end=&quot;1121&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;480&quot; data-end=&quot;608&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;482&quot; data-end=&quot;608&quot;&gt;Maintain and establish global standards for conferencing systems and Live Events platforms like &lt;strong data-start=&quot;578&quot; data-end=&quot;605&quot;&gt;TMS and UBS TV (Vbrick)&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;609&quot; data-end=&quot;707&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;611&quot; data-end=&quot;707&quot;&gt;Provide technical assistance to resolve problems with conference systems and related services.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;708&quot; data-end=&quot;809&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;710&quot; data-end=&quot;809&quot;&gt;Monitor critical live events, hybrid video conferences, and alert the respective teams as needed.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;810&quot; data-end=&quot;923&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;812&quot; data-end=&quot;923&quot;&gt;Offer operational support for Voice and Video products such as &lt;strong data-start=&quot;875&quot; data-end=&quot;920&quot;&gt;VBrick, Digital Signage IPTV, and Utelogy&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;924&quot; data-end=&quot;1025&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;926&quot; data-end=&quot;1025&quot;&gt;Collaborate with IT teams to integrate conferencing platforms seamlessly into the IT environment.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1026&quot; data-end=&quot;1121&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1028&quot; data-end=&quot;1121&quot;&gt;Drive continuous improvement opportunities for performance, cost, and process optimization.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',300000.00,600000.00,'₹',0,'India','Hyderabad',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-19 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-07-01 11:19:55.000000','2025-11-21 04:56:54.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Cloud\", \"DevOps\", \"Monitoring\", \"MS Office\", \"Video Production\", \"Voice and Accent\", \"ITIL framework\", \"Agile and Site Reliability Engineering\", \"IT infrastructure integration\"]','[\"&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1147&quot; data-end=&quot;1510&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1147&quot; data-end=&quot;1198&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1149&quot; data-end=&quot;1198&quot;&gt;Competitive salary based on industry standards.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1199&quot; data-end=&quot;1246&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1201&quot; data-end=&quot;1246&quot;&gt;Comprehensive health and wellness benefits.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1247&quot; data-end=&quot;1315&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1249&quot; data-end=&quot;1315&quot;&gt;Paid leave, including vacation, sick leave, and public holidays.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1316&quot; data-end=&quot;1419&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1318&quot; data-end=&quot;1419&quot;&gt;Professional growth opportunities with certifications and training in Voice and Video technologies.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1420&quot; data-end=&quot;1510&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1422&quot; data-end=&quot;1510&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on global projects with a leading financial services organization.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Telangana'),('9dbf6956-15ff-4908-9049-b783e2a560ad