cal documentation and ensuring service delivery as per ITIL standards.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Full-time','Entry',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-31 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-12-03 02:32:19.000000','2025-12-03 02:32:19.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"AJAX\", \"HTML5\", \"ITIL\", \"Java\", \"JavaScript\", \"Mes\", \"SAP EWM\", \"Sap UI5\", \"Sap-ERP\", \"Kepware\", \"SAP ME\", \"SAP MII Development\", \"SAP PCo\"]','[\"&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1009&quot; data-end=&quot;1387&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1009&quot; data-end=&quot;1067&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1011&quot; data-end=&quot;1067&quot;&gt;Competitive salary with onsite Netherlands opportunity&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1068&quot; data-end=&quot;1139&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1070&quot; data-end=&quot;1139&quot;&gt;Global project exposure (Wilton, San Diego, and multi-site support)&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1140&quot; data-end=&quot;1220&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1142&quot; data-end=&quot;1220&quot;&gt;Opportunity to lead SAP ME/MII integrations and plant automation initiatives&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1221&quot; data-end=&quot;1295&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1223&quot; data-end=&quot;1295&quot;&gt;Work with advanced manufacturing systems and Industry 4.0 technologies&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1296&quot; data-end=&quot;1355&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1298&quot; data-end=&quot;1355&quot;&gt;Professional growth with cross-functional collaboration&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1356&quot; data-end=&quot;1387&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1358&quot; data-end=&quot;1387&quot;&gt;Long-term project stability&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('9f7e5c7c-acb6-435b-b82d-89c183b508a1','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','OBIEE / OAS Report Developer','obiee-oas-report-developer-291-291','&lt;p data-start=&quot;70&quot; data-end=&quot;434&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced OBIEE / OAS Report Developers for a leading Top MNC to work on enterprise-scale Business Intelligence, Analytics, and Reporting solutions. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in Oracle Business Intelligence Enterprise Edition (OBIEE), Oracle Analytics Server (OAS), dashboard development, and data visualization technologies.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;436&quot; data-end=&quot;750&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for designing, developing, and maintaining enterprise reporting solutions using OBIEE and OAS platforms. The role includes creating dashboards, reports, BI Publisher solutions, RPD development, and implementing scalable analytics architectures to support business decision-making.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;752&quot; data-end=&quot;1094&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience in RPD development across Physical, Business Model &amp;amp; Mapping (BMM), and Presentation layers, along with strong SQL query writing and optimization skills. Experience with OAS/OBIEE migration, upgrade projects, security configuration, performance tuning, and production support is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1096&quot; data-end=&quot;1453&quot;&gt;The role also involves troubleshooting reporting issues, optimizing analytics performance, implementing data-level security, collaborating with business stakeholders, and supporting enterprise BI initiatives. Candidates should possess strong analytical, problem-solving, and communication skills with the ability to deliver high-quality reporting solutions.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Hyderabad',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-08-08 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-06-10 02:40:13.000000','2026-06-10 02:40:13.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Oracle WMS\", \"Performance Tracking\", \"SQL\", \"ITIL framework\", \"OBIEE 11g/12c\", \"Oracle Analytics Server (OAS)\", \"RPD Development\", \"BI Publisher Reports\", \"OAS Migration\", \"OBIEE Migration\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1469&quot; data-end=&quot;1507&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ria9io&quot; data-start=&quot;1508&quot; data-end=&quot;1566&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale BI and Analytics projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;2u04qe&quot; data-start=&quot;1567&quot; data-end=&quot;1617&quot;&gt;Work on advanced Oracle Analytics technologies&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;wvbkj3&quot; data-start=&quot;1618&quot; data-end=&quot;1684&quot;&gt;Career growth in Business Intelligence &amp;amp; Data Analytics domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;182irwx&quot; data-start=&quot;1685&quot; data-end=&quot;1756&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global business and technical teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot; data-start=&quot;1757&quot; data-end=&quot;1812&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;1813&quot; data-end=&quot;1856&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Telangana'),('9f90d664-a8ce-4223-8950-1690497ed89c','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Senior Generative AI Developer','senior-generative-ai-developer-86-86','&lt;div&gt;We are looking for a Senior Generative AI Developer with strong expertise in building scalable AI/ML solutions using Generative AI, NLP, and modern backend technologies. The ideal candidate will possess hands-on experience in developing end-to-end AI systems, working with vector stores, prompt engineering, agent-based architectures, and deploying solutions on cloud environments like AWS or Azure.&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div&gt;As a key contributor, you will design, build, and deploy Generative AI models using tools like LangChain, Bedrock, and SageMaker, while ensuring compliance with data governance and security best practices. You should be passionate about cutting-edge AI developments and eager to bring intelligent automation and innovation to real-world applications.&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience Required:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div&gt;8+ years of industry experience&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div&gt;Minimum 2+ years in Generative AI / NLP roles&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Must-Have Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div&gt;End-to-end development experience&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div&gt;NLP, Prompt Engineering, and Agent-Based Architecture&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div&gt;Vector Store implementation&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div&gt;Python programming and frameworks: LangChain, Flask, FastAPI, Django&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div&gt;AWS &amp;amp; Azure cloud platforms&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div&gt;AWS services: S3, Lambda, Glue, Bedrock, SageMaker, Kendra, DynamoDB, DocumentDB&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div&gt;SQL and NoSQL database knowledge&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div&gt;Writing parsers for unstructured data (e.g., using AWS Textract)&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div&gt;Experience with CI/CD and DevOps tools&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div&gt;Service-oriented architecture understanding&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice-to-Have Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div&gt;Experience in LLM fine-tuning&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div&gt;Exposure to Generative AI Guardrails&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div&gt;Knowledge of data governance and AI security best practices&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div&gt;Experience building agent frameworks&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div&gt;Familiarity with large-scale deployments and microservices&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-09-30 06:00:00',0,0,'2025-07-29 10:45:12.000000','2026-05-06 20:51:53.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"AWS\", \"Django\", \"Flask\", \"Python\", \"CI/CD\", \"Generative AI\", \"Prompt Engineering\", \"NLP\", \"LangChain\", \"Vector Store\", \"SageMaker\", \"Bedrock\", \"FastAPI\", \"LLM Fine-tuning\"]','[\"&lt;div&gt;Work with top-tier global clients (e.g., TCS)&lt;/div&gt;\\r\\n&lt;div&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;\\r\\n&lt;div&gt;Competitive salary and performance-based bonuses&lt;/div&gt;\\r\\n&lt;div&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;\\r\\n&lt;div&gt;Remote flexibility / PAN India roles&lt;/div&gt;\\r\\n&lt;div&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;\\r\\n&lt;div&gt;Access to cutting-edge Generative AI projects and tools&lt;/div&gt;\\r\\n&lt;div&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;\\r\\n&lt;div&gt;Continuous learning &amp;amp; upskilling opportunities&lt;/div&gt;\\r\\n&lt;div&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;\\r\\n&lt;div&gt;Collaborative, innovative work culture&lt;/div&gt;\\r\\n&lt;div&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;\\r\\n&lt;div&gt;Health insurance and wellness benefits&lt;/div&gt;\\r\\n&lt;div&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;\\r\\n&lt;div&gt;Career growth in high-demand AI/ML technologies&lt;/div&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('9fb0500a-28c6-40ca-bb8c-d9276af6d9ee','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Azure Data Engineer','azure-data-engineer-123-123','We are seeking an experienced Azure Data Engineer with strong expertise in data ingestion, transformation, and migration using Azure tools. The role involves developing notebooks in Azure Databricks for data transformation and managing data movement between repositories and databases. The engineer will also be responsible for migrating data from on-premises systems to Azure cloud using ADF (Azure Data Factory) and other tools, while working in an agile Scrum environment.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;br /&gt;1. Develop and manage notebooks in Azure Databricks for data transformation and movement.&lt;br /&gt;2. Handle data ingestion from on-premise to Azure cloud using ADF and related tools.&lt;br /&gt;3. Collaborate with team members in an Agile/Scrum environment.&lt;br /&gt;4. Work on a pharmaceutical project, focusing on equipment, spare parts inventory, demand, procurement, and maintenance effectiveness.','Information Technology','Full-time','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2025-12-26 18:30:00',0,0,'2025-10-28 13:32:47.000000','2025-10-28 13:32:48.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Agile\", \"Azure\", \"Cloud Technologies\", \"Healthcare\", \"Pharmaceutical\", \"ADF\", \"Pyspark\", \"Data Migration\", \"Azure Databricks\"]','[\"Opportunity to work with modern Azure cloud technologies (ADF, Databricks, PySpark)&lt;br /&gt;Gain experience in the pharmaceutical/healthcare domain&lt;br /&gt;Collaborative and agile team environment&lt;br /&gt;Exposure to data migration and transformation projects on a large scale\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('a0766c9f-d772-4e9f-a434-c59cd1b5e745','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Serialization Functional Analyst','serialization-functional-analyst-24-24','We&#039;re Hiring | Immediate Requirement!&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&amp;nbsp;Position: Serialization Functional Analyst&lt;br /&gt;&amp;nbsp;Experience: 7&amp;ndash;10 Years&lt;br /&gt;&amp;nbsp;Preferred Designation: I.T. Analyst&lt;br /&gt;&amp;nbsp;Role: SAP - ATTP Consultant&lt;br /&gt;&amp;nbsp;Location: Hyderabad / PAN India&lt;br /&gt;&amp;nbsp;Start Date: Immediate&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;We are looking for an experienced SAP ATTP Functional Consultant with strong knowledge in serialization processes and global regulatory reporting.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&amp;nbsp;Desired Skills &amp;amp; Competencies:&lt;br /&gt;&amp;nbsp;Expertise in SAP ATTP configuration and functional processes&lt;br /&gt;&amp;nbsp;Understanding of serialization business flow and global compliance/reporting&lt;br /&gt;&amp;nbsp;Hands-on experience with OPTEL-OSM, Sea Vision (Serialization L2 &amp;amp; L3)&lt;br /&gt;&amp;nbsp;Basic knowledge of SAP ICH &amp;amp; TraceLink&lt;br /&gt;If you or someone in your network fits the bill and is looking for a new opportunity, let&#039;s connect!&lt;br /&gt;&amp;nbsp;DM me or send your profile to &lt;a class=&quot;npojYTzPzTWHOliEAnahXcPleomuINOXSvrw &quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot; href=&quot;mailto:siddhi@camzyinfotech.com&quot; target=&quot;_self&quot; data-test-app-aware-link=&quot;&quot;&gt;siddhi@camzyinfotech.com&lt;/a&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',500000.00,2500000.00,'₹',0,'India','Hyderabad',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-20 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-05-07 11:27:17.000000','2025-11-21 17:51:16.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Certified SAP Consultant\", \"SAP\", \"SAP ABAP\", \"Sap-ERP\"]','[\"&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;73&quot; data-end=&quot;90&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;73&quot; data-end=&quot;90&quot;&gt;Job Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;91&quot; data-end=&quot;351&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;91&quot; data-end=&quot;113&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;93&quot; data-end=&quot;113&quot;&gt;Competitive salary&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;114&quot; data-end=&quot;160&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;116&quot; data-end=&quot;160&quot;&gt;Health insurance (medical, dental, vision)&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;161&quot; data-end=&quot;191&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;163&quot; data-end=&quot;191&quot;&gt;Paid time off and holidays&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;192&quot; data-end=&quot;218&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;194&quot; data-end=&quot;218&quot;&gt;Flexible working hours&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;219&quot; data-end=&quot;245&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;221&quot; data-end=&quot;245&quot;&gt;Work-from-home options&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;246&quot; data-end=&quot;277&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;248&quot; data-end=&quot;277&quot;&gt;Career growth opportunities&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;278&quot; data-end=&quot;315&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;280&quot; data-end=&quot;315&quot;&gt;Employee training and development&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;316&quot; data-end=&quot;351&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;318&quot; data-end=&quot;351&quot;&gt;Bonuses and performance rewards&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Telangana'),('a080ad09-651f-4580-a1bb-1bdc66125073','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','STARLIMS Application Consultant','starlims-application-consultant-279-279','&lt;p data-start=&quot;73&quot; data-end=&quot;419&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced STARLIMS Application Consultants for a leading Top MNC to work on enterprise-level laboratory informatics and regulated laboratory system projects. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in STARLIMS implementation, configuration, customization, and application support within regulated laboratory environments.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;421&quot; data-end=&quot;856&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for participating in the complete STARLIMS project lifecycle, including requirements gathering, design, development, testing, deployment, upgrades, enhancements, and post-go-live support. The role includes configuring STARLIMS modules such as Sample Management, Workflow &amp;amp; Testing, Results &amp;amp; Reporting, Stability, Environmental Monitoring, and QC modules based on business and laboratory requirements.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;858&quot; data-end=&quot;1154&quot;&gt;Professionals should have strong hands-on experience with STARLIMS scripting, SQL databases, REST/SOAP web services, custom reports, and enterprise integrations. Experience supporting integrations with ELN, SDMS, ERP (SAP), MES, laboratory instruments, and middleware systems is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1156&quot; data-end=&quot;1566&quot;&gt;The role also involves troubleshooting application, interface, performance, and data-related issues while ensuring compliance with GxP, data integrity, audit trail, and validation standards. Candidates should possess strong communication, stakeholder management, analytical thinking, and documentation skills to work effectively with laboratory users, Quality teams, IT teams, vendors, and global stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-07-20 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-05-22 02:19:46.000000','2026-05-22 02:19:46.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Crystal Report\", \"RESTFUL APIS\", \"SOAP\", \"SQL Server\", \"Electronic Lab Notebook (ELN)\", \"Validation Documentation\", \"STARLIMS Configuration\", \"STARLIMS Customization\", \"LIMS Project Lifecycle Management\", \"Sample Management\", \"STARLIMS Scripting\", \"SDMS Integration\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1582&quot; data-end=&quot;1620&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1uxllaf&quot; data-start=&quot;1621&quot; data-end=&quot;1671&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-level STARLIMS projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;figprm&quot; data-start=&quot;1672&quot; data-end=&quot;1752&quot;&gt;Work on global laboratory informatics and digital transformation initiatives&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;4qpkz8&quot; data-start=&quot;1753&quot; data-end=&quot;1806&quot;&gt;Career growth in LIMS &amp;amp; Laboratory Systems domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;qo05xv&quot; data-start=&quot;1807&quot; data-end=&quot;1872&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global cross-functional teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;2lee9a&quot; data-start=&quot;1873&quot; data-end=&quot;1928&quot;&gt;Professional and compliance-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;1929&quot; data-end=&quot;1972&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('a0d18f2b-0f05-49e5-bfc4-ad09e25c7624','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Scrum Master','scrum-master-286-286','&lt;p data-start=&quot;54&quot; data-end=&quot;395&quot;&gt;We are hiring an experienced Scrum Master for a leading Top MNC to drive Agile delivery for enterprise-scale Manufacturing Execution Systems (MES) and digital transformation projects. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in Agile methodologies, Scrum practices, stakeholder management, and software delivery lifecycle management.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;397&quot; data-end=&quot;786&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for facilitating Agile ceremonies, including Sprint Planning, Daily Standups, Sprint Reviews, and Retrospectives while ensuring adherence to Scrum principles and best practices. The role involves working closely with Product Owners, Development Teams, Business Stakeholders, and Project Managers to deliver high-quality solutions on time and within scope.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;788&quot; data-end=&quot;1161&quot;&gt;Professionals should have experience managing Agile and Waterfall project environments, tracking delivery metrics, monitoring sprint health, managing risks and dependencies, and driving continuous improvement initiatives. Strong knowledge of SDLC, DevOps practices, Agile reporting, and project management tools such as JIRA, Confluence, and MS Project is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1163&quot; data-end=&quot;1491&quot;&gt;The role also requires coordination between onsite and offshore teams, stakeholder communication, issue resolution, and process optimization to improve productivity, quality, and project outcomes. Candidates with MES, Manufacturing Automation, Semiconductor, or Electronics Manufacturing experience will have an added advantage.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Pune',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-08-08 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-06-10 01:51:18.000000','2026-06-10 01:51:18.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Agile Methodology\", \"Confluence\", \"DevOps\", \"JIRA\", \"Waterfall Methodology\", \"Scrum Master\", \"Sprint Planning\", \"Scrum Framework\", \"Sprint Reviews\", \"Sprint Retrospectives\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1507&quot; data-end=&quot;1545&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;d1dw51&quot; data-start=&quot;1546&quot; data-end=&quot;1613&quot;&gt;Exposure to large-scale MES and digital transformation projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ab92bx&quot; data-start=&quot;1614&quot; data-end=&quot;1659&quot;&gt;Leadership role in Agile project delivery&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;14c1c93&quot; data-start=&quot;1660&quot; data-end=&quot;1725&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global teams and stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1vc6d2e&quot; data-start=&quot;1726&quot; data-end=&quot;1789&quot;&gt;Career growth in Agile Delivery &amp;amp; Project Management domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot; data-start=&quot;1790&quot; data-end=&quot;1845&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;1846&quot; data-end=&quot;1889&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Maharashtra'),('a1b0a516-3528-43f2-ae89-f9ec7935b8fe','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','PLC Engineer – Siemens S7 (Industrial Automation & Equipment Remediation)  Job Description','plc-engineer-siemens-s7-industrial-automation-equipment-remediation-job-description-315-315','&lt;p data-start=&quot;115&quot; data-end=&quot;430&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced PLC Engineers for a leading Top MNC to work on Industrial Automation, Equipment Remediation, and Smart Manufacturing projects. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in Siemens S7 PLC programming, TIA Portal, industrial automation systems, and brownfield equipment modernization.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;432&quot; data-end=&quot;784&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for developing, modifying, testing, and optimizing Siemens S7 PLC programs for manufacturing and industrial automation environments. The role includes equipment remediation, PLC logic redevelopment, HMI and SCADA integration, and seamless connectivity between shop-floor automation systems and enterprise applications.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;786&quot; data-end=&quot;1144&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with Siemens S7 PLCs, TIA Portal, Step 7, PLC/HMI/SCADA integration, OPC-UA, Kepware, SQL databases, and industrial communication protocols such as PROFINET and PROFIBUS. Strong understanding of manufacturing automation, equipment commissioning, validation, and enterprise system integration is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1146&quot; data-end=&quot;1515&quot;&gt;The role also involves supporting Factory Acceptance Testing (FAT), Site Acceptance Testing (SAT), IQ/OQ/UAT activities, commissioning, Hypercare support, technical documentation, SOP preparation, and troubleshooting. Candidates will collaborate with OEMs, MES teams, IT teams, and automation engineers to deliver reliable and compliant industrial automation solutions.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'INR',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-08-28 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-06-30 03:28:46.000000','2026-06-30 03:28:46.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"ERP\", \"Industrial Automation\", \"PLC Programming\", \"SAP\", \"SCADA\", \"Siemens\", \"Profinet\", \"HMI\", \"Siemens Tia Portal\", \"Kepware\", \"OPC UA\", \"Profibus\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1531&quot; data-end=&quot;1569&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1402v26&quot; data-start=&quot;1570&quot; data-end=&quot;1633&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale Industrial Automation projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;11n2mh7&quot; data-start=&quot;1634&quot; data-end=&quot;1697&quot;&gt;Work on Siemens S7 PLC and Smart Manufacturing technologies&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1rxjyxk&quot; data-start=&quot;1698&quot; data-end=&quot;1771&quot;&gt;Career growth in Industrial Automation &amp;amp; Digital Manufacturing domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;13mqfss&quot; data-start=&quot;1772&quot; data-end=&quot;1842&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global OEMs and automation experts&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;45fk39&quot; data-start=&quot;1843&quot; data-end=&quot;1898&quot;&gt;Professional and technology-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;1899&quot; data-end=&quot;1942&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('a1e2cfa5-4b01-4fa3-b353-573bfeffaac9','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Software Engineer','software-engineer-87-87','We are looking for passionate Software Engineers who are enthusiastic about building high-quality, scalable, and reliable applications for Industrial IoT. You&amp;rsquo;ll be part of a cross-functional, autonomous team working on cloud-based platforms that help power and scale industrial solutions globally.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Your role will focus on designing, developing, and deploying applications with strong emphasis on availability, performance, and DevOps principles. You&amp;rsquo;ll take ownership, collaborate with top engineers, and contribute to systems that impact how we feed the world and protect the planet.','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',1,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-19 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-08-01 13:02:21.000000','2025-11-21 04:44:34.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Automation Testing\", \"AWS\", \"Cloud Computing\", \"CSS\", \"Debugging Skills\", \"Deployment\", \"DevOps\", \"Distributed Control Systems\", \"Git\", \"Google Pub\", \"Google Sub\", \"HTML\", \"Java\", \"KOTLIN\", \"Messaging Systems\", \"Microservices\", \"Python\", \"React\", \"REST API\", \"SNS (Simple Notification Service)\", \"Software Development\", \"SQS (Simple Queue Service)\", \"CI/CD\"]','[\"Opportunity to work on cutting-edge cloud and IoT technologies&lt;br /&gt;Be part of a collaborative, autonomous product team&lt;br /&gt;Exposure to DevOps and microservices-based architectures&lt;br /&gt;Ownership of features from design to deployment&lt;br /&gt;Work alongside some of the best software engineers in the industry&lt;br /&gt;Encouraging workplace for learning, innovation, and team growth\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('a1ec3bb0-7a59-4581-ad68-40da8b8f69f9','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Plant Safety Expert | Oil & Gas / Energy Domain','plant-safety-expert-oil-gas-energy-domain-261-261','&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;tznwe9&quot; data-start=&quot;474&quot; data-end=&quot;503&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;504&quot; data-end=&quot;991&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1b5gsx9&quot; data-start=&quot;504&quot; data-end=&quot;581&quot;&gt;Ensure implementation of &lt;strong data-start=&quot;531&quot; data-end=&quot;579&quot;&gt;process safety and risk management practices&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;r58t9v&quot; data-start=&quot;582&quot; data-end=&quot;657&quot;&gt;Conduct and contribute to &lt;strong data-start=&quot;610&quot; data-end=&quot;655&quot;&gt;HAZOP, RCA, PSSR and other safety studies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;14xe3i2&quot; data-start=&quot;658&quot; data-end=&quot;739&quot;&gt;Monitor and improve &lt;strong data-start=&quot;680&quot; data-end=&quot;737&quot;&gt;plant safety, reliability, and operational efficiency&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;r8s7do&quot; data-start=&quot;740&quot; data-end=&quot;834&quot;&gt;Work closely with operations and engineering teams to ensure &lt;strong data-start=&quot;803&quot; data-end=&quot;832&quot;&gt;safe production processes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;f9kow6&quot; data-start=&quot;835&quot; data-end=&quot;918&quot;&gt;Support &lt;strong data-start=&quot;845&quot; data-end=&quot;916&quot;&gt;incident investigation, root cause analysis, and corrective actions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;14c83sc&quot; data-start=&quot;919&quot; data-end=&quot;991&quot;&gt;Maintain compliance with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;946&quot; data-end=&quot;991&quot;&gt;industry safety standards and regulations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Infrastructure Management','Contract','Entry',NULL,NULL,'INR',1,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-06-22 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-04-23 17:35:44.000000','2026-04-23 17:35:44.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Hazop\", \"PLC\", \"Root Cause Analysis (RCA)\", \"Safety\", \"Safety (EHS )\", \"DCS\"]','[\"&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1925&quot; data-end=&quot;2284&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1925&quot; data-end=&quot;2009&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1927&quot; data-end=&quot;2009&quot;&gt;Work with a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1939&quot; data-end=&quot;1973&quot;&gt;leading company in dermatology&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;focused on advancing patient care&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2010&quot; data-end=&quot;2103&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2012&quot; data-end=&quot;2103&quot;&gt;Opportunity to grow&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2032&quot; data-end=&quot;2047&quot;&gt;technically&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;and gain deep&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2062&quot; data-end=&quot;2101&quot;&gt;domain expertise in quality systems&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2164&quot; data-end=&quot;2221&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2166&quot; data-end=&quot;2221&quot;&gt;Collaborate with a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2185&quot; data-end=&quot;2219&quot;&gt;global, offshore delivery team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2222&quot; data-end=&quot;2284&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2224&quot; data-end=&quot;2284&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience in&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2247&quot; data-end=&quot;2282&quot;&gt;regulatory-compliant IT systems&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('a3456a51-87dc-4692-8099-2bfdbe30bd62','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','TrakSYS Consultant','traksys-consultant-330-330','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;60&quot; data-end=&quot;448&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced TrakSYS Consultants for a leading Top MNC to work on enterprise-scale Manufacturing Execution System (MES) and Digital Manufacturing transformation projects. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in TrakSYS implementation, customization, application support, and manufacturing process optimization across process and discrete manufacturing industries.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;450&quot; data-end=&quot;848&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for implementing, configuring, customizing, and supporting TrakSYS MES solutions to meet business and manufacturing requirements. The role includes gathering functional requirements, developing application enhancements, troubleshooting production issues, administering MES applications, and integrating TrakSYS with enterprise systems such as SAP and LabWare LIMS.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;850&quot; data-end=&quot;1183&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with TrakSYS, C# .NET application development, MS SQL, T-SQL, SQL query optimization, MES administration, and manufacturing workflows. Strong understanding of process or discrete manufacturing, enterprise integrations, application maintenance, and production support is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1185&quot; data-end=&quot;1641&quot;&gt;The role also involves collaborating with business stakeholders, manufacturing teams, IT teams, and global project teams to deliver scalable MES solutions. Candidates will support TrakSYS implementation and upgrade projects, resolve technical issues, improve manufacturing processes, prepare technical documentation, and ensure reliable system performance. Strong analytical, communication, stakeholder management, and problem-solving skills are essential.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Pune',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-09-05 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-07-08 03:20:07.000000','2026-07-08 03:20:07.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\".NET\", \".NET Framework\", \"C#\", \"Mes\", \"Microsoft SQL\", \"SAP Integration\", \"Transact-SQL\", \"LabWare LIMS\", \"TrakSYS\", \"TrakSYS Customization\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1657&quot; data-end=&quot;1695&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;gxlz0s&quot; data-start=&quot;1696&quot; data-end=&quot;1767&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale MES and Digital Manufacturing projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;p0bwr5&quot; data-start=&quot;1768&quot; data-end=&quot;1833&quot;&gt;Work on advanced TrakSYS and Smart Manufacturing technologies&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;hyh22q&quot; data-start=&quot;1834&quot; data-end=&quot;1899&quot;&gt;Career growth in Manufacturing Execution Systems (MES) domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;vq0hl0&quot; data-start=&quot;1900&quot; data-end=&quot;1972&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global business and technology teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot; data-start=&quot;1973&quot; data-end=&quot;2028&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;2029&quot; data-end=&quot;2072&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Maharashtra'),('a345956f-8fa5-405a-b5ca-37b9bc3a37e8','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Software Engineer – iOS Developer (Fresher)','software-engineer-ios-developer-fresher-100-100','We are hiring iOS Developer Freshers for our Bangalore office. As part of the development team, you will work on designing, building, and maintaining high-performance iOS applications. This is a great opportunity to start your career with a reputed MNC and collaborate with a multicultural team in Japan.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Roles &amp;amp; Key Responsibilities:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Handle iOS application&amp;rsquo;s entire lifecycle &amp;ndash; design, code, deploy, test, release (to AppStore), and maintain.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Build advanced applications on iOS platforms.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Implement innovative iOS prototypes for Proof-of-Concepts and convert them into deliverable apps.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Collaborate with server-side and other app developers to integrate backend systems.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Discover, evaluate, and implement new technologies for maximum efficiency.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Document and resolve issues/bugs on time.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Track project status and ensure timely delivery.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Ability to work under pressure and prioritize tasks effectively.','Information Technology','Contract','Executive',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-19 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-09-10 09:11:36.000000','2025-11-21 04:42:26.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Analytical Skill\", \"Functional Programming\", \"Git Version Control\", \"Hana Proxy Objects\", \"IOS\", \"Ios App Development\", \"IOS Development\", \"JSON\", \"macOS\", \"Network Architecture\", \"Objective C\", \"OOPS\", \"Problem-Solving Skills\", \"REST API\", \"Swift\", \"VPN\", \"Xcode\", \"IBM MDM\"]','[\"Opportunity to work in a Top MNC with global presence.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Direct exposure to multicultural teams in Japan.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Hands-on learning in iOS app lifecycle &amp;amp; cutting-edge technologies.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Growth-oriented role with opportunities for long-term career advancement.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Collaborative work environment with mentorship.&lt;br /&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('a39e01b9-74a4-41fd-85c9-ef1ba0665be5','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Senior Python Developer','senior-python-developer-17-17','Job Description: We are seeking a highly skilled and experienced Senior Python Developer to join our team. The ideal candidate will be responsible for designing, developing, and deploying scalable Python applications, collaborating with cross-functional teams, and ensuring code quality and performance. You will work on backend development, API integrations, and data processing pipelines, contributing to the continuous improvement of our systems Key Responsibilities: Design and develop scalable and efficient Python applications. Build and maintain RESTful APIs and microservices. Collaborate with front-end developers, DevOps, and data teams to deliver full-stack solutions. Write clean, maintainable, and well-documented code following best practices. Optimize and refactor existing code to improve performance and reliability. Work with databases (SQL and NoSQL) to design and manage data models. Develop and integrate with third-party APIs and services. Implement and manage CI/CD pipelines for automated testing and deployment. Conduct code reviews and provide mentorship to junior developers. Troubleshoot and debug complex issues in production environments. Stay updated with the latest Python frameworks, libraries, and technologies. Required Skills: 5+ years of experience in Python development. Strong proficiency in Python frameworks (Django, Flask, or FastAPI). Experience with API development and integration. Proficiency in SQL and NoSQL databases (PostgreSQL, MySQL, MongoDB, or Redis). Experience with version control systems (Git, GitHub, GitLab, or Bitbucket). Strong understanding of data structures and algorithms. Experience with Docker and containerized applications. Hands-on experience with unit testing and debugging. Familiarity with cloud platforms (AWS, Azure, or GCP). Proficiency in writing and optimizing SQL queries. Strong problem-solving skills and attention to detail.','Information Technology','Contract','Entry',300000.00,600000.00,'₹',1,'India','Hyderabad',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2025-07-03 18:30:00',0,0,'2025-05-05 02:38:20.000000','2025-05-05 02:38:20.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"API\", \"API Gateway\", \"Azure API Management\", \"Basic Python\", \"Core Python\", \"Python 3\", \"Python Fullstack\"]','[\"Perks &amp;amp; Benefits: Competitive salary package Career growth opportunities Comprehensive health insurance Hybrid work model Performance-based incentives Learning and development programs\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Telangana'),('a3b007bc-88c3-48f0-8d96-f3e34f41b8f5','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Scitara LIMS Support Analyst','scitara-lims-support-analyst-372-372','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;66&quot; data-end=&quot;449&quot;&gt;We are looking for an experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;100&quot; data-end=&quot;132&quot;&gt;Scitara LIMS Support Analyst&lt;/strong&gt; to support enterprise-level &lt;strong data-start=&quot;161&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;Laboratory Informatics and Digital Laboratory&lt;/strong&gt; environments. The ideal candidate should have hands-on experience with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;282&quot; data-end=&quot;320&quot;&gt;Scitara Digital Lab Exchange (DLX)&lt;/strong&gt; and strong expertise in LIMS, ELN, CDS, laboratory instrument integrations, APIs, middleware, databases, and production support.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;451&quot; data-end=&quot;671&quot;&gt;The role involves providing &lt;strong data-start=&quot;479&quot; data-end=&quot;508&quot;&gt;L2/L3 application support&lt;/strong&gt;, troubleshooting production and integration issues, performing RCA, managing incidents and changes, and ensuring reliable data exchange across laboratory systems.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Pune',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-25 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-08-27 02:53:54.000000','2026-08-27 02:53:54.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"JIRA\", \"JSON\", \"Lims\", \"Message Oriented Middleware\", \"MYSQL\", \"RESTFUL APIS\", \"Root Cause Analysis (RCA)\", \"ServiceNow\", \"Web Services\", \"XML\", \"Electroni