rs and technical teams during deployments and upgrades.&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1wiuy6m&quot; data-start=&quot;1353&quot; data-end=&quot;1426&quot;&gt;Ensure platform availability and performance according to defined SLAs.&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1fhqqa4&quot; data-start=&quot;1427&quot; data-end=&quot;1497&quot;&gt;Maintain technical documentation and support knowledge repositories.&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Maharashtra'),('a4902b5a-3cd9-4b11-848e-6b7f174df2a5','3ec4391c-d7e6-4810-9ac1-64f6e207fd8d','537b19b2-0785-46b6-9899-ed1f166a0469','Principal Cloud Architect (AWS & Microservices)','principal-cloud-architect-aws','Architect high-throughput financial transaction infrastructure with zero downtime and sub-millisecond latencies.','DevOps & Architecture','Full-time','Lead',190000.00,240000.00,'USD',1,'United States','New York, NY',0,1,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-12-06 05:55:39',0,0,'2026-10-07 05:55:39.409590','2026-10-16 05:31:40.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"AWS\", \"Kubernetes\", \"Docker\", \"Terraform\", \"Microservices\"]',NULL,'ANY',0,5,NULL),('a4dc58a5-127e-4bde-a819-2c993540661a','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','ThingWorx Application Developer','thingworx-application-developer-139-139','&lt;p data-start=&quot;224&quot; data-end=&quot;596&quot;&gt;A Top MNC is seeking a highly experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;266&quot; data-end=&quot;301&quot;&gt;ThingWorx Application Developer&lt;/strong&gt; to design, develop, and optimize enterprise IoT and automation solutions.&lt;br data-start=&quot;375&quot; data-end=&quot;378&quot; /&gt;This role involves building interactive mashups, integrating systems like ERP/MES/LIMS, creating data models, and implementing automation workflows for smart manufacturing and Pharma/Industrial Automation environments.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;598&quot; data-end=&quot;732&quot;&gt;The ideal candidate will have 