 AVEVA PI (OSI PI) administration, technical support, incident management, and industrial application support environments.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;437&quot; data-end=&quot;826&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for providing Level 1 administration and support for AVEVA PI systems, ensuring system availability, resolving incidents, and supporting business users across industrial and manufacturing environments. The role includes troubleshooting PI-related issues, managing user access requests, handling application permissions, and maintaining system performance.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;828&quot; data-end=&quot;1116&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with ServiceNow ticket management, IT/OT support processes, user administration, and technical troubleshooting. Exposure to Acronis and Adept administration, industrial data platforms, and operational support environments is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1118&quot; data-end=&quot;1492&quot;&gt;The role also involves coordinating with internal support teams, vendors, and stakeholders to resolve technical issues, communicate updates, and ensure timely incident resolution. Candidates should possess excellent communication, analytical thinking, stakeholder management, and problem-solving skills with the ability to work independently in a support-driven environment.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Pune',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-08-08 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-06-10 02:19:14.000000','2026-06-10 02:19:14.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Incident Reporting\", \"ServiceNow Ticket Management\", \"AVEVA PI (OSI PI)\", \"PI System Administration\", \"PI Technical Support\", \"Application Support\", \"Industrial Data Management\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;q8l4y0&quot; data-start=&quot;1508&quot; data-end=&quot;1553&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top Global MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;18iv4ke&quot; data-start=&quot;1554&quot; data-end=&quot;1627&quot;&gt;Exposure to Industrial Automation and Digital Transformation projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;12tse0h&quot; data-start=&quot;1628&quot; data-end=&quot;1687&quot;&gt;Work on enterprise-level AVEVA PI (OSI PI) environments&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;153ke7r&quot; data-start=&quot;1688&quot; data-end=&quot;1750&quot;&gt;Career growth in Industrial Data Management &amp;amp; IT/OT domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;14c1c93&quot; data-start=&quot;1751&quot; data-end=&quot;1816&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global teams and stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;5e3i2y&quot; data-start=&quot;1817&quot; data-end=&quot;1870&quot;&gt;Professional and growth-oriented work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;1871&quot; data-end=&quot;1914&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Maharashtra'),('a6ce592a-21cf-4c3e-a2a2-ad964d5048dc','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','AWS Architect / Lead','aws-architect-lead-266-266','Design scalable cloud architectures &lt;br /&gt;Lead AWS implementation &amp;amp; migration projects &lt;br /&gt;Ensure security &amp;amp; compliance standards&lt;br /&gt;Optimize cloud cost &amp;amp; performance &lt;br /&gt;Mentor technical teams &amp;amp; solve complex challenges','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Hyderabad',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-07-10 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-05-11 15:47:23.000000','2026-05-11 15:47:23.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\".NET\", \"AWS\", \"AWS DevOps\", \"AWS Lambda\", \"AWS VMs EC2\", \"C#\", \"Cloud Migration\", \"Docker\", \"Java\", \"Kafka\", \"Kubernetes\", \"S3\", \"TerraForm\", \"Aurora PostgreSQL\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;340&quot; data-end=&quot;378&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;gj6nhq&quot; data-start=&quot;379&quot; data-end=&quot;436&quot;&gt;Exposure to large-scale cloud transformation projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;6upshv&quot; data-start=&quot;437&quot; data-end=&quot;478&quot;&gt;Work on modern AWS cloud technologies&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1d1azp7&quot; data-start=&quot;479&quot; data-end=&quot;523&quot;&gt;Leadership and architecture-focused role&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ceoesw&quot; data-start=&quot;524&quot; data-end=&quot;566&quot;&gt;Career growth in Cloud &amp;amp; DevOps domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1xgac&quot; data-start=&quot;567&quot; data-end=&quot;612&quot;&gt;Collaborative enterprise work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;613&quot; data-end=&quot;656&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Telangana'),('a700e1a2-34e3-4bba-a118-927f0b834b77','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Generative AI Engineer','generative-ai-engineer-310-310','&lt;p data-start=&quot;64&quot; data-end=&quot;376&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced Generative AI Engineers for a leading Top MNC to work on next-generation Artificial Intelligence, Machine Learning, and Generative AI solutions. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in deep learning, large language models, AI model development, and cloud-based AI platforms.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;378&quot; data-end=&quot;744&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for designing, developing, training, and deploying advanced Generative AI models using modern AI architectures such as GPT, GANs, and Variational Autoencoders (VAEs). The role includes building scalable AI/ML pipelines, optimizing model performance, evaluating AI solutions, and delivering production-ready intelligent applications.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;746&quot; data-end=&quot;1075&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with Python, TensorFlow, PyTorch, Keras, Hugging Face, SpaCy, NLTK, and Azure Cloud Services. Strong knowledge of Natural Language Processing (NLP), machine learning algorithms, deep learning techniques, software engineering principles, and AI model optimization is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1077&quot; data-end=&quot;1450&quot;&gt;The role also involves collaborating with Data Scientists, Product Managers, AI Researchers, and Engineering teams to deliver enterprise-grade AI solutions, researching emerging AI technologies, mentoring junior engineers, and establishing AI development best practices. Candidates should possess excellent analytical, communication, innovation, and problem-solving skills.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Hyderabad',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-08-24 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-06-26 03:27:38.000000','2026-06-26 03:27:38.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Artificial Intelligence\", \"Machine Learning\", \"Python\", \"Generative AI\", \"NLP\", \"PyTorch\", \"TensorFlow\", \"Deep Learning\", \"Hugging Face\", \"GPT-4V\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot; data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1466&quot; data-end=&quot;1504&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1gr0ud4&quot; data-start=&quot;1505&quot; data-end=&quot;1577&quot;&gt;Exposure to cutting-edge Generative AI and Machine Learning projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1tex9ov&quot; data-start=&quot;1578&quot; data-end=&quot;1648&quot;&gt;Work on enterprise-scale AI and Digital Transformation initiatives&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot; data-section-id=&quot;12mcwph&quot; data-start=&quot;1649&quot; data-end=&quot;1716&quot;&gt;Career growth in Artificial Intelligence &amp;amp; Generative AI domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot; data-section-id=&quot;zc03ak&quot; data-start=&quot;1717&quot; data-end=&quot;1793&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global AI research and engineering teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot; data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot; data-start=&quot;1794&quot; data-end=&quot;1849&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;1850&quot; data-end=&quot;1893&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Telangana'),('a71566f1-aa16-449d-9fb0-c7d65286225d','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Inside Sales Executive - Bangalore (0 - 2 Years)','inside-sales-executive-bangalore-0-2-years-91-91','We are hiring Inside Sales Executives to join our growing team in Bangalore. This is an excellent opportunity for freshers and young professionals (0&amp;ndash;2 years) who are passionate about sales and want to build a rewarding career in IT Sales.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Generate and qualify leads through calling and online channels&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Build and maintain strong client relationships&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Conduct cold calling and follow-ups with potential clients&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Support sales growth in IT Infrastructure and Networking domain&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Work closely with the business development team for presales activities&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Requirements:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;0 to 2 years of experience in Inside Sales / Tele Sales / Lead Generation (Freshers can apply)&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Strong communication and convincing skills&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Ability to build client relationships and handle objections&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Enthusiastic, self-motivated, and eager to learn&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Location: Bangalore (Work from Office)','Information Technology','Contract','Entry',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-19 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-08-21 08:27:01.000000','2025-11-21 04:44:08.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Client Relationship Management\", \"Cold Calling\", \"Inside Sales\", \"IT Infrastructure\", \"Lead Generation\", \"Networking\", \"Strong Communication Skills.\", \"Telesales\"]','[\"Opportunity to kickstart your career with a top MNC&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Training and mentoring support from experienced professionals&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Competitive salary and performance-based incentives&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Exposure to IT Infrastructure &amp;amp; Networking industry&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Growth opportunities within the sales &amp;amp; business development domain\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('a797de3f-6aeb-4ba9-af0b-a9467f14f663','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','MES Functional Consultant','mes-functional-consultant-378-378','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;206&quot; data-end=&quot;418&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;232&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;MES Functional Consultants&lt;/strong&gt; for a leading Top MNC to work on large-scale &lt;strong data-start=&quot;308&quot; data-end=&quot;417&quot;&gt;Manufacturing Execution System (MES), Digital Manufacturing, and Manufacturing IT transformation projects&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;420&quot; data-end=&quot;777&quot;&gt;The ideal candidate should have &lt;strong data-start=&quot;452&quot; data-end=&quot;480&quot;&gt;5&amp;ndash;12 years of experience&lt;/strong&gt; in MES functional consulting, implementation, requirement gathering, manufacturing processes, and system integration. Candidates with hands-on experience in platforms such as &lt;strong data-start=&quot;656&quot; data-end=&quot;762&quot;&gt;DELMIA Apriso, Siemens SIMATIC IT, GE Proficy, SAP ME/MII, Rockwell MES, or similar COTS MES platforms&lt;/strong&gt; are preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;779&quot; data-end=&quot;1115&quot;&gt;The role involves working closely with customers and manufacturing stakeholders to understand business requirements, perform functional analysis and fit-gap assessments, prepare &lt;strong data-start=&quot;957&quot; data-end=&quot;1067&quot;&gt;Requirement Traceability Matrices (RTM), Functional Design Specifications (FDS), functional test scenarios&lt;/strong&gt;, and support SIT/UAT and validation activities.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1117&quot; data-end=&quot;1361&quot;&gt;The consultant will be responsible for supporting the complete MES implementation lifecycle, including requirement gathering, solution design, configuration support, testing, deployment, troubleshooting, user training, and post-go-live support.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-31 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-09-02 02:12:34.000000','2026-09-02 02:12:34.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Delmia Apriso\", \"GE Proficy AMS\", \"Mes\", \"Mes Administrator\", \"Mes Solutions Architect\", \"Mom\", \"PFDs\", \"Siemens Tia Portal\", \"Rockwell FTPS\", \"SAP ME\", \"ISA-95\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;i3mxm7&quot; data-start=&quot;1668&quot; data-end=&quot;1712&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a leading Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;ku1ot&quot; data-start=&quot;1713&quot; data-end=&quot;1773&quot;&gt;Exposure to large-scale global MES implementation programs&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1wsc7th&quot; data-start=&quot;1774&quot; data-end=&quot;1842&quot;&gt;Work across Manufacturing IT and Digital Manufacturing initiatives&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;79b8p8&quot; data-start=&quot;1843&quot; data-end=&quot;1910&quot;&gt;Exposure to multiple MES platforms and manufacturing technologies&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1sx3ity&quot; data-start=&quot;1911&quot; data-end=&quot;1998&quot;&gt;Opportunity to interact directly with global customers and manufacturing stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ga21hn&quot; data-start=&quot;1999&quot; data-end=&quot;2098&quot;&gt;Experience across Automotive, Chemical, Passenger Vehicle, and Hi-Tech manufacturing environments&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;17rn4sn&quot; data-start=&quot;2099&quot; data-end=&quot;2177&quot;&gt;Exposure to Industry 4.0, Smart Manufacturing, and Shop-floor Digitalization&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1hdbsdb&quot; data-start=&quot;2178&quot; data-end=&quot;2261&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with SAP, PLM, automation, and enterprise integration systems&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('a813270f-2f76-4f21-add3-1fe87293f009','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Werum PAS-X MES','werum-pas-x-mes-206-206','&amp;middot; Strong expertise in Werum PAS-X MES implementation, configuration, and support.&lt;br /&gt;&amp;middot; Knowledge of pharmaceutical manufacturing processes and regulatory compliance (GMP, GAMP 5, CFR Part 11).&lt;br /&gt;&amp;middot; Experience integrating MES with ERP (SAP), L2/L3 automation systems, and serialization platforms. &lt;br /&gt;&amp;middot; Recipe management, electronic batch records (EBR), and shop-floor automation. &lt;br /&gt;&amp;middot; Understanding of data integrity principles and validation processes. &lt;br /&gt;&amp;middot; Stong experience in Architecture, design and consulting. &lt;br /&gt;&amp;middot; Thorough knowledge of MES Application, Interfaces, Associated Systems and Master Data&lt;br /&gt;&amp;middot; Capable of supporting the proposed MBRs.&lt;br /&gt;&amp;middot; Changes to MES Application, Interfaces, other Applications and Master Data may be recommended&lt;br /&gt;&amp;middot; Knowledge of infrastructure to support MBR design requirements to be validated with K&amp;ouml;rber and Supplier.','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'INR',1,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-05-04 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-03-05 23:47:12.000000','2026-03-05 23:47:12.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"ERP\", \"GAMP5\", \"SAP\", \"Werum PAS-X V3.1.8\", \"Werum PAS-X\", \"GMP\", \"MBRs\", \"EBR\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;Competitive salary package with performance-based incentives&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;65&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;67&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;Health insurance coverage and statutory benefits (PF &amp;amp; Gratuity)&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;134&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;136&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on large-scale enterprise energy management projects&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;211&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;213&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;Strong career growth and learning opportunities&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;263&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;265&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;Collaborative and professional work environment&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('a82aab52-1b61-4fdc-9209-231527c373c5','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Senior Full Stack Developer','senior-full-stack-developer-163-163','&lt;p data-start=&quot;156&quot; data-end=&quot;769&quot;&gt;We are looking for an experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;190&quot; data-end=&quot;221&quot;&gt;Senior Full Stack Developer&lt;/strong&gt; to join our dynamic development team. The ideal candidate will be responsible for designing, developing, testing, and maintaining scalable web applications across frontend, backend, and middle-tier layers. You will work extensively on &lt;strong data-start=&quot;457&quot; data-end=&quot;519&quot;&gt;React.js, Node.js, CaaS technologies, and API integrations&lt;/strong&gt;, while supporting enterprise-grade applications like &lt;strong data-start=&quot;573&quot; data-end=&quot;602&quot;&gt;SiGAC, Tririga, and ICHEM&lt;/strong&gt;. The role also requires strong troubleshooting skills, hands-on experience in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;681&quot; data-end=&quot;700&quot;&gt;CI/CD pipelines&lt;/strong&gt;, and working on &lt;strong data-start=&quot;717&quot; data-end=&quot;740&quot;&gt;integration testing&lt;/strong&gt; in a production environment.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;771&quot; data-end=&quot;960&quot;&gt;You will collaborate closely with cross-functional teams, understand complex business processes, and contribute to system integrations while ensuring smooth deployment and high performance.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;hr data-start=&quot;962&quot; data-end=&quot;965&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;967&quot; data-end=&quot;994&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Key Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;995&quot; data-end=&quot;1588&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;995&quot; data-end=&quot;1073&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;997&quot; data-end=&quot;1073&quot;&gt;Full Stack development across &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1027&quot; data-end=&quot;1071&quot;&gt;frontend, backend, and middleware layers&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1074&quot; data-end=&quot;1135&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1076&quot; data-end=&quot;1135&quot;&gt;Perform &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1084&quot; data-end=&quot;1133&quot;&gt;testing, CI/CD execution, and troubleshooting&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1136&quot; data-end=&quot;1221&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1138&quot; data-end=&quot;1221&quot;&gt;Support development and sustainment of &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1177&quot; data-end=&quot;1219&quot;&gt;SiGAC, Tririga, and ICHEM applications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1222&quot; data-end=&quot;1303&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1224&quot; data-end=&quot;1303&quot;&gt;Execute &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1232&quot; data-end=&quot;1258&quot;&gt;integration test cases&lt;/strong&gt;, identify defects, and fix issues promptly&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1304&quot; data-end=&quot;1359&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1306&quot; data-end=&quot;1359&quot;&gt;Work on &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1314&quot; data-end=&quot;1357&quot;&gt;API development and APIGEE integrations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1360&quot; data-end=&quot;1452&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1362&quot; data-end=&quot;1452&quot;&gt;Gain understanding of &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1384&quot; data-end=&quot;1450&quot;&gt;third-party tools, business workflows, and system integrations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1453&quot; data-end=&quot;1514&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1455&quot; data-end=&quot;1514&quot;&gt;Apply strong &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1468&quot; data-end=&quot;1512&quot;&gt;analytical and production support skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1515&quot; data-end=&quot;1588&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1517&quot; data-end=&quot;1588&quot;&gt;Maintain clear &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1532&quot; data-end=&quot;1568&quot;&gt;verbal and written communication&lt;/strong&gt; with stakeholders&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Full-time','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-02-06 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-12-08 15:58:48.000000','2025-12-08 15:58:48.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"API Integration\", \"AWS\", \"Docker\", \"Integration\", \"JavaScript\", \"Kubernetes\", \"Node.JS\", \"Oracle\", \"PL/SQL\", \"React JS\", \"RESTFUL\", \"Typescript\", \"CI/CD\", \"Azure Cloud Ecosystem\", \"CaaS\", \"APIGEE\", \"SiGAC\", \"Tririga\", \"ICHEM\"]','[\"&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2251&quot; data-end=&quot;2630&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2251&quot; data-end=&quot;2281&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2253&quot; data-end=&quot;2281&quot;&gt;Competitive salary package&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2282&quot; data-end=&quot;2352&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2284&quot; data-end=&quot;2352&quot;&gt;Exposure to &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2296&quot; data-end=&quot;2350&quot;&gt;enterprise-level applications &amp;amp; cloud technologies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2353&quot; data-end=&quot;2433&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2355&quot; data-end=&quot;2433&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2378&quot; data-end=&quot;2431&quot;&gt;modern Full Stack &amp;amp; container-based architectures&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2434&quot; data-end=&quot;2494&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2436&quot; data-end=&quot;2494&quot;&gt;Career growth with advanced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2464&quot; data-end=&quot;2492&quot;&gt;DevOps &amp;amp; CI/CD practices&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2495&quot; data-end=&quot;2547&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2497&quot; data-end=&quot;2547&quot;&gt;Professional learning &amp;amp; upskilling opportunities&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2548&quot; data-end=&quot;2589&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2550&quot; data-end=&quot;2589&quot;&gt;Work with experienced technical teams&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2590&quot; data-end=&quot;2630&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2592&quot; data-end=&quot;2630&quot;&gt;Stable long-term project environment&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('a84d8bf8-1dfc-4d98-af21-27562fc67c6a','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','.NET Full Stack Developer','net-full-stack-developer-309-309','&lt;p data-start=&quot;106&quot; data-end=&quot;461&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced .NET Full Stack Developers for a leading Top MNC to work on enterprise-scale application development and digital transformation initiatives. We are looking for Associate Software Engineers and Senior Software Engineers with strong expertise in Microsoft technologies, cloud platforms, and modern full-stack development practices.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;463&quot; data-end=&quot;824&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for designing, developing, enhancing, and maintaining scalable enterprise applications using .NET technologies. The role includes developing responsive front-end applications, building secure REST APIs and microservices, optimizing database performance, and delivering high-quality software solutions using Agile methodologies.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;826&quot; data-end=&quot;1245&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with .NET Core, .NET Framework, C#, SQL Server, RESTful APIs, and Microservices architecture. Experience with modern frontend technologies such as Angular, React, or Flutter, along with Azure Cloud services, is highly preferred. Senior professionals will also be expected to provide technical leadership, mentor development teams, and contribute to architectural decisions.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1247&quot; data-end=&quot;1580&quot;&gt;The role also involves collaborating with product owners, business analysts, QA teams, and DevOps engineers to deliver enterprise-grade solutions, improve application performance, and drive cloud adoption and engineering best practices. Candidates should possess strong analytical thinking, communication, and problem-solving skills.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-08-24 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-06-26 03:23:02.000000','2026-06-26 03:23:02.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\".NET CORE\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1596&quot; data-end=&quot;1634&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1cw906g&quot; data-start=&quot;1635&quot; data-end=&quot;1699&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale Full Stack Development projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;15wexvs&quot; data-start=&quot;1700&quot; data-end=&quot;1762&quot;&gt;Work on modern .NET, Cloud, and Microservices technologies&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;vzw4cu&quot; data-start=&quot;1763&quot; data-end=&quot;1824&quot;&gt;Career growth in Software Engineering &amp;amp; Cloud Development&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1a77kja&quot; data-start=&quot;1825&quot; data-end=&quot;1885&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global engineering teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot; data-start=&quot;1886&quot; data-end=&quot;1941&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;1942&quot; data-end=&quot;1985&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('a8f9ee76-6ffe-4bd7-ae81-7f6d56079dd3','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Senior QA Engineer (TOSCA)','senior-qa-engineer-tosca-293-293','&lt;p data-start=&quot;68&quot; data-end=&quot;359&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced Senior QA Engineers with strong expertise in Tricentis TOSCA for a leading Top MNC. The ideal candidate should have hands-on experience in test automation, CI/CD integration, quality assurance processes, and enterprise application testing across multiple platforms.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;361&quot; data-end=&quot;676&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for designing, developing, executing, and maintaining automated test scripts using Tricentis TOSCA. The role includes performing functional, integration, regression, and performance testing while ensuring application quality, reliability, and compliance with business requirements.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;678&quot; data-end=&quot;997&quot;&gt;Professionals should have strong experience integrating TOSCA with Jenkins and CI/CD pipelines, building automation frameworks using BDD/TDD methodologies, and automating Web, Desktop, Mobile, and API testing. Strong knowledge of SQL, database testing, JIRA, HP ALM, and Agile development practices is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;999&quot; data-end=&quot;1367&quot;&gt;The role also involves monitoring test execution, analyzing automation failures, improving framework stability, creating manual test cases for new features, and collaborating with developers, QA leads, and stakeholders to ensure high-quality software delivery. Candidates should possess excellent analytical, troubleshooting, communication, and problem-solving skills.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-08-22 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-06-24 02:24:07.000000','2026-06-24 02:24:07.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Automation Testing\", \"Jenkins\", \"Manual Functional Testing\", \"API testing\", \"Cucumber(BDD)\", \"CI/CD\", \"Visual Regression Testing\", \"Tricentis TOSCA\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1383&quot; data-end=&quot;1421&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;4rcl1r&quot; data-start=&quot;1422&quot; data-end=&quot;1482&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale automation testing projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;125o968&quot; data-start=&quot;1483&quot; data-end=&quot;1540&quot;&gt;Work on advanced QA automation and CI/CD technologies&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1qm0vqv&quot; data-start=&quot;1541&quot; data-end=&quot;1607&quot;&gt;Career growth in Software Testing &amp;amp; Quality Engineering domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;iz6fk7&quot; data-start=&quot;1608&quot; data-end=&quot;1675&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global development and QA teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot; data-start=&quot;1676&quot; data-end=&quot;1731&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;1732&quot; data-end=&quot;1775&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('a9bcc35a-2f77-48cc-a590-922142bfcc75','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','MES Engineer – Application Support','mes-engineer-application-support-294-294','&lt;p data-start=&quot;76&quot; data-end=&quot;427&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced MES Engineers &amp;ndash; Application Support for a leading Top MNC to support enterprise Manufacturing Execution System (MES) applications in pharmaceutical manufacturing environments. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in MES application support, troubleshooting, incident management, and production support activities.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;429&quot; data-end=&quot;802&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for providing L2 application support, monitoring MES systems, troubleshooting application issues, and ensuring uninterrupted manufacturing operations. The role includes managing incidents, resolving service requests, performing root cause analysis, and coordinating with cross-functional teams to maintain system stability and performance.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;804&quot; data-end=&quot;1103&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with MES platforms, preferably Rockwell PharmaSuite, along with strong SQL and database query skills. Experience with ServiceNow (SNOW), application maintenance, production support processes, and pharmaceutical manufacturing systems is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1105&quot; data-end=&quot;1446&quot;&gt;The role also involves supporting system enhancements, managing user issues, maintaining support documentation, and ensuring compliance with operational and quality standards. Candidates should possess strong analytical, communication, troubleshooting, and problem-solving skills with the ability to work in a fast-paced support environment.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-08-22 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-06-24 02:27:45.000000','2026-06-24 02:27:45.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Mes\", \"ServiceNow\", \"SQL\", \"Pharma\", \"Rockwell FTPS\", \"L2/L3 Support\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1462&quot; data-end=&quot;1500&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;6jypnz&quot; data-start=&quot;1501&quot; data-end=&quot;1559&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise pharmaceutical MES environments&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;qofhfs&quot; data-start=&quot;1560&quot; data-end=&quot;1618&quot;&gt;Work on advanced Manufacturing Execution Systems (MES)&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1t0cbpi&quot; data-start=&quot;1619&quot; data-end=&quot;1681&quot;&gt;Career growth in MES &amp;amp; Pharmaceutical Manufacturing domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1l8m4sm&quot; data-start=&quot;1682&quot; data-end=&quot;1724&quot;&gt;Long-term stable project opportunities&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;45fk39&quot; data-start=&quot;1725&quot; data-end=&quot;1780&quot;&gt;Professional and technology-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;1781&quot; data-end=&quot;1824&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('aa2b80f4-9e99-4345-97f6-d95d4db6cef3','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Azure Engineer – Systems Monitoring','azure-engineer-systems-monitoring-72-72','&lt;p data-start=&quot;310&quot; data-end=&quot;531&quot;&gt;Are you passionate about monitoring and automation in the Azure ecosystem? We&amp;rsquo;re looking for an &lt;strong data-start=&quot;406&quot; data-end=&quot;445&quot;&gt;Azure Engineer (Systems Monitoring)&lt;/strong&gt; to design and maintain scalable monitoring solutions across our cloud infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;hr data-start=&quot;533&quot; data-end=&quot;536&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;538&quot; data-end=&quot;567&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;542&quot; data-end=&quot;567&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;568&quot; data-end=&quot;1226&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;568&quot; data-end=&quot;687&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;570&quot; data-end=&quot;687&quot;&gt;Design, configure, and maintain &lt;strong data-start=&quot;602&quot; data-end=&quot;619&quot;&gt;Azure Monitor&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong data-start=&quot;621&quot; data-end=&quot;638&quot;&gt;Log Analytics&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong data-start=&quot;640&quot; data-end=&quot;650&quot;&gt;alerts&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong data-start=&quot;652&quot; data-end=&quot;666&quot;&gt;dashboards&lt;/strong&gt;, and &lt;strong data-start=&quot;672&quot; data-end=&quot;685&quot;&gt;workbooks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;688&quot; data-end=&quot;781&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;690&quot; data-end=&quot;781&quot;&gt;Leverage &lt;strong data-start=&quot;699&quot; data-end=&quot;729&quot;&gt;Kusto Query Language (KQL)&lt;/strong&gt; or &lt;strong data-start=&quot;733&quot; data-end=&quot;743&quot;&gt;Python&lt;/strong&gt; for deep data analysis and querying&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;782&quot; data-end=&quot;870&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;784&quot; data-end=&quot;870&quot;&gt;Use &lt;strong data-start=&quot;788&quot; data-end=&quot;807&quot;&gt;Azure Functions&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong data-start=&quot;812&quot; data-end=&quot;826&quot;&gt;PowerShell&lt;/strong&gt; for automation and operational efficiency&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;871&quot; data-end=&quot;954&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;873&quot; data-end=&quot;954&quot;&gt;Implement &lt;strong data-start=&quot;883&quot; data-end=&quot;909&quot;&gt;infrastructure as code&lt;/strong&gt; using &lt;strong data-start=&quot;916&quot; data-end=&quot;929&quot;&gt;Terraform&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong data-start=&quot;931&quot; data-end=&quot;938&quot;&gt;ARM&lt;/strong&gt;, or &lt;strong data-start=&quot;943&quot; data-end=&quot;952&quot;&gt;Bicep&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;955&quot; data-end=&quot;1022&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;957&quot; data-end=&quot;1022&quot;&gt;Build and maintain &lt;strong data-start=&quot;976&quot; data-end=&quot;996&quot;&gt;DevOps pipelines&lt;/strong&gt; using &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1003&quot; data-end=&quot;1020&quot;&gt;GitHub/GitLab&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1023&quot; data-end=&quot;1128&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1025&quot; data-end=&quot;1128&quot;&gt;Monitor infrastructure, manage escalations, and ensure timely resolution to maintain system stability&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1129&quot; data-end=&quot;1226&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1131&quot; data-end=&quot;1226&quot;&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional teams to improve monitoring practices and incident response&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;hr data-start=&quot;1228&quot; data-end=&quot;1231&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;1233&quot; data-end=&quot;1258&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1237&quot; data-end=&quot;1258&quot;&gt;Must-Have Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1259&quot; data-end=&quot;1751&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1259&quot; data-end=&quot;1342&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1261&quot; data-end=&quot;1342&quot;&gt;Strong experience with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1284&quot; data-end=&quot;1301&quot;&gt;Azure Monitor&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1303&quot; data-end=&quot;1320&quot;&gt;Log Analytics&lt;/strong&gt;, and alerting tools&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1343&quot; data-end=&quot;1422&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1345&quot; data-end=&quot;1422&quot;&gt;Hands-on knowledge of &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1367&quot; data-end=&quot;1374&quot;&gt;KQL&lt;/strong&gt; or &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1378&quot; data-end=&quot;1388&quot;&gt;Python&lt;/strong&gt; for data querying and scripting&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1423&quot; data-end=&quot;1515&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1425&quot; data-end=&quot;1515&quot;&gt;Experience with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1441&quot; data-end=&quot;1460&quot;&gt;Azure Functions&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1462&quot; data-end=&quot;1486&quot;&gt;PowerShell scripting&lt;/strong&gt;, and automation techniques&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1516&quot; data-end=&quot;1581&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1518&quot; data-end=&quot;1581&quot;&gt;Familiarity with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1535&quot; data-end=&quot;1548&quot;&gt;Terraform&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1550&quot; data-end=&quot;1557&quot;&gt;ARM&lt;/strong&gt;, or &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1562&quot; data-end=&quot;1571&quot;&gt;Bicep&lt;/strong&gt; for IaC&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1582&quot; data-end=&quot;1653&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1584&quot; data-end=&quot;1653&quot;&gt;Good understanding of &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1606&quot; data-end=&quot;1625&quot;&gt;CI/CD pipelines&lt;/strong&gt; with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1631&quot; data-end=&quot;1651&quot;&gt;GitHub or GitLab&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1654&quot; data-end=&quot;1751&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1656&quot; data-end=&quot;1751&quot;&gt;Solid background in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1676&quot; data-end=&quot;1705&quot;&gt;infrastructure monitoring&lt;/strong&gt;, troubleshooting, and escalation management&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;hr data-start=&quot;1753&quot; data-end=&quot;1756&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;1758&quot; data-end=&quot;1779&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1762&quot; data-end=&quot;1779&quot;&gt;Good-to-Have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1780&quot; data-end=&quot;1913&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1780&quot; data-end=&quot;1841&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1782&quot; data-end=&quot;1841&quot;&gt;Advanced IaC knowledge with tools like Terraform or Bicep&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1842&quot; data-end=&quot;1913&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1844&quot; data-end=&quot;1913&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-level monitoring architecture and frameworks&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',500000.00,2500000.00,'₹',0,'In