The ideal candidate will possess hands-on experience in developing end-to-end AI systems, working with vector stores, prompt engineering, agent-based architectures, and deploying solutions on cloud environments like AWS or Azure.&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div&gt;As a key contributor, you will design, build, and deploy Generative AI models using tools like LangChain, Bedrock, and SageMaker, while ensuring compliance with data governance and security best practices. You should be passionate about cutting-edge AI developments and eager to bring intelligent automation and innovation to real-world applications.&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience Required:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div&gt;8+ years of industry experience&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div&gt;Minimum 2+ years in Generative AI / NLP roles&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Must-Have Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div&gt;End-to-end development experience&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div&gt;NLP, Prompt Engineering, and Agent-Based Architecture&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div&gt;Vector Store implementation&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div&gt;Python programming and frameworks: LangChain, Flask, FastAPI, Django&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div&gt;AWS &amp;amp; Azure cloud platforms&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div&gt;AWS services: S3, Lambda, Glue, Bedrock, SageMaker, Kendra, DynamoDB, DocumentDB&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div&gt;SQL and NoSQL database knowledge&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div&gt;Writing parsers for unstructured data (e.g., using AWS Textract)&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div&gt;Experience with CI/CD and DevOps tools&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div&gt;Service-oriented architecture understanding&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice-to-Have Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div&gt;Experience in LLM fine-tuning&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div&gt;Exposure to Generative AI Guardrails&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div&gt;Knowledge of data governance and AI security best practices&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div&gt;Experience building agent frameworks&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div&gt;Familiarity with large-scale deployments and microservices&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-09-30 06:00:00',0,0,'2025-07-29 10:45:12.000000','2026-05-06 20:51:53.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"AWS\", \"Django\", \"Flask\", \"Python\", \"CI/CD\", \"Generative AI\", \"Prompt Engineering\", \"NLP\", \"LangChain\", \"Vector Store\", \"SageMaker\", \"Bedrock\", \"FastAPI\", \"LLM Fine-tuning\"]','[\"&lt;div&gt;Work with top-tier global clients (e.g., TCS)&lt;/div&gt;\\r\\n&lt;div&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;\\r\\n&lt;div&gt;Competitive salary and performance-based bonuses&lt;/div&gt;\\r\\n&lt;div&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;\\r\\n&lt;div&gt;Remote flexibility / PAN India roles&lt;/div&gt;\\r\\n&lt;div&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;\\r\\n&lt;div&gt;Access to cutting-edge Generative AI projects and tools&lt;/div&gt;\\r\\n&lt;div&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;\\r\\n&lt;div&gt;Continuous learning &amp;amp; upskilling opportunities&lt;/div&gt;\\r\\n&lt;div&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;\\r\\n&lt;div&gt;Collaborative, innovative work culture&lt;/div&gt;\\r\\n&lt;div&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;\\r\\n&lt;div&gt;Health insurance and wellness benefits&lt;/div&gt;\\r\\n&lt;div&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;\\r\\n&lt;div&gt;Career growth in high-demand AI/ML technologies&lt;/div&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('aaabad22-46ca-4838-b990-55d0ecfb29ec','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Oracle BRM Developer','oracle-brm-developer-95-95','We are looking for an experienced Oracle BRM Developer with expertise in BRM, ECE, and Pricing Design Center (PDC). The ideal candidate will have 5+ years of experience in telecom billing systems and will be responsible for developing, customizing, and delivering high-quality Oracle BRM/ECE solutions in a remote setup.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;br /&gt;- Develop and customi