lt;strong data-start=&quot;992&quot; data-end=&quot;1005&quot;&gt;.NET Core&lt;/strong&gt; development skills&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1027&quot; data-end=&quot;1074&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1029&quot; data-end=&quot;1074&quot;&gt;Familiarity with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1046&quot; data-end=&quot;1074&quot;&gt;Git/code control systems&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1076&quot; data-end=&quot;1104&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1080&quot; data-end=&quot;1104&quot;&gt;Good-to-Have Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1105&quot; data-end=&quot;1302&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1105&quot; data-end=&quot;1136&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1107&quot; data-end=&quot;1136&quot;&gt;Experience with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1123&quot; data-end=&quot;1134&quot;&gt;Angular&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1137&quot; data-end=&quot;1163&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1139&quot; data-end=&quot;1163&quot;&gt;Knowledge of &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1152&quot; data-end=&quot;1161&quot;&gt;EFLOW&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1164&quot; data-end=&quot;1219&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1166&quot; data-end=&quot;1219&quot;&gt;Understanding of &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1183&quot; data-end=&quot;1217&quot;&gt;serial/communication protocols&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1220&quot; data-end=&quot;1254&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1222&quot; data-end=&quot;1254&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1222&quot; data-end=&quot;1241&quot;&gt;Shell scripting&lt;/strong&gt; experience&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1255&quot; data-end=&quot;1302&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1257&quot; data-end=&quot;1302&quot;&gt;Drive to continuously improve dev processes&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',500000.00,2500000.00,'₹',0,'India','Pune',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2025-07-05 18:30:00',0,0,'2025-05-07 11:48:00.000000','2025-05-09 11:26:49.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\".NET CORE\", \"Angular\", \"Azure\", \"Git\", \"IOT\", \"Shell Scripts\"]','[\"&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;73&quot; data-end=&quot;90&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;73&quot; data-end=&quot;90&quot;&gt;Job Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;91&quot; data-end=&quot;351&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;91&quot; data-end=&quot;113&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;93&quot; data-end=&quot;113&quot;&gt;Competitive salary&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;114&quot; data-end=&quot;160&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;116&quot; data-end=&quot;160&quot;&gt;Health insurance (medical, dental, vision)&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;161&quot; data-end=&quot;191&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;163&quot; data-end=&quot;191&quot;&gt;Paid time off and holidays&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;192&quot; data-end=&quot;218&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;194&quot; data-end=&quot;218&quot;&gt;Flexible working hours&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;219&quot; data-end=&quot;245&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;221&quot; data-end=&quot;245&quot;&gt;Work-from-home options&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;246&quot; data-end=&quot;277&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;248&quot; data-end=&quot;277&quot;&gt;Career growth opportunities&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;278&quot; data-end=&quot;315&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;280&quot; data-end=&quot;315&quot;&gt;Employee training and development&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;316&quot; data-end=&quot;351&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;318&quot; data-end=&quot;351&quot;&gt;Bonuses and performance rewards&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Maharashtra'),('aaf8d9c4-5858-48e3-be2d-5eae0350b53b','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Omniverse Developer','omniverse-developer-267-267','&lt;p data-start=&quot;61&quot; data-end=&quot;397&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced Omniverse Developers for a leading Top MNC to work on next-generation smart manufacturing, robotics simulation, and digital twin solutions. The ideal candidate should have strong hands-on expertise in NVIDIA Omniverse, Isaac SIM, robotics simulation, Python development, and industrial automation technologies.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;399&quot; data-end=&quot;799&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for designing, developing, and implementing advanced simulation environments and digital twin applications for manufacturing and industrial use cases. The role involves working closely with cross-functional teams including developers, AI engineers, automation specialists, and designers to build scalable and innovative solutions using NVIDIA ecosystem technologies.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;801&quot; data-end=&quot;1147&quot;&gt;The selected professional will contribute to robotics simulation workflows, synthetic data generation, AI model training pipelines, and autonomous navigation systems for industrial automation. The role also requires integration of Omniverse solutions with cloud platforms such as Azure and AWS, along with IoT devices and enterprise applications.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1149&quot; data-end=&quot;1440&quot;&gt;Candidates should have experience in developing simulation-based applications for factory automation, AMR navigation, path planning, and AI-driven quality inspection systems. Knowledge of industrial digital twins, real-time visualization, and smart factory concepts will be highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1442&quot; data-end=&quot;1644&quot;&gt;The role demands strong analytical thinking, problem-solving abilities, and collaboration skills to deliver enterprise-grade solutions for global manufacturing and industrial transformation initiatives.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Pune',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-07-10 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-05-12 02:13:12.000000','2026-05-12 02:13:12.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"AWS\", \"Azure Cloud Networking\", \"Digital Twin Technology\", \"Python\", \"NVIDIA Omniverse\", \"Robotics Simulation\", \"Factory Automation\", \"Synthetic Data Generation\", \"cuOpt\", \"3D Workflows\", \"Omniverse Developer\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1660&quot; data-end=&quot;1698&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1gwlbf5&quot; data-start=&quot;1699&quot; data-end=&quot;1753&quot;&gt;Exposure to advanced NVIDIA Omniverse technologies&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;vxvnsj&quot; data-start=&quot;1754&quot; data-end=&quot;1811&quot;&gt;Work on real-world Digital Twin and Robotics projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;dyiqss&quot; data-start=&quot;1812&quot; data-end=&quot;1876&quot;&gt;Opportunity to contribute to Smart Manufacturing initiatives&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1gyo669&quot; data-start=&quot;1877&quot; data-end=&quot;1938&quot;&gt;Experience with AI-driven industrial automation solutions&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;17ef2vo&quot; data-start=&quot;1939&quot; data-end=&quot;1992&quot;&gt;Exposure to cloud-integrated simulation platforms&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1sway1z&quot; data-start=&quot;1993&quot; data-end=&quot;2050&quot;&gt;Collaborative and innovation-focused work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ppg6uo&quot; data-start=&quot;2051&quot; data-end=&quot;2104&quot;&gt;Career growth in AI, Robotics &amp;amp; Simulation domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;dwyt3s&quot; data-start=&quot;2105&quot; data-end=&quot;2157&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and enterprise-level projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Maharashtra'),('ab2a74fd-9031-4e9c-b51d-5b9cb2b9ddc4','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Digital Marketing Executive','digital-marketing-executive-135-135','Looking for a Digital Marketing Specialist with strong experience in SEO, SEM, Social Media Marketing, Google Ads, Analytics &amp;amp; Content Strategy. Role involves campaign management, optimization, reporting and cross-team collaboration.&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1971&quot; data-end=&quot;2043&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1973&quot; data-end=&quot;2043&quot;&gt;Bachelor&amp;rsquo;s degree in Marketing, Communications, IT, or related field&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2044&quot; data-end=&quot;2080&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2046&quot; data-end=&quot;2080&quot;&gt;1&amp;ndash;3 years of relevant experience&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2081&quot; data-end=&quot;2149&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2083&quot; data-end=&quot;2149&quot;&gt;Experience with Google Tools, Meta Ads Manager &amp;amp; Analytics tools&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Marketing','Contract','Entry',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Pune',0,0,NULL,'PUB