y best practices.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Roles &amp;amp; Responsibilities:&lt;br /&gt;- Design, configure, and implement Rockwell MES solutions to meet client requirements.&lt;br /&gt;- Manage project timelines, deliverables, and resources to ensure successful completion.&lt;br /&gt;- Work closely with clients to understand their manufacturing processes and provide tailored solutions.&lt;br /&gt;- Provide ongoing technical support and troubleshooting for MES systems.&lt;br /&gt;- Conduct training sessions for clients to ensure effective system use.','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',1,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-19 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-08-13 08:49:54.000000','2025-11-21 04:44:21.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Client Consultations\", \"Mes Implementation\", \"Problem Solving\", \"Project Management\", \"Rockwell Software\", \"Technical Support\"]','[\"- Competitive salary and performance-based incentives&lt;br /&gt;- Health and life insurance coverage&lt;br /&gt;- Professional training and certification programs&lt;br /&gt;- Opportunities for career growth and advancement&lt;br /&gt;- Collaborative and innovative work environment&lt;br /&gt;- Work with global clients and projects\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('ab3d6f14-23a1-4a47-9f78-fcfbb0a83c59','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Control System Engineer – DCS / Industrial Data Engineering','control-system-engineer-dcs-industrial-data-engineering-363-363','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;97&quot; data-end=&quot;300&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;123&quot; data-end=&quot;157&quot;&gt;Control System Engineers &amp;ndash; DCS&lt;/strong&gt; for a leading Top MNC to work on advanced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;200&quot; data-end=&quot;287&quot;&gt;Industrial Control Systems, OT/IT Data Integration, and Industrial Data Engineering&lt;/strong&gt; initiatives.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;302&quot; data-end=&quot;505&quot;&gt;The ideal candidate should have strong hands-on experience in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;364&quot; data-end=&quot;504&quot;&gt;DCS, Industrial Control Systems, AspenTech Inmation / Industrial Data Fabric, OPC DA/UA, industrial historians, and OT data connectivity&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;507&quot; data-end=&quot;845&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for designing, engineering, testing, commissioning, and supporting DCS and industrial data solutions. The role involves integrating operational technology data from plant systems into enterprise data platforms and developing scalable architectures across &lt;strong data-start=&quot;796&quot; data-end=&quot;844&quot;&gt;Level 3 / Level 4 manufacturing environments&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;847&quot; data-end=&quot;1106&quot;&gt;Professionals with experience in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;880&quot; data-end=&quot;997&quot;&gt;industrial data modeling, contextualization, metadata management, time-series data, and industrial data platforms&lt;/strong&gt; will be highly preferred. Experience in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1038&quot; data-end=&quot;1080&quot;&gt;Oil &amp;amp; Gas, E&amp;amp;P, Refining, or Chemicals&lt;/strong&gt; is particularly valuable.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-18 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-08-20 03:55:16.000000','2026-08-20 03:55:16.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Aspen HYSYS\", \"Data Integration\", \"Distributed Control Systems\", \"OPC UA\", \"Industrial Automation Systems\", \"FAT / SAT\", \"AspenTech Inmation\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1121&quot; data-end=&quot;1165&quot; data-section-id=&quot;i3mxm7&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a leading Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1166&quot; data-end=&quot;1253&quot; data-section-id=&quot;q2baty&quot;&gt;Exposure to large-scale &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1192&quot; data-end=&quot;1244&quot;&gt;Industrial Automation and Digital Transformation&lt;/strong&gt; projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1254&quot; data-end=&quot;1313&quot; data-section-id=&quot;3lrcy2&quot;&gt;Work with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1266&quot; data-end=&quot;1313&quot;&gt;AspenTech Inmation / Industrial Data Fabric&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1314&quot; data-end=&quot;1388&quot; data-section-id=&quot;bmc1wz&quot;&gt;Exposure to advanced OT/IT integration and industrial data architectures&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1389&quot; data-end=&quot;1467&quot; data-section-id=&quot;cgiy81&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with DCS, historians, OPC, and enterprise data platforms&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1468&quot; data-end=&quot;1534&quot; data-section-id=&quot;njmn7k&quot;&gt;Experience across &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1488&quot; data-end=&quot;1534&quot;&gt;Level 3 / Level 4 industrial architectures&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1535&quot; data-end=&quot;1596&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1p8gu54&quot;&gt;Exposure to Industrial IoT and data engineering initiatives&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1597&quot; data-end=&quot;1668&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1h8eke3&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global engineering and business teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1669&quot; data-end=&quot;1740&quot; data-section-id=&quot;g6ulmj&quot;&gt;Strong technical and domain growth in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1709&quot; data-end=&quot;1740&quot;&gt;Industrial Data Engineering&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1741&quot; data-end=&quot;1823&quot; data-section-id=&quot;74ufi7&quot;&gt;Career growth opportunities across Automation, OT, IT, and Digital Manufacturing&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('ab5d996e-3b27-4da0-b5b3-9e8797457544','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','LIMS Sample manager Technical SME','lims-sample-manager-technical-sme-209-209','&amp;middot; Manage and support instrument integrations with the LIMS system &lt;br /&gt;&amp;middot; Oversee LIMS upgrades, patches, and change management activities to ensure system stability &lt;br /&gt;&amp;middot; Provide L2/L3 support for troubleshooting and resolving complex issues within SampleManager LIMS&lt;br /&gt;&amp;middot; Configure and maintain LIMS master data, including products, sampling plans, specifications, and methods &lt;br /&gt;&amp;middot; Troubleshoot application errors, user access issues, and data discrepancies, ensuring minimal system downtime&lt;br /&gt;&amp;middot; Ensure that LIMS documentation is up to date (SOPs, user guides, system configuration)','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'INR',1,'India','Pune',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-05-04 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-03-05 23:59:00.000000','2026-03-05 23:59:00.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"AWS\", \"Lims\", \"MS SQL Server\", \"SOP Development\", \"ITIL framework\", \"L2/L3 Support\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;Competitive salary package with performance-based incentives&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;65&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;67&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;Health insurance coverage and statutory benefits (PF &amp;amp; Gratuity)&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;134&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;136&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on large-scale enterprise energy management projects&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;211&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;213&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;Strong career growth and learning opportunities&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;263&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;265&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;Collaborative and professional work environment&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Maharashtra'),('ab5eb204-38c0-43e9-a86f-a1e2c3774e6f','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Business Development Executive – IT Staffing','business-development-executive-it-staffing-90-90','&lt;div data-ogsc=&quot;black&quot; data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;We are seeking a dynamic and results-driven Business Development Executive to join our IT staffing team in Pune. The ideal candidate will have 2&amp;ndash;4 years of experience in business development or client acquisition within the recruitment or staffing industry.&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div data-ogsc=&quot;black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-ogsc=&quot;&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-ogsc=&quot;black&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div role=&quot;presentation&quot; data-ogsc=&quot;&quot;&gt;Identify and acquire new clients for IT staffing services across various domains.&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-ogsc=&quot;black&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div role=&quot;presentation&quot; data-ogsc=&quot;&quot;&gt;Build and maintain strong relationships with decision-makers (HR, Procurement, Delivery Heads).&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-ogsc=&quot;black&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div role=&quot;presentation&quot; data-ogsc=&quot;&quot;&gt;Understand client requirements and collaborate with the recruitment team to deliver suitable profiles.&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-ogsc=&quot;black&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div role=&quot;presentation&quot; data-ogsc=&quot;&quot;&gt;Generate leads through cold calling, networking, and market research.&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-ogsc=&quot;black&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div role=&quot;presentation&quot; data-ogsc=&quot;&quot;&gt;Prepare proposals, negotiate terms, and close deals to meet revenue targets.&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-ogsc=&quot;black&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div role=&quot;presentation&quot; data-ogsc=&quot;&quot;&gt;Track market trends and competitor activities to identify growth opportunities.&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-ogsc=&quot;black&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div role=&quot;presentation&quot; data-ogsc=&quot;&quot;&gt;Maintain CRM and provide regular sales reports to management.&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;div data-ogsc=&quot;black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-ogsc=&quot;&quot;&gt;Key Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-ogsc=&quot;black&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div role=&quot;presentation&quot; data-ogsc=&quot;&quot;&gt;Strong communication and negotiation skills&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-ogsc=&quot;black&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div role=&quot;presentation&quot; data-ogsc=&quot;&quot;&gt;Proven ability to generate leads and close deals&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-ogsc=&quot;black&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div role=&quot;presentation&quot; data-ogsc=&quot;&quot;&gt;Understanding of IT roles and recruitment lifecycle&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-ogsc=&quot;black&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div role=&quot;presentation&quot; data-ogsc=&quot;&quot;&gt;Client relationship management&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-ogsc=&quot;black&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div role=&quot;presentation&quot; data-ogsc=&quot;&quot;&gt;Self-motivated and target-oriented&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',1,'India','Pune',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-19 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-08-18 14:52:04.000000','2025-11-21 00:43:30.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Client Relationship Management\", \"Cold Calling\", \"CRM\", \"HR\", \"Lead Generation\", \"Market Research\", \"Negotiation Skills\", \"Networking\", \"Procurement\", \"Staffing\", \"Strong Communication Skills.\"]','[\"Competitive Salary + Performance-Based Incentives\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Maharashtra'),('abaf4760-d945-4b84-986a-05f0177c63bb','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Real Estate Sales Executive','real-estate-sales-executive-18-18','Job Description: We are seeking a dynamic and results-driven Real Estate Sales Executive to join our team. The ideal candidate will be responsible for assisting clients in buying, selling, and renting properties while ensuring a seamless experience throughout the transaction process. Key Responsibilities: Identify and pursue new sales opportunities through networking, referrals, and cold calling. Showcase properties to potential buyers and guide them through the buying process. Negotiate terms and conditions on behalf of clients. Conduct market research to identify property trends and pricing. Manage property listings, maintain accurate records, and update CRM databases. Build and maintain strong client relationships. Ensure compliance with all legal and regulatory real estate requirements. Key Skills: Proven experience in real estate sales or a similar role. Strong negotiation and communication skills. Knowledge of local real estate market trends. Ability to manage multiple clients and properties simultaneously. Proficiency in CRM software and MS Office. Excellent presentation and interpersonal skills.','Sales','Contract','Mid',250000.00,300000.00,'₹',1,'India','Pune',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2025-07-03 18:30:00',0,0,'2025-05-05 02:45:41.000000','2025-05-05 02:45:41.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Accessories Knowledge\", \"Adaptability\", \"Air Transportation\", \"Amusement Park\", \"Arcade\", \"Body Cameras\", \"Consumer Applications\", \"Consumer Behavior\", \"Consumer Behavior Analysis\", \"Data Entry Operator\", \"Diagnosis\", \"EHS Compilance\", \"Regulatory\"]','[\"Job Benefits: Competitive Salary + Commission: Attractive compensation with performance-based incentives. Flexible Work Hours: Options for remote work or flexible scheduling. Professional Development: Training programs and certifications to enhance skills. Health Insurance: Comprehensive health and wellness coverage. Travel Allowance: Reimbursement for client visits and site inspections. Career Growth Opportunities: Clear career progression path with promotion prospects. Employee Discounts: Special rates on property purchases and rentals.\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Maharashtra'),('abcc7d0b-eae4-4fe2-a2d0-a9e2c02b5236','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','PLC Engineer','plc-engineer-328-328','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;54&quot; data-end=&quot;374&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced PLC Engineers for a leading Top MNC to work on advanced Industrial Automation, Control Systems, and Drilling Rig Automation projects. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in PLC programming, SCADA systems, HMI development, industrial networking, and automation system commissioning.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;376&quot; data-end=&quot;781&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for designing, developing, testing, implementing, and supporting PLC-based automation solutions for drilling rigs and industrial control systems. The role includes PLC programming, SCADA and HMI development, control system integration, troubleshooting, commissioning, and ensuring reliable operation of automation systems across manufacturing and industrial environments.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;783&quot; data-end=&quot;1228&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with Allen-Bradley PLCs (preferred), Siemens PLCs, SCADA systems, HMI development, Variable Frequency Drives (ABB &amp;amp; GE Converteam), industrial PCs, servers, industrial communication protocols, and industrial networking. Strong understanding of control system design, Factory Acceptance Testing (FAT), Site Acceptance Testing (SAT), commissioning, and industrial safety standards is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1230&quot; data-end=&quot;1667&quot;&gt;The role also involves collaborating with engineering, operations, and field service teams, preparing technical documentation, supporting customer acceptance testing, mentoring junior engineers, and providing onsite support at domestic and international project locations. Candidates should possess strong analytical, communication, troubleshooting, and problem-solving skills with the ability to work in dynamic industrial environments.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-09-05 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-07-08 02:50:37.000000','2026-07-08 02:50:37.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Industrial Automation\", \"PLC Programming\", \"SCADA Systems\", \"Siemens\", \"Integration Testing\", \"Allen-Bradley\", \"FAT / SAT\", \"HMI Development\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1683&quot; data-end=&quot;1721&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;fvlnx3&quot; data-start=&quot;1722&quot; data-end=&quot;1804&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale Industrial Automation and Control System projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;nxnoru&quot; data-start=&quot;1805&quot; data-end=&quot;1878&quot;&gt;Work on advanced PLC, SCADA, and Drilling Rig Automation technologies&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1o99mak&quot; data-start=&quot;1879&quot; data-end=&quot;1950&quot;&gt;Career growth in Industrial Automation &amp;amp; Control Engineering domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;13q8xbv&quot; data-start=&quot;1951&quot; data-end=&quot;2026&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global engineering and operations teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;x0g28h&quot; data-start=&quot;2027&quot; data-end=&quot;2074&quot;&gt;Domestic and international project exposure&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot; data-start=&quot;2075&quot; data-end=&quot;2130&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;2131&quot; data-end=&quot;2174&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('abe805e5-98eb-44c4-b5af-fdc79a7593e2','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Data Analyst','data-analyst-241-241','What you&amp;rsquo;ll be doing:&lt;br /&gt;Working with raw data and transforming it into actionable insights&lt;br /&gt;Writing efficient SQL queries for data extraction and analysis&lt;br /&gt;Creating dashboards and reports for internal teams&lt;br /&gt;Identifying trends, patterns, and anomalies in datasets&lt;br /&gt;Collaborating with business and tech teams to improve decision-making&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;What we&amp;rsquo;re looking for:&lt;br /&gt;0&amp;ndash;2 years of experience (freshers with strong skills can apply)&lt;br /&gt;Good knowledge of SQL, Excel, and data analysis concepts&lt;br /&gt;Basic understanding of tools like Power BI, Tableau, or similar&lt;br /&gt;Strong analytical thinking and problem-solving mindset','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'INR',1,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-06-02 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-04-03 20:55:33.000000','2026-04-03 20:55:33.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Azure SQL Database\", \"Data Analyst\", \"Data Analytics\", \"Data Center Automation\", \"Data Collection\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;Competitive salary package with performance-based incentives&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;65&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;67&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;Health insurance coverage and statutory benefits (PF &amp;amp; Gratuity)&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;134&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;136&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on large-scale enterprise energy management projects&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;211&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;213&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;Strong career growth and learning opportunities&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;263&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;265&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;Collaborative and professional work environment&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('ac3012a1-9ab1-40f0-9fc1-0b96a7571ed7','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','CM MES Modeler / Functional Consultant','cm-mes-modeler-functional-consultant-334-334','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;80&quot; data-end=&quot;447&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced CM MES Modelers / Functional Consultants for a leading Top MNC to work on enterprise-scale Manufacturing Execution System (MES) and Smart Manufacturing transformation projects. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in Critical Manufacturing (CM) MES, MES implementation, master data modeling, and manufacturing business processes.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;449&quot; data-end=&quot;891&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for implementing, configuring, modeling, testing, and supporting Critical Manufacturing MES solutions for global manufacturing organizations. The role includes gathering business requirements, performing master data modeling and enrichment, configuring MES applications, preparing technical documentation, conducting system testing, and ensuring successful solution delivery throughout the project lifecycle.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;893&quot; data-end=&quot;1275&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with Critical Manufacturing (CM) MES, MES implementation, CM MES modeling, master data management, manufacturing process analysis, application configuration, testing, and documentation. Strong understanding of manufacturing operations, MES deployment methodologies, customer collaboration, and functional consulting is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1277&quot; data-end=&quot;1770&quot;&gt;The role also involves collaborating with global business users, SMEs, customer stakeholders, and cross-functional project teams to design and deliver scalable MES solutions. Candidates will conduct product demonstrations, support end users during implementation, troubleshoot functional issues, prepare process flow documentation, and contribute to continuous process improvement initiatives. Strong analytical, communication, stakeholder management, and problem-solving skills are essential.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-09-11 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-07-14 02:39:14.000000','2026-07-14 02:39:14.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Functional Consultant\", \"Mes\", \"System Design\", \"User Acceptance Testing (UAT)\", \"Critical Manufacturing\", \"CM MES Modeling\", \"Master Data Modeling\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1786&quot; data-end=&quot;1824&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1e3dqkd&quot; data-start=&quot;1825&quot; data-end=&quot;1911&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale MES and Digital Manufacturing transformation projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1q5szfu&quot; data-start=&quot;1912&quot; data-end=&quot;1979&quot;&gt;Work with advanced Critical Manufacturing (CM) MES technologies&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1pswt5&quot; data-start=&quot;1980&quot; data-end=&quot;2062&quot;&gt;Career growth in Manufacturing Execution Systems (MES) and Industry 4.0 domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;13qji02&quot; data-start=&quot;2063&quot; data-end=&quot;2140&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global manufacturing and technology teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot; data-start=&quot;2141&quot; data-end=&quot;2196&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;2197&quot; data-end=&quot;2240&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('acfaab0f-7154-4ad0-be2e-d7daabe224eb','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Scitara LIMS Support Analyst','scitara-lims-support-analyst-372-372','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;66&quot; data-end=&quot;449&quot;&gt;We are looking for an experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;100&quot; data-end=&quot;132&quot;&gt;Scitara LIMS Support Analyst&lt;/strong&gt; to support enterprise-level &lt;strong data-start=&quot;161&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;Laboratory Informatics and Digital Laboratory&lt;/strong&gt; environments. The ideal candidate should have hands-on experience with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;282&quot; data-end=&quot;320&quot;&gt;Scitara Digital Lab Exchange (DLX)&lt;/strong&gt; and strong expertise in LIMS, ELN, CDS, laboratory instrument integrations, APIs, middleware, databases, and production support.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;451&quot; data-end=&quot;671&quot;&gt;The role involves providing &lt;strong data-start=&quot;479&quot; data-end=&quot;508&quot;&gt;L2/L3 application support&lt;/strong&gt;, troubleshooting production and integr