citara DLX.&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ejm8kg&quot; data-start=&quot;1141&quot; data-end=&quot;1205&quot;&gt;Validate interface connectivity and ensure seamless data flow.&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1m6e8pz&quot; data-start=&quot;1206&quot; data-end=&quot;1272&quot;&gt;Troubleshoot API, middleware, database, and connectivity issues.&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;y6lxmu&quot; data-start=&quot;1273&quot; data-end=&quot;1352&quot;&gt;Collaborate with vendors and technical teams during deployments and upgrades.&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1wiuy6m&quot; data-start=&quot;1353&quot; data-end=&quot;1426&quot;&gt;Ensure platform availability and performance according to defined SLAs.&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1fhqqa4&quot; data-start=&quot;1427&quot; data-end=&quot;1497&quot;&gt;Maintain technical documentation and support knowledge repositories.&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Maharashtra'),('ad7d39d3-c4d6-4afe-86d1-beb4d9bd5d13','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Sales Engineer – Sales and Implementation','sales-engineer-sales-and-implementation-39-39','&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;193&quot; data-end=&quot;255&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;197&quot; data-end=&quot;211&quot;&gt;Job Title:&lt;/strong&gt; Sales Engineer &amp;ndash; Sales and Implementation&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;256&quot; data-end=&quot;728&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;256&quot; data-end=&quot;269&quot;&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Bengaluru, India&lt;br /&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;468&quot; data-end=&quot;492&quot;&gt;Experience Required:&lt;/strong&gt; Fresher&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;735&quot; data-end=&quot;764&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;739&quot; data-end=&quot;764&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;765&quot; data-end=&quot;1509&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;765&quot; data-end=&quot;890&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;767&quot; data-end=&quot;890&quot;&gt;Act as a bridge between the sales and technical teams to ensure customer requirements are clearly understood and fulfilled.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;891&quot; data-end=&quot;1009&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;893&quot; data-end=&quot;1009&quot;&gt;Deliver product demonstrations, training sessions, and Proof of Concepts (PoC) for prospective clients and partners.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1010&quot; data-end=&quot;1132&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1012&quot; data-end=&quot;1132&quot;&gt;Handle account management responsibilities including pre-sales scoping, solution implementation, and post-sales support.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1133&quot; data-end=&quot;1238&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1135&quot; data-end=&quot;1238&quot;&gt;Maintain up-to-date and accurate records of sales activities, CRM entries, and project sales forecasts.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1239&quot; data-end=&quot;1345&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1241&quot; data-end=&quot;1345&quot;&gt;Develop a thorough understanding of CACHATTO services and effectively position them against competitors.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1346&quot; data-end=&quot;1419&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1348&quot; data-end=&quot;1419&quot;&gt;Provide timely and effective support for customer inquiries and issues.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1420&quot; data-end=&quot;1509&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1422&quot; data-end=&quot;1509&quot;&gt;Willingness to travel extensively for sales and implementation activities across India.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;hr data-start=&quot;1511&quot; data-end=&quot;1514&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;1516&quot; data-end=&quot;1541&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;