erprise customer engagement.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2045&quot; data-end=&quot;2100&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2047&quot; data-end=&quot;2100&quot;&gt;Customer relationship management for repeat business.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2101&quot; data-end=&quot;2176&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2103&quot; data-end=&quot;2176&quot;&gt;Conducting market and competitor research, and customer feedback surveys.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2177&quot; data-end=&quot;2217&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2179&quot; data-end=&quot;2217&quot;&gt;CRM updates and daily sales reporting.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;hr data-start=&quot;2219&quot; data-end=&quot;2222&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;2224&quot; data-end=&quot;2259&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2228&quot; data-end=&quot;2259&quot;&gt;Educational Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2260&quot; data-end=&quot;2329&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2260&quot; data-end=&quot;2329&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2262&quot; data-end=&quot;2329&quot;&gt;B.E./B.Tech/M.Tech/MBA or equivalent from a recognized institution.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;hr data-start=&quot;2331&quot; data-end=&quot;2334&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;2336&quot; data-end=&quot;2361&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2340&quot; data-end=&quot;2361&quot;&gt;Key Deliverables:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2362&quot; data-end=&quot;2594&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2362&quot; data-end=&quot;2467&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2364&quot; data-end=&quot;2467&quot;&gt;High energy and a cheerful outlook with excellent communication in English, Hindi, and local languages.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2468&quot; data-end=&quot;2535&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2470&quot; data-end=&quot;2535&quot;&gt;Strong critical thinking, listening skills, and presence of mind.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2536&quot; data-end=&quot;2594&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2538&quot; data-end=&quot;2594&quot;&gt;Proactive attitude with willingness to travel PAN India.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Sales','Contract','Entry',200000.00,400000.00,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-19 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-05-22 07:15:20.000000','2025-11-21 06:29:04.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Account Management\", \"CRM\", \"Engineer\", \"Good Communication Skills\", \"Presales\", \"Product Demonstration\", \"Sales\", \"Technical Support\"]','[\"&lt;ul data-start=&quot;97&quot; data-end=&quot;547&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;148&quot; data-end=&quot;191&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;150&quot; data-end=&quot;191&quot;&gt;5-Day Work Week (Saturday &amp;amp; Sunday off)&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;192&quot; data-end=&quot;254&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;194&quot; data-end=&quot;254&quot;&gt;Exposure to Pre-sales, Implementation &amp;amp; Client Interaction&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;255&quot; data-end=&quot;319&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;257&quot; data-end=&quot;319&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a global product company (Japan HQ)&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;320&quot; data-end=&quot;357&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;322&quot; data-end=&quot;357&quot;&gt;Travel opportunities across India&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;358&quot; data-end=&quot;424&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;360&quot; data-end=&quot;424&quot;&gt;Skill development in sales, technology, and account management&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;425&quot; data-end=&quot;483&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;427&quot; data-end=&quot;483&quot;&gt;Fast-growing organization with career growth potential&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;484&quot; data-end=&quot;547&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;486&quot; data-end=&quot;547&quot;&gt;Collaborative work environment and learning-focused culture&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('ae377d3f-2cd2-4c46-a320-e6a721e69859','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','.NET Full Stack Developer','net-full-stack-developer-309-309','&lt;p data-start=&quot;106&quot; data-end=&quot;461&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced .NET Full Stack Developers for a leading Top MNC to work on enterprise-scale application development and digital transformation initiatives. We are looking for Associate Software Engineers and Senior Software Engineers with strong expertise in Microsoft technologies, cloud platforms, and modern full-stack development practices.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;463&quot; data-end=&quot;824&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for designing, developing, enhancing, and maintaining scalable enterprise applications using .NET technologies. The role includes developing responsive front-end applications, building secure REST APIs and microservices, optimizing database performance, and delivering high-quality software solutions using Agile methodologies.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;826&quot; data-end=&quot;1245&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with .NET Core, .NET Framework, C#, SQL Server, RESTful APIs, and Microservices architecture. Experience with modern frontend technologies such as Angular, React, or Flutter, along with Azure Cloud services, is highly preferred. Senior professionals will also be expected to provide technical leadership, mentor development teams, and contribute to architectural decisions.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1247&quot; data-end=&quot;1580&quot;&gt;The role also involves collaborating with product owners, business analysts, QA teams, and DevOps engineers to deliver enterprise-grade solutions, improve application performance, and drive cloud adoption and engineering best practices. Candidates should possess strong analytical thinking, communication, and problem-solving skills.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-08-24 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-06-26 03:23:02.000000','2026-06-26 03:23:02.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\".NET CORE\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1596&quot; data-end=&quot;1634&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1cw906g&quot; data-start=&quot;1635&quot; data-end=&quot;1699&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale Full Stack Development projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;15wexvs&quot; data-start=&quot;1700&quot; data-end=&quot;1762&quot;&gt;Work on modern .NET, Cloud, and Microservices technologies&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;vzw4cu&quot; data-start=&quot;1763&quot; data-end=&quot;1824&quot;&gt;Career growth in Software Engineering &amp;amp; Cloud Development&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1a77kja&quot; data-start=&quot;1825&quot; data-end=&quot;1885&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global engineering teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot; data-start=&quot;1886&quot; data-end=&quot;1941&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;1942&quot; data-end=&quot;1985&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('ae854a84-2946-41fa-b892-9bcb1b21a4bb','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','LIMS Sample manager Technical SME','lims-sample-manager-technical-sme-216-216','&amp;middot; Manage and support instrument integrations with the LIMS system &lt;