aborative and professional work environment&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('af20fe27-0d5b-4425-9b80-efa0b91b8124','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Tech Lead – OB Portal (Kafka, Cosmos DB)','tech-lead-ob-portal-kafka-cosmos-db-29-29','&lt;h3 class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;159&quot; data-end=&quot;220&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;163&quot; data-end=&quot;177&quot;&gt;Job Title:&lt;/strong&gt; Tech Lead &amp;ndash; OB Portal (Kafka, Cosmos DB)&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;221&quot; data-end=&quot;391&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;221&quot; data-end=&quot;234&quot;&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Chennai, India (Offshore)&lt;br data-start=&quot;260&quot; data-end=&quot;263&quot; /&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;263&quot; data-end=&quot;278&quot;&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 6+ years total, with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;300&quot; data-end=&quot;335&quot;&gt;3+ years of relevant experience&lt;/strong&gt; in Kafka &amp;amp; Cosmos DB&lt;br data-start=&quot;356&quot; data-end=&quot;359&quot; /&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;359&quot; data-end=&quot;379&quot;&gt;Employment Type:&lt;/strong&gt; Full-time&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;398&quot; data-end=&quot;420&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;402&quot; data-end=&quot;418&quot;&gt;Job Summary:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;421&quot; data-end=&quot;783&quot;&gt;We are seeking a skilled and experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;462&quot; data-end=&quot;475&quot;&gt;Tech Lead&lt;/strong&gt; to join our offshore team in Chennai to lead the development and support of OB Portal systems leveraging &lt;strong data-start=&quot;581&quot; data-end=&quot;597&quot;&gt;Apache Kafka&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong data-start=&quot;602&quot; data-end=&quot;621&quot;&gt;Azure Cosmos DB&lt;/strong&gt;. The ideal candidate will have a strong background in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;676&quot; data-end=&quot;705&quot;&gt;event-driven architecture&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong data-start=&quot;707&quot; data-end=&quot;736&quot;&gt;real-time data processing&lt;/strong&gt;, and &lt;strong data-start=&quot;742&quot; data-end=&quot;782&quot;&gt;cloud-native application development&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;790&quot; data-end=&quot;819&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;794&quot; data-end=&quot;819&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;821&quot; data-end=&quot;1771&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;821&quot; data-end=&quot;934&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;823&quot; data-end=&quot;934&quot;&gt;Lead the architecture, design, and implementation of scalable data pipelines using &lt;strong data-start=&quot;906&quot; data-end=&quot;915&quot;&gt;Kafka&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong data-start=&quot;920&quot; data-end=&quot;933&quot;&gt;Cosmos DB&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;935&quot; data-end=&quot;1046&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;937&quot; data-end=&quot;1046&quot;&gt;Develop, test, and deploy &lt;strong data-start=&quot;963&quot; data-end=&quot;996&quot;&gt;Kafka producers and consumers&lt;/strong&gt; for handling high-volume, real-time data streams.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1047&quot; data-end=&quot;1169&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1049&quot; data-end=&quot;1169&quot;&gt;Design and optimize data models, partitioning strategies, and indexing in azu&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1123&quot; data-end=&quot;1136&quot;&gt;Cosmos DB&lt;/strong&gt; for performance and scalability.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1170&quot; data-end=&quot;1275&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1172&quot; data-end=&quot;1275&quot;&gt;Implement &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1182&quot; data-end=&quot;1202&quot;&gt;Kafka Connectors&lt;/strong&gt; to integrate with diverse data sources and targets, including Cosmos DB.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1276&quot; data-end=&quot;1360&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1278&quot; data-end=&quot;1360&quot;&gt;Develop microservices and APIs based on &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1318&quot; data-end=&quot;1359&quot;&gt;Kafka-based event-driven architecture&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1361&quot; data-end=&quot;1445&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1363&quot; data-end=&quot;1445&quot;&gt;Ensure data reliability, availability, and performance across distributed systems.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1446&quot; data-end=&quot;1545&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1448&quot; data-end=&quot;1545&quot;&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional teams to define technical requirements and system architecture.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1546&quot; data-end=&quot;1673&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1548&quot; data-end=&quot;1673&quot;&gt;Leverage &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1557&quot; data-end=&quot;1575&quot;&gt;Azure services&lt;/strong&gt; like &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1581&quot; data-end=&quot;1598&quot;&gt;Function Apps&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1600&quot; data-end=&quot;1614&quot;&gt;Event Hubs&lt;/strong&gt;, and others for supporting application and data workflows.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1674&quot; data-end=&quot;1771&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1676&quot; data-end=&quot;1771&quot;&gt;Troubleshoot production issues, perform root cause analysis, and implement effective solutions.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1778&quot; data-end=&quot;1815&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1782&quot; data-end=&quot;1815&quot;&gt;Required Skills &amp;amp; Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1817&quot; data-end=&quot;2569&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1817&quot; data-end=&quot;1933&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1819&quot; data-end=&quot;1933&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1819&quot; data-end=&quot;1854&quot;&gt;3+ years of hands-on experience&lt;/strong&gt; with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1860&quot; data-end=&quot;1876&quot;&gt;Apache Kafka&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;ndash; including setup, configuration, and stream processing.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1934&quot; data-end=&quot;2047&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1936&quot; data-end=&quot;2047&quot;&gt;Proven expertise in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1956&quot; data-end=&quot;1975&quot;&gt;Azure Cosmos DB&lt;/strong&gt; (NoSQL/SQL API) &amp;ndash; data modeling, query tuning, and operational support.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2048&quot; data-end=&quot;2136&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2050&quot; data-end=&quot;2136&quot;&gt;Solid experience with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2072&quot; data-end=&quot;2089&quot;&gt;Kafka Connect&lt;/strong&gt;, Schema Registry, and Avro/JSON serialization.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2137&quot; data-end=&quot;2225&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2139&quot; data-end=&quot;2225&quot;&gt;Strong proficiency in designing &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2171&quot; data-end=&quot;2205&quot;&gt;real-time, distributed systems&lt;/strong&gt; and data pipelines.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2226&quot; data-end=&quot;2322&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2228&quot; data-end=&quot;2322&quot;&gt;Proficient in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2242&quot; data-end=&quot;2261&quot;&gt;Azure ecosystem&lt;/strong&gt;, especially Function Apps, Event Hubs, and monitoring tools.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2323&quot; data-end=&quot;2430&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2325&quot; data-end=&quot;2430&quot;&gt;Experience in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2339&quot; data-end=&quot;2368&quot;&gt;microservices development&lt;/strong&gt; using any modern backend language (Java, .NET, Python, etc.).&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2431&quot; data-end=&quot;2505&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2433&quot; data-end=&quot;2505&quot;&gt;Familiarity with CI/CD tools and DevOps practices in cloud environments.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2506&quot; data-end=&quot;2569&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2508&quot; data-end=&quot;2569&quot;&gt;Strong problem-solving, communication, and leadership skills.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;hr class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2571&quot; data-end=&quot;2574&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2576&quot; data-end=&quot;2609&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2580&quot; data-end=&quot;2609&quot;&gt;Preferred Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2611&quot; data-end=&quot;2806&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2611&quot; data-end=&quot;2687&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2613&quot; data-end=&quot;2687&quot;&gt;Azure certification (e.g., Azure Developer Associate, Azure Data Engineer)&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2688&quot; data-end=&quot;2730&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; da