nt Interfaces, Lot, Sample Management for Clinical Trial &amp;amp;amp; Manufacturing Domain. &lt;br /&gt;5. Responsible for writing code, testing script and test script execution&lt;br /&gt;6. Facilitate effective and efficient meetings with the client and internal team. Work with the client and/or team to develop strategies and action plans based on the outcomes of those meetings.&lt;br /&gt;7. Responsible for resolving technical issues in Labware LIMS/ELN, including Interfaces to ERP, Label Printing Software, MDM and all modules &lt;br /&gt;8. Deployment of developed methods in testing environment and test script execution with client.&lt;br /&gt;9. Support activities like Hypercare after go live, Process Improvement &amp;amp;amp; Automation,Impact analysis and replication of application issues etc.&lt;br /&gt;10. Identify process improvements opportunities to enhance efficiency and/or quality within workstreams and lead their implementation.','Information Technology','Contract','Entry',NULL,NULL,'INR',1,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-05-30 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-03-31 21:26:31.000000','2026-03-31 21:26:31.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"ERP\", \"Lims\", \"MYSQL\", \"Oracle\", \"SAP\", \"LabWare LIMS\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;Competitive salary package with performance-based incentives&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;65&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;67&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;Health insurance coverage and statutory benefits (PF &amp;amp; Gratuity)&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;134&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;136&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on large-scale enterprise energy management projects&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;211&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;\