nefits (PF &amp;amp; Gratuity)&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;134&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;136&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on large-scale enterprise energy management projects&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;211&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;213&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;Strong career growth and learning opportunities&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;263&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;265&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;Collaborative and professional work environment&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('b07d52ca-c989-46ff-bfd1-8514cf247da7','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Python Developer','python-developer-74-74','We are seeking an experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;144&quot; data-end=&quot;164&quot;&gt;Python Developer&lt;/strong&gt; with a strong background in automation, RESTful services, and object-oriented programming. The ideal candidate will thrive in an Agile environment, taking responsibility for automation solution development and individual contributions to impactful projects.&lt;br /&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;688&quot; data-end=&quot;715&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;692&quot; data-end=&quot;713&quot;&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;716&quot; data-end=&quot;1044&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;716&quot; data-end=&quot;776&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;718&quot; data-end=&quot;776&quot;&gt;Develop and implement automation solutions using Python.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;777&quot; data-end=&quot;837&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;779&quot; data-end=&quot;837&quot;&gt;Design and maintain RESTful services and Web frameworks.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;838&quot; data-end=&quot;919&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;840&quot; data-end=&quot;919&quot;&gt;Perform shell scripting, web crawling, pattern recognition, and file parsing.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;920&quot; data-end=&quot;988&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;922&quot; data-end=&quot;988&quot;&gt;Debug and optimize Python applications for seamless performance.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;989&quot; data-end=&quot;1044&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;991&quot; data-end=&quot;1044&quot;&gt;Manage packaging and deployment processes for code.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',1,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-19 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-07-01 13:21:31.000000','2025-11-21 04:49:06.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Agile Methodology\", \"Automation\", \"Cd Pipelines\", \"CI Pipelines\", \"Object-Oriented Programming\", \"Python\", \"RESTFUL\", \"Shell Scripts\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1438&quot; data-end=&quot;1503&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1440&quot; data-end=&quot;1503&quot;&gt;Competitive salary with opportunities for career progression.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1504&quot; data-end=&quot;1557&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1506&quot; data-end=&quot;1557&quot;&gt;Exposure to cutting-edge automation technologies.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1558&quot; data-end=&quot;1634&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1560&quot; data-end=&quot;1634&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on impactful projects in a dynamic team environment.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1635&quot; data-end=&quot;1697&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1637&quot; data-end=&quot;1697&quot;&gt;Professional development with learning and certifications.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('b092b400-267d-4bc9-a887-8a257bb52f0b','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Digital Lead – Manufacturing Control Tower / Self-Optimizing Plants','digital-lead-manufacturing-control-tower-self-optimizing-plants-153-153','The Digital Lead will drive Digital Manufacturing and Industry 4.0 initiatives across Smart Factory pillars, specifically Manufacturing Control Tower and Self-Optimizing Plants. This role involves leading digital transformation programs, engaging with global and regional Smart Factory teams, evaluating technologies, and designing innovative digital solutions.\r\n\r\nThe candidate will work closely with customers to identify pain points, define requirements, create solution concepts, and manage the end-to-end implementation of digital transformation use cases. The role also requires collaboration with global partners, internal technical teams, and business stakeholders to standardize technologies, develop roadmaps, and guide Smart Factory transformation efforts across multiple Operating Entities.','Information Technology','Full-time','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Chennai',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-26 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-11-28 02:36:49.000000','2025-11-28 02:36:49.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"AI/ML\", \"Azure\", \"Cloud\", \"Data Integration\", \"Digital Twin Technology\", \"IOT\", \"Mes\", \"PLC\", \"Project Management\", \"SCADA\", \"Digital Manufacturing\", \"Industry 4.0 Solutioning\", \"Edge Connectivity\", \"Factory Systems\", \"Solution Design\"]','[\"Opportunity to lead global Smart Factory initiatives\\r\\nWork with advanced Industry 4.0 technologies (AI/ML, Digital Twins, IoT, Cloud)\\r\\nExposure to cross-functional global teams\\r\\nLeadership role in Digital Manufacturing transformation\\r\\nCompetitive compensation with performance-based rewards\\r\\nCareer growth in Industry 4.0 and Digital Strategy\\r\\nLearning &amp; certification support (Azure, IoT, Data platforms)\\r\\nWork with global clients and partners in CPG/Manufacturing\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Tamil Nadu'),('b0a5a3a6-1ede-4079-8e94-6edf32d59d9d','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','LabVantage LIMS Consultant','labvantage-lims-consultant-37-37','&lt;p data-start=&quot;225&quot; data-end=&quot;561&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;225&quot; data-end=&quot;265&quot;&gt;Job Role: LabVantage LIMS Consultant&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br data-start=&quot;265&quot; data-end=&quot;268&quot; /&gt;We are seeking an experienced LabVantage LIMS Consultant with strong hands-on experience in Java/.NET-based LIMS application development. The ideal candidate will have a background in LabVantage LIMS, including workflows, customization, integration, implementation, upgradation, and migration.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;563&quot; data-end=&quot;588&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;563&quot; data-end=&quot;588&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;589&quot; data-end=&quot;1047&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;589&quot; data-end=&quot;660&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;591&quot; data-end=&quot;660&quot;&gt;Develop and maintain Java or .NET-based LabVantage LIMS applications.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;661&quot; data-end=&quot;704&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;663&quot; data-end=&quot;704&quot;&gt;Administer and configure LabVantage LIMS.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;705&quot; data-end=&quot;770&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;707&quot; data-end=&quot;770&quot;&gt;Develop and manage workflows, customizations, and integrations.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;771&quot; data-end=&quot;831&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;773&quot; data-end=&quot;831&quot;&gt;Troubleshoot and debug application issues related to LIMS.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;832&quot; data-end=&quot;906&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;834&quot; data-end=&quot;906&quot;&gt;Collaborate with manufacturing and quality teams to gather requirements.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;907&quot; data-end=&quot;971&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;909&quot; data-end=&quot;971&quot;&gt;Ensure smooth upgradation and migration of LabVantage systems.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;972&quot; data-end=&quot;1047&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;974&quot; data-end=&quot;1047&quot;&gt;Communicate effectively with clients and provide technical documentation.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1049&quot; data-end=&quot;1066&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1049&quot; data-end=&quot;1066&quot;&gt;Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1067&quot; data-end=&quot;1326&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1067&quot; data-end=&quot;1127&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1069&quot; data-end=&quot;1127&quot;&gt;5&amp;ndash;15 years of experience in LIMS or Java/.NET development.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1128&quot; data-end=&quot;1199&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1130&quot; data-end=&quot;1199&quot;&gt;At least 3 years of experience in a manufacturing or R&amp;amp;D environment.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1200&quot; data-end=&quot;1263&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1202&quot; data-end=&quot;1263&quot;&gt;Strong analytical, communication, and customer-facing skills.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1264&quot; data-end=&quot;1326&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1266&quot; data-end=&quot;1326&quot;&gt;Bachelor&#039;s degree in Computer Science, IT, or related field.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',1000000.00,2000000.00,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-20 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-05-21 20:32:24.000000','2025-11-21 17:16:26.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Debugging Skills\", \"Java\", \"Java Webservices\", \"Lims\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1368&quot; data-end=&quot;1425&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1370&quot; data-end=&quot;1425&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on global LabVantage LIMS projects.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1426&quot; data-end=&quot;1491&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1428&quot; data-end=&quot;1491&quot;&gt;Exposure to manufacturing, quality, and R&amp;amp;D industry processes.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1492&quot; data-end=&quot;1547&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1494&quot; data-end=&quot;1547&quot;&gt;Competitive salary with performance-based incentives.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1548&quot; data-end=&quot;1615&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1550&quot; data-end=&quot;1615&quot;&gt;Professional growth through cross-functional project involvement.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1616&quot; data-end=&quot;1677&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1618&quot; data-end=&quot;1677&quot;&gt;Flexible work environment with a supportive technical team.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1678&quot; data-end=&quot;1757&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1680&quot; data-end=&quot;1757&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience with advanced LIMS configuration and migration practices.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('b0a68f30-8d72-4088-86b7-0bb6929c5f4d','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','QA Automation Engineer','qa-automation-engineer-316-316','&lt;p data-start=&quot;64&quot; data-end=&quot;439&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced QA Automation Engineers for a leading Top MNC to work on enterprise software testing, automation framework development, and manufacturing domain applications. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in automation testing, framework development, software quality assurance, and test automation for both infrastructure and functional testing.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;441&quot; data-end=&quot;814&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for designing, developing, maintaining, and executing automated and manual test scripts to ensure the quality, stability, and performance of enterprise applications. The role includes building automation frameworks, validating software across multiple releases, creating test cases, managing test data, and performing database validations.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;816&quot; data-end=&quot;1225&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with automation framework development, programming languages such as C, C++, C#, Java, Python, Perl, Shell Scripting, and Tcl/Tk, along with strong knowledge of Windows Client/Server environments, legacy desktop applications, SQL, debugging, and troubleshooting. Experience with Microsoft Sysinternals, UNIX utilities, and root cause analysis is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1227&quot; data-end=&quot;1579&quot;&gt;The role also involves collaborating with development teams throughout the Software Development Lifecycle (SDLC), identifying defects, improving automation coverage, enhancing product quality, and contributing to continuous testing initiatives. Candidates should possess strong analytical thinking, communication, debugging, and problem-solving skills.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-08-28 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-06-30 03:43:22.000000','2026-06-30 03:43:22.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"C Programming\", \"C#\", \"C++\", \"Functional Scenario Testing\", \"Java\", \"Python\", \"Quality Assurance (QA)\", \"Shell\", \"Test Case Preparation\", \"Manual Testing\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1595&quot; data-end=&quot;1633&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;4rcl1r&quot; data-start=&quot;1634&quot; data-end=&quot;1694&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale automation testing projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;18geotp&quot; data-start=&quot;1695&quot; data-end=&quot;1774&quot;&gt;Work on advanced QA automation frameworks and enterprise software solutions&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1qm0vqv&quot; data-start=&quot;1775&quot; data-end=&quot;1841&quot;&gt;Career growth in Software Testing &amp;amp; Quality Engineering domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;iz6fk7&quot; data-start=&quot;1842&quot; data-end=&quot;1909&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global development and QA teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot; data-start=&quot;1910&quot; data-end=&quot;1965&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;1966&quot; data-end=&quot;2009&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('b138c337-4ccf-48ec-b677-24ee409479ad','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Syncade MES Consultant (Master MES L3 Support)','syncade-mes-consultant-master-mes-l3-support-325-325','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;88&quot; data-end=&quot;442&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced Syncade MES Consultants for a leading Top MNC to support enterprise Pharmaceutical and Biotech Manufacturing projects across global locations. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in Emerson Syncade MES, Manufacturing Execution Systems (MES), Electronic Batch Records (EBR), and regulated manufacturing environments.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;444&quot; data-end=&quot;865&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for developing, supporting, enhancing, and maintaining Emerson Syncade MES solutions to optimize manufacturing operations and ensure regulatory compliance. The role includes developing production procedures, providing L3 application support, troubleshooting complex production issues, supporting system enhancements, and delivering validated MES solutions for global manufacturing sites.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;867&quot; data-end=&quot;1290&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with Emerson Syncade MES, Electronic Batch Records (EBR), Production Procedure Development, HP ALM testing, Computer System Validation (CSV), IQ/OQ documentation, ISA-95 (S95) models, and pharmaceutical manufacturing processes. Strong understanding of data integrity, regulatory compliance, IT lifecycle management, and validated manufacturing environments is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1292&quot; data-end=&quot;1685&quot;&gt;The role also involves collaborating with business users, manufacturing teams, QA, validation teams, and global IT stakeholders to deliver reliable MES solutions, manage change requests, support continuous improvement initiatives, and maintain compliance with regulatory standards. Candidates should possess strong analytical, communication, stakeholder management, and problem-solving skills.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-09-01 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-07-03 19:09:17.000000','2026-07-03 19:09:17.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"CSV\", \"IQ\", \"Manufacturing Execution Systems\", \"Mes Troubleshooting\", \"OQ\", \"Emerson Syncade MES\", \"Master Data Management (MDM)\", \"ISA-95\", \"L2 Application Support\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1701&quot; data-end=&quot;1739&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;3gslfz&quot; data-start=&quot;1740&quot; data-end=&quot;1812&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale Pharmaceutical and Biotech MES projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;vski8o&quot; data-start=&quot;1813&quot; data-end=&quot;1891&quot;&gt;Work on global Emerson Syncade MES implementations and support initiatives&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;jwvtzw&quot; data-start=&quot;1892&quot; data-end=&quot;1962&quot;&gt;Career growth in MES &amp;amp; Pharmaceutical Digital Manufacturing domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;lx4whh&quot; data-start=&quot;1963&quot; data-end=&quot;2042&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with international business and technology teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;2lee9a&quot; data-start=&quot;2043&quot; data-end=&quot;2098&quot;&gt;Professional and compliance-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;2099&quot; data-end=&quot;2142&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('b1d987fe-9b81-4970-85fc-cbf204cf17f6','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Testing & Validation Lead – Cyber Security (IT/OT)','testing-validation-lead-cyber-security-itot-188-188','We are looking for an experienced Testing &amp;amp; Validation Lead to manage cybersecurity testing and validation across IT-OT environments. The role involves FAT/SAT cyber test design, VA/PT coordination, SIEM validation, DR/backup checks, evidence reporting, and ensuring audit-ready compliance across project phases.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Key Skills&lt;br /&gt;FAT / SAT cyber test case design&lt;br /&gt;IT-OT security testing &amp;amp; validation&lt;br /&gt;Vulnerability Assessment &amp;amp; Penetration Testing (VA/PT) coordination&lt;br /&gt;SIEM validation &amp;amp; log use-case testing&lt;br /&gt;SCADA / EMS / DMS security validation&lt;br /&gt;Backup &amp;amp; Disaster Recovery cyber resilience testing&lt;br /&gt;Risk register &amp;amp; compliance matrix management&lt;br /&gt;Evidence collection &amp;amp; audit reporting&lt;br /&gt;IAM / PKI validation&lt;br /&gt;Stakeholder coordination &amp;amp; issue tracking','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-04-10 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-02-09 18:43:10.000000','2026-02-09 18:43:10.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Case Analysis\", \"Cybersecurity\", \"Penetration Testing\", \"SCADA\", \"SIEM Tools\", \"EMS\", \"FAT / SAT\", \"Vulnerability Assessment\", \"(VA/PT) coordination\"]','[\"Leadership role in critical IT-OT cybersecurity programs&lt;br /&gt;Exposure to FAT/SAT, audits, and regulatory reviews&lt;br /&gt;Work with OEMs, customers, and global delivery teams&lt;br /&gt;Strong career growth in OT security validation and governance&lt;br /&gt;High-impact role supporting go-live and operational readiness\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('b3123472-c539-4e09-ab2c-dd1c1ec7197a','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Tech Lead – OB Portal (Kafka, Cosmos DB)','tech-lead-ob-portal-kafka-cosmos-db-28-28','&lt;h3 class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;159&quot; data-end=&quot;220&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;163&quot; data-end=&quot;177&quot;&gt;Job Title:&lt;/strong&gt; Tech Lead &amp;ndash; OB Portal (Kafka, Cosmos DB)&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;221&quot; data-end=&quot;391&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;221&quot; data-end=&quot;234&quot;&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Chennai, India (Offshore)&lt;br data-start=&quot;260&quot; data-end=&quot;263&quot; /&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;263&quot; data-end=&quot;278&quot;&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 6+ years total, with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;300&quot; data-end=&quot;335&quot;&gt;3+ years of relevant experience&lt;/strong&gt; in Kafka &amp;amp; Cosmos DB&lt;br data-start=&quot;356&quot; data-end=&quot;359&quot; /&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;359&quot; data-end=&quot;379&quot;&gt;Employment Type:&lt;/strong&gt; Full-time&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;398&quot; data-end=&quot;420&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;402&quot; data-end=&quot;418&quot;&gt;Job Summary:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;421&quot; data-end=&quot;783&quot;&gt;We are seeking a skilled and experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;462&quot; data-end=&quot;475&quot;&gt;Tech Lead&lt;/strong&gt; to join our offshore team in Chennai to lead the development and support of OB Portal systems leveraging &lt;strong data-start=&quot;581&quot; data-end=&quot;597&quot;&gt;Apache Kafka&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong data-start=&quot;602&quot; data-end=&quot;621&quot;&gt;Azure Cosmos DB&lt;/strong&gt;. The ideal candidate will have a strong background in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;676&quot; data-end=&quot;705&quot;&gt;event-driven architecture&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong data-start=&quot;707&quot; data-end=&quot;736&quot;&gt;real-time data processing&lt;/strong&gt;, and &lt;strong data-start=&quot;742&quot; data-end=&quot;782&quot;&gt;cloud-native application development&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;790&quot; data-end=&quot;819&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;794&quot; data-end=&quot;819&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;821&quot; data-end=&quot;1771&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;821&quot; data-end=&quot;934&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;823&quot; data-end=&quot;934&quot;&gt;Lead the architecture, design, and implementation of scalable data pipelines using &lt;strong data-start=&quot;906&quot; data-end=&quot;915&quot;&gt;Kafka&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong data-start=&quot;920&quot; data-end=&quot;933&quot;&gt;Cosmos DB&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;935&quot; data-end=&quot;1046&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;937&quot; data-end=&quot;1046&quot;&gt;Develop, test, and deploy &lt;strong data-start=&quot;963&quot; data-end=&quot;996&quot;&gt;Kafka producers and consumers&lt;/strong&gt; for handling high-volume, real-time data streams.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1047&quot; data-end=&quot;1169&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1049&quot; data-end=&quot;1169&quot;&gt;Design and optimize data models, partitioning strategies, and indexing in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1123&quot; data-end=&quot;1136&quot;&gt;Cosmos DB&lt;/strong&gt; for performance and scalability.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1170&quot; data-end=&quot;1275&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1172&quot; data-end=&quot;1275&quot;&gt;Implement &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1182&quot; data-end=&quot;1202&quot;&gt;Kafka Connectors&lt;/strong&gt; to integrate with diverse data sources and targets, including Cosmos DB.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1276&quot; data-end=&quot;1360&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1278&quot; data-end=&quot;1360&quot;&gt;Develop microservices and APIs based on &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1318&quot; data-end=&quot;1359&quot;&gt;Kafka-based event-driven architecture&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1361&quot; data-end=&quot;1445&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1363&quot; data-end=&quot;1445&quot;&gt;Ensure data reliability, availability, and performance across distributed systems.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1446&quot; data-end=&quot;1545&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1448&quot; data-end=&quot;1545&quot;&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional teams to define technical requirements and system architecture.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1546&quot; data-end=&quot;1673&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1548&quot; data-end=&quot;1673&quot;&gt;Leverage &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1557&quot; data-end=&quot;1575&quot;&gt;Azure services&lt;/strong&gt; like &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1581&quot; data-end=&quot;1598&quot;&gt;Function Apps&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1600&quot; data-end=&quot;1614&quot;&gt;Event Hubs&lt;/strong&gt;, and others for supporting application and data workflows.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1674&quot; data-end=&quot;1771&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1676&quot; data-end=&quot;1771&quot;&gt;Troubleshoot production issues, perform root cause analysis, and implement effective solutions.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1778&quot; data-end=&quot;1815&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1782&quot; data-end=&quot;1815&quot;&gt;Required Skills &amp;amp; Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1817&quot; data-end=&quot;2569&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1817&quot; data-end=&quot;1933&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1819&quot; data-end=&quot;1933&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1819&quot; data-end=&quot;1854&quot;&gt;3+ years of hands-on experience&lt;/strong&gt; with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1860&quot; data-end=&quot;1876&quot;&gt;Apache Kafka&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;ndash; including setup, configuration, and stream processing.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1934&quot; data-end=&quot;2047&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1936&quot; data-end=&quot;2047&quot;&gt;Proven expertise in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1956&quot; data-end=&quot;1975&quot;&gt;Azure Cosmos DB&lt;/strong&gt; (NoSQL/SQL API) &amp;ndash; data modeling, query tuning, and operational support.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2048&quot; data-end=&quot;2136&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2050&quot; data-end=&quot;2136&quot;&gt;Solid experience with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2072&quot; data-end=&quot;2089&quot;&gt;Kafka Connect&lt;/strong&gt;, Schema Registry, and Avro/JSON serialization.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2137&quot; data-end=&quot;2225&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2139&quot; data-end=&quot;2225&quot;&gt;Strong proficiency in designing &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2171&quot; data-end=&quot;2205&quot;&gt;real-time, distributed systems&lt;/strong&gt; and data pipelines.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2226&quot; data-end=&quot;2322&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2228&quot; data-end=&quot;2322&quot;&gt;Proficient in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2242&quot; data-end=&quot;2261&quot;&gt;Azure ecosystem&lt;/strong&gt;, especially Function Apps, Event Hubs, and monitoring tools.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2323&quot; data-end=&quot;2430&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2325&quot; data-end=&quot;2430&quot;&gt;Experience in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2339&quot; data-end=&quot;2368&quot;&gt;microservices development&lt;/strong&gt; using any modern backend language (Java, .NET, Python, etc.).&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2431&quot; data-end=&quot;2505&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2433&quot; data-end=&quot;2505&quot;&gt;Familiarity with CI/CD tools and DevOps practices in cloud environments.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2506&quot; data-end=&quot;2569&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2508&quot; data-end=&quot;2569&quot;&gt;Strong problem-solving, communication, and leadership skills.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;hr class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2571&quot; data-end=&quot;2574&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2576&quot; data-end=&quot;2609&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2580&quot; data-end=&quot;2609&quot;&gt;Preferred Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2611&quot; data-end=&quot;2806&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2611&quot; data-end=&quot;2687&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2613&quot; data-end=&quot;2687&quot;&gt;Azure certification (e.g., Azure Developer Associate, Azure Data Engineer)&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2688&quot; data-end=&quot;2730&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2690&quot; data-end=&quot;2730&quot;&gt;Experience working in Agile/Scrum teams.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2731&quot; data-end=&quot;2806&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2733&quot; data-end=&quot;2806&quot;&gt;Familiarity with security and compliance best practices for data systems.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',500000.00,2500000.00,'₹',0,'India','Chennai',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2025-07-13 18:30:00',0,0,'2025-05-15 12:37:26.000000','2025-05-16 14:25:41.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Cosmos DB\", \"Kafka\"]','[\"&lt;h3 class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;75&quot; data-end=&quot;96&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;79&quot; data-end=&quot;96&quot;&gt;Job Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\\r\\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;98&quot; data-end=&quot;479&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;98&quot; data-end=&quot;154&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;100&quot; data-end=&quot;154&quot;&gt;Competitive salary with performance-based incentives&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;155&quot; data-end=&quot;202&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;157&quot; data-end=&quot;202&quot;&gt;Flexible work hours and hybrid work options&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;203&quot; data-end=&quot;251&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;205&quot; data-end=&quot;251&quot;&gt;Health insurance for employee and dependents&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;252&quot; data-end=&quot;290&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;254&quot; data-end=&quot;290&quot;&gt;Provident Fund &amp;amp; Gratuity benefits&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;291&quot; data-end=&quot;345&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;293&quot; data-end=&quot;345&quot;&gt;Paid time off (annual leave, sick leave, holidays)&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;346&quot; data-end=&quot;381&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;348&quot; data-end=&quot;381&quot;&gt;Learning &amp;amp; development programs&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;382&quot; data-end=&quot;429&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;384&quot; data-end=&quot;429&quot;&gt;Onsite/offshore collaboration opportunities&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;430&quot; data-end=&quot;479&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;432&quot; data-end=&quot;479&quot;&gt;Supportive and collaborative work environment&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Tamil Nadu');
INSERT INTO `job_postings` VALUES ('b3f89f9d-6545-4cb9-8c42-297b0d492aad','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Ortems Specialist','ortems-specialist-115-115','We are hiring an Ortems Specialist responsible for designing, configuring, and integrating Ortems scheduling environments with Apriso MES and related systems. The role involves planning, implementation, infrastructure coordination, and cross-functional stakeholder engagement to ensure optimal scheduling performance and integration with enterprise systems.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Design and configure Ortems scheduling architecture and ensure seamless integration with Apriso MES.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Determine SQL environment setup (shared/dedicated) based on performance and partitioning needs.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Plan and define use cases in collaboration with scheduling consultants.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Coordinate with infrastructure teams to ensure CPU, RAM, and network requirements.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Support Azure-to-On-prem environment transitions for Ortems.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Act as a liaison among scheduling teams, IT architects, and manufacturing stakeholders.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Maintain and update technical documentation and configuration specifications.','Information Technology','Full-time','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2025-12-11 18:30:00',0,0,'2025-10-13 04:13:01.000000','2025-10-13 04:13:01.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Apriso\", \"Azure Cloud Networking\", \"Cross-Functional\", \"Database Management\", \"Documentation\", \"Logistics\", \"Mes\", \"Mes Implementation\", \"MES Integration\", \"MS SQL Server\", \"Scheduling\", \"Stakeholder Management\", \"Supply Chain Management\"]','[\"Opportunity to work on global manufacturing systems&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Exposure to Azure and advanced scheduling tools&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Work with cross-functional teams in SCM, Logistics, and Manufacturing&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Career growth in MES &amp;amp; Smart Factory technologies&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Collaborative and innovative work environment\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('b463a0e4-9033-488a-88dc-051943f6090e','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Full Stack Technical Lead (React.js + .NET Core)','full-stack-technical-lead-reactjs-net-core-317-317','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;90&quot; data-end=&quot;447&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced Full Stack Technical Leads for a leading Top MNC to work on enterprise-scale application development and digital transformation projects. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in React.js, .NET Core, cloud-ready application architecture, and technical leadership with experience delivering scalable enterprise solutions.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;449&quot; data-end=&quot;842&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for leading the design, architecture, development, and deployment of high-performance full-stack applications using React.js and .NET Core. The role includes building responsive user interfaces, developing secure REST APIs, optimizing application performance, designing scalable architectures, and ensuring software quality through best engineering practices.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;844&quot; data-end=&quot;1225&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with React.js, TypeScript, JavaScript, HTML5, CSS3, .NET Core, C#, REST APIs, JWT authentication, role-based access control (RBAC), SQL databases, and enterprise application development. Strong knowledge of Snowflake, Oracle Database, MS SQL Server, GitHub, Visual Studio, VS Code, Postman, and Agile methodologies is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1227&quot; data-end=&quot;1634&quot;&gt;The role also involves mentoring development teams, conducting code reviews, collaborating with Product Owners and business stakeholders, optimizing ETL and database processes, resolving production issues, and driving continuous improvement initiatives. Candidates should possess strong leadership, communication, analytical, and problem-solving skills with the ability to lead cross-functional Agile teams.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-08-30 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-07-02 02:29:35.000000','2026-07-02 02:29:35.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\".NET CORE\", \"API Gateway\", \"C#\", \"CSS3\", \"ETL\", \"HTML5\", \"JavaScript\", \"JWT (Json Web Tokens)\", \"Microsoft SQL Server\", \"Oracle\", \"React JS\", \"Snowflake\", \"Typescript\", \"Rest API Integration\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1650&quot; data-end=&quot;1688&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1cw906g&quot; data-start=&quot;1689&quot; data-end=&quot;1753&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale Full Stack Development projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;5mqpvd&quot; data-start=&quot;1754&quot; data-end=&quot;1824&quot;&gt;Work on modern React.js, .NET Core, and cloud-enabled technologies&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;19n27u9&quot; data-start=&quot;1825&quot; data-end=&quot;1894&quot;&gt;Leadership role in enterprise application development initiatives&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;91jw72&quot; data-start=&quot;1895&quot; data-end=&quot;1968&quot;&gt;Career growth in Full Stack Development &amp;amp; Technical Leadership domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;16va6xi&quot; data-start=&quot;1969&quot; data-end=&quot;2041&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global engineering and product teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot; data-start=&quot;2042&quot; data-end=&quot;2097&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;2098&quot; data-end=&quot;2141&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('b470209b-a9dd-4761-b854-d90836e87516','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','AVEVA WorkTask / Workflow Profile Specialist','aveva-worktask-workflow-profile-specialist-84-84','We are hiring an experienced AVEVA Workflow Profile Specialist to support PepsiCo&#039;s manufacturing execution systems. The ideal candidate will have hands-on experience with AVEVA Work Tasks, workflow design, and mobile forms development, with deep integration knowledge across MES, SCADA, and enterprise systems.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Build and configure AVEVA WorkTask profiles (User, Service, Script, Timer)&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Integrate AVEVA WorkTask with MES, SCADA, SAP, and historian systems&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Set up rule-based workflows, auto-escalations, and notifications&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Design intuitive digital forms and mobile-ready checklists&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Ensure traceability, audit logging, and compliance tracking&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Work with SQL, .NET scripting, APIs, and web services&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Handle database management and data integration tasks&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Experience with Skelta is a strong plus&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Prior experience in large manufacturing environments','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-09-30 06:00:00',0,0,'2025-07-29 06:45:58.000000','2026-05-06 20:51:08.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\".NET\", \"API\", \"Data Integration\", \"Database Management\", \"Historian\", \"Integration\", \"Mes\", \"Mobile Apps\", \"SAP\", \"SCADA\", \"Scripting\", \"SQL\", \"Web Services\", \"Workflows\", \"AVEVA System\"]','[\"Opportunity to work with a Fortune 500 company (PepsiCo)&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Exposure to cutting-edge MES platforms&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Competitive compensation&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Professional development with enterprise-grade solutions&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Dynamic and collaborative work environment\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('b49e5acc-87ea-4410-9e5b-08bf64ae37c9','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Business Analyst (Power BI + Excel Analytics)','business-analyst-power-bi-excel-analytics-134-134','&lt;p data-start=&quot;249&quot; data-end=&quot;540&quot;&gt;We are looking for an experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;283&quot; data-end=&quot;303&quot;&gt;Business Analyst&lt;/strong&gt; with strong expertise in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;329&quot; data-end=&quot;381&quot;&gt;Excel analytics, Power BI, and data storytelling&lt;/strong&gt; to support a global team. The ideal candidate will analyze complex datasets, create meaningful dashboards, and present insights that drive business decisions.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;542&quot; data-end=&quot;809&quot;&gt;You will be responsible for building analytical models, validating data quality, and delivering executive-ready presentations with clear recommendations. This role requires a detail-oriented mindset, strong communication skills, and a passion for continuous learning.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;hr data-start=&quot;811&quot; data-end=&quot;814&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;816&quot; data-end=&quot;846&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;819&quot; data-end=&quot;846&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;847&quot; data-end=&quot;1388&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;847&quot; data-end=&quot;943&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;849&quot; data-end=&quot;943&quot;&gt;Develop, automate, and maintain &lt;strong data-start=&quot;881&quot; data-end=&quot;906&quot;&gt;advanced Excel models&lt;/strong&gt; for recurring and ad-hoc analyses.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;944&quot; data-end=&quot;1045&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;946&quot; data-end=&quot;1045&quot;&gt;Build interactive &lt;strong data-start=&quot;964&quot; data-end=&quot;987&quot;&gt;Power BI dashboards&lt;/strong&gt; using DAX, M queries, and visualization best practices.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1046&quot; data-end=&quot;1138&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1048&quot; data-end=&quot;1138&quot;&gt;Perform &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1056&quot; data-end=&quot;1106&quot;&gt;data profiling, validation, and reconciliation&lt;/strong&gt; across multiple data sources.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1139&quot; data-end=&quot;1221&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1141&quot; data-end=&quot;1221&quot;&gt;Create &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1148&quot; data-end=&quot;1186&quot;&gt;insightful and concise PPT reports&lt;/strong&gt; for leadership and stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1222&quot; data-end=&quot;1297&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1224&quot; data-end=&quot;1297&quot;&gt;Interpret business problems and convert them into analytical solutions.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1298&quot; data-end=&quot;1388&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1300&quot; data-end=&quot;1388&quot;&gt;Continuously upgrade skills in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1331&quot; data-end=&quot;1385&quot;&gt;BI tools, data visualization, and domain knowledge&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Full-time','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-19 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-11-21 06:25:49.000000','2025-11-21 06:25:49.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Advanced Excel\", \"Data Quality\", \"Pivot Tables\", \"Power BI\", \"Reconciliation\", \"Power Query\", \"DAX\", \"PPT Dashboards\"]',