uot;216&quot; data-end=&quot;248&quot;&gt;Senior Application Architect&lt;/strong&gt; to lead the design and implementation of &lt;strong data-start=&quot;290&quot; data-end=&quot;345&quot;&gt;event-driven IoT data synchronization architectures&lt;/strong&gt;. This role focuses on migrating existing solutions from &lt;strong data-start=&quot;402&quot; data-end=&quot;434&quot;&gt;Azure to AWS-native services&lt;/strong&gt;, implementing &lt;strong data-start=&quot;449&quot; data-end=&quot;495&quot;&gt;serverless and containerized architectures&lt;/strong&gt;, and modernizing infrastructure across &lt;strong data-start=&quot;535&quot; data-end=&quot;566&quot;&gt;cloud and edge environments&lt;/strong&gt;. The ideal candidate will have deep expertise in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;616&quot; data-end=&quot;686&quot;&gt;AWS services, infrastructure as code, and multi-region deployments&lt;/strong&gt;, and will provide technical leadership across all stages of architecture design and implementation.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;hr data-start=&quot;788&quot; data-end=&quot;791&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;793&quot; data-end=&quot;824&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;798&quot; data-end=&quot;822&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;825&quot; data-end=&quot;1522&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;825&quot; data-end=&quot;910&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;827&quot; data-end=&quot;910&quot;&gt;Lead architecture design for &lt;strong data-start=&quot;856&quot; data-end=&quot;897&quot;&gt;event-driven IoT data synchronization&lt;/strong&gt; solutions.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;911&quot; data-end=&quot;1020&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;913&quot; data-end=&quot;1020&quot;&gt;Drive &lt;strong data-start=&quot;919&quot; data-end=&quot;966&quot;&gt;migration from Azure to AWS-native services&lt;/strong&gt; such as AppSync, Aurora PostgreSQL, Step Functions.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data