n&lt;li data-start=&quot;585&quot; data-end=&quot;643&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;587&quot; data-end=&quot;643&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;587&quot; data-end=&quot;619&quot;&gt;Health and Wellness Programs&lt;/strong&gt; as per company policy&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('b5d9a561-64c5-48f7-a081-35e06550c010','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Senior Java Developer','senior-java-developer-133-133','&lt;p data-start=&quot;203&quot; data-end=&quot;665&quot;&gt;A top global MNC is hiring experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;242&quot; data-end=&quot;261&quot;&gt;Java Developers&lt;/strong&gt; with deep expertise in Java 21+, Spring Boot 3.x, and modern database technologies. In this role, you will design and develop scalable, secure, and high-performance backend services for enterprise applications. The ideal candidate is a strong problem-solver, highly collaborative, and passionate about building future-ready backend systems. Exposure to cloud, containers, and monitoring tools is a plus.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;667&quot; data-end=&quot;789&quot;&gt;This is a great opportunity to work on challenging global projects, modern architectures, and cutting-edge backend stacks.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;hr data-start=&quot;791&quot; data-end=&quot;794&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;796&quot; data-end=&quot;825&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;799&quot; data-end=&quot;825&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;826&quot; data-end=&quot;1598&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;826&quot; data-end=&quot;913&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;828&quot; data-end=&quot;913&quot;&gt;Develop and enhance backend applications using &lt;strong data-start=&quot;875&quot; data-end=&quot;887&quot;&gt;Java 21+&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong data-start=&quot;892&quot; data-end=&quot;911&quot;&gt;Spring Boot 3.x&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;914&quot; data-end=&quot;960&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;916&quot; data-end=&quot;960&quot;&gt;Build scalable microservices and REST APIs&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;961&quot; data-end=&quot;1036&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;963&quot; data-end=&quot;1036&quot;&gt;Work with relational and NoSQL databases (&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1005&quot; data-end=&quot;1033&quot;&gt;SQL, PostgreSQL, MongoDB&lt;/strong&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1037&quot; data-end=&quot;1097&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1039&quot; data-end=&quot;1097&quot;&gt;Implement efficient, secure, and optimized backend logic&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1098&quot; data-end=&quot;1187&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1100&quot; data-end=&quot;1187&quot;&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional teams for requirement gathering and solution design&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1188&quot; data-end=&quot;1236&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1190&quot; data-end=&quot;1236&quot;&gt;Write clean, maintainable, and testable code&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1237&quot; data-end=&quot;1297&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1239&quot; data-end=&quot;1297&quot;&gt;Perform unit testing, integration testing, and debugging&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1298&quot; data-end=&quot;1355&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1300&quot; data-end=&quot;1355&quot;&gt;Work with CI/CD pipelines and Agile/Scrum methodology&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1356&quot; data-end=&quot;1444&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1358&quot; data-end=&quot;1444&quot;&gt;(Optional) Utilize monitoring &amp;amp; observability tools like &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1415&quot; data-end=&quot;1442&quot;&gt;Grafana / OpenTelemetry&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1445&quot; data-end=&quot;1510&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1447&quot; data-end=&quot;1510&quot;&gt;(Optional) Deploy services using &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1480&quot; data-end=&quot;1508&quot;&gt;Kubernetes &amp;amp; Azure Cloud&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1511&quot; data-end=&quot;1598&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1513&quot; data-end=&quot;1598&quot;&gt;Participate in architecture discussions and contribute to technical decision-making&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Full-time','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Pune',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-19 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-11-21 06:16:10.000000','2025-11-21 06:16:10.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Azure\", \"Cloud\", \"Git\", \"Grafana\", \"Java 8+\", \"Kubernetes\", \"Microservices\", \"Mongo DB\", \"OOPS\", \"PostgreSQL\", \"RESTFUL APIS\", \"Springboot Microservices\", \"SQL\", \"CI/CD\", \"OpenTelemetry\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2185&quot; data-end=&quot;2248&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2187&quot; data-end=&quot;2248&quot;&gt;Work with a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2199&quot; data-end=&quot;2217&quot;&gt;Top Global MNC&lt;/strong&gt; on enterprise-grade projects&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2249&quot; data-end=&quot;2311&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2251&quot; data-end=&quot;2311&quot;&gt;Opportunity to build modern, scalable backend applications&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2312&quot; data-end=&quot;2375&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2314&quot; data-end=&quot;2375&quot;&gt;Exposure to cloud-native technologies &amp;amp; observability tools&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2376&quot; data-end=&quot;2439&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2378&quot; data-end=&quot;2439&quot;&gt;Excellent career growth and skill enhancement opportunities&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2440&quot; data-end=&quot;2487&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2442&quot; data-end=&quot;2487&quot;&gt;Collaborative and innovation-driven culture&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2488&quot; data-end=&quot;2544&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2490&quot; data-end=&quot;2544&quot;&gt;Competitive compensation &amp;amp; performance-based rewards&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2545&quot; data-end=&quot;2604&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2547&quot; data-end=&quot;2604&quot;&gt;Long-term project stability and global team interaction&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Maharashtra'),('b6106dd5-84d5-4c6c-93db-e63d9809a0b6','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','IoT Specialist (Senior / Medior / Junior)','iot-specialist-senior-medior-junior-288-288','&lt;p data-start=&quot;83&quot; data-end=&quot;410&quot;&gt;We are hiring IoT Specialists for a leading Top MNC to work on next-generation connected systems, Industrial IoT solutions, and digital transformation initiatives. We are looking for professionals across Junior, Medior, and Senior levels who are passionate about designing, implementing, and managing innovative IoT ecosystems.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;412&quot; data-end=&quot;745&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for designing and deploying IoT solutions, integrating connected devices, and developing scalable architectures for industrial and enterprise environments. The role includes working on device connectivity, edge computing, data streaming, real-time analytics, and end-to-end IoT lifecycle management.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;747&quot; data-end=&quot;1049&quot;&gt;Professionals should have strong experience in IoT architecture, industrial communication protocols, connected device management, and data-driven solutions. The role requires collaboration with engineering, operations, cloud, and analytics teams to deliver secure, scalable, and reliable IoT platforms.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1051&quot; data-end=&quot;1361&quot;&gt;The selected candidate will also support deployment activities, monitor system performance, troubleshoot connectivity issues, and contribute to continuous improvement of IoT infrastructures. Strong analytical thinking, problem-solving abilities, and communication skills are essential for success in this role.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-08-08 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-06-10 02:10:52.000000','2026-06-10 02:10:52.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Data Correction\", \"Troubleshooting\", \"Edge Connectivity\", \"IoT Solution Design\", \"IoT Deployment\", \"IoT Architecture\", \"Industrial IoT (IIoT)\", \"Industrial IoT Protocols\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1377&quot; data-end=&quot;1415&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;pgd3ap&quot; data-start=&quot;1416&quot; data-end=&quot;1470&quot;&gt;Exposure to advanced IoT and Industry 4.0 projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;19km3g7&quot; data-start=&quot;1471&quot; data-end=&quot;1525&quot;&gt;Work on cutting-edge connected device technologies&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;bv78a4&quot; data-start=&quot;1526&quot; data-end=&quot;1593&quot;&gt;Career growth in IoT, Cloud, and Digital Transformation domains&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1a77kja&quot; data-start=&quot;1594&quot; data-end=&quot;1654&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global engineering teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot; data-start=&quot;1655&quot; data-end=&quot;1710&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;1711&quot; data-end=&quot;1754&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('b61df815-bcf8-43c8-a809-52efe036d712','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Senior AI Engineer – GenAI / Machine Learning','senior-ai-engineer-genai-machine-learning-368-368','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;83&quot; data-end=&quot;322&quot;&gt;We are hiring an experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;112&quot; data-end=&quot;134&quot;&gt;Senior AI Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; for a leading MNC to design and develop enterprise-grade &lt;strong data-start=&quot;192&quot; data-end=&quot;252&quot;&gt;Generative AI, Machine Learning, and RAG-based solutions&lt;/strong&gt; focused on intelligent incident management and enterprise operations.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;324&quot; data-end=&quot;537&quot;&gt;The ideal candidate should have strong hands-on expertise in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;385&quot; data-end=&quot;536&quot;&gt;Azure OpenAI, Generative AI, Machine Learning, RAG Architecture, Python, LangChain / Semantic Kernel, Vector Databases, and enterprise integrations&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;539&quot; data-end=&quot;832&quot;&gt;The role involves designing AI architecture and model strategies, developing intelligent recommendation engines, building incident similarity and matching solutions, implementing root-cause classification models, and integrating AI capabilities with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;789&quot; data-end=&quot;831&quot;&gt;ServiceNow and observability platforms&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;834&quot; data-end=&quot;1021&quot;&gt;This is an excellent opportunity for senior AI professionals looking to work on &lt;strong data-start=&quot;914&quot; data-end=&quot;1020&quot;&gt;enterprise-scale GenAI, intelligent automation, AI agents, and next-generation IT operations solutions&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Entry',NU