uot;&gt;Health insurance coverage and statutory benefits (PF &amp;amp; Gratuity)&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;134&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;136&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on large-scale enterprise energy management projects&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;211&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;213&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;Strong career growth and learning opportunities&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;263&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;265&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;Collaborative and professional work environment&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('b71127e9-0ff7-45b7-8418-e4ef365bb0d4','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','KMC – Process Engineering Lead','kmc-process-engineering-lead-152-152','&lt;p data-start=&quot;261&quot; data-end=&quot;843&quot;&gt;The &lt;strong data-start=&quot;265&quot; data-end=&quot;293&quot;&gt;Process Engineering Lead&lt;/strong&gt; will be responsible for driving plant engineering initiatives, collaborating with global and regional teams, developing engineering standards, and supporting digital transformation across process plants. The role involves interpreting engineering drawings, preparing process engineering documents, performing process calculations, and identifying opportunities for improvement through technology-driven solutions. The candidate will work closely with cross-functional teams to standardize engineering procedures and support overall project delivery.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;1894&quot; data-end=&quot;1923&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1899&quot; data-end=&quot;1923&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;ol data-start=&quot;1924&quot; data-end=&quot;2554&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1924&quot; data-end=&quot;2014&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1927&quot; data-end=&quot;2014&quot;&gt;Collaborate with global technology leads and regional teams for standard development.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2015&quot; data-end=&quot;2092&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2018&quot; data-end=&quot;2092&quot;&gt;Support plant teams in creating engineering standards and documentation.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2093&quot; data-end=&quot;2205&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2096&quot; data-end=&quot;2205&quot;&gt;Work with project delivery teams to gather essential engineering inputs such as PFDs, layouts, quotes, etc.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2206&quot; data-end=&quot;2297&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2209&quot; data-end=&quot;2297&quot;&gt;Identify opportunities for process and operational improvement using new technologies.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2298&quot; data-end=&quot;2382&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2301&quot; data-end=&quot;2382&quot;&gt;Explore latest engineering and digital trends to identify applicable use cases.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2383&quot; data-end=&quot;2476&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2386&quot; data-end=&quot;2476&quot;&gt;Develop global engineering standards in collaboration with regional/plant digital teams.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2477&quot; data-end=&quot;2554&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2480&quot; data-end=&quot;2554&quot;&gt;Communicate progress and updates of digital initiatives to stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ol&gt;','Information Technology','Full-time','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Chennai',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-26 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-11-28 02:04:01.000000','2025-11-28 02:05:11.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"A