0&quot; data-end=&quot;337&quot;&gt;We are looking for an experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;134&quot; data-end=&quot;200&quot;&gt;DELMIA Quintiq Software Expert (SwE) / Quintiq Specialist (QS)&lt;/strong&gt; to join a leading Top MNC and work on enterprise-level &lt;strong data-start=&quot;256&quot; data-end=&quot;327&quot;&gt;Quintiq planning, scheduling, modeling, integration, and deployment&lt;/strong&gt; projects.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;339&quot; data-end=&quot;580&quot;&gt;The ideal candidate should have a strong background in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;394&quot; data-end=&quot;443&quot;&gt;DELMIA Quintiq development and implementation&lt;/strong&gt;, with hands-on experience in complex modeling, architecture, troubleshooting, performance optimization, and end-to-end project delivery.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;582&quot; data-end=&quot;831&quot;&gt;The candidate will take ownership of Quintiq modeling activities, resolve complex technical and performance challenges, and collaborate closely with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;731&quot; data-end=&quot;830&quot;&gt;business consultants, customers, suppliers, project managers, and global cross-functional teams&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;18w7bso&quot; data-start=&quot;833&quot; data-end=&quot;856&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;858&quot; data-end=&quot;1958&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;693s5e&quot; data-start=&quot;858&quot; data-end=&quot;932&quot;&gt;Own end-to-end &lt;strong data-start=&quot;875&quot; data-end=&quot;906&quot;&gt;Quintiq modeling activities&lt;/strong&gt; and project deliverables.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;sfskk8&quot; data-start=&quot;933&quot; data-end=&quot;1006&quot;&gt;Design, develop, configure, and implement &lt;strong data-start=&quot;977&quot; data-end=&quot;1005&quot;&gt;DELMIA Quintiq solutions&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;g4biow&quot; data-start=&quot;1007&quot; data-end=&quot;1077&quot;&gt;Work on complex Quintiq models and planning/scheduling requirements.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ozftpy&quot; data-start=&quot;1078&quot; data-end=&quot;1144&quot;&gt;Perform Quintiq integration, deployment, and release activities.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1t75q1d&quot; data-start=&quot;1145&quot; data-end=&quot;1219&quot;&gt;Analyze and resolve complex modeling and application performance issues.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1e1mqrc&quot; data-start=&quot;1220&quot; data-end=&quot;1309&quot;&gt;Use &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1226&quot; data-end=&quot;1284&quot;&gt;Quintiq Profiler and performance troubleshooting tools&lt;/strong&gt; to identify bottlenecks.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;qi027f&quot; data-start=&quot;1310&quot; data-end=&quot;1382&quot;&gt;Optimize Quintiq models for performance, scalability, and reliability.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-27 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-08-29 00:32:33.000000','2026-08-29 00:32:33.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Agile Methodology\", \"Quintiq\", \"DELMIA Quintiq\", \"Quintiq Macro Planner\", \"Quintiq Company Planner\", \"Quintiq Demand Planner\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1nc4xd1&quot; data-start=&quot;1973&quot; data-end=&quot;2051&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2002&quot; data-end=&quot;2013&quot;&gt;Top MNC&lt;/strong&gt; on enterprise-scale Quintiq projects.&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1xmha9r&quot; data-start=&quot;2052&quot; data-end=&quot;2142&quot;&gt;Exposure to complex &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2074&quot; data-end=&quot;2141&quot;&gt;planning, scheduling, optimization, and manufacturing solutions&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;84px3f&quot; data-start=&quot;2143&quot; data-end=&quot;2197&quot;&gt;Work with global customers and cross-cultural teams.&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1yr2wa2&quot; data-start=&quot;2198&quot; data-end=&quot;2279&quot;&gt;Opportunity to solve challenging &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2233&quot; data-end=&quot;2278&quot;&gt;Quintiq modeling and performance problems&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1p7x0va&quot; data-start=&quot;2280&quot; data-end=&quot;2353&quot;&gt;Exposure to advanced Quintiq architecture, integration, and deployment.&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;ura13i&quot; data-start=&quot;2354&quot; data-end=&quot;2449&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with business consultants, technical experts, and project leaders.&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('b82b03f2-11de-4091-a0fb-cc863087e3bf','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Senior DELMIA Apriso Developer','senior-delmia-apriso-developer-344-344','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;72&quot; data-end=&quot;476&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;98&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;Senior DELMIA Apriso Developers&lt;/strong&gt; for a leading Top MNC to support enterprise-scale Manufacturing Execution System (MES), Apriso Version Upgrade, and Digital Manufacturing transformation initiatives. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in Dassault Syst&amp;egrave;mes DELMIA Apriso MES, application development, enterprise integrations, and manufacturing process automation.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;478&quot; data-end=&quot;972&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for developing, upgrading, configuring, and supporting DELMIA Apriso MES solutions across global manufacturing environments. The role includes leading Apriso version upgrade projects (FlexNet 9.6 to Apriso 2024), designing manufacturing workflows, developing custom solutions using Apriso Process Builder and Screen Framework, implementing enterprise integrations, optimizing application performance, and providing HyperCare support during production rollouts.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;974&quot; data-end=&quot;1472&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with DELMIA Apriso, Apriso Process Builder, Screen Framework, HTML, CSS, JavaScript, AJAX, .NET, SQL Server, T-SQL, Stored Procedures, machine integration, business integration, ERP integration, OPC integration, GPM deployment, release management, archiving solutions, and MES implementation. Strong understanding of manufacturing processes, complex assembly operations, SDLC, source control, and enterprise application development is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1474&quot; data-end=&quot;1966&quot;&gt;The role also involves collaborating with business stakeholders, manufacturing teams, automation engineers, architects, and global delivery teams to gather requirements, design scalable MES solutions, mentor development teams, conduct code reviews, prepare technical documentation, and ensure successful project delivery. Candidates should possess strong leadership, communication, stakeholder management, analytical, and problem-solving skills with experience managing small technical teams.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-09-15 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-07-18 03:16:04.000000','2026-07-18 03:16:04.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\".NET\", \"AJAX\", \"Azure DevOps\", \"CSS3\", \"Delmia Apriso\", \"ERP\", \"GPM Deployment\", \"HTML5\", \"JavaScript\", \"Mes\", \"Microsoft SQL Server\", \"MYSQL\", \"Transact-SQL\", \"OPC UA\", \"Machine Integrator\", \"Dassault DELMIA Apriso MES\", \"FlexNet\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1982&quot; data-end=&quot;2020&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;di3z59&quot; data-start=&quot;2021&quot; data-end=&quot;2115&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale MES upgrade and Digital Manufacturing transformation projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;13xzwaj&quot; data-start=&quot;2116&quot; data-end=&quot;2195&quot;&gt;Work on the latest DELMIA Apriso 2024 platform and Industry 4.0 initiatives&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;13ica1w&quot; data-start=&quot;2196&quot; data-end=&quot;2285&quot;&gt;Career growth in Manufacturing Execution Systems (MES) and Smart Factory technologies&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;13qji02&quot; data-start=&quot;2286&quot; data-end=&quot;2363&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global manufacturing and technology teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot; data-start=&quot;2364&quot; data-end=&quot;2419&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;2420&quot; data-end=&quot;2463&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('b84923cf-fa4e-47c8-81c9-369795bdc492','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Gen AI Engineer','gen-ai-engineer-282-282','&lt;p data-start=&quot;57&quot; data-end=&quot;390&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced Gen AI Engineers for a leading Top MNC to work on advanced Generative AI, Agentic AI, Azure Cloud, and IoT-based enterprise solutions. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in designing scalable AI systems, cloud-native application development, and AI model optimization using Azure technologies.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;392&quot; data-end=&quot;706&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for developing, implementing, and optimizing Generative AI and Agentic AI solutions for enterprise applications. The role includes building AI-powered cloud-native systems, integrating IoT architectures, and working with Azure services to deliver scalable and secure AI platforms.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;708&quot; data-end=&quot;999&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with Azure ML, Azure IoT Hub, Azure PaaS services, Docker, Kubernetes, Azure DevOps, and microservices architecture. Strong knowledge of AI model optimization, event-driven systems, stream analytics, and cloud infrastructure is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1001&quot; data-end=&quot;1321&quot;&gt;The role also involves troubleshooting AI applications, improving model performance, researching emerging AI technologies, and collaborating with cross-functional technical teams to deliver enterprise-grade AI solutions. Candidates should possess strong analytical, problem-solving, communication, and innovation skills.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Mumbai',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-07-20 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-05-22 02:45:42.000000','2026-05-22 02:45:42.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"ASP.NET MVC\", \"Azure DevOps\", \"C#\", \"Docker\", \"Event Hubs\", \"Java\", \"Kubernetes\", \"Generative AI\", \"Azure IoT\", \"Azure ML\", \"IoT Data Pipelines\", \"Agentic AI\", \"Azure PaaS Services\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1337&quot; data-end=&quot;1375&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;fuqgpg&quot; data-start=&quot;1376&quot; data-end=&quot;1431&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-level Generative AI projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;3a6wcu&quot; data-start=&quot;1432&quot; data-end=&quot;1492&quot;&gt;Work on advanced Agentic AI and Azure Cloud technologies&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ln62jh&quot; data-start=&quot;1493&quot; data-end=&quot;1536&quot;&gt;Career growth in AI, Cloud &amp;amp; IoT domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1q9unrw&quot; data-start=&quot;1537&quot; data-end=&quot;1595&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global technical teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot; data-start=&quot;1596&quot; data-end=&quot;1651&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;1652&quot; data-end=&quot;1695&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Maharashtra'),('b87bcf9a-dab4-4aa1-a779-74f4768b2110','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','LabVantage Support Engineer','labvantage-support-engineer-301-301','&lt;p data-start=&quot;69&quot; data-end=&quot;408&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced LabVantage Support Engineers for a leading Top MNC to support enterprise laboratory systems, LIMS applications, and global laboratory operations. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in LabVantage LIMS, application support, production support, troubleshooting, and laboratory informatics environments.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;410&quot; data-end=&quot;765&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for providing development, maintenance, and support services for LabVantage LIMS applications across global laboratory operations. The role includes handling production incidents, supporting HyperCare activities, managing platform upgrades and migrations, and ensuring the stability and performance of laboratory systems.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;767&quot; data-end=&quot;1111&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with LabVantage development, LIMS production support, master data management, change management processes, and troubleshooting complex application issues. Strong understanding of laboratory workflows, ITIL processes, ServiceNow ticket management, and service delivery practices is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1113&quot; data-end=&quot;1493&quot;&gt;The role also involves handling L2/L3 support incidents, validating new functionalities, supporting system enhancements, collaborating with global teams, and ensuring adherence to service level agreements (SLAs). Candidates should possess excellent analytical, communication, stakeholder management, and problem-solving skills to support business-critical laboratory applications.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-08-22 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-06-24 03:05:58.000000','2026-06-24 03:05:58.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Change Management\", \"ITIL\", \"ServiceNow\", \"SLA Management\", \"LabVantage\", \"LabVantage LIMS\", \"L2/L3 Support\", \"LabVantage Application Support\", \"LIMS Production Support\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1509&quot; data-end=&quot;1547&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;16i2l48&quot; data-start=&quot;1548&quot; data-end=&quot;1611&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale laboratory informatics systems&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;juga9v&quot; data-start=&quot;1612&quot; data-end=&quot;1679&quot;&gt;Work on global LabVantage LIMS support and enhancement projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;4qpkz8&quot; data-start=&quot;1680&quot; data-end=&quot;1733&quot;&gt;Career growth in LIMS &amp;amp; Laboratory Systems domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1jyhyty&quot; data-start=&quot;1734&quot; data-end=&quot;1806&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with international teams and stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1474nug&quot; data-start=&quot;1807&quot; data-end=&quot;1861&quot;&gt;Professional and customer-focused work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;1862&quot; data-end=&quot;1905&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('b8d8a0f6-ba53-4e0a-819b-5b0e1b534f20','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','CSV Engineer – MES Systems (Emerson Syncade Preferred)','csv-engineer-mes-systems-emerson-syncade-preferred-159-159','&lt;p data-start=&quot;300&quot; data-end=&quot;696&quot;&gt;We are seeking an experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;330&quot; data-end=&quot;383&quot;&gt;CSV Engineer with strong MES validation expertise&lt;/strong&gt; to support system validation, documentation, and quality compliance activities in a regulated manufacturing environment. The ideal candidate will lead validation deliverables, execute UAT, and ensure regulatory compliance across MES implementations&amp;mdash;preferably with hands-on experience in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;672&quot; data-end=&quot;695&quot;&gt;Emerson Syncade MES&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;698&quot; data-end=&quot;880&quot;&gt;This role requires strong collaboration with business, IT, and quality stakeholders to deliver audit-ready, validated MES solutions aligned with operational and regulatory standards.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;hr data-start=&quot;882&quot; data-end=&quot;885&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;887&quot; data-end=&quot;916&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;892&quot; data-end=&quot;916&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;918&quot; data-end=&quot;957&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Computer System Validation (CSV)&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;958&quot; data-end=&quot;1322&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;958&quot; data-end=&quot;1114&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;960&quot; data-end=&quot;1024&quot;&gt;Develop, review, and maintain validation deliverables including:&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1027&quot; data-end=&quot;1114&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1027&quot; data-end=&quot;1043&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1029&quot; data-end=&quot;1043&quot;&gt;Test scripts&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1046&quot; data-end=&quot;1070&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1048&quot; data-end=&quot;1070&quot;&gt;Validation protocols&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1073&quot; data-end=&quot;1114&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1075&quot; data-end=&quot;1114&quot;&gt;System Life Cycle (SLC) documentation&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1115&quot; data-end=&quot;1180&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1117&quot; data-end=&quot;1180&quot;&gt;Execute &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1125&quot; data-end=&quot;1158&quot;&gt;User Acceptance Testing (UAT)&lt;/strong&gt; and document results.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1181&quot; data-end=&quot;1269&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1183&quot; data-end=&quot;1269&quot;&gt;Support &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1191&quot; data-end=&quot;1209&quot;&gt;Change Control&lt;/strong&gt; activities by assessing impacts and updating documentation.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1270&quot; data-end=&quot;1322&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1272&quot; data-end=&quot;1322&quot;&gt;Ensure complete traceability and audit compliance.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;1324&quot; data-end=&quot;1351&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;MES System Expertise&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1352&quot; data-end=&quot;1606&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1352&quot; data-end=&quot;1416&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1354&quot; data-end=&quot;1416&quot;&gt;Work extensively on &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1374&quot; data-end=&quot;1415&quot;&gt;Manufacturing Execution Systems (MES)&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1417&quot; data-end=&quot;1526&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1419&quot; data-end=&quot;1466&quot;&gt;Strong exposure to &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1438&quot; data-end=&quot;1461&quot;&gt;Emerson Syncade MES&lt;/strong&gt; for:&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1469&quot; data-end=&quot;1526&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1469&quot; data-end=&quot;1489&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1471&quot; data-end=&quot;1489&quot;&gt;Recipe authoring&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1492&quot; data-end=&quot;1509&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1494&quot; data-end=&quot;1509&quot;&gt;Configuration&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1512&quot; data-end=&quot;1526&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1514&quot; data-end=&quot;1526&quot;&gt;Validation&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1527&quot; data-end=&quot;1606&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1529&quot; data-end=&quot;1606&quot;&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional teams to design and validate MES solutions.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;1608&quot; data-end=&quot;1645&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Compliance &amp;amp; Quality Assurance&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1646&quot; data-end=&quot;1782&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1646&quot; data-end=&quot;1726&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1648&quot; data-end=&quot;1668&quot;&gt;Ensure adherence to:&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1671&quot; data-end=&quot;1726&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1671&quot; data-end=&quot;1680&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1673&quot; data-end=&quot;1680&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1673&quot; data-end=&quot;1680&quot;&gt;GxP&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1683&quot; data-end=&quot;1692&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1685&quot; data-end=&quot;1692&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1685&quot; data-end=&quot;1692&quot;&gt;FDA&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1695&quot; data-end=&quot;1726&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1697&quot; data-end=&quot;1726&quot;&gt;Other regulatory guidelines&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1727&quot; data-end=&quot;1782&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1729&quot; data-end=&quot;1782&quot;&gt;Maintain inspection-ready documentation at all times.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;1784&quot; data-end=&quot;1821&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Cross-Functional Collaboration&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1822&quot; data-end=&quot;1972&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1822&quot; data-end=&quot;1899&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1824&quot; data-end=&quot;1899&quot;&gt;Work with global IT teams, site representatives, and business stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1900&quot; data-end=&quot;1972&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1902&quot; data-end=&quot;1972&quot;&gt;Participate in process discussions and provide MES technical guidance.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;1974&quot; data-end=&quot;2013&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Leadership &amp;amp; Managerial Skillset&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2014&quot; data-end=&quot;2151&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2014&quot; data-end=&quot;2092&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2016&quot; data-end=&quot;2092&quot;&gt;Self-driven professional capable of working independently with stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2093&quot; data-end=&quot;2151&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2095&quot; data-end=&quot;2151&quot;&gt;Mentor and guide team members to develop future leaders.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-02-02 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-12-04 16:15:34.000000','2025-12-04 16:15:34.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"CapIQ\", \"CSV\", \"Mes Validation Processes\", \"OQ\", \"Validation Processes\", \"SLC\", \"User Acceptance Testing (UAT)\", \"Change Control Management\", \"Emerson Syncade MES\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;99&quot; data-end=&quot;154&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;101&quot; data-end=&quot;154&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and performance-based incentives&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;155&quot; data-end=&quot;238&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;157&quot; data-end=&quot;238&quot;&gt;Exposure to large-scale &lt;strong data-start=&quot;181&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;MES &amp;amp; Validation projects&lt;/strong&gt; in regulated environments&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;239&quot; data-end=&quot;317&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;241&quot; data-end=&quot;317&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;266&quot; data-end=&quot;315&quot;&gt;advanced manufacturing and automation systems&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;318&quot; data-end=&quot;397&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;320&quot; data-end=&quot;397&quot;&gt;Strong career growth in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;344&quot; data-end=&quot;395&quot;&gt;CSV, Quality, and Digital Manufacturing domains&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;398&quot; data-end=&quot;443&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;400&quot; data-end=&quot;443&quot;&gt;Onsite and client-facing project exposure&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;444&quot; data-end=&quot;536&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;446&quot; data-end=&quot;536&quot;&gt;Learning &amp;amp; upskilling opportunities on &lt;strong data-start=&quot;485&quot; data-end=&quot;508&quot;&gt;Emerson Syncade MES&lt;/strong&gt; and compliance frameworks&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;537&quot; data-end=&quot;576&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;539&quot; data-end=&quot;576&quot;&gt;Stable long-term project engagement&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;577&quot; data-end=&quot;629&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;579&quot; data-end=&quot;629&quot;&gt;Collaborative work environment with global teams&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;630&quot; data-end=&quot;672&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;632&quot; data-end=&quot;672&quot;&gt;Leadership and mentoring opportunities&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;673&quot; data-end=&quot;728&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;675&quot; data-end=&quot;728&quot;&gt;Work-life balance with structured project schedules&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('b917070f-2c28-4c3f-b707-ec13f081078d','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Oracle SQL Developer','oracle-sql-developer-12-12','Job Description: We are seeking a highly skilled and experienced Oracle SQL Developer with 7+ years of hands-on experience to join our team. The ideal candidate will be responsible for designing, developing, and optimizing Oracle database solutions. You will collaborate with cross-functional teams to develop and maintain complex SQL queries, PL/SQL scripts, and stored procedures, ensuring high performance, data accuracy, and reliability. Key Responsibilities: Design, develop, and optimize Oracle SQL queries, stored procedures, functions, and triggers. Create and maintain PL/SQL scripts for data extraction, transformation, and loading (ETL). Perform database performance tuning and query optimization. Develop and implement complex data models and database structures. Collaborate with application developers to integrate SQL queries with front-end applications. Troubleshoot and resolve database-related issues and bugs. Ensure data integrity, security, and consistency through proper validation and indexing. Design and maintain data migration scripts and routines. Collaborate with data analysts and business stakeholders to understand reporting requirements. Document SQL scripts, data flows, and database architecture. Ensure compliance with best practices and security standards. Required Skills: 7+ years of experience as an Oracle SQL Developer. Strong proficiency in Oracle SQL and PL/SQL programming. Hands-on experience with Oracle Database (11g, 12c, 19c). Expertise in writing complex queries, joins, and subqueries. Experience with performance tuning (SQL profiling, indexing, and query optimization). Proficiency in data modeling and schema design. Hands-on experience with ETL processes and data migration. Strong knowledge of Oracle stored procedures, triggers, and functions. Familiarity with database security practices and data encryption. Experience with version control systems (Git, SVN). Excellent problem-solving and analytical skills.','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',300000.00,600000.00,'₹',1,'India','Mumbai',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-31 06:00:00',0,0,'2025-05-04 18:59:18.000000','2026-05-12 14:51:12.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Microsoft SQL Server\", \"MS SQL Server\", \"MYSQL\", \"Oracle\", \"PL/SQL\"]','[\"Perks &amp;amp; Benefits: Competitive salary package Career growth opportunities Comprehensive health insurance Hybrid work model Performance-based incentives Learning and development programs\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Maharashtra'),('b91aeff3-169a-4d20-bf8b-fe5b7cf8ff5f','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Azure Cloud Developer','azure-cloud-developer-226-226','Skilled Azure Cloud &amp;amp; Python Developer with hands-on experience in Azure App Service, Datafactory, Azure Web Application, Azure DevOps, VueJs for frontend, FastAPI for backend development, API management, and troubleshooting. The ideal candidate should be proficient in maintaining backend services along with in-depth understanding of Microsoft Azure services to support integration and deployment needs.','Information Technology','Contract','Entry',NULL,NULL,'INR',1,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-05-25 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-03-26 20:20:07.000000','2026-03-26 20:20:07.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Azure\", \"Azure  CLI\", \"Azure  Security\", \"Azure  Storage\", \"Azure Cloud Networking\", \"Data and Analytics\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;Competitive salary package with performance-based incentives&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;65&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;67&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;Health insurance coverage and statutory benefits (PF &amp;amp; Gratuity)&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;134&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;136&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on large-scale enterprise energy management projects&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;211&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;213&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;Strong career growth and learning opportunities&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;263&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;265&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;Collaborative and professional work environment&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('b9453d10-de3a-4d6b-b316-ca88a2cea2df','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Critical Manufacturing MES Developer / Lead','critical-manufacturing-mes-developer-lead-362-362','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;245&quot; data-end=&quot;458&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;271&quot; data-end=&quot;320&quot;&gt;Critical Manufacturing MES Developers / Leads&lt;/strong&gt; for a leading Top MNC to work on large-scale &lt;strong data-start=&quot;366&quot; data-end=&quot;448&quot;&gt;Manufacturing Execution System (MES), Digital Manufacturing, and Smart Factory&lt;/strong&gt; projects.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;460&quot; data-end=&quot;693&quot;&gt;The ideal candidate should have strong hands-on experience in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;522&quot; data-end=&quot;582&quot;&gt;Critical Manufacturing MES development and customization&lt;/strong&gt;, along with expertise in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;608&quot; data-end=&quot;692&quot;&gt;C#, .NET, SQL Server, Angular, TypeScript, RxJS/NGRX, CI/CD, and MES integration&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;695&quot; data-end=&quot;995&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for developing and customizing &lt;strong data-start=&quot;760&quot; data-end=&quot;800&quot;&gt;Critical Manufacturing MES solutions&lt;/strong&gt;, performing frontend and backend enhancements, supporting MES implementation and integration activities, and working closely with manufacturing and technical teams to deliver scalable solutions.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;997&quot; data-end=&quot;1228&quot;&gt;The role involves participating in Agile/Scrum activities, understanding customer requirements, troubleshooting complex MES issues, implementing technical solutions, and taking ownership of assigned deliverables through to closure.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1230&quot; data-end=&quot;1490&quot;&gt;Professionals with experience in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1263&quot; data-end=&quot;1386&quot;&gt;MES migration, upgrades, OOB MES features, custom solution design, manufacturing processes, and shop-floor applications&lt;/strong&gt; will be highly preferred. Technical Lead or Technical Architect experience would be an added advantage.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-18 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-08-20 03:27:53.000000','2026-08-20 03:27:53.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\".NET\", \"Agile\", \"Angular\", \"C#\", \"Mes\", \"Mes Configuration\", \"Mes ERP Integration\", \"Mes Implementation\", \"MS SQL Server\", \"Typescript\", \"Scrum Master\", \"CI/CD\", \"RxJs\", \"NgRx\", \"Critical Manufacturing\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;i3mxm7&quot; data-start=&quot;1505&quot; data-end=&quot;1549&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a leading Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1y56mc6&quot; data-start=&quot;1550&quot; data-end=&quot;1620&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1581&quot; data-end=&quot;1611&quot;&gt;Critical Manufacturing MES&lt;/strong&gt; projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;fxdou0&quot; data-start=&quot;1621&quot; data-end=&quot;1694&quot;&gt;Work on advanced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1640&quot; data-end=&quot;1682&quot;&gt;Digital Manufacturing and Industry 4.0&lt;/strong&gt; initiatives&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1adk8pt&quot; data-start=&quot;1695&quot; data-end=&quot;1763&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with global manufacturing and technology teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;atuics&quot; data-start=&quot;1764&quot; data-end=&quot;1835&quot;&gt;Exposure to MES implementation, migration, upgrades, and integrations&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1c8chuf&quot; data-start=&quot;1836&quot; data-end=&quot;1926&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with modern technologies including &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1893&quot; data-end=&quot;1926&quot;&gt;.NET, Angular, SQL, and CI/CD&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1dteob1&quot; data-start=&quot;1927&quot; data-end=&quot;1977&quot;&gt;Strong technical and domain growth opportunities&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;121z81&quot; data-start=&quot;1978&quot; data-end=&quot;2043&quot;&gt;Exposure to manufacturing and shop-floor digital transformation&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1efv9fm&quot; data-start=&quot;2044&quot; data-end=&quot;2125&quot;&gt;Opportunity to take ownership of complex MES solutions and technical challenges&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1922k2h&quot; data-start=&quot;2126&quot; data-end=&quot;2194&quot;&gt;Career growth toward &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2149&quot; data-end=&quot;2188&quot;&gt;Technical Lead / Solution Architect&lt;/strong&gt; roles&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('b9649ba8-1287-47cc-ad36-f1e3f890c420','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Responsible AI Engineer','responsible-ai-engineer-302-302','&lt;p data-start=&quot;65&quot; data-end=&quot;410&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced Responsible AI Engineers for a leading Top MNC to work on enterprise-scale AI Governance, Responsible AI, Risk Management, and Compliance initiatives. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in AI governance frameworks, ethical AI practices, risk assessment, regulatory compliance, and AI lifecycle management.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;412&quot; data-end=&quot;791&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for evaluating AI and Generative AI solutions to ensure compliance with organizational governance standards, regulatory requirements, and ethical AI principles. The role includes assessing AI applications for privacy, fairness, explainability, transparency, security, and operational risks while supporting enterprise AI transformation programs.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;793&quot; data-end=&quot;1091&quot;&gt;Professionals should have experience in AI governance, technology risk management, compliance processes, and Responsible AI assessments. Strong understanding of AI risk classification frameworks, bias detection, privacy controls, governance reviews, and AI lifecycle management is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1093&quot; data-end=&quot;1511&quot;&gt;The role also involves collaborating with Data Science, Product, Engineering, Legal, Risk, and Compliance teams to establish governance processes, conduct Responsible AI review forums, prepare assessment reports, and recommend mitigation strategies. Candidates should possess excellent analytical, communication, stakeholder management, and problem-solving skills with a passion for ethical and trustworthy AI systems.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-08-22 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-06-24 03:16:21.000000','2026-06-24 03:16:21.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Generative AI\", \"LLM Fine-tuning\", \"Data Lineage\", \"Responsible AI\", \"AI Governance\", \"AI Risk Assessment\", \"Ethical AI Frameworks\", \"Explainable AI (XAI)\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1527&quot; data-end=&quot;1565&quot; data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1566&quot; data-end=&quot;1624&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1qhk4dl&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale AI Governance initiatives&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1625&quot; data-end=&quot;1691&quot; data-section-id=&quot;qan40c&quot;&gt;Work on cutting-edge Responsible AI and Generative AI programs&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1692&quot; data-end=&quot;1751&quot; data-section-id=&quot;walrho&quot;&gt;Career growth in AI Governance &amp;amp; Risk Management domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1752&quot; data-end=&quot;1825&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1xqjez6&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global AI, Compliance, and Risk teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1826&quot; data-end=&quot;1881&quot; data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1882&quot; data-end=&quot;1925&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('ba0512b4-ee3d-488c-a026-2709da1d8ad9','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','LIMS Developer (Labware LIMS)','lims-developer-labware-lims-104-104','We are looking for an experienced LIMS Developer with strong expertise in Labware LIMS configuration, customization, deployment, and support. The ideal candidate should have 3&amp;ndash;7 years of hands-on experience in global LIMS implementations, system administration, and troubleshooting. You will be responsible for handling end-to-end Labware LIMS projects including implementation, upgrade, integration with third-party applications, and ensuring compliance with GxP and Computer System Validation (CSV) requirements.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;The role demands excellent technical knowledge in SQL, Java/J2EE, JBoss Server, and reporting tools, along with strong analytical and communication skills. Candidates must come from a Pharma/Life Sciences background and should have independently handled at least one full LIMS implementation or upgrade project.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Configure, customize, and deploy Labware LIMS applications.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Build deployment packages and ensure smooth implementation.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Perform LIMS system administration, maintenance, and troubleshooting.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Develop and implement instrument interfaces, CDS systems (e.g., OpenLab, ATLAS), and other third-party integrations.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Implement enterprise application interfaces for seamless data flow.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Handle Level-1, Level-2, and Level-3 support activities for LIMS applications.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Ensure compliance with GxP, CSV, and regulatory requirements.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Generate reports using reporting tools and create complex SQL queries.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Collaborate with clients, act as a liaison, and manage customer expectations.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Mentor and guide junior team members on LIMS-related tasks.','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2025-11-21 18:30:00',0,0,'2025-09-23 07:22:06.000000','2025-09-23 07:22:07.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Administration\", \"Configurations\", \"Debugging Skills\", \"Deployment\", \"Enterprise\", \"Gxp Compliance\", \"Instruments\", \"J2EE\", \"Java\", \"Jboss\", \"Lims\", \"MS SQL Developer\", \"Oracle\", \"Pharma Industry\", \"Reporting Tools\", \"SQL\", \"Trouble Shooting\", \"LabWare LIMS\"]','[\"Opportunity to work on global LIMS projects&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Exposure to latest Labware LIMS versions&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Career growth in Pharma/Life Sciences domain&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Client interaction &amp;amp; mentoring responsibilities&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Competitive salary &amp;amp; supportive work culture\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('ba5c285f-71e0-427a-ab60-84ad743bd6cd','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Full Stack Developer','full-stack-developer-290-290','&lt;p data-start=&quot;62&quot; data-end=&quot;363&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced Full Stack Developers for a leading Top MNC to work on enterprise-grade web applications, APIs, and digital transformation projects. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in React JS, C#, .NET technologies, SQL Server, and modern application development practices.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;365&quot; data-end=&quot;691&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for designing, developing, and maintaining scalable front-end and back-end applications. The role includes building responsive user interfaces using React JS, developing robust APIs and backend services using C#, .NET, and .NET Core, and ensuring high application performance and reliability.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;693&quot; data-end=&quot;982&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with Web APIs, REST APIs, SQL Server, Microservices architecture, and messaging platforms such as Active MQ. Strong knowledge of application design, database optimization, debugging, and software development best practices is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;984&quot; data-end=&quot;1347&quot;&gt;The role also involves troubleshooting complex application issues, optimizing backend performance, collaborating with Product Owners and business stakeholders, and contributing to development and enhancement projects. Candidates should possess strong analytical, problem-solving, and communication skills with the ability to work in fast-paced Agile environments.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-08-08 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-06-10 02:24:06.000000','2026-06-10 02:24:06.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\".NET\", \".NET CORE\", \"ActiveMQ\", \"Agile\", \"API Integration\", \"Backend Development\", \"C#\", \"Debugging Skills\", \"Frontend Development\", \"Full Stack Development\", \"React JS\", \"RESTFUL APIS\", \"SQL Query Optimization\", \"SQL Server\", \"Web API\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1363&quot; data-end=&quot;1401&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;pwpeen&quot; data-start=&quot;1402&quot; data-end=&quot;1467&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale application development projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1hyzd6b&quot; data-start=&quot;1468&quot; data-end=&quot;1529&quot;&gt;Work on modern Full Stack and Microservices architectures&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;17b139y&quot; data-start=&quot;1530&quot; data-end=&quot;1598&quot;&gt;Career growth in Software Development &amp;amp; Digital Solutions domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;14c1c93&quot; data-start=&quot;1599&quot; data-end=&quot;1664&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global teams and stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot; data-start=&quot;1665&quot; data-end=&quot;1720&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;1721&quot; data-end=&quot;1764&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('ba7a13b8-87cd-4b08-9855-d7cc5374b17e','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Quintiq Specialist','quintiq-specialist-269-269','&lt;p data-start=&quot;60&quot; data-end=&quot;368&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced Quintiq Specialists for a leading Top MNC to work on enterprise-level supply chain, workforce planning, and optimization projects. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in Quintiq Scheduler, Demand Planning, Workforce Planning, and algorithm-based optimization solutions.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;370&quot; data-end=&quot;716&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for designing, implementing, and supporting Quintiq-based planning and scheduling solutions for global enterprise projects. The role includes analyzing business planning challenges, developing optimization algorithms, validating solutions during SIT/UAT phases, and supporting end-to-end Quintiq implementations.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;718&quot; data-end=&quot;976&quot;&gt;Professionals should have experience in supply chain demand planning, workforce management, forecast management, and shift scheduling solutions. Strong knowledge of Quintiq optimizers, solution debugging, and business process improvement is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;978&quot; data-end=&quot;1299&quot;&gt;The role also involves working directly with clients and stakeholders to provide consulting support, manage change requests, and deliver SLA-based services. Candidates should possess excellent analytical, communication, and problem-solving skills with the ability to handle complex planning and optimization requirements.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-07-10 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-05-12 03:02:03.000000','2026-05-12 03:02:04.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"SLA Management\", \"Supply Chain Agreements\", \"Quintiq\", \"Quintiq Scheduler\", \"Workforce Planner\", \"QPLC Methodology\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1315&quot; data-end=&quot;1353&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;vtguah&quot; data-start=&quot;1354&quot; data-end=&quot;1421&quot;&gt;Exposure to global supply chain and workforce planning projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;mgxw31&quot; data-start=&quot;1422&quot; data-end=&quot;1473&quot;&gt;Work on enterprise-level optimization solutions&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1tks50r&quot; data-start=&quot;1474&quot; data-end=&quot;1524&quot;&gt;Career growth in Quintiq &amp;amp; Supply Chain domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;m3lb3u&quot; data-start=&quot;1525&quot; data-end=&quot;1582&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with international clients&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot; data-start=&quot;1583&quot; data-end=&quot;1638&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;1639&quot; data-end=&quot;1682&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('ba957185-7d66-4035-9bef-696846f19834','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Core Voice Tooling Analyst – L2 Support','core-voice-tooling-analyst-l2-support-75-75','Are you an experienced voice infrastructure professional with hands-on expertise in Cisco UC, Oracle SBC, and cloud-based voice solutions? We&amp;rsquo;re looking for a Core Voice Tooling Analyst (L2) to join our high-performance team in Hyderabad. Role Overview: This role involves supporting and enhancing our global voice environment, ensuring platform stability, and contributing to the continuous improvement of voice services through automation and cloud-native technologies. Key Responsibilities: Provide L2 support for Cisco UC voice services, Oracle SBCs, and Microsoft Teams voice Perform application support across Windows/Linux servers, SNMP monitoring tools, and call capture solutions Troubleshoot and resolve incidents related to voice platforms, monitoring, and CDR tools Collaborate with vendors and internal stakeholders to ensure smooth operations and deployments Contribute to automation efforts within the voice ecosystem and help integrate cloud-based tooling Support software releases, CI/CD processes, and work within Agile/SRE/DevOps frameworks Must-Have Skills: Hands-on experience with Cisco UC, Oracle SBCs, and cloud voice platforms (MS Teams) Strong troubleshooting skills in voice services and SBCs Familiarity with SNMP monitoring (experience with Nectar a plus) Knowledge of CDR applications like Proteus, and automation tools (e.g., Kurmi) Experience with Azure and Azure foundations certification Understanding of Agile, SRE, or DevOps practices Good-to-Have: Familiarity with change management, ServiceNow, Jira, and GitLab Scripting knowledge in Python, PowerShell, or Linux shell Experience with Power BI and collaboration tools like Confluence Understanding of ITIL processes','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',500000.00,2500000.00,'₹',0,'India','Hyderabad',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-19 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-07-01 13:21:48.000000','2025-11-21 04:48:52.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Cisco Routers\", \"Gitlab\", \"JIRA\", \"Linux\", \"Oracle\", \"Powershell\", \"Python\", \"ServiceNow\"]','[\"Exposure to cloud technologies and modern tech stack Opportunities for continuous learning and upskilling Collaborative and supportive team environment Career growth with leadership mentorship Health and wellness benefits Strong focus on work-life balance\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Telangana'),('bac3203d-135b-47f9-9394-6b062d335178','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','CM MES Modeler / Functional Consultant','cm-mes-modeler-functional-consultant-277-277','&lt;p data-start=&quot;80&quot; data-end=&quot;432&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced CM MES Modeler / Functional Consultants for a leading Top MNC to work on enterprise-level Manufacturing Execution System (MES) implementation and rollout projects. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in Critical Manufacturing MES solutions, manufacturing operations, and customer-facing implementation activities.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;434&quot; data-end=&quot;766&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for working on MES implementation, configuration, modeling, rollout, and support activities across manufacturing environments. The role includes understanding customer requirements, configuring MES solutions, collaborating with global teams, and supporting manufacturing digitalization initiatives.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;768&quot; data-end=&quot;1045&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience in Critical Manufacturing MES implementations, manufacturing process understanding, and direct client interaction. Candidates with certification in Critical Manufacturing Professional / Associate &amp;ndash; Modeler will be highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1047&quot; data-end=&quot;1308&quot;&gt;The role also requires close collaboration with customer teams and internal stakeholders across US and India locations to ensure successful delivery of MES projects. Strong communication, analytical thinking, and teamwork skills are essential for this position.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'INR',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-07-20 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-05-22 0