;1215&quot;&gt;Java, JavaScript, and REST APIs&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1219&quot; data-end=&quot;1305&quot;&gt;Implement&nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1231&quot; data-end=&quot;1255&quot;&gt;user interfaces (UI)&lt;/strong&gt;&nbsp;using Mendix&rsquo;s page editor and styling options.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1306&quot; data-end=&quot;1390&quot;&gt;Perform&nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1316&quot; data-end=&quot;1336&quot;&gt;data integration&lt;/strong&gt;&nbsp;with external systems using&nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1365&quot; data-end=&quot;1387&quot;&gt;SOAP/REST services&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1391&quot; data-end=&quot;1474&quot;&gt;Ensure application security by configuring&nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1436&quot; data-end=&quot;1471&quot;&gt;access rules and authentication&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1475&quot; data-end=&quot;1545&quot;&gt;Conduct&nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1485&quot; data-end=&quot;1542&quot;&gt;unit testing, debugging, and performance optimization&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1546&quot; data-end=&quot;1637&quot;&gt;Collaborate with DevOps teams to implement&nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1591&quot; data-end=&quot;1610&quot;&gt;CI/CD pipelines&lt;/strong&gt;&nbsp;for Mendix applications.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1638&quot; data-end=&quot;1696&quot;&gt;Maintain and improve&nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1661&quot; data-end=&quot;1693&quot;&gt;existing Mendix applications&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1697&quot; data-end=&quot;1778&quot;&gt;Create and manage&nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1717&quot; data-end=&quot;1744&quot;&gt;technical documentation&lt;/strong&gt;&nbsp;for applications and processes&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1697&quot; data-end=&quot;1778&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;1785&quot; data-end=&quot;1811&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1789&quot; data-end=&quot;1809&quot;&gt;Required Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1812&quot; data-end=&quot;2516&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1812&quot; data-end=&quot;1899&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1814&quot; data-end=&quot;1826&quot;&gt;5+ years&lt;/strong&gt;&nbsp;of hands-on experience in&nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1853&quot; data-end=&quot;1896&quot;&gt;Mendix low-code application development&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1900&quot; data-end=&quot;1965&quot;&gt;Proficiency with&nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1919&quot; data-end=&quot;1940&quot;&gt;Mendix Studio Pro&lt;/strong&gt;&nbsp;and&nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1945&quot; data-end=&quot;1962&quot;&gt;Mendix Studio&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1966&quot; data-end=&quot;2035&quot;&gt;Strong knowledge of&nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1988&quot; data-end=&quot;2032&quot;&gt;microflows, nanoflows, and domain models&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2036&quot; data-end=&quot;2106&quot;&gt;Experience with&nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2054&quot; data-end=&quot;2077&quot;&gt;Java and JavaScript&lt;/strong&gt;&nbsp;for custom Mendix actions.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2107&quot; data-end=&quot;2175&quot;&gt;Familiarity with&nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2126&quot; data-end=&quot;2151&quot;&gt;RESTful and SOAP APIs&lt;/strong&gt;&nbsp;for data integration.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2176&quot; data-end=&quot;2249&quot;&gt;Experience with&nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2194&quot; data-end=&quot;2211&quot;&gt;SQL databases&lt;/strong&gt;&nbsp;(PostgreSQL, MySQL, or SQL Server).&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2250&quot; data-end=&quot;2316&quot;&gt;Strong understanding of&nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2276&quot; data-end=&quot;2303&quot;&gt;UI/UX design principles&lt;/strong&gt;&nbsp;in Mendix.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2317&q