M MDM\"]','[\"Opportunity to work in a Top MNC with global presence.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Direct exposure to multicultural teams in Japan.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Hands-on learning in iOS app lifecycle &amp;amp; cutting-edge technologies.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Growth-oriented role with opportunities for long-term career advancement.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Collaborative work environment with mentorship.&lt;br /&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('bc293661-95f1-49fc-a8b7-6d6f71fa7658','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Unified Namespace (UNS) HiveMQ Developer','unified-namespace-uns-hivemq-developer-225-225','&amp;middot; Large scale UNS Implementation experience in Production preferably HiveMQ&lt;br /&gt;&amp;middot; Experience working with Data Modelling &amp;amp; Transformation&lt;br /&gt;&amp;middot; Familiarity with MES / MFG IT systems such as GE Proficy or similar&amp;nbsp; &lt;br /&gt;&amp;middot; Experience in Azure Data Factory in creating Data Source Pipelines&lt;br /&gt;&amp;middot; Azure platform exposure, particularly with Azure SQL and ADLS &lt;br /&gt;&amp;middot; Strong problem-solving, analytical, and communication skills','Information Technology','Contract','Entry',NULL,NULL,'INR',1,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-05-25 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-03-26 20:17:23.000000','2026-03-26 20:17:24.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Data Analysis\", \"Data Modeling\", \"GE Proficy AMS\", \"Mes\", \"MYSQL\", \"HiveMQ\", \"Azure ML\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;Competitive salary package with performance-based incentives&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;65&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;67&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;Health insurance coverage and statutory benefits (PF &amp;amp; Gratuity)&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;134&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;136&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on large-scale enterprise energy management projects&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;211&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;213&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;Strong career growth and learning opportunities&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;263&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;265&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;Collaborative and professional work environment&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('bc53493b-dd33-419d-ac9e-ededaeb7165f','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','SAP BTP Architect','sap-btp-architect-94-94','About the Role:&lt;br /&gt;We are looking for a highly skilled and motivated SAP BTP Architect with 12&amp;ndash;16 years of experience. The ideal candidate will have strong expertise in SAP BTP technologies such as CAPM, RAPM, and SAP Integration Suite, along with experience in SAP Build Process Automation and analytics. This role involves architecting, designing, and implementing enterprise-level SAP solutions across complex landscapes.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;br /&gt;- Create and manage OData services for Fiori/UI5 applications and other frontend integrations.&lt;br /&gt;- Build business applications using SAP BTP, focusing on CAPM (Cloud Application Programming Model) and RAPM (RESTful ABAP Programming Model).&lt;br /&gt;- Design and implement integration scenarios between SAP and third-party systems using SAP Integration Suite.&lt;br /&gt;- Develop and deliver solutions using SAP BTP technologies including CAPM, RAPM, Build Process Automation, and Integration Suite.&lt;br /&gt;- Conduct code reviews, performance tuning, and prepare technical documentation.&lt;br /&gt;- Collaborate with functional consultants, solution architects, and other stakeholders to deliver end-to-end SAP solutions.&lt;br /&gt;- Stay updated with SAP&amp;rsquo;s latest technologies, ensuring future-proof and scalable solutions.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Required Skills &amp;amp; Qualifications:&lt;br /&gt;- 12&amp;ndash;16 years of IT experience with at least 5+ years in SAP BTP technologies.&lt;br /&gt;- Hands-on expertise in CAPM, RAPM, SAP Integration Suite, and Build Process Automation.&lt;br /&gt;- Strong experience with OData services, Fiori/UI5 integrations, and SAP analytics.&lt;br /&gt;- Ability to design and implement scalable SAP BTP solutions across complex enterprise landscapes.&lt;br /&gt;- Strong problem-solving, communication, and stakeholder management skills.','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-19 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-08-27 10:46:26.000000','2025-11-21 04:43:38.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Cloud Architect\", \"Enterprise\", \"RESTFUL\", \"SAP\", \"SAP ABAP\", \"Sap Business Objects\", \"SAP FIORI\", \"SAP Integration\", \"SAP Odata\", \"SAP Solutions\", \"Stakeholder Management\", \"Technical Documentation\", \"Performance Tuning\"]','[\"- Competitive salary package&lt;br /&gt;- Opportunity to work on the latest SAP BTP technologies&lt;br /&gt;- Exposure to large-scale enterprise SAP projects&lt;br /&gt;- Professional growth with cutting-edge SAP innovations&lt;br /&gt;- Collaborative and innovative work environment&lt;br /&gt;- PAN India work flexibility\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('bc590b04-6ca3-4ff9-8c46-28e1b38cde39','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','MES OT Validation Engineer','mes-ot-validation-engineer-79-79','&lt;p data-start=&quot;355&quot; data-end=&quot;705&quot;&gt;We are hiring a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;371&quot; data-end=&quot;401&quot;&gt;MES OT Validation Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; with 6&amp;ndash;8 years of experience in validating manufacturing execution systems (MES), preferably Rockwell or Honeywell. The ideal candidate will have hands-on experience in protocol development (IQ/OQ/PQ), regulatory compliance (GAMP, FDA, GMP), and system integrations with tools like LIMS, SAP, and Kneat.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;707&quot; data-end=&quot;855&quot;&gt;You&#039;ll play a critical role in ensuring the accuracy, compliance, and functionality of MES platforms across life sciences or regulated environments.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;868&quot; data-end=&quot;902&quot;&gt;Responsibilities / Key Duties:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;903&quot; data-end=&quot;1626&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;903&quot; data-end=&quot;1002&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;905&quot; data-end=&quot;1002&quot;&gt;Develop &amp;amp; execute validation protocols (IQ/OQ/PQ) for Rockwell, Honeywell, or similar MES tools&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1003&quot; data-end=&quot;1076&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1005&quot; data-end=&quot;1076&quot;&gt;Ensure compliance with FDA, GMP, GAMP, and other regulatory standards&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1077&quot; data-end=&quot;1156&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1079&quot; data-end=&quot;1156&quot;&gt;Collaborate with IT, Quality, and Manufacturing teams for system validation&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1157&quot; data-end=&quot;1219&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1159&quot; data-end=&quot;1219&quot;&gt;Perform risk assessments and develop mitigation strategies&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1220&quot; data-end=&quot;1291&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1222&quot; data-end=&quot;1291&quot;&gt;Maintain documentation in line with regulatory and company policies&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1292&quot; data-end=&quot;1360&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1294&quot; data-end=&quot;1360&quot;&gt;Troubleshoot MES tools during validation and post-implementation&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1361&quot; data-end=&quot;1409&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1363&quot; data-end=&quot;1409&quot;&gt;Provide training &amp;amp; support to MES/LIMS users&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1410&quot; data-end=&quot;1475&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1412&quot; data-end=&quot;1475&quot;&gt;Contribute to continuous improvement in validation approaches&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1476&quot; data-end=&quot;1553&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1478&quot; data-end=&quot;1553&quot;&gt;Interface MES with LIMS, SAP, and assist in end-to-end MES implementation&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1554&quot; data-end=&quot;1626&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1556&quot; data-end=&quot;1626&quot;&gt;Use &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1560&quot; data-end=&quot;1589&quot;&gt;Kneat Validation Software&lt;/strong&gt; for test execution (preferred skill)&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Noida',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-19 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-07-11 07:46:44.000000','2025-11-21 04:47:32.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Agile Methodology\", \"Cross-Functional\", \"Data Integrity\", \"Documentation\", \"GAMP5\", \"IQ\", \"Lims\", \"Mes Validation Processes\", \"OQ\", \"PQ\", \"Protocols\", \"Risk Assessment\", \"Rockwell Software\", \"SAP Integration\", \"Validation\", \"Honeywell EPKS\"]','[\"&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2351&quot; data-end=&quot;2610&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2351&quot; data-end=&quot;2423&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2353&quot; data-end=&quot;2423&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2376&quot; data-end=&quot;2421&quot;&gt;global compliance and validation projects&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2424&quot; data-end=&quot;2483&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2426&quot; data-end=&quot;2483&quot;&gt;Exposure to &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2438&quot; data-end=&quot;2464&quot;&gt;regulated environments&lt;/strong&gt; in life sciences&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2484&quot; data-end=&quot;2562&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2486&quot; data-end=&quot;2562&quot;&gt;Work with latest MES platforms and tools like &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2532&quot; data-end=&quot;2560&quot;&gt;Kneat &amp;amp; SAP integrations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2563&quot; data-end=&quot;2610&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2565&quot; data-end=&quot;2610&quot;&gt;Be part of a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2578&quot; data-end=&quot;2610&quot;&gt;cross-functional global team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Uttar Pradesh'),('bcb698cc-ebeb-499c-aef9-baa0a175de4a','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','LabWare LIMS Consultant / Specialist','labware-lims-consultant-specialist-323-323','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;78&quot; data-end=&quot;502&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced LabWare LIMS Consultants / Specialists for a leading Top MNC to work on enterprise Laboratory Information Management System (LIMS) implementation, support, and digital laboratory transformation projects. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in LabWare LIMS configuration, customization, SQL development, laboratory workflows, and regulated pharmaceutical and life sciences environments.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;504&quot; data-end=&quot;911&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for implementing, configuring, customizing, and supporting LabWare LIMS solutions to meet laboratory and business requirements. The role includes developing workflows, reports, templates, and screens, performing system validation, supporting production environments, troubleshooting application issues, and ensuring system performance, stability, and regulatory compliance.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;913&quot; data-end=&quot;1280&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with LabWare LIMS, LIMS Basic scripting, SQL development, database management, ITIL processes, and enterprise application support. Strong knowledge of laboratory operations, system validation (IQ/OQ/PQ), GxP regulations, FDA compliance, and integrations with ERP, MES, ELN, and laboratory instruments is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1282&quot; data-end=&quot;1732&quot;&gt;The role also involves collaborating with QA, QC, laboratory users, IT teams, and business stakeholders to deliver enterprise-grade laboratory solutions. Candidates will support implementation projects, manage production issues, prepare compliance documentation, optimize application performance, and contribute to continuous improvement initiatives. Strong analytical, communication, stakeholder management, and problem-solving skills are essential.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-09-01 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-07-03 18:50:25.000000','2026-07-03 18:50:25.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Compliance Reporting\", \"CSV\", \"Database Management\", \"ERP\", \"Gxp Compliance\", \"IQ\", \"ITIL\", \"Lims\", \"MYSQL\", \"OQ\", \"PQ\", \"System Validation\", \"Workflow Configuration\", \"LabWare LIMS\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1748&quot; data-end=&quot;1786&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;40zchx&quot; data-start=&quot;1787&quot; data-end=&quot;1868&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale LabWare LIMS implementation and support projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;xhvcpx&quot; 