d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Full Stack Developer','full-stack-developer-233-233','&amp;middot; .NET Framework and C# for Backend Development &lt;br /&gt;&amp;middot; Angular and JavaScript for Frontend Development &lt;br /&gt;&amp;middot; Database Design and T-SQL &lt;br /&gt;&amp;middot; Web API Development &lt;br /&gt;&amp;middot; Version Control (Git/TFS)','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'INR',1,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-05-30 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-03-31 22:09:58.000000','2026-03-31 22:09:58.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\".NET\", \".NET CORE\", \"ASP.NET Core Web API\", \"C#\", \"Github\", \"MYSQL\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;Competitive salary package with performance-based incentives&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;65&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;67&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;Health insurance coverage and statutory benefits (PF &amp;amp; Gratuity)&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;134&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;136&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on large-scale enterprise energy management projects&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;211&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;213&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;Strong career growth and learning opportunities&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;263&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;265&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;Collaborative and professional work environment&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('bd057cde-0f21-4edc-8edf-5e3d730fd614','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','LIMS SampleManager Consultant / Specialist','lims-samplemanager-consultant-specialist-322-322','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;84&quot; data-end=&quot;485&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced LIMS SampleManager Consultants / Specialists for a leading Top MNC to support enterprise laboratory informatics and digital laboratory transformation initiatives. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in Thermo Fisher SampleManager LIMS, laboratory workflows, system administration, application support, and regulated pharmaceutical and life sciences environments.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;487&quot; data-end=&quot;884&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for configuring, administering, supporting, and enhancing Thermo Fisher SampleManager LIMS to meet business and laboratory requirements. The role includes managing master data, user administration, system configuration, troubleshooting production issues, implementing system enhancements, and ensuring high availability and performance of laboratory applications.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;886&quot; data-end=&quot;1270&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with SampleManager LIMS administration, laboratory sample management processes, system integrations, ITIL-based support processes, and enterprise application support. Strong knowledge of LIMS configuration, ELN, ERP, laboratory instrument integration, GxP regulations, FDA compliance, and laboratory quality processes is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1272&quot; data-end=&quot;1731&quot;&gt;The role also involves collaborating with laboratory users, QA, R&amp;amp;D, IT teams, business stakeholders, and global project teams to deliver enterprise-grade laboratory solutions. Candidates will support production environments, resolve application issues, manage documentation, ensure regulatory compliance, and contribute to continuous improvement initiatives. Strong analytical, communication, stakeholder management, and problem-solving skills are essential.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-09-01 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-07-03 18:45:34.000000','2026-07-03 18:45:34.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"ERP\", \"Gxp Compliance\", \"ITIL\", \"Lims\", \"Pharmaceutical\", \"User Administration\", \"Master Data Management (MDM)\", \"Sample Management\", \"Thermo Chromeleon\", \"ELN Integration\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1747&quot; data-end=&quot;1785&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;dsvz3c&quot; data-start=&quot;1786&quot; data-end=&quot;1859&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale Laboratory Informatics and LIMS projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1tdsp3b&quot; data-start=&quot;1860&quot; data-end=&quot;1943&quot;&gt;Work with global Pharmaceutical, Biotechnology, and Life Sciences organizations&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1kbcrt5&quot; data-start=&quot;1944&quot; data-end=&quot;2012&quot;&gt;Career growth in LIMS &amp;amp; Laboratory Digital Transformation domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;i1fuo0&quot; data-start=&quot;2013&quot; data-end=&quot;2091&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with international business and technical teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;2lee9a&quot; data-start=&quot;2092&quot; data-end=&quot;2147&quot;&gt;Professional and compliance-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;2148&quot; data-end=&quot;2191&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('be3ce381-4eab-46af-87ef-cb150e1ca73a','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','LabVantage LIMS SME','labvantage-lims-sme-376-376','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;57&quot; data-end=&quot;307&quot;&gt;We are looking for experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;88&quot; data-end=&quot;137&quot;&gt;LabVantage LIMS Subject Matter Experts (SMEs)&lt;/strong&gt; to join a leading Top MNC and work on enterprise-level &lt;strong data-start=&quot;193&quot; data-end=&quot;297&quot;&gt;Laboratory Information Management System (LIMS) implementation, deployment, integration, and support&lt;/strong&gt; projects.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;309&quot; data-end=&quot;669&quot;&gt;The ideal candidate should have strong hands-on experience with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;373&quot; data-end=&quot;490&quot;&gt;LabVantage LIMS configuration, customization, deployment, administration, troubleshooting, and production support&lt;/strong&gt;. Experience with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;508&quot; data-end=&quot;648&quot;&gt;LabVantage 8, deployment packages, Jasper Reports, SQL, instrument interfaces, CDS integrations, and enterprise application integrations&lt;/strong&gt; is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;671&quot; data-end=&quot;894&quot;&gt;The candidate will work closely with customers, laboratory teams, technical teams, and global stakeholders to deliver scalable LIMS solutions and provide technical expertise throughout implementation and support activities.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;18w7bso&quot; data-start=&quot;896&quot; data-end=&quot;919&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;921&quot; data-end=&quot;2079&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1bm2mx5&quot; data-start=&quot;921&quot; data-end=&quot;996&quot;&gt;Act as a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;932&quot; data-end=&quot;955&quot;&gt;LabVantage LIMS SME&lt;/strong&gt; for implementation and support projects.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1vr4obs&quot; data-start=&quot;997&quot; data-end=&quot;1085&quot;&gt;Configure and customize LabVantage LIMS based on business and laboratory requirements.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;471dzw&quot; data-start=&quot;1086&quot; data-end=&quot;1142&quot;&gt;Develop and manage &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1107&quot; data-end=&quot;1141&quot;&gt;LabVantage deployment packages&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1rav57&quot; data-start=&quot;1143&quot; data-end=&quot;1208&quot;&gt;Design and maintain &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1165&quot; data-end=&quot;1183&quot;&gt;Jasper Reports&lt;/strong&gt; and reporting solutions.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;16nahsr&quot; data-start=&quot;1209&quot; data-end=&quot;1272&quot;&gt;Participate in end-to-end LabVantage implementation projects.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1j8qgoe&quot; data-start=&quot;1273&quot; data-end=&quot;1340&quot;&gt;Provide L2/L3 support and troubleshoot complex production issues.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;17ylils&quot; data-start=&quot;1341&quot; data-end=&quot;1430&quot;&gt;Perform system administration, maintenance, debugging, and performance troubleshooting.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;szi4wj&quot; data-start=&quot;1431&quot; data-end=&quot;1513&quot;&gt;Design and support integrations with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1470&quot; data-end=&quot;1512&quot;&gt;laboratory instruments and CDS systems&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1uraifr&quot; data-start=&quot;1514&quot; data-end=&quot;1592&quot;&gt;Work with platforms such as &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1544&quot; data-end=&quot;1571&quot;&gt;Empower, OpenLab, ATLAS&lt;/strong&gt;, or similar systems.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;179szey&quot; data-start=&quot;1593&quot; data-end=&quot;1666&quot;&gt;Integrate LabVantage with enterprise applications and external systems.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-27 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-08-29 00:47