d=&quot;1598&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1544&quot; data-end=&quot;1598&quot;&gt;Excellent written and spoken communication in English.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1599&quot; data-end=&quot;1646&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1601&quot; data-end=&quot;1646&quot;&gt;Strong interpersonal and presentation skills.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1647&quot; data-end=&quot;1738&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1649&quot; data-end=&quot;1738&quot;&gt;Good analytical ability to understand client requirements and deliver tailored solutions.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1739&quot; data-end=&quot;1828&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1741&quot; data-end=&quot;1828&quot;&gt;Ability to manage multiple tasks with strong time management and organizational skills.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1829&quot; data-end=&quot;1876&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1831&quot; data-end=&quot;1876&quot;&gt;Troubleshooting and problem-solving aptitude.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;hr data-start=&quot;1878&quot; data-end=&quot;1881&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;1883&quot; data-end=&quot;1908&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1887&quot; data-end=&quot;1908&quot;&gt;Preferred Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1909&quot; data-end=&quot;2217&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1909&quot; data-end=&quot;1970&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1911&quot; data-end=&quot;1970&quot;&gt;Ability to generate new business and achieve sales targets.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1971&quot; data-end=&quot;2044&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1973&quot; data-end=&quot;2044&quot;&gt;Proven capability in market hunting and enterprise customer engagement.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2045&quot; data-end=&quot;2100&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2047&quot; data-end=&quot;2100&quot;&gt;Customer 