ng Domain&lt;br data-start=&quot;934&quot; data-end=&quot;937&quot; /&gt;&amp;nbsp;Design &amp;amp; Development of Manufacturing Functions and Interfaces&lt;br data-start=&quot;1001&quot; data-end=&quot;1004&quot; /&gt;&amp;nbsp;Working on Mainframe Technologies&lt;br data-start=&quot;1039&quot; data-end=&quot;1042&quot; /&gt;&amp;nbsp;Supporting Manufacturing / Metals Industry Projects&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1099&quot; data-end=&quot;1266&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Candidates with experience in MES, Manufacturing, Steel, Metals, Mainframe Solutioning, COBOL Development, DB2, IMS, and Functional Consulting are highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Kolkata',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-07-10 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-05-11 15:24:37.000000','2026-05-11 15:24:37.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"COBOL\", \"IMS (IP Multimedia Subsystem)\", \"Manufacturing\", \"DB2\", \"Mainframe\", \"Solution Design\"]','[\"Work with Top MNC\"]','No Preference',1,5,'West Bengal'),('bf7415c6-37f8-4ad2-a61f-201fa03092a5','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Data Pipeline Engineer – OT–IT Integration','data-pipeline-engineer-ot-it-integration-199-199','&lt;p&gt;&amp;middot; End-to-end pipelines: Design, implement, and operate batch/streaming flows from SCADA, MES, and Historians to cloud/enterprise (Azure/AWS/GCP); Experience in Azure Event Hubs/Event Grid is plus.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;middot; UNS &amp;amp; modeling: Apply UNS (ISA-95/88), data modeling, and metadata management; ensure data quality, lineage, and governance.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;middot; Industrial integration: Connect (Ignition, HighByte, HiveMQ advantageous) using OPC UA, MQTT, BACnet, Modbus; build/consume RESTful APIs and connectors for SCADA, MES, LIMS, Historians.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;middot; Design schemas and tune performance across SQL and NoSQL stores.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;middot; Security &amp;amp; re