experienced CDS (Chromatography Data System) Developers for a leading Top MNC to work on enterprise laboratory informatics and pharmaceutical digital transformation projects. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in CDS platforms, laboratory workflows, system integrations, and regulated pharmaceutical environments.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;427&quot; data-end=&quot;785&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for configuring, customizing, developing, and supporting Chromatography Data Systems such as Waters Empower, Agilent OpenLab, and Thermo Chromeleon. The role includes developing chromatography methods, processing methods, report templates, and workflow solutions to support laboratory operations and compliance requirements.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;787&quot; data-end=&quot;1087&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with CDS integrations, SQL scripting, database management, system optimization, and troubleshooting instrument-to-CDS communication issues. Strong knowledge of LIMS, ELN integrations, laboratory systems, and data management practices is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1089&quot; data-end=&quot;1425&quot;&gt;The role also involves supporting validation activities, ensuring compliance with GxP, 21 CFR Part 11, and ALCOA+ requirements, collaborating with laboratory users and stakeholders, and maintaining system performance and reliability. Candidates should possess strong analytical, communication, documentation, and problem-solving skills.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-08-08 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-06-10 02:52:05.000000','2026-06-10 02:52:05.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"CSV\", \"Gxp Compliance\", \"SQL Query Optimization\", \"SQL Server\", \"21 CFR Part 11\", \"Waters Empower\", \"Agilent OpenLab\", \"Thermo Chromeleon\", \"Chromatography Data Systems (CDS)\", \"CDS Configuration\", \"LIMS Integration\