lytics projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1fm9s77&quot; data-start=&quot;438&quot; data-end=&quot;483&quot;&gt;Work on modern Azure cloud data platforms&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1brhfb&quot; data-start=&quot;484&quot; data-end=&quot;531&quot;&gt;Career growth in Data Analytics &amp;amp; BI domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;9wn5a9&quot; data-start=&quot;532&quot; data-end=&quot;583&quot;&gt;Collaborative and professional work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1gb5m6x&quot; data-start=&quot;584&quot; data-end=&quot;643&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience with enterprise reporting solutions&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;644&quot; data-end=&quot;687&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('c307de0e-a5c7-41b8-ba2e-2c6edcea7a48','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','TrakSYS Consultant','traksys-consultant-330-330','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;60&quot; data-end=&quot;448&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced TrakSYS Consultants for a leading Top MNC to work on enterprise-scale Manufacturing Execution System (MES) and Digital Manufacturing transformation projects. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in TrakSYS implementation, customization, application support, and manufacturing process optimization across process and discrete manufacturing industries.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;450&quot; data-end=&quot;848&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for implementing, configuring, customizing, and supporting TrakSYS MES solutions to meet business and manufacturing requirements. The role includes gathering functional requirements, developing application enhancements, troubleshooting production issues, administering MES applications, and integrating TrakSYS with enterprise systems such as SAP and LabWare LIMS.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;850&quot; data-end=&quot;1183&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with TrakSYS, C# .NET application development, MS SQL, T-SQL, SQL query optimization, MES administration, and manufacturing workflows. Strong understanding of process or discrete manufacturing, enterprise integrations, application maintenance, and production support is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1185&quot; data-end=&quot;1641&quot;&gt;The role also involves collaborating with business stakeholders, manufacturing teams, IT teams, and global project teams to deliver scalable MES solutions. Candidates will support TrakSYS implementation and upgrade projects, resolve technical issues, improve manufacturing processes, prepare technical documentation, and ensure reliable system performance. Strong analytical, communication, stakeholder management, and problem-solving skills are essential.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Pune',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-09-05 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-07-08 03:20:07.000000','2026-07-08 03:20:07.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\".NET\", \".NET Framework\", \"C#\", \"Mes\", \"Microsoft SQL\", \"SAP Integration\", \"Transact-SQL\", \"LabWare LIMS\", \"TrakSYS\", \"TrakSYS Customization\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1657&quot; data-end=&quot;1695&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;gxlz0s&quot; data-start=&quot;1696&quot; data-end=&quot;1767&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale MES and Digital Manufacturing projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;p0bwr5&quot; data-start=&quot;1768&quot; data-end=&quot;1833&quot;&gt;Work on advanced TrakSYS and Smart Manufacturing technologies&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;hyh22q&quot; data-start=&quot;1834&quot; data-end=&quot;1899&quot;&gt;Career growth in Manufacturing Execution Systems (MES) domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;vq0hl0&quot; data-start=&quot;1900&quot; data-end=&quot;1972&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global business and technology teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot; data-start=&quot;1973&quot; data-end=&quot;2028&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;2029&quot; data-end=&quot;2072&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Maharashtra'),('c30e01a6-ee7c-497e-800c-8482e2a57d39','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','CM MES Modeler / Functional Consultant','cm-mes-modeler-functional-consultant-218-218','&lt;p&gt;&amp;middot; CM Professional certified Modeler&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;middot; 5 to 8+ years of development experience in Manufacturing domain, 2+Years experience handling critical manufacturing MES implementations, Rollout&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;middot; Certified Critical manufacturing Professional / Associate: Modeler&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;middot; Previous work experience in MES implementation using any platform.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;middot; Good communication skills&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;middot; Manufacturing domain experience&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;middot; Directly working with customer&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;middot; Working collaboratively and helping other team members from US and India&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'INR',1,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-05-24 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-03-25 16:13:36.000000','2026-03-25 16:13:36.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Mes\", \"Mes Administrator\", \"Mes Applications\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;Competitive salary package with performance-based incentives&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;65&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;67&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;Health insurance coverage and statutory benefits (PF &amp;amp; Gratuity)&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;134&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;136&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on large-scale enterprise energy management projects&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;211&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;213&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;Strong career growth and learning opportunities&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;263&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;265&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;Collaborative and professional work environment&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('c30f050a-621b-4569-b230-4b7596bad0df','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','LabVantage LIMS Consultant','labvantage-lims-consultant-36-36','&lt;p data-start=&quot;225&quot; data-end=&quot;561&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;225&quot; data-end=&quot;265&quot;&gt;Job Role: LabVantage LIMS Consultant&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br data-start=&quot;265&quot; data-end=&quot;268&quot; /&gt;We are seeking an experienced LabVantage LIMS Consultant with strong hands-on experience in Java/.NET-based LIMS application development. The ideal candidate will have a background in LabVantage LIMS, including workflows, customization, integration, implementation, upgradation, and migration.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;563&quot; data-end=&quot;588&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;563&quot; data-end=&quot;588&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;589&quot; data-end=&quot;1047&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;589&quot; data-end=&quot;660&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;591&quot; data-end=&quot;660&quot;&gt;Develop and maintain Java or .NET-based LabVantage LIMS applications.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;661&quot; data-end=&quot;704&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;663&quot; data-end=&quot;704&quot;&gt;Administer and configure LabVantage LIMS.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;705&quot; data-end=&quot;770&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;707&quot; data-end=&quot;770&quot;&gt;Develop and manage workflows, customizations, and integrations.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;771&quot; data-end=&quot;831&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;773&quot; data-end=&quot;831&quot;&gt;Troubleshoot and debug application issues related to LIMS.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;832&quot; data-end=&quot;906&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;834&quot; data-end=&quot;906&quot;&gt;Collaborate with manufacturing and quality teams to gather requirements.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;907&quot; data-end=&quot;971&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;909&quot; data-end=&quot;971&quot;&gt;Ensure smooth upgradation and migration of LabVantage systems.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;972&quot; data-end=&quot;1047&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;974&quot; data-end=&quot;1047&quot;&gt;Communicate effectively with clients and provide technical documentation.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1049&quot; data-end=&quot;1066&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1049&quot; data-end=&quot;1066&quot;&gt;Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1067&quot; data-end=&quot;1326&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1067&quot; data-end=&quot;1127&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1069&quot; data-end=&quot;1127&quot;&gt;5&amp;ndash;15 years of experience in LIMS or Java/.NET development.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1128&quot; data-end=&quot;1199&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1130&quot; data-end=&quot;1199&quot;&gt;At least 3 years of experience in a manufacturing or R&amp;amp;D environment.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1200&quot; data-end=&quot;1263&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1202&quot; data-end=&quot;1263&quot;&gt;Strong analytical, communication, and customer-facing skills.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1264&quot; data-end=&quot;1326&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1266&quot; data-end=&quot;1326&quot;&gt;Bachelor&#039;s degree in Computer Science, IT, or related field.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',1000000.00,2000000.00,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-20 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-05-21 20:30:37.000000','2025-11-21 17:51:43.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\".NET\", \"Java\", \"Lims\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1368&quot; data-end=&quot;1425&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1370&quot; data-end=&quot;1425&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on global LabVantage LIMS projects.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1426&quot; data-end=&quot;1491&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1428&quot; data-end=&quot;1491&quot;&gt;Exposure to manufacturing, quality, and R&amp;amp;D industry processes.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1492&quot; data-end=&quot;1547&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1494&quot; data-end=&quot;1547&quot;&gt;Competitive salary with performance-based incentives.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1548&quot; data-end=&quot;1615&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1550&quot; data-end=&quot;1615&quot;&gt;Professional growth through cross-functional project involvement.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1616&quot; data-end=&quot;1677&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1618&quot; data-end=&quot;1677&quot;&gt;Flexible work environment with a supportive technical team.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1678&quot; data-end=&quot;1757&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1680&quot; data-end=&quot;1757&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience with advanced LIMS configuration and migration practices.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('c338e2f5-1253-4f37-9a32-28b858c0c5f4','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Opcenter Developer / Designer / Modeller/ Portal Developer (4+ Years Experience)','opcenter-developer-designer-modeller-portal-developer-4-years-experience-50-50','&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;315&quot; data-end=&quot;340&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;319&quot; data-end=&quot;338&quot;&gt;About the Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;341&quot; data-end=&quot;617&quot;&gt;We are seeking an experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;371&quot; data-end=&quot;415&quot;&gt;Opcenter Developer / Designer / Modeller&lt;/strong&gt; to join our innovative team. If you have a strong background in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;480&quot; data-end=&quot;500&quot;&gt;Siemens Opcenter&lt;/strong&gt; and a passion for optimizing manufacturing processes through cutting-edge MES solutions, we&amp;rsquo;d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;hr data-start=&quot;619&quot; data-end=&quot;622&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;624&quot; data-end=&quot;655&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;628&quot; data-end=&quot;653&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;656&quot; data-end=&quot;1070&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Design and develop solutions using &lt;strong data-start=&quot;694&quot; data-end=&quot;714&quot;&gt;Siemens Opcenter&lt;/strong&gt; (formerly SIMATIC IT).&lt;br data-start=&quot;737&quot; data-end=&quot;740&quot; /&gt;&amp;nbsp;Collaborate with cross-functional teams to gather and translate business requirements.&lt;br data-start=&quot;829&quot; data-end=&quot;832&quot; /&gt;&amp;nbsp;Configure and implement Opcenter modules (MES, APS, RD&amp;amp;L, etc.).&lt;br data-start=&quot;899&quot; data-end=&quot;902&quot; /&gt;&amp;nbsp;Create comprehensive technical documentation.&lt;br data-start=&quot;950&quot; data-end=&quot;953&quot; /&gt;&amp;nbsp;Perform system integration, testing, and issue resolution.&lt;br data-start=&quot;1014&quot; data-end=&quot;1017&quot; /&gt;&amp;nbsp;Provide training and ongoing support to end-users.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;hr data-start=&quot;1072&quot; data-end=&quot;1075&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;1077&quot; data-end=&quot;1120&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1081&quot; data-end=&quot;1118&quot;&gt;Required Skills &amp;amp; Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1121&quot; data-end=&quot;1600&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;4+ years of hands-on experience with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1160&quot; data-end=&quot;1180&quot;&gt;Siemens Opcenter&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Semi (Execution, APS, RD&amp;amp;L, etc.)&lt;br data-start=&quot;1209&quot; data-end=&quot;1212&quot; /&gt;&amp;nbsp;Solid understanding of &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1237&quot; data-end=&quot;1271&quot;&gt;MES, PLM, and Manufacturing IT&lt;/strong&gt; systems&lt;br data-start=&quot;1279&quot; data-end=&quot;1282&quot; /&gt;&amp;nbsp;Proficiency in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1299&quot; data-end=&quot;1322&quot;&gt;SQL, JavaScript, C#&lt;/strong&gt;, or other relevant languages&lt;br data-start=&quot;1351&quot; data-end=&quot;1354&quot; /&gt;&amp;nbsp;Experience with databases such as &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1390&quot; data-end=&quot;1412&quot;&gt;Oracle, SQL Server&lt;/strong&gt;, etc.&lt;br data-start=&quot;1418&quot; data-end=&quot;1421&quot; /&gt;&amp;nbsp;Strong skills in business process modeling and workflow management&lt;br data-start=&quot;1489&quot; data-end=&quot;1492&quot; /&gt;&amp;nbsp;Excellent proble