ta-section-id=&quot;wa1cqy&quot; data-start=&quot;113&quot; data-end=&quot;152&quot;&gt;Health insurance (medical coverage)&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1elu4nz&quot; data-start=&quot;153&quot; data-end=&quot;191&quot;&gt;Paid leaves (casual, sick, earned)&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1sa4caw&quot; data-start=&quot;192&quot; data-end=&quot;243&quot;&gt;Flexible working hours / Work-from-home options&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;17iplkr&quot; data-start=&quot;244&quot; data-end=&quot;288&quot;&gt;Career growth and learning opportunities&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1uu5yk4&quot; data-start=&quot;289&quot; data-end=&quot;327&quot;&gt;Training and certification support&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('c589e49a-f9f5-4196-8046-2322b49f23e3','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','AI/ML Engineer','aiml-engineer-297-297','&lt;p data-start=&quot;56&quot; data-end=&quot;408&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced AI/ML Engineers for a leading Top MNC to work on enterprise-scale Artificial Intelligence, Generative AI, and Agentic AI transformation initiatives. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in Azure AI technologies, machine learning model development, cloud-native AI solutions, and advanced data processing platforms.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;410&quot; data-end=&quot;770&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for designing, developing, and deploying scalable Agentic AI and Generative AI solutions using the Azure AI ecosystem. The role includes building intelligent AI applications, developing and optimizing machine learning models, integrating AI capabilities into enterprise platforms, and ensuring high-performance AI deployments.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;772&quot; data-end=&quot;1059&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with Azure Machine Learning, Azure OpenAI Services, PromptFlow, Databricks, Python, and PySpark. Strong knowledge of AI model fine-tuning, prompt engineering, cloud-based AI architectures, and large-scale data processing is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1061&quot; data-end=&quot;1462&quot;&gt;The role also involves troubleshooting AI/ML solutions, improving model performance, researching emerging AI technologies, and collaborating with business stakeholders, data engineers, and development teams to deliver innovative enterprise AI solutions. Candidates should possess strong analytical thinking, communication, and problem-solving skills with a passion for next-generation AI technologies.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Pune',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-08-22 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-06-24 02:44:13.000000','2026-06-24 02:44:13.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Artificial Intelligence\", \"Machine Learning\", \"Python\", \"Pyspark\", \"Azure Databricks\", \"Generative AI\", \"LLM Fine-tuning\", \"Agentic AI\", \"PromptFlow\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1478&quot; data-end=&quot;1516&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;nrj93i&quot; data-start=&quot;1517&quot; data-end=&quot;1588&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale AI and Digital Transformation projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;5ma4m4&quot; data-start=&quot;1589&quot; data-end=&quot;1655&quot;&gt;Work on cutting-edge Generative AI and Agentic AI technologies&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;4lu7s&quot; data-start=&quot;1656&quot; data-end=&quot;1726&quot;&gt;Career growth in Artificial Intelligence &amp;amp; Machine Learning domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;srp47p&quot; data-start=&quot;1727&quot; data-end=&quot;1794&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global AI and engineering teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot; data-start=&quot;1795&quot; data-end=&quot;1850&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;1851&quot; data-end=&quot;1894&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Maharashtra'),('c5c46085-0692-4592-97f3-c558077b605c','e89ae72d-8340-432c-bbe1-1c3300fd04f0','76e2725a-cd7a-4a87-ab4c-a1f31dfd36a1','Office Assistant','office-assistant-23-23','1 Years of Experience in Telecalling&lt;br /&gt;Flight and Hotel Booking Experience&lt;br /&gt;Customer Care service experience','Travel & Transportation','Contract','Mid',120000.00,180000.00,'₹',1,'India','Patna',0,1,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2025-12-30 18:30:00',0,0,'2025-05-05 20:51:07.000000','2025-08-24 22:39:25.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Customer Care\", \"Flight Reservations\", \"Hotels\", \"Telecalling\", \"Ticketing\"]','[\"Customer Care service experience\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Bihar'),('c5feddcb-2a3e-4f05-9cf1-c1cb14c65ba8','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','SAP Developer','sap-developer-15-15','Job Description: We are seeking an experienced SAP Developer with 6+ years of hands-on experience to join our team. The ideal candidate will be responsible for designing, developing, and implementing SAP applications and solutions to meet business requirements. You will collaborate with cross-functional teams to deliver custom SAP programs, enhance existing modules, and ensure system performance and reliability. Key Responsibilities: Design, develop, and implement SAP custom applications using ABAP, ABAP Objects, and SAP Fiori. Develop and enhance custom reports, interfaces, conversions, forms, and workflows (RICEFW). Integrate SAP modules (FI, CO, MM, SD, PP, HCM, etc.) with third-party applications. Develop and manage SAP OData services and APIs for data integration. Perform code optimization, debugging, and performance tuning of SAP programs. Work with SAP S/4HANA, ECC, and SAP Cloud Platform for development and enhancements. Collaborate with functional consultants and business analysts to gather requirements and deliver solutions. Implement and support SAP Fiori/UI5 applications for an enhanced user experience. Ensure data consistency, integrity, and security across SAP systems. Create and maintain technical documentation for custom developments. Provide production support and troubleshoot issues in SAP environments. Stay updated with the latest SAP technologies, tools, and best practices. Required Skills: 6+ years of experience in SAP development. Strong proficiency in SAP ABAP, ABAP Objects, and SAP Fiori/UI5. Experience with RICEFW objects (Reports, Interfaces, Conversions, Enhancements, Forms, and Workflows). Hands-on experience with SAP S/4HANA and ECC environments. Experience in OData service development and integration. Proficiency in performance tuning and code optimization techniques. Familiarity with SAP CDS Views, AMDP, and RAP. Experience with BAPIs, BADIs, and User Exits. Strong knowledge of SAP tables, data dictionary, and transport management. Hands-on experience with SAP Workflow and IDocs. Proficiency in debugging and troubleshooting complex SAP issues.','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',350000.00,600000.00,'₹',1,'India','Chennai',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-30 06:00:00',0,0,'2025-05-04 19:47:12.000000','2026-05-06 18:02:56.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"S/4HANA\", \"S4 HANA\", \"SAP\", \"SAP ABAP\", \"SAP Apparel\", \"SAP Basis\", \"Sap Basis Administration\", \"SAP BI\", \"Sap Business Objects\", \"SAP FIORI\", \"SAP ME System Enhancements\", \"SAP MES – ERP Integration\", \"Sap-ERP\"]','[\"Benefits: Competitive salary and performance-based bonuses. Health insurance and paid time off. Flexible work hours and remote/hybrid options. Professional development and training opportunities. Collaborative and growth-oriented work environment\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Tamil Nadu'),('c6425720-d7b0-4594-b1de-0cb