tion Technology','Contract','Entry',NULL,NULL,'INR',1,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-05-26 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-03-27 17:11:29.000000','2026-03-27 17:11:29.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Data Modeling\", \"MYSQL\", \"Oracle\", \"Oracle ERP\", \"PostgreSQL\", \"TOAD\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;Competitive salary package with performance-based incentives&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;65&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;67&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;Health insurance coverage and statutory benefits (PF &amp;amp; Gratuity)&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;134&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;136&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on large-scale enterprise energy management projects&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;211&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;213&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;Strong career growth and learning opportunities&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;263&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;265&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;Collaborative and professional work environment&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('c723d2ca-a6d3-47b0-85d7-ec69f9619d72','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Beamex CMX Specialist / SolidWorks Support Analyst','beamex-cmx-specialist-solidworks-support-analyst-353-353','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;92&quot; data-end=&quot;487&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;118&quot; data-end=&quot;174&quot;&gt;Beamex CMX Specialists / SolidWorks Support Analysts&lt;/strong&gt; for a leading Top MNC to support enterprise engineering, calibration management, CAD/PDM, and regulated manufacturing environments. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;359&quot; data-end=&quot;486&quot;&gt;SolidWorks application support, SolidWorks PDM administration, Beamex CMX Calibration, and Computer System Validation (CSV)&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;489&quot; data-end=&quot;916&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for providing L2/L3 technical support for SolidWorks applications, troubleshooting modeling, assembly, drawing, licensing, compatibility, and performance-related issues, and managing SolidWorks PDM environments. The role also includes software installation, configuration, upgrades, user access management, CAD data management, revision control, technical documentation, and end-user training.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;918&quot; data-end=&quot;1263&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;969&quot; data-end=&quot;1111&quot;&gt;SolidWorks, SolidWorks PDM, Beamex CMX, CSV, CAD data management, Windows environments, software deployment, and technical troubleshooting&lt;/strong&gt;. Strong understanding of engineering design workflows, CAD standards, templates, PLM/PDM processes, and manufacturing environments is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1265&quot; data-end=&quot;1666&quot;&gt;The role also involves collaborating with engineering teams, IT support teams, application owners, vendors, and business stakeholders to resolve technical issues, maintain application availability, implement software changes, and support enterprise engineering operations. Candidates should possess strong analytical, communication, stakeholder management, troubleshooting, and problem-solving skills.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Pune',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-09 