enced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;271&quot; data-end=&quot;320&quot;&gt;Critical Manufacturing MES Developers / Leads&lt;/strong&gt; for a leading Top MNC to work on large-scale &lt;strong data-start=&quot;366&quot; data-end=&quot;448&quot;&gt;Manufacturing Execution System (MES), Digital Manufacturing, and Smart Factory&lt;/strong&gt; projects.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;460&quot; data-end=&quot;693&quot;&gt;The ideal candidate should have strong hands-on experience in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;522&quot; data-end=&quot;582&quot;&gt;Critical Manufacturing MES development and customization&lt;/strong&gt;, along with expertise in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;608&quot; data-end=&quot;692&quot;&gt;C#, .NET, SQL Server, Angular, TypeScript, RxJS/NGRX, CI/CD, and MES integration&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;695&quot; data-end=&quot;995&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for developing and customizing &lt;strong data-start=&quot;760&quot; data-end=&quot;800&quot;&gt;Critical Manufacturing MES solutions&lt;/strong&gt;, performing frontend and backend enhancements, supporting MES implementation and integration activities, and working closely with manufacturing and technical teams to deliver scalable solutions.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;997&quot; data-end=&quot;1228&quot;&gt;The role involves participating in Agile/Scrum activities, understanding customer requirements, troubleshooting complex MES issues, implementing technical solutions, and taking ownership of assigned deliverables through to closure.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1230&quot; data-end=&quot;1490&quot;&gt;Professionals with experience in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1263&quot; data-end=&quot;1386&quot;&gt;MES migration, upgrades, OOB MES features, custom solution design, manufacturing processes, and shop-floor applications&lt;/strong&gt; will be highly preferred. Technical Lead or Technical Architect experience would be an added advantage.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-18 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-08-20 03:27:53.000000','2026-08-20 03:27:53.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\".NET\", \"Agile\", \"Angular\", \"C#\", \"Mes\", \"Mes Configuration\", \"Mes ERP Integration\", \"Mes Implementation\", \"MS SQL Server\", \"Typescript\", \"Scrum Master\", \"CI/CD\", \"RxJs\", \"NgRx\", \"Critical Manufacturing\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;i3mxm7&quot; data-start=&quot;1505&quot; data-end=&quot;1549&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a leading Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1y56mc6&quot; data-start=&quot;1550&quot; data-end=&quot;1620&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1581&quot; data-end=&quot;1611&quot;&gt;Critical Manufacturing MES&lt;/strong&gt; projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;fxdou0&quot; data-start=&quot;1621&quot; data-end=&quot;1694&quot;&gt;Work on advanced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1640&quot; data-end=&quot;1682&quot;&gt;Digital Manufacturing and Industry 4.0&lt;/strong&gt; initiatives&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1adk8pt&quot; data-start=&quot;1695&quot; data-end=&quot;1763&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with global manufacturing and technology teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;atuics&quot; data-start=&quot;1764&quot; data-end=&quot;1835&quot;&gt;Exposure to MES implementation, migration, upgrades, and integrations&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1c8chuf&quot; data-start=&quot;1836&quot; data-end=&quot;1926&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with modern technologies including &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1893&quot; data-end=&quot;1926&quot;&gt;.NET, Angular, SQL, and CI/CD&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1dteob1&quot; data-start=&quot;1927&quot; data-end=&quot;1977&quot;&gt;Strong technical and domain growth opportunities&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;121z81&quot; data-start=&quot;1978&quot; data-end=&quot;2043&quot;&gt;Exposure to manufacturing and shop-floor digital transformation&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1efv9fm&quot; data-start=&quot;2044&quot; data-end=&quot;2125&quot;&gt;Opportunity to take ownership of complex MES solutions and technical challenges&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1922k2h&quot; data-start=&quot;2126&quot; data-end=&quot;2194&quot;&gt;Career growth toward &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2149&quot; data-end=&quot;2188&quot;&gt;Technical Lead / Solution Architect&lt;/strong&gt; roles&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('c74d0eea-d48e-46e7-881e-57070623527e','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','IT Business Partner – Supply Chain Analytics','it-business-partner-supply-chain-analytics-329-329','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;86&quot; data-end=&quot;465&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced IT Business Partners &amp;ndash; Supply Chain Analytics for a leading Top MNC to drive enterprise-wide Supply Chain Digital Transformation, ERP modernization, and business analytics initiatives. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in supply chain processes, ERP systems, business intelligence, stakeholder management, and data-driven decision-making.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;467&quot; data-end=&quot;912&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for partnering with Supply Chain, Procurement, Logistics, and Manufacturing teams to identify business opportunities, define digital solutions, and deliver analytics platforms that improve operational performance. The role includes gathering business requirements, implementing ERP-enabled supply chain solutions, developing KPI dashboards, ensuring data governance, and driving continuous process improvements.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;914&quot; data-end=&quot;1292&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with ERP systems such as SAP, including Materials Management (MM), Production Planning (PP), Sales &amp;amp; Distribution (SD), and Logistics modules. Strong expertise in Power BI, Tableau, SAP Analytics Cloud, dashboard development, data pipeline automation, master data management, and business intelligence solutions is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1294&quot; data-end=&quot;1702&quot;&gt;The role also involves collaborating with cross-functional IT teams, managing solution deployments, supporting production environments, enabling Control Tower initiatives, training business users, prioritizing business demands, and aligning technology roadmaps with organizational objectives. Candidates should possess strong analytical, communication, stakeholder management, and business consulting skills.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-09-05 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-07-08 03:01:40.000000','2026-07-08 03:01:40.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"ERP Implementation\", \"KPI Analysis\", \"Power BI\", \"Supply Chain Management\", \"Tableau\", \"Supply Chain Analytics\", \"Procurement Processes\", \"SAP ERP\", \"Materials Management (MM)\", \"Production Planning (PP)\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1718&quot; data-end=&quot;1756&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1knw2er&quot; data-start=&quot;1757&quot; data-end=&quot;1834&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale Supply Chain Digital Transformation projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1txae1h&quot; data-start=&quot;1835&quot; data-end=&quot;1907&quot;&gt;Work on advanced ERP, Business Intelligence, and Analytics solutions&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;mgyjh4&quot; data-start=&quot;1908&quot; data-end=&quot;1981&quot;&gt;Career growth in Supply Chain Technology &amp;amp; Business Consulting domain&lt;/li&g