uires collaboration with operations teams, IT/OT experts, and business stakeholders to support data-driven decision-making and improve manufacturing performance. Candidates should possess strong analytical thinking, problem-solving abilities, and communication skills.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-07-12 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-05-14 03:40:30.000000','2026-05-14 03:40:30.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Advanced Excel\", \"Data Analysis\", \"Data Validation\", \"Data Visualization\", \"KPI Reporting\", \"Power BI\", \"SQL\", \"Tableau\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1325&quot; data-end=&quot;1363&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;8ue3l6&quot; data-start=&quot;1364&quot; data-end=&quot;1422&quot;&gt;Exposure to industrial digital transformation projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1pi0y5s&quot; data-start=&quot;1423&quot; data-end=&quot;1495&quot;&gt;Work on manufacturing analytics and process optimization initiatives&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1u2c6fv&quot; data-start=&quot;1496&quot; data-end=&quot;1565&quot;&gt;Career growth in Industrial Data Analytics &amp;amp; Manufacturing domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1djpck1&quot; data-start=&quot;1566&quot; data-end=&quot;1630&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with cross-functional IT/OT teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot; data-start=&quot;1631&quot; data-end=&quot;1686&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;1687&quot; data-end=&quot;1730&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('c7d31d86-37d7-4f4b-9372-dd0c61c1e648','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','LabX Specialist','labx-specialist-332-332','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;57&quot; data-end=&quot;409&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced LabX Specialists for a leading Top MNC to support enterprise laboratory digitalization and laboratory informatics initiatives. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in Mettler Toledo LabX Software, laboratory instrument integration, system administration, and regulated pharmaceutical or life sciences environments.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;411&quot; data-end=&quot;850&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for configuring, administering, supporting, and optimizing Mettler Toledo LabX Software to ensure efficient laboratory operations and regulatory compliance. The role includes system configuration, instrument integration, user administration, troubleshooting, validation support, data integrity management, and collaboration with laboratory and IT teams to deliver reliable laboratory automation solutions.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;852&quot; data-end=&quot;1265&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with LabX configuration, system administration, analytical instrument integration, Computer System Validation (CSV), GxP regulations, 21 CFR Part 11 compliance, audit trail management, and laboratory automation. Strong understanding of QC/QA laboratory processes, laboratory digitalization, end-user support, and regulated laboratory environments is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1267&quot; data-end=&quot;1686&quot;&gt;The role also involves collaborating with QA, QC, IT teams, laboratory users, and business stakeholders to support implementation projects, system upgrades, documentation, SOP preparation, user training, and continuous improvement initiatives. Candidates should possess strong analytical, communication, stakeholder management, and problem-solving skills while ensuring compliance with quality and regulatory standards.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Hyderabad',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-09-11 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-07-14 02:18:05.000000','2026-07-14 02:18:05.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"CapIQ\", \"CSV\", \"Data Integrity\", \"Gxp Compliance\", \"OQ\", \"PQ\", \"Quality Control (Audit)\", \"21 CFR Part 11\", \"Mettler Toledo LabX Software\", \"LabX Configuration\", \"Laboratory Instrument Integration\", \"Titrator Integration\", \"Balance Integration\", \"pH Meter Integration\", \"Laboratory Automation\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1702&quot; data-end=&quot;1740&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;sj0lu9&quot; data-start=&quot;1741&quot; data-end=&quot;1808&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale Laboratory Digitalization projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;um7fb3&quot; data-start=&quot;1809&quot; data-end=&quot;1882&quot;&gt;Work with advanced Laboratory Informatics and Automation technologies&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;rjc7p9&quot; data-start=&quot;1883&quot; data-end=&quot;1967&quot;&gt;Career growth in Laboratory Information Systems and Digital Laboratory Solutions&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1dbe3vl&quot; data-start=&quot;1968&quot; data-end=&quot;2042&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global laboratory and technology teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;2lee9a&quot; data-start=&quot;2043&quot; data-end=&quot;2098&quot;&gt;Professional and compliance-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;2099&quot; data-end=&quot;2142&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Telangana'),('c860bcdf-ca57-4311-9087-a4d5c530a85b','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','ORTEMS Developer & Support Engineer','ortems-developer-support-engineer-386-386','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;94&quot; data-end=&quot;460&quot;&gt;We are looking for experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;125&quot; data-end=&quot;165&quot;&gt;ORTEMS Developer &amp;amp; Support Engineers&lt;/strong&gt; to join a leading Top MNC and work on advanced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;213&quot; data-end=&quot;233&quot;&gt;DELMIA ORTEM APS&lt;/strong&gt; solutions for manufacturing and production planning environments. The role involves designing, configuring, customizing, developing, and supporting Advanced Planning &amp;amp; Scheduling solutions for complex manufacturing operations.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;462&quot; data-end=&quot;858&quot;&gt;The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;514&quot; data-end=&quot;682&quot;&gt;DELMIA ORTEM / ORTEM APS, finite-capacity production scheduling, production planning, scheduling logic, constraints, priorities, setup times, and planning scenarios&lt;/strong&gt;. The candidate will work on developing optimized production schedules while considering resources, capacity, manufacturing constraints, calendars, and changeover requirements.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;860&quot; data-end=&quot;1194&quot;&gt;The role also involves integrating ORTEM with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;906&quot; data-end=&quot;966&quot;&gt;MES platforms such as DELMIA Apriso and Siemens Opcenter&lt;/strong&gt;, along with ERP systems, preferably &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1003&quot; data-end=&quot;1010&quot;&gt;SAP&lt;/strong&gt;. The engineer will handle data mapping for orders, BOMs, routings, resources, constraints, and calendars, while supporting real-time data exchange between ORTEM, MES, and ERP systems.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-11-10 07:00:00',0,0,'2026-09-12 01:31:50.000000','2026-09-12 01:31:50.000000','INTER