quot; data-end=&quot;1107&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1051&quot; data-end=&quot;1107&quot;&gt;Optimize database design, performance, and scalability&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1108&quot; data-end=&quot;1198&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1110&quot; data-end=&quot;1198&quot;&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional teams to understand data and automation requirements&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1199&quot; data-end=&quot;1264&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1201&quot; data-end=&quot;1264&quot;&gt;Ensure data quality, security, and best engineering practices&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-03-23 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-01-22 22:21:42.000000','2026-01-22 22:21:43.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Code (IaC) Tools\", \"Github\", \"Python\", \"SQL\", \"TerraForm\", \"CI/CD\", \"Power Automate\", \"AWS CDK\", \"Data Engineer\", \"GitHub Actions\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1310&quot; data-end=&quot;1382&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1312&quot; data-end=&quot;1382&quot;&gt;Strong proficiency in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1334&quot; data-end=&quot;1344&quot;&gt;Python&lt;/strong&gt; for data engineering and processing&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1383&quot; data-end=&quot;1452&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1385&quot; data-end=&quot;1452&quot;&gt;Advanced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1394&quot; data-end=&quot;1401&quot;&gt;SQL&lt;/strong&gt; skills (querying, optimization, database design)&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1453&quot; data-end=&quot;1491&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1455&quot; data-end=&quot;1491&quot;&gt;Experience with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1471&quot; data-end=&quot;1489&quot;&gt;Power Automate&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1492&quot; data-end=&quot;1540&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1494&quot; data-end=&quot;1540&quot;&gt;Expertise with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1509&quot; data-end=&quot;1538&quot;&gt;GitHub and GitHub Actions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1541&quot; data-end=&quot;1612&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1543&quot; data-end=&quot;1612&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1568&quot; data-end=&quot;1612&quot;&gt;AWS CDK, Terraform, or similar IaC tools&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('c9f4530c-41d8-4e66-bf02-317ad128c77b','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','OT Engineer (Ignition SCADA)','ot-engineer-ignition-scada-319-319','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;70&quot; data-end=&quot;444&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced OT Engineers for a leading Top MNC to work on enterprise-scale Industrial Automation, Operational Technology (OT), and Digital Transformation projects. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in Ignition SCADA, industrial communication protocols, SCADA system development, and OT/IT integration within manufacturing and process industries.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;446&quot; data-end=&quot;898&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for designing, developing, implementing, and supporting Ignition SCADA applications for industrial automation environments. The role includes configuring Ignition Gateway, developing Vision and Perspective applications, managing tag structures, creating reusable libraries, implementing historian and alarm management solutions, and integrating SCADA systems with PLCs, enterprise applications, and industrial devices.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;900&quot; data-end=&quot;1241&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with Ignition SCADA Core/Gold, ISA-95 standards, OPC UA, MQTT, Modbus, SQL database integration, industrial networking, and SCADA architecture. Strong understanding of OT/IT integration, commissioning, validation, production support, and industrial automation best practices is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1243&quot; data-end=&quot;1709&quot;&gt;The role also involves performing system testing, commissioning, troubleshooting, performance optimization, preparing technical documentation, and collaborating with automation engineers, MES teams, IT teams, and business stakeholders to deliver scalable and reliable industrial automation solutions. Candidates should possess strong analytical thinking, communication, and problem-solving skills with a passion for Smart Manufacturing and Industry 4.0 technologies.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Pune',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-08-30 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-07-02 02:39:27.000000','2026-07-02 02:39:27.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Ignition\", \"Historian\", \"MS SQL Server\", \"PLC Programming\", \"SCADA\", \"Modbus\", \"OPC UA\", \"MQTT\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1725&quot; data-end=&quot;1763&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;mjtz5&quot; data-start=&quot;1764&quot; data-end=&quot;1837&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale Industrial Automation and SCADA projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ig72h1&quot; data-start=&quot;1838&quot; data-end=&quot;1910&quot;&gt;Work on advanced Ignition SCADA and Smart Manufacturing technologies&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;5bm7e&quot; data-start=&quot;1911&quot; data-end=&quot;1976&quot;&gt;Career growth in OT, SCADA &amp;amp; Industrial Digitalization domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1g8u6de&quot; data-start=&quot;1977&quot; data-end=&quot;2052&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global automation and engineering teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot; data-start=&quot;2053&quot; data-end=&quot;2108&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;2109&quot; data-end=&quot;2152&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Maharashtra'),('cac919b5-d246-4273-b3a1-3cb2e3b6d443','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Backend Data Engineer','backend-data-engineer-346-346','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;63&quot; data-end=&quot;422&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;89&quot; data-end=&quot;115&quot;&gt;Backend Data Engineers&lt;/strong&gt; for a leading Top MNC to build enterprise-scale data engineering solutions supporting AI, analytics, and intelligent IT operations platforms. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in modern data engineering, cloud-based data platforms, API integrations, and enterprise data pipeline development.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;424&quot; data-end=&quot;917&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for designing, developing, and maintaining scalable data pipelines that integrate ServiceNow, observability platforms, runbooks, knowledge repositories, RCA documents, and other enterprise data sources into AI platforms. The role includes extracting and transforming operational data, building robust ingestion frameworks, creating optimized data models, managing vector databases, and preparing high-quality datasets for AI and machine learning applications.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;919&quot; data-end=&quot;1251&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with Python, SQL, Azure Data Factory, Azure Databricks, API integration, data modeling, and ServiceNow data integration. Strong knowledge of ETL/ELT processes, cloud data engineering, data quality, data lineage, metadata management, and enterprise data architecture is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1253&quot; data-end=&quot;1704&quot;&gt;The role also involves collaborating with AI engineers, data scientists, solution architects, and business stakeholders to deliver reliable, scalable, and secure data solutions. Candidates will optimize SQL queries, improve data processing performance, ensure data governance, and support AI-driven initiatives by enabling high-quality data pipelines. Strong analytical, communication, stakeholder management, and problem-solving skills are essential.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-09-20 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-07-23 01:36:42.000000','2026-07-23 01:36:42.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"API Integration\", \"Azure Key Vault\", \"Data Integration\", \"Data Modeling\", \"ETL\", \"Python\", \"Root Cause Analysis (RCA)\", \"SQL\", \"ADF\", \"Azure Databricks\", \"Metadata Management\", \"ELT Pipelines\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1720&quot; data-end=&quot;1758&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;tx54tn&quot; data-start=&quot;1759&quot; data-end=&quot;1842&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale AI, Data Engineering, and Cloud Analytics projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;sryw5o&quot; data-start=&quot;1843&quot; data-end=&quot;1919&quot;&gt;Work with modern Azure cloud technologies and intelligent data platforms&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ben0oy&quot; data-start=&quot;1920&quot; data-end=&quot;1990&quot;&gt;Career growth in Data Engineering, AI, and Cloud Data Architecture&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;tpg6vp&quot; data-start=&quot;1991&quot; data-end=&quot;2058&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global engineering and AI teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot; data-start=&quot;2059&quot; data-end=&quot;2114&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;2115&quot; data-end=&quot;2158&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('cad193a3-22c4-49cd-b2dc-508e7e4f6c97','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Wonderware MES Support Executive','wonderware-mes-support-executive-190-190','We are looking for an experienced Wonderware MES Support Executive to provide 24/7 Level-3 technical support for Wonderware MES solutions across multiple sites. The role focuses on troubleshooting, performance optimization, and ensuring smooth MES operations in a manufacturing/CPG environment.&lt;br /&gt;Provide 24/7 L3 technical support for Wonderware MES suite&lt;br /&gt;Troubleshoot MES issues across multiple production sites&lt;br /&gt;Support MES configurations, performance, and OEE monitoring&lt;br /&gt;Handle incident management and root cause analysis&lt;br /&gt;Coordinate with customers and provide regular status updates&lt;br /&gt;Work on MS SQL queries, stored procedures, and reports&lt;br /&gt;Ensure high availability and stability of MES systems','Information Technology','Contract','Entry',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Hyderabad',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-04-11 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-02-10 19:04:25.000000','2026-02-10 19:04:25.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Historian\", \"Mes\", \"MS SQL Server\", \"Stored Procedures\", \"OEE Analysis\", \"AVEVA Intouch HMI\", \"SSRS\", \"ArchestrA\", \"Wonderware OMI\", \"Skelta\"]','[\"Opportunity to work on enterprise-scale MES implementations&lt;br /&gt;Exposure to multi-site global manufacturing environments&lt;br /&gt;12-month contractual assignment with immediate joining&lt;br /&gt;Strong learning and domain expertise growth in MES &amp;amp; CPG&lt;br /&gt;Collaborative customer-facing role\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Telangana'),('cae81b7f-6667-460f-9238-59d2e72e88b9','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Presales Consultant – Pharma Digital Manufacturing','presales-consultant-pharma-digital-manufacturing-336-336','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;92&quot; data-end=&quot;519&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced Presales Consultants &amp;ndash; Pharma Digital Manufacturing for a leading Top MNC to drive enterprise-scale Digital Manufacturing, Smart Factory, and Industry 4.0 transformation initiatives for global pharmaceutical organizations. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in Manufacturing IT, MES/MOM, Connected Plant solutions, presales consulting, solution architecture, and business transformation.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;521&quot; data-end=&quot;955&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for leading end-to-end presales engagements, from opportunity qualification and solution discovery to proposal development and deal closure. The role includes designing Connected Plant and Manufacturing IT solutions, conducting customer workshops, preparing technical and commercial proposals, defining solution architectures, and presenting value-driven digital transformation strategies to clients.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;957&quot; data-end=&quot;1365&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with Pharma Digital Manufacturing, MES/MOM platforms, IT/OT integration, Industry 4.0, IIoT, cloud technologies, AI, analytics, and enterprise manufacturing systems. Strong understanding of production, quality, inventory, material management, supply chain planning, traceability solutions, and pharmaceutical regulatory compliance (CSV, GMP) is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1367&quot; data-end=&quot;1833&quot;&gt;The role also involves collaborating with delivery teams, domain SMEs, solution architects, and business stakeholders to develop scalable and innovative manufacturing solutions. Candidates will prepare RFP/RFI responses, support commercial solutioning, conduct maturity assessments, define technology roadmaps, and drive strategic customer engagements. Strong communication, stakeholder management, consulting, presentation, and problem-solving skills are essential.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-09-11 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-07-14 02:53:28.000000','2026-07-14 02:53:28.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Agile\", \"CSV\", \"Mes\", \"Mes Industry 4.0\", \"Mom Solutions\", \"SDLC\", \"Supply Chain Management\", \"IIoT\", \"Generative AI\", \"Smart Manufacturing\", \"GMP\", \"Solution Design\", \"Industrial IT/OT\", \"Scrum Framework\", \"Pharma Digital Manufacturing\", \"Connected Plant Solutions\", \"Presales Consulting\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1849&quot; data-end=&quot;1887&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;68qjvb&quot; data-start=&quot;1888&quot; data-end=&quot;1983&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale Digital Manufacturing and Industry 4.0 transformation programs&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1fmg89i&quot; data-start=&quot;1984&quot; data-end=&quot;2060&quot;&gt;Work on advanced Connected Plant, MES/MOM, AI, IIoT, and Cloud solutions&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1r8wft4&quot; data-start=&quot;2061&quot; data-end=&quot;2143&quot;&gt;Career growth in Presales, Solution Architecture, and Manufacturing Consulting&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1avb4eg&quot; data-start=&quot;2144&quot; data-end=&quot;2238&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global customers, business leaders, and technology experts&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot; data-start=&quot;2239&quot; data-end=&quot;2294&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-sec