/ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li aria-setsize=&quot;-1&quot; data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;5&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;3&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Impact&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;: Directly contribute to the growth of our business and success in an evolving market.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li aria-setsize=&quot;-1&quot; data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;5&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;4&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Supportive Culture&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;: Work in a collaborative environment with a strong focus on teamwork, innovation, and customer satisfaction.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Maharashtra'),('cc8486ca-0739-4a9b-9347-a44168e81f21','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Azure Administrator','azure-administrator-215-215','&lt;p&gt;1. Manage Azure Subscriptions &amp;amp; Resources &amp;middot; Oversee Azure subscriptions, resource allocation, cost governance, and tagging standards. &amp;middot; Ensure compliance with organizational policies and optimize resource spend. &lt;br /&gt;2. Implement &amp;amp; Manage Azure Storage Solutions &amp;middot; Configure, secure, and monitor Azure storage accounts, blob storage, file shares, and backup vaults. &amp;middot; Ensure storage availability, performance, and lifecycle policies. &lt;br /&gt;3. Configure &amp;amp; Manage Virtual Networks (VNet) &amp;middot; Design and maintain VNets, subnets, NSGs, firewalls, and VPN/ExpressRoute connectivity. &amp;middot; Ensure secure and reliable network communication. &lt;br /&gt;4. Manage Identities &amp;amp; Access (Azure AD)&amp;middot; Administer users, groups, roles, and RBAC policies. &amp;middot; Implement conditional access and identity protection policies. &lt;br /&gt;5. Deploy &amp;amp; Manage Compute Resources &amp;middot; Provision and manage virtual machines, scale sets, containers, and associated compute workloads. &amp;middot; Optimize configurations for performance and cost.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Entry',NULL,NULL,'INR',1,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-05-17 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-03-18 17:57:29.000000','2026-03-18 17:57:29.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Azure\", \"Azure  Security\", \"Azure Basics\", \"Azure Data Engineer\", \"Azure Firewall\", \"VPN\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;Competitive salary package with performance-based incentives&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;65&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;67&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;Health insurance coverage and statutory benefits (PF &amp;amp; Gratuity)&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;134&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;136&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on large-scale enterprise energy management projects&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;211&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;213&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;Strong career growth and learning opportunities&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;263&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;265&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;Collaborative and professional work environment&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('ccee173e-3643-489a-bdeb-7df03cea84ad','9761d44d-0ba1-4d3e-9735-b908d67e4c77','03405083-d488-4f2b-b894-70962cac2b62','Hiring GW Configurator','hiring-gw-configurator-38-38','&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Description for GW Configurator&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;table&gt;\r\n&lt;tbody&gt;\r\n&lt;tr&gt;\r\n&lt;td width=&quot;93&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Job Title:&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/td&gt;\r\n&lt;td width=&quot;503&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;GW Configurator&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/td&gt;\r\n&lt;/tr&gt;\r\n&lt;tr&gt;\r\n&lt;td width=&quot;93&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Primary Skill:&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/td&gt;\r\n&lt;td width=&quot;503&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;P&amp;amp;C Insurance Knowledge, Configuration and customization of GW InsuranceSuite, Willing to learn SQL/PLSQL and GW Database schema and relations.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/td&gt;\r\n&lt;/tr&gt;\r\n&lt;tr&gt;\r\n&lt;td width=&quot;93&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Secondary Skill:&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/td&gt;\r\n&lt;td width=&quot;503&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;SQL/PLSQl&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/td&gt;\r\n&lt;/tr&gt;\r\n&lt;tr&gt;\r\n&lt;td width=&quot;93&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Location:&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/td&gt;\r\n&lt;td width=&quot;503&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Hyderabad&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/td&gt;\r\n&lt;/tr&gt;\r\n&lt;tr&gt;\r\n&lt;td width=&quot;93&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Experience&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/td&gt;\r\n&lt;td width=&quot;503&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;7+ Years&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/td&gt;\r\n&lt;/tr&gt;\r\n&lt;/tbody&gt;\r\n&lt;/table&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;About the job&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a highly skilled Guidewire Configurator to join our insurance technology team. The ideal candidate will be responsible for configuring and customizing the Guidewire InsuranceSuite (PolicyCenter, BillingCenter, or ClaimCenter) to meet business and technical requirements. You will work closely with business analysts, developers, testers, and stakeholders to ensure seamless implementation and support of Guidewire solutions.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Know your team (&ldquo;Legacy Rewired, Engineering the Future&rdquo;)&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;At ValueMomentum&rsquo; s Technology Solution Centre(TSC), we are a team of passionate engineers who thrive on tackling complex business challenges with innovative solutions while transforming the P&amp;amp;C insurance value chain. We achieve this through strong engineering foundation and continuously refining our processes, methodologies, tools, agile delivery teams, and core engineering archetypes. Our core expertise lies in six key areas: Cloud TSC, Application TSC, Data TSC, Core TSC, Quality TSC, and Domain expertise.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Join a team that invests in your growth. Our Infinity Program empowers you to build your career with role-specific skill development leveraging immersive learning platforms. You&#039;ll have the opportunity to showcase your talents by contributing to impactful projects.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Job Responsibilities:&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Configure business rules, user interface (UI), and data model components within Guidewire PolicyCenter, BillingCenter, or ClaimCenter.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with business analysts to understand functional requirements and translate them into technical specifications.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Implement changes using Guidewire&#039;s Gosu programming language where scripting is needed.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Participate in design sessions and provide input on configuration best practices.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Troubleshoot and resolve issues related to Guidewire configuration and integration.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Perform unit testing and support system/integration testing phases.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Ensure configurations follow company standards, performance best practices, and security protocols.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Maintain documentation for all configuration changes and enhancements.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with QA and development teams to deliver high-quality Guidewire solutions&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Stay updated on Guidewire version upgrades and new feature capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Learn SQL/PLSQL and understand entity relationships within the Guidewire schema, including related diagrams, with the goal of transitioning into a Guidewire Data Analyst role within 45 days.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Begin performing responsibilities of a Guidewire Data Analyst within 2 to 3 months.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Requirements:&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Minimum 3+ years of hands-on experience with Guidewire configuration (PolicyCenter, BillingCenter, or ClaimCenter).&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Proficient in Guidewire Studio and configuration of data model, UI, and business rules.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Experience with Gosu scripting language.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Understanding of Agile software development methodologies.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with web services (SOAP/REST), XML, and integration frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and problem-solving skill.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and collaboration skills.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Must Have:&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;GW configuration expertise&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Gosu programming language&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with RESTful web services&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;P&amp;amp;C Insurance Knowledge&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Good to Have&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Agile knowledge&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;GW certifications&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;About the Company:&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.valuemomentum.com/&quot;&gt;ValueMomentum &lt;/a&gt;is amongst the fastest growing insurance-focused IT services providers in North America. Leading insurers trust ValueMomentum with their core, digital and data transformation initiatives. Having grown consistently every year by 24%, we have now grown to over 4000 employees. ValueMomentum is committed to integrity and to ensuring that each team and employee is successful. We foster an open work culture where employees&#039; opinions are valued. We believe in teamwork and cultivate a sense of fun, fellowship, and pride among our employees.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Benefits:&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;We at Value Momentum offer you the opportunity to grow by working alongside the experts. Some of the benefits you can avail are:&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation package comparable to the best in the&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Career Advancement: Individual Career Development, coaching and mentoring programs for professional and leadership skill development.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Comprehensive training and certification&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Performance Management: Goal Setting, continuous feedback and year-end Reward &amp;amp; recognition for the extraordinary performers.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Benefits: Comprehensive health benefits, wellness and fitness Paid time off and holidays.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Culture: A highly transparent organization with an open-door policy and a vibrant culture&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;and a vibrant culture&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',2000000.00,3000000.00,'₹',1,'India','Hyderabad',0,1,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-07-31 06:00:00',0,0,'2025-05-22 07:06:18.000000','2026-05-04 00:15:59.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Database\", \"Microsoft SQL\", \"Guidewire PolicyCenter\", \"Guidewire QA\", \"Guidewire Integration\", \"Guidewire PC\", \"Guidewire Manual Testing\"]','[\"All Benifites as per Company Norms\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Telangana'),('cd2ef67a-e64a-4404-b084-e1c8f174c22f','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','PROMIS MES Engineer','promis-mes-engineer-354-354','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;61&quot; data-end=&quot;411&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;87&quot; data-end=&quot;111&quot;&gt;PROMIS MES Engineers&lt;/strong&gt; for a leading Top MNC to support enterprise-scale Semiconductor Manufacturing Execution System (MES) and smart manufacturing initiatives. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in PROMIS MES, Oracle database technologies, Unix/Linux environments, and semiconductor manufacturing processes.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;413&quot; data-end=&quot;780&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for configuring, maintaining, troubleshooting, and supporting PROMIS MES applications across semiconductor manufacturing environments. The role includes production support, MES configuration, incident resolution, database development, system monitoring, and ensuring smooth MES operations across high-volume manufacturing facilities.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;782&quot; data-end=&quot;1083&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;833&quot; data-end=&quot;943&quot;&gt;PROMIS MES, Oracle SQL, PL/SQL, DCL, Unix Shell Scripting, OpenVMS, Linux, and Semiconductor Manufacturing&lt;/strong&gt;. Experience supporting wafer fabrication, advanced packaging, factory automation, and semiconductor production systems is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1085&quot; data-end=&quot;1465&quot;&gt;The role also involves collaborating with manufacturing operations, equipment engineering, IT, automation, and global MES teams to resolve production issues, implement system enhancements, support factory applications, and maintain system reliability. Candidates should possess strong analytical, troubleshooting, communication, stakeholder management, and problem-solving skills.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Pune',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-09 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-08-11 03:29:42.000000','2026-08-11 03:29:42.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Linux\", \"Mes Configuration\", \"Oracle\", \"PL/SQL\", \"SQL\", \"UNIX Shells\", \"Semiconductor Manufacturing Processes\", \"PROMIS MES\", \"Semiconductor Manufacturing Execution Systems\", \"MES Application Support\", \"OpenVMS\", \"Wafer Fabrication\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1481&quot; data-end=&quot;1519&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1h47ls4&quot; data-start=&quot;1520&quot; data-end=&quot;1603&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale Semiconductor MES and Smart Manufacturing projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;tgqbuf&quot; data-start=&quot;1604&quot; data-end=&quot;1697&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience with PROMIS MES and advanced semiconductor manufacturing technologies&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;17wnnju&quot; data-start=&quot;1698&quot; data-end=&quot;1757&quot;&gt;Career growth in Semiconductor Manufacturing IT and MES&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;13qji02&quot; data-start=&quot;1758&quot; data-end=&quot;1835&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global manufacturing and technology teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;kd7xt1&quot; data-start=&quot;1836&quot; data-end=&quot;1909&quot;&gt;Exposure to high-volume wafer fab and advanced packaging environments&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot; data-start=&quot;1910&quot; data-end=&quot;1965&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Maharashtra'),('cd6fd610-b866-4374-b265-b3f44fb5ed8b','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Senior Software Engineer (Python)','senior-software-engineer-python-242-242','4+ years of strong experience in Python (must-have)&lt;br /&gt;Expertise in SQL (Postgres/Snowflake)&lt;br /&gt;Experience with Flask, REST APIs, SQLAlchemy&lt;br /&gt;Exposure to AWS, Docker, and Agile methodologies&lt;br /&gt;Frontend experience with Angular (or React)','Information Technology','Contract','Entry',NULL,NULL,'INR',1,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-06-02 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-04-03 21:39:35.000000','2026-04-03 21:39:35.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Angular\", \"AWS\", \"Azure SQL Database\", \"Consuming REST API Services\", \"Docker\", \"Python\", \"React\", \"Snowflake\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;Competitive salary package with performance-based incentives&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;65&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;67&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;Health insurance coverage and statutory benefits (PF &amp;amp; Gratuity)&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;134&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;136&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on large-scale enterprise energy management projects&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;211&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;213&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;Strong career growth and learning opportunities&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;263&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;265&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;Collaborative and professional work environment&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('cd750a01-68c7-403f-9b46-2ed9ff748a76','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Apriso Solution Architect (DELMIA Apriso MES)','apriso-solution-architect-delmia-apriso-mes-342-342','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;87&quot; data-end=&quot;505&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced Apriso Solution Architects for a leading Top MNC to drive enterprise-scale Manufacturing Execution System (MES), Manufacturing Operations Management (MOM), and Smart Manufacturing transformation initiatives. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in Dassault Syst&amp;egrave;mes DELMIA Apriso MES, enterprise solution architecture, manufacturing processes, and digital transformation programs.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;507&quot; data-end=&quot;943&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for designing, architecting, and delivering end-to-end DELMIA Apriso MES solutions across global manufacturing organizations. The role includes conducting fit-gap analysis, defining solution architecture, translating business requirements into technical solutions, leading implementation programs, supporting system upgrades, and ensuring seamless integration between enterprise and shop-floor systems.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;945&quot; data-end=&quot;1534&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with DELMIA Apriso MES (2016&amp;ndash;2025), Manufacturing Operations Management (MOM), Apriso Screen Framework, Process Builder, Global Process Manager (GPM), machine integration, business integration, ERP integration using XSLT, OPC DA/UA, RS232 communication, JavaScript, C# scripting, SQL Server, Oracle Database, and performance optimization. Strong knowledge of production execution, order management, quality management, warehouse operations, maintenance management, time and labor management, and complex assembly processes is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1536&quot; data-end=&quot;2099&quot;&gt;The role also involves leading technical architecture, preparing Functional and Technical Design documents, supporting RFI/RFQ/RFP responses, effort estimation, project planning, customer workshops, solution reviews, and mentoring development teams. Candidates will collaborate with business stakeholders, manufacturing teams, automation engineers, and global delivery teams to deliver scalable, secure, and high-performance MES solutions. Strong leadership, consulting, stakeholder management, communication, analytical, and problem-solving skills are essential.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Entry',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Pune',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-09-15 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-07-18 03:06:02.000000','2026-07-18 03:06:02.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"AJAX\", \"Apriso\", \"C#\", \"ERP\", \"GPM Deployment\", \"JavaScript\", \"Mes\", \"Mes Implementation\", \"Microsoft SQL Server\", \"Mom Systems\", \"Oracle\", \"Solution Architect\", \"Transact-SQL\", \"OPC UA\", \"Dassault DELMIA Apriso MES\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;2115&quot; data-end=&quot;2153&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1r9fmxd&quot; data-start=&quot;2154&quot; data-end=&quot;2244&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale MES, MOM, and Smart Manufacturing transformation projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ng2d7s&quot; data-start=&quot;2245&quot; data-end=&quot;2313&quot;&gt;Work on advanced DELMIA Apriso MES and Industry 4.0 technologies&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1b78xst&quot; data-start=&quot;2314&quot; data-end=&quot;2393&quot;&gt;Career growth in Solution Architecture and Digital Manufacturing Consulting&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;13qji02&quot; data-start=&quot;2394&quot; data-end=&quot;2471&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global manufacturing and technology teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot; data-start=&quot;2472&quot; data-end=&quot;2527&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;2528&quot; data-end=&quot;2571&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Maharashtra'),('cda5582d-a6d3-4813-864a-fa6d2161031c','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','SAP UI5 Developer','sap-ui5-developer-158-158','&lt;p data-start=&quot;175&quot; data-end=&quot;594&quot;&gt;We are looking for an experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;209&quot; data-end=&quot;230&quot;&gt;SAP UI5 Developer&lt;/strong&gt; responsible for designing, developing, testing, and supporting SAP UI5 applications. The ideal candidate must have strong hands-on experience in SAP UI5 (MVC architecture), HTML5, JavaScript, CSS, and OData services. The role involves development, deployment, UAT support, documentation, and collaboration with project teams to deliver high-quality UI5 solutions.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;hr data-start=&quot;596&quot; data-end=&quot;599&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h1 data-start=&quot;601&quot; data-end=&quot;629&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;605&quot; data-end=&quot;629&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;\r\n&lt;ol data-start=&quot;630&quot; data-end=&quot;918&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;630&quot; data-end=&quot;688&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;633&quot; data-end=&quot;688&quot;&gt;Design, develop, and test applications using SAP UI5.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;689&quot; data-end=&quot;755&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;692&quot; data-end=&quot;755&quot;&gt;Deploy and configure SAP UI5 objects and provide UAT support.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;756&quot; data-end=&quot;812&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;759&quot; data-end=&quot;812&quot;&gt;Maintain and enhance existing SAP UI5 applications.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;813&quot; data-end=&quot;865&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;816&quot; data-end=&quot;865&quot;&gt;Prepare functional and technical documentation.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;866&quot; data-end=&quot;918&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;869&quot; data-end=&quot;918&quot;&gt;Work collaboratively as part of a project team.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ol&gt;','Information Technology','Full-time','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Hyderabad',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-31 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-12-03 03:07:05.000000','2025-12-03 03:07:05.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"AJAX\", \"HTML\", \"HTML5\", \"JavaScript\", \"JQUERY\", \"MVC\", \"OOPS\", \"REST API\", \"Sap UI5\", \"XML\", \"CMS\", \"SAP MII Development\", \"OData Protocols\", \"SAP NetWeaver\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1507&quot; data-end=&quot;1537&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1509&quot; data-end=&quot;1537&quot;&gt;Competitive salary package&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1538&quot; data-end=&quot;1589&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1540&quot; data-end=&quot;1589&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with leading global clients&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1590&quot; data-end=&quot;1626&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1592&quot; data-end=&quot;1626&quot;&gt;Growth-oriented work environment&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1627&quot; data-end=&quot;1667&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1629&quot; data-end=&quot;1667&quot;&gt;Skill enhancement &amp;amp; training support&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1668&quot; data-end=&quot;1710&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1670&quot; data-end=&quot;1710&quot;&gt;Work-life balance &amp;amp; team collaboration&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Telangana'),('cec6a382-dca0-49d2-9f3d-b18108113d99','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Application Developer – GE Plant Apps','application-developer-ge-plant-apps-143-143','&lt;p data-start=&quot;258&quot; data-end=&quot;594&quot;&gt;We are seeking an experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;288&quot; data-end=&quot;329&quot;&gt;Application Developer (GE Plant Apps)&lt;/strong&gt; to join a leading global organization driving digital transformation in manufacturing.&lt;br data-start=&quot;416&quot; data-end=&quot;419&quot; /&gt;In this role, you will work on implementing, customizing, and supporting &lt;strong data-start=&quot;492&quot; data-end=&quot;517&quot;&gt;GE Plant Applications&lt;/strong&gt; across modules like Production, Quality, Efficiency, and Data Integration.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;596&quot; data-end=&quot;876&quot;&gt;You will collaborate with manufacturing, quality, and automation teams to design scalable solutions, develop SQL-driven logic, integrate shop-floor systems, and ensure seamless MES operations.&lt;br data-start=&quot;788&quot; data-end=&quot;791&quot; /&gt;Candidates with experience in regulated environments (like Pharma) will be preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;hr data-start=&quot;878&quot; data-end=&quot;881&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;883&quot; data-end=&quot;913&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;886&quot; data-end=&quot;913&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;914&quot; data-end=&quot;1481&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;914&quot; data-end=&quot;1010&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;916&quot; data-end=&quot;1010&quot;&gt;Develop, configure, and support &lt;strong data-start=&quot;948&quot; data-end=&quot;973&quot;&gt;GE Plant Apps modules&lt;/strong&gt; (Production, Quality, Efficiency).&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1011&quot; data-end=&quot;1087&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1013&quot; data-end=&quot;1087&quot;&gt;Design and implement SQL-based logic, queries, triggers, and procedures.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1088&quot; data-end=&quot;1159&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1090&quot; data-end=&quot;1159&quot;&gt;Integrate MES with ERP, LIMS, SCADA, PLCs using APIs or middleware.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1160&quot; data-end=&quot;1232&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1162&quot; data-end=&quot;1232&quot;&gt;Troubleshoot MES performance issues and provide long-term solutions.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1233&quot; data-end=&quot;1304&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1235&quot; data-end=&quot;1304&quot;&gt;Develop MES reports, dashboards, and analytics for production KPIs.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1305&quot; data-end=&quot;1391&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1307&quot; data-end=&quot;1391&quot;&gt;Work closely with cross-functional teams to understand manufacturing requirements.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1392&quot; data-end=&quot;1481&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1394&quot; data-end=&quot;1481&quot;&gt;Ensure compliance with GMP, GxP, and other regulatory standards (preferred for pharma).&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Full-time','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-20 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-11-22 04:07:12.000000','2025-11-22 04:07:12.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"ERP\", \"KPIS\", \"Lims\", \"Mes Reporting\", \"Production\", \"Quality\", \"SCADA\", \"SQL\", \"Stored Procedures\", \"Database Design\", \"Pharma\", \"GE Plant Apps\", \"Efficiency Modules\"]','[\"&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1507&quot; data-end=&quot;1859&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1507&quot; data-end=&quot;1557&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1509&quot; data-end=&quot;1557&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1536&quot; data-end=&quot;1554&quot;&gt;Top Global MNC&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1558&quot; data-end=&quot;1627&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1560&quot; data-end=&quot;1627&quot;&gt;Exposure to large-scale &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1584&quot; data-end=&quot;1624&quot;&gt;MES &amp;amp; Digital Manufacturing projects&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1628&quot; data-end=&quot;1678&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1630&quot; data-end=&quot;1678&quot;&gt;Attractive salary package based on experience.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1679&quot; data-end=&quot;1741&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1681&quot; data-end=&quot;1741&quot;&gt;Chance to work with the latest manufacturing technologies.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1742&quot; data-end=&quot;1807&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1744&quot; data-end=&quot;1807&quot;&gt;Career growth in Industry 4.0 and Smart Manufacturing domain.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1808&quot; data-end=&quot;1859&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1810&quot; data-end=&quot;1859&quot;&gt;Collaborative and innovation-driven work culture.&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('ced352f9-67a0-4ebb-82bd-68186d68a4dc','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Operations Analyst','operations-analyst-236-236','&amp;nbsp;&lt;br /&gt;This role focuses on managing seller operations, analyzing data, and improving overall operational efficiency. You will work closely with sellers and internal teams to ensure smooth execution and business growth.&lt;br /&gt;&amp;nbsp;Key Responsibilities&lt;br /&gt;&amp;bull; Manage seller relationships and resolve queries&lt;br /&gt;&amp;bull; Analyze operational and sales data to generate insights&lt;br /&gt;&amp;bull; Create dashboards and reports (daily/weekly/monthly)&lt;br /&gt;&amp;bull; Ensure adherence to operational processes and SOPs&lt;br /&gt;&amp;bull; Collaborate with cross-functional teams (logistics, catalog, category)','Information Technology','Contract','Entry',NULL,NULL,'INR',1,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-06-02 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-04-03 20:31:40.000000','2026-04-03 20:31:40.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Data Accuracy\", \"Data Analyst\", \"Data and Analytics\", \"Power BI\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;Competitive salary package with performance-based incentives&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;65&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;67&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;Health insurance coverage and statutory benefits (PF &amp;amp; Gratuity)&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;134&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;136&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on large-scale enterprise energy management projects&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;211&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;213&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;Strong career growth and learning opportunities&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;263&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;265&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;Collaborative and professional work environment&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('cfa8e471-0bbd-4f39-a0c2-625aefde6c97','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Sr Oracle Developer/ DBA','sr-oracle-developer-dba-227-227','&amp;middot; Proficiency in SQL and PL/SQL: involving writing complex queries, stored procedures, functions, packages, and triggers for managing and manipulating data effectively.&lt;br /&gt;&amp;middot; Understanding Oracle Database Architecture: A deep understanding of database components like tablespaces, data files, schema objects, and memory structures is essential for efficient development and troubleshooting. &lt;br /&gt;&amp;middot; Performance Tuning and Optimization: Skills in query optimization, using EXPLAIN PLAN, indexing (B-tree, bitmap), and other techniques to ensure optimal database performance are highly valued.&lt;br /&gt;&amp;middot; Data Modelling and Design: The ability to design efficient, scalable, and normalized database schemas (tables, relationships) is fundamental to meeting business requirements and ensuring data integrity. &lt;br /&gt;&amp;middot; Experience with Oracle Tools: Proficiency in Oracle-specific tools streamlines workflows. Key tools include: Oracle SQL Developer and TOAD for development and administration.&lt;br /&gt;&amp;middot; Problem-Solving and Analytical Skills: The ability to analyze complex issue