grams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('d0044b47-1f7c-4c04-b617-5dc02231210f','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','OT Security Consultant','ot-security-consultant-196-196','1. Conduct site-level risk assessments, vulnerability analyses, and provide mitigation strategies while supporting incident response planning and remediation. &lt;br /&gt;2. Experience with Industrial control system / Operational technology (PLC/SCADA/Historian / DCS/ MES) &lt;br /&gt;3. Good understanding of Server dimensioning, DMZ and perdue model. Knowledge of Firewall rules and VLAN Mapping &lt;br /&gt;4. Working knowledge of Current OT security standards like NIST 800-82, ISA99, NERC, IEC-62443&lt;br /&gt;5. Deep knowledge of ICS Components and interface protocols (IEC61850-8-1, IEC61850-9-2, IEC 60870-5-101/104, MODBUS, OPC, C37.118, SNMP, NTP, SFTP, SSH) &lt;br /&gt;6. Good to know MS Visio to create network reference architecture and data flow diagram. Inventory preparation&amp;rsquo;s coordination with Plant team, Local partners, internal stakeholders.','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'INR',1,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-04-21 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-02-20 22:33:34.000000','2026-02-20 22:33:34.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Mes\", \"Opc\", \"PLC\", \"PLC Systems\", \"Risk Assessment\", \"SCADA\", \"SCADA Systems\", \"SNMP\", \"SSH\", \"DCS\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;Competitive salary package with performance-based incentives&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;65&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;67&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;Health insurance coverage and statutory benefits (PF &amp;amp; Gratuity)&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;134&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-st