to work on large-scale enterprise energy management projects&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;211&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;213&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;Strong career growth and learning opportunities&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;263&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;265&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;Collaborative and professional work environment&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('d050ca3b-fd5a-41ce-b13c-85e49b5a3ff0','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Maintenance Engineer – Master Data Specialist | SAP EAM/MM','maintenance-engineer-master-data-specialist-sap-eammm-384-384','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;96&quot; data-end=&quot;466&quot;&gt;We are looking for an experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;130&quot; data-end=&quot;179&quot;&gt;Maintenance Engineer &amp;ndash; Master Data Specialist&lt;/strong&gt; with strong expertise in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;205&quot; data-end=&quot;274&quot;&gt;SAP EAM/MM, SAP S/4HANA EAM &amp;amp; MM, and Oil &amp;amp; Gas Plant Maintenance&lt;/strong&gt;. The role will be responsible for managing and maintaining high-quality maintenance, asset, equipment, material, and technical master data across upstream, midstream, and refinery operations.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;468&quot; data-end=&quot;879&quot;&gt;The ideal candidate should have a strong engineering background in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;535&quot; data-end=&quot;619&quot;&gt;Mechanical, Instrumentation, Electrical Engineering, or relevant technical trade&lt;/strong&gt;, combined with hands-on experience in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;658&quot; data-end=&quot;696&quot;&gt;Oil &amp;amp; Gas maintenance environments&lt;/strong&gt;. The candidate will work on SAP EAM/MM master data, including technical objects, assets, maintenance plans, BOMs, measuring points, materials, and associated technical documentation.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;881&quot; data-end=&quot;1227&quot;&gt;The role requires strong understanding of &lt;strong data-start=&quot;923&quot; data-end=&quot;1040&quot;&gt;maintenance strategies, plant equipment, P&amp;amp;IDs, work instructions, data sheets, SLDs, and technical documentation&lt;/strong&gt;. The candidate will collaborate closely with Site, Reliability, Integrity, Projects, Operations, and HSE teams to ensure accurate, consistent, and business-ready maintenance master data.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-11-02 07:00:00',0,0,'2026-09-04 04:09:28.000000','2026-09-04 04:09:29.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Power BI\", \"SAP (Oil Module)\", \"SAP FIORI\", \"SAP S4 HANA\", \"Mesosphere\", \"Master Data Management (MDM)\", \"SAP GUI\", \"UAT (User Acceptance Testing)\", \"SAP EAM & MM\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;iofbfz&quot; data-start=&quot;1539&quot; data-end=&quot;1587&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a leading &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1576&quot; data-end=&quot;1587&quot;&gt;Top MNC&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;inkeli&quot; data-start=&quot;1588&quot; data-end=&quot;1660&quot;&gt;Exposure to large-scale &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1614&quot; data-end=&quot;1660&quot;&gt;Oil &amp;amp; Gas and Plant Maintenance operations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;15p13hn&quot; data-start=&quot;1661&quot; data-end=&quot;1712&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1688&quot; data-end=&quot;1712&quot;&gt;SAP S/4HANA EAM &amp;amp; MM&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;y354p5&quot; data-start=&quot;1713&quot; data-end=&quot;1748&quot;&gt;Exposure to SAP GUI and &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1739&quot; data-end=&quot;1748&quot;&gt;Fiori&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1m1vs7c&quot; data-start=&quot;1749&quot; data-end=&quot;1829&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on enterprise-scale &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1791&quot; data-end=&quot;1829&quot;&gt;Maintenance Master Data Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1xq5b61&quot; data-start=&quot;1830&quot; data-end=&quot;1910&quot;&gt;Collaboration with Reliability, Integrity, Operations, Projects, and HSE teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;yvvkc0&quot; data-start=&quot;1911&quot; data-end=&quot;1992&quot;&gt;Exposure to asset management, maintenance strategies, and reliability practicesoil&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('d110f612-2d2f-400a-9c26-de24ec67cd9a','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Systems Engineer – MES','systems-engineer-mes-390-390','&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an experienced Senior SCADA Engineer to join a high-tech battery manufacturing facility and lead the design, development, integration, commissioning, and support of advanced SCADA and industrial automation systems. The role will involve working on large-scale plant automation environments with strong exposure to SCADA, PLC, BMS, data acquisition, and smart factory technologies.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate should have strong hands-on expertise in Ignition SCADA, PLC systems, Siemens TIA Portal, Rockwell Automation, Beckhoff TwinCAT, and Omron Sysmac. The candidate will be responsible for developing robust SCADA and PLC architectures and managing the complete automation lifecycle, including design, FAT, SAT, commissioning, integration, handover, and production support.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The role will also involve leading SCADA vendor technical scope, system integration, implementation, diagnostics, alarm management, and real-time monitoring. The engineer will work closely with Process, Facilities, EHS, Quality, and other plant engineering teams to ensure reliable and effective automation across the manufacturing facility.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-11-18 07:00:00',0,0,'2026-09-19 17:23:35.000000','2026-09-19 17:23:35.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Ignition\", \"PLC\", \"SCADA\", \"Siemens\", \"OPC UA\"]','[\"&lt;p&gt;Opportunity to work with a leading Top MNC&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p&gt;Exposure to next-generation battery manufacturing automation&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p&gt;Work on large-scale SCADA and PLC systems&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p&gt;Hands-on experience with Ignition SCADA and multiple PLC platforms&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p&gt;Exposure to Smart Factory / Industry 4.0 initiatives&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p&gt;Opportunity to work with BMS and plant automation systems&lt;/p&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('d1afdfd1-3e6a-4897-b19a-66f09d843063','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Business Development - IT Infrastructure Specialist','business-development-it-infrastructure-specialist-80-80','&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a results-driven Business Development Specialist with 5+ years of experience in IT Infrastructure Sales. The ideal candidate will be responsible for generating leads, closing enterprise-level deals, managing client relationships, and driving revenue growth in cloud services, networking, storage, and datacenter solutions across Delhi and nearby regions. This is a full-time opportunity with a leading IT System Integrator.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',1500000.00,2000000.00,'₹',1,'India','New Delhi',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-19 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-07-17 08:51:27.000000','2025-11-21 04:47:09.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Cisco Routers\", \"Client Acquisition\", \"Cloud Infrastructure\", \"Cloud Sales\", \"Data Center\", \"Enterprise\", \"Firewalls\", \"IT Infrastructure\", \"IT Networking\", \"Switches\"]','[\"Competitive Salary + Performance-Based Incentives&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Opportunity to work with a reputed IT solutions provider&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Leadership and team management responsibilities&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Exposure to enterprise and government clients&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Career growth in high-demand IT Infrastructure industry&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Product and technology training from global OEMs&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Collaborative and growth-driven work culture\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Delhi'),('d1ff51ef-3bb3-444a-a8d3-767d9c997fab','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','React Native Developer','react-native-developer-30-30','&lt;h2 class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;304&quot; data-end=&quot;349&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;310&quot; data-end=&quot;347&quot;&gt;Job Title: React Native Developer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;350&quot; data-end=&quot;449&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;350&quot; data-end=&quot;365&quot;&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 5&ndash;10 Years&lt;br data-start=&quot;376&quot; data-end=&quot;379&quot; /&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;379&quot; data-end=&quot;392&quot;&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt;&nbsp;Chennai&lt;br data-start=&quot;421&quot; data-end=&quot;424&quot; /&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;424&quot; data-end=&quot;437&quot;&gt;Job Type:&lt;/strong&gt; Full-time&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;451&quot; data-end=&quot;480&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;455&quot; data-end=&quot;480&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ol data-start=&quot;481&quot; data-end=&quot;1133&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;481&quot; data-end=&quot;565&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;484&quot; data-end=&quot;565&quot;&gt;Develop and maintain high-performance mobile applications using &lt;strong data-start=&quot;548&quot; data-end=&quot;564&quot;&gt;React Native&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;566&quot; data-end=&quot;673&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;569&quot; data-end=&quot;673&quot;&gt;Implement complex UI components and ensure seamless user experiences across platforms (iOS and Android).&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;674&quot; data-end=&quot;783&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;677&quot; data-end=&quot;783&quot;&gt;Utilize &lt;strong data-start=&quot;685&quot; data-end=&quot;707&quot;&gt;React fundamentals&lt;/strong&gt; such as components, props, state, hooks, and lifecycle methods effectively.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;784&quot; data-end=&quot;865&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;787&quot; data-end=&quot;865&quot;&gt;Integrate mobile applications with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;822&quot; data-end=&quot;835&quot;&gt;REST APIs&lt;/strong&gt; and handle asynchronous data.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;866&quot; data-end=&quot;936&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;869&quot; data-end=&quot;936&quot;&gt;Optimize application performance, memory usage, and responsiveness.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;937&quot; data-end=&quot;996&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;940&quot; data-end=&quot;996&quot;&gt;Implement &lt;strong data-start=&quot;950&quot; data-end=&quot;985&quot;&gt;Redux or other state management&lt;/strong&gt; solutions.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;997&quot; data-end=&quot;1062&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1000&quot; data-end=&quot;1062&quot;&gt;Participate in code reviews, testing, and debugging processes.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1063&quot; data-end=&quot;1133&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1066&quot; data-end=&quot;1133&quot;&gt;Handle &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1073&quot; data-end=&quot;1092&quot;&gt;CI/CD pipelines&lt;/strong&gt; and participate in deployment workflows.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ol&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1135&quot; data-end=&quot;1160&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1139&quot; data-end=&quot;1160&quot;&gt;Must-Have Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1161&quot; data-end=&quot;1417&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1161&quot; data-end=&quot;1222&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1163&quot; data-end=&quot;1222&quot;&gt;Strong proficiency in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1185&quot; data-end=&quot;1221&quot;&gt;React Native and React ecosystem&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1223&quot; data-end=&quot;1279&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1225&quot; data-end=&quot;1279&quot;&gt;Experience with hooks, Virtual DOM, lifecycle methods.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1280&quot; data-end=&quot;1334&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1282&quot; data-end=&quot;1334&quot;&gt;Proven track record of building complex mobile apps.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1335&quot; data-end=&quot;1417&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1337&quot; data-end=&quot;1417&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1362&quot; data-end=&quot;1371&quot;&gt;Redux&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1373&quot; data-end=&quot;1386&quot;&gt;REST APIs&lt;/strong&gt;, and performance optimization.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',500000.00,2500000.00,'₹',0,'India','Chennai',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-30 06:00:00',0,0,'2025-05-15 13:20:31.000000','2026-05-12 14:53:09.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"React\", \"React Native\"]','[\"&lt;h3 class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;84&quot; data-end=&quot;104&quot;&gt;Job Benefits&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Competitive Salary &amp;amp; performance bonuses&lt;br /&gt;Flexible Work Hours &amp;amp; hybrid/remote options&lt;br /&gt;Health Insurance for employees &amp;amp; dependent&lt;br /&gt;Learning &amp;amp; Development programs&lt;br /&gt;Cutting-Edge Projects with global teams&lt;br /&gt;Team Outings, hackathons &amp;amp; cultural event&lt;br /&gt;International Exposure &amp;amp; career growth opportunities&lt;/h3&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Tamil Nadu'),('d2824c37-d5ff-4bc0-8a4f-ded07372bc00','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Control System Engineer – DCS / Industrial Data Engineering','control-system-engineer-dcs-industrial-data-engineering-363-363','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;97&quot; data-end=&quot;300&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;123&quot; data-end=&quot;157&quot;&gt;Control System Engineers &amp;ndash; DCS&lt;/strong&gt; for a leading Top MNC to work on advanced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;200&quot; data-end=&quot;287&quot;&gt;Industrial Control Systems, OT/IT Data Integration, and Industrial Data Engineering&lt;/strong&gt; initiatives.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;302&quot; data-end=&quot;505&quot;&gt;The ideal candidate should have strong hands-on experience in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;364&quot; data-end=&quot;504&quot;&gt;DCS, Industrial Control Systems, AspenTech Inmation / Industrial Data Fabric, OPC DA/UA, industrial historians, and OT data connectivity&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;507&quot; data-end=&quot;845&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for designing, engineering, testing, commissioning, and supporting DCS and industrial data solutions. The role involves integrating operational technology data from plant systems into enterprise data platforms and developing scalable architectures across &lt;strong data-start=&quot;796&quot; data-end=&quot;844&quot;&gt;Level 3 / Level 4 manufacturing environments&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;847&quot; data-end=&quot;1106&quot;&gt;Professionals with experience in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;880&quot; data-end=&quot;997&quot;&gt;industrial data modeling, contextualization, metadata management, time-series data, and industrial data platforms&lt;/strong&gt; will be highly preferred. Experience in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1038&quot; data-end=&quot;1080&quot;&gt;Oil &amp;amp; Gas, E&amp;amp;P, Refining, or Chemicals&lt;/strong&gt; is particularly valuable.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-18 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-08-20 03:55:16.000000','2026-08-20 03:55:16.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Aspen HYSYS\", \"Data Integration\", \"Distributed Control Systems\", \"OPC UA\", \"Industrial Automation Systems\", \"FAT / SAT\", \"AspenTech Inmation\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1121&quot; data-end=&quot;1165&quot; data-section-id=&quot;i3mxm7&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a leading Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1166&quot; data-end=&quot;1253&quot; data-section-id=&quot;q2baty&quot;&gt;Exposure to large-scale &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1192&quot; data-end=&quot;1244&quot;&gt;Industrial Automation and Digital Transformation&lt;/strong&gt; projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1254&quot; data-end=&quot;1313&quot; data-section-id=&quot;3lrcy2&quot;&gt;Work with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1266&quot; data-end=&quot;1313&quot;&gt;AspenTech Inmation / Industrial Data Fabric&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1314&quot; data-end=&quot;1388&quot; data-section-id=&quot;bmc1wz&quot;&gt;Exposure to advanced OT/IT integration and industrial data architectures&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1389&quot; data-end=&quot;1467&quot; data-section-id=&quot;cgiy81&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with DCS, historians, OPC, and enterprise data platforms&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1468&quot; data-end=&quot;1534&quot; data-section-id=&quot;njmn7k&quot;&gt;Experience across &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1488&quot; data-end=&quot;1534&quot;&gt;Level 3 / Level 4 industrial architectures&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1535&quot; data-end=&quot;1596&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1p8gu54&quot;&gt;Exposure to Industrial IoT and data engineering initiatives&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1597&quot; data-end=&quot;1668&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1h8eke3&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global engineering and business teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1669&quot; data-end=&quot;1740&quot; data-section-id=&quot;g6ulmj&quot;&gt;Strong technical and domain growth in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1709&quot; data-end=&quot;1740&quot;&gt;Industrial Data Engineering&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1741&quot; data-end=&quot;1823&quot; data-section-id=&quot;74ufi7&quot;&gt;Career growth opportunities across Automation, OT, IT, and Digital Manufacturing&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('d2976d5f-b47f-4d20-b97f-8fd8a506d6ef','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','ORTEMS Developer & Support Engineer','ortems-developer-support-engineer-360-360','&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced &lt;strong&gt;ORTEMS Developers &amp;amp; Support Engineers&lt;/strong&gt; for a leading Top MNC to work on global &lt;strong&gt;DELMIA ORTEMS Advanced Planning &amp;amp; Scheduling (APS)&lt;/strong&gt; projects across Discrete Manufacturing, Automotive, Defense, Hi-Tech, and Wire Harness industries.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;The ideal candidate should have strong hands-on experience in &lt;strong&gt;DELMIA ORTEMS configuration, customization, development, integration, deployment, and production support&lt;/strong&gt;. The role involves designing and supporting advanced planning and scheduling solutions, optimizing finite-capacity production schedules, and integrating ORTEMS with MES and ERP platforms.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Candidates should have strong expertise in &lt;strong&gt;Advanced Planning &amp;amp; Scheduling (APS), Finite Capacity Scheduling, MS SQL/SQL Server/Oracle, MES integration with Apriso or Siemens Opcenter, and ERP integration with SAP&lt;/strong&gt;. Experience with production planning, manufacturing execution, setup and changeover logic, reporting, scheduling optimization, and troubleshooting is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The role also includes participation in &lt;strong&gt;SIT, UAT, functional testing, deployment, release management, post-go-live support, and production issue resolution&lt;/strong&gt;. Candidates should be comfortable working with global customers and cross-functional manufacturing, MES, ERP, and IT teams.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-18 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-08-20 02:49:35.000000','2026-08-20 02:49:35.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"ERP\", \"Mes Configuration\", \"Microsoft SQL Server\", \"MYSQL\", \"Oracle\", \"SAP\", \"UAT\", \"DELMIA ORTEMS\", \"ORTEMS Configuration\", \"ORTEMS Customization\", \"ORTEMS Development\", \"ORTEMS Integration\", \"Siemens Opcenter Integration\", \"DELMIA Apriso Integration\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to work with a leading Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li&gt;Exposure to global APS and digital manufacturing transformation projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li&gt;Work with customers across Automotive, Defense, Hi-Tech, and Wire Harness manufacturing&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with DELMIA ORTEMS and advanced scheduling technologies&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li&gt;Exposure to MES and ERP integration environments&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to work on end-to-end APS implementation and support programs&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li&gt;Global project exposure and collaboration with cross-functional teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li&gt;Career growth in APS, Manufacturing IT, and Digital Manufacturing&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('d2eea219-42ae-4d4a-8278-60181b6dba75','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Graphics Designer','graphics-designer-278-278','&lt;p data-start=&quot;69&quot; data-end=&quot;342&quot;&gt;We are hiring creative and passionate Graphics Designer Freshers for a leading Top MNC based in Bangalore. This is an excellent opportunity for fresh graduates who are interested in building their career in graphic designing, visual content creation, and creative branding.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;344&quot; data-end=&quot;657&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for designing engaging visual content for digital platforms, presentations, social media, and marketing materials. The role includes working with design tools like Canva, Photoshop, Illustrator, and other creative platforms to create professional and visually appealing graphics.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;659&quot; data-end=&quot;925&quot;&gt;Professionals should have a good understanding of design principles, creativity, typography, color combinations, and layout concepts. Basic awareness of AI tools such as ChatGPT, Copilot, Claude, and other AI-assisted content/design tools will be an added advantage.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;927&quot; data-end=&quot;1238&quot;&gt;The role also involves collaborating with internal teams, understanding creative requirements, and delivering high-quality visual content within timelines. Candidates should possess strong communication skills, attention to detail, creativity, and a willingness to learn in a professional corporate environment.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-07-20 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-05-22 02:02:31.000000','2026-05-22 02:02:32.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Adobe Illustrator\", \"Adobe InDesign\", \"Adobe Photoshop\", \"Canva\", \"Graphic Design\", \"Illustrator Adobe\", \"Social Media Promotion\", \"Typography\", \"Copilot\", \"Adobe XD\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1254&quot; data-end=&quot;1292&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1s4fksp&quot; data-start=&quot;1293&quot; data-end=&quot;1360&quot;&gt;Excellent opportunity for freshers to start their design career&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;mw3cs&quot; data-start=&quot;1361&quot; data-end=&quot;1415&quot;&gt;Exposure to professional corporate design projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ft4w2z&quot; data-start=&quot;1416&quot; data-end=&quot;1470&quot;&gt;Work with experienced creative and marketing teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;kdcvhx&quot; data-start=&quot;1471&quot; data-end=&quot;1527&quot;&gt;Career growth in Graphic Designing &amp;amp; Creative domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;pux9gi&quot; data-start=&quot;1528&quot; data-end=&quot;1584&quot;&gt;Learning opportunity with modern AI and design tools&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;vfuj5t&quot; data-start=&quot;1585&quot; data-end=&quot;1636&quot;&gt;Professional and collaborative work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('d3630abf-2bf7-4213-9c87-348da479358a','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Warehouse Simulation Consultant','warehouse-simulation-consultant-349-349','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;110&quot; data-end=&quot;550&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;136&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;Warehouse Simulation Consultants / Discrete Event Simulation Engineers&lt;/strong&gt; for a leading Top MNC to support enterprise-scale warehouse, logistics, and supply chain transformation initiatives. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in warehouse simulation, Digital Twin technologies, and Discrete Event Simulation (DES) to optimize warehouse operations, material flow, and distribution center performance.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;552&quot; data-end=&quot;1022&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for designing, developing, and validating warehouse simulation models using Siemens Tecnomatix Plant Simulation, FlexSim, AnyLogic, or other Discrete Event Simulation tools. The role includes developing Digital Twin models, analyzing warehouse layouts, optimizing throughput and capacity, validating material handling systems, evaluating automation strategies, and conducting what-if scenario analysis to improve operational efficiency.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1024&quot; data-end=&quot;1513&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with warehouse simulation, distribution center modeling, material flow analysis, conveyor systems, AS/RS, sortation systems, storage policies, labor productivity optimization, forklift and operator movement simulation, dock door scheduling, trailer management, and warehouse process optimization. Strong knowledge of supply chain operations, logistics engineering, warehouse automation, and KPI-driven performance analysis is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1515&quot; data-end=&quot;2001&quot;&gt;The role also involves collaborating with warehouse operations teams, supply chain stakeholders, automation engineers, solution architects, and global project teams to deliver scalable simulation models, support warehouse modernization programs, and recommend process improvements. Candidates should possess strong analytical, communication, stakeholder management, presentation, and problem-solving skills with experience in enterprise logistics and digital manufacturing environments.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Pune',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-09-20 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-07-23 02:02:10.000000','2026-07-23 02:02:10.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"AnyLogic\", \"FlexSim\", \"Warehouse Robotics\", \"Warehouse Management Systems\", \"Discrete Event Simulation\", \"Siemens Tecnomatix Plant Simulation\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2017&quot; data-end=&quot;2055&quot; data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2056&quot; data-end=&quot;2151&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1yixf8&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale Warehouse, Logistics, and Supply Chain transformation projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2152&quot; data-end=&quot;2230&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1qlsuo4&quot;&gt;Work with advanced Digital Twin and Discrete Event Simulation technologies&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2231&quot; data-end=&quot;2323&quot; data-section-id=&quot;9t061b&quot;&gt;Career growth in Warehouse Automation, Logistics Engineering, and Supply Chain Analytics&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2324&quot; data-end=&quot;2400&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1umbggs&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global supply chain and technology teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2401&quot; data-end=&quot;2456&quot; data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2457&quot; data-end=&quot;2500&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Maharashtra'),('d36deeb3-caa8-4f3b-85c0-6d70e6521e3b','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','LabVantage LIMS Developer','labvantage-lims-developer-359-359','&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced &lt;strong&gt;LabVantage LIMS Developers&lt;/strong&gt; for a leading Top MNC to work on digital laboratory transformation initiatives across the &lt;strong&gt;Pharmaceutical, Life Sciences, and Healthcare&lt;/strong&gt; domains. The ideal candidate should have strong hands-on experience in LabVantage LIMS development, configuration, customization, administration, integrations, and production support.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for developing and customizing LabVantage workflows, forms, reports, dashboards, and laboratory applications. The role also involves supporting LabVantage installation, upgrades, patching, environment management, troubleshooting, and application administration.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Professionals should have strong technical expertise in &lt;strong&gt;LabVantage LIMS, Java, SQL, Web Services, System Integrations, Laboratory Instrument Integration, and BarTender Label Printing&lt;/strong&gt;. Experience with Computer System Validation (CSV), GxP, 21 CFR Part 11, and regulated pharmaceutical environments is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The role requires collaboration with global stakeholders, laboratory teams, QA, IT, and business users to understand requirements, deliver LIMS solutions, resolve production issues, and support continuous improvement initiatives.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-18 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-08-20 02:39:05.000000','2026-08-20 02:39:05.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"API Integration\", \"CSV\", \"Documentation\", \"Java\", \"MYSQL\", \"REST API\", \"System Design\", \"Validation\", \"Web Services\", \"LabVantage LIMS\", \"21 CFR Part 11\", \"Laboratory Equipment Support\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale LIMS and laboratory digitalization projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li&gt;Work with Pharmaceutical, Life Sciences, and Healthcare clients&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li&gt;Exposure to LabVantage configuration, development, integrations, and administration&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li&gt;Experience with regulated GxP and validated laboratory environments&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global stakeholders and technical teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li&gt;Career growth in LIMS and Laboratory Informatics&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li&gt;Professional and collaborative work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('d3ab6db0-9c56-4a3d-a41d-e71aadeda54e','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Product Manager – Microsoft Surface','product-manager-microsoft-surface-110-110','&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n&lt;li aria-setsize=&quot;-1&quot; data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Define and own the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;product roadmap&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; for Microsoft Surface devices, ensuring alignment with strategic business objectives.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n&lt;li aria-setsize=&quot;-1&quot; data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-prop