th &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1654&quot; data-end=&quot;1687&quot;&gt;RESTful APIs and Web Services&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1690&quot; data-end=&quot;1738&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1692&quot; data-end=&quot;1738&quot;&gt;Apply &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1698&quot; data-end=&quot;1738&quot;&gt;DevOps practices and CI/CD pipelines&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-02-03 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-12-05 15:22:52.000000','2025-12-05 15:24:26.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\".NET CORE\", \".NET Framework\", \"Agile\", \"Angular\", \"Angular JS\", \"C#\", \"Cosmos DB\", \"DevOps\", \"HTML5\", \"Node.JS\", \"Python\", \"REST API\", \"SQL Server\", \"Web Services\", \"IBM Cloud\", \"Scrum Master\", \"CI/CD\", \"Azure Databricks\", \"Azure Cloud Ecosystem\", \"Azure Functions\", \"App Insights\", \"Log Analytics\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2526&quot; data-end=&quot;2556&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2528&quot; data-end=&quot;2556&quot;&gt;Competitive Salary Package&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2557&quot; data-end=&quot;2623&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2559&quot; data-end=&quot;2623&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2582&quot; data-end=&quot;2621&quot;&gt;Cloud, Manufacturing &amp;amp; IoT Projects&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2624&quot; data-end=&quot;2673&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2626&quot; data-end=&quot;2673&quot;&gt;Exposure to &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2638&quot; data-end=&quot;2671&quot;&gt;Enterprise-Scale Applications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2674&quot; data-end=&quot;2728&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2676&quot; data-end=&quot;2728&quot;&gt;Career Growth &amp;amp; Technical Leadership Opportunities&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2729&quot; data-end=&quot;2755&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2731&quot; data-end=&quot;2755&quot;&gt;Agile Work Environment&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2756&quot; data-end=&quot;2826&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2758&quot; data-end=&quot;2826&quot;&gt;Skill Development on Latest Technologies (Azure, DevOps, Big Data)&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2827&quot; data-end=&quot;2866&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2829&quot; data-end=&quot;2866&quot;&gt;Cross-functional Team Collaboration&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('d3ed3c3f-6ee8-4b1a-8a00-d9bbe9e1b549','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Senior SCADA Engineer','senior-scada-engineer-320-320','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;63&quot; data-end=&quot;443&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced Senior SCADA Engineers for a leading Top MNC to work on next-generation Smart Manufacturing, Industrial Automation, and Digital Factory transformation projects. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in SCADA systems, PLC programming, industrial communication protocols, and automation system integration for complex manufacturing environments.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;445&quot; data-end=&quot;827&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for leading the complete lifecycle of SCADA and PLC projects, including solution design, development, testing, commissioning, deployment, and handover. The role includes designing scalable SCADA architectures, implementing real-time monitoring systems, integrating PLC and SCADA platforms, and supporting Smart Factory and Industry 4.0 initiatives.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;829&quot; data-end=&quot;1253&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with Siemens TIA Portal, Rockwell Automation, Beckhoff TwinCAT, Omron Sysmac, Ignition SCADA, Siemens WinCC, AVEVA SCADA, FactoryTalk View, and Building Management Systems (BMS). Strong knowledge of industrial communication protocols such as OPC UA, MQTT, Modbus, Ethernet/IP, and PROFINET, along with industrial control systems and cybersecurity practices, is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1255&quot; data-end=&quot;1724&quot;&gt;The role also involves coordinating with Process, Facilities, Quality, EHS, and Operations teams, supporting Factory Acceptance Testing (FAT), Site Acceptance Testing (SAT), commissioning activities, troubleshooting automation systems, and ensuring reliable, secure, and high-performance manufacturing operations. Candidates should possess strong leadership, communication, analytical, and problem-solving skills with experience in enterprise-scale automation projects.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Ahmedabad',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-08-30 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-07-02 02:44:38.000000','2026-07-02 02:44:38.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Industrial Automation\", \"PLC\", \"PLC Programming\", \"SCADA\", \"Profinet\", \"Siemens Tia Portal\", \"Modbus\", \"AVEVA MES\", \"OPC UA\", \"MQTT\", \"Rockwell FTPS\", \"Ethernet\", \"Beckhoff\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1740&quot; data-end=&quot;1778&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1styg6k&quot; data-start=&quot;1779&quot; data-end=&quot;1866&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale Smart Manufacturing and Industrial Automation projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;9ujpem&quot; data-start=&quot;1867&quot; data-end=&quot;1936&quot;&gt;Work on cutting-edge SCADA, PLC, and Digital Factory technologies&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;dlbhff&quot; data-start=&quot;1937&quot; data-end=&quot;2008&quot;&gt;Career growth in Industrial Automation &amp;amp; Smart Manufacturing domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1g8u6de&quot; data-start=&quot;2009&quot; data-end=&quot;2084&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global automation and engineering teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot; data-start=&quot;2085&quot; data-end=&quot;2140&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;2141&quot; data-end=&quot;2184&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Gujarat'),('d4129a4c-c957-4af1-a8b9-ae12b91f8527','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Data Engineer / DataOps / IoT Expert','data-engineer-dataops-iot-expert-275-275','&lt;p data-start=&quot;78&quot; data-end=&quot;423&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced Data Engineers / DataOps / IoT Experts for a leading Top MNC to work on Industrial Data Engineering, IoT Connectivity, and Digital Transformation projects. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in data pipeline development, industrial data integration, cloud-based analytics platforms, and DataOps practices.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;425&quot; data-end=&quot;769&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for designing, implementing, and managing industrial data lakehouse architectures and end-to-end data pipelines for manufacturing and industrial environments. The role includes handling data ingestion, validation, governance, monitoring, and ensuring reliable and scalable data flows across enterprise systems.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;771&quot; data-end=&quot;1059&quot;&gt;Professionals should have experience with IoT device and sensor connectivity, machine data integration, ETL/ELT pipeline development, and industrial data gateway solutions. Strong knowledge of cloud platforms, analytics ecosystems, and DataOps collaboration practices is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1061&quot; data-end=&quot;1360&quot;&gt;The role also involves working closely with DevOps, analytics, and application teams to optimize infrastructure, improve data quality, and support advanced analytics and reporting initiatives. Candidates should possess strong analytical thinking, troubleshooting abilities, and communication skills.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-07-12 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-05-14 03:54:27.000000','2026-05-14 03:54:28.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Data Analyst\", \"Data Encryption\", \"Data Integration\", \"DevOps\", \"ETL Processes\", \"ELT Pipelines\", \"DataOps\", \"IoT Connectivity\", \"Industrial Data Integration\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1376&quot; data-end=&quot;1414&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;ood3cj&quot; data-start=&quot;1415&quot; data-end=&quot;1481&quot;&gt;Exposure to Industrial IoT and Digital Transformation projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;60jesv&quot; data-start=&quot;1482&quot; data-end=&quot;1539&quot;&gt;Work on advanced Data Engineering &amp;amp; DataOps solutions&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1uwhdy3&quot; data-start=&quot;1540&quot; data-end=&quot;1595&quot;&gt;Career growth in Industrial Data &amp;amp; Analytics domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;vcbymj&quot; data-start=&quot;1596&quot; data-end=&quot;1664&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with cross-functional technical teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot; data-start=&quot;1665&quot; data-end=&quot;1720&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;1721&quot; data-end=&quot;1764&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('d4775ecd-4b5a-4efd-a338-ba5596dbfe18','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','AVEVA PI (OSI PI) Support Specialist','aveva-pi-osi-pi-support-specialist-289-289','&lt;p data-start=&quot;78&quot; data-end=&quot;435&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced AVEVA PI (OSI PI) Support Specialists for a leading Top MNC to support industrial data management, IT/OT operations, and digital transformation initiatives. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in AVEVA PI (OSI PI) administration, technical support, incident management, and industrial application support environments.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;437&quot; data-end=&quot;826&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for providing Level 1 administration and support for AVEVA PI systems, ensuring system availability, resolving incidents, and supporting business users across industrial and manufacturing environments. The role includes troubleshooting PI-related issues, managing user access requests, handling application permissions, and maintaining system performance.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;828&quot; data-end=&quot;1116&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with ServiceNow ticket management, IT/OT support processes, user administration, and technical troubleshooting. Exposure to Acronis and Adept administration, industrial data platforms, and operational support environments is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1118&quot; data-end=&quot;1492&quot;&gt;The role also involves coordinating with internal support teams, vendors, and stakeholders to resolve technical issues, communicate updates, and ensure timely incident resolution. Candidates should possess excellent communication, analytical thinking, stakeholder management, and problem-solving skills with the ability to work independently in a support-driven environment.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Pune',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-08-08 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-06-10 02:19:14.000000','2026-06-10 02:19:14.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Incident Reporting\", \"ServiceNow Ticket Management\", \"AVEVA PI (OSI PI)\", \"PI System Administration\", \"PI Technical Support\", \"Application Support\", \"Industrial Data Management\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;q8l4y0&quot; data-start=&quot;1508&quot; data-end=&quot;1553&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top Global MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;18iv4ke&quot; data-start=&quot;1554&quot; data-end=&quot;1627&quot;&gt;Exposure to Industrial Automation and Digital Transformation projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;12tse0h&quot; data-start=&quot;1628&quot; data-end=&quot;1687&quot;&gt;Work on enterprise-level AVEVA PI (OSI PI) environments&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;153ke7r&quot; data-start=&quot;1688&quot; data-end=&quot;1750&quot;&gt;Career growth in Industrial Data Management &amp;amp; IT/OT domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;14c1c93&quot; data-start=&quot;1751&quot; data-end=&quot;1816&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global teams and stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;5e3i2y&quot; data-start=&quot;1817&quot; data-end=&quot;1870&quot;&gt;Professional and growth-oriented work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;1871&quot; data-end=&quot;1914&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Maharashtra'),('d49640f6-6368-4439-8600-3b2b560bea1a','b0895415-7331-4fa1-a30c-361a1c8b6b76','76e2725a-cd7a-4a87-ab4c-a1f31dfd36a1','Office Assistant','office-assistant-23-23','1 Years of Experience in Telecalling&lt;br /&gt;Flight and Hotel Booking Experience&lt;br /&gt;Customer Care service experience','Travel & Transportation','Contract','Mid',120000.00,180000.00,'₹',1,'India','Patna',0,1,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2025-12-30 18:30:00',0,0,'2025-05-05 20:51:07.000000','2025-08-24 22:39:25.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Customer Care\", \"Flight Reservations\", \"Hotels\", \"Telecalling\", \"Ticketing\"]','[\"Customer Care service experience\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Bihar'),('d49c5dd7-527f-4a30-921e-440347521208','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Senior Data Engineer','senior-data-engineer-284-284','&lt;p data-start=&quot;62&quot; data-end=&quot;386&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced Senior Data Engineers for a leading Top MNC to work on enterprise-scale data engineering, cloud infrastructure, and analytics transformation projects. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in Python, SQL, AWS cloud technologies, data architecture, and scalable data pipeline development.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;388&quot; data-end=&quot;767&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for designing, building, and maintaining robust data architectures and high-performance data pipelines to support business intelligence, analytics, and operational reporting requirements. The role includes developing scalable cloud-based data solutions, ensuring data quality, optimizing performance, and implementing best engineering practices.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;769&quot; data-end=&quot;1085&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with Python development, advanced SQL, database design, GitHub, GitHub Actions, AWS CDK, Terraform, and cloud-native data engineering solutions. Strong understanding of data modeling, ETL/ELT processes, infrastructure as code, and cloud architecture is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1087&quot; data-end=&quot;1398&quot;&gt;The role also involves creating and maintaining technical documentation, improving engineering efficiency, reviewing code quality, and collaborating with cross-functional teams to deliver enterprise-grade data solutions. Candidates should possess excellent analytical, problem-solving, and communication skills.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-08-08 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-06-10 01:30:46.000000','2026-06-10 01:30:46.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Python\", \"SQL\", \"Database Design\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1414&quot; data-end=&quot;1452&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;69ydlb&quot; data-start=&quot;1453&quot; data-end=&quot;1511&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale data engineering projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;odidie&quot; data-start=&quot;1512&quot; data-end=&quot;1573&quot;&gt;Work on advanced AWS cloud and data platform technologies&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1l489fm&quot; data-start=&quot;1574&quot; data-end=&quot;1626&quot;&gt;Career growth in Data Engineering &amp;amp; Cloud domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1a77kja&quot; data-start=&quot;1627&quot; data-end=&quot;1687&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global engineering teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot; data-start=&quot;1688&quot; data-end=&quot;1743&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;1744&quot; data-end=&quot;1787&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('d49dfcf2-08f5-4b09-b24d-dc4cf0b5e9d4','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Senior IoT / ThingWorx Developer','senior-iot-thingworx-developer-295-295','&lt;p data-start=&quot;74&quot; data-end=&quot;430&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced Senior IoT / ThingWorx Developers for a leading Top MNC to work on Smart Manufacturing, Industry 4.0, Industrial IoT (IIoT), and Manufacturing Digital Transformation projects. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in PTC ThingWorx, manufacturing IT systems, IoT architectures, and enterprise-scale industrial solutions.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;432&quot; data-end=&quot;808&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for designing, developing, and implementing scalable IoT applications and connected manufacturing solutions using the ThingWorx platform. The role includes developing high-performance applications, conducting proof of concepts (POCs), supporting smart factory initiatives, and delivering innovative solutions for global manufacturing clients.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;810&quot; data-end=&quot;1151&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with Industrial IoT solutions, MES, SCADA/HMI, LIMS, EAM systems, manufacturing IT architecture, and shop-floor digitalization initiatives. Strong understanding of manufacturing processes, value stream mapping, application portfolio assessment, and ROI framework development is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1153&quot; data-end=&quot;1511&quot;&gt;The role also involves leading technical teams, mentoring developers, participating in architectural reviews, supporting Industry 4.0 implementations, and driving continuous improvement initiatives. Candidates should possess strong analytical, problem-solving, communication, and leadership skills with the ability to work in complex enterprise environments.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-08-22 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-06-24 02:32:20.000000','2026-06-24 02:32:20.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Lims\", \"Mes\", \"SCADA\", \"SDLC\", \"HMI\", \"PTC ThingWorx Platform\", \"Smart Factory\", \"Industrial IoT (IIoT)\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1527&quot; data-end=&quot;1565&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;18yzlgk&quot; data-start=&quot;1566&quot; data-end=&quot;1627&quot;&gt;Exposure to Smart Manufacturing and Industry 4.0 projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1obh9ja&quot; data-start=&quot;1628&quot; data-end=&quot;1690&quot;&gt;Work on advanced Industrial IoT and ThingWorx technologies&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;n64kxj&quot; data-start=&quot;1691&quot; data-end=&quot;1755&quot;&gt;Career growth in Manufacturing Digital Transformation domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;8vszhn&quot; data-start=&quot;1756&quot; data-end=&quot;1820&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global manufacturing clients&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;o2ta5m&quot; data-start=&quot;1821&quot; data-end=&quot;1863&quot;&gt;Leadership and mentoring opportunities&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot; data-start=&quot;1864&quot; data-end=&quot;1919&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;1920&quot; data-end=&quot;1963&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('d4fa1a26-cd5e-46dc-b0dc-5e77a4a0f295','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','PostgreSQL Developer / Database Specialist','postgresql-developer-database-specialist-381-381','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;189&quot; data-end=&quot;435&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;215&quot; data-end=&quot;263&quot;&gt;PostgreSQL Developers / Database Specialists&lt;/strong&gt; for a leading &lt;strong data-start=&quot;278&quot; data-end=&quot;289&quot;&gt;Top MNC&lt;/strong&gt; to work on enterprise-scale &lt;strong data-start=&quot;318&quot; data-end=&quot;359&quot;&gt;MES (Manufacturing Execution Systems)&lt;/strong&gt; and data-layer solutions within the &lt;strong data-start=&quot;396&quot; data-end=&quot;427&quot;&gt;Semiconductor Manufacturing&lt;/strong&gt; domain.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;437&quot; data-end=&quot;684&quot;&gt;The ideal candidate should have strong hands-on expertise in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;498&quot; data-end=&quot;683&quot;&gt;PostgreSQL development and administration, SQL, PL/pgSQL, stored procedures, schema design, database migration, query optimization, indexing, execution plans, and performance tuning&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;686&quot; data-end=&quot;940&quot;&gt;The role involves developing and maintaining robust database solutions for data-intensive manufacturing applications, troubleshooting database performance issues, supporting database migrations, and ensuring reliability and scalability of the data layer.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Hyderabad',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-31 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-09-02 02:28:40.000000','2026-09-02 02:28:40.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Agile\", \"Database Management\", \"Database Troubleshooting\", \"Database User Management\", \"Indexing\", \"Mes\", \"PL/SQL\", \"PostgreSQL\", \"Python\", \"Scripting\", \"SQL\", \"SQL Query Optimization\", \"Stored Procedures\", \"triggers\", \"Aurora PostgreSQL\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;rdheb3&quot; data-start=&quot;1179&quot; data-end=&quot;1226&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a leading global MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;13hx139&quot; data-start=&quot;1227&quot; data-end=&quot;1294&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1258&quot; data-end=&quot;1294&quot;&gt;PostgreSQL database environments&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;14vz9vr&quot; data-start=&quot;1295&quot; data-end=&quot;1363&quot;&gt;Work on advanced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1314&quot; data-end=&quot;1353&quot;&gt;MES and Semiconductor Manufacturing&lt;/strong&gt; solutions&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;nagogh&quot; data-start=&quot;1364&quot; data-end=&quot;1425&quot;&gt;Experience with high-volume and data-intensive applications&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;qt50wy&quot; data-start=&quot;1426&quot; data-end=&quot;1501&quot;&gt;Exposure to database migration, optimization, and performance engineering&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1awf1k2&quot; data-start=&quot;1502&quot; data-end=&quot;1577&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with modern &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1536&quot; data-end=&quot;1577&quot;&gt;CI/CD and Agile development practices&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1mkipl6&quot; data-start=&quot;1578&quot; data-end=&quot;1635&quot;&gt;Collaboration with distributed global engineering teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Telangana'),('d50205ac-7dcd-4d68-b0c5-7e2671f319fb','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Developer – AVEVA MES','developer-aveva-mes-340-340','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;63&quot; data-end=&quot;420&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced AVEVA MES Developers for a leading Top MNC to work on enterprise-scale Manufacturing Execution System (MES), Industrial Automation, and Smart Manufacturing transformation projects. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in AVEVA MES, AVEVA System Platform, Wonderware technologies, and enterprise manufacturing solutions.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;422&quot; data-end=&quot;834&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for designing, developing, implementing, configuring, and supporting AVEVA MES applications across global manufacturing environments. The role includes deploying AVEVA System Platform, configuring MES environments, developing manufacturing workflows, integrating shop-floor systems, troubleshooting production issues, and supporting enterprise digital manufacturing initiatives.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;836&quot; data-end=&quot;1179&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with AVEVA MES, AVEVA System Platform, AVEVA Work Tasks (Skelta BPM), AVEVA MDM, Wonderware Historian, SQL development, and .NET/C# programming. Strong knowledge of ISA-95, ISA-88, MESA standards, OPC, PLC, SCADA integration, manufacturing processes, and industrial automation is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1181&quot; data-end=&quot;1660&quot;&gt;The role also involves collaborating with business stakeholders, automation engineers, manufacturing teams, and global delivery teams to gather requirements, design scalable MES solutions, prepare technical documentation, support production environments, and deliver high-quality enterprise manufacturing applications. Candidates should possess strong analytical, communication, stakeholder management, and problem-solving skills with a focus on digital manufacturing excellence.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Pune',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-09-13 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-07-16 02:38:23.000000','2026-07-16 02:38:23.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\".NET Development\", \"C#\", \"Mes\", \"Microsoft SQL Server\", \"SCADA\", \"AVEVA System\", \"AVEVA Intouch HMI\", \"AVEVA MES\", \"PLC Integration\", \"ISA-95\", \"ISA-88\", \"AVEVA Work Tasks\", \"AVEVA MDM\", \"Wonderware Historian\", \"SQL Scripting\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1676&quot; data-end=&quot;1714&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1jb3rem&quot; data-start=&quot;1715&quot; data-end=&quot;1799&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale MES and Smart Manufacturing transformation projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1aspo82&quot; data-start=&quot;1800&quot; data-end=&quot;1889&quot;&gt;Work with advanced AVEVA MES, System Platform, and Industrial Automation technologies&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1m946pf&quot; data-start=&quot;1890&quot; data-end=&quot;1981&quot;&gt;Career growth in Manufacturing Execution Systems (MES) and Digital Manufacturing domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;13qji02&quot; data-start=&quot;1982&quot; data-end=&quot;2059&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global manufacturing and technology teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot; data-start=&quot;2060&quot; data-end=&quot;2115&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;2116&quot; data-end=&quot;2159&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Maharashtra'),('d58bc2bc-ceb7-4c38-9f0e-2fa639d60417','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','CM  MES Backend Developer','cm-mes-backend-developer-219-219','&lt;p&gt;&amp;middot; Min 4 to 8+ years of experience in C#.Net : Mastery skill in foundational language construct - Class, Object, Interface, Inheritance, Polymorphism, Encapsulation, Overloading, Overriding, Type conversion, Expression, C# syntax like Statement &amp;ndash; block, Declaration, Loop &amp;amp; For Each ,Try, Catch. Event, Event Handler, Callback, Delegates, Debugging, Net control &amp;ndash; properties / data binding, Collection like Dictionaries, Array, Generic, I/O &amp;amp; File management, LINQ , Experience in Entity Framework. MVC framework, Knowledge on writing unit test cases.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;middot; SQL Server (Good knowledge of relational database concepts and T-SQL) : Knowledge about architecture, writing &amp;amp; optimizing stored procedure, writing &amp;amp; optimizing views procedure, Cross platform database connection knowledge&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;middot; Experience with source control tools (preferably Git)&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;middot; Knowledge of agile software development methodologies&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;middot; Experience with Docker and container orchestration (Swarm / Kubernetes)&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;middot; Good to have - ASP.net core Web API, jQuery and CSS, Azure DevOps&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;middot; Good to have &amp;ndash; Manufacturing domain experience&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;middot; Knowledge of agile software development methodologies&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Entry',NULL,NULL,'INR',1,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-05-24 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-03-25 16:18:19.000000','2026-03-25 16:18:19.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"ASP.NET\", \"AWS DevOps\", \"Azure\", \"CSS\", \"Docker\", \"Github\", \"JQUERY\", \"Kubernetes\", \"Mes\", \"MS SQL Server\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;Competitive salary package with performance-based incentives&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;65&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;67&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;Health insurance coverage and statutory benefits (PF &amp;amp; Gratuity)&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;134&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;136&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on large-scale enterprise energy management projects&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;211&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;213&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;Strong career growth and learning opportunities&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;263&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;265&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;Collaborative and professional work environment&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('d60538ef-863c-4d1b-ae73-b5e45c654981','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Beamex CMX Specialist','beamex-cmx-specialist-337-337','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;63&quot; data-end=&quot;485&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced Beamex CMX Specialists for a leading Top MNC to support enterprise Calibration Management, Computer System Validation (CSV), and Digital Asset Management initiatives in regulated manufacturing environments. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in Beamex CMX Calibration Management Software, calibration workflows, validation activities, and pharmaceutical or life sciences industries.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;487&quot; data-end=&quot;941&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for configuring, administering, supporting, and optimizing the Beamex CMX Calibration Management System to ensure accurate calibration scheduling, instrument lifecycle management, and regulatory compliance. The role includes managing calibration records, maintaining instrument master data, supporting Computer System Validation (CSV), preparing validation documentation, and ensuring compliance with industry standards.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;943&quot; data-end=&quot;1344&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with Beamex CMX, calibration management, asset management, instrument lifecycle processes, IQ/OQ/PQ validation, GxP, GMP, ISO 17025, and 21 CFR Part 11 compliance. Strong knowledge of calibration scheduling, compliance reporting, SAP PM/MM integration, enterprise asset management systems, and laboratory or manufacturing environments is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1346&quot; data-end=&quot;1778&quot;&gt;The role also involves collaborating with QA, Engineering, Maintenance, Validation, and IT teams to deliver reliable calibration management solutions, support audits, troubleshoot application issues, generate compliance reports and dashboards, prepare SOPs and user manuals, and drive continuous improvement initiatives. Candidates should possess strong analytical, communication, stakeholder management, and problem-solving skills.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-09-13 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-07-16 02:05:17.000000','2026-07-16 02:05:17.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"CapIQ\", \"CSV\", \"Gxp Compliance\", \"OQ\", \"PQ\", \"GMP\", \"21 CFR Part 11\", \"Beamex CMX\", \"Calibration Management\", \"Calibration Scheduling\", \"SAP PM Integration\", \"SAP MM Integration\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1794&quot; data-end=&quot;1832&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;kkk1f2&quot; data-start=&quot;1833&quot; data-end=&quot;1923&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale Calibration Management and Digital Manufacturing projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1cu8f6l&quot; data-start=&quot;1924&quot; data-end=&quot;1991&quot;&gt;Work with advanced Beamex CMX and Asset Management technologies&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;bf28ml&quot; data-start=&quot;1992&quot; data-end=&quot;2077&quot;&gt;Career growth in Calibration Management &amp;amp; Computer System Validation (CSV) domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1icv5lc&quot; data-start=&quot;2078&quot; data-end=&quot;2166&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global engineering, quality, and manufacturing teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;2lee9a&quot; data-start=&quot;2167&quot; data-end=&quot;2222&quot;&gt;Professional and compliance-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;2223&quot; data-end=&quot;2266&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('d64b7277-44f3-4cf4-876d-5be1a547b452','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725