t;br data-start=&quot;1219&quot; data-end=&quot;1222&quot; /&gt;&amp;nbsp;Proficient in JavaScript, Java, SQL, and Web Services&lt;br data-start=&quot;1278&quot; data-end=&quot;1281&quot; /&gt;&amp;nbsp;Solid grasp of Industrial IoT architecture&lt;br data-start=&quot;1326&quot; data-end=&quot;1329&quot; /&gt;&amp;nbsp;Strong debugging, analytical, and problem-solving abilities&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',500000.00,2500000.00,'₹',0,'India','Pune',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-19 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-06-10 09:09:23.000000','2025-11-21 04:58:38.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Data Models\", \"Java\", \"JavaScript\", \"Mes\", \"PLC\", \"REST API\", \"SCADA\", \"SQL\", \"IIoT\", \"ThingWorx\", \"ThingWorx Navigate\", \"Thingworx\", \"Kepware\"]','[\"&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;224&quot; data-end=&quot;248&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;231&quot; data-end=&quot;247&quot;&gt;Job Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/h3&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;250&quot; data-end=&quot;901&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;253&quot; data-end=&quot;283&quot;&gt;Competitive Salary Package&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br data-start=&quot;334&quot; data-end=&quot;337&quot; /&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;340&quot; data-end=&quot;360&quot; data-is-only-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;Health Insurance&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br data-start=&quot;386&quot; data-end=&quot;389&quot; /&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;392&quot; data-end=&quot;409&quot;&gt;Paid Time Off&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;ndash; Vacation, Sick Leave, Public Holidays&lt;br data-start=&quot;449&quot; data-end=&quot;452&quot; /&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;455&quot; data-end=&quot;478&quot;&gt;Performance Bonuses&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Maharashtra'),('d7d4a4c6-6a20-4983-83ac-9d8d9ea63c62','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','MedTech Domain Consultant – APR Assessment','medtech-domain-consultant-apr-assessment-174-174','&lt;p data-start=&quot;214&quot; data-end=&q