s, negotiate terms, and close deals to meet revenue targets.&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-ogsc=&quot;black&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div role=&quot;presentation&quot; data-ogsc=&quot;&quot;&gt;Track market trends and competitor activities to identify growth opportunities.&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-ogsc=&quot;black&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div role=&quot;presentation&quot; data-ogsc=&quot;&quot;&gt;Maintain CRM and provide regular sales reports to management.&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;div data-ogsc=&quot;black&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-ogsc=&quot;&quot;&gt;Key Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-ogsc=&quot;black&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div role=&quot;presentation&quot; data-ogsc=&quot;&quot;&gt;Strong communication and negotiation skills&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-ogsc=&quot;black&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div role=&quot;presentation&quot; data-ogsc=&quot;&quot;&gt;Proven ability to generate leads and close deals&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-ogsc=&quot;black&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div role=&quot;presentation&quot; data-ogsc=&quot;&quot;&gt;Understanding of IT roles and recruitment lifecycle&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-ogsc=&quot;black&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div role=&quot;presentation&quot; data-ogsc=&quot;&quot;&gt;Client relationship management&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-ogsc=&quot;black&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div role=&quot;presentation&quot; data-ogsc=&quot;&quot;&gt;Self-motivated and target-oriented&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',1,'India','Pune',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-19 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-08-18 14:52:04.000000','2025-11-21 00:43:30.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Client Relationship Management\", \"Cold Calling\", \"CRM\", \"HR\", \"Lead Generation\", \"Market Research\", \"Negotiation Skills\", \"Networking\", \"Procurement\", \"Staffing\", \"Strong Communication Skills.\"]','[\"Competitive Salary + Performance-Based Incentives\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Maharashtra'),('db5f0884-93d2-458a-9738-923169631aab','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Senior IoT Engineer','senior-iot-engineer-161-161','&lt;p data-start=&quot;171&quot; data-end=&quot;775&quot;&gt;We are seeking a highly experienced Senior IoT Engineer with over 8 years of expertise in industrial IoT systems. The role involves leading the modernization of OPC Publisher architecture, designing and implementing secure bi-directional communication patterns, and developing scalable industrial data workflows across cloud and edge environments. The engineer will work on telemetry routing, cloud-to-edge communication, industrial protocol integration, and ensure secure, reliable plant-level IoT systems. This is a hands-on technical leadership role in a distributed, production-grade IoT environment.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-02-03 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-12-05 15:03:07.000000','2025-12-05 15:03:07.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"AWS\", \"Azure\", \"Cloud\", \"Cybersecurity\", \"Distributed Control Systems\", \"Docker\", \"Edge Computing\", \"GCP\", \"Kafka\", \"Kubernetes\", \"REST API\", \"CI/CD\", \"OPC UA\", \"MQTT\", \"RPC Protocols\", \"Industrial Automation Systems\", \"Telemetry Aggregation\", \"IoT Engineering\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1474&quot; data-end=&quot;1516&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1476&quot; data-end=&quot;1516&quot;&gt;Competitive salary based on experience&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1517&quot; data-end=&quot;1537&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1519&quot; data-end=&quot;1537&quot;&gt;Health insurance&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1538&quot; data-end=&quot;1555&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1540&quot; data-end=&quot;1555&quot;&gt;Paid time off&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&