-start=&quot;922&quot; data-end=&quot;1007&quot;&gt;Provide &lt;strong data-start=&quot;930&quot; data-end=&quot;967&quot;&gt;L4-level advanced troubleshooting&lt;/strong&gt; for MES applications (FTPS/Opcenter).&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1008&quot; data-end=&quot;1103&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1010&quot; data-end=&quot;1103&quot;&gt;Perform &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1018&quot; data-end=&quot;1100&quot;&gt;system monitoring, performance tuning, capacity planning &amp;amp; root cause analysis&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1104&quot; data-end=&quot;1193&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1106&quot; data-end=&quot;1193&quot;&gt;Lead integration oversight with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1138&quot; data-end=&quot;1190&quot;&gt;ERP, LIMS, SCADA, PLCs, OPC UA, middleware tools&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1194&quot; data-end=&quot;1291&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1196&quot; data-end=&quot;1291&quot;&gt;Manage &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1203&quot; data-end=&quot;1225&quot;&gt;critical incidents&lt;/strong&gt;, service requests, change implementations &amp;amp; impact assessments.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1292&quot; data-end=&quot;1371&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1294&quot; data-end=&quot;1371&quot;&gt;Validate MES configurations, workflows, and interfaces in GMP environments.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1372&quot; data-end=&quot;1463&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1374&quot; data-end=&quot;1463&quot;&gt;Collaborate with Production, QA, IT &amp;amp; Automation teams to resolve high-priority issues.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1464&quot; data-end=&quot;1554&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1466&quot; data-end=&quot;1554&quot;&gt;Ensure compliance with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1489&quot; data-end=&quot;1517&quot;&gt;GMP, GxP, 21 CFR Part 11&lt;/strong&gt;, data integrity &amp;amp; audit readiness.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1555&quot; data-end=&quot;1627&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1557&quot; data-end=&quot;1627&quot;&gt;Support deployments, upgrades, patching, and environment validation.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1628&quot; data-end=&quot;1716&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1630&quot; data-end=&quot;1716&quot;&gt;Document troubleshooting steps, SOPs, architecture diagrams &amp;amp; knowledge base articles.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Full-time','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Pune',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-20 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-11-22 03:47:02.000000','2025-11-22 03:47:03.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"CSV\", \"ERP\", \"Gxp Compliance\", \"Lims\", \"Mes Troubleshooting\", \"PLC\", \"SAP\", \"SCADA\", \"Siemens Opcenter\", \"SQL\", \"OPC UA\", \"GMP\", \"Rockwell FTPS\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2874&quot; data-end=&quot;2946&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2876&quot; data-end=&quot;2946&quot;&gt;Work with a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2888&quot; data-end=&quot;2910&quot;&gt;leading global MNC&lt;/strong&gt; in Pharma &amp;amp; Industrial Automation&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2947&quot; data-end=&quot;3010&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2949&quot; data-end=&quot;3010&quot;&gt;Opportunity to handle &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2971&quot; data-end=&quot;3008&quot;&gt;critical, high-impact MES systems&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;3011&quot; data-end=&quot;3073&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;3013&quot; data-end=&quot;3073&quot;&gt;Exposure to latest MES platforms &amp;amp; enterprise integrations&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;3074&quot; data-end=&quot;3126&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;3076&quot; data-end=&quot;3126&quot;&gt;Excellent learning &amp;amp; certification opportunities&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;3127&quot; data-end=&quot;3193&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;3129&quot; data-end=&quot;3193&quot;&gt;Collaborative, process-driven, and growth-oriented environment&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;3194&quot; data-end=&quot;3244&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;3196&quot; data-end=&quot;3244&quot;&gt;Competitive salary + performance-based rewards&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;3245&quot; data-end=&quot;3332&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;3247&quot; data-end=&quot;3332&quot;&gt;Chance to work on &lt;strong data-start=&quot;3265&quot; data-end=&quot;3318&quot;&gt;digital manufacturing transformation (Pharma 4.0)&lt;/strong&gt; initiatives&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Maharashtra'),('dcad6ea4-e630-4e6b-bdec-1ebe166a392f','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','OT Engineer – Ignition SCADA','ot-engineer-ignition-scada-49-49','&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;385&quot; data-end=&quot;403&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;389&quot; data-end=&quot;401&quot;&gt;Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;404&quot; data-end=&quot;671&quot;&gt;We are looking for &lt;strong data-start=&quot;423&quot; data-end=&quot;451&quot;&gt;experienced OT Engineers&lt;/strong&gt; with strong hands-on expertise in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;486&quot; data-end=&quot;504&quot;&gt;Ignition SCADA&lt;/strong&gt; to support the design, integration, and deployment of automation solutions across various industrial sectors such as manufacturing, automotive, pharma, and oil &amp;amp; gas.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;673&quot; data-end=&quot;701&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;677&quot; data-end=&quot;701&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ol data-start=&quot;702&quot; data-end=&quot;1193&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;702&quot; data-end=&quot;807&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;705&quot; data-end=&quot;807&quot;&gt;Understand business and process requirements to design and implement Ignition SCADA-based solutions.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;808&quot; data-end=&quot;925&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;811&quot; data-end=&quot;925&quot;&gt;Program and configure Ignition SCADA systems using relevant modules for visualization, control, and integration.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;926&quot; data-end=&quot;1006&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;929&quot; data-end=&quot;1006&quot;&gt;Perform system testing, commissioning, and provide post-deployment support.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1007&quot; data-end=&quot;1107&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1010&quot; data-end=&quot;1107&quot;&gt;Integrate SCADA systems with PLCs, third-party devices, and databases using standard protocols.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1108&quot; data-end=&quot;1193&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1111&quot; data-end=&quot;1193&quot;&gt;Stay informed on developments in Ignition SCADA and other automation technologies.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ol&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;1195&quot; data-end=&quot;1219&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1199&quot; data-end=&quot;1219&quot;&gt;Must-Have Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1220&quot; data-end=&quot;1791&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1220&quot; data-end=&quot;1317&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1222&quot; data-end=&quot;1317&quot;&gt;Strong hands-on experience in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1252&quot; data-end=&quot;1270&quot;&gt;Ignition SCADA&lt;/strong&gt; project design, scripting, and configuration&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1318&quot; data-end=&quot;1411&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1320&quot; data-end=&quot;1411&quot;&gt;Proficient in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1334&quot; data-end=&quot;1341&quot;&gt;SQL&lt;/strong&gt;, OPC UA, MQTT, Modbus, and other industrial communication protocols&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1412&quot; data-end=&quot;1528&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1414&quot; data-end=&quot;1528&quot;&gt;Capable of designing and integrating SCADA systems for diverse domains (Manufacturing, Automotive, Pharma, etc.)&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1529&quot; data-end=&quot;1612&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1531&quot; data-end=&quot;1612&quot;&gt;Experience with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1547&quot; data-end=&quot;1567&quot;&gt;Ignition modules&lt;/strong&gt; (Vision, Perspective, Tag Historian, etc.)&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1613&quot; data-end=&quot;1692&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1615&quot; data-end=&quot;1692&quot;&gt;Strong communication skills with attention to detail and system reliability&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1693&quot; data-end=&quot;1791&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1695&quot; data-end=&quot;1791&quot;&gt;Good understanding of &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1717&quot; data-end=&quot;1727&quot;&gt;ISA-95&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1729&quot; data-end=&quot;1746&quot;&gt;MES functions&lt;/strong&gt;, and certified in Ignition SCADA (preferred)&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;1793&quot; data-end=&quot;1820&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1797&quot; data-end=&quot;1820&quot;&gt;Good-to-Have Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1821&quot; data-end=&quot;2011&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1821&quot; data-end=&quot;1862&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1823&quot; data-end=&quot;1862&quot;&gt;Python scripting for SCADA automation&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1863&quot; data-end=&quot;1946&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1865&quot; data-end=&quot;1946&quot;&gt;Familiarity with industry standards and best practices in industrial automation&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1947&quot; data-end=&quot;2011&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1949&quot; data-end=&quot;2011&quot;&gt;Willingness to stay updated with evolving SCADA technologies&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',500000.00,2500000.00,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-19 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-06-06 10:35:25.000000','2025-11-21 04:59:32.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Engineer\", \"Historian\", \"Industrial Automation\", \"Pharma Industry\", \"Python\", \"SCADA\", \"SCADA Systems\"]','[\"&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;2877&quot; data-end=&quot;2895&quot;&gt;Job Benefits&lt;/h3&gt;\\r\\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2896&quot; data-end=&quot;3206&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2896&quot; data-end=&quot;2943&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2898&quot; data-end=&quot;2943&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and long-term engagement&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2944&quot; data-end=&quot;3023&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2946&quot; data-end=&quot;3023&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-level cloud architecture and modern design practices&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;3024&quot; data-end=&quot;3076&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;3026&quot; data-end=&quot;3076&quot;&gt;Collaborative, cross-functional team environment&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;3077&quot; data-end=&quot;3149&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;3079&quot; data-end=&quot;3149&quot;&gt;Opportunities for leadership, innovation, and architecture ownership&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;3150&quot; data-end=&quot;3206&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;3152&quot; data-end=&quot;3206&quot;&gt;Access to internal learning and development programs&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('dcad8499-7c5b-44b2-a53f-4fadd7d88149','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Pharmasuite MES Consultant','pharmasuite-mes-consultant-250-250','&lt;p&gt;Roles &amp;amp; Responsibilities&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;q Participates in fit gap analysis &amp;amp; Process Modeling &amp;amp; process standardization with Area lead &amp;amp; Process SME&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;q Works with Rockwell Automation Lead to develop BB requirements&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;q Provide times, user story point estimates, and status for all stories assigned to them&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;q Authors and performs documents supporting validation of EBRs&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;q Configures EBR in Development, Stage, &amp;amp; Production Environment&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;q Address Site specific questions, use cases and ER from Site EBR and PO&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;q Works across the teams to put requirement together for ER development&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;q Provide HyperCare and Go-live support&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Entry',NULL,NULL,'INR',1,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-06-16 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-04-17 23:15:25.000000','2026-04-17 23:15:25.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Rockwell Software\", \"Data Modeling\", \"Rockwell FTPS\", \"EBR\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1b8ludi&quot; data-start=&quot;57&quot; data-end=&quot;112&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and performance-based incentives&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;wa1cqy&quot; data-start=&quot;113&quot; data-end=&quot;152&quot;&gt;Health insurance (medical coverage)&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1elu4nz&quot; data-start=&quot;153&quot; data-end=&quot;191&quot;&gt;Paid leaves (casual, sick, earned)&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1sa4caw&quot; data-start=&quot;192&quot; data-end=&quot;243&quot;&gt;Flexible working hours / Work-from-home options&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;17iplkr&quot; data-start=&quot;244&quot; data-end=&quot;288&quot;&g