bles and adherence to change control processes during commissioning.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Consolidated reporting: timeline health, deliverable status, risk heatmap, and corrective actions.','Information Technology','Full-time','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',1,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2025-12-11 18:30:00',0,0,'2025-10-13 03:44:59.000000','2025-10-13 03:44:59.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Advanced Excel\", \"AvevaWonderware\", \"Change Management\", \"Confluence\", \"Critical Path Management\", \"Cross-Functional Teams\", \"Data Analytics\", \"ERP Integration\", \"Industrial Maintenance\", \"JIRA\", \"Manufacturing\", \"Mes\", \"Mes Scada Integration\", \"Mom\", \"MS Project\", \"Performance Tracking\", \"PLC\", \"Primavera\", \"Project Management\", \"Risk Management\", \"Siemens Opcenter\", \"Stakeholder Management\", \"Rockwell Factorytalk\", \"Program Manager\"]','[\"Competitive salary and performance bonus&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Health insurance and family coverage&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Provident Fund / statutory benefits and paid time off&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Travel allowance / site-visit reimbursements&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Learning &amp;amp; certification sponsorship (PMP/MES tools)&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Flexible/hybrid working (office + site visits) depending on project phase&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Relocation or travel support if required for specific site activities\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('dd503745-1886-4710-9283-beca6115d010','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Werum PAS-X MES MBR Designer','werum-pas-x-mes-mbr-designer-205-205','&amp;middot; Strong expertise in Werum PAS-X MES MBR,GMBR,PMBR,etc. designing and Validation&lt;br /&gt;&amp;middot; Knowledge of pharmaceutical manufacturing processes and regulatory compliance (GMP, GAMP 5, CFR Part 11). &lt;br /&gt;&amp;middot; Experience with MES with ERP (SAP), L2/L3 automation systems, and serialization platforms. &lt;br /&gt;&amp;middot; Understanding of data integrity principles and validation processes.&lt;br /&gt;&amp;middot; Design and configure Master Batch Records (MBRs) in Werum PAS-X according to client manufacturing processes. &lt;br /&gt;&amp;middot; Collaborate with process engineers and QA teams to ensure compliance with GMP and data integrity. &lt;br /&gt;&amp;middot; Validate and test MBRs to meet regulatory and operational requirements. &lt;br /&gt;&amp;middot;Support MES implementation projects and troubleshoot issues related to MBR design. &lt;br /&gt;&amp;middot; Work closely with cross-functional teams to harmonize processes and promote standardization across sites.','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'INR',1,'India','Mumbai',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-05-04 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-03-05 23:43:34.000000','2026-03-05 23:43:34.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"ERP\", \"GAMP5\", \"SAP\", \"Werum PAS-X V3.1.8\", \"Werum PAS-X\", \"GMP\", \"MBRs\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;Competitive salary package with performance-based incentives&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;65&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;67&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;Health insurance coverage and statutory benefits (PF &amp;amp; Gratuity)&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;134&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;136&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on large-scale enterprise energy management projects&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;211&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;213&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;Strong career growth and learning opportunities&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;263&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;265&quot; data-end