 Energy Auditor, M&amp;amp;V , Energy Savings Recommendations calculation and Implementation , Energy Analysis &amp;middot; Monitor and performance analysis of Heater, Heat Exchanger, cooling Towers,Pumps and Steam system. &amp;middot; Work experience in Energy Domain, Certified Energy Auditor, Identify Energy Savings Opportunity &amp;middot; Experience in managing energy management projects and commitments to show saving through energy management &amp;middot; Develop detailed Functional Requirement Specification (FRS) documents that accurately reflect customer requirements and project objectives. &amp;middot; Data analysis of key energy performance indicators at overall Industrial and asset level &amp;middot; Perform comprehensive Energy and Mass Balance calculations to support system optimization and efficiency evaluations &amp;middot; Collaborate effectively with customers, UI/UX teams, and technical leads to support product enhancements and ensure seamless feature integration. &amp;middot; Analyze technical feasibility of energy savings &amp;middot; Experience in managing energy management projects &amp;middot; Commitments to show saving through energy management opportunities','Information Technology','Contract','Entry',NULL,NULL,'INR',1,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-04-18 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-02-17 19:38:43.000000','2026-02-17 19:38:43.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Energy\", \"Energy Auditor\", \"Energy Efficiency\", \"Energy Efficiency Optimization\", \"Energy Management Systems\", \"Functional Risk Assessments\", \"Heat Exchangers\"]','[\"*Opportunity to work on large-scale enterprise energy management projects across India. *Strong career growth, learning support, and exposure to industry-leading technologies in a collaborative work environment.\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('dde96f47-0d93-462e-91eb-5fb691efd819','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','MES Project Manager','mes-project-manager-114-114','As the MES/MOM Project Manager you will own end-to-end project planning and execution for Manufacturing Execution System (MES) and Manufacturing Operations Management (MOM) workstreams. You will create and maintain the integrated master schedule aligned with industrialization plans (India &amp;amp; UK), control the critical path to digital go-lives, drive cross-functional mitigation for risks and issues, and present consolidated status and recommendations to executives and steering committees.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Develop &amp;amp; maintain the integrated project plan / master schedule across MOM/MES and related industrialization milestones.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Manage critical-path planning and ensure on-time digital go-lives by coordinating cross-functional teams (IT, engineering, operations, quality, vendors).&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Maintain a RAID tracker (Risks, Assumptions, Issues, Dependencies) and drive mitigation &amp;amp; resolution with owners.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Monitor integrated dependencies between industrial and digital milestones; escalate when slippage threatens go-live.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Provide clear, decisive recommendations and status updates to senior leadership and steering committees.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Ensure governance inputs and prepare materials for steering-committee forums.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Coordinate vendor deliveries, factory acceptance tests (FAT), site acceptance tests (SAT), and cutover planning.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Ensure quality of deliverables and adherence to change control processes during commissioning.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Consolidated reporting: timeline health, deliverable status, risk heatmap, and corrective actions.','Information Technology','Full-time','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',1,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2025-12-11 18:30:00',0,0,'2025-10-13 03:44:59.000000','2025-10-13 03:44:59.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Advanced Excel\", \"Aveva