r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1pthkry&quot; data-start=&quot;1180&quot; data-end=&quot;1242&quot;&gt;Integrate AI models with embedded systems and IoT platforms.&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-27 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-08-29 00:53:25.000000','2026-08-29 00:53:26.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"AI/ML\", \"C++\", \"Embedded Systems\", \"Machine Learning\", \"Python\", \"Raspberry PI\", \"PyTorch\", \"TensorFlow\", \"NVIDIA Jetson\", \"Edge AI\", \"ONNX\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1n6cily&quot; data-start=&quot;1982&quot; data-end=&quot;2055&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2011&quot; data-end=&quot;2022&quot;&gt;Top MNC&lt;/strong&gt; on advanced Edge AI initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1jr7h49&quot; data-start=&quot;2056&quot; data-end=&quot;2156&quot;&gt;Exposure to &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2070&quot; data-end=&quot;2155&quot;&gt;Generative AI, Computer Vision, Embedded AI, and real-time inference technologies&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;w6jl9f&quot; data-start=&quot;2157&quot; data-end=&quot;2234&quot;&gt;Work with leading edge hardware such as &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2199&quot; data-end=&quot;2233&quot;&gt;NVIDIA Jetson and Raspberry Pi&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;hgsvzi&quot; data-start=&quot;2235&quot; data-end=&quot;2318&quot;&gt;Opportunity to build and optimize production-grade AI models for edge deployment.&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;xtgmfk&quot; data-start=&quot;2319&quot; data-end=&quot;2391&quot;&gt;Exposure to &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2333&quot; data-end=&quot;2390&quot;&gt;MLOps, Docker, Kubernetes, CI/CD, and AI accelerators&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;a903ru&quot; data-start=&quot;2392&quot; data-end=&quot;2482&quot;&gt;Work on real-world AI applications involving anomaly detection and predictive analytics.&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('dff2c8f1-902b-476e-b67e-52be0ffa1ba8','78245df0-b94d-4541-87d3-a40e115b62a2','b9745af6-2f9b-4b9c-92ab-6fb310858bca','IAM developer','iam-developer-55-55','Years of Experience: 3-5 Years direct experience in IAM Design, Implementation, Security Administration &amp;amp; Configuration.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Shift Time: Same IST - 12 to 9 or 11 to 8 - Flexible with US Calls &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Project duration: 3 months (extendable basis)&lt;br /&gt;Location: Remote&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;JD-Key pointers:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Develop, implement, and maintain IAM solutions, including identity provisioning, access control, authentication, and authorization mechanisms.&lt;br /&gt;Design IAM workflows, policies, and procedures to ensure secure and efficient access management using SAAS Identity &amp;amp; Access Management platforms.&lt;br /&gt;Strong understanding of access control, authentication &amp;amp; authorization.&lt;br /&gt;Manage user onboarding, offboarding, and role changes, ensuring adherence to security policies and compliance requirements.&lt;br /&gt;Must have experience in SCIM REST API, Java, JSON, XML,Webservices, Install, customize, configure, and support identity provisioning and governance tools.&lt;br /&gt;Troubleshoot and resolve L2/L3 technical issues related to IAM configurations, connector integrations, customizations and support hypercare for different project rollouts &amp;amp; phases.&lt;br /&gt;Define and enforce access control policies, including role-based access control (RBAC), least privilege principle, and segregation of duties (SoD).&lt;br /&gt;Perform unit testing, integration testing, and validation of the IAM solutions to ensure they meet quality and security standards.&lt;br /&gt;Good to have exposure on Bean Shell,Groovy,Shell scripting &amp;amp; hands on Terraform script but desired.&lt;br /&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional teams, including IT, security, and compliance, to ensure IAM aligns with business goals.','Information Technology','Full-time','Mid',NULL,NULL,'INR',1,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2025-08-08 18:30:00',0,0,'2025-06-10 10:10:16.000000','2025-06-10 10:10:16.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Administration\", \"IAM Roles And Policies\"]','[]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('e0451113-28dd-4c5d-950c-bc1640d7f9d4','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Honeywell PHD Historian Technical SME','honeywell-phd-historian-technical-sme-207-207','&amp;middot; Install, configure and maintain the Honeywell PHD historian and associated interfaces.&lt;br /&gt;&amp;bull; Monitor system health, troubleshoot issues and ensure data integrity and availability. &lt;br /&gt;&amp;bull; Work closely with process engineers, IT and operations teams to understand data requirements and implement historian solutions.&lt;br /&gt;&amp;bull; Manage historian points/tags, user access and system security. &lt;br /&gt;&amp;bull; Develop and maintain documentation related to historian architecture, configuration and standard operating procedures.&lt;br /&gt;&amp;bull; Support data extraction, reporting and integration with other plant information systems and applications. &lt;br /&gt;&amp;bull; Plan and execute historian upgrades, patches and migrations as required. &lt;br /&gt;&amp;bull; Ensure compliance with Santos&#039; cybersecurity, data governance and backup policies.&lt;br /&gt;&amp;bull; Provide training and support to end users on historian tools and data access methods','Information Technology','Contract','Entry',NULL,NULL,'INR',1,'India','Pune',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-05-04 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-03-05 23:52:32.000000','2026-03-05 23:52:34.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Data Integration\", \"Historian\", \"Oil\", \"Security\", \"SQL Server\", \"DevOps AWS\", \"Honeywell EPKS\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quo