ot; Data Warehousing: Apply strong Data Warehousing (DWH) concepts to build efficient data models and metadata.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;middot; Collaboration: Work closely with business analysts, architects, and testing teams to gather requirements and deliver integrated solutions.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;middot; DevOps &amp;amp; Automation: Implement and maintain CI/CD pipelines for SSIS deployments, leveraging tools like GIT,DevOPS&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Technical Skills:&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;middot; SSIS: Expert-level experience in building, deploying (SSIS Catalog), and managing SSIS packages.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;middot; SQL server: Advanced SQL, T-SQL, Stored Procedures, Functions, Performance Tuning, Indexing.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;middot; ETL/DWH Deep understanding of ETL processes, Data Warehousing principles, Metadata Management.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;middot; Version Control: Git, GitHub.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'INR',1,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-04-26 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-02-25 19:24:30.000000','2026-02-25 19:24:30.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Agile\", \"Azure\", \"ETL\", \"ETL Processes\", \"Github\", \"Mes Scrum Methodology\", \"MYSQL\", \"Power BI\", \"Powershell\", \"SSIS\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;Competitive salary package with performance-based incentives&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;65&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;67&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;Health insurance coverage and statutory benefits (PF &amp;amp; Gratuity)&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;134&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;136&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on large-scale enterprise energy management projects&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;211&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;213&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;Strong career growth and learning opportunities&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;263&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;265&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;Collaborative and professional work environment&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('e129b6e4-7cb2-448f-8648-c0c6fe67de4f','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','SSRS / Power BI Report Builder','ssrs-power-bi-report-builder-191-191','&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span role=&quot;presentation&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SSRS (SQL Server Reporting Services) &amp;nbsp;/ Power BI Report Builder&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span role=&quot;presentation&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Should be good in SQL&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;span role=&quot;presentation&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Should be good in Communication&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Should have knowledge of optimizing SQL Queries and power BI reports&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Good if have Energy Components knowledge&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'INR',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-04-18 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-02-17 18:57:34.000000','2026-02-17 18:57:34.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"MYSQL\", \"Power BI\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;233&quot; data-end=&quot;263&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;235&quot; data-end=&quot;263&quot;&gt;Skill development programs&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;264&quot; data-end=&quot;292&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;266&quot; data-end=&quot;292&quot;&gt;Leadership opportunities&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;377&quot; data-end=&quot;400&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;379&quot; data-end=&quot;400&quot;&gt;Mentorship programs&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;377&quot; data-end=&quot;400&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;379&quot; data-end=&quot;400&quot;&gt;Strong market presence&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;401&quot; data-end=&quot;433&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;403&quot; data-end=&quot;433&quot;&gt;Exposure to new technologies&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('e161d780-fd68-4014-886e-ee130d557ee5','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','AI / ML Engineer','ai-ml-engineer-96-96','We are hiring AI/ML Engineers (3&ndash;12 years) for PAN India (Full-Time). You will design and build production-grade AI solutions using Cloud AI services and GenAI models, with robust cloud/on-prem pipelines. Work spans deep learning, neural networks, chatbots, and image processing. You&rsquo;ll operate independently, contribute as an SME, and collaborate closely with cross-functional teams.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;br /&gt;- Design and develop applications using AI tools and Cloud AI services.&lt;br /&gt;- Build cloud or on-prem MLOps pipelines with production-ready quality.&lt;br /&gt;- Apply GenAI models (LLMs, embeddings, RAG) as part of end-to-end solutions.&lt;br /&gt;- Implement deep learning and classical ML (NNs, regression, trees, clustering).&lt;br /&gt;- Design and develop chatbots and image processing solutions.&lt;br /&gt;- Participate actively in technical discussions and solution design; mentor as needed.&lt;br /&gt;- Troubleshoot, optimize, and document models, data flows, and services.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Required Skills &amp;amp; Qualifications:&lt;br /&gt;- Must-have: Proficiency in MLOps (model training, CI/CD for ML, monitoring).&lt;br /&gt;- Strong grasp of statistics and ML algorithms (regression, classification, trees, clustering).&lt;br /&gt;- Experience with data visualization tools (Tableau or Power BI).&lt;br /&gt;- Solid data wrangling: cleaning, transformation, normalization, feature engineering.&lt;br /&gt;- Hands-on with Python and ML/DL frameworks (e.g., scikit-learn, TensorFlow/PyTorch).&lt;br /&gt;- Experience with at least one cloud (AWS/GCP/Azure) and containerization (Docker).&lt;br /&gt;- Strong problem-solving, communication, and collaboration skills.','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-30 06:00:00',0,0,'2025-08-27 11:32:15.000000','2026-05-06 20:52:57.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"AI/ML\", \"AWS\", \"Azure\", \"Chatbots\", \"Cloud\", \"Computer Vision\", \"Data Cleaning\", \"Data Transcription\", \"GCP\", \"Image Recognition\", \"Machine Learning\", \"Power BI\", \"Python\", \"SQL\", \"Tableau\", \"Data Modeling\", \"CI/CD\", \"Generative AI\", \"NLP\", \"LLM Fine-tuning\"]','[\"- Competitive salary and performance bonuses&lt;br /&gt;- 100% PAN India flexibility (remote/hybrid per project)&lt;br /&gt;- Work on real-world GenAI and production-scale AI platforms&lt;br /&gt;- Upskilling: certifications, trainings, conferences&lt;br /&gt;- Health benefits and wellness programs&lt;br /&gt;- Collaborative, fast-paced, innovation-driven culture\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('e17437f5-814b-495a-bfc5-31055e8696d0','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Tester /QA - Manual / Automation','tester-qa-manual-automation-211-211','o Hands-on experience in both manual and automation testing of enterprise/N-tier applications.&lt;br /&gt;o Proficiency in creating, executing, and maintaining test plans, test cases, and regression suites. &lt;br /&gt;o Experience with test automation tools such as Playwright, Selenium or similar. &lt;br /&gt;o Good understanding of automation test frameworks (data-driven, keyword-driven, hybrid, etc.).&lt;br /&gt;o Experience in defect management and source control tools (e.g., JIRA, HP ALM, TFS, ADO).&lt;br /&gt;o Strong knowledge of SDLC, STLC, and Agile/Scrum testing practices. &lt;br /&gt;o Good understanding of databases (SQL, MySQL, Oracle) and ability to write basic queries.&lt;br /&gt;o Experience in developing automated test scripts based on application test frameworks. o Excellent analytical and logical skills.','Information Technology','Contract','Entry',NULL,NULL,'INR',1,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-05-05 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-03-07 01:55:59.000000','2026-03-07 01:56:26.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Agile\", \"Automation Testing\", \"HTFS\", \"JIRA\", \"MYSQL\", \"Oracle\", \"SDLC\", \"Manual Testing\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;Competitive salary package with performance-based incentives&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;65&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;67&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;Health insurance coverage and statutory benefits (PF &amp;amp; Gratuity)&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;134&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;136&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on large-scale enterprise energy management projects&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;211&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;213&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;Strong career growth and learning opportunities&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;263&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;265&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;Collaborative and professional work environment&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('e177b41e-e034-42d1-9fe0-896f03178272','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Solution Architect – AVEVA MES','solution-architect-aveva-mes-341-341','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;72&quot; data-end=&quot;457&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced Solution Architects &amp;ndash; AVEVA MES for a leading Top MNC to drive enterprise-scale Manufacturing IT, Manufacturing Execution Systems (MES), and Smart Manufacturing transformation initiatives. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in AVEVA MES, Manufacturing Operations Management (MOM), enterprise solution architecture, and Industry 4.0 technologies.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;459&quot; data-end=&quot;904&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for designing, architecting, and delivering end-to-end AVEVA MES solutions for global manufacturing organizations. The role includes defining enterprise MES architectures, translating business requirements into scalable technical solutions, leading digital manufacturing initiatives, supporting MES implementation and migration programs, and ensuring seamless integration with enterprise and shop-floor systems.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;906&quot; data-end=&quot;1373&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with AVEVA MES, AVEVA System Platform, AVEVA Work Tasks (Skelta BPM), AVEVA MDM, AVEVA Enterprise Integrator, AVEVA InTouch, AVEVA OMI, Microsoft SQL Server, C#/.NET, and enterprise manufacturing solutions. Strong knowledge of ISA-95, ISA-88, MESA standards, GMP compliance, production scheduling, OEE, genealogy, traceability, ERP integration, industrial automation, and manufacturing best practices is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1375&quot; data-end=&quot;1890&quot;&gt;The role also involves leading customer workshops, conducting site assessments, preparing Functional Requirement Specifications (FRS) and Functional Design Specifications (FDS), supporting SIT, UAT, validation activities, and collaborating with global business stakeholders, delivery teams, automation engineers, and solution architects to deliver enterprise-grade MES solutions. Candidates should possess strong leadership, consulting, communication, stakeholder management, analytical, and problem-solving skills.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Pune',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-09-13 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-07-16 02:51:23.000000','2026-07-16 02:51:23.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"ERP Integration\", \"Mes\", \"Mes Oee\", \"AVEVA System\", \"AVEVA Intouch HMI\", \"AVEVA MES\", \"AVEVA Work Tasks\", \"AVEVA MDM\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1906&quot; data-end=&quot;1944&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1jb3rem&quot; data-start=&quot;1945&quot; data-end=&quot;2029&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale MES and Smart Manufacturing transformation projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ae7wl8&quot; data-start=&quot;2030&quot; data-end=&quot;2096&quot;&gt;Work on advanced AVEVA MES, MOM, and Industry 4.0 technologies&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1b78xst&quot; data-start=&quot;2097&quot; data-end=&quot;2176&quot;&gt;Career growth in Solution Architecture and Digital Manufacturing Consulting&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;13qji02&quot; data-start=&quot;2177&quot; data-end=&quot;2254&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global manufacturing and technology teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot; data-start=&quot;2255&quot; data-end=&quot;2310&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;2311&quot; data-end=&quot;2354&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Maharashtra'),('e20890ca-d98c-44be-b351-ce97754ba68c','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Senior AI Engineer (GenAI / Machine Learning)','senior-ai-engineer-genai-machine-learning-347-347','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;87&quot; data-end=&quot;508&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;113&quot; data-end=&quot;136&quot;&gt;Senior AI Engineers&lt;/strong&gt; for a leading Top MNC to design and deliver enterprise-scale Artificial Intelligence, Generative AI (GenAI), and Machine Learning solutions. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in Large Language Models (LLMs), Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG), AI architecture, and intelligent automation to drive next-generation enterprise AI transformation initiatives.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;510&quot; data-end=&quot;1006&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for designing, developing, and deploying enterprise-grade GenAI and Machine Learning solutions for intelligent incident management, recommendation systems, similarity matching, resolution prediction, and root-cause analysis. The role includes building RAG-based AI applications, developing AI-powered knowledge retrieval systems, integrating AI models with enterprise platforms, defining AI architecture, and implementing continuous feedback learning mechanisms.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1008&quot; data-end=&quot;1409&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with Azure OpenAI, Machine Learning, Generative AI, RAG Architecture, LangChain, Semantic Kernel, Python, Vector Databases, AI model orchestration, and enterprise system integration. Strong understanding of LLMs, prompt engineering, AI agents, embeddings, semantic search, ServiceNow integration, and scalable AI solution architecture is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1411&quot; data-end=&quot;1924&quot;&gt;The role also involves collaborating with solution architects, data engineers, backend engineers, business stakeholders, and global delivery teams to build scalable AI platforms and intelligent automation solutions. Candidates will mentor junior AI engineers, establish AI development best practices, optimize model performance, and ensure secure, responsible, and enterprise-ready AI implementations. Strong leadership, communication, stakeholder management, analytical, and problem-solving skills are essential.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-09-20 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-07-23 01:46:59.000000','2026-07-23 01:46:59.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Agent Maintenance\", \"Azure\", \"Machine Learning\", \"Python\", \"Generative AI\", \"Prompt Engineering\", \"LangChain\", \"Vector Store\", \"LLM Fine-tuning\", \"RAG Pipelines\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1940&quot; data-end=&quot;1978&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1fwcla9&quot; data-start=&quot;1979&quot; data-end=&quot;2066&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale AI, Generative AI, and Intelligent Automation projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;t6o54h&quot; data-start=&quot;2067&quot; data-end=&quot;2167&quot;&gt;Work with the latest Large Language Models (LLMs), RAG, AI Agents, and Azure OpenAI technologies&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1a7ievx&quot; data-start=&quot;2168&quot; data-end=&quot;2262&quot;&gt;Career growth in Artificial Intelligence, Machine Learning, and Enterprise AI Architecture&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;irffqr&quot; data-start=&quot;2263&quot; data-end=&quot;2343&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global AI, engineering, and technology teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot; data-start=&quot;2344&quot; data-end=&quot;2399&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;2400&quot; data-end=&quot;2443&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('e2639d55-4d3c-44ef-aa83-07121d6ff0a0','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Databricks Engineer','databricks-engineer-223-223','&lt;blockquote&gt;\r\n&lt;ul&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;Design, develop, and maintain&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;end-to-end data pipelines&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;using&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Databricks (Spark, Delta Lake)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Build and optimize&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;batch and streaming pipelines&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;using Spark Structured Streaming&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Implement&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Delta Lake&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;best practices (ACID, schema evolution, time travel, optimization)&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Develop data transformations using&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;PySpark / Spark SQL / Scala&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Integrate data from multiple sources (IoT, relational, APIs, streaming platforms like Kafka/Event Hubs)&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Optimize performance using&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;partitioning, caching, Z-ordering, cluster tuning&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Implement&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;data quality checks, validation, and observability&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Work closely with data scientists, ML engineers, and BI teams to support analytics and ML workflows&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Implement&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;CI/CD pipelines&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;for Databricks notebooks, jobs, and workflows&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Ensure&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;data security, governance, and access control&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;using Unity Catalog and RBAC&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Monitor, troubleshoot, and resolve pipeline and cluster issues in production&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;/blockquote&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Entry',NULL,NULL,'INR',1,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-05-25 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-03-26 20:09:47.000000','2026-03-26 20:09:47.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Big Data\", \"Data Security Awareness\", \"Scala\", \"Spark\", \"Pyspark\", \"CI/CD\", \"Azure Databricks\", \"Delta Lake\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;Competitive salary package with performance-based incentives&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;65&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;67&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;Health insurance coverage and statutory benefits (PF &amp;amp; Gratuity)&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;134&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;136&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on large-scale enterprise energy management projects&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;211&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;213&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;Strong career growth and learning opportunities&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;263&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;265&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;Collaborative and professional work environment&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('e27d5af7-bf91-4c38-a656-0eba127385bd','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Sample Manager LIMS SME','sample-manager-lims-sme-53-53','&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;334&quot; data-end=&quot;360&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;341&quot; data-end=&quot;358&quot;&gt;Role Summary:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;361&quot; data-end=&quot;654&quot;&gt;We are seeking an experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;391&quot; data-end=&quot;417&quot;&gt;SampleManager LIMS SME&lt;/strong&gt; to support the design, development, customization, and integration of SampleManager LIMS systems. The ideal candidate will have strong technical skills in LIMS and related technologies, and a passion for optimizing laboratory processes.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;hr data-start=&quot;656&quot; data-end=&quot;659&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;661&quot; data-end=&quot;693&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;668&quot; data-end=&quot;693&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;694&quot; data-end=&quot;1319&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;694&quot; data-end=&quot;769&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;696&quot; data-end=&quot;769&quot;&gt;Design, develop, configure, and support SampleManager LIMS applications&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;770&quot; data-end=&quot;847&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;772&quot; data-end=&quot;847&quot;&gt;Gather user requirements and maintain system documentation and procedures&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;848&quot; data-end=&quot;909&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;850&quot; data-end=&quot;909&quot;&gt;Perform performance tuning and upgrade existing codebases&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;910&quot; data-end=&quot;980&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;912&quot; data-end=&quot;980&quot;&gt;Work on version upgrades/migrations and custom module enhancements&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;981&quot; data-end=&quot;1045&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;983&quot; data-end=&quot;1045&quot;&gt;Manage complete product configuration and analysis workflows&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1046&quot; data-end=&quot;1108&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1048&quot; data-end=&quot;1108&q