SAP development. Strong proficiency in SAP ABAP, ABAP Objects, and SAP Fiori/UI5. Experience with RICEFW objects (Reports, Interfaces, Conversions, Enhancements, Forms, and Workflows). Hands-on experience with SAP S/4HANA and ECC environments. Experience in OData service development and integration. Proficiency in performance tuning and code optimization techniques. Familiarity with SAP CDS Views, AMDP, and RAP. Experience with BAPIs, BADIs, and User Exits. Strong knowledge of SAP tables, data dictionary, and transport management. Hands-on experience with SAP Workflow and IDocs. Proficiency in debugging and troubleshooting complex SAP issues.','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',350000.00,600000.00,'₹',1,'India','Chennai',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-30 06:00:00',0,0,'2025-05-04 19:47:12.000000','2026-05-06 18:02:56.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"S/4HANA\", \"S4 HANA\", \"SAP\", \"SAP ABAP\", \"SAP Apparel\", \"SAP Basis\", \"Sap Basis Administration\", \"SAP BI\", \"Sap Business Objects\", \"SAP FIORI\", \"SAP ME System Enhancements\", \"SAP MES – ERP Integration\", \"Sap-ERP\"]','[\"Benefits: Competitive salary and performance-based bonuses. Health insurance and paid time off. Flexible work hours and remote/hybrid options. Professional development and training opportunities. Collaborative and growth-oriented work environment\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Tamil Nadu'),('e293047c-3442-452d-b4b4-dc076239ffae','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','LIMS Support Engineer','lims-support-engineer-166-166','&lt;p data-start=&quot;182&quot; data-end=&quot;730&quot;&gt;We are seeking a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;199&quot; data-end=&quot;224&quot;&gt;LIMS Support Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; with 4&amp;ndash;6 years of experience to provide technical support, configuration, and enhancement for LIMS applications. The ideal candidate should have hands-on experience with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;395&quot; data-end=&quot;416&quot;&gt;any LIMS platform&lt;/strong&gt;, strong understanding of &lt;strong data-start=&quot;442&quot; data-end=&quot;460&quot;&gt;ITIL processes&lt;/strong&gt;, and the ability to work closely with cross-functional teams to ensure smooth lab operations.&lt;br data-start=&quot;554&quot; data-end=&quot;557&quot; /&gt;You will be responsible for troubleshooting issues, performing system changes, managing workflows, training users, and ensuring system stability for production environments.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;hr data-start=&quot;732&quot; data-end=&quot;735&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;737&quot; data-end=&quot;766&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;742&quot; data-end=&quot;766&quot;&gt;Job Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;767&quot; data-end=&quot;1359&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;767&quot; data-end=&quot;865&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;769&quot; data-end=&quot;865&quot;&gt;Provide technical support and issue resolution for LIMS users across different business units.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;866&quot; data-end=&quot;958&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;868&quot; data-end=&quot;958&quot;&gt;Perform &lt;strong data-start=&quot;876&quot; data-end=&quot;931&quot;&gt;LIMS configuration, customization, and enhancements&lt;/strong&gt; as per lab requirements.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;959&quot; data-end=&quot;1065&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;961&quot; data-end=&quot;1065&quot;&gt;Manage and implement &lt;strong data-start=&quot;982&quot; data-end=&quot;1001&quot;&gt;change requests&lt;/strong&gt; including scripting, workflow updates, and system validation.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1066&quot; data-end=&quot;1165&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1068&quot; data-end=&quot;1165&quot;&gt;Perform &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1076&quot; data-end=&quot;1128&quot;&gt;system testing, user training, and documentation&lt;/strong&gt; based on change 