 within a manufacturing environment. The role involves developing, enhancing, and maintaining enterprise applications, performing system integrations, database optimization, and supporting application migrations to modern .NET technologies. The candidate will work as part of a collaborative delivery team and interact closely with business and technical stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;hr data-start=&quot;713&quot; data-end=&quot;716&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;718&quot; data-end=&quot;745&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;721&quot; data-end=&quot;745&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;746&quot; data-end=&quot;1325&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;746&quot; data-end=&quot;795&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;748&quot; data-end=&quot;795&quot;&gt;Develop UI screens and server-side components&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;796&quot; data-end=&quot;857&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;798&quot; data-end=&quot;857&quot;&gt;Build and optimize SQL queries, procedures, and functions&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;858&quot; data-end=&quot;933&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;860&quot; data-end=&quot;933&quot;&gt;Perform system integrations using Web Services, WCF, APIs, and DB links&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;934&quot; data-end=&quot;982&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;936&quot; data-end=&quot;982&quot;&gt;Monitor application and database performance&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;983&quot; data-end=&quot;1037&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;985&quot; data-end=&quot;1037&quot;&gt;Troubleshoot production issues and perform RCA/RCF&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1038&quot; data-end=&quot;1110&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1040&quot; data-end=&quot;1110&quot;&gt;Communicate effectively with stakeholders and cross-functional teams&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1111&quot; data-end=&quot;1191&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1113&quot; data-end=&quot;1191&quot;&gt;Migrate legacy .NET Framework / VB.NET applications to &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1168&quot; data-end=&quot;1189&quot;&gt;.NET Core with C#&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1192&quot; data-end=&quot;1255&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1194&quot; data-end=&quot;1255&quot;&gt;Provide support for AI-related integrations or enhancements&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1256&quot; data-end=&quot;1325&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1258&quot; data-end=&quot;1325&quot;&gt;Work as part of a delivery team reporting to the Delivery Manager&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-03-17 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-01-16 18:17:50.000000','2026-01-16 18:17:50.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\".NET CORE\", \".NET Framework\", \".NET MVC\", \"ASP.NET\", \"C#\", \"MS SQL Server\", \"Oracle\", \"PL/SQL\", \"VB.NET\", \"WCF\", \"Web API\", \"IIS\", \"Windows Forms\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2035&quot; data-end=&quot;2066&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2037&quot; data-end=&quot;2066&quot;&gt;Long-term project stability&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2067&quot; data-end=&quot;2129&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2069&quot; data-end=&quot;2129&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2092&quot; data-end=&quot;2127&quot;&gt;manufacturing shopfloor systems&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2130&quot; data-end=&quot;2181&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2132&quot; data-end=&quot;2181&quot;&gt;Exposure to &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2144&quot; data-end=&quot;2179&quot;&gt;legacy-to-modern .NET migration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2182&quot; data-end=&quot;2252&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2184&quot; data-end=&quot;2252&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2209&quot; data-end=&quot;2250&quot;&gt;enterprise integrations and databases&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2253&quot; data-end=&quot;2321&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2255&quot; data-end=&quot;2321&quot;&gt;Collaborative team environment under a structured delivery model&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('e35040f6-a9da-4baa-aa2b-8983b469a36f','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Warehouse Simulation Consultant','warehouse-simulation-consultant-349-349','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;110&quot; data-end=&quot;550&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;136&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;Warehouse Simulation Consultants / Discrete Event Simulation Engineers&lt;/strong&gt; for a leading Top MNC to support enterprise-scale warehouse, logistics, and supply chain transformation initiatives. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in warehouse simulation, Digital Twin technologies, and Discrete Event Simulation (DES) to optimize warehouse operations, material flow, and distribution center performance.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;552&quot; data-end=&quot;1022&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for designing, developing, and validating warehouse simulation models using Siemens Tecnomatix Plant Simulation, FlexSim, AnyLogic, or other Discrete Event Simulation tools. The role includes developing Digital Twin models, analyzing warehouse layouts, optimizing throughput and capacity, validating material handling systems, evaluating automation strategies, and conducting what-if scenario analysis to improve operational efficiency.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1024&quot; data-end=&quot;1513&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with warehouse simulation, distribution center modeling, material flow analysis, conveyor systems, AS/RS, sortation systems, storage policies, labor productivity optimization, forklift and operator movement simulation, dock door scheduling, trailer management, and warehouse process optimization. Strong knowledge of supply chain operations, logistics engineering, warehouse automation, and KPI-driven performance analysis is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1515&quot; data-end=&quot;2001&quot;&gt;The role also involves collaborating with warehouse operations teams, supply chain stakeholders, automation engineers, solution architects, and global project teams to deliver scalable simulation models, support warehouse modernization programs, and recommend process improvements. Candidates should possess strong analytical, communication, stakeholder management, presentation, and problem-solving skills with experience in enterprise logistics and digital manufacturing environments.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Pune',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-09-20 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-07-23 02:02:10.000000','2026-07-23 02:02:10.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"AnyLogic\", \"FlexSim\", \"Warehouse Robotics\", \"Warehouse Management Systems\", \"Discrete Event Simulation\", \"Siemens Tecnomatix Plant Simulation\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2017&quot; data-end=&quot;2055&quot; data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2056&quot; data-end=&quot;2151&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1yixf8&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale Warehouse, Logistics, and Supply Chain transformation projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2152&quot; data-end=&quot;2230&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1qlsuo4&quot;&gt;Work with advanced Digital Twin and Discrete Event Simulation technologies&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2231&quot; data-end=&quot