 /&gt;- Proficiency in JIRA, Trello, Asana, or MS Project.&lt;br /&gt;- Knowledge of IT systems, infrastructure, or IoT concepts (sensors, gateways, hardware).&lt;br /&gt;- Excellent communication skills&amp;mdash;fluent in English (Spanish is a plus).&lt;br /&gt;- Experience handling enterprise-level clients (preferably Fortune 500).&lt;br /&gt;- Highly organized, detail-oriented, and capable of managing multiple priorities.','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-19 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-08-27 10:22:04.000000','2025-11-21 04:43:55.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Agile\", \"Client Communication\", \"IOT\", \"IT Infrastructure\", \"JIRA\", \"Leadership\", \"MS Project\", \"Project Management\", \"Risk Management\", \"SDLC\", \"Stakeholder Management\", \"Team Collaboration\", \"Trello\", \"Scrum Master\"]','[\"- Competitive salary package&lt;br /&gt;- Opportunity to work with global IoT clients including Fortune 500 companies&lt;br /&gt;- Exposure to cutting-edge technologies and enterprise-level projects&lt;br /&gt;- Professional growth in Agile/Scrum environment&lt;br /&gt;- Collaborative and innovative work culture&lt;br /&gt;- Flexible working hours (if applicable)\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('e44d9cea-54bb-432c-a5f2-0211db57e187','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Camstar Opcenter Consultant','camstar-opcenter-consultant-171-171','&lt;ul&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;186&quot; data-end=&quot;270&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;188&quot; data-end=&quot;270&quot;&gt;Work on &lt;strong data-start=&quot;196&quot; data-end=&quot;270&quot;&gt;Camstar Opcenter MES implementation, support, and enhancement projects&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;271&quot; data-end=&quot;361&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;273&quot; data-end=&quot;361&quot;&gt;Configure and customize &lt;strong data-start=&quot;297&quot; data-end=&quot;317&quot;&gt;Camstar Opcenter&lt;/strong&gt; to meet manufacturing business requirements&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;362&quot; data-end=&quot;439&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;364&quot; data-end=&quot;439&quot;&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional teams to design and deliver MES solutions&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;440&quot; data-end=&quot;508&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;442&quot; data-end=&quot;508&quot;&gt;Handle &lt;strong data-start=&quot;449&quot; data-end=&quot;508&quot;&gt;production support, issue analysis, and troubleshooting&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;509&quot; data-end=&quot;579&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;511&quot; data-end=&quot;579&quot;&gt;Integrate Camstar Opcenter with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;543&quot; data-end=&quot;579&quot;&gt;ERP and other enterprise systems&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;580&quot; data-end=&quot;660&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;582&quot; data-end=&quot;660&quot;&gt;Participate in requirement gathering, solution design, testing, and deployment&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;661&quot; data-end=&quot;727&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;663&quot; data-end=&quot;727&quot;&gt;Provide technical support and documentation for MES applications&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Full-time','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-02-15 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-12-17 17:29:09.000000','2025-12-17 17:29:09.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Camstar\", \"ERP\", \"Mes\", \"Mes Customization\", \"Opcenter\", \"Oracle\", \"SAP\"]','[\"&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1282&quot; data-end=&quot;1593&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1282&quot; data-end=&quot;1362&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1284&quot; data-end=&quot;1362&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1309&quot; data-end=&quot