on Technology','Full-time','Mid',NULL,NULL,'INR',0,'India','Pune',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-24 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-11-25 16:34:45.000000','2025-11-25 16:34:45.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Azure\", \"Azure SQL Database\", \"Data Lake\", \"ETL\", \"Java\", \"Python\", \"Scala\", \"SQL\", \"Pyspark\", \"Azure Databricks\"]','[\"Exposure to global projects, cutting-edge Azure technologies, growth-focused environment, collaborative work culture.\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Maharashtra'),('e4edfed9-c2e3-4450-8ba0-ea40b5ccff65','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','VCP MO Engineer','vcp-mo-engineer-157-157','&lt;p data-start=&quot;244&quot; data-end=&quot;591&quot;&gt;We are seeking an experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;274&quot; data-end=&quot;293&quot;&gt;VCP MO Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; with strong technical, analytical, and communication skills to manage, monitor, and support customer environments. The ideal candidate should have hands-on experience with Linux administration, orchestration tools (Docker, Kubernetes, Mesosphere), scripting tools, databases, and monitoring tools.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;593&quot; data-end=&quot;882&quot;&gt;The role involves software installation, deployment, environment monitoring, and adherence to ITSM processes such as Incident, Change, and Problem Management. The candidate will work with global teams across Europe, USA, APAC, and India and may be required to travel to customer locations.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Full-time','Entry',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-31 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-12-03 02:48:48.000000','2025-12-03 02:48:48.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Ansible\", \"Docker\", \"Grafana\", \"Hadoop Ecosystem\", \"Kubernetes\", \"Linux\", \"Linux Administration\", \"Mongo DB\", \"Splunk\", \"TerraForm\", \"Problem Management\", \"DCOS\", \"Mesosphere\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;957&quot; data-end=&quot;999&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;959&quot; data-end=&quot;999&quot;&gt;Competitive salary based on experience&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1000&quot; data-end=&quot;1047&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1002&quot; data-end=&quot;1047&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with top global clients&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1048&quot; data-end=&quot;1120&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1050&quot; data-end=&quot;1120&quot;&gt;Exposure to advanced cloud, orchestration, and Big Data technologies&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1121&quot; data-end=&quot;1171&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1123&quot; data-end=&quot;1171&quot;&gt;Work with global teams across multiple regions&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1172&quot; data-end=&quot;1248&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1174&quot; data-end=&quot;1248&quot;&gt;Career growth opportunities into cloud, DevOps, and platform engineering&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1249&quot; data-end=&quot;1303&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1251&quot; data-end=&quot;1303&quot;&gt;Travel opportunities (as per project requirements)&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1304&quot; data-end=&quot;1356&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1306&quot; data-end=&quot;1356&quot;&gt;Professional development &amp;amp; certification support&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('e533f17c-54cf-4289-8f61-491fa5d82058','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','SAP DM / SAP BTP Developer','sap-dm-sap-btp-developer-313-313','&lt;p data-start=&quot;68&quot; data-end=&quot;415&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced SAP DM / SAP BTP Developers for a leading Top MNC to work on enterprise-scale Smart Manufacturing and Digital Transformation projects. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in SAP Digital Manufacturing (SAP DM/DMC), SAP Business Technology Platform (SAP BTP), SAP UI5, and cloud-native application development.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;417&quot; data-end=&quot;820&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for designing, developing, deploying, and supporting SAP Digital Manufacturing solutions and SAP BTP applications based on business and manufacturing requirements. The role includes developing custom SAP DM plugins, CAP services, SAP UI5 applications, and cloud-native solutions while ensuring scalability, performance, and seamless integration with enterprise systems.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;822&quot; data-end=&quot;1168&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with SAP DM, SAP BTP, SAP UI5, JavaScript, Node.js, CAP Framework, SAP Business Application Studio (BAS), SQL, and manufacturing data configuration. Strong understanding of SAP cloud technologies, application architecture, API integrations, and enterprise manufacturing processes is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1170&quot; data-end=&quot;1587&quot;&gt;The role also involves participating in solution design workshops, collaborating with business users, technical teams, and global stakeholders, mentoring junior developers, and supporting implementation, deployment, and enhancement activities. Candidates should possess strong analytical, communication, troubleshooting, and problem-solving skills with a passion for delivering innovative SAP manufacturing solutions.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Entry',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Pune',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-08-24 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-06-26 03:43:00.000000','2026-06-26 03:43:00.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"JavaScript\", \"MYSQL\", \"Node.JS\", \"PL/SQL\", \"REST API\", \"SAP\", \"SAP BW\", \"SAP Hana\", \"Sap UI5\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1603&quot; data-end=&quot;1641&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;5xs02m&quot; data-start=&quot;1642&quot; data-end=&quot;1709&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale SAP Digital Manufacturing projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;s216jm&quot; data-start=&quot;1710&quot; data-end=&quot;1772&quot;&gt;Work on cutting-edge SAP BTP and cloud-native technologies&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1wfxilv&quot; data-start=&quot;1773&quot; data-end=&quot;1843&quot;&gt;Career growth in SAP Manufacturing &amp;amp; Digital Transformation domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;fm4t10&quot; data-start=&quot;1844&quot; data-end=&quot;1921&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global SAP consultants and business teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot; data-start=&quot;1922&quot; data-end=&quot;1977&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;1978&quot; data-end=&quot;2021&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Maharashtra'),('e5f0d063-6220-4e40-92a5-dcf8ac34a43a','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Vision Data Scientist','vision-data-scientist-193-193','1. Extensive Hands-on experience in Machine Learning model design, model training and optimization; especially CNN, RCNN, Faster RCNN, RL networks. &lt;br /&gt;2. Experience in defining solution architecture for training and model inference, choose models/algorithms, &lt;br /&gt;3. Exposure to Tensorflow, Caffe /TensorRT/ONNX &lt;br /&gt;4. Excellent coding skill in Python/Pytorch &lt;br /&gt;5. Exposure to OpenCV/Openvino&lt;br /&gt;6. Experience in multithreading will be added advantage&lt;br /&gt;7. Experience in mentoring team&lt;br /&gt;8. Exposure Gen AI &amp;amp; AI agent for vision (Azure open AI/ AWS Gen AI suite/ Nvidia NeMo) would be added advantage','Information Technology','Contract','Entry',NULL,NULL,'INR',1,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-04-18 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-02-17 19:43:09.000000','2026-02-17 19:43:09.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"AWS\", \"Azure\", \"Azure  CLI\", \"Core Python\", \"Machine Learning\", \"TerraForm\", \"Generative AI\", \"PyTorch\", \"OpenCV\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;Competitive salary package with performance-based incentives&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;65&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;67&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;Health insurance coverage and statutory benefits (PF &amp;amp; Gratuity)&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;134&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;136&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on large-scale enterprise energy management projects&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;211&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;213&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;Strong career growth and learning opportunities&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;263&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;265&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;Collaborative and professional work environment&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('e6c37280-df9b-4883-b818-736982d27468','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','CM MES Modeler / Functional Consultant','cm-mes-modeler-functional-consultant-334-334','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;80&quot; data-end=&quot;447&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced CM MES Modelers / Functional Consultants for a leading Top MNC to work on enterprise-scale Manufacturing Execution System (MES) and Smart Manufacturing transformation projects. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in Critical Manufacturing (CM) MES, MES implementation, master data modeling, and manufacturing business processes.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;449&quot; data-end=&quot;891&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for implementing, configuring, modeling, testing, and supporting Critical Manufacturing MES solutions for global manufacturing organizations. The role includes gathering business requirements, performing master data modeling and enrichment, configuring MES applications, preparing technical documentation, conducting system testing, and ensuring successful solution delivery throughout the project lifecycle.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;893&quot; data-end=&quot;1275&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with Critical Manufacturing (CM) MES, MES implementation, CM MES modeling, master data management, manufacturing process analysis, application configuration, testing, and documentation. Strong understanding of manufacturing operations, MES deployment methodologies, customer collaboration, and functional consulting is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1277&quot; data-end=&quot;1770&quot;&gt;The role also involves collaborating with global business users, SMEs, customer stakeholders, and cross-functional project teams to design and deliver scalable MES solutions. Candidates will conduct product demonstrations, support end users during implementation, troubleshoot functional issues, prepare process flow documentation, and contribute to continuous process improvement initiatives. Strong analytical, communication, stakeholder management, and problem-solving skills are essential.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-09-11 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-07-14 02:39:14.000000','2026-07-14 02:39:14.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Functional Consultant\", \"Mes\", \"System Design\", \"User Acceptance Testing (UAT)\", \"Critical Manufacturing\", \"CM MES Modeling\", \"Master Data Modeling\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1786&quot; data-end=&quot;1824&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1e3dqkd&quot; data-start=&quot;1825&quot; data-end=&quot;1911&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale MES and Digital Manufacturing transformation projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1q5szfu&quot; data-start=&quot;1912&quot; data-end=&quot;1979&quot;&gt;Work with advanced Critical Manufacturing (CM) MES technologies&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1pswt5&quot; data-start=&quot;1980&quot; data-end=&quot;2062&quot;&gt;Career growth in Manufacturing Execution Systems (MES) and Industry 4.0 domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;13qji02&quot; data-start=&quot;2063&quot; data-end=&quot;2140&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global manufacturing and technology teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot; data-start=&quot;2141&quot; data-end=&quot;2196&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;2197&quot; data-end=&quot;2240&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('e6f0a2b8-54eb-41b8-8c40-c3e15130dcbc','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','LabWare LIMS Developer','labware-lims-developer-299-299','&lt;p data-start=&quot;64&quot; data-end=&quot;407&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced LabWare LIMS Developers for a leading Top MNC to work on enterprise laboratory informatics and digital transformation projects within the Pharma and Life Sciences domain. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in LabWare LIMS configuration, customization, implementation, deployment, and support activities.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;409&quot; data-end=&quot;744&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for developing, configuring, customizing, and maintaining LabWare LIMS solutions to support laboratory operations and business requirements. The role includes participating in implementation, upgrade, deployment, and enhancement projects while ensuring system reliability, compliance, and performance.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;746&quot; data-end=&quot;1098&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with LabWare LIMS package development, application troubleshooting, system administration, instrument interfaces, CDS integrations, and enterprise application integrations. Strong knowledge of Java, J2EE, JBoss Server, Oracle/MS SQL databases, reporting tools, and laboratory workflows is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1100&quot; data-end=&quot;1448&quot;&gt;The role also involves supporting L1, L2, and L3 activities, mentoring team members, collaborating with global clients and stakeholders, and ensuring compliance with Computer System Validation (CSV), GxP regulations, and industry best practices. Candidates should possess strong analytical, communication, documentation, and problem-solving skills.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-08-22 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-06-24 02:53:52.000000','2026-06-24 02:53:52.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"CSV\", \"Gxp Compliance\", \"J2EE\", \"Java\", \"Jboss\", \"MS SQL Server\", \"Oracle\", \"LabWare LIMS\", \"L2/L3 Support\", \"STARLIMS Customization\", \"Agilent OpenLab\", \"Chromatography Data Systems (CDS)\", \"LIMS Integration\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1464&quot; data-end=&quot;1502&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;rfwbzn&quot; data-start=&quot;1503&quot; data-end=&quot;1557&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale LabWare LIMS projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1yplwh&quot; data-start=&quot;1558&quot; data-end=&quot;1613&quot;&gt;Work on global Pharma and Life Sciences initiatives&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1flwegv&quot; data-start=&quot;1614&quot; data-end=&quot;1671&quot;&gt;Career growth in LIMS &amp;amp; Laboratory Informatics domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1mfsq9e&quot; data-start=&quot;1672&quot; data-end=&quot;1746&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with international clients and stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;2lee9a&quot; data-start=&quot;1747&quot; data-end=&quot;1802&quot;&gt;Professional and compliance-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;1803&quot; data-end=&quot;1846&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('e7579ccb-18a6-4682-8538-c33299159641','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Trackwise Developer','trackwise-developer-255-255','&lt;p data-start=&quot;201&quot; data-end=&quot;624&quot;&gt;We are seeking an experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;231&quot; data-end=&quot;261&quot;&gt;Trackwise / EQMS Developer&lt;/strong&gt; to join our offshore team supporting a leading dermatology-focused organization. The role involves designing, developing, implementing, testing, and maintaining &lt;strong data-start=&quot;423&quot; data-end=&quot;454&quot;&gt;Trackwise/EQMS applications&lt;/strong&gt; while providing technical support and troubleshooting. This is an excellent opportunity to grow both &lt;strong data-start=&quot;556&quot; data-end=&quot;623&quot;&gt;technically and in the domain of regulatory and quality systems&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;hr data-start=&quot;626&quot; data-end=&quot;629&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;631&quot; data-end=&quot;660&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;634&quot; data-end=&quot;658&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;661&quot; data-end=&quot;1232&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;661&quot; data-end=&quot;806&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;663&quot; data-end=&quot;806&quot;&gt;Work closely with the customer on &lt;strong data-start=&quot;697&quot; data-end=&quot;771&quot;&gt;design, development, implementation, testing, rollout, and maintenance&lt;/strong&gt; of Trackwise / EQMS applications&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;807&quot; data-end=&quot;866&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;809&quot; data-end=&quot;866&quot;&gt;Perform &lt;strong data-start=&quot;817&quot; data-end=&quot;864&quot;&gt;Trackwise configuration and troubleshooting&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;867&quot; data-end=&quot;951&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;869&quot; data-end=&quot;951&quot;&gt;Support Trackwise Web Services, Import Utilities, and Coordinator configurations&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;952&quot; data-end=&quot;1022&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;954&quot; data-end=&quot;1022&quot;&gt;Develop and optimize &lt;strong data-start=&quot;975&quot; data-end=&quot;993&quot;&gt;MS SQL queries&lt;/strong&gt; for Trackwise applications&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1023&quot; data-end=&quot;1092&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1025&quot; data-end=&quot;1092&quot;&gt;Provide timely &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1040&quot; data-end=&quot;1074&quot;&gt;support for application issues&lt;/strong&gt; and escalations&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1093&quot; data-end=&quot;1176&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1095&quot; data-end=&quot;1176&quot;&gt;Collaborate with offshore and onshore teams to ensure high-quality deliverables&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1177&quot; data-end=&quot;1232&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1179&quot; data-end=&quot;1232&quot;&gt;Maintain compliance with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1204&quot; data-end=&quot;1232&quot;&gt;IT and quality standards&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'INR',1,'India','Hyderabad',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-06-16 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-04-18 04:01:02.000000','2026-04-18 04:01:02.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Apache Kafka\", \"ITIL\", \"MS SQL Server\", \"EQMS Developer\", \"Trackwise Developer\", \"Trackwise configuration\"]','[\"&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1925&quot; data-end=&quot;2284&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1925&quot; data-end=&quot;2009&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1927&quot; data-end=&quot;2009&quot;&gt;Work with a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1939&quot; data-end=&quot;1973&quot;&gt;leading company in dermatology&lt;/strong&gt; focused on advancing patient care&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2010&quot; data-end=&quot;2103&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2012&quot; data-end=&quot;2103&quot;&gt;Opportunity to grow &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2032&quot; data-end=&quot;2047&quot;&gt;technically&lt;/strong&gt; and gain deep &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2062&quot; data-end=&quot;2101&quot;&gt;domain expertise in quality systems&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2104&quot; data-end=&quot;2163&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2106&quot; data-end=&quot;2163&quot;&gt;Exposure to &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2118&quot; data-end=&quot;2152&quot;&gt;Trackwise/EQMS implementations&lt;/strong&gt; at scale&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2164&quot; data-end=&quot;2221&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2166&quot; data-end=&quot;2221&quot;&gt;Collaborate with a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2185&quot; data-end=&quot;2219&quot;&gt;global, offshore delivery team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2222&quot; data-end=&quot;2284&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2224&quot; data-end=&quot;2284&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2247&quot; data-end=&quot;2282&quot;&gt;regulatory-compliant IT systems&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Telangana'),('e7a5c460-a9a2-430a-8e54-c249ffda3059','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Tuplip Developer','tuplip-developer-107-107','&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an experienced Tulip Developer with 4+ years of expertise in Tulip development and support. The role involves designing and developing Tulip applications, understanding frontline operations, and ensuring seamless process streamlining. You will work closely with cross-functional teams, assist in project status meetings, and provide Tulip software support for product-related issues.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Key responsibilities include coordinating with product teams on roadmaps and innovations, analyzing IoT data for insights, developing data models and dashboards to support IoT initiatives, and managing new feature requests including experimentation, testing, rollouts, and system upgrades. This role requires strong collaboration, problem-solving, and communication skills to drive successful Tulip implementation and support.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Pune',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2025-11-22 18:30:00',0,0,'2025-09-24 08:35:44.000000','2026-10-21 07:10:20.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Java\", \"Spring Boot\", \"SQL\", \"Microservices\"]','[\"Opportunity to work on IoT-driven digital transformation projects&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Exposure to Tulip app design &amp;amp; frontline operations platform&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Career growth in Industry 4.0 and IoT development&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Collaborative work environment with product &amp;amp; service teams\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Maharashtra'),('e7b01ea8-fcd3-4f97-b776-5086bb65a736','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','PROMIS MES Engineer','promis-mes-engineer-354-354','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;61&quot; data-end=&quot;411&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;87&quot; data-end=&quot;111&quot;&gt;PROMIS MES Engineers&lt;/strong&gt; for a leading Top MNC to support enterprise-scale Semiconductor Manufacturing Execution System (MES) and smart manufacturing initiatives. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in PROMIS MES, Oracle database technologies, Unix/Linux environments, and semiconductor manufacturing processes.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;413&quot; data-end=&quot;780&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for configuring, maintaining, troubleshooting, and supporting PROMIS MES applications across semiconductor manufacturing environments. The role includes production support, MES configuration, incident resolution, database development, system monitoring, and ensuring smooth MES operations across high-volume manufacturing facilities.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;782&quot; data-end=&quot;1083&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;833&quot; data-end=&quot;943&quot;&gt;PROMIS MES, Oracle SQL, PL/SQL, DCL, Unix Shell Scripting, OpenVMS, Linux, and Semiconductor Manufacturing&lt;/strong&gt;. Experience supporting wafer fabrication, advanced packaging, factory automation, and semiconductor production systems is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1085&quot; data-end=&quot;1465&quot;&gt;The role also involves collaborating with manufacturing operations, equipment engineering, IT, automation, and global MES teams to resolve production issues, implement system enhancements, support factory applications, and maintain system reliability. Candidates should possess strong analytical, troubleshooting, communication, stakeholder management, and problem-solving skills.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Pune',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-09 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-08-11 03:29:42.000000','2026-08-11 03:29:42.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Linux\", \"Mes Configuration\", \"Oracle\", \"PL/SQL\", \"SQL\", \"UNIX Shells\", \"Semiconductor Manufacturing Processes\", \"PROMIS MES\", \"Semiconductor Manufacturing Execution Systems\", \"MES Application Support\", \"OpenVMS\", \"Wafer Fabrication\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1481&quot; data-end=&quot;1519&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1h47ls4&quot; data-start=&quot;1520&quot; data-end=&quot;1603&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale Semiconductor MES and Smart Manufacturing projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;tgqbuf&quot; data-start=&quot;1604&quot; data-end=&quot;1697&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience with PROMIS MES and advanced semiconductor manufacturing technologies&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;17wnnju&quot; data-start=&quot;1698&quot; data-end=&quot;1757&quot;&gt;Career growth in Semiconductor Manufacturing IT and MES&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;13qji02&quot; data-start=&quot;1758&quot; data-end=&quot;1835&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global manufacturing and technology teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;kd7xt1&quot; data-start=&quot;1836&quot; data-end=&quot;1909&quot;&gt;Exposure to high-volume wafer fab and advanced packaging environments&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot; data-start=&quot;1910&quot; data-end=&quot;1965&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Maharashtra'),('e8676e04-3e9b-4c5f-a920-996f449362d6','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Senior AWS Architect','senior-aws-architect-45-45','&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;473&quot; data-end=&quot;491&quot;&gt;Job Overview&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;492&quot; data-end=&quot;915&quot;&gt;We are looking for an experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;526&quot; data-end=&quot;543&quot;&gt;AWS Architect&lt;/strong&gt; to lead the architectural design and implementation of a large-scale digital transformation project. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in AWS solutions, microservices architecture, and full-stack .NET development. This role is pivotal in ensuring scalable, secure, and cost-efficient cloud-native application delivery using Domain Driven Design principles.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;917&quot; data-end=&quot;943&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;944&quot; data-end=&quot;1839&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;944&quot; data-end=&quot;1047&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;946&quot; data-end=&quot;1047&quot;&gt;End-to-end responsibility for architecture, design, and deployment of the Next Gen MITS application&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1048&quot; data-end=&quot;1178&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1050&quot; data-end=&quot;1178&quot;&gt;Lead cloud-native solution architecture using AWS services including Lambda, Fargate, and other compute/integration components&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1179&quot; data-end=&quot;1341&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1181&quot; data-end=&quot;1341&quot;&gt;Design and implement Domain-Driven Micro, Macro, and Nano services for critical application modules such as Production, Invoicing, Transportation, and Finance&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1342&quot; data-end=&quot;1456&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1344&quot; data-end=&quot;1456&quot;&gt;Drive architectural improvements, cost optimization, cloud security, observability, and automation initiatives&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1457&quot; data-end=&quot;1567&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1459&quot; data-end=&quot;1567&quot;&gt;Support technical teams in agile delivery, ensuring adherence to design patterns and reusable architecture&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1568&quot; data-end=&quot;1726&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1570&quot; data-end=&quot;1726&quot;&gt;Collaborate across squads for integration with systems such as Oracle, file stores, camera systems, and L2 systems from a data/API engineering perspective&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1727&quot; data-end=&quot;1839&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1729&quot; data-end=&quot;1839&quot;&gt;Maintain architecture lifecycle documentation, checklists, and reviews, ideally aligned with TOGAF practices&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;1841&quot; data-end=&quot;1863&quot;&gt;Must-Have Skills&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1864&quot; data-end=&quot;2212&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1864&quot; data-end=&quot;1910&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1866&quot; data-end=&quot;1910&quot;&gt;AWS Solution Architecture (E3 proficiency)&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1911&quot; data-end=&quot;1958&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1913&quot; data-end=&quot;1958&quot;&gt;Microservices architecture (E2 proficiency)&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1959&quot; data-end=&quot;2011&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1961&quot; data-end=&quot;2011&quot;&gt;.NET, C# full-stack development (E2 proficiency)&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2012&quot; data-end=&quot;2050&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2014&quot; data-end=&quot;2050&quot;&gt;Agile methodology (E1 proficiency)&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2051&quot; data-end=&quot;2131&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2053&quot; data-end=&quot;2131&quot;&gt;Hands-on with AWS services like Lambda, Fargate, CloudWatch, S3, API Gateway&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2132&quot; data-end=&quot;2212&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2134&quot; data-end=&quot;2212&quot;&gt;Strong understanding of Domain Driven Design and cloud-native best practices&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;2214&quot; data-end=&quot;2239&quot;&gt;Good-to-Have Skills&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2240&quot; data-end=&quot;2425&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2240&quot; data-end=&quot;2272&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2242&quot; data-end=&quot;2272&quot;&gt;Angular 19 (basic knowledge)&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2273&quot; data-end=&quot;2337&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2275&quot; data-end=&quot;2337&quot;&gt;TOGAF certification and/or AWS Certified Solutions Architect&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2338&quot; data-end=&quot;2425&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2340&quot; data-end=&quot;2425&quot;&gt;Experience in observability, monitoring, testing automation, and productivity tools&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',500000.00,2500000.00,'₹',0,'India','Pune',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-19 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-06-06 09:20:06.000000','2025-11-21 06:27:48.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Agile Methodology\", \"Angular\", \"AWS\", \"AWS Lambda\", \"CloudWatch\", \"RESTFUL APIS\", \"AWS Architect\"]','[\"&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;117&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;Job Benefits&lt;/h3&gt;\\r\\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;135&quot; data-end=&quot;996&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;135&quot; data-end=&quot;192&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;137&quot; data-end=&quot;192&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;137&quot; data-end=&quot;159&quot;&gt;Competitive Salary&lt;/strong&gt; based on skills and experience&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;193&quot; data-end=&quot;296&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p d