ust data integration solutions using Informatica (IICS), Python, MDM, and SQL.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;645&quot; data-end=&quot;760&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;647&quot; data-end=&quot;760&quot;&gt;Design end-to-end data pipelines to support complex business requirements in a cloud-based technical environment.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;761&quot; data-end=&quot;916&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;763&quot; data-end=&quot;916&quot;&gt;Participate in all phases of cloud development: requirements gathering, design, development, deployment, maintenance, performance tuning, and monitoring.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;917&quot; data-end=&quot;1024&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;919&quot; data-end=&quot;1024&quot;&gt;Contribute to strategies around data transformation, change management, and business process improvement.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1025&quot; data-end=&quot;1122&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1027&quot; data-end=&quot;1122&quot;&gt;Work with geospatial databases and integrate third-party and internal APIs for data enrichment.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1123&quot; data-end=&quot;1236&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1125&quot; data-end=&quot;1236&quot;&gt;Create and implement automated data quality checks and alerting mechanisms to ensure integrity and consistency.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1237&quot; data-end=&quot;1371&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1239&quot; data-end=&quot;1371&quot;&gt;Collaborate with product owners, business analysts, and other stakeholders to ensure deliverables meet business objectives and SLAs.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1372&quot; data-end=&quot;1483&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1374&quot; data-end=&quot;1483&quot;&gt;Follow Agile methodologies and implement CI/CD and DevOps practices to modernize the existing infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1484&quot; data-end=&quot;1589&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1486&quot; data-end=&quot;1589&quot;&gt;Develop unit and integration test cases, and support seamless migration from development to production.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1590&quot; data-end=&quot;1673&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1592&quot; data-end=&quot;1673&quot;&gt;Provide on-call production support for applications across multiple environments.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;hr data-start=&quot;1675&quot; data-end=&quot;1678&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;1680&quot; data-end=&quot;1712&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1684&quot; data-end=&quot;1712&quot;&gt;Qualifications &amp;amp; Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1714&quot; data-end=&quot;2406&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1714&quot; data-end=&quot;1828&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1716&quot; data-end=&quot;1828&quot;&gt;Minimum 10 years of hands-on experience as a Data Engineer, with a strong focus on Informatica PowerCenter/IICS.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1829&quot; data-end=&quot;1902&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1831&quot; data-end=&quot;1902&quot;&gt;Deep understanding of data integration tools, techniques, and patterns.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1903&quot; data-end=&quot;2006&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1905&quot; data-end=&quot;2006&quot;&gt;Strong SQL expertise with hands-on experience in RDBMS platforms like Oracle, SQL Server, or DB2/UDB.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2007&quot; data-end=&quot;2106&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2009&quot; data-end=&quot;2106&quot;&gt;Proficiency in Python, UNIX Shell Scripting, or similar technologies (ArcPy scripting is a plus).&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2107&quot; data-end=&quot;2178&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2109&quot; data-end=&quot;2178&quot;&gt;Excellent analytical, problem-solving, and troubleshooting abilities.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2179&quot; data-end=&quot;2301&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2181&quot; data-end=&quot;2301&quot;&gt;Experience working in Agile teams, with a solid understanding of story refinement, task breakdown, and sprint execution.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2302&quot; data-end=&quot;2406&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2304&quot; data-end=&quot;2406&quot;&gt;Strong communication and collaboration skills, with the ability to work across cross-functional teams.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',500000.00,2500000.00,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-19 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-07-01 11:08:20.000000','2025-11-21 04:57:06.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Agile Methodology\", \"Oracle\", \"Python\", \"Shell Scripts\", \"SQL\", \"UNIX Shells\", \"IBM MDM\", \"Informatica PowerCenter\"]','[\"&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;81&quot; data-end=&quot;102&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;85&quot; data-end=&quot;102&quot;&gt;Job Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\\r\\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;104&quot; data-end=&quot;364&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;104&quot; data-end=&quot;156&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;106&quot; data-end=&quot;156&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and performance-based bonuses&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;157&quot; data-end=&quot;186&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;159&quot; data-end=&quot;186&quot;&gt;Health insurance coverage&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;187&quot; data-end=&quot;235&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;189&quot; data-end=&quot;235&quot;&gt;Opportunities for learning and career growth&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;236&quot; data-end=&quot;283&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;238&quot; data-end=&quot;283&quot;&gt;Flexible work hours and remote work options&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;284&quot; data-end=&quot;333&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;286&quot; data-end=&quot;333&quot;&gt;Supportive and collaborative work environment&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;334&quot; data-end=&quot;364&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;336&quot; data-end=&quot;364&quot;&gt;Paid time off and holidays&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('e9ef5277-67b0-4406-bc33-a265e38ade4e','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','LabVantage Solution Architect','labvantage-solution-architect-312-312','&lt;p data-start=&quot;71&quot; data-end=&quot;465&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced LabVantage Solution Architects for a leading Top MNC to lead enterprise-scale Laboratory Information Management System (LIMS) implementation and digital laboratory transformation projects. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in LabVantage solution architecture, system design, configuration, enterprise integrations, and regulated laboratory environments.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;467&quot; data-end=&quot;886&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for designing end-to-end LabVantage LIMS solutions aligned with business, quality, and regulatory requirements. The role includes leading solution architecture, conducting requirements workshops, defining functional and technical designs, configuring workflows, security, master data, reports, dashboards, and ensuring successful implementation across multiple laboratory environments.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;888&quot; data-end=&quot;1275&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with LabVantage configuration, administration, customization, Java, JavaScript, HTML, JSP, Groovy, SQL, database design, API integrations, SDMS connectivity, and laboratory instrument integration. Strong understanding of laboratory operations, quality systems, enterprise architecture, and compliance-driven environments is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1277&quot; data-end=&quot;1724&quot;&gt;The role also involves providing technical leadership to development teams, reviewing solution designs, governing implementation activities, supporting enterprise integrations, and collaborating with business stakeholders, laboratory users, and global project teams. Candidates should possess strong leadership, analytical, communication, documentation, and problem-solving skills with the ability to deliver enterprise-grade laboratory solutions.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-08-24 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-06-26 03:37:17.000000','2026-06-26 03:37:17.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Database Fine Tuning\", \"Groovy\", \"HTML\", \"Java\", \"JavaScript\", \"JSP\", \"RESTFUL APIS\", \"SQL\", \"Workflow\", \"LabVantage\", \"LabVantage LIMS\", \"Solution Design\", \"Master Data Management (MDM)\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1740&quot; data-end=&quot;1778&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;bp4tda&quot; data-start=&quot;1779&quot; data-end=&quot;1851&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale LabVantage LIMS implementation projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;w9qg6s&quot; data-start=&quot;1852&quot; data-end=&quot;1925&quot;&gt;Work with global pharmaceutical, manufacturing, and R&amp;amp;D organizations&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;q3zpu0&quot; data-start=&quot;1926&quot; data-end=&quot;2000&quot;&gt;Career growth in Laboratory Informatics &amp;amp; Solution Architecture domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;i1fuo0&quot; data-start=&quot;2001&quot; data-end=&quot;2079&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with international business and technical teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;144xvrk&quot; data-start=&quot;2080&quot; data-end=&quot;2159&quot;&gt;Leadership role in enterprise digital laboratory transformation initiatives&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;2160&quot; data-end=&quot;2203&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('e9f2f698-2bae-4b4f-9cd0-9b3356d1c104','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Serialization Functional Analyst','serialization-functional-analyst-24-24','We&#039;re Hiring | Immediate Requirement!&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&amp;nbsp;Position: Serialization Functional Analyst&lt;br /&gt;&amp;nbsp;Experience: 7&amp;ndash;10 Years&lt;br /&gt;&amp;nbsp;Preferred Designation: I.T. Analyst&lt;br /&gt;&amp;nbsp;Role: SAP - ATTP Consultant&lt;br /&gt;&amp;nbsp;Location: Hyderabad / PAN India&lt;br /&gt;&amp;nbsp;Start Date: Immediate&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;We are looking for an experienced SAP ATTP Functional Consultant with strong knowledge in serialization processes and global regulatory reporting.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&amp;nbsp;Desired Skills &amp;amp; Competencies:&lt;br /&gt;&amp;nbsp;Expertise in SAP ATTP configuration and functional processes&lt;br /&gt;&amp;nbsp;Understanding of serialization business flow and global compliance/reporting&lt;br /&gt;&amp;nbsp;Hands-on experience with OPTEL-OSM, Sea Vision (Serialization L2 &amp;amp; L3)&lt;br /&gt;&amp;nbsp;Basic knowledge of SAP ICH &amp;amp; TraceLink&lt;br /&gt;If you or someone in your network fits the bill and is looking for a new opportunity, let&#039;s connect!&lt;br /&gt;&amp;nbsp;DM me or send your profile to &lt;a class=&quot;npojYTzPzTWHOliEAnahXcPleomuINOXSvrw &quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot; href=&quot;mailto:siddhi@camzyinfotech.com&quot; target=&quot;_self&quot; data-test-app-aware-link=&quot;&quot;&gt;siddhi@camzyinfotech.com&lt;/a&gt;','Information Techno