data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;Competitive salary package with performance-based incentives&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;65&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;67&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;Health insurance coverage and statutory benefits (PF &amp;amp; Gratuity)&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;134&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;136&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on large-scale enterprise energy management projects&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;211&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;213&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;Strong career growth and learning opportunities&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;263&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;265&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;Collaborative and professional work environment&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('ea1bfc49-7275-4472-801e-248199fa8c66','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Developer – AVEVA MES','developer-aveva-mes-364-364','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;59&quot; data-end=&quot;258&quot;&gt;We are hiring an experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;88&quot; data-end=&quot;111&quot;&gt;AVEVA MES Developer&lt;/strong&gt; for a leading Top MNC to work on global &lt;strong data-start=&quot;152&quot; data-end=&quot;233&quot;&gt;Manufacturing Execution System (MES), Digital Manufacturing, and Industry 4.0&lt;/strong&gt; transformation projects.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;260&quot; data-end=&quot;448&quot;&gt;The ideal candidate should have strong hands-on experience with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;324&quot; data-end=&quot;447&quot;&gt;AVEVA MES, AVEVA System Platform, AVEVA Work Tasks, AVEVA MDM, Wonderware/AVEVA Historian, SQL, and .NET/C# development&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;450&quot; data-end=&quot;827&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for developing, configuring, implementing, and supporting end-to-end AVEVA MES solutions across manufacturing environments. The role involves understanding client requirements, translating them into scalable MES solutions, setting up MES environments, integrating industrial systems, and collaborating with global technical and business teams.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;829&quot; data-end=&quot;987&quot;&gt;Professionals with strong knowledge of &lt;strong data-start=&quot;868&quot; data-end=&quot;961&quot;&gt;ISA-95, ISA-88, MESA, OPC, PLC, SCADA, industrial networking, and manufacturing processes&lt;/strong&gt; will be highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-23 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-08-25 02:14:26.000000','2026-08-25 02:14:26.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"AvevaWonderware\", \"Mes\", \"MS SQL Developer\", \"SCADA\", \"AVEVA System\", \"AVEVA MES\", \"OPC UA\", \"PLC Integration\", \"Skelta\", \"ISA-95\", \"AVEVA MDM\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;i3mxm7&quot; data-start=&quot;1002&quot; data-end=&quot;1046&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a leading Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;d6zm4b&quot; data-start=&quot;1047&quot; data-end=&quot;1124&quot;&gt;Exposure to global &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1068&quot; data-end=&quot;1124&quot;&gt;AVEVA MES implementation and transformation projects&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1q9wx46&quot; data-start=&quot;1125&quot; data-end=&quot;1206&quot;&gt;Work on enterprise-scale &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1152&quot; data-end=&quot;1194&quot;&gt;Digital Manufacturing and Industry 4.0&lt;/strong&gt; initiatives&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i8uuaa&quot; data-start=&quot;1207&quot; data-end=&quot;1281&quot;&gt;Hands-on exposure to AVEVA MES Performance, Operations &amp;amp; Quality modules&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;osodh3&quot; data-start=&quot;1282&quot; data-end=&quot;1366&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1309&quot; data-end=&quot;1366&quot;&gt;AVEVA System Platform, MDM, Work Tasks, and Historian&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;t8qvts&quot; data-start=&quot;1367&quot; data-end=&quot;1425&quot;&gt;Exposure to industrial automation and MES-OT integration&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ceisxp&quot; data-start=&quot;1426&quot; data-end=&quot;1488&quot;&gt;Collaboration with global clients and cross-functional teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;grfv1v&quot; data-start=&quot;1489&quot; data-end=&quot;1555&quot;&gt;Strong technical growth in Manufacturing IT and MES technologies&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ix4hom&quot; data-start=&quot;1556&quot; data-end=&quot;1635&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on end-to-end MES development and implementation projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;167blw9&quot; data-start=&quot;1636&quot; data-end=&quot;1722&quot;&gt;Career growth in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1655&quot; data-end=&quot;1722&quot;&gt;MES, Smart Manufacturing, and Industrial Digital Transformation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('ea3659e9-27b0-4353-8b36-747a0005a695','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','IAM & PKI Specialist (Network & OT Security)','iam-pki-specialist-network-ot-security-186-186','&lt;p data-start=&quot;224&quot; data-end=&quot;595&quot;&gt;We are looking for an experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;258&quot; data-end=&quot;282&quot;&gt;IAM &amp;amp; PKI Specialist&lt;/strong&gt; with strong expertise in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;308&quot; data-end=&quot;335&quot;&gt;network and OT security&lt;/strong&gt; to design, review, and validate secure network architectures. The role focuses on &lt;strong data-start=&quot;418&quot; data-end=&quot;523&quot;&gt;firewalls, ACLs, network segmentation, secure WAN/VPN connectivity, and IEC-aligned security controls&lt;/strong&gt;, ensuring compliance and high availability in critical OT environments.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;605&quot; data-end=&quot;629&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;630&quot; data-end=&quot;1383&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;630&quot; data-end=&quot;717&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;632&quot; data-end=&quot;717&quot;&gt;Design and review &lt;strong data-start=&quot;650&quot; data-end=&quot;680&quot;&gt;firewall and ACL baselines&lt;/strong&gt; aligned with security architecture&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;718&quot; data-end=&quot;786&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;720&quot; data-end=&quot;786&quot;&gt;Implement and validate &lt;strong data-start=&quot;743&quot; data-end=&quot;767&quot;&gt;network segmentation&lt;/strong&gt; (VLAN, VPN, DMZ)&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;787&quot; data-end=&quot;864&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;789&quot; data-end=&quot;864&quot;&gt;Support &lt;strong data-start=&quot;797&quot; data-end=&quot;833&quot;&gt;secure WAN/MPLS/VPN connectivity&lt;/strong&gt; and remote access governance&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;865&quot; data-end=&quot;932&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;867&quot; data-end=&quot;932&quot;&gt;Validate &lt;strong data-start=&quot;876&quot; data-end=&quot;910&quot;&gt;inter-zone communication flows&lt;/strong&gt; and DMZ enforcement&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;933&quot; data-end=&quot;995&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;935&quot; data-end=&quot;995&quot;&gt;Enable &lt;strong data-start=&quot;942&quot; data-end=&quot;973&quot;&gt;logging and SIEM onboarding&lt;/strong&gt; for network devices&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;996&quot; data-end=&quot;1077&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;998&quot; data-end=&quot;1077&quot;&gt;Troubleshoot network issues across &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1033&quot; data-end=&quot;1075&quot;&gt;L2/L3 switches, routers, and firewalls&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1078&quot; data-end=&quot;1150&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1080&quot; data-end=&quot;1150&quot;&gt;Maintain firewall rule sets, baselines, and &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1124&quot; data-end=&quot;1148&quot;&gt;change documentation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1151&quot; data-end=&quot;1215&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1153&quot; data-end=&quot;1215&quot;&gt;Collaborate with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1170&quot; data-end=&quot;1213&quot;&gt;OT architects, OEMs, and customer teams&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1216&quot; data-end=&quot;1291&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1218&quot; data-end=&quot;1291&quot;&gt;Align network configurations with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1252&quot; data-end=&quot;1279&quot;&gt;IEC 62443 and IEC 62351&lt;/strong&gt; standards&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1292&quot; data-end=&quot;1383&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1294&quot; data-end=&quot;1383&quot;&gt;Operate within &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1309&quot; data-end=&quot;1346&quot;&gt;high-availability OT environments&lt;/strong&gt; following strict change management&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Hyderabad',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-04-10 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-02-09 18:12:21.000000','2026-02-09 18:12:21.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"CCNA\", \"CCNP\", \"Cisco Routers\", \"Fortinet\", \"Network ACL Management\", \"SCADA\", \"VPN\", \"VLAN\", \"TLS\", \"OEM\", \"IEC 62443\", \"IEC 62351\", \"DMZ\", \"OT network\", \"IPsec\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2646&quot; data-end=&quot;2722&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2648&quot; data-end=&quot;2722&quot;&gt;High-impact role in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2668&quot; data-end=&quot;2720&quot;&gt;critical OT and industrial security environments&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2723&quot; data-end=&quot;2797&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2725&quot; data-end=&quot;2797&quot;&gt;Hands-on ownership of &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2747&quot; data-end=&quot;2795&quot;&gt;network security architecture and governance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2798&quot; data-end=&quot;2877&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2800&quot; data-end=&quot;2877&quot;&gt;Exposure to &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2812&quot; data-end=&quot;2875&quot;&gt;international OT security standards (IEC 62443 / IEC 62351)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2878&quot; data-end=&quot;2947&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2880&quot; data-end=&quot;2947&quot;&gt;Collaboration with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2899&quot; data-end=&quot;2945&quot;&gt;OEMs, architects, and enterprise customers&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2948&quot; data-end=&quot;3028&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2950&quot; data-end=&quot;3028&quot;&gt;Strong career growth in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2974&quot; data-end=&quot;3026&quot;&gt;OT cybersecurity and network security leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Telangana'),('eb519658-c013-4170-a885-a3b2531f7a38','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Power Apps / Power Automate Developer','power-apps-power-automate-developer-303-303','&lt;p data-start=&quot;79&quot; data-end=&quot;405&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced Power Apps / Power Automate Developers for a leading Top MNC to work on enterprise automation, digital transformation, and Microsoft Power Platform initiatives. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in Power Apps, Power Automate, Copilot technologies, and Microsoft ecosystem integrations.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;407&quot; data-end=&quot;758&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for designing, developing, and deploying business applications and automated workflows using Microsoft Power Platform technologies. The role includes building Canvas and Model-Driven Apps, creating cloud and desktop automation flows, and implementing scalable low-code/no-code solutions to improve business processes.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;760&quot; data-end=&quot;1052&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with Dataverse, SharePoint, Microsoft 365 integrations, Power Automate, Power Apps, and third-party API integrations. Strong knowledge of Copilot Studio, Power Virtual Agents, AI Builder, and Azure OpenAI integration concepts is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1054&quot; data-end=&quot;1446&quot;&gt;The role also involves developing AI-powered chatbots, optimizing automation solutions, implementing governance standards, monitoring platform performance, and collaborating with business and technical teams to deliver innovative enterprise solutions. Candidates should possess strong analytical, communication, and problem-solving skills with a passion for automation and digital innovation.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-08-22 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-06-24 03:22:16.000000','2026-06-24 03:22:17.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Azure\", \"Canvas Apps\", \"Microsoft 365 Integration\", \"Dataverse\", \"Microsoft Power Apps\", \"Microsoft Power Automate\", \"Copilot Studio\", \"Microsoft Power Platform\", \"SharePoint Integration\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1462&quot; data-end=&quot;1500&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;snpizq&quot; data-start=&quot;1501&quot; data-end=&quot;1557&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale Power Platform projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;5c4879&quot; data-start=&quot;1558&quot; data-end=&quot;1632&quot;&gt;Work on advanced Microsoft Copilot and AI-powered automation solutions&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;wmya4&quot; data-start=&quot;1633&quot; data-end=&quot;1702&quot;&gt;Career growth in Low-Code/No-Code Development &amp;amp; Automation domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;vq0hl0&quot; data-start=&quot;1703&quot; data-end=&quot;1775&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global business and technology teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot; data-start=&quot;1776&quot; data-end=&quot;1831&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;1832&quot; data-end=&quot;1875&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('eba3583f-a64c-4ccc-933a-9f5e203b8580','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Gen AI Engineer','gen-ai-engineer-282-282','&lt;p data-start=&quot;57&quot; data-end=&quot;390&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced Gen AI Engineers for a leading Top MNC to work on advanced Generative AI, Agentic AI, Azure Cloud, and IoT-based enterprise solutions. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in designing scalable AI systems, cloud-native application development, and AI model optimization using Azure technologies.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;392&quot; data-end=&quot;706&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for developing, implementing, and optimizing Generative AI and Agentic AI solutions for enterprise applications. The role includes building AI-powered cloud-native systems, integrating IoT architectures, and working with Azure services to deliver scalable and secure AI platforms.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;708&quot; data-end=&quot;999&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with Azure ML, Azure IoT Hub, Azure PaaS services, Docker, Kubernetes, Azure DevOps, and microservices architecture. Strong knowledge of AI model optimization, event-driven systems, stream analytics, and cloud infrastructure is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1001&quot; data-end=&quot;1321&quot;&gt;The role also involves troubleshooting AI applications, improving model performance, researching emerging AI technologies, and collaborating with cross-functional technical teams to deliver enterprise-grade AI solutions. Candidates should possess strong analytical, problem-solving, communication, and innovation skills.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Mumbai',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-07-20 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-05-22 02:45:42.000000','2026-05-22 02:45:42.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"ASP.NET MVC\", \"Azure DevOps\", \"C#\", \"Docker\", \"Event Hubs\", \"Java\", \"Kubernetes\", \"Generative AI\", \"Azure IoT\", \"Azure ML\", \"IoT Data Pipelines\", \"Agentic AI\", \"Azure PaaS Services\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1337&quot; data-end=&quot;1375&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;fuqgpg&quot; data-start=&quot;1376&quot; data-end=&quot;1431&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-level Generative AI projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;3a6wcu&quot; data-start=&quot;1432&quot; data-end=&quot;1492&quot;&gt;Work on advanced Agentic AI and Azure Cloud technologies&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ln62jh&quot; data-start=&quot;1493&quot; data-end=&quot;1536&quot;&gt;Career growth in AI, Cloud &amp;amp; IoT domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1q9unrw&quot; data-start=&quot;1537&quot; data-end=&quot;1595&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global technical teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot; data-start=&quot;1596&quot; data-end=&quot;1651&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;1652&quot; data-end=&quot;1695&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Maharashtra'),('eba657c4-c329-4ee7-a00a-5bf21ab8287c','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Wonderware MES Support Executive – Aveva Wonderware Suite','wonderware-mes-support-executive-aveva-wonderware-suite-33-33','&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot; data-start=&quot;467&quot; data-end=&quot;493&quot;&gt;Job Description:&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot; data-start=&quot;494&quot; data-end=&quot;795&quot;&gt;We are seeking a skilled Wonderware MES Support Executive with hands-on experience in supporting Aveva Wonderware MES solutions. The ideal candidate will have strong technical troubleshooting skills, MES configuration knowledge, and the ability to provide L3 support across multiple sites.&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;832&quot; data-end=&quot;1419&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;832&quot; data-end=&quot;930&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;834&quot; data-end=&quot;930&quot;&gt;Provide 24/7 L3 technical support for Wonderware MES Suite (Operations, Performance, OEE).&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;931&quot; data-end=&quot;1084&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;933&quot; data-end=&quot;1084&quot;&gt;Configure, troubleshoot, and support Wonderware ArchestrA IDE, MES, System Platform, InTouch, Historian, Skelta Workflow, and Information Server.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1085&quot; data-end=&quot;1168&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1087&quot; data-end=&quot;1168&quot;&gt;Handle incident resolution and communicate regular status updates to customers.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1169&quot; data-end=&quot;1254&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1171&quot; data-end=&quot;1254&quot;&gt;Develop and troubleshoot MS SQL Stored Procedures as part of MES integration.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1255&quot; data-end=&quot;1344&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1257&quot; data-end=&quot;1344&quot;&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional teams to ensure seamless MES operation and support.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1345&quot; data-end=&quot;1419&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1347&quot; data-end=&quot;1419&quot;&gt;Ensure documentation and knowledge base updates for all resolved issues.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\nMust-Have Skills:&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1452&quot; data-end=&quot;1939&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot; data-start=&quot;1452&quot; data-end=&quot;1514&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div data-start=&quot;1454&quot; data-end=&quot;1514&quot;&gt;5+ years of experience in Wonderware MES Suite support&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot; data-start=&quot;1515&quot; data-end=&quot;1738&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div data-start=&quot;1517&quot; data-end=&quot;1532&quot;&gt;Expertise in:&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1535&quot; data-end=&quot;1738&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1535&quot; data-end=&quot;1601&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1537&quot; data-end=&quot;1601&quot;&gt;Wonderware ArchestrA IDE, MES Operations, Performance, OEE&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1604&quot; data-end=&quot;1687&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1606&quot; data-end=&quot;1687&quot;&gt;System Platform, Historian, InTouch, Skelta Workflow, Enterprise Integrator&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1690&quot; data-end=&quot;1738&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1692&quot; data-end=&quot;1738&quot;&gt;MS SQL programming and stored procedures&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot; data-start=&quot;1739&quot; data-end=&quot;1799&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div data-start=&quot;1741&quot; data-end=&quot;1799&quot;&gt;Strong troubleshooting and customer communication skills&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot; data-start=&quot;1800&quot; data-end=&quot;1862&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div data-start=&quot;1802&quot; data-end=&quot;1862&quot;&gt;Experience in the CPG (Consumer Packaged Goods) domain&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1863&quot; data-end=&quot;1939&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot; data-start=&quot;1865&quot; data-end=&quot;1939&quot;&gt;Degree in Electrical, Electronics, ECE, or Instrumentation Engineering&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',500000.00,2500000.00,'₹',0,'India','Pune',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2025-07-13 18:30:00',0,0,'2025-05-15 14:09:30.000000','2025-05-19 04:48:38.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"AvevaWonderware\", \"Historian\", \"Mes\", \"Mes Support\", \"Mes Workflow Automation\", \"MS SQL Server\", \"SCADA\", \"SCADA Systems\", \"AVEVA System\", \"AVEVA Intouch HMI\"]','[\"&lt;h3 class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1946&quot; data-end=&quot;1967&quot;&gt;Job Benefits:&lt;/h3&gt;\\r\\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1968&quot; data-end=&quot;2221&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1968&quot; data-end=&quot;2036&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;1970&quot; data-end=&quot;2036&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with global industrial automation leaders&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2037&quot; data-end=&quot;2095&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2039&quot; data-end=&quot;2095&quot;&gt;Skill enhancement in MES/SCADA/Automation platforms&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2096&quot; data-end=&quot;2127&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2098&quot; data-end=&quot;2127&quot;&gt;Competitive compensation&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2128&quot; data-end=&quot;2180&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2130&quot; data-end=&quot;2180&quot;&gt;Work flexibility depending on site/project&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2181&quot; data-end=&quot;2221&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;2183&quot; data-end=&quot;2221&quot;&gt;Pan India deployment and exposure&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Maharashtra'),('ebe36d05-6958-41f3-a65b-64cd089834a3','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Digital Tech Lead – Industrial IT/OT Architect','digital-tech-lead-industrial-itot-architect-271-271','&lt;p data-start=&quot;88&quot; data-end=&quot;370&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced professionals for the role of Digital Tech Lead &amp;ndash; Industrial IT/OT Architect with a leading Top MNC. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in Industrial Digital Transformation, Manufacturing IT solutions, and enterprise-level IT/OT architecture.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;372&quot; data-end=&quot;755&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for leading Digital Factory initiatives, managing manufacturing technology platforms, and driving enterprise-wide industrial digital solutions. The role includes designing and implementing Industrial Information Systems, ensuring architecture consistency across manufacturing applications, and supporting large-scale digital transformation programs.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;757&quot; data-end=&quot;1068&quot;&gt;Professionals should have strong exposure to MES, SCADA, IIoT platforms, enterprise integration, and manufacturing automation systems. The role also requires collaboration with global IT, Engineering, Operations, and business stakeholders to deliver scalable and standardized manufacturing technology solutions.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1070&quot; data-end=&quot;1353&quot;&gt;The selected candidate will lead technical discussions, manage Agile project delivery, oversee quality and support frameworks, and mentor cross-functional teams. Strong leadership, analytical thinking, communication, and stakeholder management skills are essential for this position.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-07-12 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-05-14 03:29:31.000000','2026-05-14 03:29:31.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Automation\", \"Digital Transformation\", \"Documentation\", \"IOT\", \"Mes\", \"SCADA\", \"Industrial IT/OT\", \"Manufacturing Digital Platforms\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1369&quot; data-end=&quot;1407&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;fzquuh&quot; data-start=&quot;1408&quot; da