ot;&gt;IFIX SCADA Consultant&lt;/strong&gt; with strong expertise in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;250&quot; data-end=&quot;265&quot;&gt;GE iFIX 6.5&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong data-start=&quot;267&quot; data-end=&quot;281&quot;&gt;GE IGS 7.8&lt;/strong&gt;, and industrial automation systems. The role involves providing &lt;strong data-start=&quot;346&quot; data-end=&quot;365&quot;&gt;L2 &amp;amp; L3 support&lt;/strong&gt;, troubleshooting SCADA issues, performing system updates, handling server patching, and coordinating with key users and external vendors. The consultant will work on support, monitoring, development, and shutdown activities related to iFIX SCADA environments.','Information Technology','Full-time','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Hyderabad',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-02-09 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-12-11 15:25:17.000000','2025-12-11 15:25:17.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"PLC\", \"SCADA\", \"GE iFIX\", \"IGS OPC\", \"Historian Server\", \"L2/L3 Support\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;754&quot; data-end=&quot;796&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;756&quot; data-end=&quot;796&quot;&gt;Competitive salary based on experience&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;797&quot; data-end=&quot;836&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;799&quot; data-end=&quot;836&quot;&gt;Health insurance &amp;amp; medical coverage&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;837&quot; data-end=&quot;876&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;839&quot; data-end=&quot;876&quot;&gt;PF/ESI and other statutory benefits&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;877&quot; data-end=&quot;961&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;879&quot; data-end=&quot;961&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on GE SCADA systems in a fast-growing industrial environment&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;962&quot; data-end=&quot;1046&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;964&quot; data-end=&quot;1046&quot;&gt;Skill enhancement through hands-on exposure to SCADA, OPC, and Historian servers&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1047&quot; data-end=&quot;1117&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1049&quot; data-end=&quot;1117&quot;&gt;Work with cross-functional teams and industrial automation experts&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Telangana'),('ecc276d1-fe1a-40a0-89c2-ab853fbaf9b3','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Senior React Native Developer','senior-react-native-developer-281-281','&lt;p data-start=&quot;71&quot; data-end=&quot;390&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced Senior React Native Developers for a leading Top MNC to work on high-performance cross-platform mobile application projects. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in React Native development, mobile application architecture, API integration, and modern mobile development practices.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;392&quot; data-end=&quot;733&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for designing, developing, and maintaining scalable mobile applications for both iOS and Android platforms using React Native. The role includes collaborating with product managers, UI/UX designers, backend developers, and cross-functional teams to build user-friendly and enterprise-grade mobile solutions.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;735&quot; data-end=&quot;1046&quot;&gt;Professionals should have strong hands-on experience in JavaScript (ES6+), TypeScript, React ecosystem, state management libraries, API integrations, debugging, testing, and performance optimization. Experience with native module integration using Swift, Objective-C, Java, or Kotlin will be an added advantage.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1048&quot; data-end=&quot;1402&quot;&gt;The role also involves code reviews, mentoring junior developers, implementing CI/CD pipelines, improving application performance, and following Agile/Scrum development methodologies. Candidates should possess strong analytical thinking, communication, problem-solving, and leadership skills with a passion for delivering high-quality mobile experiences.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Chennai',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-07-20 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-05-22 02:35:37.000000','2026-05-22 02:36:09.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"API Integration\", \"Graph QL\", \"IOS\", \"Java\", \"JavaScript\", \"KOTLIN\", \"Mobile Application Development (using DELMIA Apriso)\", \"Objective C\", \"React\", \"React Native\", \"Redux\", \"REST API\", \"Swift\", \"Typescript\", \"Cross-Browser Compatibility\", \"Android Development\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1418&quot; data-end=&quot;1456&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;12h952q&quot; data-start=&quot;1457&quot; data-end=&quot;1517&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-level mobile application projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1eu0i6p&quot; data-start=&quot;1518&quot; data-end=&quot;1583&quot;&gt;Work on advanced React Native and cross-platform technologies&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1rlca45&quot; data-start=&quot;1584&quot; data-end=&quot;1642&quot;&gt;Career growth in Mobile Application Development domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1rngw46&quot; data-start=&quot;1643&quot; data-end=&quot;1715&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global product and engineering teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot; data-start=&quot;1716&quot; data-end=&quot;1771&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;1772&quot; data-end=&quot;1815&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Tamil Nadu'),('ee4163ef-e246-4ce5-bc10-1a3ec076e9b5','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','TrakSYS Consultant','traksys-consultant-268-268','&lt;p data-start=&quot;60&quot; data-end=&quot;346&quot;&gt;We are hiring skilled TrakSYS Consultants for a leading Top MNC to work on enterprise-level digital manufacturing and MES projects. The ideal candidate should have hands-on experience in TrakSYS application support, customization, implementation, and manufacturing process environments.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;348&quot; data-end=&quot;674&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for working on TrakSYS implementation, upgrade, and support activities across manufacturing projects. The role includes gathering business requirements, configuring MES solutions, troubleshooting application issues, and supporting manufacturing operations for process and discrete industries.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;676&quot; data-end=&quot;905&quot;&gt;Professionals should have strong technical expertise in C# .NET, MS SQL, T-SQL, and SQL query debugging. Experience with MES integrations involving SAP, Labware LIMS, and other manufacturing applications will be highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;907&quot; data-end=&quot;1174&quot;&gt;The role also requires collaboration with business users, stakeholders, and technical teams to optimize manufacturing processes and deliver efficient MES solutions. Strong communication, analytical thinking, and client-handling skills are essential for this position.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-07-10 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-05-12 02:36:17.000000','2026-05-12 02:36:17.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\".NET\", \"C#\", \"Mes\", \"MES Integration\", \"MS SQL Server\", \"SAP Integration\", \"LabWare LIMS\", \"Manufacturing Process Optimization\", \"TrakSYS\", \"TrakSYS Customization\", \"TrakSYS Support\", \"Discrete Manufacturing\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1190&quot; data-end=&quot;1228&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1w2kxkp&quot; data-start=&quot;1229&quot; data-end=&quot;1294&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise MES and digital manufacturing projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;2lrxkj&quot; data-start=&quot;1295&quot; data-end=&quot;1359&quot;&gt;Work on advanced TrakSYS implementation &amp;amp; support activities&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;13aq81t&quot; data-start=&quot;1360&quot; data-end=&quot;1407&quot;&gt;Career growth in Manufacturing &amp;amp; MES domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;9wn5a9&quot; data-start=&quot;1408&quot; data-end=&quot;1459&quot;&gt;Collaborative and professional work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;123neq0&quot; data-start=&quot;1460&quot; data-end=&quot;1517&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with global manufacturing clients&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;1518&quot; data-end=&quot;1561&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('ee64de8b-7466-45cd-a195-1004cc232304','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Developer – AVEVA MES','developer-aveva-mes-340-340','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;63&quot; data-end=&quot;420&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced AVEVA MES Developers for a leading Top MNC to work on enterprise-scale Manufacturing Execution System (MES), Industrial Automation, and Smart Manufacturing transformation projects. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in AVEVA MES, AVEVA System Platform, Wonderware technologies, and enterprise manufacturing solutions.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;422&quot; data-end=&quot;834&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for designing, developing, implementing, configuring, and supporting AVEVA MES applications across global manufacturing environments. The role includes deploying AVEVA System Platform, configuring MES environments, developing manufacturing workflows, integrating shop-floor systems, troubleshooting production issues, and supporting enterprise digital manufacturing initiatives.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;836&quot; data-end=&quot;1179&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with AVEVA MES, AVEVA System Platform, AVEVA Work Tasks (Skelta BPM), AVEVA MDM, Wonderware Historian, SQL development, and .NET/C# programming. Strong knowledge of ISA-95, ISA-88, MESA standards, OPC, PLC, SCADA integration, manufacturing processes, and industrial automation is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1181&quot; data-end=&quot;1660&quot;&gt;The role also involves collaborating with business stakeholders, automation engineers, manufacturing teams, and global delivery teams to gather requirements, design scalable MES solutions, prepare technical documentation, support production environments, and deliver high-quality enterprise manufacturing applications. Candidates should possess strong analytical, communication, stakeholder management, and problem-solving skills with a focus on digital manufacturing excellence.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Pune',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-09-13 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-07-16 02:38:23.000000','2026-07-16 02:38:23.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\".NET Development\", \"C#\", \"Mes\", \"Microsoft SQL Server\", \"SCADA\", \"AVEVA System\", \"AVEVA Intouch HMI\", \"AVEVA MES\", \"PLC Integration\", \"ISA-95\", \"ISA-88\", \"AVEVA Work Tasks\", \"AVEVA MDM\", \"Wonderware Historian\", \"SQL Scripting\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1676&quot; data-end=&quot;1714&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1jb3rem&quot; data-start=&quot;1715&quot; data-end=&quot;1799&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale MES and Smart Manufacturing transformation projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1aspo82&quot; data-start=&quot;1800&quot; data-end=&quot;1889&quot;&gt;Work with advanced AVEVA MES, System Platform, and Industrial Automation technologies&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1m946pf&quot; data-start=&quot;1890&quot; data-end=&quot;1981&quot;&gt;Career growth in Manufacturing Execution Systems (MES) and Digital Manufacturing domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;13qji02&quot; data-start=&quot;1982&quot; data-end=&quot;2059&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global manufacturing and technology teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot; data-start=&quot;2060&quot; data-end=&quot;2115&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;2116&quot; data-end=&quot;2159&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Maharashtra'),('ef4a1c23-da95-4688-ae80-c20dd522e805','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','MES L4 Support Engineer','mes-l4-support-engineer-141-141','&lt;p data-start=&quot;229&quot; data-end=&quot;437&quot;&gt;A Top MNC is seeking an experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;265&quot; data-end=&quot;296&quot;&gt;MES L4 Support Professional&lt;/strong&gt; to lead advanced troubleshooting, system monitoring, and performance optimization for MES applications in highly regulated GMP environments.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;439&quot; data-end=&quot;719&quot;&gt;The role involves providing deep technical support across MES platforms (Rockwell FTPS, Siemens Opcenter), ensuring system stability, supporting integrations with ERP/LIMS/SCADA, managing incidents/changes, and collaborating with cross-functional teams for continuous improvement.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;721&quot; data-end=&quot;883&quot;&gt;This position is ideal for professionals who excel in MES architecture, critical issue resolution, performance tuning, and enterprise-level integration oversight.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;hr data-start=&quot;885&quot; data-end=&quot;888&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h1 data-start=&quot;890&quot; data-end=&quot;919&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;892&quot; data-end=&quot;919&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;920&quot; data-end=&quot;1716&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;920&quot; data-end=&quot;1007&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;922&quot; data-end=&quot;1007&quot;&gt;Provide &lt;strong data-start=&quot;930&quot; data-end=&quot;967&quot;&gt;L4-level advanced troubleshooting&lt;/strong&gt; for MES applications (FTPS/Opcenter).&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1008&quot; data-end=&quot;1103&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1010&quot; data-end=&quot;1103&quot;&gt;Perform &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1018&quot; data-end=&quot;1100&quot;&gt;system monitoring, performance tuning, capacity planning &amp;amp; root cause analysis&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1104&quot; data-end=&quot;1193&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1106&quot; data-end=&quot;1193&quot;&gt;Lead integration oversight with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1138&quot; data-end=&quot;1190&quot;&gt;ERP, LIMS, SCADA, PLCs, OPC UA, middleware tools&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1194&quot; data-end=&quot;1291&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1196&quot; data-end=&quot;1291&quot;&gt;Manage &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1203&quot; data-end=&quot;1225&quot;&gt;critical incidents&lt;/strong&gt;, service requests, change implementations &amp;amp; impact assessments.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1292&quot; data-end=&quot;1371&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1294&quot; data-end=&quot;1371&quot;&gt;Validate MES configurations, workflows, and interfaces in GMP environments.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1372&quot; data-end=&quot;1463&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1374&quot; data-end=&quot;1463&quot;&gt;Collaborate with Production, QA, IT &amp;amp; Automation teams to resolve high-priority issues.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1464&quot; data-end=&quot;1554&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1466&quot; data-end=&quot;1554&quot;&gt;Ensure compliance with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1489&quot; data-end=&quot;1517&quot;&gt;GMP, GxP, 21 CFR Part 11&lt;/strong&gt;, data integrity &amp;amp; audit readiness.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1555&quot; data-end=&quot;1627&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1557&quot; data-end=&quot;1627&quot;&gt;Support deployments, upgrades, patching, and environment validation.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1628&quot; data-end=&quot;1716&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1630&quot; data-end=&quot;1716&quot;&gt;Document troubleshooting steps, SOPs, architecture diagrams &amp;amp; knowledge base articles.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Full-time','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Pune',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-20 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-11-22 03:47:02.000000','2025-11-22 03:47:03.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"CSV\", \"ERP\", \"Gxp Compliance\", \"Lims\", \"Mes Troubleshooting\", \"PLC\", \"SAP\", \"SCADA\", \"Siemens Opcenter\", \"SQL\", \"OPC UA\", \"GMP\", \"Rockwell FTPS\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2874&quot; data-end=&quot;2946&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2876&quot; data-end=&quot;2946&quot;&gt;Work with a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2888&quot; data-end=&quot;2910&quot;&gt;leading global MNC&lt;/strong&gt; in Pharma &amp;amp; Industrial Automation&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2947&quot; data-end=&quot;3010&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2949&quot; data-end=&quot;3010&quot;&gt;Opportunity to handle &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2971&quot; data-end=&quot;3008&quot;&gt;critical, high-impact MES systems&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;3011&quot; data-end=&quot;3073&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;3013&quot; data-end=&quot;3073&quot;&gt;Exposure to latest MES platforms &amp;amp; enterprise integrations&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;3074&quot; data-end=&quot;3126&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;3076&quot; data-end=&quot;3126&quot;&gt;Excellent learning &amp;amp; certification opportunities&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;3127&quot; data-end=&quot;3193&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;3129&quot; data-end=&quot;3193&quot;&gt;Collaborative, process-driven, and growth-oriented environment&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;3194&quot; data-end=&quot;3244&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;3196&quot; data-end=&quot;3244&quot;&gt;Competitive salary + performance-based rewards&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;3245&quot; data-end=&quot;3332&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;3247&quot; data-end=&quot;3332&quot;&gt;Chance to work on &lt;strong data-start=&quot;3265&quot; data-end=&quot;3318&quot;&gt;digital manufacturing transformation (Pharma 4.0)&lt;/strong&gt; initiatives&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Maharashtra'),('ef589d68-434d-4064-affa-a92aedcfc37b','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Tulip Developer','tulip-developer-108-108','&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an experienced Tulip Developer with 4+ years of expertise in Tulip development and support. The role involves designing and developing Tulip applications, understanding frontline operations, and ensuring seamless process streamlining. You will work closely with cross-functional teams, assist in project status meetings, and provide Tulip software support for product-related issues.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Key responsibilities include coordinating with product teams on roadmaps and innovations, analyzing IoT data for insights, developing data models and dashboards to support IoT initiatives, and managing new feature requests including experimentation, testing, rollouts, and system upgrades. This role requires strong collaboration, problem-solving, and communication skills to drive successful Tulip implementation and support.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',1,'India','Pune',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2025-11-22 18:30:00',0,0,'2025-09-24 08:39:05.000000','2025-09-24 08:39:05.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Data Analysis\", \"Data Models\", \"IOT\", \"Stakeholder Communication\", \"System Validation\"]','[\"Opportunity to work on IoT-driven digital transformation projects&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Exposure to Tulip app design &amp;amp; frontline operations platform&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Career growth in Industry 4.0 and IoT development&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Collaborative work environment with product &amp;amp; service teams\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Maharashtra'),('f05358c3-1f57-4ef6-a67a-e2e1e5fe7ab4','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Developer – AVEVA MES','developer-aveva-mes-364-364','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;59&quot; data-end=&quot;258&quot;&gt;We are hiring an experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;88&quot; data-end=&quot;111&quot;&gt;AVEVA MES Developer&lt;/strong&gt; for a leading Top MNC to work on global &lt;strong data-start=&quot;152&quot; data-end=&quot;233&quot;&gt;Manufacturing Execution System (MES), Digital Manufacturing, and Industry 4.0&lt;/strong&gt; transformation projects.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;260&quot; data-end=&quot;448&quot;&gt;The ideal candidate should have strong hands-on experience with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;324&quot; data-end=&quot;447&quot;&gt;AVEVA MES, AVEVA System Platform, AVEVA Work Tasks, AVEVA MDM, Wonderware/AVEVA Historian, SQL, and .NET/C# development&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;450&quot; data-end=&quot;827&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for developing, configuring, implementing, and supporting end-to-end AVEVA MES solutions across manufacturing environments. The role involves understanding client requirements, translating them into scalable MES solutions, setting up MES environments, integrating industrial systems, and collaborating with global technical and business teams.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;829&quot; data-end=&quot;987&quot;&gt;Professionals with strong knowledge of &lt;strong data-start=&quot;868&quot; data-end=&quot;961&quot;&gt;ISA-95, ISA-88, MESA, OPC, PLC, SCADA, industrial networking, and manufacturing processes&lt;/strong&gt; will be highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-23 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-08-25 02:14:26.000000','2026-08-25 02:14:26.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"AvevaWonderware\", \"Mes\", \"MS SQL Developer\", \"SCADA\", \"AVEVA System\", \"AVEVA MES\", \"OPC UA\", \"PLC Integration\", \"Skelta\", \"ISA-95\", \"AVEVA MDM\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;i3mxm7&quot; data-start=&quot;1002&quot; data-end=&quot;1046&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a leading Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;d6zm4b&quot; data-start=&quot;1047&quot; data-end=&quot;1124&quot;&gt;Exposure to global &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1068&quot; data-end=&quot;1124&quot;&gt;AVEVA MES implementation and transformation projects&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1q9wx46&quot; data-start=&quot;1125&quot; data-end=&quot;1206&quot;&gt;Work on enterprise-scale &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1152&quot; data-end=&quot;1194&quot;&gt;Digital Manufacturing and Industry 4.0&lt;/strong&gt; initiatives&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i8uuaa&quot; data-start=&quot;1207&quot; data-end=&quot;1281&quot;&gt;Hands-on exposure to AVEVA MES Performance, Operations &amp;amp; Quality modules&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;osodh3&quot; data-start=&quot;1282&quot; data-end=&quot;1366&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1309&quot; data-end=&quot;1366&quot;&gt;AVEVA System Platform, MDM, Work Tasks, and Historian&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;t8qvts&quot; data-start=&quot;1367&quot; data-end=&quot;1425&quot;&gt;Exposure to industrial automation and MES-OT integration&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ceisxp&quot; data-start=&quot;1426&quot; data-end=&quot;1488&quot;&gt;Collaboration with global clients and cross-functional teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;grfv1v&quot; data-start=&quot;1489&quot; data-end=&quot;1555&quot;&gt;Strong technical growth in Manufacturing IT and MES technologies&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ix4hom&quot; data-start=&quot;1556&quot; data-end=&quot;1635&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on end-to-end MES development and implementation projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;167blw9&quot; data-start=&quot;1636&quot; data-end=&quot;1722&quot;&gt;Career growth in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1655&quot; data-end=&quot;1722&quot;&gt;MES, Smart Manufacturing, and Industrial Digital Transformation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('f057121d-f7e8-4602-9e11-333fee252fee','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Azure Data Engineer','azure-data-engineer-123-123','We are seeking an experienced Azure Data Engineer with strong expertise in data ingestion, transformation, and migration using Azure tools. The role involves developing notebooks in Azure Databricks for data transformation and managing data movement between repositories and databases. The engineer will also be responsible for migrating data from on-premises systems to Azure cloud using ADF (Azure Data Factory) and other tools, while working in an agile Scrum environment.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;br /&gt;1. Develop and manage notebooks in Azure Databricks for data transformation and movement.&lt;br /&gt;2. Handle data ingestion from on-premise to Azure cloud using ADF and related tools.&lt;br /&gt;3. Collaborate with team members in an Agile/Scrum environment.&lt;br /&gt;4. Work on a pharmaceutical project, focusing on equipment, spare parts inventory, demand, procurement, and maintenance effectiveness.','Information Technology','Full-time','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2025-12-26 18:30:00',0,0,'2025-10-28 13:32:47.000000','2025-10-28 13:32:48.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Agile\", \"Azure\", \"Cloud Technologies\", \"Healthcare\", \"Pharmaceutical\", \"ADF\", \"Pyspark\", \"Data Migration\", \"Azure Databricks\"]','[\"Opportunity to work with modern Azure cloud technologies (ADF, Databricks, PySpark)&lt;br /&gt;Gain experience in the pharmaceutical/healthcare domain&lt;br /&gt;Collaborative and agile team environment&lt;br /&gt;Exposure to data migration and transformation projects on a large scale\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('f079a46c-89a5-42a1-a346-03dc649cdc16','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Senior React Native Developer','senior-react-native-developer-281-281','&lt;p data-start=&quot;71&quot; data-end=&quot;390&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced Senior React Native Developers for a leading Top MNC to work on high-performance cross-platform mobile application projects. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in React Native development, mobile application architecture, API integration, and modern mobile development practices.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;392&quot; data-end=&quot;733&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for designing, developing, and maintaining scalable mobile applications for both iOS and Android platforms using React Native. The role includes collaborating with product managers, UI/UX designers, backend developers, and cross-functional teams to build user-friendly and enterprise-grade mobile solutions.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;735&quot; data-end=&quot;1046&quot;&gt;Professionals should have strong hands-on experience in JavaScript (ES6+), TypeScript, React ecosystem, state management libraries, API integrations, debugging, testing, and performance optimization. Experience with native module integration using Swift, Objective-C, Java, or Kotlin will be an added advantage.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1048&quot; data-end=&quot;1402&quot;&gt;The role also involves code reviews, mentoring junior developers, implementing CI/CD pipelines, improving application performance, and following Agile/Scrum development methodologies. Candidates should possess strong analytical thinking, communication, problem-solving, and leadership skills with a passion for delivering high-quality mobile experiences.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Chennai',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-07-20 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-05-22 02:35:37.000000','2026-05-22 02:36:09.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"API Integration\", \"Graph QL\", \"IOS\", \"Java\", \"JavaScript\", \"KOTLIN\", \"Mobile Application Development (using DELMIA Apriso)\", \"Objective C\", \"React\", \"React Native\", \"Redux\", \"REST API\", \"Swift\", \"Typescript\", \"Cross-Browser Compatibility\", \"Android Development\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1418&quot; data-end=&quot;1456&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;12h952q&quot; data-start=&quot;1457&quot; data-end=&quot;1517&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-level mobile application projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1eu0i6p&quot; data-start=&quot;1518&quot; data-end=&quot;1583&quot;&gt;Work on advanced React Native and cross-platform technologies&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1rlca45&quot; data-start=&quot;1584&quot; data-end=&quot;1642&quot;&gt;Career growth in Mobile Application Development domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1rngw46&quot; data-start=&quot;1643&quot; data-end=&quot;1715&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global product and engineering teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot; data-start=&quot;1716&quot; data-end=&quot;1771&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;1772&quot; data-end=&quot;1815&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Tamil Nadu'),('f1031556-4c44-4ce7-bf74-4ea64f54ca36','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Software Engineer – Flutter Developer (Fresher)','software-engineer-flutter-developer-fresher-83-83','We are looking for a passionate Flutter Developer (Fresher) to join a leading MNC&amp;rsquo;s mobile app development team. This is an excellent opportunity for fresh graduates to kickstart their career in a high-growth, global tech environment.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Design and build advanced mobile applications using Flutter and Dart&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Work on cross-platform (Android/iOS) compatibility&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Integrate RESTful APIs and third-party libraries&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Participate in full mobile app development lifecycle &amp;ndash; design, develop, test, deploy&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Collaborate with backend developers and UX/UI teams&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Debug and optimize application performance&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Understand requirements shared by Japanese teams and deliver accordingly','Information Technology','Contract','Entry',220000.00,240000.00,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-19 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-07-25 04:15:19.000000','2025-11-21 04:46:14.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Android\", \"Application Development\", \"Cross-Platform\", \"Dart\", \"Debugging Skills\", \"Development\", \"Flutter\", \"Git\", \"IOS\", \"IOS Development\", \"Material Management\", \"Mobile Apps\", \"REST API\", \"UI-UX\"]','[\"Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Hands-on experience with live projects and real-world mobile apps&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Mentorship and training from experienced professionals&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Exposure to global teams (Japan collaboration)&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;5-day working (Monday&amp;ndash;Friday)&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Career growth and learning-focused environment&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Friendly and collaborative work culture\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('f12de9c6-3188-4aeb-af3e-1719c332f679','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Factory Automation Engineer - SECS/GEM MES','factory-automation-engineer-secsgem-mes-58-58','We are seeking a highly skilled Factory Automation - SECS/GEM MES Engineer with expertise in semiconductor manufacturing processes. The ideal candidate will have in-depth knowledge of SECS/GEM standards (SEMI E30 and related protocols) and experience configuring and integrating equipment for efficient factory automation.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Work on semiconductor manufacturing processes, adhering to SECS/GEM standards.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Configure and integrate SECS/GEM interfaces for various manufacturing equipment.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Develop communication protocols and define data collection variables.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Manage Siemens Camstar/OpCenter systems and create equipment recipes.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Monitor real-time data from sensors and equipment.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Implement statistical process control (SPC) and analyze performance metrics.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Maintain and enhance test automation frameworks for continuous improvement.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Provide thorough documentation and ensure good compliance practices.','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',500000.00,2500000.00,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-19 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-06-25 08:28:07.000000','2025-12-29 21:33:02.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Camstar\", \"Communication Skills\", \"Opcenter\", \"Problem-Solving Skills\", \"Siemens Opcenter\", \"Semiconductor Manufacturing Processes\", \"SECS/GEM Standards\", \"GUI Design\", \"Statistical Process Control\"]','[\"Competitive salary package and performance-based incentives.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Opportunity to work on advanced semiconductor technologies.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Exposure to cutting-edge factory automation and SECS/GEM standards.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;A supportive and collaborative work environment.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Opportunities for professional growth and skill enhancement.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Health insurance and wellness programs.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Flexible work hours and leave policies.\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('f15df30c-f991-4908-b25b-b7124bd033b7','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Pharmasuite MES Consultant','pharmasuite-mes-consultant-250-250','&lt;p&gt;Roles &amp;amp; Responsibilities&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;q Participates in fit gap analysis &amp;amp; Process Modeling &amp;amp; process standardization with Area lead &amp;amp; Process SME&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;q Works with Rockwell Automation Lead to develop BB requirements&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;q Provide times, user story point estimates, and status for all stories assigned to them&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;q Authors and performs documents supporting validation of EBRs&lt;/p&gt;