phism, Encapsulation, Overloading, Overriding, Type conversion, Expression, C# syntax like Statement &amp;ndash; block, Declaration, Loop &amp;amp; For Each ,Try, Catch. Event, Event Handler, Callback, Delegates, Debugging, Net control &amp;ndash; properties / data binding, Collection like Dictionaries, Array, Generic, I/O &amp;amp; File management, LINQ , Experience in Entity Framework. MVC framework, Knowledge on writing unit test cases.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;middot; SQL Server (Good knowledge of relational database concepts and T-SQL) : Knowledge about architecture, writing &amp;amp; optimizing stored procedure, writing &amp;amp; optimizing views procedure, Cross platform database connection knowledge&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;middot; Experience with source control tools (preferably Git)&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;middot; Knowledge of agile software development methodologies&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;middot; Experience with Docker and container orchestration (Swarm / Kubernetes)&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;middot; Good to have - ASP.net core Web API, jQuery and CSS, Azure DevOps&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;middot; Good to have &amp;ndash; Manufacturing domain experience&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;middot; Knowledge of agile software development methodologies&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Entry',NULL,NULL,'INR',1,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-05-24 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-03-25 16:18:19.000000','2026-03-25 16:18:19.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"ASP.NET\", \"AWS DevOps\", \"Azure\", \"CSS\", \"Docker\", \"Github\", \"JQUERY\", \"Kubernetes\", \"Mes\", \"MS SQL Server\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;Competitive salary package with performance-based incentives&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;65&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;67&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;Healt