ity architectures across manufacturing and industrial setups.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;4fjve3&quot; data-start=&quot;540&quot; data-end=&quot;573&quot;&gt;&lt;span role=&quot;text&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;547&quot; data-end=&quot;571&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;574&quot; data-end=&quot;1129&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;wwjc41&quot; data-start=&quot;574&quot; data-end=&quot;668&quot;&gt;Conduct &lt;strong data-start=&quot;584&quot; data-end=&quot;615&quot;&gt;site-level risk assessments&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong data-start=&quot;620&quot; data-end=&quot;646&quot;&gt;vulnerability analysis&lt;/strong&gt; for OT environments&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;dioihb&quot; data-start=&quot;669&quot; data-end=&quot;741&quot;&gt;Design and implement &lt;strong data-start=&quot;692&quot; data-end=&quot;717&quot;&gt;OT security solutions&lt;/strong&gt; in industrial systems&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;3aj4rj&quot; data-start=&quot;742&quot; data-end=&quot;816&quot;&gt;Work closely with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;762&quot; data-end=&quot;814&quot;&gt;plant teams, network leads, and key stakeholders&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;9m8i3y&quot; data-start=&quot;817&quot; data-end=&quot;908&quot;&gt;Drive &lt;strong data-start=&quot;825&quot; data-end=&quot;851&quot;&gt;remediation strategies&lt;/strong&gt; and support &lt;strong data-start=&quot;864&quot; data-end=&quot;906&quot;&gt;incident response planning &amp;amp; execution&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;10x019r&quot; data-start=&quot;909&quot; data-end=&quot;981&quot;&gt;Ensure alignment with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;933&quot; data-end=&quot;979&quot;&gt;industry security standards and frameworks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;8y872s&quot; data-start=&quot;982&quot; data-end=&quot;1067&quot;&gt