ot;1376&quot; data-end=&quot;1413&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1378&quot; data-end=&quot;1411&quot;&gt;NIST 800-82, IEC 62443, ISA99&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;sv1cbb&quot; data-start=&quot;1414&quot; data-end=&quot;1522&quot;&gt;Understanding of &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1433&quot; data-end=&quot;1466&quot;&gt;network architecture concepts&lt;/strong&gt;:\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1472&quot; data-end=&quot;1522&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;30inmn&quot; data-start=&quot;1472&quot; data-end=&quot;1522&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1474&quot; data-end=&quot;1520&quot;&gt;Purdue Model, DMZ, Firewalls, VLAN Mapping&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1oti6uu&quot; data-start=&quot;1523&quot; data-end=&quot;1605&quot;&gt;Experience with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1541&quot; data-end=&quot;1558&quot;&gt;ICS protocols&lt;/strong&gt;:\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1564&quot; data-end=&quot;1605&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;10phq97&quot; data-start=&quot;1564&quot; data-end=&quot;1605&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1566&quot; data-end=&quot;1603&quot;&gt;Modbus, OPC, IEC 61850, SNMP, SSH&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1njrhon&quot; data-start=&quot;1606&quot; data-end=&quot;1676&quot;&gt;Expertise in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1621&quot; data-end=&quot;1674&quot;&gt;OT Security Risk Assessment &amp;amp; Architecture Design&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;17kbv01&quot; data-start=&quot;1678&quot; data-end=&quot;1702&quot;&gt;&lt;span role=&quot;text&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1684&quot; data-end=&quot;1700&quot;&gt;Good to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1703&quot; data-end=&quot;1927&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ntwrv5&quot; data-start=&quot;1703&quot; data-end=&quot;1795&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1730&quot; data-end=&quot;1751&quot;&gt;OT security tools&lt;/strong&gt; (IDS/IPS, vulnerability assessment tools)&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1yw983m&quot; data-start=&quot;1796&quot; data-end=&quot;1855&quot;&gt;Experience in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1812&quot; data-end=&quot;1853&quot;&gt;IT-OT network design &amp;amp; implementation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;r0df1d&quot; data-start=&quot;1856&quot; data-end=&quot;1927&quot;&gt;Relevant certifications:\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1887&quot; data-end=&quot;1927&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;19r1mjo&quot; data-start=&quot;1887&quot; data-end=&quot;1927&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1889&quot; data-end=&quot;1925&quot;&gt;IEC 62443 / CCNA / CISSP / GICSP&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Pune',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-06-16 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-04-18 04:27:31.000000','2026-04-18 04:27:31.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"CCNA\", \"ISA\", \"Mes IOT Integration\", \"Opc\", \"PLC\", \"SCADA\", \"HMI\", \"Modbus\", \"VLAN\", \"IEC 62443\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;hpnyf2&quot; data-start=&quot;1956&quot; data-end=&quot;2043&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1985&quot; data-end=&quot;2041&quot;&gt;Top MNC on critical infrastructure security projects&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;10h2f31&quot; data-start=&quot;2044&quot; data-end=&quot;2120&quot;&gt;Exposure to &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2058&quot; data-end=&quot;2118&quot;&gt;industrial cybersecurity &amp;amp; OT transformation initiatives&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1a0lhuw&quot; data-start=&quot;2121&quot; data-end=&quot;2182&quot;&gt;Work on &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2131&quot; data-end=&quot;2180&qu