1-22 18:30:00',0,0,'2025-09-24 04:38:12.000000','2025-09-24 04:38:12.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Hibernate\", \"Java\", \"Spring Boot\"]','[\"Competitive salary and performance-based bonuses.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Health insurance, paid leaves, and retirement benefits.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Flexible work hours / hybrid or remote options.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Professional growth opportunities through training and certifications.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Exposure to modern technologies and large-scale projects.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Supportive and collaborative work culture.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Employee wellness and work-life balance initiatives.\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('f306747c-3437-41fa-9330-5353ce83ae5f','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Senior Java Developer','senior-java-developer-133-133','&lt;p data-start=&quot;203&quot; data-end=&quot;665&quot;&gt;A top global MNC is hiring experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;242&quot; data-end=&quot;261&quot;&gt;Java Developers&lt;/strong&gt; with deep expertise in Java 21+, Spring Boot 3.x, and modern database technologies. In this role, you will design and develop scalable, secure, and high-performance backend services for enterprise applications. The ideal candidate is a strong problem-solver, highly collaborative, and passionate about building future-ready backend systems. Exposure to cloud, containers, and monitoring tools is a plus.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;667&quot; data-end=&quot;789&quot;&gt;This is a great opportunity to work on challenging global projects, modern architectures, and cutting-edge backend stacks.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;hr data-start=&quot;791&quot; data-end=&quot;794&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;796&quot; data-end=&quot;825&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;799&quot; data-end=&quot;825&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;826&quot; data-end=&quot;1598&quot;&gt