to cloud-native technologies &amp;amp; observability tools&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2376&quot; data-end=&quot;2439&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2378&quot; data-end=&quot;2439&quot;&gt;Excellent career growth and skill enhancement opportunities&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2440&quot; data-end=&quot;2487&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2442&quot; data-end=&quot;2487&quot;&gt;Collaborative and innovation-driven culture&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2488&quot; data-end=&quot;2544&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2490&quot; data-end=&quot;2544&quot;&gt;Competitive compensation &amp;amp; performance-based rewards&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2545&quot; data-end=&quot;2604&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2547&quot; data-end=&quot;2604&quot;&gt;Long-term project stability and global team interaction&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Maharashtra'),('f3091091-2d4e-4b6a-811d-0e4a08798385','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','IT Support Analyst – Kinaxis RapidResponse / Maestro','it-support-analyst-kinaxis-rapidresponse-maestro-352-352','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;94&quot; data-end=&quot;429&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;120&quot; data-end=&quot;153&quot;&gt;IT Support Analysts &amp;ndash; Kinaxis&lt;/strong&gt; for a leading Top MNC to support enterprise-scale Supply Chain Planning and Digital Transformation initiatives. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in Kinaxis RapidResponse / Maestro, supply chain planning, application support, and ITIL-based service management.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;431&quot; data-end=&quot;871&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for supporting, maintaining, and troubleshooting Kinaxis RapidResponse / Maestro applications used for enterprise supply chain planning and decision-making. The role includes supporting demand planning, supply planning, inventory optimization, Sales &amp;amp; Operations Planning (S&amp;amp;OP), resolving application incidents, analyzing root causes, supporting data integrations, and ensuring smooth business operations.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;873&quot; data-end=&quot;1235&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with Kinaxis RapidResponse / Maestro, ITIL processes, supply chain planning, demand planning, supply planning, inventory management, S&amp;amp;OP, SQL, data integration, and application support. Strong analytical and problem-solving skills, along with experience working with global enterprise clients, are highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1237&quot; data-end=&quot;1614&quot;&gt;The role also involves collaborating with supply chain business users, IT teams, application owners, technical teams, and global stakeholders to resolve incidents, implement enhancements, manage service requests, and maintain application stability. Candidates should possess strong communication, stakeholder management, troubleshooting, analytical, and problem-solving skills.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Pune',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-09 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-08-11 02:58:40.000000','2026-08-11 02:58:40.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Data Integration\", \"Demand Forecasting\", \"NoSQL\", \"Root Cause Analysis (RCA)\", \"Supply Chain Management\", \"ITIL framework\", \"Kinaxis RapidResponse\", \"Kinaxis Maestro\", \"Kinaxis Application Support\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1630&quot; data-end=&quot;1668&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1b15olh&quot; data-start=&quot;1669&quot; data-end=&quot;1759&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale Supply Chain Planning and Digital Transformation projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1pxfh92&quot; data-start=&quot;1760&quot; data-end=&quot;1820&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience with Kinaxis RapidResponse / Maestro&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1t06ccf&quot; data-start=&quot;1821&quot; data-end=&quot;1911&quot;&gt;Career growth in Supply Chain IT, Planning Systems, and Enterprise Application Support&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1umbggs&quot; data-start=&quot;1912&quot; data-end=&quot;1988&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global supply chain and technology teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;5smgwd&quot; data-start=&quot;1989&quot; data-end=&quot;2053&quot;&gt;Exposure to multiple industry domains and enterprise client&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Maharashtra'),('f33e47e5-f0a6-4744-a261-6f8562c62bf6','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Beamex CMX Specialist / SolidWorks Support Analyst','beamex-cmx-specialist-solidworks-support-analyst-353-353','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;92&quot; data-end=&quot;487&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;118&quot; data-end=&quot;174&quot;&gt;Beamex CMX Specialists / SolidWorks Support Analysts&lt;/strong&gt; for a leading Top MNC to support enterprise engineering, calibration management, CAD/PDM, and regulated manufacturing environments. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;359&quot; data-end=&quot;486&quot;&gt;SolidWorks application support, SolidWorks PDM administration, Beamex CMX Calibration, and Computer System Validation (CSV)&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;489&quot; data-end=&quot;916&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for providing L2/L3 technical support for SolidWorks applications, troubleshooting modeling, assembly, drawing, licensing, compatibility, and performance-related issues, and managing SolidWorks PDM environments. The role also includes software installation, configuration, upgrades, user access management, CAD data management, revision control, technical documentation, and end-user training.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;918&quot; data-end=&quot;1263&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;969&quot; data-end=&quot;1111&quot;&gt;SolidWorks, SolidWorks PDM, Beamex CMX, CSV, CAD data management, Windows environments, software deployment, and technical troubleshooting&lt;/strong&gt;. Strong understanding of engineering design workflows, CAD standards, templates, PLM/PDM processes, and manufacturing environments is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1265&quot; data-end=&quot;1666&quot;&gt;The role also involves collaborating with engineering teams, IT support teams, application owners, vendors, and business stakeholders to resolve technical issues, maintain application availability, implement software changes, and support enterprise engineering operations. Candidates should possess strong analytical, communication, stakeholder management, troubleshooting, and problem-solving skills.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Pune',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-09 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-08-11 03:12:54.000000','2026-08-11 03:12:54.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"CSV\", \"L2 Application Support\", \"Beamex CMX\", \"SolidWorks\", \"SolidWorks Application Support\", \"SolidWorks PDM\", \"SolidWorks PDM Administration\", \"Beamex CMX Calibration\", \"CAD Data Management\", \"CAD Revision Control\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1682&quot; data-end=&quot;1720&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;9g8c1s&quot; data-start=&quot;1721&quot; data-end=&quot;1814&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale Engineering IT, CAD/PDM, and Calibration Management projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\