0&quot; data-end=&quot;762&quot;&gt;engineering, operations, cybersecurity, automation, and digital transformation&lt;/strong&gt; to deliver secure, scalable, and high-performing enterprise applications.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-25 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-08-27 02:39:53.000000','2026-08-27 02:39:53.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Angular\", \"API Integration\", \"Azure Cloud Networking\", \"DevOps\", \"Github\", \"Java\", \"Microservices Architectures\", \"REST API\", \"Spring Boot\", \"SonarQube\", \"CI/CD\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;851&quot; data-end=&quot;898&quot; data-section-id=&quot;rdheb3&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a leading global MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;899&quot; data-end=&quot;975&quot; data-section-id=&quot;wv7j07&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale &lt;strong data-start=&quot;930&quot; data-end=&quot;975&quot;&gt;cloud and digital transformation projects&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;976&quot; data-end=&quot;1059&quot; data-section-id=&quot;3bjg6i&quot;&gt;Work with modern technologies including &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1018&quot; data-end=&quot;1059&quot;&gt;Java, Spring Boot, Angular, and Azure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1060&quot; data-end=&quot;1123&quot; data-section-id=&quot;sclcb3&quot;&gt;Opportunity to contribute to architecture and solution design&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1124&quot; data-end=&quot;1185&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1br1c3e&quot;&gt;Exposure to DevOps, CI/CD, monitoring, and cloud deployment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1186&quot; data-end=&quot;1253&quot; data-section-id=&quot;xvaclq&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with emerging &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1222&quot; data-end=&quot;1253&quot;&gt;AI development accelerators&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1254&quot; data-end=&quot;1305&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1rt07v0&quot;&gt;Collaboration with multidisciplinary global teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1306&quot; data-end=&quot;1372&quot; data-section-id=&quot;oc64q0&quot;&gt;Career growth across software engineering and cloud technologies&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1373&quot; data-end=&quot;1457&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1me3ktf&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on performance, scalability, and cost optimization initiatives&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('f3a55558-9a72-4e5f-bba7-6eafe2a8aafe','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','SAP DM / SAP BTP Developer','sap-dm-sap-btp-developer-313-313','&lt;p data-start=&quot;68&quot; data-end=&quot;415&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced SAP DM / SAP BTP Developers for a leading Top MNC to work on enterprise-scale Smart Manufacturing and Digital Transformation projects. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in SAP Digital Manufacturing (SAP DM/DMC), SAP Business Technology Platform (SAP BTP), SAP UI5, and cloud-native application development.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;417&quot; data-end=&quot;820&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for designing, developing, deploying, and supporting SAP Digital Manufacturing solutions and SAP BTP applications based on business and manufacturing requirements. The role includes developing custom SAP DM plugins, CAP services, SAP UI5 applications, and cloud-native solutions while ensuring scalability, performance, and seamless integration with enterprise systems.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;822&quot; data-end=&quot;1168&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with SAP DM, SAP BTP, SAP UI5, JavaScript, Node.js, CAP Framework, SAP Business Application Studio (BAS), SQL, and manufacturing data configuration. Strong understanding of SAP cloud technologies, application architecture, API integrations, and enterprise manufacturing processes is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1170&quot; data-end=&quot;1587&quot;&gt;The role also involves participating in solution design workshops, collaborating with business users, technical teams, and global stakeholders, mentoring junior developers, and supporting implementation, deployment, and enhancement activities. Candidates should possess strong analytical, communication, troubleshooting, and problem-solving skills with a passion for delivering innovative SAP manufacturing solutions.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Entry',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Pune',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-08-24 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-06-26 03:43:00.000000','2026-06-26 03:43:00.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"JavaScript\", \"MYSQL\", \"Node.JS\", \"PL/SQL\", \"REST API\", \"SAP\", \"SAP BW\", \"SAP Hana\", \"Sap UI5\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1603&quot; data-end=&quot;1641&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;5xs02m&quot; data-start=&quot;1642&quot; data-end=&quot;1709&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale SAP Digital Manufacturing projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;s216jm&quot; data-start=&quot;1710&quot; data-end=&quot;1772&quot;&gt;Work on cutting-edge SAP BTP and cloud-native technologies&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1wfxilv&quot; data-start=&quot;1773&quot; data-end=&quot;1843&quot;&gt;Career growth in SAP Manufacturing &amp;amp; Digital Transformation domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;fm4t10&quot; data-start=&quot;1844&quot; data-end=&quot;1921&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global SAP consultants and business teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot; data-start=&quot;1922&quot; data-end=&quot;1977&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;1978&quot; data-end=&quot;2021&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Maharashtra'),('f3b700d1-3375-4984-9b1a-b1afe2261f97','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Opcenter Execution Core Designer','opcenter-execution-core-designer-304-304','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;74&quot; data-end=&quot;389&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced Opcenter Execution Core Designers for a leading Top MNC to work on enterprise-scale Manufacturing Execution System (MES) projects. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in Siemens Opcenter Execution Core, .NET technologies, SQL Server, and manufacturing application development.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;391&quot; data-end=&quot;728&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for designing, developing, enhancing, and supporting Opcenter Execution Core applications for manufacturing environments. The role includes implementing business logic using CLF and CDO frameworks, supporting system integrations, optimizing application performance, and ensuring reliable MES operations.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;730&quot; data-end=&quot;1034&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with .NET, C#, MVC Framework, MS SQL Server, stored procedures, database optimization, API development, and system integration activities. Strong knowledge of GIT version control, technical documentation, and ITIL-based support processes is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1036&quot; data-end=&quot;1389&quot;&gt;The role also involves incident resolution, bug fixing, performance tuning, deployment support, requirement analysis, and collaboration with business and functional teams. Candidates should possess strong analytical, troubleshooting, communication, and problem-solving skills with the ability to work independently in complex manufacturing environments.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-08-23 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-06-25 02:36:25.000000','2026-06-25 02:36:25.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\".NET\", \"API Integration\", \"C#\", \"ITIL\", \"MS SQL Server\", \"MVC\", \"Siemens Opcenter\", \"SQL Server\", \"Change Control Management\", \"Opcenter MDD\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1405&quot; data-end=&quot;1443&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1qqs5nn&quot; data-start=&quot;1444&quot; data-end=&quot;1506&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale Siemens Opcenter MES projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;16fr91r&quot; data-start=&quot;1507&quot; data-end=&quot;1595&quot;&gt;Work on advanced Manufacturing Execution Systems and Smart Manufacturing initiatives&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1kmt4tx&quot; data-start=&quot;1596&quot; data-end=&quot;1658&quot;&gt;Career growth in MES &amp;amp; Manufacturing Digitalization domain&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;13qji02&quot; data-start=&quot;1659&quot; data-end=&quot;1736&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global manufacturing and technology teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot; data-start=&quot;1737&quot; data-end=&quot;1792&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;1793&quot; data-end=&quot;1836&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('f3eafb1a-99d6-4ac5-a978-ff4e34d2a248','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Software Engineer - Android Developer (Fresher)','software-engineer-android-developer-fresher-102-102','We are hiring Android Developer Freshers for our Bangalore office. This role is ideal for recent graduates who are passionate about building mobile applications and want to start their career in Android app development.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Assist in designing, coding, testing, and maintaining Android applications.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Write clean, efficient, and maintainable code in Java/Kotlin.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional teams to define, design, and deliver features.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Debug and fix issues to improve application performance.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Stay updated with the latest Android trends and tools.','Information Technology','Contract','Executive',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-19 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-09-17 10:37:13.000000','2025-11-21 00:44:26.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Android\", \"Android SDK\", \"Firebase\", \"Git Version Control\", \"Good Communication\", \"Java\", \"JSON\", \"KOTLIN\", \"Material Specification\", \"OOPS\", \"Problem Solving\", \"Push\", \"RESTFUL APIS\", \"SQLITE\", \"Teamwork\", \"UI-UX\", \"Visual Studio\", \"XML Creation\"]','[\"Opportunity to work with a Top MNC and global teams.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Hands-on training with real-time projects.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Guidance and mentorship from experienced developers.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Competitive salary with career growth opportunities.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Collaborative, learning-friendly work environment.\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('f43df5ee-ffc9-4eb6-a6d1-e7c65567a6d7','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Systems Engineer – MES','systems-engineer-mes-390-390','&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an experienced Senior SCADA Engineer to join a high-tech battery manufacturing facility and lead the design, development, integration, commissioning, and support of advanced SCADA and industrial automation systems. The role will involve working on large-scale plant automation environments with strong exposure to SCADA, PLC, BMS, data acquisition, and smart factory technologies.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate should have strong hands-on expertise in Ignition SCADA, PLC systems, Siemens TIA Portal, Rockwell Automation, Beckhoff TwinCAT, and Omron Sysmac. The candidate will be responsible for developing robust SCADA and PLC architectures and managing the complete automation lifecycle, including design, FAT, SAT, commissioning, integration, handover, and production support.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;The role will also involve leading SCADA vendor technical scope, system integration, implementation, diagnostics, alarm management, and real-time monitoring. The engineer will work closely with Process, Facilities, EHS, Quality, and other plant engineering teams to ensure reliable and effective automation across the manufacturing facility.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-11-18 07:00:00',0,0,'2026-09-19 17:23:35.000000','2026-09-19 17:23:35.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Ignition\", \"PLC\", \"SCADA\", \"Siemens\", \"OPC UA\"]','[\"&lt;p&gt;Opportunity to work with a leading Top MNC&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p&gt;Exposure to next-generation battery manufacturing automation&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p&gt;Work on large-scale SCADA and PLC systems&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p&gt;Hands-on experience with Ignition SCADA and multiple PLC platforms&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p&gt;Exposure to Smart Factory / Industry 4.0 initiatives&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p&gt;Opportunity to work with BMS and plant automation systems&lt;/p&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('f46c7644-eca6-48ae-8715-07f6690f8f57','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Institutional Business Development Manager','institutional-business-development-manager-131-131','&lt;p data-start=&quot;240&quot; data-end=&quot;804&quot;&gt;We are hiring a dynamic and self-driven &lt;strong data-start=&quot;280&quot; data-end=&quot;326&quot;&gt;Institutional Business Development Manager&lt;/strong&gt; to join our growing team. The ideal candidate will have a strong background in Sales &amp;amp; Marketing and will be responsible for driving B2B and institutional partnerships. You will plan and execute marketing and networking strategies, manage promotional and digital marketing campaigns for exhibitions, and support the business development team in identifying new growth opportunities. This is a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;720&quot; data-end=&quot;751&quot;&gt;full-time office-based role&lt;/strong&gt; with no field work. Immediate joiners are preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;hr data-start=&quot;806&quot; data-end=&quot;809&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;811&quot; data-end=&quot;840&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;814&quot; data-end=&quot;840&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;841&quot; data-end=&quot;1405&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;841&quot; data-end=&quot;922&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;843&quot; data-end=&quot;922&quot;&gt;Develop and execute &lt;strong data-start=&quot;863&quot; data-end=&quot;920&quot;&gt;B2B networking and institutional marketing strategies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;923&quot; data-end=&quot;994&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;925&quot; data-end=&quot;994&quot;&gt;Collaborate with internal teams to support key business initiatives&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;995&quot; data-end=&quot;1076&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;997&quot; data-end=&quot;1076&quot;&gt;Manage promotional activities and &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1031&quot; data-end=&quot;1058&quot;&gt;digital media campaigns&lt;/strong&gt; for exhibitions&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1077&quot; data-end=&quot;1150&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1079&quot; data-end=&quot;1150&quot;&gt;Conduct market and client research to identify business opportunities&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1151&quot; data-end=&quot;1211&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1153&quot; data-end=&quot;1211&quot;&gt;Maintain strong relationships with institutional clients&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1212&quot; data-end=&quot;1266&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1214&quot; data-end=&quot;1266&quot;&gt;Assist in brand positioning and marketing planning&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1267&quot; data-end=&quot;1341&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1269&quot; data-end=&quot;1341&quot;&gt;Prepare reports, presentations, and business development documentation&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1342&quot; data-end=&quot;1405&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1344&quot; data-end=&quot;1405&quot;&gt;Work closely with senior management to drive revenue growth&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Gurugram',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-19 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-11-21 05:52:36.000000','2025-11-21 05:52:36.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"B2B\", \"Business Development\", \"Communication\", \"Marketing\", \"MS Excel\", \"MS Office\", \"Negotiation\", \"Networking\", \"Sales\", \"Word\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1940&quot; data-end=&quot;2010&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1942&quot; data-end=&quot;2010&quot;&gt;Opportunity to grow in a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1967&quot; data-end=&quot;2008&quot;&gt;fast-paced and expanding organization&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2011&quot; data-end=&quot;2082&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2013&quot; data-end=&quot;2082&quot;&gt;Work in a strategic role driving B2B and institutional partnerships&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2083&quot; data-end=&quot;2137&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2085&quot; data-end=&quot;2137&quot;&gt;Full-time &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2095&quot; data-end=&quot;2116&quot;&gt;office-based role&lt;/strong&gt; with no field work&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2138&quot; data-end=&quot;2193&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2140&quot; data-end=&quot;2193&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and performance-based incentives&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2194&quot; data-end=&quot;2252&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2196&quot; data-end=&quot;2252&quot;&gt;Exposure to marketing, branding, and digital campaigns&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2253&quot; data-end=&quot;2302&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2255&quot; data-end=&quot;2302&quot;&gt;Supportive and collaborative work environment&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2303&quot; data-end=&quot;2352&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2305&quot; data-end=&quot;2352&quot;&gt;Career development and learning opportunities&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2353&quot; data-end=&quot;2395&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2355&quot; data-end=&quot;2395&quot;&gt;Quick onboarding for immediate joiners&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Haryana'),('f4b82c7a-38f8-48e0-887c-4689108b21d1','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Empower Global CDS Specialist','empower-global-cds-specialist-333-333','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;71&quot; data-end=&quot;442&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced Empower Global CDS Specialists for a leading Top MNC to support enterprise laboratory informatics and global Chromatography Data System (CDS) initiatives. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in Waters Empower CDS, laboratory informatics, system administration, validation, and regulated pharmaceutical or life sciences environments.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;444&quot; data-end=&quot;814&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for administering, configuring, supporting, and maintaining Waters Empower CDS across global laboratory sites. The role includes user management, access control, system configuration, production support, troubleshooting, software upgrades, validation activities, and ensuring system availability, performance, and regulatory compliance.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;816&quot; data-end=&quot;1166&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with Waters Empower CDS, Chromatography Data Systems (CDS), Computer System Validation (CSV), ELN, SQL, Java, and laboratory informatics solutions. Strong knowledge of GxP regulations, 21 CFR Part 11, data integrity principles, laboratory workflows, and enterprise laboratory systems is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1168&quot; data-end=&quot;1672&quot;&gt;The role also involves collaborating with QA, QC, laboratory users, IT teams, and business stakeholders to support global Empower deployments, system integrations, compliance initiatives, and continuous improvement projects. Candidates will prepare validation documents, SOPs, user guides, conduct end-user training, and ensure seamless integration with LIMS, ELN, ERP, and other laboratory applications. Strong analytical, communication, stakeholder management, and problem-solving skills are essential.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-09-11 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-07-14 02:27:04.000000','2026-07-14 02:27:04.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"CSV\", \"Gxp Compliance\", \"Java\", \"OQ\", \"PQ\", \"SQL\", \"User Administration\", \"Electronic Lab Notebook (ELN)\", \"21 CFR Part 11\", \"Waters Empower\", \"Chromatography Data Systems (CDS)\", \"Waters Empower CDS\", \"Empower Administration\", \"ALCOA+\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1688&quot; data-end=&quot;1726&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;dszjsj&quot; data-start=&quot;1727&quot; data-end=&quot;1798&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale Global Laboratory Informatics projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1nr0t53&quot; data-start=&quot;1799&quot; data-end=&quot;1879&quot;&gt;Work with advanced Waters Empower CDS and Laboratory Automation technologies&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1vr270j&quot; data-start=&quot;1880&quot; data-end=&quot;1959&quot;&gt;Career growth in Laboratory Informatics &amp;amp; Chromatography Data Systems (CDS)&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1dbe3vl&quot; data-start=&quot;1960&quot; data-end=&quot;2034&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global laboratory and technology teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;2lee9a&quot; data-start=&quot;2035&quot; data-end=&quot;2090&quot;&gt;Professional and compliance-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;2091&quot; data-end=&quot;2134&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('f4f872b1-ffad-4db2-9a59-46c89c159c62','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Azure Data Engineer','azure-data-engineer-65-65','&lt;p data-start=&quot;162&quot; data-end=&quot;385&quot;&gt;Are you an experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;185&quot; data-end=&quot;208&quot;&gt;Azure Data Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; with expertise in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;227&quot; data-end=&quot;271&quot;&gt;PySpark, Databricks, and Azure Data Lake&lt;/strong&gt;? Join our team to work on cutting-edge &lt;strong data-start=&quot;311&quot; data-end=&quot;333&quot;&gt;Big Data solutions&lt;/strong&gt; and help transform data into actionable insights!&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;387&quot; data-end=&quot;414&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;387&quot; data-end=&quot;412&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-star