d governance standards.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;hr data-start=&quot;547&quot; data-end=&quot;550&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;552&quot; data-end=&quot;579&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;555&quot; data-end=&quot;579&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;580&quot; data-end=&quot;1265&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;580&quot; data-end=&quot;648&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;582&quot; data-end=&quot;648&quot;&gt;Develop, deploy, and maintain &lt;strong data-start=&quot;612&quot; data-end=&quot;646&quot;&gt;Rockwell FTPC MES applications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;649&quot; data-end=&quot;713&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;651&quot; data-end=&quot;713&quot;&gt;Analyze FTPC functionalities and propose system improvements&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;714&quot; data-end=&quot;786&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;716&quot; data-end=&quot;786&quot;&gt;Debug and resolve issues related to data gaps or application defects&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;787&quot; data-end=&quot;863&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;789&quot; data-end=&quot;863&quot;&gt;Perform unit testing to ensure reliability of newly developed components&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;864&quot; data-end=&quot;931&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;866&quot; data-end=&quot;931&quot;&gt;Support customer teams during &lt;strong data-start=&quot;896&quot; data-end=&quot;929&quot;&gt;QA and Production deployments&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;932&quot; data-end=&quot;992&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;934&quot; data-end=&quot;992&quot;&gt;Resolve post-deployment defects and enhancement requests&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;993&quot; data-end=&quot;1047&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;995&quot; data-end=&quot;1047&quot;&gt;Ensure timely delivery with high quality standards&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1048&quot; data-end=&quot;1111&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1050&quot; data-end=&quot;1111&quot;&gt;Adhere to security, governance, and compliance requirements&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1112&quot; data-end=&quot;1190&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1114&quot; data-end=&quot;1190&quot;&gt;Understand and align with existing customer architecture and MES landscape&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1191&quot; data-end=&quot;1265&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1193&quot; data-end=&quot;1265&quot;&gt;Develop and optimize &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1214&quot; data-end=&quot;1236&quot;&gt;SQL Server queries&lt;/strong&gt; for MES application design&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Pune',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-03-17 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-01-16 18:34:53.000000','2026-01-16 18:34:53.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Debugging Skills\", \"Mes\", \"SQL Server\", \"Troubleshooting\", \"Unit Testing\", \"Rockwell Factorytalk\", \"Rockwell FTPS\"]','[\"&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1837&quot; data-end=&quot;2124&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1837&quot; data-end=&quot;1904&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1839&quot; data-end=&quot;1904&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1862&quot; data-end=&quot;1902&quot;&gt;enterprise-level MES implementations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1905&quot; data-end=&quot;1970&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1907&quot; data-end=&quot;1970&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1932&quot; data-end=&quot;1968&quot;&gt;Rockwell Automation technologies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1971&quot; data-end=&quot;2017&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1973&quot; data-end=&quot;2017&quot;&gt;Exposure to global manufacturing customers&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2018&quot; data-end=&quot;2072&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2020&quot; data-end=&quot;2072&quot;&gt;Stable project with long-term engagement potential&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2073&quot; data-end=&quot;2124&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2075&quot; data-end=&quot;2124&quot;&gt;Collaborative delivery-focused team environment&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Maharashtra'),('f56db03e-002c-4fe1-bbb2-56b57fdd27e2','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Senior React Native Developer','senior-react-native-developer-189-189','We are seeking an experienced Senior React Native Developer to design, develop, and maintain high-performance cross-platform mobile applications for iOS and Android. The role involves close collaboration with product, design, and backend teams to deliver scalable, secure, and user-friendly mobile solutions.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Design and develop cross-platform mobile apps using React Native&lt;br /&gt;Collaborate with designers, product managers, and backend teams&lt;br /&gt;Ensure application performance, quality, and responsiveness&lt;br /&gt;Integrate backend services and third-party libraries&lt;br /&gt;Review code and mentor junior developers&lt;br /&gt;Debug issues and optimize app performance&lt;br /&gt;Implement CI/CD pipelines for automated builds and deployments&lt;br /&gt;Stay updated with emerging mobile technologies and best practices','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Chennai',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-04-11 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-02-10 18:54:14.000000','2026-02-10 18:54:14.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Agile\", \"Github\", \"IOS\", \"Java\", \"JavaScript\", \"KOTLIN\", \"Objective C\", \"React Native\", \"Redux\", \"REST API\", \"Swift\", \"Typescript\", \"Scrum Master\", \"CI/CD\", \"State Management\", \"Jest\", \"GraphQL\"]','[\"