, scripting, SQL, and deep knowledge of pharma manufacturing processes like Batch Execution and EBR.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;hr data-start=&quot;836&quot; data-end=&quot;839&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h1 data-start=&quot;841&quot; data-end=&quot;868&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;843&quot; data-end=&quot;866&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;869&quot; data-end=&quot;1688&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;869&quot; data-end=&quot;996&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;871&quot; data-end=&quot;996&quot;&gt;Develop, customize &amp;amp; maintain integrations for MES platforms (Rockwell FTPS, Siemens Opcenter, Werum PAS-X, GE Plant Apps).&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;997&quot; data-end=&quot;1089&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;999&quot; data-end=&quot;1089&quot;&gt;Design and implement interfaces with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1036&quot; data-end=&quot;1062&quot;&gt;ERP, LIMS, SCADA, PLCs&lt;/strong&gt;, and middleware systems.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1090&quot; data-end=&quot;1179&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1092&quot; data-end=&quot;1179&quot;&gt;Develop workflows, recipes, and integration logic for pharma manufacturing workflows.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1180&quot; data-end=&quot;1272&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1182&quot; data-end=&quot;1272&quot;&gt;Build SQL queries, stored procedures &amp;amp; data transformation logic for integration layers.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1273&quot; data-end=&quot;1350&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1275&quot; data-end=&quot;1350&quot;&gt;Implement REST APIs, OPC UA communication, and event-driven integrations.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1351&quot; data-end=&quot;1447&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1353&quot; data-end=&quot;1447&quot;&gt;Collaborate with MES functional, IT, QA, and automation teams to ensure seamless operations.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1448&quot; data-end=&quot;1543&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1450&quot; data-end=&quot;1543&quot;&gt;Support interface validations, testing, documentation, and compliance activities (GMP/GxP).&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1544&quot; data-end=&quot;1625&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1546&quot; data-end=&quot;1625&quot;&gt;Troubleshoot integration issues and optimize performance across environments.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1626&quot; data-end=&quot;1688&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1628&quot; data-end=&quot;1688&quot;&gt;Contribute to Pharma 4.0 digital transformation initiatives.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Full-time','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-20 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-11-22 03:58:12.000000','2025-11-22 03:58:12.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"CSV\", \"ERP\", \"JavaScript\", \"Lims\", \"Mes\", \"Mes Gxp Compliance\", \"MES Integration\", \"Opcenter\", \"Pharma Industry\", \"Python\", \"SCADA\", \"SDLC\", \"Werum PAS-X\", \"OPC UA\", \"GMP\", \"Rockwell FTPS\", \"GE Plant Apps\", \"EBR\"]','[\"&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2782&quot; data-end=&quot;3232&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2782&quot; data-end=&quot;2869&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2784&quot; data-end=&quot;2869&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2811&quot; data-end=&quot;2829&quot;&gt;top global MNC&lt;/strong&gt; in Pharma &amp;amp; Industrial Digitalization&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2870&quot; data-end=&quot;2938&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2872&quot; data-end=&quot;2938&quot;&gt;Exposure to &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2884&quot; data-end=&quot;2936&quot;&gt;advanced MES platforms &amp;amp; enterprise integrations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2939&quot; data-end=&quot;3001&quot;&gt;\\r