 salary package with performance-based incentives&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;65&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;67&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;Health insurance coverage and statutory benefits (PF &amp;amp; Gratuity)&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;134&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;136&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on large-scale enterprise energy management projects&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;211&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;213&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;Strong career growth and learning opportunities&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;263&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;265&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;Collaborative and professional work environment&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('f77c98fe-438a-4479-bea0-51dfab82220b','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Senior Application Architect','senior-application-architect-160-160','&lt;p data-start=&quot;180&quot; data-end=&quot;786&quot;&gt;We are seeking a highly experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;216&quot; data-end=&quot;248&quot;&gt;Senior Application Architect&lt;/strong&gt; to lead the design and implementation of &lt;strong data-start=&quot;290&quot; data-end=&quot;345&quot;&gt;event-driven IoT data synchronization architectures&lt;/strong&gt;. This role focuses on migrating existing solutions from &lt;strong data-start=&quot;402&quot; data-end=&quot;434&quot;&gt;Azure to AWS-native services&lt;/strong&gt;, implementing &lt;strong data-start=&quot;449&quot; data-end=&quot;495&quot;&gt;serverless and containerized architectures&lt;/strong&gt;, and modernizing infrastructure across &lt;strong data-start=&quot;535&quot; data-end=&quot;566&quot;&gt;cloud and edge environments&lt;/strong&gt;. The ideal candidate will have deep expertise in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;616&quot; data-end=&quot;686&quot;&gt;AWS services, infrastructure as code, and multi-region deployments&lt;/strong&gt;, and will provide technical leadership across all stages of architecture design and implementation.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;hr data-start=&quot;788&quot; data-end=&quot;791&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;793&quot; data-end=&quot;824&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;798&quot; data-end=&quot;822&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;825&quot; data-end=&quot;1522&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;825&quot; data-end=&quot;910&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;827&quot; data-end=&quot;910&quot;&gt;Lead architecture design for &lt;strong data-start=&quot;856&quot; data-end=&quot;897&quot;&gt;event-driven IoT data synchronization&lt;/strong&gt; solutions.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;911&quot; data-end=&quot;1020&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;913&quot; data-end=&quot;1020&quot;&gt;Drive &lt;strong data-start=&quot;919&quot; data-end=&quot;966&quot;&gt;migration from Azure to AWS-native services&lt;/strong&gt; such as AppSync, Aurora PostgreSQL, Step Functions.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1021&quot; data-end=&quot;1117&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1023&quot; data-end=&quot;1117&quot;&gt;Design and implement &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1044&quot; data-end=&quot;1072&quot;&gt;serverless architectures&lt;/strong&gt; using AWS Lambda and event-driven systems.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1118&quot; data-end=&quot;1200&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1120&quot; data-end=&quot;1200&quot;&gt;Ensure &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1127&quot; data-end=&quot;1170&quot;&gt;security, observability, and compliance&lt;/strong&gt; across all cloud solutions.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1201&quot; data-end=&quot;1301&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1203&quot; data-end=&quot;1301&quot;&gt;Lead &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1208&quot; data-end=&quot;1240&quot;&gt;infrastructure modernization&lt;/strong&gt; using IaC, API modernization, and containerized solutions.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1302&quot; data-end=&quot;1381&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1304&quot; data-end=&quot;1381&quot;&gt;Support &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1312&quot; data-end=&quot;1378&quot;&gt;edge computing, data replication, and multi-region deployments&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1382&quot; data-end=&quot;1457&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1384&quot; data-end=&quot;1457&quot;&gt;Provide architectural oversight during &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1423&quot; data-end=&quot;1454&quot;&gt;UAT and production launches&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1458&quot; data-end=&quot;1522&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1460&quot; data-end=&quot;1522&quot;&gt;Mentor technical teams and guide best architectural practices.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-02-02 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-12-05 04:29:31.000000','2025-12-05 04:29:31.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"API Design\", \"AWS Lambda\", \"Azure\", \"Cloud Architect\", \"Containerization\", \"TerraForm\", \"AWS AppSync\", \"AWS Step Functions\", \"Aurora PostgreSQL\", \"AWS CloudFormation\", \"Serverless Architecture\", \"Modernization\", \"IoT Data Pipelines\", \"Security Frameworks\", \"AWS Migration\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2632&quot; data-end=&quot;2676&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2634&quot; data-end=&quot;2676&quot;&gt;Competitive Salary (Based on Experience)&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2677&quot; data-end=&quot