ionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;100&quot; data-end=&quot;507&quot;&gt;We are looking for an experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;134&quot; data-end=&quot;159&quot;&gt;Senior SCADA Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; to join a high-tech &lt;strong data-start=&quot;180&quot; data-end=&quot;214&quot;&gt;battery manufacturing facility&lt;/strong&gt; and lead the design, development, integration, commissioning, and support of advanced SCADA and industrial automation systems. The role will involve working on large-scale plant automation environments with strong exposure to SCADA, PLC, BMS, data acquisition, and smart factory technologies.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;509&quot; data-end=&quot;905&quot;&gt;The ideal candidate should have strong hands-on expertise in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;570&quot; data-end=&quot;678&quot;&gt;Ignition SCADA, PLC systems, Siemens TIA Portal, Rockwell Automation, Beckhoff TwinCAT, and Omron Sysmac&lt;/strong&gt;. The candidate will be responsible for developing robust SCADA and PLC architectures and managing the complete automation lifecycle, including &lt;strong data-start=&quot;822&quot; data-end=&quot;904&quot;&gt;design, FAT, SAT, commissioning, integration, handover, and production support&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;907&quot; data-end=&quot;1252&quot;&gt;The role will also involve leading &lt;strong data-start=&quot;942&quot; data-end=&quot;1067&quot;&gt;SCADA vendor technical scope, system integration, implementation, diagnostics, alarm management, and real-time monitoring&lt;/strong&gt;. The engineer will work closely with Process, Facilities, EHS, Quality, and other plant engineering teams to ensure reliable and effective automation across the manufacturing facility.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Surat',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-11-10 07:00:00',0,0,'2026-09-12 01:23:14.000000','2026-09-12 01:23:14.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Ignition\", \"Industrial