nt with a key focus on backend services, database design, optimization, and system integration. The role involves working on enterprise-grade applications such as SiGAC, Tririga, and ICHEM, supporting their development, testing, and maintenance. You will also manage source control using GitHub, run integration test cases, troubleshoot database issues, and ensure high-quality, performance-optimized solutions.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;hr data-start=&quot;739&quot; data-end=&quot;742&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;744&quot; data-end=&quot;774&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;750&quot; data-end=&quot;774&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;775&quot; data-end=&quot;1274&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;775&quot; data-end=&quot;850&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;777&quot; data-end=&quot;850&quot;&gt;Full-stack development with strong focus on backend and database layers&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;851&quot; data-end=&quot;938&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;853&quot; data-end=&quot;938&quot;&gt;Support development, testing, and sustaining activities for enterprise applications&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;939&quot; data-end=&quot;1005&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;941&quot; data-end=&quot;1005&quot;&gt;Manage source control using GitHub and ensure coding standards&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1006&quot; data-end=&quot;1073&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1008&quot; data-end=&quot;1073&quot;&gt;Design, develop, and optimize SAP HANA and PostgreSQL databases&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1074&quot; data-end=&quot;1141&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1076&quot; data-end=&quot;1141&quot;&gt;Execute integration testing and resolve database-related issues&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1142&quot; data-end=&quot;1214&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1144&quot; data-end=&quot;1214&quot;&gt;Understand third-party systems, business processes, and integrations&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1215&quot; data-end=&quot;1274&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1217&quot; data-end=&quot;1274&quot;&gt;Perform database troubleshooting and performance tuning&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Full-time','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-02-06 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-12-08 16:40:59.000000','2025-12-08 16:40:59.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\".NET CORE\", \".NET Framework\", \"AWS\", \"Azure\", \"C#\", \"Cloud\", \"Entity Framework\", \"Github\", \"Optimization\", \"PostgreSQL\", \"SAP Hana\", \"SQL\", \"Web API\", \"Database Design\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1818&quot; data-end=&quot;1859&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1820&quot; data-end=&quot;1859&quot;&gt;Work on enterprise-level applications&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1860&quot; data-end=&quot;1916&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1862&quot; data-end=&quot;1916&quot;&gt;Exposure to modern backend and database technologies&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1917&quot; data-end=&quot;1961&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1919&quot; data-end=&quot;1961&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with cloud platforms&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1962&quot; data-end=&quot;2008&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1964&quot; data-end=&quot;2008&quot;&gt;Career growth and leadership opportunities&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2009&quot; data-end=&quot;2056&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2011&quot; data-end=&quot;2056&quot;&gt;Collaborative professional work environment&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('f8431965-8b32-4f39-ae58-e2850be48fef','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','IAM & PKI Specialist (Network & OT Security)','iam-pki-specialist-network-ot-security-186-186','&lt;p data-start=&quot;224&quot; data-end=&quot;595&quot;&gt;We are looking for an experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;258&quot; data-end=&quot;282&quot;&gt;IAM &amp;amp; PKI Specialist&lt;/strong&gt; with strong expertise in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;308&quot; data-end=&quot;335&quot;&gt;network and OT security&lt;/strong&gt; to design, review, and validate secure network architectures. The role focuses on &lt;strong data-start=&quot;418&quot; data-end=&quot;523&quot;&gt;firewalls, ACLs, network segmentation, secure WAN/VPN connectivity, and IEC-aligned security controls&lt;/strong&gt;, ensuring compliance and high availability in critical OT environments.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;605&quot; data-end=&quot;629&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;630&quot; data-end=&quot;1383&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;630&quot; data-end=&quot;717&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;632&quot; data-end=&quot;717&quot;&gt;Design and review &lt;strong data-start=&quot;650&quot; data-end=&quot;680&quot;&gt;firewall and ACL baselines&lt;/strong&gt; aligned with security architecture&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;718&quot; data-end=&quot;786&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;720&quot; data-end=&quot;786&quot;&gt;Implement and validate &lt;strong data-start=&quot;743&quot; data-end=&quot;767&quot;&gt;network segmentation&lt;/strong&gt; (VLAN, VPN, DMZ)&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;787&quot; data-end=&quot;864&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;789&quot; data-end=&quot;864&quot;&gt;Support &lt;strong data-start=&quot;797&quot; data-end=&quot;833&quot;&gt;secure WAN/MPLS/VPN connectivity&lt;/strong&gt; and remote access governance&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;865&quot; data-end=&quot;932&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;867&quot; data-end=&quot;932&quot;&gt;Validate &lt;strong data-start=&quot;876&quot; data-end=&quot;910&quot;&gt;inter-zone communication flows&lt;/strong&gt; and DMZ enforcement&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;933&quot; data-end=&quot;995&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;935&quot; data-end=&quot;995&quot;&gt;Enable &lt;strong data-start=&quot;942&quot; data-end=&quot;973&quot;&gt;logging and SIEM onboarding&lt;/strong&gt; for network devices&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;996&quot; data-end=&quot;1077&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;998&quot; data-end=&quot;1077&quot;&gt;Troubleshoot network issues across &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1033&quot; data-end=&quot;1075&quot;&gt;L2/L3 switches, routers, and firewalls&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1078&quot; data-end=&quot;1150&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1080&quot; data-end=&quot;1150&quot;&gt;Maintain firewall rule sets, baselines, and &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1124&quot; data-end=&quot;1148&quot;&gt;change documentation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1151&quot; data-end=&quot;1215&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1153&quot; data-end=&quot;1215&quot;&gt;Collaborate with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1170&quot; data-end=&quot;1213&quot;&gt;OT architects, OEMs, and customer teams&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1216&quot; data-end=&quot;1291&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1218&quot; data-end=&quot;1291&quot;&gt;Align network configurations with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1252&quot; data-end=&quot;1279&quot;&gt;IEC 62443 and IEC 62351&lt;/strong&gt; standards&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1292&quot; data-end=&quot;1383&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1294&quot; data-end=&quot;1383&quot;&gt;Operate within &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1309&quot; data-end=&quot;1346&quot;&gt;high-availability OT environments&lt;/strong&gt; following strict change management&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Hyderabad',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-04-10 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-02-09 18:12:21.000000','2026-02-09 18:12:21.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"CCNA\", \"CCNP\", \"Cisco Routers\", \"Fortinet\", \"Network ACL Management\", \"SCADA\", \"VPN\", \"VLAN\", \"TLS\", \"OEM\", \"IEC 62443\", \"IEC 62351\", \"DMZ\", \"OT network\", \"IPsec\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2646&quot; data-end=&quot;2722&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2648&quot; data-end=&quot;2722&quot;&gt;High-impact role in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2668&quot; data-end=&quot;2720&quot;&gt;critical OT and industrial security environments&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2723&quot; data-end=&quot;2797&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2725&quot; data-end=&quot;2797&quot;&gt;Hands-on ownership of &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2747&quot; data-end=&quot;2795&quot;&gt;network security architecture and governance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2798&quot; data-end=&quot;2877&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2800&quot; data-end=&quot;2877&quot;&gt;Exposure to &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2812&quot; data-end=&quot;2875&quot;&gt;international OT security standards (IEC 62443 / IEC 62351)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2878&quot; data-end=&quot;2947&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2880&quot; data-end=&quot;2947&quot;&gt;Collaboration with &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2899&quot; data-end=&quot;2945&quot;&gt;OEMs, architects, and enterprise customers&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2948&quot; data-end=&quot;3028&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2950&quot; data-end=&quot;3028&quot;&gt;Strong career growth in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2974&quot; data-end=&quot;3026&quot;&gt;OT cybersecurity and network security leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Telangana'),('f906d395-c51d-4cc9-8492-eb9fff078a87','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','SAP BTP Architect','sap-btp-architect-94-94','About the Role:&lt;br /&gt;We are looking for a highly skilled and motivated SAP BTP Architect with 12&amp;ndash;16 years of experience. The ideal candidate will have strong expertise in SAP BTP technologies such as CAPM, RAPM, and SAP Integration Suite, along with experience in SAP Build Process Automation and analytics. This role involves architecting, designing, and implementing enterprise-level SAP solutions across complex landscapes.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;br /&gt;- Create and manage OData services for Fiori/UI5 applications and other frontend integrations.&lt;br /&gt;- Build business applications using SAP BTP, focusing on CAPM (Cloud Application Programming Model) and RAPM (RESTful ABAP Programming Model).&lt;br /&gt;- Design and implement integration scenarios between SAP and third-party systems using SAP Integration Suite.&lt;br /&gt;- Develop and deliver solutions using SAP BTP technologies including CAPM, RAPM, Build Process Automation, and Integration Suite.&lt;br /&gt;- Conduct code reviews, performance tuning, and prepare technical documentation.&lt;br /&gt;- Collaborate with functional consultants, solution architects, and other stakeholders to deliver end-to-end SAP solutions.&lt;br /&gt;- Stay updated with SAP&amp;rsquo;s latest technologies, ensuring future-proof and scalable solutions.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Required Skills &amp;amp; Qualifications:&lt;br /&gt;- 12&amp;ndash;16 years of IT experience with at least 5+ years in SAP BTP technologies.&lt;br /&gt;- Hands-on expertise in CAPM, RAPM, SAP Integration Suite, and Build Process Automation.&lt;br /&gt;- Strong experience with OData services, Fiori/UI5 integrations, and SAP analytics.&lt;br /&gt;- Ability to design and implement scalable SAP BTP solutions across complex enterprise landscapes.&lt;br /&gt;- Strong problem-solving, communication, and stakeholder management skills.','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-19 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-08-27 10:46:26.000000','2025-11-21 04:43:38.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Cloud Architect\", \"Enterprise\", \"RESTFUL\", \"SAP\", \"SAP ABAP\", \"Sap Business Objects\", \"SAP FIORI\", \"SAP Integration\", \"SAP Odata\", \"SAP Solutions\", \"Stakeholder Management\", \"Technical Documentation\", \"Performance Tuning\"]','[\"- Competitive salary package&lt;br /&gt;- Opportunity to work on the latest SAP BTP technologies&lt;br /&gt;- Exposure to large-scale enterprise SAP projects&lt;br /&gt;- Professional growth with cutting-edge SAP innovations&lt;br /&gt;- Collaborative and innovative work environment&lt;br /&gt;- PAN India work flexibility\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('f909d062-3bdb-4f82-994b-0428c3ea46d8','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','IT Support Analyst – Kinaxis RapidResponse / Maestro','it-support-analyst-kinaxis-rapidresponse-maestro-352-352','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;94&quot; data-end=&quot;429&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;120&quot; data-end=&quot;153&quot;&gt;IT Support Analysts &amp;ndash; Kinaxis&lt;/strong&gt; for a leading Top MNC to support enterprise-scale Supply Chain Planning and Digital Transformation initiatives. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in Kinaxis RapidResponse / Maestro, supply chain planning, application support, and ITIL-based service management.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;431&quot; data-end=&quot;871&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for supporting, maintaining, and troubleshooting Kinaxis RapidResponse / Maestro applications used for enterprise supply chain planning and decision-making. The role includes supporting demand planning, supply planning, inventory optimization, Sales &amp;amp; Operations Planning (S&amp;amp;OP), resolving application incidents, analyzing root causes, supporting data integrations, and ensuring smooth business operations.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;873&quot; data-end=&quot;1235&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with Kinaxis RapidResponse / Maestro, ITIL processes, supply chain planning, demand planning, supply planning, inventory management, S&amp;amp;OP, SQL, data integration, and application support. Strong analytical and problem-solving skills, along with experience working with global enterprise clients, are highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1237&quot; data-end=&quot;1614&quot;&gt;The role also involves collaborating with supply chain business users, IT teams, application owners, technical teams, and global stakeholders to resolve incidents, implement enhancements, manage service requests, and maintain application stability. Candidates should possess strong communication, stakeholder management, troubleshooting, analytical, and problem-solving skills.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Pune',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-09 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-08-11 02:58:40.000000','2026-08-11 02:58:40.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Data Integration\", \"Demand Forecasting\", \"NoSQL\", \"Root Cause Analysis (RCA)\", \"Supply Chain Management\", \"ITIL framework\", \"Kinaxis RapidResponse\", \"Kinaxis Maestro\", \"Kinaxis Application Support\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1630&quot; data-end=&quot;1668&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1b15olh&quot; data-start=&quot;1669&quot; data-end=&quot;1759&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale Supply Chain Planning and Digital Transformation projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1pxfh92&quot; data-start=&quot;1760&quot; data-end=&quot;1820&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience with Kinaxis RapidResponse / Maestro&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1t06ccf&quot; data-start=&quot;1821&quot; data-end=&quot;1911&quot;&gt;Career growth in Supply Chain IT, Planning Systems, and Enterprise Application Support&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1umbggs&quot; data-start=&quot;1912&quot; data-end=&quot;1988&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global supply chain and technology teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;5smgwd&quot; data-start=&quot;1989&quot; data-end=&quot;2053&quot;&gt;Exposure to multiple industry domains and enterprise client&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Maharashtra'),('f949cfaf-436c-4f4c-b183-9eb2710031a5','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Senior React Native Developer','senior-react-native-developer-189-189','We are seeking an experienced Senior React Native Developer to design, develop, and maintain high-performance cross-platform mobile applications for iOS and Android. The role involves close collaboration with product, design, and backend teams to deliver scalable, secure, and user-friendly mobile solutions.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Design and develop cross-platform mobile apps using React Native&lt;br /&gt;Collaborate with designers, product managers, and backend teams&lt;br /&gt;Ensure application performance, quality, and responsiveness&lt;br /&gt;Integrate backend services and third-party libraries&lt;br /&gt;Review code and mentor junior developers&lt;br /&gt;Debug issues and optimize app performance&lt;br /&gt;Implement CI/CD pipelines for automated builds and deployments&lt;br /&gt;Stay updated with emerging mobile technologies and best practices','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Chennai',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-04-11 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-02-10 18:54:14.000000','2026-02-10 18:54:14.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Agile\", \"Github\", 