&quot;2173&quot;&gt;Exposure to complex IT infrastructure and compliance-driven environments&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',500000.00,2500000.00,'₹',0,'India','Hyderabad',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-19 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-07-01 13:44:23.000000','2025-11-21 04:48:24.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Configurations\", \"Finance\", \"Hardware\", \"Integration\", \"Linux\", \"Perl\", \"Shell\", \"Software\", \"Testing\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;123&quot; data-end=&quot;158&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;125&quot; data-end=&quot;158&quot;&gt;Exposure to latest technologies&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;159&quot; data-end=&quot;209&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;161&quot; data-end=&quot;209&quot;&gt;Opportunities for upskilling and certification&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;210&quot; data-end=&quot;255&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;212&quot; data-end=&quot;255&quot;&gt;Supportive and collaborative work culture&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;256&quot; data-end=&quot;288&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;258&quot; data-end=&quot;288&quot;&gt;Health and wellness benefits&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;289&quot; data-end=&quot;322&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;291&quot; data-end=&quot;322&quot;&gt;Work-life balance initiatives&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Telangana'),('faa7a363-e1bd-497f-aed1-9b1e73a722e1','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Senior Java Full Stack Developer (Microservices + Angular)','senior-java-full-stack-developer-microservices-angular-97-97','We are hiring experienced Full Stack Java Developers with strong expertise in Java, Microservices, and Angular, specifically for the Banking &amp;amp; Insurance domain. This role requires hands-on experience in building scalable, cloud-native solutions with AWS, databases, and CI/CD pipelines. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;br /&gt;- Design, develop, and optimize scalable microservices in Java.&lt;br /&gt;- Build user-friendly Angular-based frontends for enterprise applications.&lt;br /&gt;- Work on cloud-native deployments and solutions in AWS.&lt;br /&gt;- Develop and maintain SQL/NoSQL database systems (Oracle preferred).&lt;br /&gt;- Implement CI/CD pipelines using GitLab for smooth deployments.&lt;br /&gt;- Collaborate with cross-functional teams to deliver mission-critical applications.&lt;br /&gt;- Contribute to system architecture and ensure performance, security, and scalability.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Key Requirements:&lt;br /&gt;- 5&amp;ndash;8 years of experience in full-stack Java development.&lt;br /&gt;- Strong expertise in Java, Microservices, Angular.&lt;br /&gt;- Hands-on experience with AWS cloud services.&lt;br /&gt;- Proficiency in SQL/NoSQL, Oracle databases.&lt;br /&gt;- Knowledge of GitLab CI/CD.&lt;br /&gt;- Domain knowledge in Banking and/or Insurance applications.&lt;br /&gt;- Strong problem-solving skills, team collaboration, and communication.','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-19 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-08-27 11:56:29.000000','2025-11-21 04:43:05.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Angular\", \"API Banking\", \"API Integration\", \"AWS\", \"Cloud Native\", \"Enterprise Applications\", \"Full Stack Development\", \"Gitlab\", \"Insurance\", \"Java\", \"Microservices\", \"NoSQL\", \"Oracle\", \"Problem Solving\", \"RESTFUL\", \"Spring Boot\", \"SQL\", \"System Design\", \"CI/CD\"]','[\"- Competitive salary (₹18 LPA &amp;ndash; ₹21 LPA, based on experience).&lt;br /&gt;- 100% Remote &amp;ndash; work from anywhere in India.&lt;br /&gt;- Opportunity to work on mission-critical Banking &amp;amp; Insurance applications.&lt;br /&gt;- Exposure to scalable cloud-native architecture and modern tech stacks.&lt;br /&gt;- Career growth and professional development opportunities.&lt;br /&gt;- Fast-paced, innovative, and collaborative work environment.\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('fac975a2-3600-41cd-8257-b1f2c8d4889b','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','BEV Consultant – Siemens OpCenter','bev-consultant-siemens-opcenter-351-351','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;75&quot; data-end=&quot;484&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;101&quot; data-end=&quot;139&quot;&gt;BEV Consultants &amp;ndash; Siemens OpCenter&lt;/strong&gt; for a leading Top MNC to support large-scale Manufacturing IT, Manufacturing Execution System (MES), and Battery Electric Vehicle (BEV) manufacturing transformation initiatives. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in Siemens OpCenter Discrete, MES configuration, manufacturing workflows, system integration, and production support.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;486&quot; data-end=&quot;944&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for configuring and customizing Siemens OpCenter Discrete modules, developing user interfaces, workflows, and data models, and supporting manufacturing operations across production, quality, logistics, and production control processes. The role involves working on a major battery manufacturing plant / Manufacturing Operations Management (MOM) implementation and delivering reliable MES solutions for shop-floor operations.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;946&quot; data-end=&quot;1377&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with Siemens OpCenter Discrete, OpCenter configuration, MES implementation and support, SQL, C#/Python/JavaScript, API and Web Services, MES-to-ERP integration, and MES-to-PLC integration. Experience troubleshooting production issues, optimizing MES performance, performing unit and system testing, and providing Tier-3 technical support during production launches is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-09 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-08-11 02:52:46.000000','2026-08-11 02:52:47.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"API Integration\", \"C#\", \"Data Modeling\", \"JavaScript\", \"Mes\", \"Mes Implementation\", \"PLC Systems\", \"Python\", \"Siemens Opcenter\", \"SQL\", \"Workflow Configuration\", \"Siemens OpCenter Discrete\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1763&quot; data-end=&quot;1801&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;571r7h&quot; data-start=&quot;1802&quot; data-end=&quot;1882&quot;&gt;Exposure to large-scale Siemens OpCenter MES and MOM implementation projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;10ohnwl&quot; data-start=&quot;1883&quot; data-end=&quot;1965&quot;&gt;Work on cutting-edge BEV, battery manufacturing, and Smart Factory initiatives&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;7607zf&quot; data-start=&quot;1966&quot; data-end=&quot;2035&quot;&gt;Career growth in Manufacturing IT, MES, and Digital Manufacturing&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;13qji02&quot; data-start=&quot;2036&quot; data-end=&quot;2113&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global manufacturing and technology teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;lbdux7&quot; data-start=&quot;2114&quot; data-end=&quot;2174&quot;&gt;Exposure to MES-ERP and MES-PLC integration environments&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot; data-start=&quot;2175&quot; data-end=&quot;2230&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('fb3c9bc5-cd0c-4f1e-9890-78f3695b4f00','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','AVEVA MES Consultant','aveva-mes-consultant-60-60','We are looking for an experienced AVEVA MES Consultant to join our team. If you have expertise in industrial automation and MES implementation and are passionate about delivering technology solutions, we&amp;rsquo;d love to hear from you!&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Design, develop, and implement AVEVA MES systems across various projects.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional teams to gather and analyze requirements.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Perform system integration and testing to ensure smooth functionality.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Work on lifecycle MES implementations and system upgrades.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Provide training and support for end-users and clients.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Troubleshoot and resolve technical issues in a timely manner.','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',500000.00,1500000.00,'₹',1,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-19 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-07-01 08:56:06.000000','2025-11-21 04:57:28.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\".NET\", \"ERP Integration\", \"JavaScript\", \"Mes Architect\", \"Mom\", \"SCADA\", \"SQL\", \"AVEVA MES\"]','[\"Competitive salary based on experience.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Opportunity to work with global clients on cutting-edge technology.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Comprehensive health and wellness benefits.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Flexible work arrangements (remote or hybrid, if applicable).&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Professional growth opportunities through certifications and training.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Paid leave, including vacation, sick leave, and public holidays.\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('fb4cb093-c657-4a6e-b826-d2700efa6155','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Lead architecture','lead-architecture-200-200','&lt;p&gt;&amp;sect; Architect and design end‑to‑end OT&amp;rarr;IT data integrations (batch/streaming) from SCADA, MES, Historians to enterprise/cloud (Azure/AWS/GCP); Experience in Azure Event Hubs/Event Grid is a plus.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;sect; Apply UNS (ISA‑95/88), industrial data modeling, and metadata management; enforce data quality, lineage, governance, and security-by-design.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;sect; Integrate industrial platforms (Ignition, HiveMQ, HighByte advantageous) via OPC UA, MQTT, BACnet, Modbus; build/govern RESTful APIs and connectors for SAP, SCADA, MES, LIMS, Historians.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;sect; Define and socialize application/integration/infrastructure standards, lead architecture for enterprise IT and digital transformation in regulated manufacturing.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;sect; Deploy/support enterprise applications with reliability, compliance, and operability, design for scalability, resilience, and cost efficiency.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;sect; Perform schema design and performance tuning across SQL/NoSQL datastores.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;sect; Produce and maintain clear architecture artifacts (diagrams, process/sequence flows, specifications); provide guidance to cross‑functional delivery teams.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;sect; Experience in manufacturing or life sciences with OT/IT interoperability; familiarity with GxP, regulated data flows, and enterprise data governance is advantageous.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Entry',NULL,NULL,'INR',1,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-04-26 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-02-25 19:15:06.000000','2026-02-25 19:15:07.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"AWS\", \"Azure\", \"Gxp Compliance\", \"Lims\", \"MYSQL\", \"Opc\", \"PLC\", \"SAP\", \"SCADA\", \"Modbus RTU\", \"Modbus\", \"MQTT\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;Competitive salary package with performance-based incentives&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;65&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;67&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;Health insurance coverage and statutory benefits (PF &amp;amp; Gratuity)&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;134&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;136&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on large-scale enterprise energy management projects&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;211&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;213&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;Strong career growth and learning opportunities&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;263&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;265&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;Collaborative and professional work environment&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('fba2c9a2-1030-4eee-aa8f-5769b1dc926c','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Wonderware/AVEVA Tools Specialist','wonderwareaveva-tools-specialist-59-59','We are hiring a Wonderware/AVEVA Tools Specialist to join our dynamic team!&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;As an AVEVA Project Engineer, you will play a pivotal role in developing and implementing innovative solutions using Wonderware/AVEVA tools to optimize processes and systems. You will work closely with cross-functional teams to drive operational excellence and deliver value to our clients.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Design, configure, and implement Wonderware/AVEVA System Platform solutions.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Collaborate with teams to integrate MES/MDM systems, OSI PI, and Batch Management solutions.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Work on AVEVA Work Tasks/Skelta modules to optimize workflows.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Provide technical expertise and troubleshooting support for Wonderware/AVEVA tools.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Create and maintain detailed technical documentation and reports.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Required Skills &amp;amp; Qualifications:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;2-10 years of hands-on experience with Wonderware/AVEVA tools.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Expertise in System Platform, MES/MDM, OSI PI, and Batch Management.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Familiarity with AVEVA Work Tasks/Skelta and process automation.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Strong understanding of industrial software systems and data management.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Excellent problem-solving and communication skills.&lt;br /&gt;If you&#039;re ready to make an impact and take your career to the next level, we want to hear from you!','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',500000.00,2000000.00,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-19 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-07-01 08:19:10.000000','2025-11-21 04:57:39.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"AvevaWonderware\", \"MES Order Processing\", \"Industrial Automation\", \"MYSQL\", \"PI System (OSIsoft)\", \"PLC\", \"PLC Programming\", \"Process Control Systems\", \"SCADA Systems\", \"DCS\"]','[\"Competitive salary aligned with industry standards.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Opportunity to work with cutting-edge Wonderware/AVEVA tools and technologies.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Professional growth through exposure to advanced industrial automation systems.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Comprehensive health insurance for you and your family.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Paid time off, including vacation, sick leave, and public holidays.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Training and certification opportunities in Wonderware/AVEVA and related technologies.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Collaborative and innovative work environment.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Chance to work with a dynamic and talented team on impactful projects.\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('fc2fc02b-5f9b-4333-aa10-897ce36a4997','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Inside Sales Executive - Bangalore (0 - 2 Years)','inside-sales-executive-bangalore-0-2-years-91-91','We are hiring Inside Sales Executives t