aa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Business Analyst (Power BI + Excel Analytics)','business-analyst-power-bi-excel-analytics-134-134','&lt;p data-start=&quot;249&quot; data-end=&quot;540&quot;&gt;We are looking for an experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;283&quot; data-end=&quot;303&quot;&gt;Business Analyst&lt;/strong&gt; with strong expertise in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;329&quot; data-end=&quot;381&quot;&gt;Excel analytics, Power BI, and data storytelling&lt;/strong&gt; to support a global team. The ideal candidate will analyze complex datasets, create meaningful dashboards, and present insights that drive business decisions.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;542&quot; data-end=&quot;809&quot;&gt;You will be responsible for building analytical models, validating data quality, and delivering executive-ready presentations with clear recommendations. This role requires a detail-oriented mindset, strong communication skills, and a passion for continuous learning.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;hr data-start=&quot;811&quot; data-end=&quot;814&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;816&quot; data-end=&quot;846&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;819&quot; data-end=&quot;846&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;847&quot; data-end=&quot;1388&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;847&quot; data-end=&quot;943&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;849&quot; data-end=&quot;943&quot;&gt;Develop, automate, and maintain &lt;strong data-start=&quot;881&quot; data-end=&quot;906&quot;&gt;advanced Excel models&lt;/strong&gt; for recurring and ad-hoc analyses.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;944&quot; data-end=&quot;1045&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;946&quot; data-end=&quot;1045&quot;&gt;Build interactive &lt;strong data-start=&quot;964&quot; data-end=&quot;987&quot;&gt;Power BI dashboards&lt;/strong&gt; using DAX, M queries, and visualization best practices.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1046&quot; data-end=&quot;1138&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1048&quot; data-end=&quot;1138&quot;&gt;Perform &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1056&quot; data-end=&quot;1106&quot;&gt;data profiling, validation, and reconciliation&lt;/strong&gt; across multiple data sources.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1139&quot; data-end=&quot;1221&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1141&quot; data-end=&quot;1221&quot;&gt;Create &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1148&quot; data-end=&quot;1186&quot;&gt;insightful and concise PPT reports&lt;/strong&gt; for leadership and stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1222&quot; data-end=&quot;1297&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1224&quot; data-end=&quot;1297&quot;&gt;Interpret business problems and convert them into analytical solutions.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1298&quot; data-end=&quot;1388&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1300&quot; data-end=&quot;1388&quot;&gt;Continuously upgrade skills in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1331&quot; data-end=&quot;1385&quot;&gt;BI tools, data visualization, and domain knowledge&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;/ul&gt;','Information Technology','Full-time','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Bengaluru',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-19 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-11-21 06:25:49.000000','2025-11-21 06:25:49.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Advanced Excel\", \"Data Quality\", \"Pivot Tables\", \"Power BI\", \"Reconciliation\", \"Power Query\", \"DAX\", \"PPT Dashboards\"]','[\"&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1960&quot; data-end=&quot;2309&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1960&quot; data-end=&quot;2007&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1962&quot; data-end=&quot;2007&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1989&quot; data-end=&quot;2007&quot;&gt;top global MNC&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2008&quot; data-end=&quot;2078&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2010&quot; data-end=&quot;2078&quot;&gt;Work on &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2018&quot; data-end=&quot;2053&quot;&gt;high-impact analytical projects&lt;/strong&gt; used by leadership teams&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2079&quot; data-end=&quot;2129&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2081&quot; data-end=&quot;2129&quot;&gt;Exposure to modern BI tools and best practices&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2130&quot; data-end=&quot;2206&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2132&quot; data-end=&quot;2206&quot;&gt;Growth-oriented culture focusing on &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2168&quot; data-end=&quot;2206&quot;&gt;upskilling and continuous learning&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2207&quot; data-end=&quot;2255&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2209&quot; data-end=&quot;2255&quot;&gt;Collaborative and inclusive work environment&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2256&quot; data-end=&quot;2309&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2258&quot; data-end=&quot;2309&quot;&gt;Competitive salary &amp;amp; performance-based incentives&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Karnataka'),('fc6a536d-f60c-4661-b6c0-af86ed5675fe','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Core Voice Tooling Analyst – L2 Support','core-voice-tooling-analyst-l2-support-75-75','Are you an experienced voice infrastructure professional with hands-on expertise in Cisco UC, Oracle SBC, and cloud-based voice solutions? We&amp;rsquo;re looking for a Core Voice Tooling Analyst (L2) to join our high-performance team in Hyderabad. Role Overview: This role involves supporting and enhancing our global voice environment, ensuring platform stability, and contributing to the continuous improvement of voice services through automation and cloud-native technologies. Key Responsibilities: Provide L2 support for Cisco UC voice services, Oracle SBCs, and Microsoft Teams voice Perform application support across Windows/Linux servers, SNMP monitoring tools, and call capture solutions Troubleshoot and resolve incidents related to voice platforms, monitoring, and CDR tools Collaborate with vendors and internal stakeholders to ensure smooth operations and deployments Contribute to automation efforts within the voice ecosystem and help integrate cloud-based tooling Support software releases, CI/CD processes, and work within Agile/SRE/DevOps frameworks Must-Have Skills: Hands-on experience with Cisco UC, Oracle SBCs, and cloud voice platforms (MS Teams) Strong troubleshooting skills in voice services and SBCs Familiarity with SNMP monitoring (experience with Nectar a plus) Knowledge of CDR applications like Proteus, and automation tools (e.g., Kurmi) Experience with Azure and Azure foundations certification Understanding of Agile, SRE, or DevOps practices Good-to-Have: Familiarity with change management, ServiceNow, Jira, and GitLab Scripting knowledge in Python, PowerShell, or Linux shell Experience with Power BI and collaboration tools like Confluence Understanding of ITIL processes','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',500000.00,2500000.00,'₹',0,'India','Hyderabad',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-01-19 07:00:00',0,0,'2025-07-01 13:21:48.000000','2025-11-21 04:48:52.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Cisco Routers\", \"Gitlab\", \"JIRA\", \"Linux\", \"Oracle\", \"Powershell\", \"Python\", \"ServiceNow\"]','[\"Exposure to cloud technologies and modern tech stack Opportunities for continuous learning and upskilling Collaborative and supportive team environment Career growth with leadership mentorship Health and wellness benefits Strong focus on work-life balance\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Telangana'),('fc6c0fd1-fc2f-4aae-9f06-4e4567d8e827','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Senior DELMIA Apriso Developer','senior-delmia-apriso-developer-344-344','&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;72&quot; data-end=&quot;476&quot;&gt;We are hiring experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;98&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;Senior DELMIA Apriso Developers&lt;/strong&gt; for a leading Top MNC to support enterprise-scale Manufacturing Execution System (MES), Apriso Version Upgrade, and Digital Manufacturing transformation initiatives. The ideal candidate should have strong expertise in Dassault Syst&amp;egrave;mes DELMIA Apriso MES, application development, enterprise integrations, and manufacturing process automation.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;478&quot; data-end=&quot;972&quot;&gt;The candidate will be responsible for developing, upgrading, configuring, and supporting DELMIA Apriso MES solutions across global manufacturing environments. The role includes leading Apriso version upgrade projects (FlexNet 9.6 to Apriso 2024), designing manufacturing workflows, developing custom solutions using Apriso Process Builder and Screen Framework, implementing enterprise integrations, optimizing application performance, and providing HyperCare support during production rollouts.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;974&quot; data-end=&quot;1472&quot;&gt;Professionals should have hands-on experience with DELMIA Apriso, Apriso Process Builder, Screen Framework, HTML, CSS, JavaScript, AJAX, .NET, SQL Server, T-SQL, Stored Procedures, machine integration, business integration, ERP integration, OPC integration, GPM deployment, release management, archiving solutions, and MES implementation. Strong understanding of manufacturing processes, complex assembly operations, SDLC, source control, and enterprise application development is highly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1474&quot; data-end=&quot;1966&quot;&gt;The role also involves collaborating with business stakeholders, manufacturing teams, automation engineers, architects, and global delivery teams to gather requirements, design scalable MES solutions, mentor development teams, conduct code reviews, prepare technical documentation, and ensure successful project delivery. Candidates should possess strong leadership, communication, stakeholder management, analytical, and problem-solving skills with experience managing small technical teams.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','PAN India',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-09-15 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-07-18 03:16:04.000000','2026-07-18 03:16:04.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\".NET\", \"AJAX\", \"Azure DevOps\", \"CSS3\", \"Delmia Apriso\", \"ERP\", \"GPM Deployment\", \"HTML5\", \"JavaScript\", \"Mes\", \"Microsoft SQL Server\", \"MYSQL\", \"Transact-SQL\", \"OPC UA\", \"Machine Integrator\", \"Dassault DELMIA Apriso MES\", \"FlexNet\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j985z7&quot; data-start=&quot;1982&quot; data-end=&quot;2020&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a Top MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;di3z59&quot; data-start=&quot;2021&quot; data-end=&quot;2115&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale MES upgrade and Digital Manufacturing transformation projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;13xzwaj&quot; data-start=&quot;2116&quot; data-end=&quot;2195&quot;&gt;Work on the latest DELMIA Apriso 2024 platform and Industry 4.0 initiatives&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;13ica1w&quot; data-start=&quot;2196&quot; data-end=&quot;2285&quot;&gt;Career growth in Manufacturing Execution Systems (MES) and Smart Factory technologies&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;13qji02&quot; data-start=&quot;2286&quot; data-end=&quot;2363&quot;&gt;Opportunity to collaborate with global manufacturing and technology teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;65o1vi&quot; data-start=&quot;2364&quot; data-end=&quot;2419&quot;&gt;Professional and innovation-driven work environment&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1i65dym&quot; data-start=&quot;2420&quot; data-end=&quot;2463&quot;&g