l be highly valuable.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Mid',NULL,NULL,'₹',0,'India','Pune',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-10-31 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-09-02 02:41:37.000000','2026-09-02 02:41:37.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"GE Cimplicity\", \"GE Proficy AMS\", \"Historian\", \"Mes\", \"Mes Configuration\", \"Mes Implementation\", \"RDBMS\", \"SQL\", \"SQL Server\", \"SSRS\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;rdheb3&quot; data-start=&quot;1170&quot; data-end=&quot;1217&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work with a leading global MNC&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;d0ckx3&quot; data-start=&quot;1218&quot; data-end=&quot;1276&quot;&gt;Exposure to enterprise-scale &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1249&quot; data-end=&quot;1267&quot;&gt;GE Proficy MES&lt;/strong&gt; projects&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;tts59o&quot; data-start=&quot;1277&quot; data-end=&quot;1346&quot;&gt;Work on global manufacturing and digital transformation initiatives&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1e9nnmk&quot; data-start=&quot;1347&quot; data-end=&quot;1413&quot;&gt;Exposure to &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1361&quot; data-end=&quot;1413&quot;&gt;MES, SCADA, Historian, OPC, and PLC environments&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;lxpbm&quot; data-start=&quot;1414&quot; data-end=&quot;1488&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work across multiple manufacturing sites and global teams&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;13yggb8&quot; data-start=&quot;1489&quot; data-end=&quot;1544&quot;&gt;Experience with modern .NET and database technologies&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;rbdf8t&quot; data-start=&quot;1545&quot; data-end=&quot;1611&quot;&gt;Exposure to &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1559&quot; data-end=&quot;1599&quot;&gt;Industry 4.0 and smart manufacturing&lt;/strong&gt; initiatives&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'Maharashtra'),('fd54f000-d100-4193-b1a3-ea12ca184395','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8f