&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;926&quot; data-end=&quot;976&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;928&quot; data-end=&quot;976&quot;&gt;Design user interfaces using &lt;strong data-start=&quot;957&quot; data-end=&quot;974&quot;&gt;HTML5 and CSS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;977&quot; data-end=&quot;1083&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;979&quot; data-end=&quot;1083&quot;&gt;Configure and implement &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1003&quot; data-end=&quot;1039&quot;&gt;Business Integrator / Middleware&lt;/strong&gt; for SAP and enterprise system integration&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1084&quot; data-end=&quot;1172&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1086&quot; data-end=&quot;1172&quot;&gt;Configure and troubleshoot &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1113&quot; data-end=&quot;1135&quot;&gt;Machine Integrator&lt;/strong&gt; for shop-floor device connectivity&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1173&quot; data-end=&quot;1281&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1175&quot; data-end=&quot;1281&quot;&gt;Develop and implement &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1197&quot; data-end=&quot;1223&quot;&gt;reports and dashboards&lt;/strong&gt; using Crystal Reports, SSRS, Dashboard Builder, and MPI&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1282&quot; data-end=&quot;1357&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1284&quot; data-end=&quot;1357&quot;&gt;Participate in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1299&quot; data-end=&quot;1333&quot;&gt;end-to-end MES implementations&lt;/strong&gt; and solution rollouts&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1358&quot; data-end=&quot;1424&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1360&quot; data-end=&quot;1424&quot;&gt;Support testing, validation, and production rollout activities&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1425&quot; data-end=&quot;1495&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1427&quot; data-end=&quot;1495&quot;&gt;Monitor and optimize business logic and &lt;s