l Development on Latest Technologies (Azure, DevOps, Big Data)&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;2827&quot; data-end=&quot;2866&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2829&quot; data-end=&quot;2866&quot;&gt;Cross-functional Team Collaboration&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'PAN India'),('feca8f85-5340-4120-86a1-db6543b8eed1','895c2926-0596-4115-a3e5-03a9d8fe042d','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','SAP Consultant','sap-consultant-220-220','&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;ERP Consultant:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Lead SAP integration design and delivery for Loftware Cloud engagement for pharma major. Own interface architecture, data mapping, and controls. Ensure data accuracy through rigorous testing and validation. Coordinate with global site teams to support cutover, stabilization, and post‑go‑live support across multi‑region Loftware implementations, while managing risks, governance, and stakeholder communication effectively globally.&lt;/p&gt;','Information Technology','Contract','Entry',NULL,NULL,'INR',1,'India','Kolkata',0,0,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-05-24 06:00:00',0,0,'2026-03-25 16:37:42.000000','2026-03-25 16:37:44.000000','INTERNAL',NULL,'[\"Mes\", \"SAP\", \"SAP ABAP\", \"SAP BI\"]','[\"&lt;ul&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;2&quot; data-end=&quot;64&quot;&gt;Competitive salary package with performance-based incentives&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;65&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;67&quot; data-end=&quot;133&quot;&gt;Health insurance coverage and statutory benefits (PF &amp;amp; Gratuity)&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;134&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;136&quot; data-end=&quot;210&quot;&gt;Opportunity to work on large-scale enterprise energy management projects&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;211&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;213&quot; data-end=&quot;262&quot;&gt;Strong career growth and learning opportunities&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;263&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;\\r\\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;265&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;Collaborative and professional work environment&lt;/p&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/li&gt;\\r\\n&lt;/ul&gt;\"]','No Preference',1,5,'West Bengal'),('fefb361e-a56e-4fee-a5d2-0c4c22354a17','17bcd594-d749-4baa-8493-ad59b499fe1f','1ee4d080-3a60-4e83-ba83-d1de1e725d54','Global Master Data Consultant','global-master-data-consultant-170-170','&lt;p data-start=&quot;176&quot; data-end=&quot;724&quot;&gt;We are looking for an experienced &lt;strong data-start=&quot;210&quot; data-end=&quot;243&quot;&gt;Global Master Data Consultant&lt;/strong&gt; to support enterprise-wide master data transformation initiatives. The role involves data migration, cleansing, harmonization, governance, and SAP MDG implementation across global business units. The consultant will work closely with cross-functional and cross-regional teams to align local requirements with global data standards, support testing activities, manage change, and ensure high-quality master data throughout project lifecycles including cutover and hypercare phases.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;hr data-start=&quot;726&quot; data-end=&quot;729&quot; /&gt;\r\n&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;731&quot; data-end=&quot;758&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;734&quot; data-end=&quot;758&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;ul data-start=&quot;759&quot; data-end=&quot;1617&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;759&quot; data-end=&quot;815&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;761&quot; data-end=&quot;815&quot;&gt;Data preparation for &lt;strong data-start=&quot;782&quot; data-end=&quot;815&quot;&gt;data conversion and migration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;816&quot; data-end=&quot;893&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;818&quot; data-end=&quot;893&quot;&gt;Master data &lt;strong data-start=&quot;830&quot; data-end=&quot;893&quot;&gt;cleansing, standardization, harmonization, and localization&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;894&quot; data-end=&quot;959&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;896&quot; data-end=&quot;959&quot;&gt;SAP S/4HANA master data &lt;strong data-start=&quot;920&quot; data-end=&quot;959&quot;&gt;value mapping and data construction&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;960&quot; data-end=&quot;1021&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;962&quot; data-end=&quot;1021&quot;&gt;Cross-workstream coordination for data element requirements&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1022&quot; data-end=&quot;1066&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1024&quot; data-end=&quot;1066&quot;&gt;Test data creation and &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1047&quot; data-end=&quot;1066&quot;&gt;data validation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1067&quot; data-end=&quot;1101&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1069&quot; data-end=&quot;1101&quot;&gt;Bug investigation and resolution&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1102&quot; data-end=&quot;1138&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1104&quot; data-end=&quot;1138&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1104&quot; data-end=&quot;1138&quot;&gt;Change management and training&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1139&quot; data-end=&quot;1196&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1141&quot; data-end=&quot;1196&quot;&gt;Master Data Governance using &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1170&quot; data-end=&quot;1196&quot;&gt;SAP MDG (CRUD process)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li data-start=&quot;1197&quot; data-end=&quot;1250&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;p data-start=&quot;1199&